#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DaisyAD_BrinePool
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = f177bbae-da80-4a70-a9a5-9ebc1f4c3032
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DaisyAD_BrinePool:f177bbae-da80-4a70-a9a5-9ebc1f4c3032
msgctxt "h8879cc82gc338g4eb8gbff1g73e294f7c482"
msgid ""
"Brine pools... but empty of tadpoles. Unusual. Harvesting all the larvae "
"indicates they are getting ready for something big."
msgstr ""
"일리시드 수조인가... 올챙이는 하나도 없어. 이상하군. 아직 덜 자란 것들까지 전부 사용했단건 뭔가 큰 일을 준비한다는 말인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Arrival_DaisyAD_ThroughPrison
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 08c6da6d-89ba-4d96-ade9-ed1e3aecee10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_General_Knows_ColonyIsIllithid = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Arrival_DaisyAD_ThroughPrison:08c6da6d-89ba-4d96-ade9-ed1e3aecee10
msgctxt "h79e0ae40gaa6dg49bbg9fb7ga97af425b581"
msgid ""
"An illithid oubliette. Right beneath the Towers. A colony must be close. "
"That must be where the tadpoles are coming from."
msgstr "일리시드 지하굴이 탑 바로 아래 있었다니. 군락지가 근처에 있는 게 틀림없어. 올챙이가 만들어지는 곳도 거기겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DaisyAD_BrinePool
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = f177bbae-da80-4a70-a9a5-9ebc1f4c3032
