msgctxt "h0a3f257fgee88g4434gac07ge54521966979"
msgid ""
"An illithid oubliette. Right beneath the Towers. A colony must be close. "
"That must be where the tadpoles are coming from."
msgstr "일리시드 지하굴이 탑 바로 아래 있었다니. 군락지가 근처에 있는 게 틀림없어. 올챙이가 만들어지는 곳도 거기겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_Blessing
#. Speaker = Kressa Bonedaughter
#. NodeID = 1219deab-e327-9d00-f210-9686e41509e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_Barracks_State_BlessingFinished = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_Blessing:1219deab-e327-9d00-f210-9686e41509e6
msgctxt "h27fbed4cg126bg4201ga7c5gcc14cf48b2a0"
msgid "You are the sacred hand that reaches from the grave."
msgstr "너는 무덤에서 뻗어 나오는 신성한 손이니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_Blessing
#. Speaker = Kressa Bonedaughter
#. NodeID = 377f8abe-4356-47fc-a3ed-e91d6ca6fcf6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_Blessing:377f8abe-4356-47fc-a3ed-e91d6ca6fcf6
msgctxt "hae2dcccagf098g4aa5gbb89geb54d93b34e9"
msgid "Bring death, embrace death, <i>become</i> death."
msgstr "죽음을 가져오라, 죽음을 받아들여라, 죽음이 <i>되어라</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_Blessing
#. Speaker = Kressa Bonedaughter
#. NodeID = 9d624120-cf80-68c9-8fb9-26c10f503133
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_Barracks_State_BlessingFinished = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_Blessing:9d624120-cf80-68c9-8fb9-26c10f503133
msgctxt "h67b7615dga944g4408g81f6g7d96e2649575"
msgid "Walk in dusk and shadow - walk the path of bones in our Lord's name."
msgstr "어둠과 황혼 속에서 걸어라. 주군의 이름으로 뼈의 길을 걸어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_Blessing
#. Speaker = Kressa Bonedaughter
#. NodeID = cad40d36-049c-e95c-4aa7-a47228e5d671
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_Barracks_State_BlessingFinished = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_Barracks_Event_MistressBlessesSkullLashers = True
#.     - COL_Barracks_State_BlessingFinished = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_Blessing:cad40d36-049c-e95c-4aa7-a47228e5d671
msgctxt "h2102d5d0gb1e7g4b07ga94eg75a4b44dfaf7"
msgid ""
"This is his blessing, his consecration, and you are his scythe. Go forth and "
"reap."
msgstr "이것이 그분의 축복이며, 축성이며, 너는 그분의 낫이니라. 나아가 수확하거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_Blessing
#. Speaker = Kressa Bonedaughter
#. NodeID = d03d63f2-1f77-f399-4986-2381f7371493
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_Barracks_State_BlessingFinished = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_Blessing:d03d63f2-1f77-f399-4986-2381f7371493
msgctxt "h189fbe87g44bdg4811gaaa8gda4871271331"
msgid ""
"You are the lasher of skulls, the carver of crypts, the dancer of bones."
msgstr "너는 뼈로 채찍질하는 자요, 무덤을 새기는 자요, 뼈 가운데 춤추는 자이니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_Minthara_EnteredBarracks
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 9ec0a505-786b-a325-4f5b-2563bfcba112
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_Minthara_EnteredBarracks:9ec0a505-786b-a325-4f5b-2563bfcba112
msgctxt "hae9bf573g13a4g43adgbe5bg494417e9b0cf"
msgid ""
"Some who worked here were not thralls or undead. They were loyal to Ketheric "
"and his grim cause."
msgstr "여기서 일했던 건 노예나 언데드가 아니야. 케서릭의 음침한 대의에 충성했던 부역자들이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_MistressOfSouls_Combat
#. Speaker = Kressa Bonedaughter
#. NodeID = 2691d74c-45d3-9c32-4a01-2a85903c8c16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_MistressOfSouls_Combat:2691d74c-45d3-9c32-4a01-2a85903c8c16
msgctxt "h49472872g1371g4784g9609gc64319d75bfe"
msgid "Not even the worms will want your carcass once I'm done with you!"
msgstr "시체에 구더기조차 꼬이지 않도록 참혹하게 죽여주마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_MistressOfSouls_GoForth
#. Speaker = Kressa Bonedaughter
#. NodeID = 047ee0e0-1ae5-4d37-98b4-d3da8bcf8395
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_MistressOfSouls_GoForth:047ee0e0-1ae5-4d37-98b4-d3da8bcf8395
msgctxt "h911a9de5g3272g487dg94b4g65bc0b70f540"
msgid "Gather yourselves - soon, we march to victory."
msgstr "준비를 하거라. 곧, 우린 승리를 향해 나아가리니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_001_Combat
#. Speaker = Hairy Henry
#. NodeID = e80a082b-03ca-43ad-bf8f-4e42342645b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_001_Combat:e80a082b-03ca-43ad-bf8f-4e42342645b2
msgctxt "hcee74f70gf288g41cagb34fgc26b99f908dc"
msgid "You will beg for death long before we grant it!"
msgstr "네놈은 죽여 달라고 구걸하게 될 것이다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_002_AttackDummy
#. Speaker = Ironfinger
#. NodeID = 144549dd-0680-4d6d-9ee7-43822a3d50e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 2bc86ee2-13ec-992e-993a-8b2fb705bd0a_B = False
#.      - 2bc86ee2-13ec-992e-993a-8b2fb705bd0a_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2bc86ee2-13ec-992e-993a-8b2fb705bd0a_B = True
#.     - 2bc86ee2-13ec-992e-993a-8b2fb705bd0a_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_002_AttackDummy:144549dd-0680-4d6d-9ee7-43822a3d50e7
msgctxt "h58393861ge61dg408dgb994g9ba3b51857db"
msgid "I won't hold back."
msgstr "참지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_001_Prayer
#. Speaker = Hairy Henry
#. NodeID = 22276d81-d631-4e73-b5e1-948c546f5696
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - a2b4b527-63b6-ffde-caf9-cb61e6405ce3_A = True
#.      - a2b4b527-63b6-ffde-caf9-cb61e6405ce3_B = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a2b4b527-63b6-ffde-caf9-cb61e6405ce3_A = False
#.     - a2b4b527-63b6-ffde-caf9-cb61e6405ce3_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_001_Prayer:22276d81-d631-4e73-b5e1-948c546f5696
msgctxt "h2ce718a7g1f23g4213gbebbg22c2fec252b2"
msgid "All that live are yours, Myrkul. Let us hasten them on their journey."
msgstr "살아있는 모든 생명은 것은 당신의 것입니다, 머큘이시여, 당신의 곁으로 저들을 빠르게 보내버리겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_002_AttackDummy
#. Speaker = Ironfinger
#. NodeID = 1d9c15f1-c4a2-4ec5-86b0-c006c1e18196
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 2bc86ee2-13ec-992e-993a-8b2fb705bd0a_B = True
#.      - 2bc86ee2-13ec-992e-993a-8b2fb705bd0a_A = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2bc86ee2-13ec-992e-993a-8b2fb705bd0a_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_002_AttackDummy:1d9c15f1-c4a2-4ec5-86b0-c006c1e18196
msgctxt "hfada61fag17f6g4ffbg92d3g0bed5e4330c1"
msgid "My aim is true."
msgstr "내 의도는 순수해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_001_Prayer
#. Speaker = Hairy Henry
#. NodeID = 2e9eb598-0e56-4abf-83f3-7d6a22682a07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - a2b4b527-63b6-ffde-caf9-cb61e6405ce3_A = False
#.      - a2b4b527-63b6-ffde-caf9-cb61e6405ce3_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a2b4b527-63b6-ffde-caf9-cb61e6405ce3_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_001_Prayer:2e9eb598-0e56-4abf-83f3-7d6a22682a07
msgctxt "h2ba6d2c2g3155g45f5gb28cg85421d304eb4"
msgid "Their cities shall become charnel houses."
msgstr "저들의 도시는 납골당으로 변하리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_002_AttackDummy
#. Speaker = Ironfinger
#. NodeID = a07c4827-6c6b-4ebd-97b1-494d807b5b67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2bc86ee2-13ec-992e-993a-8b2fb705bd0a_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_002_AttackDummy:a07c4827-6c6b-4ebd-97b1-494d807b5b67
msgctxt "h89fda1f1gb77dg46f3g80e4gd06dcc822a0c"
msgid "We will reap the Sword Coast."
msgstr "우린 소드 코스트를 차지할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_001_Prayer
#. Speaker = Hairy Henry
#. NodeID = 58c1bdf2-d1ff-4052-9817-5c6e0490d054
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a2b4b527-63b6-ffde-caf9-cb61e6405ce3_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_001_Prayer:58c1bdf2-d1ff-4052-9817-5c6e0490d054
msgctxt "h408b4a4fg2c1cg44efga9c6gbd71b4301bf7"
msgid ""
"We are yours, Lord of Bones, in this life and the eternity that follows."
msgstr "우린 당신의 것입니다, 뼈의 군주시여, 이 삶과 그 뒤 영원토록 당신을 따르겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Barracks_AD_SkullLasher_002_AttackDummy
#. Speaker = Ironfinger
#. NodeID = ad95e051-5715-4b0a-a5ca-e1e87986583d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
