#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Entrance_PAD:f6188594-8a4b-1f1c-9366-81d122eea215
msgctxt "h776fac6fg4237g4e2eg93f5gfddaed35b2d9"
msgid "Your father too, if our fortunes are so kind."
msgstr "운이 좋다면, 네 아버지도 찾게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Entrance_PAD_NeverThoughtWouldReturn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2daf8ae4-a0dc-47f5-bb1e-c7e6e46fcf91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Entrance_PAD_NeverThoughtWouldReturn:2daf8ae4-a0dc-47f5-bb1e-c7e6e46fcf91
msgctxt "h86cdfefag3d32g4a2fg9ee8g499fb16a17a5"
msgid "Be thankful you don't carry one of their worms inside your skull."
msgstr "머릿속에 그 벌레를 넣고 다니지 않아도 된다는 사실에 감사하도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Entrance_PAD_NeverThoughtWouldReturn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2daf8ae4-a0dc-47f5-bb1e-c7e6e46fcf91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Entrance_PAD_NeverThoughtWouldReturn:2daf8ae4-a0dc-47f5-bb1e-c7e6e46fcf91
msgctxt "h27fbb55ag99aag4166g9232gb001b3f7e25d"
msgid "Maybe it's me, but you sound almost <i>nostalgic.</i>"
msgstr "내 기분 탓일지 모르지만, 네 말은 마치 <i>그리워하는</i> 것처럼 들려."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Entrance_PAD_NeverThoughtWouldReturn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2daf8ae4-a0dc-47f5-bb1e-c7e6e46fcf91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Entrance_PAD_NeverThoughtWouldReturn:2daf8ae4-a0dc-47f5-bb1e-c7e6e46fcf91
msgctxt "h7bf7e5e4g5a1bg4b93g8397gdfe6171060ac"
msgid "I think we have more pressing concerns than a trip down memory lane."
msgstr "추억의 뒤안길 말고 더 급한 일이 있을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Entrance_PAD_NeverThoughtWouldReturn
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = c0e0c6bb-ede3-4bb4-a3bf-c6c5c880d571
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Entrance_PAD_NeverThoughtWouldReturn:c0e0c6bb-ede3-4bb4-a3bf-c6c5c880d571
msgctxt "h29acbed3g882dg4b3ag90degb60d392ba2b1"
msgid ""
"Of all the beastly lairs I've had to poke my nose into - an illithid colony "
"is still by far the worst."
msgstr "온갖 짐승의 굴 속을 다녀봤지만 - 일리시드 군집에서 나는 냄새가 그 중 최악이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_AD_IntellectDevourer
