msgctxt "h8e662d71g45b2g4374g804ag34f37bb97bc2"
msgid "So long in silence - now the Elder sings!"
msgstr "오랜 침묵을 깨고, 엘더가 노래를 부른다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment:12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
msgctxt "hf0375cc3gf74cg4392gab30g9f718518f1f5"
msgid ""
"The little brains aren't attacking. They must think we're all on the same "
"side."
msgstr "작은 뇌들이 공격하지 않아. 우리가 같은 편이라고 생각하는 게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment:12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
msgctxt "he4076194g7710g44d2ga6a5g892a7b8ffed1"
msgid "The devourers are leaving us be. They think we're one of them."
msgstr "포식자들이 우리를 내버려 두고 있어, 그들 중 하나라고 생각하나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment:12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
msgctxt "hdaeb23b6gf1fag4f88g8059gb0b235daa1c2"
msgid "Strange - they're leaving us be. Do they think we're one of them?"
msgstr "이상해. 우리를 내버려 두고 있어. 그들 중 하나라고 생각하는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment:12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
msgctxt "hbdc49953g3b1fg4740gafd2g2f6eb27dfb87"
msgid "They're not attacking - perhaps they think we're the same as them."
msgstr "공격을 안하네. 아마 우리가 그들과 같다고 생각하나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment:12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
msgctxt "h22a5fa76ga7acg40ceg81c4g7be5a682ede6"
msgid ""
"Those brain-things aren't attacking - they must think I'm one of... them."
msgstr "저 뇌들이 공격하지 않아. 우리가 그들 중 하나라고 생각하는 게 틀림없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment:12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
msgctxt "h8346da76g1070g45b2ga1f8g65173af8d10b"
msgid "Huh. They think we're... friends? Allies?"
msgstr "허. 우리를 친구나 같은 편으로 생각한다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment:12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
msgctxt "h515cac41g6e68g4c60gb7a0g5f4d0a4e10e8"
msgid "They know their own kind - quite the welcome home."
msgstr "집에 돌아온 것 처럼 환영하는 거 보니, 같은 종족으로 생각하나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment:12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
msgctxt "h20071c0fgae0dg4e96gaa41g1f35316d11c8"
msgid "They are not attacking - perhaps they think you are one of their own."
msgstr "공격하지 않네. 아마도 동족이라고 생각하는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_GEN_PAD_IntellectDevourerComment:12396ce2-12f9-43b1-a814-09559fc8df33
msgctxt "hd4aa7b12g607cg41bcgae1bg0e706f571c9a"
msgid "They're not attacking. Seems they think we're allies."
msgstr "공격을 안하네. 우리가 아군이라고 생각하나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail:1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
msgctxt "h83fc746agdcecg406bgb154gc28feeff6aa5"
msgid "Hardly any point - the platform's already here."
msgstr "전혀 필요 없어 - 벌써 승강기가 여기 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail:1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
msgctxt "h23dbc236gc80eg42b7g955egfe351012a8ce"
msgid "The elevation device is already in place. All I have to do is hop on."
msgstr "올라가는 장치가 이미 있어. 나는 올라 타기만 하면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail:1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
msgctxt "h80fd489bg632ag463eg8596g4403a091a566"
msgid "Platform's here. Good to go."
msgstr "승강기가 왔어. 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail:1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
msgctxt "h4bb7c239g663bg4030g82e7g7e0799421a01"
msgid "Pointless to touch this foul device - the platform is already here."
msgstr "그 몹쓸 장치를 만져봐야 소용 없어 - 승강기가 이미 왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail:1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
msgctxt "ha07e6e7bgb9c9g4f83g9dfeg62699453deb8"
msgid "Not much point when the platform's already here."
msgstr "승강기가 이미 와있는데 별 의미 없어보여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail:1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
msgctxt "h75558202gcc01g4321g8289g0465a12704e6"
msgid "No need - the platform's here."
msgstr "필요없어 - 승강기가 왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_CallLiftFail:1caeef34-0f71-4ec9-acbd-006c0e2b9b83
msgctxt "h56a471fcg6280g42d7g9589g9904e75a654d"
msgid "The platform's already here."
msgstr "승강기가 이미 와있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
msgctxt "he2b18258g4173g400fg986egc1bd0beb2cfa"
msgid "Mine too - it senses something down there. Something big."
msgstr "내 올챙이도 그래. 저 아래에 뭔가 있는 게 느껴져. 그것도 거대한 녀석이."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
msgctxt "hfe6400c8g37e7g441ag843eg4e819419b1ac"
msgid "Something's roused them. Something significant."
msgstr "뭔가 대단한 게 올챙이들을 깨웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
msgctxt "h104fefc0g2b9eg43a9g9a5eg30c7da86da83"
msgid "It's reacting to something down here. We should prepare to do the same."
msgstr "올챙이가 저 아래 뭔가에 반응하고 있어. 우리도 준비해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
msgctxt "h0a5d670fg28cag41b4gb89dg95859f7725f4"
msgid "It's almost like it's excited by something. Drawn to it."
msgstr "녀석이 무언가에 홀려서 들떠있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
msgctxt "h1495c8d1g7f67g4705g8df0gf6d90548371e"
msgid "It senses something, doesn't it? I'll keep my guard up."
msgstr "뭔가를 알아챘나 보군, 그렇지? 경계를 늦추지 말아야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
msgctxt "h8e402af2g9303g49d8g8e20gfe7ea7357f19"
msgid "Mine too. It's... excited by something down here."
msgstr "내 올챙이도 그래. 저 아래에 있는 녀석 때문에 들떠있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:a013428f-4794-4d4e-aeea-9ba40776ca17
msgctxt "h2cef839ag9fd5g43b3gbdf7g6a43e47f6fb9"
msgid "Aye. Feels like something down here has them excited... or scared."
msgstr "응, 아래에 있는 녀석이 올챙이를 들뜨게 만들고 있는 게 느껴져...아니면 두렵게 만들거나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
msgctxt "h70602865g4ac9g4d87g9d72ga1ca4f5201da"
msgid ""
"Hells, I can feel the worm squirming - like it wants to burrow through my "
"skull."
msgstr "젠장, 올챙이가 꿈틀대는 게 느껴져, 내 머리를 뚫고 숨기를 원하는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
msgctxt "h2f0b3700ga20fg4214gaaa0ge3984152e163"
msgid "Feel that? Our tadpoles are restless."
msgstr "느껴져? 올챙이들이 가만히 있질 못해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
msgctxt "ha41640beg4075g4ddega98dga724b804c29a"
msgid "My tadpole's growing restless. Does anyone else feel that?"
msgstr "내 올챙이가 가만히 있지를 못하네. 너희는 좀 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
msgctxt "h095bacb3g8dc3g42d5gb739ga73ae175f2aa"
msgid "Ngh... anyone else feel like their tadpole is set to burst?"
msgstr "윽... 올챙이가 터질 것 같은 느낌이 드는 사람 또 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
msgctxt "h19075444g687dg4df5g97bagddae0773c864"
msgid ""
"Agh, the tadpole feels like it's about to <i>pop</i>. Is anyone else's head "
"squirming?"
msgstr "윽, 올챙이가 곧 <i>터질 것 같아</i>. 머릿속에서 꿈틀거리는 사람 또 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
msgctxt "h73a8bda1g751bg447dgb876g75bdbf309e97"
msgid "Tadpole's lashing around like a whip."
msgstr "올챙이가 격렬하게 휘젓고 다니고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:b67c7f3e-03fa-4dab-9394-5e88793745cf
msgctxt "ha34eccb9g6f6cg43bcgb86age0dfabdbefa1"
msgid "Is anyone else's tadpole squirming around a lot more than usual?"
msgstr "올챙이가 평소보다 훨씬 더 꿈틀거리는 사람 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
msgctxt "hb6eebaefgb70ag4dbbgaa6eg6ba7b42d2fc9"
msgid ""
"I can feel the parasite squirming in my skull. There's something big ahead - "
"and the worm knows it."
msgstr "내 머릿속에서 올챙이가 꿈틀거리는 게 느껴져. 엄청난 녀석이 이 앞에 있어, 그리고 올챙이도 그걸 알고 있고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
msgctxt "h3ea983e0g8566g46d0ga9fegd1f9fde910da"
msgid "My tadpole is restless. It senses something... significant."
msgstr "내 올챙이가 가만히 있지 않아. 녀석이 뭔가 엄청난게 있다는 걸 느끼고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
msgctxt "h9ff69671ga5adg4e93g939fg2ed419a589f5"
msgid "My tadpole's growing restless. Feels like it's excited. Or terrified."
msgstr "내 올챙이가 가만히 있지 않아. 녀석이 신나거나, 두려워 하는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
msgctxt "h8cdf35e2g0332g4d4aga6c7g5a9a17e4711b"
msgid "Ngh... feels like my tadpole is going to burst out of my skull."
msgstr "윽... 올챙이가 내 머리를 부수고 튀어나갈 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
msgctxt "hacefc5c0g981dg4735g9141gaaca50ecd2f0"
msgid "Ha! I think I can feel my tadpole kicking."
msgstr "하! 올챙이 발길질이 느껴지는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
msgctxt "h1d2fae25g7e01g445dg8775g6ae59fe8ef0b"
msgid "Tadpole's lashing around like a whip."
msgstr "올챙이가 채찍처럼 휘젓고 다니고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
msgctxt "h85f93179g55d8g4223gaf78gd07c5857c74d"
msgid "Down, then - to see what waits."
msgstr "그러면, 내려가서 뭐가 우리를 기다리고 있는지 보도록 하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
msgctxt "he976710fgf016g4d95g8cb3g40b771c177dd"
msgid ""
"This place seems endless. Need to remain on guard - who is to say what "
"awaits?"
msgstr "여기는 끝도 없이 광활하네. 뭐가 우리를 기다릴지 모르니, 경계를 유지해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_General_PAD_ElevatorBanter:f291de56-b7bf-45b5-8511-8fcfaa72f5b9
msgctxt "h2cd7ad6dg6f98g4f70gbea6g24651b9fb28e"
msgid "My tadpole's squirming like it's excited... or scared."
msgstr "올챙이가 신이 난 듯 꿈틀거려...아니면 겁을 먹었거나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_IsobelKilled
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = c8b60d86-5050-01ed-72c0-6748445b012f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_IsobelKilled:c8b60d86-5050-01ed-72c0-6748445b012f
msgctxt "h6b944f42gdd44g4ddbgaebag2b42e27b0c46"
msgid "My Lord brought her back once already. <i>Your</i> death will be final."
msgstr "그 분께서 이미 한 번 그녀를 되살리셨다. <i>너의</i> 죽음은 영원할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_IsobelKilled
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = df18985c-59a4-bf68-956b-a4c951ef4ad5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_IsobelKilled:df18985c-59a4-bf68-956b-a4c951ef4ad5
msgctxt "h060bf676g91d1g4a19g93f5ga6757a01bf3c"
msgid "ISOBEL!"
msgstr "<b>이소벨</b>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_KethericCommandTroops
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = cecd56ac-e52f-4ce3-93c9-327de0308135
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_KethericCommandTroops:cecd56ac-e52f-4ce3-93c9-327de0308135
msgctxt "h531adce3g28b1g4e14g8fc3g07707c9d45a6"
msgid "Focus your attack, soldiers."
msgstr "제군들, 공격을 집중해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_KethericFingerOfDeath
#. Speaker = Myrkul
#. NodeID = 7d1d597d-31a9-4d62-8931-a701a226c7ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_KethericFingerOfDeath:7d1d597d-31a9-4d62-8931-a701a226c7ab
msgctxt "hd542ed8cg93bbg4a18ga85fg6381b3db53d8"
msgid "Die, and serve again."
msgstr "죽거라, 그리고 다시 섬겨라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_KethericInvulnerable
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = a873a44d-d72e-68ab-a9c6-890b8a454394
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_KethericInvulnerable:a873a44d-d72e-68ab-a9c6-890b8a454394
msgctxt "h8ae73c10g00beg473dgb6c0g80ad5750558b"
msgid "Have you not learned? I am beyond death, fool."
msgstr "아직도 몰랐나? 나는 죽음을 초월한 자다, 멍청아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_KethericInvulnerable_Apostle
#. Speaker = Myrkul
#. NodeID = 22870f69-f84a-43a1-8b5c-a5df9cf3034f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_KethericInvulnerable_Apostle:22870f69-f84a-43a1-8b5c-a5df9cf3034f
msgctxt "he27487c5g6788g418egbc25gdabba52c19a9"
msgid "I AM NO SLAVE TO DEATH - I AM ITS MASTER."
msgstr "나는 죽음의 노예가 아니니 - 나는 죽음의 주인이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongApostle
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = c9b742b9-9338-0e06-d957-5bb3afdf160e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. Comment = TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongApostle:c9b742b9-9338-0e06-d957-5bb3afdf160e
msgctxt "h9bed203aga4c1g479cgb53dga0ab10cbc827"
msgid "Now you wear a face to match your soul, oathbreaker."
msgstr "이제 네 영혼에 걸맞는 얼굴을 하는군, 맹세파기자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongAfterCombat
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = e90ec873-dafe-460f-b948-7e183d201dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. Comment = TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongAfterCombat:e90ec873-dafe-460f-b948-7e183d201dcd
msgctxt "h00d2c107g54f6g4f45g9d8bg566a7a9b66a6"
msgid "We fly at your word."
msgstr "떠나고 싶을 때 말하라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = df97ee97-99cc-fd36-52d7-81ebaa98783e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongFreed:df97ee97-99cc-fd36-52d7-81ebaa98783e
msgctxt "h7ed3fd0eg93d8g4260g9fa6gcbd97b96405e"
msgid "KETHERIC THORM - FACE ME!"
msgstr "<b>케서릭 쏨 - 덤벼라!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = f807f3dd-36a3-1e49-fee9-16fdf4261e53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongFreed:f807f3dd-36a3-1e49-fee9-16fdf4261e53
msgctxt "hf11bb153g3c34g4262g8fe9gc9e484d19aa3"
msgid "<i>BACK IN YOUR CAGE.</i>"
msgstr "<i>네 우리로 돌아가거라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongFreed_Apostle
#. Speaker = Myrkul
#. NodeID = 0531b4ef-0e0b-4eb3-84e5-c8d2121090b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongFreed_Apostle:0531b4ef-0e0b-4eb3-84e5-c8d2121090b8
msgctxt "h0eb0ca4cgdba9g45a4g84b1g9a99fb24f93a"
msgid "<i>BACK IN YOUR CAGE.</i>"
msgstr "<i>니 우리로 돌아가거라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongFreed_Apostle
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = c5eaaca9-9c54-4bff-8122-fbb4ddffb88b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongFreed_Apostle:c5eaaca9-9c54-4bff-8122-fbb4ddffb88b
msgctxt "hf364fd32g6c5eg4f78gaa94ged9169cd2851"
msgid "KETHERIC THORM - FACE ME!"
msgstr "<b>케서릭 쏨 - 덤벼라!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongTransform
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = ea06620d-1f94-44e0-8396-6a3994261dde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. Comment = TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_NightsongTransform:ea06620d-1f94-44e0-8396-6a3994261dde
msgctxt "h6e40a987gae87g4cd5g8279g8009ae196a50"
msgid "MOONMAIDEN, HEAR ME! DAME AYLIN IS FREE!"
msgstr "<b>달의 여신이시여, 들으소서! 여기사 에일린은 자유의 몸입니다!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_Phase3Transition
#. Speaker = Myrkul
#. NodeID = 033146de-9c49-ba55-e26f-d1a264d64e1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_AD_Phase3Transition:033146de-9c49-ba55-e26f-d1a264d64e1c
msgctxt "he9926407g1431g4b58g9e89ga9a1a5cdc118"
msgid "UNLIFE TO MY LIFE - SUSTAIN ME, SLAVES."
msgstr "<b>죽음으로 나의 생명을 - 나의 양분이 되어라, 노예들아.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 05be6db4-a856-eb2b-30aa-a44aa4e2dbd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:05be6db4-a856-eb2b-30aa-a44aa4e2dbd6
msgctxt "hd60a35c8g3e2dg42c1g86b4g128df8b0459d"
msgid ""
"Go ahead. We stand no chance against such forces. Let's end this together."
msgstr "어서 해. 저렇게 강대한 적을 상대로는 승산이 없어. 함께 끝내자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = 0910aa99-28f5-f79e-921a-f3a61e99080c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:0910aa99-28f5-f79e-921a-f3a61e99080c
msgctxt "h89e6d96age803g4714gb59dg18c4e74ccd48"
msgid "Behold, Duke Ravengard: the Absolute!"
msgstr "레이븐가드 공작, 목도하시게. 절대자를!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0b3e7765-e34f-7b4f-3d28-9ef17530a6ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:0b3e7765-e34f-7b4f-3d28-9ef17530a6ae
msgctxt "h98108060g5b88g4e59g9307gf582c406d364"
msgid ""
"*Beneath the smoking ashes of Moonrise Towers, the elder brain lies "
"destroyed. But what of the tadpoles it commanded?*"
msgstr "*문라이즈 타워의 연기 나는 폐허 아래에서, 엘더 브레인은 파괴되었습니다. 허나 그것이 지배하던 올챙이들은 어떻게 되었을까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 0eef8659-d9c3-4b77-821d-31acbbf55b5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:0eef8659-d9c3-4b77-821d-31acbbf55b5c
msgctxt "hf739a32ag1cecg48b4gbf06gb46d1c67d867"
msgid "NO!"
msgstr "<b>안 돼!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 0eef8659-d9c3-4b77-821d-31acbbf55b5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:0eef8659-d9c3-4b77-821d-31acbbf55b5c
msgctxt "h16f390acgae1eg4025g8784g66e14aec9722"
msgid "NO!"
msgstr "<b>안 돼!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = 0f4a97d6-17a0-12da-e191-367d5bd74666
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Audience_Event_PassTeleporter = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:0f4a97d6-17a0-12da-e191-367d5bd74666
msgctxt "h9db3aacbg001ag460cga910gcc20c0aaed2c"
msgid ""
"A rogue True Soul, flaunting it under your very nose. And you almost "
"<i>missed</i> it."
msgstr "독자적으로 행동하는 참된 영혼이 네 코앞에서 그걸 들고 돌아다니고 있었는데, 넌 그걸 거의 <i>놓칠</i> 뻔했잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = 11e41159-e7ef-602b-dbda-3992995ab62c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:11e41159-e7ef-602b-dbda-3992995ab62c
msgctxt "h8198edcdg1a8cg4284ga095g9d1df4e13485"
msgid ""
"You've built an army for our masters, true enough. But what of the Astral "
"Prism?"
msgstr "우리 주인님들을 위해 네가 군대를 양성했지, 그건 맞아. 하지만 아스트랄 프리즘은 어쩌고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 1ac4755c-89a9-ca2a-dd84-dae8680af2b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Karlach_Knows_GortashGrudge = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:1ac4755c-89a9-ca2a-dd84-dae8680af2b4
msgctxt "heafc1f42g7ed2g4c08gbabfg767647b29201"
msgid "It isn't you I answer to, Gortash."
msgstr "난 너를 섬기는 게 아니다. 고타쉬."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1b4e6eeb-586a-5d02-e83c-f17f3eb8b82d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:1b4e6eeb-586a-5d02-e83c-f17f3eb8b82d
msgctxt "he34c1914gb5ceg49a2gb4c3g571f179cce87"
msgid ""
"*Freed of the Absolute's control, they will complete their transformations. "
"A plague of illithids will soon descend on the Sword Coast, enslaving all "
"they do not infect.*"
msgstr ""
"*절대자의 통제에서 벗어난 올챙이들은 이윽고 변이를 끝마칠 것입니다. 머지않아 일리시드의 무리가 역병처럼 소드 코스트에 내려앉을 것이고, "
"감염시키지 않은 자들은 전부 노예로 삼을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ff23c50-2f68-be95-3a5c-c154a0d352a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:1ff23c50-2f68-be95-3a5c-c154a0d352a3
msgctxt "hcfd29d86g523ag4457ga622g694c9a492041"
msgid "<i>Or the beginning of something else... You will not die today.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아니면 다른 무언가의 시작일지도 모른다... 당신은 오늘 죽지 않을 것이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 202e046c-59c2-640c-43b3-a9cc11c35de0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DatingGale(5) = False
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithGale(5) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:202e046c-59c2-640c-43b3-a9cc11c35de0
msgctxt "h06528602g5d63g4110g8280g4214773f151c"
msgid "Trust me, Gale. We'll find another way."
msgstr "나를 믿어, 게일. 다른 방법을 찾을 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = 2059bdab-a9c1-123d-a3b0-fc351cb8d72f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:2059bdab-a9c1-123d-a3b0-fc351cb8d72f
msgctxt "hc348dce6gd522g4498gae54g4632041138e6"
msgid ""
"The distractions have been <i>yours</i>, Ketheric. Perhaps we never should "
"have dug your daughter up."
msgstr "한눈은 <i>네가</i> 판 거잖아, 케서릭. 네 딸을 되살리지 않는 게 나았겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b78a54d-858f-4780-a4aa-a3ae04f7ae8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:2b78a54d-858f-4780-a4aa-a3ae04f7ae8e
msgctxt "h8e87b70fgf400g49bbg8788g41ab8cd825d7"
msgid "But I can't... This is it. I must do as Mystra commands."
msgstr "하지만 그럴 순 없어... 이걸로 끝이야. 미스트라가 명령한 대로 해야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = 3342454b-ca10-df0b-2523-7be1843f525f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:3342454b-ca10-df0b-2523-7be1843f525f
msgctxt "h70aa183bg8722g4989gbbc7g04d3d6a51d72"
msgid "Now! It's really time we were going."
msgstr "자! 이제 진짜 가야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 46bf4c17-1a9b-5cbb-723f-e28226fbe2b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:46bf4c17-1a9b-5cbb-723f-e28226fbe2b4
msgctxt "h5a20c560gff57g4784g8609gae3b0a7986c7"
msgid ""
"*Freed of the Absolute's control, they will complete their transformations. "
"A plague of illithids will soon descend on the Sword Coast, enslaving all "
"they do not infect.*"
msgstr ""
"*절대자의 통제에서 벗어난 올챙이들은 이윽고 변이를 끝마칠 것입니다. 머지않아 일리시드의 무리가 역병처럼 소드 코스트에 내려앉을 것이고, "
"감염시키지 않은 자들은 전부 노예로 삼을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4715ece2-52ea-ca83-0f24-c7e5f4221682
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:4715ece2-52ea-ca83-0f24-c7e5f4221682
msgctxt "he65b9f61g5856g41a0g9b46g4627c45b67a2"
msgid "Very well. Whether I condemn this world or not: I choose you."
msgstr "좋아. 내가 이 세상에 사형 선고를 내린 건지 아닌지는 모르겠지만, 네 말을 따르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48b7d89a-ff8c-32f1-1091-732f7e0d6275
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithGale(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Gale_State_ChosenThree_ChooseMe(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:48b7d89a-ff8c-32f1-1091-732f7e0d6275
msgctxt "h5bf0b624g7abag4296gbf00g3e8dc7f0aefd"
msgid ""
"You could choose me, the one who loves you. We can find another way together."
msgstr "우리는 서로 사랑하잖아. 내 말대로 해. 함께 다른 방법을 찾아볼 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 4cee9e37-a07c-49d8-918d-e04b24ed167f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - COL_KethericShowdown_State_WasActiveSpeaker(5) = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:4cee9e37-a07c-49d8-918d-e04b24ed167f
msgctxt "ha3bd0218g99b4g4f76gb060gb0143e9ffeae"
msgid ""
"An elder brain... one of the cruellest and most powerful creatures in "
"existence, enslaved by mere mortals."
msgstr "엘더 브레인... 존재하는 생명체 중 가장 잔혹하고 강대한 존재 중 하나가 단순한 필멸자들의 노예가 되어 있다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 4cee9e37-a07c-49d8-918d-e04b24ed167f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - COL_KethericShowdown_State_WasActiveSpeaker(5) = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:4cee9e37-a07c-49d8-918d-e04b24ed167f
msgctxt "h2a9a4ec8gdcb7g4ecega773gc2e648df415b"
msgid ""
"An elder brain... one of the cruellest and most powerful creatures in "
"existence, enslaved by mere mortals."
msgstr "엘더 브레인... 존재하는 생명체 중 가장 잔혹하고 강대한 존재 중 하나가 단순한 필멸자들의 노예가 되어 있다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4fd3ab9b-e80a-34ce-6645-80979a93591d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DatingGale(5) = True
#.      - ORI_State_PartneredWithGale(5) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:4fd3ab9b-e80a-34ce-6645-80979a93591d
msgctxt "h77846fa8g3787g488cg9fefg36d02d1b6004"
msgid ""
"Please, Gale. It can't end like this. We can find another way. Together."
msgstr "부탁이야, 게일. 이렇게 끝날 수는 없어. 다른 방법을 찾아보자. 함께 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 535973ac-5b83-2732-ee70-0c98e4b3d7a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:535973ac-5b83-2732-ee70-0c98e4b3d7a0
msgctxt "h0c64db56ge7c0g40bfg981bg51225d1dd30a"
msgid ""
"To end it... To struggle on... It is a grave choice you're making for us "
"both, but if it must be so - very well, I'll stand down to stand by you."
msgstr ""
"다 끝내거나... 계속 분투하거나... 우리 둘 모두에게 중대한 선택이지만, 꼭 그래야만 하는 거라면... 좋아. 물러서서 네 곁에 "
"서겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 557f1280-31da-cf80-dd19-90c41ce66a0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MUTED(8) = False
#.      - AVATAR(8) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(8) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_WyllShoutedFather = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:557f1280-31da-cf80-dd19-90c41ce66a0a
msgctxt "hebd7cf7ag09ebg4bd6gb29fgaa74064bc315"
msgid "Shit, no - father!"
msgstr "젠장, 안 돼. 아버지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 55ca7914-cd6f-d8bd-8d46-1ff33f9187e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:55ca7914-cd6f-d8bd-8d46-1ff33f9187e5
msgctxt "h57649503g46d5g42e0g80e0g750a27f60816"
msgid ""
"*It is an ending, of sorts. Though not the one destiny had in store for you.*"
msgstr "*일종의 결말이라고 할 수 있습니다. 비록 운명이 당신을 위해 준비해 놓았던 것은 아니지만 말입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 57bc4a9f-72d7-7a24-30bf-a14a08244303
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:57bc4a9f-72d7-7a24-30bf-a14a08244303
msgctxt "h5e056513g7b56g444fgb05eg222a9dc5a4c7"
msgid ""
"*It is an ending, of sorts. Though not the one destiny had in store for you.*"
msgstr "*일종의 결말이라고 할 수 있습니다. 비록 운명이 당신을 위해 준비해 놓았던 것은 아니지만 말입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = 5e9f5921-6c53-35e8-9687-482307f67a80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:5e9f5921-6c53-35e8-9687-482307f67a80
msgctxt "h30176639g17f6g4c91g8458gfb03d3a63a45"
msgid ""
"We will empty this place and begin the march. You may catch up with the army "
"once you've retrieved the weapon."
msgstr "우리는 이 곳을 비우고 행군을 시작하겠어. 넌 무기를 손에 넣고 나서 따라오면 되겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 6185b1eb-0fbc-3982-f9c4-3019131cc3ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_ControlledByActiveSpeakerAvatar(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - MUTED(7) = False
#.      - AVATAR(7) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Gale_State_SawElderBrain = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:6185b1eb-0fbc-3982-f9c4-3019131cc3ce
msgctxt "h623332d9ge3b7g4700gb795g46a64c7a41b6"
msgid ""
"Look at that crown. It radiates with power unlike anything I've ever seen. "
"To have it... to hold... If only I could..."
msgstr "저 왕관을 봐. 내가 지금껏 본 적 없는 강대한 힘을 발산하고 있어. 저것을... 가질 수만... 손에 넣을 수만 있다면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = 642c3ab7-0ec7-ce96-5f46-e524480cda6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:642c3ab7-0ec7-ce96-5f46-e524480cda6e
msgctxt "h318378ebg0f81g42bcg8836g52c0460b2336"
msgid ""
"Orin and I can wait for you no longer. The plan proceeds - we're going to "
"the city, and we expect you to follow - army and the weapon in tow."
msgstr ""
"오린과 나는 더 이상 기다릴 수 없어. 계획대로 진행한다. 우리는 먼저 도시로 갈 테니, 따라오길 기다리고 있겠어. 군대와 그 무기를 "
"챙겨서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 669a24a8-f16c-5834-c4f0-5b51c08a4225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:669a24a8-f16c-5834-c4f0-5b51c08a4225
msgctxt "hf904dcfag3d1ag4002gaa11g0a0270402458"
msgid "NO!"
msgstr "<b>안 돼!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 669a24a8-f16c-5834-c4f0-5b51c08a4225
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:669a24a8-f16c-5834-c4f0-5b51c08a4225
msgctxt "h6ca261ecg2e00g4e1bgae02gd6e56dfdccb5"
msgid "NO!"
msgstr "<b>안 돼!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = 6d8eae7f-325d-e6aa-8dc1-b90d46712ed7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:6d8eae7f-325d-e6aa-8dc1-b90d46712ed7
msgctxt "h5d624f19g9b2fg423fgb0a7g5402c7fa9551"
msgid "Oh, the <i>General</i> voice. Is this where we salute?"
msgstr "아, <i>장군님</i> 말투로구만. 경례라도 하면 되나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 70de3d84-7572-82b4-1a9a-640b6795e3d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MUTED(5) = False
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#.      - AVATAR(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:70de3d84-7572-82b4-1a9a-640b6795e3d0
msgctxt "hd2bf1f4agc03bg42a6gbaeagc1260d74e789"
msgid ""
"*There he is: the man who sold you to Zariel to live out your days in the "
"Hells.*"
msgstr "*당신을 자리엘에게 팔아넘기고 지옥에서 세월을 보내게 만든 그 남자가 바로 저기 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = 730130f3-198f-85fe-2ed2-1846ba517c7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:730130f3-198f-85fe-2ed2-1846ba517c7d
msgctxt "hcd6cd5d4ga592g46c1gae5dg5b478f46def6"
msgid "There we are. It wouldn't do to fight in front of our guest."
msgstr "저기 계시는구만. 손님 앞에서 싸우지는 말자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 77ec208c-de1a-653f-22c4-26441f95081a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:77ec208c-de1a-653f-22c4-26441f95081a
msgctxt "hd0393cc5g6559g4ba3gb110g8a1d8070a996"
msgid ""
"Balthazar has them now. He'll deliver the Prism soon enough - so if you "
"would cease these distractions, I -"
msgstr "발타자르가 녀석들을 붙잡아놓고 있다. 곧 프리즘도 가져올 테고, 그러니 그만 좀 귀찮게 굴면, 내가-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7dd09c40-80a0-c0ca-e952-a18babe53fd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:7dd09c40-80a0-c0ca-e952-a18babe53fd7
msgctxt "hfde6f081g47fbg4730gb888g6d7818ee564a"
msgid ""
"You're right... we truly have no other choice. This is it, then - the end of "
"ends."
msgstr "네 말이 맞아... 다른 선택지가 없어. 그럼 이걸로 끝이군, 종말의 끝이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = 87a98ca0-4277-ba60-7c1b-63efcd0c46ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:87a98ca0-4277-ba60-7c1b-63efcd0c46ec
msgctxt "h32a7e2fdg457cg42cag9632gdf4a7895295d"
msgid "And I am the hero who will save it."
msgstr "그리고 난 그 도시를 구원하는 영웅을 맡는 거고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 8a284fca-acbd-d313-7fb7-986c91282564
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:8a284fca-acbd-d313-7fb7-986c91282564
msgctxt "h37d1d73cgf76fg4ab9gaaacg1cb152cfbc50"
msgid "Growl."
msgstr "(으르렁거림)"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b61a0b0-2fb3-4bb4-4248-4d808fe54afc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MUTED(5) = False
#.      - AVATAR(5) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_WyllShoutedFather = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:8b61a0b0-2fb3-4bb4-4248-4d808fe54afc
msgctxt "h16a93743gb0d5g439fga3d7gca82086c1ca6"
msgid "Shit, no - father!"
msgstr "젠장, 안 돼. 아버지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Orin
#. NodeID = 8ed57b23-2760-8901-3279-ce730f1ac143
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:8ed57b23-2760-8901-3279-ce730f1ac143
msgctxt "h85978a5dg2ea0g4b27g95a2g129e0add4e22"
msgid ""
"Salute, yes, with cleavers through his blood-starved flesh. How it crawls "
"with failure like flies on lick-wet carrion."
msgstr ""
"경례라, 그래, 그 혈액 없는 육신에 칼을 박아 경의를 표해주지. 축축한 썩은 고기 위에 파리들이 가득하듯 그 육신에도 실패가 가득하구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 900fed7f-6b74-da4b-775e-dd9d0892ba8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:900fed7f-6b74-da4b-775e-dd9d0892ba8c
msgctxt "h42a219beg4c22g4c0dgb5bcga66f39dd34db"
msgid "One last gust of Weave. One last gale to end them all."
msgstr "마지막으로 부는 위브의 바람. 놈들을 끝장낼 마지막 돌풍이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 93bce30d-2033-2811-b9d9-039b85a4b7e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:93bce30d-2033-2811-b9d9-039b85a4b7e4
msgctxt "h711893a7gb092g42fcga7bcga50cfa23c710"
msgid ""
"*The orb senses your hesitation. It shudders within you - longing for "
"<i>something</i>, though you cannot tell what.*"
msgstr "*보주는 당신이 망설이는 것을 알아챕니다. 당신 몸 속에서 알 수 없는 <i>무언가</i>를 갈망하며, 전율하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = 94f39dac-51c0-1ae7-149a-4c5c8dc86f60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:94f39dac-51c0-1ae7-149a-4c5c8dc86f60
msgctxt "h81f49cdege96bg4794ga01eg6852fe5eccaf"
msgid ""
"If the weapon is truly in your grasp, Ketheric, might I suggest closing your "
"fist?"
msgstr "케서릭, 그 무기가 네 손바닥 안에 있다고 호언장담할 거면 말이야. 그 손을 쥐어서 좀 잡아보지 않겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 96e4847e-0c11-6c75-1ca7-dce9018d2e3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MUTED(5) = False
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#.      - AVATAR(5) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:96e4847e-0c11-6c75-1ca7-dce9018d2e3f
msgctxt "h6ef9575bgbd76g4b15g814aga08698bc45a0"
msgid "Motherfucker! <i>Gortash!</i>"
msgstr "이런 씨발! <i>고타쉬잖아!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Orin
#. NodeID = 99e16950-5859-e9f0-1256-92e5a98c804f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:99e16950-5859-e9f0-1256-92e5a98c804f
msgctxt "h11f91ca9g5640g4048g8e7dga33f73a7030e"
msgid "The lash of Bhaal."
msgstr "바알의 채찍."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Duke Ulder Ravengard
#. NodeID = 9d3f2041-d44f-40c4-63a5-a4654fc20b64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:9d3f2041-d44f-40c4-63a5-a4654fc20b64
msgctxt "hd97ccbd1g005fg455cga689g15e661edbe96"
msgid "<i>Helm preserve us...</i>"
msgstr "<i>헬름이시여, 저흴 지켜 주소서...</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = 9dc9529d-fc71-b1cb-eb62-18109380e309
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:9dc9529d-fc71-b1cb-eb62-18109380e309
msgctxt "h8037d310ge3f3g4caag8c8egab6cd6f4ce9a"
msgid ""
"So you <i>haven't </i>lost your edge. But you're still not as sharp as Orin "
"is, I wager."
msgstr "그래, 예리한 모습을 잃지는 <i>않았군</i>. 하지만 보아하니 여전히 오린만큼 날카롭지는 못하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = a2be8889-5672-d6cb-abe5-a5f2c3ca52ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:a2be8889-5672-d6cb-abe5-a5f2c3ca52ad
msgctxt "hb95f692fg7824g42efg8befg8db709ebe3e3"
msgid "I... I have no desire to end your life, you know that."
msgstr "나는... 네 목숨을 끝낼 생각은 없어, 알잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = a932dd43-431d-fc53-bce0-43da76f582cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:a932dd43-431d-fc53-bce0-43da76f582cf
msgctxt "hbb2bcde4gd258g46f4g9a70g8a8b277784e2"
msgid "One last gust of Weave. One last gale to end them all."
msgstr "마지막으로 부는 위브의 바람. 놈들을 끝장낼 마지막 돌풍이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Orin
#. NodeID = a967bde0-dd79-2921-8d4e-6fbfa2e99906
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:a967bde0-dd79-2921-8d4e-6fbfa2e99906
msgctxt "h3b93751agcddfg46fcg8cf9g7c926782afb4"
msgid "But he must lead the murdermarch to Baldur's Grave."
msgstr "하지만 이 녀석은 곧 무덤이 될 발더스 게이트로 살육의 행진을 이끌어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aac1bb80-a9d8-9866-5125-66994a913a9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MUTED(5) = False
#.      - AVATAR(5) = False
#.      - REALLY_GALE(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Gale_State_SawElderBrain = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:aac1bb80-a9d8-9866-5125-66994a913a9f
msgctxt "hefa68c32g1f5cg4aa0ga6b5gfd2acbbeea28"
msgid ""
"Look at that crown. It radiates with power unlike anything I've ever seen. "
"To have it... to hold... If only I could..."
msgstr "저 왕관을 봐. 내가 지금껏 본 적 없는 강대한 힘을 발산하고 있어. 저것을... 가질 수만... 손에 넣을 수만 있다면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ab171a8d-24c8-bd67-8a0a-db6e33471514
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:ab171a8d-24c8-bd67-8a0a-db6e33471514
msgctxt "h697f0a35g43a6g4af4g866agded37fa90b1d"
msgid ""
"*But here, in this very moment lies your chance to heed Mystra's call. This "
"must be it: the end of the Absolute.*"
msgstr "*하지만 바로 지금 이 순간이, 미스트라의 부름에 응할 기회입니다. 이것이 절대자의 종말이 될 것임이 틀림없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = ab7518c4-ba7f-bef3-5e42-f9f01143dd4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:ab7518c4-ba7f-bef3-5e42-f9f01143dd4d
msgctxt "h4b0dc873gf1cfg48aag8cc2gae111d9e9a3b"
msgid "You said it was under control."
msgstr "네 통제 하에 있다고 하지 않았나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Disembodied Voice
#. NodeID = ae05b5f1-3dc4-4115-61ca-91bccb558667
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:ae05b5f1-3dc4-4115-61ca-91bccb558667
msgctxt "h11af4744g6764g4d49gb459g6fe3e680fbdf"
msgid ""
"<b><i>It is time, faithful ones. March on Baldur's Gate. We go to prepare "
"the way.</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>때가 왔다, 신실한 자들이여. 발더스 게이트로 진군하라. 우리가 길을 닦아 놓을 것이다.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = aef575bd-e043-291f-957a-0d045ecfecdc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:aef575bd-e043-291f-957a-0d045ecfecdc
msgctxt "h1de69df2g9b8eg4565g9c2agbdd832940ade"
msgid "But I can't... This is it. I must do as Mystra commands."
msgstr "그렇지만 그럴 수는... 이걸로 끝이야. 미스트라가 명령한 대로 해야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b339cb7b-3c82-55ec-b3ab-3f4520d836af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MUTED(9) = False
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(9) = True
#.      - AVATAR(9) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:b339cb7b-3c82-55ec-b3ab-3f4520d836af
msgctxt "hee228e86g828ag4d2agaf15gf5e2842aba53"
msgid "Motherfucker! <i>Gortash!</i>"
msgstr "이런 씨발! <i>고타쉬잖아!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Orin
#. NodeID = b3a72e90-bceb-9589-a01d-b89035091407
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_SawRavengardTadpoled = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:b3a72e90-bceb-9589-a01d-b89035091407
msgctxt "h6de225f6gf531g4d63g828eg660ed497df1a"
msgid ""
"You wag your wordflap in vain, Ulderling. Once the worm holds the whip, your "
"shredded flesh will serve us."
msgstr "헛된 말장난은 집어치우거라, 작은 얼더야. 벌레가 통제력을 가지게 되면 네 강인한 육신이 우리를 섬기게 될 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = b877506d-1370-8dbb-a340-b91c382f6406
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:b877506d-1370-8dbb-a340-b91c382f6406
msgctxt "h070e5abeg8303g4fd9g968cgea26ebd1e7b4"
msgid ""
"And Ketheric - do try not to sulk. You're supposed to be the fearsome "
"General, come to conquer the city."
msgstr "그리고 케서릭, 그렇게 삐친 표정은 짓지 말도록 해. 도시를 정복하러 오는 무시무시한 장군님 역할을 해야 하니까 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ba625cb7-871c-5df5-3fea-1e7482ca7dc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:ba625cb7-871c-5df5-3fea-1e7482ca7dc8
msgctxt "hbd15adbcga7afg4f20gb13eg1e0c7b4ff75d"
msgid ""
"What choice do I have? More than just a goddess counts on my courage: whole "
"worlds hang in the balance."
msgstr "내게 무슨 선택지가 있겠어? 그저 한 여신이 내 용기에 의지하는 게 아니라, 전 세계가 위태로운 상황이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = bb70e2c7-3841-748f-f570-f57e514b5b05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:bb70e2c7-3841-748f-f570-f57e514b5b05
msgctxt "hfb9e42c8gb43dg4c25gb14eg5267f782f081"
msgid "The slayer against the undying one. That would be fun to see."
msgstr "살육자 대 불사자라니. 싸우면 볼만하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bca31ca3-069f-8f5d-ee49-9fba289e4666
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Gale_State_SawElderBrain = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:bca31ca3-069f-8f5d-ee49-9fba289e4666
msgctxt "h767f6a4eg4a91g436fgaa1agafe957ce2008"
msgid ""
"*You realise that it could change everything. Your own course. Your own "
"life. The destiny of worlds.*"
msgstr "*당신은 저 물건이 모든 걸 바꿀 수 있다는 것을 압니다. 당신의 진로. 당신의 인생. 세계의 운명까지도.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bce40237-fe95-b97e-cd5a-2db45616ea17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MUTED(5) = False
#.      - AVATAR(5) = True
#.      - REALLY_GALE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:bce40237-fe95-b97e-cd5a-2db45616ea17
msgctxt "h6c314855g223ag4a0ega65cg39f763fc48b9"
msgid ""
"*The sight of the crown atop the elder brain strikes you like lightning. "
"Never before have you beheld an artefact of such unrivalled power.*"
msgstr ""
"*엘더 브레인이 쓰고 있는 왕관을 본 당신은 마치 번개에 맞은 듯 충격을 받습니다. 당신은 저런 비할 데 없는 힘을 지닌 아티팩트를 본 "
"적이 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c057bdfe-5c87-f41d-6588-93220f93fdd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:c057bdfe-5c87-f41d-6588-93220f93fdd4
msgctxt "h6f07f161ge673g4719ga798g0bb0b15ce76d"
msgid "Stand down! This isn't your decision to make."
msgstr "물러서! 네가 결정할 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c30210ef-e5f7-4415-4d82-b9f377f6f340
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:c30210ef-e5f7-4415-4d82-b9f377f6f340
msgctxt "hbdb86f3fg9e6dg4931g9c45g5510b67f148e"
msgid ""
"I do trust you. More than myself right now. Perhaps even more than Mystra."
msgstr "난 너를 신뢰해. 내 자신보다도 더 신뢰하고, 어쩌면 미스트라보다도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = c5a4b76c-342c-fc11-1b00-04ce95f61a25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:c5a4b76c-342c-fc11-1b00-04ce95f61a25
msgctxt "h4ad3660bg8fe9g4d00gb8f5gb95f2caebfcc"
msgid ""
"Sure that they would follow, and deliver it into my hands here. If you would "
"cease these distractions -"
msgstr "녀석들은 분명 날 쫓아 여기까지 왔을 테고, 곧 프리즘을 내 손에 넘겨줄 것이다. 이렇게 한눈 팔게 만들 거면-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c6010eda-1e73-7a42-36c6-67ddd90ae4b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MUTED(8) = True
#.      - AVATAR(8) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(8) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_WyllShoutedFather = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:c6010eda-1e73-7a42-36c6-67ddd90ae4b0
msgctxt "h3c4b889dg0e94g4ebeg87e9g3063b2b3d349"
msgid ""
"*Wyll freezes at the sight. His own father, Duke Ulder Ravengard, seized by "
"the Chosen. Yet for now, there's little he can do.*"
msgstr ""
"*윌은 이 광경에 얼어붙습니다. 그의 아버지, 얼더 레이븐가드 공작이 선택받은 자들에게 잡혀 있습니다. 허나 지금 윌이 할 수 있는 것은 "
"별로 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c60fa119-5400-ba59-4229-c40bab22a853
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:c60fa119-5400-ba59-4229-c40bab22a853
msgctxt "h45f84990g5edag410agab3aga807c88e19fb"
msgid ""
"*Beneath the smoking ashes of Moonrise Towers, the elder brain lies "
"destroyed. But what of the tadpoles it commanded?*"
msgstr "*문라이즈 타워의 연기 나는 폐허 아래에서, 엘더 브레인은 파괴되었습니다. 허나 그것이 지배하던 올챙이들은 어떻게 되었을까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca1da5fa-d70e-f14d-0529-8c091aff2883
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:ca1da5fa-d70e-f14d-0529-8c091aff2883
msgctxt "h8857f8dag59f4g4b83gad0cg12260218fd56"
msgid "<i>Obey your goddess. Detonate the orb. Destroy the Absolute.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신 여신의 명령에 복종한다. 보주를 터뜨린다. 절대자를 파괴한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cab870b9-5cb9-f989-dbf6-6acd24f1b84f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(5) = True
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:cab870b9-5cb9-f989-dbf6-6acd24f1b84f
msgctxt "heffb6a9cg71bbg43f2gac06gd4f726af78be"
msgid ""
"*You freeze at the sight. Your own father, Duke Ulder Ravengard, seized by "
"the Chosen. Yet for now, there's little you can do.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 이 광경에 얼어붙습니다. 당신의 아버지, 얼더 레이븐가드 공작이 선택받은 자들에게 잡혀 있습니다. 허나 지금 당신이 할 수 있는 "
"것은 별로 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d09b67b9-85f1-1f37-4a5a-f19b243dc502
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:d09b67b9-85f1-1f37-4a5a-f19b243dc502
msgctxt "h94d934b8gd827g4688gb492g4e050fab118d"
msgid ""
"*A prickling dread rises along your spine - you have disobeyed Mystra. "
"Again. If you survive this, there will be consequences.*"
msgstr ""
"*공포가 엄습하며 등골이 오싹해집니다. 당신은 미스트라의 뜻을 또다시 거역했습니다. 여기서 살아남는다면, 그에 따르는 결과가 있을 "
"것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Orin
#. NodeID = d6362d70-3ba2-7d8d-3a06-89a062101ba0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:d6362d70-3ba2-7d8d-3a06-89a062101ba0
msgctxt "hdf898231ga21eg47c2g9e95g5c5e85ec3936"
msgid "His cryptbreath sings to my sinews, again again againagainagain!"
msgstr "그 썩은 숨결이 내 힘줄에게 노래를 불러주는군. 다시 다시 그리고 또 다시다시다시!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = d66b248e-8892-e997-fba2-c31b08d49eab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:d66b248e-8892-e997-fba2-c31b08d49eab
msgctxt "h9692a6d6gd289g4f46g9e32g480a4db694a3"
msgid "You forget yourself, Orin. I have played my part."
msgstr "네 본분을 잊었군, 오린. 난 맡은 바를 다했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e5bc96f2-4e62-1534-b0af-af8b96618af7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GEN_SoloPlayer = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:e5bc96f2-4e62-1534-b0af-af8b96618af7
msgctxt "h2afd36e6g798ag4996g9100g1caa62167577"
msgid ""
"<i>It's one thing to sacrifice yourself, but you will not sacrifice your "
"friends. You will wait - there will be another chance.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신을 희생하는 건 그렇다쳐도, 친구들까지 희생시킬 수는 없다. 다른 기회가 있을 것이니, 기다려보자.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e613d0c5-7717-de73-ec5a-73a51ed35af7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:e613d0c5-7717-de73-ec5a-73a51ed35af7
msgctxt "hb5833116gd192g4d16gbc88g8a33892717e4"
msgid "Gale, you <i>cannot</i> do this. You can't condemn us to death."
msgstr "게일, 이럴 수는 <i>없어</i>. 우리를 모두 죽음으로 몰고 갈 수는 없단 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = f7e67fab-c504-566d-53f4-8d792569a8c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:f7e67fab-c504-566d-53f4-8d792569a8c3
msgctxt "haf62e128g7311g4da2gae58g4f56adb67f71"
msgid "The testament of Myrkul."
msgstr "머큘의 언약."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = fc932c40-77c9-04d7-0fbe-0c3dfe1d61e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:fc932c40-77c9-04d7-0fbe-0c3dfe1d61e0
msgctxt "h41ff8026gb976g4ec8g8fbfgd35dea47a4c1"
msgid ""
"A rogue True Soul, flaunting it under your nose all this time. And you "
"<i>ran </i>from her."
msgstr "독자적으로 행동하는 참된 영혼이 네 코앞에서 그걸 들고 돌아다니고 있었는데, 넌 그자와 싸우다가 <i>도망을</i> 쳤지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = fc932c40-77c9-04d7-0fbe-0c3dfe1d61e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:fc932c40-77c9-04d7-0fbe-0c3dfe1d61e0
msgctxt "h003d96acg6a2bg43b8ga10fg26598e81e2c1"
msgid ""
"A rogue True Soul, flaunting it under your nose all this time. And you "
"<i>ran </i>from him."
msgstr "독자적으로 행동하는 참된 영혼이 네 코앞에서 그걸 들고 돌아다니고 있었는데, 넌 그자와 싸우다가 <i>도망을</i> 쳤지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = fc932c40-77c9-04d7-0fbe-0c3dfe1d61e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:fc932c40-77c9-04d7-0fbe-0c3dfe1d61e0
msgctxt "h6ddadba7g09a1g43c2g97a7g644b46ff85cb"
msgid ""
"A rogue True Soul, flaunting it under your nose all this time. And you "
"<i>ran </i>from them."
msgstr "독자적으로 행동하는 참된 영혼이 네 코앞에서 그걸 들고 돌아다니고 있었는데, 넌 그자와 싸우다가 <i>도망을</i> 쳤지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Lord Enver Gortash
#. NodeID = fdc772ef-338f-2816-92e5-5b24f0c179fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:fdc772ef-338f-2816-92e5-5b24f0c179fa
msgctxt "h7bc6e898gcfbcg4aadga91bg900f2e854ef5"
msgid "The edict of Bane."
msgstr "베인의 칙령."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = fdede63b-adb4-8d68-70e9-aad9b79ab985
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_ChosenThree:fdede63b-adb4-8d68-70e9-aad9b79ab985
msgctxt "h33e64361ga2c6g421bg842cg95cfbc404cb3"
msgid "I love you too. Much more than myself. More even than Mystra."
msgstr "나도 너를 사랑해. 나 자신보다도. 심지어 미스트라보다도 더."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
