msgctxt "h71d31eaag9c2fg402cgb465ge5da5df551c9"
msgid ""
"The crown it wears controls it, and these stones control the crown. It has "
"been dominated."
msgstr "왕관이 엘더 브레인을 통제하고, 이 돌들은 그 왕관을 제어하고 있어. 엘더 브레인은 지배당하고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
