#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Knows_KethericMyrkul(0) = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:19bad993-f928-c195-2eb5-e97d50b48b4c
msgctxt "h21af8c49g5d39g46c5gbf5ag12072a284da7"
msgid ""
"Since Ketheric is the Chosen of Myrkul, that means... the Absolute is a "
"front for the gods of death and our enemies are Chosen of the Dead Three."
msgstr ""
"케서릭은 머큘에게 선택받은 자이니, 그 말인 즉... 절대자는 죽음의 세 신이 내세우는 간판이고, 우리의 적은 삼악신에게 선택받은 "
"자들이란 거겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
