msgctxt "h068d0e6cg5397g4d18gb127g49ef4dcd6eb8"
msgid "What can you tell me about the Crown the brain was wearing?"
msgstr "엘더 브레인이 쓰고 있던 왕관이 뭔지 알려줄 수 있겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = d6f60744-1254-03a3-b94d-6900eedde228
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:d6f60744-1254-03a3-b94d-6900eedde228
msgctxt "h617595ccgdab4g456fg96cdg02aeabd49987"
msgid ""
"To master an elder brain... to <i>subdue</i> it... Our enemies are "
"formidable."
msgstr "엘더 브레인을 조종하고... <i>통제</i>한다니... 우리의 적은 정말 강대하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
