msgctxt "h4169bb44gdb32g4086ga6a3g71304a034f67"
msgid ""
"To master an elder brain... to <i>subdue</i> it... Our enemies are "
"formidable."
msgstr "엘더 브레인을 조종하고... <i>통제</i>한다니... 우리의 적은 정말 강대하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
