msgctxt "hab5d0398g25f5g435bgae05gf883eced5461"
msgid "Remarkable. Truly."
msgstr "정말이지, 대단해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = dc23f460-5b37-e882-d572-a5c6f567504d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:dc23f460-5b37-e882-d572-a5c6f567504d
msgctxt "h506bdc04g421cg4898g8b45g8ec4b9be5173"
msgid "An order the death gods' Chosen are on the cusp of giving."
msgstr "목구멍까지 차올라있을 죽음의 신에게 선택받은 자의 명령 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = dc23f460-5b37-e882-d572-a5c6f567504d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:dc23f460-5b37-e882-d572-a5c6f567504d
msgctxt "ha7c4255bg8933g42ebg92d7g1c3deff2d65a"
msgid "An order the death gods' Chosen are on the cusp of giving."
msgstr "죽음의 신들에게 선택받은 자들이 곧 내릴 명령 말이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = dd9fc9cf-0083-4468-acef-5f89e23ac598
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Knows_BrainHasCrownOfKarsus = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:dd9fc9cf-0083-4468-acef-5f89e23ac598
msgctxt "hc274ad76g7cc2g4b5cgb43ag43f808ef8f1e"
msgid ""
"Whoever controls the crown could reshape the world... <i>if</i> they can "
"control it."
msgstr "왕관을 통제하는 자는 세상을 바꿀 수도 있어... 그걸 통제할 <i>수만</i> 있다면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e07b0a87-cd3d-4395-914e-041195709305
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:e07b0a87-cd3d-4395-914e-041195709305
msgctxt "h21818eebgd222g45fcg98c0gab78bcf43976"
msgid "*In death, the body is cooling, but energy radiates from the stone.*"
msgstr "*죽음을 맞이한 시신은 차가워지지만, 돌에서 에너지가 뿜어져 나옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = e268c474-13b7-9921-fed5-9081c1f420cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_DeadThree = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:e268c474-13b7-9921-fed5-9081c1f420cc
msgctxt "h51af0fa0g2854g4f5ega439ge7bded99fee0"
msgid ""
"They are known to pick from their most devout followers a Chosen, granting "
"them incredible powers."
msgstr "그 신들은 가장 열렬한 추종자 가운데에서 한 명을 골라 선택받은 자로 만들어, 놀라운 힘을 내려주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = e268c474-13b7-9921-fed5-9081c1f420cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_DeadThree = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:e268c474-13b7-9921-fed5-9081c1f420cc
msgctxt "h764393fcga2d5g495cg88bbg3dc58e4b0eec"
msgid ""
"They are known to pick from their most devout followers a Chosen, granting "
"them incredible powers."
msgstr "그 신들은 가장 열렬한 추종자 가운데에서 한 명을 골라 선택받은 자로 만들어, 놀라운 힘을 내려주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e5b0cfc4-bd24-ad91-dc02-42dd0f6dd99f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Knows_NethereseMagic(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - COL_KethericShowdown_Knows_NethereseMagic(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:e5b0cfc4-bd24-ad91-dc02-42dd0f6dd99f
msgctxt "ha09b35b7g58c0g4512gbb58gefc415e04ea7"
msgid "I came here looking for a cure - I still haven't found one."
msgstr "치료할 방법을 찾고자 온 건데, 여전히 못 찾았군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = ef09e043-4cef-7253-1953-8649ee889ac2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DAISY_DESIRETRACK(2) = True
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:ef09e043-4cef-7253-1953-8649ee889ac2
msgctxt "h061dc38ag04dbg4fd2g87c1g4c3762ed6f11"
msgid "I know. But this is the only way."
msgstr "나도 알아. 하지만 이 길 밖에 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = ef09e043-4cef-7253-1953-8649ee889ac2
