msgctxt "h11770a00g9718g40b8ga824g7d873f814b16"
msgid "I know. But this is the only way."
msgstr "나도 알아. 하지만 이 길 밖에 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = f43a6176-a295-70db-f1c3-d05877abd4cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:f43a6176-a295-70db-f1c3-d05877abd4cb
msgctxt "h5c8c1858g0231g4834gb4c5gdd4d28c7772b"
msgid ""
"If the crown can do this to the parasites, I dare not imagine what it is "
"doing to the brain."
msgstr "왕관이 기생충에게도 이 정도의 힘을 부여할 수 있다면, 엘더 브레인에게는 어떤 걸 할 수 있을지 감히 상상하기 어려워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = f43a6176-a295-70db-f1c3-d05877abd4cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:f43a6176-a295-70db-f1c3-d05877abd4cb
msgctxt "h8c491346g87a2g4d30gb233g32813be3762d"
msgid ""
"If the crown can do this to the parasites, I dare not imagine what it is "
"doing to the brain."
msgstr "왕관이 기생충에게도 이 정도의 힘을 부여할 수 있다면, 엘더 브레인에게는 어떤 걸 할 수 있을지 감히 상상하기 어려워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = fb1ea351-59a6-d301-d761-64c7efa3034f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:fb1ea351-59a6-d301-d761-64c7efa3034f
msgctxt "h1ceb1c72gf5fag43aag9e36g5c08009f1a5c"
msgid "This is the battle of our lives, and the lives of everyone in Faerûn."
msgstr "이건 우리 자신과, 페이룬에 사는 모든 이의 생명을 건 전투예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = fb1ea351-59a6-d301-d761-64c7efa3034f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:fb1ea351-59a6-d301-d761-64c7efa3034f
msgctxt "h64cf9e03g6909g4b45gae83g85f364ebd130"
msgid "This is the battle of our lives, and the lives of everyone in Faerûn."
msgstr "이건 우리 자신과, 페이룬에 사는 모든 이의 생명을 건 전투예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = ff20b451-12fc-9476-f65a-6f8714c82483
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController:ff20b451-12fc-9476-f65a-6f8714c82483
msgctxt "hc55d296cg9677g4021gb11eg0aaa552fe14d"
msgid ""
"Our chances of success are slim, but we must not fail. If we fail, "
"everything ends."
msgstr "성공할 확률은 높지 않지만, 실패할 수는 없어. 실패한다면, 모든 것이 종말을 맞을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_CrownController
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = ff20b451-12fc-9476-f65a-6f8714c82483
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
