msgctxt "h418c67f2g5716g4c57ga5d7gf0aa039c901d"
msgid ""
"Our chances of success are slim, but we must not fail. If we fail, "
"everything ends."
msgstr "성공할 확률은 높지 않지만, 실패할 수는 없어. 실패한다면, 모든 것이 종말을 맞을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_DaisyAD_Balthazar
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 5529a98d-7297-4312-83b4-998a0a34dc9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_DaisyAD_Balthazar:5529a98d-7297-4312-83b4-998a0a34dc9a
msgctxt "hbf9723fbg321eg4f4cgac6fg568f96240b19"
msgid "The necromancer was experimenting on the tadpoles."
msgstr "사령술사가 올챙이로 실험을 하고 있었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_DaisyAD_EntranceDoor
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = b10f1865-8ad8-49cc-9231-f7e66104d43b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_DaisyAD_EntranceDoor:b10f1865-8ad8-49cc-9231-f7e66104d43b
msgctxt "hf8c96c61g6214g4f2eg8c6dg171e3f223374"
msgid "We've found it. The Absolute is behind this door."
msgstr "드디어 찾았어. 절대자는 이 문 뒤에 있어."

