msgid "Ketheric's Netherstone - it's in his armour. Take it."
msgstr "케서릭의 네더스톤이 갑옷 안에 있어. 가져가야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 0afb6113-2c1e-4716-b780-f99878eaf90d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
