msgctxt "h11714f62g484cg4e88g87a1gbc36151827ef"
msgid "Hello, Death. I like your hat."
msgstr "안녕하신가, 사신 양반. 모자 멋지네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 1f62b042-f1ab-403d-b894-4f92e709937b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:1f62b042-f1ab-403d-b894-4f92e709937b
msgctxt "h1c76f554g4a68g4e79g9ff2g76960eb2be1f"
msgid "What a fool you are. You cannot kill me - I am eternal."
msgstr "정말이지 어리석군. 넌 나를 죽일 수 없어. 나는 영원하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 2224c429-da4c-8fa0-5526-4991e3f5e1e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:2224c429-da4c-8fa0-5526-4991e3f5e1e8
msgctxt "h6226028dg795fg40a9gb42ag674ddd24d8bb"
msgid "He is watching. He is listening. He is... he is..."
msgstr "그분께서 보고 계신다. 그분께서 듣고 계신다. 그분께서... 그분께서는..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Myrkul
#. NodeID = 2f9f2dfe-7d37-8b96-d2ce-680684c91bac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_DeadThree = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:2f9f2dfe-7d37-8b96-d2ce-680684c91bac
msgctxt "h87d76177g15a3g4e13gb468g135e23d6a274"
msgid "I am Myrkul, Lord of Bones, and you have slain my Chosen."
msgstr "나는 뼈의 군주 머큘이다. 내가 선택한 자를 네가 살해했구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 61c50a24-d276-4362-8c82-f379302c96de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_Apostle_Inclusion_Selected(9) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(9) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:61c50a24-d276-4362-8c82-f379302c96de
msgctxt "he28d9a54gff8dg434cg88e4g3ba1fabc9b82"
msgid "Well, <i>fuck</i>."
msgstr "이런, <i>씨발</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 7337c87e-33c6-a343-d954-d2dbb28e578c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_SkipToApostleForm = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:7337c87e-33c6-a343-d954-d2dbb28e578c
msgctxt "h9f122849g09d5g4aa2g9437gf6c0a0200d04"
msgid ""
"No... there is no repentance... no release. My debt can never be repaid."
msgstr "아니... 회개할 수 없다. 풀려날 수도 없어. 내 업보는 절대 갚을 수 없는 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 7f0aa875-52d2-4eb3-b0dc-a51aecb37b11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_Apostle_Inclusion_Selected(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:7f0aa875-52d2-4eb3-b0dc-a51aecb37b11
msgctxt "ha984415cge944g4d1dg8bddga23ed3b4a8cd"
msgid "<i>Tsk'va!</i>"
msgstr "<i>츠크바!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 91369f2c-7a36-4c54-b842-f028976f7092
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_Apostle_Inclusion_Selected(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:91369f2c-7a36-4c54-b842-f028976f7092
msgctxt "h4e590aa2g1434g4cc4gaaacgd5058f43a721"
msgid "The Triad help us..."
msgstr "삼선신이시여, 저희를 도우소서..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Myrkul
#. NodeID = a571007b-a632-a8ad-40e3-04659b559454
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:a571007b-a632-a8ad-40e3-04659b559454
msgctxt "ha11c2c1fg908fg4226gac22g9cac4bb50c2b"
msgid "For I am Death. And I am not the end - I am a <i>beginning</i>."
msgstr "나는 죽음이니라. 그리고 나는 끝이 아니니, <i>시작</i>일 지어다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = b1f11d32-55ad-4b82-b864-b4731c3bfd5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_Apostle_Inclusion_Selected(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:b1f11d32-55ad-4b82-b864-b4731c3bfd5e
msgctxt "h0e785926g41b0g4276ga360g62c71d61df5c"
msgid "Shit."
msgstr "젠장."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = b2e9af30-588e-ee9e-97f9-ff4cca223952
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:b2e9af30-588e-ee9e-97f9-ff4cca223952
msgctxt "hd6a7df0bgba1cg4089gbe9agc7e578d2128b"
msgid "Myrkul... Lord of Bones. I am here. I am ready."
msgstr "머큘... 뼈의 군주이시여. 저는 여기 있습니다. 준비됐습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Myrkul
#. NodeID = c1a56a19-f660-5425-364f-5c8a44624513
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:c1a56a19-f660-5425-364f-5c8a44624513
msgctxt "h560ea716g3b2fg4fb2g96d5g107c3b05efa1"
msgid ""
"I am the smile of the worm-cleansed skull. I am the regrets of those who "
"remain, and the restlessness of those who are gone."
msgstr "나는 벌레가 깨끗이 파먹은 해골이 짓는 미소이니라. 나는 남은 자들의 후회와 떠난 자들의 불안이니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c750b667-fc13-453d-970b-13896977fc0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_Apostle_Inclusion_Selected(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:c750b667-fc13-453d-970b-13896977fc0b
msgctxt "h6986ca8dgbb23g4d91gb362gfaceef464b5b"
msgid "By Mystra's silken tresses..."
msgstr "미스트라 맙소사..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Myrkul
#. NodeID = ce7e4a84-895b-8dd6-1212-bffb22dc8f6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:ce7e4a84-895b-8dd6-1212-bffb22dc8f6f
msgctxt "hd3c752efg0b25g4602ga72ega3b0aa447b2f"
msgid ""
"I am the haunt of mausoleums, the god of graves and age, of dust and dusk."
msgstr "나는 영묘의 유령이자, 무덤과 세월, 먼지와 황혼의 신이니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Myrkul
#. NodeID = d0407e20-fe52-3927-17cc-4ac5396333cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:d0407e20-fe52-3927-17cc-4ac5396333cd
msgctxt "hc252c26ag8798g4677g8e28g0f4cfcddedac"
msgid "You dare end one who belongs to me?"
msgstr "감히 내 권속을 죽여버리다니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d66c34e6-31ff-48d9-a68f-f5dd6e8f8e34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_Apostle_Inclusion_Selected(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(6) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:d66c34e6-31ff-48d9-a68f-f5dd6e8f8e34
msgctxt "hee5175cfg8edcg4cb3gbee8gbb7edf6aca51"
msgid "Oh. Oh dear."
msgstr "오... 오, 이런."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Myrkul
#. NodeID = e8b521be-ac28-4257-6d78-74b4a9bbdd6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:e8b521be-ac28-4257-6d78-74b4a9bbdd6c
msgctxt "h426c9bcbg9d22g41degbe42g47287fa0c6f9"
msgid "But it is no matter."
msgstr "하지만 상관없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = f33f94d6-3e94-ae56-4461-ffff57cf2761
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:f33f94d6-3e94-ae56-4461-ffff57cf2761
msgctxt "h8fc3b33dg33f1g4b36gaa66g28a2e2b7f4ed"
msgid "He is <i>here</i>."
msgstr "그분께서 <i>오셨다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f452ef8a-2ce0-4291-975c-98666a13b99d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_Apostle_Inclusion_Selected(10) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALSIN(10) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:f452ef8a-2ce0-4291-975c-98666a13b99d
msgctxt "h9c06f0c8g73a4g4eefgb1bag8369f5654b35"
msgid "By Silvanus' mossy beard..."
msgstr "실바누스 맙소사..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = fc1753a3-bfc6-ac3b-7413-3f081c107037
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericApostle:fc1753a3-bfc6-ac3b-7413-3f081c107037
msgctxt "h6338c8f1g5200g4ce5g907eg06649fcf4964"
msgid "I am <i>yours</i>."
msgstr "저는 <i>당신 것입니다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 0c8c9a13-352c-db41-12c5-76995b68ab86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated:0c8c9a13-352c-db41-12c5-76995b68ab86
msgctxt "h15a18450gf469g41f0g8ae6g58d53f7f7f06"
msgid "Impossible... death cannot take me... I am its master..."
msgstr "불가능해... 죽음은 날 데려갈 수 없어... 난 죽음의 주인이다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 135b1b42-af5e-7bf6-5bfd-1b11eeb492fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated:135b1b42-af5e-7bf6-5bfd-1b11eeb492fa
msgctxt "h9869b9fcgf87dg45bdg9518g3a4d1d48011b"
msgid "Isobel..."
msgstr "이소벨..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 13dc4257-b77e-270f-eb69-1b3a00630316
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated:13dc4257-b77e-270f-eb69-1b3a00630316
msgctxt "h353b669fg8401g4b48g8f6agaae309b085bd"
msgid "Now... now... we pick our way toward our fates... <i>unleashed</i>."
msgstr "이제... 이제... 우린 스스로의 운명을 향해 나아가리라... <i>해방이로다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 21ba7aa3-1996-d1cd-d642-38a987ab8034
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated:21ba7aa3-1996-d1cd-d642-38a987ab8034
msgctxt "h69182b6cg7854g47e5g837bg5d92be93f7e6"
msgid "Nothing... I am forsaken."
msgstr "아무것도... 나는 버림받았다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 4d3d30a9-524e-c29f-827c-13af3a90854b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated:4d3d30a9-524e-c29f-827c-13af3a90854b
msgctxt "ha49e63cfgdf22g4f74g8764g1dfb5039e986"
msgid "My Lord, hear me!"
msgstr "주군이시여, 들리십니까!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 6d42693f-d1fe-7d1f-e9c6-baf9475ce261
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_IsobelDiedInCOL = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated:6d42693f-d1fe-7d1f-e9c6-baf9475ce261
msgctxt "h0e398759g9b1cg41b0gb760g5ebeeaa54512"
msgid ""
"Ketheric's daughter - Isobel. I... knew her. <i>Long </i>have I mourned her. "
"May she know peace now - safe from her father's machinations."
msgstr ""
"케서릭의 딸, 이소벨. 난... 그녀를 알고 있었어. <i>오랫동안</i> 그녀를 애도했지. 이제 그녀가 평화를 누리길 - 아버지의 "
"계략에서 벗어나서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 81a08869-7a1c-2d8f-2c7a-d5cb3b50d77c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated:81a08869-7a1c-2d8f-2c7a-d5cb3b50d77c
msgctxt "hc3aaf9ffg329ag46c5gabe7g8ae742af2425"
msgid "Do what you must - then we fly this foul place."
msgstr "해야 할 일을 하거라. 그런 다음 이 추악한 곳을 떠나자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 9d186bef-ed7c-a5ed-6f88-c872c244118a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated:9d186bef-ed7c-a5ed-6f88-c872c244118a
msgctxt "h6ad588d9gf1e0g456ag8a18g4f2db8c85086"
msgid "The wretch! Together we have crushed him, brain and body."
msgstr "이 비열한 놈! 우린 함께 케서릭을 박살냈다, 몸과 정신 모두를."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = a2f5eb1d-c005-6625-f8c6-3fee9271c140
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Isobel_State_IsDead = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated:a2f5eb1d-c005-6625-f8c6-3fee9271c140
msgctxt "hb1622e34gc535g4a52g9312ge15c0131bfc5"
msgid ""
"A pity I cannot say the same for Isobel. She may have been Ketheric's "
"daughter, but she was my world entire."
msgstr "유감스럽게도 이소벨에겐 같은 말을 할 수 없군. 이소벨은 케서릭의 딸이었을지 몰라도 내 전부였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = a5dce848-f8d2-fabb-1ab7-43a3ed2068c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated:a5dce848-f8d2-fabb-1ab7-43a3ed2068c3
msgctxt "he3e963fcg718ag43c3gb842g7af0a7b6e04e"
msgid "The villain is DEAD!"
msgstr "악당은 <b>죽었다!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = c6478697-c85d-9463-d73f-4a72b09dd82d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated:c6478697-c85d-9463-d73f-4a72b09dd82d
msgctxt "h72d27effgc19fg45e7g856fg7000f130b320"
msgid "You... you have no idea what you've done."
msgstr "너... 너는 네가 무슨 짓을 저질렀는지 모르는구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = cb4328ed-f4a7-c4d8-d9fb-62679e819734
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated:cb4328ed-f4a7-c4d8-d9fb-62679e819734
msgctxt "h1089aa0cgf178g43cega0afg1ffe9ce55ddf"
msgid "You have my sword - my fealty."
msgstr "내 칼과, 내 충성이 함께한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = cc58e1cb-d76f-0be8-e748-e848c38e3914
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericDefeated:cc58e1cb-d76f-0be8-e748-e848c38e3914
msgctxt "hf27f9ff0g755cg4c7cgaf4dgdca7082657b3"
msgid ""
"Though you have great crimes against my person for which to answer, strange "
"ally."
msgstr "비록 너는 나에게 큰 죄를 지은 상대지만, 기묘한 동맹이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 02b667fc-673a-a234-d795-ac13f0b1dac4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:02b667fc-673a-a234-d795-ac13f0b1dac4
msgctxt "ha42fcff7g7bd6g4d49g83e1gc906608202c1"
msgid ""
"I have fought great wars before, in the service of other gods, and other "
"powers. But for Myrkul, I would condemn all of Faerûn to death."
msgstr ""
"예전에는 큰 전쟁에서 싸웠다. 다른 신들과, 다른 세력을 위해서 싸웠지. 하지만 머큘님을 위해서라면, 온 페이룬을 죽음으로 몰고 갈 수도 "
"있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 04595a65-17b7-8e0c-b0ed-ae68c1e0c1cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_State_PermaDefeated = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:04595a65-17b7-8e0c-b0ed-ae68c1e0c1cf
msgctxt "hd15acbbegc689g48d4g9034gd2d2707bd0e4"
msgid ""
"You are no True Soul - <i>you </i>are a <i>champion</i>. Kill the madman. I "
"fight at your side."
msgstr "너는 참된 영혼 따위가 아니야. <i>너는 용사다</i>. 저 미치광이를 죽이자. 네 곁에서 싸우겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 0d2d82e6-d5e3-a835-f591-ca6b508fbf86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:0d2d82e6-d5e3-a835-f591-ca6b508fbf86
msgctxt "hedf8afd8gd14eg4db1ga3e9gf5c66727b749"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you hoped to learn your place in history before you are erased from "
"it. A bright flash of clarity before the snuffing-out."
msgstr "아마 네 존재가 지워지기 전에, 역사 속에서의 네 자리를 알아보려고 했겠지. 끝장나기 직전의 번뜩임인가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 1391ec38-e316-1adf-577b-0f67b673b08f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_KethericIntro_BacksideApproach = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:1391ec38-e316-1adf-577b-0f67b673b08f
msgctxt "hac63fb30g438bg4fe5gb9eegb4e7293797b8"
msgid ""
"There you are. As predicted. What is it, I wonder, that draws one toward "
"death like a moth to light?"
msgstr "여기 있었군. 예상대로다. 궁금하구나, 대체 무슨 이유로, 나방이 불빛에 이끌리듯 죽음을 향해 이끌려온 것이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2405a9da-afc4-4cc2-2f65-42ab011362f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_JAHEIRA(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:2405a9da-afc4-4cc2-2f65-42ab011362f3
msgctxt "h20000b55g419fg4914ga8c4g2c3e11476d99"
msgid ""
"I sense you ask questions only to hear yourself answer them - so by all "
"means, tell me my <i>place</i>."
msgstr "답을 정해놓고 물어보는 것 같은데, 그럼 내 자리가 어딘지 말해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a95c3c8-190f-8957-4b8a-55f2bc5c6941
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:2a95c3c8-190f-8957-4b8a-55f2bc5c6941
msgctxt "h3fee0028gbaefg4d11gbeccga3f5038fe846"
msgid ""
"I know my destiny - he's waiting in Baldur's Gate. And you're standing in my "
"way, old man."
msgstr "내 운명은 잘 알고 있지. 카사도어가 발더스 게이트에서 기다리고 있다. 그리고 늙은이, 당신이 내 앞을 가로막고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2c1acd2d-f9f7-0b1b-815c-f0cf2a686b34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:2c1acd2d-f9f7-0b1b-815c-f0cf2a686b34
msgctxt "ha868a44fg22b6g4a44gaad1gf3cd0822578f"
msgid "Neither you nor your pal Gortash know the first thing about my 'place'."
msgstr "너도, 네 친구 고타쉬도 내 '자리'에 대해서는 하나도 모르는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Isobel
#. NodeID = 2f497ae8-fb95-1750-6dbe-e3d5d0e6573c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:2f497ae8-fb95-1750-6dbe-e3d5d0e6573c
msgctxt "hb9bdd7e5g9fa4g42ebg839fgeea2e4f9fe89"
msgid "Good luck in the City of Judgement. I wish you the best, sincerely."
msgstr "심판의 도시에서 행운이 따르길. 진심으로 빌게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 346a8a7c-a15c-f106-a5bc-3ad62f03dec1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:346a8a7c-a15c-f106-a5bc-3ad62f03dec1
msgctxt "h56d8d43fg3ae5g4fc5g8f19gf868b3065302"
msgid "Enough talk. Let's finish this."
msgstr "대화는 그만. 이제 끝내자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 3c8c607a-8adc-11fd-1cd8-9d9adc4375f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:3c8c607a-8adc-11fd-1cd8-9d9adc4375f1
msgctxt "h2e95889fgc2e8g4822g9e02gefd5bf30076f"
msgid ""
"For that, he asked that I serve as his Chosen, join Orin and Gortash to grow "
"the cult of the Absolute, and then... take control of it."
msgstr ""
"그 대가로, 내가 선택받은 자로서 그분을 섬기길 원하셨지. 오린과 고타쉬와 함께하여 절대자 교단의 세를 키우고, 그리고 나서는... "
"장악하기를 원하셨다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 3db33858-6622-71f1-3d19-06b371246e99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:3db33858-6622-71f1-3d19-06b371246e99
msgctxt "h0f578b52gab3bg4eabgb3f0g70983c92daa9"
msgid "With pleasure."
msgstr "기꺼이."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 3f5e4317-5994-7352-981e-7b94feae32a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:3f5e4317-5994-7352-981e-7b94feae32a2
msgctxt "hde5d7a4cg7993g45f7gbb9ag18453ce137c8"
msgid ""
"But he did not only give me power - he gave me the one thing no other god "
"could grant me."
msgstr "그분께선 내게 이 권능만 내려주신 게 아니다. 다른 어떤 신도 줄 수 없는 것을 내게 주셨지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 405efda3-9930-5fb0-cfc9-a45a03d9d846
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:405efda3-9930-5fb0-cfc9-a45a03d9d846
msgctxt "h40982e37g8056g45c2gb07agdf9543ef1bac"
msgid "Perhaps..."
msgstr "어쩌면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 4689a355-6a18-c34e-3e66-0e2ca74568c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:4689a355-6a18-c34e-3e66-0e2ca74568c2
msgctxt "hefdc9da9g9dd4g4695g9d99ga4ecbb27187d"
msgid ""
"My Lord, I offer you these souls so they may return as servants to your "
"cause."
msgstr "머큘이시여, 이들이 당신의 대의를 위해 봉사하는 종으로서 돌아올 수 있도록, 이 영혼들을 당신께 바치나이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Isobel
#. NodeID = 49764aa1-2026-0e2c-f3dd-b186238dc8f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:49764aa1-2026-0e2c-f3dd-b186238dc8f6
msgctxt "h7351f9f3ge6c1g49ebg846eg6a5c54b1e541"
msgid ""
"I'm grateful to you for bringing me home. I was a fool to resist. I know "
"better now."
msgstr "집으로 데려다 주셔서 고마워요. 저항하다니 참 어리석었죠. 이제 더 잘 알겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 4a73af0e-afbf-6536-8ad1-a81a6b0ed3b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:4a73af0e-afbf-6536-8ad1-a81a6b0ed3b1
msgctxt "hbf4803fbg2ac9g45ffg96a3gd725b52d5d6d"
msgid "What good is an army of thralls if they do not obey their master?"
msgstr "주인에게 복종하지 않는 노예 군단이 무슨 쓸모가 있겠는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c02469e-a0ee-9204-55a5-1087be13c971
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:4c02469e-a0ee-9204-55a5-1087be13c971
msgctxt "h37abd37bg18c2g49f0g92d2g30e40bf5ac73"
msgid "I'm here to snuff out this whole evil plot - and you along with it."
msgstr "그 사악한 음모를 끝장내러 왔다. 너도 함께 쓰러질 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 5a972dc0-37a4-ff8d-c36c-42a00b7121a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_State_PermaDefeated = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:5a972dc0-37a4-ff8d-c36c-42a00b7121a8
msgctxt "ha9e7a391g3d49g4c25g80a1gcace1a929af5"
msgid "Join the army of the dead, True Soul. Witness Lord Myrkul's glory!"
msgstr "망자의 군대에 합류해라, 참된 영혼. 머큘님의 영광을 목도하라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 5e073b39-674e-2cda-c03e-0b3c95e5412a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:5e073b39-674e-2cda-c03e-0b3c95e5412a
msgctxt "h28d21641g9ee9g426fg8aa6g8e356a435399"
msgid "Let us speak plainly."
msgstr "단도직입적으로 말하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 662107e8-3ba7-aaa5-9a09-d735c501dd3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:662107e8-3ba7-aaa5-9a09-d735c501dd3e
msgctxt "hdc9e0fe9g147fg42daga0f1g12bd93ece46a"
msgid ""
"The very fact of your being attests to its power - despite your infection, "
"you resisted the brain, here in the heart of its domain."
msgstr ""
"네 존재 자체가 그 힘을 증명하는 거다. 감염되었음에도 엘더 브레인에 저항하고 있지. 심지어 녀석의 영역 한가운데인 이곳에서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 6a607b02-f125-d2c3-4d43-da1d57001f87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:6a607b02-f125-d2c3-4d43-da1d57001f87
msgctxt "h7c650890g43f3g47eeg8992g125e53958939"
msgid "He's never had a more devoted follower."
msgstr "나처럼 열성적인 추종자를 거느리셨던 적은 없으셨다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 6d829460-6cf5-cb59-bbbf-8e45143d3cc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:6d829460-6cf5-cb59-bbbf-8e45143d3cc3
msgctxt "h29efe846gbddbg4f05gba12gcf2b307c942a"
msgid ""
"Finer champions than you have tried and failed. But perhaps they lacked the "
"fear that drives you: your freedom, hanging in the balance."
msgstr ""
"너보다 더 뛰어난 용사들도 내게 도전했지만 실패했지. 하지만 그들에겐 두려움이 없었을지도 모르겠구나. 자유를 잃을지도 모른다는 두려움 "
"말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 6dc7acc8-efab-eef9-95e9-1ac730a9a76b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_IsobelDiedInCOL = False
#.      - MOO_Isobel_State_AtMoonrise = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:6dc7acc8-efab-eef9-95e9-1ac730a9a76b
msgctxt "h2e0d257fg1436g4f72g82c0gfc196e02b634"
msgid "Say farewell, Isobel."
msgstr "작별 인사 하거라, 이소벨."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 6ff1b72d-602a-e9dd-73fa-cbafbe74308e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:6ff1b72d-602a-e9dd-73fa-cbafbe74308e
msgctxt "hbd27bcc4g92a3g402egb4f2gc8521494751e"
msgid "Impossible - you are bound to it, and in death it will bind you to me."
msgstr "불가능하다. 네놈은 그 기생충에 결속되어 있지. 그리고 죽음으로써, 네 녀석은 내게 결속될 것이다.."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 70439845-f7a4-6fd8-8d79-4306f33929bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_IsobelDiedInCOL = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:70439845-f7a4-6fd8-8d79-4306f33929bb
msgctxt "h757760e8g1627g408bg9904g3249118f25aa"
msgid ""
"You. After all you've done, after all your trifling, you <i>dare </i>strike "
"at my daughter?!"
msgstr "네 녀석이로군. 그 모든 걸 해 놓고, 그 쓸데없는 짓을 다 하고 나서는, <i>감히</i> 내 딸을 공격해?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75d6af80-0752-13e4-9abe-60d1e299ab73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_MINTHARA(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:75d6af80-0752-13e4-9abe-60d1e299ab73
msgctxt "hbc7abf18gf224g49c0g94d0gee2050c31023"
msgid "My place is standing over you, with my boot on your throat."
msgstr "내 자리는 네 몸 위에 서서, 목을 짓밟고 있는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 77d01c9a-b6a5-953f-1b43-ac3f23ac5998
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:77d01c9a-b6a5-953f-1b43-ac3f23ac5998
msgctxt "hc1200311gf958g40a6gafe1g7cac01c96fb1"
msgid "Repent? Would that even be possible?"
msgstr "회개? 그게 가능하기나 할까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7841f7db-9620-ca4f-a12a-8fd9b1a09864
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:7841f7db-9620-ca4f-a12a-8fd9b1a09864
msgctxt "h17855f6cgce8ag436bgbe6eg4a952e093108"
msgid "You are planning on betraying your allies?"
msgstr "동맹을 배신할 생각인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7945d2e7-b713-69d2-8fa3-06026e8254b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#. TagRule: SHADOWHEART_SHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:7945d2e7-b713-69d2-8fa3-06026e8254b7
msgctxt "he0cfc859g6250g4e9fg96afg32e9223cd422"
msgid "My place is right here - ready to strike you down in Lady Shar's name."
msgstr "내 자리는 바로 여기야. 샤의 이름으로 널 쓰러트릴 준비가 된 곳."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7945d2e7-b713-69d2-8fa3-06026e8254b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:7945d2e7-b713-69d2-8fa3-06026e8254b7
msgctxt "h09bffe39g7a1fg4edfg9b36gfc00225106f9"
msgid ""
"My place is in Baldur's Gate. Yours is in a grave - permanently, this time."
msgstr "내 자리는 발더스 게이트에 있어. 네 자리는 무덤이지. 이번엔 영원히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79bdc682-68ad-2e11-0d50-71dac10d1510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:79bdc682-68ad-2e11-0d50-71dac10d1510
msgctxt "h71c28b53g41b2g4c9aga09cg08aea6781ecb"
msgid "Why is the Prism so important to you?"
msgstr "프리즘이 네게 왜 그렇게 중요한 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 85688efd-8c4b-d926-efbe-0d293fd7a7de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:85688efd-8c4b-d926-efbe-0d293fd7a7de
msgctxt "h38ca7255g2bdbg4de2g91dagaf975ec89c25"
msgid ""
"All mortals find their place at our Lord's side in time - your time is now."
msgstr "모든 필멸자들은 결국 군주님의 곁으로 가게 되지. 네게는 지금이 바로 그 순간이구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 8f069077-33c5-9252-1fb3-91ba73443118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:8f069077-33c5-9252-1fb3-91ba73443118
msgctxt "hb3101dc6gf32dg49c2gadc3g070967d45133"
msgid "Balthazar - I should have expected his <i>weakness</i>."
msgstr "발타자르... 놈이 <i>나약하다는</i> 것을 알아봤어야 하는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 91294de9-0749-966b-3b2a-59bf25d6875d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:91294de9-0749-966b-3b2a-59bf25d6875d
msgctxt "h33477eccg4a17g46f7gbea6g15657b64d026"
msgid ""
"You could have run away. Absconded with the Prism - the one thing that could "
"prevent me from fulfilling my destiny."
msgstr "도망칠 수도 있었을 텐데. 프리즘을, 내 운명을 완성할 그 물건을 들고 사라질 수도 있었는데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 919b5a20-47e4-d805-f865-f96dfc878be0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:919b5a20-47e4-d805-f865-f96dfc878be0
msgctxt "h56a674e1ge475g4bcfgb289gd28412a7a8d9"
msgid "I only serve one god."
msgstr "나는 오직 한 신만을 섬긴다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 976f7120-3bae-5bc8-4d24-b94a588140d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:976f7120-3bae-5bc8-4d24-b94a588140d2
msgctxt "h262bed21g80c4g4211gbe47g3e3a2692aa9a"
msgid ""
"The liberation of my people may be close at hand. And I will stop at nothing "
"to see it done."
msgstr "우리 민족의 해방이 목전에 있다. 그걸 이루기 위해서는 절대 멈추지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 9784290f-0826-b742-8660-3ec5b98da860
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:9784290f-0826-b742-8660-3ec5b98da860
msgctxt "h8a2c3d49g4531g4a6cga2a8g340fb86bfa5d"
msgid ""
"My Lord Myrkul gave me the one thing I desired - the one thing that no other "
"god could grant me."
msgstr "머큘님께서는 내가 바라던 단 한 가지, 다른 어떤 신도 줄 수 없는 것을 내게 주셨다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 99c4494a-2ad8-2f99-ce25-e9eb4ecd2195
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:99c4494a-2ad8-2f99-ce25-e9eb4ecd2195
msgctxt "h3d21e843g393dg4f46gaddbge7546c1fad63"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99f98439-14cd-7fe5-4da4-5782f4145c7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:99f98439-14cd-7fe5-4da4-5782f4145c7e
msgctxt "h409fa4e5gf72bg42b1gbc0dg00c6467829c2"
msgid "And what is my place, Ketheric?"
msgstr "그럼 내 자리는 어디지, 케서릭?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 9c2e3a00-200b-f186-b73e-faa3ea1e8ac1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_KethericIntro_BacksideApproach = True
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_IsobelDiedInCOL = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:9c2e3a00-200b-f186-b73e-faa3ea1e8ac1
msgctxt "h54d87c8bg6d25g47cdg87fcgff71b03ddbd1"
msgid ""
"You. After all you've done, after all your trifling, you <i>dare </i>strike "
"at my daughter?!"
msgstr "네 녀석이로군. 그 모든 걸 해 놓고, 그 쓸데없는 짓을 다 하고 나서는, <i>감히</i> 내 딸을 공격해?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Isobel
#. NodeID = 9ed85a44-01d7-5b92-20eb-ae355f7a7edd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_State_PermaDefeated = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_4 = True
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:9ed85a44-01d7-5b92-20eb-ae355f7a7edd
msgctxt "h103b3ad4gc8d5g482bg915agbc46e91a0300"
msgid "In your cage, Aylin."
msgstr "감옥으로 돌아가, 에일린."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = a9db03d9-78f4-a813-3ce6-ea81ef3bb862
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:a9db03d9-78f4-a813-3ce6-ea81ef3bb862
msgctxt "h293dc4e7g0f8fg4731gaf62g6950bb969acf"
msgid ""
"A temptation or a threat? With your god, it's always the latter, isn't it?"
msgstr "그건 유혹인가 위협인가? 너의 신과 함께라면, 항상 후자겠지, 그렇지 않나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af2bd493-3c34-ecd6-7548-d9c9ee6fbd4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID_HIDDEN_CHECK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:af2bd493-3c34-ecd6-7548-d9c9ee6fbd4c
msgctxt "hbfcfb068g9ce5g4870g9544g6c9def7f20f3"
msgid "I just want to be free of my parasite."
msgstr "그냥 내 기생충으로부터 해방되고 싶을 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = b00ded6b-c00e-fa22-2d0a-7a7604ea91f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:b00ded6b-c00e-fa22-2d0a-7a7604ea91f2
msgctxt "h34488bb0gcfd7g4ed6gbed2ga863fdb4b1f4"
msgid "I will kill you now. And then I will raise you as my servant."
msgstr "이제 너를 죽이겠다. 그리고 그 시체를 일으켜 내 종복으로 삼아주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = b70513ba-bbef-ce6d-97b3-5b22e6efe231
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:b70513ba-bbef-ce6d-97b3-5b22e6efe231
msgctxt "h3b39e016gfc50g45ddg8248gb7b074904e17"
msgid "My daughter's life returned. Her heart beating once more."
msgstr "내 딸아이가 살아 돌아왔다. 그 아이의 심장이 다시 뛰기 시작했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb56acfe-5d52-ffb0-4ac8-c9c80152045a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:bb56acfe-5d52-ffb0-4ac8-c9c80152045a
msgctxt "hada6d4ebge08cg49b8ga4fcg92c51aee46e1"
msgid ""
"Funny you say that. My place is right here, and my 'bright flash' could be "
"the last thing you see..."
msgstr "웃기는 소리 하네. 내 자리는 바로 여기야, 당신이 마지막으로 보게 될 것이 내 '번뜩임'일지도 모르지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd1f49ca-32a4-d7f2-9061-eb41044c84c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_BANE or PALADIN_BANE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:bd1f49ca-32a4-d7f2-9061-eb41044c84c0
msgctxt "h57f9bd6ag2e8cg4201g8e68gf410da06aa67"
msgid ""
"You have an alliance with the Black Hand, Bane. I am his servant. You ought "
"to work with me."
msgstr "넌 블랙 핸드와 동맹 관계에 있지, 나도 베인님의 하수인이야. 우린 같은 편이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = bdaad161-6d65-5406-0e9c-428e9bd5e221
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:bdaad161-6d65-5406-0e9c-428e9bd5e221
msgctxt "ha11768e2g1035g4212gb132g4932450a00cb"
msgid ""
"I will continue to serve him on this plane as long as I am needed, for he "
"has given me everything I want."
msgstr "그 분께서 내게 모든 걸 내려주셨으니, 나 또한 그분이 날 필요로 하시는 동안 계속 그분을 섬기리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be65780a-96f5-91d2-1e78-b2483c1e80c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALSIN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:be65780a-96f5-91d2-1e78-b2483c1e80c6
msgctxt "h4c7a7e75gbf59g4c3cgab16gdc6f6846f9ac"
msgid ""
"I am right where I need to be - ready to vanquish you and your curse, "
"forever."
msgstr "나는 정확히 내가 있어야 할 곳에 있다. 너와 네 저주를 영원히 물리칠 준비가 돼 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = c08b8f14-3aa2-1a93-99a2-76b82dc3c4c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:c08b8f14-3aa2-1a93-99a2-76b82dc3c4c9
msgctxt "h39375a12g0af2g44cdg84a2gfbd680c61a04"
msgid ""
"What a fool you are. I am death. She is mine. She will return - always "
"return. And you..."
msgstr "정말이지 어리석군. 나는 죽음 그 자체고, 내 딸은 내 것이다. 그 아이는 돌아올 것이다. 항상 그렇지. 그리고 너는..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = cc5a0151-ba1a-5363-5c77-014cab57ae1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:cc5a0151-ba1a-5363-5c77-014cab57ae1b
msgctxt "h9115b775gbca7g4cc8gbae2g64d1fa67351c"
msgid "For a moment - a moment only - I was weak. No longer."
msgstr "잠깐 - 아주 잠깐 - 나약해졌군. 더는 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce548f60-feb1-e9e5-89d4-f3e7d86a39fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:ce548f60-feb1-e9e5-89d4-f3e7d86a39fc
msgctxt "hca5f11f7g7ddbg4bc5gb22dg5d784e32cd25"
msgid "Damned wretch. I will liberate my father from your rotten hands."
msgstr "저주 받을 놈. 아버지를 네 썩은 손아귀에서 구해내겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d075e52e-3387-21e6-4ebc-18b808eda178
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:d075e52e-3387-21e6-4ebc-18b808eda178
msgctxt "h950a90efg83abg4b7egbe43ga488808b655c"
msgid ""
"I am not intimidated by the likes of you. I will gain my queen's favour and "
"ascend."
msgstr "나는 너 같은 부류에게 겁먹지 않는다. 난 여왕님의 총애를 얻고 승천할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = d3641438-29b3-ed04-7d67-714802b1199e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_State_PermaDefeated = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_4 = True
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:d3641438-29b3-ed04-7d67-714802b1199e
msgctxt "h549e3d6eg5922g4653gb254gd5988e0b5312"
msgid "Isobel - my love, what has happened to you?"
msgstr "이소벨, 내 사랑. 대체 어떻게 된 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = d6f90db3-680c-b3b7-75c3-7b2732f767d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:d6f90db3-680c-b3b7-75c3-7b2732f767d2
msgctxt "h9643bbdcgd6efg45d5g8a80g6f01adc83cdd"
msgid ""
"There you are. As predicted. What is it, I wonder, that draws one toward "
"death like a moth to light?"
msgstr "여기 있었군. 예상대로다. 궁금하구나, 대체 무슨 이유로, 나방이 불빛에 이끌리듯 죽음을 향해 이끌려 온 것이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = d8b44493-81db-d9b8-31cf-07a5fdf2a9b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:d8b44493-81db-d9b8-31cf-07a5fdf2a9b1
msgctxt "hd13cc87fg3557g4728g927egcbac8778b29a"
msgid ""
"That is the power my Lord Myrkul has granted me - command over the "
"immeasurable legions of the dead."
msgstr "머큘께서 내게 내리신 권능이 바로 그거다. 헤아릴 수 없이 많은, 죽은 자의 군단을 지휘하는 것 말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dee2a810-4ff1-140f-c17f-e34ba3343ced
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_IsobelDiedInCOL = False
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_ConvincedKetheric = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:dee2a810-4ff1-140f-c17f-e34ba3343ced
msgctxt "h972948e9g4ff4g4951g9d74gea97d2f95548"
msgid ""
"I was ready to show you mercy before. It's still not too late. You can "
"repent."
msgstr "이미 자비를 베풀 준비는 되어있다. 아직도 늦지 않았다. 회개하라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = e1e5afa1-8b10-0c72-464d-e8d68d48b56b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:e1e5afa1-8b10-0c72-464d-e8d68d48b56b
msgctxt "hf63ff5c6g824cg4bcdg8b54g00ea063c4837"
msgid "Your place is to die so I might <i>finally </i>live."
msgstr "네 자리는 무덤 속이다. 내가 <i>마침내</i> 살 수 있도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3486623-cfba-49e0-0a9d-f3e094f266c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#. TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:e3486623-cfba-49e0-0a9d-f3e094f266c7
msgctxt "heed114eegde37g40a5gb12dg71bcf82dd441"
msgid "I will find out who I was, and end my killing fate."
msgstr "내가 누구였는지 알아내고, 이 살인의 운명을 끝내겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = e69f05eb-907a-d020-02ce-8ff22dab90e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Audience_State_SpokeToKetheric = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:e69f05eb-907a-d020-02ce-8ff22dab90e7
msgctxt "h089a34aeg0d3ag410eg84ccg513b837f81cb"
msgid "But the lure of one's destiny is irresistible, isn't it?"
msgstr "하지만 운명의 유혹은 거부할 수 없지, 그렇지 않나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = f31c1a85-13d3-632c-51a0-80ea81554d3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:f31c1a85-13d3-632c-51a0-80ea81554d3c
msgctxt "hd96ce4acg5fdag46dbg9879gd7008ded19dd"
msgid ""
"You are all that stands between me and my destiny - and you have brought the "
"Prism here."
msgstr "너는 내 운명을 가로막는 유일한 걸림돌이야. 그런데 프리즘을 여기로 가져왔군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = f3a06a39-e547-16e9-f6f7-3face8e1a2a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Audience_State_SpokeToKetheric = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:f3a06a39-e547-16e9-f6f7-3face8e1a2a9
msgctxt "hbcf0f84eg39bfg4ffdgbecdg50d8fc94867e"
msgid ""
"<i>You</i> - what in the name of the <i>Nine Hells</i> are you doing here?!"
msgstr "<i>너</i>, <i>아홉 지옥</i> 맙소사 도대체 여기서 뭘 하고 있는 거냐?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f5f5e367-373d-66cc-0e50-517335dbd2df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_MYRKUL or PALADIN_MYRKUL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:f5f5e367-373d-66cc-0e50-517335dbd2df
msgctxt "hfb105688ge94fg46f1gb51bgfb3c6c558e9d"
msgid "My place is at the Lord of Bones' side, like yours."
msgstr "내가 있을 자리도 뼈의 군주님 옆이라고, 바로 너처럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6e55ef2-01ae-61c1-9c9e-1f2758005f5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#. TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:f6e55ef2-01ae-61c1-9c9e-1f2758005f5b
msgctxt "h64b5ed88g6b4eg48a5ga984g7d74a2fc040b"
msgid "I will reach my own crimson castle, and your corpse will pave my path."
msgstr "나는 핏빛 성채에 다다르겠다. 네 시체를 길잡이 삼아 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = f6f9e900-78bc-8b31-4700-c97f24d4b129
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Event_KethericIntro_BacksideApproach = True
#.      - MOO_Audience_State_SpokeToKetheric = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:f6f9e900-78bc-8b31-4700-c97f24d4b129
msgctxt "h7b1fd5fag46f4g429bg9eeag796ffaece9dd"
msgid ""
"<i>You</i> - what in the name of the <i>Nine Hells</i> are you doing here?!"
msgstr "<i>너</i>, <i>아홉 지옥</i> 맙소사 도대체 여기서 뭘 하고 있는 거냐?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = f7f4157b-8cad-30a6-2d9d-5c6ce3fafb97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:f7f4157b-8cad-30a6-2d9d-5c6ce3fafb97
msgctxt "hf3fe40e5g0ad9g421cg8014g0322a998d1d1"
msgid "Join the army of the dead, True Soul. Witness Lord Myrkul's glory!"
msgstr "망자의 군대에 합류해라, 참된 영혼. 머큘님의 영광을 목도하라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = fd6e274b-8a88-6c7c-99cf-0a587fee2b1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:fd6e274b-8a88-6c7c-99cf-0a587fee2b1a
msgctxt "h696709ceg1885g4970g8828g7119644100b3"
msgid "A mad dog like Orin might be impressed. I am not."
msgstr "오린 같은 미친개는 감동할지도 모르겠군. 나는 아냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = fe2965be-f3f0-0b66-85f7-905079eeb987
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Audience_State_SpokeToKetheric = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_KethericIntro:fe2965be-f3f0-0b66-85f7-905079eeb987
msgctxt "h562d4b58g0da8g45c5gb0b0g5fa4891fd5b7"
msgid "But the lure of one's destiny is irresistible, isn't it?"
msgstr "하지만 운명의 유혹은 거부할 수 없지, 그렇지 않나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment:07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
msgctxt "hd63c9c73g671eg4c05gacacg8c5147b281dd"
msgid "It's not every day you get to kill the Chosen of a god."
msgstr "신의 선택받은 자를 죽일 수 있는 기회는 자주 있는 게 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment:07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
msgctxt "h661ace0bg4e6bg42a5ga207g5e64c945f707"
msgid "Myrkul's Chosen has fallen. <i>Ch'mar, zal'a Vlaakith!</i>"
msgstr "머큘의 선택받은 자가 쓰러졌노라. <i>츠마르, 잘라 블라키스!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: LAEZEL_ORPHEUSPATH and REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment:07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
msgctxt "hd2ba9321g5b35g4f91ga96cgea0649b29570"
msgid "Myrkul's Chosen has fallen. <i>Ch'mar, zal'a Gith!</i>"
msgstr "머큘의 선택받은 자가 쓰러졌노라. <i>츠마르, 잘라 기스!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment:07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
msgctxt "h51539ce1gb988g4ee1gbf10g166e5fe4113f"
msgid "Nothing left but ash and bone. A fitting end to the Chosen of Myrkul."
msgstr "재와 뼈밖에 남지 않았군. 머큘의 선택 받은 자에게 어울리는 최후야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment:07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
msgctxt "h150e43e9g39b3g4d5bg93f1g2ea688e621ae"
msgid "Hells, I could sleep for a tenday after that."
msgstr "젠장, 지금 누우면 열흘도 잘 수 있겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment:07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
msgctxt "h6d65f39ege78dg41c3g9470gb5e2a61057ec"
msgid "Dead for good! Wow, the Chosen of Myrkul... What a fight!"
msgstr "영원히 잠들어라! 와, 머큘의 선택받은 자라니... 엄청난 싸움이었어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment:07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
msgctxt "h2332044dgd2ffg44d1gb3f5gd9179664cc51"
msgid "The <i>Apostle of Myrkul</i> - hadn't expected that. Or <i>Gortash</i>."
msgstr "<i>머큘의 사도</i>라니 - 이건 예측 못했네. 또 고타쉬도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment:07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
msgctxt "h2b8aa784g104bg4e07g9ccdg47b8dedb1206"
msgid ""
"It is done. Ketheric Thorm is no more. Now the land can heal and the dead "
"can rest, avenged."
msgstr "이제 끝이다. 케서릭 쏨은 쓰러졌노라. 드디어 대지는 회복되고 죽은 자 들도 편히 쉴 수 있겠지. 인과응보다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_AfterCombatComment:07d08e0d-826b-9415-1c3b-cdf6b07e0449
msgctxt "haa77eb5fg40f7g47fegbc04g6f016f9733d4"
msgid "The Chosen of Myrkul is dead - permanently, this time."
msgstr "머큘의 선택받은 자가 죽었군 - 이번엔 영원히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged:852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
msgctxt "h7d4c393fgc9f4g498fga335gfc850d3caa79"
msgid ""
"This is pointless! Ketheric's invincible so long as Nightsong's rotting in "
"his cage."
msgstr "다 소용없어! 케서릭은 밤의 노래가 그 우리에 처박혀 있는 한 무적이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged:852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
msgctxt "h70b49b11g334ag4f27g8450g3cb35cda4f1a"
msgid "<i>Tsk'va.</i> Thorm can't die while Nightsong's still caged!"
msgstr "<i>츠크바.</i> 밤의 노래가 갇혀있는 한 쏨은 죽지 않는다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged:852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
msgctxt "hdff9bcabgb049g447fgb7ecg0b9a001518f8"
msgid "Nothing can harm Ketheric as long as Nightsong is caged."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 갇혀 있는 한 케서릭을 해칠 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged:852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
msgctxt "h5a91c3b5ge1abg4a6egaad8g78d6654caa20"
msgid ""
"Pointless attacking Ketheric while the Nightsong's bound to him - she must "
"be freed!"
msgstr "밤의 노래가 그에게 묶여있는 한 케서릭을 공격 해봐야 소용없어 - 밤의 노래를 풀어줘야 해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged:852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
msgctxt "h2ba52312g77f6g4781gb6fbg746bedf3e695"
msgid "Getting nowhere fast. He'll never die while Nightsong's still caged!"
msgstr "아무 의미 없다고. 밤의 노래가 갇혀있는 한 저자식은 절대 죽지 않을 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged:852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
msgctxt "h8921d79eg3659g41e1gb98fgbb0d2d2501f2"
msgid "We can't get at him as long as the Nightsong's caged."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 갇혀있는 한 저 자식한테 이길 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged:852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
msgctxt "hd7e163fag4eeag4c51gbfd3g061b12c47c87"
msgid "Ketheric still clings to his power! We need the Nightsong - free!"
msgstr "케서릭이 여전히 힘을 흡수하고 있어! 서둘러 밤의 노래를 풀어줘야 해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged:852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
msgctxt "h34a52af5g6c4fg44b9g9444g2c334c9c44a9"
msgid ""
"Ketheric's unstoppable so long as he feeds on the Nightsong - we must free "
"her."
msgstr "밤의 노래의 힘을 흡수하고 있는 한 케서릭을 막을 순 없어 - 밤의 노래를 풀어줘야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KethericShowdown_PAD_NightsongCaged:852e1416-a656-4758-b603-62a7b864a1ca
msgctxt "hdc5f0b52gfdc1g4c75g824cgb8e7b7d958b6"
msgid ""
"So long as Nightsong's in that cage, Ketheric will keep getting back up."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 갇혀있는 한, 케서릭은 계속 부활할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD:13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
msgctxt "h9418c799g505cg43f9ga47fgc0fbdd3e58b4"
msgid "Oh, this is <i>wretched</i>. I've never smelled such rotten blood."
msgstr "으, 진짜 <i>끔찍하군</i>. 이 정도로 썩은 피냄새는 맡아본 적 없는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD:13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
msgctxt "hb550d055ga848g4b01ga027ge6fce81c4606"
msgid "Gods, that smell. Abattoir crossed with privy."
msgstr "맙소사, 무슨 냄새야. 도축장이랑 똥통을 섞어놓은 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD:13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
msgctxt "ha0a83ca3g06bag468ag9e17g2e3149a6c8df"
msgid "Gods, it's like a charnel house. All these people."
msgstr "맙소사, 이 많은 사람들 좀 봐, 마치 납골당같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD:13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
msgctxt "h99fbd404g39ecg4506g95cag76505ff1393d"
msgid "By the One in the Void, this stench could choke a neogi master."
msgstr "튜나라스 맙소사, 이정도 악취면 네오기 마스터도 질식하겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD:13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
msgctxt "hb526c796g49fag43e8gaa15g4d718c1e3cae"
msgid "Smells like blood and tears. This place saw a lot of suffering."
msgstr "피와 눈물의 냄새가 나는군. 얼마나 많은 이들이 여기서 고통받았을까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD:13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
msgctxt "h2707c39eg3e2bg4420ga5cdg853db5e7b198"
msgid "Ugh - smells like I've gone down one of the Gate's stormwater grates."
msgstr "으 - 마치 발더스 게이트 하수구에 내려온 것 같은 냄새네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD:13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
msgctxt "hcbcb998fg35c8g4379gbfcdg25f1236f727c"
msgid "That smell... How much butchery has this place seen?"
msgstr "이 냄새... 얼마나 많은 사람들을 여기서 도륙한 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD:13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
msgctxt "h6e6ff403gaa77g4679g958eg2e3da252f075"
msgid "Gods. Not a stench I've ever been able to forget."
msgstr "맙소사. 한 번 맡으면 잊을 수 있을 만한 냄새가 아니군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenEntry_PAD:13cdc741-10b3-44b9-9833-e5d2dac2525a
msgctxt "h63697758g165eg415fg815eg61becddc6a2c"
msgid ""
"The <i>stench</i>. I wonder how many pilgrimages to Moonrise ended down here."
msgstr "이 <i>악취</i>. 얼마나 많은 문라이즈 순례자들이 여기서 생을 마감했을까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
msgctxt "h9895d721g7e90g4256g9dfdgad5aa3a46bf5"
msgid "How strange, I feel... marvellous!"
msgstr "정말 이상하네, 기분이... 끝내줘!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
msgctxt "h0aba63c7gfb2bg4f33gbd2eg7f02a54575c5"
msgid ""
"I'm rather alarmed to say I suddenly feel inexplicably jubilant. How "
"ominously delightful."
msgstr "이런 말하긴 그런데, 갑자기 설명할 수 없을 만큼 환희에 차고 있어. 이렇게 불길하게 기쁘다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
msgctxt "hafb6d228gdd00g41d6g85d3g580e7b300147"
msgid "Haha! What's this feeling? I'm so... so happy."
msgstr "하하! 이 느낌은 뭐지? 너무... 너무 행복해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
msgctxt "hd0c9ab79ga968g45a1g976bg2aa99a1c3265"
msgid "Is this... is this joy I feel? It's terrible. And <i>incredible</i>."
msgstr "지금 느껴지는 이게... 기쁨인가? 끔직하면서도, <i>엄청난</i> 기분이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
msgctxt "h53751530g6782g41eegaa0ag9a50d36156d4"
msgid "Strange, I almost feel like I've just, um... I feel good."
msgstr "이상하네. 음...그냥 기분이 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
msgctxt "h62fc0baegd43fg44f3g8452g9a8f3702961e"
msgid "Happy?! Now is a weird time for happy, but I am <i>joyous</i>!"
msgstr "행복? 지금 행복하다는 게 이상하지만, 아무튼<i>기뻐</i>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:2a6c85a3-3734-4782-b45b-98baede4abe7
msgctxt "hc8e47fd9ga861g4749ga6afg854643d3d95a"
msgid "I feel... <i>glorious</i>."
msgstr "기분이 <i>너무 좋아</i>..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
msgctxt "hd6d1c716gc1c2g4eb8gb865g8745c0f02895"
msgid "Ah, the marvellousness fades. Nothing ever lasts, I suppose."
msgstr "아, 끝내주는 이 기분이 사라지고 있네. 아마 영원한 건 없겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
msgctxt "he6973e45g39f5g46begb30fg43e5b96e0884"
msgid ""
"That feeling of jubilance... It's gone. What a relief it is to return to a "
"state of appropriate dread."
msgstr "그 환희의 느낌이...사라졌어. 적절한 두려움이 몰려오니 정말 다행이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
msgctxt "hd3bd9dc4gb114g4d42gaf90ge0bd86d6082e"
msgid "Oh. Right. Not happy, just psionicked."
msgstr "오. 이제 행복하지 않네, 그냥 사이오닉이었나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
msgctxt "h20063983g1481g4b5dgb6fdg64d6b291d4e9"
msgid "Ah, the joy's faded. No matter - I much prefer furious indignation."
msgstr "아, 기쁨이 사라졌어. 상관없어. 어차피 나는 격렬한 분노를 느끼는 걸 더 좋아하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
msgctxt "h33957389g978cg46a5ga298gdb6aa4f92c35"
msgid "Oh, well that didn't last long."
msgstr "에이, 그리 오래가진 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
msgctxt "h76285b30g2e6cg4556g9fbfgc4972a61c19b"
msgid "Grounded again. I prefer merriment when it is earned, anyway."
msgstr "기분이 다시 돌아왔어. 상관없어. 나는 직접 얻은 기쁨이 더 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_KitchenSecret_State_JoyRemoved(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenSecret_ResonanceStone_PAD:a5fdbe2c-a48a-4f74-a789-c94a59bb9993
msgctxt "h32217060g8b25g4fd1gaa5egef89b37844d9"
msgid "Agh. Well. Good feelings never last, I suppose."
msgstr "윽. 그래. 좋은 감정들은 영원하지 않지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
msgctxt "h283b7543gefffg426dg9e46g63bd6ddb6345"
msgid "That's a little too much blood, even for me."
msgstr "나 같은 사람에게도 너무 많은 피야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
msgctxt "hdbc14223gfbe6g4ca6g980fg845f3347a962"
msgid ""
"To stand on the shores of this sea of gore... It's enough to drive one "
"mercifully insane."
msgstr "피의 바다 앞에 서 있는 것만으로도...누군가를 미치게 만들기에 충분할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
msgctxt "hc7f69a99gabcfg4720g8a64g320bf24483d1"
msgid "I'm gonna be sick."
msgstr "토할 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
msgctxt "hfe10c0afg3d99g40b1g98c0g8fb67098217c"
msgid "An ocean of blood. <i>Ghaik</i> depravity truly knows no bounds."
msgstr "피의 바다라니. <i>게이크</i>의 사악함은 끝이 없네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
msgctxt "ha2bc3a5eg9f19g4b54ga779gc25e68650442"
msgid "Hells. How many lives where snuffed out to spill that much blood?"
msgstr "세상에. 이렇게 많은 피를 흘리기 위해 얼마나 많은 목숨들이 희생된거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
msgctxt "h81def564ge98dg4febga05cg5c503640bed8"
msgid ""
"A lake of blood. Gods, think of all the poor souls who perished to fill it."
msgstr "피의 호수라니. 신이시여, 희생 된 불쌍한 영혼들은 굽어살피소서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:8756df00-c936-9514-4e37-3cfba9fe59bc
msgctxt "hab032c91gd132g4ca7gb927g29f785c6d964"
msgid "So much blood. The illithids take what's useful and discard the rest."
msgstr "엄청난 양의 피야. 일리시드들은 필요한 부분만 사용하고 나머지는 모두 버리지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Oubliette_State_HasEntered(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
msgctxt "h9112e90fgd7c0g4463ga418gdb479a0a9c3f"
msgid "Ah, this again. It's even worse up close."
msgstr "아. 하나 더 있어. 가까이서 보니 더 심각하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Oubliette_State_HasEntered(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
msgctxt "hce18e745gc664g4c30gb0c4g742365d52f1b"
msgid "I suppose a lake of blood counts as rustic in this illithid hell."
msgstr "일리시드 지옥에서 피의 호수는 소소한 축에 속하나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Oubliette_State_HasEntered(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
msgctxt "ha831f210gbebdg4ca8ga1c8ge89db5cf7648"
msgid "All that blood. Guess there's a worse place than Avernus after all."
msgstr "저 피들을 봐. 아베르누스보다 더 나쁜 곳도 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Oubliette_State_HasEntered(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
msgctxt "h8cbee5d0g891eg4460gb58ag022b5111be11"
msgid ""
"The blood lake once more. And the <i>ghaik</i>'s grand design for our "
"future, laid bare."
msgstr "피의 호수가 하나 더 있네. 우리의 미래를 위한 <i>게이크</i>의 위대한 설계가 뭔지 알겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Oubliette_State_HasEntered(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
msgctxt "hf5b0d02dg0c4ag4339gaa73gd51f7cd89724"
msgid "So much blood. You could row a boat through it."
msgstr "너무 많은 피야. 배로 지나갈 수 있을 정도야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Oubliette_State_HasEntered(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
msgctxt "h82081786gf19cg4003g9605gfe70da82eb54"
msgid "All that blood. Gods, it's even more sickening than I first reckoned."
msgstr "저 피들을 봐. 신이시여. 내가 처음에 생각했던 것보다 훨씬 더 역겹군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Oubliette_State_HasEntered(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_KitchenVista_PAD:ce38556d-ac6c-42c1-8c9a-dc9cc95181a3
msgctxt "h8d748516g62c9g4694ga067g05f183bc0a65"
msgid "This lake of blood again. It's even bigger up close."
msgstr "또 피의 강이네. 가까이서 보니 더 거대해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0a69cec3-d2f4-d592-a51f-6e9ae27b1062
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_Morgue_State_UsFreed = False
#.      - COL_Morgue_Butcher_State_MentionedUs = False
#.   User:
#.      - COL_Morgue_User_HasMet_Us(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:0a69cec3-d2f4-d592-a51f-6e9ae27b1062
msgctxt "h694bb4b5g5923g4ed3ga6ebgc0ee2be54525"
msgid "About that creature in the cage..."
msgstr "우리 안에 있는 저 녀석 말인데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = 11d62efb-d327-6d7a-0e26-501073b30b43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1af91160-546a-c0ab-b431-3ab7c7bd3233_MentionedBecoming = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:11d62efb-d327-6d7a-0e26-501073b30b43
msgctxt "h9b2177f6g6389g491agb61bg6d311d033ffd"
msgid "Nur. Sery. Here. They become."
msgstr "양육. 실. 이곳. 거듭난다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = 13adb5de-a759-3385-9dd3-f839def88da5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_KethericShowdown_Knows_ToldKethericLocation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:13adb5de-a759-3385-9dd3-f839def88da5
msgctxt "h5028fdabgc5ddg480bgb4abge2cecf034be1"
msgid "Down. Deep. One of Three. <i>One of Three</i>."
msgstr "아래. 깊은 곳. 셋 중의 하나. <i>셋 중의 하나</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = 193e46ea-f93e-b189-29ec-6316ad5dbbde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:193e46ea-f93e-b189-29ec-6316ad5dbbde
msgctxt "h08382a1fg78c4g4d82g8e21g3ce99d8f1afe"
msgid "Odd. Other. Beyond One Mind."
msgstr "다르다. 다른 것들과. 하나의 정신 넘어선다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a29f86d-e300-cca1-653c-4d9bffd8e0ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_Morgue_State_UsFreed = False
#.      - COL_Morgue_Butcher_State_MentionedUs = True
#.   User:
#.      - COL_Morgue_User_HasMet_Us(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:1a29f86d-e300-cca1-653c-4d9bffd8e0ac
msgctxt "h89bd7118g4630g4847ga389g9124e046415f"
msgid "About the 'little kitty' in the cage..."
msgstr "우리 안에 있는 '작은 고양이' 말 인데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2feb0466-5e20-5d95-c9cf-a414adbf080e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:2feb0466-5e20-5d95-c9cf-a414adbf080e
msgctxt "h39620d8bgd098g4a58gb982gf132a4ab9b3f"
msgid "Do as you will with it."
msgstr "네가 하고 싶은대로 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36b8d1f9-afbd-f6ef-7353-fb7ad5f0b222
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:36b8d1f9-afbd-f6ef-7353-fb7ad5f0b222
msgctxt "h5e3c5ed3g49ffg41e2g9080gbaeccbb269f6"
msgid "<i>Leave</i>."
msgstr "<i>떠난다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 398cdc4e-5896-86a8-a7f1-53de6fa1d3ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:398cdc4e-5896-86a8-a7f1-53de6fa1d3ed
msgctxt "h81bc4fbagde45g4f1ag83e9g6fd4802209af"
msgid ""
"*Or you could take advantage of its vulnerability and plunder what's left of "
"its hollow mind for anything that could serve you.*"
msgstr "*아니면 취약하고 텅 빈 마음을 약탈해, 당신에게 도움이 된다면 무엇이든 하게 할 수도 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3f780df4-9271-a41f-59af-a73c89389e0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - COL_Kitchen_Butcher_HasMet_WhatIsMorgue(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - COL_Kitchen_Butcher_HasMet_WhatIsMorgue(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:3f780df4-9271-a41f-59af-a73c89389e0b
msgctxt "h50adbf47ga9cfg4d2ega6f4g3bbb42646b47"
msgid "What is this place?"
msgstr "여긴 뭐하는 곳이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = 466a022a-6855-1f0c-bc87-2bdbfc27385d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_Morgue_Butcher_State_ConvincedReleaseUs = True
#.   Object:
#.     - COL_Morgue_Butcher_Event_ReceiveUsKey(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:466a022a-6855-1f0c-bc87-2bdbfc27385d
msgctxt "h0b8e223ag058dg4772ga2eege45b3f1eb2a9"
msgid "...Yes. Yes. Take - only One song remains."
msgstr "알았다. 알았다. 데리고 간다. 오직 하나의 노래만 있어야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = 46a03315-fe90-96e9-b032-f0b22b6a027b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:46a03315-fe90-96e9-b032-f0b22b6a027b
msgctxt "h685aa802g1d4cg48a2g8507g34d1c73a0d5d"
msgid "No. No. Wrong song."
msgstr "아니다. 아니다. 틀린 노래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = 495cc001-b57b-b8ad-82e0-ab507e2cffbf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_Morgue_State_UsInColony = True
#.      - COL_Morgue_State_UsFreed = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_Morgue_Butcher_State_MentionedUs = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:495cc001-b57b-b8ad-82e0-ab507e2cffbf
msgctxt "hcd517232g053fg47a4g8c36g40f061e05eac"
msgid "But there is one. Little. Kitty. Dances. To another song."
msgstr "하지만 있다. 작다. 고양이. 춤춘다. 다른 노래에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 507f29fa-064c-aa71-c1eb-215c57d4ca4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 1af91160-546a-c0ab-b431-3ab7c7bd3233_MentionedBecoming = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:507f29fa-064c-aa71-c1eb-215c57d4ca4c
msgctxt "h96251abbgc912g4524g9848g154f43f8b909"
msgid "Why don't I send you to join all these creatures you butchered?"
msgstr "네가 도축한 것들과 똑같이 만들어 줄까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 69226405-b3ce-18a2-13e8-f1c0ce2f2690
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:69226405-b3ce-18a2-13e8-f1c0ce2f2690
msgctxt "heab1968bg921fg4a41ga9a9ge3621eb73ee5"
msgid ""
"*With a lurch, you realise he means the intellect devourers. Here the brains "
"are harvested - made part of the hivemind.*"
msgstr "*갑자기 비틀거리며, 그가 말한 것이 지성 포식자임을 깨닫습니다. 여기서 수확된 뇌는 하이브 마인드의 일부가 됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 70715927-a69c-44a8-a308-2603875e8671
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - COL_Kitchen_Butcher_HasMet_LaezelInclusion(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - COL_Kitchen_Butcher_HasMet_LaezelInclusion(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:70715927-a69c-44a8-a308-2603875e8671
msgctxt "hab5a7a4bgb3e9g44dcg8ce0gd78d70a597e0"
msgid "A <i>ghaik</i> thrall. The only way to save it is to kill it."
msgstr "<i>게이크</i>의 노예군. 녀석을 구원하려면 죽이는 수 밖에 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72156c19-b7a6-377b-9d79-625f69a61595
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 1af91160-546a-c0ab-b431-3ab7c7bd3233_MentionedBecoming = True
#.   User:
#.      - COL_Kitchen_Butcher_HasMet_BecomeWhat(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - COL_Kitchen_Butcher_HasMet_BecomeWhat(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:72156c19-b7a6-377b-9d79-625f69a61595
msgctxt "h74988f44g034eg415bg817fg1af20883df20"
msgid "Become what?"
msgstr "뭐로 거듭나는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = 737b1aad-7339-37ac-d9af-11907f8f3bae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:737b1aad-7339-37ac-d9af-11907f8f3bae
msgctxt "ha73b8d67g8723g4f66gb87cgb067cf7d6dd7"
msgid "Mas. Ter? <i>No.</i>"
msgstr "주인. 님? <i>아니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 742c34af-00a4-7add-e399-6286eea2d54a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:742c34af-00a4-7add-e399-6286eea2d54a
msgctxt "ha7631ff2g7cb3g4f89g9639gc1184dc24ed5"
msgid "Free the creature or I'll kill you and every one of your creations."
msgstr "저 녀석을 풀어줘. 그렇지 않으면 너와 너가 만든 것들을 전부 죽여버리겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 76d20e5e-0540-acea-b187-a1326a9ba9c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:76d20e5e-0540-acea-b187-a1326a9ba9c4
msgctxt "hb2746c86g7c8eg45f9g8e4cge4b125714fbc"
msgid ""
"*You could kill it, end its miserable life of enslavement. Surely that would "
"be the humane thing to do...*"
msgstr "*죽여서, 비참한 노예의 삶을 끝마쳐 줄 수도 있습니다. 분명 그게 가장 인도적인 일일 겁니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 776dc363-24f5-407b-ba38-b77ea9ad84fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_Morgue_State_ReadButcherMind(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - COL_Morgue_State_ReadButcherMind(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:776dc363-24f5-407b-ba38-b77ea9ad84fb
msgctxt "h563f2b26g218ag4833gb43ag9a382bacaf68"
msgid "<i>Enter his thoughts.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그의 생각 속으로 들어간다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7d107fee-c4e9-424c-8303-cf6454c2af70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:7d107fee-c4e9-424c-8303-cf6454c2af70
msgctxt "ha906c7bcg9fa9g4d34g99a7g58c1a4a8cca4"
msgid ""
"*You focus on the source of the power, but it is quiet and still. It needs "
"to rest.*"
msgstr "*힘의 원천인 존재에 정신을 집중하지만, 응답이 없습니다. 휴식이 필요한 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 81f289f5-2136-81a2-7656-3e9810b8c1b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - COL_Morgue_Knows_ButcherKillUsReason(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - COL_Morgue_Knows_ButcherKillUsReason(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:81f289f5-2136-81a2-7656-3e9810b8c1b5
msgctxt "hffb359d6gfea1g4d3fg8355g1bcd65c8df94"
msgid "What's wrong with it?"
msgstr "뭐가 문제야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = 84bf429f-0d54-4dae-b592-eb65795f0eff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_Morgue_Butcher_State_ConvincedReleaseUs = True
#.   Object:
#.     - COL_Morgue_Butcher_Event_ReceiveUsKey(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:84bf429f-0d54-4dae-b592-eb65795f0eff
msgctxt "h353b83efg43b2g4cb5g8c34g9677add19325"
msgid "No<i>. No. </i>Kitties good. Sing One song. Take other. Away!"
msgstr "아니다. <i>아니다. </i> 고양이 착하다. 노래는 한 가지만 불러야 한다. 다른 노래. 치워!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8bdfd1ea-badd-6661-a4ad-4377fcf3a26f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_Morgue_Butcher_State_MentionedUs = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:8bdfd1ea-badd-6661-a4ad-4377fcf3a26f
msgctxt "h0c5c82eeg5b78g4b9bgb850g8bada76cc059"
msgid "Let it come with me. We sing the same song."
msgstr "고양이를 데리고 갈 수 있게 해 줘. 우리는 똑같은 노래를 부르거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = 95bb84d1-9938-4b0e-147a-e9d9ebe42b49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_Morgue_Butcher_State_ConvincedReleaseUs = True
#.   Object:
#.     - COL_Morgue_Butcher_Event_ReceiveUsKey(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:95bb84d1-9938-4b0e-147a-e9d9ebe42b49
msgctxt "hec1a4d25g5a46g49a8g814cgb70cf325d3e1"
msgid "...Yes. Yes. I hear. Go then. Make. Happy?"
msgstr "...알았다. 알겠다. 데리고 간다. 해준다. 행복하게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = 98543b4e-79ff-7366-0f11-5ada1e6e6492
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:98543b4e-79ff-7366-0f11-5ada1e6e6492
msgctxt "h29722eb0gfb52g4272gaf37gfd79c6323892"
msgid "No. NO. I CHOP!"
msgstr "아니다. <b>아니다. 나 썬다!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = 9f8e751f-865f-26a1-2327-b92928c3643d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:9f8e751f-865f-26a1-2327-b92928c3643d
msgctxt "h9c02beabg3047g459ega033g20dab6de8256"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a024fb9c-a29b-4629-75bf-c031031c1f4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:a024fb9c-a29b-4629-75bf-c031031c1f4e
msgctxt "hd9258a0cgafc1g4d71g88ceg37af7f611520"
msgid ""
"*Pliant as well-worn boots, his mind turns to his work. Chop. Cut. Sort.*"
msgstr "*잘 길들여진 신발처럼, 그는 역할에 집중합니다. 썰고. 자르고. 분류합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a7049952-91b1-7089-b3db-5ec3bb951818
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:a7049952-91b1-7089-b3db-5ec3bb951818
msgctxt "he539c07eg65a5g4042g8407g72de4c507006"
msgid ""
"*No will sparks behind his eyes. His mind has been hollowed out, to better "
"echo the commands of the collective.*"
msgstr "*이 생물에게는 어떠한 의지도 없어보입니다. 명령을 더 효율적으로 수행하기 위해서, 마음은 비워져 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a87c7a06-83a0-bdba-a90f-375f7302861c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_KethericShowdown_State_Started = False
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_Knows_ToldKethericLocation = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:a87c7a06-83a0-bdba-a90f-375f7302861c
msgctxt "h2e865df2g76efg40d3gbdd4gd85b24dfae63"
msgid "I need to find your master - Ketheric."
msgstr "네 주인을 찾아야 해, 케서릭."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9a56809-4f58-20e9-71e2-0e682420a6a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - COL_Kitchen_Butcher_HasMet_WhyButcherPeople(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - COL_Kitchen_Butcher_HasMet_WhyButcherPeople(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:a9a56809-4f58-20e9-71e2-0e682420a6a9
msgctxt "h71ba3eafgc128g42d1gbdcegeb08ad1d75a8"
msgid "What did you do to all these people?"
msgstr "이 사람들에게 무슨 짓을 한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = ac2edd00-cdac-f00e-9cc0-4b10916ed77f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1af91160-546a-c0ab-b431-3ab7c7bd3233_MentionedBecoming = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:ac2edd00-cdac-f00e-9cc0-4b10916ed77f
msgctxt "h4b6e11b2g4700g419cg96ecg74736a51fb7e"
msgid "Chop. Chop. Help them. Become?"
msgstr "썬다. 썬다. 그들 도와준다. 거듭나게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = b3c1abcb-fdda-1abb-bdf1-e28a5dc5ab1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:b3c1abcb-fdda-1abb-bdf1-e28a5dc5ab1d
msgctxt "h4f37f0bcgf718g4dd4gb178g2079bf8c3264"
msgid "Careful petting. Sticky."
msgstr "조심히 쓰다듬는다. 끈적거린다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = b6e6e260-29a4-5ac3-0404-c161b53be8e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:b6e6e260-29a4-5ac3-0404-c161b53be8e0
msgctxt "h897afee9gec02g4817gb395g2be5c1d2cf41"
msgid "Part of One Mind. Four little feet. Dancing. To same song."
msgstr "하나의 정신 중 일부. 네 개의 작은 다리. 춤춘다. 같은 노래에 맞춰."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = c31f1c44-6878-1de6-1d5f-25c1c6289165
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:c31f1c44-6878-1de6-1d5f-25c1c6289165
msgctxt "h7466ccaeg023dg4833g8f97ge2b0786ba0a0"
msgid "Cut. Chop. Until it is <i>us</i> again."
msgstr "자른다. 썬다. 다시 <i>우리</i>가 될 때까지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = c3884e69-017e-3da5-d94c-3e20c74dc125
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - COL_Kitchen_Butcher_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:c3884e69-017e-3da5-d94c-3e20c74dc125
msgctxt "h44f064fbgabf1g4ac9gb511gd99b8c45032f"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c6df2ea2-0d71-ca17-435d-c5a8aac67e81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:c6df2ea2-0d71-ca17-435d-c5a8aac67e81
msgctxt "h1ed11c91g4f2cg4670ga269g9b50b2f08d9f"
msgid "I'll take the creature with me. It won't disrupt the hivemind anymore."
msgstr "이 녀석은 내가 데려갈게. 그러면 더 이상 이 녀석이 하이브 마인드를 방해하지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c832841c-74ba-bf85-ffd9-98d0a5ced1b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:c832841c-74ba-bf85-ffd9-98d0a5ced1b5
msgctxt "h3a0fb808g232ag4623gb279g3e7d449e4c8d"
msgid ""
"*You focus on the source of the power, but it is quiet and still. It needs "
"to rest.*"
msgstr "*힘의 원천인 존재에 정신을 집중하지만, 응답이 없습니다. 휴식이 필요한 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cce23279-c1d9-32f0-87cd-9b67c1af1dc4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1af91160-546a-c0ab-b431-3ab7c7bd3233_MentionedBecoming = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher:cce23279-c1d9-32f0-87cd-9b67c1af1dc4
msgctxt "h0d737ffbg3035g4343ga095gc7edca6b0cd8"
msgid ""
"*Shiver of impact. Crack of bone. He removes the brains, digs free the "
"squirming tadpoles. The unworthy ones, given over to the illithids. To "
"become.*"
msgstr ""
"*충격에 흔들리고, 뼈가 갈라집니다. 뇌를 제거하고, 꿈틀거리는 올챙이들을 꺼내 풀어줍니다. 꺼내진 올챙이들은 일리시드가 되기 위해 다른 "
"일리시드에게 넘겨집니다. *"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Kitchen_Butcher
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d02a10cb-7440-8e2e-7dfe-493edf6a3a41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
