msgctxt "h61e7d5d0g64a2g41f9gb574g26b0e9034a93"
msgid "<i>Fructus cordis...</i>"
msgstr "<i>프룩투스 코르디스...</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrand
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 3fa62c82-7b71-4a78-b45e-c80293ac42de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - a6f2350b-ecc4-bf6c-0c73-dcb37f9e9690_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a6f2350b-ecc4-bf6c-0c73-dcb37f9e9690_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrand:3fa62c82-7b71-4a78-b45e-c80293ac42de
msgctxt "h6046b3ccgb73dg4273ga227g1860a8abd493"
msgid "Too feeble by far. This needs muscle; the stronger, the better."
msgstr "너무나도 나약하다. 더 강하고, 더 튼튼한 근육이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrand
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 60f1b6ee-cf54-4bab-a160-d16eb79749c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - a6f2350b-ecc4-bf6c-0c73-dcb37f9e9690_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a6f2350b-ecc4-bf6c-0c73-dcb37f9e9690_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrand:60f1b6ee-cf54-4bab-a160-d16eb79749c3
msgctxt "h6d013557g2719g49fdg9900g406757e174c8"
msgid ""
"Better. Much better. But still lacking perspective. Bring me eyes - clear, "
"young ones."
msgstr "좋아. 훨씬 낫군. 하지만 시력은 아직도 별로인데. 새 눈을 가져와라, 깨끗하고 어린 놈으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrand
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = aea4afd0-6f72-4386-a0a5-d803774c2799
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a6f2350b-ecc4-bf6c-0c73-dcb37f9e9690_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrand:aea4afd0-6f72-4386-a0a5-d803774c2799
msgctxt "h7b67c148g4d65g4ee6g88e9g5ed272fc55eb"
msgid "This brew lacks a touch of magic - bring me some wizard flesh."
msgstr "이 맥주는 마법의 향이 부족하군. 마법사의 살코기를 좀 가져오도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrand
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = b0ce4dfd-cd79-41e3-a314-c2d7912b24d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - a6f2350b-ecc4-bf6c-0c73-dcb37f9e9690_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a6f2350b-ecc4-bf6c-0c73-dcb37f9e9690_B = False
#.     - a6f2350b-ecc4-bf6c-0c73-dcb37f9e9690_C = False
#.     - a6f2350b-ecc4-bf6c-0c73-dcb37f9e9690_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrand:b0ce4dfd-cd79-41e3-a314-c2d7912b24d5
msgctxt "h96d33106g1ef5g437cgb6b3g1747853d1cc5"
msgid ""
"Good. Lacking a little passion perhaps. Bring me some nether parts - or "
"failing that, a heart."
msgstr "좋아. 정력이 좀 부족한 것 같군. 아랫도리를 가져와라. 없다면 심장도 괜찮다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrandDone
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 0ccf843e-3359-4475-8c97-d17325e96a69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 14e6adcb-c6a8-99e4-1c39-4d3b925590e2_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 14e6adcb-c6a8-99e4-1c39-4d3b925590e2_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrandDone:0ccf843e-3359-4475-8c97-d17325e96a69
msgctxt "hcece6717g59abg4ce4g86bcg2478bd0f67da"
msgid "Stop dawdling - it's not as though you have somewhere better to be."
msgstr "빈둥거리지 마라. 딱히 나은 곳에 갈 수 있을 만한 처지도 못 되지 않느냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrandDone
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 1a0b7b56-fa20-46c3-8238-a5413947228a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 14e6adcb-c6a8-99e4-1c39-4d3b925590e2_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 14e6adcb-c6a8-99e4-1c39-4d3b925590e2_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrandDone:1a0b7b56-fa20-46c3-8238-a5413947228a
msgctxt "h24c91e8bgc4f6g41e3g9b5bgb557e447ca49"
msgid ""
"<i>Gentle! </i>If you want to throw offal about without care, go work in the "
"kitchens."
msgstr "<i>조심히!</i> 내장을 생각없이 던질 생각이면 주방에서 일해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrandDone
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 7d03a5d6-5400-4c6f-b2f8-2d02da670e0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 14e6adcb-c6a8-99e4-1c39-4d3b925590e2_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrandDone:7d03a5d6-5400-4c6f-b2f8-2d02da670e0a
msgctxt "h767e0f10g194bg4660gb139g499f1f2a2e3c"
msgid "Not the freshest, but it will do."
msgstr "가장 신선한 건 아니지만, 그래도 괜찮아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrandDone
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 9cb009bb-4938-4332-bf81-a1cc0ae5db4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 14e6adcb-c6a8-99e4-1c39-4d3b925590e2_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 14e6adcb-c6a8-99e4-1c39-4d3b925590e2_B = False
#.     - 14e6adcb-c6a8-99e4-1c39-4d3b925590e2_C = False
#.     - 14e6adcb-c6a8-99e4-1c39-4d3b925590e2_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_AD_ZombieErrandDone:9cb009bb-4938-4332-bf81-a1cc0ae5db4f
msgctxt "hbe7346f3ge055g4259gbc5ag44e2d37ed97a"
msgid ""
"Perhaps I should augment you with some wings, so you can do your tasks more "
"quickly."
msgstr "널 날개로 강화시켜야 하나. 일을 더 빨리 할 수 있게 말야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_DaisyAD_Balthazar
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 64c49c5a-7b15-0ab1-d039-21d763d759b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_DaisyAD_Balthazar:64c49c5a-7b15-0ab1-d039-21d763d759b6
msgctxt "h957a3233g93d5g40d2gbcfagc101b8572042"
msgid ""
"But they were already imbued with Netherese magic - so where did that magic "
"come from?"
msgstr "하지만 이미 네더릴 마법이 부여되어있었어 - 그럼 그 마법은 어디서 온 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_DaisyAD_Balthazar
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 64c49c5a-7b15-0ab1-d039-21d763d759b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_DaisyAD_Balthazar:64c49c5a-7b15-0ab1-d039-21d763d759b6
msgctxt "hd18d4706gefc5g438fg89d9g7633b0461b1f"
msgid ""
"But they were already imbued with Netherese magic - so where did that magic "
"come from?"
msgstr "하지만 이미 네더릴 마법이 부여되어있었어 - 그럼 그 마법은 어디서 온 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 0ebb3498-77f6-8e98-806d-d4323f36e740
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_NecromancerLab_State_PretendedToBeThralls = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:0ebb3498-77f6-8e98-806d-d4323f36e740
msgctxt "h684412a7g7bb9g4feagb3ddg70c59db3296e"
msgid "Away, thrall. Enough distractions."
msgstr "물러나라, 노예. 산만하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 16c76589-38c2-be5a-b7d3-4afa3417f327
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_NecromancerLab_State_PretendedToBeThralls = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:16c76589-38c2-be5a-b7d3-4afa3417f327
msgctxt "h7590fcabgb724g458ega786g29d50cf358ce"
msgid "How often do I have to repeat myself? <i>No disturbances.</i>"
msgstr "몇 번을 말해야 하나? <i>방해하지 마라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 19385673-ed3f-5ff3-d7e2-3597d0dcf9e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:19385673-ed3f-5ff3-d7e2-3597d0dcf9e8
msgctxt "h9d12ae24gb40eg4e3egb4f7gdba8df678d7e"
msgid ""
"General Thorm didn't inform me you were coming, which means you're "
"trespassing."
msgstr "쏨 장군이 너의 방문을 알린 적은 없다. 즉, 넌 무단으로 침입했단 뜻이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 296a8676-0983-6843-9ead-44230e19e94d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:296a8676-0983-6843-9ead-44230e19e94d
msgctxt "h72ac0f55gc231g47aagbc52g3b4c521a57d4"
msgid ""
"No... there's far too much life in your eyes for you to be a thrall. But I "
"can easily remedy that..."
msgstr "아니야... 노예 치고는 네 눈엔 생기가 너무 가득해. 하지만 그정돈 내가 쉽게 고쳐줄 수 있지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 334020de-6ab9-c14a-0bd7-57d16c8745ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:334020de-6ab9-c14a-0bd7-57d16c8745ad
msgctxt "hea37dbaagcdd9g480dg9ef1g563b028d6b73"
msgid ""
"<i>General Thorm </i>to you, thrall. You should have told me you were meant "
"for him from the beginning."
msgstr "<i>쏨 장군</i>이라고 했나, 노예? 그럼 처음부터 쏨을 섬기고 있다고 말했어야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3899f1f1-54d9-d02b-059b-3539727b38a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:3899f1f1-54d9-d02b-059b-3539727b38a8
msgctxt "h43c3d83bge5ceg4958ga16cg4d654808f4b6"
msgid "<i>Stare vacantly, pretending to be a thrall.</i>"
msgstr "<i>노예인 척을 하며, 멍하게 쳐다본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 3fbdd953-5e55-9873-197f-640cec04d872
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:3fbdd953-5e55-9873-197f-640cec04d872
msgctxt "h67b07f69gd5e9g4983gbd72g0ee41b3f8d7c"
msgid ""
"Wait - you're no underling of mine. Far too <i>intact </i>for my tastes. "
"That means you're a trespasser."
msgstr "잠깐 - 넌 내 부하가 아니야. 내 취향치고 너무 <i>온전해</i>. 네가 침입자라는 의미지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 40d94570-1566-34ef-2263-dca431a1feea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MINTHARA(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:40d94570-1566-34ef-2263-dca431a1feea
msgctxt "hc9784bf4g0e40g4788gb685g6b1f1f08792e"
msgid ""
"Wait... you're that treacherous drow that failed General Thorm. <i>Minthara</"
"i>. Most kind of you to turn yourself in..."
msgstr "잠깐... 넌 쏨 장군을 실망시킨 그 신뢰할 수 없는 드로우 <i>민타라</i>군. 제 발로 여길 찾아오다니 착하군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 511cfe0a-d813-a74b-7f92-c5ad73c6ed83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:511cfe0a-d813-a74b-7f92-c5ad73c6ed83
msgctxt "hd4010447g906dg4d29g975dg87ea137f63bb"
msgid ""
"A <i>misunderstanding</i>, is it? Poor creature. But fear not - you'll be "
"relieved of all such concerns, once I'm through with you..."
msgstr "<i>오해</i>라고? 불쌍한 녀석. 그래도 겁먹지말거라. 내가 널 손봐준 다음에는 그런 걱정을 할 필요가 없을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c8879d7-396a-847a-018a-646b8bdc95d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:6c8879d7-396a-847a-018a-646b8bdc95d5
msgctxt "hfd94ca0ag35abg4e38g9429g173cdacd25b9"
msgid "<i>Stare vacantly, pretending to be a thrall.</i>"
msgstr "<i>노예인 척을 하며, 멍하니 바라본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6dbf737b-d7da-f363-a711-b6fbc308edfd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_KethericShowdown_State_Started = False
#.   User:
#.      - COL_NecromancerLab_Knows_KethericLocation(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:6dbf737b-d7da-f363-a711-b6fbc308edfd
msgctxt "hfa1f2894g5e82g405ega365g2e3d6808459f"
msgid "I need to find Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨을 찾아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 6faff76c-9ac6-efff-ba9d-71cf5c02ecf8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:6faff76c-9ac6-efff-ba9d-71cf5c02ecf8
msgctxt "h3e7eb6c2ge154g4158g81e5g87ad85a99474"
msgid ""
"<i>Who...? </i>Come now, do you know just how many children have been "
"through here, in one form or another?"
msgstr "<i>누구...?</i>이봐, 얼마나 많은 아이들이 여길 거쳐갔는지 알기나 하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 78f61387-08ce-62ec-341a-e350b1626260
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:78f61387-08ce-62ec-341a-e350b1626260
msgctxt "he5c75fb4g0603g4dbbg8e86g48d7eff296b2"
msgid "Now chop-chop. or <i>I'll </i>chop-chop."
msgstr "썩 꺼져. 안 그럼 <i>썩썩</i> 썰어 버릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 805c64f9-e13b-b0f5-0920-49d51f82685e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - JAHEIRA(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:805c64f9-e13b-b0f5-0920-49d51f82685e
msgctxt "hecc70c76g851bg4b2ag9e70g6380f98b585b"
msgid ""
"Wait... You're that wretched Harper woman who's been interfering in General "
"Thorm's plans. <i>Jaheira.</i> Most kind of you to turn yourself in..."
msgstr "잠깐... 넌 쏨 장군의 계획을 방해하던 그 형편없는 하퍼 여자 <i>자헤이라</i>잖아. 제 발로 찾아오다니 기쁘군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 806e1294-cd7a-c37b-57d6-d0476d6cc242
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:806e1294-cd7a-c37b-57d6-d0476d6cc242
msgctxt "h90761b24g84bcg4478gb84bg28aa5ec72c3a"
msgid ""
"Hold on - it's <i>you</i>. My little helper from the Nightsong's former home."
msgstr "잠깐 - <i>너</i>잖아. 전에 밤의 노래가 살던 곳에서 날 도와준 놈이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 860f28e3-5f77-a784-ee0c-d728162d7dea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_NecromancerLab_State_PretendedToBeThralls = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_NecromancerLab_State_PretendedToBeThralls = False
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:860f28e3-5f77-a784-ee0c-d728162d7dea
msgctxt "h34e7eb47gcf3bg43e1g9211g0a357fb8059a"
msgid ""
"I can't be expected to remember every little morsel. But I do remember that "
"you're supposed to be a thrall. Evidently not."
msgstr "내가 그런 잔챙이들까지 하나하나 기억해야 하나. 하지만 네가 노예가 될 예정이었단 건 기억나는데. 아니었나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 94c40c39-def4-84a4-4052-7ed014c7b630
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - COL_NecromancerLab_Knows_KethericLocation(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:94c40c39-def4-84a4-4052-7ed014c7b630
msgctxt "h34963d51g2234g486fg8a11g7dda43909e96"
msgid ""
"Seek out the nautiloid bay, descend the elevator, then the doorway that lies "
"straight ahead. The general will be there."
msgstr "노틸로이드 화물칸에서 승강기로 내려가라. 그 다음에 쭉 직진해서 보이는 문을 열면, 장군이 거기 있을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 966e0c8c-4333-35c0-608d-3c9e11036221
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:966e0c8c-4333-35c0-608d-3c9e11036221
msgctxt "h2b081be3g14e0g4fcag9d65g30b0b36ff3c7"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6066367-99df-2c9c-2956-a4d14ceecc15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Thieflings_HasMet_Mol = True
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_NecromancerLab_HasItem_MolEyepatch(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_FindMol_Event_AskedNecromancerAboutMol = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:a6066367-99df-2c9c-2956-a4d14ceecc15
msgctxt "h1aa3e48fg155bg451eg9203g13f03dce28eb"
msgid "There was a tiefling child here - Mol. What did you do to her?"
msgstr "여기 몰이라는 티플링 아이가 있었다. 그 애에게 무슨 짓을 했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8771dd0-ae10-494d-b121-0af3e3fc110f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:a8771dd0-ae10-494d-b121-0af3e3fc110f
msgctxt "h830e78b2g2d38g49a8g9760gdc323f721d0a"
msgid "I come to serve."
msgstr "당신에게 복종하기 위해 왔습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = a962e454-a141-164c-e385-a0b0995deba9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_NecromancerLab_State_PretendedToBeThralls = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:a962e454-a141-164c-e385-a0b0995deba9
msgctxt "h553963bfgf485g4beeg9e7ag2d66cf405ce9"
msgid ""
"Ah, my mistake. I should have known by your gormless demeanour. You've had "
"your mind decluttered and have been put to work."
msgstr "아, 내가 실수했군. 네 놈의 바보 같은 행실을 보고 알았어야 했는데. 정신에서 필요 없는 부분을 깨끗이 청소하고 왔겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = c9d0a572-a0f8-24b7-59e4-f05299f8fd5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_NecromancerLab_State_PretendedToBeThralls = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:c9d0a572-a0f8-24b7-59e4-f05299f8fd5e
msgctxt "h43a7440dgd799g467dga92fg80bf6efb6bb7"
msgid "Just keep out of the way, thrall. I'm in the midst of a sensitive task."
msgstr "노예, 걸리적 거리지 마라. 이 몸은 섬세한 작업을 하는 중이란 말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca2aec84-e29b-a0f3-6aba-82845391c3be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:ca2aec84-e29b-a0f3-6aba-82845391c3be
msgctxt "hcbadb35fgac2bg4723g9fc9g8b032d993ab3"
msgid "Hold on - this is just a misunderstanding."
msgstr "잠깐만. 오해야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = d97d3d5b-b397-9724-cd21-02174a96e645
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:d97d3d5b-b397-9724-cd21-02174a96e645
msgctxt "h6f7751fbgaecag4459gaf27gc8bfad65d0ba"
msgid ""
"An admirable charade, but you overplayed your hand. No matter - you won't "
"need any hands soon enough."
msgstr "훌륭한 연기였지만, 손짓이 너무 과장됐군. 상관없다. 곧 손이 필요 없게 될 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = e416de8f-1eea-bfcc-899b-cdeaa54dcb28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:e416de8f-1eea-bfcc-899b-cdeaa54dcb28
msgctxt "ha7da16b9g1d1fg4681gb23fg1df42fa14044"
msgid "Well I didn't seek your service, did I?"
msgstr "글쎄 너에게 복종을 요구한 적은 없는데, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = eaaed2d2-718a-be6e-db2f-0c4901880ad9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:eaaed2d2-718a-be6e-db2f-0c4901880ad9
msgctxt "h43122e55g0f1ag48dcgb416gbfd8f66868b6"
msgid ""
"I admire the attempt, but your acting leaves something to be desired. I'll "
"try to make something more useful from whatever parts of you survive "
"undamaged."
msgstr "시도는 좋았지만, 연기 실력은 좀 아쉽군. 네 놈의 신체 부위 중 멀쩡한 부분을 골라 더 쓸모 있게 만들어주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = f1bc669f-4fc3-3bb1-c78e-94de6f2389e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_NecromancerLab_State_PretendedToBeThralls = False
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:f1bc669f-4fc3-3bb1-c78e-94de6f2389e1
msgctxt "he19ba978ga9d4g447fgafa1gf18744e95195"
msgid "Thralls don't make demands. But you're no thrall, are you?"
msgstr "노예는 뭔가를 요구할 수 없어. 너는 노예가 아니구나, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = f3eea985-0591-9536-673e-e2151291e704
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_NecromancerLab_State_PretendedToBeThralls = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_NecromancerLab_State_PretendedToBeThralls = False
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:f3eea985-0591-9536-673e-e2151291e704
msgctxt "hda3cbfe2g0ee9g4d28g905bg51b1c20c6963"
msgid ""
"I can't be expected to remember every little morsel. But I digress, "
"<i>trespasser</i>."
msgstr "내가 잔챙이들을 모두 기억하진 못해. 어쨌든, 본론으로 들어가지, <i>불청객</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa6b5dd4-99c5-cfea-ebfd-5eeef0e60825
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_EnterRoom:fa6b5dd4-99c5-cfea-ebfd-5eeef0e60825
msgctxt "h83d2043cgf87dg48fag8d21g1cd83b3bce47"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_PAD_MolEyepatch
