msgctxt "h6cf0fb62g89e6g495ega380g2a36393c89c5"
msgid "Mol's eyepatch. We should find her before she can come to harm."
msgstr "몰의 안대야. 몰이 피해를 입기 전에 찾아내야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_PAD_MolEyepatch
