#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h44f06f04gf338g4bdagb5d9g3d3aa4649551"
msgid "That's Mol's eyepatch... in <i>this</i> place? Silvanus protect her."
msgstr "몰의 안대가... <i>이런 곳</i>에? 실바누스시여, 몰을 지켜주소서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_PAD_MolEyepatch
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85a59177-1632-4b8d-8b0d-b49c2e0cf3da
