msgctxt "hf2109d06gd914g47b8gaf74g3c565aead9f3"
msgid "An eyepatch."
msgstr "안대군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_PAD_MolEyepatch
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac9e8214-30d4-d3d2-c814-435034cdda7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_PAD_MolEyepatch:ac9e8214-30d4-d3d2-c814-435034cdda7b
msgctxt "h2f3ccccag0979g4933ga271gb14bb14a541b"
msgid "Someone lost their eyepatch. Hopefully that's all they lost."
msgstr "누가 안대를 잃어버렸어. 안대만 잃어버린 거였으면 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_PAD_MolEyepatch
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac9e8214-30d4-d3d2-c814-435034cdda7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Necromancer_PAD_MolEyepatch:ac9e8214-30d4-d3d2-c814-435034cdda7b
msgctxt "h1bea79cag552bg4d30gb0ccg76baa1b44782"
msgid "An eyepatch. Wonder who it belongs to - or <i>belonged</i> to."
msgstr "안대야. 누구 것일까, 아니면 누구의 것<i>이었을까</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 18a432c4-0255-4393-5a98-c13f8db68744
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Event_BombDisarmed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric:18a432c4-0255-4393-5a98-c13f8db68744
msgctxt "h7f1301e2gfc1bg4259g8aa4g761e44917c05"
msgid "An elder brain... <i>That</i> was the Heart of the Absolute?"
msgstr "엘더 브레인... <i>그게</i> 절대자의 실체였다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a9130e4-8a2b-f2f0-c029-6b188e63e87d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_JAHEIRA(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric:2a9130e4-8a2b-f2f0-c029-6b188e63e87d
msgctxt "h984aafe5gfd64g437cg9f24g3081178f3169"
msgid ""
"Come. There is much to discuss - but we need not do it in this rotting place."
msgstr "어서. 논의할 게 많아. 일단은 이 타락한 장소에서 벗어나자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 31abe5ab-9803-f5d7-71bb-01d84272545e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALSIN(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric:31abe5ab-9803-f5d7-71bb-01d84272545e
msgctxt "h6af17581g7a1bg4852g907agcdfb3a5dcf6f"
msgid ""
"At last, it is done. Ketheric Thorm will rise no more. All those who did not "
"live to see this day can finally rest."
msgstr "드디어 끝이다. 케서릭 쏨은 다시는 부활하지 못하겠지. 오늘의 승리를 살아서 보지 못한 모든 영혼이 편히 잠들기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4144594c-4037-4b25-937c-5924bd1d690e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric:4144594c-4037-4b25-937c-5924bd1d690e
msgctxt "h4429c68fg5a83g4105g80a4g9df62a6b229d"
msgid ""
"Myrkul's Chosen is naught but a corpse. Let us see the other two suffer the "
"same fate."
msgstr "머큘의 선택받은 자는 시체나 다름없다. 남은 둘에게도 같은 운명을 안겨 주자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4144594c-4037-4b25-937c-5924bd1d690e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric:4144594c-4037-4b25-937c-5924bd1d690e
msgctxt "hd35e6806gdfcag47bdg9e0ag38d6add538e9"
msgid ""
"Ketheric's defeated, but my father is taken. On to The Gate - we must tear "
"him out of the Absolute's grasp."
msgstr "케서릭은 패배했으나 나의 부친께서 끌려가셨다. 게이트로 가자. 절대자의 손아귀에서 아버지를 빼내야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4144594c-4037-4b25-937c-5924bd1d690e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric:4144594c-4037-4b25-937c-5924bd1d690e
msgctxt "hcca19923gd357g4118ga79ag20367a806623"
msgid ""
"Killing an undying man is no easy task, but the Absolute is not vanquished. "
"Our work has only just begun."
msgstr "불사신을 죽이는 건 쉬운 일이 아니지, 그러나 절대자는 여전히 건재해. 우리의 임무는 이제 막 시작되었을 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4144594c-4037-4b25-937c-5924bd1d690e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and !SHADOWHEART_SHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric:4144594c-4037-4b25-937c-5924bd1d690e
msgctxt "h1aeb210eg514fg4a1dg82ebg5411171f190e"
msgid "Ketheric Thorm is no more. And may he stay dead, this time."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨은 더는 존재하지 않아. 바라건대 죽은 채로 남아 있기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4144594c-4037-4b25-937c-5924bd1d690e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and SHADOWHEART_SHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric:4144594c-4037-4b25-937c-5924bd1d690e
msgctxt "hd790edf6ga00bg42ceg833dgbfd35e5e3410"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm is dead - <i>really </i>dead, this time. Lady Shar's justice "
"has been delivered."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨이 죽었어 - 이번에는 <i>진짜로 </i> 죽었다고. 샤 여신의 정의가 실현되었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c663871-1bf3-9e92-2c21-7422214f5dc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric:5c663871-1bf3-9e92-2c21-7422214f5dc7
msgctxt "hcbffffa3gddd8g4f84g857ag942bce8552e3"
msgid "He's dead. He's finished. But Gortash... Gortash was <i>here.</i>"
msgstr "쏨이 죽었어. 마침내 끝장났다고. 하지만 고타쉬가... 고타쉬가 <i>여기</i> 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 634cf8a1-5b8d-8328-c0f9-b6d2d9fcf887
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric:634cf8a1-5b8d-8328-c0f9-b6d2d9fcf887
msgctxt "h2747ececgced3g49bdg8245gf330f27d08d2"
msgid "There was barely anything of the man left, even before we finished him."
msgstr "쏨의 잔해는 거의 남아 있지도 않았어. 우리가 끝장내기도 전에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c424b84-88f5-0ced-be40-52c882288147
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric:6c424b84-88f5-0ced-be40-52c882288147
msgctxt "h3185588ag141ag4c2dga91bg0968b12c7bb5"
msgid ""
"The transformation Ketheric underwent was... horrifying. So powerful, but so "
"grotesque."
msgstr "케서릭이 겪은 변형은... 끔찍했어. 정말 강력했지만, 동시에 기괴했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca544817-3b1a-e3c1-ea0b-5ffadcf949b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALSIN(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric:ca544817-3b1a-e3c1-ea0b-5ffadcf949b3
msgctxt "h8cccb876g4f86g4938g8b6eg98aa227ca1c4"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm's demise was the deathblow against the Shadow Curse also. We "
"have done all that was asked about us. Thaniel will soon take care of the "
"rest."
msgstr ""
"케서릭 쏨의 최후는 그림자 저주에도 치명상을 남겼네. 우리는 맡은 임무를 훌륭히 완수했어. 남은 일들은 테니엘의 손에 맡겨 보세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6fe0793-99b2-7aff-5bef-59568d1979e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_Event_BombDisarmed = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_PartySuppression_PAD_DefeatedKetheric:e6fe0793-99b2-7aff-5bef-59568d1979e3
msgctxt "h912f2dd6g15fcg4c46ga0a2gba2606b24007"
msgid "Controlling an elder brain... Such power."
msgstr "엘더 브레인을 조종하다니... 어마어마한 힘이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_AD_Butcher_SourcePain
#. Speaker = Chop
#. NodeID = 83d82704-1f8e-6b32-4ce9-25048821e74e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_AD_Butcher_SourcePain:83d82704-1f8e-6b32-4ce9-25048821e74e
msgctxt "hf5b1ea94g0506g46edg84a3gbf72c6f6d9fc"
msgid "W...w...why..."
msgstr "어...어...어째서..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = False
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
msgctxt "h635bcc52g56f5g427fga440gded55e4671a8"
msgid ""
"Looks like it pulls power from whoever's in the cradle. Now we just need a "
"victim - eh - <i>volunteer</i>."
msgstr "받침대 안에 있는 사람으로부터 동력을 끌어오는 것 같네. 이제 희생자 - 크흠 - <i>지원자</i>만 있으면 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = False
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
msgctxt "h1fe22377g3359g418cg8dd9g78c2a7004c90"
msgid ""
"Seems like it draws power from whoever's in the cradle... which is currently "
"nobody."
msgstr "받침대 안에 있는 사람으로부터 동력을 끌어오는 것 같은데... 지금은 아무도 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = False
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
msgctxt "ha74489d2gdebdg4987gb0a5g57e11f1ed696"
msgid ""
"It draws power from anyone on that cradle... someone needs to assume the "
"position or it's useless."
msgstr "받침대에 누워 있는 사람으로부터 동력을 끌어오는 것 같은데... 누군가 자리를 잡지 않으면 작동하지 않을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = False
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
msgctxt "h66db8945g3d64g4209g9433g9797c3fb41d1"
msgid ""
"I think it's siphoning life from whoever's unfortunate enough to be attached "
"to this thing."
msgstr "이 물건에 애착을 느낄 만큼 불쌍한 사람으로부터 생명을 빨아들이는 것 같은데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = False
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
msgctxt "h4d11e6d1g06bag480agb822gd7f5b4825dd0"
msgid ""
"The device siphons power from whomever lies in that cradle. I can think of a "
"few worthy candidates..."
msgstr "이 장치는 받침대에 누운 사람으로부터 동력을 빨아들인다. 적당한 후보자를 추려낼 수 있을 것 같군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = False
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
msgctxt "h9d2e6238g4e13g4c99gb2e0g82b0ede4ab97"
msgid ""
"Looks like it siphons power from whoever lies in that cradle. Just needs a "
"volunteer."
msgstr "장치에 누워 있는 사람으로부 동력을 빨아들이는 것 같아. 지원자만 있으면 되겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = False
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
msgctxt "hecf340bcgccd6g4e17g8e5cgb654ffe4bc16"
msgid ""
"Any unlucky soul in that cradle would be feeling a tickle right about now."
msgstr "장치 안에 누워 있는 불운한 영혼이 있다면 누구라도 지금쯤 간지러움을 느낄 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = False
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
msgctxt "hc72666cbgf768g4b0cg81f4g05ae536ba3c5"
msgid "It sucks energy from the occupant of that cradle. Seems - unpleasant."
msgstr "장치 안의 사람으로부터 동력을 빨아들이는 것 같군. 심히 - 불쾌한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = False
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:66858a58-68bd-471d-87e1-d322f29f4aa1
msgctxt "h38a6ab45g50a8g49e4g8754gc0a9514fae2b"
msgid ""
"Looks like it siphons power from anyone lying in that cradle. Wonderful."
msgstr "장치 안에 누워 있는 사람으로부터 동력을 빨아들이는 것 같군. 경이로워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
msgctxt "h3de0e6aegb415g42e8gad4eg9914b0119452"
msgid "It pulls life from one and gives it to another. How relatable."
msgstr "한 사람의 생명을 뽑아내서 다른 이에게 나누어 준다라... 남 일 같지 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
msgctxt "hef3e059cgcf2bg461egbfafgf184f0fc1183"
msgid ""
"It draws power from a host. About what you expect from illithid technology."
msgstr "숙주로부터 동력을 끌어오는 거야. 과연 일리시드 기술답네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
