#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
msgctxt "h912836a7g63fcg4d1eg9cddg3bf18be4c4f4"
msgid "Looks like it drains power from a host. Nasty."
msgstr "숙주로부터 동력을 빨아들이는 것 같아. 끔찍해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
msgctxt "h31bbb268gbd1fg4eb3ga854g044013b86990"
msgid "It requires a living host for its power. And a rat will hardly do."
msgstr "작동하려면 살아 있는 숙주가 필요하다. 쓸만한 쥐는 찾아보기 힘들 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
msgctxt "hd0266f59gddd3g4244ga6adg31241dc7ecc9"
msgid ""
"It draws power from a living host. Nothing in life is free, I suppose..."
msgstr "살아 있는 숙주로부터 동력을 빨아들이는 거야. 세상에는 공짜가 없다, 이건가..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
msgctxt "hfd482149gec07g44c7g8c65gbf275747e12b"
msgid "It needs power. <i>Living</i> power. Figures."
msgstr "동력이 필요해. <i>살아 움직이는</i> 동력 말이야. 틀림없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
msgctxt "he22cdd9cg1093g4429gb2e0g4806987690d2"
msgid "It feeds on a host. How very illithid."
msgstr "숙주를 포식하는군. 얼마나 일리시드스러운지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_RegenStations_State_UsedOnce = True
#.      - COL_RegenStation_State_CheckSuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD:df542562-f6f2-cf5f-8893-6ac4153eadf0
msgctxt "h6e36fdddg38f6g439fg8692g95e82941e9d3"
msgid "It needs to draw power from a host. How very illithid."
msgstr "숙주로부터 동력을 뽑아낸다라. 얼마나 일리시드스러운지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_RegenStation_PAD
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f941e883-b0c6-2be6-cf2f-f4d710cb521c
