msgctxt "h2627a680geca2g4ad0g9d7fg004a0c7f32b1"
msgid ""
"*The device releases a stream of fragmented memories and emotions - all that "
"remains of the pod inhabitant's former self.*"
msgstr "*장치가 기억과 감정의 파편들을 쏟아냅니다. 포드에 있는 존재의 예전 자아가 남긴 전부입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_005_Mindflayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d6548889-47e3-5159-b0dc-23e272ff3ac0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_TadpolingCentre_MemoryImprint_FirstUse = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_005_Mindflayer:d6548889-47e3-5159-b0dc-23e272ff3ac0
msgctxt "h381f7c08g07bdg4096ga535g2a75f315165c"
msgid ""
"*Courage... conviction... defiance. Even as her organs began to dissolve, "
"she believed she could resist.*"
msgstr "*용기... 신념... 저항. 이 여자는 자신의 내장이 녹아내리기 시작했을 때에도, 이겨낼 수 있을 거라 믿었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_006_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7a13c7f3-5171-b15e-401b-3d40b9ee6148
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_006_Zevlor:7a13c7f3-5171-b15e-401b-3d40b9ee6148
msgctxt "h7075850cg0abag4678ga4a7g25e68d3288ed"
msgid ""
"*In its horror, the Blood War unites you. Tiefling, dwarf and elf alike "
"huddle behind the shields of your paladin order, waiting for salvation. But "
"when it comes... disunity.*"
msgstr ""
"*그런 공포 속에서, 피의 전쟁은 당신들을 하나로 묶습니다. 티플링, 드워프, 엘프가 모두 당신의 팔라딘 기사단의 방패 뒤에서 하나가 "
"되어 구원을 기다립니다. 그러나 그 구원이 찾아오자... 분열됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_006_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 91db7b25-6bc9-4199-04e9-9725caf413b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_006_Zevlor:91db7b25-6bc9-4199-04e9-9725caf413b8
msgctxt "h6ad23e9eg9d1fg4797g9adbgd2ca81603e8d"
msgid ""
"*The returned city casts your people out, the devils who dragged them down "
"to hell. In the end, it is not your paladin oath that is broken: it is your "
"faith itself.*"
msgstr ""
"*돌아온 도시는 당신의 사람들을, 도시를 지옥으로 끌고 간 데빌들이라며 쫓아냅니다. 결국 부서진 것은 당신의 맹세가 아니었습니다. 당신의 "
"믿음 그 자체였습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_006_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a159ea0c-732a-4917-8812-013f48424bb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_006_Zevlor:a159ea0c-732a-4917-8812-013f48424bb4
msgctxt "h8ac1651ag445ag429ag9c10g2904951ef8e0"
msgid ""
"*You remember the shattered windows of Elturel's High Cathedral, the burning "
"black sky of Avernus beyond.*"
msgstr "*당신은 엘투렐 대성당의 부서진 창문과, 그 너머로 타오르던 아베르누스의 검은 하늘을 기억합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_006_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f66b3ed5-a7fe-4276-a24f-f3d0bbee9076
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - COL_TadpolingCentre_State_PodEmpty(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_006_Zevlor:f66b3ed5-a7fe-4276-a24f-f3d0bbee9076
msgctxt "h13ec477bg3e7ag4094gbafbg46cee4ac8cc9"
msgid "*The pod lies empty, echoing - no mind to draw on within.*"
msgstr "*포드는 비어있고, 공허한 메아리만 울려 퍼집니다. 그리고 끌어낼 정신이 남아있지 않습니다. *"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_007_Mindflayer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6a11b641-0d4a-047f-e2fb-242640652fda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_TadpolingCentre_MemoryImprint_FirstUse = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_007_Mindflayer:6a11b641-0d4a-047f-e2fb-242640652fda
msgctxt "h47418b55gb9fag48c6gbf03g2797ea8e9714"
msgid ""
"*Delirium... mania... laughter. His mind broke before the end, and he was "
"laughing uncontrollably as the skin fell from his face.*"
msgstr ""
"*망상... 광기... 웃음. 이 남자의 정신은 결국 무너져 내렸고, 살가죽이 얼굴에서 벗겨질 때에는 주체할 수 없을 정도로 웃고 "
"있었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_007_Mindflayer
