msgid "*The device does not react to your presence.*"
msgstr "*장치는 당신의 존재에 전혀 반응하지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_010_Empty_Ravengard
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3008db87-6999-7a25-111b-197f17c6a07d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_010_Empty_Ravengard:3008db87-6999-7a25-111b-197f17c6a07d
msgctxt "h104098a9g6c9cg495bgadffg40377d6f4a6c"
msgid "*Ravengard was here, in this pod, not long ago.*"
msgstr "*얼마 전까지만 해도, 레이븐가드가 이 포드 안에 있었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_010_Empty_Ravengard
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 31bba1c3-294f-35e5-6626-fe4ad947d9dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_010_Empty_Ravengard:31bba1c3-294f-35e5-6626-fe4ad947d9dc
msgctxt "h982ffff8g419cg4d0fga346ga04cf053e3c0"
msgid ""
"*And then, clearer than any other image, the face of a child. <i>Your</i> "
"face, smiling proudly as you follow your father, Duke Ravengard, through the "
"corridors of the great fortress at Wyrm's Rock.*"
msgstr ""
"*그리고 나서, 다른 어떤 장면보다도 선명하게 아이의 얼굴이 보입니다. <i>당신의</i> 얼굴입니다. 당신의 아버지, 레이븐가드 공작과 "
"함께 고룡 바위의 거대한 요새 복도를 따라 걸으며 자랑스럽게 미소짓는 얼굴입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_010_Empty_Ravengard
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 646f0ed6-bb1a-c991-fdce-abbc29c5f731
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_010_Empty_Ravengard:646f0ed6-bb1a-c991-fdce-abbc29c5f731
msgctxt "h13825dbdg6a75g4665ga39bg8112f9b6c4f7"
msgid ""
"*You feel the courage of a soldier who became a commander, and the "
"intelligence of a commander who became a Duke.*"
msgstr "*당신은 지휘관이 된 병사의 용기와, 대공이 된 지휘관의 지혜를 느낍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_010_Empty_Ravengard
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dd1f4a05-2794-c0ce-bc69-2d3cf2f297a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_010_Empty_Ravengard:dd1f4a05-2794-c0ce-bc69-2d3cf2f297a0
msgctxt "h9fc26fa2g11e5g40feg8656gbed710d287d9"
msgid ""
"*You see the streets of Baldur's Gate... the emblem of the Flaming Fist... "
"martial drills and courtly dances.*"
msgstr "*당신은 발더스 게이트의 거리를 바라봅니다... 플레이밍 피스트의 문장... 무술 훈련과 궁중 무용의 모습이 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_010_Empty_Ravengard
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e2e5e540-1aff-b253-f4f1-4a56b312ee1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_010_Empty_Ravengard:e2e5e540-1aff-b253-f4f1-4a56b312ee1f
msgctxt "h2ab503bcg0268g4ce4ga634g383c1195ff79"
msgid ""
"*The image soon fades, but a shadow of his presence remains. He was here, in "
"this pod, not long ago.*"
msgstr ""
"*곧이어 장면은 희미해지지만, 그 존재가 남긴 그림자는 남아있습니다. 아버지가 여기에, 이 포드 안에 있었습니다. 나간 지는 오래되지 "
"않았습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_010_Empty_Ravengard
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ecef3fea-d8f6-0fa8-b714-b726aa081d31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_MemoryImprint_010_Empty_Ravengard:ecef3fea-d8f6-0fa8-b714-b726aa081d31
msgctxt "h5bdad0c8g386fg4170gbb8bg5cc8ad22b564"
msgid ""
"*Though the pod is empty, traces of psychic energy still linger around it, "
"and memories of its former inhabitant spill into your mind.*"
msgstr ""
"*포드는 비었지만, 정신 에너지의 흔적이 여전히 그 주위를 맴돌고 있으며, 그 안에 있던 자의 기억이 당신의 머릿속으로 흘러 들어옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_Mindflayers_EnterCombat
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act2_TadpolingCentre_Mindflayers
#. NodeID = 6af5da79-26db-06d2-b780-e400a33afa30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_Mindflayers_EnterCombat:6af5da79-26db-06d2-b780-e400a33afa30
msgctxt "heaa5ba91g844cg4a94g86bega0875479d9db"
msgid "<i>Eliminate.</i>"
msgstr "<i>제거하라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_Minthara_EnteredTadpolingCenter
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 33bcfecf-38c1-0923-139f-5b4fa52594fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_Minthara_EnteredTadpolingCenter:33bcfecf-38c1-0923-139f-5b4fa52594fa
msgctxt "h371a59cegaf9cg44e5gaf0cgbd85b56330e0"
msgid "This place has been used to make slaves of those who should be masters."
msgstr "이곳은 지도가가 되었어야 할 사람들을 노예로 만들어온 곳이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_AD_Zevlor_Combat
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 5e2f541c-18fd-7361-2260-840dbf2576cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
