msgctxt "hef746e34gea85g4f2fg9052gfd04a6b8a40d"
msgid "Humour me, Astarion, can you give this blood a smell?"
msgstr "부탁 좀 들어 줘, 아스타리온, 이 피 냄새를 좀 맡아 볼 수 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09558e09-bd97-d3fd-9637-f4a1a366ee3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:09558e09-bd97-d3fd-9637-f4a1a366ee3b
msgctxt "h32024634g1e74g4c19g88a7g41f66c55be91"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0ac70821-4198-eae9-1fe8-77d494015d45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:0ac70821-4198-eae9-1fe8-77d494015d45
msgctxt "h6e258c42g6cafg407ag8d6fg9616b78982c6"
msgid ""
"*You were in the pod a long, long while, but it seems you have no "
"recollection of ever entering the nautiloid.*"
msgstr "*당신은 포드 안에 무척 오래 있었습니다. 하지만 노틸로이드에 승선한 기억은 전혀 갖고 있지 않은 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0f78fd9b-fc46-7dfc-86af-a691f2b894fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:0f78fd9b-fc46-7dfc-86af-a691f2b894fb
msgctxt "hb76848b0g9656g41efg8c6bgf424a4713930"
msgid ""
"*Banging your fists on a chamber until half your fingers were broken. How "
"long inside? Days? Months? Lifetimes?*"
msgstr "*손가락 절반이 부러질 때까지 주먹으로 벽을 두드립니다. 얼마나 오래 있었던 거지? 며칠? 몇 달? 평생이었나?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2037294f-bab3-32d2-e351-af255f923a61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_TadpolingCentre_Knows_ImpliedDarkUrgePod = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:2037294f-bab3-32d2-e351-af255f923a61
msgctxt "h8831edc3g11d4g4d04g8d72g3c26a78583e9"
msgid ""
"*This was the pod of someone who was among the very first to be tadpoled - "
"the blood inside is already stale.*"
msgstr "*최초로 올챙이를 이식 받은 이들 중 한 사람의 포드입니다 - 내부의 혈흔은 이미 부패했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20de5f40-e742-5578-3f77-c757cdad01b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:20de5f40-e742-5578-3f77-c757cdad01b9
msgctxt "he675b5b0g562cg4972gb170gdefc5951d7e0"
msgid "<i>Try to discern how long this pod has been empty.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이 포드가 얼마나 오랫동안 비어 있었나 판별해 본다</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 36e0bbaf-f789-e437-8579-67664471e73f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:36e0bbaf-f789-e437-8579-67664471e73f
msgctxt "hf615e2b4g4c50g4283g8b70g80c75189c865"
msgid ""
"*Perhaps even this very pod was your prison... where were you first "
"captured? It's impossible to remember...*"
msgstr "*바로 이 포드가 당신의 감옥이었을지도 모릅니다... 처음 잡혔던 곳이 어디였던가? 이젠 기억조차 나지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 56e2c090-8206-e36e-9407-f27a5aa39bf0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:56e2c090-8206-e36e-9407-f27a5aa39bf0
msgctxt "h02f3a65ag2decg46aeg9ae6gafa086e3ed87"
msgid ""
"*Your brain hurls an image towards you. Your own head-blood gushing down in "
"front of your eyes.*"
msgstr "*당신의 뇌가 토해내는 어떤 장면이 눈앞에 떠오릅니다. 피가 눈을 가릴 만큼 뿜어져 나오고 있는 당신의 머리입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5df0ce19-6fcd-6a04-9d7e-eaa7152a4422
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_TadpolingCentre_Knows_ImpliedDarkUrgePod = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:5df0ce19-6fcd-6a04-9d7e-eaa7152a4422
msgctxt "h65abfc7ag83d4g4d92g9975g7a1f21e39c7d"
msgid ""
"*This pod's inhabitant must have taken a lot of damage while they were "
"inside.*"
msgstr "*이 포드의 주인은 내부에 있는 동안 많은 피해를 입은 게 분명합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 74c61c8f-e92e-a916-9262-5be4f4c9b19a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:74c61c8f-e92e-a916-9262-5be4f4c9b19a
msgctxt "hc57496b7g1dddg4675gaa97gb586a23b6e5c"
msgid "*This mind-flayer pod is not only empty, it looks abandoned.*"
msgstr "*이 마인드 플레이어 포드는 비어 있고, 버려진 듯 보이기도 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7c05b9c4-c248-9791-d8da-02aeb35b28b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - COL_TadpolingCentre_State_FailedSkillCheck(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:7c05b9c4-c248-9791-d8da-02aeb35b28b3
msgctxt "h7f9b0cc5g4b30g443eg871fg638f01bd2537"
msgid ""
"*This was the pod of someone who was among the very first to be tadpoled - "
"the blood inside is already stale.*"
msgstr "*최초로 올챙이를 이식 받은 이들 중 한 사람의 포드입니다 - 내부의 혈흔은 이미 부패했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 815d2c87-0ed4-5c01-a3c4-712540c4786f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:815d2c87-0ed4-5c01-a3c4-712540c4786f
msgctxt "h4c0f68c1g442cg4a8cg8b1bg68b29c272146"
msgid "*Its inhabitant is long gone... and not peacefully.*"
msgstr "*포드의 거주자는 사라진 지 오래이며, 그 과정도 평화롭지 않았던 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 82edc8b0-9ffa-51d1-8632-9ae7bf08c7e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:82edc8b0-9ffa-51d1-8632-9ae7bf08c7e0
msgctxt "hb60b5442ga9bfg43bdga541g717ad03cf59f"
msgid "*These pods are made to preserve. Time means nothing.*"
msgstr "*이 포드는 오래가도록 제작되었습니다. 시간 앞에서 거의 무적이죠.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 87b5f4f1-14c8-9d28-b613-3a6c4fa961ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:87b5f4f1-14c8-9d28-b613-3a6c4fa961ce
msgctxt "h0bc65c1fg31dag4d3egbf73g485826af5904"
msgid ""
"*This pod has a different air to its chitinous cavern. Dust and dirt gather "
"on the inside.*"
msgstr "*이 포드는 키틴질 동굴과는 다른 느낌이 납니다. 내부에 먼지와 흙이 가득합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8caf4d73-920d-ee72-3c29-d787a0173650
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_TadpolingCentre_Knows_IdentifiedDarkUrgePod = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:8caf4d73-920d-ee72-3c29-d787a0173650
msgctxt "h5c58a68age358g4ad8g914ag4b92e04eaa64"
msgid ""
"*This was the pod of someone whose tadpoling happened bloodily: they damaged "
"themselves fighting back.*"
msgstr "*이 포드의 주인은 올챙이를 이식 받으며 많은 피를 흘렸습니다: 저항하다 크게 다친 모양입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a689f426-cd1b-c40d-777f-6d6e27fab6bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:a689f426-cd1b-c40d-777f-6d6e27fab6bd
msgctxt "h0ede9484g38a8g4667gbb2dg773421f3d791"
msgid ""
"*The parasite was inserted into your head, and your body crammed into a pod "
"long before you were moved to the nautiloid.*"
msgstr "*기생충이 당신 머리에 삽입되었고, 노틸로이드로 옮겨지기 전에 당신의 몸은 포드에 처박혔습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = aa9d3cad-6e45-c20e-81bb-3efb159bfb81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Astarion_TheHungerC_Bite = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:aa9d3cad-6e45-c20e-81bb-3efb159bfb81
msgctxt "h02f21832gbd83g431fg8c68g96e26ebdcaff"
msgid ""
"Oh yes, that's yours all right. Even stale, I'd recognise that bouquet "
"anywhere."
msgstr "맞아, 이건 네 피야. 아무리 부패했어도 이 향기는 알아차릴 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce04a432-132f-ed6b-963a-b7ad9788a1f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType:
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:ce04a432-132f-ed6b-963a-b7ad9788a1f7
msgctxt "h1c824619g0cceg45bfg8313g3bad139a2e32"
msgid "<i>Push deeper into the memory.</i>"
msgstr "<i>기억 속으로 더 깊게 파고든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e88e3710-4fd0-c95b-ccf2-f876b8eb3bf4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_TadpolingCentre_Knows_IdentifiedDarkUrgePod = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:e88e3710-4fd0-c95b-ccf2-f876b8eb3bf4
msgctxt "hec17f73agfb20g4269ga461gdf1781ee4fd2"
msgid ""
"*It's broken beyond repair. Seemingly by a blunt impact, as if whoever was "
"inside threw themselves against it in an effort to break out.*"
msgstr ""
"*고칠 수 없을 만큼 망가졌습니다. 강한 충격에 의해 부서진 듯한데, 안에 있던 누군가 달아나기 위해 몸을 힘껏 부딪힌 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e9968a06-2ef5-0593-0c6c-4c2e31805720
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:e9968a06-2ef5-0593-0c6c-4c2e31805720
msgctxt "hfaba9924g1fd4g4eafg8d75gddc47c2c5815"
msgid ""
"Excuse me? I'm not some bloodhound tracking your scent. I'm of a much higher "
"pedigree."
msgstr "뭐라고? 난 네 냄새를 쫓는 사냥개 따위가 아냐. 훨씬 혈통 좋은 품종이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f96713ed-c70c-b073-c79d-83a8e9c39a07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:f96713ed-c70c-b073-c79d-83a8e9c39a07
msgctxt "h65dd2f0cgc01eg4b56g9cbdgcaf6f5c508c9"
msgid "*A laughing woman, taunting you... She betrayed you... Who was she?*"
msgstr "*웃고 있는 여인이 당신을 조롱합니다... 당신을 배신했던 그 여인은... 대체 누구일까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fa7beaa1-8d75-4580-9581-4cbeab5ee5a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_TadpolingCentre_Knows_IdentifiedDarkUrgePod = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:fa7beaa1-8d75-4580-9581-4cbeab5ee5a5
msgctxt "h27b3b80cg5087g42a8gab4cgcbfcbfbfe187"
msgid ""
"*This pod has a different air to its chitinous cavern. Dust and dirt are "
"gathered on the inside.*"
msgstr "*이 포드는 키틴질의 동굴과는 다른 느낌입니다. 먼지와 흙이 내부에 가득합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fd363fcd-6540-2bb9-1f0b-48ebfe573b8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_DarkUrgePod:fd363fcd-6540-2bb9-1f0b-48ebfe573b8f
msgctxt "h50fc6a11g4587g4fb6g9bbbg45227dca565d"
msgid "*The blood inside has not started to rot. There is a fresh hint to it.*"
msgstr "*내부의 피는 아직 썩기 시작하지 않았습니다. 신선한 징후가 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved:cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
msgctxt "h3e9e3f63gc50cg4670gb64eg38d213f119c2"
msgid "This better be worth it - I can't <i>stand</i> puzzles."
msgstr "고생한 보람이 있어야 할 텐데. 퍼즐은 <i>진절머리</i> 나거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole:2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
msgctxt "hc6ad3735g9532g4634g8b69gb8793b32fda3"
msgid "As tadpoles go, this is <i>quite</i> the specimen."
msgstr "올챙이치고는 꽤 <i>괜찮은</i> 표본이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved:cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
msgctxt "h1ee31a5dgebebg47b8gaf5cg38cb9c160250"
msgid "The way is opened. The reward better be worth the effort."
msgstr "길이 열렸어. 고생한 보람이 있으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole:2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
msgctxt "h83d511d4g917fg49c7g858agc60a21b52163"
msgid "No ordinary tadpole, that. I can hear its call, deep in my head."
msgstr "일반적인 올챙이가 아니야. 머릿속 깊은 곳에서 녀석의 부름이 들려."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved:cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
msgctxt "he26b3431g6802g4bc7ga158gecd4115366f5"
msgid "Nothing too taxing. Now, let's see what was so worth such protection..."
msgstr "그렇게 어렵진 않네. 이제, 뭘 그렇게 보호하려고 했는지 볼까..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole:2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
msgctxt "he5cfade0ge104g4d68g9a4cgd5c9951cd5ee"
msgid "Now here's a strange little tadpole. It's like it's calling to me..."
msgstr "정말 희한한 올챙이네. 마치 날 부르고 있는 것 같아..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved:cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
msgctxt "h333fce56ga1d4g483ag985eg5560a8cf9d80"
msgid "Unlocked. I hope that was worth the effort."
msgstr "열렸어. 고생한 보람이 있어야 할 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole:2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
msgctxt "h4b3c9597g0e6dg46d2gba43g04847ecc444d"
msgid ""
"Strange-looking tadpole. Might warrant a closer look - very carefully..."
msgstr "이상하게 생긴 올챙이네. 아주 조심스럽게 더 가까이서 볼 필요가 있어 보여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved:cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
msgctxt "hbdffa051g388ag44b6g8080g82bf9334e56a"
msgid "Done. Now to reap the rewards."
msgstr "해냈군. 이제 보상을 거둘 차례야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole:2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
msgctxt "hcc8887d9g70deg429dgafceg1ee7275f833a"
msgid ""
"That's an odd parasite. I feel my own tadpole tingling, reaching out to it."
msgstr "특이한 기생충이네. 내 올챙이가 꿈틀거리면서, 녀석에게 접촉하려고 애쓰는 게 느껴져."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved:cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
msgctxt "h7ebfccf4ge527g4d2cg8a7bgf8df71ed17a0"
msgid "That did it."
msgstr "이 정도면 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole:2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
msgctxt "h4fe65d7bg2fa8g4813g9abdge6c3976a82c1"
msgid "Funny looking tad. Wonder what gives."
msgstr "웃기게 생긴 올챙이네. 뭘 줄지 궁금한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved:cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
msgctxt "h306d20f5g6393g4eb1g8c47g55a68d7ccf31"
msgid "At last. Let us see what an illithid would keep under lock and key."
msgstr "드디어 열렸군. 일리시드가 자물쇠 아래에 뭘 숨겨두고 있는지 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole:2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
msgctxt "hbd757fdfgbcd5g4c11gbd8ag85314676b94b"
msgid "Huh. That is no ordinary tadpole."
msgstr "허. 평범한 올챙이는 아니네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved:cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
msgctxt "hf5860d5dga4acg486cga285g5582c23a4f59"
msgid "The way is clear. Time to see what awaits."
msgstr "열렸어. 이제 뭐가 있는지 보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole:2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
msgctxt "h4486e43fga742g4659gaafbg3c05bca79cee"
msgid "A curious-looking tadpole. May be of interest."
msgstr "신기하게 생긴 올챙이야. 흥미로워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_PuzzleSolved:cd75d32f-4001-49c9-a8b3-fde9f6572429
msgctxt "h6a3af8bdg6b7fg4e4cgae99gb2b411b50599"
msgid "That should do it. Time to see what's back there."
msgstr "이거면 되겠지. 뒤에 뭐가 있는지 확인할 차례야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_BrinePool_Tadpole:2112af62-97ad-4e69-a8f5-25b7ee5f9844
msgctxt "h7c28384egc6cag4b77g8376gee6abf899a1e"
msgid "An unusual parasite, here. It's - it's reaching out to me."
msgstr "특이한 기생충이야. 이게...이게 나랑 접촉하려고 애쓰고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment:2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
msgctxt "hb032937dg53a9g40a7g8813gd72b09d0b801"
msgid "Tadpoling a cambion... Better the devil you know, I suppose."
msgstr "감염된 캠비온이라...데빌이 더 낫겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment:2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
msgctxt "h412c4c9fg171dg45d7g9223gd78cb3d10e30"
msgid "Is that... Mizora in that pod?"
msgstr "저 포드 안에... 미조라야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment:2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
msgctxt "h402dae8fg24c7g47b8g9f5aga9adc62432b8"
msgid "A cambion. Do the Hells themselves answer the Absolute's call?"
msgstr "캠비온이군. 이제 지옥도 절대자를 따르는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment:2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
msgctxt "ha55354a2g7acag499bg92bfg9e437ffdb966"
msgid "A cambion? The Absolute has eclectic taste in recruits."
msgstr "캠비온? 절대자의 군사 모집 취향이 다채롭네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment:2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
msgctxt "h5e5af35egdabfg44bfg9010g49e5c2dab10f"
msgid "What in the Hells? That's Mizora in that pod..."
msgstr "세상에... 포드 안에 미조라가 있어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment:2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
msgctxt "hf9173945gad80g4e06g8a9ag054744f05634"
msgid "A cambion. Stay back."
msgstr "캠비온이야. 물러서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment:2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
msgctxt "h863e53dag37f8g45ccga0c9g3e2306020835"
msgid "A <i>cambion</i>. Truly, the Absolute casts its nets wide."
msgstr "<i>캠비온</i>이야. 절대자는 정말 폭넓게 등용하는구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment:2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
msgctxt "h74b98b93g3dbag406dg9b99gfe4b67259a7d"
msgid ""
"A cambion? The Absolute truly does ensnare all sorts under its foul banner."
msgstr "캠피온? 절대자는 그 더러운 깃발 아래 모든 종류의 사람들을 가두려고 하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PAD_MizoraPodComment:2aaac7f5-fe89-409c-811c-f1d78c6ddc08
msgctxt "h54476dbcgffc8g48b7ga96agf7d93bfdaa0e"
msgid "That pod - is that Mizora inside?"
msgstr "저 포드 안에 미조라야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0c53f053-dacc-e6d2-0a7c-eabd5995dff4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_TadpolingCentre_Event_ReleasePods = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods:0c53f053-dacc-e6d2-0a7c-eabd5995dff4
msgctxt "h0d77ec12g40e0g4601g977ag9551bf405129"
msgid "*The device is inert, and unresponsive.*"
msgstr "*장치가 비활성화되어있고 응답이 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1b6d8dd7-89fa-4e4b-bdf6-69154ea1a037
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods:1b6d8dd7-89fa-4e4b-bdf6-69154ea1a037
msgctxt "ha14b6266g1478g4e9eg9fe3ga9a1ad251401"
msgid ""
"*You connect to the device, and gain control of the pods - and the fate of "
"their occupants.*"
msgstr "*당신은 장치에 연결되었습니다. 그리고 포드의 작동 권한과 포드 안에 있는 사람들의 운명을 손에 쥐게 되었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 32810d64-3965-ba72-8d62-eef78fbcd315
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods:32810d64-3965-ba72-8d62-eef78fbcd315
msgctxt "haa4f336fg8200g4afcg907fg8e74dab520de"
msgid "*Screams. Psychic agony. Terror. Then... nothing.*"
msgstr "*비명, 정신적 고통, 공포, 그리고... 아무것도 남지 않았습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5c5bd662-48c3-c3be-fe43-59849b0e58e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_TadpolingCentre_State_NoInnocentOccupants = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods:5c5bd662-48c3-c3be-fe43-59849b0e58e0
msgctxt "h39cb8eb9gb26bg4faeg9bb8g91323ff7c702"
msgid ""
"*But there are others in the pods - those not yet infected, not yet "
"<i>illithid. </i>Terrified, desperate to escape.*"
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 아직 감염되지 않은, 아직 <i>일리시드</i>가 되지 않은 이들도 포드에 갇혀있습니다. 모두 공포에 질려있고, 간절히 "
"탈출하고 싶어 합니다.\""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 60c9e24d-c27b-e028-a5e2-ac6481cdf041
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - COL_TadpolingCentre_Lever_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods:60c9e24d-c27b-e028-a5e2-ac6481cdf041
msgctxt "hecedfe71g3254g4e67gb0a1g0cc2daa097c6"
msgid ""
"*Every mind flayer in the room calls out hungrily from its pod, seeking "
"release. And sustenance.*"
msgstr "*포드 안의 모든 마인드 플레이어들이 굶주린 목소리로 울부짖고, 풀려나기를 애원합니다. 그리고 영양분을 원합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 62758bd6-99fe-6551-c16c-f391c1156cef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods:62758bd6-99fe-6551-c16c-f391c1156cef
msgctxt "hfc629085gf4b8g4399gb6deg9cac78e9f519"
msgid "*The device is open to your tadpole's command - to your authority.*"
msgstr "*장치는 올챙이의 명령, 즉 당신의 명령에 따라 열립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 70e893fc-d24c-4634-b0e7-14fc1cbc04a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods:70e893fc-d24c-4634-b0e7-14fc1cbc04a9
msgctxt "h95270f81ga044g449egb161gc6d419b12f1d"
msgid "<i>Leave the pods be.</i>"
msgstr "<i>포드를 그대로 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 718a07a4-171e-888c-0df1-01590a4fcdeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_TadpolingCentre_Event_ReleasePods = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods:718a07a4-171e-888c-0df1-01590a4fcdeb
msgctxt "he9cd0ff9g3775g4f12gae50gd227800f9f43"
msgid "<i>Release</i>."
msgstr "<i>풀어준다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7f25ef85-528a-677c-14c9-ab212c32fcc4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods:7f25ef85-528a-677c-14c9-ab212c32fcc4
msgctxt "h8494cbdagd98eg44a6g9b1eg7811e42f4bc2"
msgid "*There is no visible means of operating the device.*"
msgstr "*이 장치를 작동시킬 만한 눈에 띄는 수단이 없습니다.\""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b2cc6183-ad9d-5b88-c920-e6eefe40cd57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods:b2cc6183-ad9d-5b88-c920-e6eefe40cd57
msgctxt "h8d3090e7gbfdag467fg9c8cgba884e1a71de"
msgid ""
"<i>Ghaik</i> machinery. Cold as the Sea of Night, alien as time to the "
"Astral Plane. Avert your eyes, close your mind."
msgstr "게이크의 기계군. 밤의 바다처럼 차갑고, 아스트랄 차원처럼 이질적이지. 눈을 돌리고, 마음을 닫아라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b7e00c47-1e44-d398-1941-f5239f41814d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - COL_TadpolingCentre_Lever_HasMet(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods:b7e00c47-1e44-d398-1941-f5239f41814d
msgctxt "h9fc07302g0194g4a55ga1e0g08110d04c94c"
msgid ""
"*Your tadpole forms a telepathic connection with the device, and chorus of "
"static energy fills your mind.*"
msgstr "*당신의 올챙이와 장치가 텔레파시를 통해 연결됩니다. 그리고 에너지의 화음이 당신의 마음을 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d07f83b2-a019-1745-6215-f8a102f6e5fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_TadpolingCentre_Event_PurgePods = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Pods:d07f83b2-a019-1745-6215-f8a102f6e5fb
msgctxt "h487aa225gcfa0g4a86ga6bfg89762966c87d"
msgid "<i>Purge</i>."
msgstr "<i>몰살한다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Manip
#. Speaker = Manip Shuurga
#. NodeID = 27564135-5c92-24e7-fa97-43ea56680590
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - COL_TadpolingCentre_HasMet_Manip(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Manip:27564135-5c92-24e7-fa97-43ea56680590
msgctxt "h2a05de97g618cg4366gb36cg43ab6e128ddf"
msgid ""
"On the other hand, maybe I'll just live for revenge. Yeah, by Gruumsh! That "
"sounds like a plan."
msgstr "한편으론, 그저 복수를 위해 살아갈 까봐. 그래, 그룸쉬님을 따르는 거야! 좋은 생각 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Manip
#. Speaker = Manip Shuurga
#. NodeID = 31475862-c625-428a-b74b-1e16d7c646aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Manip:31475862-c625-428a-b74b-1e16d7c646aa
msgctxt "h49c6f78fg7483g448bg8379ge4d56e7f4242"
msgid ""
"Is there any news about Duke Ravengard? Did he get out alive? No, I can tell "
"by your expression. I'm going to have to fall on my sword, aren't I?"
msgstr ""
"레이븐가드 공작에 대한 소식이 있어? 공작이 살아서 탈출했나? 표정을 보니 아니군. 내 목숨으로 책임을 져야 될 것 같아. 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Manip
#. Speaker = Manip Shuurga
#. NodeID = 4eb16b54-033c-4605-9940-c4334b43efc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - COL_TadpolingCentre_HasMet_Manip(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Manip:4eb16b54-033c-4605-9940-c4334b43efc6
msgctxt "hab528411g4daag41e9gbdeag91aa2fc7ef4a"
msgid ""
"Hurr, what a stench. I'm beginning to think I should have stayed in that "
"pod. In there it only smelled like me."
msgstr "허, 냄새 한번 고약하네. 포드에 남아 있을 걸 그랬어. 적어도 거기선 내 냄새만 났으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva
#. Speaker = Gauntlet Yeva
#. NodeID = 440eb3e6-a2b2-77be-eef9-8b0518500bcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - COL_TadpolingCentre_HasMet_Yeva(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva:440eb3e6-a2b2-77be-eef9-8b0518500bcf
msgctxt "h3a99243cg5bc9g43beg9171g12487672644b"
msgid "We came here to rescue Duke Ravengard, but we didn't stand a chance."
msgstr "우린 레이븐가드 공을 구출하려 왔는데, 가망이 없었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 49168053-9355-beef-7d86-5be5314da93a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva:49168053-9355-beef-7d86-5be5314da93a
msgctxt "h3ceb61c4g0d91g4fc0ga941gba29746d4889"
msgid "Did you see the Duke?"
msgstr "공작을 봤나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva
#. Speaker = Gauntlet Yeva
#. NodeID = 4d7fd553-7dd4-800a-4b78-748ab9c2507e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva:4d7fd553-7dd4-800a-4b78-748ab9c2507e
msgctxt "h170531fdgb851g44dcgbc26gfb3209199373"
msgid ""
"The cultists took Ravengard when they locked us up. He was still human last "
"I saw him. Still trying to put up a fight."
msgstr "추종자들이 우릴 가두고 레이븐가드를 끌고 갔어. 마지막으로 봤을 때 그는 아직 인간이었지. 저항하길 포기하지 않았고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva
#. Speaker = Gauntlet Yeva
#. NodeID = 594c4d52-7c3b-715f-08e7-ff1fd52cfd8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva:594c4d52-7c3b-715f-08e7-ff1fd52cfd8a
msgctxt "h90911cc0g03bfg4d98gb693gb4b9a4995065"
msgid "I don't know how to thank you. I thought I was done for."
msgstr "어떻게 감사를 해야 할지 모르겠네. 이젠 끝장인 줄 알았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva
#. Speaker = Gauntlet Yeva
#. NodeID = 6735ec31-39a9-9e73-4f7d-7f05d110f8e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva:6735ec31-39a9-9e73-4f7d-7f05d110f8e1
msgctxt "ha43cb980g5d43g4689g9065gf111181c3e1b"
msgid "Yes he does. A mercenary are you?"
msgstr "그런 편이지. 넌 용병인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f18d870-377a-a513-308c-ac9d771b5773
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva:7f18d870-377a-a513-308c-ac9d771b5773
msgctxt "hbdf014b5g8552g47e3g9d1ag5f978d2a5f36"
msgid "I'll take it from here."
msgstr "여기부턴 내가 맡지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva
#. Speaker = Gauntlet Yeva
#. NodeID = 94dff1f8-a0a9-8760-25c9-be23a203edc4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva:94dff1f8-a0a9-8760-25c9-be23a203edc4
msgctxt "hac400522g7cbeg4021g92f8g2a7ee7071f88"
msgid ""
"This is a bleeding shitshow. Half my squad's dead, the other half's sporting "
"tentacles."
msgstr "여긴 난리 개판이야. 분대의 절반은 죽었고, 나머지 절반은 촉수랑 놀고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva
#. Speaker = Gauntlet Yeva
#. NodeID = a6e6a65f-a23d-4917-a2dc-ce05e9b30a75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - COL_TadpolingCentre_HasMet_Yeva(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva:a6e6a65f-a23d-4917-a2dc-ce05e9b30a75
msgctxt "h7e411b91g6f19g4ca2ga5d7g35ecbfef4d79"
msgid ""
"A couple of those flayers were comrades of mine. I'd have been trying to "
"suck your brains out along with 'em if you'd arrived any later."
msgstr ""
"저 마인드 플레이어 중 몇몇은 내 동료였어. 네가 조금만 더 늦게 도착했더라면, 저들과 함께 네 뇌를 빨아 먹으려고 달려들었겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva
#. Speaker = Gauntlet Yeva
#. NodeID = a77459c3-ff9b-a9f0-27e4-d075e4a8d0f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva:a77459c3-ff9b-a9f0-27e4-d075e4a8d0f7
msgctxt "h9db80876g7744g4c2eg957agdec56455d4f7"
msgid "He was still human. And still trying to put up a fight."
msgstr "공작은 아직 인간인 상태였고, 계속 저항하고 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva
#. Speaker = Gauntlet Yeva
#. NodeID = c997fc42-14b3-a1f4-9a0c-583d938ae8c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva:c997fc42-14b3-a1f4-9a0c-583d938ae8c9
msgctxt "hcf2e46dbg0151g4ecag89a9g17d74d327ef8"
msgid ""
"You've got more courage than sense if you're planning to go deeper. But "
"someone needs to."
msgstr "더 깊게 들어갈 생각이라니, 배짱은 두둑하지만 분별력은 한참 모자라구나. 뭐, 누군가는 그렇게 행동해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d572812f-4356-654e-cc52-378430ddb925
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva:d572812f-4356-654e-cc52-378430ddb925
msgctxt "hfec6c93cg9914g4e49ga1deg794a2437c640"
msgid "Are you sure Ravengard's down here?"
msgstr "레이븐가드가 여기 있는 게 확실해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva
#. Speaker = Gauntlet Yeva
#. NodeID = e99e3490-3df9-da53-01cc-a667ea3d2630
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva:e99e3490-3df9-da53-01cc-a667ea3d2630
msgctxt "h6b1b9248g44cbg46b1gaf61g5b71fffd303e"
msgid "Yeah. He was in one of the pods, but the cultists took him away."
msgstr "응. 어떤 포드에 들어 있었어. 근데 추종자들이 끌고 가 버렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1d7b6a9-30c7-d0b3-fbb6-efa72f4fa5bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Yeva:f1d7b6a9-30c7-d0b3-fbb6-efa72f4fa5bd
msgctxt "h3bad423cg1bc3g425bg81e7g12865019a492"
msgid "Is the Duke someone who rewards well?"
msgstr "공작은 포상을 후하게 내리는 편인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 0732094f-aa2d-bfd0-0dcb-6c7b6b6d9a69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:0732094f-aa2d-bfd0-0dcb-6c7b6b6d9a69
msgctxt "h5eb489aegcc97g4276g9d4ag6bdf06e51000"
msgid "An ugly thought. With the echo of truth to it."
msgstr "추악한 생각이었지. 일말의 진심이 담긴."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 0e4c3bc3-3e8e-aea0-9850-c0c281782d0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:0e4c3bc3-3e8e-aea0-9850-c0c281782d0f
msgctxt "h05fd96c8g83a7g4decgbe7agde4e3c3f2407"
msgid ""
"You've heard some of it, I'm sure. That I froze, or broke, or some other lie "
"that is kinder than the truth."
msgstr "분명 이미 들어봤겠지. 내가 얼어붙었다던가, 무너졌다던가, 진실보다 더 나은 그런 거짓말들을 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 0e8ebed5-2827-c408-c3b4-f8b096565809
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:0e8ebed5-2827-c408-c3b4-f8b096565809
msgctxt "hde0de0f1gba7fg42d9g818bgb1525808eb55"
msgid "As you wish. I'll pray for your success, to any god who will listen."
msgstr "원하는 대로. 모든 신께 네 성공을 기도하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 1219d2ce-4909-0221-831a-cf69bb2b4d4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - a6d91c3d-039c-b06d-81fa-7026e33b2dfe_WyllInclusion = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a6d91c3d-039c-b06d-81fa-7026e33b2dfe_WyllInclusion = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:1219d2ce-4909-0221-831a-cf69bb2b4d4a
msgctxt "h7664dd67g8a9ag49b3ga7ccg45b83a6d62c5"
msgid ""
"The Blade of Frontiers. The saviour I needed, if not the one I deserved."
msgstr "변경의 칼날. 내게 필요한 구원자로군. 내게 구원을 받을 자격이 있는지는 모르겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 16afbe48-4d79-1943-9987-56507350dbca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:16afbe48-4d79-1943-9987-56507350dbca
msgctxt "h0803fa21g49ffg4afegb3f0gfbf236772f11"
msgid "Mind your own business, Zevlor."
msgstr "당신 일이나 신경써요, 제블로어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 1890b210-2607-84e0-17d2-bf7d22deed4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:1890b210-2607-84e0-17d2-bf7d22deed4e
msgctxt "h007d0857gfe6cg4337g93d2g4bb00e1f9867"
msgid "I paid the price of angering the wrong devil."
msgstr "데빌을 잘못 건드린 대가를 치뤘지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 20692b70-fe2c-3622-692a-8450aa25c094
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:20692b70-fe2c-3622-692a-8450aa25c094
msgctxt "h5349e8efg0d6ag4651g904eg51b172d0638b"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "그렇군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 276d677b-82a7-fc95-1e61-96b2e3da59d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:276d677b-82a7-fc95-1e61-96b2e3da59d2
msgctxt "hb58b0d3dg371dg496bgb376gdc12f4a59f75"
msgid "The others. The ambush - tell me they survived."
msgstr "다른 사람들은? 습격을 받았는데 - 살아남았다고 말해주게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 2cbcd1b5-9e2c-b082-77c1-7f7773e64b2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:2cbcd1b5-9e2c-b082-77c1-7f7773e64b2f
msgctxt "h16e8097bg47f9g4417gbeeag990b1d6b1f1a"
msgid "Watching gods - the Blade of Frontiers? <i>Wyll?</i> What happened?"
msgstr "신들이여 맙소사 - 변경의 칼날? <i>윌?</i> 어떻게 된 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 2e420544-9886-2258-53e5-e3b28da87ee4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:2e420544-9886-2258-53e5-e3b28da87ee4
msgctxt "h4fd962b7gd3d9g4bc9g8eeag85e850ece8fd"
msgid ""
"It would be nice to think so. But whatever these monsters twist us into... I "
"believe it begins in us."
msgstr "그렇게 생각할 수 있다면 편하겠지. 하지만 이 괴물들이 우릴 어떻게 바꿔놓건... 그건 원래 우리 안에 있던 모습일 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 39f9dbd1-2909-eb43-659a-b9760053b059
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:39f9dbd1-2909-eb43-659a-b9760053b059
msgctxt "h68cf6b68gba8bg4e8egba57gcac291663319"
msgid ""
"I won't make excuses. I can't make amends. But I know something of what you "
"came to do - I want to help, if you'll let me."
msgstr ""
"변명은 하지 않겠네. 돌이킬 수도 없는 일이고. 하지만 난 자네가 여기에서 하려고 하는 일에 대해 아는 바가 있네 - 허락한다면, 돕고 "
"싶네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 3d80b819-293e-731b-c86e-eebf9cbc1ff3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:3d80b819-293e-731b-c86e-eebf9cbc1ff3
msgctxt "h44fb4210g9537g420dgbdb4g0352837708ad"
msgid "Of course. Forgive me."
msgstr "물론이지. 미안하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 45e90fef-cb92-57ad-872a-b6cab034a5bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:45e90fef-cb92-57ad-872a-b6cab034a5bd
msgctxt "hdc624f28ga3e7g452ega079gb465ed53509c"
msgid ""
"By the time I regained my senses, it was too late. I did not just surrender "
"to the Absolute. For a moment, I <i>welcomed</i> it."
msgstr ""
"내가 다시 정신을 차렸을 땐, 이미 너무 늦은 뒤였네. 난 단지 절대자에게 굴복했던 게 아니야. 한순간, 난 그걸 <i>환영</i>했었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 4716fb99-e671-bc51-ad96-fd09a58dcdb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - COL_TadpolingCentre_HasMet_Zevlor(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:4716fb99-e671-bc51-ad96-fd09a58dcdb7
msgctxt "h975ca8c1g1ba5g42c1g89ccge3549b4bd38c"
msgid "I... owe you an explanation. Much more than that. But first, please..."
msgstr "난... 자네에게 설명을 해야겠지. 단지 설명 이상의 것을. 하지만 그 전에, 제발..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 49c1d04c-795c-1da4-f23e-03d7811483dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:49c1d04c-795c-1da4-f23e-03d7811483dd
msgctxt "h820c2beegfb9ag44d1gbfafg3c591a0e2df4"
msgid ""
"And all the while, the cult tortured them. They fought, and ran, and died "
"around me, while I imagined myself their saviour."
msgstr ""
"그 와중에 교단이 그들을 고문했네. 내가 스스로 구원자가 될 수 있다는 망상에 빠진 동안 그들은 내 주위에서 싸우고, 도망가고, 죽었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 4bb8aadb-aec4-3826-bea1-797952ab7d44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:4bb8aadb-aec4-3826-bea1-797952ab7d44
msgctxt "heff58098gc274g4953g87fag9bc021582012"
msgid ""
"I would be a paladin again - with a god's purpose, a god's power. Everything "
"I needed to protect my people."
msgstr "내가 다시 신의 뜻과 힘을 지닌 팔라딘이 되어서, 동족을 보호할 수 있게 될 거라는 약속이었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 50c0c429-e014-55b8-05ae-cb72fe8d11b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:50c0c429-e014-55b8-05ae-cb72fe8d11b1
msgctxt "h759ba517gd699g4092ga143g171dd56fd4ce"
msgid ""
"I fell short of that mark in Avernus - and even so, it was not so bad as "
"this."
msgstr "난 아베르누스에서도 그걸 깨닫지 못했네 - 하지만 이번에는 더 나빴지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 51ad790a-880c-8de7-c065-d02f94b5ac98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:51ad790a-880c-8de7-c065-d02f94b5ac98
msgctxt "h5c3a1334ge619g4086gb34ag18b67317e1fd"
msgid ""
"They did? Oh sweet gods. I have no right to feel it - but I am proud of them."
msgstr "그랬단 말인가? 오 신이시여. 내겐 이럴 자격 따위 없다만, 그들이 무척 자랑스럽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 51c39d38-8c57-87da-8f59-01aa89ae7356
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:51c39d38-8c57-87da-8f59-01aa89ae7356
msgctxt "hb7612f85gad7fg410ag80c7g52ba35740dab"
msgid "Fine. Good luck, Zevlor."
msgstr "좋아요. 행운을 빌죠, 제블로어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 52ab4fd4-f284-3718-73e8-5ae3bb0db50d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:52ab4fd4-f284-3718-73e8-5ae3bb0db50d
msgctxt "h52847467g8351g4c29gafa0gaf9df62e2633"
msgid "'For a moment' - until you realised your reward would be a tadpole."
msgstr "'한순간'이라, 당신의 보상이 올챙이라는 사실을 깨닫기 전까지 말이로군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5945d751-6b7a-af5c-5f68-fd0a1d7ee913
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#.      - HAV_GeneralHaven_State_HavenDestroyed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:5945d751-6b7a-af5c-5f68-fd0a1d7ee913
msgctxt "h6407017dg626cg4e51g8e3ag7e4872c79b99"
msgid "The only survivors ended up in a cell in Moonrise."
msgstr "남은 생존자들은 결국 문라이즈의 감옥에 갇혔어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 5a3ec975-ee1a-e145-f34c-f7b4530614dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Knows_TieflingsSafe = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:5a3ec975-ee1a-e145-f34c-f7b4530614dd
msgctxt "h3b00b8e0g647bg4518ga673g04f35c573a60"
msgid ""
"Somehow, I suspect it's worse even than you imagine. Likely you heard that I "
"broke, or froze, or some other lie kinder than the truth."
msgstr ""
"그렇군. 진실은 자네가 생각하는 것보다 더 나쁠 걸세. 아마 내가 무너졌다거나, 겁을 먹었다거나, 혹은 다른 진실보다 더 나은 이야기를 "
"들었을 테지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 5c94141c-c9f6-7217-6c8a-dc3b54fb923e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:5c94141c-c9f6-7217-6c8a-dc3b54fb923e
msgctxt "h44c74c37g0512g489dgabebg44b4af13641c"
msgid ""
"Ketheric is below. He thinks you're no longer a menace. Descend and show him "
"how wrong he is."
msgstr "케서릭은 아래에 있네. 자네가 더 이상 위협이 되지 않는다고 생각하겠지. 내려가서 그 생각이 틀렸다는 걸 보여주게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60951e94-b050-915c-953e-5ac6e9d7068e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:60951e94-b050-915c-953e-5ac6e9d7068e
msgctxt "h3d217d10g63f0g46cbg967bg6890929c39cd"
msgid "Find your own people. They need you."
msgstr "티플링들을 찾아가요. 그 사람들은 당신이 필요합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 614f9a67-81e2-f0b4-fea5-5e05cf9de531
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:614f9a67-81e2-f0b4-fea5-5e05cf9de531
msgctxt "hb65e11b7g7b05g4903g85c7g9ecbbdcdd353"
msgid "Hells... I didn't think I was going to make it. Thank you..."
msgstr "맙소사... 내가 해낼 수 있을 줄 몰랐네. 고맙군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b2f4e2e-31e4-25cf-5645-ff21ef138a8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_GeneralHaven_State_HavenDestroyed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a6d91c3d-039c-b06d-81fa-7026e33b2dfe_SaidTieflingsAreDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:6b2f4e2e-31e4-25cf-5645-ff21ef138a8e
msgctxt "h4c4b8df3ga193g448ag9368g3b9e4235676d"
msgid "They're all dead."
msgstr "모두 죽었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 6b78f925-77eb-5c9c-1ea1-4de0e475272f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:6b78f925-77eb-5c9c-1ea1-4de0e475272f
msgctxt "h6aa19416g7854g4bc2gb69bgdf682511002a"
msgid "Go, my friend. Please. Let me do this much."
msgstr "떠나게, 친구여. 제발. 이 정도는 내가 할 수 있게 해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 6e04088b-d7cb-18e0-83d6-567c04e629eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:6e04088b-d7cb-18e0-83d6-567c04e629eb
msgctxt "haa69a971ge9cbg484fg9797g7f67d0602f97"
msgid "And shouldered the cost to spare someone else a worse fate, I'd wager."
msgstr "분명 다른 누군가의 운명을 구하려다 생긴 일이겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 72381f1f-559c-404d-378a-404fbe44512a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:72381f1f-559c-404d-378a-404fbe44512a
msgctxt "h420dea81g92e1g458fgadf0g9a62411c732e"
msgid ""
"If there are any more survivors to be found, I'll find them - and lead them "
"out of this place."
msgstr "생존자가 한 명이라도 더 있다면, 내가 찾아내겠네 - 그리고 이곳에서 같이 나가겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 737c7cde-c06f-2a5c-bfac-73bff85d2ce5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:737c7cde-c06f-2a5c-bfac-73bff85d2ce5
msgctxt "h8d497cb8g5990g42e8gb10agbd3fd3a80b69"
msgid "Gods... it's all my fault."
msgstr "신들이여... 모두 내 탓이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7955de0e-466a-303b-8dc5-f313141c9290
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - a6d91c3d-039c-b06d-81fa-7026e33b2dfe_SaidTieflingsAreDead = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:7955de0e-466a-303b-8dc5-f313141c9290
msgctxt "h1993914cg0ac4g4dceg81bcg29d474601410"
msgid "Your people didn't need a paladin - they saved themselves."
msgstr "당신의 동족은 팔라딘을 필요하지 않았습니다 - 자기들 스스로를 보호했죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ecbb95e-57e6-ffb5-45f2-bf7c69d17216
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#.      - HAV_GeneralHaven_State_HavenDestroyed = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:7ecbb95e-57e6-ffb5-45f2-bf7c69d17216
msgctxt "h0dbf5814g51c9g4147g9f0dg04e59afd6710"
msgid "Some. Others ended up in a cell in Moonrise. That's on you."
msgstr "몇몇은. 나머지는 문라이즈 감옥에서 죽었어. 당신 때문이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8a3874ff-9cad-1c36-d27c-fa66210ca118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:8a3874ff-9cad-1c36-d27c-fa66210ca118
msgctxt "h3c4f3b9dg28a1g44b2g9dddg90b01c7b8fee"
msgid "I could use another blade in the fight to come."
msgstr "당신이 가세하면 다가올 싸움에 도움이 될 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c3cb9fb-9284-4b4b-76ec-6a4ef0f58d14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:8c3cb9fb-9284-4b4b-76ec-6a4ef0f58d14
msgctxt "h805f0142g4eb5g48f8g9e79g293f6e8de9e0"
msgid "I paid the price of angering the wrong devil."
msgstr "건드려선 안될 데빌을 분노케 한 대가를 치르고 왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 928e2178-d827-3385-1202-dee1c4fba71f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:928e2178-d827-3385-1202-dee1c4fba71f
msgctxt "hd588fc35ge961g4c51gbed7g6a277514c4c2"
msgid ""
"Until I realised what I'd done. Perhaps I fought - I don't recall. Either "
"way, I was deemed... unworthy of becoming a True Soul."
msgstr ""
"내가 무슨 짓을 했는지 깨닫기 전까지 말이야. 어쩌면 내가 저항했을지도 모르지만..기억이 나질 않네. 어느 쪽이건, 난 참된 영혼이... "
"될 가치가 없다고 여겨졌으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 9811a0ec-4f00-63eb-fae8-1ada0886ffc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:9811a0ec-4f00-63eb-fae8-1ada0886ffc8
msgctxt "hb1f2decbg2036g45a2g9771g8f8e81723d57"
msgid "And shouldered the cost to spare someone else a worse fate, I'd wager."
msgstr "그렇다면 다른 이들에게 닥칠 어두운 운명을 막기 위해 대가를 치러야 하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9f2d57a5-0410-0c9f-488c-546092f50323
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Zevlor_State_KnowsWyllDevil = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - WYLL_DEVIL(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Zevlor_State_KnowsWyllDevil = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:9f2d57a5-0410-0c9f-488c-546092f50323
msgctxt "h87468a7fg6775g4587g8fa2gdcc93e9efdc1"
msgid "*Confusion crosses Zevlor's eyes as he takes you in.*"
msgstr "*당신을 보자마자 제블로어의 눈에 혼란이 스칩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = a01435f4-a5f8-43f6-f200-9be2e9b90c87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:a01435f4-a5f8-43f6-f200-9be2e9b90c87
msgctxt "h1a3bc797g185bg48e1gb85fg0dc927933a6d"
msgid ""
"Only if you can trust it won't be buried in your back. The Absolute swayed "
"me once before. I won't risk it happening again."
msgstr "아니면 등 뒤에서 자네를 찌를지도 모르지. 절대자는 이미 나를 한 번 흔들었네. 같은 일이 또 일어날 위험을 감수할 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = a2b6e0a6-10ac-09f4-c6c8-5983e5c7a5fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:a2b6e0a6-10ac-09f4-c6c8-5983e5c7a5fc
msgctxt "h5745cc2ag2491g47e5g8b2cg2940f1f56a8e"
msgid ""
"I thought I was done for... Thank you... Watching gods - the Blade of "
"Frontiers? <i>Wyll?</i> What happened?"
msgstr "이대로 끝인 줄만 알았네... 고맙군... 신들이여 - 변경의 칼날? <i>윌?</i> 어떻게 된 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2dfd4e0-5ce4-3eb0-4730-10e9c4dbc04a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:a2dfd4e0-5ce4-3eb0-4730-10e9c4dbc04a
msgctxt "h7ca292e7gb233g4007ga75egf8fc0a0c8002"
msgid "Be honest. You wanted the power, but not for any ideal - for yourself."
msgstr "솔직하게 말해요. 당신은 그저 힘을 원했을 뿐입니다. 어떤 이상을 위해서가 아니라 - 당신 자신을 위해서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8905ce5-c00e-c472-a7a7-66c06ab768b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:a8905ce5-c00e-c472-a7a7-66c06ab768b2
msgctxt "ha2429239gc8ecg4828g8e6agef73b2e5c98e"
msgid "I don't care what you do - just get out of my sight."
msgstr "당신이 뭘 하든 관심 없으니 내 눈 앞에서 사라져요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = bc487989-2d06-7ae4-da49-439fca533461
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - COL_TadpolingCentre_HasMet_Zevlor(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:bc487989-2d06-7ae4-da49-439fca533461
msgctxt "hd28ec563g67d7g4397ga7ebg24645f6a9e46"
msgid "Finish what you came here to do - I daresay you've done enough for me."
msgstr "자네가 여기 온 목적을 달성한다면 - 내겐 그걸로 족하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1dc8a85-67f9-e41d-0286-3434bb962c41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:c1dc8a85-67f9-e41d-0286-3434bb962c41
msgctxt "h7ee19c99g572dg44bbg9242g0ef510425892"
msgid "I can't tell you."
msgstr "당신에겐 말할 수 없습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4bb51db-a0d0-c3ee-5b7f-fe4cef3f60af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:c4bb51db-a0d0-c3ee-5b7f-fe4cef3f60af
msgctxt "h29602d68g5a24g4bdfgb254gcce42ff2c6d7"
msgid "You abandoned them. Do you really think you have the right to ask?"
msgstr "당신은 동족을 버렸어요. 정말로 그런 질문을 할 권리가 있다고 생각하는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c8a6e842-e0cc-458d-9d4c-90c08ce47bcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Zevlor_State_KnowsWyllDevil = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - WYLL_DEVIL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Zevlor_State_KnowsWyllDevil = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:c8a6e842-e0cc-458d-9d4c-90c08ce47bcc
msgctxt "hf36d5b19g6a1dg4efcg858cgcb933e2adefc"
msgid "Zevlor."
msgstr "제블로어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4cec404-526f-0d2d-a188-47764c331a6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:d4cec404-526f-0d2d-a188-47764c331a6b
msgctxt "h7239ec1eg80cdg4ebag94c2g0371ccd9ce62"
msgid "I figured I was due a makeover. What do you think?"
msgstr "기분 전환이 필요했습니다. 괜찮아 보이나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = d891d842-ff35-a0e0-67f4-55f78fd0aa2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - COL_TadpolingCentre_HasMet_Zevlor(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:d891d842-ff35-a0e0-67f4-55f78fd0aa2b
msgctxt "h896782dcg11c7g4321g87ecg5c59c484e6b2"
msgid "As for my sorry state..."
msgstr "내 추한 몰골 말이네만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = e29e77a1-5b19-3033-2165-e0f7c1f89ba5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:e29e77a1-5b19-3033-2165-e0f7c1f89ba5
msgctxt "h9636ce58g3905g45a4g95a6gb37f263c8a78"
msgid ""
"If I know you at all, you chose this fate to spare someone else a worse one. "
"So I think it suits you."
msgstr ""
"내가 자네에 대해 잘 알고 있다면, 자넨 다른 누군가가 더 끔찍한 운명을 마주하는 걸 막으려 이런 결말을 택했으리라 생각하네. 그러니 "
"그대다운 행동이라 보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3f563f7-04c3-c6e7-b54a-b22bb926258c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_GeneralHaven_State_HavenDestroyed = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:e3f563f7-04c3-c6e7-b54a-b22bb926258c
msgctxt "h0fe066d7gbed2g4d78g9ba3gf34b5f919fa8"
msgid "They found refuge. But what the hells happened out there, Zevlor?"
msgstr "티플링들은 피난처를 찾았습니다. 대체 무슨 일이 있었던 거죠, 제블로어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = e63f50ba-85f9-0c09-1d6c-9578b97f7a8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:e63f50ba-85f9-0c09-1d6c-9578b97f7a8d
msgctxt "hd993addag8b24g4958gbb4fg42f9221f1984"
msgid ""
"And you, my friend. And pathetic, <i>inadequate</i> as it is - thank you."
msgstr "그리고 자네, 내 친구여. 정말 한심하고 <i>턱없이 부족한 말이지만</i>, 고맙네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e722036a-0b48-24b8-5c84-b051d45cdbe7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:e722036a-0b48-24b8-5c84-b051d45cdbe7
msgctxt "hde4fd57fg743fg414dgbc7ag69c61884d43d"
msgid "It sounds like you were being enthralled. It's not your fault."
msgstr "정신을 지배당했던 것 같군요. 당신 잘못이 아닙니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eed5b3cb-ccab-917d-65d7-3a2307b51c89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:eed5b3cb-ccab-917d-65d7-3a2307b51c89
msgctxt "hf8bbbd75g47b9g493bga06bgca68ef21d7ed"
msgid "Some. No thanks to you."
msgstr "일부는 살았죠. 당신 덕분은 아니지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = f255cba7-efb1-3791-aef9-0907bb3c6a44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:f255cba7-efb1-3791-aef9-0907bb3c6a44
msgctxt "hc576fa66gbb04g484agb697gf0f688f36a99"
msgid "They have you."
msgstr "이미 자네가 있잖나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = f34c5568-fff5-f9b1-3d97-c7f86d73b36f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:f34c5568-fff5-f9b1-3d97-c7f86d73b36f
msgctxt "h031d10e1gae48g4a85g95d4g40fc92ad98c1"
msgid ""
"We were ambushed by cultists, yes. And then I heard... <i>Her. </i>Their "
"false god, whispering promises in my mind."
msgstr ""
"우린 사교도들의 습격을 받았네. 그리곤, 내 귀에... <i>그녀</i>의 목소리가 들렸지. 그 거짓된 신이, 내게 약속을 속삭였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f7ea26d0-5842-437a-5e87-b618f3c3c656
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:f7ea26d0-5842-437a-5e87-b618f3c3c656
msgctxt "h0a0c4bceg689ag43d8g939dgaa1b47fcc572"
msgid ""
"If you wanted power, you never needed a god - only to live up to your ideal."
msgstr "힘을 원했다면, 신에게 의지할 게 아니라 - 스스로를 믿었어야죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = ffabbc28-d5c3-851e-2024-6a681c94e03f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_PostCombat_Zevlor:ffabbc28-d5c3-851e-2024-6a681c94e03f
msgctxt "h09677982gae42g4162g91f0ge4e04bdc2569"
msgid ""
"I do not. But if you know what happened... well, you deserve to know <i>all</"
"i> of it."
msgstr "아닐세. 하지만 무슨 일이 있었는지 자네가 안다면... 음, 자네는 <i>전부</i> 알 자격이 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 091f0c9a-4167-f9ba-027b-715062a95e1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead:091f0c9a-4167-f9ba-027b-715062a95e1c
msgctxt "hd2b9e545gf883g4854g8bf8g621a5ef40dcc"
msgid "*The spell's power wanes. You can ask no more questions.*"
msgstr "*주문의 힘이 약해집니다. 더 이상 질문을 할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ec5f066-d9ca-e0ac-68df-898320021257
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead:0ec5f066-d9ca-e0ac-68df-898320021257
msgctxt "h31217a8agb3dag450ag9d81g7df9edb2e34e"
msgid "Why did you surrender your people to the cult?"
msgstr "왜 사교에게 당신네 사람들을 넘긴 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 2b77b045-8e7b-b754-2585-b94f01340f09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 260f61d5-60df-da35-608b-a9856291b143_PlayerKnowsOrinKilledZevlor = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead:2b77b045-8e7b-b754-2585-b94f01340f09
msgctxt "h9e402bbag76cag4e36gb7b4g8e383f8df625"
msgid "Blessed... by the Chosen..."
msgstr "축복... 선택받은 자의..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3be7b6f1-8de3-79d7-0a42-2e4499191625
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 260f61d5-60df-da35-608b-a9856291b143_ZevlorMentionnedSurrender = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead:3be7b6f1-8de3-79d7-0a42-2e4499191625
msgctxt "h403a8c89ga17fg482ag91d8g2069ecc35efd"
msgid "What did the voice of the Absolute promise you?"
msgstr "절대자의 목소리가 당신에게 뭘 약속했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 45209d06-7791-9d08-bde4-07a5224ba97b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - WYR_ZevlorsAppeal_Knows_ZevlorStory = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead:45209d06-7791-9d08-bde4-07a5224ba97b
msgctxt "hde597092gc3ddg45fegac73g7afe88fed04d"
msgid "What... happened to... others...?"
msgstr "다들... 어떻게... 됐지...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 48529058-5743-b694-8e79-6ee42dec6857
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead:48529058-5743-b694-8e79-6ee42dec6857
msgctxt "hcee9d81fg0cc8g4f07g8f12g2f64bb4606de"
msgid "*The corpse stares at you lifelessly.*"
msgstr "*시체가 당신을 생기 없는 눈빛으로 바라봅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 488d83d0-d7dc-35ff-08c1-33a27e7ba929
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead:488d83d0-d7dc-35ff-08c1-33a27e7ba929
msgctxt "h4c314fecg120fg4c2egac75g4fb943893213"
msgid "Down... in the dark... down... down..."
msgstr "아래로... 어둠 속... 아래로... 아래로..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead
#. Speaker = Zevlor
#. NodeID = 7f78819c-9e9c-f5e6-7590-ea150641a361
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 260f61d5-60df-da35-608b-a9856291b143_PlayerKnowsOrinKilledZevlor = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead:7f78819c-9e9c-f5e6-7590-ea150641a361
msgctxt "h5ce6249agf19bg47cfgbbc2g904d07248c1a"
msgid "The Absolute's... Chosen... an offering..."
msgstr "절대자의... 선택받은 자.... 제물로..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f8d62e6-5e77-3efd-204f-e457d192a6dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 260f61d5-60df-da35-608b-a9856291b143_PlayerKnowsOrinKilledZevlor = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead:8f8d62e6-5e77-3efd-204f-e457d192a6dd
msgctxt "h57789f81g8a9cg44bag9b3dg67c6bb8d8dbd"
msgid "Where are these Chosen now?"
msgstr "선택받은 자들은 지금 어디에 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9cd92725-8597-aa10-8e11-e805981f0337
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 260f61d5-60df-da35-608b-a9856291b143_ZevlorMentionnedSurrender = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead:9cd92725-8597-aa10-8e11-e805981f0337
msgctxt "hf457b30dg95f2g4055g9265g138d345f2f32"
msgid "Many of your people died. Because of you."
msgstr "당신을 따르던 많은 사람들이 죽었어. 바로 당신 때문에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d2c88b0-1bae-1809-f79c-c89123335635
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_TadpolingCentre_Zevlor_Dead:9d2c88b0-1bae-1809-f79c-c89123335635
msgctxt "h6d433e20gbc27g4593ga9ecg312e92a11f99"
msgid "What happened to you?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 있었지?"

