msgctxt "hb55db34bg44c6g4b74g93a4g990464452fbd"
msgid "*The corpse seems willing to speak - but not to its killer.*"
msgstr "*시체는 말할 의지가 있지만, 자신을 죽인 자와 대화하고 싶지는 않은 듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_AD_Solving
