msgctxt "h19610e49g572bg40c7gb881gc63a7b4b97e1"
msgid ""
"The Grand Design. The restoration of the mind flayer empire. The dream of "
"all illithids."
msgstr "원대한 설계. 마인드 플레이어 제국의 부흥이야. 모든 일리시드의 꿈과도 같은 것이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_DaisyAD_GrandDesignReaction
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = 98034208-e52e-9188-f8de-5b017b37dccc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_DaisyAD_GrandDesignReaction:98034208-e52e-9188-f8de-5b017b37dccc
msgctxt "h4e1998d1g741dg4da4g84f0g96a4ed17aceb"
msgid ""
"The Grand Design. The restoration of the mind flayer empire. The dream of "
"all illithids."
msgstr "원대한 설계. 마인드 플레이어 제국의 부흥이야. 모든 일리시드의 꿈과도 같은 것이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_GrandDesign
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 9b5360c4-5cb0-4547-beff-be39e54ea4f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_GrandDesign:9b5360c4-5cb0-4547-beff-be39e54ea4f0
msgctxt "h07b11b01g4331g4a32gad08g6dad9b922627"
msgid "I wonder, how did the Illithid Empire fall?"
msgstr "궁금하군. 일리시드 제국이 어떻게 몰락한 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_GrandDesign
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c968e520-c85a-4bfb-b6a0-cd67219a483a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_GrandDesign:c968e520-c85a-4bfb-b6a0-cd67219a483a
msgctxt "h2a0ce516g8e22g4541g9622gc07a055c0c48"
msgid ""
"Led by the great Mother Gith, my people cast off our chains and eliminated "
"our <i>ghaik</i> slavers from the Astral Plane - though they still fester "
"elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"위대한 어머니 기스의 인도 아래, 우리 종족은 사슬을 떨치고 일어나 우리의 <i>게이크</i> 아스트랄 차원의 노예상들을 제거했지 - "
"하지만 놈들은 아직도 여기저기 남아 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_GrandDesign
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c968e520-c85a-4bfb-b6a0-cd67219a483a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_GrandDesign:c968e520-c85a-4bfb-b6a0-cd67219a483a
msgctxt "hd494ca2dg970ag4c97gbfa4g81f1d3314d60"
msgid "I don't know. I'm just glad it fell."
msgstr "모르겠어. 몰락했다는 것이 기쁠 따름이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_GrandDesign
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = c968e520-c85a-4bfb-b6a0-cd67219a483a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_PAD_GrandDesign:c968e520-c85a-4bfb-b6a0-cd67219a483a
msgctxt "hf8ce3ea6ge33eg4cf0g9daeg70fa65d90e8c"
msgid "Probably with a great gooey bang."
msgstr "아마 끈적하게 \"펑!\"하고 터졌겠지."

