msgid ""
"*The console glows as you approach, the mind still desperately yearning for "
"connection.*"
msgstr "*다가설수록 콘솔은 빛을 내며, 당신과 연결되기를 갈망합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Colony/COL_Vault_Puzzle
