msgctxt "hd4b24094g8fd0g4565g9773gdf53575c74d6"
msgid "Will there be anyone left when we arrive in the city?"
msgstr "도시에 도착하면 우리를 도와줄 사람들이 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/GLO_GatherYourAllies_DaisyJournalBegin
