msgctxt "hc7902dbbg1262g4b14g9badg25712f71f0cc"
msgid "Together, we will put an end to the Absolute, the Chosen, all."
msgstr "우리가 함께 절대자와 선택받은 자, 그 모두를 끝장내는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/GLO_GatherYourAllies_DaisyJournalBegin
