#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/GLO_GatherYourAllies_DaisyJournalBegin:5d26c718-32a6-3b06-1679-736aff4dbe88
msgctxt "he595dad8gb242g4198g8cb5gecbbe4e4d81d"
msgid "Did you not see what I just did? I don't need <i>anyone</i>."
msgstr "방금 내가 뭘 했는지 보지 못했어? 난 <i>누구도</i> 필요없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/GLO_GatherYourAllies_DaisyJournalBegin
