msgid "And you are the one who could prevent it."
msgstr "그리고 그걸 막을 수 있는 건 바로 너야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/GLO_GatherYourAllies_DaisyJournalBegin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 693e44ad-52bc-4357-fd8a-5744f611beeb
