msgctxt "h1204b9dfg9145g403dg8424g957d1ac429fc"
msgid ""
"Whatever you might do to <i>one</i> cannot be worse than what the Chosen "
"will unleash on <i>all.</i>"
msgstr "네가 <i>그들</i>에게 무슨 일을 저지르건 간에, 선택받은 자들이 <i>모두</i>에게 저지를 일보다는 나을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/GLO_GatherYourAllies_DaisyJournalBegin
