msgctxt "h837c0d94g8ed9g4ec2gbd74g7755d70cdc86"
msgid ""
"Enough lives have been lost. I don't want to send others to their deaths."
msgstr "이미 많은 생명이 사그라졌어. 더는 누구도 죽음으로 내몰고 싶지 않아."

