msgid ""
"If Nightsong's fury against Ketheric runs as deep as it seems, she will make "
"a fierce ally indeed."
msgstr "케서릭을 향한 밤의 노래의 분노가 보이는 것만큼 깊다면, 흉포한 동료가 될 거야."

