msgctxt "hcba01010g8372g4a34ga730g79e4ccc55707"
msgid ""
"And if they died, would their deaths not count? But they need not die, for "
"they would have you."
msgstr "누군가 죽는다면 그 죽음이 아무런 의미가 없었다는 건가? 하지만 누구도 죽지 않아도 돼, 네가 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/GLO_GatherYourAllies_DaisyJournalBegin
