msgctxt "h3b281ca4gd82cg4c50ga8d2gb8c438015c5f"
msgid ""
"I want to resurrect [CAMP_Jergal_PlayerToResurrect_1_c85cdca4-6579-776d-206d-"
"6967e4999281]."
msgstr ""
"[CAMP_Jergal_PlayerToResurrect_1_c85cdca4-6579-776d-206d-6967e4999281]을(를) "
"부활시키고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 566ebb54-b0b5-1662-a506-436c0d74b53f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CHA_Jergal_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:566ebb54-b0b5-1662-a506-436c0d74b53f
msgctxt "haec341c4g4978g4ec5gb1b6g0fadbff3333d"
msgid ""
"A flock without souls - yet to what end, O tempted one? This is the question "
"thou must come to answer."
msgstr "영혼이 없는 무리들로, 무엇을 하려 하는가? 오 유혹당한 자여, 이것이 그대가 대답해야 할 질문이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 580d51e3-0175-821b-dd43-eaee6d30154b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:580d51e3-0175-821b-dd43-eaee6d30154b
msgctxt "hfc6133deg6228g4839gad23g1c4aa620a399"
msgid ""
"I would like to recruit a hireling. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_3_01f129ea-"
"b4dc-44b6-8154-9a948f876a82])"
msgstr ""
"용병을 고용하고 싶습니다. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_3_01f129ea-b4dc-"
"44b6-8154-9a948f876a82])"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5dcc4aac-71a9-5fda-1b1d-69c0276ec69c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_Jergal_State_ShadowheartAskedWhatToDo = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#.      - SHADOWHEART_ENEMYOFSHARPATH(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCE_Jergal_State_ShadowheartAskedWhatToDo = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:5dcc4aac-71a9-5fda-1b1d-69c0276ec69c
msgctxt "h00a83e40gf61fg465bg8d9dg424555559dd7"
msgid "Serving Shar is all I have ever known. What should I do now?"
msgstr "샤를 섬기는 것만이 제 전부였어요. 저는 이제 뭘 해야 하죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 5de7bdc5-21ed-2b85-8850-dc0cf96df642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - Hirelings_State_CCmutex = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:5de7bdc5-21ed-2b85-8850-dc0cf96df642
msgctxt "h7d32b015g196cg4e4dgb3a3g6772ccf726fd"
msgid "Patience. Thy colleague still peruses my ledger."
msgstr "인내하라. 그대의 동료가 아직 내 장부를 읽고 있도다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 5e5a6a0b-1d0a-ebd1-b463-bc5bac4b8468
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - Hirelings_State_InCamp_1 = False
#.      - Hirelings_State_InCamp_3 = True
#.      - Hirelings_State_InCamp_2 = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:5e5a6a0b-1d0a-ebd1-b463-bc5bac4b8468
msgctxt "h5ec1de19gd6c9g49e5g902ag48ec714f76b2"
msgid "All three of thy hirelings wait in thy camp."
msgstr "세 용병 모두가 그대의 야영지에서 기다리고 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f3b858c-1e31-c3da-6f44-75cca0b5066d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_State_PartyMemberDead = True
#.   User:
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_AskedAboutServices(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:5f3b858c-1e31-c3da-6f44-75cca0b5066d
msgctxt "h2b21182agb06ag44dagae70g773fe605fc1e"
msgid "I need to resurrect someone."
msgstr "부활시킬 사람이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60b3f077-6533-6afd-26ab-93e847c285c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCE_JergalDebrief_Event_TalkRiddles(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_JergalDebrief_Event_TalkRiddles(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:60b3f077-6533-6afd-26ab-93e847c285c7
msgctxt "hf36377bbge6e2g4985g8d22g765577c8592f"
msgid "You know of these Urges. What can you tell me?"
msgstr "당신은 이 충동을 알고 있군요. 저에게 알려줄 수 있는 게 있나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60dd5574-491f-52af-64e8-c719b6a99013
