#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:6abf3ea8-eeaa-2995-8097-d659689d7bca
msgctxt "h72a77d32g9953g42f5g8dedgc820e1a345dc"
msgid "Two of thy hirelings wait in thy camp."
msgstr "그대가 고용한 두 용병이 야영지에서 기다리고 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c73c747-0734-87da-2166-cf8eae21f323
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
