msgctxt "h84858667g0d81g4cbbga7dcg4007c073b8e5"
msgid ""
"This is the price of balance. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630"
"-9f0a-be548b134c54])"
msgstr ""
"이것이 균형의 대가이니라. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_6057ad05-9492-4630-9f0a-"
"be548b134c54])"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 754c01f1-6936-971e-10be-8da506db5dfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCE_JergalDebrief_Event_WhyHere(1) = False
#.      - CHA_Jergal_HasMet(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_HasMet(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_JergalDebrief_Event_WhyHere(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:754c01f1-6936-971e-10be-8da506db5dfc
msgctxt "h96c729c0g785fg4c3ag958bg815a3de7a8b7"
msgid "Forget that. What are you doing here, Withers?"
msgstr "그 얘긴 됐어요. 여기서 대체 뭐하시는 겁니까, 위더스?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 7830c36e-d71d-bb4c-5f60-612bdb6e36df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:7830c36e-d71d-bb4c-5f60-612bdb6e36df
msgctxt "h8b04ca9ag16e2g4edfga2cfgca146c868103"
msgid "Only thy leader may banish hirelings."
msgstr "오직 그대의 지도자만이 용병을 해산할 수 있다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = 7e098bc1-de87-3e7d-0041-c517949e1062
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:7e098bc1-de87-3e7d-0041-c517949e1062
msgctxt "h8eee5844g8c82g40d1gb4a4gd698ab74ac45"
msgid ""
"Yes. Bane, Lord of Darkness. Bhaal, Lord of Murder. Myrkul, Lord of Bones."
msgstr "그렇네. 어둠의 군주 베인. 살인의 군주 바알. 뼈의 군주 머큘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 801c5552-4458-2c86-d0e2-011b173116e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCE_JergalDebrief_Event_WhyHere(1) = False
#.      - CHA_Jergal_HasMet(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_JergalDebrief_Event_WhyHere(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:801c5552-4458-2c86-d0e2-011b173116e3
msgctxt "hcbc58c0dgfa0fg4d58gbc13g077a5a369f90"
msgid "Forget that. Who are you? What are you doing here?"
msgstr "그 얘긴 됐어요. 당신은 누구시죠? 여기서 대체 뭘 하시는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80fbee61-529a-dd5d-ef5a-8a5c299fd534
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
