#.     - SCE_Jergal_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:b33e01b2-d716-9112-aa99-683b5d2ed023
msgctxt "h25bd2e44gc498g4fc4gbba8gb0c961203f10"
msgid ""
"Thou hast angered thy goddess, yet spared the child of another. A curious "
"turn."
msgstr "그대의 여신의 분노를 사면서 까지 다른 여신의 아이를 살려주었구나. 기묘한 반전이로다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b68a0c60-3cc7-a61e-a143-2cf4a33558de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCE_JergalDebrief_Event_WhyHere(1) = False
#.      - CHA_Jergal_HasMet(1) = False
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_HasMet(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_JergalDebrief_Event_WhyHere(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:b68a0c60-3cc7-a61e-a143-2cf4a33558de
msgctxt "hbe298780g8da1g4adeg8bdcg57a38afc1a3d"
msgid "Forget that. What are you doing here, Withers?"
msgstr "그 얘긴 됐어요. 여기서 대체 뭐하시는 겁니까, 위더스?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
