msgctxt "h7b9580begdb79g4ac7g870cg34207715dcc8"
msgid "Here's the gold."
msgstr "돈은 여기 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = c4fecd29-9578-8c7e-ca50-4663540c9372
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:c4fecd29-9578-8c7e-ca50-4663540c9372
msgctxt "hfc85ceccg1786g4bf6g9a8bg24eabe168580"
msgid "Nothing thou dost not already know."
msgstr "그대가 모르는 것은 알려줄 수 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = c5533dcb-ed8c-22aa-6731-4c2c8a2205a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:c5533dcb-ed8c-22aa-6731-4c2c8a2205a3
msgctxt "h5b735d1bg43c7g47b7ga50aga4a349bc987e"
msgid "Correct."
msgstr "그렇다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = c6fdbbf0-7fc3-39f0-d565-1b9d79c8f82a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:c6fdbbf0-7fc3-39f0-d565-1b9d79c8f82a
msgctxt "h5da4de87g0c77g4f92gba8dg3e40278367c1"
msgid "I shall ask yet again. Do illithids possess souls?"
msgstr "다시 한 번 묻겠네. 일리시드에게는 영혼이 있는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = c82397c0-af79-ccb3-1c0f-01a49124a0a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:c82397c0-af79-ccb3-1c0f-01a49124a0a4
msgctxt "h2a707358gac2eg45d5ga83cg85e86a40a334"
msgid ""
"Seek the daughter of Selûne, whose blood thou left unspilled. There are "
"truths yet to be spoken."
msgstr "그대가 직접 피 흘리지 않게 한 셀루네의 딸을 찾을지어다. 아직 입에 오르지 않은 진실이 있을지니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = cb967f1a-4148-6a95-5474-3ff4e52c3084
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:cb967f1a-4148-6a95-5474-3ff4e52c3084
msgctxt "h345acbf7g0167g4ba5g975dg6dbf6d77283f"
msgid "No. Nor canst thou count mind flayers among them."
msgstr "아니. 그대는 마인드 플레이어가 그들과 같다고 간주해서는 안 될지어다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = cecf9c50-598b-1446-a540-f5ebdc98ce06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - CHA_Jergal_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:cecf9c50-598b-1446-a540-f5ebdc98ce06
msgctxt "h5da6e4f4g448bg4f8cg9916gbbab1e223d6b"
msgid ""
"A flock without souls - yet to what end, mortal? This is the question thou "
"must come to answer."
msgstr "영혼이 없는 무리들을, 어째서 부리려고 하는가? 필멸자여, 이것이 그대가 대답해야 할 질문이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3f5549c-d3f5-1d11-3192-fe82a291d1ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:d3f5549c-d3f5-1d11-3192-fe82a291d1ce
msgctxt "h6465cb7fgadacg416bg8e76ga1cb7ffb4300"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dbbd1ee5-a824-4f2f-9448-b031d0fcc35f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - Hirelings_Dialog_ShowHireling_1(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - Hirelings_Event_DismissHireling_1(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:dbbd1ee5-a824-4f2f-9448-b031d0fcc35f
msgctxt "h5e1d8c34gc6acg4b62g9bbdgf2f8a5fd5018"
msgid ""
"I would like to dismiss "
"[HirelingName_1_03d3080c-4144-7335-8478-a4fb38a54eb9]."
msgstr "[HirelingName_1_03d3080c-4144-7335-8478-a4fb38a54eb9]을(를) 해고하고 싶습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = dc8b01c7-d8de-0eb5-b3f6-51500248f7a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:dc8b01c7-d8de-0eb5-b3f6-51500248f7a3
msgctxt "h99be23a1gd52cg4d32g8836gc26707c74536"
msgid "Very well."
msgstr "좋네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df2a5687-7902-1a1e-b3db-cc4ac4020c2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:df2a5687-7902-1a1e-b3db-cc4ac4020c2d
msgctxt "h9ce9a0bfg917eg4df4gb88ag2d1833f640d2"
msgid "I'm not sure. Don't all living things?"
msgstr "잘 모르겠네요. 모든 생명체에겐 영혼이 있지 않나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = dfab2db4-1a19-7d92-d785-d0c2c8e1c030
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - Hirelings_State_Hired_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:dfab2db4-1a19-7d92-d785-d0c2c8e1c030
msgctxt "he5ad96bcg0d66g4d97ga89dg019eb4e3b59a"
msgid "Thou hast reached thy limit."
msgstr "그대는 그대의 한계에 다다랐다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = ee8aeab0-b301-7198-4110-fb185b195d60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:ee8aeab0-b301-7198-4110-fb185b195d60
msgctxt "h04bd3509gc635g41ddgae61gf541d099c95a"
msgid ""
"This is the price of balance. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410"
"-412d-aba3-875cf81c38ca])"
msgstr ""
"이것이 균형의 대가이니라. ([GEN_CheckMagicPocketGold_2_463b0f43-5410-412d-"
"aba3-875cf81c38ca])"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = efc673e4-c0ae-beae-b695-4c65452f3f89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCE_JergalDebrief_Event_WhyHere(1) = False
#.      - CHA_Jergal_HasMet(1) = True
#.      - CAMP_Jergal_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_JergalDebrief_Event_WhyHere(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:efc673e4-c0ae-beae-b695-4c65452f3f89
msgctxt "hc2f8f67fg6558g41d7ga530g888ff85b99a8"
msgid "I'm surprised to see you. Why are you here?"
msgstr "여기서 보게 돼서 놀랐네요. 왜 여기 계신 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f22ec3dc-c72e-0b11-e65f-a28c6244156e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:f22ec3dc-c72e-0b11-e65f-a28c6244156e
msgctxt "h9e8e7bb5g884dg4375gb005gcdb54791ddb3"
msgid "Never mind."
msgstr "됐습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = f3633eac-72d1-8cd4-e8dd-7fc6a9cfd508
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_Jergal_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:f3633eac-72d1-8cd4-e8dd-7fc6a9cfd508
msgctxt "h528f2be7g8dc4g46adgb180gc0d425ce560c"
msgid "A curse lifted. The Dead Three, allied once more. The balance shifts."
msgstr "저주가 풀려났도다. 죽음의 삼악신이, 다시 한 번 동맹을 맺는구나. 균형이 깨지고 있도다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = f93057a3-b19f-7597-15f5-e2cd840fe1eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:f93057a3-b19f-7597-15f5-e2cd840fe1eb
msgctxt "h5f50ef0cg5b9cg4eefgb40agd99e35aa2e06"
msgid "Thou hast broken thy oath. Before I can aid thee, thou must atone."
msgstr "그대는 그대의 맹세를 저버렸구나. 내가 그대를 도우려면, 먼저 그대가 속죄해야만 한다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief
#. Speaker = Withers
#. NodeID = ff0ff3ad-9284-f774-bdfb-37470414e5c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Jergal_Debrief:ff0ff3ad-9284-f774-bdfb-37470414e5c6
msgctxt "hd019a574gfdf7g4851ga940ge82f4d66ec2b"
msgid "There are many answers to those questions. None are important."
msgstr "그 질문에 대한 답은 무수히 많다네. 모두 부질없지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 00b341fc-8b79-15b4-a21a-6b4e930f1159
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:00b341fc-8b79-15b4-a21a-6b4e930f1159
msgctxt "h79cf6502g146fg4c0cga3eeg39895a2145dd"
msgid ""
"Well, you're not the most nimble-looking - but seems like it did the trick."
msgstr "글쎄, 너도 그다지 잽싼 놈처럼 보이진 않는데, 그래도 그게 먹힌 거 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1c0c3189-dac3-1876-00e5-739bad083e9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:1c0c3189-dac3-1876-00e5-739bad083e9a
msgctxt "hc2ff7fefgd1cbg4d0ag858bga0b21f564a7c"
msgid ""
"Oh don't you worry - I gave Ketheric a rather nasty poke on Mol's behalf."
msgstr "걱정하지 마 - 케서릭과 싸울 때 몰의 몫까지 패줬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 1db08f27-aeba-c6a8-c302-004c8fe88581
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:1db08f27-aeba-c6a8-c302-004c8fe88581
msgctxt "h0c9f90cdg69fag4288g9104g29ff7d6142e3"
msgid ""
"Uh, well done on that, though! I'm just focusing on getting the others ready "
"to go."
msgstr "그래도 잘해줬어! 난 다른 사람들이 준비하는 걸 돕던 참이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f1e0ee6-8356-6c0f-9de7-4d610ace0ac0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:1f1e0ee6-8356-6c0f-9de7-4d610ace0ac0
msgctxt "hcd424d6bg62f0g41eeg861fgafeb03391ddf"
msgid "About Mol - I found her eyepatch."
msgstr "몰의 소식인데, 걔가 쓰던 안대를 찾았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 25bd6414-45c8-7da1-4408-7f448ee16293
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:25bd6414-45c8-7da1-4408-7f448ee16293
msgctxt "he6adc7b5g4b8fg47a2ga7b8g28465f17e79a"
msgid "No... but she'll turn up at some point. That's just how Mol is."
msgstr "당장은 안 보이지만 언젠가는 나타날 거야. 몰이 원래 그렇거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2674eb80-4fd8-b070-c108-88a90741c178
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:2674eb80-4fd8-b070-c108-88a90741c178
msgctxt "h4ccc9cd9g156eg4490ga668g60c54e0c93e0"
msgid "<i>Say nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무 말도 하지 않는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2fed0971-a22c-3731-5388-d425ee0ee061
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:2fed0971-a22c-3731-5388-d425ee0ee061
msgctxt "hc11b42eeg2eacg460ag87c5gefbbc846fbc0"
msgid "It's all right - I'm sure Mol will be waiting for you at Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "괜찮을 거야. 몰이라면 분명 발더스 게이트에서 너를 기다리고 있을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 35f8bb54-7dd3-a88b-7593-33e8e60f7b0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:35f8bb54-7dd3-a88b-7593-33e8e60f7b0a
msgctxt "h2b241621gfc0cg42dfg933bg3ed911fd5e06"
msgid "Be careful - there's still plenty of dangers on the road."
msgstr "조심해 - 아직 도로는 위험해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3cafce85-f860-cd69-d94b-f754f6e78d5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:3cafce85-f860-cd69-d94b-f754f6e78d5b
msgctxt "h4dd6a509gca8fg4dedg9daagb1df33056699"
msgid "It was a matter of skill - and he was lacking."
msgstr "기술의 싸움이었어. 그리고 그놈은 부족했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3eabafe4-a3aa-b090-cc48-4b60ac0dbebe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:3eabafe4-a3aa-b090-cc48-4b60ac0dbebe
msgctxt "h83c468f7g4a57g4412gad3bg95f63287d5aa"
msgid "So what's the plan now?"
msgstr "그래서 앞으로의 계획은 어떻게 돼?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 425b1578-a5d1-2e20-ecc9-1996e19dfe20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Mattis_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_BackupLeader_State_Dead = False
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_Unavailable = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:425b1578-a5d1-2e20-ecc9-1996e19dfe20
msgctxt "h33bbc460g75d7g4d5egb462g3ad1bd1f376c"
msgid "I said thank you - what more do you want? I'm a busy man, you know."
msgstr "고맙다고 했는데 뭘 더 바라는 거야? 나 바쁜 거 잘 알잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e650eb8-d1ec-503c-4d31-4ee31129b8c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:4e650eb8-d1ec-503c-4d31-4ee31129b8c5
msgctxt "h1756fc97g6c00g4727g9a7ag4e397f2f81fe"
msgid "Mol's not here with the rest of you?"
msgstr "몰은 어디갔어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 526772b5-fbaf-c8b0-929d-26955a8027f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:526772b5-fbaf-c8b0-929d-26955a8027f3
msgctxt "hfde5c2c9gc2dcg4053g9340g93749194a53a"
msgid "<i>You'll</i> be leading the way? I doubt it."
msgstr "<i>네</i>가 앞장서겠다고? 영 못미더운데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56efe83b-ed2a-ecc7-e248-b23b221ce30c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BALDURIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:56efe83b-ed2a-ecc7-e248-b23b221ce30c
msgctxt "hee1cfdfegb5d7g41a8ga5f1g9c8ab4782821"
msgid "Just make sure to keep your wits about you - the city's no playground."
msgstr "재치있게 잘 해보도록 해 - 도시는 놀이터가 아니니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 5717a797-a7c2-6fd2-f613-d080de3205a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_BackupLeader_State_Dead = True
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_Unavailable = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Mattis_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:5717a797-a7c2-6fd2-f613-d080de3205a1
msgctxt "h582c2b79g3d81g4140gb9dfg37b0fe9a25eb"
msgid ""
"Wish I could've seen you putting Ketheric in his place - must have been "
"quite the spectacle."
msgstr "케서릭을 물리치는 모습을 봤으면 했는데... 분명 장관이었을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 5819d587-4ef1-881e-6d2f-c5ecc4f198ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:5819d587-4ef1-881e-6d2f-c5ecc4f198ba
msgctxt "hc32467a6g7e7fg4147ga80fg61acfc6d3115"
msgid "In fact, I bet we'll even get there first."
msgstr "아마 너보다 우리가 먼저 도착할걸?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 5b08c483-b4dd-fc39-61db-870b887d766e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:5b08c483-b4dd-fc39-61db-870b887d766e
msgctxt "h7e647799g6e6bg468eg9968g91d860300359"
msgid "Yeah, I think you still have some of him on you..."
msgstr "그러네, 아직도 살점이 너한테 묻어있는 것 같아..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 5d27b983-39c6-90fe-83ba-42022ee9db27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:5d27b983-39c6-90fe-83ba-42022ee9db27
msgctxt "hfa03246agcf7eg4649g8b38g123667b1d23e"
msgid ""
"You think any of those corpses are gonna do it? Well, then - guess it'll "
"<i>have</i> to be me."
msgstr "그럼 저기 널린 시체가 길을 안내해줄 것 같아? 나밖에 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6182aaff-b488-ae12-7ce3-366760be1742
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:6182aaff-b488-ae12-7ce3-366760be1742
msgctxt "hd44d6a9agce6fg46fdgb551gc4252d857eec"
msgid "Where are the others?"
msgstr "다른 사람들은 어디에 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 61840d75-55f2-377c-94b5-53cc21abe41a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:61840d75-55f2-377c-94b5-53cc21abe41a
msgctxt "h2c3909efg2d77g4486ga387gb3de4cee735d"
msgid "Yes, yes, big hero, got it - I'll keep an eye out."
msgstr "네, 네. 잘나가는 영웅님, 알았다구요. 조심하죠 뭐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 6a6a76a0-6eb0-300c-d27c-d1de15245025
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Mattis_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Knows_MolMissingEyepatch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:6a6a76a0-6eb0-300c-d27c-d1de15245025
msgctxt "h1e586e55g7beag41a9gae9bgd80e75abcfaf"
msgid ""
"I'm gonna get everyone to Baldur's Gate safely - and Mol'll be there to "
"welcome us."
msgstr "모두를 발더스 게이트로 안전하게 안내하고 나면 몰이 우릴 반겨줄 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c047671-3b7a-a0c0-c92f-b1af6c2bd439
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:6c047671-3b7a-a0c0-c92f-b1af6c2bd439
msgctxt "h63d12cf8ge20bg4881ga813gf9cd7f00047b"
msgid ""
"The others are in good hands - looking forward to seeing you at Baldur's "
"Gate."
msgstr "다른 일들도 잘 될 거야 - 발더스 게이트에서 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 6c10908a-5d47-3688-d67b-648a07a2f2fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:6c10908a-5d47-3688-d67b-648a07a2f2fb
msgctxt "ha49f0939g13beg4b2ag937fg719d469bd2b5"
msgid ""
"Besides, she wouldn't us to wait for her anyway. Just got to get the others "
"in line, now."
msgstr "게다가, 우리가 기다리는 걸 바라지도 않을 거야. 지금은 우선 다른 사람들이 준비를 마칠 수 있도록 도와줘야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 6fdad880-9202-a753-4939-1b891474b886
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:6fdad880-9202-a753-4939-1b891474b886
msgctxt "h453bff01gf83cg4f03g8890g54625648e977"
msgid ""
"Exactly! And we'll definitely feel her wrath if she thinks we ever doubted "
"her."
msgstr "당연하지! 우리가 그녈 의심한 걸 들키면 화낼 게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 73ff6312-a9d9-37c9-dc2a-63d137acca54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:73ff6312-a9d9-37c9-dc2a-63d137acca54
msgctxt "ha8075daeg8ce0g4d51g8f75g9d9a040792bd"
msgid "Oh you most <i>definitely </i>will, pal."
msgstr "어우 아주 <i>분명히</i>그럴거야, 친구."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 8171a9f1-f83e-9009-6070-38c7c976c0c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Knows_MeanAboutMol = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:8171a9f1-f83e-9009-6070-38c7c976c0c4
msgctxt "ha58125b8gb63cg436egb6bcgf2c89fb25f17"
msgid ""
"<i>She is not! </i>Look, get lost, all right? You're letting this hero stuff "
"go to your head."
msgstr "<i>안 죽었어! </i> 봐, 저리 좀 꺼져, 응? 영웅이라도 된 것처럼 잘난 척하지 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 8309ca5f-9626-6871-ffc5-d6193e410e49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:8309ca5f-9626-6871-ffc5-d6193e410e49
msgctxt "hb10316d0g745dg426cga567g4b7a746a2bf0"
msgid ""
"You and me both! Now I just need to wrangle the others and we'll be on our "
"way."
msgstr "나도 실망이 클 거야! 자, 이제 다른 사람들만 준비시키면 출발할 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 831e70c1-8b41-ed8e-3033-04ab3fb978eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Mattis_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:831e70c1-8b41-ed8e-3033-04ab3fb978eb
msgctxt "h9e70a9f3g52e0g47e8g96d2gc23c0f7c9dcd"
msgid ""
"Why, yes - once Alfira's done with this song, we <i>will </i>be looking for "
"patrons. All coppers welcome, pal."
msgstr "알피라의 공연이 끝나고 나면 후원자들을 찾아봐야겠어. 돈이 된다면 뭐든 환영이라구."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c3bab71-df14-9f89-a7fc-7f6723f63461
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:8c3bab71-df14-9f89-a7fc-7f6723f63461
msgctxt "h9dbd6b71gdcf5g4d7egaeb7g7cd6361ac54c"
msgid "It's all right - I'm sure Mol will be waiting for you at Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "다 잘될거야. 분명 몰이라면 발더스 게이트에 먼저 도착해서 너를 기다리고 있을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 980d2ddc-533a-593c-d11d-521e98434aa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:980d2ddc-533a-593c-d11d-521e98434aa1
msgctxt "h86ced690g44e1g4c9bg91e1g7f0ead30720c"
msgid ""
"I'm glad you asked! For now, I've got the others scavenging supplies for the "
"road."
msgstr "물어봐줘서 고마워! 당장은 도로에서 보급품이 될만한 걸 뒤지고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = 98e10f7a-c6e5-622c-63b5-777fdc479290
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:98e10f7a-c6e5-622c-63b5-777fdc479290
msgctxt "hefc354b7g8e4cg4f2bg9845g74ca709761b7"
msgid "I'm putting my own skills to use getting the others ready to leave."
msgstr "나는 내 기술을 살려서 다른 사람들이 떠날 채비하는 걸 돕는 중이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = a38210ea-341a-69a5-b971-25b128c3b2ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Knows_MolMissingEyepatch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:a38210ea-341a-69a5-b971-25b128c3b2ce
msgctxt "h207e7178gf548g48dcg90acg21944890ee51"
msgid ""
"So? It's just Mol's eyepatch. She's lost loads of them. That doesn't mean "
"<i>anything</i>."
msgstr "그래서? 몰이 쓰다가 잃어버린 안대가 한 두 장이어야지. 이거 하나로는 <i>아무런 의미</i>도 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6bf98f4-b0c2-ec13-2753-38d613b83259
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:a6bf98f4-b0c2-ec13-2753-38d613b83259
msgctxt "hc83c08fdg1ca1g4869ga5d8g6839030b7024"
msgid "Mol's dead - you and I both know it. Death happens. Grow up."
msgstr "몰은 죽었어 - 너도 알잖아. 누구든 죽는 법이야. 철 좀 들어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = a7bf98aa-ead9-d448-0f59-edc51c2c18ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:a7bf98aa-ead9-d448-0f59-edc51c2c18ad
msgctxt "hea8b5057g7185g43e6ga607g2cc4fb4cbda1"
msgid "I've put them to use scavenging supplies for the journey."
msgstr "여행길에 쓸 만한 물건이라도 주워 오라고 시켰지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = ad3d5f6a-7a29-d97f-4694-4b9020df8bd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:ad3d5f6a-7a29-d97f-4694-4b9020df8bd2
msgctxt "h13b67c92g53bdg4ef0gbbc9g47ee06379adb"
msgid ""
"Once they've packed up everything, I'll be leading us all on to Baldur's "
"Gate."
msgstr "준비가 끝나는 대로 내가 발더스 게이트로 안내할 생각이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = b7f2201c-a83a-7d48-cdcf-0c614d1bef57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Mattis_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:b7f2201c-a83a-7d48-cdcf-0c614d1bef57
msgctxt "he7ebdd71g533cg46c2g97d0g501eb9d32d03"
msgid ""
"On second thoughts, I think we could be earning silver with this song - "
"maybe even gold..."
msgstr "다시 생각해보니 이 노래로 돈 좀 만질 수 있을 것 같아 - 아니, 어쩌면 아주 많이..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = c13fda9a-e01f-0351-1240-e2734fbd60cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:c13fda9a-e01f-0351-1240-e2734fbd60cb
msgctxt "hb7c9d291g39e7g4fd2gb497gb700e1dd90bc"
msgid "Did you want something or are you just here to stir?"
msgstr "필요한 게 뭐야? 그냥 분위기 망치러 온 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = c4612b67-34ce-777a-ac7c-aa5b8f2ac2e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:c4612b67-34ce-777a-ac7c-aa5b8f2ac2e6
msgctxt "hfc23bcf7g050fg40d5gb1bbgad178c807289"
msgid "Mol would've shanked him up proper."
msgstr "몰이 있었다면 제대로 혼쭐을 내줬을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd5600ee-771d-8235-a2c3-f99ecc22ba5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:cd5600ee-771d-8235-a2c3-f99ecc22ba5a
msgctxt "hd9efce4dg4439g4fc5g9b68g8cd1c4701da4"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d26a0fb0-18b1-8449-e67b-a2fdea3e5374
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:d26a0fb0-18b1-8449-e67b-a2fdea3e5374
msgctxt "h3ebc4a41g71c9g4c65gae36g8ae17f9ae46f"
msgid "Mol's dead - you and I both know it. Death happens. Grow up."
msgstr "몰은 죽었어 - 너도 알잖아. 누구든 죽는 법이야. 철 좀 들어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d8ed2eb7-1437-3d6d-0e56-a89d8ba936b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:d8ed2eb7-1437-3d6d-0e56-a89d8ba936b2
msgctxt "h0521cd36g389cg4779ga692gc2ea63dd7dcd"
msgid "I found Mol's eyepatch."
msgstr "몰의 안대를 찾았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3dfadb9-4c01-1b4e-3cfb-783138a5b448
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:e3dfadb9-4c01-1b4e-3cfb-783138a5b448
msgctxt "h39fdee9ag61a1g4c57gabc3g8d7e4084b7c2"
msgid "Not likely - you could have gotten hurt."
msgstr "그럴 가능성은 낮아. 네가 다칠 수도 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e56ff596-ce0a-0d08-87b5-b862df161779
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:e56ff596-ce0a-0d08-87b5-b862df161779
msgctxt "h22c0c85cg3e0cg4f51ga714gbe3e2966dc61"
msgid "I crushed him to pulp."
msgstr "내가 그놈이 곤죽이 될 때까지 으깨 버렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = e7740a00-1bd4-a1d5-56fd-5bccaf57e659
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Mattis_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Knows_MolMissingEyepatch = True
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Knows_MeanAboutMol = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:e7740a00-1bd4-a1d5-56fd-5bccaf57e659
msgctxt "hdf476218g1e7bg48efg91e8g240f61b09aae"
msgid "I said <i>get lost</i>, hero."
msgstr "분명 <i>꺼지라고</i> 말했는데, 영웅 씨."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = eaa38289-fa38-cf3a-b726-9ae54b9a6d2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:eaa38289-fa38-cf3a-b726-9ae54b9a6d2a
msgctxt "h9f371745g4848g4995g932eg434ad83120c9"
msgid "Pft - I've made it this far, ain't I? Better than some of the adults."
msgstr "흥 - 난 아직까지도 잘 살아남았잖아? 몇몇 어른들보다도 낫다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = f025ebec-904e-837d-c757-abe877b6a672
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_BackupLeader_State_Dead = False
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_Unavailable = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Mattis_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:f025ebec-904e-837d-c757-abe877b6a672
msgctxt "h37e829efg7a7cg42e4g92e4g1d6a3f68d696"
msgid ""
"Well done putting Ketheric in his place - couldn't have done it better "
"myself."
msgstr "케서릭을 물리쳤다던데 수고했어 - 난 꿈도 못 꾸는 일이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f28f5906-c3d0-294b-5601-82e4d8d72e9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:f28f5906-c3d0-294b-5601-82e4d8d72e9a
msgctxt "h6f8c8664g98bfg4924g819cg59a87dfa5cdc"
msgid "If tales aren't told of it for years to come, I'll be disappointed."
msgstr "몇 년 안에 내 이야기가 노래로 불리지 않는다면 실망스러울 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2e6774a-2965-0068-741d-92961207a3c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:f2e6774a-2965-0068-741d-92961207a3c2
msgctxt "h21647055g33f8g426cgbfceg334fca245d4b"
msgid "I just thought Mol would be here with the rest of you."
msgstr "몰이 너희들과 함께 있을 줄 알았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = fb48c3fc-322a-db53-fb8a-0540befc6482
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Mattis_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_BackupLeader_State_Dead = True
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_Unavailable = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:fb48c3fc-322a-db53-fb8a-0540befc6482
msgctxt "h9fa91bcegc752g43c6gb6e0g97a9f646fd45"
msgid ""
"Don't think you're gonna get to Baldur's Gate before us - not with me at the "
"helm."
msgstr "여기는 내가 지휘하고 있으니까, 우리보다 먼저 발더스 게이트에 도착할 거란 생각은 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = fc54bead-c31a-d86c-863d-13bbbdcea6e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Mattis:fc54bead-c31a-d86c-863d-13bbbdcea6e9
msgctxt "h0afab36ag8678g4119gb830gcbcc335aa39e"
msgid "<i>Please</i> - with that smug mug, you're more of a kid than I am."
msgstr "우쭐해하는 표정 좀 봐. 니가 더 어려보여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 004ee2f6-b347-552f-a0a3-4503ec83849f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:004ee2f6-b347-552f-a0a3-4503ec83849f
msgctxt "h359ce416g79a8g46beg9790g4640be0162d7"
msgid ""
"A wise ploy, and it was successful, to an extent. We did not find a cure, "
"but we found our purpose."
msgstr "어느 정도 현명하고 성공적인 전략이었어. 치료법은 못 찾았어도 목적은 찾았으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 006240b5-e5fc-9327-dd8a-c314b91bed09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:006240b5-e5fc-9327-dd8a-c314b91bed09
msgctxt "h29502d21g6179g43c0g8f5bga1ae42f2eeb6"
msgid ""
"Perhaps in time, I can help direct your violence. Until then, I will watch "
"my back."
msgstr "아마 시간이 지나면 네 폭력성을 다스리는 걸 도와줄 수 있을 거야. 그때까지는, 내가 조심해야겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 00aa0d23-0eba-c98d-8575-148f6b4324ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:00aa0d23-0eba-c98d-8575-148f6b4324ba
msgctxt "h2d55e29dg708bg4324g8f69gfe3b9c631e39"
msgid "Are you in control of your actions now?"
msgstr "이젠 자기 행동을 통제할 수 있겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01262652-bf53-7096-b4ef-ccad6bca44f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:01262652-bf53-7096-b4ef-ccad6bca44f5
msgctxt "hc3bd9d6bg98adg46a5g9548g7dfaf4156e76"
msgid "I'm with you."
msgstr "그래, 해 보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 039fc55d-c86e-c6c2-fba6-556fdbdcb8b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:039fc55d-c86e-c6c2-fba6-556fdbdcb8b0
msgctxt "hbd32ecb2gdfa7g4cc9gaec4g66d1f66ccd88"
msgid ""
"I like the deliberate nature of the lie even less than the disorder of your "
"actions."
msgstr "네가 거짓말할 때 보이는 신중함이 무질서한 행동보단 마음에 드는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 05a48c4e-27ff-121d-d90e-11985b21dd04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BHAAL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:05a48c4e-27ff-121d-d90e-11985b21dd04
msgctxt "h0b883e5fg08b8g4e58g93a2g1bc79d747e9f"
msgid "When I murder her, Bhaal will choose me in her place."
msgstr "내가 그녀를 살해하면 바알이 그녀의 빈자리에 나를 세울 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 06bb37cd-d9fd-fe0c-1db6-381000fcfb9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - f69d373d-d9c3-007f-666d-4122cb3ec56f_SCE_Minthara_MentionedPower = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:06bb37cd-d9fd-fe0c-1db6-381000fcfb9f
msgctxt "ha884ec89g1c2dg4787g9608gfdab96ab6a69"
msgid "Power always has. But I shall not get too comfortable here."
msgstr "권력이라는 게 나와 잘 어울리는 편이지. 하지만 여기서 만족할 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 0b5e2e4c-ad56-037a-3864-9e3f0adf3d1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:0b5e2e4c-ad56-037a-3864-9e3f0adf3d1e
msgctxt "hfa626062g15dag4462g95e9g00ed1bbde297"
msgid "And they will pose a greater threat than Ketheric."
msgstr "그리고 그들은 케서릭보다 더 큰 위협이 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 0bcf95f7-8a50-c52a-637b-3ab2cebe8fdc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:0bcf95f7-8a50-c52a-637b-3ab2cebe8fdc
msgctxt "h632824e7g6a4bg4ffeg8123gc123cd11aac0"
msgid ""
"I go where my enemies are, and they are not here in the shadows. They are in "
"Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "난 적이 있을 곳을 찾아 다니지. 이 그림자 속이 아니라, 발더스 게이트 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c38eb74-aa07-bbd6-31f1-8bff3e825f73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:0c38eb74-aa07-bbd6-31f1-8bff3e825f73
msgctxt "h2d9be154g6ea4g4f9bgb87fg379c78de4c1d"
msgid "An old flame?"
msgstr "아직도 추앙하는 건 아니겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d9341ed-6c51-0db7-9f5b-9f350996e23b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:0d9341ed-6c51-0db7-9f5b-9f350996e23b
msgctxt "hac1e67c1gbff8g48d0g8a58g20bb6d4c8f37"
msgid "I fear we could lose everything if we try to take control."
msgstr "우리가 통제권을 가지려 든다면 모든 걸 잃어버릴 것 같은 불안한 느낌이 들어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 1300427b-9d6f-954e-8f08-7a4fdec34727
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:1300427b-9d6f-954e-8f08-7a4fdec34727
msgctxt "hdba2d91egc518g4f5cgaebcg0c7415ed53ba"
msgid "But you had the Prism, did you not? So the Absolute was not the cause."
msgstr "하지만 프리즘이 있었잖아? 그럼 절대자가 조종한 경우는 아니겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 14825f17-2c00-8c70-d2ce-8a34e5fc8ef2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:14825f17-2c00-8c70-d2ce-8a34e5fc8ef2
msgctxt "h918dd5f1g8e1eg48a0gb098ge5fbe6c0b5c7"
msgid ""
"If there is a way to turn this design toward slaughter rather than control, "
"she will take it."
msgstr "계획의 목표를 지배가 아닌 살육으로 삼을 수 있다면, 기꺼이 그렇게 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 14a77750-ddca-bb66-7abf-f78257f18e18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:14a77750-ddca-bb66-7abf-f78257f18e18
msgctxt "h95b1bb83g1bbcg46e1gb48fgf676d40f5b32"
msgid "I am satisfied."
msgstr "만족스러운 대답이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 15ffa4a0-8db3-546e-e389-886b73da5b30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:15ffa4a0-8db3-546e-e389-886b73da5b30
msgctxt "h6805091bgd643g4b8agaff2gc56f281a2e7a"
msgid "Now I know that those memories are lies."
msgstr "이제 그 기억들이 거짓임을 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 16a9f2d0-1bbf-233b-da6f-d83a9956f78b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:16a9f2d0-1bbf-233b-da6f-d83a9956f78b
msgctxt "hd054a28egdd21g4db5g935cgbfc66b0ca595"
msgid "We'll be heroes - the saviours of Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "우리는 발더스 게이트의 구원자, 영웅으로 불리겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 16dd05b3-fef1-9e31-7796-2e60b8425c2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:16dd05b3-fef1-9e31-7796-2e60b8425c2b
msgctxt "h0a834cb1g8c21g4e5fgb637g40ae59142f89"
msgid "Madness. We need to eradicate the cult and the elder brain."
msgstr "미친 짓이야. 교단과 엘더 브레인은 뿌리 뽑혀야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 1794187d-6db6-f1c9-0d69-acbafce3b855
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:1794187d-6db6-f1c9-0d69-acbafce3b855
msgctxt "he4ae60d6g8b7cg4ec3gb967g7ee72f37b405"
msgid "It was more of an idea than an entity. Pure love. Total power."
msgstr "그건 존재라기보단 관념에 가까운, 순수한 사랑이자 완전한 힘이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 193878c8-71d0-a34f-7daf-cc7d3539ec9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:193878c8-71d0-a34f-7daf-cc7d3539ec9b
msgctxt "hbc531f54g0420g4798g93d1g9d195f994d4a"
msgid "Indeed. And now we know that he was not acting alone."
msgstr "맞아. 그리고 케서릭이 혼자서 모든 걸 꾸민 게 아니라는 점도 분명해졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 1d563e35-c67e-bbd8-d92c-29363c6e7fde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Leave(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:1d563e35-c67e-bbd8-d92c-29363c6e7fde
msgctxt "hb919af8ag0715g44bdg9bedg2448ee89fe33"
msgid "My time will come. With or without you."
msgstr "너와 함께이든 아니든, 곧 나의 시간이 올 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e631c5b-47c6-b628-400a-46bce32bbbbf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:1e631c5b-47c6-b628-400a-46bce32bbbbf
msgctxt "h8bb80333gb27bg423agb817ga5c3b58d74f1"
msgid ""
"There was another with Ketheric - Gortash. Do you know anything about him?"
msgstr "케서릭 옆에 고타쉬라는 놈도 있었어. 그 자에 대해서 뭔가 아는 게 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ebb8228-1d74-33df-d4cb-5a98333d01fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:1ebb8228-1d74-33df-d4cb-5a98333d01fc
msgctxt "h3a381272g4d5bg4fefga9e6ge5256276d1ba"
msgid "You can stay with me if you swear to follow my lead."
msgstr "내 명령을 따를 거라 맹세한다면 내 곁에 남아있도록 허락하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fe9e6c6-0e8e-6014-37ad-919dd879c298
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - LOLTHDROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:1fe9e6c6-0e8e-6014-37ad-919dd879c298
msgctxt "hdd627cdcg5c52g4531gac7ag6a3e4c80c013"
msgid ""
"You deserve a chance to return to Lolth's side. I could not let you die "
"worshipping a false god."
msgstr "롤쓰님께 돌아갈 기회를 주고 싶었으니까. 가짜 신을 섬기며 죽게 놔둘 순 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21a5cedd-2ee9-08e4-c718-5a445e91c2bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:21a5cedd-2ee9-08e4-c718-5a445e91c2bb
msgctxt "hbaefaafbg1245g46fegad98ga23161fc9aaa"
msgid "So it's personal? Good - let's take her down."
msgstr "개인적인 감정이 남아 있는 건가? 잘됐네, 없애버리자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22cb3e26-703d-423b-45db-0a2bb61172a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:22cb3e26-703d-423b-45db-0a2bb61172a2
msgctxt "hc2920088g1aa5g4b23ga2a0g8ccb8dee634f"
msgid ""
"I thought that if I could free you from the Absolute's control, you might be "
"a worthy ally."
msgstr "널 절대자의 손아귀에서 빼내면, 좋은 동료가 될 수 있을지도 모른다고 생각했으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22ddcb04-4d43-b59c-c550-4354fabd013a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:22ddcb04-4d43-b59c-c550-4354fabd013a
msgctxt "h1e24a997g6914g44eeg8846gdc3ff57039fd"
msgid "What would we do with that power?"
msgstr "그 힘으로 뭘 할 생각이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 24ab8abf-e534-e923-fa7f-b8300f212b81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:24ab8abf-e534-e923-fa7f-b8300f212b81
msgctxt "he5144a5egeaefg4bd1g97d9ge1324a463a34"
msgid "I expected you would be, but know this..."
msgstr "그럴 거라 생각했어. 하지만 이걸 알아둬..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 25d30cf1-baeb-55cc-45fa-d8c7118c5e76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:25d30cf1-baeb-55cc-45fa-d8c7118c5e76
msgctxt "he21f4f29g20e8g4c5eg9ecbg88b31908c2ba"
msgid ""
"You are not stupid. When we reach Baldur's Gate and face the other Chosen, "
"you will see that my way is the right one."
msgstr "생각보다 멍청하진 않군. 우리가 발더스 게이트에 도착해서 선택받은 자들과 마주했을 때 내 방식이 옳았다는 걸 알게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26336f95-26de-f541-1b93-72649e759747
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:26336f95-26de-f541-1b93-72649e759747
msgctxt "h7903dc44g0147g4518gbb92g10325bd06049"
msgid "Stealing an <i>entire cult</i> is a new one, even for me."
msgstr "<i>교단을 통째로</i> 훔치는 건 나도 처음 해보는 일인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 276020bc-c7cf-a318-d339-4f1f694a537c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:276020bc-c7cf-a318-d339-4f1f694a537c
msgctxt "h47191d8bga4bag47eagb109ge1bb79243075"
msgid ""
"The power of the enslaved elder brain could reshape the world. <i>We</i> "
"could reshape the world."
msgstr "사로잡힌 엘더브레인의 힘은 세상을 뒤바꿀 정도야. <i>우리</i>가 세상을 바꿀 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 27b956b8-942c-099b-d6a3-ed78c5954fd5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Jaheira_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:27b956b8-942c-099b-d6a3-ed78c5954fd5
msgctxt "he3e409aag82eag43b3g885cg004778b8055c"
msgid ""
"The Harper may know more - her precious Baldur's Gate was the soil that "
"nourished his growth."
msgstr "하퍼들도 아는 게 많을 거야 - 그들이 아끼는 발더스 게이트가 놈의 성장을 위한 밑거름이 된 셈이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2bb5ce6a-62b7-6e42-dab5-3d075bd8ad20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:2bb5ce6a-62b7-6e42-dab5-3d075bd8ad20
msgctxt "hb6e63245g72a5g4f2agb1a4g0f730f568b36"
msgid ""
"Walking away wouldn't have helped. While the tadpole lives, I can't be free."
msgstr "도망치는 건 답이 될 수 없어. 올챙이가 살아 있는 한, 난 절대 자유롭지 못할 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e2d8319-c48e-bf94-8396-a6c4b8c91342
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:2e2d8319-c48e-bf94-8396-a6c4b8c91342
msgctxt "h5f5da19bgb0d1g429agac24g8b5ff3877cfa"
msgid "Is vengeance the limit of your ambitions?"
msgstr "네 야망은 고작 복수로 끝인 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ebe8cd6-c5c7-3bfb-1432-2e31d3002f3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:2ebe8cd6-c5c7-3bfb-1432-2e31d3002f3f
msgctxt "hb299f452g576dg4385g85f5ga9ea180eec53"
msgid "To impress you."
msgstr "너에게 잘 보이고 싶어서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34b0e1d9-aa42-08f0-84ef-bdef3ec82e95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:34b0e1d9-aa42-08f0-84ef-bdef3ec82e95
msgctxt "hddbd7a4cgded9g4f6agafbcg88ea92704cb4"
msgid "To watch them suffer - I need no other reason than that."
msgstr "그 녀석들의 얼굴이 고통으로 일그러지는 걸 보고 싶어서. 그 이상의 이유는 필요 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34e41314-0c4e-f54d-8325-b9933bad4bb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:34e41314-0c4e-f54d-8325-b9933bad4bb8
msgctxt "h3b4035c7gd72fg4e34g9e0dgf3984d0fa0db"
msgid "Completely."
msgstr "완전히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 36d54345-742c-d95d-bbd5-cf7863b23b17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:36d54345-742c-d95d-bbd5-cf7863b23b17
msgctxt "hebe35a47ge97eg4b7fg8babga5da336f657d"
msgid ""
"We have a purpose and a bond. By my oath, I will fight with you while that "
"purpose holds."
msgstr "우리에게는 목적과 유대가 있지. 내 맹세하노니, 그 목적이 유지되는 한, 네 곁에서 싸우도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 373e8585-7b23-ae6c-5e39-63e7b19826b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:373e8585-7b23-ae6c-5e39-63e7b19826b7
msgctxt "h764f9b49g5f20g45d4ga4bfg8145a3c5560f"
msgid "Most of the time."
msgstr "보통은."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 3b942bc6-e718-05fb-e354-6ed71f47e065
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:3b942bc6-e718-05fb-e354-6ed71f47e065
msgctxt "ha96a6d5bg16cdg49b7g843ag25b3ba006218"
msgid ""
"Let them think that. There is a short path from saviour to ruler - a short "
"and <i>bloody</i> path. I know it well, and we will walk it together."
msgstr ""
"그렇게들 생각하라고 내버려 둬. 구원자에서 지배자로 향하는 <i>피투성이</i> 길은 짧아. 나는 그 길을 잘 알고 있고, 우리는 그 "
"길로 함께 나아갈 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 3eb174c8-c93f-51da-8f6a-260a4270e7b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:3eb174c8-c93f-51da-8f6a-260a4270e7b2
msgctxt "hd4e774b3gca48g450aga3acg976bef9d4eeb"
msgid ""
"Good. Whatever afflicted you, we can leave it in the past, like the corpses "
"in the Grove."
msgstr "좋아. 널 고통스럽게 했던 건 과거에 묻어버려. 무덤 속의 시체처럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ebea26c-fa8c-5fa9-4311-305249b67b59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:3ebea26c-fa8c-5fa9-4311-305249b67b59
msgctxt "he3d739beg057ag41ffgba3agfc834da5077c"
msgid "What do you remember of your indoctrination?"
msgstr "세뇌에 대해서 뭔가 기억나는 게 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 460e5c66-b162-1bfe-f701-06d93ff93015
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:460e5c66-b162-1bfe-f701-06d93ff93015
msgctxt "h6f237a30gfd4ag48abg9b74gfa349205a2bd"
msgid "No. An omnipresent authority figure controls all of my actions."
msgstr "아니. 절대적인 존재가 내 행동을 통제하는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 479c8825-10f9-d334-0d03-c4c526ac0b10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_MintharaInvolvedInShowdown = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:479c8825-10f9-d334-0d03-c4c526ac0b10
msgctxt "hcdcc9ac5g82dfg4dfdga646ga7d0b41ef1c1"
msgid ""
"My blood ran hot when we broke Ketheric's bones together. But we have "
"greater challenges ahead of us."
msgstr "너와 함께 케서릭의 뼈를 부술 때 피가 끓어올랐어. 하지만 더 큰 도전들이 우리를 기다리고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48b6cc5a-f1cb-6a03-dc1c-3b263a6afc23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:48b6cc5a-f1cb-6a03-dc1c-3b263a6afc23
msgctxt "hdeea0b37g5a90g4cbegb688g257590c6bbf3"
msgid "It suits you."
msgstr "너에게 잘 어울려."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 48eabf3a-11cb-60d6-b410-279eaec58c97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:48eabf3a-11cb-60d6-b410-279eaec58c97
msgctxt "hc71a5c5agd352g4fdcgb2b1gd51d6f1d8319"
msgid ""
"There was no god. Orin held me down in a cocoon of flesh, while a mind "
"flayer forced a parasite into my brain. And she laughed at my fear."
msgstr ""
"신은 없었어. 오린은 나를 살의 고치 속에 가둬두고, 마인드 플레이어가 내 뇌에 기생충을 강제로 박아넣을 때, 내 두려움을 비웃었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 49ee1edf-df32-6374-7f3a-59be58ab372e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:49ee1edf-df32-6374-7f3a-59be58ab372e
msgctxt "haed323bbg18fdg42f7gabf5gcae4c1bbdcf2"
msgid "A bold gamble. How can you be sure it's possible?"
msgstr "과감한 도박인데. 어떻게 그게 가능할 거라 확신해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 4efee68b-01e6-6b3a-043b-274bba10f021
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:4efee68b-01e6-6b3a-043b-274bba10f021
msgctxt "he49ad201g8657g474cg820dgca41196162f5"
msgid ""
"We are bound, then, to travel together, even if we do not yet agree on our "
"ultimate purpose."
msgstr "그렇다면 궁극적인 목적은 다르더라도 함께 여행하도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 502c785a-45c9-85b9-9633-b0e08b60313c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:502c785a-45c9-85b9-9633-b0e08b60313c
msgctxt "h1700ffe9g5b5bg483cg9c37g781a6557b2d8"
msgid "<i>Straj.</i>"
msgstr "<i>스트라지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 508fa578-0916-6da9-421c-f8d4d4c69235
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:508fa578-0916-6da9-421c-f8d4d4c69235
msgctxt "h79552f1dg1d61g4d42g803dg0550837e2b9d"
msgid ""
"She is the one who brought me to Moonrise, and into the presence of her so-"
"called god - the Absolute."
msgstr "날 문라이즈 타워로 데려와 그들이 신으로 모시는 절대자와 만나게 한 것도 오린이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 514e1369-3eab-e1c7-134b-127334a12d3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:514e1369-3eab-e1c7-134b-127334a12d3c
msgctxt "h8f17c94dg3ec8g4eb0gb606g015f0fc10456"
msgid ""
"I would prefer to put my faith in your strength than the favour of your god. "
"After all, it is Orin and this grand deception that he chose - not you."
msgstr "바알보다는 네가 가진 힘을 믿어. 애초에 바알이 선택한 건 오린이었으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5469b62d-4f8a-6c51-857b-323fd0673151
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:5469b62d-4f8a-6c51-857b-323fd0673151
msgctxt "ha6115d7cg6063g4197gb65cgbd370e39ad63"
msgid "First Myrkul, now Bhaal - I feel like we're in over our heads."
msgstr "처음엔 머큘이고 그 다음은 바알이라니 - 혼잡하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56d219b9-8e6f-5e72-c7af-02748ba372e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:56d219b9-8e6f-5e72-c7af-02748ba372e8
msgctxt "hfec3fa9cg1eeeg47fdga1d2g04f16b624fc9"
msgid "It's going to be glorious - I can hardly wait."
msgstr "그렇게 된다면 정말 멋질 거야 - 벌써 기대되는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 5726704f-06eb-538d-9df3-33eb863b60d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:5726704f-06eb-538d-9df3-33eb863b60d3
msgctxt "ha1a6b3e6gb410g445bg80a2gb12da78a4ac4"
msgid "Good. That is as it should be."
msgstr "좋아. 그 마음가짐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 57930a83-ded4-359b-0309-9984e4209e17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:57930a83-ded4-359b-0309-9984e4209e17
msgctxt "h1746ac3bgbfd9g48c8gaf80g043d61dfbe81"
msgid ""
"What I propose is nigh on impossible, but if anyone can succeed, it is us. "
"We have the Prism, and we have the courage to slay gods."
msgstr ""
"거의 불가능할지도 모르지만, 이걸 성공시킬 수 있는 사람이 있다면 바로 우리일 거야. 우리에겐 프리즘이 있고, 신에게 칼을 겨눌 용기도 "
"있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 59a571df-89bf-7170-a4f3-78e49f3a9d78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:59a571df-89bf-7170-a4f3-78e49f3a9d78
msgctxt "h81f8d033g4646g49f2gbc39gb3e4b26aa4cd"
msgid "You were simply too stubborn to die."
msgstr "네 명줄이 제법 끈질긴가 보지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 5ab96471-ce7c-f50b-a1b9-9369c4b247fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:5ab96471-ce7c-f50b-a1b9-9369c4b247fd
msgctxt "h3186ae7cg995cg4f9bg97fcgdbdef96daf7b"
msgid ""
"Only that he serves Bane, which could make him a petty lordling, or a despot "
"capable of bending the world to his will."
msgstr "베인을 섬긴다는 것 이외는 모르지만, 그건 그가 별 볼 일 없는 군주가 되거나, 세상을 거느리는 독재자도 될 수 있다는 뜻이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 5bcfe4f8-db03-bf37-9153-d0f20aaea43b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:5bcfe4f8-db03-bf37-9153-d0f20aaea43b
msgctxt "ha929607bg5c53g47bagace8g71b57ac04b8f"
msgid "Patience. If we do not prepare, Baldur's Gate will be our tomb."
msgstr "진정해. 철저히 준비하지 않으면 발더스 게이트가 우리의 무덤이 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5bd308eb-2313-bc8a-04c5-d38fd2428016
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:5bd308eb-2313-bc8a-04c5-d38fd2428016
msgctxt "hbf0667b2gffdeg48adga144g932f53824774"
msgid ""
"Ketheric was a dead man long before we arrived - a servant of Myrkul, Lord "
"of Bones."
msgstr "우리가 도착하기 오래전에 죽어있었던 케서릭은 뼈의 군주 머큘의 하수인이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 5c624bec-094f-9417-a2ff-792f5e405db8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:5c624bec-094f-9417-a2ff-792f5e405db8
msgctxt "hb408b225g8b91g4a92g804cg824611ecd7da"
msgid ""
"That is all I ask. And remember, I <i>know</i> when your mind is closed."
msgstr "내가 바라는 건 그게 전부야. 그리고 명심해. 난 네 마음이 닫혀있는지 열려있는지 <i>알</i> 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 5de860e9-668a-2938-42fd-63eae33c79f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_Minthara_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_Recruited(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:5de860e9-668a-2938-42fd-63eae33c79f5
msgctxt "h8ab02577g5308g466egbc39g31219fdc086d"
msgid "You killed the dead man. I'm impressed."
msgstr "죽은 자를 또 한번 죽였군. 인상적이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 5f388c1e-b21f-c45f-7bbf-a745fae5092d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:5f388c1e-b21f-c45f-7bbf-a745fae5092d
msgctxt "h8a8c2679gcedeg4b77g9569g0a992f3ca1da"
msgid ""
"If Ketheric had ordered me to slay you to prove my worth, I would have. Or "
"died trying."
msgstr "케서릭이 내 가치를 증명하기 위해 널 죽이라 명했다면, 난 따랐을 거다. 아니, 널 죽이려다 죽었겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 5f395030-eefa-d970-51cd-b4c6a777b644
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:5f395030-eefa-d970-51cd-b4c6a777b644
msgctxt "h8bb6c16cgf28dg4ddcg82dcg2cb3892c39b0"
msgid ""
"To think I thought her to be speaking for the Absolute. I worshipped that "
"woman."
msgstr "그녀가 절대자의 뜻을 대변하고 있다고 생각해서 그녀를 추앙했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 5ff5ad05-6c53-4f13-8af9-d2482ccf706e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:5ff5ad05-6c53-4f13-8af9-d2482ccf706e
msgctxt "h5ec2021dgee1dg4ab2gb78fgb0d4542c2692"
msgid "The cult are a threat to <i>you</i>. That is what matters."
msgstr "교단이 <i>너에게</i> 위협이 되니까. 단지 그뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 63839611-c025-f111-c20f-bb08f5c2b198
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:63839611-c025-f111-c20f-bb08f5c2b198
msgctxt "h5d5600c9geec2g446cg895dg1393726ac1fd"
msgid ""
"There is no limit to my ambitions. I will enjoy killing Orin, but unlike "
"her, I do not kill for pleasure alone. I kill to gain advantage."
msgstr ""
"내 야망에 한계 따윈 없어. 오린을 죽이는 건 즐겁겠지. 하지만 오린과 달리 난 즐거움만을 쫓아 목숨을 빼앗진 않아. 이득을 위해 죽이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 670a683c-f12f-00b1-0618-6b1d22c70c26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:670a683c-f12f-00b1-0618-6b1d22c70c26
msgctxt "h444c2407ga3c1g4de5gbb78g552734576875"
msgid ""
"There is violence in your future regardless. With me, you can at least be "
"sure the violence will lead to glory."
msgstr "어차피 폭력은 피할 수 없어. 적어도 나와 함께라면 그 폭력이 영광으로 이어지겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 691c7920-661c-85af-4f87-3c4a1164c42d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:691c7920-661c-85af-4f87-3c4a1164c42d
msgctxt "he0007fdfg4327g425dg925bg288986d84997"
msgid ""
"And now your path takes you to Baldur's Gate. I shall walk that path with "
"you."
msgstr "그리고 너의 길은 발더스 게이트로 이어지겠군. 나도 함께 그 길을 걷겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 6e82a691-68bd-81a8-ba7b-2fe3dafc4ecc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:6e82a691-68bd-81a8-ba7b-2fe3dafc4ecc
msgctxt "ha447c52cgc7bbg4dc8g8a54g3f7f2ba60fcb"
msgid ""
"I should not lose myself in these thoughts of what might have been. I live, "
"and I am grateful."
msgstr "됐다, 일어나지 않은 일을 곱씹을 필요는 없겠지. 난 살아 있고, 그 점에 감사한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 709b131e-7b58-5ad1-4a25-c723643bd112
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:709b131e-7b58-5ad1-4a25-c723643bd112
msgctxt "h434d8c68g4bb6g405dga6bfg3c75d6405527"
msgid "I was just looking for more people to kill."
msgstr "난 그저 더 많은 사람들의 목을 따고 싶었을 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 768f01d2-b575-999b-5f01-cfb2acd6ed15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:768f01d2-b575-999b-5f01-cfb2acd6ed15
msgctxt "h72ba82f5ge691g456cga5a8geafc8e396e38"
msgid ""
"We must be free if we are to rule - and to be free, we must destroy this "
"cult, and Ketheric's co-conspirators along with it."
msgstr "지배자가 되고자 한다면 우선 자유로워져야 해. 자유로워지려면, 이 이교도와 함께 케서릭의 공모자까지 모조리 멸해야 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a8ce98d-03ca-92ba-ab4d-1c722f90cab8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:7a8ce98d-03ca-92ba-ab4d-1c722f90cab8
msgctxt "h422168c8g54e3g464cgba89gd7378d55ca8b"
msgid "I want revenge on those who did this to me."
msgstr "나한테 이런 짓을 한 놈들에게 본때를 보여주려고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b02e525-f8c7-f954-8c76-b304025912fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:7b02e525-f8c7-f954-8c76-b304025912fb
msgctxt "h583475b5g1418g4c38gad19gb86a05318cee"
msgid ""
"Coming here was my best chance to learn more about the tadpole. Possibly "
"even cure it."
msgstr "이곳이 올챙이에 대한 정보를 모으기 제일 좋은 곳이니까. 운이 좋다면 그걸 아예 제거할 수도 있겠다 생각했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d07949a-6cfc-e5fc-7958-f3bff8838f97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:7d07949a-6cfc-e5fc-7958-f3bff8838f97
msgctxt "hc6b66adfg1334g4128g87beg8f53a0943bb8"
msgid "Stealing an <i>entire cult</i> is a new one, even for me."
msgstr "교단을 <i>통째로</i> 훔치는 건 나도 처음 해보는 일인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 7dbc1a5d-ee7e-d4e7-c493-94c6eb81efce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:7dbc1a5d-ee7e-d4e7-c493-94c6eb81efce
msgctxt "hf7b70b6ega8b5g43eag955dg3eee71b0bcf9"
msgid "I will find her, I will murder her. And I will smile."
msgstr "오린을 찾아내고, 죽여버릴 거야. 그리고 그 얼굴에 대고 맘껏 비웃어 줄 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 7e65892a-7a2e-0676-476b-b36ddf0bc395
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:7e65892a-7a2e-0676-476b-b36ddf0bc395
msgctxt "hfe5e41cdgacf7g4f57g841ag8731aba1ae98"
msgid ""
"The elder brain is the only thing that has ever managed to change my mind. "
"You're welcome to try."
msgstr "내 마음을 돌릴 수 있었던 건 오직 엘더 브레인뿐이었어. 하지만 해볼 테면 해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 7eb050c5-a48d-57ed-e4f3-5a3d9562f011
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_DenVictory = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:7eb050c5-a48d-57ed-e4f3-5a3d9562f011
msgctxt "hf1c6d39agee13g4304gb9f0gff7396c08d84"
msgid ""
"You chose to incapacitate me rather than killing me when you eradicated my "
"minions. Why?"
msgstr "넌 내 부하들을 죽이고 내 숨통을 끊을 수도 있었지만 기절시키는 데 그쳤다. 왜지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ede71a0-57fc-8100-7b2e-667f62c6e85b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:7ede71a0-57fc-8100-7b2e-667f62c6e85b
msgctxt "he3671ceeg616dg4dd7g8eccg97c2e5de36e7"
msgid ""
"Tempting, but eradicating the brain may be wiser, to put an end to this "
"madness."
msgstr "솔깃하긴 하지만, 뇌를 파괴하는 쪽이 더 현명할 거야. 이 광기를 끝내야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 80916e96-707d-43d0-d260-7329ace643e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:80916e96-707d-43d0-d260-7329ace643e3
msgctxt "h6f1f11c1gaeebg4970gba72g83901b26686e"
msgid ""
"That he has enslaved illithids to fulfil his ambitions strongly suggests he "
"is the latter."
msgstr "야망을 위해 일리시드를 사로잡은 걸 보면 후자일 가능성이 높지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 8233e453-0d2a-de9f-7a62-dffe55a38343
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:8233e453-0d2a-de9f-7a62-dffe55a38343
msgctxt "h65246625gff98g4ac9gab11g006729cc68d8"
msgid ""
"That will do. For now. We should speak more of whatever afflicts you, but "
"there will be time for that."
msgstr "당장은 그걸로 충분해. 무엇이 그런 충동을 유발하는지는, 나중에 이야기해 보도록 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 83fa7180-41e7-d91e-ad51-4ceec5f96e4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:83fa7180-41e7-d91e-ad51-4ceec5f96e4e
msgctxt "h41b6b35ag0e6cg4cf1g921cgfebb94317cb8"
msgid ""
"I jest, but it is as good a reason as any. I have done much more foolish "
"things to win the respect of far inferior people."
msgstr ""
"농담이야. 그렇지만 그 정도면 괜찮은 이유네. 난 훨씬 열등한 존재들의 경외를 얻겠다고 이것보다도 어리석은 짓거리를 해 왔으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 87128468-868b-29c3-4441-ed16abe2e6c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:87128468-868b-29c3-4441-ed16abe2e6c0
msgctxt "h90dd381bgc7a8g4521g9f21g5eb1f00e3fe6"
msgid ""
"I'm flattered. Will you be bringing dead rats and birds to my tent now that "
"we share a camp?"
msgstr "기분 좋은데. 그럼, 이제 가서 세계를 정복하고 나에게 왕좌를 가져다주지 않을래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 88382b1d-7c0d-1452-44a4-75c56f0baf83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:88382b1d-7c0d-1452-44a4-75c56f0baf83
msgctxt "hfe28efb0g70b1g4a01gb7a7g2b581d8e924d"
msgid "It is clear, now, that he was not working alone."
msgstr "이 모든 걸 케서릭 혼자 꾸미지 않았다는 게 분명하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 898057bb-6593-280d-aadc-001f15e902fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_Minthara_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:898057bb-6593-280d-aadc-001f15e902fc
msgctxt "h1e1d54e1g6c0eg47e9g99a7g46c02cc4d633"
msgid "We should not tarry in this charnel house long."
msgstr "이 납골당에서 시간을 너무 지체해선 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 8aa1d979-e36a-5f94-63cd-2916cca42ea2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:8aa1d979-e36a-5f94-63cd-2916cca42ea2
msgctxt "hfbc59ef3g69b3g4ce9gb2ecg4d68553182c0"
msgid "Fine. All I ask of you is that you keep an open mind."
msgstr "좋아. 내가 바라는 건 단지 네가 가능성을 열어두는 것뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b61edd4-c2e8-3c62-1c6a-d83294895283
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:8b61edd4-c2e8-3c62-1c6a-d83294895283
msgctxt "h75d4717dgea16g4891g8055g0b775f5cd7b0"
msgid "Maybe I'll change your mind."
msgstr "어쩌면 내가 네 생각을 바꿀지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 8c5746d9-82d5-3a97-5291-1fe292454957
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:8c5746d9-82d5-3a97-5291-1fe292454957
msgctxt "h0ef47851gb67bg498agba9eg12a04360f52c"
msgid "When I first visited Moonrise, I stood before the Absolute in awe."
msgstr "처음 문라이즈에 왔을 때, 경외감에 휩싸여 절대자 앞에 섰었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 8e30927e-c00e-fc65-937e-c58e19a56093
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:8e30927e-c00e-fc65-937e-c58e19a56093
msgctxt "h2fd56304gbdb3g40a1g8837gb6947ed6366e"
msgid ""
"In the long history of these Realms, few people have attempted anything so "
"bold."
msgstr "오랜 역사 속에서 그렇게 대담한 시도를 한 사람들은 극히 일부야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f185761-a28a-c88f-01bb-756f726e7f91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:8f185761-a28a-c88f-01bb-756f726e7f91
msgctxt "hd1349802g2a93g406eg89d9gcaf7bc72c4be"
msgid ""
"The future you propose is shaped by violence. I'd prefer to find another way."
msgstr "네가 제안하는 미래는 폭력으로 점철되어 있군. 난 다른 방법을 찾겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 9017ce9a-643b-1085-5311-2c0da7781fb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:9017ce9a-643b-1085-5311-2c0da7781fb8
msgctxt "h5eabf44cg3aa5g46e2gb2b2g6e893b0e5d34"
msgid ""
"There is yet one thing about you that troubles me, though. Something I need "
"you to explain."
msgstr "너에 대해 한가지 마음에 걸리는 게 있어. 설명해 줘야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9068ba23-9356-6054-ad48-808778b4c6e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:9068ba23-9356-6054-ad48-808778b4c6e1
msgctxt "h1d315856g08f9g4a2fg93b4gda21fc6c10e2"
msgid "A violent urge drives me. I wasn't in control of my actions."
msgstr "가슴 깊은 곳에서 그러라고 한 것 같았어. 정신을 차려보니 이미 저지른 후였지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 908b6f0a-f7c0-56de-9ea6-107f305faa5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:908b6f0a-f7c0-56de-9ea6-107f305faa5b
msgctxt "h98bdd644g0b81g4431gb282g2785ecd2d8d3"
msgid ""
"But Baldur's Gate is a mere bauble. We have the chance to seize something "
"much greater. Surely you see it?"
msgstr "하지만 발더스 게이트는 사소한 것일 뿐이야. 훨씬 더 큰 것을 쟁취할 기회가 있는데, 분명 너도 이해하고 있겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 966fe414-8a1c-68e5-0dea-c0d3c1170a17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:966fe414-8a1c-68e5-0dea-c0d3c1170a17
msgctxt "heaf6302eg767fg4b65gb1e1g849e0ed4864a"
msgid "You may be right. I'll keep an open mind."
msgstr "어쩌면 네 말이 맞을지도 모르겠군. 가능성은 열어 둘게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 99b279c3-d926-dd7c-5323-cbbc767f9ff7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:99b279c3-d926-dd7c-5323-cbbc767f9ff7
msgctxt "hf04e8408g333cg4683gb180g3ba9cd058577"
msgid ""
"And for that I am sorry. I will commit all future atrocities for my own gain "
"- and yours, should we stand together."
msgstr "그 점에 대해선 유감을 표하지. 우리가 함께하는 한, 앞으로는 오직 나 자신과 널 위해 잔혹함을 발휘하도록 하마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 99c32ba8-9290-4d45-b0dc-9f7d88c0b03f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:99c32ba8-9290-4d45-b0dc-9f7d88c0b03f
msgctxt "h12ce73d6g4b2ag4fe7ga90agbafcd9e7d100"
msgid ""
"I would have thought this entire conspiracy of gods and monsters to be "
"impossible if I had not seen it for myself."
msgstr "내 눈으로 직접 보지 못했다면 신과 괴물들이 공모한다는 건 불가능하다고 여겼을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 99c8a0d6-3ac6-9c35-28ae-ded900f37ab1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:99c8a0d6-3ac6-9c35-28ae-ded900f37ab1
msgctxt "hece68da9g5f52g44d6g9b76g0da2f62d49a0"
msgid "That troubles me."
msgstr "그거 참 난감한 일이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 9d3351a5-f64b-e452-6171-0c6c773dddf9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:9d3351a5-f64b-e452-6171-0c6c773dddf9
msgctxt "hfece052bg0ac7g4bfbg9ad0gdab9ab509b45"
msgid "I do not have a home there anymore - my own siblings would slay me."
msgstr "그곳에 내가 돌아갈 집은 없어. 형제들조차 날 죽이려고 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 9e385874-fd11-5854-a15b-c656030a0805
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:9e385874-fd11-5854-a15b-c656030a0805
msgctxt "h6552db1cgc2f5g418egb927ge8859b1583b8"
msgid ""
"We make an <i>acceptable</i> team. But there are greater challenges than "
"Ketheric ahead of us."
msgstr "우리 <i>꽤 괜찮은</i> 한 팀인 것 같아. 그렇지만 앞으로는 케서릭 보다 더한 강적들이 기다리고 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e450e0b-5e13-6620-0580-efbfd2f4a741
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:9e450e0b-5e13-6620-0580-efbfd2f4a741
msgctxt "hff8a4af9g852bg473cg8c5egbb3fd4501ff2"
msgid "Most people would be grateful to live, not suspicious of their saviour."
msgstr "보통은 살려줘서 고맙다는 얘기부터 하던데. 구해준 사람을 의심하는 대신."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 9fb2dedb-0d97-2728-fc0a-d74b1f1ac9f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_RaiderVictory = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:9fb2dedb-0d97-2728-fc0a-d74b1f1ac9f4
msgctxt "h93c26f07g3feag486dgb0adgc40d82801a5b"
msgid ""
"When we killed the tieflings, at the grove, I was not in control of my "
"actions. You do not have that excuse. So I ask you - <i>why</i>? Why kill "
"them?"
msgstr ""
"우리가 숲에서 티플링을 학살했을 때, 난 내 의지로 움직이는 상태가 아니었어. 너에겐 그런 변명거리가 없지. 그러니까 말해봐 - 넌 "
"<i>왜</i> 그들을 죽였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = a1750003-2b93-1ac5-f64d-4869c11fe3b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:a1750003-2b93-1ac5-f64d-4869c11fe3b6
msgctxt "h9c06d1f9gb19fg4c7bgb51fgdb5e4b3ff924"
msgid "I know one of them all too well - Bhaal's blood-letter, Orin."
msgstr "놈들 중 하나는 내가 너무 잘 알지 - 바알의 수하 '피 흘리게 하는자' 오린이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1a46be5-5664-01f3-5e44-e19b581ebb35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:a1a46be5-5664-01f3-5e44-e19b581ebb35
msgctxt "h4f2e89c2gb8f3g4dafg990eg857539349daa"
msgid "No - you're staying here in the shadows."
msgstr "아니, 넌 이 곳에 남아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = a23b24e2-f964-93e6-74e0-07d645e97a9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:a23b24e2-f964-93e6-74e0-07d645e97a9d
msgctxt "h7433c581ge834g4448ga3f0g49169603630f"
msgid ""
"Me too, but I am keen to find joy in the consequences of the killing as well "
"as in the act itself."
msgstr "나도 마찬가지지만, 난 살인이라는 행위 자체만큼이나 그 결과도 즐기지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3c30829-1222-34b0-c696-9265de7211e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:a3c30829-1222-34b0-c696-9265de7211e0
msgctxt "hd20b6e79ga1dfg4a3dg9533g0c23aa02a6c7"
msgid "If you go to Baldur's Gate, you're going alone."
msgstr "정 발더스 게이트로 가고 싶다면 혼자 가야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = a5c28a2d-0bb4-500c-083e-febd787133fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:a5c28a2d-0bb4-500c-083e-febd787133fd
msgctxt "hb52f1b15g0429g46a3ga6bbg30d7af8164c2"
msgid ""
"Drought, famine and warfare are threats to the world as well. Do you intend "
"to eradicate them?"
msgstr "가뭄, 기근, 전쟁도 세상에 위협이 되는 것들이지. 그것들도 제거할 생각이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = aa6b20a7-53ef-4a46-183a-b60d3ddff20d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:aa6b20a7-53ef-4a46-183a-b60d3ddff20d
msgctxt "hdb300a86gb9aag490dgabebg9a8a4c581fd5"
msgid "He favours her, and she is one of the founders of this insane cult."
msgstr "바알의 총애를 받고 있지. 이 미치광이 사교 집단의 설립자 중 하나이기도 하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = abf04ca7-43f1-8dc1-f3fd-bc616a6d8a94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:abf04ca7-43f1-8dc1-f3fd-bc616a6d8a94
msgctxt "hb5c61644g019eg4784gb14eg13d831dd8c20"
msgid "Indeed, she is the one who indoctrinated me with the Absolute's lies."
msgstr "날 절대자의 거짓말로 세뇌한 것도 그녀였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b43af941-0e0c-bc5f-4307-09ceaac500e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:b43af941-0e0c-bc5f-4307-09ceaac500e7
msgctxt "h1df0a026g2b9cg4b32ga9a3gf8e10f4fe71d"
msgid "Good. The world will be safe from your mad ambitions."
msgstr "다행이네. 세상이 네 미친 야망으로부터 안전하다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = b44e61ab-07ba-04d9-c8f0-3eb93468ddbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:b44e61ab-07ba-04d9-c8f0-3eb93468ddbb
msgctxt "he54ec8degcbc3g4759g90d9g8b6e20090dd7"
msgid "But if we are wise, it will be our dominion."
msgstr "하지만 우리가 현명하게 굴면, 놈들을 지배할 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = b495edff-d26d-5a7e-f290-784dd83efca5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:b495edff-d26d-5a7e-f290-784dd83efca5
msgctxt "h5cd4abcbgbf7eg49ffgb555gdec87b1acea4"
msgid ""
"And then we will need no gods. We will be their equal. We will be Absolute."
msgstr "그럼 우리에게 더 이상 신은 필요없겠지. 우리가 신들과 동등해질 테니까. 우리가 절대자가 되는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = bac85791-1403-857e-860b-00e029e64b01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:bac85791-1403-857e-860b-00e029e64b01
msgctxt "h1070ef0dgbe61g48d7gab65g12bcb45a2998"
msgid ""
"Without you - without the Prism - I cannot risk going to the city. The "
"Absolute would take my mind again."
msgstr "난 너 없이 - 프리즘 없이 - 발더스게이트로 가는 위험을 무릅쓸 순 없어. 절대자가 다시 내 정신을 지배할 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = bfe8558c-7da5-c78d-a3b0-fcdde65f93fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:bfe8558c-7da5-c78d-a3b0-fcdde65f93fc
msgctxt "hff489a70g0a60g42ffga95bg9203a33eab41"
msgid "We may fail, but we must try."
msgstr "실패할 수도 있지만, 반드시 시도해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = c06b255d-c315-669a-340b-1ccfe0e4a919
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:c06b255d-c315-669a-340b-1ccfe0e4a919
msgctxt "h5647737eg5b5ag4041g80c5gf8fc02b945bb"
msgid ""
"Nothing worthwhile ever came without loss. But together we have the strength "
"to decide who loses. And to make sure it is not us."
msgstr ""
"가치 있는 것들을 얻으려면 희생이 필요해. 하지만 우리가 함께하면 희생시킬 대상을 선택할 수 있는 힘을 가지게 될 거야. 우리는 결코 그 "
"대상이 되는 일이 없을 테고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = c186fcee-411f-8729-cfb1-91699bd6990f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:c186fcee-411f-8729-cfb1-91699bd6990f
msgctxt "hf6d800fdgf96cg48dcg9640g7b38f54accff"
msgid ""
"But I will satisfy my war-lust soon, for there are greater challenges than "
"Ketheric ahead of us."
msgstr "하지만 내 전쟁에 대한 욕구는 곧 채워지겠지. 우리 앞에 케서릭보다 더 강대한 적들이 도사리고 있으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c65ff439-d171-180a-8eb0-2492c9606d46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:c65ff439-d171-180a-8eb0-2492c9606d46
msgctxt "h64ed51edg5394g425dg867bg150adfba065b"
msgid "What can you tell me about Orin?"
msgstr "오린에 대해 아는 게 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c9c504e9-e598-dd65-75e7-69debe2b703c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:c9c504e9-e598-dd65-75e7-69debe2b703c
msgctxt "heabbe8d6g4210g40fbgb041g1f246a81fc78"
msgid "The cult are a threat to the world. I aim to eradicate them."
msgstr "난 이 세상에 위협이 되는 교단을 완전히 쓸어버릴 생각이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = cd141431-ad4f-c735-35ac-a65e2d1e9770
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:cd141431-ad4f-c735-35ac-a65e2d1e9770
msgctxt "h0888bd95gb72eg49ecga896g2074e5e0d817"
msgid ""
"She is fierce, vicious, and cruel. In those respects, we are alike - but she "
"is dangerously unpredictable."
msgstr "나처럼 난폭하고 사악하고 잔인한 여자야. 게다가 위험할 정도로 예측하기 어렵지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = ce44d9bd-b775-31da-1155-448d3c59a364
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:ce44d9bd-b775-31da-1155-448d3c59a364
msgctxt "he1f447ddga166g43fcg9629g6a9d9b5cb01d"
msgid "Then you are no different than I once was."
msgstr "그럼 너도 과거의 나와 다를 바 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cfa389c8-34ad-ad45-f6ea-b2a0eaaaae93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:cfa389c8-34ad-ad45-f6ea-b2a0eaaaae93
msgctxt "hcd065118g787dg4749gb015g8e8fdbe236a5"
msgid "I enjoy killing."
msgstr "난 살인을 즐겨."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = d238db62-6c9e-dc28-477d-39407e71d450
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:d238db62-6c9e-dc28-477d-39407e71d450
msgctxt "h75b664b7gf582g473bg8246ga7d773a2cc7f"
msgid "So I ask again - why kill the inhabitants of the Grove?"
msgstr "그러니까 말해보라고 - 왜 숲에 있던 자들을 죽였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = d44e3baf-c24b-426a-85ec-ab7356e835be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:d44e3baf-c24b-426a-85ec-ab7356e835be
msgctxt "hd01cd055g842ag4f9dgae56g5809b5cd3649"
msgid ""
"And we have the chance to seize the greatest advantage of all. Surely you "
"see it?"
msgstr "그리고 우리에겐 가장 큰 이점을 취할 기회가 있어. 당연히 너도 알겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = d474a504-c76b-5ee0-c6c0-a7faa0d06c6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:d474a504-c76b-5ee0-c6c0-a7faa0d06c6b
msgctxt "h1bb4a850gee33g4dd0g9a82g2faf600aff1c"
msgid "I do have one more question though, before we continue."
msgstr "그래도 여정을 계속하기 전에, 하나 묻고 싶은 게 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = d47c07df-2d26-9465-b75b-c5db4fbcd051
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_Minthara_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:d47c07df-2d26-9465-b75b-c5db4fbcd051
msgctxt "h796e85c3g13b7g4861g87begbbbb7878e6c9"
msgid "I will never tire of sitting on dead men's thrones."
msgstr "죽은 사람의 왕좌를 빼앗는 것만큼 즐거운 일이 또 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = d5730fe9-acd5-37a7-45b7-cfda8865b260
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:d5730fe9-acd5-37a7-45b7-cfda8865b260
msgctxt "h530ae2f1gbda4g4164gab7ag18150425ef46"
msgid ""
"Jealous? You needn't be -  when Orin is in my hands, her agony will nourish "
"me."
msgstr "질투하는 건가? 그럴 필요 없어. 나만큼 오린의 고통을 즐길 사람은 없거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = d5e3fee8-eae8-3fc9-ee6b-0d6d40f28afe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:d5e3fee8-eae8-3fc9-ee6b-0d6d40f28afe
msgctxt "h73fec6b1g26f2g4fc0gb955g8de940f2453f"
msgid "She is the <i>iblith</i> who indoctrinated me with the Absolute's lies."
msgstr "날 절대자의 거짓말로 세뇌한 게 그 이블리스 년이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d691310b-ff17-1e34-ce6b-ad5976a1936f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:d691310b-ff17-1e34-ce6b-ad5976a1936f
msgctxt "h397ea6ceg9cbbg4a27g85b5gb6b43adef4a6"
msgid ""
"Once she's dead, the cult will need new leadership - perhaps we can take her "
"place."
msgstr "오린이 죽고 나면 신도들에게 새 지도자가 필요할 거야. 아마 우리가 그 자리를 차지할 수도 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = da9bfb1d-3fe3-0de2-ec0b-0399ead57a62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:da9bfb1d-3fe3-0de2-ec0b-0399ead57a62
msgctxt "h8b4633fdg510fg4bc8gbc4bga1dda4ea7550"
msgid ""
"No god commands me now. But out of respect for what you have done for me, "
"for my salvation, I shall follow you whatever your beliefs."
msgstr "난 이제 어떤 신의 명도 따르지 않는다. 하지만 나의 구원자인 네 믿음을 따라, 그 어떤 신의 가르침도 따르겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = dbf2cb59-4358-7384-c7f2-cb8c9c105505
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:dbf2cb59-4358-7384-c7f2-cb8c9c105505
msgctxt "hd9181b35gb6c1g4d22gb94cgd5ee2ac0ee63"
msgid "I don't care about them, I care about you."
msgstr "녀석들은 상관없어. 네가 중요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = dd07eccb-61ee-505e-bf31-e4ce4d353704
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_MintharaInvolvedInShowdown = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:dd07eccb-61ee-505e-bf31-e4ce4d353704
msgctxt "h757d22bdgbbd1g4579gb85dg2c4a1c457f79"
msgid "Yes - although I wish we had collaborated on the killing itself."
msgstr "물론. 놈을 죽일 때 나도 함께였다면 더 좋았겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = dd6dadda-5ac2-dc26-b102-8aa54730e639
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:dd6dadda-5ac2-dc26-b102-8aa54730e639
msgctxt "h6e341012g6122g41a4ga632gacb1e49ff226"
msgid ""
"So might any other True Soul, and yet Gut and Ragzlin do not stand with us, "
"under your protection."
msgstr "다른 참된 영혼들 역시 마찬가지 아니었나. 하지만 거트와 라그즐린은 네게 보호받고 있지 않지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de6c6261-74ee-fb79-6a46-99ff3d287609
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:de6c6261-74ee-fb79-6a46-99ff3d287609
msgctxt "h6153a148g833dg441dg98b9g361d126540e1"
msgid "I ask myself the same question, and I don't have an answer."
msgstr "나도 그 이유를 찾고 싶었지만, 도저히 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = de83da9d-efa6-f564-fbb2-2e4d109cb756
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:de83da9d-efa6-f564-fbb2-2e4d109cb756
msgctxt "hb438611eg7617g487eg91e7g1292bfd2a9e7"
msgid "It is as if you read my mind. Perhaps you did."
msgstr "내 마음을 읽은 것 같이 말하는군. 역시 통하는 부분이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = e0a6c22a-744e-b91b-9737-857fbbf2b1e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:e0a6c22a-744e-b91b-9737-857fbbf2b1e8
msgctxt "hf323d0edg01bbg47d9gabf3g2e81fe93beb1"
msgid ""
"True. But do not lose yourself to despair and fatalism. They tried to make "
"victims of us, but we can take this opportunity to become gods."
msgstr ""
"맞는 말이야. 하지만 운명론과 절망이 널 집어삼키도록 두진 마. 교단은 우리를 제물 삼으려 했을 뿐이지만, 이 기회에 우리가 신이 될 "
"수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = e142a791-290c-b9f1-7a87-875f1bdb9d6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:e142a791-290c-b9f1-7a87-875f1bdb9d6a
msgctxt "h83ed87b8g518eg4f37g84bagb51f9f84d99e"
msgid ""
"If the gods stand in our way, we will tear them down. Nothing will deny me "
"my vengeance on Orin."
msgstr "우리의 앞을 막는다면 신조차 찢어버릴 거야. 오린을 향한 내 복수는 누구도 막을 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = e299a711-a69e-3483-4529-13b871f10ad9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:e299a711-a69e-3483-4529-13b871f10ad9
msgctxt "hd93d43b9g48cfg47bcg8f2eg81ab0e1bc457"
msgid ""
"Why come to Moonrise, where the cult's power is strongest? Why not walk away?"
msgstr "왜 교단의 힘이 가장 강한 문라이즈를 피해 가지 않은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = e59432ce-13e5-04a5-06ea-27e92f2937d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:e59432ce-13e5-04a5-06ea-27e92f2937d3
msgctxt "h06ce9221g03c7g430dg93dcgbdc8221ea62c"
msgid ""
"You describe me well, but you deceive nonetheless. You chose to spare me, I "
"am sure of it."
msgstr "관상가 납셨군 그래. 허나 그건 진실이 아니지. 네가 날 살려준 거다. 내가 살아남은 게 아니고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e62faa28-c09b-7cdf-5e00-863d74f62028
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:e62faa28-c09b-7cdf-5e00-863d74f62028
msgctxt "h043d87edgf81dg475fg8433g1050db823cae"
msgid ""
"I was hoping to earn your trust so that I could learn more about the "
"tadpoles."
msgstr "올챙이에 대해 더 알아내기 위해 네 신뢰를 얻을 필요가 있었으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = e84523a4-54b4-e681-bdd1-359c191f570a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:e84523a4-54b4-e681-bdd1-359c191f570a
msgctxt "hd403b67eg5e48g4234gb457g309ea0aae22a"
msgid ""
"In killing Ketheric, we fractured the cult's leadership. When we break the "
"other Chosen and claim their Netherstones, <i>we</i> can take control."
msgstr ""
"케서릭을 죽임으로써 우리는 그 교단의 지도부를 붕괴시켰어. 다른 선택받은 자들을 무너뜨리고 그들의 네더스톤을 차지하면, <i>우리</"
"i>가 지배권을 가져올 수 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8801ea3-df67-0f7f-afce-687923325267
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - OriginAddToParty(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:e8801ea3-df67-0f7f-afce-687923325267
msgctxt "hb4ba071dgf7dcg473eg9de2g2ea0275db53b"
msgid "I hoped you would - we make a good team."
msgstr "환영이야, 우린 좋은 팀이 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eb3d6639-6d37-f4d0-a6b7-aeae02debc1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:eb3d6639-6d37-f4d0-a6b7-aeae02debc1f
msgctxt "h4bd5f30cg7209g4901g9f53gc6904b268a0f"
msgid ""
"And I'll never tire of killing their previous occupants. We make a good team."
msgstr "그리고 나도 왕좌에 앉았던 놈들을 죽이는 게 질리지 않아. 우리 손발이 척척 맞는다니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eef28aab-35fc-0ae7-3e5d-a5f070cb31e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:eef28aab-35fc-0ae7-3e5d-a5f070cb31e3
msgctxt "he45ee143g5a69g4a27g8f72g9d98abd51598"
msgid "You committed atrocities in the name of those lies."
msgstr "넌 그 거짓말을 내세우며 끔찍한 짓을 저질렀지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = f13aaf60-c58e-80a4-9ebe-7a0fe9a23925
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:f13aaf60-c58e-80a4-9ebe-7a0fe9a23925
msgctxt "h09efe4e5g4afbg4f35g8cd6g40c81ce0320c"
msgid "Then you misunderstand me."
msgstr "그렇다면 날 잘못 이해했군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = f2f4979e-b7b1-8603-4b98-e7b5c5a4bf5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:f2f4979e-b7b1-8603-4b98-e7b5c5a4bf5a
msgctxt "hc841b098g7c63g407dg8dedged0772ccba04"
msgid "Madness would be to let the Absolute's potential go to waste."
msgstr "절대자의 잠재력을 버리는 것이야말로 미친 짓이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f5e503f8-bdbd-69a1-3c4f-5daa180554a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCE_MintharaFollowUp_HeardMintharaStory(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:f5e503f8-bdbd-69a1-3c4f-5daa180554a7
msgctxt "hdee3f28ag5e92g4d9dg9b9cg1b1ece912aa2"
msgid "Does it matter? They were nobody."
msgstr "문제 있어? 걔네는 아무것도 아니잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = f86c1c3e-f8f7-04b3-30d8-c5a35c48abe4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - f69d373d-d9c3-007f-666d-4122cb3ec56f_SCE_Minthara_MentionedPower = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:f86c1c3e-f8f7-04b3-30d8-c5a35c48abe4
msgctxt "hb012684ag0000g40c2ga2fag827abf9e98c1"
msgid ""
"During my time in the cult, I came to know one of his co-conspirators all "
"too well - Bhaal's blood-letter, Orin."
msgstr "교단에 속해있을 때, 케서릭의 공범 중 하나와 친해졌었지. 그건 바알의 하수인, 피에 미친 오린이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = f8bb6c9b-7284-521e-7b5a-e22350362e11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:f8bb6c9b-7284-521e-7b5a-e22350362e11
msgctxt "h735f5ccbg97e9g4314g8969g27e9216e025b"
msgid "We can travel together, but there can be no trust between us."
msgstr "함께 여행할 순 있겠지만, 널 신용하긴 어려울 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = f8edf583-bf9f-9d6e-5137-b69f58536df9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - OriginAddToParty(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:f8edf583-bf9f-9d6e-5137-b69f58536df9
msgctxt "hd3190906g34c7g4102gbe08gd0fc6bfafac9"
msgid ""
"Now. I am ready to leave this damned place whenever you give the word. The "
"city awaits."
msgstr "이 망할 곳을 어서 떠나 발더스 게이트로 가고 싶으니 준비가 되면 말만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f91f46ed-193b-1fe9-784f-fedcc154548a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - OriginAddToParty(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:f91f46ed-193b-1fe9-784f-fedcc154548a
msgctxt "h73b85c0fgf787g4cb4gb927g33f7bf3120fa"
msgid ""
"Excellent - I could have used your help against Ketheric. He was a "
"formidable foe."
msgstr "훌륭해. 케서릭과 싸울 때 네가 함께 해줬다면 큰 도움이 되었을 거야. 만만치 않은 녀석이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9342fa6-6994-36e6-7fcc-9f39cd0a4730
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:f9342fa6-6994-36e6-7fcc-9f39cd0a4730
msgctxt "h886940d5g7f4cg4c95ga771gbf15f638a314"
msgid "Shouldn't you be skulking off back to the Underdark?"
msgstr "이제 슬슬 언더다크로 기어들어 가야 하는 거 아냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = f9880b02-1b88-22c3-ee0d-a639b48cb79e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:f9880b02-1b88-22c3-ee0d-a639b48cb79e
msgctxt "hd9a06678g5860g4737g90cega2cac4583dd4"
msgid "First we take the Netherstones, then the brain, then the world."
msgstr "먼저 네더스톤들을 차지한 후에는 엘더브레인, 그 다음은 온 세상을 갖는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = faa3a10a-6410-3e35-fef3-4995f1028982
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:faa3a10a-6410-3e35-fef3-4995f1028982
msgctxt "h4cb9cdfcgc389g42cagba17g483f52147f8d"
msgid ""
"Those who kill without motive cannot be trusted. I would not like to wake "
"with your knife at my throat, and never understand the reason why."
msgstr ""
"너처럼 이유 없이 죽이는 사람들은 신뢰할 수 없어. 영문도 모른 채 일어났을 때 네가 내 목에 칼을 겨누고 있는 걸 보고 싶진 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = fbf6faf0-a776-55e0-e696-2c9ff69a9347
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:fbf6faf0-a776-55e0-e696-2c9ff69a9347
msgctxt "hcd91edebg9563g4053g8493gf4f183be3a22"
msgid ""
"Sparing an enemy's life is a great risk. Even though I owe my life to the "
"part of you that showed me mercy, it concerns me."
msgstr "적의 목숨을 살려주는 건 무모한 행동이다. 네 자비심 덕분에 신변을 부지하긴 했지만, 도리어 걱정이 앞서는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd03f676-c659-ffdd-e9ab-31cff6c52446
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:fd03f676-c659-ffdd-e9ab-31cff6c52446
msgctxt "hc38a23dbgad2ag4a6fg9751g8fe05de2d12c"
msgid "You make it sound so simple."
msgstr "말은 쉽지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = fe930e86-f5db-828c-3afd-6ee04c422cf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:fe930e86-f5db-828c-3afd-6ee04c422cf2
msgctxt "h14c01562g17deg4137g9b9dga10c394e7de7"
msgid ""
"You make it sound so simple. She is the Chosen of Bhaal, Lord of Murder, and "
"one of the cult's founders."
msgstr "말처럼 쉬운 게 아니야. 그녀는 살인의 신, 바알의 선택을 받은 자이고 교단의 창립자이기도 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = ff468878-5be0-ad05-fec4-3dc1bbf5a36b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara:ff468878-5be0-ad05-fec4-3dc1bbf5a36b
msgctxt "hbc863768g3a06g477aga643gfe4edaefde03"
msgid ""
"Orin was by my side. She told me that god had chosen me to be a True Soul. "
"Blessed and adored."
msgstr "오린이 내 옆에 있었지. 그녀는 내게 신이 나를 축복하고 사랑하여 참된 영혼으로 선택하였다고 말해줬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_AD
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 08f05096-f34b-49d1-80b1-e5ab99eda605
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_MintharaInvolvedInShowdown = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 34ee6a65-b150-1285-073a-82bec424e37f_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 34ee6a65-b150-1285-073a-82bec424e37f_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_AD:08f05096-f34b-49d1-80b1-e5ab99eda605
msgctxt "he9d882e8g6af9g4c5cga20eg755982ad1596"
msgid "Is Ketheric truly slain?"
msgstr "정말로 케서릭이 당한 겐가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_AD
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 26aba418-d14a-4827-a602-ea54e8379a6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_MintharaInvolvedInShowdown = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 34ee6a65-b150-1285-073a-82bec424e37f_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 34ee6a65-b150-1285-073a-82bec424e37f_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_AD:26aba418-d14a-4827-a602-ea54e8379a6b
msgctxt "hbd261a42g6518g4f70gb295gc163a75b4356"
msgid "We must talk of the horrors you saw below."
msgstr "네가 아래에서 본 끔찍한 것들에 대해 의논해야 할 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_AD
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 6e4c543b-09af-4aa2-9ae4-c0a0b6b79d05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_MintharaInvolvedInShowdown = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 34ee6a65-b150-1285-073a-82bec424e37f_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 34ee6a65-b150-1285-073a-82bec424e37f_C = False
#.     - 34ee6a65-b150-1285-073a-82bec424e37f_A = False
#.     - 34ee6a65-b150-1285-073a-82bec424e37f_B = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_AD:6e4c543b-09af-4aa2-9ae4-c0a0b6b79d05
msgctxt "hfeb5c8adgcc70g4bc7g9666gb7fa23098a21"
msgid "You survived. Good."
msgstr "살아남았구나. 잘했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_AD
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 7b2bd39f-7fc3-468f-80ab-8883b8357aae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 34ee6a65-b150-1285-073a-82bec424e37f_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_AD:7b2bd39f-7fc3-468f-80ab-8883b8357aae
msgctxt "hfbc48185g2eaag4ac6gb213gceef1596e7c4"
msgid "We should not linger here. The cult's army is on the march."
msgstr "여기서 뭉그적거릴 시간 없다. 교단의 군대가 전진 중이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 028743ae-f57b-c3ea-bf26-fd01ba424465
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:028743ae-f57b-c3ea-bf26-fd01ba424465
msgctxt "h13f7e675gdf5eg4f44g8489g4bc1538f5e2e"
msgid "What were your ambitions before you died?"
msgstr "죽기 전에는 어떤 포부가 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 0dcc5bf8-c702-5148-c206-e802d47b6966
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:0dcc5bf8-c702-5148-c206-e802d47b6966
msgctxt "ha44eb9c0g3543g4013gb75bgdfa65bba2c1f"
msgid "Destined to be... matron mother... House Baenre..."
msgstr "대모가 될... 자였다... 베인레 가문의..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21e32731-01a2-b5aa-7fd2-9d10ad41d3e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:21e32731-01a2-b5aa-7fd2-9d10ad41d3e1
msgctxt "h5b34f0ecg1455g419fgbf1ag94f293eb7aec"
msgid "Who were you before the Absolute claimed you?"
msgstr "절대자를 믿기 전까지는 어떤 사람이었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 237701ff-cb10-4c8e-9c28-cbc1228c1f84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:237701ff-cb10-4c8e-9c28-cbc1228c1f84
msgctxt "h714feff4g56c1g4762g89b7gfb8ca8426ba9"
msgid "*The spell's power wanes. You can ask no more questions.*"
msgstr "*주문의 힘이 약해집니다. 더 이상 질문을 할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 373c2130-bfc0-8474-98ec-d7235ccdb290
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:373c2130-bfc0-8474-98ec-d7235ccdb290
msgctxt "hc03846afg34cfg4b7bg9cb8gb0139baf99d4"
msgid "Have you left anything unsaid or undone?"
msgstr "아직 하지 않은 일이나 못 다한 일이 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4dfcb292-a908-d3ac-66fe-3c8633a58136
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:4dfcb292-a908-d3ac-66fe-3c8633a58136
msgctxt "hc5ca9f51g62f5g408dga1a7g32fe1eb4ad59"
msgid "*The corpse regards you lifelessly.*"
msgstr "*시체가 생기 없는 모습으로 당신을 맞이합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61661d47-3bbb-9d9c-0f5a-2947cf0c6bb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:61661d47-3bbb-9d9c-0f5a-2947cf0c6bb5
msgctxt "h4ef6d556gaf81g4ed1g88aagf2e18743dc09"
msgid "Where are you from?"
msgstr "어디서 왔지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6789bdec-6e6f-2ac4-1536-dd5e1b68ac64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_Killer(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:6789bdec-6e6f-2ac4-1536-dd5e1b68ac64
msgctxt "hb7dc05b0g48ccg4f39g997fgaf6a2813ac9a"
msgid "*The corpse seems willing to speak - but not to its killer.*"
msgstr "*시체는 말할 의지가 있지만, 자신을 죽인 자와 대화하고 싶지는 않은 듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a1c64a3-e1f9-39f9-9672-cb07ef221e8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:6a1c64a3-e1f9-39f9-9672-cb07ef221e8f
msgctxt "h406c2d11g0512g4e30g852eg1dc985b514b6"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 77af09a1-f608-5d25-4287-48b23518f5dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:77af09a1-f608-5d25-4287-48b23518f5dc
msgctxt "hda09cd2cg661fg4fbagb9f8g629cb88bbc64"
msgid "The commander I was... not the slave... I became..."
msgstr "노예가... 된 자가... 아닌.. 지휘관이었던.. 자로..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 8a1f8a01-81eb-61ba-c2ab-493306c6a8a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:8a1f8a01-81eb-61ba-c2ab-493306c6a8a2
msgctxt "h3e041d71g1a7ag4577gbf0egb288d541a6f0"
msgid "For the Absolute's lie..."
msgstr "절대자의.. 거짓말 때문에..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3b173f8-d804-14f1-2a01-5d50c5496d69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:a3b173f8-d804-14f1-2a01-5d50c5496d69
msgctxt "h3e3331a5g0ea9g4cb9g8c29g8e34bd474523"
msgid "How do you want to be remembered?"
msgstr "어떻게 기억 되고 싶지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = b0cbb02e-1d08-de58-be30-a14c3baabd97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:b0cbb02e-1d08-de58-be30-a14c3baabd97
msgctxt "h8bd5f99egf658g419fg8b64g839fb4dd6235"
msgid "To find a home... for myself... and my child..."
msgstr "나와... 내 아이를 위한... 집을 찾는 것...."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = b0f97c31-86d4-12b3-b881-6f7ff45401f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:b0f97c31-86d4-12b3-b881-6f7ff45401f4
msgctxt "h11102682g00b3g4510ga6a4ge2d7c33ecf85"
msgid "Murdering Orin... raising my daughter..."
msgstr "오린을 죽이고... 딸을 키우는 것..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = c0524a1a-7826-0620-9f0f-aa8c2302e870
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:c0524a1a-7826-0620-9f0f-aa8c2302e870
msgctxt "he16bb03eg6b57g4c98g9c7bg969af5f83b3f"
msgid "Menzoberranzan..."
msgstr "멘조베란잔..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e8acfa9e-1f2f-ad07-f721-9b77080cc470
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:e8acfa9e-1f2f-ad07-f721-9b77080cc470
msgctxt "h62933c82ga9acg49c9gaea9g02f2bdb4ba55"
msgid "*The corpse does not stir. It will answer no more questions.*"
msgstr "*시체는 움직이지 않습니다. 더 이상 질문을 받지 않을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4b75d6d-38b5-2013-0211-29e51bdbfe42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Minthara_Dead:f4b75d6d-38b5-2013-0211-29e51bdbfe42
msgctxt "h9599d348g314ag44c7ga83ega52121ca7a99"
msgid "Why did you abandon Lolth?"
msgstr "롤쓰 신앙을 버린 이유가 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0269709f-be08-2cd0-5e57-fcf05d819448
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:0269709f-be08-2cd0-5e57-fcf05d819448
msgctxt "hf39830b0g0fccg4e26gb8c1g1cb67ee8f4f9"
msgid "It was strategy - not personal."
msgstr "개인적인 감정은 없었어. 전략이었을 뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 07cbc3bb-fcd1-5f5e-eba5-baa951865a89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:07cbc3bb-fcd1-5f5e-eba5-baa951865a89
msgctxt "h02b119a0g36d3g4851g8fd1gce68c36c61d1"
msgid ""
"We must remain vigilant. And grateful. I will join your camp tonight. There, "
"we will discuss the spirals of time - past and future. And we will make "
"merry in the present, wherein we reside."
msgstr ""
"방심해서는 안 되네. 또 감사하는 마음도 가져야지. 오늘 밤 자네들의 야영지에 합류하도록 하겠네. 시간의 격류 속에서 파묻힌 이야기가 "
"있다면 거기서 풀어내도록 하지. 그러고 난 후에는 우리가 살아가는 이 순간을 한번 즐겨보도록 하세나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 0e533730-021c-e234-d748-c2f565d7e158
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_IsobelNightsongReunion_SoloNS_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = False
#.      - HAV_Isobel_State_IsDead = True
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_IsobelNightsongReunion_SoloNS_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:0e533730-021c-e234-d748-c2f565d7e158
msgctxt "h17493cd4gce7dg45b8g8ee9g424bb70aaf81"
msgid ""
"You have defeated Ketheric Thorm, yet you who were content to leave Dame "
"Aylin in his thrall until it served you best. How do you account for it?"
msgstr ""
"케서릭 쏨을 물리쳤구나. 그러나 너는 네가 유리한 고지를 차지하기 전까지 나 여기사 에일린을 그의 노예로 짓밟히도록 내버려 두었지. "
"해명할 수 있겠나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 107b2436-b934-43f8-5221-777885486696
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:107b2436-b934-43f8-5221-777885486696
msgctxt "hce7ec284g44f2g48b5g8e79gaff301f96179"
msgid "See you there."
msgstr "거기서 보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 28fc1700-6f55-5d22-bf26-63dbf49f3ddb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:28fc1700-6f55-5d22-bf26-63dbf49f3ddb
msgctxt "h69d5be17g7892g4a7dgb877g6d62355bd085"
msgid ""
"Failure is disquieting. But you are lucky - for you have failed at a destiny "
"that was not yours to fulfil."
msgstr "실패는 사람을 불안하게 하지. 그러나 자네에게는 다행스럽게도, 자네가 망쳤다고 여기는 그 운명은 자네의 것이 아니라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2be37456-985c-99cb-2742-c71325a9729e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:2be37456-985c-99cb-2742-c71325a9729e
msgctxt "h4afa220fg4ccag4b38g92cagd05999f44324"
msgid "Good. I'll see you there."
msgstr "좋아. 거기서 보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 2c8af086-a138-1269-f90e-f77ad09faba5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:2c8af086-a138-1269-f90e-f77ad09faba5
msgctxt "hc63f6b9bg6e9cg4760gbd0bg17151a90120e"
msgid ""
"True, we live at the mercy of the gods. But we get to choose to whom we yoke "
"our fate."
msgstr "그래, 우리는 정말로 신들의 자비 속에서 살아가지. 그러나 누구에게 운명을 맡길지는 스스로의 선택이라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2f5f9d7f-500d-69ec-f065-4508ad5e17af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:2f5f9d7f-500d-69ec-f065-4508ad5e17af
msgctxt "h10bce0eag2078g49dbg8497g3cea8fd1d6c1"
msgid ""
"No need to wait. I freed you so I could kill Ketheric, but I have no "
"interest in an alliance."
msgstr "아니, 기다릴 필요도 없지. 난 케서릭을 죽이기 위해 당신을 풀어줬을 뿐, 동맹에는 별로 흥미 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 328c8693-650e-4b19-375b-e73a19993665
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:328c8693-650e-4b19-375b-e73a19993665
msgctxt "h5c857312gccf8g4c6bg9a58g414002d63263"
msgid ""
"We must remain vigilant. And grateful. I will join your camp tonight. There, "
"we will discuss the Moonmaiden's plan for you - for your past, your future."
msgstr ""
"방심해서는 안 되네. 또 감사하는 마음도 가져야지. 오늘 밤 자네들의 야영지에 합류하도록 하겠네. 달처녀께서 자네들의 과거와 미래에 대해 "
"안배해두신 계획은 바로 거기서 논의하도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 471f94d6-5baf-d8c4-58e5-dac7f2d0f670
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_IsobelNightsongReunion_SoloNS_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = False
#.      - HAV_Isobel_State_IsDead = True
#.      - COL_KethericShowdown_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_IsobelNightsongReunion_SoloNS_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:471f94d6-5baf-d8c4-58e5-dac7f2d0f670
msgctxt "he246250eg7d7bg4cdeg8cccgae687aabcdf7"
msgid ""
"Isobel is dead. But <i>you </i>live - you who were content to leave me in "
"the thrall of foul Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr ""
"이소벨은 죽었어. 그러나 <i>네놈</i>은 살아있구나. 나 여기사 에일린을 사악한 케서릭 쏨의 노예로 짓밟히도록 내버려 두었던 네놈 "
"말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 49d166d9-de96-8cdd-85b1-3da6ff5c975f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:49d166d9-de96-8cdd-85b1-3da6ff5c975f
msgctxt "h4d711651g851cg4d3dg8713g478581706392"
msgid ""
"It takes a lion's heart to admit such a terrible mistake. I will forgive "
"you, in time."
msgstr "사자의 심장과도 같은 큰 용기를 지닌 사람만이 자신의 끔찍한 실수를 인정할 수 있겠지. 때가 되면 용서하겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 539b485a-4f4b-31c3-5ab5-aed552ae10c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_IsobelNightsongReunion_SoloNS_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:539b485a-4f4b-31c3-5ab5-aed552ae10c0
msgctxt "h630d5dc9g516fg4102g99ddgf0593b134d10"
msgid "Blessings of the Moonmaiden upon all beneath her watchful eye."
msgstr "달처녀께서 굽어살피는 모든 것들에 축복이 있기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5494465f-e153-9a94-bb82-065ce466318d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:5494465f-e153-9a94-bb82-065ce466318d
msgctxt "h942d0078gd942g4761gb4deg19b98caf2fcb"
msgid "Fine. I'll see you this evening."
msgstr "좋아. 오늘 밤에 보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58ccfa77-84ff-14df-0445-203aae8d8f29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:58ccfa77-84ff-14df-0445-203aae8d8f29
msgctxt "h8b70c4bcg4f2ag492cgb7f4gcbd5f088fb4b"
msgid "I don't think so. Our journey together ends here."
msgstr "아니. 우리의 여정은 여기서 끝이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 6b3f13f6-ef4d-6580-c593-a8a803e79e9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:6b3f13f6-ef4d-6580-c593-a8a803e79e9a
msgctxt "h825ee0a1g72fag4ae5g8da9g6b27a77c9b20"
msgid ""
"I will visit your camp later. Perhaps the madness of battle will have left "
"you, and you will be ready to speak sense."
msgstr "나중에 네 야영지에 들러보겠네. 어쩌면 그때쯤이면 네놈도 전투의 광기에서 벗어나 이성적으로 대화할 준비가 되어 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 6c6bc600-68c7-0ff3-c9db-eea19ac3fb8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:6c6bc600-68c7-0ff3-c9db-eea19ac3fb8f
msgctxt "hf814114cg4713g48dcgb89cg02162f2dec00"
msgid ""
"We live at the mercy of the gods. Even I, immortal, have no guarantee of "
"days to come."
msgstr "우리는 신들의 자비 속에서 살아가지. 불멸자인 나조차도, 앞날이 보장되어 있지는 않다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6edd1b50-0db1-7828-704e-b53466c4d0dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:6edd1b50-0db1-7828-704e-b53466c4d0dc
msgctxt "h3b10f265g3d81g4d60g93b7g4b644dc306e3"
msgid "I'd do it again, if the whim struck me."
msgstr "만약 그럴 충동이 든다면, 또 못할 것도 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 736a36df-42e4-825d-b759-8119da1af699
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:736a36df-42e4-825d-b759-8119da1af699
msgctxt "h360f9ef4gd71ag4b0dgae85g47e26e8becd1"
msgid ""
"And you - Sharran. Cleric of the Lady of Loss, who is so much more than she "
"appears. You and Dame Aylin have dangerous ground to tread."
msgstr ""
"그리고 상실의 여인을 섬기는 클레릭, 샤 신도여. 자네의 이면에는 많은 것이 숨겨져 있다네. 그대와 여기사 에일린은 앞으로 위험한 "
"이야기를 나누게 될 것이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 76614a37-e522-fb89-3f79-bac8af577812
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:76614a37-e522-fb89-3f79-bac8af577812
msgctxt "h8058f19agd62ag4fbagb6d6g421e02d5a7ea"
msgid ""
"Good. Whatever you think you know about me had better be worth it. You've "
"already cost me dearly."
msgstr "좋아. 당신이 나에 대해 뭘 알고 있든 내가 치른 값비싼 희생에 걸맞아야 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 76d21563-ce86-4e57-fa77-860b789261e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:76d21563-ce86-4e57-fa77-860b789261e8
msgctxt "h8f8e224eg343dg4c1cg8916gae996282a73d"
msgid ""
"Aye, it was. It was a failure I won't soon forget. Still, you are no lost "
"cause, are you?"
msgstr "그래, 그렇다네. 내가 쉬이 잊을 실수는 아니지. 그래도 자네는 개과천선의 여지가 없는 녀석은 아니로군?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a25707e-9a56-17a3-1aba-d6782d46b97e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:7a25707e-9a56-17a3-1aba-d6782d46b97e
msgctxt "h30b39242gdbf1g46ecgbe9cgd051f3ea3be8"
msgid ""
"I may not live long - Lady Shar wanted me to kill you. Now I've failed her, "
"<i>and </i>spited you."
msgstr ""
"난 이제 곧 죽을지도 몰라. 샤 여신께서는 내가 당신을 죽이길 원하셨어. 난 이제 샤님도 실망하게 했고, <i>게다가</i> 당신에게 "
"앙심도 품었던 몸이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 7db65b88-d5b6-cf6d-dfcc-5e3c568678b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:7db65b88-d5b6-cf6d-dfcc-5e3c568678b5
msgctxt "hf696a90fg7c36g418bg8d65g3b7e8f6bfca9"
msgid ""
"If you seek to protect it, our aims are aligned - even if you've much to "
"learn about the <i>methods </i>of a true champion."
msgstr ""
"만일 그대가 이 세계를 지키고자 한다면, 우리는 동지라네. 비록 그대가 진정한 용사가 되기 위해 <i>배울 점</i>이 많이 남았다 해도 "
"말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 7ec0310e-a31d-e8d2-926a-56b18ea1eef7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:7ec0310e-a31d-e8d2-926a-56b18ea1eef7
msgctxt "hc8d84383gfe84g4b0eg83fcg28e126dc30fd"
msgid ""
"They will keep. Let us first retire to a more restful place. Your camp will "
"do."
msgstr "기다리도록 하게. 우선 이곳을 떠나서 좀 조용한 곳에서 얘기하도록 하지. 그대의 야영지가 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 90c0d1d7-531b-7f8b-dbc8-0170051cbe8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:90c0d1d7-531b-7f8b-dbc8-0170051cbe8a
msgctxt "h7f1ab23fg3b11g46d1g8de2g7c58b76e870a"
msgid "Be careful, <i>little soldier</i>. Whims are not all that can strike."
msgstr "조심하라고, <i>작은 병사</i>님. 찾아오는 건 충동만이 아니니깐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a6f07c6-e888-0958-029d-cb2d60abb486
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:9a6f07c6-e888-0958-029d-cb2d60abb486
msgctxt "hc577a576gd31fg4073g9040g797adeb8b09b"
msgid "I apologise. It was wrong of me to leave you in Ketheric's clutches."
msgstr "사과하지. 당신을 케서릭의 손아귀에 내버려 뒀던 건 실수였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 9f45bf65-6a9d-4a52-3904-ad772c6d80b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:9f45bf65-6a9d-4a52-3904-ad772c6d80b2
msgctxt "h7d2b7181g162eg4253g9bd2gafea1553f6bf"
msgid ""
"You would deny Dame Aylin, daughter of the Moonmaiden, paladin of the "
"selfsame Selûne?"
msgstr "감히 달처녀의 딸이자 셀루네의 팔라딘인 여기사 에일린을 거절하는 것이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a16a690f-27fc-27a3-e719-a053d7581df4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:a16a690f-27fc-27a3-e719-a053d7581df4
msgctxt "h410e3962ga082g44e7g94a2g0a1b6394b735"
msgid "I would."
msgstr "맞아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = a62cf548-a71e-0a47-e299-3543336a5cfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:a62cf548-a71e-0a47-e299-3543336a5cfa
msgctxt "he72e3e2agd733g4899g8be9g3e5ec2065a33"
msgid ""
"I will not forget it. But nor will I turn down a powerful ally in the fight "
"for Faerûn."
msgstr "이를 잊지 않겠네. 하지만 페이룬을 위한 싸움에서 강력한 동맹이 되어줄 자를 거절하지도 않을 것이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = b3cbc6d7-ca01-3579-0886-97f9f4b7979b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:b3cbc6d7-ca01-3579-0886-97f9f4b7979b
msgctxt "h18b3287egd1a5g41a8gb31fgfcd3a1aeccea"
msgid "We will cover some small part of it soon."
msgstr "조만간 그에 대해 이야기를 조금씩 해보도록 하겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = b825bb5b-d7d7-5d03-39df-b929ce5faf44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_IsobelNightsongReunion_SoloNS_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - HAV_Isobel_State_IsDead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_IsobelNightsongReunion_SoloNS_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:b825bb5b-d7d7-5d03-39df-b929ce5faf44
msgctxt "h261020acgf5e3g4270ga546ge6bca1335c1b"
msgid ""
"Ketheric is dead. Balthazar is dead. Isobel, sweet Isobel, is no more. But "
"we, <i>we </i>live."
msgstr "케서릭은 죽었다. 발타자르도 죽었지. 이소벨, 나의 이소벨은... 이제 없어. 하지만 우리, <i>우리</i>는 살아있구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = ba8bf3a6-7b6c-a626-46ac-c6c15ae25ef4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:ba8bf3a6-7b6c-a626-46ac-c6c15ae25ef4
msgctxt "h593798d5g432fg4376gaed8g428758191552"
msgid ""
"I will join your camp tonight. There is much you should know. About the "
"Moonmaiden, about your past. Your future."
msgstr ""
"오늘 밤 자네들의 야영지에 합류하도록 하겠네. 자네가 알아야 할 것들이 아주 많아. 달처녀님에 대한 것들. 그리고 그대의 과거와, 미래에 "
"관한 것들 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c884ab80-7fc5-4e38-7a4a-f8579f64e024
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:c884ab80-7fc5-4e38-7a4a-f8579f64e024
msgctxt "h127e7b6eg944cg49b1gbf7bg4c1f8f0cc8cb"
msgid "Why delay? Just tell me now."
msgstr "왜 미루는 거지? 그냥 지금 말해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb9e854a-f4f2-cf0b-b79a-99eae2f1d90d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:cb9e854a-f4f2-cf0b-b79a-99eae2f1d90d
msgctxt "hfd209eaeg8e00g4cd8gb2ebg6cfecf28c8aa"
msgid "What do you mean by that?"
msgstr "무슨 의미지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = d7d32bca-8094-a809-b72b-640f885d9361
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:d7d32bca-8094-a809-b72b-640f885d9361
msgctxt "hdea964cbg0b8cg4b10ga5b8gfa080c004f71"
msgid ""
"Reject the moon, if it be your will. It will not stop her from lending you "
"her light. Good day."
msgstr "달을 거절하는 것은 자네의 자유라네. 그러나 달빛이 그대에게 닿는 것을 막을 수는 없어. 좋은 하루가 되길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = d944e222-9a92-74df-6292-d4d5bff5c04f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:d944e222-9a92-74df-6292-d4d5bff5c04f
msgctxt "h4367e2dbg3002g4b80gb7c2geaf113bdbfbe"
msgid ""
"I will join your camp, that we may discuss what must needs be discussed."
msgstr "자네들의 야영지에 합류하겠네. 거기서 논의해야 마땅한 일들을 다뤄보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = dd6709be-a6c6-b7b8-484b-de9386f1bb10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCE_IsobelNightsongReunion_JoiningCamp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:dd6709be-a6c6-b7b8-484b-de9386f1bb10
msgctxt "hb377184bg3b54g4122g8409g2fe0ec245cd5"
msgid "You certainly will."
msgstr "그럴 것이라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = e4500e28-497a-5da2-7ecd-2534bf5e5864
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCE_IsobelNightsongReunion_JoiningCamp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:e4500e28-497a-5da2-7ecd-2534bf5e5864
msgctxt "h930141beg030dg4b25gb28bg7b7eb4f033c7"
msgid "All in its own time, the Sharran-who-wasn't."
msgstr "때가 되면 알게 되리라. 한때 샤 신도가 아니었던 자여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = edd3d2e2-6f3c-698b-548b-8c1f0a7a129b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:edd3d2e2-6f3c-698b-548b-8c1f0a7a129b
msgctxt "hf39dea5fg2b44g4114gb215gf28f9d541b70"
msgid "I have questions <i>now</i>."
msgstr "난 <i>지금</i> 물어보고 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = f17ab125-3c92-bc3e-fa13-baf45f522767
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:f17ab125-3c92-bc3e-fa13-baf45f522767
msgctxt "h1c155a7fg1d30g4870ga86ag50850d50d15c"
msgid ""
"Not personal for <i>you</i>, perhaps. You played a game of life and death, "
"using mine as a chip in your pile."
msgstr "네놈 <i>스스로</i>에게는 별로 상관이 없었겠지. 너는 나를 판돈으로 걸고 삶과 죽음이 오가는 게임을 했으니 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = f98b7787-d444-3ded-993d-ccae8e6aeea2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_NightsongSoloReunion:f98b7787-d444-3ded-993d-ccae8e6aeea2
msgctxt "h7b2f0011g8cf0g461egbca0g2896bb2de2d8"
msgid ""
"I am Dame Aylin. Daughter of the Moonmaiden, Selûne; champion of her causes "
"in this fine realm."
msgstr "나는 여기사 에일린이네. 달처녀 셀루네의 딸이며, 이 아름다운 세상에서 그분의 뜻을 대신하는 투사이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
msgctxt "h7fe826cag1632g4055ga6a3gc965a7799b7a"
msgid ""
"At least the shadow curse is banished. I like the dark, but not when it's "
"trying to kill me."
msgstr "적어도 그림자 저주는 사라졌네. 어둠을 좋아하기는 하지만 그게 날 죽이려 들 때는 별로지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
msgctxt "hb0a4825cg740ag445cgb111gd05bfedaede4"
msgid ""
"I have conquered beholders and bandits, but never darkness itself. I dare "
"say we could part all the seas of Toril if we so wished!"
msgstr ""
"나는 수많은 비홀더와 도적들을 찍어눌렀지만, 어둠만은 정복한 적이 없다. 마음만 먹는다면 아마 토릴의 모든 바다도 가를 수 있을 거다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
msgctxt "h5bf44b2agab91g4a3cg9e54g11465e601371"
msgid ""
"Whatever dangers lie ahead, at least the shadow curse is one blight we were "
"able to cure."
msgstr "이 앞에 어떤 위험이 도사리고 있든, 적어도 그림자 저주는 우리가 치유할 수 있는 역병이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
msgctxt "h54acecacg53eeg49a7g9005g80d357a9dba7"
msgid "We leave this place better than when we found it. Well done."
msgstr "우리가 처음 이 땅을 밟았을 때보다 더 좋은 곳으로 만들고 떠나는 군. 참 잘했네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
msgctxt "h163d23e0g2893g4613ga97dgb7b3f6b81404"
msgid "Curse: gone. Hell yes."
msgstr "저주 상태: 사라짐. 존나 좋군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
msgctxt "h7aacbefbg0f90g454egaa05g5da4f5147360"
msgid ""
"Whatever waits in the city - at least I did not have to leave this place "
"abandoned to the curse a second time."
msgstr "그 도시에서 무엇이 기다리고 있든, 이번에는 이 땅을 그림자 저주에 남겨둔 채 떠나지 않아도 되어서 다행이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
msgctxt "h6ad6db0bg2131g4fedg8eadg91bd77f1a19d"
msgid ""
"Whatever awaits us on the road ahead, we can at least be proud that the "
"shadow curse is no more."
msgstr "앞 길에 무엇이 우릴 기다리고 있든, 이 땅에 그림자 저주는 더 이상 없다는 점에 대해서는 자랑스럽게 여겨도 될 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2120e9b0-7f8a-492e-aaa6-762afc491e21
msgctxt "hfeb4577eg44feg4d57gb2b5gc3cf7aed1278"
msgid "The shadow curse will soon be forgotten, thanks to us."
msgstr "우리의 활약 덕에 그림자 저주는 곧 잊힐 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 214b6f61-f6a4-dd4d-d95e-87b71bdf9536
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:214b6f61-f6a4-dd4d-d95e-87b71bdf9536
msgctxt "h14697980g3df1g4995gada8g1aa38c036dd6"
msgid "Lady Shar's embrace holds strong. She will be pleased, no doubt."
msgstr "샤 여신의 축복이 여전히 강하게 남아있어. 분명히 기뻐하실 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
msgctxt "h33798f31gef23g487ag83f8gec94f3e3710a"
msgid ""
"I can't wait to be clear of this damned shadow curse. I like darkness - just "
"not when it's trying to kill me."
msgstr "이 망할 그림자 저주에서 한시라도 빨리 벗어나고 싶어. 어둠을 좋아하지만 날 죽이려들면 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
msgctxt "h228dea3dgb13fg41e0gbfcdga70c3c3d24ad"
msgid ""
"The cursed darkness still lingers. Don't waste any regrets on it - we have "
"more pressing foes to conquer."
msgstr "그림자 저주가 아직 남아 있군, 더 급한 적들이 있으니 마음에 담아 둘 필요는 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
msgctxt "h7268132dg650ag4069gbad5g61490c478b19"
msgid ""
"A pity to leave this land in the shadow curse's blighted grip. But the "
"Absolute's threat dwarfs even this."
msgstr "그림자 저주의 황폐한 손아귀에 이 땅을 두고 가게 되어서 안타깝군. 하지만 절대자의 위협에 비하면 이조차도 작은 일이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
msgctxt "h50db344bgbb1fg4d1fgb777gf0668aa594ff"
msgid "We leave this land as we found it: lost to the shadows. What a shame."
msgstr "여전히 그림자 속에 묻혀 있군, 우리가 처음 봤을 때 그대로 두고 떠나게 되다니. 안타까운 일이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
msgctxt "h445c907fg9d6bg4197ga0f7g3e8cb00f2605"
msgid ""
"A pity we couldn't clear this curse. I bet this place was beautiful, once."
msgstr "그림자 저주를 풀어내지 못하다니 아쉽군. 한때는 여기도 아름다운 곳이었겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
msgctxt "hc4daa03fg1bbcg482fg8debg8b9e417fe0b7"
msgid ""
"And again, we leave this place blighted by the curse. Always a bigger battle "
"somewhere else."
msgstr "또 다시 이 땅을 저주에 황폐해진 채로 내버려두고 떠나게 되는군. 언제나 어딘가에서 더 큰 전투가 기다리고 있는 법이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
msgctxt "hc295a044gbf58g4587gb8bdg3d022804a64b"
msgid ""
"The shadow curse still holds sway - please, we must not go on without "
"lifting it."
msgstr "그림자 저주가 여전히 영향을 끼치고 있네. 부디, 이 저주를 해결하고 가야만 한다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:2a7c3c66-589f-f9f7-7759-3abae845a2a1
msgctxt "hc1abbe7dg1fdag405egb6a3ge8b2d7a70b37"
msgid ""
"The shadow curse still taints the land. Perhaps we could have lifted it, had "
"we tried."
msgstr "그림자 저주가 여전히 이 땅을 더럽히고 있어. 우리가 노력했다면 저주를 풀었을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 485173de-3457-747e-1a3d-548acc6713ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#.      - SHADOWHEART_ENEMYOFSHARPATH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:485173de-3457-747e-1a3d-548acc6713ea
msgctxt "h154ed555gf3beg41a2g9b32g5b36931b1108"
msgid ""
"Now these lands are free of Shar. I hope I can say the same of myself, soon "
"enough."
msgstr "이 땅은 이제 샤로부터 해방되었어. 머지않아 나도 그렇게 된다면 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 559baa35-2821-6e5c-b1bf-c5ab25c84fe7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#.      - SHADOWHEART_ENEMYOFSHARPATH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:559baa35-2821-6e5c-b1bf-c5ab25c84fe7
msgctxt "h1b96776eg0402g4b0fg818ege82b5bb0771a"
msgid ""
"The shadow curse persists. A shame we could not lift it... but we have to "
"move on."
msgstr "그림자 저주가 여전히 남아 있어. 저주를 풀지 못해서 안타깝지만... 나아가야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74503ba4-d5cb-b386-5e15-0389e095d623
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_CurseStateComment:74503ba4-d5cb-b386-5e15-0389e095d623
msgctxt "hb1a84385g1cc0g4c6ag8e9bg229d4c733085"
msgid ""
"Lady Shar's embrace has been lifted from these lands. A necessary sacrifice, "
"to stop that traitor, Thorm."
msgstr "샤 여신의 축복이 이 땅에서 사라졌지만, 배신자 쏨을 처단하기 위해서는 필요한 희생이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted:f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
msgctxt "hb1996a2dg5322g46ddgbac4gd09c6fdcc9c3"
msgid ""
"Ketheric's gone, but his shadow curse remains. We'll need to be careful out "
"there."
msgstr "케서릭은 죽었지만 그림자 저주는 여전해. 조심 해야겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted:f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
msgctxt "h34a83a12gfec5g4186gb68ag7c12343e8373"
msgid "A shame the curse did not fall with Ketheric Thorm. Beware the shadows."
msgstr "저주가 케서릭 쏨과 함께 사라지지 않았다는 게 아쉽군. 그림자를 조심해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted:f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
msgctxt "hca47d838gf9d4g4308g98f7g78905b8327d0"
msgid ""
"Ketheric is dead, but the shadow curse lives. It would be unwise to succumb "
"to it now."
msgstr "케서릭은 죽었지만 그림자 저주는 남아있어. 이제 와서 저주에게 지는 건 그리 현명하지 못하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and SHADOWHEART_ENEMYOFSHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted:f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
msgctxt "h90fb3fa0gda19g43cdg9bfbg9f3901f884f1"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm is no more, but the shadow curse still remains. I need to be "
"careful."
msgstr "케서릭은 죽었어, 하지만 그림자 저주는 여전하군. 조심해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted:f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
msgctxt "h912086bdg6f0fg4b7bgaef6g016c8e204fc0"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm is no more, yet Lady Shar's power persists. She shall be "
"pleased, no doubt."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨은 죽었지만 샤 여신의 힘은 여전하군. 분명히 기뻐하실 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted:f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
msgctxt "h6f0a88d0g8a9fg42aegaf24gcd3501b4eb00"
msgid ""
"Keep to the light. Ketheric may be dead - but the curse did not fall with "
"him."
msgstr "케서릭은 죽었지만 저주는 그렇지 않군. 빛을 가까이 하도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted:f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
msgctxt "he5f8d39egb8f1g4ceag950dg3d2e317af599"
msgid ""
"The Absolute may be gone, but the shadows aren't. We'll still need to tread "
"carefully."
msgstr "절대자는 사라졌을지도 모르지만 그림자는 여전해. 조심할 필요가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted:f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
msgctxt "h4df472begb409g4eeeg8b33g31e6594ee08b"
msgid ""
"We may have cleansed this place of Ketheric, but the shadow curse will kill "
"us just as dead."
msgstr "케서릭은 물리쳤지만 그림자 저주는 여전히 우릴 죽음으로 몰아넣을 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted:f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
msgctxt "hf0f4ff95g1f7eg44b1gb83ag773a7f350227"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm is no more, but the shadow curse remains. There must be a way "
"to lift it."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨은 사라졌지만 그림자 저주는 여전하네. 이걸 없앨 수 있는 방법이 분명 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[9].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ShadowCurseNotLifted:f14d55bb-98e8-4adc-8237-55f779e165c6
msgctxt "h9ab41338g1b6ag4975g8206g1b760818dd0b"
msgid "Ketheric may be gone, but the shadows remain. On our guard."
msgstr "케서릭이 죽었지만 그림자는 아직도 남아 있어. 경계를 늦추지마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate:ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
msgctxt "hf234699fg364dg4951gb396g7c57aa5a3f47"
msgid ""
"If we head west, we'll hit Baldur's Gate. And if we're quick, we might even "
"get there before the Absolute's army."
msgstr "서쪽으로 간다면, 발더스 게이트에 도착 할 거야. 서두른다면, 절대자의 군대보다 더 먼저 도착할지도 모르고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate:ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
msgctxt "h6a2b85adg3919g477eg84a6ged1dc1e0885b"
msgid ""
"The Absolute's forces will march west, to Baldur's Gate. Let's aim to reach "
"it before they do."
msgstr "절대자의 군대는 발더스 게이트가 있는 서쪽으로 진군하겠지. 놈들보다 먼저 도착하는데 집중하도록 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate:ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
msgctxt "hd72c9f29g7815g48e3gb709g4dc6415780d0"
msgid ""
"The road to Baldur's Gate lies west of Reithwin. Our quickest route, if we "
"can stay ahead of the Absolute' forces."
msgstr "발더스 게이트로 가는 길은 라이스윈의 서쪽에 있어. 절대자의 군대보다 앞설 수만 있다면 가장 빠른 길이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate:ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
msgctxt "h32878610gfaaag4edega448gcc591cf49965"
msgid ""
"The road to Baldur's Gate awaits us, west of town. Let's try to outpace the "
"Absolute's armies."
msgstr "발더스 게이트로 향하는 길은 마을의 서쪽에 있어. 절대자의 군대보다 앞서 가보자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate:ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
msgctxt "h695d5f59ge796g4a5cgaebbgafb1dcc88293"
msgid ""
"The way to Baldur's Gate lies to the west of town. Come - the city beckons."
msgstr "마을의 서쪽에 발더스 게이트로 향하는 길이 있어. 서두르자, 도시가 우릴 부르고 있으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate:ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
msgctxt "h668db1f8gc692g4187g90aegff4d14071d5a"
msgid ""
"Baldur's Gate! I'm coming, home. And I'll get there before the Absolute."
msgstr "발더스 게이트! 집이여, 내가 간다. 그리고 절대자보다 먼저 가주겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate:ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
msgctxt "h19427c1eg7602g430fg9d37gcbc4522b38d7"
msgid ""
"The road to the city lies west of the town. We might outpace the army yet, "
"if we do not dally."
msgstr "도시로 향하는 길은 마을의 서쪽에 있어. 꾸물대지 않는다면 절대자의 군세를 앞지를 수 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate:ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
msgctxt "h2742b67dg6d88g457bgbbadgb0f90501f28f"
msgid ""
"The road to Baldur's Gate lies west of the town. We should try to head off "
"the Absolute's forces."
msgstr "마을 서쪽에 발더스 게이트로 향하는 길이 있네. 절대자의 군대를 앞질러야만 한다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_ToBaldursGate:ba38941f-7212-4031-9516-ccef33fab70c
msgctxt "hac7b6df9g33c4g450dg88a6gf0df44c13597"
msgid ""
"The road to Baldur's Gate is west of the town. If we hurry, we'll arrive "
"before the Absolute's forces."
msgstr "발더스 게이트로 향하는 길은 마을의 서쪽에 있어. 서두른다면 절대자의 군대를 앞지를 수 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness:2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
msgctxt "h3c74b50dg3c2cg4cddgb3bcg5fc41713f3b6"
msgid ""
"If you must chatter with everyone before we go, <i>do</i> be quick. The City "
"awaits."
msgstr "출발하기 전에 모든 사람들하고 수다를 떨고 싶다면, <b>빨리</b> 하도록 해. 도시가 우릴 기다리고 있잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness:2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
msgctxt "h6f0e0b2fg4dffg4c34gbdeege0ef1baff5df"
msgid ""
"The road to the city lies ahead. If we have business behind us, let us face "
"it now."
msgstr "도시로 가는 길이 바로 앞이야. 마무리 짓지 못한 일이 있다면 지금 해결하자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness:2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
msgctxt "hcb12ab41g42b4g4d36ga316g637e0d1f0118"
msgid ""
"Baldur's Gate lies ahead. A one way journey, for now - better tie up our "
"loose ends before we depart."
msgstr "발더스 게이트로 가는 길이 곧장 앞에 있어. 당장은, 일방통행이지. 그러니 떠나기 전에 일을 마무리 짓는 게 좋을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness:2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
msgctxt "h3ada9e5bgf576g4499g90dag4366122e4d0b"
msgid ""
"The road to Baldur's Gate awaits us, west of town. We had better see to any "
"unfinished matters now."
msgstr "발더스 게이트로 가는 길은 마을의 서쪽에 있어. 끝내지 못한 일들이 있다면 확인해 보는 게 좋을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness:2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
msgctxt "h96edf90cgf4c0g402cg86c3g282372a0fb2d"
msgid ""
"Baldur's Gate lies ahead. If we've any lingering business to attend to, "
"now's the time."
msgstr "발더스 게이트가 목전이군. 마무리 짓지 못한 일이 있다면 지금이 기회야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness:2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
msgctxt "h0e8b402eg65feg4c49gaf03ge54764f641ca"
msgid ""
"The road home is up ahead. Baldur's Gate. Anything left undone, we should do "
"it now, before it's too late."
msgstr "고향, 발더스 게이트로 향하는 길이 바로 앞이야. 끝내지 못한 일이 있다면 너무 늦기 전에 끝내는 게 좋겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness:2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
msgctxt "h5c7f8bf0gddaeg49afg87bdga853e2c291ea"
msgid ""
"The road to Baldur's Gate lies ahead. If there are matters to be settled in "
"this place, let us have it done."
msgstr "발더스 게이트로 향하는 길이 눈 앞에 있어. 여기서 끝내지 못한 일이 있다면, 끝내도록 하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness:2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
msgctxt "hf98e7db7g7a98g4836g8645g9a76ebb8866e"
msgid ""
"Baldur's Gate lies that way. We may not return here - better see to any "
"unfinished work before we depart."
msgstr "발더스 게이트는 이 쪽이라네. 돌아오지 못할 수도 있으니 출발 하기 전에 미뤄둔 일들을 확인 해보는 게 좋을걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PartyVB_PAD_UnfinishedBusiness:2aa03a5f-724a-49e3-a7cf-455c7357de6c
msgctxt "h20d0b473g7cb1g438cgb2f8gc981a4ec0701"
msgid ""
"The road to Baldur's Gate is up ahead. No turning back, once we start down "
"that road."
msgstr "발더스 게이트로 가는 길이 목전에 있어. 이 곳으로 간다면 다시 돌아올 수 없을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_000
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = 4b565292-b6db-5284-6ad9-6f610d43d8ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_000_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_000:4b565292-b6db-5284-6ad9-6f610d43d8ef
msgctxt "h5211fe8fg6c3eg48a2ga272gb99e92fa9a49"
msgid "Safely on to Baldur's Gate. For all of us."
msgstr "우리 모두를 위해 발더스 게이트에 무사히 도달하기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_000
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = 88be5730-3ca2-783e-8ce2-bfaf972b8ebf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_000_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_000_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_000:88be5730-3ca2-783e-8ce2-bfaf972b8ebf
msgctxt "hacdd2dc6g324eg4908gbe94gd613c0606b38"
msgid "You'd make a fine Fist."
msgstr "당신은 휼륭한 피스트 대원이 될 수 있을 것 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_001
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = 539bfd9c-1ad1-438f-9a3f-3ebd2b416f57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_001_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_001:539bfd9c-1ad1-438f-9a3f-3ebd2b416f57
msgctxt "h7b201a0eg2756g459fgb3ddg239fdf2fdb39"
msgid "We need to move. The city's in danger."
msgstr "서둘러야 합니다. 도시가 위험에 처해 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_001
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = 79d52eba-6b5d-4d11-9cce-871fe869789d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_001_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_001_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_PatrollingFlamingFist_001:79d52eba-6b5d-4d11-9cce-871fe869789d
msgctxt "he2f84ca9g7b47g48b5gac64g42af92e2ff6c"
msgid ""
"We need to get back to the city before those monsters do. Baldur's Gate is "
"my home - I have to protect it."
msgstr "발더스 게이트는 내 고향이야, 내가 지켜야만 해. 괴물 놈들보다 도시로 먼저 돌아가야 한다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist
#. Speaker = Art Cullagh
#. NodeID = 13569f44-6a22-441e-ba20-1f1edb6061c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e680129a-9d39-6ffc-3e6d-926daf0d76ff_A = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e680129a-9d39-6ffc-3e6d-926daf0d76ff_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist:13569f44-6a22-441e-ba20-1f1edb6061c3
msgctxt "h2f7e5d45g5d97g422egb377g711b180a6cee"
msgid "It's... like... like your mind wants you dead."
msgstr "이건 그러니까.. 마치... 네 마음이 네가 죽기를 원하는 것만 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist
#. Speaker = Art Cullagh
#. NodeID = 412608d6-647f-410a-91ff-2ece6356db29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist:412608d6-647f-410a-91ff-2ece6356db29
msgctxt "h986cea9cg89c4g43c6g818agb3b439ecdaf5"
msgid ""
"Thaniel. I had to look after him. Without him, I wouldn't have lasted long."
msgstr "테니엘 덕분이야. 녀석을 돌봐야 했었지. 테니엘이 없었더라면 오래 버티지 못했을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = 4969ed7d-bce6-4a31-a4fd-3dcef91e0b5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist:4969ed7d-bce6-4a31-a4fd-3dcef91e0b5d
msgctxt "h66f5abc4g9139g47fbg91e2gd77fb85fc1d9"
msgid "How'd you survive it?"
msgstr "어떻게 견뎌낸 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist
#. Speaker = Art Cullagh
#. NodeID = 87ac4643-e935-459f-abf6-fec6ad1f0ba8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist:87ac4643-e935-459f-abf6-fec6ad1f0ba8
msgctxt "hc1f4856cg7b2bg4f20g91adga56737a0c0c2"
msgid "I'm glad that's still the case."
msgstr "여전히 피스트라니, 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist
#. Speaker = Art Cullagh
#. NodeID = aefdb0cc-fd88-4497-929b-c2f5a472b8e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist:aefdb0cc-fd88-4497-929b-c2f5a472b8e9
msgctxt "hf420fb31gad37g4cabg821fgdbc642e6676e"
msgid "In the curse? More horrible than you can imagine."
msgstr "저주 안 말이야? 상상하기보다 더 끔찍해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = b1f643ee-9b5e-4558-8f74-b5dc6976ea7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist:b1f643ee-9b5e-4558-8f74-b5dc6976ea7f
msgctxt "h4887e7a7gf504g4616g919dge8ae09bbfe14"
msgid "You're one of us. No Fist left behind."
msgstr "넌 우리 일원이야. 어떤 피스트 대원도 버려두고 갈 수는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist
#. Speaker = Art Cullagh
#. NodeID = c0446497-81fc-458b-aac5-9daa51007aa8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e680129a-9d39-6ffc-3e6d-926daf0d76ff_A = False
#.     - e680129a-9d39-6ffc-3e6d-926daf0d76ff_B = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist:c0446497-81fc-458b-aac5-9daa51007aa8
msgctxt "hc3376810g3c28g4550gaaa6ge488a5309cd3"
msgid ""
"Thanks for watching out for me. You lot could've tossed me back in the "
"shadows."
msgstr "그림자 속에 버려두어도 이상하지 않았을 텐데 돌봐줘서 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = c94509ee-2ea9-477c-810a-ff14a7482ea4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist:c94509ee-2ea9-477c-810a-ff14a7482ea4
msgctxt "h039d3d4egad69g4159g8f17gd6d552e96b21"
msgid "Try me."
msgstr "이야기 해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = d412a3bb-f01d-4e29-929b-500eddff3a92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e680129a-9d39-6ffc-3e6d-926daf0d76ff_B = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e680129a-9d39-6ffc-3e6d-926daf0d76ff_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_ArtAndFlamingFist:d412a3bb-f01d-4e29-929b-500eddff3a92
msgctxt "h53d66b7egeaaag4536ga835ga984dfe7e41a"
msgid "What was it like in there?"
msgstr "그 안은 어땠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = 0e0bdfc8-977f-4506-b849-6fd86249c58a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 26007d1c-bac9-a896-4f4d-19a9d2a1e66f_A = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 26007d1c-bac9-a896-4f4d-19a9d2a1e66f_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists:0e0bdfc8-977f-4506-b849-6fd86249c58a
msgctxt "h3c114cd9g4516g4f21gbe12gc5d83302aa03"
msgid "I ought to do the rounds again."
msgstr "순찰을 다시 돌아봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = 1de63318-466d-41cf-bd23-13707d4a1c8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists:1de63318-466d-41cf-bd23-13707d4a1c8a
msgctxt "hb25e9da1gc529g4149g93bdga95f3dc345b4"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "그렇다면야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = 3508dad1-3476-403d-a3fe-1c0b973fb7f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists:3508dad1-3476-403d-a3fe-1c0b973fb7f3
msgctxt "h4ea5002ag2705g4237gae82gf2cca12f859f"
msgid "No point. Everyone's wrecked. Leave 'em be."
msgstr "모두 만신창이잖아, 그럴 필요 없어. 내버려두자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = 45187efe-929e-414b-afa8-2a9478d414c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists:45187efe-929e-414b-afa8-2a9478d414c3
msgctxt "h172ad568g798fg48a6g9e9agcd76ea6519e2"
msgid "Gods, I can't wait to be back home."
msgstr "신이시여, 빨리 집에 가고 싶구만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = 535065eb-e58c-4249-8a09-6f9cae5c4d8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists:535065eb-e58c-4249-8a09-6f9cae5c4d8a
msgctxt "h43a03460g573bg441cg9b3agbceaafb2a69b"
msgid "Better be. It hasn't been that long."
msgstr "그리 오래되지도 않았으니 그래야겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = a08c8e9c-7bb7-45bc-81d5-6f6240e89e67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists:a08c8e9c-7bb7-45bc-81d5-6f6240e89e67
msgctxt "h90441a34g6441g459dg9eb5g651285a8852c"
msgid "Ready enough."
msgstr "준비되었습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = a396909d-59b4-4c6b-a139-58d3d2cd05db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 26007d1c-bac9-a896-4f4d-19a9d2a1e66f_A = False
#.     - 26007d1c-bac9-a896-4f4d-19a9d2a1e66f_B = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists:a396909d-59b4-4c6b-a139-58d3d2cd05db
msgctxt "hebc9bc42g02d3g44a7ga0f9g8fcdfbe6cfa6"
msgid "Troops ready?"
msgstr "병사들은 준비됐나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = b6bdac60-60a8-48cc-89bf-2c73bd1910d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists:b6bdac60-60a8-48cc-89bf-2c73bd1910d3
msgctxt "hede15593gdabcg4120g8951g588f216f337c"
msgid "Feels like forever."
msgstr "꼭 평생처럼 느껴지는구만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = e07885ee-911e-4326-90fa-2aeda869a246
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 26007d1c-bac9-a896-4f4d-19a9d2a1e66f_B = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 26007d1c-bac9-a896-4f4d-19a9d2a1e66f_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_RavenguardFollowUp_AD_MainGateFlamingFists:e07885ee-911e-4326-90fa-2aeda869a246
msgctxt "he33a9e05g97b8g46f0gb47bgefa0a14ce394"
msgid "Marne waiting for you?"
msgstr "마르느가 널 기다리고 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_StandingFlamingFist_000
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = 30097b36-60f2-4858-9ccc-36ce21b59b36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_StandingFlamingFist_000:30097b36-60f2-4858-9ccc-36ce21b59b36
msgctxt "hda72276cg5e41g4e72ga076g8940f82acb79"
msgid "Safe return to the city. We'll see you there, Helm willing."
msgstr "별 탈 없이 도시에서 만납시다. 헬름께서 함께하길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_StandingFlamingFist_001
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = caf9454d-8b29-4213-8229-9f3f0c91190a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_StandingFlamingFist_001_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_StandingFlamingFist_001:caf9454d-8b29-4213-8229-9f3f0c91190a
msgctxt "h1a777637g9daeg408cg8250g69ee6775ba6b"
msgid "We should march. Rest, maybe - then march."
msgstr "지금 전진 해야만 해. 아니, 어쩌면 쉬어야 할지도. 그 후에 움직이자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_StandingFlamingFist_001
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = cfd5edc2-5bae-49d0-8e0f-b011b344c1e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_StandingFlamingFist_001_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_StandingFlamingFist_001_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_StandingFlamingFist_001:cfd5edc2-5bae-49d0-8e0f-b011b344c1e3
msgctxt "h37022f8fg0c23g4f22gb04ag9e6755ec5c19"
msgid ""
"Can't believe there are <i>mind flayers </i>targeting Baldur's Gate. We "
"can't let them gain a foothold."
msgstr "<i>마인드 플레이어</i>들이 감히 발더스 게이트를 노리다니 얼씬도 못하게 해야해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_StandingFlamingFist_002
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = 6be2760b-8adf-41a3-8171-6ca125207c41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_StandingFlamingFist_002_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_StandingFlamingFist_002:6be2760b-8adf-41a3-8171-6ca125207c41
msgctxt "h7651ca04gb467g4f96g8befg5d41590d7165"
msgid "Let's regroup and march. I don't know if I can wait around much longer."
msgstr "재집결 후 행군을 하도록 하지. 여기서 더 꾸물댈 수는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_StandingFlamingFist_002
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = c961027f-0029-4c0a-ba5d-b1e0e058fe1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_StandingFlamingFist_002_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_StandingFlamingFist_002_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_StandingFlamingFist_002:c961027f-0029-4c0a-ba5d-b1e0e058fe1f
msgctxt "h398d7c6eg4395g48bcg845dgf7423b83c8cf"
msgid ""
"My mum lives in the Lower City. If those freaks hurt her, I'll turn them "
"inside out."
msgstr "하부 도시에는 우리 엄마가 살고 있다고. 그 괴물 놈들이 엄마를 건드린다면 아주 그냥 완전히 뒤집어 놓을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_StandingFlamingFist_003
#. Speaker = Flaming Fist
#. NodeID = 1845521f-dd53-4293-841d-57e6517803cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_StandingFlamingFist_003_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_StandingFlamingFist_003:1845521f-dd53-4293-841d-57e6517803cd
msgctxt "hbbbbe4fdg6ed0g4c7eg9e22g5ec03ad30e9a"
msgid "Helm's blessings upon you."
msgstr "헬름의 축복이 있기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Umi
#. NodeID = 0b5517d7-203c-21fe-8a32-ad006e3471b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:0b5517d7-203c-21fe-8a32-ad006e3471b5
msgctxt "hd1e70d82gdd87g4856g818dg225517dc9981"
msgid ""
"You think so? Mol <i>is</i> really clever. I hope she finds us again soon."
msgstr "그런가요? 몰은 정말 <b>똑똑한</b> 애니까 금방 우릴 찾아올 수 있겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 160c71ae-b3cb-6b67-f306-30e902294b08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:160c71ae-b3cb-6b67-f306-30e902294b08
msgctxt "he9b76fadg002cg487agb5ecgf285cd8b160e"
msgid "I don't know - I found this in Ketheric's lair."
msgstr "모르겠단다, 케서릭의 은신처에서 찾아냈어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Umi
#. NodeID = 2730f771-b5e3-9951-ec9f-3d469cefc416
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:2730f771-b5e3-9951-ec9f-3d469cefc416
msgctxt "he8258369g10e9g46ecgbd97g982fbbc4455a"
msgid "Does that mean Ketheric got her? Oh no. No. Mol..."
msgstr "케서릭이 몰을 잡았다는 거예요? 아냐.. 안돼.. 몰..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Umi
#. NodeID = 3145164d-058f-d273-0e3c-0950c18be452
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_Unavailable = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Umi_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:3145164d-058f-d273-0e3c-0950c18be452
msgctxt "h052778bbgaf03g4610g839dgba5310d49d3b"
msgid ""
"Um, now you've won can we go home? Mattis says it's not far, and I'm tired."
msgstr "음, 이제 이겼으니까 저희들 집으로 돌아갈 수 있는 거죠? 매티스가 그렇게 안 멀다고 하고.. 저는 좀 힘들어서요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42f55be6-171e-a1c9-9fdd-edaa2b304144
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:42f55be6-171e-a1c9-9fdd-edaa2b304144
msgctxt "h1e6f12ddg49e4g45bag9e10g7b0e6fc48ca3"
msgid "<i>Say nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무 말도 하지 않는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Umi
#. NodeID = 43ae8184-60a4-a94d-8123-0540b89502a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Umi_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_Unavailable = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:43ae8184-60a4-a94d-8123-0540b89502a8
msgctxt "h62bfc19aga120g4486gb15eg6267caa6629c"
msgid "Mattis also said there's monsters in Moonrise that are bigger than you."
msgstr "매티스가 문라이즈에 당신보다 더 큰 괴물이 있다고 했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Umi
#. NodeID = 4890de21-c9e6-4bd1-af49-2f17df922ce1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_BackupLeader_State_Dead = True
#.      - SCE_BackupLeader_State_AtEpilogue = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Umi_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:4890de21-c9e6-4bd1-af49-2f17df922ce1
msgctxt "h392620ccg3bbfg429aga22eg783dee0ab115"
msgid "Mattis said we can go to Baldur's Gate now, but I want to go home."
msgstr "이제 발더스 게이트로 갈 수 있다고 매티스가 그랬는데요, 전 그냥 집에 가고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5bbe1c67-14d9-6d91-8206-eed13d6ca33f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:5bbe1c67-14d9-6d91-8206-eed13d6ca33f
msgctxt "h7a6c983dg09e9g4d41ga86dg62694a154263"
msgid "Hey, calm down - I'm sure she just dropped it. Mol's fine, I promise."
msgstr "진정하렴, 몰은 분명 괜찮을 거야. 그냥 떨어뜨린 거겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Umi
#. NodeID = 937c2ff3-4ec8-fa4a-cba5-16f63f393ac1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Umi_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Knows_MolMissingEyepatch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:937c2ff3-4ec8-fa4a-cba5-16f63f393ac1
msgctxt "hf8e14edag700eg45d1g8d87g56471fe76c95"
msgid ""
"Mol'll be cross with me if I'm crying when she finds us. I bet you never cry."
msgstr "몰이 우릴 찾았을 때 제가 울고 있으면 괜히 심술을 부릴걸요. 당신은 눈물도 찔끔 안 할 것 같지만요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Umi
#. NodeID = 93a4deb8-03e7-afb4-a2f9-a20bb67f8efb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Umi_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:93a4deb8-03e7-afb4-a2f9-a20bb67f8efb
msgctxt "h824cdaa2gf442g41b4g8b8cg22b710a2df18"
msgid ""
"Miss Alfira wants to write us a song about you fighting Ketheric - but I "
"miss Mol."
msgstr "알피라 씨가 당신이랑 케서릭이랑 싸우는 노래를 만들어 보라는데요, 저는 그냥 몰이 보고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Umi
#. NodeID = a6e1ca4d-425f-1ffa-3105-5205c11701ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Knows_MeanAboutMol = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:a6e1ca4d-425f-1ffa-3105-5205c11701ab
msgctxt "h845a0049g5b00g49e0gba9dg43d74657efab"
msgid "No! <i>No!</i> Don't say that! Don't!"
msgstr "아냐! <b>아니라고!</b> 그렇게 말하지 마! 그런 말 하지 말라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Umi
#. NodeID = b2614fea-df56-0472-7490-be91408f8a1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Umi_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_BackupLeader_State_Dead = True
#.      - SCE_BackupLeader_State_AtEpilogue = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:b2614fea-df56-0472-7490-be91408f8a1b
msgctxt "h16a5ba43g4b38g4dd0gb109g3403f44a1577"
msgid ""
"Ketheric's really gone, isn't he? Ide said he eats eyes - Mol only has one."
msgstr "케서릭이 정말로 죽은거 맞죠? 눈깔을 먹어 치우는 사람이라고 이데가 그러던데, 몰은 눈깔이 하나 밖에 없잖아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c68d3dd4-e8ed-fe89-4ef6-dcc5e342ed16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:c68d3dd4-e8ed-fe89-4ef6-dcc5e342ed16
msgctxt "h42a2d2fegef2ag4247gbeebg4dbd691e7909"
msgid "I found Mol's eyepatch."
msgstr "몰의 안대를 찾았단다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Umi
#. NodeID = cabe2206-58e9-4d7a-5112-f281d98bcca5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Knows_MolMissingEyepatch = True
#.      - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Knows_MeanAboutMol = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:cabe2206-58e9-4d7a-5112-f281d98bcca5
msgctxt "h307f5ca4g0c52g43d1g969bg2a3d9efb4b50"
msgid "I don't want to die!"
msgstr "죽기 싫어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0bb5eb2-c100-cd60-25d1-ee2de2d03fc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:e0bb5eb2-c100-cd60-25d1-ee2de2d03fc7
msgctxt "h99a45f73gb079g45f8g98a1ga58e63ee61b2"
msgid "Dead - like you'll be soon, you little runt."
msgstr "죽었지. 너도 곧 그리 될 거다 이 쥐새끼 같은 놈아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi
#. Speaker = Umi
#. NodeID = ecc918dc-6658-292b-e3a2-44a09dce5952
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCE_TieflingFollowUp_Knows_MolMissingEyepatch = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Umi:ecc918dc-6658-292b-e3a2-44a09dce5952
msgctxt "hc2afa96ag6c6bg4565gacf4gbcaa013c155d"
msgid "What? Where is she?"
msgstr "네? 몰은 어디에 있나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = cd3ac9e8-8c00-6526-0337-dff977fa2ca1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:cd3ac9e8-8c00-6526-0337-dff977fa2ca1
msgctxt "h508caf75g89fag420dgb0afgb88aebb0517b"
msgid ""
"Who? Oh - right. Well, forget about that magungus. We have more important "
"things to worry about. Like Wulbren."
msgstr "누구? 아, 그래. 그, 그 마법쟁이는 이제 잊어버리도록 해. 더 중요한 것들이 있잖아. 울브렌같이 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 060767f6-9050-1770-2f7b-38329163f709
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:060767f6-9050-1770-2f7b-38329163f709
msgctxt "h32c72f34gbcadg4827gbfa6g66e9e6f859d1"
msgid ""
"I'll not deny he wounded me. I cared for Wulbren - care for him, really. But "
"he's... well, he's acting like a true idiot."
msgstr ""
"울브렌이 내게 상처를 줬다는걸 부정하지는 않겠어. 그래도 난 울브렌을 아끼고 있어, 진심으로. 그런데 그 녀석은.. 정말 바보처럼 굴고 "
"있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 0a6c5f3d-33d6-9ebc-6ca1-29fd2e81985f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_HasMet_WulbrenAlive(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:0a6c5f3d-33d6-9ebc-6ca1-29fd2e81985f
msgctxt "h3424111eg9c9bg48a6gb3a8g8c3aab7361e3"
msgid "<i>There</i> you are. I was wondering where the devil you'd been."
msgstr "<b>여기</b> 있었군. 어디로 갔는지 궁금해 하던 참이었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 0c2e12be-18c4-7617-6ab5-dc971efdfa9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:0c2e12be-18c4-7617-6ab5-dc971efdfa9f
msgctxt "h215ed234g8192g4a03gae23gea95d8bbf206"
msgid ""
"That is to say, they gabbed about their plans like geese, and I overheard "
"them, like a very devious goose."
msgstr ""
"그 친구들이 마치 거위처럼 자기들 계획을 떠들고 다녔다는 말이지. 그리고 내가 그놈들을 엿듣고 있었고. 마치 교활한 거위 한 마리처럼 "
"말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 133b7a40-8bb4-8245-c0f6-c2ebfdb9b1e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:133b7a40-8bb4-8245-c0f6-c2ebfdb9b1e7
msgctxt "h00641b70gcc06g4085g9d97g37ef9f82688f"
msgid "What about him?"
msgstr "울브렌이 왜?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 1d950f51-b2a0-eff7-bdab-3ba58349cc65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:1d950f51-b2a0-eff7-bdab-3ba58349cc65
msgctxt "h75ac1bb3g52d2g4756gb14cg23498936fe29"
msgid "Farewell. And good luck."
msgstr "잘 있게, 행운이 따르길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 205bd528-44ad-4ca3-e4d2-ec6427c378d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:205bd528-44ad-4ca3-e4d2-ec6427c378d4
msgctxt "h8e55a7b3gd13cg4aacg82dbg9b67d03dfdc8"
msgid "To talk about Wulbren, of course."
msgstr "물론, 울브렌에 대한 이야기지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 217db236-f5cd-0505-cb94-4bbbddaf353b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:217db236-f5cd-0505-cb94-4bbbddaf353b
msgctxt "h94596a5dg083cg470ag9304gcf1448fadf9b"
msgid ""
"My friend. Yes. He'll always be my friend, won't he? And I - I believe I'll "
"think of him every day."
msgstr "내 친구. 그래. 언제나 내 친구로 있어주겠지, 그치? 난... 아마 매일같이 그 친구를 생각하며 살지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 271fd036-906c-a7b1-f42f-737323d7c7a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:271fd036-906c-a7b1-f42f-737323d7c7a3
msgctxt "h8a143a56g0bfbg405ag9c83g7fad81c48680"
msgid ""
"Because they're a gaggle of vindictive crybabies with no sense of propriety."
msgstr "그야 그 녀석들이 도덕적인 잣대도 없이 앙심 품은 울보들 마냥 꽥꽥거리고 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 2c2d44c5-660a-fba4-6ecd-670b49421eb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:2c2d44c5-660a-fba4-6ecd-670b49421eb2
msgctxt "h212cd3f6g1380g4c46gbcb4gf32593e5a264"
msgid ""
"Wulbren made his life there. For his sake, if nothing else, I'd like to see "
"it survive."
msgstr "울브렌은 거기서 자랐으니까. 다른 건 몰라도, 울브렌을 위해서 그 도시가 무사했으면 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 3123c060-72a6-fc56-6e54-d3ad953cc068
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:3123c060-72a6-fc56-6e54-d3ad953cc068
msgctxt "h68013dfag49e2g4fc7ga2e3gdbd72097494c"
msgid ""
"With the sword of justice in one hand and the shield of self-righteousness "
"in the other, we most certainly will."
msgstr "한 손에 정의의 검을 그리고 다른 손에 독선의 방패를 든다면, 우리 대부분이 그럴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 31e9d73a-e1b7-3733-75e4-e0b910b06e1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:31e9d73a-e1b7-3733-75e4-e0b910b06e1f
msgctxt "h12161657gb0c2g4332gb795gbc72dd5d1a32"
msgid "I'd tell you to write, but I never check the post."
msgstr "편지를 써 달라고 말하고 싶지만, 우편함을 확인하는 편이 아니라서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 3316118a-2cbc-4dcb-e8ae-469135b944c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:3316118a-2cbc-4dcb-e8ae-469135b944c8
msgctxt "h9e4bbf1bgbf4dg40a2g89bcg81f8ed12f66d"
msgid "They have runepowder. They have motive. <i>We </i>have to stop them."
msgstr "그들은 룬파우더를 가지고 있어. 그리고 동기도 있지. <i>우리</i>가 막아야 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 356fca7d-5284-011a-c67b-4436c94535d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_WrootRequest_State_ReunionDone = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:356fca7d-5284-011a-c67b-4436c94535d2
msgctxt "h06b071dcg3a68g46edg8629g405cda831d9f"
msgid "Barcus, Wulbren wants nothing to do with you. He made that clear."
msgstr "바커스, 울브렌이 당신과는 상관 없다고 못 박아 이야기 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41c5e1b2-b5bd-439a-c9ef-f5e933a2747f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:41c5e1b2-b5bd-439a-c9ef-f5e933a2747f
msgctxt "h8265eb09gf16fg44e8ga60dg3ab93480c7f3"
msgid "Why are you so down? You should be celebrating my good deeds."
msgstr "왜 그렇게 침울한 거야? 내 선행을 축하 해줘야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 431e737a-f9d9-d928-c210-4aa850649a59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:431e737a-f9d9-d928-c210-4aa850649a59
msgctxt "hc61d404bge2b8g46b2g8dc2ge74ae283da58"
msgid ""
"Wulbren and the Ironhand Gnomes are planning something dreadful in the city."
msgstr "울브렌과 아이언핸드 노움들이 도시에 뭔가 끔찍한 짓을 저지르려 하고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 431edabf-e661-09a3-013b-a7a982b594c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_HasMet_WulbrenAlive(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:431edabf-e661-09a3-013b-a7a982b594c8
msgctxt "h96dc1c3dg5869g4722g975cgd96fe04f9e01"
msgid "I'll be seeing <i>you </i>at your camp."
msgstr "야영지에서 보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 4751931f-0655-76e0-df7b-3527ca2df32d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:4751931f-0655-76e0-df7b-3527ca2df32d
msgctxt "h3e016215g6d13g48c5g8e69g5cee7b1ba115"
msgid ""
"It isn't the first time, and I'm sure it won't be the last. But I won't let "
"him hurt anyone - or himself."
msgstr ""
"그런 일이 처음도 아니고, 아마 마지막도 아닐 거라 믿어. 그래도 울브렌이 다른 이들을 해치게 놔두진 않을 거야. 울브렌 자신도 그렇고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ad2943f-3fa6-2f36-ce94-58de7c569c39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:4ad2943f-3fa6-2f36-ce94-58de7c569c39
msgctxt "h63ea2636g73f7g4217gaa8ag5e1a53fc11ff"
msgid "Goodbye, Barcus."
msgstr "잘 가, 바커스."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 4b437286-81b5-6f84-7590-0263c424ecfe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:4b437286-81b5-6f84-7590-0263c424ecfe
msgctxt "h240ca960g1df6g4f55g89dag401ae9e0e483"
msgid ""
"That sounds... slimy. But never mind your distasteful predilections. We need "
"to talk about Wulbren."
msgstr "좀... 끈적이는 이야기네. 당신네들의 불쾌한 취향에 대한 이야기는 접어두지. 울브렌에 대해 의논할 게 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 54bd5102-fcf0-948d-ea69-7e5561c37870
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:54bd5102-fcf0-948d-ea69-7e5561c37870
msgctxt "he7fc8d72g1562g41e8ga487g43ac10206ee9"
msgid "To saving the city - and my fool of a friend."
msgstr "도시를 지키기 위해. 그리고 바보같은 내 친구를 위해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 5693409d-2e1b-5bf8-3009-a65f5f8e6b13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:5693409d-2e1b-5bf8-3009-a65f5f8e6b13
msgctxt "h25b52a9bgae2bg42d9g8fa5g26ec780a8982"
msgid ""
"A pity Wulbren isn't here. You two would've gotten on like a house on fire, "
"I think."
msgstr "울브렌이 여기 없어서 안타깝군. 둘이 금방 친해졌을 텐데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 571dcdeb-96f3-bdd2-1754-f1b884be73bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:571dcdeb-96f3-bdd2-1754-f1b884be73bb
msgctxt "h63ee9336gb349g4085gaf57ga2403ce18f4d"
msgid ""
"You'll what? Tie me to a windmill? Enslave me in the Underdark? Smack me "
"upside the head? I assure you, circumstance has beaten you to it."
msgstr ""
"말하면 어쩔 건데? 날 풍차에 메달기라도 할 거야? 언더다크의 노예로 부리기라도 할 거야? 내 뒤통수라도 갈길 거야? 내가 장담하건대 "
"네가 굳이 말 안 해도 그렇게 돼가고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f4c2825-33d9-ded4-53a0-4f798ac98951
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:5f4c2825-33d9-ded4-53a0-4f798ac98951
msgctxt "h3b35c936g3c22g4baeg862cg7ad244119070"
msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr "속이 다 시원하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63aa4a73-a639-39f3-76ba-cc8b1aec8cbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:63aa4a73-a639-39f3-76ba-cc8b1aec8cbd
msgctxt "hc30beaa9ge242g49c1gb476gaaa3d9ccfa6d"
msgid "It seems we'll have our hands full in Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "발더스 게이트에서는 정말 바빠지겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64363286-cd18-7f11-13c0-365914050b6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:64363286-cd18-7f11-13c0-365914050b6c
msgctxt "hba2d1cddg2262g4244gafd7g309b2f8d6d3f"
msgid ""
"Leave it to me, Barcus. You've proven you aren't able for this kind of thing."
msgstr "내게 맡겨둬, 바커스. 당신은 이런 일에 어울리지 않다는 걸 이미 보였으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64e43c40-4337-c434-b3f4-bdae667c07d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:64e43c40-4337-c434-b3f4-bdae667c07d8
msgctxt "hefea2f19gc036g404bg9c30g569a4cac0ef3"
msgid "I was preoccupied defeating Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨을 물리치느라 바빴지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 660a8dcd-0726-b0db-e364-383bd80f89c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:660a8dcd-0726-b0db-e364-383bd80f89c2
msgctxt "heb76dc67g10a6g4151g9e21g70db712afde4"
msgid "Here I am. What do you want?"
msgstr "그래, 무슨 일이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6cc65b0e-4d91-2224-6db9-e80de039e7a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: ROGUE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:6cc65b0e-4d91-2224-6db9-e80de039e7a3
msgctxt "hfb6eebbeg9b47g46cag8aa2g42ed79feeb3d"
msgid ""
"A job like you're describing isn't easy - what makes you think they're "
"serious?"
msgstr "그 쪽이 말한 일은 그렇게 쉬운 게 아니야. 무엇 때문에 아이언핸드 노움들이 그렇게 심각하다고 생각하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6cc65b0e-4d91-2224-6db9-e80de039e7a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:6cc65b0e-4d91-2224-6db9-e80de039e7a3
msgctxt "hfaf5e30bg028eg463agb89cg835980f0be7c"
msgid "How can you be sure?"
msgstr "어떻게 그리 확신할 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 74a2674d-84a7-a136-78f0-04dd75de093e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:74a2674d-84a7-a136-78f0-04dd75de093e
msgctxt "h1fb15f1eg6d9ag40a0gad10g7f7cb1bc6d1a"
msgid "Knowing when to ask for help is a sign of wisdom, not weakness."
msgstr "도움을 구할 때를 아는 것은 약한 게 아니라 지혜롭다는 걸 드러내는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8963b70b-b745-5cd8-3c93-dea54cd3d0dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:8963b70b-b745-5cd8-3c93-dea54cd3d0dc
msgctxt "h92387a19ga43eg4ce6ga5deg2a2ea686fe3c"
msgid "We don't need to say goodbye just yet. You're welcome at camp."
msgstr "아직 작별 인사를 할 때는 아니잖아, 내 야영지에 머물러도 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b898b94-f479-6eaa-fe22-f7cc0ce0c12b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_WrootRequest_State_ReunionDone = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:8b898b94-f479-6eaa-fe22-f7cc0ce0c12b
msgctxt "h779cc396g3ad7g4212ga856gd8869e458f5b"
msgid "Is this just because Wulbren rejected you?"
msgstr "그냥 울브렌이 당신을 퇴짜 놓았다고 이러는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 998344e0-f1b5-9614-f358-41cfe38f75cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: GNOME
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:998344e0-f1b5-9614-f358-41cfe38f75cd
msgctxt "h3ed83938gc3cfg4bd8gbf90g382bf783120c"
msgid ""
"The city has more important concerns than a bunch of ne'er-do-wells with a "
"grudge."
msgstr "도시에는 앙심을 품은 한량들보다 더 큰 문제들이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 998344e0-f1b5-9614-f358-41cfe38f75cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:998344e0-f1b5-9614-f358-41cfe38f75cd
msgctxt "h48707502g47c0g4e2bg8f11gb1fd01ec6c00"
msgid ""
"The city has more important concerns than a bunch of gnomes with a grudge."
msgstr "도시에는 앙심을 품은 노움 무리들보다 더 큰 문제들이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = 9b18aabe-f153-82fe-baaa-4610d0fa8476
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:9b18aabe-f153-82fe-baaa-4610d0fa8476
msgctxt "h4c1dcce6g39d4g4084gb9b9g1db8b5600b48"
msgid ""
"Oh, forget about that. Wulbren and the Ironhand Gnomes are planning "
"something dreadful in the city."
msgstr "아, 그건 그냥 아무 것도 아니야. 울브렌과 아이언핸드 노움들이 도시에서 뭔가 끔찍한 짓을 꾸미고 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = a0b2416f-1f67-238c-a23c-389735040664
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:a0b2416f-1f67-238c-a23c-389735040664
msgctxt "hd5b2609dg6b46g42b1gbb26g198c3d8e08eb"
msgid ""
"I'm not one for parties on the best of days. And today... is not the best of "
"days."
msgstr "나라는 사람은 좋았던 나날에도 파티를 즐기는 사람이 아니었고, 오늘은... 좋은 나날도 아니니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = a5ec733f-9e73-0477-c9f3-e768da809bda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:a5ec733f-9e73-0477-c9f3-e768da809bda
msgctxt "h549decb4g1f33g4ad7gb373g08a0e8216c18"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately for evil, it has <i>you </i>to worry about. Look after the "
"city - it's an awful place, but it's home."
msgstr "안타깝게도 그 악에게도 당신이라는 걱정거리가 있지. 도시를 지켜주게, 끔찍한 곳이기는 하지만 그래도 고향이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b9c42540-a307-623e-b2b5-5f1399a14e09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:b9c42540-a307-623e-b2b5-5f1399a14e09
msgctxt "h3038df3dgf5d0g43dagbe64g5a3798a99d1e"
msgid "If I have to hear the name 'Wulbren' one more time..."
msgstr "그 '울브렌'이란 이름을 한번만 더 꺼내면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb0a5f0d-071d-30fd-a963-44348b521975
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_WulbrenReturned = False
#.      - GLO_UnfortunateGnome_State_PlayerOfferedHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:bb0a5f0d-071d-30fd-a963-44348b521975
msgctxt "hc8cf2b8cg0745g480dgb1cdg0304b9862d62"
msgid "I'm sorry I couldn't find your friend Wulbren."
msgstr "당신 친구 울브렌을 찾지는 못했어, 유감이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7c908c6-79ca-5464-d050-46391ca67008
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:c7c908c6-79ca-5464-d050-46391ca67008
msgctxt "hf54866a1ga2dcg447cgb9f3g130d4f4e5a6f"
msgid "Not quite. I didn't get this parasite out of my head."
msgstr "전부는 아니야. 아직 올챙이를 머리에서 없애지 못했거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = cc555087-5998-27dd-95d3-913a0bf791e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:cc555087-5998-27dd-95d3-913a0bf791e8
msgctxt "hddad4af7g167bg457bgb227g617efdbfdc0c"
msgid ""
"A fellow knows when it's time to go his own way. We've had an interesting "
"run of it, but it's time I whence'd my way back home."
msgstr ""
"사내는 홀로 갈 길을 가야 할 때를 알고 있는 법이지. 흥미로운 여정을 함께 했지만 이제 난 고향으로 돌아가야 할 때가 된 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cd871efe-b38f-832f-0525-5c4e375ffeee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:cd871efe-b38f-832f-0525-5c4e375ffeee
msgctxt "h99c1c90ag3d5cg42b1g8f23g457d80a00bd7"
msgid ""
"We're not out of the woods yet. It seems evil is on its way to Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "악이 발더스 게이트를 향해 가고 있는 것 같더군. 아직 고비를 넘긴 건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = cfa22837-1660-a479-c63c-24a9be12974b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:cfa22837-1660-a479-c63c-24a9be12974b
msgctxt "h17137749g30d6g4cf2g9d8dga8207669096b"
msgid ""
"Well, if you turn into a mind flayer, I'll be sure to tell people you were a "
"decent sort, pre-tentacle."
msgstr "음. 만약 당신들이 마인드 플레이어로 변한다면, 촉수가 돋아나기 전에는 휼륭한 사람들이었다고 사람들에게 이야기 해드리지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = d981593d-b698-4cfa-c2e7-a2dee231432f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_HasMet_WulbrenDead(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Wulbren_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:d981593d-b698-4cfa-c2e7-a2dee231432f
msgctxt "hcd163090gec08g4972gafffg35f3ca776c28"
msgid "Until, if ever, we meet again."
msgstr "다시 볼지도 모르겠지만, 그럼 다음에 보지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = da7ef94a-64ed-ac84-ec3d-f720d7019e65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Wulbren_State_PermaDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_HasMet_WulbrenDead(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:da7ef94a-64ed-ac84-ec3d-f720d7019e65
msgctxt "hd43556e0gd371g402agaf54gd274f529abae"
msgid ""
"So. You did it. Cleared the tower. Killed the villain. Everything you said "
"you'd do."
msgstr "당신 해냈군. 문라이즈 타워를 쓸어버리고, 악당을 죽이고. 본인이 말한 모든 걸 해냈어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = e7e37a00-5a90-09d6-2a30-bf2cd847a172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:e7e37a00-5a90-09d6-2a30-bf2cd847a172
msgctxt "ha447a8a6gadb5g4b09g9a66gada9bbfb4cd1"
msgid ""
"But it doesn't do to remain smackèd. We fall, we moan, then we rise to annoy "
"our enemies once more."
msgstr ""
"하지만 처맞고 쓰러져 있어 봐야 아무것도 안 된다고. 쓰러졌다가, 아파서 앓는 소리 좀 내다가, 그리고 다시 일어나서 적을 성가시게 "
"해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = eb238135-5188-aeab-a0ca-42e70e7ccf2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:eb238135-5188-aeab-a0ca-42e70e7ccf2b
msgctxt "hcf127b89g973fg42d1ga86eg48143a6d46e8"
msgid ""
"Erm. I... I'll say my goodbyes now. You were - that is, it was... So long."
msgstr "으음.. 이제 작, 작별인사를 해야겠네. 당신은, 그러니까.. 이건.. 안녕히.."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f0679c80-d037-ff07-6ba6-d32bee53ae52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:f0679c80-d037-ff07-6ba6-d32bee53ae52
msgctxt "hfe34d8e6g8b4ag4599g8ab0g2f77af133a87"
msgid "I was taking a little holiday in the mind flayer colony downstairs."
msgstr "마인드 플레이에 군락지에서 휴가를 좀 보내고 왔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = f27b1cc1-0ee0-721c-44a9-56eaa3840da9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DRAGONBORN or TORTLE or WARFORGED
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:f27b1cc1-0ee0-721c-44a9-56eaa3840da9
msgctxt "h98a596dcg33f7g4284gbdecg48b80ac8ee5c"
msgid ""
"You're tired from your exertions. Who could blame you? Have a smoke, a wash -"
" or a polish, as it were - and let's regroup when you're more yourself."
msgstr ""
"그렇게 고생했으니 피곤하겠지. 당연한 일이야. 연초 좀 한 대 피우고 씻거나, 아님 광을 내거나, 휴식을 취하고 다시 만나도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = f27b1cc1-0ee0-721c-44a9-56eaa3840da9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:f27b1cc1-0ee0-721c-44a9-56eaa3840da9
msgctxt "h5795b448gb668g4104g9fdcg8db548c38a1c"
msgid ""
"You're tired from your exertions. Who could blame you? Have a smoke, a wash, "
"and a cup of tea, and let's regroup when you're more yourself."
msgstr ""
"그렇게 고생했으니 피곤하겠지. 당연한 일이야. 연초 좀 한 대 피우고 씻고 차 한잔 좀 마시라고. 그리고 좀 더 자신다워졌을 때 다시 "
"모이도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = f73173e0-3820-38aa-7b51-92126d9f4a7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:f73173e0-3820-38aa-7b51-92126d9f4a7d
msgctxt "hfda95737g11ecg4d6cgad8agc131333d2c1d"
msgid ""
"You helped me in this gods-awful quagmire; when we're back in the city, I'll "
"be fully in my element once more."
msgstr "네가 이 끔찍한 수렁에서 날 도와줬으니깐. 우리가 도시에 돌아가게 되면 다시 물 만난 물고기가 될 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = f979ccfd-1dcd-451a-6869-7b6879ec868e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:f979ccfd-1dcd-451a-6869-7b6879ec868e
msgctxt "h6ba09c0bgcbd9g4e67g995cg823f9e89314a"
msgid "Heh. As you say."
msgstr "흠. 말씀하신 대로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome
#. Speaker = Barcus Wroot
#. NodeID = fc65ea15-5b99-6186-5787-cd0a7b281593
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_UnfortunateGnome:fc65ea15-5b99-6186-5787-cd0a7b281593
msgctxt "h64ed3c87g0c82g4eddg8b06gc5d7ee9d868e"
msgid ""
"Wulbren is... dead. Far before his time. Mourning him will be... well, it'll "
"be the work of a lifetime."
msgstr "울브렌이... 너무 이른 때에 죽었어. 울브렌을 추모하는 건... 음, 그건 평생이 걸리는 일일 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 024fa9c8-7ddd-d2f8-a6bf-b82826efedc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:024fa9c8-7ddd-d2f8-a6bf-b82826efedc8
msgctxt "hd792f824gd949g4adbgabd8gd4708c443e4e"
msgid "Apology accepted."
msgstr "사과를 받아주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08de4aa1-be59-3f65-0249-8124bfe823a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:08de4aa1-be59-3f65-0249-8124bfe823a6
msgctxt "h94b2cbaag35abg42a8ga8a6g0869c34e7e36"
msgid "If I can help, I will."
msgstr "도울 수 있다면 도울게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b198594-768c-5470-60d7-e16a1bb113ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_WrootRequest_Wulbren_AskedAboutIronhandGnomes(1) = False
#.   Local:
#.      - aa1d4932-8689-5e30-2b17-9b0968663a7a_historysuccess = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_WrootRequest_Wulbren_AskedAboutIronhandGnomes(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:0b198594-768c-5470-60d7-e16a1bb113ee
msgctxt "h404f052bg14d6g4c6bg8f8bg2f7bfb670200"
msgid "Weren't your people exiled from Baldur's Gate?"
msgstr "당신네들은 발더스 게이트에서 추방된 게 아니었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 0db035a5-b96f-6550-3092-de37365a8247
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Wulbren_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:0db035a5-b96f-6550-3092-de37365a8247
msgctxt "h69c4147bga635g44c4g94cfg55879a96cef1"
msgid ""
"We'll be heading for Baldur's Gate soon. If fate wills it, I'll see you "
"there."
msgstr "우린 발더스 게이트로 향할 거야. 인연이 있다면 거기서 다시 만나겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 12bfb386-9899-15f1-04fa-50a48c327c68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_WulbrenReturned = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:12bfb386-9899-15f1-04fa-50a48c327c68
msgctxt "h931bf298g485eg40fdg98c9geb97f1ae291b"
msgid "Last I saw you, you were disappearing on a boat down the river."
msgstr "지난 번에 봤을 때는 강을 따라 배를 타고 사라졌었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 13cd4d38-7e08-6ba5-1492-871460ca763e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Wulbren_UneasyAboutPlayer(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:13cd4d38-7e08-6ba5-1492-871460ca763e
msgctxt "hf1605c64g2d08g41fdg802eg761b63c3af22"
msgid ""
"*Sigh.* Foolish and ignorant, like the rest. But you'll change your mind "
"once you see what's become of Baldur's Gate, I have no doubt."
msgstr "*한숨.* 다른 이들처럼 멍청하고 무지하군. 발더스 게이트가 어떻게 변했는지 알게 된다면 마음을 바꿀 수 밖에 없을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 150dc4b8-fc52-cfbb-93c1-b79fb714d6f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:150dc4b8-fc52-cfbb-93c1-b79fb714d6f7
msgctxt "h0c43d5d8g32eeg4593gb5d4g3b03cd0adc6b"
msgid "I wasn't sure you would - I appreciate it."
msgstr "받아주지 않을 줄 알았는데... 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 183f29e4-278e-2fd2-6bec-b364f3f4d7b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:183f29e4-278e-2fd2-6bec-b364f3f4d7b8
msgctxt "hf5ff05e3g9abfg4df6g9d78g029aa03b0a9b"
msgid ""
"In a sense - yes. But that's because I didn't know what you were capable of."
msgstr "어떤 의미에서는... 그래. 하지만 예전에는 네가 뭘 할 수 있는지 몰라서 그랬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a75539d-22aa-99e0-491a-efe7ab37e60e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:1a75539d-22aa-99e0-491a-efe7ab37e60e
msgctxt "h011780c6g0f4eg4c51g9b93gcbebf45c6520"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22ba70cd-e399-5544-7a1f-f87c032216ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Event_DetectThoughts(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Event_DetectThoughts(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:22ba70cd-e399-5544-7a1f-f87c032216ee
msgctxt "h0810a3dag8899g4d98gb949g3b12d3bdc240"
msgid ""
"<i>Gently pierce the veil of his mind, probing for his true intentions.</i>"
msgstr "<i>울브렌의 진의를 알아내 위해 그의 정신의 장막을 조심스럽게 뚫고 들어간다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 2712a1ed-659d-0a47-013b-0fd9bbda78e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:2712a1ed-659d-0a47-013b-0fd9bbda78e9
msgctxt "h6d4c5f0cg43e3g4a6ag8a37g59d8d2dd7174"
msgid ""
"Not my finest exit. I hid out on the river until the sky lit up. Couldn't "
"believe my eyes - especially when I realised you were behind it."
msgstr ""
"세련된 퇴장은 아니었지. 하늘이 밝아질 때까지 강에 숨어있었어. 내 눈을 믿지 못하겠더군 - 특히 네 덕분인 걸 알았을 때 더욱 그랬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 28091bf6-c5b7-4782-b33f-65682661bb93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:28091bf6-c5b7-4782-b33f-65682661bb93
msgctxt "hae175432gde62g4b00gbf0cge53800d9618b"
msgid "Heh. That's I like to hear. You're worth ten of my crew."
msgstr "허, 말도 잘하는군. 네게는 우리 애들 열 명 만큼의 가치가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 28613b35-c558-c46f-53b0-43efd9a5172a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:28613b35-c558-c46f-53b0-43efd9a5172a
msgctxt "h9db1c9d0gf5e5g4389ga400gfaf54a67fb77"
msgid "And that's precisely why I want you by my side in Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "그리고 바로 그런 이유 때문에 발더스 게이트에서 내 편이 되어주길 바라는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2da695f4-0e12-f5ef-5ea5-f4ea861f5fa5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:2da695f4-0e12-f5ef-5ea5-f4ea861f5fa5
msgctxt "h820e36fagcd80g4124ga976g19f4845ad0d6"
msgid "Siding with a murderous lunatic is more than 'foolish'."
msgstr "미친 살인광에게 동조했던 건 그냥 '어리석은 짓'이었다고 퉁칠 수 있는 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 30628ca9-b39a-a5a3-1c3c-d37a11bed1a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:30628ca9-b39a-a5a3-1c3c-d37a11bed1a4
msgctxt "h479a96e3g4f7ag4c44g864fg1ce1180edc39"
msgid ""
"But our forebears were foolish - complicit with Sarevok's madness over a "
"century past, and so we were banished. Still are to this day."
msgstr ""
"하지만 우리 조상들은 어리석었어, 백 년도 전에 사레복의 미친짓에 가담했고 그 덕에 우린 추방 당하고 말았지. 지금까지도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 3076e672-ece1-c190-24ab-3d39d4596013
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Wulbren_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Knows_WulbrenZealot = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:3076e672-ece1-c190-24ab-3d39d4596013
msgctxt "h0d1c3833g1a63g4ae4g96d5g3b8a253d94c2"
msgid ""
"Bring every scrap of courage you have to Baldur's Gate - you'll need it for "
"what's to come."
msgstr "발더스 게이트에 용기를 남은 한 방울까지 쥐어 짜내서 오라고. 다가오는 일에 써야 할 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a3ed514-70d8-88da-24ae-91f6e91a9561
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:3a3ed514-70d8-88da-24ae-91f6e91a9561
msgctxt "hd9eb2d0agdd34g4007gb5ecg88c8e3e91580"
msgid "Good luck with that."
msgstr "그 일에 행운을 빌지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3bda8c1b-65e6-44d6-5ee8-34a04ad44cdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - aa1d4932-8689-5e30-2b17-9b0968663a7a_insightsuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:3bda8c1b-65e6-44d6-5ee8-34a04ad44cdd
msgctxt "h60c49c93g3e1fg4ad3g87dfga96c259ad281"
msgid ""
"*You see a column of fire that dominates the sky in a blazing inferno - "
"nothing more.*"
msgstr "*하늘을 맹렬한 불로 뒤덮는 불기둥 외에는 그 무엇도 보이지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 3f93c9cb-caaa-ff31-c302-d3f40b7c7979
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:3f93c9cb-caaa-ff31-c302-d3f40b7c7979
msgctxt "h174d5f63gcccfg4036g8b75g2c79e7924bb1"
msgid ""
"I've filled appeals - pleaded with the High Artificer himself. They've "
"refused us time and again. Now, however, I will <i>make </i>them listen."
msgstr ""
"난 탄원서도 여러장 쓰고, 고위 아티피서 본인까지 찾아가며 간곡히 부탁했어. 그들은 우릴 수없이 거부했지. 하지만 이제 그들이 우리 말을 "
"<i>듣게</i> 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 404988e1-8e19-7bf3-01f2-8ae73f1b9d02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - aa1d4932-8689-5e30-2b17-9b0968663a7a_historysuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:404988e1-8e19-7bf3-01f2-8ae73f1b9d02
msgctxt "h776329f0gd6adg4928g9e06g97da239475ae"
msgid ""
"*You recall stories of the Ironhand Gnomes - a talented group of inventors "
"who were banished from Baldur's Gate.*"
msgstr "*당신은 발더스 게이트에서 추방된 재능 있는 발명가들의 모임인 아이언핸드 노움의 이야기를 상기해봅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 4517d9ea-1454-c776-6688-91be43ef4964
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:4517d9ea-1454-c776-6688-91be43ef4964
msgctxt "h3aeedd40g6a36g4ce8g9ebfg19dac83fa172"
msgid ""
"I see Gondian propaganda is alive and well. We match the High House of "
"Wonders in design. Innovation. <i>Brilliance.</i>"
msgstr ""
"곤드 신자가 퍼뜨리는 선동이 아직 건재한 듯하군. 우린 경이의 집과 견주어도 설계에서도, 독창성도, <i>탁월함</i>도 뒤처지지 않는단 "
"말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 48b9e23a-fd7f-dec4-fd3d-b7bc6520764a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:48b9e23a-fd7f-dec4-fd3d-b7bc6520764a
msgctxt "ha343b051g6b70g494fg803fg750d5a7e799c"
msgid ""
"But I stand by what I said before - you and I were meant to meet. And "
"together, we'll save Baldur's Gate from itself."
msgstr "그래도 다시 말하지만, 우리가 만난 건 운명이야. 함께라면 발더스 게이트를 도시 스스로부터 구할 수 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 48c800f1-87be-96b5-c43e-4b3930c69fa5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:48c800f1-87be-96b5-c43e-4b3930c69fa5
msgctxt "h5ad51161g380eg474dga724g993318087956"
msgid ""
"That's what I like to hear. Find me in the city - and together, we can save "
"Baldur's Gate from itself."
msgstr "바라던 바야. 도시에 오면 날 찾아. 우리가 함께하면 발더스 게이트를 구할 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 4a6081a0-be8e-716d-3d9f-03ad41d4893e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:4a6081a0-be8e-716d-3d9f-03ad41d4893e
msgctxt "h67900493g429fg4652gbe53g5b6e072bc7c0"
msgid ""
"Wait until you reach the city. Once you see what it's become, you'll know "
"the Ironhand Gnomes are needed."
msgstr "도시가 어떻게 변했는지 직접 확인해봐. 그럼 아이언핸드 노움의 개입이 필요하다는 걸 이해할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4f3ce724-ff8c-9477-2601-299e7c0e3345
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GNOME(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:4f3ce724-ff8c-9477-2601-299e7c0e3345
msgctxt "h350d0e35ge448g421ag8d11gd49f63d39fbc"
msgid ""
"Inventors? Traitors, more like. Every gnome in Baldur's Gate suffered for "
"your treachery."
msgstr "발명가들이라고? 배신자에 가깝겠지. 네 놈들의 배신 때문에 발더스 게이트의 모든 노움들이 고통 받았다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 56fbd35a-003e-e9de-7b98-c7526cf0a413
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:56fbd35a-003e-e9de-7b98-c7526cf0a413
msgctxt "h2dae0f01gb0f1g4093gb9a5gf445e0b135a8"
msgid "And I'm not a man easily impressed."
msgstr "난 쉽게 감명을 받는 사람이 아닌데도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 5742ebf0-bb41-26cf-84d8-fd0dcb37cabf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:5742ebf0-bb41-26cf-84d8-fd0dcb37cabf
msgctxt "h257c6e36g6523g4225g9aafg6a5b6fd85ce8"
msgid ""
"I apologise - for not seeing your true worth. And for being, quite frankly, "
"rude in Last Light."
msgstr "사과하지. 네 가치를 몰라봤어. 다시 말하자면, 그 여관에서는 내가 지나치게 무례했었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 59b9b424-b483-0a6a-2966-05bd2c0df40b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:59b9b424-b483-0a6a-2966-05bd2c0df40b
msgctxt "hd20c9820ga6ecg44a8gba9fg8da356e96380"
msgid "I can be rude myself sometimes."
msgstr "나도 가끔 무례할 때가 있는 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 5fa87e80-f8df-3098-1a37-666030b9dd10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:5fa87e80-f8df-3098-1a37-666030b9dd10
msgctxt "h97904c07g3f1bg49c9gacafg5a871b9b66d0"
msgid ""
"Find me in the city - once you see what it's become, you'll know that I and "
"I alone can stop it."
msgstr "도시에서 날 찾아와. 도시가 어떻게 변했는지 두 눈으로 확인하면, 나 혼자서는 막을 수 없다는 걸 알게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 60098085-55a6-d667-e5c4-63d973ab60b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:60098085-55a6-d667-e5c4-63d973ab60b8
msgctxt "hc9f7eeddg5593g4261g8082ge60421a9fb20"
msgid "You agree with such machinations? Duly noted."
msgstr "그딴 음모에 정당함을 느낀다는 건가? 일단은 알아두지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 617234da-3c2d-ce1f-d5b6-19c1daf873d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - aa1d4932-8689-5e30-2b17-9b0968663a7a_persuadecheck = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:617234da-3c2d-ce1f-d5b6-19c1daf873d0
msgctxt "h7003f878g885fg4278gbbccg575959eec886"
msgid "If you want my help, I'm going to need more to go on."
msgstr "내 도움이 필요하다면 그보다는 자세한 정보가 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 619f00ef-e4d1-8273-76d4-0a9e1a7e1958
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:619f00ef-e4d1-8273-76d4-0a9e1a7e1958
msgctxt "h939fbcafg7673g4503ga4e2g4e255f42af62"
msgid "Gracious as well as impressive - a fine combination."
msgstr "자비로우면서도 인상적이군. 좋은 조합이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 623ef025-d457-2569-14f4-99915eaf319f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:623ef025-d457-2569-14f4-99915eaf319f
msgctxt "hd6f0cb51gf432g4761ga328g024dc8c65ced"
msgid ""
"I am Wulbren Bongle, leader of the Ironhand Gnomes. No doubt you've heard of "
"us?"
msgstr "나는 아이언핸드 노움의 지도자 울브렌 봉글이라네. 우리가 누군지는 들어 봤겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 64e0bed8-8b20-139d-f05d-b5bab9bdfbe3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:64e0bed8-8b20-139d-f05d-b5bab9bdfbe3
msgctxt "ha0895941g8363g4422ga167gf88d011f7b0e"
msgid ""
"Problem is, Baldur's Gate is sick. Once the pinnacle of greatness, it's "
"eating itself alive to save itself from starving."
msgstr ""
"문제는 발더스 게이트가 병들어 있단 거야. 한때는 위대함의 정점이었던 도시가 이제는 기아에서 벗어나고자 스스로를 먹어 치우는 중이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 651db3ee-5048-0c83-aac9-e6c119cdbf78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:651db3ee-5048-0c83-aac9-e6c119cdbf78
msgctxt "hc477d2ccgcb4bg4b6bg8907g1956eb6654c4"
msgid ""
"The Ironhand Gnomes are going to save the city - and you can be part of it."
msgstr "아이언핸드 노움이 도시를 구할 거야. 그리고 너도 이바지할 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 68b5b6cb-ab57-dd04-d8f8-e72c3665239a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:68b5b6cb-ab57-dd04-d8f8-e72c3665239a
msgctxt "h464004bcgc62fg4e43gbaf8gf90c0d628eb6"
msgid ""
"I saw you as a means to escape, nothing more. But when the sky lit up - when "
"I followed it here - I knew you were behind it."
msgstr ""
"널 그저 탈출 수단 정도로만 생각했어. 그런데 이곳에 도착했을 때 하늘을 다시 밝힌 것이, 저주를 푼 것이 너라는 걸 알게 되었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a6f7a80-a8e8-78ed-34f6-7c3068598040
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_WrootRequest_Wulbren_AskedAboutIronhandGnomes(1) = False
#.   Local:
#.      - aa1d4932-8689-5e30-2b17-9b0968663a7a_historysuccess = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_WrootRequest_Wulbren_AskedAboutIronhandGnomes(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:6a6f7a80-a8e8-78ed-34f6-7c3068598040
msgctxt "h2a0117f9gc13bg4c28g827fg2750b46052da"
msgid "I don't know much, I'm afraid."
msgstr "미안하지만 아는 바가 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 762e9a7c-b7bb-d0a1-16a4-81a99c05043a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:762e9a7c-b7bb-d0a1-16a4-81a99c05043a
msgctxt "ha8e36c64g2f1bg4ca1g8f13g64c200f45365"
msgid "I believe the words you're looking for are 'thank you'."
msgstr "고맙다는 말을 하고 싶은 거라고 생각할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 78933244-0ad6-e218-c705-2a32d0cd67fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:78933244-0ad6-e218-c705-2a32d0cd67fd
msgctxt "h553a8bfbg38b1g4549g97cbg3ed35e1542f5"
msgid "You were being an arsehole."
msgstr "넌 개새끼였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79617652-844f-c854-b083-d6fbd267b7e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:79617652-844f-c854-b083-d6fbd267b7e8
msgctxt "hd122f08dg659ag458eg89e2g25b6a3ca7525"
msgid "For what?"
msgstr "뭐 때문이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a07ccac-7e2d-904b-a019-efe7a85b8e5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:7a07ccac-7e2d-904b-a019-efe7a85b8e5c
msgctxt "h59ae8cc7g28cfg4dabg8771gd53c682a27c9"
msgid "I do what I can."
msgstr "할 수 있는 일을 한 것뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a3cad23-ab11-eb8b-00c4-ce61fbd93fd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:7a3cad23-ab11-eb8b-00c4-ce61fbd93fd4
msgctxt "h9d3ed755g4cc2g44d8gae2eg9ad9998e7b71"
msgid "Pity he never succeeded."
msgstr "그가 성공하지 못한 게 아쉬울 따름이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a7f4503-12d1-a488-d55c-b525406c1e1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - aa1d4932-8689-5e30-2b17-9b0968663a7a_persuadecheck = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:7a7f4503-12d1-a488-d55c-b525406c1e1b
msgctxt "hd7d1a033g0d19g40abgb94cg6e88a35de7d5"
msgid "Doing a job without information is a surefire way to get caught. Spill."
msgstr "정보 없이 일을 한다면 걸릴 수 밖에 없어. 다 말해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 7ddca4d4-bf39-3df5-6503-2cb7dbb95805
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Wulbren_UneasyAboutPlayer(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:7ddca4d4-bf39-3df5-6503-2cb7dbb95805
msgctxt "h01d29b8ag355bg4f1eg9e65g12cc72913ac2"
msgid ""
"We're outnumbered, my friend - and secrecy is a slim advantage. I'll tell "
"you more in the city."
msgstr "우린 수적열세라고 이 친구야, 그리고 비밀 유지는 근소한 우위 밖에 안되고. 도시에서 좀 더 많은 걸 알려주겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 7ebea4e9-32d4-8a3c-4662-96b1f145735c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:7ebea4e9-32d4-8a3c-4662-96b1f145735c
msgctxt "h0a429680g367dg4adegaa6bg739d1f29f267"
msgid ""
"I underestimated you. Kept who I was, and who I represent, from you - but I "
"see now that was a mistake."
msgstr "널 얕보고 있었어. 그래서 내가 누구고 뭘 대변 하는지 너에게 숨겼지. 이제 와서 보니 실수였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f507102-6920-dc51-777e-c5465cadaddd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_WrootRequest_State_ReunionDone = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:7f507102-6920-dc51-777e-c5465cadaddd
msgctxt "h9c4e0778g0b49g48bcga835g4bfa73adf590"
msgid ""
"It's Barcus you should apologise to. Your reunion in Last Light was... "
"strained."
msgstr "사과를 한다면 바커스에게 해야지. 최후의 빛 여관에서 가진 재회는... 껄끄러웠다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8880c25b-4311-cb53-dfe8-1e2b90f6c757
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_WrootRequest_Wulbren_AskedAboutRunepowder(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_IronhandGnomes_Knows_Runepowder = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_WrootRequest_Wulbren_AskedAboutRunepowder(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:8880c25b-4311-cb53-dfe8-1e2b90f6c757
msgctxt "h98edde69g1683g4eb4gb0f2gb4bf9d12cf7c"
msgid ""
"I met some Ironhand Gnomes looking for runepowder in the Underdark - any "
"idea why?"
msgstr "언더다크에서 룬파우더를 찾던 아이언핸드 노움들을 만난 적이 있었는데, 그 이유를 알고 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88fc548e-6d2d-c321-c2e8-88cdb2d970d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:88fc548e-6d2d-c321-c2e8-88cdb2d970d4
msgctxt "h89d74dfcgc8d5g4131gaf25gf4791593e85e"
msgid "I'm no scholar of history - what are you talking about?"
msgstr "역사를 잘 몰라서 그러는데, 사레복이 뭘 말하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 93b096e1-c835-df0f-a832-97e86d9f4647
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:93b096e1-c835-df0f-a832-97e86d9f4647
msgctxt "h6e382e1dg161dg4d25gb696gbf26f20c64b2"
msgid ""
"I've fought tooth and nail to restore our reputation. Particularly against "
"Gondian detractors who live in glass houses."
msgstr "난 우리의 평판을 되찾기 위해 이 악물고 싸웠어. 특히 유리집에 살면서 우릴 깎아내리는 곤드 신자하고는 더욱이나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 9464143c-364f-112b-a594-506099e9f243
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:9464143c-364f-112b-a594-506099e9f243
msgctxt "hcd286da7g00bdg4d39g927cg2e9af567a6c6"
msgid ""
"It was out of pure necessity - I imagine you'd have done the same if our "
"roles were reversed."
msgstr "순전히 필요에 의해 그랬던 거야. 너도 내 입장이었다면 똑같이 했을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 94a790c9-7f06-dfef-a20d-1069215b5a53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:94a790c9-7f06-dfef-a20d-1069215b5a53
msgctxt "hff639b4bg8e20g436dg9121gb9b5a0626739"
msgid "Our cause is just and righteous, friend. That's all the luck we need."
msgstr "우리의 대의는 정의로우며 정당하지. 그것만으로도 충분할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = 950452ca-484c-608b-245e-d9241c35d9dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:950452ca-484c-608b-245e-d9241c35d9dd
msgctxt "ha8a68904gf2fcg4b25gb059gae0ae3d14a27"
msgid ""
"To use it as all innovators do - for the good of the realm. Nothing to "
"concern yourself with."
msgstr "모든 혁신가가 그렇듯 렐름의 이익을 위해서지. 네가 상관할 바는 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d311d93-7119-7751-b683-e000b37653bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - aa1d4932-8689-5e30-2b17-9b0968663a7a_insightsuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:9d311d93-7119-7751-b683-e000b37653bc
msgctxt "h89a86467g632fg426eg8cf8gb4dd9042a587"
msgid "Details. <i>Now.</i>"
msgstr "자세히 말해봐. <b>당장</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = a0c5c4d8-9e32-47b4-2914-8e7fe761138e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:a0c5c4d8-9e32-47b4-2914-8e7fe761138e
msgctxt "h33bf749fg12ecg4b80gb82bg35ba87809418"
msgid "Well? Will you help me or not?"
msgstr "그래서 날 도울 거야 말 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1f4b40b-6848-c79c-926c-4c13285c0b7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:a1f4b40b-6848-c79c-926c-4c13285c0b7f
msgctxt "h24317982g6dc7g404fg8bc2gcdfbd96c7f2b"
msgid "Sarevok? The Bhaalspawn?"
msgstr "사레복? 그 바알스폰을 말하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = a3403913-4d3c-c894-048d-6679ea4ed1af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:a3403913-4d3c-c894-048d-6679ea4ed1af
msgctxt "h8eece46cg92aeg4022g8efeg0cfd927fb76d"
msgid ""
"We are inventors of the highest order, matched, perhaps, but never surpassed "
"by the Gondians at the High House of Wonders."
msgstr "우리는 최고의 발명가들이다. 경이의 집에 있는 곤드 신자는 우리와 대등할 순 있겠지만 절대 우릴 능가하진 못 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = a47ae2b2-0850-0234-40ba-e6d7229fe332
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:a47ae2b2-0850-0234-40ba-e6d7229fe332
msgctxt "hf47f36c1g600bg46dcgb695gbbf9ddd25d9e"
msgid ""
"Yes, our forebears were complicit with Sarevok's madness. But it was a "
"century ago, and nothing more than foolishness."
msgstr ""
"우리 조상들이 사레복의 미친 짓에 가담한 건 사실이야, 하지만 그건 벌써 백 년 전의 일이고 한낱 어리석음 따위에 불과 했던 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = a97db076-dab3-e9ff-8164-530ea312e056
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:a97db076-dab3-e9ff-8164-530ea312e056
msgctxt "hb7773b9ag2741g479egb08agc85d10c3b86b"
msgid "Perhaps. But why should I be punished for a mistake I took no part in?"
msgstr "그럴지도 몰라, 하지만 그렇다고 저지르지도 않은 실수로 나까지 벌을 받아야만 하는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa744218-2c53-64f5-325c-4be177c86427
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:aa744218-2c53-64f5-325c-4be177c86427
msgctxt "hd549f12cgbfc9g4405g977ag4e54f6d19400"
msgid "Is there anything I can do to help?"
msgstr "내가 도와줄 수 있는 일이 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = b07ded41-09b2-de8f-0324-55cb36c3e623
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:b07ded41-09b2-de8f-0324-55cb36c3e623
msgctxt "h8d062743g14aeg48c9g8b62g87c2c715347f"
msgid "Yet they banished us from Baldur's Gate. And for what?"
msgstr "그런데도 놈들은 발더스 게이트에서 우리를 추방했지, 대체 어째서일까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b27fd1b2-133b-049b-23c5-98dc453b89a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:b27fd1b2-133b-049b-23c5-98dc453b89a5
msgctxt "hc1b4a86bg7515g4a54gad60ga415cbf9480b"
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr "사양하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = b484425d-0e2b-96db-ac23-4aac382ee9a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_GnomePrisoner001_State_PermaDefeated = True
#.      - MOO_GnomePrisoner002_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:b484425d-0e2b-96db-ac23-4aac382ee9a4
msgctxt "h89af7699g0b75g4312g86f7gb3b8d7889bf5"
msgid "Hence why you're here, and they're dead."
msgstr "그러니까 너는 살아 있고 그 녀석들은 죽은 거겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = b60c551c-515a-2459-3d45-d801b6e24f15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Wulbren_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_WrootRequest_Event_TalkedToWulbrenInHaven = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Wulbren_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:b60c551c-515a-2459-3d45-d801b6e24f15
msgctxt "h2ca4e7feg4c8eg4f37g80d5g2ff0dee10e9f"
msgid "I owe you an apology."
msgstr "너에게 사과를 해야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6f2e93b-6e00-7336-21f3-070a08387c31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:b6f2e93b-6e00-7336-21f3-070a08387c31
msgctxt "h30845efeg7ac1g44adgb621g4c1ee9ec4c44"
msgid "He was hardly a challenge."
msgstr "그 놈, 별 것도 아니던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bb304abd-a921-47d6-c657-6bb94fe3c8e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:bb304abd-a921-47d6-c657-6bb94fe3c8e4
msgctxt "hc4531f5dgbd37g4fa7g842dg87ad34f60d72"
msgid "I kill Ketheric, and suddenly we're friends, are we?"
msgstr "케서릭을 죽였더니, 갑자기 친구가 되고 싶어진 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = bb5fd4b8-8e5b-4fe6-3508-03f2d54888e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:bb5fd4b8-8e5b-4fe6-3508-03f2d54888e1
msgctxt "h448ce485g6cdeg49c4g9f20g41615112784f"
msgid ""
"Sarevok was a madman and a murderer. He brought Baldur's Gate to the brink "
"of destruction. And we were fool enough to work with him."
msgstr "발더스 게이트를 파멸 직전까지 몰아붙인 광인이자 살인마야. 우리 아이언핸드는 그런 놈에게 가담할 정도로 멍청했었고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = c0231f42-c82e-bed8-3b99-ef8595bfbc14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:c0231f42-c82e-bed8-3b99-ef8595bfbc14
msgctxt "h2b2fe764ga840g4b37gb72dgc4fd47eabcc8"
msgid "Barcus and I are another matter - I'm dealing with you right now."
msgstr "바커스와 내 문제는 별개고, 난 지금 너와 이야기 중이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = c03c83a3-14b2-94f6-444b-df2f6cad524e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:c03c83a3-14b2-94f6-444b-df2f6cad524e
msgctxt "h92aa1b6cg8a50g4ff7g864bg408dcb1c82c2"
msgid "Do not speak of a story you only know the half of."
msgstr "잘 모르는 이야기는 입에 담지마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = c115b6a9-2688-0bce-16c8-e56646013c5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:c115b6a9-2688-0bce-16c8-e56646013c5c
msgctxt "ha2af3758g2ae0g4684gb5b5gfd4521ba0cee"
msgid ""
"Plenty. Find me in the city, and help us save Baldur's Gate from itself."
msgstr "도울 것이야 많지, 발더스 게이트에서 날 찾아 도시를 스스로부터 구하는 데에 도움을 주게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c90c9efd-19b3-f27c-a505-dce69d5b7e74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:c90c9efd-19b3-f27c-a505-dce69d5b7e74
msgctxt "h4ddb2fb5g1bc7g4140g9cfcg425553e23354"
msgid "Go on. I'm sure you're dying to tell me all about the Ironhand Gnomes."
msgstr "계속해봐. 아이언핸드 노움 이야기를 들려주고 싶어서 안달이 난 게 보이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cf629931-f3f4-aa30-8d87-6949f9c6412c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:cf629931-f3f4-aa30-8d87-6949f9c6412c
msgctxt "h70d35a95g2836g4c1cgb7feg87b5fa8f529d"
msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr "듣고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d36220d6-d0fa-f9f6-93fb-f84d8cfa7173
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:d36220d6-d0fa-f9f6-93fb-f84d8cfa7173
msgctxt "h86e0d2c3gb53dg4765ga1e0gde8a7062707e"
msgid "Were I a Gondian, I'd keep you out of the city too."
msgstr "내가 곤드 신자였다면 나도 널 도시에 발도 못 들이게 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = d6cb883d-d42c-2cd4-5823-1a143afbe25b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:d6cb883d-d42c-2cd4-5823-1a143afbe25b
msgctxt "h3165c7abgc3d4g4192gb166g510f12be7662"
msgid "Indeed. You're worth ten of my own crew - that is clear to see."
msgstr "그렇겠지. 네게는 분명히 우리 애들 열 명 만큼의 가치가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = dad0d3cd-f898-169a-0db5-e71e7a929711
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Knows_WulbrenZealot = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:dad0d3cd-f898-169a-0db5-e71e7a929711
msgctxt "h76fab185g2754g469fg85b9gb5eebc8477f5"
msgid ""
"The plan is what it's always been - to bring the work and innovations of the "
"Ironhand Gnomes to every corner of the realm."
msgstr "계획에는 변함이 없어. 도시 곳곳에 아이언핸드 노움의 혁신과 결과물을 가져오는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = e450d1e6-5cb4-d566-eac0-cb161267662d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Wulbren_UneasyAboutPlayer(1) = True
#.      - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Wulbren_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:e450d1e6-5cb4-d566-eac0-cb161267662d
msgctxt "hd274eb57gdb88g4b47g8922g850b35e895ba"
msgid ""
"Find us in Baldur's Gate. You'll see the Ironhand Gnomes in a new light - I "
"guarantee it."
msgstr "발더스 게이트에서 우릴 찾아와. 아이언핸드 노움을 새롭게 보게 되리라고 보장하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6add991-593e-dc70-48d9-39504b60e22a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GNOME(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:e6add991-593e-dc70-48d9-39504b60e22a
msgctxt "h6d9047dbgaf8bg4e8fg986cg5867d26d6e16"
msgid ""
"There are few as innovative as the Ironhand Gnomes. Your creations were "
"ingenious."
msgstr "아이언핸드 노움만큼 독창적인 발명가들은 많지 않아. 당신들의 발명품은 기발했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = e7cac3a2-4502-0d3e-d20b-ffce470cf379
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:e7cac3a2-4502-0d3e-d20b-ffce470cf379
msgctxt "hafd7748fgd11dg4fd4g9dd4g5f92d788193b"
msgid ""
"The very one. It's the only mistake the Ironhand Gnomes ever made - and it "
"cost us everything."
msgstr ""
"그래, 바로 그 사레복. 사레복을 도운 건 아이언핸드 노움들이 저지른 유일한 실수였어, 하지만 그 실수 때문에 모든 걸 잃어버렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = e876a329-ec0a-dfca-5054-f94db4c149f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:e876a329-ec0a-dfca-5054-f94db4c149f5
msgctxt "h31b3547cga584g41a7g8d40g2deec0cd3665"
msgid "Tough, but fair."
msgstr "심한 말이지만, 맞는 말이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = ea3c6848-2eff-668b-edb2-84b8efd162ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Wulbren_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCE_GnomeFollowUp_Wulbren_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:ea3c6848-2eff-668b-edb2-84b8efd162ab
msgctxt "h1d22f964g0c65g446egb63cg59c20dacaaba"
msgid ""
"You helped me escape this hellspit, then took down the heart of Moonrise - "
"Ketheric himself. I'm impressed."
msgstr "넌 이 지옥 같은 곳에서 날 구해주고 문라이즈의 핵심 그 자체인 케서릭을 쓰러트렸어. 꽤 감명 받았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f046be93-0369-d47c-8937-02d0ea679e2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Jailbreak_Event_BoatLeavesWithoutPlayers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:f046be93-0369-d47c-8937-02d0ea679e2b
msgctxt "hfe5f4602gcef3g42aeg8054g503b2938c3b5"
msgid "Have you forgotten the bit where you <i>left me behind.</i>"
msgstr "날 <b>버려두고</b> 가버렸던 건 잊은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = f2807911-7f5b-910c-4c82-5131609c0bf1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:f2807911-7f5b-910c-4c82-5131609c0bf1
msgctxt "hc5a531acg0cc6g43ffg9489ga8811ae91896"
msgid "I was getting to that, but all right - thank you."
msgstr "그럴 참이었는데, 뭐 그래. 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = f57c1f35-52e1-3bdc-e447-a6c628bf9f34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:f57c1f35-52e1-3bdc-e447-a6c628bf9f34
msgctxt "h7024d898gb33ag49efga218gb9211e5c76b8"
msgid ""
"Back in my cell, I didn't tell you everything - about who I was, and more "
"importantly, who I represent."
msgstr "감옥에서는 너에게 모든 걸 털어놓지 않았었어. 내가 누구인지, 그리고 더 중요하게는 무엇을 대변하는지 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren
#. Speaker = Wulbren Bongle
#. NodeID = fc30ea42-e3c4-fa9d-c560-fb92ccf9772f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Epilogue/SCE_Wulbren:fc30ea42-e3c4-fa9d-c560-fb92ccf9772f
msgctxt "h6fe261dbg6652g4102gb92cg83ca7337b3e5"
msgid ""
"Thank you, but there is no 'were'. We <i>are</i> inventors of the highest "
"order, matched, perhaps, but never surpassed by the Gondians at the High "
"House of Wonders."
msgstr ""
"고맙네. 그런데 \"기발했어\"라니. 우리는 <i>여전히</i> 최고의 발명가들이다. 경이의 집에 있는 곤드 신자는 우리와 대등할 순 "
"있겠지만 절대 우릴 능가하진 못 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AD_Combat_Desire
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 94ad0cb7-5ddc-4d51-8afb-d3a0cc5738ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AD_Combat_Desire:94ad0cb7-5ddc-4d51-8afb-d3a0cc5738ae
msgctxt "h6399d187g3599g4dcdg80d3gd64405d357fb"
msgid "Fists! Draw your weapons!"
msgstr "피스트! 무기를 들어라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AD_Combat_FlamingFist_001
#. Speaker = Fist Thadwick
#. NodeID = 1ec9fc02-5503-45f0-b86a-a104d2f6988d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AD_Combat_FlamingFist_001:1ec9fc02-5503-45f0-b86a-a104d2f6988d
msgctxt "h53e4399eg1cd7g4f33g89a1gf6e00111bbb6"
msgid "For Duke Ravengard!"
msgstr "레이븐가드 공작님을 위하여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AD_Combat_FlamingFist_001_DesireDied
#. Speaker = Fist Thadwick
#. NodeID = 657b360d-05b7-4281-b998-1b2db53b50e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AD_Combat_FlamingFist_001_DesireDied:657b360d-05b7-4281-b998-1b2db53b50e5
msgctxt "he08d06dcg4be0g4797g9006g6cec91a71a09"
msgid "Florrick! You bastards."
msgstr "플로릭 님! 이런 개자식들."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AD_Combat_FlamingFist_003
#. Speaker = Fist Rahir
#. NodeID = 63f82194-a152-42b7-ba66-8774abc23335
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AD_Combat_FlamingFist_003:63f82194-a152-42b7-ba66-8774abc23335
msgctxt "h65603b0eg319dg487cg9ea8g64a1ee3eefec"
msgid "Stand your ground, Fists!"
msgstr "물러서지 마라, 피스트!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AD_Combat_FlamingFist_005
#. Speaker = Fist Gretta
#. NodeID = c241b98c-dae1-442c-98ee-32254fe289ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AD_Combat_FlamingFist_005:c241b98c-dae1-442c-98ee-32254fe289ee
msgctxt "h50c4e18eg9f97g4badgbb0agc9059e59afb5"
msgid "I'm going home to Baldur's Gate with your blood on my tunic."
msgstr "내 옷자락에 네 놈의 피를 묻히고 발더스게이트로 돌아가겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AD_Combat_FlamingFist_006
#. Speaker = Fist Cyril
#. NodeID = 607bad34-3604-4ddd-aa58-567c18062b18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AD_Combat_FlamingFist_006:607bad34-3604-4ddd-aa58-567c18062b18
msgctxt "h26adcf37gafe4g4cb2g8320g5e8b8c0319a8"
msgid "Come at me, you freaks!"
msgstr "괴물 녀석들, 덤벼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 1cb37a6c-6562-4eeb-8c1d-a2cb2a2858c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 512d5ba7-a884-f1f5-5d26-fad488c07e2c_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 512d5ba7-a884-f1f5-5d26-fad488c07e2c_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty:1cb37a6c-6562-4eeb-8c1d-a2cb2a2858c4
msgctxt "h5d20b66agc3f2g496bg96a3g15403d5a2bbc"
msgid "Can I get you anything? A drink? A bite to eat?"
msgstr "뭐라도 마실래? 아니면 먹을래? 뭐 필요한 거라도 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 1f03effc-1986-4300-9d73-28aca845e94d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 512d5ba7-a884-f1f5-5d26-fad488c07e2c_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 512d5ba7-a884-f1f5-5d26-fad488c07e2c_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty:1f03effc-1986-4300-9d73-28aca845e94d
msgctxt "h010bc7cfgc870g46bdg91a5g3161bc0f591a"
msgid "Anything happen while I was away?"
msgstr "내가 없었을 때 무슨 일이라도 있었어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 213a16e1-ec05-22d8-c7f8-1b4c3a446b3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty:213a16e1-ec05-22d8-c7f8-1b4c3a446b3a
msgctxt "h5587c83bgb2b3g4028gbbdbg1b7ac2daa69d"
msgid "Uh-huh."
msgstr "으흠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 27b281e8-5b20-4447-87ac-73f843d747a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty:27b281e8-5b20-4447-87ac-73f843d747a4
msgctxt "hc73be0d3g1999g48cdga0bfg7799ce50dc7a"
msgid "I'm just glad you're safe."
msgstr "그냥 네가 무사해서 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 342ffff0-bdcd-4c46-b73b-5449099677c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty:342ffff0-bdcd-4c46-b73b-5449099677c6
msgctxt "h2dacdae6gf724g40fdg9d65ge621ee36b797"
msgid "Too much. I can't wait for things to just be... quiet."
msgstr "엄청 많은 일이 있었지. 그냥 빨리... 잠잠해졌으면 좋겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 4fe6f9d5-74ea-4eab-861e-9d041cfd212c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty:4fe6f9d5-74ea-4eab-861e-9d041cfd212c
msgctxt "h71a554c4ga002g4653g9f63gb2166ac6a378"
msgid "Hmm."
msgstr "흐음."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 5e380c80-e7e0-4e93-a47e-d48aeff483d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty:5e380c80-e7e0-4e93-a47e-d48aeff483d7
msgctxt "hc069b095g0de1g4f0bga209g6d1546290464"
msgid "It'll be quiet in the city. We'll have a little house, maybe a garden?"
msgstr "도시에서는 좀 잠잠해질 거야. 작은 집을 한 채 가지게 될 테고, 어쩌면 정원도?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 71ea4592-b4e9-47da-b594-cc7ea8fddde2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty:71ea4592-b4e9-47da-b594-cc7ea8fddde2
msgctxt "h84b68213g23c3g47acg8e4dg290317336f41"
msgid "Alfira, I'm all right."
msgstr "난 괜찮아, 알피라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 7ccd29e8-785a-489b-9efb-686110205405
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 512d5ba7-a884-f1f5-5d26-fad488c07e2c_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty:7ccd29e8-785a-489b-9efb-686110205405
msgctxt "h856cc5cag8490g490cgacf5ga5ae7ed9f1d2"
msgid "Why are you smiling at me?"
msgstr "왜 여길 쳐다보며 웃는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 8bb80cf0-a51a-4c2e-b850-2f49aefa37c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 512d5ba7-a884-f1f5-5d26-fad488c07e2c_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 512d5ba7-a884-f1f5-5d26-fad488c07e2c_C = False
#.     - 512d5ba7-a884-f1f5-5d26-fad488c07e2c_A = False
#.     - 512d5ba7-a884-f1f5-5d26-fad488c07e2c_B = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty:8bb80cf0-a51a-4c2e-b850-2f49aefa37c6
msgctxt "hcf5f2014g702dg4d94g811cgf1ee063bbf94"
msgid "How about you? You all right?"
msgstr "좀 어때? 괜찮아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = c86f81e5-55d2-4757-ae93-173f5666f468
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty:c86f81e5-55d2-4757-ae93-173f5666f468
msgctxt "hcf0624bcga5aeg482cgbb55gdc5acbd5d913"
msgid "I know, I know. Sorry."
msgstr "알았어, 알았어. 미안해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = d0961349-45ef-4138-9817-dff99dfe79d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty:d0961349-45ef-4138-9817-dff99dfe79d8
msgctxt "h3681f6ccg9ee4g474ega274g45220b8c5ec8"
msgid "Me? I'm fine."
msgstr "저요? 전 괜찮아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = fe4fb040-d4ed-6a73-5bdf-21982491aa04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_AD_WithFlirty:fe4fb040-d4ed-6a73-5bdf-21982491aa04
msgctxt "h0667b30cg053ag43d5gbbd2g73d87277bf65"
msgid "That sounds perfect."
msgstr "그거 좋네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0119c3ba-8782-b85d-6c5d-391cb721a986
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:0119c3ba-8782-b85d-6c5d-391cb721a986
msgctxt "h23ef4563g9771g4f78ga1e4g1b07c1a46557"
msgid ""
"'When the night is dark, stars shine brightest.' So keep on shining. It's "
"going to be all right."
msgstr "'밤이 어두울 때, 별은 가장 밝게 빛난다.' 그러니 계속 반짝이는 거야 . 다 잘될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 01b55741-b9f6-d463-b87d-bb776c9e8e52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:01b55741-b9f6-d463-b87d-bb776c9e8e52
msgctxt "h38801bc2g6b68g4494ga669gc45ea402ba74"
msgid "Just be careful out there, all right? I can't handle anyone else dying."
msgstr "조심하세요, 아셨죠? 또 누군가 죽는다면 견딜 수 없을 것 같아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 067c11ed-5c3b-78be-742d-d4b783be7c7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:067c11ed-5c3b-78be-742d-d4b783be7c7f
msgctxt "h99129163gc8f7g4551g8691gc7041ff9d28d"
msgid "I don't feel lucky. I feel... I feel like I'm at the end of my rope."
msgstr "운이 좋았다기보다는... 힘이 다한 느낌이네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 074bc1bd-0733-ed99-18f1-4a95bcd76a4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:074bc1bd-0733-ed99-18f1-4a95bcd76a4b
msgctxt "h20a7ec75gd341g4c28gab29g3cf70a169d78"
msgid "I knew it. The moment you came through that door I just knew."
msgstr "그럴 것 같았어요. 당신이 문을 열고 들어오는 순간, 그럴 것 같더라고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 090e39fd-2f2b-6be2-d467-668f4eea1576
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6aeab4b9-0f6e-b812-37dc-68db60f8170d_AsharakHook = True
#.      - 6aeab4b9-0f6e-b812-37dc-68db60f8170d_IkaronHook = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:090e39fd-2f2b-6be2-d467-668f4eea1576
msgctxt "h54b0cc62g8401g4160g92e9g45192fa01527"
msgid "Which one was Asharak again?"
msgstr "아샤라크가 누구였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 09657957-eac6-73cc-250b-4314fd1825ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_AlfiraTale_Event_SmallReward = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:09657957-eac6-73cc-250b-4314fd1825ec
msgctxt "h0eae91f6g5da2g4613ga850g9ca6cf925453"
msgid "It's a sad day to be giving this, but here."
msgstr "이걸 주기엔 슬픈 날이지만, 어쨌든 받으세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f4ae728-01da-7b98-e041-a06c43f18738
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:0f4ae728-01da-7b98-e041-a06c43f18738
msgctxt "h42afb502ge1a4g4766gbe25gfefe123ce9aa"
msgid "Honestly? Sheer dumb luck."
msgstr "솔직히? 순전히 뜻밖의 행운이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 11190388-0583-5f49-c06d-1ab0cc091677
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_Alfira_NightsongFreed_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:11190388-0583-5f49-c06d-1ab0cc091677
msgctxt "h1a683699g5c5cg4536gaaf2g56b601cb9239"
msgid ""
"When I'm sure it's safe, I'll see about rounding people up to follow the "
"light."
msgstr "안전하다는 확신이 들면, 사람들을 모아 불빛을 따라가도록 해볼게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 12824dd2-62a4-28ed-7be4-8ead5a7b5e36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_AlfiraTale_State_AsharakWasAlive = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6aeab4b9-0f6e-b812-37dc-68db60f8170d_AsharakHook = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:12824dd2-62a4-28ed-7be4-8ead5a7b5e36
msgctxt "hce861f4bge188g4440g8448g8df286ede686"
msgid ""
"They lined us up like dogs. Asharak was with the kids, telling them it was "
"gonna be all right."
msgstr "저희를 개처럼 줄 세웠죠. 아샤라크가 아이들에게 다 괜찮아질 거라고 말해줬어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 12d4a3a8-7d26-0588-737f-7780f7693f08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:12d4a3a8-7d26-0588-737f-7780f7693f08
msgctxt "h3c714d99g41b2g4c5eg9431gc06226dfe0ea"
msgid ""
"That means a lot, coming from you. You always seem to take everything in "
"your stride."
msgstr "그렇게 말해줘서 고마워요. 당신은 모든 일을 침착하게 잘 처리해내는 것 같아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 14407bce-bb73-d62f-e774-8cec30988930
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_AlfiraTale_HasMet_Upset(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:14407bce-bb73-d62f-e774-8cec30988930
msgctxt "h8bd8d482g2f80g4805gb50ag5ed73c41bb9e"
msgid ""
"Why would you say something like that? What is <i>wrong </i>with you? "
"Actually - never mind."
msgstr "왜 그런 말을 하는 거죠? <i>대체</i> 왜 그러는 거예요? 아니 - 됐어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14dae281-858b-ff6b-573f-4e47cb2502ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:14dae281-858b-ff6b-573f-4e47cb2502ff
msgctxt "he223a239gf1fdg45a9gb4bage955e874d94d"
msgid "I'm so sorry."
msgstr "정말 유감이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 169245c0-67d6-a776-de15-734394378c10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:169245c0-67d6-a776-de15-734394378c10
msgctxt "he19f9f1fgc50dg403cga547g6394c0780a89"
msgid ""
"I am! Sorry - that came out wrong. Thank you - I know you did everything you "
"could."
msgstr "당연하죠! 죄송해요. 방금 전엔 말이 헛나왔어요. 고마워요 - 당신이 최선을 다한 거 알고 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 16d71a68-b554-bba8-42a9-8597c7161199
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:16d71a68-b554-bba8-42a9-8597c7161199
msgctxt "h5e570333g7f0bg489ega29cg05bf71db9158"
msgid "Then I'm glad we were lucky enough to meet you."
msgstr "그렇다면 당신을 만나게 된 우리도 운이 좋은 거니 다행이네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 17211ef2-fd58-db90-0fbe-f74ba938049c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:17211ef2-fd58-db90-0fbe-f74ba938049c
msgctxt "h0bdc87e2g972fg4c53g9ff7g5000145a6013"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 197399fd-6b37-2c3e-49a1-dc2e2d69b607
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:197399fd-6b37-2c3e-49a1-dc2e2d69b607
msgctxt "h77ea5548g562bg4979gb9aeg154b4b2e5da5"
msgid "But thank you - I'm sure you did what you could."
msgstr "그렇지만 고마워요. 당신도 할 수 있는 최선을 다했을 테니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19c04cf3-b6bf-7353-aa07-c51c018d6974
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:19c04cf3-b6bf-7353-aa07-c51c018d6974
msgctxt "h59271ac1g4e9fg4d8fg8e6ag3f1a134437a9"
msgid "Stop whining."
msgstr "그만 징징대."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a78cded-3310-51ee-c10b-9fa11c1b1f51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:1a78cded-3310-51ee-c10b-9fa11c1b1f51
msgctxt "h1ee262cfge8c9g48c8gb1fcg4c58abbefaa3"
msgid "Danger is my life - there is no greater thrill for me than the hunt."
msgstr "위험은 내 삶이야 - 사냥보다 스릴 넘치는 건 세상에 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 1af32e61-9f40-2a37-f544-b554ba3fc4c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:1af32e61-9f40-2a37-f544-b554ba3fc4c5
msgctxt "h7339c9f7g31b2g488bgb25fg9695ed1f8414"
msgid "Some of us fought back - or tried to. But it was hopeless."
msgstr "저희 중 일부가 맞서 싸웠지만, 가망이 없었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 1b0a7d89-fdc7-d4ad-eba1-a95468aea0a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:1b0a7d89-fdc7-d4ad-eba1-a95468aea0a3
msgctxt "hc76540a6g9b7dg44fega09bg7630d44da962"
msgid "Maybe that's why they picked him. Told him to kneel..."
msgstr "그래서 그를 선택한 걸지도 몰라요. 그를 무릎 꿇린 후에는..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 1d3e10ff-a4e2-daac-62b0-c0d24fc1871d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:1d3e10ff-a4e2-daac-62b0-c0d24fc1871d
msgctxt "hd95e51degc36eg4d9agb76agfc9846a5c64f"
msgid "We're in the same boat, then? That's... somewhat of a comfort."
msgstr "우리 그럼 같은 처지인 건가요? 뭔가... 위안이 되네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1d68433a-d3ab-1d76-06bd-b6b391ccb770
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:1d68433a-d3ab-1d76-06bd-b6b391ccb770
msgctxt "h597fc5d1gfa65g496egac05g988af4c9451e"
msgid "I'm sure they're fine. Probably being held for questioning."
msgstr "괜찮을 거야. 아마 심문을 위해 잡아둔 걸 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 1f1eb1b7-058f-5def-5dc0-5484ae434945
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:1f1eb1b7-058f-5def-5dc0-5484ae434945
msgctxt "hf2c97d6bg27c8g4c18g8534g17e6515e8606"
msgid "You don't know? Stars above..."
msgstr "몰랐어요? 세상에..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fb813b0-4d26-5a4f-5782-f1d81a236d36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:1fb813b0-4d26-5a4f-5782-f1d81a236d36
msgctxt "h0305b2f3g66ebg42e3ga815g5aaa8f22ebbb"
msgid "How did you survive?"
msgstr "어떻게 살아남은 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fb94c01-f604-4a66-da9d-340ac04e7553
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:1fb94c01-f604-4a66-da9d-340ac04e7553
msgctxt "hc328f9fcgfc6cg4681gb0dcg3cff031b4e27"
msgid "You think a few shadows could beat me?"
msgstr "그림자 따위가 날 이길 수 있었을 거라 생각해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 203551f9-acde-6be4-fed9-faedbb327fc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_Event_SmashedLute(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:203551f9-acde-6be4-fed9-faedbb327fc7
msgctxt "h75f4c30dg7c3ag443bga017g7dcecfacd43d"
msgid ""
"Everyone else might welcome you with open arms, but stay the hells away from "
"me you lute-smashing arsehole."
msgstr "다른 사람들이 널 양 팔 벌려 환영할지라도 내게는 그냥 류트를 부순 개자식일 뿐이야, 얼씬도 하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22e077c0-907d-2f4a-23f1-51755d416d8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:22e077c0-907d-2f4a-23f1-51755d416d8f
msgctxt "hc6b53af0g39c1g4335gb80dg81410c81b32c"
msgid "Danger is my life - I wouldn't change it for the world."
msgstr "위험은 내 삶 그 자체야. 온 세상을 준다 해도 바꾸지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 2602e0c4-76d6-dd04-4ce1-83677dd00445
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:2602e0c4-76d6-dd04-4ce1-83677dd00445
msgctxt "h38bbd78fg5b10g4fb4g87c2gd9681fb27018"
msgid "I believe in ballads they call that 'talent' and 'courage'."
msgstr "발라드에서는 그걸 '재능' 과 '용기'라고 불러요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 275898d2-ecfd-ba5d-549a-d25d739b70f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:275898d2-ecfd-ba5d-549a-d25d739b70f1
msgctxt "ha1ae9021g8669g4fdbga0f3gf1a970e985c6"
msgid "How did you do it? How did you get them out of that hellspit?"
msgstr "어떻게 한 거예요? 어떻게 그 지옥 구덩이에서 데리고 나온 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 2a1eb006-3c90-c96e-c401-790c2ec33241
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:2a1eb006-3c90-c96e-c401-790c2ec33241
msgctxt "h1d8080cbg9807g4dbfg8756g0ba95277134a"
msgid ""
"He said he stayed in the grove because of you, and I'm damn glad of it. "
"Without him... well, none of us would be here."
msgstr ""
"그가 당신 때문에 숲에 남아있게 됐다고 했는데, 그래서 정말 기뻐요. 그가 없었다면... 우리 중 누구도 이 자리에 있지 못 했을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 2c7defac-146d-3e2c-ba2c-df928235bae1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:2c7defac-146d-3e2c-ba2c-df928235bae1
msgctxt "h98574801gcbc7g4ad6gbadfgf04979f5c16a"
msgid "Gods alive! <i>Why?!</i>"
msgstr "세상에! <i>대체 왜?!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ca3b95d-734e-fc3d-4aca-a34e17b9dbba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:2ca3b95d-734e-fc3d-4aca-a34e17b9dbba
msgctxt "h52053da3ga38dg4775g817dg811316feaebb"
msgid "Wandering into the darkness was a stupid idea."
msgstr "어둠 속으로 방황한 건 바보같은 생각이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 300e65b3-fe88-0d58-e503-32b2ea6ce866
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:300e65b3-fe88-0d58-e503-32b2ea6ce866
msgctxt "h557bfb24gd83bg45f5g84b7g132bee971243"
msgid "My teacher always said emotions are to be felt - not feared."
msgstr "제 스승님은 항상 감정은 두려움의 대상이 아니라 느끼는 것이라 하셨어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 331e1035-5b32-5580-6fec-0c65e421a38b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:331e1035-5b32-5580-6fec-0c65e421a38b
msgctxt "h10af1bc1gafeag47c2gba18g3ee728a13458"
msgid "I'm glad you made it too, it's one hell of a curse."
msgstr "너도 살아남은 걸 보니 기뻐. 정말 끔찍한 저주야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 37854347-45a0-86cf-40b5-4c5e53ac264c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:37854347-45a0-86cf-40b5-4c5e53ac264c
msgctxt "he7a3356eg9e59g43f5gb4dagde0d61eff7fd"
msgid ""
"Can you blame him? His brother and sister are gone. He's... dealing with it "
"as best he can. We all are."
msgstr "롤란을 탓할 수 있을까요? 그의 형제자매가 이젠 없어요. 본인은... 최선을 다하는 중일 거예요. 우리 모두가 그렇고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 39110fb6-1981-d5a9-fd1b-283939931288
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:39110fb6-1981-d5a9-fd1b-283939931288
msgctxt "hffde4c4dg2d1eg489egb92fg7cf64222fb8b"
msgid ""
"'Heart's Requiem', right? The hero survives a war and rebuilds her life - "
"stronger than ever. A tale worth remembering - especially now."
msgstr ""
"'마음의 진혼곡'이죠? 영웅이 전쟁에서 살아 나와 예전보다 더 강해져 새 삶을 이루는 이야기 말이에요. 암송할 가치가 있는 이야기예요. "
"특히 요즘 들어서는 말이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 3bab4458-daf5-887c-c58d-29f5d19ac1e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:3bab4458-daf5-887c-c58d-29f5d19ac1e6
msgctxt "h675dee71gfb00g4878g9507g46e1dfacde39"
msgid "You make it sound so easy - but I'll try."
msgstr "아주 쉬운 일인 양 말하시는군요. 그래도 시도해볼게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 3cd46661-d8fc-f997-5ccc-ed8ebba4db7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:3cd46661-d8fc-f997-5ccc-ed8ebba4db7d
msgctxt "hd7df8175g34d2g419bg9dacgba202a43b18a"
msgid ""
"If it was anyone else, I'd be sceptical - but you? You've more than earned "
"the title of hero."
msgstr "다른 사람이었다면, 회의적이었을 텐데 - 당신이라면? 충분히 영웅이라 불리고도 남죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3cf92250-c06c-545e-ff59-8664c4ea2a02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:3cf92250-c06c-545e-ff59-8664c4ea2a02
msgctxt "h970e9d12g02ceg42bag842egc716db039a6d"
msgid "I take what I'm due and I don't look back."
msgstr "난 내 몫을 다 하고 다른 건 신경 쓰지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 3ecfb6c7-a71b-488e-09af-b0b09c0f40a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:3ecfb6c7-a71b-488e-09af-b0b09c0f40a7
msgctxt "h77965bfeg258bg48c6g99bdgd29eaf403a97"
msgid ""
"Damn it, no! Once we left that bloody grove, everything was supposed to be "
"all right! We were supposed to be <i>safe</i>."
msgstr "젠장, 안 돼! 그 빌어먹을 숲을 떠나면 모든 게 다 잘 됐어야 했는데! <i>안전해야</i> 했다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 3f8f0894-9639-c149-f830-63f97793c036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:3f8f0894-9639-c149-f830-63f97793c036
msgctxt "hdee1259ega676g4a38gbc44g8cbe0861cbe3"
msgid ""
"Maybe. Sorry, I shouldn't have said anything. You've enough on your plate."
msgstr "그럴지도요. 죄송해요. 아무 말도 안 하는 게 좋았을 텐데. 당신도 걱정거리가 많겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 4161bc10-d054-a933-cfa6-9cb1fc57dfde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:4161bc10-d054-a933-cfa6-9cb1fc57dfde
msgctxt "h6432d161gb6e3g4d2dgbf69g78973348b09e"
msgid ""
"Don't say that. When I think of what would have happened if Cal and Lia "
"weren't there..."
msgstr "그런 말씀 하지 마세요. 칼과 리아가 없었으면 어떻게 됐을지 생각하면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 41e6bd47-2b80-c935-9702-318d2f9adffe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_AlfiraTale_Event_BigReward = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:41e6bd47-2b80-c935-9702-318d2f9adffe
msgctxt "hee96a2a3gb120g4ba1gbaefg227ec912c864"
msgid "It's not much, but you here - deserve it."
msgstr "별건 아니지만, 이거 받으세요. 당신은 받을 자격이 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 440d6b30-0ee4-81a1-9919-2a4b6acb3949
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_UNDERDARK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:440d6b30-0ee4-81a1-9919-2a4b6acb3949
msgctxt "h7e7b9b1fge2f9g4a4agb169g800cca228d00"
msgid "Only the strong survive. You want to live? Focus on yourself."
msgstr "강한 자만이 살아남는다. 살고 싶나? 너 자신만 생각해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 4687065d-1ea0-1e99-0290-d9cad97d103c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_AlfiraTale_HasMet_Upset(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:4687065d-1ea0-1e99-0290-d9cad97d103c
msgctxt "hdc863cc3g8968g4002ga3ecg5f0d9bb0d47d"
msgid "...Never mind, then. Just - just leave me be."
msgstr "...됐어요. 날 내버려 둬요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 4725c534-03b7-f78a-29b8-a12fc58cf880
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:4725c534-03b7-f78a-29b8-a12fc58cf880
msgctxt "h2597eea0gd869g4d5cgaee5g084ecc7a9024"
msgid "Stars, you hadn't heard?"
msgstr "세상에. 아직도 못 들었어요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 480aca1e-65b4-d110-7325-fa0bce6fd0e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:480aca1e-65b4-d110-7325-fa0bce6fd0e0
msgctxt "h7dad0effgecefg4ed5g82f0g59c89964246b"
msgid "Thank you. If anyone can manage it, you can."
msgstr "고마워요. 그걸 해낼 수 있는 사람이 있다면, 아마 당신일 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 48661513-b22c-533f-f45a-59856313e381
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_ReturnCompleted = True
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_TieflingsReturned = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_AlfiraPostRescue(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:48661513-b22c-533f-f45a-59856313e381
msgctxt "h80b63887g1f0dg4eebg8fd7g63392435354a"
msgid ""
"Our group grows smaller and smaller. We've lost many, but we have you to "
"thank for the ones who survived."
msgstr "우리의 숫자는 점점 더 줄어들고 있어요. 많은 사람을 잃었지만, 우리 모두 살아남은 사람들에 대해 감사해하고 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a1829c1-5bb3-e9ad-7f95-03b7ce8766a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:4a1829c1-5bb3-e9ad-7f95-03b7ce8766a6
msgctxt "h90c7f6bbgcdabg4fc2gbcc1gfc929b878f12"
msgid "Honestly? Sheer dumb luck."
msgstr "솔직히 말하면 순전히 운이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4d72236e-f11d-9a9e-b8a9-a490d7be65c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:4d72236e-f11d-9a9e-b8a9-a490d7be65c2
msgctxt "hf50d608egf54ag4a02gbcb4g89034217f66f"
msgid "You can trust me."
msgstr "날 믿어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 53db688a-97e4-f673-627e-e2443d56a53f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_AlfiraPostRescue(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:53db688a-97e4-f673-627e-e2443d56a53f
msgctxt "h0e96fe9dg32c7g4861gb274ge4970deb1a10"
msgid ""
"The others should be in Baldur's Gate: safe, <i>happy. </i>To die like they "
"did... they didn't deserve it."
msgstr "다른 사람들은 발더스 게이트에 있어야만 해요: 안전하고, <i>행복하게요.</i>그런 식으로 죽는 건... 그건 정말 아니에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 547f885f-cfa1-3afc-88e4-d910d979b6a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:547f885f-cfa1-3afc-88e4-d910d979b6a9
msgctxt "h9a0849f2g9c52g4ee1gb3e6ga7eb58d94d94"
msgid ""
"Which...? He was on the quiet side, but had a heart of gold. Back in the "
"grove, he'd kept an eye on the kids. Gods, that feels like a lifetime ago."
msgstr ""
"누구였냐고요...? 그는 조용한 편이지만 훌륭한 마음씨를 지닌 사람이었어요. 숲에서 항상 아이들을 돌봤죠. 세상에, 정말 오래 전의 "
"일처럼 느껴져요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 54d5a894-4a14-3600-44f2-6f3cc7dfdaee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_AlfiraTale_State_IkaronWasAlive = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6aeab4b9-0f6e-b812-37dc-68db60f8170d_IkaronHook = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:54d5a894-4a14-3600-44f2-6f3cc7dfdaee
msgctxt "h19ffea35g7ba2g48a2gbe12gcb81986216bd"
msgid ""
"They lined us up like dogs. Ikaron was with the kids, telling them it was "
"gonna be all right."
msgstr "저희를 개처럼 줄 세웠죠. 이카론은 아이들에게 다 괜찮아질 거라고 말해줬어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5768e792-f43b-89e4-592a-e4dc98b293b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:5768e792-f43b-89e4-592a-e4dc98b293b2
msgctxt "h4925d620gf8b7g476dga3cbgbebd1796dbc6"
msgid "I'll let you know when I figure it out."
msgstr "나도 알게 되면 알려줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 591c8d6d-3530-c236-13c9-c981d8e02a5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_AlfiraTale_HasMet_Alert(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:591c8d6d-3530-c236-13c9-c981d8e02a5a
msgctxt "h6eb298bag5a05g4df1gbcf7gead2a21251bc"
msgid ""
"First cultists nearly murder us, and now we have a traitor on the inside? "
"Can't we trust anyone?"
msgstr "처음엔 광신도들이 우릴 거의 죽여 놓더니, 이젠 내부에 배신자까지? 믿을 사람이 있기는 한 건가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 5c75784a-ab7c-2e9a-be28-dfb7df95adae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:5c75784a-ab7c-2e9a-be28-dfb7df95adae
msgctxt "h6e6d9b31g16efg47bag96dcg9f45940cf3e7"
msgid "Just leave me be."
msgstr "절 좀 내버려 둬요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 5dd1f135-f449-176e-126d-c144bc13c844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:5dd1f135-f449-176e-126d-c144bc13c844
msgctxt "h1241f789g4887g4f2eg89f1g9f19d6e5a159"
msgid "It wasn't the curse that did us in."
msgstr "저희를 죽인 건 저주가 아니었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 5e34d7c6-9163-417c-f9f6-bf50bcba8473
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_AlfiraTale_Knows_ProdigySiblingsFate = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:5e34d7c6-9163-417c-f9f6-bf50bcba8473
msgctxt "h13f9158bg1a27g4e24ga45eg35be485ef8b2"
msgid ""
"Cal and Lia were dragged away, along with the others. Rolan isn't... taking "
"it so well. None of us, to be honest."
msgstr "다른 이들과 함께 칼과 리아가 끌려갔어요. 롤란은... 잘 받아들이지 못하고 있고요. 실은 우리 모두가 그래요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 6028c2e5-4cdf-303d-dfcf-e14199041ec2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:6028c2e5-4cdf-303d-dfcf-e14199041ec2
msgctxt "h63611868gfbadg4ad5gb833gb2d20b40d25a"
msgid ""
"They were good people - they deserved to die old and happy. Not in the hands "
"of monsters."
msgstr "그 사람들은 선량한 이들이었어요. 괴물들의 손아귀에서 죽는 게 아니라 늙어서 행복하게 죽어야만 했던 사람들이라고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 626e15ee-241b-f259-1bcf-0673dd3985c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:626e15ee-241b-f259-1bcf-0673dd3985c4
msgctxt "h65de6da9g6e2eg402fga6eag5c46ed616ce1"
msgid "Cultists? What happened?"
msgstr "추종자들이라고? 무슨 일이었어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6278280e-5e2b-25ac-c58d-c8c2965e945f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_ProdigyLament_Event_Intro = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:6278280e-5e2b-25ac-c58d-c8c2965e945f
msgctxt "h0c28a150ga5a0g409bg95f9g443df83e1292"
msgid ""
"If he hadn't listened to me, maybe his brother and sister would still be "
"here."
msgstr "그가 내 말을 듣지 않았다면, 그의 형제와 자매도 아직 여기에 있었을 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 62dfb9b6-4e1e-bfda-e155-63760b8981e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Prodigy_State_Staying = True
#.      - HAV_ProdigyLament_Event_Intro = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:62dfb9b6-4e1e-bfda-e155-63760b8981e8
msgctxt "hec4f9befg2660g4168gb394g97f80095df88"
msgid "Rolan? The apprentice wizard?"
msgstr "롤란? 그 견습 위저드?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 64d31acb-e3cc-45bc-10c3-be765d83d879
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:64d31acb-e3cc-45bc-10c3-be765d83d879
msgctxt "he7ff3292gcb91g4b99g9b0fg15aa0c81c11a"
msgid "I keep replaying it... over and over in my head."
msgstr "계속 떠올리게 돼요... 머릿속에서 계속."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 6523ed29-12a1-857a-85b1-5d5e45c11c5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_AlfiraTale_HasMet_Upset(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:6523ed29-12a1-857a-85b1-5d5e45c11c5c
msgctxt "hb5b9ff23g7074g44eag94cega76eae3a072d"
msgid "It was that or get dragged to Moonrise."
msgstr "도망치지 않았으면 문라이즈로 끌려갔을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 66d70d2d-6ab2-2e74-1224-6065fad163b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:66d70d2d-6ab2-2e74-1224-6065fad163b5
msgctxt "h1849edccg0088g4d37gb452gdd3c76eaef98"
msgid "...Wait. No one's told you?"
msgstr "...잠깐. 아무도 말해주지 않은 거예요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 676927e0-467b-ada4-ec81-1b2d431ef039
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:676927e0-467b-ada4-ec81-1b2d431ef039
msgctxt "h17eda382g3a5eg4e9cg85c8g97fb43b4d493"
msgid "And I regret it with every breath."
msgstr "매 순간 후회하고 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 67f741cb-771a-34ce-041b-e639e0abd128
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - HALFORC(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:67f741cb-771a-34ce-041b-e639e0abd128
msgctxt "h4190d538g336cg43fdg92e1g5e207fb6f045"
msgid "This anger you feel? This fear? <i>Use it.</i> Don't give in to it."
msgstr "분노를 느끼나? 공포를 느끼나? <i>이용해.</i> 굴복하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 6b50d8df-ab7e-d874-dc20-175b20d57e06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:6b50d8df-ab7e-d874-dc20-175b20d57e06
msgctxt "h5b4b0da3g2a2ag4a29gbf11gaa970aaf6e80"
msgid "And your damn well good at it. Thank you - for everything."
msgstr "아주 기가 막히게 잘 해냈어요. 전부 고마워요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c632301-6f65-0a87-b2ea-a7b736f5c1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:6c632301-6f65-0a87-b2ea-a7b736f5c1ca
msgctxt "h382f1b95g4a06g4c7cg9847g2537f4c5e844"
msgid "I imagine the cultists are torturing them right now."
msgstr "아마 지금 이 순간, 그 추종자들에게 고문당하고 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 6f3b496a-e53f-d20e-482c-3704bb9724c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_ConvincedToQuit = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:6f3b496a-e53f-d20e-482c-3704bb9724c1
msgctxt "hb85188d5geb00g452fgb791gc859831ca00e"
msgid ""
"By the time we get to the city, I'm gonna have an entire <i>catalogue</i> of "
"songs about you."
msgstr "저희가 도시에 도착할 때쯤이면, 제 가사집엔 당신에 대한 노래로 가득 차 있을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72dd62ff-f83d-0a40-2106-ce46fc34fb41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: PALADIN_ANCIENTS or PALADIN_DEVOTION or PALADIN_VENGEANCE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:72dd62ff-f83d-0a40-2106-ce46fc34fb41
msgctxt "hc8818ea5g5f8ag411egbeceg679aef665478"
msgid ""
"I'll do everything in my power to save them - you have my most solemn vow."
msgstr "그들을 구하기 위해 내 모든 힘을 쏟겠다 - 가장 엄숙히 맹세하마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7424c48f-472a-b9d1-7661-746a0b153e1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:7424c48f-472a-b9d1-7661-746a0b153e1d
msgctxt "he0e36ea4ge10ag49e9gb448gfe1d02079e86"
msgid "I heard what happened - that people were taken to Moonrise."
msgstr "이야기 들었어. 사람들이 문라이즈로 끌려갔다면서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 74c81a4d-c7f1-491d-080c-a8d0b6378243
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:74c81a4d-c7f1-491d-080c-a8d0b6378243
msgctxt "ha5e63eebgf40eg45c5gaf5fg26736256e2e4"
msgid "By doing what I do best - being a hero."
msgstr "내가 제일 잘하는 걸 했지. 영웅이 되는 거 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7926add2-80ac-5cf5-af1b-c8a31490b73e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:7926add2-80ac-5cf5-af1b-c8a31490b73e
msgctxt "hdb2f28a5gfda8g4c69ga0fag44e644087b9c"
msgid "Running was the right call."
msgstr "도망치는 게 맞는 선택이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 7c1e738d-e19e-8e03-bc57-4dde79df2279
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:7c1e738d-e19e-8e03-bc57-4dde79df2279
msgctxt "h61bb1358g9a82g42f7g8e2eg90aa6ee15582"
msgid "It just... it just never stops."
msgstr "그냥... 계속 생각이 나요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 7c2033f3-df56-df0d-c089-fae55630cd37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:7c2033f3-df56-df0d-c089-fae55630cd37
msgctxt "h31a45ab5g67f9g4369ga648g6bb4bb0e5c57"
msgid ""
"I had to watch my friends, people who can barely hold a sword, try to fight "
"a pack of murderous zealots."
msgstr "전 칼도 겨우 들까 말까 하면서 살인광들에게 맞서려는 친구들을 바라봐야 했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e47e49d-f901-7c99-bdb9-f649ee5ae4f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:7e47e49d-f901-7c99-bdb9-f649ee5ae4f6
msgctxt "h1b083687ge0bbg4c1ega72fgef82b21d9c74"
msgid ""
"Only fools fight an ambush. Better to live and strike another day - "
"preferably to the neck."
msgstr "매복 당했을 때 싸우는 건 바보짓이야. 일단 살고 다음에 반격하는 게 낫지. 목을 치면 더 좋고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 863d9051-2d99-1fb8-40c8-200318f55a10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_AlfiraTale_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:863d9051-2d99-1fb8-40c8-200318f55a10
msgctxt "hc9c5b70fga55ag4fc1g9390g4d5bddeded48"
msgid "You're all right! Thank goodness, I was worried they'd got you too."
msgstr "무사하시군요! 정말 다행이에요. 당신도 당했을까 봐 걱정했잖아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8741d7a3-88ee-5e86-f6c7-cb7449047f76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_DEVOTION(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN_ANCIENTS(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:8741d7a3-88ee-5e86-f6c7-cb7449047f76
msgctxt "h6d063d75g51abg48a1g8572gc8c67cf11ab2"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll find them."
msgstr "걱정하지 마, 찾아낼 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 87a20bde-fe50-7b04-6b64-955c6301b26e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:87a20bde-fe50-7b04-6b64-955c6301b26e
msgctxt "h5fc73c4eg3080g4ee0ga5c7g1e397002938e"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 8db55946-c8a0-02ca-0c10-ec1297fa9ac3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Event_AlfiraAskedForHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:8db55946-c8a0-02ca-0c10-ec1297fa9ac3
msgctxt "h60d01320gbe2ag442eg9f9ag17472c5cc6a6"
msgid ""
"You've done so much for us already, but I have to ask - the others might "
"still be out there."
msgstr "이미 저희를 위해 너무 많은 것을 해주셨지만, 그래도 부탁할게요. 아직 저 밖에서 다른 사람들이 살아 있을지도 몰라요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8ee4bc68-f788-9a9d-2f38-d1f9f384672a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:8ee4bc68-f788-9a9d-2f38-d1f9f384672a
msgctxt "he36f0dd7gc22fg4cdag9ab3gdd1606b34965"
msgid ""
"I've seen a lot of nasty ambushes in my time - but that sounds among the "
"worst. I'm sorry."
msgstr "그동안 끔찍한 매복은 많이 봐왔지만 - 이건 정말 최악인 거 같네. 유감이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 9036e8e8-f64f-b25e-e3e6-6c126e434ec3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Jailbreak_State_AllPrisonersDied = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:9036e8e8-f64f-b25e-e3e6-6c126e434ec3
msgctxt "hc737842egf5deg4067g8af7g3b1372d39ed8"
msgid "You're back! Is... is everything all right?"
msgstr "돌아오셨군요! 전부.. 전부 괜찮은 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 92522a50-5ca8-f33e-ef7a-3bc4c7feafb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:92522a50-5ca8-f33e-ef7a-3bc4c7feafb9
msgctxt "h03dca751g7da7g49a7g80e4g7a315ae66679"
msgid "Honestly? Terribly."
msgstr "솔직히요? 끔찍해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 92d60849-1d25-bc7d-3550-b7ef115f3803
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:92d60849-1d25-bc7d-3550-b7ef115f3803
msgctxt "he0547af0gbd5fg48a4ga707gb64cc4437d49"
msgid ""
"If they're not dead, they're in Moonrise. And gods have mercy on anyone in "
"that hellspit."
msgstr "아직 살아있다면, 문라이즈에 있을 거예요. 신들께서 그 지옥 구덩이의 모두에게 자비를 내리시길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 95dbdf93-ef74-5b01-c06e-bf8582b0a30e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_AlfiraTale_HasMet_Alert(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:95dbdf93-ef74-5b01-c06e-bf8582b0a30e
msgctxt "h5cc9ba7fg0f89g47abg98d5g50722b575d5a"
msgid ""
"That Flaming Fist seemed kind. I keep looking at everyone and wonder whose "
"side they're really on..."
msgstr "플레이밍 피스트의 인상은 괜찮아 보였어요. 계속 지켜보며 그들이 정말 누구의 편인지 고민했는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 967c67a8-ff00-f014-ffea-9eb844b1ddb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:967c67a8-ff00-f014-ffea-9eb844b1ddb3
msgctxt "h3dd5dbd6gb326g426dga544gb865fbdb6889"
msgid "You ran? Cowardly."
msgstr "도망갔다고? 겁쟁이 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9705a9cb-8316-fa1e-faa7-01e142da6b2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:9705a9cb-8316-fa1e-faa7-01e142da6b2f
msgctxt "h91ad4750gaf7fg4ec4g82eegb30c52ba0f31"
msgid "You're lucky to be alive."
msgstr "넌 살아있어 다행이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a3e373e-8e52-7eba-7c67-a0d22b748359
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_AlfiraPostRescue(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_ReturnCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:9a3e373e-8e52-7eba-7c67-a0d22b748359
msgctxt "hecaeedd3g27f3g4aa0ga1fcg15715e77cacf"
msgid "The other tieflings are dead."
msgstr "다른 티플링들은 죽었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 9f66aa4a-fb40-dd5a-0906-2507e0b79bcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:9f66aa4a-fb40-dd5a-0906-2507e0b79bcf
msgctxt "hd44d79a1g25c5g4624gb558g1d726ff6fdeb"
msgid ""
"They lined us up like dogs. Someone told them to rot in the Nine Hells, that "
"we weren't going anywhere."
msgstr "그들은 저희를 개처럼 줄 세웠어. 누군가 그들에게 아홉 지옥에서 썩으라고, 우린 아무 데도 안 간다고 했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = a135c16e-3c2c-f0cc-f287-ae1a78183cb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:a135c16e-3c2c-f0cc-f287-ae1a78183cb7
msgctxt "h6256b21fg3bc4g4ff1gbf73g93e6ef7fe0c1"
msgid "...If you say so. But not everyone is as strong as you are."
msgstr "...알았어요. 하지만 모든 사람이 당신처럼 강한 건 아니에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2fa507e-8b3c-ca7f-12eb-b7b4b41335e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_ProdigyLament_Event_Intro = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:a2fa507e-8b3c-ca7f-12eb-b7b4b41335e2
msgctxt "h0019f947gfcfeg490cgade0ga7838ab6e857"
msgid "I know - Rolan isn't happy with me."
msgstr "그래, 롤란은 내가 싫을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a80b5eaa-023f-5c8a-283c-4403bb3302e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:a80b5eaa-023f-5c8a-283c-4403bb3302e5
msgctxt "hc435c6d7g85a2g474cgbffcg6801a0abdfbb"
msgid "You should be grateful I managed to save anyone at all."
msgstr "내가 몇 명이라도 구한 거에 고마워해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = a96e4898-4670-3a34-9e8b-d0ea93daa87c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:a96e4898-4670-3a34-9e8b-d0ea93daa87c
msgctxt "h80e29488g40b4g429agad4ega68343fb4290"
msgid ""
"We were ambushed out in the darkness - by <i>cultists. </i>We surrendered, "
"but that wasn't enough for them."
msgstr "저희는 어둠 속에서 매복을 당했어요. <i>광신도들</i>에게요. 항복했지만, 광신도들은 그걸로 만족하지 않았죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = aa9e075c-5dc1-2df0-5e15-775fc4fcc95d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_AlfiraTale_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:aa9e075c-5dc1-2df0-5e15-775fc4fcc95d
msgctxt "h1b3820b6gf0a9g490egbb4ag573d27593b02"
msgid "Watch yourself out there. Please."
msgstr "저 밖에서 조심해요. 부탁이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = adaf188f-fb3a-1100-c5a4-74d41adbed52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:adaf188f-fb3a-1100-c5a4-74d41adbed52
msgctxt "h55e6f5bdg5968g4237g9065gb23afbfdc214"
msgid ""
"I know what I am and what I'm not - and I'm not ashamed of running. No "
"matter what you think."
msgstr "전 제 능력과 한계를 알아요. 당신이 어떻게 생각하든, 전 도망치는 게 부끄럽지 않아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aef8107f-6b7f-25aa-5cb5-34526ac7cdeb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:aef8107f-6b7f-25aa-5cb5-34526ac7cdeb
msgctxt "h85679683g3b95g4656g9fbdg14e229f2f3de"
msgid "What did the cultists do to the others?"
msgstr "그 추종자들이 다른 사람들은 어떻게 했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b031d29d-3e80-b0da-4227-bb45298711cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:b031d29d-3e80-b0da-4227-bb45298711cb
msgctxt "h6e6657fbg3ca0g4beagb4e6g6e4ed7862259"
msgid "I see some familiar faces, but where's everyone else?"
msgstr "친숙한 얼굴들이 좀 보이네. 그런데 나머지는 다 어디 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = b046b595-e77b-81d8-b0b0-c6a002e7ac25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:b046b595-e77b-81d8-b0b0-c6a002e7ac25
msgctxt "h9ff118cag0ed1g429bg9970g8fe5d649abc9"
msgid "You're made of sterner stuff than me then."
msgstr "당신은 저보다 강하게 태어나셨군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = b0d81188-05ce-4cb8-bcd5-2e66797cf6ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:b0d81188-05ce-4cb8-bcd5-2e66797cf6ad
msgctxt "h9d43d878g2ca3g4c21ga9d5g50cea1efa53a"
msgid ""
"I know - you've been there for us every step of the way. It's just all a bit "
"much sometimes, you know?"
msgstr "알고 있어요. 매 순간 저희와 함깨 해주셨잖아요. 그런데 가끔은 너무 힘든 거 있죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1cddbdb-b436-ff14-9076-3bdda8e6ec26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:b1cddbdb-b436-ff14-9076-3bdda8e6ec26
msgctxt "h70bc18e8gf70dg4692ga961g2ce060062b6a"
msgid "I don't complain constantly. It's very annoying."
msgstr "난 시도 때도 없이 짜증나게 불평하지 않거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = b1d8be22-83f0-075e-6227-8f3dfcc8e702
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:b1d8be22-83f0-075e-6227-8f3dfcc8e702
msgctxt "h6441f76bg790fg4fa8g8aaagd39d7ebabe8d"
msgid ""
"Which...? Back in the grove, he ran drills with the kids. Wooden swords and "
"the like. That seems like a lifetime ago now."
msgstr "숲에서 아이들을 훈련하던 사람이에요. 나무 칼이랑 기억나시죠? 아주 오래 전의 일처럼 느껴지네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = b28cbf5f-1c1f-9781-7aa4-83862b5288bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:b28cbf5f-1c1f-9781-7aa4-83862b5288bd
msgctxt "h8e4b7d8fg85a0g4cdagbaa4ge6f4b178e2ae"
msgid "You're right. We can't give in - not now. Thank you."
msgstr "맞아요. 아직은 무릎 끓을 수 없죠. 고마워요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = b67b59d0-63d6-69b1-bae1-b18869500f20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:b67b59d0-63d6-69b1-bae1-b18869500f20
msgctxt "h9c58bda9g5706g4a65g9d93g893e23ca4e46"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry it came to that. But if it was you or them, I'd pick you every "
"time."
msgstr "그렇게 돼서 정말 유감이에요. 하지만 당신이나 그들 중에 고르라면, 전 항상 당신을 택할 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = b7909640-ede3-0d09-414e-6d274e292dbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:b7909640-ede3-0d09-414e-6d274e292dbe
msgctxt "h7c44b56fgb096g4fc6g83b7g2847f5f5be13"
msgid "That sounds quite freeing - but I don't have that option, I'm afraid."
msgstr "해방감은 깨나 느껴지겠네요. 하지만 제게 그런 선택권은 없어요. 안타깝게도 말이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7993379-668b-6f4a-48e8-ee5a7310efd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:b7993379-668b-6f4a-48e8-ee5a7310efd8
msgctxt "hb2c62d69gff5dg4b8eg823dgbc4680d32b6f"
msgid "Of course I am. As if there was any doubt."
msgstr "당연히 무사하지. 안 그럴 리가 없잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = b7fff46a-01d5-33e2-c58b-feca25a427ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_AlfiraTale_HasMet_Upset(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:b7fff46a-01d5-33e2-c58b-feca25a427ea
msgctxt "h61232235ge3e3g4798ga289gdb16efd65722"
msgid "<i>Go away.</i>"
msgstr "<i>저리 가.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = bb753591-8251-5a26-7905-114ddac7110d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:bb753591-8251-5a26-7905-114ddac7110d
msgctxt "hb412b959gfcd2g4146g8270g026a1657bb6f"
msgid ""
"Yes. He shielded me and the kids while his brother and sister rushed the "
"cultists."
msgstr "네. 그의 형제자매가 추종자들에게 달려드는 동안 롤란이 저와 아이들을 보호해 줬어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = bbea9619-c552-4317-92ef-d964808a1a1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:bbea9619-c552-4317-92ef-d964808a1a1e
msgctxt "h931b016fg4aa8g4a66gbd25g8170a9ca8375"
msgid "You're truly unpleasant sometimes, you know? Don't know why I bother."
msgstr "당신, 가끔씩 정말 불쾌한 거 알아요? 제가 왜 귀찮게 하는지도 모르겠네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = c17f5e5a-18fc-5b32-1d25-4c48745d35f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:c17f5e5a-18fc-5b32-1d25-4c48745d35f0
msgctxt "h81b7ee0cg2d77g46a9g86d3gf3216bbdba00"
msgid "All I could do was run."
msgstr "제가 할 수 있는 건 도망치는 것밖에 없었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4de5afe-49ed-0720-bc5f-c617504416bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:c4de5afe-49ed-0720-bc5f-c617504416bd
msgctxt "h60a000a7g7507g488ag9515gf9e970b9da3d"
msgid ""
"It helps to remember what is at stake - I fight for nature, for balance. I "
"fight for life itself."
msgstr "무엇이 위태로운지 잊지 않는 게 도움이 돼 - 난 자연을 위해, 균형을 위해 싸워. 생명 그 자체를 위해 싸우지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = c82f944a-fd17-1278-5dbd-df1a4ce7041f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Alfira_NightsongFreed_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:c82f944a-fd17-1278-5dbd-df1a4ce7041f
msgctxt "hffc64be8g4868g4d01gabc6g499a796ec0dc"
msgid ""
"With all this darkness, I'd forgotten what light, true blazing light, felt "
"like. Thank you - we needed a bit of hope."
msgstr "이 캄캄한 어둠 속에서, 진정한 빛이 무엇이고 어떤 느낌인지 잊었던 거 같아요. 고마워요. 희망이 정말 필요했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = c9159db4-c724-a314-6779-57302704d152
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:c9159db4-c724-a314-6779-57302704d152
msgctxt "h91badb77g195bg41f9g9386g96948bc2eca3"
msgid "They took his eyes first. Then his tongue."
msgstr "그의 눈을 도려냈어요. 그러고는 혀를 뽑았고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c939e260-e748-d631-de38-e3c694b93520
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:c939e260-e748-d631-de38-e3c694b93520
msgctxt "h1eda4ca6gfda0g4ac6g97bbga39ea11044a9"
msgid "Just focus on getting through this."
msgstr "이 상황을 헤쳐 나가는 데 집중해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = c9e5cd3e-1c82-235f-7f0f-138e5a2e5b21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:c9e5cd3e-1c82-235f-7f0f-138e5a2e5b21
msgctxt "h895108dfg0e74g49efgb309g3c5cfac191f6"
msgid "Easier said than done."
msgstr "말하기는 쉽죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = d04fccd9-3b97-0727-ab70-24e454e79861
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:d04fccd9-3b97-0727-ab70-24e454e79861
msgctxt "hcd365576geea8g434agb8b5g40f2a08fc5b3"
msgid "I don't know. It just... happened so quickly."
msgstr "모르겠어요. 너무... 순식간이었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d07ff023-8afd-4319-5273-922b4181f085
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:d07ff023-8afd-4319-5273-922b4181f085
msgctxt "hd1cb1fddg1629g43bagb710g0655b3064d42"
msgid "How about you? How are you holding up?"
msgstr "넌 어때? 잘 견디고 있는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0cd5905-0892-039c-a608-b2989a8617de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_AlfiraPostRescue(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_ReturnCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:d0cd5905-0892-039c-a608-b2989a8617de
msgctxt "h005d4ce6g5e30g4435gb52ag4749250179ed"
msgid "I'm sorry, but the others? They didn't make it."
msgstr "미안해. 다른 사람들은 살아남지 못했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = d129a6c3-dc40-1cec-7244-3ac6f889a223
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_AllTieflingsReturned = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_AlfiraPostRescue(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:d129a6c3-dc40-1cec-7244-3ac6f889a223
msgctxt "h2b0f3d02gfc8ag474fg88b2g61a7c38c8065"
msgid "You actually did it - you rescued them from Moonrise. <i>How?</i>"
msgstr "정말 해내셨군요. 당신이 문라이즈에서 그들을 구해냈어요. <i>어떻게?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = d621d43c-8652-116a-2ecb-bee60e22603a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_Prodigy_State_Staying = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_AlfiraTale_Knows_SavedByRolan = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:d621d43c-8652-116a-2ecb-bee60e22603a
msgctxt "he134fe84gcd49g4371gac3cg41f4eb1b4f0a"
msgid "Rolan, of all people, saved us."
msgstr "그 모든 이들 중에, 롤란이 저희를 지켜줬어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = dd9bffe0-7a89-1c89-6e37-2f8b6e0545a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:dd9bffe0-7a89-1c89-6e37-2f8b6e0545a0
msgctxt "hb0b3b392gefefg4ae5g8f1bg1dac51f1d28d"
msgid "I'm afraid doubt is all I know these days."
msgstr "요즘엔 뭐든 염려부터 하게 되는 거 같아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = df2d0110-52e2-2d65-2833-fb9435f69601
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:df2d0110-52e2-2d65-2833-fb9435f69601
msgctxt "h568fdcefg07b9g4465gbce7g11410ec2aca1"
msgid "Killing everyone who got in my way."
msgstr "앞을 가로막는 모든 것들을 죽여서지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = e4128a61-3dd6-f34d-3780-bbe9805f89c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:e4128a61-3dd6-f34d-3780-bbe9805f89c6
msgctxt "ha42841ddgb55bg4c75g9353g5682ed638b97"
msgid "How do you do it? How do you keep going?"
msgstr "어떻게 계속 나아가실 수 있는 거죠? 어떻게 하는 거예요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eacf16f8-9613-4678-d3ed-4ac62523d96d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:eacf16f8-9613-4678-d3ed-4ac62523d96d
msgctxt "hef932deegf73eg46d7gb5f8g4861488df1e0"
msgid "By doing what I do best - being a hero."
msgstr "내가 제일 잘하는 걸 했지. 영웅이 되는 거 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = ef5ea6bc-05f6-7649-f5e6-6cdfccd69216
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:ef5ea6bc-05f6-7649-f5e6-6cdfccd69216
msgctxt "h53cb9026gd03bg4e1eg9e86g27f82cb15d49"
msgid "I still can't believe it. The cultists. The screams..."
msgstr "아직도 믿기지 않아요. 광신도들. 비명 소리..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2172f63-2e52-a94e-a198-c1dff3c6effa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:f2172f63-2e52-a94e-a198-c1dff3c6effa
msgctxt "h2015b8bcg33bdg468fgabc7g2cb9b7d594af"
msgid ""
"To linger in the past is to condemn our future. Focus on the here and now."
msgstr "과거에 매달리는 건 미래를 망치는 길이지. 지금 이 순간에 충실해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4944b48-b973-94ed-6c9f-ebce64af23eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:f4944b48-b973-94ed-6c9f-ebce64af23eb
msgctxt "h9c2ea762gc7ebg4e7dg9fa7g53d0c83b4fb6"
msgid "A strong weapon-arm and a bit of luck. That's all you need."
msgstr "무기를 휘두르는 강한 팔과 약간의 운이면 충분해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = f52c311b-de64-5256-77de-287ca360cdd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_AlfiraPostRescue(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_TieflingsReturned = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:f52c311b-de64-5256-77de-287ca360cdd2
msgctxt "h98d8f0ccg34b5g4ab8g8cafg281a0c4ae397"
msgid "I'm glad it was you who walked through that door. Thank you."
msgstr "문을 열고 들어온 게 당신이라 다행이네요. 고마워요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9ebb96a-4be3-c134-28d2-26e350c28c9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:f9ebb96a-4be3-c134-28d2-26e350c28c9e
msgctxt "hb5f26511g5f48g4392gbd76g4555a3dfc6d2"
msgid ""
"I cannot help - I have far greater evils to conquer. But your friends have "
"survived worse - I am sure they will be fine."
msgstr "난 도울 수 없어 - 더 큰 악을 물리쳐야 하거든. 네 친구들은 더한 것에서도 살아남았으니 - 분명 괜찮을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc381f0b-6d98-6a27-256e-e43120460870
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:fc381f0b-6d98-6a27-256e-e43120460870
msgctxt "hf402cf66g32e3g4e5fga98cgddcc54922f26"
msgid "Just take it one step at a time."
msgstr "한 번에 한 걸음씩 나아가면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fde669cf-169f-ccdf-d7e9-b0c4b26da980
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6aeab4b9-0f6e-b812-37dc-68db60f8170d_AsharakHook = False
#.      - 6aeab4b9-0f6e-b812-37dc-68db60f8170d_IkaronHook = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_Bard:fde669cf-169f-ccdf-d7e9-b0c4b26da980
msgctxt "h7b12e860ge7f2g4035ga8f7g65bf8bb33203"
msgid "Which one was Ikaron again?"
msgstr "이카론이 누구였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 0de18c69-f271-975a-31d0-9cdcafa583d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:0de18c69-f271-975a-31d0-9cdcafa583d0
msgctxt "h85e683cdg575eg418cg98feg4cf0d2c6f392"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry it came to that. But if it was you or them, I'd pick you every "
"time."
msgstr "그렇게 돼서 정말 유감이에요. 하지만 당신이나 그들 중에 고르라면, 전 항상 당신을 택할 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 17067518-b5dd-43a4-8e79-9a5efbd447d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_AlfiraTale_State_ReunionDone = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_AlfiraPostRescue(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:17067518-b5dd-43a4-8e79-9a5efbd447d6
msgctxt "h2f2360fbg179cg4d43g9f77g053db707f7b1"
msgid "You're here. You're all right - <i>how?</i>"
msgstr "오셨군요. 무사하시네요. <i>어떻게?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 1a674cb8-0740-0bdd-abfd-9691cb0393c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:1a674cb8-0740-0bdd-abfd-9691cb0393c0
msgctxt "h50439fb2g0888g4e66gb137gee722a9f7d21"
msgid "In ballads they'd call you 'talented' and 'courageous'."
msgstr "발라드에선 당신 같은 사람을 '재능' 있고 '용감'하다고 하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 28c49097-4884-3c36-b299-b3c2224e4fa0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DRUID or RANGER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:28c49097-4884-3c36-b299-b3c2224e4fa0
msgctxt "hb695293bg1899g4b4bg8085gd71a5ff76542"
msgid "With the help of nature's resilience, cunning and fury."
msgstr "자연의 회복력, 교활함, 분노가 도와준 덕분이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34c54cbe-e466-892d-28fb-dd0c62f1093e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:34c54cbe-e466-892d-28fb-dd0c62f1093e
msgctxt "h6ce51cddg31c4g48f3g9abage163e5b216b8"
msgid "I was in Moonrise and I just happened to run into her."
msgstr "문라이즈에 있었을 때 우연히 마주쳤지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 4c3f2cfd-d1e2-34e2-41e2-638a6b004d04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:4c3f2cfd-d1e2-34e2-41e2-638a6b004d04
msgctxt "h2a270c7dg1c73g4d74gb268g89c545e8be18"
msgid "She's done half the Harpers' job for them already."
msgstr "벌써 하퍼즈의 일 절반은 해준 셈인 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 4c3f2cfd-d1e2-34e2-41e2-638a6b004d04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:4c3f2cfd-d1e2-34e2-41e2-638a6b004d04
msgctxt "h227c147bg3487g4c0dg9e93g3a9ae8b1794c"
msgid "He's done half the Harpers' job for them already."
msgstr "벌써 하퍼즈의 일 절반은 해준 셈인 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 4c3f2cfd-d1e2-34e2-41e2-638a6b004d04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:4c3f2cfd-d1e2-34e2-41e2-638a6b004d04
msgctxt "hc4418033gf375g4f58gb33fgc1ec046f91b5"
msgid "They've done half the Harpers' job for them already."
msgstr "벌써 하퍼즈의 일 절반은 해준 셈인 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e9a1714-3afc-cae0-5206-a231921e2c59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:4e9a1714-3afc-cae0-5206-a231921e2c59
msgctxt "h0c525769g0d0fg4fbdg9541ga398c4413b99"
msgid "I'd tell you, but that would spoil the song I'm writing about it."
msgstr "말해주고 싶은데, 그러면 내가 쓰고 있는 노래에 흥미가 깨질 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 4ec601d5-06ee-b039-e804-3db68f662477
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:4ec601d5-06ee-b039-e804-3db68f662477
msgctxt "h2dbd7e1agf7edg4e23gac45gb8a3d46cd28b"
msgid "You forgot 'incredibly good-looking'."
msgstr "'엄청나게 잘생긴'은 까먹었나 보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 6d890aa9-c84d-ef3b-44b0-a83a746573b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:6d890aa9-c84d-ef3b-44b0-a83a746573b9
msgctxt "h7a2d1177g6bc5g4a70ga2d2g66aaed288411"
msgid ""
"The druids back in the grove could have learned a thing or two from you."
msgstr "에메랄드 숲 드루이드들도 당신한테서 한두 가지 정도는 배울 수 있었을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 836cccf7-1d55-1ea9-2100-af7bcc4ed36b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_AlfiraTale_State_ReunionDone = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:836cccf7-1d55-1ea9-2100-af7bcc4ed36b
msgctxt "hab70b357gb9c3g40b5g8796gf2153bef3442"
msgid "I never thought I'd see... well, anyone, again."
msgstr "다시는... 누구도 만나지 못할 거라고 생각했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = 8d93702b-2d60-3030-6fb4-b62515e70302
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:8d93702b-2d60-3030-6fb4-b62515e70302
msgctxt "h24b290b0g59b9g417eg8dc3g7bc9aa0f6ea4"
msgid "<i>Lakrissa.</i>"
msgstr "<i>라크리사.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = 95d99002-733b-53a2-a13b-4e82dc88851c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:95d99002-733b-53a2-a13b-4e82dc88851c
msgctxt "h700655dbg985fg41d2ga8edg219ae35d4924"
msgid "Fingers-crossed I'll hear it some day."
msgstr "잘 되길 바랄게. 언젠가 꼭 들을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a39292c4-18b5-70db-1a90-cdefb2964973
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:a39292c4-18b5-70db-1a90-cdefb2964973
msgctxt "h78816e6cg75e7g4997g8412gcf0f0261df30"
msgid "Tactics, planning and, when needed, brute force."
msgstr "전술, 계획, 필요하다면 무차별적인 폭력으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = a63310ab-5d03-e8f5-0cb9-97ab4ebfed3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:a63310ab-5d03-e8f5-0cb9-97ab4ebfed3b
msgctxt "hcad48126g2f8dg4b19g998eg7712f17c98dd"
msgid ""
"You should have seen her. She was brave but also terrifying - in a good way."
msgstr "네가 봤어야 했는데. 용맹했지만 동시에 무시무시했어 - 좋은 쪽으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = a63310ab-5d03-e8f5-0cb9-97ab4ebfed3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:a63310ab-5d03-e8f5-0cb9-97ab4ebfed3b
msgctxt "hec36e541gc19eg4885g930egd8d82a324960"
msgid ""
"You should have seen him. He was brave but also terrifying - in a good way."
msgstr "네가 봤어야 했는데. 용맹했지만 동시에 무시무시했어 - 좋은 쪽으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = a63310ab-5d03-e8f5-0cb9-97ab4ebfed3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:a63310ab-5d03-e8f5-0cb9-97ab4ebfed3b
msgctxt "h37439bcbgc7ecg4206ga98dg016eafa4bc1d"
msgid ""
"You should have seen them. They were brave but also terrifying - in a good "
"way."
msgstr "네가 봤어야 했는데. 용맹했지만 동시에 무시무시했어 - 좋은 쪽으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = af2bd668-be29-5ff3-7e48-21a711419fed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:af2bd668-be29-5ff3-7e48-21a711419fed
msgctxt "h5ddbf354gbeeeg42cega87dg2bc89c73203d"
msgid "How did you do it?"
msgstr "어떻게 한 거예요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2afc6b4-067e-e07b-ba82-30050b1e6069
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:b2afc6b4-067e-e07b-ba82-30050b1e6069
msgctxt "h3359aedbgdd34g4f62g8b90gf6e2aa5ab1dd"
msgid "If it got in my way I killed it."
msgstr "앞을 가로 막는 건 다 죽여버렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = b810cac4-d63b-d9f3-6124-4a77fa3f8a73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:b810cac4-d63b-d9f3-6124-4a77fa3f8a73
msgctxt "ha9f21020g4e4ag40a8g9f23g863d13961af0"
msgid "Well, they're not the ones standing here, are they?"
msgstr "글쎄요, 그분들이 여기 있는 건 아니잖아요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bbdc40ee-da22-b94c-a361-3f8902042953
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:bbdc40ee-da22-b94c-a361-3f8902042953
msgctxt "h2a4d4786g3301g42fag9594g3a227f38b54e"
msgid "Killing everyone who got in my way."
msgstr "앞을 가로막는 모든 것들을 죽여서지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = bf3cd44b-cf39-4f67-1de5-d023888e4a4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingBard_State_ConvincedToQuit = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:bf3cd44b-cf39-4f67-1de5-d023888e4a4a
msgctxt "h9d048646g6a59g49ddgb348g430d61125c85"
msgid ""
"We're 'two tiefling queens', remember? I couldn't leave my favourite bard "
"without her partner in crime."
msgstr "우린 '두 티플링 여왕들'이라구. 내가 제일 좋아하는 바드가 동반자도 없는데 어떻게 떠나겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = bf765f67-ac07-60e9-81f6-1db2b8346cd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:bf765f67-ac07-60e9-81f6-1db2b8346cd2
msgctxt "hb7eeb7aag3806g4290gab0ag93d44a18716e"
msgid "Don't play coy - you could have left us behind but you didn't."
msgstr "수줍어하지 마 - 그냥 두고 올 수도 있었는데 그러지 않았잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = cb122cee-e1e7-2b09-e266-271e3067e832
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:cb122cee-e1e7-2b09-e266-271e3067e832
msgctxt "h28be105cgf45eg4ba7g945fgedb68fe107e1"
msgid "I did have some help from an old friend though."
msgstr "절친에게 약간의 도움을 받기는 했지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = d79f13db-04ac-90df-b3cd-37d4345100e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:d79f13db-04ac-90df-b3cd-37d4345100e8
msgctxt "h01c76571ge66cg4492gb910g9f6c0ab720ac"
msgid ""
"Thank you - a thousand times, thank you. One last favour? Take this off my "
"hands - it suits you better."
msgstr "고마워. 천 번이고 만 번이고 고마워. 마지막으로 부탁 하나만 들어줄래? 이걸 가져가 줘. 너한테 더 어울리는 것 같으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e2902d3c-9b83-87f3-23f8-0b3ffc69780f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:e2902d3c-9b83-87f3-23f8-0b3ffc69780f
msgctxt "hfaedda45gffcbg46cag9bdcgc6d315cd3a2c"
msgid "Honestly? Sheer dumb luck."
msgstr "솔직히? 순전히 뜻밖의 행운이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea448730-75e0-dc5c-7ac0-f1cb76dc50dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:ea448730-75e0-dc5c-7ac0-f1cb76dc50dd
msgctxt "h9abf1708g4a3cg4b6cgadfbg9e41a0d8901d"
msgid "I'm a rogue - breaking and entering is kind of my thing."
msgstr "난 로그라고. 무단침입은 내 전문이라고나 할까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = f1acf188-9ca0-f22b-3a40-ae9c23b1e591
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:f1acf188-9ca0-f22b-3a40-ae9c23b1e591
msgctxt "he9715b35g0343g41e1g9fe4g029396066296"
msgid ""
"If it was anyone else, I'd be sceptical - but you? You've more than earned "
"the title."
msgstr "다른 사람이었다면, 의심했을 텐데 - 하지만 당신이라면? 영웅 그 이상이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = f5e7cdf9-9c45-7aab-e79c-4eb09a109ef7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:f5e7cdf9-9c45-7aab-e79c-4eb09a109ef7
msgctxt "h8cc2eb80g9ec8g49a3g866cgba2937ab08d5"
msgid "Of course. How could I leave my sidekick without her partner in crime?"
msgstr "물론이지. 동반자도 없는 내 들러리를 어떻게 떠나겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f7851831-0949-a3d4-2bfe-ec9a6c2b83d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC or PALADIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:f7851831-0949-a3d4-2bfe-ec9a6c2b83d0
msgctxt "h20c351fegfcffg4cb6g9a13g4449f5206fc5"
msgid "Don't thank me; I had help from a higher power."
msgstr "나에게 고마워 하지 마; 신께서 도움을 주신 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Lakrissa
#. NodeID = fa82cb49-a8b2-8e02-5221-a7ddace9f489
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:fa82cb49-a8b2-8e02-5221-a7ddace9f489
msgctxt "h95da3ca7gec8ag4299gbff1g9903980a5c55"
msgid "What? It's true."
msgstr "왜? 사실이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa902009-1161-fdfc-72d6-814b104a4b6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:fa902009-1161-fdfc-72d6-814b104a4b6a
msgctxt "h898995deg6037g42f6g95f7ga956c24c87da"
msgid "By doing what I do best - being a hero."
msgstr "내가 제일 잘하는 걸 했지. 영웅이 되는 거 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty
#. Speaker = Alfira
#. NodeID = ff1119bc-0a9d-f206-e730-72b9e59785f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_AlfiraTale_ReunionWithFlirty:ff1119bc-0a9d-f206-e730-72b9e59785f2
msgctxt "h17ec51e5gf1a2g44d6g8cf6gfdd38c7d3cc8"
msgid "Then I'm glad you're on our side."
msgstr "그렇다면 당신이 우리 편이라 다행이네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 008c1948-3d93-a383-7563-5af465eb90c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_ProdigyLament_State_ToldStory = True
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_ZevlorWasLeader = True
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:008c1948-3d93-a383-7563-5af465eb90c2
msgctxt "he2197ae3g40e9g41bbg9fb3g1740a26a2884"
msgid "I don't see Zevlor. Don't tell me he's missing aswell?"
msgstr "제블로어가 안 보이네. 그도 실종된 건 아니겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 026ed0ae-af49-f0f5-f20a-79b8a8bd3e67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_ProdigyLament_State_ToldStory = False
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:026ed0ae-af49-f0f5-f20a-79b8a8bd3e67
msgctxt "h6aecb573gb91bg4d4agaca0g5b240202fb00"
msgid "I heard you were ambushed by the cult. It sounded brutal."
msgstr "교단에게 매복 당했다고 들었어, 끔찍했겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 03e30d4a-61f7-ba7f-eed9-a890dd180bf8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:03e30d4a-61f7-ba7f-eed9-a890dd180bf8
msgctxt "h4f7d60dbgb19cg4d57g8e39g0beb67ba3489"
msgid ""
"Aye, I did. Maybe you'd have been the one to save us all, if you'd been "
"there."
msgstr "맞아. 그랬지. 만약 당신이 거기 있었다면 우리 모두 구해줄 수 있었을지도 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04fa325c-28d2-37f0-9750-15b94a41c1d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:04fa325c-28d2-37f0-9750-15b94a41c1d5
msgctxt "h46d0ebe8g25fbg404fg95baga10294734649"
msgid ""
"Your life is your own - you owe these people nothing. You were right to run."
msgstr "네 목숨은 네가 챙겨야지, 이 사람들에게 빚진 것도 없잖아. 잘 도망친거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08d8cc31-b497-52f1-f148-4be6ef49988e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_ProdigyLament_State_ToldStory = True
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:08d8cc31-b497-52f1-f148-4be6ef49988e
msgctxt "h11bb98c3ge1d9g49b1gbe38g813a52501bc3"
msgid "I heard you were ambushed by the cult. It sounded brutal."
msgstr "교단에게 매복 당했다고 들었어, 끔찍했겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 0db25430-5c01-d94b-8fb1-3167019d3166
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:0db25430-5c01-d94b-8fb1-3167019d3166
msgctxt "h6afab300g6bb7g4867ga2d8gba2a1b6c4f48"
msgid "Heroism is no comfort to the dead."
msgstr "영웅심은 죽은 자에게는 아무런 위안도 안돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 0f4cb49d-8c1a-dbb1-ac76-6b33e5753cf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:0f4cb49d-8c1a-dbb1-ac76-6b33e5753cf5
msgctxt "h20f6440ag0ac7g439dgacc2g4c08fb456466"
msgid ""
"I owe you an apology. You pulled my people from one death-trap, only for me "
"to land them in another."
msgstr "당신에게 사과 해야만 할 게 있어. 그 쪽이 우리 사람들을 사지에서 구해줬는데도 내가 다시 밀어 넣고 말았거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 145a1cdb-d163-2d6a-f123-e8ffffca9c92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:145a1cdb-d163-2d6a-f123-e8ffffca9c92
msgctxt "hd4ecf3d2gad6eg42cag9ae7g7b9213f1b557"
msgid "You didn't stand your ground? You deserted your allies? Disgraceful."
msgstr "자리를 유지 하지 않고 동료들을 저버렸다니, 수치스럽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 145f3b7a-e72f-2170-af64-819cf368cbdc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_ReturnCompleted = True
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_AllTieflingsReturned = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_CerysPostRescue(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:145f3b7a-e72f-2170-af64-819cf368cbdc
msgctxt "h8d0b10fbgee8fg466dgb879g2df5efc0b361"
msgid ""
"We're bruised, battered... but we're together again. You damn well brought "
"them <i>back.</i>"
msgstr "우리는 멍들고, 박살났지만... 다시 함께 모였어. 정말 멋지게 <i>구해줬어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 17f7e55c-8fe1-9d72-83c4-531dd958b7f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_ZevlorWasLeader = False
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_AsharakWasLeader = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_BackupLeader_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:17f7e55c-8fe1-9d72-83c4-531dd958b7f4
msgctxt "h6d1810b4g3263g4fc4g99bcg3f62d99440da"
msgid ""
"I promised you a drink the next time we met. This inn isn't what I had in "
"mind."
msgstr "다음에 보면 한잔 사기로 약속했었지만, 이런 여관을 생각한 건 아닌데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21f2cd60-0182-cd52-8d20-4a368f35597f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:21f2cd60-0182-cd52-8d20-4a368f35597f
msgctxt "h0fe1f7d7gb2a0g4cacg8d89g6cffe02a48a5"
msgid "I prefer setting traps over walking into them - what happened?"
msgstr "난 함정에 빠지기 보다는 만드는 쪽인데, 무슨 일이 있었던 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 23e1d085-4f3e-9cfc-cac8-4ab72581e5a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:23e1d085-4f3e-9cfc-cac8-4ab72581e5a9
msgctxt "h2f1174ebgc512g4396g8f2cg0e14bf91b603"
msgid "Still, you're here. Better than being a prisoner of the Absolute."
msgstr "그래도 넌 여기 있잖아. 절대자의 죄수가 되는 것보다는 낫지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 254cc36a-5f7a-51b1-c7c9-a298c298c073
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_BackupLeader_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:254cc36a-5f7a-51b1-c7c9-a298c298c073
msgctxt "h95ecb73dgfc86g4003g92fage5eb38c5764d"
msgid "Thought you'd be ten yards tall, the way my people speak of you."
msgstr "사람들 말만 들었을 땐, 키가 10미터는 될 줄 알았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3061cda9-e9fb-3d85-b184-41b12c069cf8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_ProdigyLament_State_ToldStory = False
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_ZevlorWasLeader = True
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:3061cda9-e9fb-3d85-b184-41b12c069cf8
msgctxt "h081e525dg7bbdg47a2g9a6cgff00899e9ceb"
msgid "I don't see Zevlor. Don't tell me he's missing aswell?"
msgstr "제블로어가 안보이는데, 그 사람도 실종된 건 아니겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 324c61fb-e673-d72f-30e2-acf5033cdf9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:324c61fb-e673-d72f-30e2-acf5033cdf9f
msgctxt "hfc5de3cdg60d2g4272g89f5g09f1315eee0a"
msgid ""
"Aye - brutal is putting it lightly. Maybe we should have just surrendered, "
"but..."
msgstr "끔찍함 이상이지, 어쩌면 그냥 항복해야 했을지도 몰라. 그런데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 342d0a51-052b-69d3-6820-3e3b5aae4198
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:342d0a51-052b-69d3-6820-3e3b5aae4198
msgctxt "h8fdd44c2g0b59g42c6g848cg61071a5ca242"
msgid ""
"You let your fear conquer you. Be careful not to let your life be ruled by "
"it."
msgstr "공포가 스스로를 사로잡게 두었군. 그게 네 삶을 좌지우지 하지 않게 조심 하도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c3e24f4-2c78-dc36-378b-4f5f08b0c9bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:3c3e24f4-2c78-dc36-378b-4f5f08b0c9bd
msgctxt "hd001022bga9e3g4790g9fa4g17ec9933cc45"
msgid "Don't lose hope. The others might still be alive."
msgstr "희망을 잃지 마. 다른 사람들이 아직 살아있을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3cda13ac-e696-c5fc-0520-126d7b4355bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:3cda13ac-e696-c5fc-0520-126d7b4355bd
msgctxt "h2b3df469gff74g4bbfg80b8g7140525637c9"
msgid "Do you think the cult planned this? Or was it a surprise attack?"
msgstr "교단이 이걸 미리 계획해두고 있었을까? 아니면 그저 우발적인 공격인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 40c6596d-78c4-7906-fc29-3add987148f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:40c6596d-78c4-7906-fc29-3add987148f9
msgctxt "hfad4c189g3b75g4db0g9179gbc5e4fc586f5"
msgid ""
"I thought we might pass unnoticed along the fringes of this place. Escape "
"the owlbear by hiding in its shadow, so to speak."
msgstr ""
"여기 변두리를 따라간다면 걸리지 않고 지나갈 수 있을 것 같았어. 말하자면, 아울베어 그림자에 숨어 아울베어에게 도망치기라는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 41e1527a-ecd9-9e4b-c936-e9c00c22dd64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:41e1527a-ecd9-9e4b-c936-e9c00c22dd64
msgctxt "hd92e3554g88f8g43ebga2c7g10e8dd467f20"
msgid "You can see exactly how well that went."
msgstr "결과는 보는 바와 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 44f4f72a-e597-e165-a052-de716cfd445b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:44f4f72a-e597-e165-a052-de716cfd445b
msgctxt "h28ede578g5d85g4c82ga6ffg062de43aac55"
msgid ""
"I was trying to scout a path for us while you got busy carving one. But "
"don't worry, I've had my fill of fighting since."
msgstr "네가 칼싸움 바쁠 때 난 정찰 중이었어. 걱정하지 말라고. 그 이후로 싸움은 진절머리 나게 했으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45b88072-a8df-89b4-4b84-73ebeee52bba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:45b88072-a8df-89b4-4b84-73ebeee52bba
msgctxt "h67770b62g4b23g42eag9f45g062bb04a05d4"
msgid "So you managed to miss all that trouble at the grove. Convenient."
msgstr "숲에서 있었던 일을 모두 놓치셨다는 거로군, 편하셨겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a3ea550-5af7-3087-06e5-cabc5d0ab0e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:4a3ea550-5af7-3087-06e5-cabc5d0ab0e8
msgctxt "hfa195cc1g7debg4f5ag895fg690f0f2c1497"
msgid "The inn is old, but 'death-trap' is a <i>bit </i>much."
msgstr "여관이 낡기는 했는데, '사지'라고 하는 건 좀 심하지 않나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c028bf4-8aea-bd51-0f91-c32427ba0d72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:4c028bf4-8aea-bd51-0f91-c32427ba0d72
msgctxt "h514a70cag033bg4439g8b58g37b628aa0920"
msgid "What the hells happened? Where is everyone?"
msgstr "도대체 어떻게 된 거야? 다들 어디 간 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 500cd35b-82fe-1a22-3c0c-4dc39731e6f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:500cd35b-82fe-1a22-3c0c-4dc39731e6f5
msgctxt "h35fc7752g32abg41cfg8f55gf8e0a615d7d3"
msgid "Sounds like you made a right mess of things."
msgstr "일을 제대로 조져놓은 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 50ad2852-7c14-3475-bcb8-9e8a8118d98e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_ProdigyLament_State_ToldStory = True
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_ZevlorWasLeader = True
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:50ad2852-7c14-3475-bcb8-9e8a8118d98e
msgctxt "hcd20d5d7g8ba6g43acgaf3bgddc4e6623f83"
msgid "I don't see Zevlor. Don't tell me he's missing aswell?"
msgstr "제블로어가 안보이는데, 그 사람도 실종된 건 아니겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 52f74817-97f1-4f62-abe3-cbe6675c9b1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_ZevlorWasLeader = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_BackupLeader_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:52f74817-97f1-4f62-abe3-cbe6675c9b1f
msgctxt "h76e2b086gb654g4becg979ag752b7d839943"
msgid "Thought you'd be ten yards tall, the way Zevlor spoke of you."
msgstr "제블로어 말만 들었을 땐, 키가 10미터는 될 줄 알았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 56b287d0-b53f-434e-23d8-e8ea1e834fb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:56b287d0-b53f-434e-23d8-e8ea1e834fb3
msgctxt "hf6dcacd8g80b2g4ac4g88e2g6a1989e16b9b"
msgid ""
"Glad you've kept your humour. The others could use it - what's left of us."
msgstr "유머 감각이 남아있어서 다행이군. 남은 사람들에게도 필요하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5a34b1fa-a2a3-9e1d-1c60-9630bf4e546d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:5a34b1fa-a2a3-9e1d-1c60-9630bf4e546d
msgctxt "hdcd7259eg8a7dg4644gb87agddfd6a0bf92a"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 5d222ed9-f183-6a67-6791-2dca412be99b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_ZevlorWasLeader = False
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_ReturnCompleted = True
#.      - MOO_Jailbreak_State_AllPrisonersDied = True
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_TieflingsReturned = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_CerysPostRescue(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:5d222ed9-f183-6a67-6791-2dca412be99b
msgctxt "h0ad24db6g9650g406eg9df5g3a283ef78d44"
msgid ""
"Seems not everyone made it out of that tower. But it'd be none at all with "
"you - thank you. Truly."
msgstr "문라이즈에서 모두가 살아서 돌아오진 않은 거 같네. 하지만 너였기에 이 정도도 가능했던 거야 - 고마워. 진심이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 5d771ce7-d499-1a2f-9ba3-445b48b60572
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:5d771ce7-d499-1a2f-9ba3-445b48b60572
msgctxt "h64839fd8g3fa4g4305g9e9eg333c19b51ebf"
msgid "...That's that, then."
msgstr "...그렇군, 그럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 5f5af26f-e1f4-6f2a-affe-b35d71dd9979
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_ZevlorWasLeader = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#.     - COL_FindZevlor_Knows_MissingHav = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:5f5af26f-e1f4-6f2a-affe-b35d71dd9979
msgctxt "h04bb5e1ag1d18g4f54gbaebgb02f7a30073e"
msgid ""
"We were ambushed out in the cursed lands - cultists of this Absolute. Zevlor "
"froze, begged us to surrender, but..."
msgstr "이 저주 받은 땅에서 절대자의 추종자들에게 기습을 당했어. 제블로어는 얼어붙어서 우리에게 항복하자고 빌었지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 6160a24a-6955-db94-0f28-11fcad1e80f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_ZevlorWasLeader = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:6160a24a-6955-db94-0f28-11fcad1e80f2
msgctxt "h4fca1f7eg8e83g4a29g8816g8ba72175ec73"
msgid ""
"Zevlor had hope. It didn't save him. A little sense will serve us better, I "
"think."
msgstr "제블로어도 희망을 가졌어. 하지만 그게 그를 구하진 못했지. 차라리 본능을 믿는 게 더 도움이 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 67966389-dde7-dc15-10e2-38be15293891
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Absolute_Knows_MoonriseTowers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:67966389-dde7-dc15-10e2-38be15293891
msgctxt "h06a721fcg7708g4738ga1b5g45406b4dfaf3"
msgid ""
"This army of the Absolute is growing, and flowing towards Moonrise. There's "
"worse than goblins on the roads now."
msgstr "절대자의 군대가 몸집을 키워가며 문라이즈로 향하고 있어. 지금 길은 고블린 때보다 더해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 6d06d3c6-ed4c-31ac-3e64-d4d1f6dc1e98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:6d06d3c6-ed4c-31ac-3e64-d4d1f6dc1e98
msgctxt "h01104a2bg4f3fg4715gb7e9g0bce91f5a7ee"
msgid ""
"We were bound for Baldur's Gate, and what's left of us is damn well getting "
"there."
msgstr "우리는 발더스 게이트로 향할 거고, 이제는 그곳에 반드시 도착하는 거뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 700414e5-98ba-7aaf-c945-1fb59bd5ddbf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:700414e5-98ba-7aaf-c945-1fb59bd5ddbf
msgctxt "h5e327f71g7a28g40adgaca7ga51baef96338"
msgid "Or maybe you'd be missing along with the rest."
msgstr "다른 사람들처럼 실종 됐을지도 모르고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77e063a5-5606-c6dd-7f27-0ad863767efa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EVIL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:77e063a5-5606-c6dd-7f27-0ad863767efa
msgctxt "h69f405d2g00c1g494bg9421g98772fc03e0b"
msgid "They are gone, you have been spared. Do not squander the gods' grace."
msgstr "신의 자비를 낭비 하지는 마, 그 자들은 죽고 넌 살아 남았으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77e063a5-5606-c6dd-7f27-0ad863767efa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_NEUTRAL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:77e063a5-5606-c6dd-7f27-0ad863767efa
msgctxt "h51155d29gc57bg4983gaec4g08b1ae10e998"
msgid ""
"Cultists, curse - it matters not. The past is done. Focus on moving forward."
msgstr "교단과 저주, 그건 중요치 않아. 과거는 지나갔으니, 이제 나아가는 것에 집중 하도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77e063a5-5606-c6dd-7f27-0ad863767efa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GOOD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:77e063a5-5606-c6dd-7f27-0ad863767efa
msgctxt "heaa96030g48b3g40fcg8112g185149341625"
msgid "To despair is fruitless. To hope is divine - do <i>not</i> give up."
msgstr "절망에는 결실이 없지만 희망은 신성하지. <b>절대</b> 포기하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 7ee462c1-eee3-0b6e-91a3-e0bcfe4dcba9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_FindZevlor_Knows_MissingHav = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:7ee462c1-eee3-0b6e-91a3-e0bcfe4dcba9
msgctxt "h3d073fa7g3507g4724g9de3gbc198f6f908a"
msgid "I almost hope he never found out why."
msgstr "제블로어가 그 이유를 모르기만을 바랄 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 83cf181e-dbb1-6c63-966a-2c07b6888928
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EVIL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:83cf181e-dbb1-6c63-966a-2c07b6888928
msgctxt "hd650cf23ga687g401egbdaeg514c97b080de"
msgid "What exactly have I left to squander?"
msgstr "나한테 낭비할 게 뭐가 있다고 대체?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 83cf181e-dbb1-6c63-966a-2c07b6888928
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_NEUTRAL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:83cf181e-dbb1-6c63-966a-2c07b6888928
msgctxt "h7f233ea2ga8beg4043g90d9ge12f2a620408"
msgid "Move forward to <i>what</i> exactly?"
msgstr "나아가라고? 대체 <b>어디로</b>?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 83cf181e-dbb1-6c63-966a-2c07b6888928
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GOOD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:83cf181e-dbb1-6c63-966a-2c07b6888928
msgctxt "h35956caegb7e4g404aga43cg19a615289d09"
msgid "Hope? You would bid me <i>hope?</i>"
msgstr "희망을 가지라고? 내가 <b>희망을</b> 가져야 한다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 91530040-e7c7-0a31-b780-2fc7e414811a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:91530040-e7c7-0a31-b780-2fc7e414811a
msgctxt "hf5f0f59fge820g43a1gb3fcgcd600dc90f83"
msgid ""
"Aye. Not a battle she's likely to put to song. Maybe we should have just "
"surrendered, but..."
msgstr "그래, 알피라가 노래로 만들만한 전투는 아니었지. 어쩌면 그냥 항복해야 했을지도 몰라. 그런데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 93ea3be4-ab1d-96c3-7865-db97dca81d32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:93ea3be4-ab1d-96c3-7865-db97dca81d32
msgctxt "hf9ca6b6bgcafbg4901g9d68g475aeeda9185"
msgid ""
"We were ambushed out in the cursed lands - cultists of this Absolute. Likely "
"we should have surrendered, but..."
msgstr "이 저주받은 땅에서 절대자의 추종자들에게 기습을 당했어, 항복해야 했을지도 몰랐지. 하지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95e59bc5-de0a-af1d-f080-6d637d5ce9ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_ProdigyLament_State_ToldStory = False
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_ZevlorWasLeader = True
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:95e59bc5-de0a-af1d-f080-6d637d5ce9ae
msgctxt "hdd5cdddbg969eg4486g8419g05a07229a7cb"
msgid "What happened? Where's Zevlor?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 있었던 거야? 제블로어는?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 96cc1c64-9589-3c06-a3e7-351b30846ea4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:96cc1c64-9589-3c06-a3e7-351b30846ea4
msgctxt "hd80b02edg78beg479bg8e61gfcd3c021d4a9"
msgid ""
"We've no brighter horizon ahead of us. There's just the city - <i>if </i>I "
"can get us there alive."
msgstr "우리 앞에 희망 따위는 없어. 저 앞에는 오직 도시만 있을 뿐이지, 그조차도 살아서 갈 수 있을 때의 이야기지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 98421be1-2993-a406-ea73-82af7e8e000d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:98421be1-2993-a406-ea73-82af7e8e000d
msgctxt "heb2c2f5fg42a1g4363ga6dfgea3460ee5c0b"
msgid ""
"Have you no shame? You were tasked with protecting these people, yet you "
"<i>ran.</i>"
msgstr "이 사람들을 지켜야 한다는 의무가 있었는데도 도망쳐버렸다고? 부끄럽지도 않나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 98708ee0-934e-f4f4-6e7c-0f94a0cc99c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:98708ee0-934e-f4f4-6e7c-0f94a0cc99c3
msgctxt "h6358e74bg90b8g4013g8430gfbcebf253cc9"
msgid ""
"Those of us who cut free just kept running 'til we found this place. The "
"others... maybe the cult got them. Maybe the curse."
msgstr "우리 중에서 탈출한 사람들은 여길 찾을 때까지 계속 도망쳤어. 나머지는... 추종자들이나 저주에 당했을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 9cef7522-6ca2-62f8-de9d-4d4f9eb0457c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:9cef7522-6ca2-62f8-de9d-4d4f9eb0457c
msgctxt "hb0fa0e3ag4f7cg40bagb999g764cc0f6fdcc"
msgid "I almost hope the others never found out why."
msgstr "다른 사람들이 그 이유를 모르기만을 바랄 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = 9eaeb546-875f-257d-65fb-180b43ca928d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:9eaeb546-875f-257d-65fb-180b43ca928d
msgctxt "hb2ebb581gf512g46d0g89cbgf0f1cc718e7d"
msgid ""
"Prison's the best I can hope for the ones we left behind. This cult seemed "
"to want us alive."
msgstr "남겨져 버린 사람들에게는 죄수가 되는 게 그나마 제일 나은 경우겠지, 교단 놈들이 우릴 살려두고 싶어하는 것 같더라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = a0229eb6-2da0-4e34-93b2-39076345974f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_BackupLeader_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:a0229eb6-2da0-4e34-93b2-39076345974f
msgctxt "hd3656f86g41d6g430bg86fagc7a2d4ff4379"
msgid ""
"Watch your back out there. If it's not the cult coming for you, it'll be the "
"shadows."
msgstr "조심하도록 해, 교단 놈들이 아니어도 그림자가 널 노릴 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a142098e-fc32-7999-3b9d-68465ff93e31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_CerysPostRescue(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_ReturnCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:a142098e-fc32-7999-3b9d-68465ff93e31
msgctxt "h5c3d54eegd9f5g4594g9509g97d698bcc8b5"
msgid "I tried, but your people didn't make it out of Moonrise. I'm sorry."
msgstr "노력했지만, 그 사람들은 문라이즈에서 나오질 못했어. 미안하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a53d3b32-d82d-4e68-4618-cabd334c315a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:a53d3b32-d82d-4e68-4618-cabd334c315a
msgctxt "h3effaeb4gd7aag4688g87cfg6be8213eae59"
msgid "How did you blunder into danger this time?"
msgstr "이번에는 어쩌다가 위험에 빠진 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6c9e517-c704-57ae-e08d-2914954ed901
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC(1) = False
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN_DEVOTION(1) = False
#.      - RANGER(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN_ANCIENTS(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(1) = False
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:a6c9e517-c704-57ae-e08d-2914954ed901
msgctxt "h6fe4c2bfg62c8g4e4dgaa1fgf97574b29931"
msgid "So you abandoned them."
msgstr "그래, 그 사람들을 버렸다는 거군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a829f286-e6ee-e2f7-19b6-e48b9834eeee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:a829f286-e6ee-e2f7-19b6-e48b9834eeee
msgctxt "h44165e42gd2bag44dcgae85gfc009039eceb"
msgid "You did right. You do not want to be a prisoner of the Absolute."
msgstr "잘한 일이야, 절대자 교단의 포로가 되기는 싫잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = acd82961-3113-8c3c-8753-d7ca8782a96a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:acd82961-3113-8c3c-8753-d7ca8782a96a
msgctxt "h4f87b8c7gf71bg44d5g9afcga7808569426e"
msgid "...I suppose I deserve that."
msgstr "...내 생각에는 내 잘못이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = ad55b60c-11f0-f0c3-6e7d-09b2ebc34ead
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_ZevlorWasLeader = True
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_ReturnCompleted = True
#.      - MOO_Jailbreak_State_AllPrisonersDied = True
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_TieflingsReturned = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_CerysPostRescue(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:ad55b60c-11f0-f0c3-6e7d-09b2ebc34ead
msgctxt "hc72a5217g0689g4658gb0cegdb0b1d498a33"
msgid ""
"I looked for Zevlor among those who came back. No matter his fate... I know "
"he'd be grateful to you. I am too."
msgstr "돌아온 사람 중에서 제블로어가 있나 찾아봤어. 그의 운명이 어찌됐든간에... 분명 네게 고마워할 거야. 나도 마찬가지고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = b0bed5ee-4bed-2c70-47c5-0d5bbcd2b17f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:b0bed5ee-4bed-2c70-47c5-0d5bbcd2b17f
msgctxt "hc2c58528g47e7g4d10gaec3g49ab0bc48f3d"
msgid "I'll make sure the others know you tried, but nothing's changed."
msgstr "다른 사람들에게 네가 노력했다는 건 확실히 알려주겠지만, 변한 건 아무것도 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = bd5fa149-1a0b-97e5-2495-c54024f0a7ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:bd5fa149-1a0b-97e5-2495-c54024f0a7ae
msgctxt "h1030b646g6996g4111gba96g7016261ac260"
msgid ""
"Cerys. Scout. Seems we missed one another at the grove, but the others told "
"me how you helped us."
msgstr "세리스야. 정찰병이지. 숲에서는 마주칠 기회가 없었지만, 다른 사람들이 네 도움에 관해 이야기해 줬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd77dbd3-f575-1d0d-6c87-38521410d775
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_CerysPostRescue(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_ReturnCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:bd77dbd3-f575-1d0d-6c87-38521410d775
msgctxt "he716896cg5bfbg4b0fg862ag6e2b013af254"
msgid "The others are dead."
msgstr "다른 사람들은 다 죽었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = bfcddde3-9cb4-de12-c0f7-6e96ab6e3d53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_BackupLeader_NightsongFreedHasMet(1) = False
#.      - HAV_BackupLeader_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_BackupLeader_NightsongFreedHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:bfcddde3-9cb4-de12-c0f7-6e96ab6e3d53
msgctxt "hbbd943edg3b84g44b2ga1c6ge4da034df57f"
msgid ""
"Glad to see you again. I was afraid you'd get swallowed up by the shadows. "
"Instead, you've found us some cavalry. Very well done."
msgstr "다시 만나서 반갑네. 그림자에 삼켜지면 어쩌나 걱정했었어. 대신에, 웬 기사를 데리고 왔네. 정말 잘했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = c449a261-62e4-e2d0-5b18-39685a939dde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_ZevlorWasLeader = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_FindZevlor_Knows_MissingHav = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:c449a261-62e4-e2d0-5b18-39685a939dde
msgctxt "hc9a542a1g82a0g49d0ga94eg111cfc9a7045"
msgid ""
"Aye - brutal is putting it lightly. Maybe we should have just surrendered - "
"Zevlor begged us to. But..."
msgstr "끔찍함 이상이지, 어쩌면 그냥 항복해야 했을지도 몰라. 제블로어도 그러자고 우리에게 간청 했지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = c48ef568-d3ec-da41-1a4c-879d1c362cde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:c48ef568-d3ec-da41-1a4c-879d1c362cde
msgctxt "hfb3b22dag952cg4f2cgbec7gb4e6cbf26e21"
msgid ""
"We're in a dilapidated inn, surrounded by cursed darkness - only a fool "
"wouldn't be afraid."
msgstr "저주받은 어둠에 둘러싸인 채로 다 쓰러져가는 여관에 있잖아. 겁이 나는 게 정상이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = c6f0a5d6-1631-2324-6fb7-a2837c4777dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:c6f0a5d6-1631-2324-6fb7-a2837c4777dc
msgctxt "h82b02f14gb881g41a5gb4begaa977c431cac"
msgid ""
"They were toying with us. <i>Making examples</i>. And we'd had enough of "
"taking it."
msgstr "그 놈들이 우릴 가지고 놀았어, <b>본보기를 만들었지</b>. 그런 건 더 이상 견딜 수 없었다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca4b9d2b-6b93-1f68-7386-885d7f95a483
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:ca4b9d2b-6b93-1f68-7386-885d7f95a483
msgctxt "h36d3dde5gafdfg4900g9c49g635fcffb9c64"
msgid "<i>Coward.</i>"
msgstr "<b>겁쟁이.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ccf20331-42fc-1063-992d-f039dac3ef13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:ccf20331-42fc-1063-992d-f039dac3ef13
msgctxt "h5eb2d011g5aa5g492dgbb29gcdf7dfea7273"
msgid "'Death-trap'? I've slept in worse inns, trust me."
msgstr "'사지'라고? 장난 아니고 난 여기 보다 더 나쁜 여관에서도 지내봤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cf5ac6af-e098-0d80-3db9-2e14ead83021
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_ProdigyLament_State_ToldStory = True
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_Knows_CapturedTieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:cf5ac6af-e098-0d80-3db9-2e14ead83021
msgctxt "h4d78782ag4ddag4e61g8273g4a39d63df359"
msgid "Rolan said his siblings were taken. What happened out there?"
msgstr "롤란의 형제자매들이 납치됐다던데 무슨 일이 있었던 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = cfd04678-9da4-3eee-c05b-80b812e9d2a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:cfd04678-9da4-3eee-c05b-80b812e9d2a6
msgctxt "h9156e556g1601g4623g9c04g8bc6014b5654"
msgid "Aye. Don't blame him for drinking this place dry."
msgstr "그래, 그러니까 녀석이 술통이 비도록 마셔대는 걸 나무라지는 말라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = d186e7a1-1130-4789-4051-2acb1db1b36c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:d186e7a1-1130-4789-4051-2acb1db1b36c
msgctxt "hc5331282gcd7fg4edeg98d8gb5a3f78528db"
msgid ""
"A pity. You pulled them from one death-trap only for me to land them in this "
"one."
msgstr "안타깝군, 그 쪽이 우리 사람들을 사지에서 구해줬는데도 내가 다시 밀어 넣고 말았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = d2d8aa8e-8457-ab80-ca3f-2040a696c8d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_BackupLeader_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Jailbreak_State_AllPrisonersDied = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:d2d8aa8e-8457-ab80-ca3f-2040a696c8d9
msgctxt "ha103c7abgf052g4073g9174g0b63b85c3c6b"
msgid "You've the look of someone with news. Good or bad?"
msgstr "새로운 소식이 있어 보이네. 좋은 소식이야, 나쁜 소식이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = d750e954-22c5-6c9d-1b4c-f7332ec2d73e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:d750e954-22c5-6c9d-1b4c-f7332ec2d73e
msgctxt "h98866051gfe83g4b95gb225g56b4a3319539"
msgid ""
"It's hard to tell. We were alone in the darkness one moment, surrounded the "
"next."
msgstr "모르겠어, 한 순간 어둠 속에서 고립 되어서는 바로 포위 당했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = e106f25d-21c5-2486-bc0a-0148b0efa4ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_ZevlorWasLeader = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_FindZevlor_Knows_MissingHav = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:e106f25d-21c5-2486-bc0a-0148b0efa4ea
msgctxt "h0536c83fgeff0g4b14ga13fg4b51446a0076"
msgid ""
"Aye. Not a battle she's likely to put to song. Maybe we should have just "
"surrendered - Zevlor begged us to. But..."
msgstr ""
"그래, 알피라가 노래로 만들만한 전투는 아니었지. 어쩌면 그냥 항복해야 했을지도 몰라. 제블로어도 그러자고 우리에게 간청 했지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e3d9d172-d8cd-bb78-cd4f-fdd97c78bac3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:e3d9d172-d8cd-bb78-cd4f-fdd97c78bac3
msgctxt "h00811aedg60ffg4c0cg9ce0gdfc74d1118ac"
msgid ""
"What are you doing out here to begin with? You were bound for Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "애초에 여기서 뭘하고 있는 거야? 발더스 게이트로 가고 있었어야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = e48f50cc-71d6-9f49-582f-9948046f3642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:e48f50cc-71d6-9f49-582f-9948046f3642
msgctxt "h3df49bd8g0584g444cgaa59gcbd294936f01"
msgid ""
"The time for hoping is past. I've got to get what's left of us to the city."
msgstr "이제 와서 무슨 희망이야. 남은 사람들이라도 도시에 잘 도착하길 바랄 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = e4a3dce7-a68f-e1a3-f02a-91fa6d5b7484
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:e4a3dce7-a68f-e1a3-f02a-91fa6d5b7484
msgctxt "hfdcec065gc0aeg407dg9f17g823708811433"
msgid "Sorry for what? Doing more for them than I did?"
msgstr "뭐가 미안한데? 나보다 더 많이 노력해 준 게 미안한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = ef9ffb60-2916-befc-e96c-015fb0db2045
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_ReturnCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:ef9ffb60-2916-befc-e96c-015fb0db2045
msgctxt "h0a25ea8fge073g4c7egb5a7g0810e883b605"
msgid "I'll catch up with you later. I have some... funeral rites to prepare."
msgstr "나중에 봐. 난 음... 장례식 준비를 해야 하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = f135a99b-a20e-121e-94bc-45d6aada3c92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_ZevlorWasLeader = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:f135a99b-a20e-121e-94bc-45d6aada3c92
msgctxt "h70edeae0g8671g4a49gba3bg1e510261d551"
msgid ""
"Prison's the best I can hope for the ones we left behind. Zevlor seemed to "
"think the cult wanted us alive."
msgstr ""
"남겨져 버린 사람들에게는 죄수가 되는 게 그나마 제일 나은 경우겠지, 제블로어는 교단이 우릴 살려두고 싶어 한다고 여기는 것 같더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = f21c4098-93b2-406a-df2c-1004bd33d645
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:f21c4098-93b2-406a-df2c-1004bd33d645
msgctxt "h9e9fd283g5aa5g46a3ga4eagf6d220669368"
msgid "Aye, and more than half the others with him."
msgstr "맞아, 다른 절반하고 같이 사라졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = f6ab8869-7e75-7ba1-49f2-9036686d4867
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_BackupLeader_NightsongFreedHasMet(1) = False
#.      - HAV_BackupLeader_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_BackupLeader_NightsongFreedHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:f6ab8869-7e75-7ba1-49f2-9036686d4867
msgctxt "h3e677337gd6b9g47fbg99eeg07050268cd85"
msgid ""
"This place has been buzzing with talk of an adventurer who found us an "
"angel. Sounds like salvation to me, don't you think?"
msgstr "지금 이곳은 천사를 찾아 데려온 모험가 얘기로 떠들썩 해. 나에게는 구원처럼 들리는데, 어떻게 생각해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6c3ad15-e5ec-dbac-d5a1-07998d8ffe32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:f6c3ad15-e5ec-dbac-d5a1-07998d8ffe32
msgctxt "h4e70b9e1gab3fg4d4egb3d5g88d9a839e9f3"
msgid "Have hope. You survived - I'm sure the others did too."
msgstr "넌 살아남았잖아, 다른 이들도 마찬가지겠지. 희망을 가져."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = f90dd55e-3c60-c3ba-0d71-75e6c3b97dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:f90dd55e-3c60-c3ba-0d71-75e6c3b97dcd
msgctxt "hc17f4868ga076g402cg8846g0b57f79ba23a"
msgid "But... thanks. It was sweet of you try."
msgstr "그래도... 노력해줘서 고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = fa9e129e-f163-5ede-16b3-ac3c56a7add7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_BackupLeader_NightsongFreedHasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:fa9e129e-f163-5ede-16b3-ac3c56a7add7
msgctxt "h22133276gb809g4fa8g9c6eg41e7ae89d13b"
msgid "The end's in sight. I can <i>feel </i>it."
msgstr "끝이 가까워 지고 있어. <i>느껴져.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader
#. Speaker = Cerys
#. NodeID = fe28c07e-832f-2d3b-b6ea-846ad9b4648d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_BackupLeader:fe28c07e-832f-2d3b-b6ea-846ad9b4648d
msgctxt "h18f00feegdb33g4ffdgbcb3ga38bf41d6aa7"
msgid "Gone, and more than half the others with him."
msgstr "다른 절반하고 같이 사라졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 045afbb3-5de0-08eb-5e51-101f8591f479
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:045afbb3-5de0-08eb-5e51-101f8591f479
msgctxt "h8eebf645gc936g48ceg838bg78f2ec050476"
msgid "Aw, is the little kitten afraid of some shadows? PATHETIC!"
msgstr "오, 우리 새끼 고양이께서는 그림자가 두려우신 건가? <b>한심하기는</b>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 05263b8d-f868-d8b4-1da8-8c9cb5385b89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:05263b8d-f868-d8b4-1da8-8c9cb5385b89
msgctxt "hee113b48g2338g4bafg9e17gab1b149047c5"
msgid ""
"I do not seek your territory, noble beast, only a few moments of your time."
msgstr "고귀한 짐승이여, 당신의 영토를 빼앗으려고 하는 게 아닙니다, 그저 몇마디 나누고 싶을 뿐이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 05f126d5-b5e5-e6bb-d6cc-2e0bc7820f10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:05f126d5-b5e5-e6bb-d6cc-2e0bc7820f10
msgctxt "h8e61a297gaf3eg4256gac60g42783f701f0e"
msgid "You'll see <i>these </i>points unless you retreat!<i></i>"
msgstr "썩 물러나지 않으면 <i>진짜</i> 날카로운 게 뭔지 보여주겠다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 0ac36f2a-49af-60a8-80d9-1b5a243a59e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:0ac36f2a-49af-60a8-80d9-1b5a243a59e1
msgctxt "h16dd732fgf21bg444agb904ge40b0efc4057"
msgid "It was quite straightforward. I <i>slinked.</i>"
msgstr "당연한 걸 묻는군. <i>몰래</i> 들어왔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14e12440-592e-1b13-8344-fc36c9d74635
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:14e12440-592e-1b13-8344-fc36c9d74635
msgctxt "ha66f49eagbb93g4ad8g8aa2g3a43370d5366"
msgid "Heard anything interesting around here?"
msgstr "이곳과 관련된 흥미로운 이야기는 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1584252b-af27-b8b2-1bf3-07252efa2d40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:1584252b-af27-b8b2-1bf3-07252efa2d40
msgctxt "h8f1db640gd20bg4a5bgb96bgceb1a05d3c39"
msgid "I see your point."
msgstr "날카로운 지적이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 1ae1fcfc-d137-5bfb-31b3-8497b1e9fc0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Cat_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:1ae1fcfc-d137-5bfb-31b3-8497b1e9fc0b
msgctxt "he408847egfb5ag47cfga31cg7ba5e3ac7187"
msgid "*HISS!*"
msgstr "*쉬익!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21c808c9-7bd0-95fb-c83a-f11aba25cc7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Unprotected = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:21c808c9-7bd0-95fb-c83a-f11aba25cc7f
msgctxt "h074cff37gabe0g48bfgb4d3g3e67b229b9c1"
msgid ""
"You should get out of here - this place is vulnerable to the shadow curse."
msgstr "여긴 그림자 저주에 위험해, 떠나는 게 좋을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 22c19d61-308f-b90a-3a5d-bc7a0b912b8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:22c19d61-308f-b90a-3a5d-bc7a0b912b8f
msgctxt "h6ccc2622g1041g445cg8741geeaab60b68c9"
msgid "*Rrreow...*"
msgstr "*냐우우...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 266387a7-1ebe-a83b-64e1-980b2ad47f52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_UnfortunateGnome(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:266387a7-1ebe-a83b-64e1-980b2ad47f52
msgctxt "he233bba3gc02bg44aegb4aag282ad57ec443"
msgid "Barcus is permitted and I'm not?"
msgstr "바커스는 되고 난 안된다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 28aae27d-1a9f-af8a-8a33-513d9a90f70c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:28aae27d-1a9f-af8a-8a33-513d9a90f70c
msgctxt "hf20fb396gc1fdg4dd0ga6ebg6bc58df9c794"
msgid "Quite the specimen you are. How did you come to this place?"
msgstr "너 정말 특이하구나. 여긴 어떻게 온 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b36839f-0733-db43-3848-488f637ad9ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 03a0f3e2-6643-1f20-f998-2dcf9d4a63d8_name = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:2b36839f-0733-db43-3848-488f637ad9ae
msgctxt "h5b27adf9ga41dg4a05g985fgcf299d12b438"
msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr "이름이 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 2ba86634-77e4-a6b0-f903-25821a53fa76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:2ba86634-77e4-a6b0-f903-25821a53fa76
msgctxt "h1f7b1c02g7e6dg4bb1ga102gd2bb70f79e08"
msgid "I call myself <i>His Majesty.</i>"
msgstr "짐을 <i>황제 폐하</i>라 부르도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2eefe458-ca3e-3bdb-0c7c-70c0248646de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:2eefe458-ca3e-3bdb-0c7c-70c0248646de
msgctxt "h78850900g3fd8g43a1gbfb9g60727e8e4acc"
msgid "<i>Quietly admire the cat.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고양이를 사랑스럽게 바라본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 35000384-209d-3933-a418-9e1903bb3453
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:35000384-209d-3933-a418-9e1903bb3453
msgctxt "h0b0f77c4ga8eeg4a71g8be7ge34c90ed06e3"
msgid "Who's a good kitty?"
msgstr "고양아. 이리 온."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 36461d92-fe4f-700f-dd5a-0594e23fc347
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:36461d92-fe4f-700f-dd5a-0594e23fc347
msgctxt "h59f756c6gb306g4677ga069gd9466495c780"
msgid ""
"Good of you to notice. For my part, <i>I</i> have noticed the cleric is a "
"liar."
msgstr "눈썰미 하나는 뛰어나군. 흥미로운 사실 하나 알려 주자면... 저 클레릭은 거짓말쟁이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 38760683-2219-1435-b1fb-2a6b744b2498
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:38760683-2219-1435-b1fb-2a6b744b2498
msgctxt "hfcc3947egddc1g49acga316g8ab6108764a6"
msgid "I'd rather die."
msgstr "그러느니 죽고 말겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4463d103-c398-fe98-e083-a617118b0b0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:4463d103-c398-fe98-e083-a617118b0b0f
msgctxt "h73ba1b5cg366ag4323gb012g573c92c6c4fa"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 462623df-33e5-b566-18c0-bbac3a7d3387
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:462623df-33e5-b566-18c0-bbac3a7d3387
msgctxt "hcb154a14g3a98g49a5g90f9geb04d3187061"
msgid "I slinked, of course."
msgstr "당연히 몰래 들어왔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 468c0a65-5b72-dff5-cd0a-a546983c0071
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:468c0a65-5b72-dff5-cd0a-a546983c0071
msgctxt "hae2abd24g72bbg48eeg84a9gee824fc7e22e"
msgid "My intentions are pure. I only wanted to admire you up close."
msgstr "순수한 의도로 온 거야. 그저 널 가까이에서 바라보고 싶었을 뿐이라구."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 46b17fe6-9d21-4ebc-3146-6d147c80a26b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Cat_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:46b17fe6-9d21-4ebc-3146-6d147c80a26b
msgctxt "h2fb1a482g2f62g46f1gbcd2g60fd79896cf0"
msgid "*RIIIIIIIIAAOW!"
msgstr "*뭬야아아옹!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 489577f2-43ed-1412-d983-ea4d2b8c7058
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:489577f2-43ed-1412-d983-ea4d2b8c7058
msgctxt "h7fd54e06g8efbg4580gb96dg3d68a5482de4"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 49c579ca-e836-a99f-89a7-39be786bb8c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:49c579ca-e836-a99f-89a7-39be786bb8c5
msgctxt "hf8f2830egc30dg4764g8b0bga2f8095a85ae"
msgid "Apologies. I'll keep my distance."
msgstr "미안해. 더 이상 가까이 가지 않을게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 504a2021-20ea-1540-4aee-645bf8445475
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_Cat_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Cat_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:504a2021-20ea-1540-4aee-645bf8445475
msgctxt "hb506fa6cg189ag421aga0bdge9f93dd7db72"
msgid "Hiss! I say: <i>HISS!</i>"
msgstr "하아악! 내 말하노니, <i><b>하아악!</b></i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 52f51087-ba0f-4c15-9191-a1dc71d35333
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_State_DatingAstarion(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:52f51087-ba0f-4c15-9191-a1dc71d35333
msgctxt "h1db509fbg78e1g4a83gac9ag0d6e6368034c"
msgid "Well, at least you purr for me..."
msgstr "뭐, 적어도 너는 나한테 갸르릉 거리긴 했으니..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 59fc2308-732e-a58e-d636-c898a9b84641
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:59fc2308-732e-a58e-d636-c898a9b84641
msgctxt "hd7a42b4bge083g4443g9f14g46faea0b352a"
msgid "WOOF!"
msgstr "컹컹!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 5e547cb8-bba8-409a-a32e-bbbf1aab77ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:5e547cb8-bba8-409a-a32e-bbbf1aab77ef
msgctxt "hc4478e1ag7bc4g470dg81f6gb6c0ca6ea30b"
msgid "<i>Precisely!</i>"
msgstr "<i>그렇도다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 603bae6b-05fd-c985-4f80-42e803c892f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:603bae6b-05fd-c985-4f80-42e803c892f6
msgctxt "hfbc470b4g3394g430fga496g39c4a7465457"
msgid "Hmm."
msgstr "흐음."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 65bfc14d-ac52-a039-5992-86f1b997f83b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_Cat_NightsongFreed_HasMet(1) = False
#.      - HAV_Cat_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Cat_NightsongFreed_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:65bfc14d-ac52-a039-5992-86f1b997f83b
msgctxt "h166dcfe8g7d62g4a9ag98efg96f1340c47bd"
msgid ""
"I don't know who you are. I don't know why you're here. But I <i>will </"
"i>kill you."
msgstr "네가 누구인지, 왜 여기 왔는지도 모르겠지만 널 <i>죽여</i>버리겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69bab102-5354-7c0f-d681-c4e6c65a55b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 03a0f3e2-6643-1f20-f998-2dcf9d4a63d8_name = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:69bab102-5354-7c0f-d681-c4e6c65a55b8
msgctxt "h820a0572g5a77g495dgb7c1gbd2807a8b615"
msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr "네 이름은 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 69bf4b6e-1eee-a340-b8a1-73945e718ec9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:69bf4b6e-1eee-a340-b8a1-73945e718ec9
msgctxt "he684d349gd64eg4ebcg9880g9e1ae9213b6b"
msgid "I see. Yes, perhaps you're right."
msgstr "그렇군. 어쩌면 네 말이 맞는지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 6ef6acee-cf12-52cb-f28e-9bf6a4630c00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:6ef6acee-cf12-52cb-f28e-9bf6a4630c00
msgctxt "h815d2473g51b5g44f1ga05ag93e95a6512cd"
msgid ""
"Plenty of pointless banging about. The only highlight was when the cleric "
"here promised me a bit of milk that has yet to materialise."
msgstr ""
"의미 없는 이야기로 가득하지. 무엇보다 중요한 건 내게 우유를 헌상하기로 약속했던 클레릭의 소식을 아직도 듣지 못했다는 사실이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 70013ff0-6df4-6bc4-7458-b2150fabb035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:70013ff0-6df4-6bc4-7458-b2150fabb035
msgctxt "h4596ad49g1fc0g4e1cg9184gd1280ea6dd8b"
msgid "How did you get to this place?"
msgstr "여긴 어떻게 온 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 71d948bc-8f15-5e5f-0485-eef344f9109a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:71d948bc-8f15-5e5f-0485-eef344f9109a
msgctxt "h23c89b12g390dg4b09gb44dg7408f83ef306"
msgid ""
"*Your years of hunting and tracking have taught you to recognise a "
"territorial animal when you see it.*"
msgstr "*오랜 기간의 사냥과 추적 덕에 당신은 영역동물을 구별할 수 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 7537fc94-12c2-63b0-274b-e9f0260905c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:7537fc94-12c2-63b0-274b-e9f0260905c9
msgctxt "h5f3e74e0g5f3bg439egbd54gad84141e1564"
msgid "My conclusion: She's a liar."
msgstr "내 결론은 클레릭은 거짓말쟁이라는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77c4d414-b2f0-e929-54ac-14bfdb4e4878
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:77c4d414-b2f0-e929-54ac-14bfdb4e4878
msgctxt "hc30e13d0g7fc7g4002g989fge273609c9021"
msgid "BOO!"
msgstr "워!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 780c4fb5-2f0d-ec52-5359-d83cb3c0e5c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:780c4fb5-2f0d-ec52-5359-d83cb3c0e5c2
msgctxt "h6dce4bbegd4f8g4a6bg9b12g29f967ed6244"
msgid ""
"She promised me a bit of milk. But do you see any milk? Do you? Nor do I. "
"Disgraceful."
msgstr "그녀가 약속했던 건 우유인데 주변에 우유가 보이나? 안 보이지. 부끄러운 일이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 7a78daaf-5563-cea7-be78-820b664e40b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:7a78daaf-5563-cea7-be78-820b664e40b6
msgctxt "h831a23bfgb954g4594gaa7bgcf329f54ed82"
msgid ""
"Indeed, you will. Or you'll find my claws planted firmly in your dangles."
msgstr "암, 그러셔야지. 아니면 내 발톱이 네 거시기에 단단히 박혀있는 꼴을 볼 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 7ce2cf8e-6759-0a8c-dd25-8ba61ee10bce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_Cat_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:7ce2cf8e-6759-0a8c-dd25-8ba61ee10bce
msgctxt "h508fbbf4g966fg4600g8543g7a042cf0eab3"
msgid "<i>Begone!</i>"
msgstr "<i>사라져라!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86b58b54-02da-988d-d58e-e5ec186b791e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Cat_HasMet(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:86b58b54-02da-988d-d58e-e5ec186b791e
msgctxt "h9b65eee9g780eg43b7g90adgcd897ff3fb5a"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89b29f46-e599-773a-4984-75eea018eed9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:89b29f46-e599-773a-4984-75eea018eed9
msgctxt "ha8185ba0g996cg479fg84cegaa983be613a0"
msgid "Easy, kitty. I mean you no harm."
msgstr "진정하렴, 야옹아. 해치려는 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8afddcfe-8306-fea2-e60c-7a9e5934cfd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:8afddcfe-8306-fea2-e60c-7a9e5934cfd7
msgctxt "hac9b286cgbb94g4546g95f1g6ed301ad5d97"
msgid "Hiss!"
msgstr "샤악!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90dcb232-1260-bff9-f7c3-647ffbc28ae6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:90dcb232-1260-bff9-f7c3-647ffbc28ae6
msgctxt "h0d0e9bc7gdedag44b3g8759g515e2a111460"
msgid "What's got your whiskers in a twist?"
msgstr "수염을 그렇게 배배꼬는 이유가 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = 96123c84-31a6-80b9-b6ae-12e66babbbe1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_Cat_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:96123c84-31a6-80b9-b6ae-12e66babbbe1
msgctxt "h259f2140gf43bg4938gbe7fg13947a2f2c2b"
msgid "<i>*Hiss.*</i>"
msgstr "<i>*하아악.*</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 975ad81c-d584-7c1e-50a1-2b4627225b33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:975ad81c-d584-7c1e-50a1-2b4627225b33
msgctxt "hda4657bfgc8feg4ae8g87ddg995848d166cc"
msgid "You're in my territory. Get out."
msgstr "여긴 내 영역이야. 나가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a830193-2766-8328-13d0-77159bbd9de9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:9a830193-2766-8328-13d0-77159bbd9de9
msgctxt "hdf46bad2g25edg41bbga932g2be5b13470e6"
msgid "<i>Reach out to pet the cat.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고양이를 쓰다듬는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9cf94475-e7a4-a0b0-bcad-605dfdac5b89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:9cf94475-e7a4-a0b0-bcad-605dfdac5b89
msgctxt "h66bc6902ge204g482aga434g994bb98c6562"
msgid "Good. I'd like it if we could have a civil discussion."
msgstr "좋아. 우리가 정중한 토론을 나눌 수 있다면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = a43dbf6a-b07f-b1fc-6493-60871eab8b6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:a43dbf6a-b07f-b1fc-6493-60871eab8b6d
msgctxt "h2829ffbcg9387g4392ga53dgfbc9c1dcd932"
msgid "This is my territory. And <i>you're </i>in it."
msgstr "여기는 짐의 영토이니. <i>너는</i> 무단 침입했노라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae06acd2-7cb6-cee6-8f43-3914cd63a505
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:ae06acd2-7cb6-cee6-8f43-3914cd63a505
msgctxt "h388a488eg8846g4d09gbbbbg4e6617d73730"
msgid "<i>Try to muster some kindness, and calm the creature.</i>"
msgstr "<i>동물을 친절히 대하며 진정시키려 해본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae06acd2-7cb6-cee6-8f43-3914cd63a505
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:ae06acd2-7cb6-cee6-8f43-3914cd63a505
msgctxt "h28146786g6bb2g4eb0gb4a1g5ec5ca647296"
msgid "Here, kitty kitty."
msgstr "이리 온, 야옹아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b69e603f-8456-952e-c3e6-3bc534446166
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:b69e603f-8456-952e-c3e6-3bc534446166
msgctxt "h8b8e38eag7c58g4fb7g8c3cge1ae23c30d76"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = bd45082b-0f3c-9328-6626-b3263b1a031f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:bd45082b-0f3c-9328-6626-b3263b1a031f
msgctxt "h2c7b51c2g3c83g4ee0ga88bgdfbb0ebec2c2"
msgid "<i>You'll </i>be under attack if you don't heed my hiss!"
msgstr "내 하악질을 귀담아 듣지 않는다면 <i>네놈이야 말로</i> 공격 당하리라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be656006-c174-57ba-8212-4e81a676174f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:be656006-c174-57ba-8212-4e81a676174f
msgctxt "h73d37ff3g6aa8g445bga3abg2e6f3bab8e06"
msgid "<i>Back away.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물러선다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c07d2b8a-f323-6cfd-fd55-1c8e783fff7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:c07d2b8a-f323-6cfd-fd55-1c8e783fff7a
msgctxt "hab75342fgf48eg407cgaed1g238c54e4f594"
msgid "This place is under attack!"
msgstr "여긴 지금 공격 당하고 있다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = cbebfb1b-810a-4f69-c47f-202e9939c8e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_Cat_NightsongFreed_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:cbebfb1b-810a-4f69-c47f-202e9939c8e2
msgctxt "h85dd02dbg25e0g4621g8309g1048f64ee6dc"
msgid "Would that I lived on an island, far away, all alone..."
msgstr "내가 멀리 떨어진 섬에서 혼자 살았다면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = cbf964a0-cc74-4b26-b954-545c9dc799b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:cbf964a0-cc74-4b26-b954-545c9dc799b0
msgctxt "h735ec5fag1ffcg46e4g9b78gb45e30d68f12"
msgid "<i>Chk</i>. Why would anyone keep such neurotic creatures as pets?"
msgstr "<i>츠크</i>. 이런 신경질이나 부리는 생물이 뭐가 좋다고 다들 키우는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = d0a15709-18e4-ff5c-7f7d-ec9b267b1a21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:d0a15709-18e4-ff5c-7f7d-ec9b267b1a21
msgctxt "hbbdd1642gc342g4916g94d2gead48fd79527"
msgid "You've had enough! Now go! Quickly! HISS!"
msgstr "그정도면 충분하지 않나! 이제 가도록 해! 빨리! 하아악!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = d4509327-1425-b64f-c51c-7067b01fbf95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:d4509327-1425-b64f-c51c-7067b01fbf95
msgctxt "h8290c2a6gc587g411fg9591gedebf53d871d"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "알겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = d7c0aa6f-fc4f-602a-60ed-d48c72f6597e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:d7c0aa6f-fc4f-602a-60ed-d48c72f6597e
msgctxt "h324f7ba5g8b0fg453dgb5e8ge6cd07b88738"
msgid "I'll allow it."
msgstr "내 허락하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = d8832e5e-6e79-db10-01c5-db01e27487e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:d8832e5e-6e79-db10-01c5-db01e27487e5
msgctxt "h6ea4424cg8296g4415g9ce7g5b27db292d7c"
msgid "AND YET YOU HARM ME BY YOUR VERY PRESENCE!"
msgstr "<b>그럼에도 네 존재 자체가 내게 해를 끼치고 있다!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db095083-243c-0853-19ec-c1397dc2429c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:db095083-243c-0853-19ec-c1397dc2429c
msgctxt "h8749439fgb5a0g49deg848bg85bc2d878529"
msgid "I could use someone like you in my camp. Care to join?"
msgstr "네가 합류해준다면 도움이 될 것 같아. 야영지로 와주겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de8fe9c6-1dd5-38cb-efc8-124d803d616d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:de8fe9c6-1dd5-38cb-efc8-124d803d616d
msgctxt "h8090b053ge868g49f1gadf2g52336e9f57d0"
msgid "MREAOW!"
msgstr "뭬야오옹!!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = e4fd6dfe-4182-fc49-ba85-2d17b9476fa9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Cat_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:e4fd6dfe-4182-fc49-ba85-2d17b9476fa9
msgctxt "h2d82063agd55bg4575ga4c5gb0b9a8718449"
msgid "*RIAOW!*"
msgstr "*냐앙!*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = e92d5d68-5499-c2a7-8368-550b9642de13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:e92d5d68-5499-c2a7-8368-550b9642de13
msgctxt "h431d3dccg7045g4249ga884g14c1503e1e54"
msgid ""
"A parting piece of advice: don't trust the cleric. She's a bounder and a "
"cad. Much like yourself, some might say."
msgstr "이별 선물로 조언을 해주지: 클레릭을 믿지 마. 그녀는 너처럼 천하고 비열한 사람이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eac14687-edfb-221a-47e7-5836e24d9381
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:eac14687-edfb-221a-47e7-5836e24d9381
msgctxt "h2cd9703bgd2ecg4d81g8be2gc97207719faa"
msgid ""
"You seem like someone who knows what he's about. Heard anything interesting "
"around here?"
msgstr "사람을 꿰뚫어 볼 줄 아는 것 같은데. 여기 관련해서 해 줄 만한 얘기 없어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = edb05fe9-54ab-5b8c-21cf-148be03ecdcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_Cat_NightsongFreed_HasMet(1) = False
#.      - HAV_Cat_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Cat_NightsongFreed_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat:edb05fe9-54ab-5b8c-21cf-148be03ecdcb
msgctxt "hb3308f1aga9bfg424dga3b7g0a85c4b3186e"
msgid ""
"There you are, unfortunately<i>. </i>Ever since you arrived, things keep... "
"changing. <i>I hate it.</i>"
msgstr ""
"유감스럽게도 아직 여기 있다니<i>. </i>네가 나타난 이후로 모든 것이...변하기 시작했어. <i>썩 마음에 들지 않는군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Cat
#. Speaker = His Majesty
#. NodeID = f0ed7f92-bee6-4c22-fbbd-092a0cf99198
