msgctxt "h0a8523a9ga2adg4732g986bg9286b3891e2c"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "너는 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_Dead_CursedFist
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f41544d0-257e-4d8d-8a24-f559a17d8292
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_Dead_CursedFist:f41544d0-257e-4d8d-8a24-f559a17d8292
msgctxt "h0364d503geb98g4128g989agb5652f137982"
msgid "*The spell's power wanes. You can ask no more questions.*"
msgstr "*주문의 힘이 약해집니다. 더 이상 질문을 할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_Dead_CursedFist
#. Speaker = Art Cullagh
#. NodeID = fa32949c-4713-4d03-9001-7fb30887ad78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_Dead_CursedFist:fa32949c-4713-4d03-9001-7fb30887ad78
msgctxt "h412bdb38gc836g4d7cgbf0eg8e517595acae"
msgid ""
"Investigating... Ketheric Thorm. Rumours of... Sharran cult. Worse... than "
"we thought."
msgstr "샤 종교 집단과 케서릭 쏨을... 조사했다... 생각보다... 심각한 상황... 이었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_Dead_CursedFist
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fd651631-589f-4cf4-8780-fa7c6a7048e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_Killer(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_Dead_CursedFist:fd651631-589f-4cf4-8780-fa7c6a7048e1
msgctxt "hd1e263ebg24ebg4cbag8168g0da3aaa190af"
msgid "*The corpse seems willing to speak - but not to its killer.*"
msgstr "*시체는 말할 의지가 있지만, 자신을 죽인 자와 대화하고 싶지는 않은 듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit:c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
msgctxt "h1191d097g0f47g4869ga308g072caf9e165d"
msgid "What's that in his pocket? Looks official."
msgstr "주머니에 저건 뭐지? 공식 문서 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit:c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
msgctxt "h08b6af1eg3959g4560gb9dagf3daa1c32dcd"
msgid ""
"Hmmm, there seems to be some kind of document protruding from this "
"gentleman's pantaloons."
msgstr "흠, 이 신사분의 판탈롱 바지에서 문서 같은 게 삐져나와 있는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit:c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
msgctxt "h220f6f3aga4cag4053gbd10g587a03bff856"
msgid "What's that in your pocket, sir?"
msgstr "주머니에 그건 뭔가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit:c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
msgctxt "h4aa5b265ga741g43bfg9a84g9285ce1b2ed9"
msgid "Is that a parchment in his pocket?"
msgstr "주머니에 저거 양피지인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit:c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
msgctxt "h0696fc6ag0e7cg4d2dga481g7e2d8a9ef557"
msgid "Some parchment there - looks official."
msgstr "양피지가 있어. 공식 문서 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit:c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
msgctxt "h0d23b02bga0cdg48edgba6bg0ff73d8ff5f2"
msgid "Something poking from his pocket. Might be worth a gander."
msgstr "주머니에서 뭔가 튀어나왔어. 한 번 훑어볼 가치가 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_SpottedWrit:c4dd2d37-f660-433b-9fc0-9ac62fa59af1
msgctxt "h37cd922bg732cg4e5ag9d5fgc148f9df976f"
msgid "What's that sticking out of his pocket?"
msgstr "주머니에 튀어나와 있는 저건 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ:4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
msgctxt "hfa310cbbg1dcbg45a0g98bcgd7280dbcf032"
msgid "So he was snooping around the House of Healing. I wonder what he found."
msgstr "치유의 집을 기웃거리며 염탐했나 보군. 거기서 뭘 찾았던 걸까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ:4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
msgctxt "h54f4fe40gf30cg4fc3g9a48g15010110cce5"
msgid ""
"Looks like he was investigating the House of Healing. In search of what, I "
"wonder."
msgstr "치유의 집을 조사했었나 본데. 뭘 찾기 위해서였을까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ:4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
msgctxt "h2492f2f9g7127g4563ga3a9gf1013b84109e"
msgid ""
"He was investigating the House of Healing. Must've found something there, "
"right?"
msgstr "치유의 집을 조사하고 있었군. 거기서 뭔가 찾아낸 게 분명해, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ:4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
msgctxt "hdde1e551gd5ccg4805ga7ebg9e80d2f93526"
msgid "He was at the House of Healing. But what did he find?"
msgstr "치유의 집에 있었군. 뭘 발견한 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ:4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
msgctxt "h12488861g62c7g4ab6gb402gbd517d6a6533"
msgid "Looks like he was at the House of Healing. But to what end?"
msgstr "치유의 집에 갔었나 봐. 무엇 때문에 갔을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ:4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
msgctxt "h4edac74bgdc07g4561g83c5gfe718f4122e1"
msgid ""
"The poor fellow was poking around the House of Healing. He must have found "
"something."
msgstr "이 불쌍한 친구가 치유의 집을 들쑤시고 다녔나 봐. 뭔가를 찾아낸 게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_CursedFist_PAD_Writ:4a9dc39c-bd7a-4f80-9bc1-9091b79c4d21
msgctxt "h417104dag1441g433ag86eeg31f42b2e455c"
msgid "So he was at the House of Healing? Wonder what he found."
msgstr "치유의 집에 있었던 건가? 거기서 뭘 발견했는지 궁금하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DaisyAD_DiscoveredHaven
