msgctxt "h3a5838b0gc8e7g4762gbf37ge1622a77a0aa"
msgid "At least it's dead now."
msgstr "일단 죽은 건 확실하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_AD_WeaponSmithReactionToOx
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = b0e84569-b529-43c1-93a8-b6e8f2335e70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_AD_WeaponSmithReactionToOx:b0e84569-b529-43c1-93a8-b6e8f2335e70
msgctxt "hc4a74666g8c18g4bfega876g3cac2165d3ac"
msgid "Just when I think I've seen it all..."
msgstr "살다 살다 이런 광경은 또 처음 보는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
msgctxt "hbed19c58g7849g4a3eg917bg440a0ddaed1d"
msgid "Next time, we might want to consider leaving well enough alone."
msgstr "다음부터는, 그냥 조용히 사는 놈들까지 건드리지는 말자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
msgctxt "h1aca30d7g5a3dg4926g8928g8ab17a50bcaa"
msgid "Well, that'll teach us never to judge an ox by its cover."
msgstr "음, 황소를 외모로 판단하면 안 된다는 교훈을 얻었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
msgctxt "h2075765egfec3g446bg8a50g790527ec7220"
msgid "Well. Got a bit more than we bargained for with that one."
msgstr "뭐. 예상을 좀 뛰어넘는 소였군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
msgctxt "hbe43b8bbgf35cg49f6gb2a1g49290c1dbaaa"
msgid "Perhaps we shouldn't bother the cattle."
msgstr "어쩌면 소들을 건드리지 말아야 할지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
msgctxt "h05f91ce1g2c1fg4746g801ag6f3db6a0d36c"
msgid "You can't even take beasts of burden for granted these days."
msgstr "짐을 지는 짐승마저도 믿어서는 안 되는 세상이라니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
msgctxt "ha96f0358ga5a9g43f8g8f52g1c3731d5f734"
msgid "They say not to go poking bears. Perhaps we should apply that to oxen."
msgstr "곰을 건드리지 말라는 충고가 떠오르는군. 앞으로는 황소들도 그 정도로 조심해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:2e31610c-6538-42e0-8a94-f702c2dd3293
msgctxt "h1a7bc91bgb2e7g4b71g9785g00cdb634cac5"
msgid "Perhaps next time we shouldn't poke the mysterious ox."
msgstr "아마도 다음번엔 수상한 황소를 건드리지 말아야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
msgctxt "he96cafd8g0656g460cg93eage49aad55cc0e"
msgid ""
"Food animals should not try to kill you. That goes for oxen, chickens, and "
"people."
msgstr "맛보고 즐기려던 음식이 죽이려 든다니, 말도 안 되지. 황소건 닭이건, 사람이건 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
msgctxt "h07b2f6cag9680g43ddg804fgfe3d4b2e30fb"
msgid "Well, that'll teach me never to judge an ox by its cover."
msgstr "허, 앞으로는 황소를 외모로 판단하면 안된다는 교훈을 얻은 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
msgctxt "h372da8c2g2630g43b7gb5b4g71d9c44e1131"
msgid "Well! I'll stay on my toes around cows from now on."
msgstr "하! 이제부터 소떼 근처에선 조심할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
msgctxt "h290256d4gb700g403dgac0cgc7add422f066"
msgid "An ox can't just be an ox on this ridiculous floating rock."
msgstr "황소가 황소답게 살지도 못하는 행성이라니, 참 어이가 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
msgctxt "h08e5db34gaa49g4529g847bga8db69c76225"
msgid "You can't even take beasts of burden for granted these days."
msgstr "짐을 지는 짐승마저도 믿어서는 안 되는 세상이라니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
msgctxt "h511fed08g8440g4166g8313g1e3f4112ce11"
msgid "They say not to go poking bears. They never said anything about oxen."
msgstr "곰을 찔러 대지 말라고는 했지만 황소 얘기는 못 들었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:89ffc858-309a-49c2-be27-86dd4843ce4e
msgctxt "ha0a208f5g5583g43a8ga616g51861e869192"
msgid "I don't think I'll ever look at an ox quite the same."
msgstr "이후론 황소를 예전처럼 바라볼 수 없을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
msgctxt "h68cac1e3g1077g41c6gb925g4b90d747f878"
msgid "Perhaps, but what a fight. What a story!"
msgstr "아마 그렇지만, 이렇게 흥미로운 전투는 또 드문 편이지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
msgctxt "hdf46ce6eg4a7bg4eacg9ac0gf3f9132627c0"
msgid "This was one of those memorable encounters I'd love to forget."
msgstr "이번 일은 잊고 싶어도 평생 못 잊을 것 같단 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
msgctxt "h2dceba1agfd02g43d4g8e51ga6bd5499bb32"
msgid "Good fight, anyway. I needed that."
msgstr "어쨌든 좋은 싸움이었어. 내가 필요로 하던 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
msgctxt "hb827ba3dg33dfg484eg95fagb7aa28772b30"
msgid ""
"We must strike as we please. Assume every beast channels the Hells' fires, "
"and be ready."
msgstr "성에 찰 때까지 부수며 나아가자고. 앞으로 어떤 놈들이 튀어나올지 모르니 각오하고, 항상 대비하도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
msgctxt "h0edaafc7g8b53g45fdg8812g6c16c346f86e"
msgid ""
"An interesting tale for the grandchildren - if you survive to have any, that "
"is."
msgstr "손자들에게 들려줄 좋은 이야기가 되겠네 - 만약 우리가 살아남을 수 있다면 말이지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
msgctxt "h1b031d13gca3eg48a1g9bbdgff9cfa4b443f"
msgid "Perhaps. But you can't tell me you didn't have fun."
msgstr "아마도 그렇지만, 솔직히 너도 꽤 즐기는 것 같던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_DeathReaction:f4b0658a-741b-4d40-ad2a-f39f615f69b7
msgctxt "hddc3023cg4d61g4124gbca5g238bca1b3340"
msgid "Perhaps. But that's certainly a fight I won't soon forget."
msgstr "맞는 말이지. 다만, 이번 전투는 평생 못 잊을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight:c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
msgctxt "h82465ae0g57dag4f98g852ag0614c0da3b37"
msgid "That's... not the same cow as I saw at the druids' grove... is it?"
msgstr "저건... 드루이드 숲에서 봤던 소가 아닐 거야... 맞나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight:c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
msgctxt "hf2775d4cged84g4f30gb37bg8c7b5239bd35"
msgid "I'm almost certain I've seen that ox someplace before..."
msgstr "거의 확신컨데 저 소를 어디서 본 적이 있어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight:c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
msgctxt "h4ebce2c5g4a9eg4402g8fd3g24179cd5ef5f"
msgid "I've seen that ox before - I'm certain of it."
msgstr "분명히 저 황소를 어딘가에서 봤어 - 확실히 기억해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight:c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
msgctxt "hb63a5c31g2b56g4ec0g88b3g127df901bb4a"
msgid ""
"I've definitely seen that ox before. It has the same strange look in its eye."
msgstr "분명 전에 본 황소야. 눈빛이 똑같이 이상해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight:c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
msgctxt "hc60cd40bg0951g470aga636g4e8e8feb9170"
msgid ""
"The ox from the grove. How in the Hells did it make it all the way here?"
msgstr "숲에서 본 황소잖아. 대체 어떻게 여기까지 온 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight:c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
msgctxt "h2f89c057g6e53g4bb5gaabbgfa79a96849da"
msgid "I've got a good sense for horned freaks, and that ox is one of them."
msgstr "난 뿔 달린 괴물들을 잘 알아, 저 황소도 그 중 하나야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_DevilishOx_PAD_SecondInsight:c0dab87e-a072-4367-8650-161d70b759b7
msgctxt "h601573b3g044dg4173ga283gd32abcdaf0bc"
msgid "Looks like that odd ox made it through the shadows."
msgstr "저 이상한 황소도 그림자를 통과한 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ad028452-8989-42e4-b0a0-c9b235dc20e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Halsin:ad028452-8989-42e4-b0a0-c9b235dc20e6
msgctxt "h23a47508gc2a5g432eg9587g4ed815e21036"
msgid ""
"The Archdruid at the time spoke to us all, inspiring our courage... he was a "
"fine leader."
msgstr "당시의 대드루이드께서 모두에게 용기를 불어넣는 말씀을 해주셨었어... 훌륭한 지도자셨네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d5a9cb1d-cab8-4da9-9255-37fd0517b516
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Halsin:d5a9cb1d-cab8-4da9-9255-37fd0517b516
msgctxt "h9f27d4f4g3926g48aeg8456g39eadf38f236"
msgid ""
"Last Light Inn... we rallied here once, years ago, before the assault on "
"Moonrise Towers."
msgstr "최후의 빛 여관... 문라이즈 타워를 공격하기 전에 여기 집결했던 적이 있었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield:bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
msgctxt "h5167b001g899ag4bbbg8518g5861660d84f0"
msgid ""
"A little shimmering shield of light. It should be a reprieve from the "
"shadows, if nothing else."
msgstr "희미한 빛의 방벽이라. 다른 건 몰라도 그림자는 막아주는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield:bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
msgctxt "hc1255239g5045g4a22gb504g8b89dd9002f5"
msgid "A shimmer of light - the shadows can't penetrate."
msgstr "희미하게 반짝거린다... 그림자가 침투할 수 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield:bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
msgctxt "h749d0f7dg9ec7g4d99gb8acg536fa62b398b"
msgid "What light is that? A barrier to keep the shadows at bay?"
msgstr "무슨 빛이지? 그림자로부터 보호하는 장벽인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield:bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
msgctxt "hbfdc5c1eg6a55g4d12g8059gf5e4999d3134"
msgid "Some sort of barrier. The shadows can't penetrate it."
msgstr "장벽의 일종이군. 그림자가 침투할 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield:bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
msgctxt "hb17f908fg10a6g40b1ga029g93794f39542b"
msgid "Look there - a shimmer of light, keeping the shadows at bay."
msgstr "저기 봐, 희미한 불빛이야. 그림자를 막아내고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield:bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
msgctxt "heb8e4358g605ag456eg8328gceebd794d726"
msgid "Would you look at that. No shadows."
msgstr "저기 좀 봐. 그림자가 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_PAD_Moonshield:bd1dccf7-ff43-439a-be31-8df8ace20c4f
msgctxt "ha1a6da7bg158bg4285g8831g42d0bb2c54db"
msgid "No shadows here - something must be keeping it at bay."
msgstr "여긴 그림자가 없군. 뭔가가 막아내고 있는 게 틀림없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01b503af-6827-d876-2309-40c91179350b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_MINTHARA(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:01b503af-6827-d876-2309-40c91179350b
msgctxt "hbc8bac3ag30b4g405bg962bg53f152f7a52e"
msgid ""
"He's right. I was enslaved by the cult and served them once, but I'm free of "
"them now."
msgstr "그가 말한 대롭니다. 절대자의 노예가 되어 그 밑에서 봉사한 적이 있지만 지금은 아니죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 0294c495-1d23-ba44-a096-aff7c9e5be4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_HarpyMeal_Event_KidReturnHideout = True
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_KidFreed = True
#.      - DEN_Hideout_Event_BefriendedThieflings = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:0294c495-1d23-ba44-a096-aff7c9e5be4c
msgctxt "h5327903eg7da0g4494g98ceg57c43e096546"
msgid ""
"Saved two of my friends - one from a harpy, and one from a mad druid with a "
"snake."
msgstr "제 친구 둘을 구해줬어요. 한 명은 하피로부터, 다른 한 명은 뱀이 있는 화난 드루이드에게서요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 030d925f-806e-e133-212c-faac353148d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_WasVouchedFor = False
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_FlamingSpyRevealed = False
#.   Object:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_Event_TrespasserSpotted(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Jaheira_HasMet(5) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_JaheiraMet = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:030d925f-806e-e133-212c-faac353148d3
msgctxt "h4b7ae0d6g95bbg4d4dga70dgae0ca5818bb3"
msgid ""
"*The guard insists that you meet with their leader - a Harper by the name of "
"Jaheira.*"
msgstr "*경비가 그들의 지도자를 만나야 한다고 말합니다. 그 지도자는 자헤이라라는 하퍼라고 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 036d25bd-00b1-fe51-71f2-593adf81156b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint_MetJaheira = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:036d25bd-00b1-fe51-71f2-593adf81156b
msgctxt "h98d4d763ge72cg4589g9ca8g1c73cfece2df"
msgid ""
"Settle in, then come join me for a drink. You may just be the godsend we've "
"been praying for."
msgstr "둘러보고 와서 나랑 한잔 해. 네가 어쩌면 우리가 염원하던 신의 선물일지도 모르겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03bc58f4-2023-cb04-3c3d-f945219e36a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:03bc58f4-2023-cb04-3c3d-f945219e36a4
msgctxt "h3cf794f7gefb3g4186g827fgdcf8d4d28755"
msgid "Just this once, I wish people would simply say hello."
msgstr "한 번쯤은 그냥 평범하게 '안녕'하고 인사받았으면 좋겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 04fb21ae-cd36-18a7-faf9-32df8feaf6b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:04fb21ae-cd36-18a7-faf9-32df8feaf6b5
msgctxt "h7e5155bcg5196g4064g8702gc9e16998f31a"
msgid ""
"Then our interests align. We must all cure ourselves - of the entire cult of "
"the Absolute."
msgstr "그렇다면 우리의 관심사가 일치하는군. 우리 모두가, 이 절대자 교단으로부터 치유되어야만 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0558de1a-cc06-288f-cfe4-12ef21e33910
#. HandlePath = RollAdvantageReason
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Strength
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_Entangled = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:0558de1a-cc06-288f-cfe4-12ef21e33910
msgctxt "hdceb82acg4020g4f89g9a46ge4c698d44aa4"
msgid "Barbarian"
msgstr "바바리안"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0558de1a-cc06-288f-cfe4-12ef21e33910
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Strength
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_Entangled = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(5) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:0558de1a-cc06-288f-cfe4-12ef21e33910
msgctxt "habc74361gc60cg445bga02fg93e15fec4512"
msgid "<b><i>ROAR AND RIP APART THE PUNY VINES</i></b>."
msgstr "<b><i>울부짖으며 덩굴을 찢어버린다.</i></b>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0558de1a-cc06-288f-cfe4-12ef21e33910
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Strength
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_Entangled = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:0558de1a-cc06-288f-cfe4-12ef21e33910
msgctxt "h6b924a3egade7g4606gaa82gfffdbced7b4e"
msgid "<i>Channel your rage. Pull apart these puny vines.</i>"
msgstr "<i>격노를 시전한다. 약해 빠진 덩굴을 찢어버린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0645a725-20a1-0812-12fd-43574e2d47ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_PlayerSaidName(5) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:0645a725-20a1-0812-12fd-43574e2d47ae
msgctxt "h3f14c49cg1f49g4bbag87dbg271709f2569c"
msgid "I'm Gale, and I find myself only moderately pleased to meet you."
msgstr "게일이라고 합니다. 그쪽을 만나게 되어 적당히 반갑네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 06c57d4b-c94b-6b0b-6a92-e0d5d3615d26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_AttackedJaheira = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:06c57d4b-c94b-6b0b-6a92-e0d5d3615d26
msgctxt "h2ded3447g1096g498cga2f0gc44183e48429"
msgid "Go quietly - it'll be easier for all of us."
msgstr "조용히 돌아서라 - 그게 모두를 위한 일이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 0787ed6b-21a3-9d6a-6dc5-ae94e9e1d261
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:0787ed6b-21a3-9d6a-6dc5-ae94e9e1d261
msgctxt "h34d6d75eg3c91g4cbbga5bfg630ab9140b12"
msgid "Nervous? I've an inkling you've reason to be."
msgstr "긴장돼? 이유가 짐작되는 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08a5cbdd-f197-53b3-95ef-3fe35236812c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_RevealedArtifact = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:08a5cbdd-f197-53b3-95ef-3fe35236812c
msgctxt "hf990389agb605g48e7gac93g8ca3db7d956d"
msgid "Fine - here. <i>(Show Jaheira the artefact.)</i>"
msgstr "알았어요, 여기. <i>(자헤이라에게 아티팩트를 보여준다.)</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 0ad5dec6-dd65-2ce6-9e5c-1bb88ba14efa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_WasVouchedFor = True
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_MolVouched = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:0ad5dec6-dd65-2ce6-9e5c-1bb88ba14efa
msgctxt "ha7e0cbb1gc8d1g4f2bgb450gc829415485f8"
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr "멈춰요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0bd2fadf-9abc-2d4e-fa33-c31e0108db6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_PlayerSaidName(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:0bd2fadf-9abc-2d4e-fa33-c31e0108db6a
msgctxt "h1fab09f9g6703g4af1ga8f3g65b1e4f9a1b3"
msgid ""
"I'm [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. I walk my own "
"path, and mean you no harm - for now."
msgstr ""
"나는 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. 난 내 길을 갈뿐이고 당신을 해칠 "
"생각은 없어 - 우선 당장은."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Harper Elifer
#. NodeID = 0d5f9611-4be9-7203-3f39-2d346de04481
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:0d5f9611-4be9-7203-3f39-2d346de04481
msgctxt "h7adbdc49g88bdg4f8agbcedg046615b0818c"
msgid "We'll see how charmed you are in a minute."
msgstr "그쪽이 얼마나 매력적인지는 두고 볼 일이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 0f30040b-4149-8810-17fa-a4457fed343a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:0f30040b-4149-8810-17fa-a4457fed343a
msgctxt "h974460bag5e9cg44ecgb0c3g0a3b7b79e4d2"
msgid ""
"Hah! Well I am certainly no innocent, paladin - so I'll bind you with vines "
"a moment longer, if you do not mind."
msgstr "하! 난 순진한 사람이 아니야, 팔라딘 - 그러니 괜찮다면 널 덩굴로 조금만 더 묶어 놓겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 10714044-47f0-5d93-acf6-f0f1a29cb5b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:10714044-47f0-5d93-acf6-f0f1a29cb5b4
msgctxt "hccd7247bg73b6g4304gb011g5e6d7460b0f3"
msgid "You have me at a disadvantage. Let me correct that."
msgstr "날 알고 있다니 - 불리한 입장에 섰군. 전략을 바꿔야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 117e94a8-951d-d98d-1867-eaead01325c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:117e94a8-951d-d98d-1867-eaead01325c6
msgctxt "h6cf8230fg076cg4b1egb944gd90ae6e32cde"
msgid "A pathetic deception - I know who you <i>really </i>worship, True Soul."
msgstr "형편없는 속임수로군. 난 네가 <i>진정으로</i> 섬기는 자가 누구인지 잘 알고 있다, 참된 영혼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 142a7b57-0b08-2c9b-202e-2e75281d3fcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_ANCIENTS(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_PlayerSaidName(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:142a7b57-0b08-2c9b-202e-2e75281d3fcd
msgctxt "h689a6dcdg711bg4ef5gba19ga14ea7f42930"
msgid ""
"I'm [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. I've sworn an "
"oath to protect nature, and her creatures, from evil. I mean you no harm."
msgstr ""
"저는 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]입니다. 저는 자연과 그 피조물을 "
"악으로부터 보호하겠다고 맹세했습니다. 저는 당신을 해치지 않습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 194ba4ce-2ec4-21ae-8a4a-b29baf8003ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:194ba4ce-2ec4-21ae-8a4a-b29baf8003ac
msgctxt "h8e54ccc7g6a00g4687g802dg7c3254b70eff"
msgid "So far it's been a life-saver. Here's hoping you agree."
msgstr "지금까진 목숨을 구해준 물건입니다. 당신도 알아 줬으면 좋겠군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 19f38859-7c05-4ed8-55e9-8f5c551b5a6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:19f38859-7c05-4ed8-55e9-8f5c551b5a6e
msgctxt "h478772e7g04b9g476fga4a5g9f197b23c47e"
msgid "Marcus? He's been with us from the beginning. Since..."
msgstr "마커스? 애초부터 우리와 함께 했었어. 언제부터더라..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 19ffc8f1-9306-a214-d1f5-b938202011c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:19ffc8f1-9306-a214-d1f5-b938202011c6
msgctxt "h677af5c2gc51bg45b6g9968gbb47abbaa258"
msgid "Is this true?"
msgstr "정말 사실인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 20594dec-b098-4d22-b5de-bc752ac8e92a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(13) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(13) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:20594dec-b098-4d22-b5de-bc752ac8e92a
msgctxt "h50108d53g2d2bg4cbag83f6g4ccd8ba1a7c5"
msgid ""
"A True Soul! Play along for the minute - we can kick his arse afterward."
msgstr "참된 영혼! 잠시만 어울려 주자고 - 궁둥짝은 나중에 걷어차 주면 되니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 2701fa89-0953-6fa5-90b3-8e504c9f145a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:2701fa89-0953-6fa5-90b3-8e504c9f145a
msgctxt "ha80dde16g009cg49e1g9c50g58819473f446"
msgid "Vaguely."
msgstr "어렴풋한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2727cb98-3146-d67b-50ec-f0f7c3b85526
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType:
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_Entangled = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:2727cb98-3146-d67b-50ec-f0f7c3b85526
msgctxt "h811370e6gfa2cg4794gb328g3c89c07b36b2"
msgid "<i>Force your own magic through the vines, weakening them.</i>"
msgstr "<i>덩굴에 마법을 사용하여 약화시킨다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 287ec2e4-ae82-34b3-5434-b7cd93f5e827
