msgctxt "h76449d72g6e6cg4e0ag9329g5a6a12af3c5b"
msgid "Who am I? Who in the hells are you?"
msgstr "내가 누구냐고? 그러는 넌 뭐하는 놈인데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ec3d31d-3068-6a10-77bb-473c611354b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:2ec3d31d-3068-6a10-77bb-473c611354b8
msgctxt "ha840f47ag5c4eg491fgb53agd3134eb487e6"
msgid ""
"Fascinating - both your command of magic and its technical implementation "
"are impeccable."
msgstr "인상적이야 - 마법의 사용과 그 기술적 구현에 있어 흠잡을 게 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3083f04e-22d5-729f-d9b2-1a35f6338b1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:3083f04e-22d5-729f-d9b2-1a35f6338b1e
msgctxt "h3e68380eg7f6dg47d2ga6eag4d434322d550"
msgid "Holy shit. It's really you. <i>The </i>Jaheira."
msgstr "이런 젠장. 정말 당신이군요. <i>그 유명한</i> 자헤이라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 320bf77e-0b6a-fa56-e329-221d2a0b161e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_PlayerSaidName(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:320bf77e-0b6a-fa56-e329-221d2a0b161e
msgctxt "h91313279g7373g4e3fgba45g08e0d4c0a93d"
msgid ""
"The name's [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. Jack of "
"all trades, master of <i>plenty</i>. Charmed, I'm sure."
msgstr ""
"이름은 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. 할 수 있는 것도 많고, 심지어 "
"<i>다 잘하지</i>. 거기다. 매력적이고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 330e2908-054b-d8c3-4413-df6af2ee7062
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:330e2908-054b-d8c3-4413-df6af2ee7062
msgctxt "h7744de1ag9579g4833gb61fg7ff73f0f5efa"
msgid "Back off. <i>Now.</i>"
msgstr "물러서. <i>당장.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Fist Marcus
#. NodeID = 3462439b-d838-840b-c5fb-9be63f60e099
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:3462439b-d838-840b-c5fb-9be63f60e099
msgctxt "h9aaf340cgc57dg4f80g9523g497ed0e65957"
msgid ""
"<i>If you want to survive this, then trust me - one True Soul to another.</i>"
msgstr "<i>여기서 살아남고 싶다면, 날 믿어. 참된 영혼끼리 뭉쳐야지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 363817dc-6c53-3d6a-9398-2598da4c6169
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:363817dc-6c53-3d6a-9398-2598da4c6169
msgctxt "h2268e4cfg6dfeg4bd0ga15eg3bd5c4421390"
msgid ""
"I've met no sorcerer that powerful - and I've met many. Now, speak plain - "
"<i>how do you have control?</i>"
msgstr "많은 소서러들을 만나봤지만 이렇게 강력한 이는 처음이야. 이제 실토해, <i>어떻게 네 자신을 통제하고 있는 거지?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36c8bd33-4615-463a-537a-384012c139b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_HasSavedHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:36c8bd33-4615-463a-537a-384012c139b5
msgctxt "h74d61df4g24afg4961g8882g60050b5ff832"
msgid "<i>Look to the Harpers you saved.</i>"
msgstr "<i>구해줬던 하퍼들을 바라본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 37d283ab-81d4-5d2f-311e-1fc514c5ffd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:37d283ab-81d4-5d2f-311e-1fc514c5ffd7
msgctxt "hbe17a9a1g6f4cg44b4g8ec4gb45245ea8590"
msgid "You're just in time for happy hour."
msgstr "해피 아워에 딱 맞춰서 왔네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 398d148a-5d9f-6060-c648-c8742dc5c2fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:398d148a-5d9f-6060-c648-c8742dc5c2fd
msgctxt "he0c226e7g30a0g476dg96adgc8a78b20d4d6"
msgid "Ever so sorry to hear that."
msgstr "그런 말을 듣다니 유감이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39d49370-3928-4d63-e005-447c6c0f45c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:39d49370-3928-4d63-e005-447c6c0f45c0
msgctxt "hcdf9a304gbd12g409bg8593g3aba91c94cc5"
msgid "<i>Beseech your patron to help you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>계약의 후원자에게 도움을 요청한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a47b92b-5e27-ebba-7eaa-6270c0ea6632
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_RevealedArtifact = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:3a47b92b-5e27-ebba-7eaa-6270c0ea6632
msgctxt "h58956704g0fbcg4e71gbeb2gd96f8b5279c7"
msgid "<i>Tell Jaheira everything you know about the artefact.</i>"
msgstr "<i>자헤이라에게 당신이 아티팩트에 대해 아는 것을 모두 말한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 3b5bf61a-dae0-2099-cb70-f900b2259fc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_GainedAccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:3b5bf61a-dae0-2099-cb70-f900b2259fc7
msgctxt "h45ec3b95gdf58g499fgb445g52b9c0db10b7"
msgid "Hear me, Harpers! All clear, at ease!"
msgstr "하퍼들, 들어라! 이상 없다, 편히 쉬어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 3bbf9636-b530-65c6-557d-b3a959e3ec18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:3bbf9636-b530-65c6-557d-b3a959e3ec18
msgctxt "hc6c39e5bg1ccfg4a73g9045gae70d12bfa1f"
msgid ""
"As for you - you exposed a True Soul in our midst. You're no puppet of the "
"Absolute, are you?"
msgstr "넌 우리들 한 가운데에 와서 참된 영혼인걸 드러냈어. 넌 절대자의 꼭두각시가 아니군, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 3c627694-469c-c827-0bef-da985723877e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:3c627694-469c-c827-0bef-da985723877e
msgctxt "h724a3ae0gacefg4e06g8555gb543d48738d0"
msgid "A level head. Let us see if you will get to keep it."
msgstr "침착하군. 언제까지 그렇게 침착할 수 있을지 두고 보겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d12461d-4e71-c180-06e5-5054335c9895
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:3d12461d-4e71-c180-06e5-5054335c9895
msgctxt "heb5cc819gbe89g44d1g9d3ag853e182edac5"
msgid "My intentions are my own."
msgstr "난 내가 하고 싶은 대로 합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Fist Marcus
#. NodeID = 3d2aece4-4bd9-eb4a-8a83-203013997551
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Event_SetSurprisedNextCombat(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.     - ACT2_HAV_SUMMONREADY(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:3d2aece4-4bd9-eb4a-8a83-203013997551
msgctxt "h3bc1132aga623g4660gaf69gc7d64c914f87"
msgid ""
"<i>You, most of all, will suffer for this blasphemy. Your life is mine, but "
"in death you will belong to the General.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>특히 네 녀석은, 이 신성모독에 대한 죗값을 치르게 해 주겠다. 네 목숨은 내가 끊어주마. 그리고 죽은 뒤에는 장군님을 섬기게 해 "
"주지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42164f30-7155-d54c-64e2-7d3f84013d72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:42164f30-7155-d54c-64e2-7d3f84013d72
msgctxt "h8805944ag623dg4e09g9b8egd7340fa0db4f"
msgid "At least give me a<i> chance</i> to earn your trust."
msgstr "적어도 당신의 신뢰를 얻을 <i>기회</i>는 줬으면 해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4391c5d4-cb8c-28da-00fd-3c0c7fda40ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_PlayerSaidName(5) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:4391c5d4-cb8c-28da-00fd-3c0c7fda40ec
msgctxt "h095dc686g86c6g4dfbg8731g564c3d0cf613"
msgid "I am Wyll, the Blade of Frontiers. Perhaps you've heard of me?"
msgstr "저는 변경의 칼날, 윌입니다. 들어본 적 없으신지요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 458a5b59-ba69-4e55-bc63-8b2883906f10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(10) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(10) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:458a5b59-ba69-4e55-bc63-8b2883906f10
msgctxt "hbd13e317g62a2g4353g91edg558c3944737f"
msgid "If the True Soul wants to help, so be it. We're in no state to refuse."
msgstr "참된 영혼이 돕겠다고 하면 내버려 둬. 우리가 도움을 거절할 처지는 아니잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 46263ef0-0e69-7c2f-0970-37031e12f5dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:46263ef0-0e69-7c2f-0970-37031e12f5dd
msgctxt "hdb6e6369g8f25g4d9fga8ebgec2d74fdcada"
msgid "You should never have come here, True Soul."
msgstr "여길 오지 말았어야 했어, 참된 영혼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 49944998-d57a-e238-bab6-ec72c9498394
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:49944998-d57a-e238-bab6-ec72c9498394
msgctxt "hb114ae3cg8c88g48bdga4cdged3ef31af0f3"
msgid "What in the hells is that thing?"
msgstr "그게 도대체 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Harper Karrow
#. NodeID = 49b70cdd-0a63-b09e-54c1-37eabc2bf180
