"as his voice reverberates in your mind.*"
msgstr ""
"*남자는 당신과 눈을 맞춥니다만, 처음 보는 자입니다. 그의 목소리가 당신의 머릿속에 울려 퍼질 때, 강렬한 어지럼증만이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Fist Marcus
#. NodeID = 62d6502f-a9ab-58e9-18ed-705369a8de69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:62d6502f-a9ab-58e9-18ed-705369a8de69
msgctxt "h98480e13g4ee0g4a59gb1e3gc78051b6519b"
msgid ""
"The Absolute has given me many gifts already. She'll give me so much more "
"when all of you are dead."
msgstr "절대자께선 이미 내게 많은 선물을 주셨다. 너희 모두를 죽이고 나면 더 많은 걸 내려주시겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 65641c3e-7c88-4891-bdef-2e810d256632
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(12) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(12) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:65641c3e-7c88-4891-bdef-2e810d256632
msgctxt "h260c951bg5621g4da0ga430g929e04c579b8"
msgid "Play along with the Fist. We can deal with him later."
msgstr "피스트가 하라는대로 해. 그는 나중에 처리할 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 674e9713-7fc3-692a-7ac6-c0a0c20244e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_Entangled = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_AttackedJaheira = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:674e9713-7fc3-692a-7ac6-c0a0c20244e1
msgctxt "h3c386776g6b7fg44ecg9f3dgba0f90c73c7b"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69211b28-3106-1604-a241-82330722564d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:69211b28-3106-1604-a241-82330722564d
msgctxt "h1ecc2870g00f3g4771g9ee3gb5dee411bc22"
msgid ""
"If I have to rip these vines apart, I will. And then I'll do the same to you."
msgstr "내가 이 덩굴을 갈갈이 찢어야 한다면 그리 할 거야. 그러고 나서 너도 똑같이 해주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 6a788bde-b462-905f-9b64-42f98363d3fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:6a788bde-b462-905f-9b64-42f98363d3fb
msgctxt "hf6e86b86ge344g45beg9b0bge46ef8772cd8"
msgid "She's the one who protected the Emerald Grove?"
msgstr "이자가 에메랄드 숲을 보호한 사람이라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 6a788bde-b462-905f-9b64-42f98363d3fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:6a788bde-b462-905f-9b64-42f98363d3fb
msgctxt "hcba50d11g34dbg4883g8a84g95ca56fe2215"
msgid "He's the one who protected the Emerald Grove?"
msgstr "이자가 에메랄드 숲을 보호한 사람이라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 6a788bde-b462-905f-9b64-42f98363d3fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:6a788bde-b462-905f-9b64-42f98363d3fb
msgctxt "h936ca877g5e1fg438cg8394gc24a93859c46"
msgid "They're the one who protected the Emerald Grove?"
msgstr "이자가 에메랄드 숲을 보호한 사람이라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 6a94eebe-6cb7-f638-709d-9081faa879fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_BrokeVines(5) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_Entangled = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:6a94eebe-6cb7-f638-709d-9081faa879fc
msgctxt "h61cce3d3g62f3g45c2ga651gfc2adac41d7c"
msgid "Stand down, or we'll <i>put </i>you down."
msgstr "물러서. 아님 우리가 물러서게 <i>해 주지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a96da8a-a3ef-aac7-4bda-10382df43936
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:6a96da8a-a3ef-aac7-4bda-10382df43936
msgctxt "h034f36d0gc7ccg4cb8g9e22ge64b40b22747"
msgid "I am not... a True Soul..."
msgstr "난 참된 영혼이... 아니야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c6ad6f6-eb5c-e0c6-12a1-e7ffdbe3ebcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_PlayerSaidName(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:6c6ad6f6-eb5c-e0c6-12a1-e7ffdbe3ebcd
msgctxt "h8752f5eegfc3eg4803g9bf5ge621204c7393"
msgid ""
"I'm [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. I've sworn an "
"oath to deliver justice at any cost. Unless you harm another, you are safe "
"from me."
msgstr ""
"전 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]입니다. 어떤 대가를 치르더라도 정의를 "
"구현하겠노라 맹세했습니다. 다른 이를 해치지 않는 한 당신은 나의 적이 아닙니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Harper Elifer
#. NodeID = 6cc2c43e-bda1-f74a-ab79-3ba957a00314
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:6cc2c43e-bda1-f74a-ab79-3ba957a00314
msgctxt "h4e671289g84bfg427cg827ag0ce348ffe9fa"
msgid ""
"No doubt a wizard has opinions on this darkness - <i>she</i> will want to "
"meet you."
msgstr "마법사인만큼 이 어둠 속에서 할말이 많겠지 - <i>그녀</i>를 만나러 가지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d6c3a90-b47c-dfcc-6bdf-06a1cb7e951d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:6d6c3a90-b47c-dfcc-6bdf-06a1cb7e951d
msgctxt "h4150c7f2ge04cg4ef5gb3b0ge09eea61333c"
msgid ""
"A preposterous experiment - the tadpole could be reacting to <i>anything</"
"i>. Let me GO!"
msgstr "말도 안 되는 시험이야. 올챙이가 <i>어디에</i> 반응하는 건지 어떻게 알아. 풀어줘!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Fist Marcus
#. NodeID = 6def0776-5c55-47da-885b-9f5e8e29c134
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:6def0776-5c55-47da-885b-9f5e8e29c134
msgctxt "h27f61bd3gaf07g49b4g93f4gf9fd9c5b8a6e"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "뭐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ee4c134-bd78-9c03-2af2-d9deeefc3f78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:6ee4c134-bd78-9c03-2af2-d9deeefc3f78
msgctxt "hd8df39f2g4528g400dga774gf274aea06b47"
msgid "Hold. I can explain everything."
msgstr "잠깐. 다 설명할 수 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 6f2ba800-d2bd-7d11-9f23-e529f8f02fb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_HarpyMeal_Event_KidReturnHideout = True
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_KidFreed = False
#.      - DEN_Hideout_Event_BefriendedThieflings = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:6f2ba800-d2bd-7d11-9f23-e529f8f02fb6
msgctxt "h8a57559fgd578g4050g9ea7g5320912ab352"
msgid "Plucked my friend right out of a harpy's talons."
msgstr "제 친구를 하피의 발톱에서 빼내 오기도 했다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71bc7050-1067-c775-2d56-07b920eb2df8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:71bc7050-1067-c775-2d56-07b920eb2df8
msgctxt "hdff0d806gb84cg4bb4ga85bg6975a96cf447"
msgid ""
"If you let me go, I'll happily amend the tales. Add a 'hates strangers' "
"footnote."
msgstr "날 풀어주면, 이야기들을 고쳐드리죠. '낯선 사람을 싫어함'이라고 주석을 달게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Fist Marcus
#. NodeID = 71c23bc4-6604-bb57-6b7e-f7507b96482a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:71c23bc4-6604-bb57-6b7e-f7507b96482a
msgctxt "h01912cc1g321dg414agbd44g5772fbbe79f6"
msgid "Jaheira, come now. This one's parasite has dug a little too deep, eh?"
msgstr "자헤이라, 진정해요. 이 녀석 기생충이 뇌를 좀 파 먹은 모양인데, 안 그래요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7205d738-7534-9c7b-75d4-b490fad6cbe9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:7205d738-7534-9c7b-75d4-b490fad6cbe9
msgctxt "h2415ab56g17c0g4586g9110g858b742fab4e"
msgid "You're <i>the</i> Jaheira? I have heard of you, Friend of the Forest."
msgstr "당신이 <i>그 유명한</i> '숲의 친구' 자헤이라인가요? 당신에 대해 들어본 적 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Harper Elifer
#. NodeID = 7438b587-8387-1404-8bf9-39fa196e452e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:7438b587-8387-1404-8bf9-39fa196e452e
msgctxt "h4f45971bg6c53g4420gabfbg1be22e3363b2"
msgid "A cleric? You'll find no quarter here - for you, or the one you serve."
msgstr "클레릭 이라고? 여기에선 땡전 한 푼 구할 수 없을 텐데? 널 섬기려고 하는 사람도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 748c67d7-eb78-66c2-cce2-98c6cc5ee8f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_DEVOTION(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_PlayerSaidName(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:748c67d7-eb78-66c2-cce2-98c6cc5ee8f4
msgctxt "h7dc00b6ag1a08g40bbg8fd2g857330b919be"
msgid ""
"I'm [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. I've sworn an "
"oath to protect the innocent and fight for justice - I mean no harm."
msgstr ""
"전 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]입니다. 결백한 자들을 보호하고 정의를 "
"위해 싸울 것을 맹세했습니다. 문제가 되지 않을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 7fbe8687-da11-14d1-faae-cbc3492cebe6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:7fbe8687-da11-14d1-faae-cbc3492cebe6
msgctxt "h0ee5bb5agad80g4744g84e1g31bb1ea3b22a"
msgid "Not good enough."
msgstr "그걸로는 충분치 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 811efd0e-5e13-d085-e1a3-679087d62738
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:811efd0e-5e13-d085-e1a3-679087d62738
msgctxt "ha1087ca5gc2f7g47afg99ffg327de69be3f5"
msgid "I work in mysterious ways."
msgstr "전 신비로운 방식에 통달했습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 84eafdb9-da8c-fa7b-ea7b-a9c1bd164552
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:84eafdb9-da8c-fa7b-ea7b-a9c1bd164552
msgctxt "had3953dbga4e7g41c9g9cc4g2837dda51602"
msgid "Easy. Give me a chance to earn your trust."
msgstr "진정하고 설명할 기회를 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 86d201a1-9625-75cf-5b94-524e07f7d8bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:86d201a1-9625-75cf-5b94-524e07f7d8bb
msgctxt "hf9a04ce8gca30g473bg8cefg0d99431f0ec3"
msgid ""
"An act of kindness, or a clever decoy. Luckily, I know how to find out which."
msgstr "친절함이거나 영리한 속임수 둘 중 하나겠지. 다행히 어느 쪽인지 알아낼 방법이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8904e15f-06b5-51ed-fd25-4781cae2fe9b
#. HandlePath = RollAdvantageReason
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_BrokeVines(5) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_FlamingSpyRevealed = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:8904e15f-06b5-51ed-fd25-4781cae2fe9b
msgctxt "hac6ec2aeg0c5dg45c8gb9e9ge297fe2a5c4d"
msgid "You broke free from the vines but haven't attacked."
msgstr "덩굴을 떨쳐냈지만 공격하지 않음"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8904e15f-06b5-51ed-fd25-4781cae2fe9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_BrokeVines(5) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_FlamingSpyRevealed = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:8904e15f-06b5-51ed-fd25-4781cae2fe9b
msgctxt "hee3db593gf38eg4a81gad46g56af6dd56fca"
msgid ""
"I know it's hard to trust anyone right now, but believe me: I am <i>not </"
"i>an Absolute cultist."
msgstr "지금은 누군가를 믿는다는 게 쉽지 않겠지만, 그래도 믿어주세요. 전 절대자의 추종자가 <i>아닙니다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 89407a48-ea07-8d7c-0098-f8dd21642e97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_ClawsKilledLongAgo = False
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_Event_ClawsKilled = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:89407a48-ea07-8d7c-0098-f8dd21642e97
msgctxt "h7c220518ga13cg409egacf8g36d55e3996b8"
msgid "Bah! Vile things that befit a vile traitor."
msgstr "하! 사악한 반역자에 걸맞는 사악한 물건이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8a6965c9-3ff3-3b08-c65d-e1d5fa8d320a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Strength
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_Entangled = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(5) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:8a6965c9-3ff3-3b08-c65d-e1d5fa8d320a
msgctxt "h11ce5732g643eg4f9cg8d2bg18def329db7e"
msgid "<i>Rage against the vines.</i>"
msgstr "<i>덩굴에 분노를 쏟아낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8bb08380-a876-08d3-df27-f8238f27d1d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:8bb08380-a876-08d3-df27-f8238f27d1d8
msgctxt "h9ef5c410g6863g4ddcgbc94g3fd40f834ab6"
msgid "Your guess is as good as mine."
msgstr "모르기는 나도 마찬가지입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8ccfdb35-45cb-c6cd-1b8d-d57ad7481c80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:8ccfdb35-45cb-c6cd-1b8d-d57ad7481c80
msgctxt "h237e0c22g5c73g421cg93f1g6555b21a799e"
msgid "This land is afflicted - rotten. I am here to restore nature's will."
msgstr "이 땅은 병들고 부패했어요. 난 이곳에 자연의 의지를 회복하기 위해 왔습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 8d1d85bc-4262-fb94-c16e-d1c3d58e7928
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:8d1d85bc-4262-fb94-c16e-d1c3d58e7928
msgctxt "h3cbe108ag692cg4b19g8590gd3c3a3d10e27"
msgid "Enlighten me. <i>Now.</i>"
msgstr "이해시켜봐. <i>당장.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 8d85bff7-e57c-408c-8b4a-29c1a4fd2628
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(11) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(11) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:8d85bff7-e57c-408c-8b4a-29c1a4fd2628
msgctxt "hcc51c130ga5f1g4f78ga799gbf122bf13276"
msgid ""
"That tadpoled Fist thinks we're his allies. No need to correct him just yet, "
"if he can help us."
msgstr "저 감염된 피스트 대원은 우리가 자기 편인 줄 아나 봐. 도움을 받을 수만 있다면, 굳이 정정하게 두지 말자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 8e4a9dbc-fbfd-78a6-c0e8-3d026b137b1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_Entangled = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:8e4a9dbc-fbfd-78a6-c0e8-3d026b137b1c
msgctxt "hb4b215e7g6ee1g489agb753g7cbe0d18d2aa"
msgid "Congratulations. You've earned yourself the benefit of the doubt."
msgstr "축하해. 조금은 믿어 보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 8f77b6cc-a3cd-467d-bd92-b3a544024e22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:8f77b6cc-a3cd-467d-bd92-b3a544024e22
msgctxt "h94885b00g6697g49d1gb424g7ad1cb30455f"
msgid ""
"Strangest magic I've seen since roaming the ruins of Myth Drannor, but I "
"can't argue with the results."
msgstr "이 미스 드래놀의 폐허를 돌아다니며 본 것 중 가장 이상한 마법이군. 그렇지만 그 효과만큼은 의심할 수 없겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9633aab8-d8ca-40dd-6fa2-bc6fe5fadf1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_ReturnCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:9633aab8-d8ca-40dd-6fa2-bc6fe5fadf1d
msgctxt "h33bbe245g02b7g4fd9gb8e9g3c9dec566d95"
msgid "I've come from Moonrise Towers - I just freed some prisoners there."
msgstr "문라이즈 타워의 죄수들을 풀어주고 돌아오는 길이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 964ce1c3-fa70-6f49-1646-6b7965a1cf9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:964ce1c3-fa70-6f49-1646-6b7965a1cf9f
msgctxt "h67cda524gc38dg4febg85ffge461916977ae"
msgid "This is why we're here, you see."
msgstr "보이나? 이게 우리가 여기 서 있는 이유야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 970c0e2e-946c-2d26-f3d4-b15edafbff02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_PlayerSaidName(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:970c0e2e-946c-2d26-f3d4-b15edafbff02
msgctxt "haf747b4cg51cdg4fe9g9c32g8cdee1accbb8"
msgid ""
"I'm [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53] - a master of "
"magic, and the secrets it holds."
msgstr ""
"나는 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53] - 마법의 대가이며, 그 비밀을 "
"간직하고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 972ff43c-9bdc-2a97-e8c5-9b1a02f7382f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_HasSavedHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:972ff43c-9bdc-2a97-e8c5-9b1a02f7382f
msgctxt "ha572c0eege826g4e6agb381gf2da6b36af0b"
msgid "I saved your soldiers and this is the thanks I get?"
msgstr "당신 부하들을 구해줬건만, 이게 그에 대한 감사 표현인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 986d501b-5a2f-e6a1-c051-f93f2556e146
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_ReturnCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:986d501b-5a2f-e6a1-c051-f93f2556e146
msgctxt "h659e0475gdac1g4359g8c9bg18e4db003964"
msgid ""
"Please - I've already saved some people imprisoned by Absolute cultists. I'm "
"here to help."
msgstr "제발, 난 이미 절대자의 추종자들에게 붙잡힌 이들까지 구해냈어. 난 여기 돕기 위해 온 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 989374b5-0dd9-c038-dbc6-69ddb3c25ccd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_PlayerSaidName(5) = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:989374b5-0dd9-c038-dbc6-69ddb3c25ccd
msgctxt "he86a1741g3adag4408gb3b1gdfea336b2fba"
msgid ""
"I'm [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. Pleased to meet "
"you."
msgstr ""
"나는 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53] (이)라고 한다. 만나서 반갑군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 989374b5-0dd9-c038-dbc6-69ddb3c25ccd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_PlayerSaidName(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:989374b5-0dd9-c038-dbc6-69ddb3c25ccd
msgctxt "ha8b44bbdg2806g4ebdg8bf0g31ed4272e288"
msgid "I am Lae'zel. It is your pleasure to meet me."
msgstr "난 레이젤이라 한다. 날 만나서 영광이겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Harper Elifer
#. NodeID = 98ec2c85-faed-6679-f748-c9394bf29c3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:98ec2c85-faed-6679-f748-c9394bf29c3e
msgctxt "he14c329egc5ecg4ea3g9c81g873c7002ab21"
msgid "Sure you are."
msgstr "물론 그렇겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = 99786d72-1f34-8e35-370f-2ff31981366b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_HarpyMeal_Event_KidReturnHideout = False
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_KidFreed = True
#.      - DEN_Hideout_Event_BefriendedThieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:99786d72-1f34-8e35-370f-2ff31981366b
msgctxt "h75f72764gef00g4c7cgbdd3g34703539a186"
msgid ""
"Saved one of my friends from a druid with a snake. Knows when to be "
"discreet, too."
msgstr "뱀을 부리는 드루이드에게서 제 친구를 구해 줬어요. 신중할 때는 신중할 줄도 알고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a0173fc-10fb-9a2d-5bd5-8dfdda59fec8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:9a0173fc-10fb-9a2d-5bd5-8dfdda59fec8
msgctxt "h0c9f764fg4732g4bc7gafc0g4598a21f4398"
msgid "So it would seem. Did you hear that I saved your soldiers?"
msgstr "그렇군요. 제가 당신의 부하들을 구했다는 이야기는 들으셨나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 9a06ca4b-3eff-4a37-a561-b6445ff5143e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:9a06ca4b-3eff-4a37-a561-b6445ff5143e
msgctxt "hda51580eg6b62g427ag9504g6cae040af169"
msgid ""
"A good start - but you've told me something I already know. Tell me "
"something I don't."
msgstr "괜찮은 접근인데 - 하지만 내가 이미 아는 걸 말했지 않나. 이제 내가 모르는 걸 말해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9a7bee01-14b6-58d3-4a9f-d908612d66ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: WARLOCK_ARCHFEY
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:9a7bee01-14b6-58d3-4a9f-d908612d66ae
msgctxt "h62d8b9cfgd66eg4b4dga9fbg5e1ba59ae6d5"
msgid ""
"*You feel your request leave this plane, and carry like a whisper on the "
"Feywild's winds. There is no response.*"
msgstr "*당신은 당신의 요청이 이 차원계를 떠나 페이와일드의 바람을 타고 속삭임처럼 옮겨지는 것을 느낍니다. 응답은 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9a7bee01-14b6-58d3-4a9f-d908612d66ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: WARLOCK_FIEND
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:9a7bee01-14b6-58d3-4a9f-d908612d66ae
msgctxt "h6b3d7375g56bdg4e5bga4f0ga730310f664f"
msgid ""
"*Your request leaves this plane, barrelling through the fires of Avernus and "
"frost of Stygia. There is no response.*"
msgstr "*당신의 기도는 이곳을 떠나 스티지아의 서리와 아베르누스의 불길을 헤쳐 나가지만 응답이 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9a7bee01-14b6-58d3-4a9f-d908612d66ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: WARLOCK_GREAT_OLD_ONE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:9a7bee01-14b6-58d3-4a9f-d908612d66ae
msgctxt "h6698571bgb182g41c7gad45gd2d4b28930b7"
msgid ""
"*Your request falls deep into the nameless reaches of your patron's home "
"plane. It seems to be met with deafening silence.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 요청은 후원자의 고향 차원계 어딘가 이름 모를 구석까지 깊숙이 하강합니다. 귀가 먹먹할 정도의 침묵이 들려오는 듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9cd9d16c-5b0b-a514-da17-ebf6a140729b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint_StatedCure = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:9cd9d16c-5b0b-a514-da17-ebf6a140729b
msgctxt "h07ce0187g547ag4538gb90fgce0b30006b03"
msgid ""
"I just want a cure for the parasite in my head. Moonrise Towers is my only "
"lead."
msgstr "제 머릿속 기생충을 치료하고 싶을 뿐입니다. 문라이즈 타워가 유일한 실마리를 가지고 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d97d20a-073e-08ea-2a31-f881a53c1e32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:9d97d20a-073e-08ea-2a31-f881a53c1e32
msgctxt "h6d77bdbfg151dg4215gb719g90476099737a"
msgid ""
"If this is supposed to scare me, it won't work - monks are not so easily "
"cowed."
msgstr "나를 겁박하려는 의도였다면 소용 없어. 몽크는 그렇게 쉽게 겁먹지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9dd2b962-b832-34ae-de39-3b4bab20d329
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_RevealedArtifact = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:9dd2b962-b832-34ae-de39-3b4bab20d329
msgctxt "h47ce786fgd40dg4bbag85e6g9390a5c78e6d"
msgid "I suspect this icosahedral artefact is involved. <i>(Show Jaheira.)</i>"
msgstr "이 이십면체 아티팩트와 연관 있다고 생각합니다. <i>(자헤이라에게 보여준다)</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f14c44d-5168-f043-a2c2-67704a7f3863
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:9f14c44d-5168-f043-a2c2-67704a7f3863
msgctxt "h84309f36g1150g432fg9e6eg72bd240ee01f"
msgid "I'm here on holiday."
msgstr "놀러 왔죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f2a281d-7c28-ca84-47d5-31f3e621b4de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:9f2a281d-7c28-ca84-47d5-31f3e621b4de
msgctxt "h429ee779g90a9g4cd3g94e8g397cd26faf1c"
msgid ""
"How uncouth. Legends led me to expect better of the <i>noble</i> Jaheira."
msgstr "이렇게 무례할 수가. 전설 속 자헤이라는 <i>고귀하다</i>다고 들었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a008e285-7afd-3cf8-1d11-1613e8337852
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_HasSavedHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:a008e285-7afd-3cf8-1d11-1613e8337852
msgctxt "hdbbaf27bg1ea2g469dga533g929c3f5d17d5"
msgid "Something like that. Did you hear that I saved your soldiers?"
msgstr "그 비슷한 이야기였던 것 같아요. 내가 당신의 부하들을 구했다는 이야기는 들으셨나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a033fc18-8a0f-109f-f804-24df64e698f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_FlamingSpyRevealed = True
#.     - GLO_HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint_RevealedMarcus = True
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Event_SetSurprisedNextCombat(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:a033fc18-8a0f-109f-f804-24df64e698f7
msgctxt "hf2f89ba6g80beg4a6bg91c7g51de76ba9eb9"
msgid "You haven't tested <i>him</i>, have you? He's infected too."
msgstr "<i>저 남자</i>는 검사해보지 않았죠? 저 사람도 감염됐습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = a0c9b8d5-1784-423a-8893-58b37a9c86e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:a0c9b8d5-1784-423a-8893-58b37a9c86e4
msgctxt "h5d544b44gdc69g424cgbc96gf30abd73682c"
msgid ""
"Might as well take part in this Absolute charade if that buys us both time "
"and our lives."
msgstr "절대자 행세로 시간과 목숨을 챙길 수 있다면 그렇게 하자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1ee7a56-803c-b5ac-6bf9-9378909f1687
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:a1ee7a56-803c-b5ac-6bf9-9378909f1687
msgctxt "h0a860edfgcc16g40b3gb61cg891893221680"
msgid "You have to the count of five to let me go."
msgstr "다섯 세기 전까지 이거 푸는 게 좋을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a327f15b-dcee-8414-aa1a-7af89f94ca07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_PlayerSaidName(5) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GENERIC(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:a327f15b-dcee-8414-aa1a-7af89f94ca07
msgctxt "hcc13583ag6c09g40c6g82fcgcc74327592ba"
msgid ""
"Jaheira, is it? I'm [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53], "
"and I assure you none of this is necessary."
msgstr ""
"자헤이라 맞죠? 전 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]입니다. 장담하는데, "
"이럴 필요는 전혀 없습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = a33440b0-3829-db52-d9fd-0627b7f63403
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:a33440b0-3829-db52-d9fd-0627b7f63403
msgctxt "hca49f0b3g03d0g485eg9874g1a68c260670d"
msgid "You're about to."
msgstr "그렇게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a40d8ce9-e2ff-9885-9ac5-16b1cb7ab934
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:a40d8ce9-e2ff-9885-9ac5-16b1cb7ab934
msgctxt "h60b41cd2g33a8g430dg8bb1gef15656ffbff"
msgid ""
"The Weave itself burns through my veins - perhaps the tadpole is afraid."
msgstr "내 혈관에는 위브 자체가 넘쳐 흐르고 있습니다. 때문에 올챙이가 겁을 먹었겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Harper Elifer
#. NodeID = a619a4b8-441f-c049-34cd-e8aa76011fec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:a619a4b8-441f-c049-34cd-e8aa76011fec
msgctxt "ha2032f35g49a6g40e0g8cb4gb00849b21aa4"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "넌 누구야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = a696e6f2-9f85-0981-bab3-d453d83b02c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:a696e6f2-9f85-0981-bab3-d453d83b02c3
msgctxt "h4f98964eg4bbeg44f4ga0d0gdf00768439ab"
msgid "I'll be the judge of that."
msgstr "그건 내가 판단하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8831fe7-790b-d76d-9ca4-5e72b065c6a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(5) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_RevealedArtifact = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:a8831fe7-790b-d76d-9ca4-5e72b065c6a6
msgctxt "h1ea3c01bgcc71g420dga75bg8298782a9981"
msgid "Because of this artefact. <i>(Show Jaheira.)</i>"
msgstr "이 아티팩트 덕분이죠. <i>(자헤이라에게 보여준다)</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa7f5daa-6f67-b407-6736-76a8c4942600
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:aa7f5daa-6f67-b407-6736-76a8c4942600
msgctxt "h728ce24cg7c81g41fcgbb40ga4d3baee5795"
msgid "<i>Nod.</i>"
msgstr "<i>끄덕인다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ab679b80-ebc9-8981-f816-8cb5a442d335
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:ab679b80-ebc9-8981-f816-8cb5a442d335
msgctxt "h30cd49bcgcb14g4216ga7e0gf7dbe0e20578"
msgid "...When <i>did</i> you join us, Marcus?"
msgstr "...언제부터 우리와 함께 <i>했던</i> 거지, 마커스?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Fist Marcus
#. NodeID = ad8cba49-3829-8e6c-2619-f3d98e60f05c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:ad8cba49-3829-8e6c-2619-f3d98e60f05c
msgctxt "h456b8566g09c7g4decg8052gb0eb80d5bec7"
msgid "Hold on, Jaheira. I think I know this one."
msgstr "자헤이라 님, 잠시만요. 제가 아는 사람인 것 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Harper Elifer
#. NodeID = aeca80ad-e89e-79f9-1b99-6be718404a4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:aeca80ad-e89e-79f9-1b99-6be718404a4a
msgctxt "hf29795f0g36d4g475eg9c89g484f87487bb5"
msgid ""
"Hm. Convenient that a sorcerer would emerge from the darkness, of all places."
msgstr "흠. 소서러가 하필이면 어둠 속에서 나타나다니 안성맞춤인걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = b0dedb4c-c903-9f45-ca74-60677197d34e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_HarpyMeal_Event_KidReturnHideout = False
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_KidFreed = False
#.      - DEN_Hideout_Event_BefriendedThieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:b0dedb4c-c903-9f45-ca74-60677197d34e
msgctxt "h0e865f48g3d4eg4b14g9fb5g7ca8a4e18721"
msgid "Even caught us thieving and didn't make a thing of it."
msgstr "저희가 슬쩍하는 걸 잡았는데도 뭐라 하지도 않았어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = b149275d-8382-917f-7316-680b91f67ac8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:b149275d-8382-917f-7316-680b91f67ac8
msgctxt "h077ab8e9g2711g4d70g8750g23adba04a1c8"
msgid "You won't have to like them very long."
msgstr "불쾌함은 그리 오래 가지 않을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1d7a973-f75b-d6cb-d5ba-5569e06102fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:b1d7a973-f75b-d6cb-d5ba-5569e06102fc
msgctxt "h4bfc834dgd423g491aga804g738af6e00e0e"
msgid "I heard you were strong - smart. Seems I heard wrong."
msgstr "당신이 강하고 현명하다고 들었는데 - 보아하니 낭설인 모양이군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = b3c2720a-d11b-48a0-bf78-f60e6726e38e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:b3c2720a-d11b-48a0-bf78-f60e6726e38e
msgctxt "ha777c2eag31cdg4f67ga740ga344764d6d87"
msgid "They'll last long enough, 'magic incarnate'."
msgstr "덩굴은 풀리지 않을 거야. '마법 그 자체'씨."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = b4e5ea59-bafd-a897-cf35-4586e5d20d47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:b4e5ea59-bafd-a897-cf35-4586e5d20d47
msgctxt "h966a2ec9gdb68g430dg9292ge22520c3cbf2"
msgid ""
"Oh, but you ward something far more sinister than faith alone, don't you?"
msgstr "오, 하지만 너는 믿음보다 훨씬 사악한 걸 지니고 있잖아. 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Fist Marcus
#. NodeID = b805a2ff-f6f5-284f-c36b-fd0f8cac8633
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_Knows_FlamingFistIsSpy = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:b805a2ff-f6f5-284f-c36b-fd0f8cac8633
msgctxt "h452652e3g6011g49c5gae0cg42a52e32c62b"
msgid ""
"She's infected, aye - but she's not with the cultists. Helped me fight them "
"off a while back, in fact."
msgstr "이 사람이 감염되긴 했지만 추종자들과 한패는 아니에요. 오히려 얼마 전 추종자들과의 싸움에서 함께 싸워주기도 했다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Fist Marcus
#. NodeID = b805a2ff-f6f5-284f-c36b-fd0f8cac8633
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_Knows_FlamingFistIsSpy = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:b805a2ff-f6f5-284f-c36b-fd0f8cac8633
msgctxt "h1f1e39d7gfc7cg4488g87acg273013f64117"
msgid ""
"He's infected, aye - but he's not with the cultists. Helped me fight them "
"off a while back, in fact."
msgstr "이 사람이 감염되긴 했지만 추종자들과 한패는 아니에요. 오히려 얼마 전 추종자들과의 싸움에서 함께 싸워주기도 했다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Fist Marcus
#. NodeID = b805a2ff-f6f5-284f-c36b-fd0f8cac8633
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_Knows_FlamingFistIsSpy = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:b805a2ff-f6f5-284f-c36b-fd0f8cac8633
msgctxt "h84b7db81g2762g4f8ag9595g22a5720d4dfb"
msgid ""
"They're infected, aye - but they're not with the cultists. Helped me fight "
"them off a while back, in fact."
msgstr "이 사람이 감염되긴 했지만 추종자들과 한패는 아니에요. 오히려 얼마 전 추종자들과의 싸움에서 함께 싸워주기도 했다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ba3a91fb-bbae-4815-488a-47ce050681f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:ba3a91fb-bbae-4815-488a-47ce050681f0
msgctxt "h4755cde6gb57bg4e7ega022ge28bbe00381e"
msgid "Be on the alert, Harpers! We haven't seen the last of Marcus yet."
msgstr "하퍼들은 경계를 유지하라! 우린 아직 마커스의 마지막을 확인하지 못했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Harper Elifer
#. NodeID = bb4a4227-a7ea-155b-584b-6578c74adc0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:bb4a4227-a7ea-155b-584b-6578c74adc0d
msgctxt "h03c2498eg46e8g4c46gb04cg12cd338ad073"
msgid "You picked a strange place to meditate, monk."
msgstr "명상할 곳을 잘 못 골랐군, 몽크."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = bbd10707-6ed0-217a-2348-53b62e125ffb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:bbd10707-6ed0-217a-2348-53b62e125ffb
msgctxt "h457094b6ge1d9g4dd6g9f19g7a4b620130dd"
msgid ""
"It is a curious creature that hides all manner of secrets. But if there's "
"one thing that we know -"
msgstr "온갖 종류의 비밀을 간직하고 있는 기이한 생명체지. 하지만 우리가 아는 게 하나 있다면 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd2878c2-0359-503c-427b-bf97678ee0ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_PlayerSaidName(5) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:bd2878c2-0359-503c-427b-bf97678ee0ba
msgctxt "ha2aaf758g1c4ag4603g98edg7fc561ad58c3"
msgid ""
"I'm Shadowheart. I'd offer to shake your hand, but I'm in a spot of "
"difficulty."
msgstr "난 섀도하트야. 악수를 청하고 싶지만 약간 곤란한걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Harper Elifer
#. NodeID = bdeab3e6-01da-9f7e-b6c2-2d845614ab72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:bdeab3e6-01da-9f7e-b6c2-2d845614ab72
msgctxt "hb2efc794g1b92g4a82ga261g651a1309a473"
msgid "A fellow druid? <i>She</i> will want to meet you."
msgstr "같은 드루이드라고? <i>그녀</i>가 만나고 싶어할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Harper Elifer
#. NodeID = becb6b87-a129-4ac6-27c7-c2f1cc357bac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:becb6b87-a129-4ac6-27c7-c2f1cc357bac
msgctxt "hac46f8a7g66a7g42d3g936cgf171ed7dcfdb"
msgid "Just keep your hands where I can see them and follow me."
msgstr "손을 내가 볼 수 있게 하고 따라와."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = bf7f162c-b311-f151-639a-901dbbb2bdf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:bf7f162c-b311-f151-639a-901dbbb2bdf5
msgctxt "hce6dcd51g39b1g440egb7deg7ac75d1fbc3e"
msgid "It seems tales of my clemency have been greatly exaggerated."
msgstr "내 관용에 대한 이야기가 많이 부풀려진 모양인걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = c134309d-2e63-2cde-4009-55b07544384b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:c134309d-2e63-2cde-4009-55b07544384b
msgctxt "h07abe24cgb07dg46a8gbc59g829363718d42"
msgid "How is that possible?"
msgstr "어떻게 가능 한 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1fa05be-265e-b3b2-0eb1-331273b4311d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:c1fa05be-265e-b3b2-0eb1-331273b4311d
msgctxt "h25d3c26dgaf98g4266g9c01g6767a58e528e"
msgid "<i>Accept your fate.</i>"
msgstr "<i>운명을 받아들인다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Harper Elifer
#. NodeID = c2355eda-756f-4a4f-109b-4fe45b56b43a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
