msgctxt "h5c2a8514gb24bg4977gac07ge7aceb2b9431"
msgid "I have been named Faithwarden. I command you to release me."
msgstr "믿음지기의 이름으로 명합니다. 나를 풀어주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = de1983ef-f134-bd0e-c441-29254f3d4fd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WYLL_DEVIL(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:de1983ef-f134-bd0e-c441-29254f3d4fd4
msgctxt "hd32e9ee9gf444g4279gb2cdgd28d49cbe1a3"
msgid "I heard the Blade of Frontiers was a hero, not a hellspawn."
msgstr "변경의 칼날은 영웅이지, 지옥의 혈통이 아니라고 들었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de49dfa0-0e0c-2c41-f5db-9023ed192665
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_PlayerSaidName(5) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:de49dfa0-0e0c-2c41-f5db-9023ed192665
msgctxt "h60a19e54g9f40g4601ga6cfgf1996b2c766d"
msgid "The name's Astarion. And I rather dislike vines in uninvited places."
msgstr "제 이름은 아스타리온입니다. 그건 그렇고 이런 낯선 곳에서 덩굴이라... 불쾌하네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = deccd6db-3c29-9fc6-e691-ac6b0170457c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:deccd6db-3c29-9fc6-e691-ac6b0170457c
msgctxt "hd5db542cgf7d5g4f6eg9aecgb7edb3748131"
msgid "I mourn for whoever you were before the Absolute infected you."
msgstr "절대자에게 감염되기 전에 누구였든, 네 과거를 위해 애도하겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Mol
#. NodeID = dfb32e7a-58ec-7054-743a-6b9d99248c4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_HarpyMeal_Event_KidReturnHideout = True
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_KidFreed = True
#.      - DEN_Hideout_Event_BefriendedThieflings = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:dfb32e7a-58ec-7054-743a-6b9d99248c4a
msgctxt "h8fb6201fg2993g4ed0gaf80g782b77c1a835"
msgid ""
"Saved two of my friends - one from a harpy, and one from a mad druid with a "
"snake. Didn't make a fuss of our thieving, either."
msgstr ""
"제 친구 둘을 구해줬어요. 한 명은 하피로부터, 다른 한 명은 뱀이 있는 화난 드루이드에게서요. 저희가 도둑질을 해도 난리치지 않았어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = e035d98a-8cb3-b0ae-71b7-b8f0f991ccac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:e035d98a-8cb3-b0ae-71b7-b8f0f991ccac
msgctxt "h8fae962ag6ddcg4d97g8789gf8083cae52b8"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr "물론이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
