msgid ""
"There's food in the inn over there. Beds too if you require rest. Aloe oil "
"in the cupboard in case the vines gave you a rash."
msgstr "저쪽 여관에 음식이 있어. 휴식이 필요하면 침대도 있고. 덩굴 때문에 발진이 생겼다면 찬장에 알로에 오일도 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea8ea5b9-ec4f-7f3d-40b5-32ffd92df014
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType:
#. RollAbility: Strength
#. DifficultyClass: 15
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_Entangled = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:ea8ea5b9-ec4f-7f3d-40b5-32ffd92df014
msgctxt "h8602065fg579dg4791g9401gb811605a3c62"
msgid "<i>Force your own magic through vines, loosening them.</i>"
msgstr "<i>덩굴에 마법을 시전해 느슨하게 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ead0dc14-2936-a759-39c0-97308a919c06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:ead0dc14-2936-a759-39c0-97308a919c06
msgctxt "h73ba2f67gc1cbg46a8gb727g01972ab031b5"
msgid "He's right. Mind flayers infected me, but they don't control me."
msgstr "그의 말이 맞습니다. 마인드 플레이어가 날 감염시켰지만, 조종하진 않더군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ebc004fd-8d01-5981-8274-086ade53d8b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:ebc004fd-8d01-5981-8274-086ade53d8b6
msgctxt "h4621ff2agbfe8g4925g9b4dga9fbba42cb8a"
msgid "Tell me - why have you come here?"
msgstr "말해 봐, 여기에 왜 왔지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ee6db19f-65e4-e221-7b22-f0023fbf4ab5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:ee6db19f-65e4-e221-7b22-f0023fbf4ab5
msgctxt "hb58a0aa7gf239g409cga3begec4e737fdc1e"
msgid "Kindness is too often a decoy."
msgstr "친절은 미끼일 때가 많지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ef15cf87-8da7-e709-d745-108bf4d39f38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_RevealedArtifact = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:ef15cf87-8da7-e709-d745-108bf4d39f38
msgctxt "h30c8dc36g270bg47a6ga65egc3a94c9fd06b"
msgid ""
"I'll not pretend to understand what that artefact is, but I'm old and wise "
"enough to recognise a sliver of hope when it crawls out of the dark."
msgstr ""
"그 아티팩트에 대해서는 갈피조차 안 잡힌다만, 그래도 한 줄기 희망이 어둠 속에서 기어나오는 건 알아볼 정도로 현명해진 걸 보니 나이 "
"들긴 했나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef70473c-fca8-8985-031b-89974cc97dec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(5) = True
#. TagRule: RANGER_HUNTER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:ef70473c-fca8-8985-031b-89974cc97dec
msgctxt "h491719bdgb8a0g448dgb264gdde499a554f0"
msgid "I don't enjoy feeling like prey - free me."
msgstr "사냥감이 된 듯한 느낌이 좋지는 않군 - 풀어 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef70473c-fca8-8985-031b-89974cc97dec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(5) = True
#. TagRule: RANGER_GLOOM_STALKER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:ef70473c-fca8-8985-031b-89974cc97dec
msgctxt "ha64cc23dgd6a8g4290gba2cg319f56846e23"
msgid "Once I get out of this, you best sleep with one eye open, druid."
msgstr "장담하건대, 내가 여기서 벗어나게 되면 두 눈 감고 못 잘 줄 알아라, 드루이드."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef70473c-fca8-8985-031b-89974cc97dec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(5) = True
#. TagRule: RANGER_BEAST_MASTER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:ef70473c-fca8-8985-031b-89974cc97dec
msgctxt "h487ecfd6gecf1g474fg84d6g32907e79bb1d"
msgid "Like a noble beast in a snare... Release me, druid."
msgstr "덫에 걸린 고귀한 짐승이 된 것 같군…날 놓아 줘라, 드루이드."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef70473c-fca8-8985-031b-89974cc97dec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:ef70473c-fca8-8985-031b-89974cc97dec
msgctxt "hc93145fdgf48bg48f7gb841gb5b9b93b6eda"
msgid "Usually I'm not the one in the snare - mind releasing me?"
msgstr "보통 덫에 묶이는 건 내 쪽이 아닌데 - 풀어줄 생각 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = efc7e55c-57e2-089c-ca3a-8865a0528f3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:efc7e55c-57e2-089c-ca3a-8865a0528f3e
msgctxt "h5b7ea88fg0c41g4336g9c56ga249951902f1"
msgid "Someone lost in the dark, drawn to the light here."
msgstr "어둠에서 길을 잃었고, 빛에 이끌려 여기까지 왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = f024b331-14cd-36f1-f2f0-95ea6e35e645
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:f024b331-14cd-36f1-f2f0-95ea6e35e645
msgctxt "hf48bc8f5g9bebg4aa2gb9cbg6e428b6f474b"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr "안녕."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = f2f82094-a9ac-8056-1d21-eb55c15882ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:f2f82094-a9ac-8056-1d21-eb55c15882ea
msgctxt "h1a9252a5gf054g41a1ga26eg4cbbacb3c812"
msgid ""
"I'll not pretend to understand why you, the enigma that you are, suddenly "
"crossed our path, but I'm old and wise enough to recognise a sliver of hope "
"when it crawls out of the dark."
msgstr ""
"어째서 네가, 그러니까 너란 수수께끼가 우리 앞에 나타난 건지 갈피조차 안 잡힌다만, 그래도 한 줄기 희망이 어둠 속에서 기어나오는 건 "
"알아볼 정도로 현명해진 걸 보니 나이 들긴 했나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3096b1d-072a-e064-7217-74dccefbb9b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_BrokeVines(5) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_FlamingSpyRevealed = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:f3096b1d-072a-e064-7217-74dccefbb9b5
msgctxt "h1e167246g7333g4295g8fc8g6b33f083a930"
msgid ""
"I know it's hard to trust anyone right now, but believe me: I am <i>not </"
"i>an Absolute cultist."
msgstr "지금 누군가를 믿는다는 게 쉽지 않은 상황이겠지만, 믿어줘: 난 절대자 추종자가 <i>아니야</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = f46ed2bc-565e-737c-15a4-8939fb694562
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:f46ed2bc-565e-737c-15a4-8939fb694562
msgctxt "hf68b451fg38a8g416cgb76eg2106d809cb96"
msgid "I'm not interested in the Absolute's manipulations."
msgstr "절대자의 농간엔 관심없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = f517f672-568b-4ee5-011c-92dca7cacd5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:f517f672-568b-4ee5-011c-92dca7cacd5d
msgctxt "hdeaf0adfg8e91g497dg8dffgf19ed659a9e3"
msgid "Rather more than a spot, actually."
msgstr "'약간'은 사실, 많이 절제된 표현이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = f71c770e-af18-f23b-6b6c-978f53d2316d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:f71c770e-af18-f23b-6b6c-978f53d2316d
msgctxt "h917c0f42g9433g416fgba97g3f4488a732ba"
msgid "Then you've found an ally in me, for that is precisely why I am here."
msgstr "그러면 너와 난 아군이네. 나 또한 정확히 같은 이유로 여기 있으니 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = f7ed1e1c-8e8b-ba9d-ea33-2f595b319eb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:f7ed1e1c-8e8b-ba9d-ea33-2f595b319eb0
msgctxt "h1d71be8eg2abag4eb9g961dge48a4a3166f6"
msgid "A True Soul with a mind of her own... How is that possible?"
msgstr "독자적으로 생각하는 참된 영혼이라니... 어떻게 가능하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = f7ed1e1c-8e8b-ba9d-ea33-2f595b319eb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:f7ed1e1c-8e8b-ba9d-ea33-2f595b319eb0
msgctxt "h9edc8021g46dag4165gbf18gfded56221453"
msgid "A True Soul with a mind of his own... How is that possible?"
msgstr "독자적으로 생각하는 참된 영혼이라니... 어떻게 가능하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = f7ed1e1c-8e8b-ba9d-ea33-2f595b319eb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:f7ed1e1c-8e8b-ba9d-ea33-2f595b319eb0
msgctxt "h73ca8d3cg8247g42b9g86f4g3ef76dcb34ca"
msgid "A True Soul with a mind of their own... How is that possible?"
msgstr "독자적으로 생각하는 참된 영혼이라니... 어떻게 가능하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8b0468f-8db1-97f4-5ad3-3f5a8c949e4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint_StatedMission = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:f8b0468f-8db1-97f4-5ad3-3f5a8c949e4c
msgctxt "h638a730bg449bg432cg9fa5g441b2e8935fa"
msgid "To destroy the Absolute in its lair: Moonrise Towers."
msgstr "절대자를 그 소굴인 문라이즈 타워에서 파괴하려고 왔습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = f8e7ddff-2a49-2c66-2ad8-887d4a03bc5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:f8e7ddff-2a49-2c66-2ad8-887d4a03bc5b
msgctxt "hbb7750ddg8177g466dgab27gabe34beaca53"
msgid "A count to five is all I need."
msgstr "다섯 셀 시간이면 충분해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = fa17f9bb-6e66-b329-2349-55f63d4486ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:fa17f9bb-6e66-b329-2349-55f63d4486ac
msgctxt "hb926ad80g9c21g415fgb7cfga7a2dd6cc8dc"
msgid "It'll hurt less if you hold still."
msgstr "가만히 있으면 덜 아플 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Fist Marcus
#. NodeID = fa9caf39-a02e-2525-c8f7-b5edacc9a2f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:fa9caf39-a02e-2525-c8f7-b5edacc9a2f0
msgctxt "hbfe94b53g089bg4331gb6a7g407c6e26ed7f"
msgid "Enough of this."
msgstr "젠장, 집어치워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd80c330-34e7-263c-4387-b63e32c92f89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_MINTHARA(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_EnteringHaven_TadpoleCheckpoint:fd80c330-34e7-263c-4387-b63e32c92f89
msgctxt "hc5cb12efg33c6g4e18g8dd5g9d665a58de72"
msgid "To pursue vengeance against the cult of the Absolute."
msgstr "절대자의 추종자 놈들에게 복수하기 위해서다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act2_HAV_BlessingWarner
#. NodeID = 05ff632c-f7be-6595-b3c3-256d6bb08064
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder:05ff632c-f7be-6595-b3c3-256d6bb08064
msgctxt "h792c8ce5ga183g419egb204g9deab60a2d03"
msgid "I won't tell you your business - but I hope you're right."
msgstr "당신 일이니 알아서 잘하시겠지만, 걱정은 됩니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19c72c8b-d9eb-6178-a1c9-65e8bc149faa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder:19c72c8b-d9eb-6178-a1c9-65e8bc149faa
msgctxt "h6bd9ef7ag67b9g43a4ga04dgd021f15e56a4"
msgid "I'll be fine without it."
msgstr "축복이 없어도 괜찮을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2013aaf0-2520-bbe4-a6c3-d76498a37ac5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder:2013aaf0-2520-bbe4-a6c3-d76498a37ac5
msgctxt "hd7093448g2437g49c5g9c71ga1177b6225fb"
msgid "Far from it - thanks for the reminder."
msgstr "전혀. 그래도 알려줘서 고맙군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act2_HAV_BlessingWarner
#. NodeID = 5769527c-509c-215f-e7e1-58586fa10ff5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder:5769527c-509c-215f-e7e1-58586fa10ff5
msgctxt "h48b97907gef0bg4facg8185g046a54533677"
msgid ""
"Look at that. May it keep you from the shades - not sure we can afford to "
"lose an ally like you."
msgstr "당신과 같은 동맹을 잃을 여력이 없어요. 부디 랜턴이 당신을 어둠 속에서 지켜주길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act2_HAV_BlessingWarner
#. NodeID = 6b2701c5-0674-7527-5a60-eec640da0e82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder:6b2701c5-0674-7527-5a60-eec640da0e82
msgctxt "hc42c3ff7g61a3g4932g8dc9gf8ceb6c6d269"
msgid "I hope that's a joke. Jaheira's counting on your help. We all are."
msgstr "농담이라고 믿을게요. 자헤이라 님에겐 당신의 도움이 필요해요. 우리 모두 마찬가지지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder
#. Speaker = GROUP_Act2_HAV_BlessingWarner
#. NodeID = 6dde771d-498b-fa59-efda-755bd14a4920
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder:6dde771d-498b-fa59-efda-755bd14a4920
msgctxt "hdd6ee200ge930g4472gbd1dg36321d2557a7"
msgid ""
"Isobel - cleric upstairs in the inn. Without her blessing, those shadows'll "
"be all over you."
msgstr "여관 위층 이소벨 말이에요. 그녀의 축복 없이는 그림자에 집어 삼켜질 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder
