msgid "Heading out without Isobel's blessing? Have you got a death wish?"
msgstr "이소벨의 축복 없이 나서는 건가요? 혹시 죽고 싶은 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_ExitBlessingReminder
