#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_FlamingFistCorpse_PAD_TooHeavy:c62651b4-053c-a955-eec1-79628291ae18
msgctxt "h8192acb3g011dg4808gbd2dg1c56906cb889"
msgid "Oof. Not even an ogre could move this. What are you hiding, Marcus?"
msgstr "으. 이건 오우거도 못 옮길 거야. 뭘 숨긴 거지, 마커스?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_FlamingFistCorpse_PAD_TooHeavy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c62651b4-053c-a955-eec1-79628291ae18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_FlamingSpy_Knows_HiddenCorpse = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_FlamingFistCorpse_PAD_TooHeavy:c62651b4-053c-a955-eec1-79628291ae18
msgctxt "h599887f7gb62eg4554ga7a7g411bf5909669"
msgid "Whatever Marcus hid under here, he hid it well."
msgstr "마커스가 여기 뭘 숨겼는진 몰라도 제대로 숨겼군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_FlamingFistCorpse_PAD_TooHeavy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c62651b4-053c-a955-eec1-79628291ae18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_FlamingSpy_Knows_HiddenCorpse = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_FlamingFistCorpse_PAD_TooHeavy:c62651b4-053c-a955-eec1-79628291ae18
msgctxt "h600a49a6gc4c5g4145gb30bgef8242b2678a"
msgid "They won't move. Marcus' secrets must remain just that."
msgstr "꿈쩍도 안 하는군. 마커스의 비밀은 이대로 두어야 하나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_FlamingFistCorpse_PAD_TooHeavy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c62651b4-053c-a955-eec1-79628291ae18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_FlamingSpy_Knows_HiddenCorpse = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_FlamingFistCorpse_PAD_TooHeavy:c62651b4-053c-a955-eec1-79628291ae18
msgctxt "h9d73179fg11cdg4d96gb55dgd6fea4ae623b"
msgid "Too heavy. Whatever Marcus hid away, looks like it's staying a secret."
msgstr "너무 무거워. 마커스가 뭘 숨겼든 비밀로 남겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_FlamingFistCorpse_PAD_TooHeavy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c62651b4-053c-a955-eec1-79628291ae18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_FlamingSpy_Knows_HiddenCorpse = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_FlamingFistCorpse_PAD_TooHeavy:c62651b4-053c-a955-eec1-79628291ae18
msgctxt "h17ea0c03gac40g42ecg82ecgc6416a8a535a"
msgid "Won't budge. Marcus could have warned me."
msgstr "꿈쩍도 안 해. 마커스가 미리 경고해줄 수도 있었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_FlamingFistCorpse_PAD_TooHeavy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c62651b4-053c-a955-eec1-79628291ae18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_FlamingSpy_Knows_HiddenCorpse = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_FlamingFistCorpse_PAD_TooHeavy:c62651b4-053c-a955-eec1-79628291ae18
msgctxt "h4e293db6g4187g47cbg9f5cgd5809804009b"
msgid "Whatever Marcus hid beneath, it isn't budging."
msgstr "마커스가 아래에 뭘 숨겼는지 모르겠는데 움직이질 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 1193557d-6aab-c01f-4b89-dde16a724584
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Florrick_Event_WyllPresent = True
#.      - GLO_Florrick_State_KnowsWyllDevil = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 332d1f8d-f355-feae-f7fd-2c83a4816bb3_WyllIntervened = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - WYLL_DEVIL(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Florrick_State_KnowsWyllDevil = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:1193557d-6aab-c01f-4b89-dde16a724584
msgctxt "h7fcabf4cgcfc3g44dag828agb61af8efb32f"
msgid ""
"Hells - I know that voice. Wyll? In Tymora's name, what happened to you?"
msgstr "세상에 - 귀에 익은 목소리인데. 윌? 티모라의 이름으로, 어떻게 된 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 11cb1b25-ffd3-7ee2-d88b-ab3a25a109a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:11cb1b25-ffd3-7ee2-d88b-ab3a25a109a7
msgctxt "h8f875820gac69g4ff6gb3b3g7838fbb0f709"
msgid ""
"A devil deal? Have you lost your - hm, forget it. Your soul is your own for "
"the dealing. Your father's? That's a different matter."
msgstr ""
"데빌과 계약을? 당신 제정신 - 흠, 아닙니다. 거래에 당신 영혼을 쓴 건 상관 없습니다. 하지만 당신 아버지의 영혼은요? 그건 다른 "
"문제입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 19baa87e-b5a3-3228-b8c3-c9d8c7544e1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:19baa87e-b5a3-3228-b8c3-c9d8c7544e1f
msgctxt "h3120ef0fg196eg4de2g99e3gb8c36edb39e0"
msgid "I understand. These cursed lands present a formidable obstacle."
msgstr "이해합니다. 이 저주받은 땅은 무시무시한 장애물이니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 1b91810a-b683-2e5e-ae52-316ebc1acfb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 332d1f8d-f355-feae-f7fd-2c83a4816bb3_WyllIntervened = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:1b91810a-b683-2e5e-ae52-316ebc1acfb1
msgctxt "h4b35e751gccd0g4bdfg8af0g0eb8dd55c4b7"
msgid "Gods, please, no. <i>You </i>were supposed to be my wildcard."
msgstr "신이시여, 제발, 안 됩니다. <i>당신</i>은 제 비장의 카드여야 했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 22b9f5a3-3858-07ff-1bc4-7f5dd480e97f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:22b9f5a3-3858-07ff-1bc4-7f5dd480e97f
msgctxt "he95f7c50g3bd3g498cg872bg7d77c5978fdc"
msgid ""
"The Council sent a carrier pigeon with news that the city has been dealing "
"with Absolutist attacks. The Steel Watch is holding strong."
msgstr "의회가 전서구를 보내 도시가 절대자 신도의 공격에 대처하는 중이라고 알려줬습니다. 스틸 워치가 굳건히 버티고 있고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22cebf5e-003a-5d7a-8165-8c82151c29c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:22cebf5e-003a-5d7a-8165-8c82151c29c3
msgctxt "he3deaeb0g7adag4385g9a45g3bfd1e79fd6a"
msgid "I have no intention of heading there."
msgstr "난 그곳으로 향할 생각이 전혀 없습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 25c05950-8f01-2bb5-afa6-b55de9326479
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:25c05950-8f01-2bb5-afa6-b55de9326479
msgctxt "h1d88e55eg91b2g4f3cgb865g3e4c20ab4d4f"
msgid ""
"The Steel Watch are the future of warfare. Gondian automatons that can be "
"sent into battle without risking any lives - except those of our enemies."
msgstr "스틸 워치는 전쟁 양상의 미래입니다. 전투에 투입되어 적들의 목숨을 제외하곤 인명 피해를 발생시키지 않는 곤드의 오토마톤이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 2a8c3a4a-f161-b013-b810-a4ba7bc832bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Florrick_State_KnowsWyllDevil = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - WYLL_DEVIL(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Florrick_State_KnowsWyllDevil = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:2a8c3a4a-f161-b013-b810-a4ba7bc832bb
msgctxt "hf67bdd0aga6c6g4880g8f52gcbc62e27032f"
msgid "That eye. In Tymora's name, Wyll? What's happened to you?"
msgstr "그 눈. 티모라의 이름으로, 윌? 뭐가 어떻게 된 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ec2222a-09b2-fe41-3b3f-f481b7734b33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_BriefInRoom(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_HAV_TakingIsobel_HeardOfIsobel = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:2ec2222a-09b2-fe41-3b3f-f481b7734b33
msgctxt "h3d079836g0a4cg44ebgbcaeg9c396e9b3272"
msgid "What can you tell me about Isobel?"
msgstr "이소벨에 대해 뭘 알려줄 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ec303a5-be0b-dc58-e4c1-932511befeaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:2ec303a5-be0b-dc58-e4c1-932511befeaa
msgctxt "h2f6c8981g4621g4355g8893g8bcd39afc3c1"
msgid "What are the Steel Watch?"
msgstr "스틸 워치가 뭐죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 2f69620c-db83-ae04-459c-d2e5c4a8a8f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Florrick_Event_RavengardInTowers = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_Florrick_Event_RavengardInTowers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:2f69620c-db83-ae04-459c-d2e5c4a8a8f6
msgctxt "h6b19d6fag22a7g4413gafd1g5c3e2c26f494"
msgid ""
"We're almost sure Duke Ravengard is held within the towers, but this curse "
"presents a formidable obstacle."
msgstr "레이븐가드 공작님이 타워 안에 있다는 건 거의 확실하지만, 이 저주가 아주 큰 장애물이 되고 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Manip Vidor
#. NodeID = 368f9b54-0142-8ff9-0df4-9d6c1af69699
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_Florrick(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:368f9b54-0142-8ff9-0df4-9d6c1af69699
msgctxt "h9d1fa780g3badg4321gb6edg542c1e5437e7"
msgid "He still won't speak - just keeps going with the bloody song."
msgstr "아직 아무 말도 안 하고 망할 노래나 불러대고 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 38fae6c3-44bf-a76e-a384-2fd8953545a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_Florrick(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:38fae6c3-44bf-a76e-a384-2fd8953545a0
msgctxt "h546fe4bdgbf92g4ed8ga995ga0978c1f1afb"
msgid ""
"The journey back to Baldur's Gate won't be easier, but your task here is "
"harder still. Tymora be with you."
msgstr "발더스 게이트로 돌아가는 길은 쉽지 않을 거다. 하지만 여기에서 네 임무는 더욱 쉽지 않겠지. 티모라께서 함께하길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 3ae845d9-90c4-73d8-0538-05c71a6aaba4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Gortash_Knows_IsLord = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:3ae845d9-90c4-73d8-0538-05c71a6aaba4
msgctxt "h32f4b884g5ea2g40e9g85e5g9c8281697b8b"
msgid ""
"Lord Gortash is the man responsible for the creation of the Steel Watch. "
"It's no wonder he earned the title."
msgstr "고타쉬 경은 스틸 워치를 고안한 분입니다. 그 직위를 얻은 것도 당연하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c1f42bb-654b-3440-80dc-195ade5e483e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:3c1f42bb-654b-3440-80dc-195ade5e483e
msgctxt "hfb93ac7bgd483g471aga268g27b190708995"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 41c8ba8b-cf69-c852-8f7c-4e68ea9e0312
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:41c8ba8b-cf69-c852-8f7c-4e68ea9e0312
msgctxt "hdf9132d3g550dg4096g9c4bg47ec617e62f8"
msgid ""
"Don't count on me, and assume no aid is coming. Work with Jaheira. That "
"Harper's mind is as sharp as her blade. Follow her guidance."
msgstr ""
"저에게 기대하지는 마시고, 지원이 오지 않는 걸 가정하세요. 자헤이라와 협력해 주십시오. 그 하퍼의 정신은 그녀의 검만큼이나 예리하니, "
"그녀의 인도를 따르세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 42a68fc4-1ee9-35a8-cde3-e783145a8ddd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_Florrick(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Florrick_State_KnowsWyllDevil = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - WYLL_DEVIL(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_Florrick(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Florrick_State_KnowsWyllDevil = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:42a68fc4-1ee9-35a8-cde3-e783145a8ddd
msgctxt "h5c058c87gc8e9g4cb5gb30bg47f4077e2038"
msgid "That eye. In Tymora's name, Wyll? What's happened to you?"
msgstr "그 눈. 티모라의 이름으로, 윌? 뭐가 어떻게 된 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ac20f53-6af8-3de6-afb3-eda18d0e66f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:4ac20f53-6af8-3de6-afb3-eda18d0e66f7
msgctxt "h33ff73a9g12e7g412cgbbd9ga163da7a9485"
msgid "A devil deal gone horribly wrong."
msgstr "데빌과 계약이 지독하게 잘못됐어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e37daea-f49f-c483-df34-d5c0c714b2c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:4e37daea-f49f-c483-df34-d5c0c714b2c0
msgctxt "hdeec5392g2c06g450fgb17agabff80680c28"
msgid "It's my business, Florrick - not yours."
msgstr "당신 일이 아니라, 제 일이에요, 플로릭."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 4fab858c-4717-83e6-c8d0-f32deffb4e45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:4fab858c-4717-83e6-c8d0-f32deffb4e45
msgctxt "hae48f3b5gc36fg4646g9901gcab78d75904d"
msgid "Farewell. We'll meet again, gods willing."
msgstr "작별이군요. 신의 뜻에 따라, 우리는 다시 만날 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 54b4bd0c-0634-b430-e663-ee765b78e816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:54b4bd0c-0634-b430-e663-ee765b78e816
msgctxt "h2465149bgfb7eg433eg85f8g916514aa0f8c"
msgid ""
"With the Steel Watch at our backs, we could storm the tower whatever "
"Ketheric throws at us, I'm sure of it."
msgstr "스틸 워치의 지원이 있다면, 케서릭이 어떤 수를 쓰더라도 우리가 타워에 쳐들어갈 수 있을 거라 확신합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 571999f0-342c-03fb-f258-30e2f3a7bf50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Jaheira_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:571999f0-342c-03fb-f258-30e2f3a7bf50
msgctxt "h7aa20a29g506eg4c15gb9efgbe6fcb1ebfe4"
msgid "So don't count on me, assume no aid is coming."
msgstr "그러니 저에게 기대하지 마시고, 지원이 오지 않는 걸 가정하세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 598587a0-9bc5-3062-4988-d4735b4d1227
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:598587a0-9bc5-3062-4988-d4735b4d1227
msgctxt "hb7920ac9g46cfg4363g8ae2g4c04e030aadf"
msgid ""
"I'll do my best but there's every chance I'll fall to the curse or the cult "
"before I reach the city."
msgstr "저는 최선을 다하려 하지만, 도시에 이르기 전에 저주나 교단에 가로막힐 가능성이 크겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 5c752301-ef4a-97b9-88d4-2071e1569746
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:5c752301-ef4a-97b9-88d4-2071e1569746
msgctxt "h2c66588fgbe01g4e3bga7degbde9cd797b56"
msgid ""
"Cleric of Selûne - she's got a room upstairs if you want to meet her. Just "
"don't interrupt her while she's doing whatever it is that keeps this place "
"shadow-free."
msgstr ""
"셀루네의 클레릭입니다. 만나고 싶으시다면, 그녀는 위층의 방에 머물고 있습니다. 그녀가 이곳을 그림자로부터 보호해주는 일을 할 때 "
"방해하지만 말아 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 616089fa-aa87-e2d9-71e0-3c2b1fb64b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:616089fa-aa87-e2d9-71e0-3c2b1fb64b83
msgctxt "h1d12645dgc2d8g4943gac39g4de9e847945a"
msgid ""
"My role here is limited. I can be put to better use convincing the council "
"to send reinforcements to help rescue your father."
msgstr "여기서 제 역할은 제한적입니다. 의회를 설득해서 당신 아버지를 구하기 위한 지원군을 요청하는 편이 더 도움이 될 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 616089fa-aa87-e2d9-71e0-3c2b1fb64b83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:616089fa-aa87-e2d9-71e0-3c2b1fb64b83
msgctxt "hdc71faedgb2c3g4a47g94a3g021ef0603078"
msgid ""
"My role here is limited. I can be put to better use convincing the council "
"to send reinforcements to help rescue the duke."
msgstr "여기서 제 역할은 제한적입니다. 의회를 설득해서 공작을 구하기 위한 지원군을 요청하는 편이 더 도움이 될 거네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 6438833b-30b0-584f-2fb2-b42ea585c9e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:6438833b-30b0-584f-2fb2-b42ea585c9e3
msgctxt "hcc532c59gb223g4366ga866g351a837a0533"
msgid "It beggars belief he's alive at all."
msgstr "애초에 그가 살아있다는 것 자체가 믿기지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 65e01f94-61f6-73a6-f0ec-524a22362a51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Gortash_Knows_IsLord = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:65e01f94-61f6-73a6-f0ec-524a22362a51
msgctxt "hfc105bb1g5741g4ec0g830fg65b69cd8cb24"
msgid ""
"Lord Gortash had only completed work on the prototypes before Ravengard and "
"I left for Elturel, but even they were formidable."
msgstr "레이븐가드 공작님과 제가 엘투렐로 떠났을 때, 고타쉬 경이 프로토타입을 완성했는데, 그것조차도 가공할 만큼 강력했습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 68041e66-dd21-3b94-2ed0-3cb69323ff43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:68041e66-dd21-3b94-2ed0-3cb69323ff43
msgctxt "hf7d935bcg6cafg4c98g8305g5a3c7ee79502"
msgid ""
"Hopefully he'll come 'round. Tell us something useful about getting through "
"the shadows. Right now he seems to have little more to him than a refrain "
"from some song or other."
msgstr ""
"바라건대, 그가 정신을 차리고 그림자를 뚫고 가는 데 유용한 뭔가를 알려주겠죠. 지금 당장은 뭔지 모를 노래의 후렴구 말고는 아는 게 "
"없어 보입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ec233cd-9ed5-3beb-8e95-b3afb0ed2913
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:6ec233cd-9ed5-3beb-8e95-b3afb0ed2913
msgctxt "h38f237a4g3e14g49b4g8da4g3ecc266a73d8"
msgid "I doubt that man will recover any time soon."
msgstr "금방 회복하지는 못할 거 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 7ad11de2-980d-0b2c-34e3-d990e3a028f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:7ad11de2-980d-0b2c-34e3-d990e3a028f7
msgctxt "h71cc7875g75bag41a3gba62g42917a65c25a"
msgid ""
"Keep on searching. I'll be heading to Baldur's Gate to seek reinforcements."
msgstr "계속 찾아봐라. 난 발더스 게이트에 가서 지원군을 요청하려 할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7cd66d5e-32a9-244d-2152-4289e5da1a6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:7cd66d5e-32a9-244d-2152-4289e5da1a6b
msgctxt "h13649093g676dg473bg95f2gfade911093c2"
msgid "A story for another time and another place."
msgstr "다른 시간 다른 장소에서 얘기해 드리죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 81b59de8-84e0-5e23-b42c-429dd6abbee3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:81b59de8-84e0-5e23-b42c-429dd6abbee3
msgctxt "hf70e984cg9a82g488dg8972g62cf4bc0d464"
msgid ""
"Merciful Tymora. That's the first piece of good news I've heard since "
"Elturel, but I'm not pinning all my hopes on you."
msgstr "자비로운 티모라시여. 엘투렐 이후로 처음으로 듣는 희소식이군요. 하지만 당신에게 모든 희망을 걸 순 없습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85c0003a-fece-4fb1-f1c2-4b18fa0650dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:85c0003a-fece-4fb1-f1c2-4b18fa0650dc
msgctxt "heaa69502gd9e2g4553gb45fg989cb7a4c020"
msgid "How do you expect to reach Baldur's Gate?"
msgstr "발더스 게이트까지 어떻게 가시려고요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 87110007-4aba-06e7-958c-95ae0be8cb4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:87110007-4aba-06e7-958c-95ae0be8cb4f
msgctxt "h6fe5bfa9g84c1g435bgad58gc2f9cbfda4dd"
msgid "I doubt it too. But I haven't given up hope."
msgstr "동감합니다. 하지만 희망을 버릴 순 없죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Manip Vidor
#. NodeID = 89048377-bf9e-1fac-1457-892f375e315e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:89048377-bf9e-1fac-1457-892f375e315e
msgctxt "h88ae69a0g83b1g4d15g93bbgc710281bf298"
msgid ""
"His original writ of duty - signed by Eltan himself. Fella must be one of "
"the very first Flaming Fist."
msgstr "오래된 명령문이 있는데 - 그 엘탄이 직접 서명했더라고요. 초창기의 플레이밍 피스트 일원인 게 틀림없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 89ed9133-1c90-53c8-887f-83073eacad32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:89ed9133-1c90-53c8-887f-83073eacad32
msgctxt "he011969cgc380g43c7g9635g5d751daa1bd8"
msgid ""
"I half-expect to die trying, but I prefer that to standing on the sidelines "
"while you risk everything."
msgstr "죽을 수도 있겠지만, 자네가 모든 위험을 감수하는 동안 옆에 서서 구경하는 것보다는 낫다고 생각하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 8a08f410-88e2-0992-6104-963bfbb2f0ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Gortash_Knows_IsLord = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:8a08f410-88e2-0992-6104-963bfbb2f0ce
msgctxt "hb5524931g2d9dg4b96g9cceg4737b91e0df4"
msgid ""
"I'll request that Lord Gortash send some of them to aid in the fight against "
"Moonrise. The curse won't harm them."
msgstr ""
"고타쉬 경께 감시자 일부를 문라이즈에 대항하는 싸움에 증원군으로 보내 달라고 요청할 것입니다. 그것들은 저주의 영향도 안 받을 테죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 90bba7f6-750c-5936-08b9-feb1c5a00344
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:90bba7f6-750c-5936-08b9-feb1c5a00344
msgctxt "hb19622dcgcc06g4973ga8e9g9d08cc3f2745"
msgid "The Hells have had their vengeance - and I doubt they are done with me."
msgstr "지옥은 그들만의 앙갚음 방식이 있었고 - 끝나지도 않은 거 같네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9176dce5-4a51-a66d-b0d2-87b85164cca1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:9176dce5-4a51-a66d-b0d2-87b85164cca1
msgctxt "he03f7fadgac2eg4656g9181g5b7830bc6d01"
msgid "I have. But there was no sign of father."
msgstr "찾았어요. 하지만 아버지의 흔적은 없었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9176dce5-4a51-a66d-b0d2-87b85164cca1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:9176dce5-4a51-a66d-b0d2-87b85164cca1
msgctxt "h916323e1g0aefg4539g8ea1g115d820a2961"
msgid "I have. But there was no sign of the duke."
msgstr "찾았어. 하지만 공작의 흔적은 없었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 94af0331-5560-16ab-a427-567a85b718fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 332d1f8d-f355-feae-f7fd-2c83a4816bb3_WyllGortash = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BALDURIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:94af0331-5560-16ab-a427-567a85b718fb
msgctxt "hd201c29bg8256g464egabd1gb05cf9200db1"
msgid ""
"*You know the name Gortash. A counsellor with considerable influence on "
"Baldurian industry and politics... but he is no Lord.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 고타쉬라는 이름을 알고 있습니다. 그 자는 도시의 산업과 정치에 상당한 영향력을 갖고 있는 고문이지만... '경'은 아닙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 95089283-f0b7-5a78-2b90-22b593461ef0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:95089283-f0b7-5a78-2b90-22b593461ef0
msgctxt "h7445f089gd181g432bg95ebg7a6183d5b7b5"
msgid "Fine. Gods know I've got enough worries plucking at my nerves."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 제가 신경 쓸 걱정거리가 넘친다는 건 신들께서도 잘 아시겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95a23cbe-1c33-0e03-b9c8-b5f661e944ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:95a23cbe-1c33-0e03-b9c8-b5f661e944ba
msgctxt "ha624f49ag99a1g4533g94c1gb8ced9e59061"
msgid "I'd like to talk to him."
msgstr "저 남자와 얘기하고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = 98c22fbc-40cd-8a67-822e-879e547505d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:98c22fbc-40cd-8a67-822e-879e547505d1
msgctxt "h9d2231eag466eg4b23gbd2bgd53d211de2b8"
msgid ""
"A lot's changed since you left Baldur's Gate, Wyll. Gortash has gained "
"considerable influence since then."
msgstr "윌, 네가 떠난 후로 발더스 게이트는 많이 변했단다. 그 후로 고타쉬는 상당한 영향력을 갖게 됐지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 992e483f-15f4-9547-5799-c644c63bfb07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:992e483f-15f4-9547-5799-c644c63bfb07
msgctxt "haec9b7a8g1cb5g4410g8e28g7941fc63cd11"
msgid "You're leaving? While my father is still captive in Moonrise?"
msgstr "떠나신다고요? 아버지가 여전히 문라이즈에 잡혀있는데도요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 992e483f-15f4-9547-5799-c644c63bfb07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:992e483f-15f4-9547-5799-c644c63bfb07
msgctxt "h8c2568e3g8c93g458ag8e36g1c568af2679f"
msgid "You're leaving? While Duke Ravengard is still captive in Moonrise?"
msgstr "떠난다고? 레이븐가드 공작이 아직 문라이즈 타워에 붙잡혀있는데도?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = a0976ac1-7f7e-e084-4eaa-0884afab58c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_Florrick_Event_RavengardInTowers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:a0976ac1-7f7e-e084-4eaa-0884afab58c5
msgctxt "h5ddb1d49g208dg40a5g90bagff6cdfd529e9"
msgid ""
"We believe the cultists have taken Duke Ravengard to Moonrise Towers. I "
"don't suppose you've found a way in?"
msgstr "추종자들이 레이븐가드 공작님을 문라이즈 타워로 데려간 것 같습니다. 혹시 안으로 들어갈 방법은 찾으셨나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = a1b52336-d3fe-cdc0-4f26-360392e084eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:a1b52336-d3fe-cdc0-4f26-360392e084eb
msgctxt "hfd27ac87g0d9ag4afbga037g7c3cc9f3c29b"
msgid "Nothing of use on his person?"
msgstr "소지품 중에 쓸만한 건 없나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5bfa8ae-f2f9-5973-a9dc-3461434a881c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = False
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = False
#.      - BALDURIAN(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:a5bfa8ae-f2f9-5973-a9dc-3461434a881c
msgctxt "h15b481dcgd0afg42deg8bcegd02e49379aa3"
msgid "Who is this Lord Gortash?"
msgstr "고타쉬 경이 누굽니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8393c39-9af5-950c-8c31-e29dd145dbc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:a8393c39-9af5-950c-8c31-e29dd145dbc7
msgctxt "h861024e1ge214g45b3gbf1ag16d5ed62a7cf"
msgid "Are the Flaming Fist just going to stand around here?"
msgstr "플레이밍 피스트는 그냥 여기서 돌아다니는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = abae4386-e746-46db-32aa-d77cd91eeff0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_Florrick(1) = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_Florrick(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:abae4386-e746-46db-32aa-d77cd91eeff0
msgctxt "h1029c016g3b09g422fga185g0f1307cbc55b"
msgid "Gods, please, no. <i>You </i>were supposed to be my wildcard."
msgstr "신이시여, 제발, 안 됩니다. <i>네</i>가 내 비장의 카드여야 했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = adc8a984-4727-11b5-831b-d8d735428ce1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:adc8a984-4727-11b5-831b-d8d735428ce1
msgctxt "hf25373ebg66e2g4118g9c45g50b5393d6e1b"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, I won't be here when he comes around. I'm heading to Baldur's "
"Gate, to seek reinforcements."
msgstr "아쉽게도 그가 정신을 차릴 때쯤, 전 여기 없을 것입니다. 지원군을 청하러 발더스 게이트로 갈 생각이라서요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = b701314c-9405-73b5-c364-0b1a6d1f6336
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:b701314c-9405-73b5-c364-0b1a6d1f6336
msgctxt "h14ee9ecbg3379g491fga3b0gbfdac79b518e"
msgid ""
"Isobel cleared this place, and he just... appeared. We think he was staying "
"at the inn when the curse fell - which means he's been trapped inside for a "
"century."
msgstr ""
"이소벨이 이곳을 밝혔을 때, 그냥... 나타났습니다. 우린 저주가 닥쳤을 때 그가 여관에 머물고 있었을 거라고 생각합니다. 그건 한 세기 "
"동안 갇혀 있었다는 뜻이겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = ba3a02b0-af96-658f-bbbe-26f913030192
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_Florrick_State_ToldPlayerAboutArt = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:ba3a02b0-af96-658f-bbbe-26f913030192
msgctxt "hc35233abg7777g4795g8274gd2425e8b1132"
msgid "He must know <i>something. </i>Let's not give up on him yet.<i></i>"
msgstr "<i>뭐라도</i> 알고 있을 게 분명해. 아직 포기하지 말자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = ba5ab8ba-2177-7269-85c3-9d91815fa473
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:ba5ab8ba-2177-7269-85c3-9d91815fa473
msgctxt "hc973d183gc733g4df7ga1e2g9c8c3f888a8d"
msgid ""
"It's impressive that you reached Moonrise at all, even more impressive that "
"you're alive to tell the tale. But it's not the tale I wanted to hear."
msgstr ""
"문라이즈에 도달했다니 인상적입니다. 살아 돌아와서 그 이야기를 해주시니 더 인상적이고요. 하지만 제가 듣고 싶었던 것은 아니군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd5d19d3-bf17-cd27-6931-b44e506d1e09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = False
#.      - BALDURIAN(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:bd5d19d3-bf17-cd27-6931-b44e506d1e09
msgctxt "h128f6c9bge2cfg4391ga765g576cccdded2f"
msgid "<i>Lord</i> Gortash? Since when?"
msgstr "고타쉬 <i>경</i>? 언제부터?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd5d19d3-bf17-cd27-6931-b44e506d1e09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(1) = False
#.      - BALDURIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:bd5d19d3-bf17-cd27-6931-b44e506d1e09
msgctxt "h0325ac63gdb29g46aagbdedg3a92704e582e"
msgid "<i>Lord</i> Gortash? I thought he was no more than a counsellor."
msgstr "고타쉬 <i>경</i>? 고문 이상은 안 되는 걸로 알고 있는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = c410f4f3-be1f-a17c-7ab5-1c867caea3ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_Desire_State_ToldFlorrickAboutTowers = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_Florrick_Event_RavengardInTowers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:c410f4f3-be1f-a17c-7ab5-1c867caea3ac
msgctxt "hb0e1e2a7g9e92g46abgbb12gc94e8efdc0f7"
msgid "I don't suppose you've found a way into the Towers?"
msgstr "혹시 타워 안으로 가는 방법은 찾으셨나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c7e3aa1c-256d-4d8b-a710-bc43d9e3a1d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 332d1f8d-f355-feae-f7fd-2c83a4816bb3_WyllGortash = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:c7e3aa1c-256d-4d8b-a710-bc43d9e3a1d9
msgctxt "h2c47aa1agbfdeg4945g8b20g80f7e1d92025"
msgid ""
"Gortash, as in Enver Gortash? Last I knew, he was a minor player in city "
"affairs."
msgstr "고타쉬, 엔버 고타쉬라고? 기억하기로는, 도시에서 작은 업무를 맡았던 거 같은데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = c96c3c75-77f6-ed66-1cd9-9cdb0d9ad2cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:c96c3c75-77f6-ed66-1cd9-9cdb0d9ad2cb
msgctxt "ha150d7b0gd6ecg4404ga392g851087e8b44e"
msgid "Ye gods, fate's found no shortage of troubles to burden us with."
msgstr "신이시여, 운명이 우리에게 주는 부담은 마를 날이 없군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c9980486-39cc-4237-955b-9fb92e8f509e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 332d1f8d-f355-feae-f7fd-2c83a4816bb3_WyllIntervened = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:c9980486-39cc-4237-955b-9fb92e8f509e
msgctxt "h9c130e7bgf53ag4947ga7e3gfe6ca346e97d"
msgid "Florrick."
msgstr "플로릭."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ca4fa6e3-b1de-2981-a0c6-6fd5ca72a1ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:ca4fa6e3-b1de-2981-a0c6-6fd5ca72a1ee
msgctxt "hfed98bcdg41f3g4699g8d76gd77b43b93731"
msgid ""
"*Gortash. Your old boss - the man who sold you to Zariel. It seems he's "
"calling himself 'lord' these days.*"
msgstr "*고타쉬. 당신을 자리엘에게 팔아넘긴 - 예전 보스입니다. 요즘은 스스로를 '경'으로 부르는 듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ceece257-7773-437b-a9a9-bbda7e26d496
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:ceece257-7773-437b-a9a9-bbda7e26d496
msgctxt "ha34b052bg5c0fg4afbgbcb6g64eebbe3d45e"
msgid "Holy shit. That's my old boss - the guy who sold me to Zariel!"
msgstr "이런 미친. 내 예전 상관 얘기잖아. 날 자리엘한테 팔아넘겼던!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = cfcaa53c-0579-c688-09e6-520608503b66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:cfcaa53c-0579-c688-09e6-520608503b66
msgctxt "hcec67817gb79eg4632g8128gaff1587e11b4"
msgid ""
"Wouldn't we all. I'm not even sure he's fully conscious. But feel free to "
"say hello. Maybe a new face will inspire him."
msgstr "저희는 안 그렇겠습니까. 의식이 온전한지조차 모르겠습니다. 그래도 편히 인사해 보십시오. 새로운 얼굴이 자극이 될 수도 있죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = ddafbb39-d74e-206c-fdbb-d5557e0f9aae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:ddafbb39-d74e-206c-fdbb-d5557e0f9aae
msgctxt "h3c00b355g2cc7g4b44g95f6gde50db46b839"
msgid ""
"I trust that you will do everything you can to free your father. But in case "
"you don't find a way, I'll be heading to Baldur's Gate to seek "
"reinforcements."
msgstr ""
"당신이 아버지를 풀어주기 위해 최선을 다하실 거라 믿습니다. 하지만 실패할 경우를 대비해, 전 발더스 게이트에 가서 지원군을 요청하려 "
"합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = ddafbb39-d74e-206c-fdbb-d5557e0f9aae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:ddafbb39-d74e-206c-fdbb-d5557e0f9aae
msgctxt "hec86d944g9e9eg495fga1ebg0175f9179ba8"
msgid ""
"I trust that you will do everything you can to free the duke. But in case "
"you don't find a way, I'll be heading to Baldur's Gate to seek "
"reinforcements."
msgstr ""
"당신이 공작님을 구하기 위해 최선을 다하실 거라 믿습니다. 하지만 실패할 경우를 대비해, 전 발더스 게이트로 가서 지원군을 요청하려 "
"합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e49624c5-42e1-4306-9922-5e4ae90d6a3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_Florrick_Event_WyllPresent = True
#.   Local:
#.     - 332d1f8d-f355-feae-f7fd-2c83a4816bb3_WyllIntervened = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:e49624c5-42e1-4306-9922-5e4ae90d6a3a
msgctxt "h1239d9d7gd8e8g4920gb69bgc6ed6ae3cc4a"
msgid "Florrick."
msgstr "플로릭."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = f42a782c-59c4-18dd-0e9c-e1d28de8e316
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 332d1f8d-f355-feae-f7fd-2c83a4816bb3_WyllIntervened = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_Florrick_Event_RavengardInTowers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:f42a782c-59c4-18dd-0e9c-e1d28de8e316
msgctxt "hf73bd6acg12bcg4780g84a6gaa40ea3518c0"
msgid ""
"We believe the cultists have taken your father to Moonrise Towers. I don't "
"suppose you've found a way in?"
msgstr "추종자들이 당신 아버지를 문라이즈 타워로 데려간 것 같습니다. 혹시 타워 안으로 가는 방법은 찾으셨나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f49b9db5-28db-f8ee-b876-97f5c4c20844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:f49b9db5-28db-f8ee-b876-97f5c4c20844
msgctxt "hd0a4bd16g6252g4525ga8ffgffce42bb3bf6"
msgid "Not yet."
msgstr "아직요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = f7d0abb0-d53f-8aeb-3eb8-d77a6c3417d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 332d1f8d-f355-feae-f7fd-2c83a4816bb3_WyllIntervened = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:f7d0abb0-d53f-8aeb-3eb8-d77a6c3417d4
msgctxt "h6bc86b67gb9c0g4422gba2eg62d04bac3719"
msgid ""
"Wyll? Gods, please, no. The Blade of Frontiers was supposed to be my secret "
"weapon."
msgstr "윌? 신이시여, 제발, 안 됩니다. 변경의 칼날은 내 비장의 카드여야 했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc8b4b61-70ff-637f-a094-0461a5bba0ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:fc8b4b61-70ff-637f-a094-0461a5bba0ef
msgctxt "hf4ed154cg4844g41f4g9a01g775dc0cd3093"
msgid "'Gortash'... That name... It's sickeningly familiar..."
msgstr "'고타쉬'... 그 이름... 구역질나게 익숙한데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Counsellor Florrick
#. NodeID = fcc6f16a-d2f5-06de-9be9-1060523eac75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:fcc6f16a-d2f5-06de-9be9-1060523eac75
msgctxt "h80f6ce39gaa0bg4a19g8f22g50a0354ab0bd"
msgid "Ye gods, fate has no shortage of troubles to burden us with."
msgstr "신이시여, 운명이 우리에게 주는 부담은 마를 날이 없군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd2832b0-b6ba-763b-c2eb-b59a41406476
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_HasMet(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:fd2832b0-b6ba-763b-c2eb-b59a41406476
msgctxt "h73d937e7gbb40g433cg892eged196ab38388"
msgid "What's with the fellow in the cot?"
msgstr "간이 침대에 누워 있는 친구는 뭐가 문제입니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fffe219f-814c-1ea5-b8e7-5ae8f90dda78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_IsobelGaveOintment = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Florrick:fffe219f-814c-1ea5-b8e7-5ae8f90dda78
msgctxt "hb18192e8gcdf1g4da1g9c4dg165a34787b36"
msgid "I'm heading there shortly."
msgstr "곧 거기로 갈 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_General_AD_OutsideSignPost
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7aab044a-c419-4218-ad0e-ba59cd0ae06c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. Comment = TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_General_AD_OutsideSignPost:7aab044a-c419-4218-ad0e-ba59cd0ae06c
msgctxt "hf473c0ecg6532g49e6g81f3gd1dab4085d5e"
msgid ""
"*For a warm bed and full stomach, look no further. Welcome to the Last Light "
"Inn.*"
msgstr "*따뜻한 침대와 허기진 배를 채우길 원한다면, 더는 헤매지 마세요. 최후의 빛 여관에 오신 것을 환영합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Fist J'ehlar
#. NodeID = 3ebe9200-33d4-316d-f921-8480364ca639
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:3ebe9200-33d4-316d-f921-8480364ca639
msgctxt "h48b5e2acg4126g489ag83c8gee8104cea684"
msgid "We've tried that. Nothing."
msgstr "저희도 시도해보았습니다만. 반응은 없었습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 422b545a-f65a-f7c8-305e-38ad44f56dc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_ItemReturned = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:422b545a-f65a-f7c8-305e-38ad44f56dc6
msgctxt "h8364d132g61edg4141g8395g76c4947d6483"
msgid "Is it working? I thought he would be awake."
msgstr "효과가 있는가? 그가 곧바로 깨어날 줄 알았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Fist J'ehlar
#. NodeID = 4b5212b2-1578-e3a6-59a7-732cce3ce503
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:4b5212b2-1578-e3a6-59a7-732cce3ce503
msgctxt "h3b145e6cgac43g4a8bg984agfa6cc8ca7686"
msgid "Of course. We look after our own."
msgstr "물론입니다. 피스트 대원은 피스트 대원이 돌봐야죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5251c6e0-8c21-455c-31e6-56386f0ae451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_ItemReturned = True
#.   Local:
#.      - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:5251c6e0-8c21-455c-31e6-56386f0ae451
msgctxt "hd1b9d657g8400g411ag81c0gaf3018ad7770"
msgid "He's looking at me, I'm sure of it."
msgstr "그가 날 보고 있네. 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Fist J'ehlar
#. NodeID = 55fe8f00-8448-c99f-8e41-7a804bc260b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:55fe8f00-8448-c99f-8e41-7a804bc260b1
msgctxt "he615694cg1b2eg496bg88d1g37a683d4aeef"
msgid "Just a blink, unfortuntunately."
msgstr "눈만 깜박였을 뿐입니다, 안타깝게도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 6d5c8613-49d6-4e49-8b0e-e8d030237dfd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:6d5c8613-49d6-4e49-8b0e-e8d030237dfd
msgctxt "h4609f251g4cd2g4074g88d6g92a571551e40"
msgid "Do not give up hope just yet."
msgstr "아직 희망을 버리지 말게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Fist J'ehlar
#. NodeID = 7373d500-137e-4d88-b663-efd1b31cb0cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:7373d500-137e-4d88-b663-efd1b31cb0cd
msgctxt "h858135cbg262eg46cfg8e17g877ebb33cf17"
msgid "Something's improved, but his wits may take time."
msgstr "뭔가 나아졌습니다만, 이성이 돌아오기까지는 시간이 걸릴 듯합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7f403621-d084-41d3-a4b3-14be5a8d1eaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:7f403621-d084-41d3-a4b3-14be5a8d1eaf
msgctxt "h8d9ead11g9afcg403bgabb0g9fe80d06aa0c"
msgid "Time is not something we have in abundance. Lives are at stake."
msgstr "시간이 충분하지 않네. 여러 사람의 목숨이 달려 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 85d7d17d-cfd1-217a-36f1-73fc23f04986
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:85d7d17d-cfd1-217a-36f1-73fc23f04986
msgctxt "hc980cd2cgfb61g4f3dgb203gf15ad022b7e6"
msgid "Art? Hail, Art - can you hear me?"
msgstr "아트? 오, 아트 - 내 말이 들리는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 88ab9f18-6023-4e1c-a0d9-f7faa566074c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:88ab9f18-6023-4e1c-a0d9-f7faa566074c
msgctxt "hd0713144g78c8g4682g9205gd239520b27bb"
msgid "Has he shown any sign of coming to his senses?"
msgstr "깨어날 조짐이 보였는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9472024a-fc9c-b4b1-5c42-6574a9ae32b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_B = False
#.     - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_C = False
#.     - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:9472024a-fc9c-b4b1-5c42-6574a9ae32b7
msgctxt "h2ecfafa6g81d9g45d0g9dd5g2639935ce3c3"
msgid "He is lucky to have you watching over him, thank you."
msgstr "자네가 옆을 지켜주고 있다니 아트는 운이 좋은 자로군, 고맙네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9d5d33d5-75d7-1747-6227-ad214ea2a163
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:9d5d33d5-75d7-1747-6227-ad214ea2a163
msgctxt "h0d863bfag6a30g4377gacccg817f3c1b7edf"
msgid "One from which he will awaken soon."
msgstr "그가 곧 깨어날 거라는 의미지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Fist J'ehlar
#. NodeID = e48915c1-16f6-6089-8505-ad14c6950c2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:e48915c1-16f6-6089-8505-ad14c6950c2f
msgctxt "ha0ba2301g4026g4d43g9b1cgd93fca82222e"
msgid "Indeed - some more life is flowing into him."
msgstr "예 - 전보다 더 많은 생기가 흐르고 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Fist J'ehlar
#. NodeID = e7ad21a8-8d5d-18a2-8651-342ba4d85aa7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:e7ad21a8-8d5d-18a2-8651-342ba4d85aa7
msgctxt "hd278a0edg4cbag4a23g81fagfe5af88d39fe"
msgid "Hard to tell. Sometimes he stirs and moans as if in a nightmare."
msgstr "모르겠습니다. 가끔 악몽을 꾸고 있는 것처럼 몸을 뒤척이고 앓는 소리를 냅니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ec6ba9ee-0f9c-03dc-e2d8-4658f03557f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_ItemReturned = True
#.   Local:
#.      - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_B = False
#.     - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_C = False
#.     - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:ec6ba9ee-0f9c-03dc-e2d8-4658f03557f1
msgctxt "hc89ce07fg3e04g4dd9g89feg8673aebf0a7d"
msgid "He blinked. A code perhaps?"
msgstr "눈을 깜박였군. 일종의 신호인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f145ea88-5191-d51d-15fc-d3f6e0109281
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:f145ea88-5191-d51d-15fc-d3f6e0109281
msgctxt "h809f8124g3d6eg407bg9a04gecc12747ea9c"
msgid "I wonder if he can hear us."
msgstr "우리 말이 들리는지 궁금하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Fist J'ehlar
#. NodeID = f83f2894-3a09-86e7-fa42-3af34d97ad47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:f83f2894-3a09-86e7-fa42-3af34d97ad47
msgctxt "hf7d161b2gb75bg46acgb257gd61a62acd587"
msgid "Yes... I think so. Art? Can you hear us?"
msgstr "예... 그런 것 같습니다. 아트? 우리 말이 들립니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = fd05ebfc-5431-3018-cd97-fbf69be9a00c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_ItemReturned = True
#.   Local:
#.      - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e2b5abd4-e90e-7b14-6955-6387b07d8b6e_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:fd05ebfc-5431-3018-cd97-fbf69be9a00c
msgctxt "h9a6b34d2gd532g4c70ga601gf403e574aa57"
msgid "His pallor is improving, at least."
msgstr "적어도 그의 안색이 좋아지고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = fe3b9a2b-8b50-2cb4-f447-d6ae5abc70e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:fe3b9a2b-8b50-2cb4-f447-d6ae5abc70e4
msgctxt "hb5245ef1g7cb1g471egab6fgc7f4776aba31"
msgid "Now if only words would flow out of him."
msgstr "이제 말만 할 수 있으면 될 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk
#. Speaker = Fist J'ehlar
#. NodeID = ff8d8ccb-3b64-4a16-b2ec-33c9d90acb8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_BedTalk:ff8d8ccb-3b64-4a16-b2ec-33c9d90acb8e
msgctxt "h2d199709g734eg40eeg83c7g90de6e062fad"
msgid "None. His wits have departed him, I fear."
msgstr "아니오. 이성이 그에게서 완전히 떠나버린 것 같습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 005932d7-3099-4430-292e-3f5c016ccbc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_State_ChannelingComplete = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_State_FinishedADs = True
#. TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat:005932d7-3099-4430-292e-3f5c016ccbc3
msgctxt "hec960dd5g706fg488fg84d0g40cf04384141"
msgid ""
"It's ready - I'm going through. May the Oak Father guide me back to you."
msgstr "준비는 끝났어 - 이제 들어가겠네. 참나무 아버지께서 자네가 있는 곳으로 안내해주시길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1828f7ab-1a67-30fd-2603-0de87a95452c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_H = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_D = False
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_E = False
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_G = False
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_B = False
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_H = False
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_F = False
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_C = False
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_A = False
#. TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat:1828f7ab-1a67-30fd-2603-0de87a95452c
msgctxt "hbe2fbd21g2083g40a8g8adcge0337eb9112e"
msgid "<i>Open - let me pass. I beseech. I beg. I DEMAND!</i>"
msgstr "<i>지나갈 수 있도록 열려라. 이렇게 간청하나니. 제발. <b>명령하노라!</b></i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 19ff37c1-1949-2172-65b1-659a1f59eb76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_C = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_C = True
#. TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat:19ff37c1-1949-2172-65b1-659a1f59eb76
msgctxt "h03a532adg7f7fg4396g800ag67be16f6756d"
msgid "<i>Carve a way through the shadows. Cast light on what is sought.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그림자 속에서 길을 개척하라. 찾고자 하는 것에 빛을 밝혀라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 62498552-14e7-a219-b72c-03ed3ad79bb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_F = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_F = True
#. TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat:62498552-14e7-a219-b72c-03ed3ad79bb1
msgctxt "h9dbc3c76gedb7g46cagbef7g5f9a79313ce6"
msgid "<i>Yield to this pilgrim. Do not hamper his path.</i>"
msgstr "<i>순례자에게 길을 내주어라. 그의 길을 방해하지 말지어다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7ed9cf14-7edf-1fde-4c04-2402d8c7b126
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_B = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_B = True
#. TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat:7ed9cf14-7edf-1fde-4c04-2402d8c7b126
msgctxt "h4d0507aag68f2g4011g85d2g214e9de22865"
msgid ""
"<i>Make a doorway from nothingness. Grant me passage.\n"
"</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>무에서 문을 만들어내라. 나에게 길을 허락하라.\n"
"</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9a98b776-0f06-c3c9-91e0-7954816a37f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_D = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_D = True
#. TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat:9a98b776-0f06-c3c9-91e0-7954816a37f6
msgctxt "ha8cab97fg8a06g4753gb258g09cf51916679"
msgid "It's working - just give me some more time!"
msgstr "효과가 있어 - 조금만 시간을 벌어주게!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = cde14980-b152-29db-239a-0800ed574b3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_E = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_E = True
#. TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat:cde14980-b152-29db-239a-0800ed574b3a
msgctxt "hc45877bbgf15cg47e1gadaaged87954208c8"
msgid "<i>Map the impossible. Light the way, well and true.</i>"
msgstr "<i>불가능을 그려라. 온전히, 길을 비추어라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e33385b7-eba6-7720-239a-132c2c5f1f63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_G = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_G = True
#. TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat:e33385b7-eba6-7720-239a-132c2c5f1f63
msgctxt "hc34d371ag3d35g4ad3g8be3g8168d87729cd"
msgid "Nearly there! Just another moment!"
msgstr "거의 다 왔네! 조금만 더!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f8014d73-79c8-2d1d-7ca1-32b3f9ea2a98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - c5d19755-ee0e-b704-2c81-e4d8d1e80fab_A = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
