#. TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_AD_HalsinCombat:f8014d73-79c8-2d1d-7ca1-32b3f9ea2a98
msgctxt "ha0c671b7gb530g4276gb98eg59516b9c16ff"
msgid "<i>Part the veil separating darkness from light.</i>"
msgstr "<i>어둠과 빛을 나누는 장막을 걷어내라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 055c9c5b-e886-e500-3035-9d50333ab2ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin_Event_AcknowledgedNightsongFreed(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:055c9c5b-e886-e500-3035-9d50333ab2ca
msgctxt "h8018bd45gb1b3g4d7fg8e18ga344d1ad16db"
msgid ""
"Any word? I can't help but fear the chance to save Thaniel is slipping away "
"from us..."
msgstr "아무 소식 없는가? 테니엘을 구할 기회가 점점 멀어져가는 것 같아 두렵네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0aa8e1c3-7e49-4458-3fc2-13a3f280ea6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:0aa8e1c3-7e49-4458-3fc2-13a3f280ea6e
msgctxt "hd2893f60g0ad9g45d6gac56g042f060aa740"
msgid "There was no other way."
msgstr "다른 방법이 없었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 1a99935b-b77d-c894-930d-6fc4b0b7d8d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:1a99935b-b77d-c894-930d-6fc4b0b7d8d9
msgctxt "hea0405dag5e98g4d4cg8572g148135cf615c"
msgid ""
"That is what I needed to know. It should be cause for joy, but... that poor "
"man didn't have to die."
msgstr "내가 알고자 했던 정보일세. 기뻐해야 할 소식이네만... 그 불쌍한 남자는 죽을 필요가 없었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1db974f7-c7e4-2008-4e52-9e94e733d861
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_State_HasWokenUpFist = False
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_ItemCollected(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:1db974f7-c7e4-2008-4e52-9e94e733d861
msgctxt "hcb81a1b4g7e71g4374g927dgb30f43748441"
msgid "I found a lute. It seems to have belonged to the Flaming Fist."
msgstr "류트를 찾았어요. 플레이밍 피스트의 것으로 보이는데요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 2c4961ae-d6a6-951c-acfd-a10397ca5854
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:2c4961ae-d6a6-951c-acfd-a10397ca5854
msgctxt "h4c6cbfa7g54a0g4e00gb74ag74204fd6a10d"
msgid "What news?"
msgstr "새로운 소식이라도 있는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 368a8467-87a8-87dd-c31c-8381f0b1f6be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_State_HalsinGoToLake = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:368a8467-87a8-87dd-c31c-8381f0b1f6be
msgctxt "hcb1f039bg4407g4bbegac43g5dbe753a3201"
msgid ""
"Meet me at the lakeshore, and be prepared. What comes next will be perilous."
msgstr "호숫가에서 만나세나, 그리고 만반의 준비를 하고 오게. 앞으로 다가올 일은 위험하니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e1ecfeb-a202-dfcc-0eb4-fc9762c025b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin_Event_SearchFistInventoryAdvice(1) = False
#.      - HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin_Event_AskedForFistAdvice(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin_Event_SearchFistInventoryAdvice(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:3e1ecfeb-a202-dfcc-0eb4-fc9762c025b1
msgctxt "h111666ceg3dfeg40daga034g793147fe89f3"
msgid "Sounds like we could be looking for almost anything to wake him."
msgstr "그를 깨울 수 있을 만한 걸 닥치는 대로 다 찾아보라는 소리로 들리는데요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 435c2938-4a89-a2d2-cbb1-288a7127cfa0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:435c2938-4a89-a2d2-cbb1-288a7127cfa0
msgctxt "h41930c75g26dfg42b6gbf73g905d1a663d0f"
msgid "Good - its music might help restore him. Bring it to him."
msgstr "잘했네 - 류트의 음악이 컬라흐의 회복을 도울 수 있을 지도 몰라. 어서 가져와 보게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 47203b20-3fd3-5d1f-e17c-3a758ce6f47f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin_Event_AcknowledgedNightsongFreed(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_State_HasWokenUpFist = False
#.      - HAV_CursedFist_State_PermaDefeated = False
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin_Event_AcknowledgedNightsongFreed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:47203b20-3fd3-5d1f-e17c-3a758ce6f47f
msgctxt "h789b5f70g0f44g427egaf05g7e22b4f7e2f0"
msgid ""
"That Flaming Fist sleeps deeply - even when that winged aasimar tore through "
"the skies overhead, he did not stir."
msgstr ""
"저 플레이밍 피스트 대원은 깊이 잠들어 있군 - 날개 달린 아시마르가 머리 위의 하늘을 찢어버릴 듯이 날아가도, 미동조차 하지 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4727f970-e469-2a65-7e96-3c031ac3243d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:4727f970-e469-2a65-7e96-3c031ac3243d
msgctxt "h311c12f3g2da8g4a6bgb6acge743a25a42cd"
msgid ""
"Now an assault is brewing against Moonrise - our time may be running short. "
"We need to awaken the fist before it's too late."
msgstr ""
"이제 문라이즈를 공격할 조짐이 보이고 있으니 - 우리에겐 시간이 얼마 남지 않았네. 너무 늦기 전에 이 피스트 대원을 깨워야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 49ca11bc-4a3c-2cc7-83f0-db17e1b552ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin_Event_AcknowledgedNightsongFreed(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_State_HasWokenUpFist = False
#.      - HAV_CursedFist_State_PermaDefeated = False
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:49ca11bc-4a3c-2cc7-83f0-db17e1b552ce
msgctxt "h5fa26fb9g3718g48faga0f7g8d8c821a88f6"
msgid ""
"That fist could sleep through the end of the world - and he may do so yet, "
"unless we can rouse him."
msgstr "저 피스트 대원은 세상이 끝나는 날까지 잠들어 있을 수 있네 - 우리가 깨우지 않는 한 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a3e8a29-c334-d075-b335-ae0d7c379ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin_Event_AskedForFistAdvice(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin_Event_AskedForFistAdvice(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:4a3e8a29-c334-d075-b335-ae0d7c379ec6
msgctxt "h0413e7b1g2417g4fb1ga60dga082a4bfbe7d"
msgid "Any ideas?"
msgstr "좋은 생각이 있나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 52e4ee66-d28a-5880-1336-ea633faa5a1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:52e4ee66-d28a-5880-1336-ea633faa5a1c
msgctxt "h218d0924g8597g433bga778g7874a48395c3"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7380ecd2-b07b-f703-cb17-6767da29a42e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:7380ecd2-b07b-f703-cb17-6767da29a42e
msgctxt "h6f1bef26ga964g4ecfgaf4dg85d42aa03115"
msgid "You can claim it so... but I don't think it will ever be true."
msgstr "그렇게 말할 수도 있겠지만... 단언할 수는 없을 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 7675b609-7c30-16cf-3099-6a9c400494b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_State_HasWokenUpFist = False
#.      - HAV_CursedFist_State_PermaDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:7675b609-7c30-16cf-3099-6a9c400494b3
msgctxt "h5b724c21gd31dg47fbg8e67g297d4eef2d7e"
msgid ""
"That Flaming Fist survived the Shadowfell - I need to talk to him. There "
"must be a way to rouse him from his stupor."
msgstr ""
"저 플레이밍 피스트 대원은 섀도펠에서 살아나왔네 - 그와 이야기해야겠어. 이 남자를 혼수상태에서 깨울 방법이 반드시 있을 것이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 771f159c-66a1-185f-15c7-c8f2b9fe8a3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_State_HasWokenUpFist = False
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_HasWrit(1) = True
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_ItemCollected(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:771f159c-66a1-185f-15c7-c8f2b9fe8a3f
msgctxt "h11dfccb1ge925g41dcg9afeg6eda213ad814"
msgid "I found a writ on the Flaming Fist."
msgstr "플레이밍 피스트가 쓴 글을 찾았어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 845e5d67-6b14-feb3-e166-a8b8623bc445
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_State_KnowsBreathLocation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:845e5d67-6b14-feb3-e166-a8b8623bc445
msgctxt "h97bb28fegd6cag4215g997cgca2b5ec5a287"
msgid ""
"<i>Tell Halsin what you learned from speaking to the corpse of the Flaming "
"Fist.</i>"
msgstr "<i>플레이밍 피스트 대원의 시체와 대화했던 내용을 할신에게 말해준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 84e75187-b441-5513-a819-831efc3ed7fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:84e75187-b441-5513-a819-831efc3ed7fc
msgctxt "h7a8aba27gb3f6g4c66g9892geccb40220463"
msgid ""
"An omen of change if I ever saw one - we should double our efforts to save "
"Thaniel, before fate wrests the chance from us. What news?"
msgstr ""
"변화의 암울한 징조로군 - 운명이 우리에게서 기회를 빼앗아 가기 전에 노력을 배가해서라도 테니엘을 구해야 하네. 새로운 소식이라도 있는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8ce9288d-768b-0c00-f132-3f9fe6c5d66f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:8ce9288d-768b-0c00-f132-3f9fe6c5d66f
msgctxt "hf6bdcc4cgefddg463dgb5a9g5cccd6be6be1"
msgid ""
"See what you can learn from it. It might reveal something about his actions "
"before the curse - then we may find means to wake him."
msgstr "내용을 확인해보게. 저주에 걸리기 전 컬라흐가 뭘 했는지 알 수 있을 거야 - 그러면 깨울 방법을 찾을 수 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8e3150bc-5eba-48be-5969-68fb6c3a8ec0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:8e3150bc-5eba-48be-5969-68fb6c3a8ec0
msgctxt "hf8111f0dg7bc2g4725g8a78g845fffe81ce0"
msgid ""
"I'm afraid so, yes. Check his person - there might be something on him to "
"help get us started."
msgstr "유감스럽지만, 그렇네. 먼저 그를 살펴보게 - 추적의 실마리를 줄 무언가를 지니고 있을지도 모르니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 937a70ff-27eb-8809-0cdf-250b2cce81fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:937a70ff-27eb-8809-0cdf-250b2cce81fe
msgctxt "h3f8075dcg0279g41fdgb918g1889e57e6e84"
msgid ""
"His existence was worse than death. Now he's at peace, and we have what we "
"need."
msgstr "컬라흐는 죽느니만 못한 상태였어요. 이제 그는 안식을 찾았고, 우리는 원하는 걸 얻었잖아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 94d0d968-8ade-1f08-8f2f-06392bc53c17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:94d0d968-8ade-1f08-8f2f-06392bc53c17
msgctxt "hce623a94g59c7g4c52gbd10g4de9cd70020c"
msgid ""
"Oak Father willing, we will soon lift the curse from this place. But I "
"suspect a shadow will linger here, because of what was done to that man."
msgstr ""
"참나무 아버지여 당신의 뜻에 따라, 저희는 이 땅의 저주를 걷어낼 것입니다. 허나 이 남자가 당한 일로 이곳에 그림자가 남아있게 될 것이 "
"두렵나이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 96d3cf67-a65b-274b-f5ba-653bb5d23e07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin_Event_AcknowledgedNightsongFreed(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin_Event_AcknowledgedNightsongFreed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:96d3cf67-a65b-274b-f5ba-653bb5d23e07
msgctxt "h755faad2g8dc1g4275ga25fg6b8bef9fcfd9"
msgid ""
"A winged aasimar tore through the skies like a bolt of lightning, crying for "
"vengeance."
msgstr "날개 달린 아시마르가 복수를 외치며 한 줄기 번개처럼 하늘을 찢으며 날아갔네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 97ae9616-64a6-e973-4ebb-154550169b67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:97ae9616-64a6-e973-4ebb-154550169b67
msgctxt "h1984660dg4dd4g4745g8149g0348607bf296"
msgid ""
"We need to unlock whatever's left of him, inside his head. There must be "
"something to trigger him - a word, a memory, an item. We just need to find "
"it."
msgstr ""
"이 남자의 머릿속에 남아있는 걸 알아내야 하네. 깨울 수 있는 계기 - 단어, 기억, 물건 등이 남아있을걸세. 그걸 찾기만 하면 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = adb9a2d5-e4f5-e547-fb59-9d8ab534f66c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:adb9a2d5-e4f5-e547-fb59-9d8ab534f66c
msgctxt "h1a16337cg843cg484fgbb71g5f3e87f20c86"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b314a8af-6b11-a768-a837-70d27ac1039d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:b314a8af-6b11-a768-a837-70d27ac1039d
msgctxt "h65951d37ga980g4c82gb9a3ge0d80c97cd4f"
msgid "True. But are we still deserving? Only time and nature can tell."
msgstr "자네 말이 맞네. 하지만 우리에게 그럴 자격이 있었는가? 이건 오직 시간과 자연만이 답할 수 있는 것이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e867f3a3-f8f9-8990-f83c-bd96a8bb03d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin:e867f3a3-f8f9-8990-f83c-bd96a8bb03d2
msgctxt "h629c9ecag133eg4963g9dbbgebc77aa756b4"
msgid ""
"If he was able to escape the Shadowfell, then it mustn't have managed to "
"consume his spirit - not all of it, anyway."
msgstr "컬라흐가 섀도펠을 탈출할 수 있었다는 건 영혼이 완전히 잠식되지는 않았음을 의미하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath:f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
msgctxt "h048de57cgf5d0g4ea1g84a6g5916e7dd91a3"
msgid "He's dead. And he took any chance of lifting the curse with him."
msgstr "할신이 죽었어. 함께 저주를 풀 수 있는 기회를 영영 잃었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath:f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
msgctxt "hbfd74448g4ed6g4130g9908ged184f029d9d"
msgid ""
"Rest in peace, proud druid. What a pity his death means the Sharran curse "
"will remain alive and well."
msgstr "자랑스러운 드루이드여, 평안히 잠들길. 할신의 죽음으로 샤의 저주가 활개 칠 것을 생각하니 안타깝군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath:f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
msgctxt "h1bde0ebcge144g4850g8403gd4f01e5b2859"
msgid "Oh no. Halsin!"
msgstr "안돼. 할신!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath:f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
msgctxt "h3146fb81g4d1eg43eeg9747g414f1aac4c2b"
msgid "Dead. And with him, the chances of lifting the shadows."
msgstr "죽었군. 그림자 저주를 풀 기회도 함께."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath:f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
msgctxt "hdcdd7315ga402g41f3g88ceg1c731bd05f2c"
msgid "He's dead. And so is any chance of lifting this curse."
msgstr "할신이 죽었어. 그림자 저주를 풀 기회도 사라졌고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath:f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
msgctxt "h4b05b2b5gda78g4ed2g8da2gbbba3a0c7466"
msgid "Damn it all - Halsin's gone."
msgstr "젠장 - 할신이 죽었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinDeath:f2f5cf9e-4ad4-4704-9526-c84828589f94
msgctxt "hfd4740a5g6c64g4038ga86fgf60b16162931"
msgid "Halsin... he's dead. No chance of lifting the curse now."
msgstr "할신... 할신이 죽었어. 이제 저주를 풀 방법이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal:79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
msgctxt "h03286f3ag291bg4b89ga49dgf46e05a1d671"
msgid "Hells, he did it. He's through to the Shadowfell."
msgstr "세상에, 그가 해냈어. 섀도펠로 넘어갔다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal:79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
msgctxt "h436f31bag79b6g45f5g9b43gf40412cf8747"
msgid ""
"There he goes, into the Shadowfell. Let's hope his mind and body are up to "
"the challenges that await in that fabled place."
msgstr "그렇게 섀도펠로 들어가는군. 할신의 정신과 육체가 저 전설적인 장소에 도사리고 있는 도전을 견뎌낼 수 있길 빌어보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal:79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
msgctxt "hc0197e14g39c0g4550ga58ega567c3242945"
msgid "It worked! Halsin's in the Shadowfell now."
msgstr "이게 통했어! 할신은 이제 섀도펠에 있다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal:79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
msgctxt "h27d011ddgae75g4747gaf2cg9e07658f5d2d"
msgid ""
"Halsin now walks the Plane of Shadow. And not all that enters will return..."
msgstr "할신이 이제 그림자의 차원을 걷는군. 허나 들어가는 모든 것이 돌아오지는 않지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal:79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
msgctxt "h8f088f9dg1e43g4949gb8abg0338b8f8fb5a"
msgid ""
"He's gone. The Shadowfell holds him now - unless he can find his way back."
msgstr "할신은 가버렸어. 이제 섀도펠이 그를 붙잡고 있지 - 돌아올 길을 찾지 못하는 한은 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal:79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
msgctxt "hb19610ceg31bbg484dg94afgc068036579ea"
msgid ""
"I'll be damned - the portal worked. Here's hoping he makes it back in one "
"piece."
msgstr "빌어먹을 - 차원문이 작동했군. 할신이 온전히 돌아와야 할텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_HalsinReachedPortal:79dc19da-abff-4741-86f3-0fee06389831
msgctxt "h0c98a422g0220g421bga3f0gc5806d583457"
msgid "He made it. Now let's just hope he survives what's on the other side."
msgstr "할신이 해냈어. 이제 다른 쪽에 있는 것들에게서 살아남길 바라자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0:feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
msgctxt "h9b0b8796ga31ag466dgbf28g2fb0a70dcd7e"
msgid "This curse really doesn't want to be lifted!"
msgstr "정말 끈질긴 저주군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0:feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
msgctxt "h096d5bbcgb2e1g496bgb2bdg8209864630d0"
msgid "Strike them down, protect the portal!"
msgstr "놈들을 해치워라, 차원문을 지켜!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0:feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
msgctxt "hc709fd7bg48bdg4577ga717g527fe79b4afb"
msgid "The shadow curse is gathering its forces. Got to protect the portal."
msgstr "그림자 저주가 병력을 모으고 있어. 차원문을 지켜야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0:feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
msgctxt "hcdd8549cg5aedg474bg9113g01d4990da3e1"
msgid "Need to keep these things at bay until Halsin's back."
msgstr "할신이 돌아올 때까지 막아내야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0:feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
msgctxt "h1ed3e299g6cf3g4ba1gb932gd84e5643b002"
msgid "The shadows' forces have come. Guard that portal!"
msgstr "그림자들이 왔어. 차원문을 지켜!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0:feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
msgctxt "h49eca45cg32b9g4ff9g9d55gc33a9ddabdef"
msgid "Come at me you fucking shades."
msgstr "그림자 새끼들아, 덤벼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned0:feed67bb-b8a1-4362-8752-0e12997de486
msgctxt "hde592518g0b27g4844g8cfbg17a7d0acc85b"
msgid "We need to protect the portal!"
msgstr "차원문을 지켜야 해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1:311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
msgctxt "hbedcc90dge21dg474aga3e5ge812e537c1ec"
msgid ""
"Followers of the Absolute? Seems the curse isn't picky when it comes to "
"victims."
msgstr "절대자의 추종자들? 저주가 대상을 고르는데 그렇게 까다롭진 않나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1:311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
msgctxt "he89c1e6agf6adg4c80gbc12g34bfc21da769"
msgid "Cultists. Not even the Absolute's faithful are immune."
msgstr "추종자들이다. 그 절대자의 신실한 신도들도 저주에 면역은 아니군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1:311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
msgctxt "h19faf72cgc7f1g40d3gad78gcae9317a193b"
msgid ""
"If only the curse had taken all of the Absolute's followers - we'd claim two "
"birds with one stone."
msgstr "이 저주가 모든 절대자의 추종자들을 삼켰더라면 - 일석이조였겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1:311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
msgctxt "hf69aada9g68f8g422dgb3e4g885f561be836"
msgid "Absolute followers, seized by the curse. Foes all the same."
msgstr "절대자의 추종자들이 저주에 삼켜졌군. 적인 건 매한가지야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1:311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
msgctxt "h299d7a19g992fg44f7gb5eeged839f48e81c"
msgid "What's worse than cultists? Cursed cultists, of course."
msgstr "추종자들보다 더 나쁜 게 뭐가 있겠냐고? 저주받은 추종자들이지, 당연히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1:311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
msgctxt "h9d71c04dg257cg4ea6g90degc29902332bc9"
msgid "Shadow's been swallowing cultists."
msgstr "그림자가 추종자들도 삼키고 있었나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned1:311b8cc6-af9a-4d08-bf29-f16037508e87
msgctxt "hb3a20161gfaeag496cg99d5gd4a34c7c0105"
msgid ""
"Looks like the curse claimed some of the Absolute's followers as its own."
msgstr "저주가 절대자의 추종자들마저도 삼켜버린 듯하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2:a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
msgctxt "h2704180fg44f4g41e2ga554g42b0dd69b3e2"
msgid ""
"I'm not an impatient man, but Halsin is taking his bloody time in there."
msgstr "나 꽤 참을성 있는 사람인데, 할신이 저 안에서 너무 오래 죽치고 앉아있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2:a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
msgctxt "hcf74120fgf142g431cg97fbg4d410d64d4d0"
msgid "More cursed enemies still. Halsin needs to hurry."
msgstr "저주받은 적들이 더 있군. 할신이 서둘러야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2:a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
msgctxt "h89b5e2e0gaabbg44a4g878ag00a6777a0217"
msgid ""
"Enemies popping up like weeds. Halsin better conclude his search very soon..."
msgstr "적이 잡초처럼 튀어나오는군. 할신이 서둘러 수색을 끝내야 할 텐데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2:a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
msgctxt "h7b1b4d16g09c6g41b0ga4ecg16f957efbc75"
msgid "They'll just keep coming until that portal is gone - where is Halsin?!"
msgstr "차원문이 있는 한 계속 몰려올 거야 - 할신은 어딨지?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2:a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
msgctxt "h6a739337g51f2g431cg8bebg7af2537fb7bf"
msgid "They just keep coming. Halsin, would you hurry it up in there?"
msgstr "계속 몰려오고 있어. 할신, 좀 서둘러줄 순 없어요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2:a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
msgctxt "h1e5f2481gce1ag46e1g85bag237ef6a9df12"
msgid "How many more of these can we take?"
msgstr "얼마나 더 버텨내야 하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned2:a6dfd815-5fc7-432d-a18e-b2474419f0c4
msgctxt "h14a6e3afgc8c9g4612g9b79gdc782f55f015"
msgid "More foes - Halsin better get back soon."
msgstr "적이 더 많아졌어 - 할신이 어서 돌아와야 할 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3:26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
msgctxt "h9865826fg1fedg469cg9c00gf3d10480b4b0"
msgid "Shadow-cursed gith? As if they weren't bad enough normally."
msgstr "그림자 저주를 받은 기스? 안 그래도 상대하기 힘든데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3:26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
msgctxt "hb8f43194g3627g4d3eg8c4fgcfe6a9efdf6c"
msgid "The shadows have infected githyanki. Don't hesitate - take them down!"
msgstr "그림자가 기스양키마저 감염시켰다. 망설이지 마 - 놈들을 물리쳐!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3:26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
msgctxt "he10993b8ga9b3g434dg8e13gf0de3296808d"
msgid "Even the githyanki's finest must have succumbed to the curse."
msgstr "기스양키의 정예들도 그림자 저주는 당해내지 못했군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3:26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
msgctxt "he1b5810cgf87cg4878ga2d7gf175ebf151bd"
msgid "Gith warriors? What else is the curse going to throw against us?"
msgstr "기스 전사들? 저주가 또 뭘 가져오려는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3:26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
msgctxt "hcac24de1gc4feg451dg81c0g40c1e18aa935"
msgid "Githyanki warriors. Well, ex-githyanki, to be accurate."
msgstr "기스양키 전사들이군. 음, 정확히 말하자면, 전 기스양키지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3:26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
msgctxt "h66edd68bgc919g4e9ag9be2gb48bf28523aa"
msgid "Gith warriors?! Gods, what hasn't this thing swallowed."
msgstr "기스 전사들?! 빌어먹을, 저주가 안 삼킨 게 대체 뭐야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned3:26913075-c745-4acd-b85e-c96631de4622
msgctxt "h3ddc4dc0g8844g4c36g81e5g6e469155609d"
msgid "Gith warriors? Some must have fallen to the curse."
msgstr "기스 전사들? 누군가가 저주에 쓰러졌나 본데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4:39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
msgctxt "h4361a84bg4c4ag4b9egb8cagb3dcdb207770"
msgid "It's now or never, druid! Get back here!"
msgstr "지금 아니면 안 돼, 드루이드! 당장 돌아와!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4:39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
msgctxt "h9a314708g89f9g4b44ga65egf14570b3ba70"
msgid "The druid's return is imminent! Have to keep foes at bay until then!"
msgstr "드루이드가 곧 돌아온다! 그때까지 적을 막아내야 해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4:39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
msgctxt "h2a43294bgb85eg49f6g967eg58ba4a46d3c2"
msgid "Do not falter - Halsin is near, I can feel it!"
msgstr "약해지지 마 - 할신이 가까워지는 게 느껴져!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4:39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
msgctxt "h6208e0a0g18d2g4273gb30eg01b335db37d9"
msgid ""
"Halsin will be back any moment, surely - just need to hold on a little "
"longer..."
msgstr "할신이 곧 돌아올 거야, - 아주 조금만 더 버티면 돼..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4:39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
msgctxt "h815d3730g1829g4d6bg9c99gdb69c1e549db"
msgid "Godsdamn it, Halsin. We can't hold out forever!"
msgstr "젠장, 할신. 언제까지고 버틸 순 없어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4:39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
msgctxt "h83dec773gd53bg4c83g9199ge45184ffa848"
msgid "Hold on! Halsin will be out soon... right?"
msgstr "버텨! 할신이 곧 나올 거야...그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PAD_WaveSpawned4:39088e72-e0be-4396-a12c-477d3cc9a006
msgctxt "h5e808fb0g36afg4a7ega5ebgd196992928e3"
msgid "I can sense Halsin - we just have to buy him a little more time!"
msgstr "할신의 기운이 느껴져 - 조금만 더 시간을 벌어주자!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 07cb4006-6d6a-b530-008f-e6f0f90a9b7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_Portal_Knows_DontTouchPortal(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:07cb4006-6d6a-b530-008f-e6f0f90a9b7d
msgctxt "hf9c6f547g9e67g49dcgbb2egfe738eaddeb1"
msgid ""
"No. If there's any interference with the portal, then our one chance is lost "
"forever. And so am I."
msgstr "아니. 만약 차원문에 어떠한 방해라도 생겼다간, 유일한 기회가 완전히 사라져버린다네. 나도 마찬가지고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 083ec3b1-0910-e351-9a32-9262248e7d0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:083ec3b1-0910-e351-9a32-9262248e7d0a
msgctxt "h3d057b2bg5f19g48fcg8d36g105cfd0289c8"
msgid "Let's do it."
msgstr "시작하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 0e3d0b0f-1030-e602-289d-a0558eed8485
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:0e3d0b0f-1030-e602-289d-a0558eed8485
msgctxt "h556c5bc5g82c8g485eg8218gc9c4acc3cb32"
msgid ""
"With the Oak Father's blessing, I can infiltrate the Shadowfell, but doing "
"so will sap my strength. I'll need your help if I'm to return."
msgstr ""
"참나무 아버지의 축복으로 나는 섀도펠에 잠입할 수 있네. 그러나 들어서는 순간 내 힘은 약화하지. 돌아오기 위해서는 자네의 도움이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 114c5001-17c8-fe97-62e5-e2267267c79f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:114c5001-17c8-fe97-62e5-e2267267c79f
msgctxt "hbd4897ccgd369g466fgaa13g714e33812aa1"
msgid "You can count on me."
msgstr "맡겨주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1763480d-2ff8-2a62-044b-85af1a34ae23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:1763480d-2ff8-2a62-044b-85af1a34ae23
msgctxt "h8ba5a3ccg5ae9g4a1cg9139g95f360959abe"
msgid "Hold on - shouldn't I come with you?"
msgstr "잠시만요 - 저도 함께 가야 하지 않겠어요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4896234e-183d-70fb-dbdb-249f31b2cd62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:4896234e-183d-70fb-dbdb-249f31b2cd62
msgctxt "h2fc22f5eg5106g4e96g9873g9ab8986723fa"
msgid ""
"No. This opportunity has been a hundred years in the making. It has to be "
"me, and only me."
msgstr "안 되네. 이 기회는 백년 만에 찾아왔어. 들어가는 건 반드시 나여야만 하고, 나 혼자여야만 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4c93d3a4-cc8a-6b7e-f4b1-5b23ea55d639
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_Event_PortalAppears = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:4c93d3a4-cc8a-6b7e-f4b1-5b23ea55d639
msgctxt "h5c2b1655g8f98g4812g8994gaea771633500"
msgid ""
"<i>Oak Father, hear me, aid me. Force open the jaws of Darkness. Make "
"passage for your vessel of Light.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>참나무 아버지여, 들어주소서, 도와주소서. 그 힘으로 어둠의 입을 열어주시고 당신의 빛을 품은 자에게 길을 내어주소서.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4f1e3251-59b6-8d35-2bbc-15807fdde370
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_Portal_Knows_DontTouchPortal(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_Portal_Knows_DontTouchPortal(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:4f1e3251-59b6-8d35-2bbc-15807fdde370
msgctxt "h8cb3fc3egfe5cg4a97gaff5g911ed4905767"
msgid ""
"Let's begin. Whatever happens, do not attempt enter the portal, and do not "
"let anything interfere with it."
msgstr "시작하도록 하지. 무슨 일이 있어도 절대 차원문으로 들어오려 하지 말게. 그리고 그 어떤 것도 차원문을 방해하면 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 63e2329a-1835-6547-8b06-01924a1ce869
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_Portal_Knows_DontTouchPortal(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:63e2329a-1835-6547-8b06-01924a1ce869
msgctxt "h2d076131gabd0g4382g94ddg11cd6f7b586a"
msgid ""
"Let's begin. Remember what I told you - we won't have a second chance here."
msgstr "시작하도록 하지. 부디 명심해주게 - 실패하면 다음은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66b27c77-627a-d945-358b-e9f396b46fcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_ANCIENTS(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:66b27c77-627a-d945-358b-e9f396b46fcf
msgctxt "h9f92a956g7dd0g4369g8e11g5dce3152cb87"
msgid "Upon my oath, druid - I swear you shall be safe."
msgstr "나의 맹세 아래, 당신을 안전히 보호할 것을 약조합니다 - 드루이드여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 87dfdeb9-8943-ccfb-82ab-651ca815a9f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:87dfdeb9-8943-ccfb-82ab-651ca815a9f2
msgctxt "h0a7152f6ga5e5g4231gbfddgd56830adece8"
msgid "I'd rather have you by my side, but this is the only way."
msgstr "자네와 함께 가고 싶지만, 이 방법밖에는 없네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 91cde852-080c-ba86-004d-bc828dafab5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:91cde852-080c-ba86-004d-bc828dafab5d
msgctxt "hdfcdf9aag8c72g4ec9g8533gb67e9ab07004"
msgid ""
"You did - and most splendidly. But if we are to restore the land, there is "
"more to be done."
msgstr "훌륭하게 잘 해주었어. 그러나 이 땅을 회복하기 위해서는 아직 해야 할 일들이 많이 남아있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9a55da68-4f5d-0ae4-291d-0fecc8c046ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:9a55da68-4f5d-0ae4-291d-0fecc8c046ba
msgctxt "hde59db24g50bbg4146gbc81ge6d49d446561"
msgid "We should begin at once, before we lose the opportunity."
msgstr "영영 기회를 잃기 전에 바로 시작해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a01c477f-0f00-078f-17ae-1333e5fc3427
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:a01c477f-0f00-078f-17ae-1333e5fc3427
msgctxt "h26584d03g35f0g46fbg8158g35045c3ba30b"
msgid "Defend it? What do you mean?"
msgstr "지키라고요? 무슨 말입니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a922b6dc-a0ae-f26a-f760-4ce367555249
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:a922b6dc-a0ae-f26a-f760-4ce367555249
msgctxt "h1fec3c6egc371g41c1g9adeg0bfe34548ba7"
msgid "First, I want to know what to expect."
msgstr "앞으로 무슨 일이 일어날지 알고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a9891f8c-d053-f0de-dff2-36ca709aa838
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:a9891f8c-d053-f0de-dff2-36ca709aa838
msgctxt "h1ae525ccg69a1g4289gbdcbg10f6effe07df"
msgid ""
"Very well. Once I begin the ritual, a portal to the Shadowfell will open - "
"one that will help me save Thaniel. Whatever happens - <i>I must go "
"alone.</i>"
msgstr ""
"알겠네. 의식을 시작하게 되면 섀도펠로 향하는 차원문이 열릴걸세 - 그 문을 통해 테니엘을 구해올 수 있어. 무슨 일이 있어도 <i>나 "
"홀로 가야 하네.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = acba3593-58bc-fa1a-d779-080c88b892d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:acba3593-58bc-fa1a-d779-080c88b892d6
msgctxt "h17088993g56a3g4605gab74g78070a71bbdd"
msgid ""
"It took me years of study, of seeking the Oak Father's favour, to find a way "
"to part the veil. Pray that this works."
msgstr "참나무 아버지의 은혜를 구하고 이 장막을 걷어낼 방법을 찾는 데 수년간의 연구가 필요했네. 부디, 효과가 있기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = ad8506a3-bc10-636f-5e06-96b6cc27b4a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:ad8506a3-bc10-636f-5e06-96b6cc27b4a8
msgctxt "hb03c359dg7764g4e04gb971g84a181cd59fa"
msgid ""
"The shadows won't be banished without a fight. Once I open the portal, "
"they'll swarm like carrion birds and try to destroy it. You must not let "
"that happen."
msgstr ""
"그림자들은 싸움 없이 순순히 사라져 주지 않지. 차원문을 연 순간 녀석들은 새 떼처럼 몰려와 문을 부수려 할 걸세. 그걸 반드시 막아야 "
"해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = b7f31304-081f-6ba0-8c65-5f6a4e549918
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_Portal_HasMet(1) = False
#.      - HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin_Event_AcknowledgedNightsongFreed(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_Portal_HasMet(1) = True
#.     - HAV_HalsinQuest_Halsin_Event_AcknowledgedNightsongFreed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:b7f31304-081f-6ba0-8c65-5f6a4e549918
msgctxt "h77c8401ag998bg41bdg9571gf2800e5ca910"
msgid ""
"You're here, good. And not a moment too soon - a winged aasimar was seen in "
"the skies overhead, and now an assault on Moonrise is brewing."
msgstr "좋아, 와 주었군. 때마침 날개 달린 아시마르가 하늘에서 포착되었고, 이제 그를 따라 문라이즈를 공격할 조짐이 보이고 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b89ad36b-1467-495a-7f22-fab3dcd1ebfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_Portal_Event_PlayerReluctant(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:b89ad36b-1467-495a-7f22-fab3dcd1ebfc
msgctxt "he9ae963bg55ebg4deagb4eagf4fe30b4e33f"
msgid "<i>You </i>can begin. I already did my part."
msgstr "<i>당신이</i> 시작해 주세요. 할 일은 다 마쳤습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = bb129bbf-dede-3281-7fb1-113c373ef2a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_State_ReachedPortal = True
#.     - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_Event_ShadowsAppear = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:bb129bbf-dede-3281-7fb1-113c373ef2a2
msgctxt "h37c99f68gfa80g4674gbeb6g6820f320665a"
msgid ""
"It's ready. I'll return with Thaniel as soon as possible. Stay close to the "
"portal - buy me what time you can."
msgstr "준비는 모두 끝났네. 가능한 한 빨리 테니엘을 데리고 돌아오겠네, 차원문 근처에 있으면서 최대한 시간을 벌어주게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = cb9b56ae-e564-f5b4-bdb0-4616c27d3035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:cb9b56ae-e564-f5b4-bdb0-4616c27d3035
msgctxt "hab64353bg683cg4762gb3e5gb9d67561ff9d"
msgid ""
"I need you to stay here. Keep the portal open until I return - and defend it "
"at all costs."
msgstr "여기 있어 주게. 돌아올 때까지 그 어떤 수단과 방법을 가리지 말고 차원문이 닫히지 않도록 지켜야 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d5772797-b20e-23ee-b2c7-4976e92b1dda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:d5772797-b20e-23ee-b2c7-4976e92b1dda
msgctxt "h252b0672g4f37g430ag9facg9f365fac3bff"
msgid "Wrong. You are the beacon that will guide me home."
msgstr "그렇지 않네. 자네는 돌아오는 길을 안내해 줄 등불이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d897342d-402d-2cbd-5c75-20db39e927a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:d897342d-402d-2cbd-5c75-20db39e927a3
msgctxt "h82af2e63g0414g424cgbcc8g3cc4a820841d"
msgid ""
"But I didn't bring you here to witness an old druid's grandstanding. You "
"have a part to play in this - and I trust you will play it well."
msgstr "이 늙은 드루이드의 자기 과시를 보라고 부른 것이 아니야. 여기서 해줘야 하는 역할이 있네 - 자네가 아주 잘해낼 거라 믿어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = d907c0ae-b23b-0ed5-d4f1-1a8346cfbe43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_Portal_Knows_DontTouchPortal(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:d907c0ae-b23b-0ed5-d4f1-1a8346cfbe43
msgctxt "hbdb7a70bg5942g4e52gbb31g11d90fcdfb3a"
msgid ""
"Good. Now it's important that only I pass through the portal once it opens. "
"The magic is fragile - any mistake, and our one chance will be lost forever."
msgstr ""
"좋아. 강조하지만, 차원문이 열린 후에는 오로지 나만이 들어가야 하네. 취약한 마법인 만큼 작은 실수에도 주어진 단 한 번의 기회가 "
"영원히 사라져 버릴 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da3332d9-bd6c-4ae0-2812-97ed24157d15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:da3332d9-bd6c-4ae0-2812-97ed24157d15
msgctxt "haa46ed55g317ag43f7ga760gb5402fe64923"
msgid "Going in alone is suicide. I'll come with you."
msgstr "혼자 들어가는 건 자살행위나 다를 바 없어요. 같이 가겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6919e5f-b2bf-65f7-0267-c1f1490ebc36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:e6919e5f-b2bf-65f7-0267-c1f1490ebc36
msgctxt "h57fee364g6eddg4785gbc8dg0a4c6c5931af"
msgid "What am I to do?"
msgstr "뭘 하면 되죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e6d0d8ca-680a-3a00-1ed0-ccd68129ba85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:e6d0d8ca-680a-3a00-1ed0-ccd68129ba85
msgctxt "h3892053fg3e5fg46cdg8beag61b310e509a0"
msgid ""
"Thaniel is trapped in the Shadowfell, but thanks to your efforts, I know "
"where to look. Now I must go there - alone."
msgstr "테니엘이 섀도펠에 갇혀 있어. 하지만 자네 덕에 어딜 찾아봐야 할지 알게 되었지. 이제 나 혼자 그 곳으로 가야 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e87cc79b-4359-2275-e6c3-91789a6720f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:e87cc79b-4359-2275-e6c3-91789a6720f5
msgctxt "h52161f5fg7b20g4294gbc95g92f7a1c8bd6c"
msgid "Sounds like you don't need my help anymore."
msgstr "할 일이 없는 것 같은데요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e87df987-ab76-b953-df39-56dbc293cf2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_Portal_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_Portal_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Portal:e87df987-ab76-b953-df39-56dbc293cf2d
msgctxt "hc52778cfgc12bg49c5g9474g83311eb4f7c7"
msgid "You're here, good. Now we can begin."
msgstr "와 주었군. 좋아. 이제 시작하도록 하세나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 135ddca2-bcf7-284b-80b9-a57ea6b6264b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge:135ddca2-bcf7-284b-80b9-a57ea6b6264b
msgctxt "hf27ee22cg0e6dg4a59g95e1g8dd83d96741b"
msgid "I need to examine him back at the camp."
msgstr "야영지로 돌아가서 살펴봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2c135657-ba38-11c4-4cd4-06ba7a705d49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge:2c135657-ba38-11c4-4cd4-06ba7a705d49
msgctxt "h67a32278g2025g4905g9142gec3dab45e40b"
msgid "The shadow curse is as strong as ever. Your plan has failed."
msgstr "그림자 저주가 어느 때보다 더 강해졌어요. 계획이 실패한 것 같습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 350f674b-3aae-71ea-2888-735a90939ca2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge:350f674b-3aae-71ea-2888-735a90939ca2
msgctxt "h73dcaec9gb72eg4e61g8ee6gb656ffef8ed4"
msgid ""
"No. Everything went exactly as it was supposed to. But there's something "
"else - something missing from Thaniel."
msgstr "실패가 아니야. 모든 게 계획대로 진행되었네. 하지만 다른, 다른 문제가 있어 - 테니엘에게서 무언가가 사라져버렸네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5304ecfd-9220-48ed-90ed-651772342a13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_Event_HalsinClosesPortal = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge:5304ecfd-9220-48ed-90ed-651772342a13
msgctxt "h2f7bc589g0cf7g4011g84a5g85dc0183f175"
msgid "But something's wrong. Dreadfully wrong."
msgstr "하지만 뭔가가 잘못됐네. 끔찍하게 잘못됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 69f4c50b-b605-9084-5787-d38a69fd53f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge:69f4c50b-b605-9084-5787-d38a69fd53f4
msgctxt "h55f5c724g0e70g4280g950fgc105def22105"
msgid "Yes. I'll bring him back to camp. He'll be safest with us."
msgstr "자네 말이 맞아. 야영지로 데려가도록 하겠네. 우리와 함께 있는 것이 가장 안전할테지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 8a7d4ee9-29c0-07a2-c46c-163db1f98b77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge:8a7d4ee9-29c0-07a2-c46c-163db1f98b77
msgctxt "h59104a00gf7a7g4d9dg97c8g9767167b5f31"
msgid ""
"I need to examine him. I need to understand what's wrong. It's almost like "
"something's <i>missing </i>from him."
msgstr "그를 살펴보아야 하네. 무엇이 잘못되었는지 알아야겠어. 마치 일부가 <i>사라져</i> 버린 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 96e0f3c7-ca48-1dc9-8777-00c8ede7d896
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge:96e0f3c7-ca48-1dc9-8777-00c8ede7d896
msgctxt "h0f3a2c05g3923g4a4cga847gc63153393eb7"
msgid "No, it can't be..."
msgstr "안돼. 그럴 리가..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 9d80d094-2bb5-45fa-87d9-2f6915bc7b02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge:9d80d094-2bb5-45fa-87d9-2f6915bc7b02
msgctxt "h37d36659g023fg44d1gb44fg4ce09ee2a177"
msgid "It's done, I have him."
msgstr "해냈어, 소년을 찾았네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = a36d6e18-8091-d5f8-1c50-d86b374b2dc4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge:a36d6e18-8091-d5f8-1c50-d86b374b2dc4
msgctxt "h1a84fce3gf9c8g4ca5gbc67gc70655d0c14c"
msgid "No - but some part of him is missing. He is... hollow."
msgstr "아니 - 그의 일부가 사라진 것 같네. 마치...텅 비어있는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c4fbe575-8b72-4b61-bb79-decf762bb084
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge:c4fbe575-8b72-4b61-bb79-decf762bb084
msgctxt "h4a5246bbg6d09g4c47g8642g74111daf1d05"
msgid ""
"Come see us when you can. And be careful out there - forces may be rallying "
"against Moonrise, but Ketheric Thorm is most dangerous when cornered. I know "
"from experience."
msgstr ""
"가능할 때 우릴 보러 오게. 그리고 조심하게 - 문라이즈를 공격하기 위해 병력이 집결하고 있다지만, 케서릭 쏨은 궁지에 몰렸을 때가 가장 "
"위협적인 자라네. 경험으로 알고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = e20b7b81-7545-5d34-7086-153817ce378b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge:e20b7b81-7545-5d34-7086-153817ce378b
msgctxt "h84b610fcg914fg4dffg9163g1fa0663d3d8e"
msgid "Come see us, when you can."
msgstr "가능할 때 우릴 만나러 오게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f701b83f-58a7-86a7-dd56-5f6a30126e94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge:f701b83f-58a7-86a7-dd56-5f6a30126e94
msgctxt "h22e760d6g7a05g40b0gb598g58cf3d1fd4f2"
msgid "We need to get Thaniel someplace safe."
msgstr "테니엘을 안전한 곳으로 데려가야 해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc43ca32-0c27-eab0-35ae-10e9268cd34b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEmerge:fc43ca32-0c27-eab0-35ae-10e9268cd34b
msgctxt "h416e69feg976fg4f77g8383g30cb7a137601"
msgid "Is he dead?"
msgstr "테니엘이 죽은 건가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 23e9f5d9-0ed7-4199-a559-079af30f8581
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:23e9f5d9-0ed7-4199-a559-079af30f8581
msgctxt "hc4f2a783ga14ag466dg89e8gd1ed11328937"
msgid ""
"I warned you - told you this was my burden to carry. Why didn't you listen?"
msgstr "경고했잖은가 - 이건 내가 홀로 짊어져야 할 일이라고 말했잖아. 왜 듣지 않은거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 34ad70ca-cbdd-42be-8e1f-2f8fb8dc1592
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:34ad70ca-cbdd-42be-8e1f-2f8fb8dc1592
msgctxt "h38ecec16gd77eg4ca6g854cg73ea986ca029"
msgid ""
"<i>Glory?! </i>There's no glory here. Now there's nothing here - only "
"shadows and the total absence of hope."
msgstr "<i>영광?!</i> 여기에 영광은 없어. 이제 여긴 아무것도 없어 - 오직 그림자와 희망의 부재만이 있을 뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 38a65275-3f09-4966-b34d-64f09c92fcd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:38a65275-3f09-4966-b34d-64f09c92fcd9
msgctxt "h7bb4062ag7ab0g490ag852egadb814619a2b"
msgid "I did all the work here - I couldn't just let you take the glory."
msgstr "여기서 모든 일을 한 건 저니까요 - 당신이 영광을 차지하는 걸 두고 볼 수만은 없었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 4d78c592-62fe-4d2c-abb3-e8ea4547ce08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:4d78c592-62fe-4d2c-abb3-e8ea4547ce08
msgctxt "h57f156b7g311dg4282ga6e5gb1499f5cee28"
msgid ""
"It wasn't just power this needed - it was wisdom, <i>understanding</i>. I "
"suffered along with this place for years trying to understand the curse... "
"and it seems I will continue to do so."
msgstr ""
"힘만 필요했던 것이 아닐세 - 지혜와 <i>이해</i>도 필요했네. 이 곳과 함께 수년을 고통받으며 저주를 이해하려 노력했어... "
"앞으로도 그래야 할 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57baccac-104d-4baf-b8f5-514f36d233c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:57baccac-104d-4baf-b8f5-514f36d233c7
msgctxt "had0f4230g41c0g4f6cgb99agc36113d41ced"
msgid "I thought my powers were equal to yours."
msgstr "제 힘이 당신만큼 강할 거라고 생각했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 5fd3855c-a6dd-4dbd-a66c-cebcf304cfcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:5fd3855c-a6dd-4dbd-a66c-cebcf304cfcb
msgctxt "h982e243dg0010g46fag8bf1g9914ec995a11"
msgid ""
"We were this close to healing these lands. Now your arrogance has torn open "
"the wounds once more."
msgstr "이 땅을 치유하기 직전이었네. 이제 자네의 오만함이 그 상처를 다시 한번 더 찢어버렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c12e3d3-0a1b-4b77-80f1-a61f28746651
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SELUNE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:6c12e3d3-0a1b-4b77-80f1-a61f28746651
msgctxt "hbeb3c750g4280g45fagaa3bg7637be92589c"
msgid "I trusted in Selûne to guide me through the shadows."
msgstr "셀루네가 절 이 그림자 속에서 인도해 주실 거라 믿었습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 787bc54d-7d35-4213-a99f-e16ee486301f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:787bc54d-7d35-4213-a99f-e16ee486301f
msgctxt "hb8276b92g47c2g45b0g98eagb2ffd0d56892"
msgid "I should never have trusted an ally of the Dark Lady."
msgstr "어둠의 여신을 섬기는 자를 믿지 말았어야 했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 820afe4d-fabc-4a18-b54e-68b6f98cdce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:820afe4d-fabc-4a18-b54e-68b6f98cdce4
msgctxt "h1bfea9b7gc37ag43aeg9cb4gfe4ace442fdd"
msgid ""
"Words won't repair what's been done to this land. Nothing will... I need to "
"be alone."
msgstr "말로는 이 땅을 회복시킬 수 없네. 이제는 그 무엇도 회복시킬 수 없어... 혼자만의 시간을 가져야겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = 93326335-543c-4720-be69-2a81af72e67b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:93326335-543c-4720-be69-2a81af72e67b
msgctxt "h45858596gcf6dg4384gb7fag62c6b3d6bce3"
msgid "No! Stop!"
msgstr "안돼! 멈춰!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9548041f-165e-491a-9f79-4ea4fc77753e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SHAR(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:9548041f-165e-491a-9f79-4ea4fc77753e
msgctxt "h8e08dc46g423eg4c67g8669g95092b9a6e45"
msgid ""
"The Shadowfell is no place for non-believers - I couldn't allow you to soil "
"it."
msgstr "섀도펠은 불신자들을 위한 장소가 아닙니다 - 그 땅을 더럽히게 둘 수 없었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b996726e-72c2-41f9-a9cb-5f367e1da993
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:b996726e-72c2-41f9-a9cb-5f367e1da993
msgctxt "hed461c49g4af9g4152ga86ega8941237b54d"
msgid "I'm sorry - I acted on instinct."
msgstr "죄송합니다 - 본능적으로 몸이 움직였어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = c70893d9-bfef-453e-b768-f3dbf5c371d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:c70893d9-bfef-453e-b768-f3dbf5c371d4
msgctxt "h12887c04gb13cg4469g8f61g5ef365e6fc1d"
msgid "My friend - I wish you had trusted in me."
msgstr "친구여 - 자네가 날 믿기를 바랐네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = cf3f561a-3c01-411d-99df-684b9747aee1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:cf3f561a-3c01-411d-99df-684b9747aee1
msgctxt "hadf0a218g7f6eg4a6cg90c0gaf8add2cbcf1"
msgid "There is nothing more to be said... I need to be alone."
msgstr "이 이상 할 말은 없어... 혼자만의 시간을 가져야겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e5a006c3-d2f7-4daa-9b52-d28a0d539d99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:e5a006c3-d2f7-4daa-9b52-d28a0d539d99
msgctxt "hbd491a37g274fg4a34g81a8g15f694c41c3e"
msgid "I saved your grove - I figured it'd be best if I handled this as well."
msgstr "당신의 에메랄드 숲도 구했잖아요 - 이 일도 직접 처리하는 게 낫겠다고 생각했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = fe82ed5e-312e-41e8-ac9f-fcdb53e794ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_LiftingTheCurse_RemovePortal = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_PortalEntry:fe82ed5e-312e-41e8-ac9f-fcdb53e794ed
msgctxt "h8a29cac9gf28cg4c10ga8f8g628958ed5657"
msgid ""
"It's gone... that was our one chance. <i>You've doomed this place to "
"darkness!</i>"
msgstr "사라졌어...유일한 기회였는데. <i>네가 이 곳을 어둠으로 몰아넣었어!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Thaniel
#. NodeID = 013d3c1d-a4db-d091-8e02-01487975cab4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:013d3c1d-a4db-d091-8e02-01487975cab4
msgctxt "h9c43ff01g4167g4ac3g958fg94db0ed9af35"
msgid ""
"It is. But mine is just beginning again. Soon this will be a place of "
"sunlight and greenery again, with birdsong honouring your triumph."
msgstr ""
"그렇습니다. 하지만 여기서부터 내 일이 다시 시작되죠. 곧 여기에는 햇살 가득한 녹음이 펼쳐질 거예요, 당신의 승리를 노래하는 새소리와 "
"함께."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Thaniel
#. NodeID = 120ce167-bf1f-64fa-dd50-ccae141439ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:120ce167-bf1f-64fa-dd50-ccae141439ca
msgctxt "hd561501cg2516g4d32ga2a0gdd82495d6d00"
msgid "Not as glad as I am."
msgstr "나만큼 기쁠까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Thaniel
#. NodeID = 18da2850-5048-22c3-eefd-e818f024b17d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:18da2850-5048-22c3-eefd-e818f024b17d
msgctxt "h9a58042fgfce5g4841gb75ege8fb7ef2987c"
msgid "I would agree. But patience is needed."
msgstr "그렇습니다. 하지만 인내심이 필요해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2361f16b-5270-ab5c-d3aa-995ace59fc4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:2361f16b-5270-ab5c-d3aa-995ace59fc4f
msgctxt "h522458cagbc62g4bd3gae49g75e462fa79b2"
msgid "I'm glad I could help."
msgstr "도울 수 있어 기쁘군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Thaniel
#. NodeID = 29255a25-cf2a-e92f-d8ac-61ce414456a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_LiftingTheCurse_State_HasMet_ThanielEpilogue = True
#.      - GLO_Ketheric_State_Dead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:29255a25-cf2a-e92f-d8ac-61ce414456a6
msgctxt "h9dbd23a6g5df6g4de7gb978gc1dd5bafaf5c"
msgid ""
"Your path leads away from me, I sense. Be safe. Perhaps one day you will see "
"the fruits that your victory has sown here."
msgstr ""
"당신의 길이, 멀어지는 것이 느껴져요. 부디 몸조심하시길. 언젠가는 승리가 흩뿌린 씨앗이 열매를 맺은 모습을 볼 수 있을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Thaniel
#. NodeID = 2e493e6a-c120-246a-d36a-7767e73b0d58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:2e493e6a-c120-246a-d36a-7767e73b0d58
msgctxt "ha5bab39eg0454g408bga6b4g3a546d0690f4"
msgid "For the land to heal, Ketheric Thorm must die."
msgstr "이 땅이 회복하기 위해서, 케서릭 쏨은 반드시 죽어야 합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Thaniel
#. NodeID = 488b998e-e16c-19b3-9e50-4af1c801e795
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#.      - GLO_Ketheric_State_Dead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_LiftingTheCurse_State_HasMet_ThanielEpilogue = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:488b998e-e16c-19b3-9e50-4af1c801e795
msgctxt "h0c4124b5ga3e9g42abg9d4dg7e16337a0548"
msgid ""
"You did it. Ketheric Thorm is no more - the shadows' grip is broken. Soon "
"the land shall heal."
msgstr "해내셨군요. 케서릭 쏨이 죽었습니다 - 그림자의 지배도 무너졌고요. 곧 이 땅은 회복하게 될 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Thaniel
#. NodeID = 48f3912f-1b93-4c33-c0c0-b9ad87217260
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:48f3912f-1b93-4c33-c0c0-b9ad87217260
msgctxt "h1ccd3fc2gd058g498egafe4ga22164f84bb1"
msgid ""
"But there is one anchor still holding the shadows in place. The soul that "
"brought it into being."
msgstr "그러나 아직도 그림자를 묶어두고 있는 닻이 있습니다. 그림자를 탄생시킨 영혼이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Thaniel
#. NodeID = 513311ff-7a06-190f-0ea5-dffcdab50f87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_HalsinQuest_HasMet_WakedThaniel(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:513311ff-7a06-190f-0ea5-dffcdab50f87
msgctxt "h4cd59d2bg29b7g4337g8de8g122ba594c01f"
msgid ""
"Ketheric's soul still nourishes the shadows. Destroy him, so the land may "
"heal. So that <i>I</i> may heal."
msgstr ""
"케서릭의 영혼이 이곳의 그림자를 키우고 있습니다. 이 땅이 회복할 수 있도록, 그를 파괴하세요. 그리하면 <i>저</i>도 회복할 수 "
"있게 됩니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 552ef57d-616a-6edd-26cb-3b52277e28e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:552ef57d-616a-6edd-26cb-3b52277e28e1
msgctxt "hc1f0e09ag50d1g4092gaf46g3955953b23e6"
msgid "My work here is done, I think."
msgstr "여기서 제가 할 일은 끝난 것 같습니다만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83ea7e6c-1f1f-fbf1-1c9c-36f1a23504fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:83ea7e6c-1f1f-fbf1-1c9c-36f1a23504fd
msgctxt "h2e5c4fd6g0204g41bcgb65eg2d097a594f79"
msgid "Seems like the sort of feat that might deserve a reward..."
msgstr "이거 꽤 짭짤한 보상을 받을만한 위업인 것 같은데요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Thaniel
#. NodeID = 95f14942-a5e2-c23a-4e4a-79e55394a1b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:95f14942-a5e2-c23a-4e4a-79e55394a1b6
msgctxt "h3931177aga147g4d03g8a3fg130db153ae64"
msgid ""
"Nature moves at its own pace, and bestows its bounty when it sees fit. Give "
"it time - a reward shall come to you, when you need it most."
msgstr ""
"자연은 자신만의 속도로 움직입니다. 그리고 때가 되었을 때 열매를 맺죠. 시간을 주세요 - 가장 필요로 할 때 자연의 보상이 찾아올 "
"겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Thaniel
#. NodeID = 9cb61ae8-d902-7f25-069a-0a861283242d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:9cb61ae8-d902-7f25-069a-0a861283242d
msgctxt "hac3d76d8g4d09g43c2g81ebg56d0aeced9ad"
msgid ""
"A hundred years of sickness, almost ended. I feel every root that riddles "
"the earth beginning to unfold."
msgstr "수백 년에 걸친 고통이, 이제 끝나가고 있습니다. 이 땅을 채울 뿌리들이 펼쳐지기 시작하는 게 느껴져요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Thaniel
#. NodeID = bc49a2ae-c3e9-a1da-6204-d83ad188f31c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CAMP_HalsinQuest_HasMet_WakedThaniel(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - CAMP_HalsinQuest_HasMet_WakedThaniel(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:bc49a2ae-c3e9-a1da-6204-d83ad188f31c
msgctxt "h21579c99g5faag48ebgb02cg2151516ae5cd"
msgid ""
"The druid Halsin spoke to me while I was sleeping. He spoke of you - said "
"that you fought shadow and spite to restore me."
msgstr ""
"잠들어 있는 동안 드루이드 할신이 내게 말을 걸었습니다. 당신에 대해 이야기했어요 - 그림자와 악의에 맞서 나를 회복시키기 위해 "
"싸웠노라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c74be090-39d8-4218-a206-37e698a101b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HalsinQuest_Spirit:c74be090-39d8-4218-a206-37e698a101b5
msgctxt "haa9b28a0g283eg4c33g9179g2f2b2701a518"
msgid "*Thaniel is unresponsive. He hardly looks alive.*"
msgstr "*테니엘은 반응하지 않는다. 살아있는 것 같지 않다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_001
#. Speaker = Harper Mijah
#. NodeID = 2903a03b-796f-4b3f-a59d-6a6fac98f4ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperGuard_001_Protected_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Protected = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_001:2903a03b-796f-4b3f-a59d-6a6fac98f4ba
msgctxt "h2ca580dfg1b60g40bcgbb3dga235f24fdd2b"
msgid "Glad you made it through the dark."
msgstr "어둠을 무사히 지나와서 다행이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_001
#. Speaker = Harper Mijah
#. NodeID = 8c583e2d-371a-452d-a2a5-e7d6eca6fc25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperGuard_001_Alert_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HarperGuard_001_Alert_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_001:8c583e2d-371a-452d-a2a5-e7d6eca6fc25
msgctxt "h341b5f7fga31ag470cga9ddg7170267f343f"
msgid ""
"No surprise to find a traitor among the Flaming Fist. Honour isn't their "
"strong suit."
msgstr "플레이밍 피스트에서 변절자가 나왔다니 놀랍지도 않군. 명예라곤 모르는 녀석들이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_001
#. Speaker = Harper Mijah
#. NodeID = d2a54420-7d28-4a0d-9bdd-778a67b7b0fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperGuard_001_Protected_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Protected = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HarperGuard_001_Protected_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_001:d2a54420-7d28-4a0d-9bdd-778a67b7b0fe
msgctxt "hf4e3047fg5f64g439cgbb72geb8186531bcc"
msgid "Take it easy while you can - we'll keep the watch."
msgstr "쉴 수 있을때 쉬어, 우리가 감시하고 있을게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_001
#. Speaker = Harper Mijah
#. NodeID = d56fa89a-1e80-43f6-a16d-9774eb711e6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperGuard_001_Alert_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_001:d56fa89a-1e80-43f6-a16d-9774eb711e6a
msgctxt "h8f80ee6eg9639g49deg8275gb4163467c6c0"
msgid ""
"You're lucky Jaheira gave you the all-clear, or I'd be looking at you next."
msgstr "자헤이라의 시험을 통과하다니 운이 좋군, 아니면 그다음은 내 차례였을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_002
#. Speaker = Harper Bor
#. NodeID = 02b515a4-dddb-2369-aa13-ceb34455b32b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperGuard_002_HasMet_Freed(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_002:02b515a4-dddb-2369-aa13-ceb34455b32b
msgctxt "hc80c2a88g73f2g4e7cg9d74g8b30663b0d19"
msgid "We might actually survive this."
msgstr "정말 우리가 여기서 살아남을 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_002
#. Speaker = Harper Bor
#. NodeID = 231bccd5-87f6-84ec-c8e7-08187b56f37a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HarperGuard_002_HasMet_Freed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_002:231bccd5-87f6-84ec-c8e7-08187b56f37a
msgctxt "h09f8e46cg30dbg461egac4ag01c855a2b12e"
msgid "Lights in the sky, shadows in retreat. Got any more miracles for us?"
msgstr "하늘에 떠있는 빛이, 그림자를 물리고 있어. 이보다 더한 기적이 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_002
#. Speaker = Harper Bor
#. NodeID = 46329d4c-27a0-47d7-9c0f-8f6941cafb21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperGuard_002_Hasmet_Protected(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Protected = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_002:46329d4c-27a0-47d7-9c0f-8f6941cafb21
msgctxt "h6bfe2851g7eceg4c31g8296ga65d5e68a0bf"
msgid ""
"Rest while you can - just not in the beds, unless your tadpole wants lice "
"for company."
msgstr "쉴 수 있을때 쉬어, 침대에서는 말고, 올챙이에게 이가 필요한 게 아니라면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_002
#. Speaker = Harper Bor
#. NodeID = 9549dba0-ef37-4b34-b410-1a8bdd00a65c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperGuard_002_Hasmet_Alert(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HarperGuard_002_Hasmet_Alert(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_002:9549dba0-ef37-4b34-b410-1a8bdd00a65c
msgctxt "hdd1d8ef5g983eg4f30g897eg0c388a6d8cfe"
msgid ""
"We'll keep an eye on Isobel. If they send anyone else to snatch her, we'll "
"be there to stop them."
msgstr "이소벨은 우리가 잘 지켜볼게. 그녀를 납치하려고 누군가를 보낸다면, 우리가 막을 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_002
#. Speaker = Harper Bor
#. NodeID = be12a9dd-0cb0-4d08-9df6-b9a9b91e64a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperGuard_002_Hasmet_Protected(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Protected = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HarperGuard_002_Hasmet_Protected(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_002:be12a9dd-0cb0-4d08-9df6-b9a9b91e64a4
msgctxt "hb92268c9gb82cg4455ga86cg1a61787b5fec"
msgid "Good to see you're still breathing. It's the best we can hope for."
msgstr "아직 살아있는 걸보니 반갑네. 그게 바랄수 있는 최선이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_002
#. Speaker = Harper Bor
#. NodeID = c70e52b7-5d41-4b94-9c13-f86aac93ab9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperGuard_002_Hasmet_Alert(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperGuard_002:c70e52b7-5d41-4b94-9c13-f86aac93ab9f
msgctxt "heb2c4da6g9eb1g433cgb110g84d59ecdf37a"
msgid ""
"Can't trust anyone - could've been a Harper that turned traitor just as "
"easily."
msgstr "아무도 못믿겠어, 하퍼도 그렇게 쉽게 변절할 수도 있었으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_AD_Arrival_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = b5cd141f-ec63-41a9-8354-d04534f6d826
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_AD_Arrival_Harper_000:b5cd141f-ec63-41a9-8354-d04534f6d826
msgctxt "h66d793dfg1bc1g4a13ga4acgee581ab1353c"
msgid "Yonas should be here with us."
msgstr "요나스도 이 자리에 함께 있어야 했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_AD_Arrival_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = fa1f7b5b-2aa6-4b8e-98c3-bdec54e5b821
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_AD_Arrival_Harper_001:fa1f7b5b-2aa6-4b8e-98c3-bdec54e5b821
msgctxt "h7463452ag0a86g4951g8618g6ddb64afb026"
msgid "We made it."
msgstr "해냈군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_AD_Arrival_Harper_003
#. Speaker = Harper Karrow
#. NodeID = 5eb63543-2da3-4e27-99a0-16b3f079343c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_AD_Arrival_Harper_003:5eb63543-2da3-4e27-99a0-16b3f079343c
msgctxt "h3837139dg122dg45f3ga0d1gecf001a6d146"
msgid "Wasn't sure we'd see light again."
msgstr "다시 빛을 볼 수 있을 줄은 몰랐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 1d0172a4-7510-41b1-a46b-ef273e4be3c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_HasMet(1) = True
#.      - HAV_Harperscouts_Harper_000_Knows_Thanked(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Harperscouts_Harper_000_Knows_Thanked(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000:1d0172a4-7510-41b1-a46b-ef273e4be3c4
msgctxt "h85e7dba1gde65g4819g9ff8gb83dc41904c7"
msgid ""
"Thank you for helping us out there. Those shadows would've torn us to bits."
msgstr "도와주셔서 감사합니다. 그림자가 우릴 갈기갈기 찢어놓을 뻔했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 1eefe4da-0ce2-9108-69dd-9eff5e5a3b3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000_HasMet_Siege(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000:1eefe4da-0ce2-9108-69dd-9eff5e5a3b3f
msgctxt "h6ca76f4bg7bb3g43c4gb8d6g4fff3b153993"
msgid "Cosy spot, all in all - let's hope it stays that way."
msgstr "편안한 곳이지, 대체로는. 앞으로도 그러길 바라자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 21d3c987-0351-1e8e-7a6f-76f73a835fe0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000_HasMet_Freed(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000:21d3c987-0351-1e8e-7a6f-76f73a835fe0
msgctxt "h05e46116gc541g412fgab64g0c1220e2ee50"
msgid "We lost too many good people out here."
msgstr "이 곳에서 좋은 이들을 너무 많이 잃었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 2d3fe405-ab85-4385-b9e7-e832bc487234
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000_HasMet_Alert(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000_HasMet_Alert(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000:2d3fe405-ab85-4385-b9e7-e832bc487234
msgctxt "h1ce214dcg84dag4483gae0ag78d977a5e583"
msgid "Watch our backs - and we'll watch yours."
msgstr "엄호해 줘. 우리도 당신들을 엄호하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 3384c040-5dec-42cb-8f34-e41e34dd6fb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_Harperscouts_Harper_000_Knows_Thanked(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000:3384c040-5dec-42cb-8f34-e41e34dd6fb3
msgctxt "h98e1472cgbbfdg4cc7gb755gc3583b70afd4"
msgid ""
"Hope you're faring all right. Yonas might be gone, but the rest of us can't "
"give up yet."
msgstr "올바르게 헤쳐나가길 바라. 비록 요나스는 갔지만, 우리는 아직 포기할 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 42e8ea33-ade7-4bb9-2687-081d58ddc679
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000_HasMet_Siege(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000_HasMet_Siege(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000:42e8ea33-ade7-4bb9-2687-081d58ddc679
msgctxt "h2c036ef3g02f1g4f20g8e2ag7e551cc8477e"
msgid ""
"If the first wave can't hold the dark, it'll be up to us - you, me, and the "
"rest."
msgstr "첫 번째 파동이 어둠을 붙들어두지 못한다면, 나머지는 우리에게 달려 있어 - 당신, 나, 그리고 다른 이들."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 59996299-916f-49a6-92c5-27ef3d9f61bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000_HasMet_Unprotected(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Unprotected = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000:59996299-916f-49a6-92c5-27ef3d9f61bf
msgctxt "he430d820g8f3cg4e60gb923g90b25fb6e6b9"
msgid ""
"Looks like we're not as safe here as we thought. Foolish of me to think the "
"curse would stay outside."
msgstr "여기도 이제 안전하지 않군. 저주가 저 밖에만 있을 거라 생각한 내가 바보지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 6a260b26-4c30-43ff-0a7b-607c38b8e82e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000:6a260b26-4c30-43ff-0a7b-607c38b8e82e
msgctxt "hcfa55741g61d8g4d7cg9d1cg79dee4529fd3"
msgid "We lost one today. Yonas."
msgstr "오늘 우리는 한 사람을 잃었다. 요나스."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 76233338-6467-859f-c1f8-73dfd1d932c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000_HasMet_Freed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000:76233338-6467-859f-c1f8-73dfd1d932c7
msgctxt "h80c6e293gb549g4782g91d7ga9b110207a0d"
msgid "Tear that tower down."
msgstr "저 탑을 산산이 부숴버리자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 881ac3b5-251c-4217-3f69-bf601fc28449
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000:881ac3b5-251c-4217-3f69-bf601fc28449
msgctxt "hce7c48e4g31ddg4d25gba6dgce7ec2e5bdf6"
msgid "He was a good Harper. A good friend."
msgstr "그는 훌륭한 하퍼이자 좋은 친구였다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = b037c34b-8e04-9a1a-b4e6-c6fc5492ac34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_HasMet(1) = False
#.      - HAV_Harperscouts_Harper_000_Knows_Thanked(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Harperscouts_Harper_000_Knows_Thanked(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000:b037c34b-8e04-9a1a-b4e6-c6fc5492ac34
msgctxt "hd8ccee21g550ag42efg8707gda44e125c3ca"
msgid "You made it through the dark? Lucky you - not everyone does."
msgstr "저 어둠을 헤쳐나왔다고? 운이 좋군. 대부분은 그렇게 못 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = e0b754a3-dc9e-459b-a226-616ec49b0372
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000_HasMet_Alert(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000:e0b754a3-dc9e-459b-a226-616ec49b0372
msgctxt "h2fcc0548geb92g4379g989dge8e16ab24f68"
msgid "Helm protect us."
msgstr "헬름이여, 우리를 지켜주소서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = ff8b71ea-3e9c-4a50-ac06-c8b06cfb34a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000_HasMet_Unprotected(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Unprotected = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000_HasMet_Unprotected(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_000:ff8b71ea-3e9c-4a50-ac06-c8b06cfb34a1
msgctxt "h41ac04f3g9e93g4ec1gbd67ga5254910a79b"
msgid "This place might've lost Isobel, but it hasn't lost us."
msgstr "이 곳에 이소벨은 없을지언정 우리는 아직 남아있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 02cc4a80-610f-97e9-af1c-52b9229d8658
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:02cc4a80-610f-97e9-af1c-52b9229d8658
msgctxt "h3fb3e7e7g4b65g4493g80cega03c58fb84ba"
msgid "What are you talking- gods, no!"
msgstr "무슨 말을... 맙소사, 안돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 06acd84d-b98b-ffe3-1505-c02df5bc6d87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:06acd84d-b98b-ffe3-1505-c02df5bc6d87
msgctxt "h6cd43098gdbbbg442bg8a5dg38d84bfe10cd"
msgid "If you hadn't been there -"
msgstr "당신이 거기 없었더라면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 0761d945-7842-e6a0-b62c-fd5337a7664b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001_HasMet_Freed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:0761d945-7842-e6a0-b62c-fd5337a7664b
msgctxt "h88889b50gc91bg4e99gaa2dg341258a6f6d2"
msgid "Path to Moonrise is opening up. Time for vengeance."
msgstr "문라이즈로 향하는 길이 열리고 있어요. 복수의 시간입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08432841-e2aa-d180-1106-5c555553eb9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:08432841-e2aa-d180-1106-5c555553eb9d
msgctxt "h490b9ed2gb0d3g4164g9c9bg2be9fc7b4ad5"
msgid ""
"There is no better death than to fall in battle. You should be happy for him!"
msgstr "전장에서 죽는 것 보다 나은 죽음은 없다. 기뻐해라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09fc3e50-6512-c57a-02f5-3ca0ab6d320a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_HasMet(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:09fc3e50-6512-c57a-02f5-3ca0ab6d320a
msgctxt "h1a6f5c15gd9aeg4d74g9cdbgbe69273e2307"
msgid ""
"Dead, is he? Maybe if he'd spent less time joking, he'd still be around."
msgstr "죽었군, 그래? 아마 농담할 시간에 다른 걸 했으면 살았을지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 0f2f9b65-c575-25de-c9d5-a1c2df880c41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:0f2f9b65-c575-25de-c9d5-a1c2df880c41
msgctxt "h7fa0d3ebg7f2eg4455ga68bg15ac0800387b"
msgid "He always took such good care of this... I'll do the same. For him."
msgstr "그는 이 칼을 참 아꼈죠... 저도 그렇게 할 거예요. 그를 위해서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 113bbe94-1d93-8957-f62b-08563e004439
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:113bbe94-1d93-8957-f62b-08563e004439
msgctxt "h15e2561eg3783g48dag8cd6g94e141c98d5a"
msgid ""
"If you lose yourself to grief we will fall before the true battle begins. "
"Harden your heart."
msgstr "슬픔에 잠겨있으면 진정한 전투가 시작되기도 전에 쓰러질 거야. 마음 굳게 먹어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 1506a078-5972-4e72-271c-289da6398c57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001_HasMet_Alert(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001_HasMet_Alert(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:1506a078-5972-4e72-271c-289da6398c57
msgctxt "h469a3a6fge79dg48f8gaeecg67839fc7e579"
msgid "We need to end this quickly - before the shadows break through again."
msgstr "빨리 끝을 봐야 합니다. 그림자가 다시 뚫고 오기 전에 말이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1512bd6d-2670-d979-7b3a-26852fb85bd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:1512bd6d-2670-d979-7b3a-26852fb85bd4
msgctxt "h0844330bg827eg4eabgb3d6gd8a42134b33e"
msgid "I don't care what you say, so long as you<i> pay.</i>"
msgstr "뭐라 말하던 상관 없어, <i>대가</i>만 내놓는다면."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1f548abd-cc14-c5d5-0ea3-5854010aab69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:1f548abd-cc14-c5d5-0ea3-5854010aab69
msgctxt "h008ec6f8ga3c6g4d6fgbbb5g8a143f87b8b7"
msgid "I'm sure he knew. I'm sure he cared for you as well."
msgstr "분명 그도 알고 있었을 거야. 분명 널 소중히 여겼겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 2135699b-1313-0361-91f0-2c103dede69d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_General_HarperScout_001_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:2135699b-1313-0361-91f0-2c103dede69d
msgctxt "h0ff65583gfde4g43adgad2bg2742303cf6af"
msgid "*Sniffle.*"
msgstr "*훌쩍.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 238886d7-ac6f-b6f6-e0b9-ec5825c28cae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:238886d7-ac6f-b6f6-e0b9-ec5825c28cae
msgctxt "h8928986eg41f5g43a8gace6gf4f4fcbef23d"
msgid "I - I'd like to be alone."
msgstr "호, 혼자 있고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2443e8df-d06b-63ef-8755-c5208ab75d39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:2443e8df-d06b-63ef-8755-c5208ab75d39
msgctxt "h84240fecg467cg420fgb4cdg77e4ce492730"
msgid "It's a dangerous life, being a soldier."
msgstr "위험한 삶이야, 군인으로 산다는 건."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 2a8a27c6-7918-0a2b-4e22-6ea89c5b9f99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_HarperScouts_Event_SawYonasFuneral = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:2a8a27c6-7918-0a2b-4e22-6ea89c5b9f99
msgctxt "h42ff56dbg2399g4e38g89dagb94aa3e3c14a"
msgid "He was a good Harper. A good friend..."
msgstr "그는 좋은 하퍼이자...좋은 친구였어요..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 30571421-a745-94c0-3412-a4d3bb172d60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:30571421-a745-94c0-3412-a4d3bb172d60
msgctxt "h1e0a69ffg19c8g485dg90eagab1129e84f3a"
msgid "...too late now."
msgstr "...이젠 늦었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 312c0e19-d14a-6df8-50e3-e03297136ef6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:312c0e19-d14a-6df8-50e3-e03297136ef6
msgctxt "h942f3a2ag55c3g4f8ag9a9bg45b0ae9d7b4d"
msgid "I think I need some time by myself now."
msgstr "이제 좀 혼자 있을게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 34cdf082-0734-378e-fff4-5256f648ead2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_General_HarperScout_001_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_General_HarperScout_001_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:34cdf082-0734-378e-fff4-5256f648ead2
msgctxt "hcccd5509g3dc0g41bfg8188g53152a016dfc"
msgid "He was joking, this morning. Yonas, I mean."
msgstr "바로 오늘 아침에도 농담하고 있었어요. 요나스 말이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 3af570ec-f923-13f4-b56c-fb9f48c0096b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:3af570ec-f923-13f4-b56c-fb9f48c0096b
msgctxt "h9ae215c2gbe95g4bf0g9234gdbdc0f115573"
msgid "What is <i>wrong</i> with you? Just... leave me be."
msgstr "대체 뭐가 <i>문제</i>에요? 그냥... 날 내버려 둬요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 4ab46375-a4a9-a9c9-1f95-2ff1744993a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:4ab46375-a4a9-a9c9-1f95-2ff1744993a9
msgctxt "h939af1b2g502eg4195g86afg3dc2b43750cd"
msgid "No, he... Sorry, I - I'd like to be alone."
msgstr "아니요, 그는...미안해요. 호, 혼자 있고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 4d9edb34-ac86-8618-ffb1-2e0aba10a05e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:4d9edb34-ac86-8618-ffb1-2e0aba10a05e
msgctxt "h3255a6adge966g4c30g91e6gd0b0727fa664"
msgid "Thank you. You're a good person."
msgstr "고마워요. 당신은 좋은 사람이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 5330bc6d-3d7c-4b97-95ad-39a20410b8ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001_HasMet_Unprotected(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Unprotected = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:5330bc6d-3d7c-4b97-95ad-39a20410b8ad
msgctxt "hb5b09d41g75dbg4e6fga30cg5930589fc5e9"
msgid "At the ready."
msgstr "준비 완료."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 5554495e-c0ae-ae1e-d518-dc11a2dd2af4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:5554495e-c0ae-ae1e-d518-dc11a2dd2af4
msgctxt "hb1c1e9dagfcd6g4e48gb2dfg8a6d94e735d3"
msgid "I hope so. They're all I have to give."
msgstr "그러길 바라요. 그게 제가 할 수 있는 전부니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 56a8512f-3ecf-2c54-3134-c51990f314f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:56a8512f-3ecf-2c54-3134-c51990f314f9
msgctxt "h84aff9beg2258g4ea3gab3ag4699ef0ef8d3"
msgid "There was an ambush in the dark. The shadows dragged him away..."
msgstr "매복이 있었어요. 그림자가 그를 끌고 갔죠..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d5e25e2-3f3f-28fe-a54c-105e8f6be3b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:5d5e25e2-3f3f-28fe-a54c-105e8f6be3b5
msgctxt "h7a746a22g165ag4cb8ga17dg44cc5e8a1fb5"
msgid "Better at jokes than keeping himself alive, I hope."
msgstr "제 목숨을 부지하는 것보단 농담 따먹기를 더 잘했나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f6d4c2a-906c-d8b3-72dc-f78aad8475be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:5f6d4c2a-906c-d8b3-72dc-f78aad8475be
msgctxt "h57947a81g213dg4ab5ga612gb5f892a31af2"
msgid "Sounds like you were close."
msgstr "둘이 친했던 모양이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 61e9975c-e9ed-de45-d6c0-baebbfb6f7b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001_HasMet_Freed(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:61e9975c-e9ed-de45-d6c0-baebbfb6f7b9
msgctxt "hba55db1eg807eg4e78gb3a6gab8afae3523c"
msgid "Make them hurt, yeah?"
msgstr "박살을 내버려요, 알겠죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 63daf7bb-fbdd-09ae-a805-e05a78f24f9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:63daf7bb-fbdd-09ae-a805-e05a78f24f9e
msgctxt "he96f0945gee87g4d60gbf78gf864242e93bd"
msgid "We were. Comrades in arms."
msgstr "맞아요. 전우였죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 6520b5e2-2db6-8cb9-38b3-1a142af6a834
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:6520b5e2-2db6-8cb9-38b3-1a142af6a834
msgctxt "h70069de5g0a96g4d5fg8a52g73017623721b"
msgid "I'm sorry, I'd like to be alone."
msgstr "미안해요, 혼자 있고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 70e45b89-fe58-3194-8cc9-401c394043ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001_HasMet_Alert(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:70e45b89-fe58-3194-8cc9-401c394043ef
msgctxt "h68016010g7ba9g41ceg8852gece54db67d74"
msgid ""
"You must know better than any of us - we've got to get into the Towers. "
"<i>Now.</i>"
msgstr "우리 중 누구보다도 잘 알고 있잖아요. 타워로 가야 합니다. <i>지금 당장.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 710035eb-8fee-ee36-e675-2d8800a2b19f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:710035eb-8fee-ee36-e675-2d8800a2b19f
msgctxt "hab24b834ga2bdg46a9g9b72g1f11f79a9af9"
msgid "Don't lose yourself in grief - many more will fall in battles to come."
msgstr "슬픔에 굴복하지 마. 앞으로 더 많은 사람이 죽을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 7375d747-8669-4d13-b3d1-b7a9e2afbfbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001_HasMet_Siege(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001_HasMet_Siege(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:7375d747-8669-4d13-b3d1-b7a9e2afbfbd
msgctxt "h5d69ae98g97e1g42c4ga46cg3a9dd8ce4713"
msgid ""
"They're here. More of those things that killed Yonas. I won't let them take "
"anyone else."
msgstr "왔어요. 요나스를 죽인 녀석들. 이번에는 아무도 죽게 하지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 76b51e59-edc8-7f2f-9242-5102b14deae7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:76b51e59-edc8-7f2f-9242-5102b14deae7
msgctxt "he7830407g14e3g4603g8c67gcd3207a9e4a4"
msgid "*Stifled sobs.*"
msgstr "*나약한 흐느낌.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7712fed4-45c4-7ea9-9085-ed730e8ac226
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:7712fed4-45c4-7ea9-9085-ed730e8ac226
msgctxt "h6ceabb59g85bdg4d91g8615g87a8ddfe08a9"
msgid "Hey - it will be all right."
msgstr "저기, 괜찮아질 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 79d6632f-d1a8-f894-11f4-ea7a7c5e63ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:79d6632f-d1a8-f894-11f4-ea7a7c5e63ad
msgctxt "h080b9153g6dd9g4a78g9837g768fbd6fd34d"
msgid ""
"He was always joking. Said it was good for morale, but he just liked seeing "
"people laugh."
msgstr "그는 항상 농담했어요. 사기를 위해서라고 했지만, 실은 사람들이 웃는 걸 좋아했을 뿐이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a6474c9-02ac-24d9-b576-92ac4f6cb61a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:7a6474c9-02ac-24d9-b576-92ac4f6cb61a
msgctxt "h6e94d93bg00bag4cb3gbba4g073299c66019"
msgid "<i>Give her time to speak.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀가 말하길 기다린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b1721f9-e055-a844-eb6a-ee051256a7be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:7b1721f9-e055-a844-eb6a-ee051256a7be
msgctxt "h30cf6e30gd7b1g4f8fga29dg0a35b561a822"
msgid "I'm so sorry for your loss."
msgstr "상심이 정말 크겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 86b44441-874b-0a45-bd68-354ecf4db480
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:86b44441-874b-0a45-bd68-354ecf4db480
msgctxt "h1a15c23bg9768g4e8ega9aeg8406c2245e66"
msgid "Got nothing to give you for it. Just... leave me be."
msgstr "당신에게 줄 만한 것도 없어요. 그냥... 날 내버려 둬요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 87f52f37-5fb0-b64b-7e23-a13110aae109
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:87f52f37-5fb0-b64b-7e23-a13110aae109
msgctxt "hb5817036g1ccdg4c6fgbbe6g9558272d5faf"
msgid "Why would that make me <i>happy? </i>Sorry, I - I'd like to be alone."
msgstr "제가 어째서 <i>기뻐해야</i> 하죠? 미안해요. 호, 혼자 있고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 8c518bf4-c00b-068c-5723-f2aefd558aef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:8c518bf4-c00b-068c-5723-f2aefd558aef
msgctxt "hab4c0c7dge35eg4602gbae0g3bd5b6e2855c"
msgid "All the more reason to mourn the ones we lose."
msgstr "그만큼 우리가 잃는 사람들을 애도해야죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f1227ee-010c-2d10-2519-ce673968ace1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_Event_GiveHarperBlade(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:8f1227ee-010c-2d10-2519-ce673968ace1
msgctxt "h419bf033gdd70g4f9cga843g19c56a4fef31"
msgid "<i>Give her the sword.</i>"
msgstr "<i>검을 준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 91f5d013-6779-d3b1-4e0a-38d8c8a0c1e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:91f5d013-6779-d3b1-4e0a-38d8c8a0c1e4
msgctxt "h8050104cgeee8g4addga0cfg3f43df4d2437"
msgid "I should thank you... take this."
msgstr "고마워요... 이걸 가져가요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 92ff846b-6731-4bd9-8c86-c325d10cfcd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001_HasMet_Siege(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:92ff846b-6731-4bd9-8c86-c325d10cfcd9
msgctxt "hd6a5457bged89g438cgba4dg8857e6df5479"
msgid "I'd rather die myself than see another Harper taken."
msgstr "또 하퍼가 죽는 걸 보느니 차라리 내가 죽겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ba241df-f8a5-b4e4-4ded-e91f035962c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:9ba241df-f8a5-b4e4-4ded-e91f035962c1
msgctxt "hb79fee7bgee15g4097g90d8g83158cd6c37b"
msgid "Kidding - I'm keeping it."
msgstr "장난이야. 내가 갖겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 9ee5fd7f-466c-3dd0-8dba-2ae523b5f4e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:9ee5fd7f-466c-3dd0-8dba-2ae523b5f4e3
msgctxt "h2aae2831ge409g4eddgb252g29ac8454940a"
msgid "I... yes, I'd like that. I don't know what to say."
msgstr "전... 네. 그럴게요. 뭐라 말할지 모르겠네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 9ef99876-8f9b-1302-f7a6-977efa1fa14f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:9ef99876-8f9b-1302-f7a6-977efa1fa14f
msgctxt "h694be72agf944g4ab3g9d85g0f0a71e20b5c"
msgid "I don't know. And I never will."
msgstr "모르겠어요. 앞으로도 모르겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a51c20a9-e402-8989-992a-c17244ce3fa7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:a51c20a9-e402-8989-992a-c17244ce3fa7
msgctxt "h9c829526g3565g423fgaf35gc5ac561d6c98"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = aa9c2b39-a085-c825-e13c-212c2900f73b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:aa9c2b39-a085-c825-e13c-212c2900f73b
msgctxt "hb82c2aa4gd089g48cfgb567g26a7bf4b3c99"
msgid "I thought we could have been something more, one day, but..."
msgstr "그 이상의 관계가 될 거라고 생각했었죠, 언젠간. 하지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = b1dee05c-c833-f16a-235e-ebc5156f445f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:b1dee05c-c833-f16a-235e-ebc5156f445f
msgctxt "h35f4cf25g7536g44c2gb386g61cc709a5a5f"
msgid "...<i>Leave</i>."
msgstr "...<i>썩 꺼져</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c519a5d0-99d1-24bf-ae2f-1f9c309c6b7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:c519a5d0-99d1-24bf-ae2f-1f9c309c6b7a
msgctxt "h8e003289g170bg491cgb752g4d39c14b826c"
msgid "Smart. Bit of levity before a daunting battle never hurt."
msgstr "똑똑하군. 두려운 전투 전 약간의 농담은 항상 옳은 법이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = caadf2fb-fac0-bf8f-5105-957f015449ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_HasMet(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:caadf2fb-fac0-bf8f-5105-957f015449ab
msgctxt "h18d3faa2gea28g4dfagbb88gdad9ac15ba36"
msgid "Is he... gone?"
msgstr "그는...죽었나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = cc5d6e1a-f844-40f8-b43e-7b8efa34b24e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_Event_GiveHarperBlade(0) = True
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:cc5d6e1a-f844-40f8-b43e-7b8efa34b24e
msgctxt "hfaf7c3d0ge60fg4dbdg9b36g14b0489d3627"
msgid "Here. Take it and leave me be."
msgstr "가져요. 이제 날 내버려 둬요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cf587fcd-b69f-3eb6-89f2-7f1a0cbd541c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:cf587fcd-b69f-3eb6-89f2-7f1a0cbd541c
msgctxt "hdb4986abgfd47g4544g9246g8809f0aee1a7"
msgid "You'll get over it."
msgstr "극복할 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dc7da256-d7e7-d558-e8b1-ac106d7822e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_MYRKUL or WIZARD_NECROMANCY
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:dc7da256-d7e7-d558-e8b1-ac106d7822e2
msgctxt "h5aa549b1gb3c2g4356g8586g88d8c27db468"
msgid "It doesn't <i>have</i> to be too late."
msgstr "꼭 늦었다는 <i>법</i>은 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de0c5d62-b3e3-5581-c282-af57d1fd78e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_State_HasHarperBlade(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:de0c5d62-b3e3-5581-c282-af57d1fd78e3
msgctxt "h1a6b4ee3g5b8fg4d63gb73agc5d44f54190d"
msgid "I found his sword on his body. Would you like to have it?"
msgstr "그가 쓰던 검을 찾았어. 가져가겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = e00b079f-fb76-a788-c0bb-7be6f2b3771f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001:e00b079f-fb76-a788-c0bb-7be6f2b3771f
msgctxt "h5c16d22fgae8eg4d20ga49eg9cc55b009b41"
msgid "Thought you were doing me a kindness. Stupid of me."
msgstr "친절을 베푸는 줄 알았던 내가 멍청이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
