msgctxt "h14fe57e6g576fg4f94gb0dbged118cd5f0be"
msgid "Humour helps on a hunt - it can be the spark when all hope is lost."
msgstr "유머는 사냥에서 도움이 되지 - 희망이 없을 때 불씨가 되어주거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_001
