#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_003:2d540e83-1859-9067-9b22-21081c0431fa
msgctxt "h84a42139gea2eg46c6gafeag9fd996dbd6a5"
msgid "We lost a good one today. Yonas. He was green as they come, poor kid."
msgstr "오늘 좋은 녀석을 잃고 말았군. 요나스, 이 가엾은 녀석, 아직 풋내기에 불과했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_003
#. Speaker = Harper Karrow
#. NodeID = 4728d8a0-b4b1-87b4-973d-054bb6b3af48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
