msgctxt "h8d884cceg7a98g47cbg8cf9g67fa06591c19"
msgid ""
"You've proven yourself a powerful ally. It's an honour to fight beside you."
msgstr "당신은 강력한 아군임을 증명했어요. 같이 싸울 수 있어 영광입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_003
