msgid "Poor Yonas. Kid was as green as they come."
msgstr "요나스, 이 가엾은 녀석. 아직 풋내기에 불과했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_003
