msgid "Keep your eyes sharp. Anyone could be a traitor."
msgstr "정신 똑바로 차리고 있어요. 누구든 배신자일 수 있으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_HarperScouts_Harper_003
