#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "There is more to say about this whole Marcus situation, but let's find a "
#| "better spot to talk."
msgctxt "he222e562gaf81g40e6gb9fagbe2bede14686"
msgid ""
"I'm spreading word - quietly. Go and flush Marcus out. My Harpers and I will "
"make sure he has nowhere to go."
msgstr "마커스 일에 대해서는 아직 할 말이 남았지만, 여기서 할 얘기는 아닌 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_LastLightOx000
#. Speaker = Ox
#. NodeID = 006ab26d-bba7-579e-680d-0ea52e23bb7d
