msgctxt "hfccbb84ag2ce6g4891g8912g4bcff5abe093"
msgid ""
"I remember you from the grove with the druids. But I think you were taller "
"then."
msgstr "그 숲에서 드루이드 녀석들 하고 같이 있지 않았나, 그 때는 좀 더 키가 컸던 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_LastLightOx000
#. Speaker = Ox
#. NodeID = 39088605-e5fc-0144-ca92-cb390a9c0a8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_LastLightOx000:39088605-e5fc-0144-ca92-cb390a9c0a8a
msgctxt "h9f274550gf88dg44caga654g75f48215e239"
msgid ""
"I remember you from the grove with the druids. I hoped I'd see you again. "
"And now I have."
msgstr "숲에서 드루이드들과 함께 있던 널 기억해. 다시 봤으면 싶었는데, 그렇게 되었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_LastLightOx000
#. Speaker = Ox
#. NodeID = 4ee228d8-b85c-331b-02d2-29bc86dbd23c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_LastLightOx000:4ee228d8-b85c-331b-02d2-29bc86dbd23c
msgctxt "h8258f28cg66e1g4dbcg9c19gdf33226dc886"
msgid "I am an ox and ever will be. It's enough for me."
msgstr "나는 황소이며 앞으로도 그럴 거야, 그거면 충분해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_LastLightOx000
