msgid "Meenlocks! Those claws are sharp as hell."
msgstr "민록이다! 발톱이 더럽게 날카롭지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_Misc_PAD_MeenlockReaction
