msgctxt "ha57a9435gfaa0g4b13ga3e9g906b282906cf"
msgid "Give it or I'm telling Mol on you."
msgstr "내놔. 안 그러면 몰한테 말한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = c6b720a1-d7fd-7e81-8a5f-d8939a9850c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_HasSilverKey(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_DealMade = True
#.   Object:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Event_GiveSilverKey(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis:c6b720a1-d7fd-7e81-8a5f-d8939a9850c5
msgctxt "h86e55c75g20aag405bg8c63g4137cffc01f7"
msgid ""
"Yes! That's my first <i>negotiation</i>. Here. Pleasure doing business with "
"you."
msgstr "좋았어! 방금 그게 제 첫 <i>협상</i>이었어요. 여기요. 좋은 거래 감사합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca2fed35-f9eb-687b-ec39-fc3ef2582b1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 6
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis:ca2fed35-f9eb-687b-ec39-fc3ef2582b1f
msgctxt "hd31c69b3g712dg40cbga05fg403a3dcc1ed4"
msgid ""
"With all the other fabulous things you've found in this inn, why hold on to "
"a dusty old key?"
msgstr "이 여관에서 찾은 다른 엄청난 것들이 많은데 더럽고 낡은 열쇠를 가지고 있어서 뭐해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = caca37f8-a4a1-94bf-10b0-5ded36c6d8ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_SilverKeyIntroHappened(1) = True
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis_BuyingKey(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_DealMade = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis:caca37f8-a4a1-94bf-10b0-5ded36c6d8ab
msgctxt "h8d264810gde75g4fedgb969gae692d28dfbc"
msgid "You mentioned you had a key?"
msgstr "열쇠가 하나 있다고 했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cff8bee9-ec9c-fd64-96e3-5bbe72a05a03
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis:cff8bee9-ec9c-fd64-96e3-5bbe72a05a03
msgctxt "h36a516fbg2496g4d0egac27g217b089d529a"
msgid "No chance. That's too much."
msgstr "절대 안돼. 너무 비싸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = d973729c-c620-1ee3-880a-c780baaab35d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_HasSilverKey(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_State_DealMade = True
#.   Object:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Event_GiveSilverKey(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis:d973729c-c620-1ee3-880a-c780baaab35d
msgctxt "hc6367717gb672g4460gaa23g78daec221526"
msgid "Are you serious? Thanks so much! I've gotta tell Mol."
msgstr "진짜요? 정말 고마워요! 몰한테 말해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = daec4f93-d93e-a94f-8326-396f68d24adb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis:daec4f93-d93e-a94f-8326-396f68d24adb
msgctxt "h36156a12g72d8g4440gbddcg5eb3dcf3defd"
msgid ""
"Mol gave it to me, said I shouldn't let it go to just <i>any </i>old "
"jack-a-day."
msgstr "몰이 저한테 줬는데, 이건 <i>아무나</i> 주면 안 된대요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = dd9aba36-8c07-0257-4920-c7c2ecb43639
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis:dd9aba36-8c07-0257-4920-c7c2ecb43639
msgctxt "h11f5f05eg852eg4801g82ffgd9b66150e6ac"
msgid "Don't worry - it isn't leaving my sight!"
msgstr "걱정 마시죠. 눈 똑똑히 뜨고 지키는 중이니까!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = e9a89787-3268-413c-546e-9231ee73d35b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis:e9a89787-3268-413c-546e-9231ee73d35b
msgctxt "h17f2cf5eg5cb0g4541g866bg412e878f7f7b"
msgid "Until she tells me that herself, I'm gonna hang onto it. Thanks."
msgstr "몰이 저한테 직접 말하지 않는 한, 제가 갖고 있을게요. 감사합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = f060f013-6650-45c7-41de-1f05771af462
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis:f060f013-6650-45c7-41de-1f05771af462
msgctxt "h7e90b1d9g09e3g4b6egbe3cg374cc3a0d70c"
msgid "<i>Pleasure</i> doing business with you."
msgstr "<i>좋은</i> 거래 감사합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis
#. Speaker = Mattis
#. NodeID = f190d339-894a-a81f-36b9-b796fc615ab2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_AllTieflingsReportedDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis:f190d339-894a-a81f-36b9-b796fc615ab2
msgctxt "hb0fad9c6g9befg4c58g8d2bg94c651725f18"
msgid "I want to go back. Back to the way things were... What can I get you?"
msgstr "돌아가고 싶어. 모든 게 예전 같았던 그때로... 뭘 도와드릴까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f47329cc-ba9e-1a82-3aee-8eb10519d982
#. HandlePath = RollAdvantageReason
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 6
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis:f47329cc-ba9e-1a82-3aee-8eb10519d982
msgctxt "h4b31d08agb260g4727g9490ga4b0066a6698"
msgid "Rogue"
msgstr "로그"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f47329cc-ba9e-1a82-3aee-8eb10519d982
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 6
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mattis:f47329cc-ba9e-1a82-3aee-8eb10519d982
msgctxt "hea305ea9g0305g4e90g9153ge1364a4aa5b8"
msgid ""
"Look - give it to me now, or I steal it later. The former is less "
"embarrassing."
msgstr "봐봐. 지금 나한테 주던지, 나중에 내가 훔쳐가던지. 전자가 덜 부끄러울 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon
#. Speaker = Mirkon
#. NodeID = 2bfcf759-df41-47cb-93cc-abda501ea712
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_Mirkon_NightsongFreed_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon:2bfcf759-df41-47cb-93cc-abda501ea712
msgctxt "h1155c064ge9a3g473dgbcf8g0c5c20ddbc7c"
msgid "Once Ketheric is gone, we can get out of here. I can't <i>wait.</i>"
msgstr "케서릭이 없어지기만 하면, 여기서 떠날 수 있을 거야. 기다리기 <i>너무 힘들다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon
#. Speaker = Mirkon
#. NodeID = 52d3f7d4-9317-7de5-5c35-81895db6cd70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_MirkonPostRescue(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_NecroLab_State_KidsRescued_DEPRECATED = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon:52d3f7d4-9317-7de5-5c35-81895db6cd70
msgctxt "h44be810bg3b25g4017g9a24g9406d70fe34b"
msgid "I'm so glad Mol is back. She's the <i>best.</i>"
msgstr "몰이 돌아와서 너무 기뻐. 걔가 <i>제일 좋단 말야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon
#. Speaker = Mirkon
#. NodeID = 5a9f10fb-62ab-901d-3f4b-d74d008dc2f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_MirkonPostRescue(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_NecroLab_State_KidsRescued_DEPRECATED = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_SavingPrisoners_HasMet_MirkonPostRescue(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon:5a9f10fb-62ab-901d-3f4b-d74d008dc2f9
msgctxt "h7b83f434g130fg4d71ga54dga6998c48f674"
msgid ""
"Ide keeps asking Mol if she's all right. Heh. She acts tough, but she was "
"super worried about Mol."
msgstr "이드가 자꾸 몰한테 어디 아픈 데 없냐고 물어본다. 히히. 괜찮은 척하고 다녔지만, 무지 걱정했었거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon
#. Speaker = Mirkon
#. NodeID = 5b0e685f-a4bc-c1c4-e7e9-7b3fd341f2a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_AllTieflingsReportedDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon:5b0e685f-a4bc-c1c4-e7e9-7b3fd341f2a5
msgctxt "h5c25ece6gc058g4c91g96ebgd7df6ff79331"
msgid "I miss them. I miss the others."
msgstr "다들 보구 싶다. 모두가 그리워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon
#. Speaker = Mirkon
#. NodeID = 5bc4c9c8-0b87-46f1-9054-3b3fd3cc8547
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_Mirkon_NightsongFreed_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Mirkon_NightsongFreed_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon:5bc4c9c8-0b87-46f1-9054-3b3fd3cc8547
msgctxt "hcaa66c8bg2185g4848gb4e1g662ca4ce77b1"
msgid ""
"The light means that Ketheric will be gone soon, right? It is! I can tell by "
"your face!"
msgstr "저 빛이 케서릭을 곧 없애버린다는 거지? 그렇지! 네 얼굴에 다 쓰여있다구!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon
#. Speaker = Mirkon
#. NodeID = 71ef6dfd-d9fe-426b-9ada-d9feccdca819
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Hasmet_Mirkon_Alert(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon:71ef6dfd-d9fe-426b-9ada-d9feccdca819
msgctxt "h0a7a47eega39bg4899gb909g1fb706a70249"
msgid "I just want to go home."
msgstr "나 그냥 집에 갈래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon
#. Speaker = Mirkon
#. NodeID = 7aa05f2c-b7f7-6151-008d-40afee148419
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_HasMet_Mirkon(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_HasMet_Mirkon(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon:7aa05f2c-b7f7-6151-008d-40afee148419
msgctxt "h3280270eg7c68g414bg992dg3dc0ac956804"
msgid "This place is awesome. There's so much stuff!"
msgstr "여기 장난 아니다. 뭐가 엄청 많아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon
#. Speaker = Mirkon
#. NodeID = 7da38cc8-0d13-8f05-dba9-e3a13d3986f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon_KidsNotRescued(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_NecroLab_State_KidsRescued_DEPRECATED = False
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_TieflingsReturned = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon:7da38cc8-0d13-8f05-dba9-e3a13d3986f7
msgctxt "hfa62abe6g957cg4790g8b9fg5eca068983b5"
msgid "Mol is super tough. If anyone can handle Moonrise, she can... I think."
msgstr "몰은 무지하게 세다구. 문라이즈를 장악할 수 있는 사람은 몰 뿐일걸... 아마도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon
#. Speaker = Mirkon
#. NodeID = b23a67a6-f503-b788-8881-628eb0ed94f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_HasMet_Mirkon(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon:b23a67a6-f503-b788-8881-628eb0ed94f2
msgctxt "h45d05de9g703eg4879g9922gea41d60c5689"
msgid "Maybe I'll find a sword. Or an axe!"
msgstr "검을 찾을 수 있을지도 몰라. 아니면 도끼라거나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon
#. Speaker = Mirkon
#. NodeID = cb0f75ed-c3ee-f742-e9b4-81c94c5bda8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_NecroLab_State_KidsRescued_DEPRECATED = False
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_TieflingsReturned = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon_KidsNotRescued(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon:cb0f75ed-c3ee-f742-e9b4-81c94c5bda8e
msgctxt "h983de4a6g04cdg4303g9f40g0f873125ebe3"
msgid ""
"I keep asking Jaheira about my friends, but she says she doesn't know where "
"they are."
msgstr "자헤이라한테 친구들이 어떻게 됐냐고 계속 물어보고 있는데, 아직 못 찾았다는 말밖에 안 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon
#. Speaker = Mirkon
#. NodeID = e8c729e2-3ce5-ab67-b649-46b4f7383adc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Hasmet_Mirkon_Alert(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Hasmet_Mirkon_Alert(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Mirkon:e8c729e2-3ce5-ab67-b649-46b4f7383adc
msgctxt "hc1733089g9f7ag4110g9dbbge87e30daeb91"
msgid ""
"Ide keeps asking to go treasure hunting, but I don't want to. Not anymore."
msgstr "이드가 자꾸 보물찾기하러 가자고 하는데, 가기 싫어. 더는 하고 싶지 않은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 0a1a4421-5415-ee7e-8987-d950b9bdcb1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Event_GiveMaskReward1(1) = True
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Event_GiveMask1(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:0a1a4421-5415-ee7e-8987-d950b9bdcb1d
msgctxt "h71728e44g3c15g4618g84bfgaa988d8e1547"
msgid ""
"Hm. I thought I sniffed a Merregon's scent somewhere. These must've been a "
"pain to get a hold of."
msgstr "흠. 어디서 메레곤 냄새가 난다 했더니. 이거 얻느라고 고생깨나 하셨겠네요. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 0d419860-d60e-52a3-65f5-ec4f1ed09f8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Dammon_State_ReceivedSecondReward = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Dammon_State_ReceivedSecondReward = True
#.   Object:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Event_GiveReward_002(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:0d419860-d60e-52a3-65f5-ec4f1ed09f8f
msgctxt "h63a38e96g9307g47dfg8071g6906806403e0"
msgid ""
"It's perfect, really. Just a moment - I'll be able to work this one quickly."
msgstr "정말이지 완벽해요. 잠시만요 - 금방이면 작업할 수 있겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 140b7b2e-f48a-a42b-e87b-1a7cee2bc121
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Knows_AboutWeapon = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:140b7b2e-f48a-a42b-e87b-1a7cee2bc121
msgctxt "h6306ac82g6e0cg49fegb907g29219c0cb707"
msgid "I found some hellish masks, can you make anything of these?"
msgstr "지옥의 가면 몇 개를 찾았는데, 이걸로 만들 수 있는 게 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 256c501a-1ed0-f390-efd4-2fa979bd20f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:256c501a-1ed0-f390-efd4-2fa979bd20f9
msgctxt "haabc728cg8cfdg409dg82dbgd5c796122bc9"
msgid "Actually, I'll hang on to them."
msgstr "일단은 가지고 있을게요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 258a5e53-ee46-d591-da12-8dbeec80e534
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:258a5e53-ee46-d591-da12-8dbeec80e534
msgctxt "h3b8363d2ga313g4c41g89f8ga079764580ac"
msgid "If you need something sharp, I have a few things left."
msgstr "날카로운 게 필요하시다면, 아직 조금 갖고 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 25e6d4f0-9af4-fee1-a4b8-827c8f2fe739
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:25e6d4f0-9af4-fee1-a4b8-827c8f2fe739
msgctxt "h8d987007g4c37g485eg8b5cgbafc7a5506e3"
msgid ""
"There you are. And be careful who you show that to. It might draw the wrong "
"kind of attention."
msgstr "여기 있습니다. 누구에게 보여줄지 조심하는 편이 좋을 겁니다. 자칫 잘못된 사람의 관심을 끌 수도 있으니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2707b2b7-7663-17a4-15e0-e6ca895e3635
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate_5 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:2707b2b7-7663-17a4-15e0-e6ca895e3635
msgctxt "h1b170a8ag42e7g4428g982fg8b17c335a649"
msgid "I've got nine masks for you."
msgstr "가면 아홉 개 줄 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32dae75c-5b7d-cb3a-f1c0-20cf26508723
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Knows_AboutWeapon = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:32dae75c-5b7d-cb3a-f1c0-20cf26508723
msgctxt "hd8254b98gf0bcg439ag98d8g965c5c85e775"
msgid "'Interesting' materials? What do you mean?"
msgstr "'흥미로운' 재료라니? 무슨 말이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 344c2fcd-8866-b190-0670-52b05ae4be8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:344c2fcd-8866-b190-0670-52b05ae4be8f
msgctxt "h1efad21cg1ac5g4303gb5e7gce3a12ff5cd9"
msgid ""
"I... hesitated to mention this back in the druids' grove - for obvious "
"reasons - but no one has earned my trust if not you."
msgstr "저... 전에 드루이드 숲에선 다들 아는 이유로 말하기가 망설여졌는데, 당신만큼은 신뢰할 수 있게 되었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37d6bffb-b54d-feaf-8a98-7cc970e57b0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Knows_AboutWeapon = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:37d6bffb-b54d-feaf-8a98-7cc970e57b0c
msgctxt "h91e24ca4gc8efg464ag844ag6c2212d57650"
msgid "Sounds like you had an interesting time in the Hells."
msgstr "아홉 지옥에서 재밌는 시간을 보냈나 봐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 3a5ef50d-c049-a0b6-87c4-066d68560d0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_NightsongFreedHasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Protected = False
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Alert = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_NightsongFreedHasMet(1) = True
#.     - HAV_Weaponsmith_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:3a5ef50d-c049-a0b6-87c4-066d68560d0e
msgctxt "h23cf751eg3041g4e71g84fbgd636bc52cb41"
msgid ""
"There you are! I'd hoped you'd made it through, but when we didn't hear from "
"you... well. I'm glad you're here now."
msgstr "당신이로군! 무사히 빠져나왔으리라 믿고는 있었는데, 아무런 소식이 없으니... 아무튼, 무사해서 다행입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4470b89f-1d60-d815-ee41-11bab18734d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Dammon_State_ReceivedThirdReward = False
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Knows_AboutWeapon = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_ForgingOfTheHeart_State_HasInfernalMetalTemplate(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:4470b89f-1d60-d815-ee41-11bab18734d3
msgctxt "h4c0a4ee3gfc53g45cbga6e5ga54498560c73"
msgid ""
"I think I found a material you could work with. What can you make of it?"
msgstr "당신이 작업할 수 있는 재료를 좀 찾은 것 같은데요. 이걸로 뭘 만들 수 있죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 56700939-fa13-2083-1bc8-25aa7a4e9e8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Protected = True
#.      - GLO_DevilishOx_State_Defeated = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Protected = False
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_killeddevilishox = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Weaponsmith_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.     - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Protected = True
#.     - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_killeddevilishox = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:56700939-fa13-2083-1bc8-25aa7a4e9e8b
msgctxt "hf5549fe0g33e0g4c2dgbb69g77e245bf1e90"
msgid ""
"I <i>thought </i>it was you - saving my skin again, I see. Never seen a "
"shapeshifted ox before, but I'm glad you dealt with it before <i>it </"
"i>dealt with <i>us.</i>"
msgstr ""
"당신인 것 <i>같더라니</i>. 또 날 구해줬군요. 형상변환 황소가 웬 말인가 싶네요. 아무튼 <i>그것</i>이 <i>우리</i>에게 "
"뭔 짓을 하기 전에 당신이 먼저 처리해서 다행입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 578ad9bb-387d-9ffb-9826-f1025443d06d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:578ad9bb-387d-9ffb-9826-f1025443d06d
msgctxt "h0da539beg32d0g47a7g94d2ga8cdd61c3b7f"
msgid "That's not as many as you said you had."
msgstr "그렇게 많이 갖고 있진 않은 것 같은데요. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d565298-b9e6-8abf-726e-e607a5940272
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Dammon_State_ReceivedThirdReward = False
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Knows_AboutWeapon = True
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_InfernalPlate_HasPlate(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:5d565298-b9e6-8abf-726e-e607a5940272
msgctxt "h96b3464ag91beg4f38g8effg9744802a8baf"
msgid ""
"I found this metal in a place called Grymforge - what do you make of it?"
msgstr "그림포지라는 곳에서 이 금속을 찾아냈습니다 - 뭘 만들어 줄 수 있죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 62bb873a-56f6-4d58-a079-3cbca6a9f46d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:62bb873a-56f6-4d58-a079-3cbca6a9f46d
msgctxt "hde70c2edg89ebg4ea3gb69cgb029f6e0563b"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 66be4d5f-c99a-1b44-5ead-8a4ae5681a51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_DevilishOx_State_Defeated = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_killeddevilishox = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_killeddevilishox = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:66be4d5f-c99a-1b44-5ead-8a4ae5681a51
msgctxt "h00a1bc62g67a3g4b41g85ecgbbb1e95f82db"
msgid ""
"I hope that fight with that hideous shapeshifted creature didn't sully your "
"weapon too badly. You'll be needing it."
msgstr "저 흉측한 형상변환 괴물이랑 싸우느라 무기가 심하게 훼손되지 않았길 바랍니다. 무기가 또 필요해질 테니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 679054af-f9a6-546e-c1ad-2f6b40d522b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Knows_AboutWeapon = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:679054af-f9a6-546e-c1ad-2f6b40d522b2
msgctxt "h29f21bb1g1b1fg4ce6gba84g96849eb6de40"
msgid ""
"I can sense some, smell it almost, somewhere in the area. Underground, maybe "
"- out there, in the shadows."
msgstr "이 근방에서 그 존재가 느껴져요. 냄새가 날 지경이죠. 지하에 있거나, 혹은 저 너머 그림자 속에 있을 수도 있겠네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 7a2e302f-1e60-396d-9c86-15e6cae186f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_DevilishOx_State_Defeated = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_killeddevilishox = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_killeddevilishox = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:7a2e302f-1e60-396d-9c86-15e6cae186f7
msgctxt "hc1ca5294ga9cag4be3gac43gd5fd4ca77b8d"
msgid ""
"Nor from shapeshifting cow-blob-things, though you made short enough work of "
"that one. Glad you handled it before <i>it </i>handled <i>me</i>."
msgstr ""
"형상변환 소-점액-괴물도 마찬가지겠지만, 당신이 재빨리 처리했죠. <i>그것</i>이 <i>날</i> 해치기 전에 먼저 해치웠으니 정말 "
"다행입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 7c2c7622-cd25-447f-8b76-1a2c43d4692d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Protected = True
#.      - GLO_DevilishOx_State_Defeated = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Protected = True
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_killeddevilishox = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Weaponsmith_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.     - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_killeddevilishox = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:7c2c7622-cd25-447f-8b76-1a2c43d4692d
msgctxt "h97bd58a4g6e50g4767g9157g613ab806aaf7"
msgid ""
"Gods above and devils below! That ox was a bloody shapeshifter! Thanks for "
"handling it."
msgstr "이런 세상에! 저 황소가 빌어먹을 형상변환자였다니! 처리해줘서 고맙습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 7c70cacf-ef70-72e4-7ce2-86a46609b271
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Protected = True
#.      - GLO_DevilishOx_State_Defeated = False
#.      - HAV_ForgingOfTheHeart_OM_Karlach_COM_HasMet = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Protected = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Weaponsmith_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.     - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Protected = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:7c70cacf-ef70-72e4-7ce2-86a46609b271
msgctxt "h29b0b5f3g3959g4f5eg8a25ge7d929869266"
msgid "Glad you and Karlach are all right. Well - as all right as any of us."
msgstr "당신이나 칼라크나 무사해서 다행입니다. 다른 이들과 마찬가지로 말이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 7d91b4df-ebe2-2c1f-694b-f629d100edd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:7d91b4df-ebe2-2c1f-694b-f629d100edd2
msgctxt "h99b1f1abg3982g4af3g80cbgf49fd9d17f08"
msgid ""
"When Elturel was dragged into Avernus, I was drafted into a devil's smithy. "
"It <i>should </i>have been awful, but infernal metal is like a wild horse. "
"Powerful, exuberant - it'll kill you if you lack technique."
msgstr ""
"엘투렐이 아베르누스로 끌려갔을 때, 전 데빌의 대장간에 징용됐어요. 끔찍한 경험<i>이었어야 했지만</i>, 지옥 강철은 흡사 야생마 "
"같았죠. 강력하고 정력적이라 기술 없이 다루다가는 죽을 수도 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 89291f33-af8b-adf6-635f-c523de6bd262
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:89291f33-af8b-adf6-635f-c523de6bd262
msgctxt "h366e4fc1g4e47g41a1g8647g8a0b2f62ebff"
msgid ""
"There. Be careful who sees you using that, might draw the wrong sort of eyes."
msgstr "여기요. 사용할 때는 주변을 살피는 게 좋을 겁니다. 의도치 않은 시선을 끌 수도 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 8b91e8f7-8695-e132-4589-ebb64d9746b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:8b91e8f7-8695-e132-4589-ebb64d9746b6
msgctxt "h7e182defg2be3g4486g8e55g5374d826fb99"
msgid ""
"I'm glad to see you're all right. The way here was anything but easy, eh?"
msgstr "다행히 별탈없이 멀쩡해 보이는군요. 여기까지 오는 길이 쉽지는 않았잖아요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 957923ef-4fa4-4dd6-d920-afd4ea21e06a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:957923ef-4fa4-4dd6-d920-afd4ea21e06a
msgctxt "h5ff92d69ga2d3g41c9g9971g462d904ba295"
msgid ""
"As for me, I won't say I <i>enjoyed </i>my time there, but it was "
"certainly... instructional."
msgstr "저로선 그곳에서의 시간을 <i>즐겼다</i>라곤 하지 않겠지만, 확실히... 배울 게 많았죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 971daf95-6515-34b5-9c17-0cd5497da278
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Dammon_State_ReceivedFirstReward = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Dammon_State_ReceivedFirstReward = True
#.   Object:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Event_GiveReward_001(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:971daf95-6515-34b5-9c17-0cd5497da278
msgctxt "h4a47f632gc598g422bg9984g38677142e1b2"
msgid ""
"Absolutely. Rare to get your hands on this stuff - well done keeping it to "
"hand."
msgstr "물론이죠. 손에 넣기 힘든 물건이니 잘 간수하셔야 할 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 9871be9a-c8df-7783-0d70-b1c39e3b0fda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:9871be9a-c8df-7783-0d70-b1c39e3b0fda
msgctxt "hbe321c66g5e43g4d59gbab1g798e8299e72c"
msgid "If you find it, bring it to me. I'll make something <i>incredible.</i>"
msgstr "그걸 찾는다면 제게 가져오세요. <i>엄청난</i> 걸 만들어드리죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c64dcea-92ca-40c5-97d5-a047dd748df5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:9c64dcea-92ca-40c5-97d5-a047dd748df5
msgctxt "h11d2dd9eg89b5g427cg9a4agd69ae8b82f16"
msgid "Let's see what you have."
msgstr "뭘 팔고 있나 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 9d5e3375-1768-ae6e-dc4d-8870ee970786
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:9d5e3375-1768-ae6e-dc4d-8870ee970786
msgctxt "h088634a3gd93ag49adg842dgc1003e930e80"
msgid ""
"Merregon masks are brittle, so what I make won't last as long as my usual "
"pieces."
msgstr "메레곤 가면은 잘 부서져요. 그러니까 제 평소 작업물처럼 오래가진 않을 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = 9eb09917-a0d5-43c9-982e-082241885713
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:9eb09917-a0d5-43c9-982e-082241885713
msgctxt "hd3406792gf0acg406cg9415g7447749163ad"
msgid "I'll be here if you need anything else."
msgstr "여기 있을테니 또 필요한 게 있으면 들러요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = a0c165a8-9044-9e74-c828-039fae75a17e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Protected = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Protected = True
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_killeddevilishox = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Weaponsmith_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:a0c165a8-9044-9e74-c828-039fae75a17e
msgctxt "hfc734df6gb8b8g4e04g8f2egb6a84d3ca358"
msgid "Need anything?"
msgstr "필요한 거 있으세요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a1890b68-2f83-d1ed-7aac-664569f5d033
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Dammon_State_ReceivedThirdReward = False
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Knows_AboutWeapon = True
#.   Object:
#.      - TUT_UpperDeck_State_HasInfernalMetal(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:a1890b68-2f83-d1ed-7aac-664569f5d033
msgctxt "h4472a0ecg16f9g4fa8ga1fag9a23f5b304f1"
msgid "I've got this metal I found in Avernus itself - will that do?"
msgstr "지옥이나 다름없는 곳에서 찾아낸 금속인데, 이거면 됩니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = a3c714a4-720a-2fae-a6e4-c1ad10803f25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:a3c714a4-720a-2fae-a6e4-c1ad10803f25
msgctxt "h3a7a238bga62eg4939gaf2eg2f96ed8223aa"
msgid ""
"Using something that's already fabricated is tough, but I can try. How many "
"do you have?"
msgstr "이미 제작이 된 물건을 원재료로 활용하는 건 꽤나 어려운 일이지만, 해볼 순 있겠죠. 얼마나 갖고 있습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = a5d5429b-3c00-7173-5f5a-732a04b64207
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:a5d5429b-3c00-7173-5f5a-732a04b64207
msgctxt "h90e0b004g966fg4b70g80b9g34e59037adbe"
msgid "Fair enough, they might have use as they are."
msgstr "그러세요. 그 모습으로도 나름의 쓰임새가 있겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa869557-01d0-17a2-9b08-a34e4020bd27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate_2 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:aa869557-01d0-17a2-9b08-a34e4020bd27
msgctxt "h8055d5edg0b65g4e12g98c7g79fa2ce7f425"
msgid "I can spare two."
msgstr "두 개 줄 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = ac7271f5-23a4-4a2f-a0d9-58097fcb7bf4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Alert = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Weaponsmith_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.     - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Alert = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:ac7271f5-23a4-4a2f-a0d9-58097fcb7bf4
msgctxt "ha0a5c1e2g59fcg4449gb03cg817c3992a8e6"
msgid "Nowhere's safe from this damned Absolute."
msgstr "어느 곳도 망할 놈의 절대자로부터 안전하지 않아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1617085-f510-a789-706d-e2ca81554a22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:b1617085-f510-a789-706d-e2ca81554a22
msgctxt "h42c4495fg0770g4966ga657g51ee290edead"
msgid "Here's one mask."
msgstr "여기 가면 하나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = b811b39b-885e-c99d-35fe-83c84e05ca85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:b811b39b-885e-c99d-35fe-83c84e05ca85
msgctxt "h3cd575f2ge208g4ee8g886egeae2f8e6ecb1"
msgid ""
"A makeshift Harper's fire might not be where I <i>hoped </i>to set up shop, "
"but maybe I've got something you can use anyway."
msgstr "임시로 지핀 하퍼의 화로가 제가 작업장으로 바랐던 곳은 딱히 아니지만, 그래도 제게 당신이 쓸만한 것이 있을지도요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = bf06c71a-4f19-73ba-0355-d74a0d2e4cfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:bf06c71a-4f19-73ba-0355-d74a0d2e4cfc
msgctxt "ha176e69dg8fd0g426cg83b1gf30a24519226"
msgid "Perhaps you've misplaced it? I'll be here should you find it again."
msgstr "어디 놓고 오셨나봐요? 찾으면 여기로 가지고 오세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = c3b2cb8f-ab18-9a57-94fd-48ee12b21179
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_NightsongFreedHasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Weaponsmith_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:c3b2cb8f-ab18-9a57-94fd-48ee12b21179
msgctxt "hbea1228eg40c2g48c3gaaf8g301e90cc06e5"
msgid ""
"Isobel said we ought to sit tight for the time being - wait until we hear "
"back from Jaheira. I know she's right, but I can't wait to get moving."
msgstr ""
"이소벨이 우리더러 자헤이라로부터 연락이 올 때까지 당분간 기다려야 한다고 했어요. 그녀의 말이 옳다는 건 알지만, 당장이라도 이곳을 뜨고 "
"싶군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = cce81a63-94bf-4688-a376-3179e24fc8ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Protected = True
#.      - GLO_DevilishOx_State_Defeated = False
#.   Local:
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Protected = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Weaponsmith_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.     - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Protected = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:cce81a63-94bf-4688-a376-3179e24fc8ec
msgctxt "hc3323b28g26cag4e26g9684ga3fa6a794ca9"
msgid ""
"It's - you! What are the odds? So glad you're all right. Well - as all right "
"as any of us."
msgstr "당신이군요! 이런 우연이? 괜찮으셔서 정말 다행이예요. 뭐, 우리 중 누구도 정말 괜찮은 사람은 없지만요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = cfb701ff-3a0a-368a-fb4b-baed824e1dca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:cfb701ff-3a0a-368a-fb4b-baed824e1dca
msgctxt "h958147bcgf2ffg46a2g8be9gd1b13aafa38e"
msgid ""
"Some of us had it easier than others. The baker, the schoolmaster - when "
"Elturel was swallowed up, they could do little but survive."
msgstr "우리 중 일부는 다른 이들보다 쉽게 견뎌냈죠. 제빵사, 교사같은 이들은 엘투렐이 삼켜지면서 그저 살아남기 바빴어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = d2ff04b4-1849-4f9f-9a58-32d18c2bb3a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 7e64876b-820d-9afc-5c90-fb12ded8fe68_HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_Weaponsmith_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:d2ff04b4-1849-4f9f-9a58-32d18c2bb3a4
msgctxt "h75bfb9ccg6437g40b9g9446gd187095726d3"
msgid "Can't sleep, so I might as well hammer. Need anything?"
msgstr "잠이 안 오니, 망치질이라도 해야죠. 필요한 거라도 있으신가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d5529833-f664-513b-0259-d4d0a50e5670
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:d5529833-f664-513b-0259-d4d0a50e5670
msgctxt "h2887f19bge145g44e6g986eg461af6161aec"
msgid "I've got three masks."
msgstr "세 개 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = dd937cc4-3c79-963a-9f48-6eb8b5f99f62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:dd937cc4-3c79-963a-9f48-6eb8b5f99f62
msgctxt "hb7e76b50g5616g454bgae31g7921ab82d8a5"
msgid ""
"And if you find any interesting materials in need of working, I'm happy to "
"help."
msgstr "가공이 필요한 흥미로운 재료를 찾으시면 기꺼이 도와드리죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = e1efac55-196f-93eb-7197-43dbe8d0cec4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:e1efac55-196f-93eb-7197-43dbe8d0cec4
msgctxt "h47238745g4144g4e1cg940cg5ecb4814c892"
msgid "If you want me to have another look, you know where to find me."
msgstr "혹시 나중에라도 생각이 바뀌면 저한테 갖고 오세요. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = f3efbd8a-b400-33b8-0624-6997595bd402
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_NightsongFreedHasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_NightsongFreedHasMet(1) = True
#.     - HAV_Weaponsmith_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:f3efbd8a-b400-33b8-0624-6997595bd402
msgctxt "h8d0d6c91g9260g44bfgbbe4gecdd3e601f93"
msgid ""
"Did you see it? The path of light? That's good, right? Means we might make "
"it out of here alive."
msgstr "그 빛의 길을 보셨나요? 좋은 징조겠지요? 우리가 여기서 살아서 나갈 수 있다는 의미길 바라요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Dammon
#. NodeID = fd8a6e4b-4bbf-477e-a8b7-a52842db145a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Dammon_State_ReceivedThirdReward = True
#.   Object:
#.     - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Event_GiveReward_003(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:fd8a6e4b-4bbf-477e-a8b7-a52842db145a
msgctxt "hf4378912ge241g4bf7g969egb8ef0a7c2621"
msgid ""
"Well, well, well... I <i>knew </i>I smelled something. And I know just what "
"to do with it. One moment."
msgstr "이런, 이런, 이런... 뭔가 냄새를 풍기는 걸 <i>알았다니까</i>. 어떻게 다뤄야 할지 알아요. 잠시만요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe8b8d77-ec89-c56f-4bf6-5ddb2b43bb05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate_4 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:fe8b8d77-ec89-c56f-4bf6-5ddb2b43bb05
msgctxt "hdd13b702gb634g4cfega65eg2c57ca8089f5"
msgid "Here's six masks I don't need."
msgstr "여기 남는 가면 여섯 개."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fffa2903-8d0f-caa7-dfb9-22a64991c705
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith_Knows_AboutWeapon = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_TieflingSurvivors_Weaponsmith:fffa2903-8d0f-caa7-dfb9-22a64991c705
msgctxt "hf98d1262g7d76g4d79g9dc4g3f45d1f43d7f"
msgid ""
"Earlier, you mentioned you could work 'interesting' materials. What did you "
"mean?"
msgstr "전에 '흥미로운' 재료들을 다룰 수 있다고 했었지. 무슨 의미였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/HAV_VB_ShadowSiege_PlayerEntersCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0afd1ce1-a6cf-48b0-92a2-b77f5aba83f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
