msgctxt "he42ba619g9b3cg4c3bg85e7g90e41ce34181"
msgid "I really want to win the treasure hunt. Ide <i>always</i> wins."
msgstr "보물찾기에서 꼭 이기고 싶어. <i>맨날</i> 아이드가 이긴단말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HarperGuard_002_AD_WithMirkon
