msgid "Duke Ravengard's still alive, you reckon?"
msgstr "레이븐가드 공작이 아직 살아 있을 것 같아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_AD_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
