msgid ""
"I wish we'd gear up and head out. All this standing around is making me "
"antsy."
msgstr "어서 장비 챙겨서 나갔으면 좋겠어. 이렇게 서있기만 하는 건 좀 불안해지는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_AD_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
