msgctxt "h6bdaa4cfg612cg4accg851egd746032e3e67"
msgid ""
"Never thought I'd see the day Jaheira shows mercy to a True Soul. Or - "
"whatever it is you are."
msgstr "자헤이라가 참된 영혼에게 자비를 보이는 날이 올 줄은 몰랐는걸. 네가 사실은 뭐든 간에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeRunners_Ranger
