#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeRunners_Ranger:c1e94a9d-a712-4189-81f4-5531272ae852
msgctxt "hcb79c158g3bb4g4ad1g876fg5a27066b50c5"
msgid ""
"Don't know if we'll survive another attack. We need to get out of here soon "
"as we can."
msgstr "다음 공격에서 우리가 살아남을 수 있을지 모르겠어. 여기서 최대한 빨리 벗어나는 게 좋겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeRunners_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Antony
#. NodeID = d7631670-ca83-52e2-bbbf-9e123e417bb8
