#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 32731edf-06a8-7af4-f884-3196996ab227_MarcusComment = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeRunners_Ranger:d7631670-ca83-52e2-bbbf-9e123e417bb8
msgctxt "h60a69f1cgcedfg4a2dgbcabg9551611116b2"
msgid ""
"Heard about what happened with Marcus. Guess you really aren't like the rest "
"of 'em. Strange bloody times."
msgstr "마커스와 무슨 일이 있었는지 들었어. 넌 정말 다른 놈들하고는 다른가 보네. 진짜 이상한 시대야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeYeller_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Donner
#. NodeID = 64d69719-81d8-ea5d-0920-9a0d10a27968
