msgctxt "h07d42809g7a5bg4e8fg983dg992b8d3995b8"
msgid ""
"Called out your buddy, but he seemed to get away without a scratch. You "
"can't pull the wool over my eyes."
msgstr "당신 친구를 불렀는데, 보아하니 상처 하나 없이 빠져나간 것 같더군. 내 눈을 속일 순 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeYeller_Ranger
