msgctxt "h965b7918gcf52g436cgac66g80cc91ed1d7c"
msgid ""
"I <i>knew </i>there was something off about that Fist. Glad you were here to "
"take him down."
msgstr "그 피스트한테 뭐가 있을 줄 <i>알았다니까</i>. 마침 네가 때려눕혀서 다행이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeYeller_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Donner
#. NodeID = b0a2609e-fbf4-4392-80c5-b7e66d7ddb3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
