#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeYeller_Ranger:b0a2609e-fbf4-4392-80c5-b7e66d7ddb3a
msgctxt "h541f2e6cg4219g44a4gae43g92be4f3d4fcf"
msgid ""
"Jaheira seems sure of you. I hope she's right. This barricade might keep the "
"shadows out, but it won't help against what's already inside."
msgstr ""
"자헤이라는 널 믿나 본데. 그게 맞았으면 좋겠네. 이 바리케이드는 그림자를 막아 줄 수 있을진 몰라도, 이미 안에 있는 놈한테는 도움이 "
"안 되니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeYeller_Ranger
