msgctxt "h4e1171e4ga98cg47c2g8184g4f8ba9a4eb41"
msgid "Look after you and yours. We've lost too many good souls as it is."
msgstr "너와 네 친구들을 잘 돌봐줘. 지금 우린 너무 많은 좋은 영혼들을 잃었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Left_Melee
