msgctxt "hff7bcf59g5e5dg4d12g8cf3g7dbd183de95c"
msgid ""
"There's a crackle in the air - in the darkness. More surprises coming. Be "
"careful."
msgstr "어둠 속의 공기가 딱딱거리는군. 기습이 더 올 거다. 조심해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Left_Ranger
