msgctxt "hdc6ce1f0g6086g4526gbb92g5575f90b1394"
msgid ""
"The Flaming Fist - I felt it. Something wrong. But betrayal? A surprise."
msgstr "플레이밍 피스트. 뭔가 이상하다는 걸 느꼈지. 근데 배신이라고? 놀랍군."

