msgctxt "hf99a583bg48d3g4282g9b5ag3d9dd6d7aa92"
msgid ""
"You look well-equipped. Good. You wouldn't believe the state of some of "
"these lads."
msgstr "넌 잘 갖추고 있군. 좋아. 여기 친구들 몇 놈 상태는 보고도 못믿을 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Melee
#. Speaker = Harper Hangfar
#. NodeID = d5be2fd2-4f70-44eb-a7ea-8243ac530a4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
