msgctxt "he4635763gadefg40fcg99dagde2945f47c92"
msgid "You need something, ask Jaheira. I'm on duty."
msgstr "볼 일이 있으면 자헤이라 님을 찾아가, 난 임무 중이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Naysa
#. NodeID = 7de4d9ab-16ca-41b2-a351-57301c5ad12e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger_Alert(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger:7de4d9ab-16ca-41b2-a351-57301c5ad12e
msgctxt "h265560b7g4411g4ca3gbcf0gb39a498b9f65"
msgid ""
"My eyes can't be everywhere. Be careful who you choose to watch your back."
msgstr "내가 모든 곳을 살펴볼 수는 없으니 당신 뒤를 봐줄 사람을 잘 고르라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Naysa
#. NodeID = 99892034-238e-4a45-895d-1da0e3a64e51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger_Protected(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Protected = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger:99892034-238e-4a45-895d-1da0e3a64e51
msgctxt "h07fafa69geca9g4b3ag98f1g1884fb2d8ba9"
msgid "Get the hint, mate. I don't have time for a chat."
msgstr "이 양반아, 눈치 좀 챙겨. 노가리 깔 시간 따위 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Naysa
#. NodeID = ac3a443f-3f4e-4550-bf6a-a4597f1046a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger_Alert(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger_Alert(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger:ac3a443f-3f4e-4550-bf6a-a4597f1046a5
msgctxt "h1f2692b0ga182g4f3eg993dg0f90ff29a8c8"
msgid ""
"Shadows on the outside, traitors on the inside... best steer clear of them "
"Flaming Fists, all right?"
msgstr "안으로는 배신자에 밖으로는 그림자라니... 플레이밍 피스트하고는 거리를 두는 게 좋겠지. 안그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_AD_Halfling_Melee_InCombat
#. Speaker = Harper Callie
#. NodeID = 6c6cc39a-d8d2-4f07-b25e-7fe46cdd0879
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_AD_Halfling_Melee_InCombat:6c6cc39a-d8d2-4f07-b25e-7fe46cdd0879
msgctxt "hd21de530g4962g49afg806cg50f311b0e3af"
msgid "Finally, a little entertainment."
msgstr "드디어 재미를 좀 볼 수 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_AD_Halfling_Melee_JaheiraDefeated
#. Speaker = Harper Callie
#. NodeID = b659a460-1ca8-4f43-b347-7b159b9ef193
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_AD_Halfling_Melee_JaheiraDefeated:b659a460-1ca8-4f43-b347-7b159b9ef193
msgctxt "hbf3eac0dge878g4beag8ecdg03d0149c9999"
msgid "An affront to the High Harper will be paid in blood."
msgstr "고위 하퍼에 대한 모욕은 피로 되갚아야 할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 0ae584f3-f103-8bf2-4b63-2232dbcdf0e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_HasMet_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_State_FlamingFistsInHaven = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HavenOutcasts_HasMet_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:0ae584f3-f103-8bf2-4b63-2232dbcdf0e1
msgctxt "h39908a91g12feg437bg8d78gf79019a3eac6"
msgid "Best head inside. There's food and warmth to spare."
msgstr "들어가시죠. 여분의 음식과 온기가 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 0b145fb0-fb86-aa6f-2f29-5f798e282efe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:0b145fb0-fb86-aa6f-2f29-5f798e282efe
msgctxt "hf862197bg11d6g407ag903cg9c18dc84c455"
msgid ""
"Don't think so, but we don't really know one way or the other. Better safe "
"than sorry, Jaheira'd say."
msgstr "그건 아닌 듯 한데, 어느 쪽이든 확실치 않다는 게 문제지. 자헤이라 님은 나중에 후회 하는 것보단 이게 나을 거라고 하시더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1d269c23-c748-b377-a1ec-d53302103c7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_Knows_WasInCurse = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:1d269c23-c748-b377-a1ec-d53302103c7f
msgctxt "heeb56982ge663g49d2g8c23ge06fff966f7c"
msgid "Why steer clear? Is he dangerous?"
msgstr "왜 접근하지 말라는 거지? 위험한가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 28470086-12f6-7706-e732-dedcd7bfd29e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:28470086-12f6-7706-e732-dedcd7bfd29e
msgctxt "h0772900eg2d46g4d25gbeb8gdd335645e8b6"
msgid "Wish the fellow inside could say the same."
msgstr "안에 있는 친구도 똑같이 말할 수 있으면 좋겠네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 2d0e3f76-3629-b3ee-6b89-0bf26be36ca3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:2d0e3f76-3629-b3ee-6b89-0bf26be36ca3
msgctxt "h6a7e09ddg0d11g4abag8979g23bfb83414d5"
msgid ""
"He clearly needs help, but we're stretched thin as is. He's just inside, if "
"you want to give him a once-over."
msgstr "그 사람, 분명히 도움이 필요하지만 우리도 힘이 부치는 상황이야. 한번 살펴 보고 싶다면 바로 안에 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 36232543-a9d9-b51f-1e46-bd7d3dfc467c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:36232543-a9d9-b51f-1e46-bd7d3dfc467c
msgctxt "h1d76a116g3c91g4f3cg8552gc78cdb0f6a2b"
msgid ""
"I'll not abandon my post. But it might be a friendly face could rouse the "
"poor fellow."
msgstr "난 내 위치에서 벗어날 수 없어. 그래도 친절함이 그 불쌍한 친구를 깨울 수 있을지 모르잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 4215dd0f-c786-4a76-cc06-66c03d2d7a88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_HasMet_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf_Freed(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:4215dd0f-c786-4a76-cc06-66c03d2d7a88
msgctxt "h8384ea8fgdac9g40b5g86cbg6ffd8f415d17"
msgid "The Harpers won't let you down."
msgstr "하퍼들은 실망시키지 않을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 4f3a49cf-b05c-f20d-d197-ea1d467abc18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_HasMet_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HavenOutcasts_HasMet_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:4f3a49cf-b05c-f20d-d197-ea1d467abc18
msgctxt "h56a75918ged14g46ccg9e14g56b268e885c2"
msgid ""
"Not <i>another </i>ward, I hope? I'm better at subterfuge and spellcasting "
"than babysitting<i>.</i>"
msgstr "<i>또</i> 돌봄이 필요한 사람들은 아니었으면 하는데, 난 <i>육아</i>보다는 교란과 주문시전에 소질이 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 50e2a18d-3226-e60a-087e-120741cca38c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:50e2a18d-3226-e60a-087e-120741cca38c
msgctxt "hd2c314bcg5f6fg4e87g8e9bg5da6e7f60410"
msgid "Who are you babysitting?"
msgstr "누구를 돌보는 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 55923de2-c310-f863-8e23-f0645398397d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:55923de2-c310-f863-8e23-f0645398397d
msgctxt "h4266f8d9gcf1cg43a3gb417g171c27dc2939"
msgid "Really? That's a pity."
msgstr "정말로? 안타깝군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 5b865916-5c53-4b6a-9a85-4661bae84f51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_HasMet_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf_Unprotected(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Unprotected = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:5b865916-5c53-4b6a-9a85-4661bae84f51
msgctxt "h4a295748g6c65g4cbfg8332g2663fc4ea851"
msgid ""
"It's not the shadows or its curse that scare me - it's seeing Lady Jaheira "
"so worried."
msgstr "그림자나 저주 따위가 두려운 게 아닙니다. 자헤이라 님이 걱정하시는 모습을 보는 것이 두렵습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 647fcd3e-f2df-c74b-2bc2-6e0402d6d63f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:647fcd3e-f2df-c74b-2bc2-6e0402d6d63f
msgctxt "h76708056g51a4g4a18g9a6dg12cdb9463595"
msgid "If that were the Harper way, I wouldn't be standing here."
msgstr "그게 하퍼의 방식이었다면 여기 서 있지도 않겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 65c05529-83c3-ae69-bb02-13bf3283745d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:65c05529-83c3-ae69-bb02-13bf3283745d
msgctxt "h13b0a12eg53eag46afgbfedg2ca092149855"
msgid ""
"Wouldn't I like to know. I've asked the fellow many times, but he's not in a "
"talking mood."
msgstr "저라고 알고 싶지 않겠습니까. 몇 번이나 물어봤지만, 얘기 할만한 기색이 아니에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 715acb5b-bd6b-7dc2-93cd-daa79c76009a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_Knows_WasInCurse = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:715acb5b-bd6b-7dc2-93cd-daa79c76009a
msgctxt "he3103faegd383g4252g9dccgf99062bf7d45"
msgid "He's comatose. You should put him out of his misery."
msgstr "혼수상태에 빠져있어, 이 자를 고통에서 해방시켜 주는 게 좋을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7da02a82-cf4d-8eef-5b46-7ff41db7f8e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_AncientFist_Knows_WasInCurse = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:7da02a82-cf4d-8eef-5b46-7ff41db7f8e8
msgctxt "he4a6f99cgd525g4b4bga7b3gb06a9d5f0ef1"
msgid "I'm not taking over for you."
msgstr "그 쪽 일을 대신 하지는 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 7eede706-14ec-d735-628e-083402d9bc79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_HasMet_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:7eede706-14ec-d735-628e-083402d9bc79
msgctxt "h2f9afb32g54b4g4febgab4fg0a682a628e88"
msgid ""
"I need to focus on the front - hopefully you and our friend inside are "
"getting on well."
msgstr "저는 앞쪽을 신경 써야 해요. 부디 당신과 안쪽의 우리 친구들이 잘 지내길 바랍니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 81a52be2-ec54-5270-4e45-a36a09a64ca7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:81a52be2-ec54-5270-4e45-a36a09a64ca7
msgctxt "h79f27590g85afg4453gbff8gf60ea668c680"
msgid ""
"Fellow inside could probably use a bit more attention, but I'm more "
"concerned with shadows at the gate, frankly."
msgstr "안에 있는 친구가 약간 더 주의가 필요할지 모르지만, 저는 솔직히 문 밖의 그림자가 더 걱정이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 8c6b8cf4-b2bf-f662-af74-aee964fc1f8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_HasMet_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_State_FlamingFistsInHaven = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:8c6b8cf4-b2bf-f662-af74-aee964fc1f8d
msgctxt "hda6d91d6gbe2eg4e73gab6fga94419812b26"
msgid "I'd not tarry out here were I you."
msgstr "내가 당신이라면 이런 곳에서 지체하지 않겠어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 939d184a-b120-4335-9ac3-120d9c32a3f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcast_HasMet_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf_Alert(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HavenOutcast_HasMet_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf_Alert(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:939d184a-b120-4335-9ac3-120d9c32a3f0
msgctxt "h2d245bb3gdd45g48bbg92edg5619d472893f"
msgid ""
"I'd rather face Ketheric's armies than suffer traitors. Watch out for those "
"Flaming Fist."
msgstr "배신자 놈들에게 시달리느니 케서릭의 군대하고 맞서는 게 차라리 낫겠다, 플레이밍 피스트 녀석들을 조심 하라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Harper Tumeril
#. NodeID = 9c3e5e2f-b426-fba4-9b7d-56470b7a9d6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:9c3e5e2f-b426-fba4-9b7d-56470b7a9d6f
msgctxt "h69a958a3g5ef3g44b5gb16eg8d5d66a926bb"
msgid "I pray that when we're done with Ketheric, we'll have time for him."
msgstr "케서릭을 처리하고 나면 이 자를 돌볼 시간을 낼 수 있길 빌어야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc9bc0cd-89e1-4d65-39bf-f40f2805b500
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf:bc9bc0cd-89e1-4d65-39bf-f40f2805b500
msgctxt "he94146c4g9cdag4acbg89f9g8217c147b3c1"
msgid "I can handle myself, thanks."
msgstr "저는 돌봐주지 않으셔도 괜찮아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Caster_HighElf
