#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Halfling_Melee:5c8b52a0-989b-4649-84bd-8f509012d989
msgctxt "he51930b8g9cc5g48bdg9be1gb0edaba49839"
msgid ""
"That traitor Marcus is lucky he didn't run into me - I'd have made him "
"suffer."
msgstr "나와 마주치지 않은걸 그 배신자 마커스놈은 행운으로 여겨야 할 거야. 나라면 아주 고통스럽게 죽여줬을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Halfling_Melee
#. Speaker = Harper Callie
#. NodeID = 873b0837-da33-4487-aea2-0bb31180a0a7
