#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Halfling_Melee:873b0837-da33-4487-aea2-0bb31180a0a7
msgctxt "h216e7124gcd3eg4361g9678g00dfbad2096d"
msgid ""
"Pretty as you are, this is no time for a natter. Head on in to Last Light."
msgstr "예쁘장하긴 하다만, 수다 떨 시간은 없어. 최후의 빛 여관으로 가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Halfling_Melee
#. Speaker = Harper Callie
#. NodeID = 955d1b10-fe35-4e64-947f-eeaac98295b1
