#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_EntranceGuards_Halfling_Melee:955d1b10-fe35-4e64-947f-eeaac98295b1
msgctxt "h5ea6c5afgb6beg4910gb36cg71f822c98694"
msgid "I broke bread with that Flaming Fist - little shit."
msgstr "그 놈과는 빵도 나눠 먹은 사이였는데, 개자식."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_Melee_1
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = 2a0ca112-cebe-f2d5-19cb-a55303d4bf42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Assault_Event_KethericTeleportedAway = True
#. SetFlags:
