#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_Melee_1:4520d8aa-0de1-481f-9cf6-9c936369aa99
msgctxt "hb0d1e7e4g3a25g4471g8795gd89b3d1108ab"
msgid ""
"Harpers are awfully <i>optimistic </i>about their plans. Ask me - plan for "
"the worst."
msgstr "하퍼 녀석들은 자기들 계획에 끔찍하리만큼 <i>낙관적</i>이야. 내 생각으로는, 최악에 대비하라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_Melee_1
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = 61ad60de-f6c8-453f-8c72-c896384d9cdd
