#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_Melee_1:9f4997d0-7199-4755-af4e-a3a89928118c
msgctxt "hfe07a4c7gbc80g40abga392gcd504ef51d73"
msgid "Knew this place would be the death of us."
msgstr "여기가 우리 무덤이 되리라는 사실을 알고 있었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_Melee_1
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = a47e09ce-16b7-4d72-b1ad-98812ce24d37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
