msgctxt "h122d9c57g2020g4ea0ga2cdg30b9ecbf8ca7"
msgid "Shut up. And you, keep walking."
msgstr "입 다물어. 거기 당신, 가던 길 가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = 3fedff95-874f-044e-4039-02cd99493010
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:3fedff95-874f-044e-4039-02cd99493010
msgctxt "hfddc64b5g83e3g4f21gaf79g039f74609b0d"
msgid "You got a name?"
msgstr "너 이름이 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = 42e30b7f-71ca-d25f-9442-a4e87b7b3ec7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:42e30b7f-71ca-d25f-9442-a4e87b7b3ec7
msgctxt "h0f26a2c8gefe3g4e39gbe96g1d4ef368c40c"
msgid "Yeah. I'm touched."
msgstr "그래. 참 감동적이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5be775af-1bc7-9297-583a-9ae48d1c4dc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:5be775af-1bc7-9297-583a-9ae48d1c4dc0
msgctxt "h2eab5b5fgacf1g492fga94eg9059d352ad85"
msgid "Daisy Dewdrop Fluffington."
msgstr "데이지 듀드롭 플러핑톤이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = 5fb3004e-ad0e-37fe-57b8-d78e6422bbd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:5fb3004e-ad0e-37fe-57b8-d78e6422bbd1
msgctxt "he569a914gb808g4953g9c69gf86ef5dd5c6c"
msgid "Good. Wouldn't want to piss on the wrong grave come the morrow."
msgstr "좋아, 내일 엉뚱한 무덤에 오줌을 갈기고 싶지는 않으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Harper Essius
#. NodeID = 6e0ab49a-721f-760c-6366-e7bf5f447479
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:6e0ab49a-721f-760c-6366-e7bf5f447479
msgctxt "h89379b63gb63cg4297ga1d6g46d77bd9f2d0"
msgid "Give it a rest, Ulthred. We need all the godsdamned help we can get."
msgstr "그만해, 얼쓰레드. 우린 최대한 많은 도움이 필요하잖나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 77f36167-f335-43cb-9fa1-2df7805c9985
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:77f36167-f335-43cb-9fa1-2df7805c9985
msgctxt "h194ae005ga49cg4f86g9004g1398b8aedd39"
msgid "Florrick's here? Where can I find her?"
msgstr "플로릭이 여기 있다고? 어디에 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = 7b754938-f09c-b8d2-caf5-9cc78ddce55c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:7b754938-f09c-b8d2-caf5-9cc78ddce55c
msgctxt "hd1509f01g7b1fg40a9gb89cgacc78f7759f4"
msgid "A bit on edge, my arse!"
msgstr "물론 좀 예민하지, 젠장할!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8566ab29-b961-6bd6-6a77-bb6325457fe5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 510fd5a3-4bfe-0a85-ce42-d03264dfac21_AskedParty = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:8566ab29-b961-6bd6-6a77-bb6325457fe5
msgctxt "hb961f96bgabeag405bg9036g9851d8178565"
msgid "A rescue party sounds right up my alley as a matter of fact."
msgstr "구출 작전은 사실 내 취향에 딱 맞는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Harper Essius
#. NodeID = 89a4725b-1d2a-9c94-656e-cc0d753b2ae1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_Event_Florrick(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:89a4725b-1d2a-9c94-656e-cc0d753b2ae1
msgctxt "h4346fde7gd5d7g4965g828fg8806faa15a4e"
msgid ""
"We're waiting for orders. Jaheira's and the counsellor's. Florrick is "
"Ravengard's political advisor - and sore as a snakebite about losing him, "
"too."
msgstr ""
"우린 자헤이라 님과 자문관 플로릭의 명령을 기다리고 있어. 플로릭은 레이븐가드 대공의 정치 고문이야, 대공을 잃어서 매우 언짢아 하는 "
"중이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b2aa600-6f3a-edda-2ec9-538f085d2ef7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(2) = True
#. TagRule: BALDURIAN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:8b2aa600-6f3a-edda-2ec9-538f085d2ef7
msgctxt "h2f1cc222g768fg481ag85d3ge93ecd820f55"
msgid "No bother - I'm used to Flaming Fists being impotent arse-wipes."
msgstr "아냐, 플레이밍 피스트가 무능한 똥닦개들인 건 익숙하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b2aa600-6f3a-edda-2ec9-538f085d2ef7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:8b2aa600-6f3a-edda-2ec9-538f085d2ef7
msgctxt "h2bb598e7gcb92g465fg9486g4ca4a395e4c0"
msgid "Don't worry - I'm used to pricks in a uniform being rude."
msgstr "괜찮아, 제복 입은 병신이 무례하게 구는 건 익숙하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = 8bfe6c83-80df-c28e-2efd-62df91f72f83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:8bfe6c83-80df-c28e-2efd-62df91f72f83
msgctxt "h427f7481ge0adg4b2cgadfbg4aa359c8491f"
msgid "Move along, godsdammit. Bloody freaks everywhere."
msgstr "썩 꺼져, 이 망할 놈아. 염병할 또라이들이 사방에 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = 91bf3120-b7ee-8d7c-bfc1-5593dd76683c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:91bf3120-b7ee-8d7c-bfc1-5593dd76683c
msgctxt "h683eb513gb063g4d2dg8d58ga08c1aae4cba"
msgid ""
"Not that <i>you</i>'ll give a triple-shat damn, but we were ambushed by them "
"bloody cultists."
msgstr "<i>너는</i> 존나게 신경 쓰지 않아도 되겠지만, 우린 망할 이교도들한테 기습을 받았다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99fe0671-3a96-7fe0-efff-8741a1fbf63b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:99fe0671-3a96-7fe0-efff-8741a1fbf63b
msgctxt "h138f3d9dg7804g42d6gae75g92e3de429dcd"
msgid "Well - good luck with all that."
msgstr "그럼, 행운을 빌도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a7178cfd-2cbe-6af9-18d4-1d57679ac1d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 510fd5a3-4bfe-0a85-ce42-d03264dfac21_AskedParty = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:a7178cfd-2cbe-6af9-18d4-1d57679ac1d2
msgctxt "h121b476dgdc39g4744g84adg514adfc99240"
msgid "What party is it that I'm crashing?"
msgstr "내가 망치는 게 대체 무슨 작전인데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abbb5e8d-ceb5-1d8e-4e7a-7653d9455dc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 510fd5a3-4bfe-0a85-ce42-d03264dfac21_AskedParty = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:abbb5e8d-ceb5-1d8e-4e7a-7653d9455dc2
msgctxt "h0bc14848gae52g4904g8b0ag1de35a0d53e8"
msgid "Say no more. Saving dukes is one of my specialties."
msgstr "말이 필요 없이, 공작을 구하는 건 내 전문 분야야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = c3cda6bb-2b92-441c-95c4-7018743de891
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:c3cda6bb-2b92-441c-95c4-7018743de891
msgctxt "h8ddd3ff9g56c1g43dcg9fc4g6a8af0d11413"
msgid "Come on. We need to talk to Florrick."
msgstr "가자. 플로릭과 얘기해봐야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c44db2a7-1c32-8c6c-c108-26dcd7c1e1e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:c44db2a7-1c32-8c6c-c108-26dcd7c1e1e4
msgctxt "h15d0403bgb7d0g4e62g97dbg732c98a97726"
msgid ""
"I usually say 'The Dark Urge', but I've been workshopping 'The Sleepless "
"Knife' and 'The Death Dream'."
msgstr "평소에는 '어두운 충동'이라고 하는데, '잠 없는 칼날'하고 '죽음의 꿈'도 연습 중이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Harper Essius
#. NodeID = c6c95ac2-64e0-de93-106f-2a50ea7eaf3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:c6c95ac2-64e0-de93-106f-2a50ea7eaf3f
msgctxt "he479a12fg0d96g4d95g9444g58f66aea5f14"
msgid "Rescue party."
msgstr "구출 작전."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ca6369e7-2f2e-d061-9cd5-6a299962f068
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:ca6369e7-2f2e-d061-9cd5-6a299962f068
msgctxt "h435d07bbga6c0g4647g8c65g11b9a3e813d6"
msgid "So what are you standing around here for?"
msgstr "그래서 무엇 때문에 여기 서 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = cb0c5b74-ee95-1e6d-08b4-86d068a79350
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:cb0c5b74-ee95-1e6d-08b4-86d068a79350
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h42e9bf5dgb64cg432egb13ag97e74edfbd09"
msgid "Much obliged, worms-for-brains."
msgstr "황공합니다, '벌레먹은뇌'님이여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb7fa291-19c6-f4cd-234e-4e9460e91d37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:cb7fa291-19c6-f4cd-234e-4e9460e91d37
msgctxt "h33f0285ag809ag42d2g84afgbfb4b279fda8"
msgid "I expected a bit more decorum from a Flaming Fist soldier."
msgstr "플레이밍 피스트 병사라면 좀 더 예의 바를 줄 알았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cf49a247-90f1-ebad-d476-dc1bd500116e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - PLA_Desire_State_Freed2 = True
#.   Object:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_Event_Florrick(2) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_Event_Florrick(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:cf49a247-90f1-ebad-d476-dc1bd500116e
msgctxt "hf061a63dg69feg4df3gab38gd904f9fceead"
msgid ""
"I was there in the aftermath. I don't suppose Counsellor Florrick made it "
"all the way here?"
msgstr "납치됐던 장소에 가본 적 있어. 그래서 플로릭이 여기까지 왔다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cffb7d41-4f0b-434e-d038-d6e3829528c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:cffb7d41-4f0b-434e-d038-d6e3829528c4
msgctxt "habbb5da0g6431g4ba9gb6d2gff76955f3461"
msgid "<i>Glare at Ulthred.</i>"
msgstr "<i>얼쓰레드를 노려본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = e1709c09-01f2-311a-d98d-37e5aa46ee66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:e1709c09-01f2-311a-d98d-37e5aa46ee66
msgctxt "hf09b25f8g857dg4013gb605gcd392df89835"
msgid "Sure did, for all the good that does us."
msgstr "확실히 왔지. 그게 우리에게 도움이 될 지는 모르겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = ebb4a9b7-bf70-7ddf-cc00-c75e1b0b91ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:ebb4a9b7-bf70-7ddf-cc00-c75e1b0b91ca
msgctxt "h4a16cf33gb9a1g43c8gb8dag5041cd2b371e"
msgid "Because my bath hasn't run yet, why do you think?"
msgstr "아직 욕조에 물이 차지도 않았으니까, 그럼 뭐라고 생각하냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = ebf441a6-4f84-26aa-03b5-923c2b4b89c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:ebf441a6-4f84-26aa-03b5-923c2b4b89c4
msgctxt "h71209b19g9da2g48dfg8748gf085084c5de4"
msgid "Want me to shine your boots while I'm at it?"
msgstr "내가 부츠라도 직접 닦아 드릴까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Harper Essius
#. NodeID = f0b6edfb-8595-e13b-2580-b1ce52047c6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:f0b6edfb-8595-e13b-2580-b1ce52047c6c
msgctxt "h3c65a917g69feg4361g85bcga876e4caede4"
msgid "Easy. He's a bit on edge since the, uh... incident."
msgstr "진정해. 이 친구는 좀 예민해졌어.. 그 사건 후론."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
#. Speaker = Fist Ulthred
#. NodeID = f6f74ce8-4ee9-855e-1b06-bc5642217c8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay:f6f74ce8-4ee9-855e-1b06-bc5642217c8f
msgctxt "h607e7118g6761g4bddg89f1g7439063e7929"
msgid ""
"Guess you need to be a godsdamned counsellor to get room and board around "
"here."
msgstr "이런 곳에서 방과 식사를 얻으려면 망할 자문관 정도는 돼야 하나 보군."

