msgctxt "hc2726116gb6c3g4f66gb12cg3ff306adf59f"
msgid "The Absolute's taken him, then - no question about it."
msgstr "그럼 절대자가 데려간 거군, 의심의 여지 없이."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainGuards_ThreeWay
