msgctxt "h49e8bd1cg38bag4c5dga43eg9955ac942761"
msgid ""
"Didn't take Marcus for a turncoat - though I suppose it wasn't his fault. "
"Cultists got to him, and that's that."
msgstr "마커스가 배신하리라고는 생각 못했어. 그래도 마커스 잘못은 아니라고 봐. 광신도들이 뭔갈 했고, 그래서 그런 거야."

