msgctxt "he852a09agd6dfg4b4dga715ga1f2e56670c5"
msgid "Did you see him? The traitor? Disgusting."
msgstr "그 놈 봤어? 그 배신자? 역거워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainPatrol_Caster
