msgctxt "h0ff91658ga784g4bd2gae40g0fca9e2aee37"
msgid "Can't chat - need to reinforce the barricade."
msgstr "잡담할 시간 없어, 방어벽을 보강해야 하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainPatrol_Caster
