#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_FountainPatrol_Caster:e87de5f0-f98c-4699-bb18-993bf5a3d9d6
msgctxt "hc5b7dcb8g3478g442ag8b6dgaf135596c0ee"
msgid ""
"I knew full well not to trust those Flaming Fist. Jaheira should know better."
msgstr "그 플레이밍 피스트가 믿을 수 없는 놈이란 거 아주 잘 알고 있었지. 자헤이라는 더 잘 알고 있었을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster
