msgctxt "hbc50e0e6gafd1g41afg808dga156144e0581"
msgid "Cheeky. But since you're asking..."
msgstr "뻔뻔스럽네. 하지만 네가 부탁하는 거니까..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster
#. Speaker = Quartermaster Talli
#. NodeID = 513cd90d-b22d-9a2e-3f7c-d5e0525d0789
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster:513cd90d-b22d-9a2e-3f7c-d5e0525d0789
msgctxt "h1fba721dg7b73g424dg88d1gd612b6456aec"
msgid ""
"Huh. I would've had something for you, but it seems to have up and "
"disappeared. Sorry."
msgstr "허어. 줄 만한 게 있었거든, 근데 여기 있다 사라진 거 같네. 미안."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster
#. Speaker = Quartermaster Talli
#. NodeID = 6beb60e8-b6c4-2d4c-ea01-4a5fa21b995a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_FlamingSpyRevealed = True
#.   Local:
#.      - e9ee4ed5-4bb9-0780-86d1-2a5622f3684c_MarcusComment = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e9ee4ed5-4bb9-0780-86d1-2a5622f3684c_MarcusComment = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster:6beb60e8-b6c4-2d4c-ea01-4a5fa21b995a
msgctxt "h0816f3ffg5ff0g48fcga7eegbf2c8313022a"
msgid ""
"Should've trusted my instincts about that Fist. Knew there was something off "
"about him, but I just... let it go."
msgstr "그 피스트 놈에 대한 내 직감을 믿었어야 했어. 뭔가 이상했는데 그냥... 그러려니 했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster
#. Speaker = Quartermaster Talli
#. NodeID = 6dada931-13f5-4e99-ace3-5c6c69db5075
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuarterMaster_HasMet_Alert(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuarterMaster_HasMet_Alert(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster:6dada931-13f5-4e99-ace3-5c6c69db5075
msgctxt "hb16c4976g80b0g4960gad44g7ef6f8abcb5b"
msgid "I sold a pair of boots to that traitor. Can't believe it."
msgstr "그 배신자에게 부츠 한 켤레도 팔았었는데. 믿기지 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster
#. Speaker = Quartermaster Talli
#. NodeID = 737d6921-1214-32ba-5a2f-4fad25be52c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuarterMaster_HasMet_Protected(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Protected = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven+Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster:737d6921-1214-32ba-5a2f-4fad25be52c9
msgctxt "h82026c19g6d95g4afdgae72gf5ab8f296d02"
msgid "If you're all right by Jaheira, you're all right by me."
msgstr "자헤이라가 괜찮다고 했으면, 나도 괜찮아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Haven/Haven Outcasts/HAV_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77cd1a18-4eeb-1a12-e718-89f418c0f2f4
