msgctxt "hae04afddg1e5ag4724g9d0cg2573109db0d0"
msgid "The Moonmaiden's light will protect us - even here."
msgstr "달처녀의 빛이 우릴 보호해 줄 거야. 이런 곳에서도 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeRunners_Ranger
