msgctxt "hc6a1b0e7g8661g4a4dgaa10ga398c359cc9b"
msgid ""
"There'll be plenty of dead to mourn, when this is done. But songs to sing, "
"too."
msgstr "이 모든 게 끝나면 많은 이들이 죽게 되겠지. 대신 그들을 기리는 노래가 울려 퍼질 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeRunners_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Antony
#. NodeID = 6744b539-3e8b-427f-b965-1e2abe686447
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
