msgctxt "hcbde7acfg988ag4345g9960g3a694055c253"
msgid ""
"Can't say I was sure of you until this very moment, 'True Soul'. But you "
"gave us a chance."
msgstr "직전까지만 해도 당신을 좀처럼 믿을 수 없었어. '참된 영혼'. 하지만 덕분에 기회가 생겼군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeRunners_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Antony
#. NodeID = 6d376ac2-fd47-49fe-a4d9-76a8c6cf135d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
