msgctxt "hd0bb2a0dg7d82g4453g8d74g1f31a5073ef6"
msgid ""
"That light in the sky... I almost feel bad for Ketheric, knowing what's "
"coming for him."
msgstr "저기 저 하늘에 빛 좀 봐... 케서릭이 불쌍해질 지경이야. 놈에게 일어날 일을 생각하면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeRunners_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Antony
#. NodeID = 89666be8-48d1-4199-b97b-0f6cd9a87c14
