#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeRunners_Ranger:89666be8-48d1-4199-b97b-0f6cd9a87c14
msgctxt "h32c97e1dgc2e7g4ebdgae6fg7fcb3005ca85"
msgid "Our Lady's light go with you."
msgstr "여신님의 빛이 함께 하길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Left_Ranger
