#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Left_Ranger:18e90a64-839d-6b3f-0515-ade36d2bc8cc
msgctxt "h6454a3b6gec03g45acga500g773862cc420c"
msgid "Rest. Soon. But not yet."
msgstr "곧 쉬게 되겠지만. 지금은 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Left_Ranger
