msgctxt "h12173b13g409cg4dd0gb0a0gd8a9a5384306"
msgid "Moon rise. Something falls."
msgstr "달이 떠올랐으니, 다른 무언가는 몰락하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Naysa
#. NodeID = 0069b9a7-7a0f-45d7-a8c7-ed62475674bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger_ThroneRoomDefeated_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_ThroneRoomDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger:0069b9a7-7a0f-45d7-a8c7-ed62475674bf
msgctxt "hd64fc86egffc8g481fga412ga091cf72886a"
msgid ""
"You fight as well as any Harper. Careful, or Jaheira might have to keep you."
msgstr "웬만한 하퍼 요원만큼이나 잘 싸우는군. 조심해, 자헤이라가 자넬 안 놔줄지도 모르니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Naysa
#. NodeID = 46868bb8-a81c-467d-ad01-1e9967b8b351
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger_PostAssault_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Assault_Event_KethericTeleportedAway = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger_PostAssault_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger:46868bb8-a81c-467d-ad01-1e9967b8b351
msgctxt "h86b08505ga431g4d01gb58ag1644f4ddc05a"
msgid ""
"That army outside won't be long noticing this mess. We need to get this done "
"- quickly."
msgstr "바깥의 군대가 이 소동을 눈치채기까지 오래 걸리진 않을 거야. 끝장을 봐야해 - 최대한 빠르게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Naysa
#. NodeID = 7ded0a71-3dbd-fd97-216c-980b67065317
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger_SCE_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_Epilogue_State_HasStarted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger:7ded0a71-3dbd-fd97-216c-980b67065317
msgctxt "h1dceb847g2684g4b5bg96f1ga64c4737810d"
msgid ""
"We can beat an army that size to the city, I reckon. But only if we get "
"going <i>now.</i>"
msgstr "저 정도 규모의 군대라면, 우리가 앞질러 도시에 도착할 수 있을 거야. 하지만 그러려면 <i>지금 당장</i> 출발해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Naysa
#. NodeID = 809af6ff-d5cf-491f-a6cb-1b56130b3604
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeRunners_Ranger_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger:809af6ff-d5cf-491f-a6cb-1b56130b3604
msgctxt "h1c78353eg4b1ag430bgad1dg400dfa297902"
msgid ""
"Finally on the front foot. Let's see how they like being turned out of their "
"beds."
msgstr "마침내 유리한 고지를 선점했군. 자기들 본거지에서 쫓겨나는 걸 어떻게 받아들이려나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Naysa
#. NodeID = 8a681ae7-cba8-eb24-fab3-3e0fa9130ece
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger_SCE_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCE_Epilogue_State_HasStarted = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger_SCE_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger:8a681ae7-cba8-eb24-fab3-3e0fa9130ece
msgctxt "h53c2a5c9gfde5g4bbcgb9f0g62d98994b399"
msgid ""
"Ketheric's done, but that army's already on the move. This isn't done yet."
msgstr "케서릭은 죽었지만, 그의 군대는 이미 출발했어. 아직 끝난 게 아냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Naysa
#. NodeID = 8b555af9-02c5-41b1-abc6-8aa24dc359ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeRunners_Ranger_HasMet(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_BarricadeRunners_Ranger_HasMet(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger:8b555af9-02c5-41b1-abc6-8aa24dc359ca
msgctxt "h0f6da171g9091g4f5aga59bg99ba55c1bb15"
msgid ""
"I'd like to pull this whole heap down when we're done. A cairn for all the "
"Harpers who died here."
msgstr "모든 일이 끝난 뒤엔 이 돌더미를 다 무너뜨렸으면 좋겠어. 여기서 죽어간 하퍼들을 위한 무덤이 될 수 있도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Naysa
#. NodeID = 8d79907a-0023-4b4f-ad37-fbbdcaefe1c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger_PostAssault_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Assault_Event_KethericTeleportedAway = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger:8d79907a-0023-4b4f-ad37-fbbdcaefe1c3
msgctxt "h3dcf3846g40efg451cgb35eg9d42403b4a50"
msgid ""
"We'll talk when this is done. Preferably squatting over Ketheric's corpse."
msgstr "대화는 일을 다 마친 뒤에 하자고. 케서릭 시체 위에 걸터 앉은 채면 더 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger
#. Speaker = Harper Naysa
#. NodeID = ceb67083-5947-1fef-ba73-6201c616b0ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger_ThroneRoomDefeated_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_ThroneRoomDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger_ThroneRoomDefeated_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_DockGuard_Ranger:ceb67083-5947-1fef-ba73-6201c616b0ac
msgctxt "h19a7c163g9e86g4289g9befg45eb38bd49ed"
msgid ""
"Can't stand this place. You can tell there's been naught but evil here for a "
"century."
msgstr "도무지 견딜 수가 없는 곳이야. 지난 백 년간 악만이 존재했다는 게 단박에 느껴질 정도라니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 104289de-d759-4b88-af15-bca903463d1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster:104289de-d759-4b88-af15-bca903463d1b
msgctxt "ha510fc03g0936g4ccbga5e9gde97b2341925"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster
#. Speaker = Quartermaster Talli
#. NodeID = 15920907-4b06-4d9c-a23b-b9242839f2e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Assault_HasMet_HarperQuartermaster(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster:15920907-4b06-4d9c-a23b-b9242839f2e1
msgctxt "h8b536a11gf783g40e5ga6d6g9fd12bb13244"
msgid "Just tell me what you need."
msgstr "뭐가 필요한지 말해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1cd0449f-255e-4a66-bc51-6dc33fd771ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster:1cd0449f-255e-4a66-bc51-6dc33fd771ae
msgctxt "h2a209956g0d8bg47b0ga14ag720df41df539"
msgid "<i>Trade.</i>"
msgstr "<i>거래한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster
#. Speaker = Quartermaster Talli
#. NodeID = 472a3271-7578-4373-90fe-b60586157e7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Assault_HasMet_HarperQuartermaster(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster:472a3271-7578-4373-90fe-b60586157e7c
msgctxt "h7b04cf7eg6f61g46eeg94b8g4e5ef6916a77"
msgid "It's a grim task, picking provisions from the dead."
msgstr "죽은 자들로부터 보급품을 회수하는 건 우울한 임무지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster
#. Speaker = Quartermaster Talli
#. NodeID = 9c4732a8-55e1-4dc8-8438-7da3dd7ee95e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster:9c4732a8-55e1-4dc8-8438-7da3dd7ee95e
msgctxt "h7727c0fagd7f7g4ff7gb2d3g67626b1f0bc0"
msgid "Lady light your way."
msgstr "여신님의 빛이 함께하길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster
#. Speaker = Quartermaster Talli
#. NodeID = e0ac49e9-c949-47c9-abd6-627747885558
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_HavenOutcasts_HarperQuartermaster:e0ac49e9-c949-47c9-abd6-627747885558
msgctxt "hb8b5f9d2g5980g45d1gab75g76be4eeaa0f9"
msgid ""
"But the way I hear it, the fighting's not done yet. You need to resupply?"
msgstr "듣자하니, 싸움이 아직 끝나진 않은 것 같은데. 재보급이 필요한가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 0395cedb-7628-ae57-d6dc-1f9036c8c0b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_GainedAccess = True
#.      - MOO_Assault_HasMet_Jaheira = True
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_GainedAccessNoJaheira = False
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_AllyReadyPositions = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:0395cedb-7628-ae57-d6dc-1f9036c8c0b6
msgctxt "hd5bb4ba4g111eg49f9g9febg094dd5a22ed7"
msgid "Onward. Let the words of Alaundo ring true."
msgstr "전진해. 알라운도의 예언이 현실이 되게 만드는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 0672deb7-d817-d374-d8b4-b82649260f1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Assault_HasMet_Jaheira = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:0672deb7-d817-d374-d8b4-b82649260f1e
msgctxt "h87d20ee6gd0e2g455bga511g0e7f288c7a28"
msgid "Let's get this over with."
msgstr "이제 결착을 짓자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 0684be08-493c-783e-57bb-e93f1df288ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_Assault_State_JaheiraJoinedParty(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:0684be08-493c-783e-57bb-e93f1df288ba
msgctxt "h50f5ad48g1bf3g41abg8e51g1e9ccff68659"
msgid "Fair enough."
msgstr "알겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 07e013d1-62bc-f879-aafd-d21943217b1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:07e013d1-62bc-f879-aafd-d21943217b1d
msgctxt "h4765b3c1g4b5ag4e73ga83eg5ebe982f6f31"
msgid "The time has come. Ketheric will taste of death at last."
msgstr "결판을 낼 때가 왔어. 케서릭은 끝내 죽음을 맛보게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 09d3299d-4dd1-636b-79dd-4f26b9d8a99c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:09d3299d-4dd1-636b-79dd-4f26b9d8a99c
msgctxt "h20bbc5f2g0c96g4f25gb26bg193f2e73c618"
msgid ""
"Seems like his prophecy missed a crucial part, though. Didn't say who gave "
"the angel back her wings."
msgstr "알라운도의 예언에선 중요한 게 빠진 것 같군. 누가 천사에게 날개를 되돌려 주었는지 말이 없었으니까 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 0b3334d3-a72c-533a-83e2-fba8ea9db73f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_Assault_State_JaheiraJoinedParty(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:0b3334d3-a72c-533a-83e2-fba8ea9db73f
msgctxt "h5f7bf319g7e07g43b2g9c49g9cb4489b3c8a"
msgid ""
"Very well. Side by side we'll stand as we'll rip True Souls from a false "
"god. As good a prophecy as any."
msgstr "좋아. 함께 가짜 신으로부터 참된 영혼을 뜯어내는 거다. 여느 훌륭한 예언처럼 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 0d6e5324-911d-e023-07d5-4f1c66b10ebe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:0d6e5324-911d-e023-07d5-4f1c66b10ebe
msgctxt "h14257561g0356g44aag8f4dg5c48425b1fae"
msgid ""
"I can't quite put my finger on why I trust you, but I do: the same instinct "
"through which I know a wolf will bite, or allow itself to be petted."
msgstr "나도 이유는 잘 모르겠지만, 널 믿는다. 늑대가 물지, 아니면 쓰다듬는 걸 허락할지 아는 본능과 같은 것이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 0dfd1414-3f79-f0a2-c671-75a3c6aa438a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:0dfd1414-3f79-f0a2-c671-75a3c6aa438a
msgctxt "hc8f89fbfg5a01g4fbeg840ag5dc50af58cbf"
msgid "Say no more. Just get the job done."
msgstr "그건 걱정 마라. 가서 해야 할 일을 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f5df5c7-658e-9d20-e8e0-fd11d67b8b79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:0f5df5c7-658e-9d20-e8e0-fd11d67b8b79
msgctxt "h2197c15agd697g46f9ga05egc0abe2facb78"
msgid "Let me prove it to you - join my party."
msgstr "증명해 드리죠. 우리 일행에 합류해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 10bc4324-4bcf-d158-2246-610711557b7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:10bc4324-4bcf-d158-2246-610711557b7d
msgctxt "hdc20875ag3617g4b8eg9264g531282655367"
msgid ""
"Well, that spared us all a tedious confrontation. We'll settle this by the "
"sword."
msgstr "뭐, 적어도 지지부진하게 대치할 필요는 없어졌군. 칼로써 결판을 내자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1550e9ee-e9bc-894e-1a68-e49ca66b04d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:1550e9ee-e9bc-894e-1a68-e49ca66b04d5
msgctxt "ha34592c9g30e1g41c7g8e94g69cfb587905a"
msgid "Ketheric is a formidable foe. I have need of a formidable ally."
msgstr "케서릭은 만만찮은 적이지. 난 만만찮은 동맹이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 16374a5c-3d36-197b-af76-ea07778f6d5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:16374a5c-3d36-197b-af76-ea07778f6d5e
msgctxt "ha015bdfbg3a0dg446bgbcb8g58d39bf3549e"
msgid "So be it."
msgstr "그럼 그렇게 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 17c3e428-9d98-38e7-8073-b5f07dec4abf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:17c3e428-9d98-38e7-8073-b5f07dec4abf
msgctxt "h0c29f252gc170g4d6cgb13bg0f189f9b7512"
msgid "This is it then. The assault commences."
msgstr "마침내 때가 왔군. 공격을 시작하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 197cef08-1780-d387-0d5a-9a4e55170485
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:197cef08-1780-d387-0d5a-9a4e55170485
msgctxt "hc6b1bd9cgc43bg48b2g9393g259b4e1cd1ac"
msgid "Say the word, and we're off."
msgstr "말만 해, 그럼 바로 출발하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1acdf21f-9afc-78c1-d493-75dcf6933a85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:1acdf21f-9afc-78c1-d493-75dcf6933a85
msgctxt "h4f5cbbf2g10ceg48ddgb5afga2ccc825f242"
msgid ""
"I'm on your side if that's what you're insinuating. On the Harpers' side."
msgstr "방금 그게 암구호 같은 거라면, 난 당신 편이에요. 하퍼들 편이요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 1c2948de-5789-51d4-6e95-1a9d0be8951c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:1c2948de-5789-51d4-6e95-1a9d0be8951c
msgctxt "hc6552534g775ag4bfcg9489g7ae10398f48a"
msgid "Keen eye. I suppose I could be persuaded."
msgstr "눈썰미가 좋은데. 누가 부추긴다면 그런 마음이 들 것도 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 20fda4a1-d112-f005-0fd6-e6ba2493e3ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:20fda4a1-d112-f005-0fd6-e6ba2493e3ff
msgctxt "hf16ed648g49a1g454fg8916gf07fcaea6475"
msgid ""
"A sound strategy. Once it's done, me and my Harpers will hold the ground "
"floor while you hunt down the general himself."
msgstr "괜찮은 전략이야. 일이 끝나면, 나와 내 하퍼들이 아래층을 사수할 테니 장군을 직접 상대하도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22f67e47-7066-1605-47e2-477adf5a75c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 440db1a3-14ad-8127-a14b-c445049225db_LocationIsMainFloor = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 440db1a3-14ad-8127-a14b-c445049225db_ToldFreedNightsong = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:22f67e47-7066-1605-47e2-477adf5a75c2
msgctxt "h5e06f0fdg75c3g40a8gb0fbgd5c1b96d330a"
msgid "That celestial being up there? I'm the one who freed her."
msgstr "그 천족이 위에 있나? 내가 바로 그녀를 풀어준 사람인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 239e712d-905e-446b-127a-e1e27e702fc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_GainedAccess = True
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_ThroneRoomDefeated = True
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_BazaarDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 440db1a3-14ad-8127-a14b-c445049225db_HasMetInTower = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:239e712d-905e-446b-127a-e1e27e702fc2
msgctxt "hcad4d584gb766g4b2dg84e0gd69927626c83"
msgid ""
"As long as we hold this floor, the tower is ours. I'll stay here - ensure no "
"one comes up or down without a scimitar welcome."
msgstr "이곳을 점령한 이상 타워는 우리 거야. 그 누구도 올라가거나 내려가지 못하도록 시미터를 든 채 여길 지킬게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 24ecbf06-442e-4d58-71b4-39202f12a4c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:24ecbf06-442e-4d58-71b4-39202f12a4c7
msgctxt "hdb267f49g9fb1g419eg98ccgb6ba1273b464"
msgid "Crazy old woman. You're talking to yourself."
msgstr "할망구가 노망이 들었군. 혼잣말을 지껄이는 걸 보니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 28a8ad8d-7c2f-741b-f8d4-44969b64b1fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:28a8ad8d-7c2f-741b-f8d4-44969b64b1fd
msgctxt "h985db1d8g7cefg479fgb605ge6d17f8d97b7"
msgid ""
"If you're the last Harper standing, it's only fitting that you walk alone."
msgstr "당신이 살아있는 마지막 하퍼라면, 응당 홀로 맞서야 이치에 맞겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 2a02f0a1-daaa-9522-13d6-cadd2181e015
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_GainedAccess = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Assault_HasMet_Jaheira = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:2a02f0a1-daaa-9522-13d6-cadd2181e015
msgctxt "h445e4f1bga452g411eg9973g5e85ff543f6f"
msgid ""
"'Unshackled from shadows, she will rise in moonlit glory and carve a path of "
"brightness to the accursed one's second death.'"
msgstr "'그림자의 족쇄에서 풀려난 그녀는 찬란한 달빛을 받으며 솟아오르고는 빛으로써 저주받은 이를 다시 한번 죽음으로 인도하리다.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 2adbea79-da8f-3166-4c84-31698ce8b9df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:2adbea79-da8f-3166-4c84-31698ce8b9df
msgctxt "ha1e5715eg61c5g44b1ga83bgcfdbf7c8078f"
msgid "You'll bite. But not me. Not as long as we run in the same pack."
msgstr "넌 물 것이다. 하지만 상대는 내가 아니야. 우리가 같은 무리 안에 있는 한 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 2e243abd-5352-adc8-0d98-b67b31b7b804
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:2e243abd-5352-adc8-0d98-b67b31b7b804
msgctxt "hf72b92fag0ae6g4a3fga8ebg2eb5eda8ef3b"
msgid "So sayeth the wise Alaundo."
msgstr "현자 알라운도는 그렇게 말했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 2f720332-a02e-04c9-cd29-0898f104513d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:2f720332-a02e-04c9-cd29-0898f104513d
msgctxt "hf51ada2bgcf80g4fefg8b0cgf60a1118f350"
msgid "Foe it is. Strike them down."
msgstr "적이라 이거지. 놈들을 쓰러뜨려라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 37ca0df9-0212-d6ff-75e6-399de14e4333
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:37ca0df9-0212-d6ff-75e6-399de14e4333
msgctxt "hdd56435fge71eg40edg85c3g5614e19a0cda"
msgid "You're close now. A final audience with Ketheric Thorm awaits."
msgstr "거의 다 왔어. 케서릭 쏨과의 마지막 대면만을 앞두고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 382361ba-a04c-4b35-c297-9c629432690f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:382361ba-a04c-4b35-c297-9c629432690f
msgctxt "h466b77aeg4703g42c1g81f3gd133267dbbb3"
msgid "Let's do this."
msgstr "한번 해 봅시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 3921f8dc-458c-fa54-9c81-bdbba2e45fa4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:3921f8dc-458c-fa54-9c81-bdbba2e45fa4
msgctxt "hf9590d20g974dg492ag886fgff49c2c5bb82"
msgid "So sayeth the wise Alaundo."
msgstr "현자 알라운도는 그렇게 말했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 39b4f8a7-7a0d-04c8-13c3-253767b71a72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:39b4f8a7-7a0d-04c8-13c3-253767b71a72
msgctxt "hdc804e03g28a6g4893gb0abg75cbeb822ccf"
msgid ""
"That beacon of angelic wrath has taken the fight to Ketheric on the rooftop, "
"and the first line of defence are dead."
msgstr "분노로 가득찬 저 천사의 불빛은 케서릭과 결판을 내기 위해 옥상으로 갔어. 1차 방어선도 물리쳤고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 3cd5d17f-9f0d-28e5-a88b-abdf5b300cea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_GainedAccess = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Assault_HasMet_Jaheira = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:3cd5d17f-9f0d-28e5-a88b-abdf5b300cea
msgctxt "hda194647gb063g40e2gb409gbae38dc185b9"
msgid "Halt!"
msgstr "정지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 418d98a0-51a3-2c1c-3f9b-45b46fcd4776
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:418d98a0-51a3-2c1c-3f9b-45b46fcd4776
msgctxt "he5d4e072gfe83g48c3g9efag98068ab6b8ba"
msgid ""
"Godsspeed. You seem to be their chosen champion after all, against the false "
"Absolute."
msgstr "행운을 빌지. 아무래도 자네는 가짜 절대자에 맞서기 위해 신들이 선택한 용사인 모양이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44b4ad26-5065-8a94-ae46-f7546c80f81c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 440db1a3-14ad-8127-a14b-c445049225db_PlayerIsBelligerent = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:44b4ad26-5065-8a94-ae46-f7546c80f81c
msgctxt "h1b43c6a1gaf65g479dg9f4bg679680ee2d38"
msgid "Foe."
msgstr "적이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 45208c32-acb4-8055-fbb9-af8468a2acd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:45208c32-acb4-8055-fbb9-af8468a2acd7
msgctxt "h5bcf8bd6g9eafg4e63gbf78gbc3577cbdb6e"
msgid "The sword-point is the only one that matters now."
msgstr "지금은 칼끝을 어디로 향하게 할 것인가가 곧 요점이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 45413737-1801-ace2-6160-385d21c256ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:45413737-1801-ace2-6160-385d21c256ff
msgctxt "h85cd0a8ag74f3g492dg8f5bg4456832e8079"
msgid ""
"But storming the tower won't be easy, and if we wait too long, Ketheric will "
"gather his strength and retaliate."
msgstr "그렇지만 타워로 진격하긴 쉽지 않을 거야. 그리고 계속 지체하다간 케서릭이 힘을 회복해서 반격하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 459f1322-42c0-1b43-9223-89cf66e821e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_AllyReadyPositions = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:459f1322-42c0-1b43-9223-89cf66e821e1
msgctxt "hbe58b829ga45eg4517g9ea5g7212e7150e73"
msgid "Later. We have enemies to silence first."
msgstr "나중에. 먼저 적을 침묵시켜야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 48a073d0-0dce-6a62-4209-73dc77fd342e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:48a073d0-0dce-6a62-4209-73dc77fd342e
msgctxt "h3a887e1cgd261g4e41ga6b3gb0266235636f"
msgid ""
"For now though, he's on the back foot for the first time since he returned "
"from the grave."
msgstr "하지만 지금 당장 케서릭은 무덤에서 돌아온 이후 처음으로 궁지에 몰려 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4c9e0722-2fbd-2210-e7e5-3354b61e0ab6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:4c9e0722-2fbd-2210-e7e5-3354b61e0ab6
msgctxt "h6a095caeg9abbg4562g9a8bg3f83965c0f62"
msgid "Wish me luck."
msgstr "행운을 빌어줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 522b5f80-39b1-935d-25dd-6c8118ab4db9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_ThroneRoomDefeated = True
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_JaheiraJoinedAsFollower = True
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_BazaarDefeated = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 440db1a3-14ad-8127-a14b-c445049225db_HasMetInTower = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:522b5f80-39b1-935d-25dd-6c8118ab4db9
msgctxt "hdec94cf5g6062g4a70g8511g568354e42a03"
msgid "I stand ready to reinforce, if you need it."
msgstr "원군이 필요하다면 내가 대기하고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 62557e04-69bb-9921-c29c-35d6d01e29ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:62557e04-69bb-9921-c29c-35d6d01e29ae
msgctxt "h461b5c35g9e82g4c69g9696ga05a8f49bebb"
msgid "Good question."
msgstr "좋은 질문이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 6318b025-0927-4b9d-4552-cb6e3b5c070a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:6318b025-0927-4b9d-4552-cb6e3b5c070a
msgctxt "hae4e6ddfg910dg4094gb028g3f739bf43559"
msgid ""
"At the ready, Harpers! In this light there will be victory! In this light we "
"will avenge the fallen!"
msgstr "전투 준비, 하퍼들이여! 빛으로써 승리를 이루리라! 빛으로써 쓰러진 이들의 복수를 해내리라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63e5498f-474a-fa08-f52c-21f8ac7a0db4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:63e5498f-474a-fa08-f52c-21f8ac7a0db4
msgctxt "h2dd690b7g02c1g4697ga829gdb7d6d590c4b"
msgid "I am not a True Soul."
msgstr "난 참된 영혼이 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 6da56000-e229-1310-7dca-0913a23a1002
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:6da56000-e229-1310-7dca-0913a23a1002
msgctxt "hfaaa259eg30bcg4d20gb0feg879768bff97d"
msgid ""
"I'll hold this floor to ensure no one can escape the tower. You must press "
"on, and find Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr "난 누구도 타워를 빠져나갈 수 없도록 여기를 지키고 있을게. 가 봐, 케서릭 쏨을 찾아내라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 6df0af57-a4e1-7223-ac07-c5450f725afd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:6df0af57-a4e1-7223-ac07-c5450f725afd
msgctxt "h6d390542g5f13g4b51ga443gccc5665d8e85"
msgid ""
"This is it - the spearhead moment. You've brought us this far, so how shall "
"we proceed?"
msgstr "지금이야말로 결전의 순간이군. 여기까지 온 것도 전부 자네 덕이니 물어보지, 어떻게 했으면 좋겠나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 73ba80f6-7e7c-e110-ad41-228d6f8af534
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:73ba80f6-7e7c-e110-ad41-228d6f8af534
msgctxt "h91020845g2c88g4cd4g86c0g041c032b4d50"
msgid "Ready your weapons, Harpers. Be prepared to strike at my command."
msgstr "준비해라, 하퍼들이여. 내 명령에 따라 공격한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 76a1b2b0-dbba-f863-1b79-1cc9114079e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Siege_State_NoProtection = True
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_HavenFellDuring = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Assault_HasMet_Jaheira = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:76a1b2b0-dbba-f863-1b79-1cc9114079e4
msgctxt "h2c3037e7g254eg4495ga07bg1ded20616064"
msgid ""
"'Unshackled from shadows, she will rise in moonlit glory and carve a path of "
"brightness to the accursed one's second death.'"
msgstr "'그림자의 족쇄에서 풀려난 그녀는 찬란한 달빛을 받으며 솟아오르고는 빛으로써 저주받은 이를 다시 한번 죽음으로 인도하리다.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7989d2e7-0439-46e0-9e6a-6cc593b72ca1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:7989d2e7-0439-46e0-9e6a-6cc593b72ca1
msgctxt "hb7f912efg1caag4270g969cg382ed6e1b1e6"
msgid "It would be my honour."
msgstr "영광이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 7ab37b86-f5de-ba28-0f8b-9ed442903789
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_GainedAccess = False
#.      - MOO_Assault_HasMet_Jaheira = True
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_AllyReadyPositions = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:7ab37b86-f5de-ba28-0f8b-9ed442903789
msgctxt "h6d2d3fc7gacadg4abag8359ga330c0b1ef5e"
msgid "Onward. Let the hunt begin."
msgstr "전진. 사냥을 시작한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 7ea4337c-c232-6d7e-105a-f3fb0fb1eea1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:7ea4337c-c232-6d7e-105a-f3fb0fb1eea1
msgctxt "hdcf9d638g993cg47f9g8f06gb1c9ee511100"
msgid "I'm Jaheira, and if our goals align, I may just be pleased to meet you."
msgstr "난 자헤이라일세. 서로의 목표가 일치한다면야 반갑게 인사를 안 할 이유가 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7fe702bd-d3fd-6445-f985-9041d1d8b4ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_GeneralHaven_State_HavenDestroyed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:7fe702bd-d3fd-6445-f985-9041d1d8b4ce
msgctxt "hacc4add8gbf60g42a8g82begbe3730592291"
msgid "I'm- I'm sorry you're alone. That Last Light went as it did."
msgstr "그 - 혼자 남게 됐다니 유감입니다. 최후의 빛 여관에선 어쩌다 보니 그렇게 됐네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 80b3588d-3094-04c1-80ce-94a94574248b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:80b3588d-3094-04c1-80ce-94a94574248b
msgctxt "hfbfd8c6dg97f0g4f78g8d14g71ad709aedda"
msgid "Victory - and retribution."
msgstr "승리와 앙갚음을 해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 8647a13d-74ac-3f7e-c012-107eb8b5f27f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_FlamingFistSupport = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:8647a13d-74ac-3f7e-c012-107eb8b5f27f
msgctxt "h06467272g7c9ag45c2g86aeg5e6f04b75334"
msgid ""
"Florrick left some of her Flaming Fist - they'll scout the prisons and "
"barracks below, to ensure we're not taken by surprise."
msgstr "플로릭이 플레이밍 피스트 몇몇을 남겨뒀어 - 그들은 아래의 감옥과 병영을 살펴보는 중이야, 기습당하지 않게 확실히 해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 8a31b2ed-e96e-4166-9dfc-774d833eec47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:8a31b2ed-e96e-4166-9dfc-774d833eec47
msgctxt "h3f0f4b05gcdefg489eg96c6g086989778b7f"
msgid "Perhaps they don't. I care not. I care only for vengeance."
msgstr "그럴지도 모르지. 아무래도 상관 없어. 복수하고 싶다는 생각 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8ac6cf97-33cf-c94b-c3a1-e552aee09ea1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:8ac6cf97-33cf-c94b-c3a1-e552aee09ea1
msgctxt "h273d4203g005eg4852g99e3g196ec5fa8f07"
msgid "Wish me luck."
msgstr "행운을 빌어줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b319b45-d6c6-8955-2d18-4b4ea9e95a41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:8b319b45-d6c6-8955-2d18-4b4ea9e95a41
msgctxt "hfe99c8dbg7154g4943ga271g8f7de872069a"
msgid ""
"I detect a hint of envy. Perhaps you'd like to be there for that finale."
msgstr "하고 싶은 말이 있는 것 같은데요. 가령 그 마지막 대단원에 함께하고 싶다거나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 8e716b36-9d80-460b-d906-7925ab7e4625
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_ThroneRoomDefeated = True
#.      - MOO_Assault_HasMet_Jaheira = False
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_BazaarDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 440db1a3-14ad-8127-a14b-c445049225db_LocationIsMainFloor = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:8e716b36-9d80-460b-d906-7925ab7e4625
msgctxt "h0d11bb0dg234dg42a9gab14g101b04935e3a"
msgid "Halt!"
msgstr "정지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 909b0799-40af-824d-b8e1-cd3af163ad6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:909b0799-40af-824d-b8e1-cd3af163ad6b
msgctxt "h3d56b5cbg8e55g4b10gae50ge2a929803349"
msgid ""
"Baldur's Gate? Does that mean the Absolute has spread to the city as well?"
msgstr "발더스 게이트라고? 그 말은 절대자의 세력이 도시에도 뻗어있다는 말이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 911ddad6-2a56-ca65-88b9-28ff9e80c9a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:911ddad6-2a56-ca65-88b9-28ff9e80c9a0
msgctxt "hdd8b2eb3gb4bdg4ec3g9a13g73d17dc803e6"
msgid "Wrong answer."
msgstr "오답이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 915d476c-b5cf-f9e0-4475-480a7a607a2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:915d476c-b5cf-f9e0-4475-480a7a607a2d
msgctxt "h67181aa4g1ffbg49a3gb77eg22551d10fe36"
msgid "What criterion is it that would put me in either camp?"
msgstr "무슨 기준으로 아군과 적군을 구별하는 건가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9599d4b7-f7f2-4711-0fb1-70d56c5cf01e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 440db1a3-14ad-8127-a14b-c445049225db_PlayerIsBelligerent = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:9599d4b7-f7f2-4711-0fb1-70d56c5cf01e
msgctxt "h1afdbbf1g3181g4124ga480g2c2ae6ae2906"
msgid ""
"Must I stumble upon another nuisance every other mile? Out of my way, the "
"lot of you!"
msgstr "가는 곳마다 성가신 일이 끊이질 않는군. 내 앞에서 다들 비켜!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 9a176f2e-ad18-4719-c332-c5c053b11236
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:9a176f2e-ad18-4719-c332-c5c053b11236
msgctxt "h46162dafgfa8dg4dc9gbd51g06df26ef1d24"
msgid "Prove it."
msgstr "증명해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a1e82a1-0da3-ae2b-c196-e98cd2286a3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:9a1e82a1-0da3-ae2b-c196-e98cd2286a3d
msgctxt "h90b6f9ebg4a9bg461cgba72gfec8be4ee67a"
msgid "Friend."
msgstr "아군이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a96f1da-586d-ba6e-7667-40ad06e208ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:9a96f1da-586d-ba6e-7667-40ad06e208ed
msgctxt "h0f494e89g6fe0g4690gaf79g272288b37f22"
msgid "Actually, Jaheira, why don't you join me?"
msgstr "자헤이라, 그럴 바엔 그냥 같이 가는 게 어때요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9c6a58bc-a211-f97c-7bd6-97866a99395c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:9c6a58bc-a211-f97c-7bd6-97866a99395c
msgctxt "h5219f13bg7478g4b05g8117gabb2e2906dae"
msgid "Likewise."
msgstr "나도 마찬가집니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = a02761f0-333a-5e91-2bef-c11d34d6add2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:a02761f0-333a-5e91-2bef-c11d34d6add2
msgctxt "h9858a316gca57g47e1gbe16g12b9487c9383"
msgid ""
"Sounds like something my scimitars would say. They'll strike true. See to it "
"you'll do the same."
msgstr "내 시미터가 할 법 한 말을 하는군. 허투루 휘두르진 않을 테니, 너도 네 말마따나 조심하라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = a3735912-5b4e-4599-c857-b741d590dbb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_ThroneRoomDefeated = True
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_BazaarDefeated = True
#.   Local:
#.      - 440db1a3-14ad-8127-a14b-c445049225db_HasMetInTower = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:a3735912-5b4e-4599-c857-b741d590dbb1
msgctxt "hdbca03edg16d8g42b5g84c1g68f1aa75287c"
msgid "It's all up to you now. Ketheric awaits."
msgstr "이제 모두 너에게 달렸어. 케서릭이 기다린다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a4aa8708-d7fe-9aa6-28b1-c8b764e443ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:a4aa8708-d7fe-9aa6-28b1-c8b764e443ae
msgctxt "hd9826cb2g90c9g44a4gb2cagf4e5402c5641"
msgid "A finale for the great Jaheira? I wouldn't miss it for the world."
msgstr "위대한 자헤이라의 대단원이라? 이걸 놓칠 수는 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9647da5-66b9-16a4-ad2b-38e9963f624d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:a9647da5-66b9-16a4-ad2b-38e9963f624d
msgctxt "h337e79a4g1401g4db1gbd66g5f43ac71b632"
msgid "I'm not in it for the glory. Victory is all that matters."
msgstr "영광을 위해서 여기까지 온 게 아니야. 무조건 승리를 거둬야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa0dca31-cfea-6ae2-39d3-2c5f7944177f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:aa0dca31-cfea-6ae2-39d3-2c5f7944177f
msgctxt "h6e997725gb241g408ag9a85gc5f5d05a86d2"
msgid "We move in and secure the ground floor first - cut off all exits."
msgstr "먼저 아래층을 확보하도록 하죠 - 모든 탈출구를 차단합시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ab01029c-c4a8-c133-79a7-4e7397974317
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:ab01029c-c4a8-c133-79a7-4e7397974317
msgctxt "h7b4659cdg3ee2g479dgbf45g84498291ebdf"
msgid "You there, friend or foe?"
msgstr "거기, 아군이냐 적이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ab8cc8c3-6720-8b50-61e9-54cebd09513f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:ab8cc8c3-6720-8b50-61e9-54cebd09513f
msgctxt "hc7a3d4cag9010g4c0cg9a2dg2119daaa28b9"
msgid ""
"My Harpers and I will be the noose that closes in around Ketheric, and as it "
"tightens, you'll go in for the kill."
msgstr "하퍼들과 내가 케서릭을 몰아넣는 올가미 역할을 맡을 테니, 포위망이 좁혀지면 네가 들어가 놈을 죽여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ac4df7d3-a751-1cc1-8648-55f030ca155a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:ac4df7d3-a751-1cc1-8648-55f030ca155a
msgctxt "h58ba9b90ga4a3g4442gbcccg23e8c0000e05"
msgid ""
"If you're hunting one target among many, the key is to isolate and corner it."
msgstr "네가 무리 가운데 한 놈을 쫓고 있다면, 놈을 고립시켜 구석에 가두는 게 최선이겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = b44f8181-576b-f72e-03fc-fa7cf5964878
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_Assault_State_JaheiraJoinedParty(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:b44f8181-576b-f72e-03fc-fa7cf5964878
msgctxt "h0838d30cg83d1g4b3dga9e5g1026ce1270a3"
msgid "And mine."
msgstr "나도 마찬가지야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = b4c6875c-4c96-66fd-3c15-970444f45e73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:b4c6875c-4c96-66fd-3c15-970444f45e73
msgctxt "hb219f3f4ge158g4182gbb85g753d6200fb2c"
msgid "You know the criterion exactly."
msgstr "기준을 확실히 알 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = b909745b-a3fd-e8f1-cf10-dfb631e7e018
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Assault_HasMet_Jaheira = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:b909745b-a3fd-e8f1-cf10-dfb631e7e018
msgctxt "hdb5a162cg8105g4460g9d90g96e99a45e0da"
msgid "Lead on."
msgstr "앞장서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ba7f2bbf-a894-4ec2-9ec1-e3ac96a36000
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_Assault_State_JaheiraJoinedParty(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:ba7f2bbf-a894-4ec2-9ec1-e3ac96a36000
msgctxt "h059358a7gdea7g4664gae92g6c8683b55086"
msgid "So I shall. Now let's run a hunt."
msgstr "그럴 것이다. 이제 사냥을 나가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = bad39b43-f451-27d3-842a-d7361618da5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:bad39b43-f451-27d3-842a-d7361618da5b
msgctxt "hb253da73g1a58g47e8g9fc4gf4e17f238fb2"
msgid "I'm touched. But I'm already spoken for."
msgstr "감동적인데. 하지만 난 이미 임자가 있어서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf187817-bbee-72dd-17b9-e2b81a5fce2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:bf187817-bbee-72dd-17b9-e2b81a5fce2a
msgctxt "h7701344bgf203g4127gb1e5gffb5ab634eb2"
msgid "Your Harpers are big boys and girls. They can handle themselves."
msgstr "네 하퍼들은 다 큰 성인이야. 앞가림은 알아서 할 수 있을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf573cce-6e4a-1873-d6ab-46a5e552c754
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:bf573cce-6e4a-1873-d6ab-46a5e552c754
msgctxt "h9db9c79eg531fg4dacgbaf7g18f52dfe1198"
msgid "On second thought, it is rather vital that this floor remains secured."
msgstr "다시 생각하니, 여기를 단단히 지키는 게 무엇보다 중요할 것 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c13c0e56-84ce-d2a9-c779-248bfbad296b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:c13c0e56-84ce-d2a9-c779-248bfbad296b
msgctxt "hce965c55gaa7dg4457gbaf1g597aec442afb"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = c23f87d2-65d1-6738-da91-ed0e89fd2a60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:c23f87d2-65d1-6738-da91-ed0e89fd2a60
msgctxt "h2f42d567g149ag437fgb268g5a6ec7404ec4"
msgid "Believe me, I'm aching to have my revenge."
msgstr "날 믿어, 복수하고 싶어서 몸이 쑤실 지경이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c5f5b5bb-2db2-1154-564c-c9e481f42275
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:c5f5b5bb-2db2-1154-564c-c9e481f42275
msgctxt "h1cd8c70agc458g4e29ga6a0g8cf688795f73"
msgid "Better we fight separately."
msgstr "따로 싸우는 게 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c622f6a4-844c-182f-2c7f-75b7fbee840c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:c622f6a4-844c-182f-2c7f-75b7fbee840c
msgctxt "hdd4ea532gc42ag4deagaeb6g4023db15494f"
msgid ""
"Let's just concentrate on the fight ahead. The real battle has yet to begin."
msgstr "앞으로 있을 싸움에나 집중하자고. 진정한 전투는 아직 시작도 안 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = c693954f-a879-832e-2c50-9217d9774a5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:c693954f-a879-832e-2c50-9217d9774a5e
msgctxt "hd81d520dgada5g43adg8c20g8de4a1c67841"
msgid "Different packs then. As you wish. Just get the job done."
msgstr "그럼 다른 무리로군. 네가 원한다면 그리하지. 해내기만 하라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c697171c-d787-812a-91c4-35baf8bc0e2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:c697171c-d787-812a-91c4-35baf8bc0e2d
msgctxt "h21fcad2dgb31fg4e0eg8029g3d1aee7031b6"
msgid ""
"I reap every soul in this tower, until we are the last creatures standing."
msgstr "이 탑에 있는 모든 영혼을 거두겠다. 살아있는 생명체가 나 혼자가 될 때까지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c866a40a-738a-7a71-e13a-24ceb40d05ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:c866a40a-738a-7a71-e13a-24ceb40d05ff
msgctxt "h18d5b472g78d4g434ag86d3gaa39f0a029ce"
msgid "Do what you will, just don't get in my way."
msgstr "하고 싶은 대로 하세요. 대신 내 앞길만 막지 마요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = c8c91098-f80f-6c68-4ba8-20a5d0180a8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_ThroneRoomDefeated = True
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_BazaarDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 440db1a3-14ad-8127-a14b-c445049225db_HasMetInTower = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:c8c91098-f80f-6c68-4ba8-20a5d0180a8b
msgctxt "h594eb27dg105ag4559ga546gf36ef8cc4b71"
msgid "You fight well - with skill and purpose."
msgstr "잘 싸우는군 - 기술과 목적이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ca6b6ba2-b79b-f12c-024d-06b9bf1bde4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:ca6b6ba2-b79b-f12c-024d-06b9bf1bde4d
msgctxt "hd75288ebg3925g4ec3g9c28g8bc67d55dcaf"
msgid "The time has come. Ketheric Thorm will taste of death at last."
msgstr "마침내 그날이 도래했다. 케서릭 쏨은 마지막으로 죽음을 맛보게 되리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cad23793-ca74-9c86-9544-4b547b036e6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 440db1a3-14ad-8127-a14b-c445049225db_LocationIsMainFloor = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 440db1a3-14ad-8127-a14b-c445049225db_ToldFreedNightsong = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:cad23793-ca74-9c86-9544-4b547b036e6d
msgctxt "h21afa8deg4871g41c6ga4deg52bcd103c008"
msgid ""
"You saw that celestial being flying over the tower, am I right? Well, I'm "
"the one who freed her."
msgstr "타워 위를 날아다니는 천족은 봤지? 사실, 내가 그녀를 풀어준 사람이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb3fdb3a-b9fc-33b4-2ea4-b99ccb40bf47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:cb3fdb3a-b9fc-33b4-2ea4-b99ccb40bf47
msgctxt "h64640f4fg9b8ag4463gac6ag865e7361db1e"
msgid "Actually, I'd rather you join my party, Jaheira."
msgstr "사실, 당신이 우리 일행에 참여하길 바라, 자헤이라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ce860f61-f08b-b44b-c46a-d86eabdd9e83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:ce860f61-f08b-b44b-c46a-d86eabdd9e83
msgctxt "hcda24f4fg1e41g41d3ga5e2g8d688359b121"
msgid ""
"I'm the last one standing, but I wouldn't be if it weren't for you. So what "
"do you say? Shall we take the final steps together?"
msgstr "오직 나만이 살아남았어. 물론 그것도 당신 덕이지만. 이제 어떻게 할까? 마지막까지 함께 할 텐가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d1e9bdfc-7c88-2dac-9b0f-e2b456aa396f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 440db1a3-14ad-8127-a14b-c445049225db_PlayerIsBelligerent = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:d1e9bdfc-7c88-2dac-9b0f-e2b456aa396f
msgctxt "h2eaf15bbg10c1g4729gb8ccgcf3ccca708a1"
msgid "I don't need to prove myself to anyone. Now step aside."
msgstr "누구든 간에 난 스스로를 증명할 필요가 없어. 비켜."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d7084c0d-1060-78a4-04f2-f35feb9edaf3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:d7084c0d-1060-78a4-04f2-f35feb9edaf3
msgctxt "h437accafgefd5g415egb1d1g163ab4ccb10b"
msgid "Then consider yourself persuaded."
msgstr "내가 부추겨 드리죠. 같이 갑시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = d7cc72a0-d4e0-e695-9ec8-1d46012ccc95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:d7cc72a0-d4e0-e695-9ec8-1d46012ccc95
msgctxt "h47f531c5g9ecag41b4g8391gcb137bf2d910"
msgid ""
"My Harpers are gone, shadows lost in the shadow theatre of my mind alone."
msgstr "하퍼들은 이제 없다. 그림자들도 내 마음 속 그림자 연극 중에 사라져버렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da4a1c73-fc79-7643-3fb1-79804bdd5408
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:da4a1c73-fc79-7643-3fb1-79804bdd5408
msgctxt "h532bc60agfcb4g474dg92c4ga9876fabaf62"
msgid "The words of a dead man mean nothing."
msgstr "죽은 사람의 말은 아무런 의미가 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dc807d76-2326-dbff-5b9a-581cd46ad1cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:dc807d76-2326-dbff-5b9a-581cd46ad1cb
msgctxt "hbb456cf2g5ceeg45c4g8c87gf3f1516af43b"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e09b3020-b812-3aa0-6cc6-bcab22100c5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:e09b3020-b812-3aa0-6cc6-bcab22100c5b
msgctxt "h7713a193g75deg478ag9a2dgcd762060d5aa"
msgid "Then consider yourself part of the pack."
msgstr "그렇다면 네가 무리의 일원이라고 여기지그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e32c7545-6db3-ad65-551e-11c09e69444a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:e32c7545-6db3-ad65-551e-11c09e69444a
msgctxt "ha0076eecg3988g4c0egae08gb1a12a62ca5b"
msgid "So be it. See you on the other side."
msgstr "알겠어요. 그럼 전장에서 봐요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea5217a3-2ac8-b2c7-e108-e8fb0e0b4ed2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 440db1a3-14ad-8127-a14b-c445049225db_ToldHereToKillKetheric = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:ea5217a3-2ac8-b2c7-e108-e8fb0e0b4ed2
msgctxt "hfd18dacdg3142g4268g8c28gf6b770c05a96"
msgid "All you need to know is that I'm here to kill Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr "당신은 내가 케서릭 쏨을 죽이러 왔다는 것만 알면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2c1d030-9a08-f27c-0977-c6dda5ec1785
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:f2c1d030-9a08-f27c-0977-c6dda5ec1785
msgctxt "hb29256abg60bcg4718g9717g5d6b0716f185"
msgid "Let's circle this conversation back to some kind of point, shall we?"
msgstr "그럼 이제 이 대화의 요점으로 다시 되돌아가 보는 게 어떨까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = f5b5ec3e-8e15-570a-ccc1-548b891116e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:f5b5ec3e-8e15-570a-ccc1-548b891116e8
msgctxt "h2a876785g7ca1g4a4eg803fg3d04fc1c6c1b"
msgid "We can talk at length once the day is won - so let's win it first."
msgstr "승리한 후에 이야기할 날이 있을 거야 - 그러니 일단 먼저 승리하자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = f7b38a6e-d0e7-0367-3f7e-57716a54911b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:f7b38a6e-d0e7-0367-3f7e-57716a54911b
msgctxt "hcde06155g024cg4950gbc1eg5932bd976941"
msgid "You don't say."
msgstr "그렇단 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = fb1a48ec-e076-392d-24d4-39b74d7a00c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:fb1a48ec-e076-392d-24d4-39b74d7a00c9
msgctxt "h3a2fb51bgdeedg41e7g8955g608e409e8790"
msgid ""
"In that case we could find ourselves to be allies indeed. Me and my Harpers "
"came all the way from Baldur's Gate to end the cult of the Absolute once and "
"for all."
msgstr ""
"그렇다면 서로 동맹을 맺을 수도 있겠군. 나와 하퍼들은 절대자 교단에 종지부를 찍기 위해 발더스 게이트에서부터 먼길을 달려 여기까지 왔다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = fb65f61a-5296-4076-2e98-ddd2ab9ac874
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:fb65f61a-5296-4076-2e98-ddd2ab9ac874
msgctxt "h9d5a1121g32e9g4a66g9321gd563c812f4a6"
msgid "Truly?"
msgstr "정말인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff69c4bd-cd86-ec6a-af30-bd2b42c93cdb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:ff69c4bd-cd86-ec6a-af30-bd2b42c93cdb
msgctxt "hb32a0a64g80e9g4378g9793g08e28a38263f"
msgid "You're the High Harper. You tell me."
msgstr "당신이 고위 하퍼잖아요. 계획을 들려 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ffa1e8d8-d6cb-c3f8-136b-4e8536c156f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira:ffa1e8d8-d6cb-c3f8-136b-4e8536c156f1
msgctxt "h1da656b8g588eg4dbbgb93egbd4f3fce6078"
msgid "May you strike like the viper and choke like the vine. Good luck."
msgstr "독사와 같이 공격하고 줄기와 같이 조르기를. 행운을 빌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 2b37e89e-cf55-a33a-8d98-35b0c30ca9d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following:2b37e89e-cf55-a33a-8d98-35b0c30ca9d9
msgctxt "hc8a3f4ebg09e0g43begbfd0ga2e1674ee839"
msgid "Yes, saer."
msgstr "알겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e5bd285-a194-4d3f-8948-d2ee368dcd89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following:2e5bd285-a194-4d3f-8948-d2ee368dcd89
msgctxt "hb156b55ag5ea2g435agb9afgacd56afdbe0a"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 52aa3c9d-9547-3543-b447-8d52e1ed262c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_JaheiraLeftParty(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_Assault_State_JaheiraJoinedParty(1) = True
#.     - MOO_Assault_State_JaheiraLeftParty(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following:52aa3c9d-9547-3543-b447-8d52e1ed262c
msgctxt "h4f19dc1bgbac6g4853gb321gd2cbc3cf3805"
msgid "Follow me."
msgstr "따라와."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72858f36-a9a8-4bb5-bb97-672dfafa1ad0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Assault_State_JaheiraLeftParty(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_Assault_State_JaheiraJoinedParty(1) = False
#.     - MOO_Assault_State_JaheiraLeftParty(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following:72858f36-a9a8-4bb5-bb97-672dfafa1ad0
msgctxt "hc5cb8ffegb6b6g417agbdd9ge591bf533f49"
msgid "Stay here for the moment."
msgstr "잠시 여기 있도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 9467f634-68d1-4411-829e-3f53576761ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following:9467f634-68d1-4411-829e-3f53576761ae
msgctxt "h651929bfgbab0g4176gab07g19db1403096f"
msgid "I'll watch our backs. Call if you need me."
msgstr "난 후방을 주시하지. 혹시 내가 필요해지면 부르라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = b752c893-07cf-42a7-96bc-1f90503b2758
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following:b752c893-07cf-42a7-96bc-1f90503b2758
msgctxt "h7c5cd6c3g9385g43ffg9b3fg780d1e506ba3"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = b752c893-07cf-42a7-96bc-1f90503b2758
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following:b752c893-07cf-42a7-96bc-1f90503b2758
msgctxt "h42569320g2d0dg4e23g84b8gd982347f6901"
msgid "Speak."
msgstr "말해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = b752c893-07cf-42a7-96bc-1f90503b2758
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[2]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following:b752c893-07cf-42a7-96bc-1f90503b2758
msgctxt "h8cdcc129g225cg42ddg9debgb13363c285fa"
msgid "Our host is at the top of the tower. Rude to keep him waiting, no?"
msgstr "주인장께서 탑 꼭대기에 있어. 기다리게 하는 건 예의가 아니겠지, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = ba2aa529-953f-39b1-0308-4a8db1de5bcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following:ba2aa529-953f-39b1-0308-4a8db1de5bcb
msgctxt "hdc9bc1c1gfe3bg41f1gb56ag648f7c6656ac"
msgid ""
"It is I who follows you. But, if I must venture some advice... this is the "
"simple part. Ketheric dies, or we do. And the Sword Coast with us."
msgstr ""
"난 그저 따르는 입장인데, 굳이 조언을 해야 한다면... 이건 오히려 간단해. 케서릭이 죽거나, 우리가 죽거나야. 그땐 소드 코스트도 "
"함께 죽겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e37f0204-b06a-d8dd-b9c3-6f4b8d4bfe16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 200aa519-5963-3b2d-3396-d1dcbb013702_AskedStrategy = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 200aa519-5963-3b2d-3396-d1dcbb013702_AskedStrategy = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_Following:e37f0204-b06a-d8dd-b9c3-6f4b8d4bfe16
msgctxt "h2f824a3eg88a5g44c7gaafdg8dfb19032851"
msgid "What's our strategy?"
msgstr "전략이 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_TopOfTowerBackup
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 72d1da73-cc9f-431e-ab72-8468a256b241
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_Jaheira_TopOfTowerBackup:72d1da73-cc9f-431e-ab72-8468a256b241
msgctxt "h1983aac0gadebg4ad7ga46eg2e30db42cf8e"
msgid "It's all up to you now. Ketheric awaits."
msgstr "이제 모두 너에게 달렸어. 케서릭이 기다린다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat:db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
msgctxt "h97eb6946g0ccbg4f99g9fa7ga0edda4af499"
msgid ""
"It seems we can't kill Ketheric Thorm without following him into the bowels "
"of this place."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨을 죽이려면 아무래도 놈을 따라 깊숙한 곳까지 들어가야만 하겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat:db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
msgctxt "hb975c68dgdd20g4a64g929bg0c8bcb36dca2"
msgid ""
"The tentacle has taken him below - if I'm to end the bastard, I've got to "
"follow."
msgstr "촉수가 그를 아래로 데려갔어 - 그 자식을 잡으려면, 우리도 따라가야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat:db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
msgctxt "ha3a5fca6gfb80g4f36gaa37ge0fc582a25cf"
msgid "Where Ketheric leads, we've no choice but to follow."
msgstr "케서릭이 간다면, 우린 따라가는 수밖에 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat:db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
msgctxt "hb71eae96ga97bg489fgab87ga6b5a8d21643"
msgid "We're not finished here - not until Thorm's dead for good."
msgstr "아직 끝나지 않았어. 쏨이 완전히 죽기 전까진 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat:db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
msgctxt "hb4659bf2gf695g4a66ga4d7gaa6a3d6b6397"
msgid ""
"That tentacle came from below. We should follow - I'm not about to let "
"Ketheric walk free."
msgstr "촉수는 저 밑에서 튀어나왔어. 그걸 따라가야만 해. 케서릭을 놓아줄 순 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat:db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
msgctxt "h4ef4e46cg5602g40bag87c7g33171c9e6d79"
msgid "Well. No choice but to follow."
msgstr "이런. 따라가는 것 말곤 방법이 없겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat:db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
msgctxt "h9cae693eg5f98g4013ga085g795783fabf31"
msgid ""
"That tentacle sprouted from below. Follow it, and I wager we'll find "
"Ketheric."
msgstr "촉수는 저 밑에서부터 솟아올랐어. 저걸 따라가면, 케서릭을 찾을 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat:db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
msgctxt "h15ee3029g7c06g4e26g92d5g5e282697ec97"
msgid "Downwards - we need to pursue Ketheric Thorm until this is done."
msgstr "밑으로 가지. 끝장을 보기 위해서는 케서릭 쏨의 뒤를 쫓아야만 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_AfterKethericCombat:db026b35-62fb-4090-8062-c448ecdad3b1
msgctxt "hafe2156bgcf92g4f48gb7e9g97d7e9c164ba"
msgid ""
"That <i>thing</i> came from below. We need to find out where it took "
"Ketheric."
msgstr "그 <i>흉물</i>은 아래에서 튀어나왔어. 케서릭을 어디로 데려갔는지 찾아내야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
msgctxt "h7991901agcfafg41aagbd0dg825da7581c75"
msgid "There's no end to these bloody things."
msgstr "이 젠장 할 것들엔 끝이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
msgctxt "hfb1cc880g2e52g454fg846age7fc68ac54d7"
msgid "It's no use. This army of the dead is an endless one."
msgstr "소용없어. 이 망자의 군대는 끝이 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
msgctxt "h84c6ff70g410dg4babgb23cged488e20203c"
msgid "More?! We might need to run for it - we can't fight them forever."
msgstr "더 있다고?! 도망가야 해. 계속 싸울 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
msgctxt "h9b8278f7ge50dg4e30ga9b8g79d5420905ce"
msgid "<i>Tsk'va. </i>How many more can there be?"
msgstr "<i>츠크바. </i>도대체 저기에 얼마나 더 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
msgctxt "h8a5c2646g71d8g441cgaa81g2fc734c6c3e8"
msgid "There's no end to these things."
msgstr "이것들 끝이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
msgctxt "ha46d04b5g1bd9g449cga9f2g353f5bc826a3"
msgid "Gods, they won't let up."
msgstr "맙소사, 줄어들질 않잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:08f60304-e5ea-4217-b50f-3bef22d5e893
msgctxt "h66c45323gbd87g43b5g9093g8187f133e5f3"
msgid "They just keep coming."
msgstr "끝도 없이 오는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
msgctxt "h3f6e13feg2848g454eg8bc7ga447ad39f601"
msgid "We're wasting our time - we can't beat an endless horde."
msgstr "시간 낭비야 - 끝도 없는 무리를 상대로 이길 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
msgctxt "h9031a5eeg066eg4d7dg9193g72777ddd968f"
msgid ""
"We can't beat them, and I sure as hell don't want to join them. Let's fall "
"back."
msgstr "우린 이길 수 없어. 그리고 난 절대 저들의 일부가 되고 싶지 않다고. 물러나자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
msgctxt "h96dd0731gbebdg4f8cgbd7dgf9e7f9f06b90"
msgid "Let's get out of here - I can't take any more skellies."
msgstr "여기서 나가자. 해골들을 더 상대할 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
msgctxt "hf81b112ag803fg4e65g93a4g433282fe4cc7"
msgid "We cannot win this battle. Fall back!"
msgstr "이 전투는 이길 수 없다. 물러나라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
msgctxt "hf46e01b9gf2b1g4327gb9dbgc963f1337938"
msgid "Let's move - we'll be long dead before they run out of reinforcements."
msgstr "떠나자. 증원군이 다 떨어지기도 전에 죽을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
msgctxt "h67aacaddg9350g4ad6g8a52g783ddf32ab9e"
msgid "No use fighting. We need to make tracks!"
msgstr "싸워 봤자 소용없어. 후퇴해야 해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_PrisonSkeletonWarning:32cafef4-3af7-4377-8c39-5ae11bec7c0a
msgctxt "h10f8cd0dgdc82g4aceg8243gd31155e7c02d"
msgid "The battle won't be won down here."
msgstr "이곳에선 이길 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric:ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
msgctxt "ha72c8b11g3e00g4ff5gbf04gbf12c084ce19"
msgid "Ketheric's up above, waiting for us. I doubt he'll go down as easily."
msgstr "케서릭이 저 위에서 우릴 기다리고 있어. 쉽게 쓰러지진 않을 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric:ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
msgctxt "h8a3b9851g288dg4627g8aacg911767c368e5"
msgid ""
"Prepare yourself. We're about to enter the tempest that is Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr "준비해. 곧 케서릭 쏨이라는 폭풍 속으로 들어갈 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric:ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
msgctxt "h82913150g6c18g438fgb3e3g0b3bb7e3f5a1"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm won't go down so easily. Best we ready ourselves - we're "
"about to have quite the fight on our hands."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨은 쉽게 쓰러지지 않을 거야. 준비를 하는 게 좋겠어. 꽤나 어려운 싸움이 우리 앞에 닥칠테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric:ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
msgctxt "h7892c1a7g141ag45c5g9d2dgb8bde84d877e"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm is close. Check your gear and say your prayers - this won't "
"be easy..."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨이 코앞에 있어. 장비도 점검하고 기도할 게 있다면 해. 쉽지 않은 싸움이 될 테니..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric:ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
msgctxt "h0109ea0bg6b55g4b41ga3ceg7282cb674cf5"
msgid "Time for Ketheric to pay for his countless crimes. I'm ready - are you?"
msgstr "수없이 많은 죄악을 저지른 케서릭에게 그 대가를 물을 시간이로군. 난 준비됐어, 넌 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric:ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
msgctxt "h2ecb81a9g289bg41c4ga8c7gb8e70d07529c"
msgid "Ketheric Thorm is behind that door. I'm ready if you are."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨이 저 문 뒤에 있어. 너만 준비됐다면 출발해도 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric:ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
msgctxt "h56cde11fg5170g4280g89eegeee6c9865942"
msgid "Ketheric waits above. We had best be ready to greet him."
msgstr "케서릭이 위에서 기다리고 있어. 그를 맞이할 준비를 하자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric:ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
msgctxt "h27b6e448g76ccg42ffgbf20gf332b0a93617"
msgid "Ketheric Thorm is close. We must take every measure to ready ourselves."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨이 코앞에 있네. 가능한 모든 수단을 동원해 단단히 준비를 해야만 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_PAD_ReadyToMeetKetheric:ab069dba-8e6f-4c8a-98d9-508541e5361e
msgctxt "heb815ef6gce25g4d72gaa80g58267fbd08b6"
msgid "Ketheric Thorm is waiting for us. Are we ready?"
msgstr "케서릭 쏨이 우리를 기다리고 있어. 준비 됐어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Assault_TentaclelessJump
