#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 0fc0f37f-e301-fc87-0fc8-6203d1771795
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:0fc0f37f-e301-fc87-0fc8-6203d1771795
msgctxt "h8624b27egd1abg4fb8g8437ge8c67ca8bb95"
msgid ""
"But above, you will stand in Her very presence. Such an honour requires... "
"more."
msgstr "하지만 위에서는, 그 분의 실체를 직접 대면하게 될 거다. 그런 영광을 얻으려면... 아직 모자라다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 188d4559-6681-ea20-f202-f359ec58cf23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:188d4559-6681-ea20-f202-f359ec58cf23
msgctxt "h1c244dbfg3d42g44bbgabdag51ca5232ddba"
msgid ""
"*But you've spent too long reading people not to see what's behind her eyes: "
"scorn, stark behind her mask of deference.*"
msgstr ""
"*여태 수많은 사람들의 표정을 읽어낸 덕분에, 그녀의 눈 뒤에 숨겨진 감정도 꿰뚫어 볼 수 있었습니다. 존중의 가면 뒤로 경멸과 냉정함이 "
"엿보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1ca95e9e-5826-c19c-8685-572e175f6146
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:1ca95e9e-5826-c19c-8685-572e175f6146
msgctxt "hca063ca8g78efg4a74g8799ge5c87ab3ced6"
msgid "*Your tadpole grasps at nothing. She carries no parasite.*"
msgstr "*올챙이가 아무것도 파악하지 못합니다. 그녀에겐 기생충이 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21f9b4b5-74b5-fb22-0ae5-d1473ac9a763
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:21f9b4b5-74b5-fb22-0ae5-d1473ac9a763
msgctxt "h76d24ea2gf3a5g449ag9701g780341030529"
msgid "And if I choose to go anyway - will you stop me?"
msgstr "어쨌든 내가 가겠다면 - 나를 막을 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 2729230b-bf37-ffd6-6075-f57d5cc2c513
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:2729230b-bf37-ffd6-6075-f57d5cc2c513
msgctxt "hdbb2fa0ag8aa9g461cg84acg6b27bc44b33b"
msgid ""
"Then patience, blessed one. Our god always gives us answers - but sometimes "
"they must be earned."
msgstr "그럼 인내해라, 축복받은 자. 우리의 신은 언제나 답을 내려주시지, 하지만 그걸 얻기위한 노력이 필요할 때도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e4e0b32-c6cb-710c-b26b-00db7ffadb35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:2e4e0b32-c6cb-710c-b26b-00db7ffadb35
msgctxt "h98d713c5g0b58g4ad3g8e32g26067f866389"
msgid "And how is one chosen to ascend?"
msgstr "그러면 올라갈 수 있는 이들은 어떻게 선택받는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b2e85db-bae5-2643-4945-8c914dcd25d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:3b2e85db-bae5-2643-4945-8c914dcd25d0
msgctxt "hf09ed6c3g66c5g4e72g84b1g58a3bc8c5eab"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 429bf860-b2f5-4abe-8a08-2b8836455f82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:429bf860-b2f5-4abe-8a08-2b8836455f82
msgctxt "hb32c43cfg76a6g4b73ga1a7g9d89e8eb9199"
msgid "Disciple Z'rell has given you a chance to earn that honour."
msgstr "신봉자 즈렐이 그러한 영광을 얻을 수 있는 기회를 주었을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 44b299c5-a16c-a138-44b2-c2e9cc9ed26e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:44b299c5-a16c-a138-44b2-c2e9cc9ed26e
msgctxt "h4fb5e6cfgc1b2g4a52g974cg9d9cbee21725"
msgid ""
"You are already changed, True Soul. Hearing Her voice is what brought you "
"here."
msgstr "넌 이미 변했다, 참된 영혼. 그 분의 목소리를 들었다는 사실이 널 여기로 데려온 것이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 47f74a06-0447-c509-2f00-a6d544fdf140
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:47f74a06-0447-c509-2f00-a6d544fdf140
msgctxt "h73c6b11eg79fcg4b88g91a1g61e204fd59c7"
msgid ""
"Her design does not end at the grave, blessed one. You will serve, whether "
"you ascend or fall."
msgstr "그분의 계획은 무덤에서도 끝나지 않는다, 축복받은 자. 네가 올라가든 떨어지든 그분을 섬기게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 5a13d4e8-768c-6c08-119e-7b242a8fca93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:5a13d4e8-768c-6c08-119e-7b242a8fca93
msgctxt "h7925cc58g4921g4a2fgb03bga8b6da61f102"
msgid ""
"She is in council with the General below. Show proper respect, and perhaps "
"you will be alive when we meet again."
msgstr "즈렐은 장군님과 아래층에 있는 의회에 있다네. 합당한 예의만 갖추면 다시 살아서 나와 만날 수 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 650adfb1-34f2-4dd7-bdc8-346a427d8996
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Audience_State_GrantedPermission = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:650adfb1-34f2-4dd7-bdc8-346a427d8996
msgctxt "h8e5ecef3g28fcg434aga178gc6f4b0ff6a7a"
msgid "Go. The General awaits - and so does <i>She</i>."
msgstr "가시오. 장군께서 기다리시니, 물론 <i>그분께서도</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73d23f8a-f3d4-7410-60d0-7969c99148c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:73d23f8a-f3d4-7410-60d0-7969c99148c9
msgctxt "hfef579c8g6a93g438bg91e3gf4954a07140b"
msgid "<i>Prove you are ready. Reach out for her tadpole.</i>"
msgstr "<i>준비 되었음을 증명한다. 그녀의 올챙이와 접촉한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 76198367-59ef-4d4c-9a01-bfda00dc9160
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Audience_HasMet_AccessCultist(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:76198367-59ef-4d4c-9a01-bfda00dc9160
msgctxt "he6b96481g7da6g4a54gb2aag53c234e1c5d0"
msgid "It is not your time yet, blessed one."
msgstr "아직은 때가 아니다, 축복받은 자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 78aeced3-0072-c4de-d15d-c3337ec722e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_Audience_Event_AccessInsightSuccess(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:78aeced3-0072-c4de-d15d-c3337ec722e7
msgctxt "he0d5bc49g2975g41eag872dgdf9b10929e3f"
msgid ""
"*Her words are diplomatic, but her face betrays her true feelings: utter "
"contempt, for you and all your kind.*"
msgstr "*요령있는 말투이지만, 그녀의 얼굴엔 그와 반대로 진심이 드러납니다. 당신과 당신과 같은 족속에 대한 완전한 경멸이.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7bf63a3e-87d0-9cf6-fd8f-0915fe8466c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Moonrise_Knows_AudienceGrantsPower = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:7bf63a3e-87d0-9cf6-fd8f-0915fe8466c7
msgctxt "h7a2ca943gd2edg407dg8412ge274eb1fa435"
msgid "I've heard that those lucky few come back changed."
msgstr "듣자하니 그 운 좋은 소수도 변한채로 돌아온다던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 827318d1-183c-0835-8038-b452954eab74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:827318d1-183c-0835-8038-b452954eab74
msgctxt "h698ebe9fgcbbcg436ega9c0g7c8b374c0710"
msgid "I'm sure you have done a great many things to get this far, True Soul."
msgstr "이 멀리까지 오기 위해서 대단한 일을 많이 했을 거라 생각한다, 참된 영혼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 830f62b0-5389-40c8-ca14-e23a2e231cb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_HasMet(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:830f62b0-5389-40c8-ca14-e23a2e231cb2
msgctxt "h78cea18fg6ea5g4659gae15g4cb9c231dfe2"
msgid "Disciple Z'rell will give you a chance to earn that honour."
msgstr "신봉자 즈렐이 그런 영광을 얻을 수 있는 기회를 줄 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83a2f02e-8de8-0e27-068b-c1377821d23f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Audience_Event_AccessInsightSuccess(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:83a2f02e-8de8-0e27-068b-c1377821d23f
msgctxt "hb8040be0gadb7g46c7gb6c3g01d2b95c7ebf"
msgid "You don't believe I'm worthy."
msgstr "내가 자격이 없다고 믿나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 877d8554-236c-4cd7-28c9-67afc29e4842
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_MYRKUL or MYRKUL or PALADIN_MYRKUL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:877d8554-236c-4cd7-28c9-67afc29e4842
msgctxt "ha5480554gb495g4188gaa6ag1f59027f565f"
msgid ""
"*But there <i>is</i> recognition of another kind between you. The faint, "
"fleeting odour of decay, as if both of you stand in an open grave.*"
msgstr ""
"*하지만 무언가 다른 종류의 무언가가 인식 <i>됩니다</i>. 마치 열려있는 무덤에 서있는 듯, 희미한 부패의 냄새가 스쳐지나갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8933c758-4fbd-15a5-93e1-4d7b4ff8db05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:8933c758-4fbd-15a5-93e1-4d7b4ff8db05
msgctxt "haa31be04g5777g4fd1g8be3g9c639c212364"
msgid "Let me pass. I'm a True Soul."
msgstr "날 들여보내도록. 난 참된 영혼이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 8e00c68f-ef24-6b05-61ec-62f988314706
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:8e00c68f-ef24-6b05-61ec-62f988314706
msgctxt "hdef99736gaa3bg40cbgb741g719ef6e0c2c3"
msgid "You hear Her word. That has brought you this far."
msgstr "너에겐 그 분의 말씀이 들린다. 그 사실이 널 이 멀리까지 데려온 것이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 992d0cf2-c17b-0ae9-d1cc-b1b2718c9486
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:992d0cf2-c17b-0ae9-d1cc-b1b2718c9486
msgctxt "h6f26884cg58feg49c7gb2fcgd145deca99c9"
msgid ""
"I believe you will find your rightful place in Her design. Either you will "
"ascend, or you will fall."
msgstr "그분의 설계 속에서 너도 적당한 자리를 찾을 수 있을 거라 생각한다. 올라가든지, 떨어지든지 하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = a248d288-ad56-46f7-3743-450f70162f28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:a248d288-ad56-46f7-3743-450f70162f28
msgctxt "hb8297b4eg2c49g4424gbbf0g49a6fef93550"
msgid ""
"The rooftop chapel is reserved for the General's private contemplation - "
"save for those he chooses to ascend."
msgstr "옥상 예배당은 장군님께서 개인적으로 명상하시는 곳이다, 그 분이 올려보내시기로 결정한 사람만 들어갈 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = befc8caf-3066-da33-78b2-8da25f83eca5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:befc8caf-3066-da33-78b2-8da25f83eca5
msgctxt "h046a1ca4g8356g4458g90fdgff5c4ccdea7b"
msgid "And I find use for even the fallen. I hope that is some comfort to you."
msgstr "그리고 난 떨어진 자들에게서도 가치를 찾지. 위안이 되었으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = d5e960db-0969-0389-1fe4-e1ebbd659c38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:d5e960db-0969-0389-1fe4-e1ebbd659c38
msgctxt "he0ffa06fgd2b3g4ae6g92acge2f5d0bb6df8"
msgid "I will not. Your fate is your own to choose - however painful."
msgstr "그러지는 않을 것입니다. 당신의 운명은 당신 스스로 선택하는 것이니까요. 아무리 고통스럽다 하더라도 말이지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = db43c60b-cb4a-bb7c-1f4f-606b860e77f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Audience_HasMet_AccessCultist(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:db43c60b-cb4a-bb7c-1f4f-606b860e77f6
msgctxt "ha2586b1eg1577g42efg8db5gd67bf845424a"
msgid ""
"I have my duties, True Soul. I'm sure Disciple Z'rell has given you yours."
msgstr "내겐 내 임무가 있다, 참된 영혼. 분명 신봉자 즈렐이 네게도 임무를 줬을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dc25abea-8e7b-1e14-dc69-b40d7d7046e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_GroundFloor_State_ExecutionOver = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:dc25abea-8e7b-1e14-dc69-b40d7d7046e2
msgctxt "h032001f9gf3aeg4a33gb387g20aacc741c8e"
msgid "Where can I find Z'rell?"
msgstr "즈렐은 어디서 찾을 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = f42f6ae5-d8fd-723a-1bcc-377b869dcfc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:f42f6ae5-d8fd-723a-1bcc-377b869dcfc9
msgctxt "ha9f4133fgf02fg4c00g9ae0g315a86695843"
msgid "As you see, True Soul... there is so much more for you to learn."
msgstr "보다시피, 참된 영혼... 아직 배워야 할 게 많이 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f69f6cfd-d34c-c217-a21c-8e0260e31e09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:f69f6cfd-d34c-c217-a21c-8e0260e31e09
msgctxt "h710adc49geb62g4e7cg8528g6727747106cc"
msgid "What's with the skeletons? Does the Absolute dabble in necromancy now?"
msgstr "저 해골들은 다 뭐지? 절대자께선 이제 강령술에도 손을 대시나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd7940bd-7e1e-5acc-0522-03907b2e9f7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:fd7940bd-7e1e-5acc-0522-03907b2e9f7c
msgctxt "hc6cfe61ag8dc2g48bcgb70dg8062f851f16e"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = fdc7c716-5f59-c6ca-2399-7801e31769ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_AccessCultist:fdc7c716-5f59-c6ca-2399-7801e31769ac
msgctxt "he62cdad8g37eeg4422g9130gebc8f660372b"
msgid "Ah. You <i>are</i> one of the faithful."
msgstr "아. 넌 신실한 자<i>로군</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 0b93c61e-200c-fee6-ac65-74a0df1f9ae8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:0b93c61e-200c-fee6-ac65-74a0df1f9ae8
msgctxt "hb3c568fag3014g480ega521g9a72b3790f6f"
msgid ""
"No matter - I do enjoy a challenge, and I have more than a few tools to "
"experiment with."
msgstr "상관없다. 도전은 늘 환영이거든. 실험에 쓸 도구 역시 넘치는 편이기도 하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 11aaccba-c09c-71ea-0ab3-67c51e6d54f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:11aaccba-c09c-71ea-0ab3-67c51e6d54f2
msgctxt "ha581f21dg2ce9g4406gbf5cg5c89e41df8c0"
msgid "Slave - TAKE IT!"
msgstr "노예야 - 저걸 당장 가져와라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Altar of Absolute Ascension
#. NodeID = 1a005d6a-de23-1d77-896c-07e25b97dd14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:1a005d6a-de23-1d77-896c-07e25b97dd14
msgctxt "h6fc842f9g6754g497egb50ege0f4bed9fae5"
msgid ""
"-prism-\n"
"-prism?-\n"
"\n"
"        <b>---KEY- </b>"
msgstr ""
"-프리즘-\n"
"-프리즘?-\n"
"\n"
"        <b>---열쇠- </b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Altar of Absolute Ascension
#. NodeID = 2c96afcd-3c37-3a38-0329-6f4e052c21f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:2c96afcd-3c37-3a38-0329-6f4e052c21f3
msgctxt "h14845b99gc7fdg4619gacb9g4d68d6070a4f"
msgid ""
"-<b>THERE</b>-\n"
"                                  -you are-\n"
"                -TRUE-\n"
"<b>-slave- </b>\n"
"                -SOUL-"
msgstr ""
"-<b>거기</b>-\n"
"                                  -너는 -\n"
"                -참된-\n"
"<b>-노예- </b>\n"
"                -영혼-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 58c250a7-7a9e-c336-5f5d-01b31219163b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:58c250a7-7a9e-c336-5f5d-01b31219163b
msgctxt "had87ffa3g2976g4318gab5bg59752eb49cff"
msgid ""
"*Once Balthazar is through with you, you will be left as just another undead "
"thrall - unless you can stop him in time.*"
msgstr "*발타자르가 실험을 끝마치면 당신은 주변에 널린 언데드 노예처럼 되고 말것입니다 - 그 전에 그를 막지 못한다면 말이죠.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 8a685e3a-2243-c547-efdf-d6706b9812ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Ketheric_State_AngryAtPlayer = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:8a685e3a-2243-c547-efdf-d6706b9812ca
msgctxt "hf7c61cb5gf76dg4bcdga9c1gd5b374dbe32a"
msgid ""
"For your sake, True Soul, I pray Her judgement is swift. Hear us, Absolute!"
msgstr "너 자신을 위해서라도 그녀의 심판이 빠르게 끝나길 바란다, 참된 영혼. 들어주소서, 절대자시여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 956b35c9-3e68-3156-ec5d-044000039c6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Audience_Event_PassTeleporter = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:956b35c9-3e68-3156-ec5d-044000039c6c
msgctxt "hbafeadd6g7003g4dccg97ddg23735a908362"
msgid "Do it. NOW!"
msgstr "지금 당장!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = abd09595-cd54-b3fa-e3a7-c20bed3fbb29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:abd09595-cd54-b3fa-e3a7-c20bed3fbb29
msgctxt "h2cd8a029g1d23g40f4g914dg042d73a1a106"
msgid ""
"Ah, you're awake. Good. General Thorm has tasked me with relieving you of a "
"certain artefact - I hear it's loath to part from you."
msgstr "아, 일어났군. 좋아. 쏨 장군께서 널 그 아티팩트로부터 해방시켜 달라고 부탁하시더군 - 네게서 떨어지고 싶어하지 않는다던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Altar of Absolute Ascension
#. NodeID = b5e535d6-abb1-0006-5723-f18680b7299d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:b5e535d6-abb1-0006-5723-f18680b7299d
msgctxt "hec99cd28g26b1g4439g833cg9a84a3499a10"
msgid ""
"---FREEDOM-  \n"
"       -find-\n"
" -me--\n"
"                    <b>-FREE US-</b>"
msgstr ""
"---자유-  \n"
"       -찾아와-\n"
" -날--\n"
"                    <b>-해방시켜-</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = b93dbb21-13a6-9d55-5b25-8d0b8a680fdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:b93dbb21-13a6-9d55-5b25-8d0b8a680fdf
msgctxt "hd9d888f3g045eg4858g9c7bge75d43bff573"
msgid "Fall into Her embrace."
msgstr "그녀의 포옹을 받아들이는 게다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = c4b1c7ae-63b1-4cb1-c6a8-79dfb6e13dad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:c4b1c7ae-63b1-4cb1-c6a8-79dfb6e13dad
msgctxt "h800336a3g692cg4fdbgb589g6c529c7cccf1"
msgid ""
"ENOUGH! If you cannot take it, then take <i>her</i>. Balthazar will find a "
"way."
msgstr "이제 됐다! 프리즘을 뺏어올 수 없다면 저 자라도 데려와라. 발타자르가 저걸 분리할 방법을 찾아낼것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = c4b1c7ae-63b1-4cb1-c6a8-79dfb6e13dad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:c4b1c7ae-63b1-4cb1-c6a8-79dfb6e13dad
msgctxt "hd4a813fcgc1b0g49c0gbd08g5807a9c1c503"
msgid ""
"ENOUGH! If you cannot take it, then take <i>him</i>. Balthazar will find a "
"way."
msgstr "이제 됐다! 프리즘을 뺏어올 수 없다면 저 자라도 데려와라. 발타자르가 저걸 분리할 방법을 찾아낼것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = c4b1c7ae-63b1-4cb1-c6a8-79dfb6e13dad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:c4b1c7ae-63b1-4cb1-c6a8-79dfb6e13dad
msgctxt "h8f132f06g3385g4bc5g8d15gee6686887b6f"
msgid ""
"ENOUGH! If you cannot take it, then take <i>them</i>. Balthazar will find a "
"way."
msgstr "이제 됐다! 프리즘을 뺏어올 수 없다면 저 자라도 데려와라. 발타자르가 저걸 분리할 방법을 찾아낼것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = c5cd2d5b-9c01-b847-9b4e-b181574ca8fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Ketheric_State_AngryAtPlayer = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:c5cd2d5b-9c01-b847-9b4e-b181574ca8fc
msgctxt "h7c17be08g92fdg468fg82e2g0a91d33cf442"
msgid "Do you feel Her? Let Her in, True Soul. Claim your reward."
msgstr "그녀가 느껴지는가? 그녀를 받아들여라, 참된 영혼. 포상을 받아가거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = cdd1c60d-e5ad-1000-5743-c4fd45ab16cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Ketheric_State_AngryAtPlayer = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:cdd1c60d-e5ad-1000-5743-c4fd45ab16cc
msgctxt "h3d5a9b6dg22cfg460fgb64fg7fe4e68a510e"
msgid ""
"You needn't beg for mercy, True Soul. The Absolute is not like other gods."
msgstr "자비를 바랄 필요는 없다, 참된 영혼. 절대자는 다른 신들과는 다르시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = d13b7f51-90bb-0d97-b04f-5edec2455ba9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Ketheric_State_AngryAtPlayer = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:d13b7f51-90bb-0d97-b04f-5edec2455ba9
msgctxt "hc4186ec5gfaddg46cagbd3bgb6f84a091e9f"
msgid "Come then, True Soul. Let us pray. Hear us, Absolute!"
msgstr "시작하자, 참된 영혼. 기도의 시간이다. 들어주소서, 절대자시여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = d515061c-bfa0-c544-dbb0-c5707eeac8a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:d515061c-bfa0-c544-dbb0-c5707eeac8a1
msgctxt "h298a4943g3424g40c9gab2aga99852f321c4"
msgid ""
"...The Prism. I scour this land in search of it, and you bring it to my "
"<i>door</i>?"
msgstr "...프리즘인가. 이 땅을 구석구석 찾아다녔건만 네가 그걸 내 <i>정문으로</i> 가지고 들어와?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = e2b91f4f-5fab-9c99-b20b-c02d1a1d18c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Altar:e2b91f4f-5fab-9c99-b20b-c02d1a1d18c7
msgctxt "hd5102196g213bg4fcbg8139g8e53efea13f1"
msgid "She always gives Her faithful <i>exactly </i>what they deserve."
msgstr "그분께선 언제나 신도들에게 그들이 <i>마땅히</i> 받아야 할 것을 주시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 006100f7-fd8f-a886-b507-0e87f5c7d6ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:006100f7-fd8f-a886-b507-0e87f5c7d6ba
msgctxt "h9693e7fcg2a13g456ag8cbfg68f4ce59c690"
msgid ""
"Only one god empowered me to bring my Isobel back. <i>That</i> is the god I "
"serve now. The god <i>we</i> serve."
msgstr "오로지 한 신만이 이소벨을 되살려냈어. 내가 섬기고 있는 <i>그</i> 신이지. <i>우리</i>가 섬기는 신 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01d518e0-f6fa-362f-0fdd-429c1170c64b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:01d518e0-f6fa-362f-0fdd-429c1170c64b
msgctxt "h16e80083ge349g4a35gbe34g517afb87db56"
msgid "Sorry about the cleric, but I'm here for an audience with the Absolute."
msgstr "그 클레릭 일은 미안하게 됐어, 하지만 나는 절대자에게 볼일이 있어서 온 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03dcbcb3-fa27-1a66-54e2-e731eec55b9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_MoonriseTower_State_Outcast = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:03dcbcb3-fa27-1a66-54e2-e731eec55b9d
msgctxt "ha08bcd8fgb5cfg461fg9ed3g44d965c2e0bd"
msgid "I thought you'd be angrier about my slaughter of your faithful."
msgstr "네 추종자들을 학살한 일로 더 화가 나 있을 거로 생각했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 08c498a4-8893-71c1-cf9a-26823b9f3028
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:08c498a4-8893-71c1-cf9a-26823b9f3028
msgctxt "h67124fb7g6dd9g4196g8770g413c918236d9"
msgid "You will <i>listen. </i>You will understand what you have cost me."
msgstr "<i>들어라.</i> 네가 무슨 짓을 저질렀는지 깨달아야 할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 096d7247-27cd-0bd0-c772-69a564bceee2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:096d7247-27cd-0bd0-c772-69a564bceee2
msgctxt "hf34d9409g88d7g4c3egab53g95d2bfb29f59"
msgid ""
"Death will only strengthen their faith, and you had no orders to spare them. "
"Your <i>orders</i> were to retrieve Isobel."
msgstr ""
"죽음은 믿음을 더 강하게 할 뿐인 데다가, 그들을 살려두라고 지시하지도 않았네. 자네에게 내려진 <i>명령은</i> 이소벨을 되찾아 "
"오라는 것이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 09bb4632-8eae-5375-479e-3f8219eb673b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:09bb4632-8eae-5375-479e-3f8219eb673b
msgctxt "h511cb6bdg0be4g4587g9038gfedf375debac"
msgid ""
"Now she is Nightsong. Balthazar's greatest creation, and the source of my "
"greatest strength."
msgstr "이제는 에일린이 아니라 밤의 노래야. 발타자르의 위대한 창작물이자 내 힘의 근원이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 0bb431ea-1623-c62e-1d26-ba1244a704e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:0bb431ea-1623-c62e-1d26-ba1244a704e9
msgctxt "h392771a4g6a6ag4ee5g8184g611b5bb75bf9"
msgid ""
"But you - you have defied Her will and my orders. <i>You </i>were to report "
"to Disciple Z'rell. <i>You </i>were to aid my cause! Instead you're here, "
"showing your worthless face to <i>me.</i>"
msgstr ""
"하지만 자네는, 절대자의 뜻과 내 명령을 거스르고 있지 않나. <i>자네는</i> 신봉자 즈렐에게 보고했어야 했네. <i>자네는</i> "
"내 뜻을 이행하고 있어야 했어! 한데 여기까지 와서는 쓰잘머리라곤 없는 낯짝을 <i>내게</i> 들이밀고 있구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 0ef80169-0c4d-96b8-8abe-69317f3e7b76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Audience_Event_AttackedKetheric = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:0ef80169-0c4d-96b8-8abe-69317f3e7b76
msgctxt "hf687ee45g24b2g4913ga0cfgf1a5b83924ec"
msgid ""
"Make no mistake, that was always your fate. But I had hoped to make it "
"painless."
msgstr "어차피 죽을 운명이었긴 했어. 고통 없이 보내주려 했건만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 0f972d17-fed1-02bb-fcd6-c0485c3e62dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:0f972d17-fed1-02bb-fcd6-c0485c3e62dc
msgctxt "h67688c43g9313g4c98ga129g07261996660b"
msgid ""
"Ironic, then, that it was Isobel who drove me into Shar's arms. She died, "
"and I was left alone."
msgstr "그런데 역설적이게도 샤의 품으로 나를 인도한 건 이소벨이었어. 이소벨은 죽었고 난 홀로 남겨졌지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 10346d83-7b71-05ee-bbf1-41fe25049570
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:10346d83-7b71-05ee-bbf1-41fe25049570
msgctxt "hc24b1f1bg4be9g4e99gbf01gd74714222b54"
msgid "What can I do to atone for my failure?"
msgstr "어떻게 해야 내 실패를 만회할 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 12754f74-3a85-ac58-ce10-093b1f968026
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:12754f74-3a85-ac58-ce10-093b1f968026
msgctxt "heae129d0g56b6g4e7fg97ddga9deca5ee4f4"
msgid "Everything you've ever wanted."
msgstr "네가 바라던 일을 이룰 차례지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 12899812-4ccb-965e-7c90-c5c1898c2488
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_MoonriseTower_State_Outcast = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:12899812-4ccb-965e-7c90-c5c1898c2488
msgctxt "hd0e5ba81ge10bg4ad4gb136g6e4f5eec5cf1"
msgid ""
"You've had your indiscretions, but I find I can forgive a great deal in "
"light of what you've done."
msgstr "경솔한 부분도 있었지만 자네가 이뤄낸 일에 비하면 별 거 아니네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 136fab92-c8b7-9a67-2b4d-031b5ce7ae39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:136fab92-c8b7-9a67-2b4d-031b5ce7ae39
msgctxt "hea9283bagffbag4725gad76g33ff35bb9bed"
msgid ""
"You had best dredge up some scrap of respect, True Soul. You will need it."
msgstr "존경심을 조금이라도 끄집어내는 게 좋을 걸세, 참된 영혼이여. 내보일 필요가 있을 것이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 1553afbb-8500-bf93-fe81-cf4159904a87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:1553afbb-8500-bf93-fe81-cf4159904a87
msgctxt "he4a2c672ge417g4c64gae14g3c68c3df15a0"
msgid "I can only wonder: why?"
msgstr "도대체 왜지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 15f384aa-2b19-a219-0b50-9404bc683b6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:15f384aa-2b19-a219-0b50-9404bc683b6c
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hf5bb1f70gdb46g4507g8caagaed30491118b"
msgid ""
"When she was killed, the man... he tried to remain whole, but it wasn't "
"possible. Do you understand?"
msgstr "딸이 살해당했을 때, 남자는... 무너지지 않으려 노력했다네. 하지만 가능할 리가 없잖은가. 이해할 수 있겠나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a04afa1-10f5-2ddc-8e2d-0ad946d20331
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:1a04afa1-10f5-2ddc-8e2d-0ad946d20331
msgctxt "hbc9b8bc2g3b79g4ad7g9361g939e895e76af"
msgid "I am devoted to the Absolute."
msgstr "절대자를 섬기고 있기 때문이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a05784a-78de-0b29-f569-563958eeb716
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_BriefInRoom(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Isobel_KnowsKethericFather = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:1a05784a-78de-0b29-f569-563958eeb716
msgctxt "h67ca47b6g8d98g4abfg89a9gd1fb38f6b5ba"
msgid "She didn't want to be brought here, General. She fears you."
msgstr "이소벨은 여기 오고 싶어 하지 않던데. 널 두려워하고 있던걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 1ddb0cb2-92fa-d3e2-e83a-e72e6402447f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_State_IsDefeated = True
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Event_AskedToKidnapIsobel = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:1ddb0cb2-92fa-d3e2-e83a-e72e6402447f
msgctxt "hdf6afeb9g4ea6g4637gbd1dg346770071589"
msgid ""
"If that were true, the Selûnite cleric would be standing next to me right "
"this moment. Instead, Disciple Z'rell is dead, and you - you're here, before "
"<i>me</i>, for some unfathomable reason."
msgstr "그게 사실이라면 죽은 즈렐 대신 셀루네의 사제가 내 옆에 있었겠지. 그리고 어째서인지 <i>네</i>가 내 앞에 서 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 1ece0229-dccc-f7f9-630e-fa1976db1776
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:1ece0229-dccc-f7f9-630e-fa1976db1776
msgctxt "hf8c95212gea88g4606g9c23gcaea68b6fe5e"
msgid "Isobel. You brought my daughter back to me."
msgstr "자네가 이소벨을 내게 돌려주었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 1fc0c9fe-0ada-45aa-85d4-f64e51e63ff9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:1fc0c9fe-0ada-45aa-85d4-f64e51e63ff9
msgctxt "h26540b52g7064g4665gbca1gc7452f7d7770"
msgid "From darkness into light. From oblivion back into her father's arms."
msgstr "그렇지. 그녀를 어둠에서 빛으로. 망각에서 나의 품으로 데려왔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 21c88426-a4ef-477b-880e-996f365245d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:21c88426-a4ef-477b-880e-996f365245d7
msgctxt "h314666eag071bg4bcagbf9eg439c5a1ed1fc"
msgid ""
"If that were true, you would have reported to Z'rell as you were told, you "
"would have stayed off this roof as you were told, and you would be out there "
"retrieving the Selûnite cleric!"
msgstr "만약 그게 사실이라면 넌 즈렐이 말한 대로 이 옥상은 얼씬도 하지 않고 셀루네의 사제를 찾고 있었겠지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 228b75a0-8224-9dc4-a987-5098ad39d68d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Isobel_State_IsDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:228b75a0-8224-9dc4-a987-5098ad39d68d
msgctxt "h2333d6a9gc811g403bg8d60g0a89cd78f1d9"
msgid ""
"I'll tell you a story, True Soul. About a man who sold himself piece by "
"piece."
msgstr "이야기를 하나 해주지, 참된 영혼이여. 자신을 하나하나씩 팔아넘긴 남자에 대한 것일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 297d4520-2ef2-b2da-6c67-a5120e8a6596
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Isobel_KnowsKethericFather = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:297d4520-2ef2-b2da-6c67-a5120e8a6596
msgctxt "hc873cd04g152dg47a1gac47g14c0d97f6615"
msgid "She wasn't overly keen on a reunion."
msgstr "이소벨은 재결합을 반가워하지 않더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 298fb0d3-7453-f0a9-92fd-ef0401448315
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:298fb0d3-7453-f0a9-92fd-ef0401448315
msgctxt "hf49af225g5487g4364gaf88g1adaef8a159c"
msgid "I'm not sure Isobel would see it that way."
msgstr "이소벨의 생각은 다를 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 2e4c4c76-9af3-aac1-a1a3-ece8318f56b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:2e4c4c76-9af3-aac1-a1a3-ece8318f56b1
msgctxt "h8b92318dg0908g428bg9aefgff2a082b6cf3"
msgid ""
"You've travelled a long way to make it this far. Lied. Fought. <i>Killed</i>."
msgstr "여기까지 참 먼 길을 왔구나. 속이고, 싸우고, <i>죽이면서</i>까지 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 2ed5a442-9a22-67d8-eab6-1064cad7e2eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:2ed5a442-9a22-67d8-eab6-1064cad7e2eb
msgctxt "hf2c79f1cgda78g46c6g80a5g1cc63ee70c02"
msgid ""
"You're not like the others. Holy fervour does not motivate you. Nor does the "
"promise of ultimate reward. How very sad for you."
msgstr "넌 달라. 신성한 열정도 보상의 약속에도 넌 꿈쩍하지 않지 참 슬픈 일이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 2f3dba48-ff77-01a6-563c-66ddc283b5b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:2f3dba48-ff77-01a6-563c-66ddc283b5b7
msgctxt "h892b8c36gc9ccg4b79g8f11g09baeda32868"
msgid "That you have. That and more, True Soul."
msgstr "물론일세. 그 이상이지, 참된 영혼이여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2f571ee3-f378-37d8-248b-f675d5bf0a37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:2f571ee3-f378-37d8-248b-f675d5bf0a37
msgctxt "h773d4680g81bbg4fb3gb963g6503d2e3eea1"
msgid "I am ready to meet with the Absolute - if you'll permit it."
msgstr "나는 절대자를 만날 준비가 되어있어. 허락만 해준다면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 30d43165-dd73-d7f6-02b5-4a559e215b58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Isobel_State_AtMoonrise = True
#.      - HAV_Isobel_State_IsDead = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:30d43165-dd73-d7f6-02b5-4a559e215b58
msgctxt "ha1dd84d2g0ce8g4412gbe1bg724d99048348"
msgid "True Soul! I was so hoping to thank you in person."
msgstr "참된 영혼이여! 자네와 이야기를 나누고 싶었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 37033e2e-3d58-e66b-bdbe-df36ace2c00f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_State_AskedBringIsobel = True
#.     - MOO_Audience_State_KethericToldToKneelAtAltar = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:37033e2e-3d58-e66b-bdbe-df36ace2c00f
msgctxt "hb58ef7b6gedb8g468egb692gb19f095b49e9"
msgid "Go on. <i>Now.</i>"
msgstr "결정하게나. <i>당장.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 38c5347d-455c-4890-8e08-b3d7d2020ef7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:38c5347d-455c-4890-8e08-b3d7d2020ef7
msgctxt "hb1def05eg8b74g4e17g9a3bgc01635b7761b"
msgid "So the man fell to pieces."
msgstr "그렇게 남자가 산산이 부서졌다는 얘기군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 3e826ea4-f55a-c166-d2aa-945fadbc4671
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:3e826ea4-f55a-c166-d2aa-945fadbc4671
msgctxt "h8f97411ag2c04g4be5gab3fgdeae1e66cd04"
msgid "He <i>could</i> not break. His daughter needed him whole, after all."
msgstr "<i>무너질 수 없었다</i>는 게 정확하겠군. 딸에겐 그가 필요했으니 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ea7f58a-543e-a46d-3ae2-a2436cc1551b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:3ea7f58a-543e-a46d-3ae2-a2436cc1551b
msgctxt "ha6652dd3g9001g411bg88e8g17d60c53e8b9"
msgid "What is this? I came to receive my audience with the Absolute."
msgstr "이건 또 뭐야? 난 절대자한테 볼일이 있어서 온 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 414bd545-586d-4a1d-1b48-47185a7776bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:414bd545-586d-4a1d-1b48-47185a7776bd
msgctxt "h5b2168d2gcc0cg4939g9e37g657fcf1ca05a"
msgid ""
"How often our burdens can be made into boons, with the right encouragement."
msgstr "적절한 고무를 통해 시련이 선물로 승화하는 일이 얼마나 있겠는가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 41b485df-857d-5923-36a4-ea46b86ecbb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:41b485df-857d-5923-36a4-ea46b86ecbb0
msgctxt "hf702b004g91ccg4ef1g874fgce42e6d11278"
msgid ""
"Either go back out there and retrieve the cleric, or kneel at the altar. See "
"if the Absolute cares to explain Herself to you."
msgstr "당장 나가서 클레릭을 데려올 게 아니라면, 제단으로 가서 무릎을 꿇어라. 절대자께서 친절하게 설명해 주실지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 437bfd23-bcbf-c05a-925c-5372644da398
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:437bfd23-bcbf-c05a-925c-5372644da398
msgctxt "hc866f757g3a2bg4106ga090gccde1950f727"
msgid "I only hope your daughter can embrace the Absolute's will."
msgstr "당신의 딸이 절대자의 큰 뜻을 헤아리길 바랍니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 43b59127-e0b3-f76e-0eb3-3880b9b35cdc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:43b59127-e0b3-f76e-0eb3-3880b9b35cdc
msgctxt "h115abb98gb01ag4dadga5f3ge6aaa4ecc38b"
msgid "No."
msgstr "아니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 442cd719-c9c4-99ca-d5a9-2bed80657a6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:442cd719-c9c4-99ca-d5a9-2bed80657a6c
msgctxt "hc1926915g0358g4eb3gb4bdgf98dc26bd46e"
msgid "What of the Nightsong?"
msgstr "밤의 노래는 어떻게 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 46b077ee-9720-9c50-dd72-8d577d1ee920
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:46b077ee-9720-9c50-dd72-8d577d1ee920
msgctxt "h81363cebgdc47g4620g95a8ge5350e91e074"
msgid ""
"She was always stubborn. She clung to Selûne even after her mother's death."
msgstr "항상 고집이 셌어. 어미를 잃은 뒤에도 셀루네를 버리지 못할 정도였지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 46da4fe6-9a8b-6dd8-c6ed-7e10fb4529c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:46da4fe6-9a8b-6dd8-c6ed-7e10fb4529c2
msgctxt "h82a20b52ge07fg446bga01fge4a4ede6315c"
msgid ""
"I'm sure it was. Though I can't imagine convincing Isobel to come to the "
"Towers was an easy feat."
msgstr "그렇겠지. 그래도 이소벨을 설득해서 데려오리라고는 상상도 못 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 46e136b2-d26a-4e90-ee5f-415999d231e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_MoonriseTower_State_Outcast = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:46e136b2-d26a-4e90-ee5f-415999d231e6
msgctxt "hdbb6f791g543fg4f4bg98fdg8875e69df3a3"
msgid ""
"You've travelled a long way to make it here. Lied. Fought. Killed - even "
"those who would be your allies."
msgstr "여기까지 참 먼 길을 왔구나. 넌 거짓말하고, 싸우고, 죽이기까지 했다. 심지어 네 편이 되어줄 수 있었던 이들도 말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48aed5c9-b72f-50ba-9d1b-f4716f65c680
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_MINTHARA(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:48aed5c9-b72f-50ba-9d1b-f4716f65c680
msgctxt "hb345ac3cg5d4ag461dg9d59g9b97f7f1d4b0"
msgid "Vengeance is the best antidote to grief."
msgstr "슬픔을 이겨내는 데는 복수만 한 약이 또 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 48d5c42b-5cd3-a97c-82fe-9c875dce6963
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Event_AskedToKidnapIsobel = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:48d5c42b-5cd3-a97c-82fe-9c875dce6963
msgctxt "h08bc11ddgedd7g4686gac0bg1ba202e2a01b"
msgid ""
"And yet Isobel - the Selûnite cleric - is nowhere to be found. Z'rell "
"instructed you quite clearly."
msgstr "그런데도 이소벨, 셀루네의 클레릭은 흔적조차 찾아볼 수 없군. 즈렐이 자네에게 명확히 지시했을 터인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 4dbcd93b-7f84-f68e-bdec-371372c4b1fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:4dbcd93b-7f84-f68e-bdec-371372c4b1fc
msgctxt "hf03fc2e4g24f9g414fgad56g8b263dfa6122"
msgid "The things <i>we</i> have done, True Soul."
msgstr "<i>우리가</i> 한 짓이라네, 참된 영혼이여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e7c91c6-5b50-fc5a-70bc-ce3bc3e52a3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:4e7c91c6-5b50-fc5a-70bc-ce3bc3e52a3b
msgctxt "h13b4f85dg118bg41a8g8548g4102d2cf8995"
msgid "I could ask the same of you."
msgstr "너에게 같은 질문을 할 수 있을 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4facb61c-4b7c-f2ed-9dd8-cce759029200
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_BriefInRoom(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Isobel_KnowsKethericFather = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:4facb61c-4b7c-f2ed-9dd8-cce759029200
msgctxt "hba8739aegd0f0g4b7dg9e2dg6d7dbc492f26"
msgid "She's your daughter, isn't she? Isobel Thorm. She <i>fears </i>you."
msgstr "이소벨 쏨, 네 딸이었던가? 너를 <i>두려워하고</i> 있더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 50f20839-372f-d47e-cfcb-52d43153112e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:50f20839-372f-d47e-cfcb-52d43153112e
msgctxt "h6e9d6c9eg5755g4a7dgaec2g5e4f6812fd40"
msgid ""
"That is precisely why I sent you to retrieve her! She is lost. Confused. It "
"is your <i>holy duty </i>to help me enlighten her."
msgstr ""
"그 때문에 자네를 대신 보낸 게 아닌가! 이소벨은 판단력이 흐린 상태일세, 혼란에 빠져있단 말이네. 나를 도와 그 아이에게 깨달음을 주는 "
"것이 자네의 <i>성스러운 임무</i>일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 515fc7ce-6162-35c9-66f2-f23c97346e4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:515fc7ce-6162-35c9-66f2-f23c97346e4f
msgctxt "h77b90c68gbad5g4d51g8c9cg0a97958408df"
msgid ""
"Her hatred he could bear, perhaps, as long as she had another chance to live."
msgstr "그래도 경멸 따위는 얼마든지 견뎌낼 수 있었어. 딸이 되찾은 삶을 살아갈 수만 있다면 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 523834c3-9977-2ab5-120b-a5b1af75b865
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:523834c3-9977-2ab5-120b-a5b1af75b865
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h65a1ee3bg40d3g4ce7gae96g767cb03f3953"
msgid ""
"And the new god did as promised. The man's brilliant, beautiful daughter "
"came back. She was whole - she was alive. But she despised the pitiful "
"wretch her father had become."
msgstr ""
"그리고 새로운 신께서는 약속을 이행하셨지. 그의 멋지고 사랑스러운 딸이 온전히, 살아서 돌아온걸세. 하지만 딸은 구제불능의 쓰레기가 "
"되어버린 아버지를 경멸했다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 54338c08-1253-04fd-5448-0e265ad22351
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:54338c08-1253-04fd-5448-0e265ad22351
msgctxt "h38664805g0d5fg4ba6gaafbg99739a97bd1c"
msgid "So you understand what you have cost me, True Soul?"
msgstr "그렇다면 자네의 행동이 어떤 의미였는지도 깨달았는가, 참된 영혼이여?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 55e4eef0-935e-b2e7-af3a-18db735fe8d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:55e4eef0-935e-b2e7-af3a-18db735fe8d7
msgctxt "h95c76dd2g1685g44d7ga3cagba5dc1e63dfd"
msgid "So you serve whichever god best serves you. A skewed philosophy."
msgstr "결국 자신의 이해에 맞는 신만 섬긴 셈이군. 알량한 철학이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5630f3f7-9778-d106-c7b3-a7b208b5fa83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:5630f3f7-9778-d106-c7b3-a7b208b5fa83
msgctxt "h5f66ea0fgc0b2g4fb0g8d19gd14f11da1153"
msgid "What could the Absolute possibly want with the cleric?"
msgstr "절대자가 클레릭에게 뭘 바란다고 생각하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 57298e5e-f522-4095-2a97-9b544739da92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:57298e5e-f522-4095-2a97-9b544739da92
msgctxt "hc79f0935gd78cg48fegb486gdee7429f7b19"
msgid "Who are you to defy the Absolute's orders? <i>My</i> orders?"
msgstr "네놈이 뭐라고 절대자의 명령을, <i>내</i> 명령을 거역하려 드는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 57a5ea5c-5db3-4b21-e1d7-818e89bc52b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Event_AskedToKidnapIsobel = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:57a5ea5c-5db3-4b21-e1d7-818e89bc52b2
msgctxt "hd1e91eb1g87d1g46d9gbef2g6f7876bf11a1"
msgid ""
"If that were true, the Selûnite cleric would be standing next to me right "
"this moment. Z'rell gave you an order - an order on my behalf - and you "
"failed it."
msgstr "그게 사실이라면 즈렐이 명령한 대로 셀루네의 사제가 내 옆에 있었겠지. 하지만 넌 실패했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 58738b7c-5dfa-3db3-f79b-b65ac07945cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:58738b7c-5dfa-3db3-f79b-b65ac07945cb
msgctxt "h589b88abga231g4da7gbf96ge2b3cc1525b2"
msgid ""
"First, he sold himself to the goddess of loss. But the pain did not subside, "
"no matter his obscene feats of devotion."
msgstr ""
"처음에는, 상실의 여신에게 그 자신을 팔아넘겼다네. 하지만 고통은 전혀 가라앉지 않았지. 그가 바친 터무니없을 정도의 헌신에도 말일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5b4dd242-9fd5-d00f-dd87-2a2bdbf91e2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4d1df34e-f8af-c996-a5ec-ecb00cd7b093_KethericWants = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:5b4dd242-9fd5-d00f-dd87-2a2bdbf91e2f
msgctxt "h5fb30107gb497g45c5g936egb3e7c904eee3"
msgid "I want to see the truth of this god. What's next?"
msgstr "그 신을 이해하고 싶어. 뭘 해야 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 5b861a7c-f1ab-9876-63d1-0c394d6164b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:5b861a7c-f1ab-9876-63d1-0c394d6164b8
msgctxt "h8a87d360gf199g48cbg80c5gd5fe742b0d7b"
msgid ""
"In the end, perhaps her death was a boon - an encouragement to point me "
"toward our higher purpose."
msgstr "따지고 보면, 딸의 죽음이 선물이었을지도 모르겠군. 숭고한 목적을 향해 나아갈 수 있게 해주었으니 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 5be1dcf4-14d7-2ec2-56c8-1635dbb21231
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:5be1dcf4-14d7-2ec2-56c8-1635dbb21231
msgctxt "h2dea4249gb1b4g4556gbe99gf9eb7e662077"
msgid ""
"I can. I <i>will. </i>But it is not without cost. Who will pay this time, "
"True Soul?"
msgstr "가능하지. <i>가능하고말고.</i> 하지만 대가 없이는 불가능하다네. 이번엔 누가 대가를 치러야겠는가, 참된 영혼이여?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 5cec9b58-bfc5-f3da-6b1f-c99535e05f74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:5cec9b58-bfc5-f3da-6b1f-c99535e05f74
msgctxt "h792cc496g6953g4e33g8a03ge3486b06dc4d"
msgid ""
"You're wrong. But you'll discover that for yourself, when you meet the "
"Absolute."
msgstr "틀렸어. 절대자와 만나고 나면 자신이 얼마나 틀렸었는지 알게 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 5d413b20-d374-bb10-cf16-5eb79589d321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:5d413b20-d374-bb10-cf16-5eb79589d321
msgctxt "h48925a21g79efg48f9gbdbagd24bc91f41e3"
msgid "Never."
msgstr "절대 안돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 5d5a61fd-7775-e231-b9b6-54429992947d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:5d5a61fd-7775-e231-b9b6-54429992947d
msgctxt "hd3ecfde4g9f12g453fga7dag460d26d819d1"
msgid ""
"He would have to give everything: his body and soul entire. He did not "
"hesitate. Not for a moment."
msgstr "대가로 남자의 몸과 영혼을 전부 바쳐야 했지만, 그는 단 한 순간도 망설이지 않았다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 5e28d7fb-91c8-90a7-9d49-08e18ca36587
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:5e28d7fb-91c8-90a7-9d49-08e18ca36587
msgctxt "h793e2a88g652dg4f32gbbacg27bcd4c4beca"
msgid "The Absolute will decide your fate."
msgstr "절대자가 자네 운명을 결정할 것일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 5fda3ade-d360-e151-247c-d70b9410be76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:5fda3ade-d360-e151-247c-d70b9410be76
msgctxt "hbf3f4a84g5ce2g4613g9300gd4f15efad55f"
msgid "No one of sound mind can look at what the Absolute offers and resist."
msgstr "정상적인 사람이라면 절대로 절대자의 제안을 거절할 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 608a5112-bfa2-587d-2375-8f178973091f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:608a5112-bfa2-587d-2375-8f178973091f
msgctxt "hba292a00g8892g445cg9408g63b6b1a6714a"
msgid ""
"You think to take Isobel from me again? Why, <i>True Soul</i>? Why come here "
"just to die?"
msgstr "이소벨을 다시 내게서 빼앗겠다고? 왜지, <i>참된 영혼이여</i>? 왜 죽음을 자초하는 것인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 64b926a1-595e-daa6-54bf-72c587fb6816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:64b926a1-595e-daa6-54bf-72c587fb6816
msgctxt "hc38fb9c9g0a93g42a8gbc51gdd5e6ddc87f8"
msgid "Half marks means you <i>fail, </i>True Soul."
msgstr "반쪽짜리 성공은 곧 <i>실패</i>를 의미한다네, 참된 영혼이여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 655bde95-c348-d91c-b788-f8547cfad2b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:655bde95-c348-d91c-b788-f8547cfad2b1
msgctxt "hee2ad91dg02ffg46dbga2bbga68416328e44"
msgid "It was an honour to serve, my lord."
msgstr "섬기게 되어 영광입니다, 주군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 674b9744-c125-f9de-7c41-59e6761b1597
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:674b9744-c125-f9de-7c41-59e6761b1597
msgctxt "haba89d45g36feg4c8cg9c5dg60e07119467e"
msgid "I'd do whatever it takes to gain an audience with the Absolute."
msgstr "절대자를 만날 수 있다면 뭐든지 할 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 67ebf3d4-1f52-6d4e-5ad9-ba6fadf13257
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:67ebf3d4-1f52-6d4e-5ad9-ba6fadf13257
msgctxt "h9384c277gebc2g4437g8f38gc7099d9fba69"
msgid "You played your part. Don't spurn your reward just as you've earned it."
msgstr "자네는 소임을 다했네. 부디 정당한 보상을 받아갔으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 6b678d56-067f-24b9-d0b5-f5f8041e0461
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:6b678d56-067f-24b9-d0b5-f5f8041e0461
msgctxt "hdb2c74c2ge0eeg4478g858fgd734a038f604"
msgid ""
"Everything I've done, everything I have built, has been to give Isobel that "
"chance. And you, True Soul - you have <i>squandered it.</i>"
msgstr ""
"내가 해온 모든 일, 내가 쌓아온 모든 것, 전부 이소벨에게 그 기회를 주기 위함이었어. 그랬는데 너, 참된 영혼아, 네가 전부 "
"<i>물거품으로</i> 만들어 버렸구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 6c4684a5-db16-5429-77cc-c45ee9c6dd6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:6c4684a5-db16-5429-77cc-c45ee9c6dd6b
msgctxt "h9ab2e5efg6a30g44edgb04agbab2eaac54fe"
msgid ""
"I've retrieved my daughter's body - the one you so ruthlessly injured. She "
"will live again. I want you to pay for what you've done."
msgstr "네놈이 끔찍하게도 훼손한 이소벨의 시신을 수습했다. 내 딸은 다시 삶을 얻게 되겠지. 네가 한 짓의 대가를 치렀으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 6d6ff9a0-6e1b-0486-cd20-c0cdf07ee910
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:6d6ff9a0-6e1b-0486-cd20-c0cdf07ee910
msgctxt "h98f74e76ga707g4ae1g80ccg148ecf3d95ab"
msgid "My motivations are clear, aren't they? I serve the Absolute."
msgstr "내 동기를 의심할 여지가 있는가? 나는 절대자를 섬길 뿐이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 6de2d25d-82fd-79cf-bc30-25b346c15245
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:6de2d25d-82fd-79cf-bc30-25b346c15245
msgctxt "h9f137e94g5e5eg4179ga89cg0f11d9dd31e5"
msgid ""
"Our forces are gathered, the Nightsong bound, and we are ready to march at "
"last. But most importantly..."
msgstr "군대가 집결했으며, 밤의 노래는 결속되었으니, 마침내 진격할 준비가 끝났다. 하지만 무엇보다도..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 75540c2b-fd2b-7079-6233-4a5b61a1fc74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:75540c2b-fd2b-7079-6233-4a5b61a1fc74
msgctxt "h721fa8aagee86g45ffg9e5cg14c145730f05"
msgid "Not <i>my </i>judgement. Be glad for that, True Soul."
msgstr "<i>내</i> 판결이 아닐세. 다행으로 여기게나, 참된 영혼이여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 7a00fe9f-fd98-b561-94a3-53ed32452d59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:7a00fe9f-fd98-b561-94a3-53ed32452d59
msgctxt "hda848b8fgddddg4aa2g8795g4cc7afefa011"
msgid ""
"Every god I have served, I have served in my daughter's name. And it almost "
"came to nothing because of <i>you.</i>"
msgstr "나는 신들을 내 딸의 이름으로 섬겨왔다네. 덕분에 <i>자네가</i> 전부 허사로 만들어 버릴 뻔했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 7b962836-10c5-310b-a38f-d2890fca26ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:7b962836-10c5-310b-a38f-d2890fca26ff
msgctxt "h2549ac8aga1fag42dcgb7f5ge72847551d6b"
msgid ""
"I pledged my body and soul entire to a new god: a god who promised me my "
"daughter could be returned to me."
msgstr "나는 몸과 영혼을 전부 새로운 신께 바치리라 맹세했다. 그분께서는 딸이 내게 돌아올 수 있을 것이라 말씀하셨지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 7e74b263-4ff4-dc90-9dc1-1629a5ff41b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:7e74b263-4ff4-dc90-9dc1-1629a5ff41b3
msgctxt "hfc6be957gb440g4e11gae8agfda2f1fa2150"
msgid "As is your due."
msgstr "물론이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f0878df-babd-f0d4-880a-b7d66ccc602d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:7f0878df-babd-f0d4-880a-b7d66ccc602d
msgctxt "h280b8e3agd44fg47b1gab5cgc513fd9f9b84"
msgid "She opposed the Absolute. Why mourn her?"
msgstr "이소벨은 절대자에 대항했는데, 왜 슬퍼하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 80d3da07-6585-7f05-f4fc-6fef4a7e0098
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:80d3da07-6585-7f05-f4fc-6fef4a7e0098
msgctxt "hed3cd671g7c04g4997gb272g0ba7b843f48f"
msgid ""
"I made perfect prey for Lady Loss. She promised vengeance. <i>Oblivion. </"
"i>But her plans came to naught."
msgstr "상실의 여신의 입맛에 맞는 표적이 된 거지. 여신은 <i>멸망</i>이라는 복수를 약속했지만, 그 계획은 수포로 돌아갔다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 81929115-c6e4-2f79-2bab-5ae4c9da14ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Audience_State_GrantedPermission = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:81929115-c6e4-2f79-2bab-5ae4c9da14ed
msgctxt "h83bfb26cgb119g4408gb323gb309ff022b1e"
msgid ""
"Indeed, I'd have thrown you off this tower by now if I didn't want to have a "
"little chat first."
msgstr "먼저 짧게라도 대화를 나누고 싶었으니 망정이지, 아니라면 지금쯤 이미 너를 탑 밖으로 던져버렸을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 828eca41-9d05-cbbf-34f3-7b5981c8ac59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_State_AngryAtPlayer = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:828eca41-9d05-cbbf-34f3-7b5981c8ac59
msgctxt "he63073e9g1898g4dfdga5f3ga6f1b9b23d1c"
msgid ""
"I have no mercy left in me - but it is for the Absolute to decide your fate."
msgstr "내게 더는 자비가 남아있지 않네만, 안타깝게도 자네의 운명을 결정하는 건 절대자의 몫일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 85983c57-ca7d-c77b-67e5-d4fceae8bfb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:85983c57-ca7d-c77b-67e5-d4fceae8bfb5
msgctxt "h5ed94764g7a6ag4ebegae2eg9c1a3f4f3337"
msgid ""
"She grew up - grew <i>strong</i>. Challenged him. Filled his heart with such "
"joy it supplanted all sorrow."
msgstr "딸은 아주 <i>강하게</i> 자라났네. 아버지에게 대들 정도로 말이지. 그의 가슴 속은 슬픔 대신 기쁨으로 가득찼네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 91c5fe27-b211-d9f9-7f08-7f5f7e10c1c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:91c5fe27-b211-d9f9-7f08-7f5f7e10c1c8
msgctxt "hd2b413fcg6b34g4c29ga617g02d574c1acc8"
msgid "And I've served well. I've come to claim my reward."
msgstr "할 일을 했으니 이제 마땅한 보수를 챙겨줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9874f3b0-d39e-963e-e241-67202a1fde0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Isobel_KnowsKethericFather = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:9874f3b0-d39e-963e-e241-67202a1fde0e
msgctxt "hf9f14cdag7eafg4daegb198g2c3d6c619156"
msgid "You're Isobel's father? She wasn't overly keen on a reunion."
msgstr "당신이 이소벨의 아버지인가? 이소벨은 재결합을 반가워하지 않더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99d7b440-980e-89f3-99f9-9ff5594b47f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:99d7b440-980e-89f3-99f9-9ff5594b47f3
msgctxt "h66a64097ge42cg4834g896dg5b3c45c1330e"
msgid "Does it matter? No sad story can undo the things you've done."
msgstr "그래서 어쩌라는 거지? 얼마나 슬픈 일이 있었든 간에 네가 저지른 짓이 없었던 일로 되는 건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9be4f3dc-9e0e-8228-022c-9753f9be22fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:9be4f3dc-9e0e-8228-022c-9753f9be22fc
msgctxt "hd542aeccgf422g49c5g850dgb044e47c054b"
msgid "Taking Isobel was a mistake. I've come here to correct it."
msgstr "이소벨을 데려온 건 실수였어. 여기서 바로잡겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 9f3a59a1-03c7-238a-0e4b-9cd8da57ef1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Isobel_State_AtMoonrise = False
#.      - HAV_Isobel_State_IsDead = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_State_AngryAtPlayer = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:9f3a59a1-03c7-238a-0e4b-9cd8da57ef1f
msgctxt "h2f7cfae6g619dg4e07g84a4gd83a5aadaf22"
msgid "I've heard a great deal about you, True Soul."
msgstr "너에 대해 많은 얘기를 들었다, 참된 영혼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 9f5077c7-a87f-bb31-925a-1151e4916f65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:9f5077c7-a87f-bb31-925a-1151e4916f65
msgctxt "h99cc9510g75a3g48fdg94cfg415fda7ed799"
msgid ""
"The pain was unbearable. All-consuming. He decided he'd do anything for "
"reprieve."
msgstr "그 고통은 견딜 수 없는 것이었네. 모든 걸 집어삼켰지. 남자는 고통을 잊을 수만 있다면 무엇이든 하기로 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = aa01f971-ed98-4355-e344-4bc8917a8ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:aa01f971-ed98-4355-e344-4bc8917a8ec6
msgctxt "h888debc7g1386g4f66gae41g9e59f773e991"
msgid ""
"Kneel before the Absolute's altar. Throw yourself at Her mercy. Or try to "
"earn Her forgiveness by retrieving the cleric Isobel. Your choice."
msgstr ""
"절대자의 제단 앞에 무릎 꿇고, 자비를 구걸해 보게나. 아니면 클레릭 이소벨을 되찾아와서 용서를 빌어보는 것도 좋네. 선택은 자네 몫일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = ad208713-73a5-8269-c952-adf337e1eefa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:ad208713-73a5-8269-c952-adf337e1eefa
msgctxt "hf2281eb8ge2a8g4929g8809gf8203177cebf"
msgid "It is not for me to permit. You have earned this right."
msgstr "내게 허락을 구할 필요는 없네. 자네는 그럴 자격이 있으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = ad46d732-ac19-be8c-e3b8-1fa3b2c09fe7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Event_AskedToKidnapIsobel = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:ad46d732-ac19-be8c-e3b8-1fa3b2c09fe7
msgctxt "hfb98abcag73e4g4346ga884g166518c584bd"
msgid ""
"But you - you have defied Her will. You failed to take Isobel - the Selûnite "
"cleric. Indeed, True Soul, she is <i>nowhere to be found.</i>"
msgstr ""
"하지만 자네는, 절대자의 뜻을 거역했어. 이소벨, 셀루네의 클레릭을 데려오는 데 실패했지. 안 그런가, 참된 영혼이여, <i>그림자조차 "
"보이지 않잖아.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = afd6723d-28ac-2032-0a2d-b2b6110114f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:afd6723d-28ac-2032-0a2d-b2b6110114f9
msgctxt "h21c31d4eg0b8eg4148gbec1g4a23a56392e0"
msgid ""
"I'll keep her close. Aylin was her name - an angel of Selûne's own brood, "
"sent to guide and guard my line. Until she failed me."
msgstr ""
"곁에 가까이 둬야겠지. 원래 이름은 에일린이라고 하네. 셀루네의 피를 이어받은 천사로써 날 인도하고 보호하기 위해 보내졌지만, 결국엔 날 "
"져버리고 말았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = b0c0ff5d-1b28-4678-11b9-93f5a7e27472
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:b0c0ff5d-1b28-4678-11b9-93f5a7e27472
msgctxt "hdd3bcf32gc3f9g4658g9b53g951d5b6ca517"
msgid ""
"A free tongue. You've earned that much, I suppose. But I do not have to "
"explain myself."
msgstr "말에 거침이 없군. 그럴 자격은 되는 것 같긴 하다만, 굳이 내가 구구절절 설명하진 않겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b6947675-a87b-ec62-e6d5-9c5573e35d53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:b6947675-a87b-ec62-e6d5-9c5573e35d53
msgctxt "heed9a2e7g6292g4f88g9261g0b253d30b29b"
msgid "Speaking of boons - I think I've earned one of my own."
msgstr "축복하니 말인데, 나도 하나 받을 자격이 있는 것 같다만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7839a1d-00be-0667-cec7-81d811f65f69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:b7839a1d-00be-0667-cec7-81d811f65f69
msgctxt "ha1f7c17dgb183g4424gbb67gb09bfaa191f0"
msgid "I brought you the Nightsong - just as you asked."
msgstr "밤의 노래를 데려오긴 했잖아. 네가 지시한 그대로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = bca8c51b-377d-2cfa-7916-a3a69d765b74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Ketheric_State_PlayerAttacked = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:bca8c51b-377d-2cfa-7916-a3a69d765b74
msgctxt "h7e8f5349g9688g4acfgb078g3c60e8f50ddf"
msgid ""
"You've travelled a long way to make it here. Lied. Fought. Even attacked me, "
"who you ought to <i>serve.</i>"
msgstr ""
"여기까지 참 먼 길을 왔구나. 너는 거짓말하고, 대항하고, 심지어 공격하기까지 했지. 네놈이 본디 <i>섬겨야</i>하는 나에게 말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = bfa6394e-c538-71ab-45e1-5f0988f018cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_State_IsDefeated = True
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Event_AskedToKidnapIsobel = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:bfa6394e-c538-71ab-45e1-5f0988f018cf
msgctxt "h5a0cd331ga19eg4094g8115g19cbc26f943d"
msgid ""
"But you - you have defied Her will and my orders. Balthazar instructed you "
"to retrieve the Selûnite cleric, but instead you are <i>here </i>questioning "
"<i>me!</i>"
msgstr ""
"하지만 너는, 절대자의 뜻과 내 명령을 거슬렀다. 분명 발타자르가 셀루네의 클레릭을 데려오라고 지시했을 텐데, 그 대신 <i>여기서</"
"i> 심문이나 하고 있군. 감히 <i>날!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = c07be840-254a-bb87-b72d-c83ad6177f2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:c07be840-254a-bb87-b72d-c83ad6177f2c
msgctxt "hddc6499dg1dc1g4f0cgb263gc5e534b7f929"
msgid ""
"He had... everything. A wonderful wife. A brilliant daughter. They lived not "
"far from here."
msgstr "그는... 모든 것을 가졌었지. 여우 같은 아내, 토끼 같은 딸. 그들은 이 근방에서 살고 있었다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c17b1212-1bd8-96af-81a1-43f271aef4ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:c17b1212-1bd8-96af-81a1-43f271aef4ae
msgctxt "h93c468a0g34eag4d47g8a7egd3298b9fb0ea"
msgid "You brought her back once. Do it again."
msgstr "한 번 되찾아 왔는데, 두 번은 못 할까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = c38bb7e7-9770-c7da-c00a-487d7a808409
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:c38bb7e7-9770-c7da-c00a-487d7a808409
msgctxt "hb96987ccgdb56g49bcg9e90g0c4d41764bad"
msgid ""
"His wife died too young. Grief tore through their home like a thief, "
"snatching away the scent of her hair, the rustle of her skirts. But the man "
"did not break."
msgstr ""
"아내는 이른 나이에 세상을 떠났네. 비탄이 한 가정을 휩쓸고 지나갔지. 그녀의 머릿결에서 풍기던 향기와 살랑대던 치맛자락 소리마저 "
"앗아가버렸어. 그럼에도 그는 무너지지 않았다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c42cdd37-d263-7661-b4c3-2fb53797900e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:c42cdd37-d263-7661-b4c3-2fb53797900e
msgctxt "h5a4b3ed8g8f2bg446cg978cg5aed0cf6d295"
msgid "Every god you served granted you power in their way. Hardly a burden."
msgstr "네가 섬겼던 신들이 저마다 힘을 주지 않았나. 퍽이나 힘들었겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = cc467177-06f0-97b3-53f4-78b119c221e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:cc467177-06f0-97b3-53f4-78b119c221e9
msgctxt "h103aa16ag259ag4064g8f88g1d8b8adc87fe"
msgid ""
"Not only do you fail to carry out your orders, but you wish to question the "
"<i>Absolute?</i>"
msgstr "자네는 임무를 실패한 것으로 모자라서, 감히 <i>절대자에게</i> 의문까지 제기하려 드는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = d0b20e11-1506-2925-cd6e-4f038fffe8ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:d0b20e11-1506-2925-cd6e-4f038fffe8ea
msgctxt "h7c3d7f37g3284g48e9gb4a9ge00807857aab"
msgid ""
"She's being introduced to the Absolute as we speak. Soon it will be as "
"though we were never apart. You have our thanks for your part in our reunion."
msgstr "절대자와 이소벨의 대면이 끝나면 앞으로 영원히 헤어질 일은 없을 거야. 다 네 덕이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = d646c554-1245-79ba-f431-fc2180789e33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Audience_State_KethericToldToKneelAtAltar = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:d646c554-1245-79ba-f431-fc2180789e33
msgctxt "h3c36c428gca4ag4becg8873g2e51c30ba9f8"
msgid "Kneel at the altar. <i>Now.</i>"
msgstr "제단 앞에 무릎을 꿇게. <i>당장.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = db109e15-856e-2800-c033-674325b932e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:db109e15-856e-2800-c033-674325b932e7
msgctxt "h70f5a178gac71g4809ga4degaf1907ccbbf6"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr "물론일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = db9f21f6-3038-9d23-5fdc-479ec455cb6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:db9f21f6-3038-9d23-5fdc-479ec455cb6d
msgctxt "he3045ea0g6210g49e4g9c97g922dfba20e8c"
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr "잘있게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = df535962-c46c-b0cb-d63d-c2a4e05fb142
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:df535962-c46c-b0cb-d63d-c2a4e05fb142
msgctxt "hd663c88cg2c8cg45d3g8fe7g6c031c1c865e"
msgid ""
"But I know it wasn't easy for Isobel to accept how our family has changed."
msgstr "하지만 이소벨도 변한 가정 환경에 적응하는 게 마냥 쉽지는 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0f4a4a9-55ea-27ce-b3a6-1ddad31c4116
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:e0f4a4a9-55ea-27ce-b3a6-1ddad31c4116
msgctxt "h11b28e7eg60e9g41e0g85c7g3ed940e6104b"
msgid "It's subtle, but let me guess - the man is you."
msgstr "꽤 교묘했는데, 한번 맞춰볼까? 그 남자는 너야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = e56f1c16-8319-e1b9-a30e-093475ac77ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:e56f1c16-8319-e1b9-a30e-093475ac77ec
msgctxt "hb6cfc4f3g5893g4070ga128g788c18703f48"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "물론."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = e8576d91-c734-3d59-d759-6866a1544341
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:e8576d91-c734-3d59-d759-6866a1544341
msgctxt "h7139f5c3ge4fdg4554g94acg5b46924d9c40"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = effb87a1-0af9-56e3-e0fa-49baaeca7f2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:effb87a1-0af9-56e3-e0fa-49baaeca7f2f
msgctxt "h39af24fdgb541g4a4fgbdbfg1c898c5ba1fd"
msgid ""
"Then a new god came - a god who promised the man something wonderful: his "
"daughter. Her life returned. Imagine it."
msgstr "그러던 중 새로운 신께서 찾아오셨고, 남자에게 엄청난 것을 약속하셨지. 딸이 죽음에서 돌아온 모습을, 상상해 보겠나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3b429d5-47e9-715e-eb5d-b3681d6616ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:f3b429d5-47e9-715e-eb5d-b3681d6616ea
msgctxt "h556d11aeg5ea7g4217g80d1gb7e7fc6bb8de"
msgid "So Isobel was dead, and you resurrected her?"
msgstr "죽은 이소벨을 당신이 살려낸 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f7dab73a-acb9-cca4-05cc-b2901274dae9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:f7dab73a-acb9-cca4-05cc-b2901274dae9
msgctxt "h1e5d48a4g19a3g44c0ga795g9bf12c0093e4"
msgid ""
"I didn't know Isobel was your daughter, General. I submit myself to your "
"judgement."
msgstr "이소벨이 장군의 딸일 줄은 몰랐는데. 판결에 따르도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = f8540e91-1f14-9a30-6838-f61b2994b666
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:f8540e91-1f14-9a30-6838-f61b2994b666
msgctxt "h6bdc32b4g84f5g4a3fgb348gc0fd4ddb5690"
msgid "Always."
msgstr "항상."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = fa34c21b-4ef8-083e-0aab-1b14e064cdc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:fa34c21b-4ef8-083e-0aab-1b14e064cdc7
msgctxt "hd89e8d4cg5526g4212gb427g7f1c52c2d942"
msgid ""
"Until the cleric is at my side, you are nothing. And you will be nothing "
"until the Absolute cures you of the sin of your own mind."
msgstr ""
"그 클레릭을 내 앞에 데려오기 전까지, 자네는 무엇도 아닐세. 그리고 절대자께서 그 죄를 사하시기 전까지 영원히 먼지만도 못한 존재로 "
"남겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = ffbde946-d68f-d93e-5ef3-49121a420476
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Audience_State_KethericToldToKneelAtAltar = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:ffbde946-d68f-d93e-5ef3-49121a420476
msgctxt "h49892990gaf78g4e14g88eegc5afb70db486"
msgid ""
"It's time for you to learn true power. Make use of my own altar. Kneel in "
"Her name, and the Absolute will come."
msgstr "진정한 힘을 깨달을 시간일세. 내 제단을 사용하시게. 그녀의 이름 앞에 무릎을 꿇게나. 그리하면 절대자가 찾아오리니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = ffd178a0-0fd0-3143-c135-3b10e1d609a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Ketheric:ffd178a0-0fd0-3143-c135-3b10e1d609a5
msgctxt "h1277ef8fgc2c0g4377g9975g92ed61917da5"
msgid "Perhaps."
msgstr "어쩌면."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista:6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
msgctxt "h68647266ga01dg4666gbaa3g7ae6fab33ec6"
msgid "Look at that - misery as far as the eye can see."
msgstr "저것 좀 봐. 온통 참담한 광경만 눈에 들어오는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista:6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
msgctxt "hda35c941g277fg447bgb7b9gaa4ca863d34b"
msgid "Quite a view."
msgstr "꽤 멋진 경치군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista:6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
msgctxt "h8a08fa02ga552g4f04gb331gae62df952408"
msgid "Could've been beautiful. Probably was, once."
msgstr "한때는 아름다웠겠지. 언젠가 한 번은 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista:6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
msgctxt "hafdd5713g55f4g47afgb00ag8e1990b08b7c"
msgid ""
"This must have been quite the view once. Now, a mere shadow of the past."
msgstr "예전에는 제법 대단한 경치였을 거야. 이제는 오래전 사라진 그림자에 불과하지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista:6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
msgctxt "h9119ada0g0bd1g4470g8294g36375d549577"
msgid "Quite a view."
msgstr "꽤 멋진 경치네. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista:6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
msgctxt "h7d569e60gee21g4306gb7aeg51d685b847dd"
msgid ""
"Gods, to think what's become of this place. A mere shadow of its glory days."
msgstr "맙소사, 이곳에서 무슨 일이 있었던 걸까. 좋았던 옛 시절의 흔적밖에 안 남았군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_PAD_TownVista:6f97c3e1-70e6-48cc-a101-80ebbdc601ee
msgctxt "hde88d4a9g43a5g44ecg91a8g515d13033e7e"
msgid "This must have been quite a view, once."
msgstr "한때는 정말 멋진 경치였을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Susdera
#. NodeID = 248143be-36cf-2f39-08a0-24d804091bd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:248143be-36cf-2f39-08a0-24d804091bd4
msgctxt "h1a7899fcgcaf8g4e67ga6dag119c014610a5"
msgid ""
"And he has need of obedience. Serve, True Soul - if Disciple Z'rell deems "
"you worthy, you will ascend."
msgstr "장군님께선 복종을 원하신다. 섬겨라, 참된 영혼. 신봉자 즈렐에게 자격을 인정받으면, 그땐 올라갈 수 있을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Susdera
#. NodeID = 29190a57-9b8e-91e4-516f-eeb39b6b9460
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Audience_HasMet_TrespassRoofCultist(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:29190a57-9b8e-91e4-516f-eeb39b6b9460
msgctxt "h5a1f2b7dg2428g4480gb26bgb4d22e774a42"
msgid "You have already been told."
msgstr "이미 말했을 터인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Susdera
#. NodeID = 2cca31cf-4f54-f804-b2f1-8e7561cdd12a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:2cca31cf-4f54-f804-b2f1-8e7561cdd12a
msgctxt "h18b4e175gaa48g40d4g82cdg03c75b5052a5"
msgid ""
"Well. You will not be the first True Soul the General has thrown from this "
"spot."
msgstr "그러던지. 네가 장군님이 이 곳에서 떨궈버린 첫 참된 영혼이 아니라는 것은 알아둬라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Susdera
#. NodeID = 35257ccd-ed5b-0e85-ccba-1eb98388c698
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Audience_HasMet_TrespassRoofCultist(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:35257ccd-ed5b-0e85-ccba-1eb98388c698
msgctxt "hc50de625ge085g42acgb684ge64167f533b2"
msgid "I received no word that a True Soul is to ascend."
msgstr "참된 영혼이 승천하러 오리라는 연락은 받지 못했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4aa6761b-0421-3b67-4ced-c729aea9dfb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:4aa6761b-0421-3b67-4ced-c729aea9dfb0
msgctxt "hbbba6d07g8e57g42d1gb557g04bd6aa15069"
msgid "Do not come between a True Soul and the Absolute."
msgstr "참된 영혼과 절대자님 사이에 끼여들지 말아라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Susdera
#. NodeID = 5cc992cc-b85f-94ce-bf8b-fdc28557aa33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Audience_HasMet_RoofCultist(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Audience_State_GrantedPermission = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:5cc992cc-b85f-94ce-bf8b-fdc28557aa33
msgctxt "hf5f923a1ga664g4fcag9bf5gbc1268af1953"
msgid ""
"Heed the General's word. He is not only Her champion, but one of Her "
"prophets as well."
msgstr "장군님의 말에 귀를 기울여라. 절대자님에게 선택받은 용사일 뿐만 아니라, 선지자이기도 하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Susdera
#. NodeID = 6e46c7b3-355f-eccd-f06a-9c7f6466769f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:6e46c7b3-355f-eccd-f06a-9c7f6466769f
msgctxt "h50da930age189g424bg92d9g050ec9e02111"
msgid "In Her name, Her design."
msgstr "그분의 이름으로, 그분의 계획대로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e6f8251-4ef4-ed01-e868-9463acbec2f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:6e6f8251-4ef4-ed01-e868-9463acbec2f5
msgctxt "h0bb1fd26gee9bg4f28g9c3dgebd2420c0982"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Susdera
#. NodeID = 70125e9c-b4f2-4b43-a506-5c5c57be3abe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:70125e9c-b4f2-4b43-a506-5c5c57be3abe
msgctxt "h65d6b1cdgbbd6g44c9ga432g45fbaac361a4"
msgid ""
"You will turn around. Should the General learn you breached his private "
"chapel, he will not be so merciful."
msgstr "당장 뒤돌아가라. 장군님이 네가 신성한 제단에 잠입했다는 걸 알면 이리 조용히 끝나진 않을 게다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Susdera
#. NodeID = 9f045ff7-df79-5626-1cb7-b0a1aec5c719
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:9f045ff7-df79-5626-1cb7-b0a1aec5c719
msgctxt "h0ba29afdg114eg49cbgaaa1g62c26dba543a"
msgid ""
"Do you think yourself so important, True Soul? Until Z'rell says otherwise, "
"you are beneath the Absolute's notice."
msgstr "네가 뭐라도 되는 줄 아느냐, 참된 영혼? 즈렐이 그렇다 할때까지 넌 절대자님께 아무 것도 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Susdera
#. NodeID = a18d3992-ef44-45e3-8090-91bcd795224a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Audience_State_GrantedPermission = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Audience_HasMet_RoofCultist(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:a18d3992-ef44-45e3-8090-91bcd795224a
msgctxt "h96129109g4ab4g4ca4gae60g58c2da9eec55"
msgid ""
"The Absolute bids you step forward, True Soul. She is so very close to us "
"here."
msgstr "절대자님께서 네가 나서는 걸 허락하셨다, 참된 영혼. 아주 가까이서 기다리고 계시다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Susdera
#. NodeID = b4d533c2-8937-676d-1bf4-d38b3d78b785
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Audience_State_InvitedToKneel = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:b4d533c2-8937-676d-1bf4-d38b3d78b785
msgctxt "h2e32948fg52bdg4924gaf83g42a3019c4255"
msgid "Kneel at the altar, True Soul. Kneel and rise anew."
msgstr "제단에 무릎을 꿇어라, 참된 영혼. 복종하고 다시 태어나는 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c85b64b5-fd17-dfbb-e2be-a59b8ce1dbf3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:c85b64b5-fd17-dfbb-e2be-a59b8ce1dbf3
msgctxt "hac22cb0cgc7a4g4fcfga504g160045daae38"
msgid "I need to speak to the General."
msgstr "장군님과 할 이야기가 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dbf6326a-c06b-799a-5ad7-361f8031b407
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofCultist:dbf6326a-c06b-799a-5ad7-361f8031b407
msgctxt "h9c8ffe46g8ae0g4fb8g8cdbg7312bfd81698"
msgid "I go where I wish."
msgstr "난 내가 가고 싶은 데로 간다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 338f33b5-d8ee-4050-9d46-00cb83a871ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Audience_Event_RoofTransgression = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression:338f33b5-d8ee-4050-9d46-00cb83a871ec
msgctxt "h81849e80g947bg4f0bg8406g5ff3e1300bf3"
msgid "Curious. I believe you were told to <i>wait.</i>"
msgstr "의아할 지경이군. 분명 <i>기다리라는</i> 지시를 받았을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 88ae9ebd-67ba-02bf-36e4-0448b60b8ebf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression:88ae9ebd-67ba-02bf-36e4-0448b60b8ebf
msgctxt "ha427c562g79b6g43cbg8c7fgce9279d628e7"
msgid "You <i>needed </i>to heed the instructions you were given."
msgstr "아니, 네놈은 하달된 지시 사항에 귀를 <i>기울였어야만</i> 했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 91423b40-4bd9-fdce-8527-81c65df7c3a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression:91423b40-4bd9-fdce-8527-81c65df7c3a8
msgctxt "hd775d31bg5b6cg4375g8277g20ac2f645f12"
msgid "Tsk. Smiting a fool is never as satisfying as one hopes it will be."
msgstr "하. 머저리를 멸하는 게 늘 그렇지만, 기대만큼 만족스러운 일은 아닌데 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e59d68f-0e97-149e-b47d-516a1bd64dd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression:9e59d68f-0e97-149e-b47d-516a1bd64dd0
msgctxt "hff2370b0g6860g4742g85d1gd03948f0ee68"
msgid "My apologies, General. Please forgive my intrusion."
msgstr "죄송합니다, 장군님. 부디 무례를 용서해 주십시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0f22d41-a5a3-5f16-abc4-096b05f3b41e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression:c0f22d41-a5a3-5f16-abc4-096b05f3b41e
msgctxt "h0e69bf7fg7e79g4aedga602g7eb40551fcea"
msgid "Ketheric Thorm, prepare to meet your maker."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨, 이제 죽을 시간이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = d0f28103-7380-d735-7f56-2b0f9d8498c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression:d0f28103-7380-d735-7f56-2b0f9d8498c0
msgctxt "hf7689b78ga534g486dgb517g033503e08508"
msgid "It is for me to punish them."
msgstr "나는 그저 응징할 뿐이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = dd34b623-01f7-4843-d5cc-3e0b824e5a01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression:dd34b623-01f7-4843-d5cc-3e0b824e5a01
msgctxt "hfa65a212geaccg47e2g830eg7ca2bf1d94d1"
msgid ""
"It isn't for me to <i>forgive </i>one who so flouts the Absolute's will."
msgstr "절대자님의 의지를 거스른 자를 <i>용서 </i>하고 말고는 내 소관이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = e8faa158-d7f0-6840-5685-751aa7592aee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression:e8faa158-d7f0-6840-5685-751aa7592aee
msgctxt "h615f246ag9613g46e2g9f65g6bac75817fe2"
msgid "A soldier who cannot follow orders is of no use to me. Goodbye."
msgstr "명령 하나 제대로 이행하지 못하는 병사는 필요없다. 잘 가라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f86120d5-84b3-d72d-4b4a-dde4daa950eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_RoofTransgression:f86120d5-84b3-d72d-4b4a-dde4daa950eb
msgctxt "h486cd828gcf88g4a1eg930dg2b60b6d9c2e2"
msgid "I need an audience with you."
msgstr "꼭 직접 알현해야만 했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Skeletons
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 77a09f26-0f87-265c-d5f1-3ff6ee1365c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Audience_Skeletons_SpokeOnce(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Audience_Skeletons_SpokeTwice(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Skeletons:77a09f26-0f87-265c-d5f1-3ff6ee1365c1
msgctxt "h0bf18fb7g0f8cg47dbga576g1148c9986ae3"
msgid ""
"*You think you hear a whisper - but perhaps it was just wind draughting "
"through a dull and empty thing.*"
msgstr "*속삭이는 소리가 들린 것 같습니다만, 어쩌면 그저 바람이 텅 비고 흐릿한 구멍을 지나가는 소리였을지도 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Skeletons
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 83fb9ee0-2584-4fe0-bf41-fa0dc08e5862
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Audience_Skeletons_SpokeOnce(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Skeletons:83fb9ee0-2584-4fe0-bf41-fa0dc08e5862
msgctxt "h99a4c7bbg4548g42efg8e8cgc48c35019f30"
msgid ""
"*Wide gaping sockets that see nothing - and still they seem to watch you.*"
msgstr "*넓게 벌어진 구멍은 아무 것도 보지 않습니다, 하지만 당신을 지켜보는 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Skeletons
#. Speaker = Necromite
#. NodeID = bc4d520f-9595-16c0-81f6-ad4b7c8c9f57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Audience_Skeletons_SpokeTwice(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_Skeletons:bc4d520f-9595-16c0-81f6-ad4b7c8c9f57
msgctxt "h64f025c5g4fc6g4e4ega7e4g2966e6a58d10"
msgid "*Creak.*"
msgstr "*삐걱.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_WaitingKetheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 0beaef8b-ffd8-c4c7-4773-a7aa31386e30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Audience_HasMet_WaitingKetheric(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_WaitingKetheric:0beaef8b-ffd8-c4c7-4773-a7aa31386e30
msgctxt "hf8123149gf4bcg420fg9ff7gea7cf2e310fd"
msgid ""
"You've come here for a reason. See it through. Kneel at the altar. The "
"Absolute will answer."
msgstr "여기까지 온 이유가 있지 않느냐. 끝을 봐야겠지. 제단에 무릎을 꿇어라. 절대자께서 응답하실 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_WaitingKetheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 3e6e5be8-5c30-9a18-0ee9-5d937be11dfd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Isobel_State_IsDead = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Audience_HasMet_WaitingKetheric(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_WaitingKetheric:3e6e5be8-5c30-9a18-0ee9-5d937be11dfd
msgctxt "hc95ffb81g0359g4502gbd16gbfdcf94ea8fb"
msgid "It's time to finish what you started. Kneel at the altar."
msgstr "네가 시작한 일에 종지부를 찍을 시간이다. 제단에 무릎을 꿇어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_WaitingKetheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 4f29e388-443f-7538-1488-27568705c60a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Audience_HasMet_WaitingKetheric(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Isobel_State_IsDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_WaitingKetheric:4f29e388-443f-7538-1488-27568705c60a
msgctxt "h323ec962g5ef7g497ega9c5g466dec338522"
msgid "The Absolute is waiting."
msgstr "절대자께서 기다리신다. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_WaitingKetheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 7580dd33-c094-48bd-3dd6-1be6eab0ea4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Audience_HasMet_WaitingKetheric(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_WaitingKetheric:7580dd33-c094-48bd-3dd6-1be6eab0ea4f
msgctxt "h182a9bcag678bg4a89ga799gd645c52c4b49"
msgid "It's too late to change your mind now, True Soul."
msgstr "이제 와서 마음을 바꾸기엔 이미 늦었다, 참된 영혼. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_WaitingKetheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 7d87ec34-dbf1-2d79-a25e-4a98596323df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Audience_HasMet_WaitingKetheric(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_State_IsobelTakenAway = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_WaitingKetheric:7d87ec34-dbf1-2d79-a25e-4a98596323df
msgctxt "h6a66a146gfc1bg4d2bg9534gcfdbcdd8d1f4"
msgid "Don't hesitate, True Soul. You deserve to meet her."
msgstr "지체하지 마라, 참된 영혼. 넌 그분을 만날 자격이 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_WaitingKetheric
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = a22eabff-6c07-569b-c33e-1dfbd9f7e45b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_State_IsobelTakenAway = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Audience_HasMet_WaitingKetheric(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Audience_WaitingKetheric:a22eabff-6c07-569b-c33e-1dfbd9f7e45b
msgctxt "h5fc8231cg250dg4a01g9e89g508d78c5819d"
msgid ""
"Kneel at the altar. The Absolute is waiting. And Her gifts are very, very "
"real."
msgstr "제단에 무릎을 꿇어라. 절대자께서 기다리신다. 그분이 내리는 선물은 결코 허상이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 01d4adc3-1135-a86d-5d0d-1f6197999c24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:01d4adc3-1135-a86d-5d0d-1f6197999c24
msgctxt "h3ce05435gbdc9g4867g94e0g3b5eed83cfa2"
msgid ""
"*For the briefest moment, you feel the touch of a reassuring hand on your "
"shoulder. Mystra has noted your service.*"
msgstr "*짧은 순간이었지만 어깨를 다독이는 듯한 손길이 느껴졌습니다. 미스트라가 당신의 노고를 치하했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0e76679f-1781-46c4-7042-26ce787bd81a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:0e76679f-1781-46c4-7042-26ce787bd81a
msgctxt "h79b44cfcge566g4012g9e7eg4c5173832009"
msgid "I'll find my own way of destroying the circle."
msgstr "마법진을 파괴할 나만의 방법을 찾겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 16656583-31ea-26b2-8028-7a16831e6e14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:16656583-31ea-26b2-8028-7a16831e6e14
msgctxt "he06a7d87g014bg4e08g9053g1a025b79220f"
msgid ""
"Well, it wasn't in his published archives - it was merely a sketch. He "
"invoked Mystra's guidance on how to complete it."
msgstr "뭐, 출판물에는 없었으니까. 그저 밑그림이었어. 그 사람은 완성하는 방법을 두고 미스트라가 인도해 주길 호소했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 18bb3d8c-0277-c8c2-5411-c11e9c01287d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:18bb3d8c-0277-c8c2-5411-c11e9c01287d
msgctxt "h69dc6b0eg25bcg4546gaf2fgfb2ab7cf0b34"
msgid ""
"*It doesn't take much. The sigils fade, the circle's tainted magic "
"dissolving harmlessly into the ether.*"
msgstr "*오래 걸리진 않았습니다. 표식이 없어지자 마법진에 깃든 부패한 마법은 먼지가 되어 사라졌습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1df33dd2-dba3-2245-4bc1-bc9fb9522873
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:1df33dd2-dba3-2245-4bc1-bc9fb9522873
msgctxt "h0a7c3768g75cbg4465ga055ge97d2f12ee6e"
msgid "Is it dangerous?"
msgstr "위험한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2111e532-6c92-7bb4-57fd-76012cdc6d8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_BalthazarLab_State_IngredientsGone = True
#.      - ORI_BalthazarLab_Circle_State_PassedCheck = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:2111e532-6c92-7bb4-57fd-76012cdc6d8a
msgctxt "h7f1b29f7g70d3g442bgac58g83f9088ed101"
msgid "<i>Craft the Shadow Lantern.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그림자등불을 만든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 25d9e824-9f90-6ecf-f7df-3a62ad5e1570
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:25d9e824-9f90-6ecf-f7df-3a62ad5e1570
msgctxt "h434b4d56gdb40g49d1ga9fbgf694e2774110"
msgid ""
"I'd advise against it - in your case, at least. No disrespect intended, but "
"this is not your typical magic."
msgstr "나라면 그러지 말라고 충고하겠어. 일단 네가 사용한다면 말이야. 폄하할 생각은 없지만, 이건 네가 쓰는 평범한 마법이 아냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27aeb2da-b650-64e0-88ed-209f50987542
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:27aeb2da-b650-64e0-88ed-209f50987542
msgctxt "hdc2e9800gdb2dg4379g91b2gf80251c291a9"
msgid "<i>Destroy the ritual circle yourself.</i>"
msgstr "<i>스스로 의식 마법진을 파괴한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2bb84c98-01cc-2eb5-9079-493e3bae100d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:2bb84c98-01cc-2eb5-9079-493e3bae100d
msgctxt "h44a57a26g43c5g4a84gac59g052da1e1cfb1"
msgid "It's your choice Gale. Whatever you want to do."
msgstr "네 선택이야 게일. 원하는 걸 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3023d363-b46e-7d3e-b262-44a3966b9021
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:3023d363-b46e-7d3e-b262-44a3966b9021
msgctxt "h498bc94bg05a1g4fe0gb946g8e09dd1d139c"
msgid "Let me deal with the circle."
msgstr "내가 이 마법진을 처리할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 3351685c-f2c0-fc4f-5fad-1b592b883830
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_BalthazarLab_Circle_State_Ruined = True
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Gale_State_BalthazarCircleUserWaitingForReaction(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:3351685c-f2c0-fc4f-5fad-1b592b883830
msgctxt "h4d4bb571g5c23g4f94g8be3g93988143418a"
msgid "Go ahead, then. Do your worst."
msgstr "그래 그럼. 멋대로 해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 35280424-b056-007f-7c07-9a740f56791e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:35280424-b056-007f-7c07-9a740f56791e
msgctxt "h6bb0fce1g9ddag4367gb1eeg81c569c8056a"
msgid ""
"Yes, I think I'd be able to craft one more lantern. And with a slight "
"modification of the casting gesture, it might be able to <i>wield </i>the "
"shadows instead of repelling them..."
msgstr ""
"그래, 내가 등불 하나를 더 만들 수 있겠어. 주문 동작을 조금만 수정하면, 그림자를 쫓는 대신 <i>휘두를</i> 수 있을지도 "
"모르지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 381ed7f6-ecaf-567e-de4f-9cb2a67b6f5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_BalthazarLab_Circle_State_Ruined = True
#.   Object:
#.     - ORI_Gale_Event_DestroyBalthazarCircle(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:381ed7f6-ecaf-567e-de4f-9cb2a67b6f5f
msgctxt "h63f14a60g4c7cg408ag9249g067a12b7fa12"
msgid "Not bad for a wizard who slept through his Calishite lessons, eh?"
msgstr "칼림샨어 수업에서 졸던 위저드 치고는 나쁘지 않았지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3c84fdd4-10bd-d8bd-dab8-43f18fc0588c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:3c84fdd4-10bd-d8bd-dab8-43f18fc0588c
msgctxt "h34685944g0034g47abg99b6g952c2dbcff50"
msgid ""
"*It doesn't take much. The sigils fade, the circle's tainted magic "
"dissolving harmlessly into the ether.*"
msgstr "*오래 걸리진 않았습니다. 표식이 없어지자 마법진에 깃든 부패한 마법은 먼지가 되어 사라졌습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e06a511-c226-5828-0e64-91ca458f6a76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 30
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_BalthazarLab_State_IngredientsGone = False
#.      - ORI_BalthazarLab_Circle_State_PassedCheck = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = False
#.      - WIZARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:3e06a511-c226-5828-0e64-91ca458f6a76
msgctxt "hebc352ecg40feg4f4ag87e7gc11bca0bf9c2"
msgid ""
"<i>Attempt to use the ritual circle yourself. Pick up the ingredients and "
"craft the shadow lantern.</i>"
msgstr "<i>의식 마법진을 직접 사용하려 시도한다. 재료를 집어 들고 그림자 등불을 만든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3edb3e78-45ac-6d79-f529-c03977003634
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ORI_GALE_MYSTRABLESSED(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:3edb3e78-45ac-6d79-f529-c03977003634
msgctxt "h52c56ec4g2750g4b51gbfacgadf6ba4a258d"
msgid ""
"*For a moment, you feel a cold hand on your shoulder. Then, an absence. "
"Mystra's blessing has been withdrawn, as has her approval. But the "
"lantern... that is yours to command.*"
msgstr ""
"*잠시 동안, 당신은 어깨에 차가운 손을 느낍니다. 그 직후, 부재를 느낍니다. 미스트라의 축복이 거둬지며, 호감도 그 뒤를 따릅니다. "
"하지만 등불은...이제 당신 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 3fc5d729-e8f5-1f5f-28c7-9e6e0cc3ad2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:3fc5d729-e8f5-1f5f-28c7-9e6e0cc3ad2f
msgctxt "h508bd5efgb157g4846ga61dgedd324a5822b"
msgid ""
"Oh, charming. I hope the Shadow Weave was to blame for that little outburst "
"of unwarranted discourtesy."
msgstr "오, 매력적이기도 해라. 제발 그 부당한 무례함이 그림자 위브 탓이길 빌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 438d10cb-ce5d-c7e4-5d08-750b1461fa50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 30
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Gale_BalthazarLab_State_IngredientsGone = False
#.      - ORI_BalthazarLab_Circle_State_PassedCheck = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:438d10cb-ce5d-c7e4-5d08-750b1461fa50
msgctxt "h863599e7g7949g4f01ga2dcgc93a7daf8a85"
msgid ""
"<i>Pick up the ingredients and attempt to craft the shadow lantern "
"yourself.</i>"
msgstr "<i>재료를 집어 들고 직접 그림자 등불을 만들어 본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 48f8b537-1800-c11d-a1ab-34dc314549fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:48f8b537-1800-c11d-a1ab-34dc314549fb
msgctxt "h9fbee8c7g2dbag46a5g9cd0g6605cfb1829c"
msgid ""
"Or did you wish to use it? I assure you - it's pointless. You'll have "
"nothing more than a sore head and a very dissatisfied wizard to show for it."
msgstr ""
"아니면 그걸 사용하고 싶었어? 내 장담컨대, 아무 소용 없을 거야. 뭘 얻기는커녕 매우 불만 가득하고 머리 아픈 위저드 한 명만 만들고 "
"말 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e20b9f9-c14b-272c-4935-7165e4470dd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle:4e20b9f9-c14b-272c-4935-7165e4470dd4
msgctxt "h33098d8ag8022g4792g81e2g28f861d4b453"
msgid ""
"I know of the Weavepasha - you speak of <i>Acham el Jhotos</i>. But I don't "
"recall seeing anything like this in his works..."
msgstr "나는 위브파샤를 알아. <i>아캄 엘 조토스</i> 이야기겠지. 하지만 그 사람이 한 일 중에 이런 건 전혀 기억에 없는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarLab_Circle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4eb508af-3c7b-639c-79cb-9d513de313d1
