#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:48c5d815-2f94-4e66-b930-05f1a96c8061
msgctxt "h87d2ab74g97beg416fg8f03g2308e7a11ba6"
msgid ""
"This 'Nightsong' sounds like the source of Ketheric Thorm's invulnerability."
msgstr "이 '밤의 노래'란 게 케서릭 쏨 무적의 원천인 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48c5d815-2f94-4e66-b930-05f1a96c8061
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_4 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:48c5d815-2f94-4e66-b930-05f1a96c8061
msgctxt "h6c65f192g995eg4abbga67dg419ac948ada2"
msgid "Ketheric's power must stem from the Nightsong."
msgstr "케서릭의 힘은 밤의 노래로부터 뻗어나오는 게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48c5d815-2f94-4e66-b930-05f1a96c8061
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_4 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:48c5d815-2f94-4e66-b930-05f1a96c8061
msgctxt "h0a7e1d38g16beg4434g8d8eg23f68cb03cd9"
msgid "So the Nightsong is the key to taking Ketheric down."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 케서릭을 쓰러뜨릴 열쇠로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48c5d815-2f94-4e66-b930-05f1a96c8061
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_4 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:48c5d815-2f94-4e66-b930-05f1a96c8061
msgctxt "ha08de0e1g4897g4c4cg846cg945ca3508edb"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong sounds like the source of Ketheric Thorm's invulnerability."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 케서릭 쏨의 무적의 원천인 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48c5d815-2f94-4e66-b930-05f1a96c8061
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_4 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:48c5d815-2f94-4e66-b930-05f1a96c8061
msgctxt "hf1025d3ag18c2g4100gbda1g18e3a93d0811"
msgid "This Nightsong sounds like the source of Ketheric's immortality."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 케서릭의 불멸의 원천인 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
msgctxt "ha546b315g8128g448cgb797g92e1aa36f8ef"
msgid "Curious name. It sounds more like a bird than a font of power."
msgstr "묘한 이름이군. 힘의 원천보다는 새처럼 들리는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
msgctxt "he234c4e8g6348g436bga8f7g6cf404159638"
msgid ""
"An evocative name. More suited to poetry than the Absolute's perversions."
msgstr "영감을 불러일으키는 이름이군. 절대자의 비뚤어진 집착보다는 시구절에 더 어울리겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
msgctxt "h870010d2g6aebg4a20ga4b7g18e89d123765"
msgid ""
"'Nightsong'. An appropriate name for an owl, perhaps - but not for a cult "
"artefact."
msgstr "'밤의 노래'라. 부엉이 이름이라면 또 모르겠지만, 교단 유물 이름으로는 안 어울리는군.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
msgctxt "h71888928g6fe2g4672g9951g36e739f30602"
msgid "'Nightsong.' A tender name for a cultist artefact."
msgstr "'밤의 노래'라. 교단 유물 치고는 간지러운 이름이군.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
msgctxt "h658d8ebbgfe2fg4146g97f7gc5e63232859d"
msgid ""
"That name... not the first thing you'd think to call an artefact of the "
"Absolute."
msgstr "그 이름... 처음 들어서는 단박에 절대자의 유물이라고 생각하기 쉽지 않겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
msgctxt "h0c91524bg7862g49b0g9db5gdcbe6817b1a1"
msgid "Nice name. Wonder if it's a music box or something."
msgstr ""
"이름 멋진데. 혹시 뮤직 박스 같은 건지 궁금하네.\n"
"\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
msgctxt "hd154972fgc81eg4f54gb938g83338eea70e9"
msgid "The very same Nightsong that Aradin once sought. What could it be?"
msgstr "아라딘이 그렇게 찾아 헤매던 그 밤의 노래로군. 대체 정체가 뭘까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:57172e51-1f90-48fe-b9f0-b179d0d77933
msgctxt "hf2bb4579g1366g4962gaefag5b311db5ce19"
msgid "'Nightsong' - not exactly a name I'd associate with the Absolute."
msgstr ""
"'밤의 노래'라. 절대자와 연관이 있으리라고는 쉽사리 떠올리지 못할 이름이야.\n"
"\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 783cf46b-7634-4020-a024-4612b6627b00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:783cf46b-7634-4020-a024-4612b6627b00
msgctxt "habc3c3degf456g45f4g87b6ge43aab0c1a22"
msgid ""
"So, the Nightsong is key to Ketheric's power. If we can find it, perhaps we "
"can use it against him."
msgstr "그러니까, 밤의 노래가 케서릭의 힘으로 통하는 열쇠로군. 그걸 찾는다면, 놈에게 역으로 사용할 수도 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 783cf46b-7634-4020-a024-4612b6627b00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:783cf46b-7634-4020-a024-4612b6627b00
msgctxt "h1840c017gbae4g4dacg9f5ege242b8322361"
msgid ""
"So, the 'Nightsong' is the source of Ketheric's invulnerability. Perhaps its "
"powers could be turned against him."
msgstr "그러니까, '밤의 노래'가 케서릭의 무적의 원천이라는 거군. 그 힘을 놈에게 역으로 사용할 수도 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 783cf46b-7634-4020-a024-4612b6627b00
