msgctxt "h9c51c479gaee5g4485gb4d9g44d607be24fd"
msgid ""
"This 'Nightsong' must be the source of Ketheric Thorm's invulnerability. But "
"perhaps it could be turned against him."
msgstr "이 '밤의 노래'가 케서릭 쏨의 무적의 원천이구나. 하지만 놈에게 역으로 사용할 수 있을지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 783cf46b-7634-4020-a024-4612b6627b00
