msgctxt "h54bfdbdegd06fg4098ga020g73edf3471a79"
msgid ""
"Assuming we can find it. Anything that powerful <i>will</i> be protected."
msgstr "그걸 찾을 수 있다면 말이지. 그렇게 강력한 거라면 <i>분명</i> 보호받고 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
