msgctxt "h2eaaefe3gfe98g4f0ag82a6g531da8121155"
msgid "Might be possible to turn it against him - or destroy it."
msgstr "놈에게 역으로 사용할 수 있을지도 몰라, 아니면 부숴버리든지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f0041212-b2c6-497f-aa60-19bacc5d378b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:f0041212-b2c6-497f-aa60-19bacc5d378b
msgctxt "h390cb408gaa50g4cdfgaf42g730ec97648b4"
msgid "Perhaps there is a way to turn its power against Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr "그 힘을 케서릭 쏨에게 역으로 사용할 방법이 있을지도 모르네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f0041212-b2c6-497f-aa60-19bacc5d378b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_PAD_NightsongInfo:f0041212-b2c6-497f-aa60-19bacc5d378b
msgctxt "h4dbc364ag1f8bg4872g969ag8d5d59d65f6f"
msgid "If we find it, maybe we can turn it against him?"
msgstr "이걸 찾아내면, 케서릭에게 역으로 사용할 수 있을지도?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BazEntranceGuard_002
#. Speaker = Zealot Brinn
#. NodeID = 91917bdc-529b-aaf2-b037-2745ed71d910
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BazEntranceGuard_002:91917bdc-529b-aaf2-b037-2745ed71d910
msgctxt "h76f18a8agd9acg4adegb37bg3831d2c51b87"
msgid "In Her name, Her Design."
msgstr "그 분의 이름으로, 그 분의 계획대로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BazEntranceGuard_002
#. Speaker = Zealot Brinn
#. NodeID = ae0c1c4b-481f-83c3-f2e9-609736d35e61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Bazaar_HasMet_BazEntranceGuard002(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Bazaar_HasMet_BazEntranceGuard002(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_BazEntranceGuard_002:ae0c1c4b-481f-83c3-f2e9-609736d35e61
msgctxt "h1e61476dg5945g4301ga376g0c63cdde54ea"
msgid ""
"Welcome, True Soul. The Disciple will have work for you, I expect. So much "
"to be done."
msgstr "환영한다, 참된 영혼. 신봉자가 네게 일을 줄 거야. 해야 할 일이 많거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Bazaar_AD_BazEntranceGuard_002
#. Speaker = Zealot Brinn
#. NodeID = 81deedc4-8af3-4446-819d-c155408b6224
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Bazaar_AD_BazEntranceGuard_002:81deedc4-8af3-4446-819d-c155408b6224
msgctxt "ha17aaf5eg9042g4368ga299gef3ed53e4443"
msgid ""
"Another True Soul. The Disciple will want to see you - through the main "
"doors."
msgstr "참된 영혼이시로군요. 신봉자께 가서 보고하십시오. 저기 정문을 지나면 됩니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Bazaar_AD_BugbearThrow
#. Speaker = Lann Tarv
#. NodeID = 5f721b1c-1bcc-47ab-88f4-7703b0bd730e
