msgid "That's for your superiors to know."
msgstr "그건 네 상급자에게 말할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Zealot Malik
#. NodeID = 29417bea-dd73-36a8-b9e6-5b39e404b764
