msgid "Find out for yourself. I think you're just in time for the show."
msgstr "네가 직접 두 눈으로 확인해라. 마침 딱 알맞게 도착한 것 같으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Docks_Checkpoint
