msgctxt "hbfbcd46bg9036g4bacgb485g6eae5e2cd594"
msgid "Drink?"
msgstr "한 잔 할까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_GoingForBreak
#. Speaker = Warrior Gronag
#. NodeID = 6cc2080b-df82-4a69-96f2-e62d45bf4f2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_GoingForBreak:6cc2080b-df82-4a69-96f2-e62d45bf4f2a
msgctxt "hf054fa11g900cg4a21ga491g40137a31aaac"
msgid "You and all."
msgstr "내가 할 소린데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_GoingForBreak
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Lora
#. NodeID = e97adede-f2b6-41f7-87e1-08430ad48c3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_GoingForBreak:e97adede-f2b6-41f7-87e1-08430ad48c3c
msgctxt "h75178ff5g0f19g4ca7ga5d3ge09154a4c546"
msgid "Ah. You survived this run."
msgstr "뭐야. 너도 살아남았구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak
#. Speaker = Warrior Gronag
#. NodeID = 134ec8e1-d53c-4941-8862-a02fa58143c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak:134ec8e1-d53c-4941-8862-a02fa58143c0
msgctxt "h7edfd56egdb15g460eg88a6g9ff8f67af941"
msgid "General's a great thinker, I hear. I suppose he's strategising."
msgstr "장군님은 대단한 책략가라고 들었어. 아마 전략을 짜고 계시겠지.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Lora
#. NodeID = 1c1e2a93-0556-4e3c-97b3-13cdebbcdb41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 8174b256-e8f2-dacc-e365-615f1ee79db5_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 8174b256-e8f2-dacc-e365-615f1ee79db5_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak:1c1e2a93-0556-4e3c-97b3-13cdebbcdb41
msgctxt "he8ef9533g3300g485fgafb2g049673e0fd2a"
msgid "Ain't they gonna let us inside?"
msgstr "우릴 안으로 들여보내주지 않으려나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Lora
#. NodeID = 3356dde3-a09b-4828-a397-7b4cd3cf6d0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak:3356dde3-a09b-4828-a397-7b4cd3cf6d0f
msgctxt "h9d0f6732g0b97g47d2ga3ccgd2744eaa4f86"
msgid "I think Vez is pretty..."
msgstr "베즈도 예쁘긴 해..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak
#. Speaker = Brawler Vez
#. NodeID = 65cc3558-f4be-4798-ac57-5980d1328784
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 8174b256-e8f2-dacc-e365-615f1ee79db5_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak:65cc3558-f4be-4798-ac57-5980d1328784
msgctxt "ha41e8a70ge05bg41e6g8617g983740306183"
msgid "Cheers to seeing the back of that leggy creep."
msgstr "건배나 할까. 다리 긴 괴물 더 안봐도 되니 좋잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak
#. Speaker = Warrior Gronag
#. NodeID = 71972c43-ff1d-4820-ae77-219a6aa47257
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak:71972c43-ff1d-4820-ae77-219a6aa47257
msgctxt "h1e300d81g8ed8g4321g81c0g57e205a6d646"
msgid "Or the shadows might take you instead, Vez."
msgstr "반대로 그림자가 널 집어삼킬지도 몰라, 베즈."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak
#. Speaker = Brawler Vez
#. NodeID = 7e9577bc-21ed-4342-bea5-0213f6c85486
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak:7e9577bc-21ed-4342-bea5-0213f6c85486
msgctxt "h9236345bgd3c2g471fg8045g226f9a509436"
msgid ""
"Bugger that. Too much bowing and scraping. I'll happily take the shadows "
"instead."
msgstr "안에 들어가긴 개뿔. 비굴하게 조아리고 굽실대느니, 차라리 그림자를 집어삼키고 말지.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak
#. Speaker = Brawler Vez
#. NodeID = 93d0df9e-d71c-44bf-b468-652753b403cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 8174b256-e8f2-dacc-e365-615f1ee79db5_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 8174b256-e8f2-dacc-e365-615f1ee79db5_B = False
#.     - 8174b256-e8f2-dacc-e365-615f1ee79db5_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak:93d0df9e-d71c-44bf-b468-652753b403cd
msgctxt "h4d2d636agc0bdg4fd4gb3dag28b11c2c2e4e"
msgid ""
"Bah. Why we all still waiting around, anyway? City ain't gonna sack itself."
msgstr "젠장. 왜 아직도 여기서 미적거리고 있는 거야? 도시가 저절로 굴러떨어지는 것도 아니고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak
#. Speaker = Sharp-Eye Lora
#. NodeID = b42d8280-a82e-47df-ad10-78e4553cb1ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak:b42d8280-a82e-47df-ad10-78e4553cb1ec
msgctxt "hf4ccc308gbcc7g4dfeg96bag4631084930c9"
msgid "Don't go thinkin' we're rid of the drider yet."
msgstr "드라이더가 아예 없어진 건 아니니까 설레발 좀 치지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak
#. Speaker = Brawler Vez
#. NodeID = c9ee38fe-6be5-4085-9ea9-5f563230ae57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak:c9ee38fe-6be5-4085-9ea9-5f563230ae57
msgctxt "h46ec3ed1gbeefg42e1g9c68g9c02a18cf408"
msgid ""
"War-chiefs don't plan. Either our god is stronger than all the others, or "
"She <i>ain't.\n"
"</i>"
msgstr "진정한 전쟁 군주는 계획 따위 세우지 않아. 우리 신이 다른 모든 신들보다 강한게 <i>아니라면</i> 모를까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak
#. Speaker = Warrior Gronag
#. NodeID = daf99827-1445-46cd-a3a0-e90409c510fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak:daf99827-1445-46cd-a3a0-e90409c510fb
msgctxt "h35fcae6agf35fg42e7g9e25g7daec4bf1f1f"
msgid "What, you gonna defect? Follow Sune of the Pretty Face?"
msgstr "그래서, 개종이라도 하려고? 예쁘장한 수니를 따르기로 했나?\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak
#. Speaker = Warrior Gronag
#. NodeID = ffefa423-c716-4dc4-9d5c-d02b09b24451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_DriderCaravan_AD_OnBreak:ffefa423-c716-4dc4-9d5c-d02b09b24451
msgctxt "hb3a357ceg2f62g42eega108g5550db16605b"
msgid ""
"I don't know. Plenty go up to the roof, I hear. Not many come back down."
msgstr "글쎄. 많은 이들이 꼭대기로 향한다고 들었어. 근데 다시 돌아온 경우는 많지 않대."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Drider_AD
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 087bef1c-eabf-4151-887f-b86263e2c8ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 0e9323d0-6637-b1b5-330d-ea99426aaaf2_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 0e9323d0-6637-b1b5-330d-ea99426aaaf2_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Drider_AD:087bef1c-eabf-4151-887f-b86263e2c8ce
msgctxt "h8b4a772fga4b5g4fbfg9180gbfe20b7486fd"
msgid "A place. A place for us."
msgstr "이곳이야. 우리를 위한 곳."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Drider_AD
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 4ac7c124-54ad-4a19-badf-36bd94e4d923
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 0e9323d0-6637-b1b5-330d-ea99426aaaf2_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 0e9323d0-6637-b1b5-330d-ea99426aaaf2_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Drider_AD:4ac7c124-54ad-4a19-badf-36bd94e4d923
msgctxt "hbdc92c29g2b26g4ba3g9f78g56bb060f413a"
msgid "Majesty rewards us. Majesty <i>sees </i>us."
msgstr "폐하께선 우리에게 상을 내리실 거야. 폐하께선 우릴 <i>보고</i> 계실 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Drider_AD
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = be930420-d034-4e88-912c-cc5041996fde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 0e9323d0-6637-b1b5-330d-ea99426aaaf2_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Drider_AD:be930420-d034-4e88-912c-cc5041996fde
msgctxt "h3c5027f1ga24fg4360gbf19g085a0a89d666"
msgid "Majesty. Majesty, You are so <i>close </i>here."
msgstr "폐하. 폐하, 너무나 <i>가깝게</i> 느껴집니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Drider_AD
