msgid "Always an honour, true soul."
msgstr "언제나 환영일세, 참된 영혼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_AD_Guard001Greeting
