msgctxt "h8200260bg7a3fg49begab10g5906970950bd"
msgid "The cleric is with General Thorm. You'll be his favourite soon enough."
msgstr "클레릭이 쏨 장군님과 함께하게 되었군. 너도 곧 장군님의 총애를 받게 되겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_AD_Guard001Greeting
#. Speaker = Zealot Malik
#. NodeID = 9f60a053-d04d-45d6-ab0a-aa19d3db02bc
