msgctxt "h60eaa31dg3cbdg4797gbf17g0c95433e1e31"
msgid "You! Heretic!"
msgstr "넌.. 이단자구나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Zealot Malik
#. NodeID = 5a382560-3dc8-45fb-6ae1-ad771d388d50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Knows_CreaturePath = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:5a382560-3dc8-45fb-6ae1-ad771d388d50
msgctxt "hc6132d3dgcfc3g4629gb44ag2210a683e3d5"
msgid "Best to head in and find out. Should be a good show."
msgstr "들어가서 직접 확인해 봐라. 훌륭한 볼거리가 기다리고 있으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 605669eb-58c4-2d34-e90f-ec9ed4280d45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:605669eb-58c4-2d34-e90f-ec9ed4280d45
msgctxt "he0b5a08dgb4b9g4797gbce3gdf3974273a7f"
msgid ""
"A - a True Soul? Why would one of your followers fight with the Harpers, "
"Majesty?"
msgstr "차, 참된 영혼? 당신의 추종자 중 하나라면 어째서 하퍼의 편에서 싸우는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 64357ab4-8d4c-706c-1cad-209c0c80b58f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:64357ab4-8d4c-706c-1cad-209c0c80b58f
msgctxt "h2c906218gf81cg42bfg9db6gce75cb216fd3"
msgid ""
"The others will go in, but I will go up. My queen summons me to her chapel - "
"to be in her presence."
msgstr "다른 놈들은 몰라도, 난 올라갈 거다. 여왕님께서 날 예배실로 부르신다. 그분과 만나야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Zealot Malik
#. NodeID = 66a199de-8c4c-72ca-e478-dc50ffe25fc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:66a199de-8c4c-72ca-e478-dc50ffe25fc9
msgctxt "h80ddb1feg6a9bg4a8dg9421g52257e094b73"
msgid "Stupid creature."
msgstr "바보같은 것."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Zealot Malik
#. NodeID = 759b3be9-3125-c509-cbe6-0ed3130c8195
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:759b3be9-3125-c509-cbe6-0ed3130c8195
msgctxt "h6a9be0ffgedbag4654g8c44gab54e2dd1ec1"
msgid "My mistake. Your mind tastes familiar."
msgstr "실수를 했군. 너의 정신에서 익숙한 느낌이 들었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Zealot Malik
#. NodeID = 759dccec-26cb-4121-b073-7a3c5cca1c55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:759dccec-26cb-4121-b073-7a3c5cca1c55
msgctxt "h26362bfbgd5c8g4717gbfb2g3e7ff62a7bd0"
msgid "New meat, drider?"
msgstr "새로운 고기냐, 드라이더?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 81d5d15e-f3b3-75df-6746-228d1d7e85c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:81d5d15e-f3b3-75df-6746-228d1d7e85c4
msgctxt "h5662098dg3cd4g4e15gae8ag20dd4dc328c2"
msgid "They return once more, Majesty. What do they want?"
msgstr "저들이 다시 돌아왔습니다, 폐하. 뭘 원하는 걸까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 842d5af7-6c05-8848-0892-eba1e0d76b4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:842d5af7-6c05-8848-0892-eba1e0d76b4f
msgctxt "h7662462dgbcf5g4fd2g8ed0g43b43a1439b4"
msgid "'Welcome back'? I've never been here before."
msgstr "'돌아온 걸 환영한다'? 난 여기 처음인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 846ecf01-f470-a5a9-edd7-cc17f2908d2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:846ecf01-f470-a5a9-edd7-cc17f2908d2a
msgctxt "h90acc452gcd59g4096gad2dg65a900a5f057"
msgid "We apologise. We never meant to disrupt any plans."
msgstr "사죄드립니다. 계획을 방해할 뜻은 추호도 없었습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 981c1ffb-3708-3390-2ae4-2959a4a64c91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_TeleportUpToChapel = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:981c1ffb-3708-3390-2ae4-2959a4a64c91
msgctxt "hcc2057f4gb1a2g4844gb520g20a794a5caed"
msgid "I hear you, sweet Majesty. I am coming, my queen!"
msgstr "폐하, 당신의 말이 들립니다. 제가 곧 가겠습니다, 여왕이시여! "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Brawler Vez
#. NodeID = 991d4223-3314-1c6e-c940-2c0a5357e508
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersPermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:991d4223-3314-1c6e-c940-2c0a5357e508
msgctxt "hffec9f63gc96fg481dg9d1bg2f279ad51ab0"
msgid "Helped us with some Harpers on the way too. They're shadowbait now."
msgstr "오는 길에 하퍼즈로부터도 도와줬지. 걔넨 이제 그림자 먹이가 되었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = a5755cd8-8876-c15a-1b95-4303011b6f53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet(3) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:a5755cd8-8876-c15a-1b95-4303011b6f53
msgctxt "h8e76dfc1g5968g4171ga37bgdf44269138ea"
msgid "What's this? Who are these, Majesty?"
msgstr "이건 뭐지? 이 자들은 누굽니까, 폐하?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Zealot Malik
#. NodeID = a67b1f0e-b6d6-1ce6-325b-26e911dfb63b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:a67b1f0e-b6d6-1ce6-325b-26e911dfb63b
msgctxt "h24a20fb9gf51dg4ff9ga512g1130ebebb3e5"
msgid "Move."
msgstr "지나가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Adept Merim
#. NodeID = a72fe754-147a-9aa4-968b-97530c46497a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:a72fe754-147a-9aa4-968b-97530c46497a
msgctxt "h0c1ece39g60f6g480agad71gfc7dbcb6a3be"
msgid ""
"The General's advisor went off on a field trip - Z'rell's in charge 'til he "
"gets back."
msgstr "장군님의 고문관께서는 출장을 나갔다. 지금은 즈렐 님이 그 자리를 대신하고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a80999bb-7ba5-2b7b-d817-71b76c5d1e71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:a80999bb-7ba5-2b7b-d817-71b76c5d1e71
msgctxt "hf1bf7e5cgb4d8g4b4cgb72ag425595c3e3f1"
msgid "What news inside the tower?"
msgstr "새로운 소식이라도 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b013abee-45d0-c0e7-3083-c78d77695680
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:b013abee-45d0-c0e7-3083-c78d77695680
msgctxt "hfb96c293ge51bg46d8g903eg3bb71c4f156f"
msgid ""
"*Your minds connect and you hear a voice whispering to you. The Absolute? Or "
"just the echoes of his fractured mind, reverberating in the darkness?*"
msgstr "*정신이 이어지고 속삭이는 목소리가 들립니다. 절대자? 아니면 단지 그의 분열된 정신의 메아리가 어둠 속에 울려퍼지는 걸까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b0538c0f-1cd9-297d-29fd-af42bdbb5ce0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:b0538c0f-1cd9-297d-29fd-af42bdbb5ce0
msgctxt "he5afcd43g571eg45b0g8b29ge2fa7191938f"
msgid "What's someone of our rank doing on guard duty?"
msgstr "왜 참된 영혼씩이나 돼서 경비를 서고 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = be382da6-bad4-edb6-501a-473f1d484eb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:be382da6-bad4-edb6-501a-473f1d484eb4
msgctxt "heb495f6dg2489g48f9ga899g2b9186e7d4a8"
msgid "Her name!"
msgstr "그분의 이름으로!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3c361f9-739e-f68f-698e-92766e00053f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:d3c361f9-739e-f68f-698e-92766e00053f
msgctxt "h1defbe68g7404g4a12gae33g72a8a117c272"
msgid "I was <i>trying </i>to infiltrate the Harpers, until you ruined it."
msgstr "하퍼즈에 <i>잠입하려고</i> 했는데, 네가 다 망쳤군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Zealot Malik
#. NodeID = d3f02870-a2b8-1608-a5b7-581a26bf0ecf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:d3f02870-a2b8-1608-a5b7-581a26bf0ecf
msgctxt "hd5b2ab24gf089g4f83g9ec8g81bdad4842b3"
msgid "In Her name."
msgstr "그분의 이름으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Adept Merim
#. NodeID = d3f0818b-0341-4a88-0093-532206df449c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:d3f0818b-0341-4a88-0093-532206df449c
msgctxt "he2a7fcfdg080bg47beg8a75g04122717c081"
msgid "In Her name."
msgstr "그분의 이름으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Zealot Malik
#. NodeID = d522aca9-a7c0-4149-76ca-06363e7873c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:d522aca9-a7c0-4149-76ca-06363e7873c4
msgctxt "hfb91ed8ag451fg4312g8fe7g3e0eadc49cfc"
msgid "Recognising our like."
msgstr "동족을 가려내야 하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = d655f554-61a5-ffa0-be9b-1bfc84f6dd11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:d655f554-61a5-ffa0-be9b-1bfc84f6dd11
msgctxt "he49e991fg3699g4764gbafegba78636dbd4e"
msgid "The queen sent them! Her Majesty's flesh grows, full and glorious."
msgstr "여왕께서 보내셨다! 여왕 폐하의 위엄이 자라나고, 충만해지며, 영광스럽도다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Zealot Malik
#. NodeID = e9242868-7a5a-ba95-cd75-7f5ca589c9c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:e9242868-7a5a-ba95-cd75-7f5ca589c9c2
msgctxt "hc82dabc6g4308g46d5g904cge567924711d0"
msgid "She's in the Great Hall. She'll be wanting to see you."
msgstr "즈렐 님은 본당에 계시다. 널 만나고 싶어하실 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = eaca4094-73ba-a23c-0903-8aae29585cc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:eaca4094-73ba-a23c-0903-8aae29585cc5
msgctxt "h7995fd7ag0ccbg4010gb8ffgb5e077435e06"
msgid "We - we would never! Our Majesty should have said."
msgstr "저.. 저희는 결코! 폐하께서 말씀하셨더라면."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = ee7c0348-edc4-c31c-9127-8ac1e8b939e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_FoughtInAmbushWithHarpers = True
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithCaravan = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:ee7c0348-edc4-c31c-9127-8ac1e8b939e5
msgctxt "h36a22be8g6fa0g4ab5g9c72g9bdbf9eefcd1"
msgid "They survived the dark, Majesty! Praise be."
msgstr "그들은 어둠 속에서 살아남았습니다, 폐하! 찬양합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb5b3646-7f8c-daf6-48b7-92558547ffbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:fb5b3646-7f8c-daf6-48b7-92558547ffbc
msgctxt "hfaecde11gd83ag4e5cga353g7a0ff38eb4a8"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = fe7c644b-e9a5-d5cd-3470-3256d518bee1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Drider:fe7c644b-e9a5-d5cd-3470-3256d518bee1
msgctxt "h4037fcb2g6adcg4c25gad1egcce1f38fab24"
msgid "We are no fools - we will not be deceived by the likes of you!"
msgstr "우린 어리석지 않다.. 너 따위에게 속을 줄 아느냐!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Ghoul1
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 0e0ad6d6-cc75-029f-5c98-35ff8425331a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Ghoul1:0e0ad6d6-cc75-029f-5c98-35ff8425331a
msgctxt "h050a7cc9gb821g4ec8g9236g2c942d88f614"
msgid "A mere shadow of a creature - yet it hears the Absolute's voice?"
msgstr "한낱 괴물의 그림자일 뿐인데, 절대자의 목소리를 듣는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Ghoul1
#. Speaker = Ghoul
#. NodeID = 2861ed2d-e14f-2cbf-fa10-93fcba1d2d31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Ghoul1:2861ed2d-e14f-2cbf-fa10-93fcba1d2d31
msgctxt "h4e450851g3227g4626ga70cg22db47b9a2d0"
msgid "Praise..."
msgstr "찬양하라..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Ghoul1
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 41790981-2c89-964f-bc36-501beafc9267
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Ghoul1:41790981-2c89-964f-bc36-501beafc9267
msgctxt "h76275552gde0dg4374gb612geeb427e7a165"
msgid "A sorry creature. Just enough wits to be able to serve the Absolute."
msgstr "안타까운 생물이로군. 딱 절대자를 섬길 만큼의 지혜만 남았다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Ghoul1
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 4581812b-3f3a-337f-3e80-b5cfb5e0c938
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_EntranceCheckpoint_Ghoul1:4581812b-3f3a-337f-3e80-b5cfb5e0c938
msgctxt "h7e37000egd298g4941g9b7cg87ca63e33c04"
msgid "Barely alive by most standards, and still it bows to the Absolute."
