msgctxt "hd34633beg711eg4283ga51cg306e74abfd48"
msgid "<i>Stay silent, simply watching.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아무 말도 하지 않고 그저 지켜본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Darra
#. NodeID = 04ebdc9c-b2eb-5bc1-2341-3d531e75e1c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:04ebdc9c-b2eb-5bc1-2341-3d531e75e1c1
msgctxt "h8436ff46ga6f4g49f6g80eegcb7d41005675"
msgid "What? No!"
msgstr "뭐? 안 돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 0804dba6-c1a4-e10c-6b58-8e92ed75a3bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Isobel_State_AtMoonrise = True
#.      - HAV_Isobel_State_IsDead = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:0804dba6-c1a4-e10c-6b58-8e92ed75a3bb
msgctxt "h0620983bgb27eg4196ga0acg85093228372d"
msgid ""
"Or better yet - put that True Soul to use. They've proven themselves "
"reliable."
msgstr "이게 더 좋겠군. 참된 영혼을 활용하지. 그들은 신뢰성을 스스로 증명해냈어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08370665-75a5-ac1c-d494-013172e69fdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_TriedHelpingMinthara = False
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_SpokeAgainstMinthara = True
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_RemainedSilent = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:08370665-75a5-ac1c-d494-013172e69fdf
msgctxt "hf53e2819g1854g4b87ga69cgc017dcf98f1e"
msgid "I'd kill her right now, if I were you."
msgstr "내가 당신이었다면 당장 죽여버렸을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08370665-75a5-ac1c-d494-013172e69fdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_TriedHelpingMinthara = False
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_SpokeAgainstMinthara = True
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_RemainedSilent = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:08370665-75a5-ac1c-d494-013172e69fdf
msgctxt "hdd0d7fd7gf59ag4a37ga801g90b680a500dd"
msgid "Why not kill her here, General? Be done with it."
msgstr "그냥 여기서 죽이는 게 어떻습니까, 장군님? 깔끔하게 끝내는 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 091a9fa7-aba2-b16d-ceaa-265c1809931a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:091a9fa7-aba2-b16d-ceaa-265c1809931a
msgctxt "h7fd192f6gef63g4714ga8dcg21f4af3779e3"
msgid "<i>When has that ever stopped you? Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>언제부터 그런 걸 다 따지고 행동했나? 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 091a9fa7-aba2-b16d-ceaa-265c1809931a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:091a9fa7-aba2-b16d-ceaa-265c1809931a
msgctxt "hd82b9bbdgf4deg46e2g86a8gea2b0f29765d"
msgid "<i>Attack anyway.</i>"
msgstr "<i>개의치 않고 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Darra
#. NodeID = 0b3a01a1-7b57-7f50-2e24-406e50238043
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_GoblinsSuffocate = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:0b3a01a1-7b57-7f50-2e24-406e50238043
msgctxt "h5d494ea5g9251g4f3fg860dgf4741ab906b7"
msgid "I can't - please -"
msgstr "그럴 수는 - 제발 -"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 0c5ce1d8-d6c7-ab12-7025-a1319b9d377c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:0c5ce1d8-d6c7-ab12-7025-a1319b9d377c
msgctxt "hd78990b7gaa6fg44cegbeceg695cbc5536bd"
msgid "You blame the Absolute's <i>Chosen </i>for your failure?"
msgstr "네 실패를 절대자께 <i>선택받으신 분</i>의 탓으로 돌린다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0cb31291-6871-d558-6841-7661f96844ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_TriedHelpingMinthara = True
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_SpokeAgainstMinthara = False
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_RemainedSilent = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:0cb31291-6871-d558-6841-7661f96844ca
msgctxt "h87c36c62g24ecg42eeg8ff0g0a7ab580f0b3"
msgid "Don't kill her - she's a loyal servant of the Absolute."
msgstr "그녀를 죽이지 마십시오. 그녀는 절대자의 충성스러운 종복입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 0e2d2840-62bc-468b-a0a2-57492961a044
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(13) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(13) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:0e2d2840-62bc-468b-a0a2-57492961a044
msgctxt "h197991fbgf2efg4dc1gae72ga365b1c6218b"
msgid ""
"Hold on, soldier. We don't stand a chance against this mob. We'll have our "
"moment, but this isn't it."
msgstr "멈춰, 신참. 이 많은 떼거리를 상대로는 승산이 없어. 저 자들을 처치할 때가 오겠지만, 지금은 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 0e3db8e9-429a-e8de-64a6-40726c80fdfb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:0e3db8e9-429a-e8de-64a6-40726c80fdfb
msgctxt "h6c6b3572gea0eg4717gb3a8g918de4c7e917"
msgid ""
"Nightwarden Minthara, your crime is incompetence and your sentence is death."
msgstr "밤지기 민타라, 자네 죄는 무능력이고 그 처벌은 죽음이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0e4d8ac7-0252-8f04-b659-36be712c6197
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_TriedHelpingMinthara = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:0e4d8ac7-0252-8f04-b659-36be712c6197
msgctxt "hc3285dc6g6759g4a3agaa2dg5a2b63d2b82f"
msgid ""
"<i>Try to force your will on Ketheric - push him to declare Minthara "
"innocent.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 뜻을 케서릭에게 관철시켜, 민타라가 무고하다고 말하게끔 시도해본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ec6fe99-0f2b-b0cb-b822-8f8eb3c65bb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:0ec6fe99-0f2b-b0cb-b822-8f8eb3c65bb5
msgctxt "hbbfe1b14g3b69g4a61ga5deg8aba1308f5b3"
msgid "Just kill them - they're worthless."
msgstr "그냥 죽이세요. 쓸모 없는 녀석들입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 0efb5809-c887-097f-f9d1-46813efbc14c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:0efb5809-c887-097f-f9d1-46813efbc14c
msgctxt "h3278c590gcaf3g4f31gaa7dge049602707e6"
msgid "You! Me old mate that saved me from the tieflings -"
msgstr "너! 나를 예전에 티플링한테서 구해 준 친구잖아-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 0f13604e-7cce-b659-aba7-3fe784d6f63a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(12) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(12) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:0f13604e-7cce-b659-aba7-3fe784d6f63a
msgctxt "ha404374cga24bg433ag91e4g3121026964ef"
msgid "They're dead. Z'rell will want to hear of this."
msgstr "전부 죽었군. 즈렐이 이 소식을 듣고 싶어하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 0f193bd7-d16f-9ed4-b2a0-225365d10a17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:0f193bd7-d16f-9ed4-b2a0-225365d10a17
msgctxt "h9e0a9bf6g5555g41bfgbf11g55e288690a6f"
msgid "Mine! It's - it's my fault. I failed you, my lord. Please, forgive me."
msgstr "접니다! 제 책임입니다. 주군을 실망시켜드렸습니다. 부디 용서해주십시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 0f382461-1e41-d84c-b7c3-1fd179a6a6f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:0f382461-1e41-d84c-b7c3-1fd179a6a6f9
msgctxt "h616444eag385bg49bagbe6cg531fc94aaf1d"
msgid "Whose, then?"
msgstr "그럼 누구 책임이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0ff195cd-3b03-9b41-0671-6a1bd28b06b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:0ff195cd-3b03-9b41-0671-6a1bd28b06b3
msgctxt "hdefe83a0g99bbg41e3gbf8dg811a3976dc17"
msgid ""
"*You slip into Minthara's mind while all her attention is focused on saving "
"her own skin. You can feel her guilt everywhere, writhing and churning. All "
"it takes is one little push...*"
msgstr ""
"*민타라가 상황을 무마하려는데 온 신경을 쓰고 있는 동안 그녀의 머릿속으로 흘러들어간다. 그 안은 죄책감으로 가득하고, 몸부림치고 "
"동요하고 있음이 느껴진다. 단 한 번 살짝 등만 밀어준다면 그것으로 충분할 것이다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Darra
#. NodeID = 10904954-1196-d256-65b1-dabf2af572ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(21) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:10904954-1196-d256-65b1-dabf2af572ce
msgctxt "hc34d7793g3e03g45ddgaf23g172d470b5c6d"
msgid "You serious? We don't stand a chance!"
msgstr "농담이시겠죠? 저희가 무슨 승산이 있다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Drenn
#. NodeID = 1292d780-bfb2-45d4-b93e-612b932eab28
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:1292d780-bfb2-45d4-b93e-612b932eab28
msgctxt "h906e38ccg3f09g4327ga707gd23cd9e4d8f2"
msgid "I did as I was told! Followed every order I was given -"
msgstr "시키신 대로 한 거예요! 받은 명령을 전부 따랐다구요-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 132c0e3d-33bb-344e-ba07-1f59c2511a09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:132c0e3d-33bb-344e-ba07-1f59c2511a09
msgctxt "haa675d17g6d7bg47bdg83a2gfb96bdae7e96"
msgid "A new True Soul, come to share their wisdom?"
msgstr "새로 온 참된 영혼이여, 우리와 지혜를 나누고자 왔는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 13dd4a05-e73b-8a64-d3ae-832712c252b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:13dd4a05-e73b-8a64-d3ae-832712c252b8
msgctxt "h2aa03011g3109g401dg950bg7d5c04870c34"
msgid ""
"*You've stood afore this very throne before, in demand, not supplication.*"
msgstr "*당신은 전에도 이 자리에 섰던 적이 있습니다. 절절히 비는 게 아닌, 당당히 요구하는 쪽이었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 14e10d13-2527-1dbe-0b36-47727aa1bebe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:14e10d13-2527-1dbe-0b36-47727aa1bebe
msgctxt "hacaa1192g3b56g45a7g9285g8d619816bcde"
msgid "They are put to death, obviously."
msgstr "당연히 사형에 처해야지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 16b32957-4aa5-08b3-2adf-39e01594908e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Execution_State_PlayerWantedToAttack(5) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_Execution_State_PlayerWantedToAttack(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:16b32957-4aa5-08b3-2adf-39e01594908e
msgctxt "h6d84fe27g6079g42a4ga39dgfb860ee30efd"
msgid "I smell a massacre. Let it begin."
msgstr "학살의 냄새가 나는군요. 시작해 보죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 171ef247-e083-4c05-93bc-577896ee1089
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(10) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(10) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:171ef247-e083-4c05-93bc-577896ee1089
msgctxt "h1dddfe9cg8c2dg4c2dg8911g088680a1e18d"
msgid ""
"I, too, crave blood. But even I know to avoid battle when fortune's tides "
"flow against me."
msgstr "나도 피를 갈망하긴 하지만, 그런 나조차도 운명의 흐름이 불리할 때는 싸움을 피할 줄 안다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 18581889-364c-a3c2-ac47-e20337104bcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:18581889-364c-a3c2-ac47-e20337104bcc
msgctxt "h2f4133e5ga6b9g4c7egb836g53b97296fa70"
msgid ""
"*Z'rell's mind is a steel trap, but you cautiously ease your way in. You "
"just need to shift her focus a little...*"
msgstr "*즈렐의 정신은 강철로 된 함정과 같습니다. 하지만 당신은 조심스럽게 길을 뚫습니다. 그녀의 시선을 조금만 옮기면 됩니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 18798b30-7ba8-8f98-0a95-128d244a55b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:18798b30-7ba8-8f98-0a95-128d244a55b0
msgctxt "hdf1a853bgaf5ag49d4g93b5gbf2d69ea5b38"
msgid "What? No!"
msgstr "뭐? 안 돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 19858cb0-6225-46fc-a216-6a0f217080f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(9) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(9) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:19858cb0-6225-46fc-a216-6a0f217080f2
msgctxt "h9fdcd3eag2c33g47c9gad69g9a400cf2b4a6"
msgid "Keep calm. Even the Blade of Frontiers knows when he's outmatched."
msgstr "침착해. 변경의 칼날이라도 불리한 상황 정도는 읽을 줄 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 1aa51e3b-0b68-a7c1-6bcf-7bc846a62e3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:1aa51e3b-0b68-a7c1-6bcf-7bc846a62e3b
msgctxt "hdb3111ddg4dafg4a25gb6d2gf5a264204118"
msgid "Of course it is not the General's fault -"
msgstr "당연히 장군님을 탓하는 게 아닙니-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 1e0a61e6-7ead-5b76-cf3d-df8ce9853694
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:1e0a61e6-7ead-5b76-cf3d-df8ce9853694
msgctxt "h6623b5beg53f3g4c8ag9c7eg0696754d3bf2"
msgid ""
"I'm being unkind. Anyone might have struggled with such imperfect tools - "
"goblins are prone to failure."
msgstr "내가 지나쳤던 것 같군. 누구든 저런 불완전한 도구들로는 힘들었을 텐데. 고블린은 도통 믿을 게 못 된단 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 1f5fde98-e337-d07d-0a3f-520a7d805026
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:1f5fde98-e337-d07d-0a3f-520a7d805026
msgctxt "h5c0c9556gde9eg49c7g81c9g987185718651"
msgid "I'm sure you will enjoy watching my justice enacted."
msgstr "내가 정의를 집행하는 모습을 마음껏 즐기리라 믿는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 1f8e76f4-20d4-1b68-5ee6-c57a59bba8c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:1f8e76f4-20d4-1b68-5ee6-c57a59bba8c9
msgctxt "hf3b12bf4g5a38g42d7gab22g39e154b99140"
msgid "Enough!"
msgstr "그만!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 1fa12bd3-fe11-8acc-e5f4-2695d53e17c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:1fa12bd3-fe11-8acc-e5f4-2695d53e17c0
msgctxt "hf7f03ef9ga3f3g4dd9gb191g3c98898ff0e0"
msgid "Guilty, then. My lord?"
msgstr "그러면 유죄로군. 장군님?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 1fbb38ad-a329-6666-b4d3-7b24bb8072cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKingScryingStarted = True
#.      - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_DefeatedOnce = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:1fbb38ad-a329-6666-b4d3-7b24bb8072cf
msgctxt "h55e9127fg6931g43fcga1f5gfddea0b1b94f"
msgid "Ah, the True Soul who so impressed Dror Ragzlin."
msgstr "아, 드롤 라그즐린에게 깊은 인상을 남겼던 참된 영혼이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 208de4e0-f5d7-b990-b89f-2d1dfee1b10b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:208de4e0-f5d7-b990-b89f-2d1dfee1b10b
msgctxt "hef78d9c1gb0b2g4fb1g9685gec21943b2800"
msgid "Enough!"
msgstr "그만!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 22ebfb78-be8e-2735-fd91-c39d79936f3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(14) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(14) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:22ebfb78-be8e-2735-fd91-c39d79936f3a
msgctxt "h7a3a1c6eg4108g418cg8ee7ge070f3f44a66"
msgid "Let's go see Z'rell - and mind you don't slip in the goblin guts."
msgstr "그럼 이제 즈렐을 만나러 가볼까? 고블린 내장 밟고 미끄러지지 않도록 조심해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 2339af7c-e65f-7f26-9b4f-9a092c73fe8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:2339af7c-e65f-7f26-9b4f-9a092c73fe8d
msgctxt "hf52ae7a8g3781g4981g952agfceeeac5a6a7"
msgid "You scrag!"
msgstr "이 멀대 같은 여자가!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 244231cb-b9e7-c80f-678c-18c958562eff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_FightGoblins = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:244231cb-b9e7-c80f-678c-18c958562eff
msgctxt "h0e12936eg1407g4364gbdc8g19dfbbc76dbd"
msgid "I will do this with my own hands, it always feels better."
msgstr "내가 직접 하도록 하지. 그편이 항상 기분이 좋더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 24b0252a-3de3-9fb3-c930-3d6c9889cce8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:24b0252a-3de3-9fb3-c930-3d6c9889cce8
msgctxt "h126569eegb7cdg4893g85c7gddc45e4e54d2"
msgid ""
"What say you about our Minthara? It is fitting that one mad dog should judge "
"another."
msgstr "민타라에 대해서는 어떻게 생각하지? 미친 개는 같은 미친 개가 심판하는 게 맞겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 24ebbc57-4526-a540-e555-92716fb25b5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:24ebbc57-4526-a540-e555-92716fb25b5e
msgctxt "h3e2448cbg882fg4ddega99cg69c54eb3646f"
msgid "Oh, crap. You're gonna enjoy this, ain't you?"
msgstr "이런 젠장. 아주 신명나게 즐기시겠구만, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 253d109f-0bfc-6cad-8ce2-59755c4b1c71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:253d109f-0bfc-6cad-8ce2-59755c4b1c71
msgctxt "hb34cd0adg6746g4bcag9cc4gf07c3ac43ba9"
msgid "Let me torture her - I am a master."
msgstr "내가 고문을 좀 해 보고 싶은데. 고문에는 일가견이 있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 263e910b-f232-727b-bbdf-0d809e9ecea1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:263e910b-f232-727b-bbdf-0d809e9ecea1
msgctxt "hcaf67a01gf3afg494dg8297g127313224742"
msgid "I don't care for a trial. An execution, however..."
msgstr "심판 따위에는 관심 없어. 하지만 처형이라면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 26f8e66b-0519-8958-c984-9269f3e4ffff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:26f8e66b-0519-8958-c984-9269f3e4ffff
msgctxt "h457f7f48g40d2g49dcga748g459c1b145b7c"
msgid "What? No!"
msgstr "뭐? 안 돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 27a4bd57-0a2e-a5ec-a4a0-fd5eec697881
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:27a4bd57-0a2e-a5ec-a4a0-fd5eec697881
msgctxt "h7bd26db6g9887g4793g81ceg4b0277d3a08e"
msgid "Exactly! 'S what I told 'em, but would they listen?"
msgstr "내 말이! 나도 정확히 그렇게 말했는데, 안 들으시더라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 283f4ff3-9c65-2075-7846-8b7afe91add9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:283f4ff3-9c65-2075-7846-8b7afe91add9
msgctxt "hcd4ff52cgb2e7g46c1g950cg76da17aa147c"
msgid "You won't regret this. Praise the Absolute!"
msgstr "후회하지 않을 거야. 절대자를 찬양하라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a275c0a-2237-c26c-09c6-4223a9c4f20b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Execution_State_PlayerWantedToAttack(5) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_Execution_State_PlayerWantedToAttack(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:2a275c0a-2237-c26c-09c6-4223a9c4f20b
msgctxt "h30e91302g332fg4cf0g9b08g896ef3deb6f4"
msgid "<i>Attack the half-orc and the general. </i>"
msgstr "<i>하프오크와 장군을 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 2b1cd097-28a4-5319-a346-58dcdd373072
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:2b1cd097-28a4-5319-a346-58dcdd373072
msgctxt "h489bf22ega465g489cg9a7fgfe545fac7e00"
msgid "See? What'd I tell yeh? Praise the Absolute!"
msgstr "보셨습니까? 제가 말했잖습니까? 절대자를 찬양하라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 2b535e7b-ca44-c196-c186-6ae4e553daf4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:2b535e7b-ca44-c196-c186-6ae4e553daf4
msgctxt "h515de5fag5c7fg4a4fgb60dgcfbf5cc7fe5b"
msgid ""
"I gave you this command because I saw something in you. Your efficiency - "
"ruthlessness - your killer's instinct. I treasured them all."
msgstr ""
"그 명령을 내린 건 내가 자네에게서 뭔가를 봤기 때문이네. 효율성, 무자비함, 살인자의 본능 말일세. 모두 매우 높이 평가했었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ba90f3f-581c-91d4-6190-d43af14b6145
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:2ba90f3f-581c-91d4-6190-d43af14b6145
msgctxt "h8da6e1a5g3019g470bg9c7cg255af66dc76d"
msgid "I saw the horrors they committed in the Absolute's name."
msgstr "저 녀석들이 절대자의 이름 아래 저지른 잔학한 짓을 보았습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Darra
#. NodeID = 2c972f4f-8bd6-bb0a-117f-d0def5b1cd37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:2c972f4f-8bd6-bb0a-117f-d0def5b1cd37
msgctxt "h29928e32g078fg434egbb61gfdcca742e099"
msgid "Praise the Absolute! And praise you, True Soul!"
msgstr "절대자를 찬양하라! 참된 영혼을 찬양하라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 2f0d544f-be7d-b562-bd4d-8c3a7cc051ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:2f0d544f-be7d-b562-bd4d-8c3a7cc051ed
msgctxt "h758fad97gead0g40c3g8b60g718c6f198655"
msgid "You know I'm loyal, tell 'im -"
msgstr "내가 충성을 다했다는걸 알잖아, 어서 말해주-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2fc62c41-0754-28d0-6d4a-62a2d6166b51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:2fc62c41-0754-28d0-6d4a-62a2d6166b51
msgctxt "h2c159e7fg881cg4cf6g97b9g990b490202a2"
msgid "Only that she'd be dead in the wilds if not for my help."
msgstr "제 도움이 아니었다면 이미 죽은 목숨이었다는 것 말고는 없습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2ff965e3-99ee-27d0-33ce-8437014d5c73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:2ff965e3-99ee-27d0-33ce-8437014d5c73
msgctxt "ha8fd7c60g22eag499fg94f2g09829e91bc02"
msgid ""
"*A blast of mental energy washes over you, filling the room. Your tadpole "
"squirms, urging you to obey.*"
msgstr "*정신적 에너지의 폭발이 당신을 덮치고, 이 공간을 가득 채웁니다. 당신의 올챙이는 꿈틀거리며, 복종하도록 재촉합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 305c37b5-bf8c-4999-6e5d-efa25dde2bb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:305c37b5-bf8c-4999-6e5d-efa25dde2bb0
msgctxt "h3adcb485g4d95g49b9gb054gb7b5e0f12f84"
msgid "Thank you, I'm going to enjoy this..."
msgstr "고맙군, 아주 재밌겠어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 316ac6b3-61a9-7a1d-44c3-4d2b1554f050
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:316ac6b3-61a9-7a1d-44c3-4d2b1554f050
msgctxt "h2f3e2e8fg2767g493dgb9e0gdfd952c09200"
msgid "Alas, it's the best option we have."
msgstr "아쉽게도, 그게 우리 최선의 선택지지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 31b13d5a-e650-c176-bde3-28763bc73c33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_State_LeftAbsolute = False
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_State_WentMT = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:31b13d5a-e650-c176-bde3-28763bc73c33
msgctxt "h601141b3g7970g4940ga9b1g5d03331dcb1e"
msgid "Ah, the True Soul who saved poor, lost Nere from his mistakes."
msgstr "아, 가엾고 길잃은 니어를 그의 실수로부터 구해주었던 참된 영혼이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 32a9b594-1afd-2dae-d2f4-c707742489c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:32a9b594-1afd-2dae-d2f4-c707742489c2
msgctxt "hbd64a9degd790g412cg9944gdf75c18ff8e2"
msgid "As if more evidence were needed."
msgstr "더 볼 것도 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 332b6cdc-5455-0d87-776f-8dd964b592d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:332b6cdc-5455-0d87-776f-8dd964b592d8
msgctxt "hb004a8fag957dg4e0egb684g8818639c19fc"
msgid ""
"Happy as I would be to kill her here, Disciple Z'Rell asked for this honour "
"long ago."
msgstr "이 자리에서 죽이는 것도 좋지만, 신봉자 즈렐이 오래 전부터 요청한 게 있어서 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 337dbae2-12ac-b859-ae62-2d021f0a81ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:337dbae2-12ac-b859-ae62-2d021f0a81ae
msgctxt "h4066f98agbe5fg4076g8a53g3b3299e4cff8"
msgid "You blasphemous little wretch!"
msgstr "이 불경스러운 이단 자식이!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3591c6bc-6a0f-b367-4bd4-d1b0df8f5880
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:3591c6bc-6a0f-b367-4bd4-d1b0df8f5880
msgctxt "h3eca6623g1a4ag442ag8b89gcc3b0d5adcfb"
msgid "She's not lying - she served the Absolute faithfully."
msgstr "그녀는 거짓을 말하는 게 아닙니다. 그녀는 절대자를 충실하게 섬겼습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 3664a302-3605-a4ca-39ff-d546e0886f66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_GoblinsSuffocate = True
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_FezzerkDied = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:3664a302-3605-a4ca-39ff-d546e0886f66
msgctxt "h7fd96cf5g65e4g4283gaa23g321fe47faf0b"
msgid "Please - help me."
msgstr "제발 - 도와줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 368f6874-a5b7-10aa-d6f4-f0e4554f0980
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:368f6874-a5b7-10aa-d6f4-f0e4554f0980
msgctxt "h2911f755g712fg47d5gb3dag0fefa024d4a9"
msgid "We did as you lot told us. Minthara's the one who -"
msgstr "저희는 당신들께서 시키신 대로 했다구요. 민타라가-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 381e1c4b-da9c-4f1f-5996-975c459fb97d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:381e1c4b-da9c-4f1f-5996-975c459fb97d
msgctxt "hc9d512f7gfce3g4e24g9bd4g36ffea523f60"
msgid ""
"We are too close to the ending - and the new beginning. I can coddle failure "
"no longer."
msgstr "우리는 결말과, 새로운 시작에 너무 가까이 왔다네. 실패는 더 이상 용납할 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Darra
#. NodeID = 3825c848-4c67-6322-721f-734b8716bb10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:3825c848-4c67-6322-721f-734b8716bb10
msgctxt "he43cab36gbe35g413cgb533g440afab3dcce"
msgid "No - please -"
msgstr "안 돼, 제발..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 387b0052-ffd7-6c71-f4d9-bdaae728148e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Execution_State_PlayerWantedToAttack(5) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_Execution_State_PlayerWantedToAttack(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:387b0052-ffd7-6c71-f4d9-bdaae728148e
msgctxt "hfdd9189ag155fg446bgbdf3g2c5a861b39a2"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 39372182-7c57-b025-9edc-30148275ec41
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:39372182-7c57-b025-9edc-30148275ec41
msgctxt "h7022fd54gabfeg42acg994bg3393f20aa944"
msgid "And the goblins, General?"
msgstr "고블린들은 어떻게 할까요, 장군님?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3993625c-a7a5-43e8-074c-eb4fbe387f5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:3993625c-a7a5-43e8-074c-eb4fbe387f5a
msgctxt "hdc031dc3gdde2g4e2bg96edg0b14369491f1"
msgid ""
"*You try to slip past Minthara's defences, but her parasite is on high "
"alert. No matter what nook you probe, it's there - blocking you from "
"interfering.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 민타라의 방어를 비집고 들어가려 하지만, 그녀의 기생충이 강력히 경계하고 있다. 당신이 어느 구석을 탐사하든지 기생충은 그곳에서 "
"당신의 간섭을 막고있다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 3b564365-0b9c-bb63-630c-c5b1d904e681
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:3b564365-0b9c-bb63-630c-c5b1d904e681
msgctxt "h7e1f9ac2g9b32g48f8g99d5g64899b248f05"
msgid ""
"I'm sure the results will send a clear message to the troops on the "
"importance of discipline."
msgstr "결과가 부대에 규율의 중요성에 대한 명확한 메시지를 전달해줄 것이라 확신하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 3ba33af4-7d73-84ec-bc53-1a5929b2693d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_MoonriseTower_State_Outcast = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:3ba33af4-7d73-84ec-bc53-1a5929b2693d
msgctxt "hc7a444cfg75d2g4546g91edg7a75f21fe527"
msgid "How amusing. Take care of them, Z'rell."
msgstr "재밌군. 자네가 처리하게, 즈렐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 3c2fb0e6-bbf0-268f-73f5-e8776fde747d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:3c2fb0e6-bbf0-268f-73f5-e8776fde747d
msgctxt "hf71d76bbgaff3g418aga5beg3ba3ad230df5"
msgid ""
"I'm sure they were very enthusiastic. But zeal without efficacy is for "
"<i>children</i>. Not servants."
msgstr "분명 매우 열렬히 임했겠지. 허나 실효 없는 열성은 <i>아이들</i>에게나 있는 것이지, 절대자의 종복에게 바랄 것은 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d4b8dcc-3752-3334-87de-6e77184e4241
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Execution_State_PlayerWantedToAttack(5) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_Execution_State_PlayerWantedToAttack(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:3d4b8dcc-3752-3334-87de-6e77184e4241
msgctxt "h2d11f5dfg0d9fg4a42g9bf2g4af7b859439e"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e21c4a0-fc45-b808-af75-8ca49a141857
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:3e21c4a0-fc45-b808-af75-8ca49a141857
msgctxt "h195f001egabbcg4d88g91f6g181610e275da"
msgid "You know me? You know of my madness?"
msgstr "날 알고 있습니까? 나의 광증에 대해서도?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 3f58648d-1297-437a-6182-13a507a469f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:3f58648d-1297-437a-6182-13a507a469f6
msgctxt "h6bbef1e7ga18fg42dcga7d8g5380a11d039b"
msgid "True, ultimate failure must earn ultimate punishment."
msgstr "맞는 말이다. 최대의 실패는 최악의 처벌을 받아야 마땅하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 400f2871-cb5b-0a2e-0ba1-8bffb83b9191
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:400f2871-cb5b-0a2e-0ba1-8bffb83b9191
msgctxt "h1d4be0c9g26f7g4574gbbf5g9825ddce2b85"
msgid "Well, True Soul? What about the goblins?"
msgstr "그래, 참된 영혼? 고블린은 어떻게 할까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Drenn
#. NodeID = 40eab7d1-24c2-3e1b-c578-4f26f5e54a5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:40eab7d1-24c2-3e1b-c578-4f26f5e54a5b
msgctxt "h2281f58eg889ag481bg90a1g04d26267a97e"
msgid "You lyin' little -"
msgstr "이 년이 거짓말을-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 41c70739-9903-e360-60ff-9d2e929b4a13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Isobel_State_AtMoonrise = True
#.      - HAV_Isobel_State_IsDead = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:41c70739-9903-e360-60ff-9d2e929b4a13
msgctxt "h7aa64fb9g9177g43e1gb744gf36b90770e07"
msgid ""
"Ah! The True Soul who retrieved Isobel - good of you to make yourself known."
msgstr "아! 이소벨을 되찾아온 참된 영혼이군. 때마침 아주 잘 왔네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Darra
#. NodeID = 421998eb-3664-d759-8689-4daca8ebc074
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_GoblinsKillThemselves = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:421998eb-3664-d759-8689-4daca8ebc074
msgctxt "h1e846aa9g458eg4077g9078gb044ec5bdb1a"
msgid "URgggh..."
msgstr "으으윽..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 44c8b5d7-9198-0969-bc5e-452e4630ffcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:44c8b5d7-9198-0969-bc5e-452e4630ffcb
msgctxt "hd0caf3cdg8bd6g47beg9c4cgf7762127b53c"
msgid ""
"*As the General's attention shifts to you, a memory stirs - a memory of this "
"room, and his voice raised in anger.*"
msgstr "*장군의 관심이 당신에게 쏠리자, 하나의 기억이 떠오릅니다. 이 방에 대한 기억, 그리고 분노로 가득찬 그의 목소리.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 45cb77f6-3093-4e8d-159a-2d023dea826a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:45cb77f6-3093-4e8d-159a-2d023dea826a
msgctxt "h78e9ca7fg20e7g48bega937gdb377b6c1bc8"
msgid ""
"Or better yet - put that True Soul to use. You have far more important "
"matters to attend to - or have you forgotten?"
msgstr "이게 더 좋겠군. 참된 영혼을 활용하지. 자네는 다른 중요한 할 일들이 있지 않나. 잊은 건 아니겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 46929be3-cc6f-59a7-d507-140e51b71862
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:46929be3-cc6f-59a7-d507-140e51b71862
msgctxt "hc680e8d3g28f0g4f05g99ceg3d3891578088"
msgid ""
"Let me make sure I understand this - you're claiming that General Thorm gave "
"you the wrong soldiers?"
msgstr "내가 네 말을 제대로 알아들은 건지 확인해보겠다. 쏨 장군님께서 병력을 잘못 주셨다고 주장하는 것이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 470d87e9-86ac-bac6-fbd1-0d69e4bc23df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:470d87e9-86ac-bac6-fbd1-0d69e4bc23df
msgctxt "h6fefb3a2g5f2fg42a3ga24fg2e1dc81dd371"
msgid "I did all the hard work - she'd be dead already without my help."
msgstr "궂은 일은 내가 다 했습니다. 내 도움이 아니었다면 그녀는 이미 죽었을 테죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4715ca60-a669-89e1-1e1d-834a51e80a7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:4715ca60-a669-89e1-1e1d-834a51e80a7c
msgctxt "h29d4cb0ag25ddg4353ga0a3g502a8dba656d"
msgid "They're faithful soldiers. You should set them free."
msgstr "녀석들은 신실한 병사였죠. 풀어주셔야 합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 4bc64594-413b-8b39-a7de-db235860150b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:4bc64594-413b-8b39-a7de-db235860150b
msgctxt "h1dd4ed5eg5b4ag486cg812bgcb0e9cdec745"
msgid "I'm so sorry, my lord. She's an unbeliever - outside my control."
msgstr "정말 죄송합니다, 주군. 저 년은 불신자여서 통제할 수가 없었습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4e428cc1-f579-e80d-f39c-35647395c905
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:4e428cc1-f579-e80d-f39c-35647395c905
msgctxt "h6713370dg3a23g42cfgb924g9d1e9427a424"
msgid "<i>Keep silent and keep watching.</i>"
msgstr "<i>조용히 지켜본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4e90dfa0-43d1-fd5a-73f5-61bfbca4e036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:4e90dfa0-43d1-fd5a-73f5-61bfbca4e036
msgctxt "h26af1b34gcacbg4265ga5bfg1289db0b6638"
msgid ""
"*Your disgrace has something to do with this Ketheric. You yearn to flay him "
"until he forgets himself, as you have.*"
msgstr ""
"*이 케서릭이라는 자는 당신이 겪은 치욕의 내막을 알고 있습니다. 당신은 그가 당신과 똑같이 스스로를 잊을 때까지 생살을 벗겨 내길 "
"갈망합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 51ed82d0-ef69-3619-ac20-ba84812d4d93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:51ed82d0-ef69-3619-ac20-ba84812d4d93
msgctxt "h53a4fdf4gf276g499ega4dfgffa633a2f806"
msgid ""
"I would remind you that while in my halls, you obey me - just as you would "
"any other Chosen."
msgstr "상기할 게 하나 있네. 이 곳에 있을 때는 내게 복종하도록. 다른 선택받은 자에게 하듯이 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5434c864-114d-4fc7-b22f-fa5de29de960
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(14) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(14) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:5434c864-114d-4fc7-b22f-fa5de29de960
msgctxt "h23c09066gd1aeg49bag9453g285bd54b2e0e"
msgid "Wait - we don't exactly have the advantage here."
msgstr "기다려. 우리가 우위를 점하고 있는 상황이 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 547a2335-4b5b-8eef-a10c-de8f84445dcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:547a2335-4b5b-8eef-a10c-de8f84445dcf
msgctxt "ha3f541b0gbb5ag4e91gab9fg674684004d5a"
msgid ""
"They are yours. You can release them, kill them, or feed them to each other "
"for all I care. Just deal with them."
msgstr "네가 알아서 하면 된다. 저놈들을 풀어주든, 죽이든, 서로를 잡아먹게 하든, 상관없다. 그냥 처리하도록 해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56132cce-25b9-af79-8b27-ac0db728c77c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:56132cce-25b9-af79-8b27-ac0db728c77c
msgctxt "h614440e9gd286g46ffgbef5ge37210546c33"
msgid "<i>Indulge in your thoughts of lacerating him.</i>"
msgstr "<i>놈을 찢어버리고 싶은 생각에 빠져든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5849ed28-7861-af6b-15c0-0e30f8261005
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:5849ed28-7861-af6b-15c0-0e30f8261005
msgctxt "hca3d9c7eg21e2g4c2bg9f2dg3c71d4ea9300"
msgid "<i>Attack!</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 5879fb16-e6a2-dd63-cf32-79e7bf208f67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:5879fb16-e6a2-dd63-cf32-79e7bf208f67
msgctxt "h63b5d02fgad2eg4308g8f3fg78bf120e4a50"
msgid "No - please -"
msgstr "안 돼, 제발..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 59caf24d-f4bd-01cd-f136-259edb070a02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:59caf24d-f4bd-01cd-f136-259edb070a02
msgctxt "hc2419543g4e7bg46aega6b5g83598ed0e335"
msgid "Thank you. I'm glad someone noticed."
msgstr "고마워. 한 명이라도 알아줘서 기쁘군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 5b3d41b7-df3e-47fe-c324-37e1f0572ef0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:5b3d41b7-df3e-47fe-c324-37e1f0572ef0
msgctxt "h58c9bd77g6e94g4d5ag9937gb63b0cd9e721"
msgid "And there you have it."
msgstr "그렇다면 자네 뜻대로 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 5c497186-dc2a-4876-da9c-be5289dde48c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:5c497186-dc2a-4876-da9c-be5289dde48c
msgctxt "hff3ec213gc074g4f2fga053gdef984e31ca4"
msgid "General?"
msgstr "장군님?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 5dbe1e9d-fae5-2817-2d28-96eb220c3ffa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:5dbe1e9d-fae5-2817-2d28-96eb220c3ffa
msgctxt "hd7abd9efg4031g4e9agb0cdg2fb11986451b"
msgid ""
"You heard the General. The goblins are yours - deal with them however you "
"wish."
msgstr "장군님 말씀 들었지. 이 고블린들은 네 몫이다. 원하는 대로 처리하도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 5e53ec6a-9550-a0ef-56f6-30370fd0a912
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_Attack = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:5e53ec6a-9550-a0ef-56f6-30370fd0a912
msgctxt "h93c2d532gff19g4408gb98fgd36c3d7a23cf"
msgid "I'll enjoy this."
msgstr "재미있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 5e9190da-4938-4612-8ddf-69fca985e16a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:5e9190da-4938-4612-8ddf-69fca985e16a
msgctxt "ha23bf35ag6816g4077g9821g6dbd37f479f3"
msgid "Kill the goblins, too."
msgstr "고블린들도 죽여라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5fc76a6c-d799-213c-250c-3525598db3ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(14) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(14) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:5fc76a6c-d799-213c-250c-3525598db3ab
msgctxt "h37c244fegdab3g4aeagb725g278dd2fa38f0"
msgid ""
"Your merciful streak will be the death of us one day. Let's hope Z'rell "
"won't be too angry."
msgstr "네 무른 구석이 언젠가는 우리 발목을 잡고 말 거야. 즈렐이 너무 화나지 않았기를 바라자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 6064125a-aa0d-41f9-1a45-8e6153f53c34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(10) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(10) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:6064125a-aa0d-41f9-1a45-8e6153f53c34
msgctxt "hbc230567g3228g4c83g9fb0g049d7319cacc"
msgid ""
"I do enjoy a bit of casual bloodshed. Now come - I'd like to know more about "
"this 'Z'rell'."
msgstr "유혈이 낭자하는 광경을 즐기는 편이긴 해. 다만 지금은 이 '즈렐'이라는 자에 대해 더 자세히 알아봤으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 6096587a-7ee4-cf46-435a-80f5faa4596d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:6096587a-7ee4-cf46-435a-80f5faa4596d
msgctxt "h2bb6e6ffg8faeg459ega09egeaeb83d2e6ee"
msgid "You know I'm loyal, tell 'im -"
msgstr "내가 충성스러운 거 알잖아. 장군님께 말씀드려!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 609f26b6-660c-5b6a-d649-6209bc578042
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_RaiderVictory = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:609f26b6-660c-5b6a-d649-6209bc578042
msgctxt "h5b392aa9g8101g4361gb92ag3c2361af7dd2"
msgid ""
"Ah, the True Soul who delivered a grove of non-believers into the Absolute's "
"arms."
msgstr "아, 숲의 불신자들을 절대자님의 품으로 보냈던 참된 영혼이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 61cdc699-182d-4d19-cf1c-85fd30d99a46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:61cdc699-182d-4d19-cf1c-85fd30d99a46
msgctxt "h7aebd9f5gb3c9g4378gabc2gd91ce7ed1762"
msgid "But we are here to speak of Minthara, not you."
msgstr "하지만 우리는 지금 민타라에 대해 논하는 중이다, 네가 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 61eaee91-8f51-966d-a9b3-6c9c55416c9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:61eaee91-8f51-966d-a9b3-6c9c55416c9e
msgctxt "h153ce240g51d7g4e91g852agaeb3ec45d72c"
msgid "Kill them. Quickly."
msgstr "전부 죽여라. 빠르게 끝내라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 6277d0b4-5359-2a4f-0cbf-8afbd38a0377
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(21) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:6277d0b4-5359-2a4f-0cbf-8afbd38a0377
msgctxt "h646e157bg0ab2g49fbgbda9g3c0cd207f8c9"
msgid "You scrag!"
msgstr "이 멀대 같은 여자가!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 62cd4c86-fc4b-d6d2-000d-7a0e95d8e734
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_UsedIllithidPowers = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:62cd4c86-fc4b-d6d2-000d-7a0e95d8e734
msgctxt "ha6d2e6cdg24bfg412bga9eeg54d17a960f91"
msgid "I dream of blood pools deep enough to bathe in. Run me a bath."
msgstr "몸을 담글만 한 피웅덩이를 한 번 보는 게 꿈이었어. 핏물로 목욕이나 해 보실까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 62cd4c86-fc4b-d6d2-000d-7a0e95d8e734
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_UsedIllithidPowers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:62cd4c86-fc4b-d6d2-000d-7a0e95d8e734
msgctxt "h3d40b670gba38g4349gb558ge37bd5647052"
msgid "Spill your guts on the floor. I want to see you bleed."
msgstr "스스로 배를 갈라 바닥에 내장을 쏟아내라. 너희가 피를 흘리는 걸 보고 싶구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6320934c-85be-9e7b-80d6-52af4838ebe2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:6320934c-85be-9e7b-80d6-52af4838ebe2
msgctxt "h91018bb0g657fg4604g956ag91f437c8f866"
msgid "<i>Hold back.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물러선다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 64f529c2-399c-45e8-8254-fcf7782fc92f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(12) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(12) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:64f529c2-399c-45e8-8254-fcf7782fc92f
msgctxt "h91e7cd7dgfcd6g4018ga2e1g223f56d4543d"
msgid "I'd reconsider. He's not exactly open to attack just now."
msgstr "나라면 다시 생각해보겠어. 지금 공격하기엔 때가 좋지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 663038f9-3109-05b8-28e1-5a50561eb95f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_MintharaLeaves = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:663038f9-3109-05b8-28e1-5a50561eb95f
msgctxt "h5517a319ga5beg419egbd60g5ddc203511bc"
msgid "Take her below. We can deal with her once the apostate is dead."
msgstr "민타라는 아래층으로 데려가도록. 변절자를 죽인 후 처리할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 675f17c5-0ac5-2fba-4ac8-e808ae56d5ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:675f17c5-0ac5-2fba-4ac8-e808ae56d5ad
msgctxt "h04ab542dg899bg45begbea3g4925020bba26"
msgid "Us? No no, it was Minthara. She got the orders, she -"
msgstr "저희가요? 아니, 아니에요. 민타라였죠. 명령을 받은 건 민타라였는데-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 67cb1697-2809-7dd5-bef7-f540742d011a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:67cb1697-2809-7dd5-bef7-f540742d011a
msgctxt "hd5a81bd6g2908g4628g9b3bg844e303bea47"
msgid "And what do you have to contribute?"
msgstr "자네의 고견은 어떠한가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 68d78a66-be7e-7897-e4db-319a3085b9fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinKingScryingStarted = True
#.      - GOB_GoblinKing_Event_DefeatedOnce = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:68d78a66-be7e-7897-e4db-319a3085b9fa
msgctxt "h4915fa39g4f87g4c2bgb5f4g975a5a63d9b7"
msgid "Ah, the True Soul who so impressed Dror Ragzlin."
msgstr "아, 드롤 라그즐린에게 깊은 인상을 남겼던 참된 영혼이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 690cf605-f8be-9f82-ae3f-6c6aa9c32f9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:690cf605-f8be-9f82-ae3f-6c6aa9c32f9c
msgctxt "he16167dage8c7g4cc8g88f3g8cc4cb193aa8"
msgid ""
"*In another lifetime, you were greeted in this throne room like a God, not "
"the living wreck you are now.*"
msgstr "*다른 생애에서 당신은 이 왕좌의 방에서 지금과 같은 살아 있는 시체가 아니라 신으로 대우받았습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6927eccf-d4e7-41df-9f81-3a779371c513
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:6927eccf-d4e7-41df-9f81-3a779371c513
msgctxt "h17ed2136ge4dbg4581gb038g037f55b6e7e8"
msgid ""
"*Nothing sickens you more than a man who is unkillable. But to a veteran "
"deviant such as yourself, it is but a matter of time.*"
msgstr ""
"*죽일 수 없는 사람만큼 당신의 골치를 썩이는 문젯거리도 없습니다. 물론 당신같이 노련한 돌연변이에게는 시간 문제일 따름입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 6de3573c-f3e0-db88-4f7b-584eb4a77a44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_Knows_AboutImmortality = True
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_KethericRegenerated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:6de3573c-f3e0-db88-4f7b-584eb4a77a44
msgctxt "hc14dd845gcc27g4eacg8bf9gfb6a4d2c5924"
msgid "Hmm."
msgstr "흐음."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e04250a-5694-9ff0-68a0-2757c3b36af4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_UsedIllithidPowers = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:6e04250a-5694-9ff0-68a0-2757c3b36af4
msgctxt "h3e13391egdceeg4a70gb8d0g2e87041a95b7"
msgid "BEG! CHOKE! DIE!"
msgstr "<b>빌어라! 질식해라! 죽어라!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e04250a-5694-9ff0-68a0-2757c3b36af4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_UsedIllithidPowers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:6e04250a-5694-9ff0-68a0-2757c3b36af4
msgctxt "h56d07e47gfa2dg45abg8ea2g16c88eb5599d"
msgid "Not another word. In fact - not another breath from any of you."
msgstr "더 이상 입 열지 마. 아니, 숨조차 쉬지 않았으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 6ecef960-f8c8-a05b-1316-9d8bdd1a30e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:6ecef960-f8c8-a05b-1316-9d8bdd1a30e4
msgctxt "hfb514af4gf278g4e05gb403g176fa384a2be"
msgid ""
"I have seen the acts you revel in. You are no soldier - you are a scourge."
msgstr "네가 즐기는 게 뭔지 난 잘 안다. 넌 병사가 아니야. 재앙 그 자체다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 70c5bb92-f139-4bc8-a400-ac9450af2743
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:70c5bb92-f139-4bc8-a400-ac9450af2743
msgctxt "h9084ca2ag403bg4cd6g9183ge79cb2162faf"
msgid "Of course, my lord. Thank you."
msgstr "물론입니다, 주군. 감사드립니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 70ca3d3d-d943-c881-e4e5-a747d1279f9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:70ca3d3d-d943-c881-e4e5-a747d1279f9b
msgctxt "h646d7d83gde75g49d4gaa69gffe491629d58"
msgid "What do you intend to do with her?"
msgstr "그녀를 어찌할 생각인가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 715c1748-3d21-bad7-5a75-17d1751519db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:715c1748-3d21-bad7-5a75-17d1751519db
msgctxt "hbcf7e286g6c69g4213gb353g93b3b249ba58"
msgid "Do - have fun."
msgstr "그럼, 즐거운 시간 보내도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71a77bdb-8c33-d626-3524-0c20c180be31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:71a77bdb-8c33-d626-3524-0c20c180be31
msgctxt "h6ffecf07g52ffg4091g9101g652bb8208774"
msgid "Make her suffer, until pain is all she knows."
msgstr "그녀에겐 고통을 줘야겠죠. 고통 외에는 아무것도 느끼지 못하게 될 때까지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 739c305d-c829-6d38-7b5c-7135c58d5918
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:739c305d-c829-6d38-7b5c-7135c58d5918
msgctxt "h838bc11fg5e60g4f97g85f8g3134c0832170"
msgid "You! Me old mate that saved me from the tieflings -"
msgstr "너! 나를 예전에 티플링한테서 구해 준 친구잖아-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 76519e66-ad44-bae1-7c95-9859b1d945db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:76519e66-ad44-bae1-7c95-9859b1d945db
msgctxt "hea7817ffg146fg46c5ga951g6629c2b2a8b9"
msgid "Kill them. Quickly."
msgstr "죽여라. 빠르게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Drenn
#. NodeID = 7d38e389-042a-1853-9488-f049359d5e15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:7d38e389-042a-1853-9488-f049359d5e15
msgctxt "hf520aef7gd182g41cfgb8a4g2b6fde3d4177"
msgid "Thank you. 'S good to be appreciated."
msgstr "고마워. 인정받으니 좋은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8044c1a2-4c26-a632-e279-66001e221667
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_TriedHelpingMinthara = False
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_SpokeAgainstMinthara = True
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_RemainedSilent = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:8044c1a2-4c26-a632-e279-66001e221667
msgctxt "h5ccb0cc7gd7abg43edgbe2agbb9b502d5731"
msgid "I'd kill her right now, if I were you."
msgstr "내가 당신이었다면 당장 죽여버렸을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8044c1a2-4c26-a632-e279-66001e221667
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_TriedHelpingMinthara = False
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_SpokeAgainstMinthara = True
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_RemainedSilent = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:8044c1a2-4c26-a632-e279-66001e221667
msgctxt "h3fb21adegbba8g4a4bgbf5cgd481513c4000"
msgid "Why not kill her here? Be done with it."
msgstr "왜 여기서 죽이지 않지? 바로 끝낼 수 있는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Drenn
#. NodeID = 84912ed5-fbec-3747-321a-d8bd9364c654
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:84912ed5-fbec-3747-321a-d8bd9364c654
msgctxt "hbe8095ddgfbc0g480dgbcafgba32bf0e7885"
msgid "Ha! Bye-bye, princess."
msgstr "하! 잘 가셔요, 공주님."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 84a8e69f-1380-a0a2-7940-7bdb23b54160
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:84a8e69f-1380-a0a2-7940-7bdb23b54160
msgctxt "hc5c57aabg61e5g4853gb876g798248d8da2d"
msgid "Please - you gotta help me. For old times' sake?"
msgstr "부탁해. 나 좀 도와줘. 옛정을 봐서라도?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 84b31a58-094a-c823-1072-44b17d644172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_TriedHelpingMinthara = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:84b31a58-094a-c823-1072-44b17d644172
msgctxt "h6d814960gfd9fg4129g89d7g5b8e09620fe4"
msgid "<i>Calm Z'rell's mind - make her treat Minthara with mercy.</i>"
msgstr "<i>즈렐의 정신을 진정시킨다. 민타라를 자비롭게 대하게 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 84b31a58-094a-c823-1072-44b17d644172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_TriedHelpingMinthara = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:84b31a58-094a-c823-1072-44b17d644172
msgctxt "h17238efbg155cg4428g8424gf23fafef5069"
msgid "<i>Mentally influence Z'rell - make her show Minthara mercy.</i>"
msgstr "<i>즈렐의 정신에 영향을 끼친다. 민타라에게 자비를 보이도록 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 86a7ccfa-35a9-1135-8422-3634ff57964f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:86a7ccfa-35a9-1135-8422-3634ff57964f
msgctxt "hf33814f8g97b9g4f55gba47gf9644a8b7961"
msgid "You. True Soul."
msgstr "거기 자네. 참된 영혼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86b164c1-8c51-4a33-ab7b-a5b07a4ab312
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_SpokeAgainstMinthara = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:86b164c1-8c51-4a33-ab7b-a5b07a4ab312
msgctxt "ha94d6c04g3372g4b13gbc44g5ce4cb92208d"
msgid ""
"<i>Force yourself into Minthara's mind. Make her scream her own "
"damnation.</i>"
msgstr "<i>민타라의 머릿속으로 비집고 들어간다. 그녀가 스스로를 매도하며 울부짖게 만든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86b164c1-8c51-4a33-ab7b-a5b07a4ab312
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_SpokeAgainstMinthara = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:86b164c1-8c51-4a33-ab7b-a5b07a4ab312
msgctxt "hb0e12f57ge0f4g4b8fga48agf2277c08585a"
msgid ""
"<i>Use your power to influence Minthara - try to force her to admit her "
"guilt.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 힘을 사용해 민타라에게 영향을 미쳐, 스스로의 잘못을 인정하도록 만든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 8715b362-d96f-1c87-af48-d9934c3256de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:8715b362-d96f-1c87-af48-d9934c3256de
msgctxt "h277dfd26gca38g4b37g9fddg2addfc23da4f"
msgid ""
"True Soul. You have seen these goblins at work, have you not? What say you?"
msgstr "참된 영혼. 이 고블린들의 일처리를 봤겠지. 어떻게 생각하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 8802814d-4cb9-ebe2-b9c2-7294cea10bc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:8802814d-4cb9-ebe2-b9c2-7294cea10bc7
msgctxt "h241b00ebg86f2g499fgb83fgbe29cb0052d6"
msgid "Better than you know yourself, it seems."
msgstr "자네가 아는 것보단 잘 아는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 8ca93486-454a-4338-bf36-28d95e6de2bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_GoblinsKillThemselves = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:8ca93486-454a-4338-bf36-28d95e6de2bd
msgctxt "hb4a636c5gf254g4191gbd19g2fcf984888cc"
msgid "URgggh..."
msgstr "으으윽..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8cda5b91-56c2-c9cb-2c14-81803970280e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:8cda5b91-56c2-c9cb-2c14-81803970280e
msgctxt "hd4a7e436g42ccg482fg8aaagd316ff939b4e"
msgid "She's a valuable soldier - she serves the Absolute faithfully."
msgstr "그녀는 쓸 만한 군인입니다. 그녀는 절대자를 충실히 섬겼습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 8d5e3d96-05d1-e706-1235-8a56fd9ce3d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:8d5e3d96-05d1-e706-1235-8a56fd9ce3d3
msgctxt "h25eaef77gc799g4668ga9bcg4a81b17d8061"
msgid "Better than you know yourself, it seems."
msgstr "자네가 아는 것보단 잘 아는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 8def007e-5fab-148c-5dac-3bb0c46d433f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:8def007e-5fab-148c-5dac-3bb0c46d433f
msgctxt "h570c24eag8fcbg4a6egae9ag1251b77b20de"
msgid ""
"Or better yet - let us take advantage of our surprising guest, and their "
"particular creative genius."
msgstr "이게 더 좋겠군. 우리 놀라운 손님과 그의 특별하게 창의적인 천재성의 덕을 좀 보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 90a65d0b-f502-0ce3-847f-c2a781929015
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:90a65d0b-f502-0ce3-847f-c2a781929015
msgctxt "h76c19addg4008g4fa2gb502g612100473b18"
msgid "Report to me upstairs when you're done."
msgstr "끝나고 나면 위층으로 올라와 보고하도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Drenn
#. NodeID = 90d57ed1-3e94-1c25-a27b-70e475252923
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:90d57ed1-3e94-1c25-a27b-70e475252923
msgctxt "hbdfc0c8ag304fg47e9gaf51gced64f0cc672"
msgid "You ain't serious. You can't be."
msgstr "진심은 아니겠지. 이럴 수는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 91f61a5f-a97a-0206-0c4e-b6b3e41d749b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:91f61a5f-a97a-0206-0c4e-b6b3e41d749b
msgctxt "h048ea35fg6bddg496agb2bag33d3bb6d1c7a"
msgid "It ain't our fault, General! We did as we were told -"
msgstr "저희 잘못 아니에요, 장군님! 저희는 시키는 대로만-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9479ecd0-a678-affc-25d6-91d07dcf2562
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:9479ecd0-a678-affc-25d6-91d07dcf2562
msgctxt "h4f443163g9423g4bafg9b46gda8f1dbc832a"
msgid "<i>Contain your excitement.</i>"
msgstr "<i>흥분을 억누른다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9479ecd0-a678-affc-25d6-91d07dcf2562
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:9479ecd0-a678-affc-25d6-91d07dcf2562
msgctxt "h9d6923b5g23d7g4030gb046g64bd3f7f8bef"
msgid "<i>Nod curtly.</i>"
msgstr "<i>짧게 끄덕인다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 95359da3-eb1e-058a-e8c6-0c93ae4c07a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:95359da3-eb1e-058a-e8c6-0c93ae4c07a6
msgctxt "h08a31f90g0fa4g463agb97eg58ae9494a809"
msgid "Faith without action is anaemic, sickly. In a word, <i>useless</i>."
msgstr "행동하지 않는 신실함이란, 곧 역겨울 정도로 빈약한 것이지. 한마디로 <i>쓸모 없다</i>는 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Darra
#. NodeID = 958de120-4033-56f5-2b56-93cde858d60d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:958de120-4033-56f5-2b56-93cde858d60d
msgctxt "h817d1155gfd86g4984g8764geb415bdb00fc"
msgid "You scrag!"
msgstr "이 멀대 같은 여자가!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99a5881a-014a-9f37-9338-3eb8b3f2906e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:99a5881a-014a-9f37-9338-3eb8b3f2906e
msgctxt "hcb44468dg63f8g4e73g8bb1gc49ac2499a80"
msgid ""
"I could make it <i>much</i> more creative. As a torturer, I am unmatched."
msgstr "내가 <i>훨씬</i> 더 창의적으로 할 수 있습니다. 나는 고문자로서 특출나거든요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 9a8acb1e-513c-b290-5119-75ee76851415
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:9a8acb1e-513c-b290-5119-75ee76851415
msgctxt "h3362635egfbc9g41c2gabaeg3c7e08282187"
msgid "A new True Soul, come to share their wisdom?"
msgstr "새로 온 참된 영혼이여, 우리와 지혜를 나누고자 왔는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 9b9f6bd3-2a3c-ae4a-bb39-23e41e3cb7c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:9b9f6bd3-2a3c-ae4a-bb39-23e41e3cb7c0
msgctxt "h86453ad2g9229g4dc2g80d6g2c0c22f8b3dc"
msgid "That we can do."
msgstr "그건 가능하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9bdc4b86-41d3-57b5-cdb3-c893b5ebf29e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:9bdc4b86-41d3-57b5-cdb3-c893b5ebf29e
msgctxt "h5ab561c7g435ag4079ga4f2ge1eb34010b9b"
msgid ""
"*With difficulty, you banish the pooling evil that bewitches your quivering "
"limbs.*"
msgstr "*당신은 충동으로 달달 떨리는 팔다리에서 사악한 악마의 유혹을 간신히 떨쳐 냅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = 9c7c9deb-4edc-9a34-3e97-2bd733d8869e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:9c7c9deb-4edc-9a34-3e97-2bd733d8869e
msgctxt "hb8a2f38dge5eeg408egb5f2g4274217f94e7"
msgid "Silence!"
msgstr "정숙!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Drenn
#. NodeID = 9ce845f7-e8dd-c504-5d8a-9c34bb14582c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:9ce845f7-e8dd-c504-5d8a-9c34bb14582c
msgctxt "h5ffcf437g3fa0g4a8cg8783g26efd3562b7f"
msgid "We did as we were told! We're loyal to the Absolute - tell 'im!"
msgstr "시킨 대로 한 거라구! 우리는 절대자께 충성한다고 장군님께 말씀드려!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d12143a-b829-0759-92ec-11266d48a93b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:9d12143a-b829-0759-92ec-11266d48a93b
msgctxt "hf9a0154dg3c7eg4785g9cb8g2ef9f0f50094"
msgid "<i>Hold back.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물러선다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 9d6b78b9-b89d-ce78-c130-c0774b0b6945
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:9d6b78b9-b89d-ce78-c130-c0774b0b6945
msgctxt "h9185e860gfa51g410dg8946g2946263254bf"
msgid "Don't listen, General! I never met this scrag before in me life."
msgstr "저 말은 듣지 마세요, 장군님! 이 멀대 같은 녀석은 만나본 적도 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = 9e7830b0-a817-bf44-f159-c4f154eab1ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_State_LeftAbsolute = False
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_State_WentMT = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:9e7830b0-a817-bf44-f159-c4f154eab1ac
msgctxt "h1f0beb85gfadfg4719ga242gd3a012628b0f"
msgid "Ah, the True Soul who saved poor, lost Nere from his mistakes."
msgstr "아, 가엾고 길잃은 니어를 그의 실수로부터 구해주었던 참된 영혼이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = a05403f3-16e3-af68-b878-24b5c434d823
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:a05403f3-16e3-af68-b878-24b5c434d823
msgctxt "h74ff27cag9fdfg4b16g896cg8b14c22c3e22"
msgid "Take Minthara below. Someone will have to consider her fate."
msgstr "민타라를 아래층으로 데려가라. 그 운명이 어떻게 될지 누군가가 정하긴 해야겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Drenn
#. NodeID = a140c49b-3e50-594e-a046-37d1bbbfe743
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:a140c49b-3e50-594e-a046-37d1bbbfe743
msgctxt "h5a0e8ca7g0645g40f9g8e1ag59c1c41b942f"
msgid "It ain't true! We're good as anyone - just give us a chance."
msgstr "사실이 아닙니다! 저희도 실력이 좋다구요. 그냥 기회를 좀 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Drenn
#. NodeID = a14d4ea9-3f0d-f694-83ca-54d24f273e17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:a14d4ea9-3f0d-f694-83ca-54d24f273e17
msgctxt "hbbde8d9dg682fg4707g83d5g6550ca95917a"
msgid "Take it up with Minthara. She's the one who -"
msgstr "그건 민타라 책임이죠. 그 여자가-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = a18197ba-8ea1-cab7-8fc6-4fef7791953b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:a18197ba-8ea1-cab7-8fc6-4fef7791953b
msgctxt "h1cdc81f9g999eg4c1ag9a73g8deaaa8ae86d"
msgid "I - yes! It's the goblins' fault. They failed you, General, not me."
msgstr "저 - 그렇습니다! 이건 다 고블린들 때문입니다. 제가 아니라 저놈들이 장군님을 실망시킨 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = a2ee6544-3686-acd7-c79e-fbf6ff862323
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DARK_URGE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:a2ee6544-3686-acd7-c79e-fbf6ff862323
msgctxt "hb8e7bc13gcc93g42c2g9164gf8258b5d27ca"
msgid ""
"I'm surprised to see you again, True Soul. You are here to assist and not to "
"meddle, I trust."
msgstr "다시 보게 되어 놀랍군, 참된 영혼이여. 간섭이 아니라 도움을 주러 온 거라고 믿겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Drenn
#. NodeID = a439ecd4-7766-db4b-bdb0-13c81222fad6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:a439ecd4-7766-db4b-bdb0-13c81222fad6
msgctxt "h2cdfe213g9a5bg44d8g930agc513050f9880"
msgid "You creaking old bag of shit!"
msgstr "이 늙어빠진 새끼야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a608b739-de3b-dbfe-55f3-a6848e98b6c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:a608b739-de3b-dbfe-55f3-a6848e98b6c8
msgctxt "h456a77a6g6cdbg4693g8705gf0bfeb2b37f7"
msgid ""
"*Perhaps parts of you were scattered in this spire. Time to knit yourself "
"together.*"
msgstr "*당신의 일부가 이 첨탑 안에 흩어져 있을 지도 모릅니다. 본모습을 되찾을 시간입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = a69677bd-ec4b-61ce-9f3d-db4aa04fb90e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(9) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(9) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:a69677bd-ec4b-61ce-9f3d-db4aa04fb90e
msgctxt "hf9c0885fg41aag4b46g94bfg976d0551e208"
msgid ""
"Ketheric plays a cruel game, and you had no choice but to play. Now let's "
"talk to Z'rell."
msgstr "케서릭은 잔인한 게임을 했고, 넌 거기 맞춰줄 수 밖에 없었어. 이제 즈렐에게로 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = a7d224a2-2cf8-3f6a-983a-af1623709917
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_GoblinsKillThemselves = True
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_FezzerkDied = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:a7d224a2-2cf8-3f6a-983a-af1623709917
msgctxt "h204b4cddg99e3g4888g85d7g0c4c6146b440"
msgid "URgggh..."
msgstr "으으윽..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ac911079-e59a-0a32-3de9-e8ee7bf1deb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(13) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(13) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:ac911079-e59a-0a32-3de9-e8ee7bf1deb8
msgctxt "h1502847dg6e82g4030gbac8ga41f5c74a4c4"
msgid "Well. That's done with. Might as well go say hello to Z'rell, then."
msgstr "자, 다 끝났군. 그러면 이제 즈렐에게 인사하러 가면 되겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aca10ae7-ed07-03d3-db83-66de89f3eede
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:aca10ae7-ed07-03d3-db83-66de89f3eede
msgctxt "hfc545379ge4e0g4aefgb4dag82749e593e10"
msgid "<i>Look around the room, trying to remember it.</i>"
msgstr "<i>방을 둘러보고, 기억해 내려고 시도한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = ad981d50-c5b3-6e0b-3f99-2e957925c3da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(11) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(11) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:ad981d50-c5b3-6e0b-3f99-2e957925c3da
msgctxt "h5ad25165g8d03g480cg86aeg4df5e7ecad03"
msgid "Done, nice and neat. Now, let's report to the lovely Z'rell."
msgstr "끝났군. 깔끔하고 완벽해. 이제 사랑스러운 즈렐에게 보고하러 가지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = ae47861d-5ccb-2590-785b-2ba778551011
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:ae47861d-5ccb-2590-785b-2ba778551011
msgctxt "h13248c9bg0779g4040g9284ga4bdb7d9fe44"
msgid "No. Please, mercy! Please!"
msgstr "안 돼. 제발, 자비를, 부디!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = ae6f071c-fcc2-f6b4-1100-b2d0c364925a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Knows_Executioner = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:ae6f071c-fcc2-f6b4-1100-b2d0c364925a
msgctxt "h6ec06fddg0749g4b7fgbbe1gb973134caa6e"
msgid ""
"The facts suggest otherwise. You were ordered to retrieve the artefact - you "
"failed to do so."
msgstr "사실관계를 보아하니 그렇지 않은 것 같은데. 너는 아티팩트를 되찾으라는 명령을 받았고, 그 임무에 실패했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b00603dd-f1a7-3cfd-c8e9-3e2d83b91c1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_DarkUrge_Quest_Execution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:b00603dd-f1a7-3cfd-c8e9-3e2d83b91c1b
msgctxt "he47a0345g46c9g4e3ag9fedg4d4c357fca9b"
msgid ""
"*His smirk says everything and nothing at once. 'I know exactly who you are, "
"and I will <i>never </i>tell.'*"
msgstr ""
"*그의 냉소는 많은 뜻을 내포하고 있으나, 정작 아무것도 알려주진 않습니다. '난 네가 누군지 정확히 알아, <i>절대</i> 말해 주진 "
"않겠지만.'*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b05060e7-5d3b-7dc3-5dcd-04eb006f6468
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_ReleasedGoblins = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:b05060e7-5d3b-7dc3-5dcd-04eb006f6468
msgctxt "hd9a99f38gbcffg47b8g995ega1cc19028fde"
msgid "<i>Put aside your torments. Free them.</i>"
msgstr "<i>충동을 억제하고, 그들을 풀어준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b05060e7-5d3b-7dc3-5dcd-04eb006f6468
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_ReleasedGoblins = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:b05060e7-5d3b-7dc3-5dcd-04eb006f6468
msgctxt "hf297f01cg138fg44f7gaf4fgf7ea88fbedb9"
msgid "Guards. Release them."
msgstr "경비병. 저들을 풀어 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = b140bb3c-5f1d-2680-d168-50e43db9d9de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:b140bb3c-5f1d-2680-d168-50e43db9d9de
msgctxt "hb88e1a76g4767g4aa7g8089g9fbf420d0b06"
msgid ""
"Here, in the seat of the Absolute's power, your authority over them is "
"complete. They will obey any command."
msgstr "절대자님의 권능이 있는 이곳에서, 저 고블린들에 대한 네 권한은 완전하다. 녀석들은 어떤 명령이든 복종할 것이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1f9ea21-31c5-f192-72c9-265221625471
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:b1f9ea21-31c5-f192-72c9-265221625471
msgctxt "hcbd35935gc279g45bfg9656gfbec2e5e6e43"
msgid "What makes you so sure I'll enjoy the judgement?"
msgstr "내가 심판을 즐길 거라고 확신하는 이유가 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b37bf05d-d944-214b-aa34-46b0d06fe500
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(5) = False
#.      - PALADIN(5) = False
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_FightGoblins = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:b37bf05d-d944-214b-aa34-46b0d06fe500
msgctxt "h0c9f0e7fg1fb9g45efg8fdbgc590e3868b2d"
msgid ""
"I'll give you a fair chance. Fight me - you either die, or you kill me and "
"you're free to go."
msgstr "공정한 기회를 주마. 나와 싸워라. 죽던지, 날 죽이고 자유를 얻든지 둘 중 하나겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = b438c1ee-7b5c-0345-fc46-9fe0737c13e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:b438c1ee-7b5c-0345-fc46-9fe0737c13e4
msgctxt "h2e7c29c5g64adg4736g87bagb8fcd4ecb45a"
msgid "And what would you do to those that have failed you?"
msgstr "그러면 너는 널 실망시킨 자들에게 어떤 처분을 내리지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = b6735ef5-afef-626f-ba9a-b76e6734a2c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:b6735ef5-afef-626f-ba9a-b76e6734a2c5
msgctxt "hf7423784g22c3g4a4ag8000g8ea0005c2ac0"
msgid "Of course not, my lord. Thank you."
msgstr "그럴 리가 있겠습니까, 주군. 감사드립니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b6eb95fd-e841-76c3-2318-cab038381beb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - IMPOSSIBLE = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:b6eb95fd-e841-76c3-2318-cab038381beb
msgctxt "hfda7fd3cg492dg4423g9571g232c4f6b64da"
msgid "*Ketheric stiffens at the sight of you. He seems to recognise you.*"
msgstr "*당신에게 시선이 닿자 케서릭의 몸이 뻣뻣해집니다. 당신을 알아본듯 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b79a5b4b-2f38-3d3d-9dfb-838a200dacc4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(13) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(13) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:b79a5b4b-2f38-3d3d-9dfb-838a200dacc4
msgctxt "ha4f6c39egcdefg4fd8gbf30g9177516cf170"
msgid ""
"You did the right thing. I'm sure those nasties deserved a bollocking, but "
"we're no executioners. Let's go see what Z'rell makes of it."
msgstr "넌 옳은 일을 했어. 저놈들은 혼구멍이 나야 했지만, 우린 처형인이 아니야. 즈렐이 어떻게 생각할지 보러 가자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = bb31f249-700b-2cc1-f0a3-f4e47b4ad1bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:bb31f249-700b-2cc1-f0a3-f4e47b4ad1bf
msgctxt "h28096388g848cg45f4gafddg0619023448ce"
msgid "If I had been given drow warriors instead of goblin trash -"
msgstr "이 고블린 쓰레기들 대신에 드로우 전사들을 주셨더라면-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bc548a5a-bff3-88e1-9433-b826263a9927
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:bc548a5a-bff3-88e1-9433-b826263a9927
msgctxt "h244d2275g3241g43a7g8f60g09581586ee8f"
msgid ""
"*As the General's attention shifts to you, a memory stirs - a memory of this "
"room, and his voice raised in anger.*"
msgstr "*장군의 관심이 당신에게 쏠리자, 하나의 기억이 떠오릅니다. 이 방에 대한 기억, 그리고 분노로 가득찬 그의 목소리.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd114a46-594e-fed6-39d7-0fb05772930d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_UsedIllithidPowers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:bd114a46-594e-fed6-39d7-0fb05772930d
msgctxt "he7a50e80ga3bag4cf4g93d3g4644ce15a831"
msgid "Split yourselves open. <i>Crack-crack! </i>And smile while you work!"
msgstr "네 몸을 가르고 쪼개라. <i>우득-우드득!</i> 웃는 표정도 잊지 말고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = bd14bf71-3437-b2d6-1964-a7b41ae6922c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:bd14bf71-3437-b2d6-1964-a7b41ae6922c
msgctxt "h1c2e2fbag24b6g4ae2gaaa3g0d3a93450c56"
msgid "Make her passing slow, Disciple Z'rell. Be creative."
msgstr "느린 죽음을 안겨줘라, 신봉자 즈렐. 창의적으로 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = bd9a54bd-bb7e-40c5-b69a-d9e5414de11e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(11) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(11) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:bd9a54bd-bb7e-40c5-b69a-d9e5414de11e
msgctxt "hbea26318gd3dbg4c9ega76fg8667ce29c9f1"
msgid ""
"I appreciate the enthusiasm, but I'm not sure this is the time or the place."
msgstr "그 열의는 마음에 든다만, 지금 때와 장소가 공격하기에 적합하지는 않은 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = bdaee4aa-03f0-7b16-7f10-2aad3ee83415
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:bdaee4aa-03f0-7b16-7f10-2aad3ee83415
msgctxt "h008fed12g8d49g464cga678gb66131713cad"
msgid "You serious? We don't stand a chance!"
msgstr "농담이지? 우리가 무슨 승산이 있다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = bf2d8150-f255-ed59-b9ee-2d380a924026
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(10) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(10) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:bf2d8150-f255-ed59-b9ee-2d380a924026
msgctxt "h164552e8gd4e6g4322gb043g92009fe4d0d4"
msgid "You exhaust me. Compassion is <i>not</i> a virtue."
msgstr "날 지치게 하는군. 연민은 미덕이 <i>아니다</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = c16243f2-aacb-a372-7936-66bcc21e90b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:c16243f2-aacb-a372-7936-66bcc21e90b2
msgctxt "h94b9f76fgdba6g4dd0g91c1gb923810a327c"
msgid "But honesty? <i>Remorse? </i>These are no use to me."
msgstr "그렇지만 정직함? <i>회한?</i> 이런 덕목은 내게 쓸모 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = c2a49591-e2d1-6951-00d6-ed5badd29f5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(11) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(11) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:c2a49591-e2d1-6951-00d6-ed5badd29f5d
msgctxt "hc82499f2ge451g4719g951eg021785b72980"
msgid "Mercy? You showed goblins mercy? The half-orc won't like this."
msgstr "자비라니? 고블린들에게 자비를 배풀어준다고? 그 하프오크는 기뻐하지 않을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = c31c8d76-f89b-81ef-562a-700e5d6f373c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:c31c8d76-f89b-81ef-562a-700e5d6f373c
msgctxt "hfec87754g1525g4223gafcag9c3f351936f1"
msgid "Let our newest arrival speak."
msgstr "새로 온 친구 말을 들어보지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = c3638006-6d68-81b3-add6-abfb6a2a9d4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:c3638006-6d68-81b3-add6-abfb6a2a9d4d
msgctxt "h9cfdeee8gdf42g4a60g89e5gfd3ebb586290"
msgid ""
"I will not be slandered! General, you saw my reports - you know it's not my "
"fault."
msgstr "이건 중상모략입니다! 장군님, 제 보고서 보시지 않으셨습니까. 제 잘못이 아닙니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Darra
#. NodeID = c3ca6da1-ec9f-2429-0f56-39c5950ed384
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:c3ca6da1-ec9f-2429-0f56-39c5950ed384
msgctxt "ha966ea52g2fbag4112gaeadg7130ad73688f"
msgid ""
"Here, you ain't gonna do anything drastic, are yeh? We've been nothing but "
"loyal!"
msgstr "극단적인 짓은 안 하실 거죠, 그쵸? 저희는 충성스럽기만 했다구요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c454587b-1e86-87bc-a1a9-514f832c92c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:c454587b-1e86-87bc-a1a9-514f832c92c7
msgctxt "h0c775a1bg518bg4757g972ag9ea57febb901"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = c837431b-243b-22c1-b4aa-9fb9a99eefa3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:c837431b-243b-22c1-b4aa-9fb9a99eefa3
msgctxt "h3f2fb0deg5606g4521gaf01g7162ce86ca73"
msgid "Praise the Absolute! And praise Her True Soul!"
msgstr "절대자를 찬양하라! 그 분의 참된 영혼도!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = c9d3bf57-045e-f698-26d3-58b92fe4afd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:c9d3bf57-045e-f698-26d3-58b92fe4afd8
msgctxt "h4c953322g7270g4695ga2e7g7ec1f5286280"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr "허."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Drenn
#. NodeID = caa0f599-9112-7079-ce4e-ace9be276830
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_KethericKillsGoblin = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:caa0f599-9112-7079-ce4e-ace9be276830
msgctxt "h6cf0dfaagc440g406bg981eg1879ee06cf95"
msgid "No - NO!"
msgstr "안 돼, <b>안 돼</b>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc189570-3235-9543-c495-618784df1940
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:cc189570-3235-9543-c495-618784df1940
msgctxt "h9bd42032gb8e3g4347g8843g32dedc8bee95"
msgid "Hear, hear!"
msgstr "옳소, 옳소!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = cd2db97c-e481-a9f5-4bd6-4dfe55799261
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:cd2db97c-e481-a9f5-4bd6-4dfe55799261
msgctxt "hd1205d6eg9ed2g44ecg9506g23c8c3016255"
msgid ""
"Fitting that a loyal servant should pass judgement on a failure. What say "
"you about our Minthara?"
msgstr "충직한 종복이 실패작에게 심판을 내리는 건 적절하지. 민트라에 대해 어떻게 생각하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cdd20b39-746a-b0dd-310d-615530574190
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:cdd20b39-746a-b0dd-310d-615530574190
msgctxt "h04023519gfe3bg4f98gbfd3ge1a7e28ce24b"
msgid "You know me, General?"
msgstr "나를 알고 있나, 장군?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = cdde0c4d-6b5e-8c7e-69d8-352d7f828fcf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:cdde0c4d-6b5e-8c7e-69d8-352d7f828fcf
msgctxt "h51ac2edag5c5dg4b92g9209g8d72f8a01249"
msgid "The goblins! They failed me. They failed us all."
msgstr "고블린이요! 녀석들이 실패한 겁니다. 저희 모두를 실망시킨 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = d0080d52-5e17-f751-d9f0-b6501454bfa3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:d0080d52-5e17-f751-d9f0-b6501454bfa3
msgctxt "h91e94276gd376g455dgb34eg19e0ae94508e"
msgid ""
"You have seen what these creatures are capable of, and you have seen their "
"inadequacies - isn't that so? What is your judgement?"
msgstr "이 녀석들이 어떤 일을 할 수 있고, 어떤 면에서 무능한지도 봤겠지, 그렇지 않나? 자네의 판결은 뭔가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = d10d0e48-2785-3350-1adb-1457c5a2ab72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:d10d0e48-2785-3350-1adb-1457c5a2ab72
msgctxt "h103e3e0dgbda6g407dga8e6g7735574e5712"
msgid "Dispose of the rest as you see fit."
msgstr "나머지 녀석들은 자네가 원하는 대로 처분하도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = d2d06682-fb73-7e58-d5de-f972ff1a4fec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:d2d06682-fb73-7e58-d5de-f972ff1a4fec
msgctxt "h84085630gc8beg4874g9236gb57b63753144"
msgid ""
"You failed to retrieve the artefact. You failed to protect your True Soul. "
"You do not deserve to live."
msgstr "너희는 아티팩트를 되찾지 못했어. 너희 참된 영혼도 지키지 못했지. 너희는 살 자격이 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3137516-33fd-3f0a-af1c-b1672c2512d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:d3137516-33fd-3f0a-af1c-b1672c2512d2
msgctxt "hf427f81cg0597g4cfagb224gf9c3de9ec128"
msgid "What will you do with her?"
msgstr "그녀를 어떻게 할 생각입니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3e02163-9ec0-8c68-9d2d-fb56ab1485ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:d3e02163-9ec0-8c68-9d2d-fb56ab1485ef
msgctxt "hb46f9ad4gb86ag441bg979fgdb35cc4df73a"
msgid "Don't kill them! They're loyal followers of the Absolute."
msgstr "죽이지 마세요! 저 고블린들은 절대자의 충성스러운 추종자들입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = d5e10c3c-1539-62d4-acc9-4289e2dcf76b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:d5e10c3c-1539-62d4-acc9-4289e2dcf76b
msgctxt "h183f1fdegd769g494bg9c61gd21763d97e19"
msgid "And the fun we had committin' 'em."
msgstr "맞아. 정말 재밌는 일이기도 했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = d792a4b4-f779-b267-a91a-7b4c8fb81d1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Knows_Executioner = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:d792a4b4-f779-b267-a91a-7b4c8fb81d1d
msgctxt "hc14d1cd7gf1c1g4834g963dg287e8a733c0b"
msgid ""
"The facts suggest otherwise. You were ordered to retrieve the artefact - you "
"failed to do so."
msgstr "사실관계를 보아하니 그렇지 않은 것 같은데. 너희는 아티팩트를 되찾으라는 명령을 받았고, 그 임무에 실패했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d7e77568-8c50-ee95-831c-d46234aabef3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:d7e77568-8c50-ee95-831c-d46234aabef3
msgctxt "hf5ba57fdg297ag4a3cgbd08g6fdff0c4c2a2"
msgid "<i>Whoever he is, he stands in your way.</i>"
msgstr "<i>정체가 어찌 됐든, 그는 당신의 앞길을 막고 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = d8634a9f-c23f-60e9-1c1f-fcf4f826b3d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DARK_URGE(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:d8634a9f-c23f-60e9-1c1f-fcf4f826b3d7
msgctxt "hc6cfe800g2b6eg42deg8974g5704348e0e29"
msgid ""
"I'm surprised to see you again, True Soul. You are here to assist and not to "
"meddle, I trust."
msgstr "다시 보게 되어 놀랍군, 참된 영혼이여. 간섭이 아니라 도움을 주러 온 거라고 믿겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = d979ba65-5fa9-8476-116c-e4300b93dd10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:d979ba65-5fa9-8476-116c-e4300b93dd10
msgctxt "hab666a33g49aeg4f1dg8e9fg5542faa00286"
msgid ""
"I would remind you that while in my halls, you obey me - just as you would "
"any other Chosen."
msgstr "상기할 게 하나 있네. 이 곳에 있을 때는 내게 복종하도록. 다른 선택받은 자에게 하듯이 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = db18fa90-b24a-9581-54f2-cfc0d06ac9bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:db18fa90-b24a-9581-54f2-cfc0d06ac9bb
msgctxt "h65ff6651g294bg475eg89bfg1f58a5ec0416"
msgid "We did as we was told, General! Followed every order -"
msgstr "저희는 시키신 대로 한 거예요, 장군님! 명령을 전부 따랐-"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dc6ad14e-1302-5d18-8ee1-b18bba33d1ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:dc6ad14e-1302-5d18-8ee1-b18bba33d1ba
msgctxt "he0577770gf20fg46f0g8d34ga6a1f7298c73"
msgid ""
"*A blast of mental energy washes over you, filling the room. Your tadpole "
"squirms, urging you to obey.*"
msgstr "*정신적 에너지의 폭발이 당신을 덮치고, 이 공간을 가득 채웁니다. 당신의 올챙이는 꿈틀거리며, 복종하도록 재촉합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = dc9b5d95-97cf-13c0-c672-85dae2558527
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:dc9b5d95-97cf-13c0-c672-85dae2558527
msgctxt "h5e4c2fc1g039eg4ee4gb115g45c4f60504fd"
msgid "She will die. Eventually."
msgstr "그녀는 결국 죽게 될 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = dccd2f01-9715-8ce7-f824-6917ee372735
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_AttackOnDen_State_RaiderVictory = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:dccd2f01-9715-8ce7-f824-6917ee372735
msgctxt "h937cfa7fg79a3g4d3dg8506g44e833bd2458"
msgid ""
"Ah, the True Soul who delivered a grove of non-believers into the Absolute's "
"arms."
msgstr "아, 불신자들의 숲을 절대자의 품에 안겨준 참된 영혼이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = dd5e508c-80c0-ac90-f6a8-a6d60be811a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:dd5e508c-80c0-ac90-f6a8-a6d60be811a5
msgctxt "h2855c2adge85eg47c7gbe1bg77e355c36fe2"
msgid "General Thorm?"
msgstr "쏨 장군님?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e049f5f3-f20d-a256-0ce9-818cf2083aef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_TriedHelpingMinthara = False
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_SpokeAgainstMinthara = False
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_RemainedSilent = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e049f5f3-f20d-a256-0ce9-818cf2083aef
msgctxt "h3fe6c0b3g7b67g4c9aga499g2d46857946d1"
msgid "<i>Stay silent, enjoy the show.</i>"
msgstr "<i>조용히 있자, 지금은 즐길 때야.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e049f5f3-f20d-a256-0ce9-818cf2083aef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_TriedHelpingMinthara = False
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_SpokeAgainstMinthara = False
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_RemainedSilent = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e049f5f3-f20d-a256-0ce9-818cf2083aef
msgctxt "h2f1cf07dg789eg4bf1g8b17gc397ab42c047"
msgid "<i>Watch and say nothing.</i>"
msgstr "<i>가만히 보기만 해.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = e05a295d-ba6f-9798-7c1e-01182e7f497a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e05a295d-ba6f-9798-7c1e-01182e7f497a
msgctxt "h78e3b3dfgfde6g4013gb337gc5d296f2c6f5"
msgid "But we are here to deal with these goblins, not to speak of your past."
msgstr "그러나 우리는 네 과거에 대해 논하는 것이 아니라, 이 고블린들을 처리하기 위해 이곳에 있는 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = e065c743-1235-d6fe-c754-5d7cd2d043d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(12) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(12) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e065c743-1235-d6fe-c754-5d7cd2d043d8
msgctxt "h8666f45egbf58g4918g84bcg58ffebec7663"
msgid ""
"Z'rell won't be pleased about this - she strikes me as the type to enjoy a "
"little bloodshed."
msgstr "즈렐이 마음에 들어 하지 않을 거야. 소소하게 피를 보는 걸 즐기는 부류로 보였다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e088ecb4-a383-524c-9875-51acd5faab23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e088ecb4-a383-524c-9875-51acd5faab23
msgctxt "h90ea66f1gae6cg4f2cg857cgcb298c7fd207"
msgid ""
"*Many eyes in the room dart away when you try to meet them. Hells, they all "
"know you. Even the dog knows you.*"
msgstr "*당신이 쳐다보는 순간 많은 눈들이 시선을 피합니다. 세상에, 모두 당신을 알고 있습니다. 개조차도 말이죠.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = e0c74767-3023-b038-f907-a42834007b87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_GeneralHaven_State_HavenDestroyed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e0c74767-3023-b038-f907-a42834007b87
msgctxt "hb6795101gb765g4150g852fgc7e23fade183"
msgid ""
"Ah! The True Soul who eliminated my Harper enemies in one fell swoop - "
"welcome."
msgstr "아! 내 하퍼 적들을 한숨에 없애버린 참된 영혼이군. 어서오게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = e195a33d-b17c-201c-f76e-9510db6dae09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e195a33d-b17c-201c-f76e-9510db6dae09
msgctxt "h0b9a6c68g5119g47a3gbc98gb5b0e777e734"
msgid "No - mercy!"
msgstr "안 돼... 자비를!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = e247a019-8206-dbb7-ff0b-40f1dcd8aca1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e247a019-8206-dbb7-ff0b-40f1dcd8aca1
msgctxt "h35e35028g5cafg4537ga0a6ga234c901ae72"
msgid "Mercy, General! Please!"
msgstr "자비를 베푸소서, 장군님! 제발!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Drenn
#. NodeID = e4c4ba16-834e-872a-307f-eb7919f62fb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e4c4ba16-834e-872a-307f-eb7919f62fb5
msgctxt "h63f08b4agbeb5g4b08ga5bcg52412cdeaf4b"
msgid "Oi, what?!"
msgstr "아니, 뭐?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = e50dd522-cf38-9d3f-32f7-e403a9267d86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e50dd522-cf38-9d3f-32f7-e403a9267d86
msgctxt "h0492e7a0gfac0g4526g8d89g81460a7abc2d"
msgid ""
"You have to take what pleasure you can, after all, in your diminished state."
msgstr "즐길 수 있을 때 즐기는 게 좋을 텐데. 더군다나 지금처럼 위축된 상태라면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = e720bb2a-4702-4697-29ac-38f25a26819c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e720bb2a-4702-4697-29ac-38f25a26819c
msgctxt "h472b5c7bg69c6g4f93ga759gd126d2cac66d"
msgid "Take her below."
msgstr "아래층으로 데려가라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = e76e4f11-741b-eafe-0bbd-16eeedb623c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e76e4f11-741b-eafe-0bbd-16eeedb623c1
msgctxt "h9f45ee45g269bg465cg8809gbedaedfbffd9"
msgid ""
"You wouldn't hurt me, would you? We're mates, me and you. Practically family!"
msgstr "날 해치지 않을 거지, 그렇지? 우린 친구잖아, 나랑 너랑. 우린 사실상 가족이나 마찬가지라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e77ab4c0-e5ed-9ab8-2343-507e6a5b72c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_Knows_KethericNotTadpoled = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e77ab4c0-e5ed-9ab8-2343-507e6a5b72c2
msgctxt "h766f01f2g70beg4cbcga6e1g7b3da983065b"
msgid ""
"*In Ketheric's place, you feel an absence. No psionic power. No tadpole at "
"all.*"
msgstr "*케서릭에게서 무언가의 부재가 느껴집니다. 사이오닉 능력이 느껴지지 않습니다. 올챙이가 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = e84bca92-b171-54be-7920-ecd29a17d56e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e84bca92-b171-54be-7920-ecd29a17d56e
msgctxt "hcafb342cgc5c8g4793g8481gb269812e5a7d"
msgid "No - please -"
msgstr "안 돼, 제발..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e8914194-46c3-25d5-f9e8-bb7b0816102e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_FailedMindMeld(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e8914194-46c3-25d5-f9e8-bb7b0816102e
msgctxt "h5a9d559ege390g497bg9dccg8f5f7b251fe2"
msgid ""
"*Z'rell's mind is a steel trap - sharp, strong, and ready to clamp down on "
"anything that intrudes. There's no way in.*"
msgstr ""
"*즈렐의 정신은 강철로 된 함정과 같습니다. 날카롭고, 강하고, 침입하는 그 무엇이라도 옥죌 준비가 되어있죠. 들어갈 길이 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = e9f9c28f-061f-9082-7dfe-970d1bcb32f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:e9f9c28f-061f-9082-7dfe-970d1bcb32f8
msgctxt "h346655e6g34eeg4a32g8cc8g7609702b5340"
msgid "Try again."
msgstr "다시 해보거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = ebee5263-0209-5215-9f15-3a3f3d1c8b9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:ebee5263-0209-5215-9f15-3a3f3d1c8b9b
msgctxt "hfaba50a8gf2eeg426eg8a22g97d5a4ef3f39"
msgid "A pity, then, that her faith was so inadequate."
msgstr "그렇다면 안타깝군. 그녀의 신앙이 이리도 부족했다니 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = edad66db-0d58-e274-e6e4-9d08a4103dcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:edad66db-0d58-e274-e6e4-9d08a4103dcc
msgctxt "h79d36ec1gc769g49b9g96cbgae629fbc1f8f"
msgid ""
"<i>Grit your teeth and ignore the feeling. Making a scene won't answer your "
"questions.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이를 악물고 충동을 삼킨다. 한바탕 소란을 벌인다고 해결될 문제가 아니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef850b48-62ed-10cc-135c-d5f0d60afda2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(5) = False
#.      - PALADIN(5) = True
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_FightGoblins = True
#. TagRule: OATHBREAKER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:ef850b48-62ed-10cc-135c-d5f0d60afda2
msgctxt "h9e05ff7cg8803g4c38ga173g065c16cac984"
msgid "It shall be trial by combat. Become the masters of your own fate."
msgstr "결투로 판결하도록 하지. 네 운명의 주인이 되어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef850b48-62ed-10cc-135c-d5f0d60afda2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(5) = False
#.      - PALADIN(5) = True
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_FightGoblins = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:ef850b48-62ed-10cc-135c-d5f0d60afda2
msgctxt "h8e84a5eeg25a0g4b73ga7a6g0c6e0f2e0fb7"
msgid ""
"It shall be trial by combat. If you wish to live, you must champion yourself."
msgstr "결투로 판결하도록 하지. 살아남고 싶다면 스스로 쟁취해 보도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f00687bb-a310-cbf0-ecb2-e2ad4542dec8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:f00687bb-a310-cbf0-ecb2-e2ad4542dec8
msgctxt "h3bf3a182g4016g4d09g8d99g133a99baa4a3"
msgid "I'm really allowed to do<i> anything</i>?"
msgstr "정말 <i>무슨 짓을</i> 해도 상관없겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f00687bb-a310-cbf0-ecb2-e2ad4542dec8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:f00687bb-a310-cbf0-ecb2-e2ad4542dec8
msgctxt "h784abdfeg2370g4cbdgb44bg1784dc7a7452"
msgid "What am I meant to do with them, exactly?"
msgstr "정확히 뭘 하면 되지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Disciple Z'rell
#. NodeID = f0d9063f-e956-81bc-4c6c-ce885fe93705
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:f0d9063f-e956-81bc-4c6c-ce885fe93705
msgctxt "h216fff23g0fa6g4f67g93c9g3e18d48d7662"
msgid "Enough! True Soul - tell the General how the goblins served our cause."
msgstr "조용히 해! 참된 영혼이여, 장군님께 이 고블린들이 우리 대의에 어떻게 봉사했는지 알려드리도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Drenn
#. NodeID = f101a398-196c-5521-87b4-b24422074258
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:f101a398-196c-5521-87b4-b24422074258
msgctxt "hb0c52ef3g28c9g4837gbf33g886e1618652f"
msgid "We did as we were told! We're loyal to the Absolute - tell 'im!"
msgstr "우린 시키는 대로 했어! 우린 절대자님한테 충성한다고. 말해 줘!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = f26f4dda-0400-e623-02d9-c45fbf437d56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:f26f4dda-0400-e623-02d9-c45fbf437d56
msgctxt "h30262bdag404cg45ffg8d57gfda5046392e9"
msgid "Yes - no!"
msgstr "네- 아, 아닙니다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f2bee7fb-9503-60f0-6300-2ea1548291e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:f2bee7fb-9503-60f0-6300-2ea1548291e1
msgctxt "h3d797f52g746dg4a0ag8451gbf31aaf78c64"
msgid "*He healed up a treat - he could enjoy your cuts forever and a day.*"
msgstr "*그는 자가 치유 능력을 지녔습니다. 당신이 주는 고통을 영원히 즐길 수 있을 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = f3d3e42b-31d9-3838-bd09-cff41fb86056
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NightsongSentToMoonrise = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:f3d3e42b-31d9-3838-bd09-cff41fb86056
msgctxt "hc0c10472g18f2g4ea6gb3d7ge1527fcec001"
msgid ""
"Or better yet - put that True Soul to use. They've proven themselves "
"reliable."
msgstr "이게 더 좋겠군. 참된 영혼을 활용하지. 그들은 신뢰성을 스스로 증명해냈어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = f46cbe8e-c38a-6620-376b-64de54ae491b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:f46cbe8e-c38a-6620-376b-64de54ae491b
msgctxt "had494fadg9a38g4d1cga4fage330a3bd2696"
msgid "NO!"
msgstr "<b>안 돼!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Ketheric Thorm
#. NodeID = f7601a6b-333f-a921-5e7d-9f920567b9e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NightsongSentToMoonrise = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:f7601a6b-333f-a921-5e7d-9f920567b9e0
msgctxt "hfc2a55a2ge4e8g4f5dgb416g82f5cf674ad9"
msgid ""
"Ah! The True Soul who retrieved the Nightsong - it is good to make your "
"acquaintance."
msgstr "아! 밤의 노래를 되찾아 온 참된 영혼이군. 만나서 반갑네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = f7c0c7a6-41ff-7c75-261d-f71104df33f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_GoblinsSuffocate = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:f7c0c7a6-41ff-7c75-261d-f71104df33f5
msgctxt "ha4ba6e4dg6ba7g4651gb817g028e8ca53717"
msgid "No - mercy..."
msgstr "안 돼 - 자비를..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = f97ad60f-fefb-bc29-bd86-f6b931747e56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FOR_GOBLINTRIBE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:f97ad60f-fefb-bc29-bd86-f6b931747e56
msgctxt "hc84e4304g1817g4fd8gb7f3g4dee1aa0ccb5"
msgid "Lies! I served the Absolute - I did everything I was told!"
msgstr "거짓말이야! 저는 절대자님을 제대로 섬겼어요, 시키시는 대로 다 했다구요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fb303e15-7e03-f1bb-9d8c-48bd37e729a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:fb303e15-7e03-f1bb-9d8c-48bd37e729a1
msgctxt "hecdaeb5ag5d68g4272g989fg6e924cf6fba4"
msgid ""
"*You're standing in the lion's den, facing a legendary general, his guards, "
"and who knows what eldritch powers. Just in case you needed a reminder.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 지금 사자굴에 들어온 것과 같습니다. 전설적인 장군과 그를 지키는 병사들, 거기에 어떤 섬뜩한 권능을 상대해야 할지도 모릅니다. "
"혹시나 해서 다시 알려드리는 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fbfca2c8-5baf-16da-7c61-57a82277f9ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:fbfca2c8-5baf-16da-7c61-57a82277f9ac
msgctxt "h8daa7780g5064g43edgb548geca67aee480d"
msgid "They're faithful to the Absolute, I'll give them that."
msgstr "놈들은 절대자님에게 독실합니다. 그건 인정하죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe56cbea-240b-107e-b3e4-4c8c88427dd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:fe56cbea-240b-107e-b3e4-4c8c88427dd9
msgctxt "h50773816g288fg40c4gadcbgcaa0d721c189"
msgid "Death is probably too good for them."
msgstr "이놈들한테는 죽음도 사치입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fee78c4c-bfa9-083d-0809-a95c19bb37ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(5) = True
#.      - PALADIN(5) = False
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_FightGoblins = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:fee78c4c-bfa9-083d-0809-a95c19bb37ea
msgctxt "hc8b05641g3da4g458bgae61gb1678958f6c3"
msgid "WE WILL DECIDE IN <b>BLOOD</b>. YOU FIGHT WELL, YOU LIVE."
msgstr "우린 <b>피로써</b> 결정할 것이다. 잘 싸우면, 넌 산다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fee78c4c-bfa9-083d-0809-a95c19bb37ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(5) = True
#.      - PALADIN(5) = False
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(5) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - MOO_Execution_Event_FightGoblins = True
#. TagRule: BARBARIAN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution:fee78c4c-bfa9-083d-0809-a95c19bb37ea
msgctxt "h69e34fa7ge8a5g4124ga15dg3894b27c92c4"
msgid ""
"An animal shows its true strength only when cornered. Show me yours. "
"<i>FIGHT.</i>"
msgstr "동물은 오직 궁지에 몰렸을 때 진정한 힘을 보이는 법이지. 네 힘을 보여봐라. <i>싸우는 거다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use:63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
msgctxt "hf429d4b8g0b55g4a96ga5dbg39fbb12f3b1e"
msgid "Oh gracious one, it is a pleasure to be in your mighty sanctum."
msgstr "오 폐하, 당신의 웅장한 내실에 오게 되어 기쁘군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use:63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
msgctxt "h37b2d2ebgfe1ag4cc8gb3acg5e6e72a28f18"
msgid "Hmm... good back support, but a little too tyrannical for my tastes."
msgstr "흠... 등받이는 괜찮은데 내 취향에는 조금 포학한 자리네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use:63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
msgctxt "h1a45909cgd047g4c3dg9d18g069dd0896365"
msgid "Evil overlordship isn't your look."
msgstr "넌 별로 사악한 군주가 어울리진 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use:63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
msgctxt "hd58c7528g78efg4221gaf55g4848c3498613"
msgid "Enjoy your fantasy, my liege. But don't expect me to bow."
msgstr "환상을 즐기시지요, 전하. 하지만 절은 기대하지 말라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use:63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
msgctxt "hb615601bgd2cbg4a7bg84cbgff9d19d836c4"
msgid "Hmm, I'm not sure it suits you - but that's probably a good thing."
msgstr "흠, 별로 어울리진 않는 것 같은데. 하지만 어울리지 않는 게 좋은 거라고 생각해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use:63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
msgctxt "h9fa5df3fgec89g4d0ag9b5dga0606e8f2474"
msgid "A throne fit for a tyrant - but most certainly not for you."
msgstr "폭군을 위한 왕좌로군. 하지만 확실히 널 위한 왕좌는 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use:63372140-a9fc-6e70-ad62-35e6a71babc1
msgctxt "h508f4e44gcf67g4787g8ff7g68e6d802c4f7"
msgid ""
"Don't get used to it. One taste of regal power might have you craving more."
msgstr "익숙해 지지 말게나. 왕의 힘을 잠깐 맛 보는 것 만으로도 그 힘을 더 갈망하게 될테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 716942a5-3dfd-603c-28d8-30912d3ebb87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use:716942a5-3dfd-603c-28d8-30912d3ebb87
msgctxt "h5817ee77g54cbg4ca6gabe1gf8e23ef349c9"
msgid "*It is not particularly comfortable.*"
msgstr "*그리 편안하진 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ea046fb1-e6c0-0529-ae53-f4d113412cd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ExecutionThrone_PAD_Use:ea046fb1-e6c0-0529-ae53-f4d113412cd8
msgctxt "hcb4b0c61g950ag4669gb4dbg5a1507bc282a"
msgid ""
"*From this seat, Ketheric defied gods and raised an army for the Absolute.*"
msgstr "*이 자리에서, 케서릭은 신들에게 거역하고 절대자를 위한 군대를 일으켰습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_SazzaPlea
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 3ba9e490-e1c5-483e-9177-8becb2bc8d83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e7931ff2-b371-33f2-96e1-9b3bb157f2ad_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e7931ff2-b371-33f2-96e1-9b3bb157f2ad_B = False
#.     - e7931ff2-b371-33f2-96e1-9b3bb157f2ad_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_SazzaPlea:3ba9e490-e1c5-483e-9177-8becb2bc8d83
msgctxt "h029d1a2dgf90fg46a7ga2c2gd79b6f51060f"
msgid "I didn't survive mad druids and hungry spiders to die here."
msgstr "여기서 죽으려고 미친 드루이드와 굶주린 거미에게서 살아남은 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_DarraPlea
#. Speaker = Darra
#. NodeID = 2dae3d63-0148-47f9-8b38-c80102fa14ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5a06a8ed-94c6-2f89-1294-63be32905562_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5a06a8ed-94c6-2f89-1294-63be32905562_B = False
#.     - 5a06a8ed-94c6-2f89-1294-63be32905562_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_DarraPlea:2dae3d63-0148-47f9-8b38-c80102fa14ad
msgctxt "h4a0df4c8gdfebg45ceg8404g4d1062312a19"
msgid "Spare us!"
msgstr "그만해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_SazzaPlea
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = 9fdaf67d-e5e6-4585-8fec-fe4b874fef6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e7931ff2-b371-33f2-96e1-9b3bb157f2ad_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_SazzaPlea:9fdaf67d-e5e6-4585-8fec-fe4b874fef6a
msgctxt "hd170f002g1c5dg450cg8e29g0c9fb4e713a9"
msgid "Don't hurt me, Ketheric. I'm loyal!"
msgstr "날 해치치마, 케서릭. 충성하고 있다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_DarraPlea
#. Speaker = Darra
#. NodeID = 7cb08d2d-d21d-4b21-9058-022c71f93dac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5a06a8ed-94c6-2f89-1294-63be32905562_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_DarraPlea:7cb08d2d-d21d-4b21-9058-022c71f93dac
msgctxt "h416b2e8cg3f45g4b28gbd50ga2725a0579b9"
msgid "This ain't our fault!"
msgstr "우리 잘못이 아니야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_SazzaPlea
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = f2010a9f-0ff7-4685-bdb2-a492cb8f2d5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e7931ff2-b371-33f2-96e1-9b3bb157f2ad_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e7931ff2-b371-33f2-96e1-9b3bb157f2ad_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_SazzaPlea:f2010a9f-0ff7-4685-bdb2-a492cb8f2d5e
msgctxt "h1dff742cg3127g4286g92ceg71206de99149"
msgid "Should have stayed in that cage."
msgstr "그냥 감옥에 갇혀 있을 걸 그랬네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_DarraPlea
#. Speaker = Darra
#. NodeID = ae0f8ba8-a6a7-44de-97ca-6898eec01c66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5a06a8ed-94c6-2f89-1294-63be32905562_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5a06a8ed-94c6-2f89-1294-63be32905562_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_DarraPlea:ae0f8ba8-a6a7-44de-97ca-6898eec01c66
msgctxt "h95b3d0a4g21d2g42eeg9b63gf131f98c320a"
msgid "We should never have come here."
msgstr "여기 오는 게 아니었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_FezzerkPlea
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 64607c39-f02a-4aed-b7f3-ab9e8d917446
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5b37f3cc-77af-2720-bed3-31d87f1bbe97_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5b37f3cc-77af-2720-bed3-31d87f1bbe97_A = False
#.     - 5b37f3cc-77af-2720-bed3-31d87f1bbe97_B = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_FezzerkPlea:64607c39-f02a-4aed-b7f3-ab9e8d917446
msgctxt "had1d2b24gc1d6g4d85ga016g4f1ef8e8e11e"
msgid "I don't know nothing about any of this."
msgstr "난 아무것도 모른다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_FezzerkPlea
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = a20358c7-7d88-4e89-834b-dc910fd8fbf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5b37f3cc-77af-2720-bed3-31d87f1bbe97_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_FezzerkPlea:a20358c7-7d88-4e89-834b-dc910fd8fbf5
msgctxt "h0272bd76gef5cg4ac5ga200gddf74ba66ed1"
msgid "It was the drow's fault!"
msgstr "전부 드로우 잘못이야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_FezzerkPlea
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = e1805e1f-d9c0-4bb0-a894-b183baa0f820
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5b37f3cc-77af-2720-bed3-31d87f1bbe97_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5b37f3cc-77af-2720-bed3-31d87f1bbe97_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_FezzerkPlea:e1805e1f-d9c0-4bb0-a894-b183baa0f820
msgctxt "hd873992fg1047g4455gbb9cg528ab9cffa70"
msgid "Absolute, save us."
msgstr "절대자님 이시여, 구해주소서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_GoblinsInCombat
#. Speaker = Darra
#. NodeID = 28851c22-3c93-79e1-3d1e-a79fc65aefe5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_GoblinsInCombat:28851c22-3c93-79e1-3d1e-a79fc65aefe5
msgctxt "hac5232b7gf95ag40d7gaaceg930b2ef1f2e6"
msgid "I won't go easy, if that's what yeh think."
msgstr "쉽지 않을 거다, 네 생각대론 안될 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_GoblinsInCombat
#. Speaker = Fezzerk
#. NodeID = 932c9faa-fc40-2bce-aaa4-190bc7fcdbd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_GoblinsInCombat:932c9faa-fc40-2bce-aaa4-190bc7fcdbd6
msgctxt "h9f551a55g2a37g40f6gaf33g64463818190b"
msgid "I ain't making this easy for yeh!"
msgstr "쉽게 지진 않을 거다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_AD_GoblinsInCombat
#. Speaker = Sazza
#. NodeID = dd20f3f1-a972-e35d-940b-63f2826db26a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
