msgid "We must learn what fuels his power."
msgstr "저 불가사의한 힘의 원천이 무엇인지 알아내야 해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_DaisyAD_PostExecution
