msgctxt "hcb3fa0dag92a0g4dc6gbe9fg09739cbedf10"
msgid ""
"The seat of the Absolute's power - occupied by a General that cannot be "
"killed. But his followers are flesh and blood."
msgstr "절대자의 권좌군. 죽지 않는 장군이 그 자리를 차지한 상태야. 하지만 그 추종자들은 평범하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_DaisyAD_PostExecution
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = d919baca-ae58-454b-b079-74299525257a
