msgctxt "hd5e9c591g780dg419cg862cg0f371259dbd1"
msgid ""
"The seat of the Absolute's power - occupied by a General that cannot be "
"killed. But his followers are flesh and blood."
msgstr "절대자의 권좌군. 죽지 않는 장군이 그 자리를 차지한 상태야. 하지만 그 추종자들은 평범하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Execution_Guard_001
#. Speaker = Adept Mola
#. NodeID = 4004de56-4d52-4912-9bbc-f9c964ab992c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
