msgctxt "hb213ead0g5d62g40bfgb8d8g7f9b286f9adf"
msgid ""
"Pray to your Absolute, bastard. You'll meet Her before you <i>touch</i> that "
"boat."
msgstr "절대자에게 기도나 해라, 개자식아. 배에 <i>손대는</i> 순간 영접하게 해줄테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Jailbreak_AD_Gnome01
