#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Jailbreak_AD_Gnome02:3168b340-96db-4082-bce1-3c3610bdfec5
msgctxt "h14caab55g0947g46ffg99d2g679cf2b3d86e"
msgid "Ah! The noise. They will come soon - all of them."
msgstr "아! 소리가 들려. 곧 그들이 올 거야, 그들 모두가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Jailbreak_AD_Gnome02
#. Speaker = Nickels
#. NodeID = 3ebf7e51-a3e2-490a-9d72-243ac594b3e6
