#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Jailbreak_AD_Gnome02:5085a3bf-5372-41ef-b86b-47b7f13335c6
msgctxt "h1ef835cfga1d6g44a1g84dfg193714d7ed9c"
msgid ""
"The stone said to come here, but - but it's just water? Maybe over here?"
msgstr "돌이 이리로 이끌었는데, 어째서 물밖에 없는 거지? 아니면 혹시 여긴가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Jailbreak_AD_Gnome02
#. Speaker = Nickels
#. NodeID = 55051af0-7948-40b7-968e-59e3ba362421
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 00a82e63-fae8-cc02-0b2b-314c9d21ce6c_F = True
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_Jailbreak_Event_ADWaitingForBoat(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 00a82e63-fae8-cc02-0b2b-314c9d21ce6c_E = False
#.     - 00a82e63-fae8-cc02-0b2b-314c9d21ce6c_F = False
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_Jailbreak_Event_ADWaitingForBoat(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Jailbreak_AD_Gnome02:55051af0-7948-40b7-968e-59e3ba362421
msgctxt "h01e3d0aeg7089g4777gacf1g6289f514d02c"
msgid "If we are going, let's go. Waiting makes me nervous."
msgstr "갈 거면 어서 가자. 기다리자니 너무 불안해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Jailbreak_AD_Gnome02
#. Speaker = Nickels
#. NodeID = 79d44293-3ce7-4362-b9d5-e941bd387d92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
