msgctxt "h2bed0dfega02fg4064g8278gfece7d6bae11"
msgid "It won't work - not until we find out what is keeping him from death!"
msgstr "소용 없어. 그가 죽음에 이르지 않게 막는 힘이 뭔지 알아내야만 해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_BackToWork
#. Speaker = Linsella
#. NodeID = 0f8e458a-8a02-45e8-b8aa-139b79e4d7a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - b693223e-c2c2-7219-7926-6cdbc4da95ce_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b693223e-c2c2-7219-7926-6cdbc4da95ce_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_BackToWork:0f8e458a-8a02-45e8-b8aa-139b79e4d7a6
msgctxt "hcfde9d11g4d8bg47e4gb8bag6664c6c9e03a"
msgid ""
"You boys are <i>very </i>good with those cleavers. Something tells me you've "
"had the practice, hm?"
msgstr "우리 강아지들 식칼을 다루는 솜씨가 아주 훌륭하구나. 따로 연습이라도 했나봐, 응?\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_BackToWork
#. Speaker = Linsella
#. NodeID = 14f32a71-dc4c-44c9-a2f2-72d4e540ec7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - b693223e-c2c2-7219-7926-6cdbc4da95ce_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b693223e-c2c2-7219-7926-6cdbc4da95ce_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_BackToWork:14f32a71-dc4c-44c9-a2f2-72d4e540ec7d
msgctxt "h00cfdb58gada2g4ff2g8706g01a72d6a9daa"
msgid "See? Isn't it so much quieter when dinner is already dead?"
msgstr "내가 말했지? 저녁 식사 거리가 이미 죽은 상태니까 얼마나 조용하니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_BackToWork
#. Speaker = Linsella
#. NodeID = 4031de96-9684-4662-9750-41752f4c3da4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b693223e-c2c2-7219-7926-6cdbc4da95ce_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_BackToWork:4031de96-9684-4662-9750-41752f4c3da4
msgctxt "hfb7e68c6g0528g416dgb327g7122d091ccf3"
msgid "The Absolute has given you a second chance, loves. Don't waste it."
msgstr "절대자께서 너희에게 두 번째 기회를 주셨단다. 그 기회를 낭비하지 말거라.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_BackToWork
#. Speaker = Linsella
#. NodeID = 5073c017-8ea9-4e16-9a5c-88144ce1c608
