msgctxt "ha54e98bbg50a4g4a75gaf82g04e730916a68"
msgid ""
"Look at this! I've eaten worse at inns in my day. Perhaps we'll try it out "
"on the ogre, hm?"
msgstr "나쁘지 않은데! 옛날 음식은 이것만도 못했어. 오우거한테 한 번 먹여보자, 응?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_FoodPrepComment
#. Speaker = 'Tomelia'
#. NodeID = 24c0256c-a42b-48f8-b834-33239347c837
