msgid "*Yip?*"
msgstr "*끼잉?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom
#. Speaker = Linsella
#. NodeID = 0642e8d4-f86b-4917-8f10-a5d5bf526686
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - f9f894ed-2f87-623c-f0e6-34cfa1b424b6_A = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - f9f894ed-2f87-623c-f0e6-34cfa1b424b6_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom:0642e8d4-f86b-4917-8f10-a5d5bf526686
msgctxt "h4cd32884g39a1g4a6cgb752g5ac37eea2810"
msgid "Clean up your mess, Timothy. That gnome was not for <i>eating.</i>"
msgstr "그 난장판 좀 치우렴, 티모시. 그 노움은 <i>식용</i>이 아니었단다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom
#. Speaker = 'Timothy'
#. NodeID = 9365ccd7-57d1-4ea8-a567-84cfdebd9641
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom:9365ccd7-57d1-4ea8-a567-84cfdebd9641
msgctxt "h4605087cg5b2ag4b76ga3b3g64101d623bc0"
msgid "*Whine*."
msgstr "*낑낑*."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom
#. Speaker = Linsella
#. NodeID = a7261983-ebfc-d52b-a1fa-04df624d4684
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom:a7261983-ebfc-d52b-a1fa-04df624d4684
msgctxt "h6f09c763g8681g4080gb6f1g2bf6064a4ea2"
msgid ""
"Oh, my love. Did you think it was me? I'm a halfling, you great furry fool."
msgstr "어머나, 세상에. 그게 난 줄 알았니? 난 하플링이야, 이 털복숭이 바보야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom
#. Speaker = Linsella
#. NodeID = ae3d3735-21a7-4177-aa2b-63fe838462dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom:ae3d3735-21a7-4177-aa2b-63fe838462dd
msgctxt "hbb38a4e6gc635g47c9g95e6g990571fddd61"
msgid "Now, now. I can see your fangs, my dov. Don't make me show you mine."
msgstr "자, 자. 송곳니가 보이는구나, 아가. 내걸 드러내게 만들지는 말렴."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom
#. Speaker = 'Timothy'
#. NodeID = bb883e75-1f78-4b80-8740-7a3f88773f7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom:bb883e75-1f78-4b80-8740-7a3f88773f7d
msgctxt "h591898b0gf4f8g4887gbc57g7065d8928fb2"
msgid "*Whine*."
msgstr "*낑낑*."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom
#. Speaker = Linsella
#. NodeID = c4b0cfd9-797d-4180-be3b-862af2b11d86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - f9f894ed-2f87-623c-f0e6-34cfa1b424b6_B = False
#.     - f9f894ed-2f87-623c-f0e6-34cfa1b424b6_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom:c4b0cfd9-797d-4180-be3b-862af2b11d86
msgctxt "h94671659gdfffg410bg9a41ga8453075c463"
msgid ""
"And over there, Timothy! The mess you made last time we had to have a little "
"talk, remember?"
msgstr "저리로 가렴, 티모시! 저번에 네가 벌인 난장판과 관련해서 할 얘기가 있었잖니, 기억하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom
#. Speaker = 'Timothy'
#. NodeID = e389bdb2-d8c7-4403-8b65-8bd35272760f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - f9f894ed-2f87-623c-f0e6-34cfa1b424b6_B = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - f9f894ed-2f87-623c-f0e6-34cfa1b424b6_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_AD_SweepingBroom:e389bdb2-d8c7-4403-8b65-8bd35272760f
msgctxt "hb6e415a2g19cag4c46g9821g396007831389"
msgid "*Growl*."
msgstr "*으르렁*."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 164254b6-13b8-4b81-9100-ee68bd63c80d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack:164254b6-13b8-4b81-9100-ee68bd63c80d
msgctxt "h8a9b4862g6e9eg4f1dg8e55g329212ade94a"
msgid ""
"*As if following a well-worn path, your mind reaches out and knows where to "
"<i>squeeze</i>.*"
msgstr "*마치 닳고 닳은 도로를 따라가듯, 당신의 정신은 어디로 가야할 지, 어디를 <i>자극해야 할지</i> 알고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack
#. Speaker = 'Barnabus'
#. NodeID = 1931a601-8118-5060-d30d-d244c31b1ad5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack:1931a601-8118-5060-d30d-d244c31b1ad5
msgctxt "ha4f41a5bg5d15g4d58ga4c5g0c396100c0b6"
msgid "Hate... you hate..."
msgstr "싫다... 너 싫다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1c953ae9-8c87-fe0e-6424-3814ce69c0cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack:1c953ae9-8c87-fe0e-6424-3814ce69c0cd
msgctxt "h2ce5493egbd8bg4537ga754g3e7295ebcb86"
msgid "You're all magnificent beasts... magnificent indeed."
msgstr "너희는 참으로 훌륭한 야수들이란다... 훌륭하고말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 279f32d7-4399-425c-a2f0-d398d0c1dac0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack:279f32d7-4399-425c-a2f0-d398d0c1dac0
msgctxt "h8c2763b1g198ag42f2ga40dg724eef0bd8b0"
msgid ""
"*The mark glows, but you feel nothing in response. Your illithid power is "
"beyond reach until you rest.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나지만, 어떤 반응도 느껴지지 않습니다. 일리시드 능력을 더 사용하려면 휴식을 취해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 28ee7138-ddea-4ad8-9437-a36ca1aac2b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack:28ee7138-ddea-4ad8-9437-a36ca1aac2b7
msgctxt "h8cb00225gcb4bg45b8g9b7fg39549a060187"
msgid "*Your mind lurches, reeling suddenly as if... bitten.*"
msgstr "*뭔가에 깨물린 것처럼 느닷없이 정신이 휘청거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 32cecebe-b4bb-4abc-b170-6dc9960764b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack:32cecebe-b4bb-4abc-b170-6dc9960764b3
msgctxt "hdec1c4d9ga6fbg49a7gb8c3g82d70c16cd6d"
msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 330a249e-d3fb-4622-a5b7-b52e36cd6ea1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack:330a249e-d3fb-4622-a5b7-b52e36cd6ea1
msgctxt "hb41afb0dg1456g4b22g8ecbg98ffa5ef057b"
msgid "Now, now, Barnabus - <i>behave.</i>"
msgstr "자, 자, 바나버스. <i>착하지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 35d9caa1-c398-a310-5ae8-40f2507ad267
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack:35d9caa1-c398-a310-5ae8-40f2507ad267
msgctxt "h4a41a33egc92dg4a83gb059g9beb3119ffe5"
msgid ""
"*All trace of restraint is gone. 'Barnabus' has tasted blood, and wants "
"more.*"
msgstr "*모든 구속이 사라졌습니다. '바나버스'는 피 맛을 봤고, 더 많은 피를 원합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_KitchenFight_GnollAttack
