#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_NightsongDeath_AD_ZrellWaiting:5e51de0f-9de4-478b-a019-8909eb1589d5
msgctxt "hac7470c6gd143g47bdg94bfga8fd41d924b0"
msgid "That True Soul did this. I was blind to miss the signs."
msgstr "그 참된 영혼 짓이로군. 일찍이 알아채지 못한 내 불찰이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_NightsongDeath_AD_ZrellWaiting
