msgctxt "h3e0a47a9gad1dg4212g8b4eg9bc68f8510a2"
msgid "I hope they at least slit that rat Balthazar from navel to nose."
msgstr "놈들이 발타자르 그 쥐새끼나 반으로 갈라 죽여놨길 바라야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Oubliette_CorpseMembranes_Dead
