msgctxt "h4c542864g1531g4d93ga6edgaea3c4ea989a"
msgid "Cell Five"
msgstr "수감실 5"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_AD_Minthara_EnteredPrisonArea
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = bec8da5a-5a88-3b41-c4e7-7bcd6cc2fbbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_AD_Minthara_EnteredPrisonArea:bec8da5a-5a88-3b41-c4e7-7bcd6cc2fbbc
msgctxt "hdfd2e418g6a36g4f1cg920ag7c38b6bf0795"
msgid "Few escape these cells. It's only thanks to you that I did."
msgstr "이 감옥에서 탈출하는 건 극소수뿐이지. 내가 탈출할 수 있었던 건 다 네 덕분이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_AD_TortureBed
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7412d365-f32b-4777-b305-e6e864410865
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_AD_TortureBed:7412d365-f32b-4777-b305-e6e864410865
msgctxt "hac96c19ag2692g4822gba23g7a554d8c51f8"
msgid ""
"*A torture rack. Chilling to behold, and even more so to imagine the horror "
"its victims must have endured.*"
msgstr "*고문 형틀입니다. 보는 것만으로도 꺼림칙하지만, 고문의 희생자가 견뎌내야했던 공포를 상상하면 더 소름이 돋습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00
#. Speaker = Adept Ghulen
#. NodeID = 17d38eb8-b503-46c4-8c75-ad16844489f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Prison_Guard00_NecromancerReturned_Hasmet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Necromancer_State_AtMoonrise = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00:17d38eb8-b503-46c4-8c75-ad16844489f1
msgctxt "hf8119491gc524g4915ga3ffgd37a8b679bba"
msgid ""
"These cells won't stay empty for long. There are still so many who defy the "
"Absolute."
msgstr "감옥이 비어있는 시간은 그리 많지 않을 거야. 아직도 절대자님을 거스르는 놈들이야 많으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00
#. Speaker = Adept Ghulen
#. NodeID = 20412222-a37d-430b-aa72-cf51c1a7f57b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_ReturnReady = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Prison_Guard00_JailbreakSuccess_Hasmet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00:20412222-a37d-430b-aa72-cf51c1a7f57b
msgctxt "h90b0c6c1g785cg4b38g9cfcg6f3438def597"
msgid ""
"Take care, True Soul - there may be a traitor among us. Those prisoners "
"didn't escape alone."
msgstr "조심해야 해, 참된 영혼. 우리 중에 배신자가 있을지도 몰라. 죄수들은 스스로의 힘으로 탈출한 게 아니라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00
#. Speaker = Adept Ghulen
#. NodeID = 22960f73-2b9e-4f85-88be-d82a5cabb6fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Prison_Guard00_JailbreakSuccess_Hasmet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_SavingPrisoners_State_ReturnReady = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00:22960f73-2b9e-4f85-88be-d82a5cabb6fd
msgctxt "h42a74864g911dg4354g9081ga32f893285f4"
msgid "We'll find the traitor - and it will be worse than a cell for them."
msgstr "배신자를 찾아내고 말겠어. 그 녀석은 감옥에 갇히는 것보다 훨씬 더 끔찍한 벌을 받게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00
#. Speaker = Adept Ghulen
#. NodeID = 3c243fb6-94c1-4a04-91ec-a90a04799a7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Prison_HasMet_Guard00(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00:3c243fb6-94c1-4a04-91ec-a90a04799a7a
msgctxt "h9adaaae3gb4ecg49c6g9738gfd461b851f27"
msgid "Cover your nose by the cells. Those gnomes smell like <i>labour.</i>"
msgstr "감옥을 지날 때면 코를 꼭 막아야 해. 저 노움들한테서 <i>노예</i> 냄새가 진동한다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00
#. Speaker = Adept Ghulen
#. NodeID = 5e667c94-bfd3-425f-bb12-a80e04ee10aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Jailbreak_State_AllPrisonersDied = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Prison_Guard00_JailbreakFailure_Hasmet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00:5e667c94-bfd3-425f-bb12-a80e04ee10aa
msgctxt "heb5473b2gd37fg4cbcgbd58ga4dc6c4308c4"
msgid "A little quiet down here, without the crying."
msgstr "울음 소리가 들리지 않으니 조금 조용한 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00
#. Speaker = Adept Ghulen
#. NodeID = 6fb4c092-bea4-454c-aa91-7ac0c848982e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Necromancer_State_AtMoonrise = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Prison_Guard00_NecromancerReturned_Hasmet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00:6fb4c092-bea4-454c-aa91-7ac0c848982e
msgctxt "hcd7d6276gc5dag4afeg9d49g4aabe5d83ec3"
msgid ""
"Advisor Balthazar has taken the prisoners into his care. He'll shape them to "
"Her design - even if he must break them first."
msgstr ""
"고문관 발타자르가 죄수들을 데려가 관리하고 있어. 발타자르는 죄수들을 절대자님의 설계에 맞게 다듬는 일을 하지, 먼저 죄수들의 몸을 "
"완전히 해체해야 해도 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00
#. Speaker = Adept Ghulen
#. NodeID = 8d5c0ae9-0d1a-47c2-86bb-27a87ce6cbc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Prison_Guard00_JailbreakFailure_Hasmet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Jailbreak_State_AllPrisonersDied = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00:8d5c0ae9-0d1a-47c2-86bb-27a87ce6cbc0
msgctxt "h7bf21241g1cc6g4028gab44ge68166a7a5f9"
msgid ""
"Didn't think the prisoners had it in them to escape. Well - I suppose they "
"<i>didn't</i>, in the end."
msgstr "죄수들이 탈출을 계획하고 있을 줄은 생각도 못 했어. 음, 뭐 결국엔 <i>못했지만</i> 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00
#. Speaker = Adept Ghulen
#. NodeID = a8a45da6-c49e-4789-bed4-81e09b45676f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_Prison_HasMet_Guard00(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_Prison_HasMet_Guard00(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_Prison_Guard00:a8a45da6-c49e-4789-bed4-81e09b45676f
msgctxt "h7519c55bg1dbag46adgb619g1830f87984f7"
msgid "Be a dear and strike me deaf. Our guests are especially sobby today."
msgstr "부탁 좀 들어주게, 내 귀 좀 막아줘 봐. 오늘따라 우리 손님들이 유난히도 울어대는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ThroneRoom_AD_Minthara_ThroneRoomEntered
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 0bd8bb9b-b510-8c89-58e8-4dbc109bbf6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ThroneRoom_AD_Minthara_ThroneRoomEntered:0bd8bb9b-b510-8c89-58e8-4dbc109bbf6f
msgctxt "hc6387088g9f6cg4f2cg828agf640c62900f6"
msgid "I'll never forget how Ketheric humiliated me here."
msgstr "케서릭이 여기서 나에게 어떤 굴욕을 줬는지, 평생 잊지 못할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ThroneRoom_AD_Minthara_ThroneRoomEntered
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 8912c1db-15ec-e436-5e0e-33828db54d0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_ThroneRoom_AD_Minthara_ThroneRoomEntered:8912c1db-15ec-e436-5e0e-33828db54d0a
msgctxt "h17d3ef84gae88g4ec9g8b32g21fad473a994"
msgid "Ketheric ruled from here for centuries. No more."
msgstr "케서릭은 수 세기 동안 여기서 지배력을 행사해 왔지. 이제는 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 004e40ae-ff5a-58a7-f75d-11622e26036a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster_Event_EntryRefusedHasmet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:004e40ae-ff5a-58a7-f75d-11622e26036a
msgctxt "h674b5c02g4541g4c0fgb8a8g0840c67a5790"
msgid "You rejected me before - I'm in no mood for dispensing favours."
msgstr "전에도 날 거부했었지. 난 지금 호의를 베풀 기분이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 181d1da8-eb85-aa33-69bb-6e636b6125a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:181d1da8-eb85-aa33-69bb-6e636b6125a6
msgctxt "he0a32015g66f8g4504gbabfga77e1c4aceec"
msgid "Of course... please, forget I said anything. Praise the Absolute."
msgstr "물론... 부디 내가 한 말은 잊으시오. 절대자를 찬양하라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 306374a8-7dce-7506-42b1-93e4dff4a594
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:306374a8-7dce-7506-42b1-93e4dff4a594
msgctxt "hdb4df881ga828g4c88g931ag2cfe1fb511d2"
msgid ""
"Even if someone managed to get that far, they'd already be as good as dead."
msgstr "혹여라도 무사히 통과해 나간다 한들, 안으로 들어가는 순간 죽은 목숨이나 다름 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 363fbb94-a5b3-83df-751f-2e6c159bca80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:363fbb94-a5b3-83df-751f-2e6c159bca80
msgctxt "hd788034aga1e7g4ff1gafb4gb2d5d9c4e839"
msgid ""
"These were gifts from the Absolute, for my loyalty. I used them to take the "
"head of the Lolth priestess who cut off my hands."
msgstr "이건 절대자께서 내 충성심에 대한 보답으로 내게 주신 선물이다. 이걸로 내 손을 잘라간 롤스 여사제의 목을 취했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 4df40c04-40df-9768-9eeb-3f7668109eea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:4df40c04-40df-9768-9eeb-3f7668109eea
msgctxt "hfe7ff142g0937g4990g8903g9a4ccc4eae26"
msgid "I was told you've been granted passage to the Illumination Chamber."
msgstr "계몽의 방에 들어갈 자격을 얻으셨다 들었소."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5a2f10d5-117b-6d5a-3518-8bc9ac89a71c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:5a2f10d5-117b-6d5a-3518-8bc9ac89a71c
msgctxt "h7463897cgf74cg4fc4g96a0g4f36ea68617d"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5acaa8de-0e66-25b4-0476-efefae99f176
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:5acaa8de-0e66-25b4-0476-efefae99f176
msgctxt "h3d8a533cged3bg4b6fgbcafgb2a3bbb0667e"
msgid "Nice blades. Don't think I'd trade my hands for them, though."
msgstr "칼 멋진데. 그래도 난 내 손이랑 바꾸진 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 60f5a9e7-dc58-a71f-a5cc-f33e1ed1d542
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:60f5a9e7-dc58-a71f-a5cc-f33e1ed1d542
msgctxt "h7634eb98g02b4g4c2ag8b59gde1bb347d8f2"
msgid "You honour me. I will not let you down."
msgstr "영광이구려. 실망시키지 않겠소."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 623d485e-4884-ba20-63e5-167d01d4bcdc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FEMALE(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_LOLTHDROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:623d485e-4884-ba20-63e5-167d01d4bcdc
msgctxt "h80f2e02fg8fc5g4ee5g9d08g351294738114"
msgid ""
"Whoever your mistress is, she needs to rein in that tongue of yours. Or "
"remove it."
msgstr "네 주인이 누구든 네 혀를 좀 단속해야겠는데. 잘라버리든가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 65f82093-2811-9979-4ecf-681780d7074e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:65f82093-2811-9979-4ecf-681780d7074e
msgctxt "haadba820g7a77g47ffg878cg1d15a2a46989"
msgid ""
"Warriors, nobility, power brokers... <i>important </i>people. Those the "
"Absolute has use for."
msgstr "전사나 귀족, 정계의 실세처럼 <i>중요한</i> 인물, 즉 절대자께 쓸모가 있는 자 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 669552c4-f763-9117-f056-f2478f8c8236
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:669552c4-f763-9117-f056-f2478f8c8236
msgctxt "hd1100775g708dg437cgbfd7g14f02db8ce29"
msgid "Chosen Ketheric is the judge. I am the executioner - if you press me."
msgstr "널 판단하는 건 선택받은 자 케서릭이시다. 난 그분의 처형인이지. 네가 날 그냥 지나치려 한다면 말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 6a448460-c55c-c4ed-3fbb-424a230b9ea3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_TrapRoom_State_AllowAccess = False
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster_Event_EntryRefusedHasmet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:6a448460-c55c-c4ed-3fbb-424a230b9ea3
msgctxt "hccb27697g3576g4faaga11egec82dd0bc180"
msgid ""
"Provoking me is a most painful means of suicide. Leave, or I'll fill this "
"chamber with your screams."
msgstr "날 자극하는 건 아주 고통스러운 자살 방법이 될 거다. 이 방을 네 비명으로 채우고 싶지 않다면 꺼져라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 6c91a250-e4e8-cfa0-e52f-d1fa30079e73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:6c91a250-e4e8-cfa0-e52f-d1fa30079e73
msgctxt "h0b65a4a1ge9fbg4a7bgb95bge6feb9c57c20"
msgid ""
"We all serve the Absolute here, remember? I don't have to answer to the "
"likes of you ever again."
msgstr "우린 모두 절대자를 섬긴다. 잊은 건가? 더는 너 같은 녀석에게 답할 이유는 없겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79da9aed-93cb-d9e1-2124-84bd7c3fe43c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:79da9aed-93cb-d9e1-2124-84bd7c3fe43c
msgctxt "hdcde1497g3868g4400ga0fag51756182522c"
msgid "<i>Leave without dignifying him with an answer.</i>"
msgstr "<i>무시하고 대답하지 않는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 7d1fd3b7-9db8-c148-2454-827e49c365ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:7d1fd3b7-9db8-c148-2454-827e49c365ef
msgctxt "hfd1bd8d1g9f6fg49a9g88f7g6b68d31cfc70"
msgid "You are not among them. Leave. "
msgstr "넌 누구도 아니니, 꺼져라. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 81ef6935-79c5-f07b-ab35-065c1aec0fd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:81ef6935-79c5-f07b-ab35-065c1aec0fd0
msgctxt "h03f0019dga243g4902g9081g42037a959e0b"
msgid ""
"No one can make it past these doors - past <i>me </i>- without Illumination."
msgstr "계몽하지 않은 자는 이 문을, <i>날</i> 지나갈 수 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 83fa909a-4698-fee1-605f-c02dd7549241
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster_Event_EntryGrantedHasmet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:83fa909a-4698-fee1-605f-c02dd7549241
msgctxt "h66de996bgbee6g4abeg9dffg40058e1980a7"
msgid ""
"Please, enter. The defences will not harm one of the Illuminated - Chosen "
"Ketheric would see me burn if anything befell you."
msgstr "들어오시오. 계몽한 자는 해할 수 없으니. 그대에게 무슨 일이라도 생긴다면 선택받은 자 케서릭께서 날 불태우실 거요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c00f8c9-27f2-52d3-a8f8-3c359017dbe6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:8c00f8c9-27f2-52d3-a8f8-3c359017dbe6
msgctxt "h58149e0cg8963g4e47gb31cg06ce80bec71c"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 912c8251-987a-23c2-53b6-a39e0aa98104
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - b466cb0c-79a6-edfe-9fd5-d61dee4d5d90_SeekingEntry = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b466cb0c-79a6-edfe-9fd5-d61dee4d5d90_SeekingEntry = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:912c8251-987a-23c2-53b6-a39e0aa98104
msgctxt "hae447f99gf09dg42b6g9922g13f2bf3dd4fd"
msgid "You will not pass me. Leave."
msgstr "넌 지나갈 수 없다. 꺼져라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 91a29b9b-6518-ce54-dd81-66b242fa6798
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_TrapRoom_State_AllowAccess = True
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster_Event_EntryGrantedHasmet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:91a29b9b-6518-ce54-dd81-66b242fa6798
msgctxt "h1ef70c5bgd422g48a4g9f0fg903e337370a0"
msgid "Please, the Path of Illumination is open to you. Praise the Absolute."
msgstr "들어오시오, 계몽의 길이 열려 있으니. 절대자를 찬양하라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 998bc10b-0748-cd75-a021-c4496acac231
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:998bc10b-0748-cd75-a021-c4496acac231
msgctxt "h8d388de8g70acg4e0bgb46cgf5c52325b258"
msgid "I still have her head in my chamber. Part of my collection."
msgstr "아직 그 여자의 목이 내 방에 있다. 수집품 중 하나지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = 9a45e560-b949-b9b9-284c-1c96577f23df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:9a45e560-b949-b9b9-284c-1c96577f23df
msgctxt "h22b278bfga654g400aga228ga02b0452a3ad"
msgid ""
"I see what you're doing - trying to trick me into talking, saying more than "
"I should. It won't work. "
msgstr "무슨 속셈인지 안다. 날 자극해서 실언이라도 내뱉길 바라는 심보겠지. 어림없다. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9abe7270-9606-007e-b6c2-ff5069e75368
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b466cb0c-79a6-edfe-9fd5-d61dee4d5d90_SeekingEntry = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:9abe7270-9606-007e-b6c2-ff5069e75368
msgctxt "hac232222g5487g44c1g80b5g83f886702b64"
msgid "You're no judge of me."
msgstr "네가 뭔데 날 판단해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e2c0d0a-65f3-d0f2-2b2c-260fee3fe84f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK and !REALLY_LOLTHDROWELF
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:9e2c0d0a-65f3-d0f2-2b2c-260fee3fe84f
msgctxt "h1ca79d78g3982g47d1g9f98gd5d28cbb595f"
msgid ""
"Curious. I thought male drow were nothing but cup-bearers and foot-stools."
msgstr "흥미롭네. 남성 드로우는 와인이나 따르는 발 받침대인 줄 알았는데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = ab2aef4f-2f18-6ad1-d546-7e49270d3038
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:ab2aef4f-2f18-6ad1-d546-7e49270d3038
msgctxt "ha8d3d7a2g1b67g4756g8d67g96d2ab451727"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you can put in a word for me - I am loyal. I am ready. Someone like "
"you could help Chosen Ketheric see the true extent of my service towards him."
msgstr ""
"청하건대 내 얘길 좀 전해 주시겠소? 난 충성심이 깊고, 준비되었다오. 그대 같은 이가 귀띔을 드린다면 선택받은 자 케서릭께서도 날 "
"알아봐 주실 거요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae7ff898-3863-5a42-2afe-457ff0582d5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster_Event_EntryRefusedHasmet(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:ae7ff898-3863-5a42-2afe-457ff0582d5a
msgctxt "h37bf898dge0f4g437dga19cg7bf05370a987"
msgid "If you were truly ready, you'd have been summoned."
msgstr "네가 정말 준비가 됐다면 부름을 받았겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = b01eb418-e206-f672-d29a-d8a7d6b08686
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:b01eb418-e206-f672-d29a-d8a7d6b08686
msgctxt "h3bcb2aa7ga783g42c1gaeb1g288cad044204"
msgid ""
"If you are found worthy of Illumination, I will know. Until then, these "
"doors are closed to you."
msgstr "네가 계몽했다면, 한눈에 알아봤을 것이다. 그때까지 이 문은 못 지나간다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bfa2eb2e-f6b7-4f3c-9265-9a1d756ede42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - b466cb0c-79a6-edfe-9fd5-d61dee4d5d90_SeekingEntry = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:bfa2eb2e-f6b7-4f3c-9265-9a1d756ede42
msgctxt "hca653742g5adbg40fdga72aga301438a84ee"
msgid ""
"There has to be another way through - there's <i>always </i>another way."
msgstr "지나갈 다른 방법이 있겠지? 방법은 <i>항상</i> 있는 법이잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4a0b501-7a27-e542-f318-f961b16c3ecc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b466cb0c-79a6-edfe-9fd5-d61dee4d5d90_SeekingEntry = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:c4a0b501-7a27-e542-f318-f961b16c3ecc
msgctxt "h876f6944gaaa2g4d97g844cg94b0f3c02159"
msgid "Stand aside. I am a True Soul."
msgstr "비켜라. 이 몸은 참된 영혼이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c6ae28ad-3b5b-e84c-55fe-a00219a46f64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:c6ae28ad-3b5b-e84c-55fe-a00219a46f64
msgctxt "h8af2304ag6192g4c29g96aag8edc5177f6fb"
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "못할 것도 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = de39e61b-1a02-d6ce-2fef-f5b9a3c9e4ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:de39e61b-1a02-d6ce-2fef-f5b9a3c9e4ce
msgctxt "h5cde6571gdff9g4276g8551gbfe523ca0e10"
msgid ""
"I answer to Chosen Ketheric, and he speaks for the Absolute. Z'rell has no "
"power down here."
msgstr "난 절대자의 목소리를 전하는 선택받은 자 케서릭의 명을 따른다. 여기선 즈렐도 아무런 힘이 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = ec2c7239-5604-2872-18a5-dd1eef553386
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:ec2c7239-5604-2872-18a5-dd1eef553386
msgctxt "h0be71e8fg632dg4bd9gbcc9ga9552228e2cb"
msgid ""
"Beyond those doors, one wrong step will kill you. Only those without a trace "
"of fear could possibly survive."
msgstr "이 문을 지나면, 한 발짝만 잘못 움직여도 목숨을 잃을 것이다. 일말의 공포도 없는 자들만이 살아남을 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = efd4c843-21c0-df4d-b705-94d6c6222425
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:efd4c843-21c0-df4d-b705-94d6c6222425
msgctxt "hc8f012bdg7d27g4344gb154g6403428ea084"
msgid "I... of course. Please, enter. Praise the Absolute."
msgstr "그땐... 좋소. 들어오시오. 절대자를 찬양하라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = f28b0415-c309-c1c8-d28b-479f3361e7ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:f28b0415-c309-c1c8-d28b-479f3361e7ff
msgctxt "h7e23a1e5g042dg423cg9606gfd2951dc08a4"
msgid ""
"That's not enough - not for here. None pass me without Chosen Ketheric's "
"favour."
msgstr "여기선 그것으로 충분하지 않다. 선택받은 자 케서릭의 허락 없인 누구도 날 지날 수 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2f84e23-1043-aba1-c80f-84bae15727ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:f2f84e23-1043-aba1-c80f-84bae15727ae
msgctxt "h11ba50d8gd89bg4ac5g86a0g34948fcaa324"
msgid "Fair enough. I'll just kill you."
msgstr "그래. 그냥 널 죽이는 게 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = f44dc12d-6bff-7937-65e2-7a36ab967b55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster_Event_EntryRefusedHasmet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:f44dc12d-6bff-7937-65e2-7a36ab967b55
msgctxt "h3a92a849g28eag4094gb54dg4250a9bebcfa"
msgid ""
"<i>Stop. </i>None but those destined for Illumination are allowed to pass "
"me, with Chosen Ketheric's blessing. "
msgstr "<i>멈춰라.</i> 선택받은 자 케서릭의 축복을 입어 계몽할 운명을 타고난 자들만이 지나갈 수 있다. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f6f87abe-3762-a564-affc-8ad7f55867c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Execution_Knows_Executioner = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:f6f87abe-3762-a564-affc-8ad7f55867c6
msgctxt "hd93dd00bg76c2g454bg9a36gf86737e120cb"
msgid "Do you think Disciple Z'rell would agree with you?"
msgstr "신봉자 즈렐도 네 말에 동의할까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster
#. Speaker = UNKNOWN_CHARACTER
#. NodeID = fd6b93da-f509-203d-296f-530a9630b217
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_TrapRoom_CellarMaster:fd6b93da-f509-203d-296f-530a9630b217
msgctxt "h78ec434bge98ag45fdg8a4fgf30299031aec"
msgid "I serve no one but the Absolute. He trusts me. He <i>honours </i>me."
msgstr "난 절대자만을 섬긴다. 그분께선 날 신뢰하시고, <i>영광</i>을 베푸신다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_AccessCultistPrayer
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 1f108183-f03f-4a1b-a193-b735ff304b6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 3e7a6665-f36f-0ddb-3882-7d68260b2104_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3e7a6665-f36f-0ddb-3882-7d68260b2104_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_AccessCultistPrayer:1f108183-f03f-4a1b-a193-b735ff304b6b
msgctxt "h7fb62eecgf961g4f05g9a4bg45ec1272d3c4"
msgid "Many hearts, one soul. In Your name, Absolute."
msgstr "수많은 마음, 하나의 영혼. 당신의 이름으로, 절대자시여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_AccessCultistPrayer
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 45f8f580-ad96-468d-8a3d-0ab40a235535
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 3e7a6665-f36f-0ddb-3882-7d68260b2104_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3e7a6665-f36f-0ddb-3882-7d68260b2104_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_AccessCultistPrayer:45f8f580-ad96-468d-8a3d-0ab40a235535
msgctxt "h8497bb8bg5c43g4d03gbbd4g68d35aa7a98a"
msgid "Their cities shall be as dust beneath Your feet."
msgstr "놈들의 도시는 먼지가 되어 당신의 발밑에 놓일 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_AccessCultistPrayer
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = 7e7ca318-709f-4060-993f-2933a7ad3fae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3e7a6665-f36f-0ddb-3882-7d68260b2104_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_AccessCultistPrayer:7e7ca318-709f-4060-993f-2933a7ad3fae
msgctxt "he391fb0dg1ce4g4b44g93efg357aa6829918"
msgid ""
"Our old lives are shed. Our old dreams are dead. We are of One Mind, in Your "
"Design."
msgstr "옛 삶은 잊혀졌고, 옛 꿈은 죽어버렸습니다. 당신의 설계 아래, 우리의 정신은 하나입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_AccessCultistPrayer
#. Speaker = Radija
#. NodeID = e2c587f4-f3b8-4ae2-92df-587e85dfbd71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 3e7a6665-f36f-0ddb-3882-7d68260b2104_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3e7a6665-f36f-0ddb-3882-7d68260b2104_B = False
#.     - 3e7a6665-f36f-0ddb-3882-7d68260b2104_C = False
#.     - 3e7a6665-f36f-0ddb-3882-7d68260b2104_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_AccessCultistPrayer:e2c587f4-f3b8-4ae2-92df-587e85dfbd71
msgctxt "h2fcf0e27gd614g430cgb2f9g61c2f712486a"
msgid "Bring dusk. Bring night. Bring Your Design."
msgstr "황혼을, 밤을, 당신의 설계를 내려주소서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards
#. Speaker = Zealot Bennel
#. NodeID = 3514721a-4520-546f-541b-64ae87bcbe82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 2235113e-140f-6798-9637-1aa37dc74a05_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2235113e-140f-6798-9637-1aa37dc74a05_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards:3514721a-4520-546f-541b-64ae87bcbe82
msgctxt "hd9d40c46g472eg4e97g987fge0c3b437f0aa"
msgid "You were Flaming Fist before this, weren't you lass?"
msgstr "여기 들어오기 전에 플레이밍 피스트였지? 안 그래 아가씨?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards
#. Speaker = Zealot Bennel
#. NodeID = 3ba094b7-397a-69dc-5232-17e566943859
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards:3ba094b7-397a-69dc-5232-17e566943859
msgctxt "h0f00b4cfg85e7g42a2gba01g9e6741294014"
msgid "<i>God. </i>We belong to just the one now, remember."
msgstr "<i>신</i>이시여. 이제 우리는 오직 한 분에게만 속했어. 명심해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards
#. Speaker = Zealot Bennel
#. NodeID = 5394c188-c834-96f1-ee59-83f2291bd065
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards:5394c188-c834-96f1-ee59-83f2291bd065
msgctxt "h866a0508gdcb9g452agbd44ge849a6040ec4"
msgid "You cheat. Badly."
msgstr "배신했구먼. 그것도 아주 심하게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 5867e41b-db06-b6c3-40ea-2062b4ba598e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards:5867e41b-db06-b6c3-40ea-2062b4ba598e
msgctxt "he0680ccdg2255g417eg9d6aga517ed6d74cb"
msgid "Gods."
msgstr "신들이시여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 8320cfad-c71a-2f9a-6bda-cda2b9d2a2cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards:8320cfad-c71a-2f9a-6bda-cda2b9d2a2cb
msgctxt "h58a5862dgc32eg4502g9c0cg3348699682e8"
msgid "Save your 'lasses' for when you're courting. But aye - how d'you know?"
msgstr "'아가씨'라는 말은 여자 꼬실 때나 쓰는 말이고. 그래도 맞았어. 어떻게 안 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards
#. Speaker = Zealot Bennel
#. NodeID = 8d2be91e-1212-a778-8f07-8bb3ac7f59df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards:8d2be91e-1212-a778-8f07-8bb3ac7f59df
msgctxt "h202263dagd2c1g4671g8986g0349ba848740"
msgid ""
"Aye. My brother's. Had to deal with him after he struck a True Soul - "
"claimed she was some kind of monster."
msgstr "그래. 내 동생의 피야. 그 자식이 참된 영혼을 공격해서 처리해야만 했어. 참된 영혼이 무슨 괴물이라고 난리 치더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 9283c25c-fc9d-e398-dcd0-ee64f1657c42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards:9283c25c-fc9d-e398-dcd0-ee64f1657c42
msgctxt "h5d24d989g1cd3g404cg91ebg9f05641afa62"
msgid "Not 'til we get there, anyway."
msgstr "우리가 도시에 도착하기 전까진 그렇겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = b27a892c-6e8e-df0a-c43a-76083eedf285
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 2235113e-140f-6798-9637-1aa37dc74a05_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2235113e-140f-6798-9637-1aa37dc74a05_A = False
#.     - 2235113e-140f-6798-9637-1aa37dc74a05_B = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards:b27a892c-6e8e-df0a-c43a-76083eedf285
msgctxt "h7cc1ac8cg01a4g4ccdg9a30g2de889f2f616"
msgid "Ugh. There's <i>blood </i>on these cards."
msgstr "으엑. 이 카드에 <i>피</i> 좀 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards
#. Speaker = Zealot Bennel
#. NodeID = b49d1d8f-8659-45fc-a274-00e6afc9beb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards:b49d1d8f-8659-45fc-a274-00e6afc9beb0
msgctxt "hd96ca080g841cg4a51gac94g5a4a5998f838"
msgid ""
"The General's just wrapping up a few loose ends. Besides - city's going "
"nowhere."
msgstr "장군님이 몇 가지 남은 일을 매듭짓고 있잖아. 게다가 도시가 당장 사라지는 것도 아니라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards
#. Speaker = Zealot Bennel
#. NodeID = d2b63218-6511-96e1-5aff-95d3aa8ce118
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards:d2b63218-6511-96e1-5aff-95d3aa8ce118
msgctxt "h1d648061gb10cg4d19gbc71gb313eea6d649"
msgid "Had to toss him over that terrace there."
msgstr "저기 테라스에 던져버렸지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = eaa27d0b-6daf-4420-bcc5-fdaece0ebbe6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 2235113e-140f-6798-9637-1aa37dc74a05_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_AD_ImpatientGuards:eaa27d0b-6daf-4420-bcc5-fdaece0ebbe6
msgctxt "h77498c49g5f12g4244ga2e3ga63a1c6235b1"
msgid ""
"I'm sick as shit of looking at your mug. The sooner we march, the better."
msgstr "네 못생긴 면상만 계속 보려니 지긋지긋하군. 당장 진군하고 싶다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 0e841618-f168-4a7a-b881-249a7f492050
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Necromancer_State_AtMoonrise = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00_NecromancerReturned_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:0e841618-f168-4a7a-b881-249a7f492050
msgctxt "h6e53944bgc3cag43beg85b8ge4d88fd52b98"
msgid ""
"Now the General's advisor is back, we can get moving. Praise Her bloody name."
msgstr "이제 장군님의 고문관이 돌아왔으니, 우리도 움직일 수 있겠어. 절대자님의 이름을 찬양하라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 1f5b431d-0d4a-4f1c-812f-8e910baed7ec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Audience_State_Ready = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00_AudienceReady_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:1f5b431d-0d4a-4f1c-812f-8e910baed7ec
msgctxt "h6308cbd1g103fg4ea2ga4d5gc3da091236b7"
msgid "Weapons ready, True Soul. We're bound for Baldur's Gate!"
msgstr "무기 준비해, 참된 영혼. 발더스 게이트로 출격한다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 296e67bc-da8a-01d4-b5e4-9d4a670c9edf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:296e67bc-da8a-01d4-b5e4-9d4a670c9edf
msgctxt "h1c35b7e7g7605g4f4bga574g361540d706b9"
msgid "Why, soldier? Do you have somewhere else to be?"
msgstr "왜 그러나, 병사? 어디 가고 싶은 곳이라도 있는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 2ccd7233-4f23-ab46-4e32-cfa1c6f2c7f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:2ccd7233-4f23-ab46-4e32-cfa1c6f2c7f4
msgctxt "hfdd6f259gde2ag4beaga22dgeb3708d685b4"
msgid "The necromancer? The General won't leave one of his own behind."
msgstr "그 사령술사? 장군님께서 자기 사람을 두고 가진 않으실텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 4010e47a-1e13-649a-7630-565d76dd1213
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_UpperFloor_HasMet_Guard00(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_UpperFloor_HasMet_Guard00(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:4010e47a-1e13-649a-7630-565d76dd1213
msgctxt "h53caa8abg636fg4d5cg98eag136785d0327c"
msgid "Hey, True Soul - what's the word?"
msgstr "이봐, 참된 영혼. 뭐 들은 거 있어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 46f6d04a-73e6-6ffd-d007-4e6924bc69b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_UpperFloor_HasMet_Guard00(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:46f6d04a-73e6-6ffd-d007-4e6924bc69b5
msgctxt "hd5c4d616g877eg43e0gb14dg3b02c3dfe88a"
msgid ""
"Hope we get moving soon. Got an army of beasts out there - don't want them "
"getting bored."
msgstr "빨리 움직였으면 좋겠어. 저 밖에 짐승 군단이 있는데, 저 녀석들이 지루해지면 안 되잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 509f559d-be66-43dc-9f96-0b2c4c103ad2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00_IsobelKidnapped_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Isobel_State_AtMoonrise = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:509f559d-be66-43dc-9f96-0b2c4c103ad2
msgctxt "h01639991g6f1eg45c1gb7dcgd2a7b4d937f6"
msgid ""
"The General won't be long bringing the Selûnite to our side. The old gods "
"are done."
msgstr "장군님이 곧 있으면 셀루네의 신도들을 우리 편으로 끌어들일 거야. 옛 신들은 이제 끝이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 5858a09e-694e-0af2-3f8a-f6d9e9080046
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:5858a09e-694e-0af2-3f8a-f6d9e9080046
msgctxt "h52c08f91g0155g468cga7dfg03d36a20ce80"
msgid "I have got faith, True Soul. 'Course I do."
msgstr "나에겐 믿음이 있어, 참된 영혼. 당연히 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 5d1e6a32-c5e2-4edf-5036-55e580300313
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:5d1e6a32-c5e2-4edf-5036-55e580300313
msgctxt "h7e5c39dagff15g4e27g8a5cgab01136c7132"
msgid "I want to be the first to put it to the torch."
msgstr "내가 가장 먼저 가서 도시를 불바다로 만들고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 5fa00bfe-c910-2a8e-8427-aafa1390538c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:5fa00bfe-c910-2a8e-8427-aafa1390538c
msgctxt "hbd4459abg1d01g45f9ga05ag3435f2b7298e"
msgid "Army's gathered outside. The General giving us marching orders?"
msgstr "밖에 군대가 모여 있어. 장군님께서 진군 명령을 내리는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 63d61efe-f62b-621f-79ee-428e09ca8bec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:63d61efe-f62b-621f-79ee-428e09ca8bec
msgctxt "hc8cb503bg3b49g4568gbdf4g3287940971f4"
msgid "Just keen to get back to the Gate, is all. I was born there."
msgstr "그냥 발더스게이트로 빨리 가고 싶을 뿐이야. 그게 다야. 거기서 태어났거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69e0980b-a272-2cb0-b4f3-eb3152488eef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:69e0980b-a272-2cb0-b4f3-eb3152488eef
msgctxt "hd5094b4bg185ag45a2g854eg9237dfff8874"
msgid "<i>Stare her down.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀와 눈싸움을 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 711e1cd2-1b3d-c253-f701-c79a2a77d029
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - b4321c68-57ff-3a0a-2426-7b2b436bb4c3_MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00_MentionedNecro = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:711e1cd2-1b3d-c253-f701-c79a2a77d029
msgctxt "h1ce1b4f9gea4eg4da8gb981g156db058d402"
msgid "Keep it to yourself - but the General's advisor is missing."
msgstr "이건 너만 알고 있어, 장군의 고문관이 실종상태라던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 72c2df75-c2c6-4417-82fd-39575faa8a45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Isobel_State_AtMoonrise = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00_IsobelKidnapped_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:72c2df75-c2c6-4417-82fd-39575faa8a45
msgctxt "h784f59d8g4c72g43efg86d2gd65f8a10fe85"
msgid ""
"Seen our special guest? The General had her brought to the roof straight "
"away - big plans, I'd say."
msgstr "특별한 손님이 왔던데? 장군님이 곧장 옥상으로 데려가셨어. 내 생각에 뭔가 큰 계획이 있는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 9095ea1e-16e1-4945-8013-2d65beb145ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00_AudienceReady_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Audience_State_Ready = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:9095ea1e-16e1-4945-8013-2d65beb145ef
msgctxt "he42d0717g0191g4170g9110gc19d9c791ad4"
msgid ""
"Baldur's Gate has seen its share of madness - but it's not ready for what's "
"coming."
msgstr "발더스 게이트는 별의별 일을 다 겪어봤지만 이제 다가올 일은 예상치 못 할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = 944f2d3f-d51d-cd6c-3a03-4fa8fbdaa502
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:944f2d3f-d51d-cd6c-3a03-4fa8fbdaa502
msgctxt "h9d6d9b78g86dfg4b82gacbbgd8ad4fb44be4"
msgid "Just got sores from all the sitting around, too."
msgstr "너무 앉아 있어서 좀이 쑤시기도 하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = a1bcceca-c9c0-9dec-b2d5-302e0cef1cdb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:a1bcceca-c9c0-9dec-b2d5-302e0cef1cdb
msgctxt "h82dd38a0g76b5g4220gb3c1gca9e8c2bd904"
msgid ""
"...Right you are, True Soul. Not questioning - just ready to serve, is all."
msgstr "...맞네, 참된 영혼. 질문하지 않는다. 그저 명령에 따를 준비만 한다. 그게 전부지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = c99bb46d-95eb-26b9-0a4a-c0076cb30867
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:c99bb46d-95eb-26b9-0a4a-c0076cb30867
msgctxt "hfe32982dg4241g455fgb090g4b9acdbf548f"
msgid ""
"He might be the Absolute's Chosen now, but he's still a soldier at heart."
msgstr "장군님은 이제 절대자의 선택받은 자일지 몰라도, 여전히 그분의 중심은 전사의 심장을 갖고 계시거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Acolyte Daine
#. NodeID = ca4a41af-ac38-4b65-8617-3796e1e575e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00_NecromancerReturned_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Necromancer_State_AtMoonrise = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:ca4a41af-ac38-4b65-8617-3796e1e575e7
msgctxt "he25e5598g1034g4652gaef2gd35761aa7c6f"
msgid ""
"Watch yourself around some of the guards. The ones the necromancers brought "
"back are a little... odd."
msgstr "몇몇 경비병들은 조심해야 해. 사령술사들이 데려온 녀석들이 좀... 이상해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f09d177a-3b08-ae43-c792-b2d5b3f415cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard00:f09d177a-3b08-ae43-c792-b2d5b3f415cb
msgctxt "hececda3cg3c51g4e7bg8d38gd569d49a8155"
msgid "The Absolute's plan will unfold in good time. Have faith."
msgstr "절대자님의 계획은 때가 되면 알게 될 거야. 믿음을 가져."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard01
#. Speaker = Zealot Bennel
#. NodeID = 0e1d6f7f-38bc-49a1-8c7c-e00ce3302893
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard01:0e1d6f7f-38bc-49a1-8c7c-e00ce3302893
msgctxt "h85ce3da1g5ecag4ce2ga6fdg3a809c827df0"
msgid "We are blessed, True Soul - to stand so close to General Thorm."
msgstr "쏨 장군님 옆에 이렇게 가까이 서게 되다니, 우린 축복받았어, 참된 영혼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard01
#. Speaker = Zealot Bennel
#. NodeID = 32984570-1977-e09e-7b2c-53cfde0c3bbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard01:32984570-1977-e09e-7b2c-53cfde0c3bbb
msgctxt "h67ff16bbg8e8dg4d48gad10g78c512c63283"
msgid "That's the Absolute's power. The <i>General's </i>power."
msgstr "절대자님의 힘이다. <i>장군님의</i> 힘이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard01
#. Speaker = Zealot Bennel
#. NodeID = 7de1a34f-358c-d2e2-452e-f5be0fc19091
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_UpperFloor_HasMet_Guard01(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_UpperFloor_HasMet_Guard01(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard01:7de1a34f-358c-d2e2-452e-f5be0fc19091
msgctxt "h8181ae08gb313g46d7g8448g368a526ff57f"
msgid ""
"Seen the view out west from the terrace? All those beasts camped under one "
"banner."
msgstr "테라스 서쪽 경치 봤어? 저 짐승들 모두가 하나의 깃발 아래 모여 있는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = 33e775a4-1feb-4f0f-87b0-e882cf504640
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Audience_State_Ready = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_UpperFloor_Audience_HasMet_Guard02(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02:33e775a4-1feb-4f0f-87b0-e882cf504640
msgctxt "h17e1216fg3272g4a57g8d75g330e9718d9e2"
msgid ""
"Congratulations, True Soul. You'll surely be granted an audience - with "
"<i>Her.</i>"
msgstr "축하하네, 참된 영혼. 자넨 분명 <i>그분</i>과 접견 할 수 있을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = 832512ef-e98e-4ece-a38a-c819e2016e6e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_UpperFloor_HasMet_Guard02_IsobelKidnapped(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Isobel_State_AtMoonrise = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02:832512ef-e98e-4ece-a38a-c819e2016e6e
msgctxt "h7129b3ecgfe09g41f7g8bddgbe80d84bfefd"
msgid ""
"I hear you had a part in capturing the cleric. The General rewards those "
"who're worthy, count on it."
msgstr "자네가 클레릭을 잡는 일에 한몫했다고 들었네. 장군님은 가치를 증명한 자에게 반드시 보상하지, 기대해도 좋을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = 92b954c9-f282-4307-b854-63a35cbeb13e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Isobel_State_AtMoonrise = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_UpperFloor_HasMet_Guard02_IsobelKidnapped(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02:92b954c9-f282-4307-b854-63a35cbeb13e
msgctxt "h45a5a494g5fdbg4b56gb711g32140116ab76"
msgid ""
"They flew the cleric directly to the chapel above. No hiding from the "
"Absolute's reach, eh?"
msgstr "클레릭을 잡아서 예배당 꼭대기로 바로 날라왔더군. 절대자님의 손길을 피할 곳은 어디에도 없지, 안 그런가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = a719ec41-8915-49b6-932d-7a99b072fd79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_UpperFloor_Audience_HasMet_Guard02(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Audience_State_Ready = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02:a719ec41-8915-49b6-932d-7a99b072fd79
msgctxt "hd6bde991g1b0ag4031g94d2ge298698d58dc"
msgid "We're finally marching - and it's because of you."
msgstr "드디어 출격하는군. 다 자네 덕분이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = bcd39d4f-bac3-4995-9b5e-a5af414c053e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_UpperFloor_Execution_HasMet_Guard02(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_GroundFloor_State_ExecutionOver = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02:bcd39d4f-bac3-4995-9b5e-a5af414c053e
msgctxt "h37695618gadfag4154gad2dg695c2bb38464"
msgid "If you've business up here, Disciple Z'rell will send for you."
msgstr "이 위층에서 볼 일이 생긴다면 신봉자 즈렐이 알아서 자넬 부를 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = d8ce149a-2ca9-4036-968d-bee81cebfe43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_GroundFloor_State_ExecutionOver = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_UpperFloor_Execution_HasMet_Guard02(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02:d8ce149a-2ca9-4036-968d-bee81cebfe43
msgctxt "h6d3fe27ag1858g422eg985dge5407a888280"
msgid ""
"Respectfully, True Soul - the General's in council downstairs. This floor is "
"for him and Z'rell alone."
msgstr "미안하지만, 참된 영혼. 장군님은 현재 아래층에 있는 의회에 계신다네. 여기는 장군님과 즈렐의 전용 공간일세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = dbb7aa05-e701-4e2a-bded-3d430ad6fae7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - MOO_UpperFloor_HasMet_Guard02(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02:dbb7aa05-e701-4e2a-bded-3d430ad6fae7
msgctxt "h0a888c4agf329g42dfgb3ecg80ea461f6031"
msgid ""
"The General's retired to his chapel on the roof. If you're lucky, he might "
"invite you to pray with him."
msgstr "장군님은 지금 탑 옥상에 있는 예배당에 계신다네. 혹시 아나, 장군님께서 자네를 기도의 자리에 초대해 주실지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = f17cdf64-044b-4196-81d6-f96c543fd99f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - MOO_UpperFloor_HasMet_Guard02(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_Guard02:f17cdf64-044b-4196-81d6-f96c543fd99f
msgctxt "hdd7d5435gcf0cg4d97g9c9eg6ef444d55828"
msgid "Whatever plans the General is making, we'll be ready."
msgstr "장군님이 어떤 계획을 세우던 우리는 따를 준비가 돼 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = 04a88a78-8471-10b2-c835-3c285eca1420
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:04a88a78-8471-10b2-c835-3c285eca1420
msgctxt "hd78b1fcag3a1ag469dgadb5g61b03603b71f"
msgid "Z'rell? Very well - do as you will. And know that I'm watching."
msgstr "즈렐이? 좋아 - 원하는 대로 해. 내가 지켜보고 있다는 걸 명심하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = 0aec2c7b-3eda-4173-9f14-f7c50dac18df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:0aec2c7b-3eda-4173-9f14-f7c50dac18df
msgctxt "h2f5bcbfbg91fdg4e07gadeagf00ea38c712c"
msgid "Pardon - you are a Disciple, indeed. The Towers are yours to explore."
msgstr "죄송합니다 - 정말 신봉자시군요. 탑을 원하는 대로 돌아다니셔도 좋습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 20d35f6a-4bb5-4b14-b16c-ab5bccba1b25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:20d35f6a-4bb5-4b14-b16c-ab5bccba1b25
msgctxt "hdc4e7491g090cg4963g8282g325ea87d35d0"
msgid ""
"*The mark glows, but you feel nothing in response. Your illithid power is "
"beyond reach until you rest.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나지만, 어떤 반응도 느껴지지 않습니다. 일리시드 능력을 더 사용하려면 휴식을 취해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = 21a008b5-ed6e-cf73-b86f-fef1616a3791
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToIndivPlayerAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:21a008b5-ed6e-cf73-b86f-fef1616a3791
msgctxt "hcd0a139eg10cdg4419g989fgbfe4adc0c75e"
msgid "I know my orders. <i>For the Absolute.</i>"
msgstr "내 명령은 내가 잘 압니다. <i>절대자님을 위하여.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 27349cd5-0c29-4257-8b82-3a5e20202c06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:27349cd5-0c29-4257-8b82-3a5e20202c06
msgctxt "h45a7c69ag690eg4264gad07gec56caf11500"
msgid "*Your mind lurches, reeling suddenly as if... bitten.*"
msgstr "*뭔가에 깨물린 것처럼 느닷없이 정신이 휘청거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 28b53d5c-8841-68bc-bc1e-21043d50123a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:28b53d5c-8841-68bc-bc1e-21043d50123a
msgctxt "h477aff52g3c66g4911g908bgfa7c0c254d28"
msgid "I work for the General. Perhaps he should hear of your insolence."
msgstr "난 장군님을 위해 일한다. 그분께 너의 무례함에 대해 알려야 할지도 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 31a64d27-521b-ac05-76cb-888afd8f7f89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToIndivPlayerAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:31a64d27-521b-ac05-76cb-888afd8f7f89
msgctxt "h4a73eb01g469fg4b15gab11g3dd1a6ab80c6"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 379d7b15-9c50-4215-bf40-06b61ab4a404
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount2(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:379d7b15-9c50-4215-bf40-06b61ab4a404
msgctxt "hd0bb6511g8287g4bffg8f0eg61184542da1c"
msgid ""
"*Something stirs deep within you, hungry and alert... it's taking something "
"you'll never get back.*"
msgstr "*몸 깊숙한 데서 굶주리고 기민한 존재가 꿈틀댑니다... 잃으면 되찾지 못할 뭔가를 좀먹고 있군요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = 3c1916f5-efae-92df-0c2a-59b710e6ab7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:3c1916f5-efae-92df-0c2a-59b710e6ab7b
msgctxt "he758fd26g23ceg4c51gb558gead45665de04"
msgid "Very well - if the General wishes."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 장군님의 뜻이라면."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40f5dcd8-456d-45b1-85c9-3e3764d1fac0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
