msgctxt "hddcdfb43gfbc9g48aaga7e2gace6fbe57034"
msgid ""
"<i>Commune with your parasite, plant a thought: 'This one </i>is <i>a "
"disciple.'</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신의 기생충을 이용해, '이 자는 </i>신봉자다<i>' 라는 생각을 심으십시오.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = a9988520-e9bf-5763-fa03-1414ac984030
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:a9988520-e9bf-5763-fa03-1414ac984030
msgctxt "h57dc6024g3302g4a2dg8dfdgcb4244d6a7ec"
msgid "I - no need, madam. Travel the Towers as you see fit."
msgstr "전- 아닙니다, 마님. 원하시는 대로 탑을 둘러보시길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = a9988520-e9bf-5763-fa03-1414ac984030
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:a9988520-e9bf-5763-fa03-1414ac984030
msgctxt "h173e1935g40c5g4a53gb9a5g13a1f8b98eaa"
msgid "I - no need, sir. Travel the Towers as you see fit."
msgstr "전 - 아닙니다, 나리. 원하시는 대로 탑을 둘러보시길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = a9988520-e9bf-5763-fa03-1414ac984030
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:a9988520-e9bf-5763-fa03-1414ac984030
msgctxt "h551927ecg067fg444fga430g1cead44b48e1"
msgid "I - no need. Travel the Towers as you see fit."
msgstr "전 - 아닙니다. 원하시는 대로 탑을 둘러보시길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Fist Marcus
#. NodeID = bcca7b3a-a2e7-64aa-a021-b04e4d4561aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:bcca7b3a-a2e7-64aa-a021-b04e4d4561aa
msgctxt "hdb226d91ge665g4cf0g9099g997b26e5aa6f"
msgid ""
"Stand down, on the General's orders. This one may seek the audience of her "
"choosing."
msgstr "물러서라, 장군의 명에 따라. 이자는 원하는 일행을 동반할 수 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Fist Marcus
#. NodeID = bcca7b3a-a2e7-64aa-a021-b04e4d4561aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:bcca7b3a-a2e7-64aa-a021-b04e4d4561aa
msgctxt "h23f3e852g7cb9g48f7gab84gb7c10448556f"
msgid ""
"Stand down, on the General's orders. This one may seek the audience of his "
"choosing."
msgstr "물러서라, 장군의 명에 따라. 이자는 원하는 일행을 동반할 수 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Fist Marcus
#. NodeID = bcca7b3a-a2e7-64aa-a021-b04e4d4561aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:bcca7b3a-a2e7-64aa-a021-b04e4d4561aa
msgctxt "heb8ed9c7g8198g4fb6g9068g5554226ae0ff"
msgid ""
"Stand down, on the General's orders. This one may seek the audience of their "
"choosing."
msgstr "물러서라, 장군의 명에 따라. 이자는 원하는 일행을 동반할 수 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cf99e266-7f38-4ee4-a0b0-4438d6c35f65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   User:
#.     - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:cf99e266-7f38-4ee4-a0b0-4438d6c35f65
msgctxt "hb2f7536eg3192g4ea8ga197g4cb72343112c"
msgid ""
"*A strange symbol glows, marked on their flesh, and something within you "
"stirs in response.*"
msgstr "*그들의 살갗에 새겨진 기묘한 상징이 빛나고, 이에 반응하여 당신 내면의 무언가가 꿈틀거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = da9f7261-0920-d202-3f71-6b7e0d2acc6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:da9f7261-0920-d202-3f71-6b7e0d2acc6b
msgctxt "hb14ea542g6770g4719g91a2ge8c08ddbcdcb"
msgid "Halt. I know neither your stride nor your bearing."
msgstr "멈춰라. 걸음걸이나 행색 모두 처음 보는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e5d2eaa1-bb22-4fac-b84c-9f12cf18b9d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - GLO_TadpoleIntro_NPC(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:e5d2eaa1-bb22-4fac-b84c-9f12cf18b9d5
msgctxt "h056950b7g527ag4c52g8a4cgd3ae4a949db0"
msgid "*As the symbol glows, power courses through you. <i>Authority</i>.*"
msgstr "*문양이 빛나며, 몸에 흐르는 힘이 느껴집니다. <i>권위</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ea42994a-b050-fd5d-606e-32617699fd12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:ea42994a-b050-fd5d-606e-32617699fd12
msgctxt "hc39ed3f0g8917g4097g8378g7d841c072660"
msgid "Disciple Z'rell sent me with urgent news for the General."
msgstr "신봉자 즈렐이 장군께 긴급한 전갈을 전하라고 나를 보냈다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ec4ed1f0-d66e-4883-b0de-dad84113a6b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount4(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:ec4ed1f0-d66e-4883-b0de-dad84113a6b8
msgctxt "h224be5bbg273fg4e3cgbad4g45f7bb5eb630"
msgid ""
"*A shadow swims across your vision, and a familiar voice tells you to be "
"calm. You are loved.*"
msgstr "*그림자가 낀 듯이 눈앞이 흐려지더니, 익숙한 목소리가 당신을 달래줍니다. 사랑이 느껴집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = efeb89f8-e20d-4c74-a911-46af072b0310
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:efeb89f8-e20d-4c74-a911-46af072b0310
msgctxt "h86cfa017g54a5g45aaga437g1a4ac4f94e36"
msgid "*A shiver runs across your mind... You feel sated.*"
msgstr "*전율이 불현듯 머릿속을 스쳐 지나가고... 만족감이 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f5115259-7a94-4c85-aec6-398b5f3f96ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:f5115259-7a94-4c85-aec6-398b5f3f96ee
msgctxt "h1b8cf1eag361bg4f7bg8dc2g12b2ac3c736b"
msgid ""
"*You focus on the source of the power, but it is quiet and still. It needs "
"to rest.*"
msgstr "*힘의 원천인 존재에 정신을 집중하지만, 응답이 없습니다. 휴식이 필요한 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f9c5cb40-9024-431f-86bf-1cc97e8709b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:f9c5cb40-9024-431f-86bf-1cc97e8709b8
msgctxt "ha2c7e840g7de6g49fbg9339g8e63d7e83729"
msgid ""
"*Your blood runs quicker, feeding the gnawing absence at the centre of your "
"mind.*"
msgstr "*피가 더 빨리 흐르면서, 당신의 정신 한가운데를 좀먹는 허전함을 양분으로 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning
#. Speaker = Zealot Klen
#. NodeID = fa504900-dd18-9c3b-b48a-ba27f8fe448a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_UpperFloor_TrespassWarning:fa504900-dd18-9c3b-b48a-ba27f8fe448a
msgctxt "hbaaabc41g52b8g47ccga6bcg7721ea0a9a74"
msgid ""
"Disciples may enter. All others are to be culled, by the General's decree."
msgstr "신봉자만이 입장할 수 있다. 그 외에는 들어갈 수 없다. 장군님의 명이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/MoonriseTowers/MOO_WallTentacle_AD_GuardsInterrupt
#. Speaker = Mig
#. NodeID = 0c48fc99-965f-4f5a-8b79-8a4e174d9e38
