msgctxt "h719c7951gdbfag412cgbb30gdd40aaf8ca1d"
msgid ""
"Forgive me True Soul, but what we want is to get to Moonrise as quickly as "
"we can."
msgstr "용서하십시오 참된 영혼이시여, 저희는 그저 문라이즈에 가능한 빨리 가고 싶을 뿐입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 03b63408-8b1d-12ae-c5b9-562f1716e280
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
