msgctxt "h48bf44b8g44efg4799g9bf7gdd4ba3d185fe"
msgid "I've other business to take care of first. Wait here."
msgstr "먼저 처리해야 할 일이 있으니. 여기서 기다려."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
