msgid "What do you suggest? I've never known him to respond to anything else."
msgstr "어떻게 할 생각입니까? 그가 다른 일에 반응하는 건 본 적이 없는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
