msgctxt "hb434192dg65c2g4b32g99d5g5c49a4765236"
msgid ""
"I hear them, my Queen, but not your music. I await that sweet, sweet sound."
msgstr "들립니다, 나의 여왕이시여, 하지만 당신의 음악이 아니군요. 전 그 달콤하고도 달콤한 소리를 기다리겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = 2aa83f04-5780-04e4-0b55-81f8300e9dd3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:2aa83f04-5780-04e4-0b55-81f8300e9dd3
msgctxt "hcd9fad70ga201g44e8g9471g7e9fd87bddd3"
msgid ""
"Of course, you are free to take your chances if you wish. But I will be "
"waiting here for the Nightwarden's lyre."
msgstr "물론, 원한다면 운을 시험해 볼수는 있겠지요. 하지만 저는 여기서 밤의 감시자의 리라를 기다리겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = 2ac43a70-fde3-ef24-fd18-dfa420f378cc
