msgctxt "h1c7c4762g1646g4362g996fgaef21079c6f6"
msgid "<i>Reach out with your powers to summon the guide.</i>"
msgstr "<i>힘을 사용하여 안내자를 소환한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = 9bcadf1b-6f9e-9457-f1c5-f17afed35cd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:9bcadf1b-6f9e-9457-f1c5-f17afed35cd4
msgctxt "h69038463g60d4g4983g8347gcbc9bdb9cbc4"
msgid ""
"We were told to expect a True Soul - that Nightwarden Minthara would send "
"someone with her lyre to summon a guide through the darkness."
msgstr ""
"참된 영혼을 기다리라는 말을 들었습니다. 밤지기 민타라가 자신의 리라를 가진, 어둠을 뚫고 갈 안내자를 소환할 수 있는 사람을 보낸다고 "
"했지요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = 9d06aefc-3731-3d1a-1a21-2c86472a5978
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_CaravanStart(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:9d06aefc-3731-3d1a-1a21-2c86472a5978
msgctxt "hc49bfa04ga651g4781ga989gf2026a007f96"
msgid "...Best introduce yourself. Perhaps he'll listen to a True Soul."
msgstr "...당신이 직접 소개하는 게 좋겠군요. 참된 영혼의 이야기는 들을 것 같으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a283abc9-711a-5f11-9987-d37ffab7bf37
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:a283abc9-711a-5f11-9987-d37ffab7bf37
msgctxt "h7e5cb9bcg87dbg4dedgaaa8g9aec06ca684a"
msgid "Why do you need a lyre, exactly?"
msgstr "리라는 정확히 왜 필요한 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a34a259e-c75a-e3e4-6795-869f4b29ca94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType:
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:a34a259e-c75a-e3e4-6795-869f4b29ca94
msgctxt "h93e6aeefg907cg4949ga024g0cf15d153338"
msgid "<i>Open your font of magic, let it pour forth as a beacon.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마법의 근원을 열어, 봉화처럼 퍼져나가게 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Brawler Vez
#. NodeID = a4e9f011-9904-b741-f4df-6637638dc1ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_4 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:a4e9f011-9904-b741-f4df-6637638dc1ff
msgctxt "h5ee65d07g657dg4733gafa9ge2fb22129212"
msgid "What, planning to sing instead?"
msgstr "뭐, 노래라도 대신 부르게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = a98432cd-921c-a599-95d6-f551e32e0b36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_CaravanSecondTime(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_CaravanHalfOrcCaster(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:a98432cd-921c-a599-95d6-f551e32e0b36
msgctxt "h4e4cbd5dgc650g4bacg9cb2g39a6d37e9c1b"
msgid "The lyre, True Soul? It will summon our guide."
msgstr "참된 영혼이시여, 리라는요? 그게 안내자를 소환할 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = b294c4ea-099a-b14f-d3d8-950fb6948130
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:b294c4ea-099a-b14f-d3d8-950fb6948130
msgctxt "h17b522ecg7170g4045gb038gde7da56c90ad"
msgid ""
"I admit, I'm surprised a True Soul does not know this. Where are you headed, "
"exactly?"
msgstr "솔직히, 참된 영혼이 이를 모른다해서 놀랐습니다. 정확히 어디로 가시는 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b4ffc0a2-f4f5-5637-27d0-fd8a9afc7503
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday1(1) = True
#.      - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday2(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#.      - ILLITHID(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Tadpoled_UsedToday2(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:b4ffc0a2-f4f5-5637-27d0-fd8a9afc7503
msgctxt "h360d7df3g4784g47fdga4begec858f50e7d8"
msgid "<i>Reach out with your powers to summon the guide.</i>"
msgstr "<i>힘을 사용하여 안내자를 소환한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = bda25c66-a07c-5b6c-7f92-c3f07ce56456
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(9) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(9) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:bda25c66-a07c-5b6c-7f92-c3f07ce56456
msgctxt "h545a4ee2geeeag439eg86a1gf9794390de33"
msgid ""
"Someone pinch me, please. I'd really love to wake up from this nightmare."
msgstr "나 좀 꼬집어줘봐. 이 악몽에서 깨어나고 싶단말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = bf65b3a9-de4e-b362-6abc-a519e59397dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(6) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:bf65b3a9-de4e-b362-6abc-a519e59397dd
msgctxt "hdd8a6b11g8e63g4fc7g9870g6fe6ff7c8e58"
msgid "Now that's what I call an abdomen."
msgstr "저거야 말로 복근이라 할 만하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bf9dc660-994d-57b3-80b6-8a13147de886
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:bf9dc660-994d-57b3-80b6-8a13147de886
msgctxt "h00638e68g2de5g45b1g8672ge07d1d89fc1d"
msgid ""
"*Your innate arcana roils and reaches - and it makes a connection. Something "
"<i>notices</i> you.*"
msgstr "*당신의 태고적 비전이 소용돌이치며 뻗어나가, 연결합니다. 무언가가 당신의 존재를 <i>알아챕니다</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = c097ebb9-ec4c-bf72-2203-a146e93f930d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:c097ebb9-ec4c-bf72-2203-a146e93f930d
msgctxt "h5bbac0d6g3995g4621ga78bg369c15fd083a"
msgid ""
"Gods - a <i>drider</i>. I always thought the stories were exaggerated..."
msgstr "이런, <i>드라이더</i>잖아. 과장된 이야기라고 생각했었는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c70f4433-540c-8ae1-6145-41e950e9785f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:c70f4433-540c-8ae1-6145-41e950e9785f
msgctxt "hd0ae52fdg6754g4d54g948ag9eca5218c536"
msgid ""
"*Your silent greeting hangs in the air a moment, unanswered. Then, from the "
"dark...*"
msgstr "*당신의 조용한 인사는 공중에 잠시 떠있습니다, 대답은 들리지 않습니다. 그때, 어둠속에서...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = cb037141-86f3-30de-579e-597b37163224
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:cb037141-86f3-30de-579e-597b37163224
msgctxt "hc168b773g3695g431ag8f0eg5cd50a8ef69a"
msgid "You will not get far without a guide. The darkness here is murderous."
msgstr "안내자 없이는 멀리 가지 못할 겁니다. 여기 이 어둠은 살인적입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = ce409939-72b2-6df5-b7d7-c748061d0527
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:ce409939-72b2-6df5-b7d7-c748061d0527
msgctxt "hf86845c0g8d22g4746ga35cgf7a9932f0b79"
msgid "Perhaps using the lyre would be the wisest course."
msgstr "어쩌면 리라를 이용하는 게 현명할 것 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = cfd90e64-1f3a-923b-26d1-ccd4e4ffd24f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Laezel_State_StartedMoonrise = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:cfd90e64-1f3a-923b-26d1-ccd4e4ffd24f
msgctxt "h45931b74gf5acg4d37g9663g60332f0e26fe"
msgid ""
"Greetings, in the Absolute's name. You have been charged with - guiding us..."
msgstr "절대자의 이름으로 인사드립니다. 당신은 우리를 안내하는 역할을 부여받았습니다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = d2081749-b366-63ac-4ede-56ba8aa639de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_ToldMintharaHasLyre = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:d2081749-b366-63ac-4ede-56ba8aa639de
msgctxt "h45caca0bgfac2g49c7gaebag7c47af6e1ec1"
msgid "Minthara always carried it on her person. I assume she still does."
msgstr "민타라가 항상 가지고 다녔습니다. 지금도 그렇겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = d2c3efeb-e776-a275-7eaf-015c15899545
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:d2c3efeb-e776-a275-7eaf-015c15899545
msgctxt "ha0c1524eg6a7bg466cg9495gadb49c24a194"
msgid ""
"I fear neither of us are travelling, then. The darkness here is murderous - "
"the only safe way through is with a guide."
msgstr ""
"그렇다면 유감이지만 우리 둘 모두 여행하고 있는 건 아니지요. 여기 이 어둠은 살인적이에요. 안전하게 지나가는 유일한 방법은 안내자와 "
"함께 가는 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = d3cd57b2-2381-a6af-ab74-c6cce3832d88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Knows_CreaturePath = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:d3cd57b2-2381-a6af-ab74-c6cce3832d88
msgctxt "hb26b8dc8gf021g4b81g9ff8g8fe56a529b58"
msgid "Did you bring the lyre?"
msgstr "리라는 가져 왔나요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd9984c7-9af1-5a15-0686-484dea5642a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:dd9984c7-9af1-5a15-0686-484dea5642a0
msgctxt "hdace84b9gb4b9g4b82ga5dag49e5f90d1e15"
msgid "True Souls don't answer stupid questions."
msgstr "참된 영혼은 바보같은 질문엔 답하지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e5c95734-f7bd-54bc-36b1-4fb13d7b55a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount5(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:e5c95734-f7bd-54bc-36b1-4fb13d7b55a8
msgctxt "ha89ad099g34ebg4b1bgbc11g322324285875"
msgid ""
"*Your blood runs quicker, feeding the gnawing absence at the centre of your "
"mind.*"
msgstr "*피가 더 빨리 흐르면서, 당신의 정신 한가운데를 좀먹는 허전함을 양분으로 채웁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e5cd1646-1111-5d58-b4ad-ca7742c00c89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:e5cd1646-1111-5d58-b4ad-ca7742c00c89
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hf5dab62fgeed9g4331ga44eg463ea8fea823"
msgid ""
"<i>Take your your instrument and play - your music a call. A summons.</i>"
msgstr "<i>악기로 연주를 시작한다, 음악이 호출이 된다. 소환장이 된다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6ad25a1-fb43-4f38-b95f-18f44ef8f707
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:e6ad25a1-fb43-4f38-b95f-18f44ef8f707
msgctxt "h370cb408gf0b0g4a30g8f21g507fc4b78ef2"
msgid "I'm travelling to Moonrise, like you."
msgstr "문라이즈로 여행 중이지, 너처럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e70e92dd-a81d-567c-9239-fcca7b2d8d91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:e70e92dd-a81d-567c-9239-fcca7b2d8d91
msgctxt "h5db134a9g6719g4061g9be9g700395adfd03"
msgid ""
"*Your rage echoes throughout the darkness - and it makes a connection. "
"Something <i>notices</i> you.*"
msgstr "*당신의 분노가 어둠 속을 메아리칩니다, 그리고 연결합니다. 무언가가 당신의 존재를 <i>알아챕니다</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e871611b-252d-e977-f5bb-55f9c9db1453
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount3(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:e871611b-252d-e977-f5bb-55f9c9db1453
msgctxt "hfdcf4703g62abg4c80gb7ddg7bc73516da6b"
msgid "*Your mind lurches, reeling suddenly as if... bitten.*"
msgstr "*뭔가에 깨물린 것처럼 느닷없이 정신이 휘청거립니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8738eb9-4866-f83b-17ad-573de6796ed4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:e8738eb9-4866-f83b-17ad-573de6796ed4
msgctxt "ha037a70fg07b0g4be3g9e9fg685910e6affe"
msgid "To rend the Absolute asunder, and tear apart every false cultist!"
msgstr "절대자를 갈기갈기 찢어버리고, 모든 거짓된 광신도들을 분쇄하러 왔다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8738eb9-4866-f83b-17ad-573de6796ed4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:e8738eb9-4866-f83b-17ad-573de6796ed4
msgctxt "he353086ega8d8g4955gbb84g517254c1df7c"
msgid "I'm here to destroy the Absolute and every last cultist."
msgstr "절대자와 모든 광신도들을 쳐부수러 왔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e9d382cf-3706-0105-996a-c43dc0844107
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:e9d382cf-3706-0105-996a-c43dc0844107
msgctxt "h09ee94adg2052g432fgaa28gff82f16fb82a"
msgid "By the gods. One of Lolth's abominations."
msgstr "신이시여. 롤쓰의 흉물 중 하나로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = eb71b914-e62e-8371-0be2-ae10e5cd2532
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:eb71b914-e62e-8371-0be2-ae10e5cd2532
msgctxt "hea1944afgf73dg4119g80ebgb8d34c34fddc"
msgid "Just hurry back, we can't wait forever. The darkness is encroaching."
msgstr "얼른 다녀오세요, 평생 기다릴 순 없으니. 어둠이 잠식하고 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = eb88d58d-0f34-ed4c-2524-a65c08ebc300
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_CaravanStart_DriderSummoned(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_StartCaravanEscort = True
#.     - ORI_Laezel_State_StartedMoonrise = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_WaitAtCaravanStart = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:eb88d58d-0f34-ed4c-2524-a65c08ebc300
msgctxt "h2941eec4g11e5g4d91gb4a6ge277079d0841"
msgid "Yes, I hear them, your majesty. Calling us."
msgstr "예, 들었습니다, 위대하신 분이여. 부르셨습니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f09bbc1b-a698-e48f-9e6e-7e303b6bafa8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - TRUESOUL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_TadpoledCount1(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:f09bbc1b-a698-e48f-9e6e-7e303b6bafa8
msgctxt "hc05f9fc8g00f7g4efdg97e5gdaff1e1ebe8f"
msgid "*A shiver runs across your mind... You feel sated.*"
msgstr "*전율이 불현듯 머릿속을 스쳐 지나가고... 만족감이 듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1b20cf6-624f-460f-94c1-ef204980b9a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:f1b20cf6-624f-460f-94c1-ef204980b9a6
msgctxt "hfae70fd0g43cfg49e2gaa6eg7d3849d0fa03"
msgid "<i>Take out the lyre and start to play.</i>"
msgstr "<i>리라를 꺼내 연주를 시작한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f54e1714-4930-5910-dac5-27fdbf1aad8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:f54e1714-4930-5910-dac5-27fdbf1aad8a
msgctxt "hc580bfe2gf911g4009ga4feg2ce0cb27b7b8"
msgid "I have it right here."
msgstr "여기 갖고 왔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = f5859f4f-3c1c-12d5-998e-db87569d9e5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:f5859f4f-3c1c-12d5-998e-db87569d9e5e
msgctxt "h5c391baeg96c6g4af4g83dbgeca593f34de2"
msgid "Then pluck a tune and our guide will come scuttling."
msgstr "이제 곡을 연주하면 안내자가 달려올겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f773ba50-ba5b-b9d8-4365-4abb0d302d38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_AttemptedToSummonDrider(1) = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckHasItemTemplate = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:f773ba50-ba5b-b9d8-4365-4abb0d302d38
msgctxt "h1ccb65e7g5eb5g403eg97b8g6ccfba64d82a"
msgid "No need for the lyre. I'll call this guide myself."
msgstr "리라는 필요없어. 내 힘으로 안내자를 부르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe0043a1-82b2-198b-5ed6-13e439c75ba3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster:fe0043a1-82b2-198b-5ed6-13e439c75ba3
msgctxt "h25d5becegf43dg4303ga694gdbb2482ebc91"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster_AtTower
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = 91f18636-b236-4dd9-874c-7160d80a24f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_CaravanHalfOrcCaster(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster_AtTower:91f18636-b236-4dd9-874c-7160d80a24f9
msgctxt "h16d00aaegbf06g4defg9f6fgb3c4ae3f812a"
msgid ""
"It was an honour to walk the shadows at your side. A little more inviting "
"here though, eh?"
msgstr "당신과 나란히 그림자 속을 지나왔다니 정말 영광입니다. 여긴 그래도 아무렴 좀 더 낫겠죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster_AtTower
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = de429a0e-6ff7-49e6-8bfe-5e59b2a7e5af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_CaravanHalfOrcCaster(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_CaravanHalfOrcCaster(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcCaster_AtTower:de429a0e-6ff7-49e6-8bfe-5e59b2a7e5af
msgctxt "h31dd5e92g6483g4141g8de0gd769e658e8ac"
msgid ""
"Delivered, safe and sound. Don't forget us as you claw your way up the "
"ranks, True Soul."
msgstr "무사히 도착했습니다. 훗날 출세하더라도 부디 우릴 잊지 말아주세요, 참된 영혼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcMelee
#. Speaker = Bedi
#. NodeID = 92c3388c-96e5-9fb7-eee0-b76d59a0e219
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_CaravanHalfOrcMelee(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcMelee:92c3388c-96e5-9fb7-eee0-b76d59a0e219
msgctxt "he614c3f0g828dg4f17g9240g7d14221612bf"
msgid "Stay sharp. These shadows can sneak up on you."
msgstr "주변을 살피세요. 그림자가 언제 은밀히 넘어올지 모릅니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcMelee
#. Speaker = Bedi
#. NodeID = cea197ce-c939-969e-7c6e-4a313d5d7230
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_CaravanHalfOrcMelee(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcMelee:cea197ce-c939-969e-7c6e-4a313d5d7230
msgctxt "h582cd954g33ecg4f92g998cg311def5ad843"
msgid "Don't wander into the dark. It's hungry."
msgstr "어둠 속으로 들어가지 마십쇼. 이 땅이 굶주렸습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcMelee_AtTower
#. Speaker = Bedi
#. NodeID = 934dc123-3610-4009-9eb2-aa3bf3f7a714
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_CaravanHalfOrcMelee(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcMelee_AtTower:934dc123-3610-4009-9eb2-aa3bf3f7a714
msgctxt "h77b8eecagaa66g4be2gb6dbg228b5ac90cf3"
msgid ""
"Her cathedral will stand in the city, True Soul. On the bones of all "
"Baldurians."
msgstr "그분의 대성당이 우뚝 솟아오를 것이다, 참된 영혼. 모든 발더인들의 시체 위에 세워지겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcMelee_AtTower
#. Speaker = Bedi
#. NodeID = a79256d1-fae5-44e3-a3d2-d63045e8080b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_CaravanHalfOrcMelee(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_CaravanHalfOrcMelee(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Caravan_HalfOrcMelee_AtTower:a79256d1-fae5-44e3-a3d2-d63045e8080b
msgctxt "h0601f924gd49cg468eg8aabgaa8a277e8c61"
msgid ""
"Stink of dead gods and dust. This ruin is scarcely worthy of our Absolute."
msgstr "죽은 신들의 곰팡내가 진동을 하는군. 우리 절대자님의 격에 맞지 않는 곳이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 06a4b97c-1a58-4891-92ff-d6b58bffe1c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:06a4b97c-1a58-4891-92ff-d6b58bffe1c1
msgctxt "h86c5d779ga1dfg46d7gae07g390035b144ae"
msgid "Where are you from?"
msgstr "어디서 왔지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0942a18c-10e8-4493-aa56-ffd257c0ad84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:0942a18c-10e8-4493-aa56-ffd257c0ad84
msgctxt "h2c5e6b82gb3ecg4336g8d88gd4110e78b5f5"
msgid "What were you doing?"
msgstr "뭘 하고 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0fd46bfb-f8cf-4355-94f8-8c34c4768abc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:0fd46bfb-f8cf-4355-94f8-8c34c4768abc
msgctxt "hc9e4f76dg5f7eg4566ga6a5g102a169022bb"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 204e68c2-5464-a164-80a9-5f08ec5ac191
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Player_Knows_MoonlanternExists = False
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:204e68c2-5464-a164-80a9-5f08ec5ac191
msgctxt "hd35047e0g4657g4f9bgad39g80fa3c4bb029"
msgid "You walk the shadows safely. How?"
msgstr "그림자 속을 안전하게 돌아다닌 방법이 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 24012c70-d220-463d-85ba-ad71e220294c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:24012c70-d220-463d-85ba-ad71e220294c
msgctxt "h1dc36d7cg50d4g45ffgae9ag58d0982324b1"
msgid "*The corpse remains silent. It does not know.*"
msgstr "*시체가 침묵을 유지합니다. 알지 못합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4430e690-9665-4319-bd3e-a5e0fcd66940
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:4430e690-9665-4319-bd3e-a5e0fcd66940
msgctxt "h4078cba4g97f0g4fcbga38dg7a837e97b642"
msgid "How did the shadow curse come to be?"
msgstr "그림자 저주가 어떻게 시작된 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 794eaf4b-71dd-4696-91ce-c4cdb122d927
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:794eaf4b-71dd-4696-91ce-c4cdb122d927
msgctxt "h2a2946c6gd1a7g4a9fg8962g3efa7e74621e"
msgid "Shepherding... the faithful... carrying... our Lady's light..."
msgstr "양치기... 길 잃은 자들을... 우리 여신의 광채 안으로... 인도하는..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d075a68-8bac-4e74-a3b2-dc5fef964bfe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:7d075a68-8bac-4e74-a3b2-dc5fef964bfe
msgctxt "heea98b06g73dcg45efg88a7gb1ffa22a6d5e"
msgid "Who killed you?"
msgstr "누가 너를 죽였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 8f1b5492-86a6-770d-4646-7f091b16c68f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:8f1b5492-86a6-770d-4646-7f091b16c68f
msgctxt "h3724e829g05a5g4a50ga9f9g5e6aa6e2f25d"
msgid "Always... many voices... hers... the LOUDEST..."
msgstr "항상... 많은 목소리가 들려... 그년이... 제일 시끄러웠지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac0c7a72-e47c-4d48-b002-2e28ec8c12ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:ac0c7a72-e47c-4d48-b002-2e28ec8c12ce
msgctxt "h45b70abcg58edg4731ga09fgdf3a43baa6ff"
msgid "What happened to you?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = b2537439-793f-4a78-80b4-868e0ec8f0f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:b2537439-793f-4a78-80b4-868e0ec8f0f3
msgctxt "h6350f66dgdda7g48c9g92bdg8da5a2b76eab"
msgid "Moonrise..."
msgstr "문라이즈..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = b9060633-a606-4e51-823e-be98d6a3b314
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:b9060633-a606-4e51-823e-be98d6a3b314
msgctxt "h576ba2c3g22c6g4845gaf7fgdc2cfd3d09e1"
msgid "Erased... forgotten... we are... <i>drider</i>..."
msgstr "지워지고... 잊혀진... 우리는... <i>드라이더</i>다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b91b3d99-73fb-4a38-a7ce-9d993664f2dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:b91b3d99-73fb-4a38-a7ce-9d993664f2dd
msgctxt "hc66c80f4g0c13g4100g8711ga84358aaf5f4"
msgid "*The corpse does not stir. It will answer no more questions.*"
msgstr "*시체는 움직이지 않습니다. 더 이상 질문을 받지 않을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = bb32dbf4-0dd1-5603-5e9b-c8f1a553cc7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:bb32dbf4-0dd1-5603-5e9b-c8f1a553cc7c
msgctxt "hce0bfe15gb4c2g436eg83c3g0e839db14d45"
msgid "Lantern... our Lady's <i>light</i>..."
msgstr "등불... 우리 여신의 <i>광채</i>..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dc83c11a-3509-46a5-827f-c33a35350f29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:dc83c11a-3509-46a5-827f-c33a35350f29
msgctxt "h95b4ceb6gbe3dg4776g9f90gdc9785c8c6bb"
msgid "*The corpse regards you lifelessly.*"
msgstr "*시체가 생기 없는 모습으로 당신을 맞이합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1b8be02-1487-4012-962d-aece72a47939
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:e1b8be02-1487-4012-962d-aece72a47939
msgctxt "hd8499d3fgeb50g4f64gb58cg06e25a3d3018"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "당신은 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = e3b93ba2-a3e8-4589-a27c-a731050d59c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:e3b93ba2-a3e8-4589-a27c-a731050d59c2
msgctxt "h10a50f37g6159g4e3egb15ag9b6f3a6b71ee"
msgid "Lolth... cast out... Absolute... <i>saved</i>..."
msgstr "롤쓰가... 추방했다... 절대자께서... <i>구원하셨지</i>..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = eb6e5fd3-4454-47d6-beed-4e6ee652059c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:eb6e5fd3-4454-47d6-beed-4e6ee652059c
msgctxt "h5619f119g60b9g421cg907cga8a71240f3d9"
msgid "*The spell's power wanes. You can ask no more questions.*"
msgstr "*주문의 힘이 약해집니다. 더 이상 질문을 할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9e32ea7-e215-3f20-2125-603b5bb2e3aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_Pixie_State_SeenPixie(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:f9e32ea7-e215-3f20-2125-603b5bb2e3aa
msgctxt "h63e664aaga113g41c8g8ad2gd5783626524b"
msgid "How did you trap that pixie in the lantern?"
msgstr "픽시를 랜턴 속에 어떻게 가둔 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = fac13fb0-0a40-4abd-9348-6d87434a5217
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:fac13fb0-0a40-4abd-9348-6d87434a5217
msgctxt "hb10275edg9521g47cfg8c13gbebb3985615b"
msgid "Traitor... heretic..."
msgstr "배신자... 이단자..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fba3245c-06a1-460b-8d33-8c6bae4b8771
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_Killer(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Dead:fba3245c-06a1-460b-8d33-8c6bae4b8771
msgctxt "hf927b067g53eeg4804g85edg3a68b117988b"
msgid "*The corpse seems willing to speak - but not to its killer.*"
msgstr "*시체는 말할 의지가 있지만, 자신을 죽인 자와 대화하고 싶지는 않은 듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 017b0c91-320a-c22b-3e0d-da5b01c7bc34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:017b0c91-320a-c22b-3e0d-da5b01c7bc34
msgctxt "h3d4c3df1g7498g4f2aga683gc6391022d3bb"
msgid "I'm ready - I think. Am I? Yes."
msgstr "준비됐어, 내 생각엔. 정말이냐고? 그래. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 02a6cc24-8bf1-8374-7100-a56201de6e8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:02a6cc24-8bf1-8374-7100-a56201de6e8a
msgctxt "hc3ee0d09gf3ceg4607g9ab2gd079d1a12bff"
msgid "You <i>will</i> fight with us won't you?"
msgstr "<i>앞으로</i> 우리와 함께 싸우지 않겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 02bdb795-5638-3010-8010-b6e4628d9de4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:02bdb795-5638-3010-8010-b6e4628d9de4
msgctxt "h83a19e5eg237cg45e5gafdag451d40f2e812"
msgid "You got it, chum. I'll mark your map, in case you get lost."
msgstr "알겠어, 친구. 길을 잃지 않도록 네 지도에 표시해둘게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 185b39eb-ba87-4df2-f2af-3c2f228e0b4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersBackAtInn = True
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithHarpers = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:185b39eb-ba87-4df2-f2af-3c2f228e0b4d
msgctxt "h0d232075g463bg4b31ga4dcgf0c45619abb7"
msgid ""
"You were something else, out in the shadows. Won't forget it, that's for "
"damn sure."
msgstr "어둠 속에서 당신은 정말 대단했어. 빌어먹을 절대 잊지 못할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 2557d88c-00d7-e255-81f5-7447e73fb09b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersWaitingAtBridge = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:2557d88c-00d7-e255-81f5-7447e73fb09b
msgctxt "hb8b2b36fg5b9fg472ega53fgf4e8353b2d77"
msgid ""
"Join us, and we'll take that convoy down. It's the only way to survive the "
"curse."
msgstr "우리와 함께하면, 호송대를 쓰러뜨릴 수 있어. 저주에서 살아남는 유일한 방법이야.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 274e76cb-84c1-0ad0-9037-47be9ff86340
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:274e76cb-84c1-0ad0-9037-47be9ff86340
msgctxt "h93a4f74dg249dg4f94g804egdb76fcd971a8"
msgid "We survived one attack. I don't know if we can survive another."
msgstr "한 번의 공격에는 살아 남았군. 다음에도 막을 수 있을지는 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 3f202515-9fd9-d06e-3a45-26413b8bd890
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:3f202515-9fd9-d06e-3a45-26413b8bd890
msgctxt "h75c27a1aga468g4a52gbb1ag095a72cfb683"
msgid "All right. But hurry it along, yeah?"
msgstr "알았어. 그렇지만 서둘러 줘, 알았지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 583bd001-609d-da4f-d860-fdce11b2a4be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersLearnMissedCaravan = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:583bd001-609d-da4f-d860-fdce11b2a4be
msgctxt "h1c0b48f6g7b72g4a3dg9ad2gc3159c31ec2d"
msgid "You're too late - I've encountered the convoy, led by a drider."
msgstr "너무 늦게 왔군. 우린 이미 드라이더가 이끄는 호송대와 마주쳤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 644e7227-eba7-4a04-cc26-c0ab5c163737
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:644e7227-eba7-4a04-cc26-c0ab5c163737
msgctxt "hcc5f86a2geabfg4196g971fga6e7729e5dc6"
msgid "But - try not to get lost. Frightful weather out there."
msgstr "하지만, 길을 잃지 않도록 해. 바깥 날씨가 끔찍하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6825ec9f-5cd6-e107-ab26-59d0fec1422d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_StartedAmbushQuestWithHarpers = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_StartHarpersAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:6825ec9f-5cd6-e107-ab26-59d0fec1422d
msgctxt "h891c27b5g9b4eg4421gbc29g0c60f9a81dae"
msgid "Go on ahead. I'll catch up."
msgstr "먼저 가. 곧 따라갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 705b1dee-5885-a9b4-f4f3-c39a1b7a1a4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:705b1dee-5885-a9b4-f4f3-c39a1b7a1a4b
msgctxt "h00628f59g5472g46ebg9440g6293c07fafea"
msgid "Jaheira says wait. So we wait."
msgstr "자헤이라가 기다리고 했어. 그래서 기다리는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 754988ec-c7d6-cb2c-dd1f-bcca35cf2761
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersBackAtInn = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:754988ec-c7d6-cb2c-dd1f-bcca35cf2761
msgctxt "he34b290cg6d8bg4f99ga8d7gb3d138c6694c"
msgid "It's all up to you, chum. But no pressure."
msgstr "너한테 달렸어 친구. 부담 주는 건 아냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 7b3e788b-95d0-22da-04a4-92baecef69f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:7b3e788b-95d0-22da-04a4-92baecef69f7
msgctxt "hdc32e5bcga824g4ac1g9fb0g94b670a4c756"
msgid "It's all up to you, then. Do us proud."
msgstr "이제 다 너에게 달렸어. 응원할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 9016d96c-622d-519d-93e3-611d36ca3363
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersBackAtInn = True
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:9016d96c-622d-519d-93e3-611d36ca3363
msgctxt "h030bea33g7a41g40dbgb36ag89ecc6aa2a16"
msgid "Reckon you're our last hope. But can't say I'm worried."
msgstr "네가 우리의 마지막 희망이라고 생각해. 하지만 걱정은 안 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 9ef7d3f7-a7af-2cd6-4864-fa8114ec39aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:9ef7d3f7-a7af-2cd6-4864-fa8114ec39aa
msgctxt "h8fba02f8g5c65g4c8bg9737g4de93907e46e"
msgid ""
"There's a cultist convoy that brings supplies and personnel to the tower - "
"by some strange magic, they move through the curse unharmed."
msgstr "타워로 보급품과 인원을 실어 나르는 광신도 호송대가 있는데, 이상한 마법으로 저주를 뚫고 무사히 타워로 이동해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = a75ac49c-fc84-d21f-4467-d873ebbd9175
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Unprotected = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:a75ac49c-fc84-d21f-4467-d873ebbd9175
msgctxt "hacaa7139g3e52g4691g91b0gde0e1acfcdd7"
msgid "I'll miss that magic wall. But no Isobel - no protection."
msgstr "그 마법의 벽이 그리울 거야. 하지만 이소벨이 없다면, 보호도 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = b9390c73-8b11-2722-15fb-339fef218f7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:b9390c73-8b11-2722-15fb-339fef218f7e
msgctxt "h3191f619ga955g4794g9b7dgc272b6878ae1"
msgid "Damn. You're lucky to be in one piece."
msgstr "젠장. 목숨이나마 부지한 게 너로선 다행이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = bf60dd3f-3173-1c01-9169-8fe7b867b525
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:bf60dd3f-3173-1c01-9169-8fe7b867b525
msgctxt "ha69d467cg7ed9g403cg85b1g18b4f0841218"
msgid ""
"But the curse is at its strongest between here and there. You won't even "
"<i>reach</i> the tower unless you can survive the darkest shadows."
msgstr "하지만 여기와 거기 사이의 저주가 가장 강력해. 그림자 저주로부터 살아남을 방법이 없다면 그곳에 <i>닿지도</i> 못할걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = c8ab26c9-9c24-6276-011c-8830d1499de0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:c8ab26c9-9c24-6276-011c-8830d1499de0
msgctxt "he025de6agdc80g48bbg994cgdf6c38608205"
msgid "That's where we come in."
msgstr "그래서 우리가 여기 있는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = cc1c9bd5-7649-5399-248d-5ed6799e2b90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:cc1c9bd5-7649-5399-248d-5ed6799e2b90
msgctxt "h68199ac6gb20cg4ef3g857fg74547830ced9"
msgid "Take a stroll, have a drink. Enjoy them while you can."
msgstr "산책도 하고, 술도 한잔 해. 즐길 수 있을 때 즐기라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = d1e065e4-a2be-81fb-e81a-d68bc08d4654
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:d1e065e4-a2be-81fb-e81a-d68bc08d4654
msgctxt "h15a5a6a8g7872g41adg9abag3d0f4b55e434"
msgid "You got it. Here - I'll mark your map. But don't keep me waiting."
msgstr "알았어. 여기, 지도에 표시해줄게. 하지만 너무 오래 기다리게 하지는 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd2da9a7-3007-9c5e-51ee-43e7992e53f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:dd2da9a7-3007-9c5e-51ee-43e7992e53f4
msgctxt "h265da4e6gf270g42f0gb6cfg2e8e1195dcd4"
msgid "I need time to prepare."
msgstr "준비할 시간이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e22c2120-9a9a-8335-5ed3-0794b8943a58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_StartedAmbushQuestWithHarpers = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_StartHarpersAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:e22c2120-9a9a-8335-5ed3-0794b8943a58
msgctxt "hb5d8162agbe3eg4697g87b8g19e4d1a029e6"
msgid "Let's do it. You lead, I follow."
msgstr "해보자고. 앞장서, 따라가지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = e5ddfd7f-273d-abeb-68c0-3e70b3393a69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersWaitingAtBridge = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperCaster000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:e5ddfd7f-273d-abeb-68c0-3e70b3393a69
msgctxt "h3d5577feg5f26g4977g851fg90c11b7a3ba8"
msgid ""
"Heard you're planning to infiltrate Moonrise, and take the fight to "
"Ketheric. That'd be a tale for the ages."
msgstr "문라이즈에 침입해서 케서릭을 쓰러뜨릴 계획을 세우고 있다고 들었는데. 세기에 남을 이야기가 되겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = e9f568ac-f5fb-bed4-5194-c45c95a437dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000:e9f568ac-f5fb-bed4-5194-c45c95a437dc
msgctxt "hd228e974g70edg4797g8cb5g30ca1c171e03"
msgid ""
"With your help, we'll ambush them, and seize their secret. When we do, it's "
"yours, and the path to Moonrise will be open."
msgstr "네가 도와준다면 우리가 그들을 기습할게, 그런 다음 그들의 비밀을 탈취해서 넘겨주면. 문라이즈로 가는 길이 열리는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 0a3268d9-d9ac-53da-70ab-f0c230d4e451
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000_AfterAmbush:0a3268d9-d9ac-53da-70ab-f0c230d4e451
msgctxt "h432081eag90b3g4a55g9e07gc7d9e08abffe"
msgid "Not the cleanest of victories. But a victory, just the same."
msgstr "깔끔한 승리는 아니라도 승리는 승리지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 37c2e824-4a64-bf5d-0dfd-52e2b435534a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000_AfterAmbush:37c2e824-4a64-bf5d-0dfd-52e2b435534a
msgctxt "h1b7ef2b4g8e94g45aegaed9gd50ff911d3b7"
msgid ""
"Hold your nose and check that corpse. The lantern should still be on it."
msgstr "숨 참고 시체를 뒤져봐. 분명 랜턴이 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 3f094588-26fe-8f73-f1f5-ab21593ac0fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000_AfterAmbush:3f094588-26fe-8f73-f1f5-ab21593ac0fd
msgctxt "h26651c38gd849g4b30gaf62g96837b190247"
msgid "A victory won with words is a victory all the same."
msgstr "말로써 이룬 승리 역시 똑같이 승리지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = d678bc0e-138f-1928-79b9-4de2f487770d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperCaster_000_AfterAmbush:d678bc0e-138f-1928-79b9-4de2f487770d
msgctxt "h700a49f8g01dfg484agae91g77c4ddac89c5"
msgid "Check that drider. The lantern's still there, I reckon."
msgstr "드라이더 확인해 봐. 등불이 놈한테 있을 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 264e9697-1447-e815-fc2e-0eacc3386d40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Unprotected = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperMelee000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000:264e9697-1447-e815-fc2e-0eacc3386d40
msgctxt "h19b11e8fg398fg46d2g8019gd534655cfbc3"
msgid "The shadows deepen. Seek light where you can."
msgstr "그림자가 짙어진다. 어떻게든 빛을 찾아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 391488f8-a2b2-8e1e-fd6f-3ae0165ab91e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperMelee000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000:391488f8-a2b2-8e1e-fd6f-3ae0165ab91e
msgctxt "h1a5dba71gd365g4141g9b68gef36e782aec5"
msgid "Keen your blades, nock your arrows. They know we're here."
msgstr "모두 날을 세우고, 시위에 화살을 걸어라. 놈들도 우리를 눈치챘다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 44da4349-3325-cad8-2ae7-5036cc0d3a21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperMelee000(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperMelee000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000:44da4349-3325-cad8-2ae7-5036cc0d3a21
msgctxt "h3eb8927eg4478g4131g8eb4g15e873dbb440"
msgid "Steel yourself, and fight to the last."
msgstr "마음 단단히 먹고, 끝까지 싸워라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 4ac72e22-d6e5-2df0-6365-89dece8000e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperMelee000(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersBackAtInn = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000:4ac72e22-d6e5-2df0-6365-89dece8000e3
msgctxt "h1044805eg12e6g4059gbcfcg09eededd5fbc"
msgid "Moonrise waits, True Soul."
msgstr "문라이즈가 기다린다, 참된 영혼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 5dbbdb3f-638b-a7d4-0f17-31411560e102
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperMelee000(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000:5dbbdb3f-638b-a7d4-0f17-31411560e102
msgctxt "he466553dgf83dg441fga1bfg7dd673329bbe"
msgid "Show me your might, friend!"
msgstr "그대의 힘을 보여주시오, 친구여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 9efa6be3-58bd-7710-2ece-f74794e86576
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000:9efa6be3-58bd-7710-2ece-f74794e86576
msgctxt "h6e75978agb170g46deg9760g6c149f0a7ffd"
msgid "So go. Be great."
msgstr "그러니 어서 가 봐요. 기대하겠소."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = d0282675-22ce-93c1-f47a-6e6e70d3e5d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersBackAtInn = True
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithHarpers = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperMelee000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000:d0282675-22ce-93c1-f47a-6e6e70d3e5d4
msgctxt "hed470d21g0ea3g4877ga2e6g49c470fd6a10"
msgid ""
"I'll be honest - didn't think we stood a chance. Not 'til you came along."
msgstr "솔직히 말해, 우리한테 승산이 있을 거라고는 생각도 못 했소. 당신이 오기 전까지는 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = d4cbb290-fcd1-1cf7-63fa-ff8f4bb756d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperMelee000(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperMelee000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000:d4cbb290-fcd1-1cf7-63fa-ff8f4bb756d1
msgctxt "h939965dag98d2g46bag9f3cg12bb556a8156"
msgid "Jaheira's godsend, in the flesh. Pleasure to have you."
msgstr "자헤이라가 말한 신의 선물이 당신이었군요. 만나뵙게 되어 반갑습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = de32e00f-c968-4689-5009-692e84fb9486
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperMelee000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000:de32e00f-c968-4689-5009-692e84fb9486
msgctxt "hc29bda9bg854bg4b53g97cegaec4f7a84564"
msgid "Jaheira's waiting for you, is she not?"
msgstr "자헤이라께서 당신을 기다리고 계십니다만?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = ea191f63-8db5-11ad-0378-1e9bf5c4a6e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperMelee000(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersBackAtInn = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperMelee000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000:ea191f63-8db5-11ad-0378-1e9bf5c4a6e4
msgctxt "hfa86e699gbfc0g46cdg92e3g7d1e64b8f9e0"
msgid "We expect great things of you."
msgstr "당신에게서 많은 걸 기대하고 있습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 06921e28-816c-4631-dba6-5450a0a16ec9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:06921e28-816c-4631-dba6-5450a0a16ec9
msgctxt "h64f33743g54b2g4be4gaaf6g64225509ac4b"
msgid "Lead on, then."
msgstr "앞장서, 그럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 121fc084-cd5f-7525-1c77-585cecc2a694
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:121fc084-cd5f-7525-1c77-585cecc2a694
msgctxt "h7744957dgfcbbg43d0g9956ga0e34821f3e1"
msgid ""
"*The lantern flickers ever so briefly, and you hear a slight twitter - or "
"perhaps it's simply your imagination.*"
msgstr "*등불이 아주 짧게 깜빡입니다, 그리고 약하게 지저귀는 소리가 들립니다, 어쩌면 단순히 당신의 착각일지도 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 1415367c-8882-8f0d-b795-761c9b8e7dbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:1415367c-8882-8f0d-b795-761c9b8e7dbc
msgctxt "h3864571ag9168g4af1g988cgc0c1b090984d"
msgid "Incredible. A light so radiant, not even the curse can dim it."
msgstr "엄청나. 빛이 아주 환하군, 저주에도 흐려지지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 15f38e6b-551e-c7e7-e0c4-dece5e0a48ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:15f38e6b-551e-c7e7-e0c4-dece5e0a48ef
msgctxt "ha115363bgcc54g4700g90f1gdc767a32775c"
msgid "A prisoner? Then I must be a welcome sight indeed."
msgstr "잡혀있었다고? 그렇다면 당연히 반갑게 맞아줘야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 2b45deea-bc0e-4184-9bef-5db00521e4ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:2b45deea-bc0e-4184-9bef-5db00521e4ef
msgctxt "hbc9dd92bg91bbg4107g8e04gf83bfcd07578"
msgid "An cultist apostate - I reckon one of a kind. Curious."
msgstr "변절한 이교도라, 특이한 경우로군. 흥미로워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 2c194f29-f1f6-30d0-b919-4b853d5fe97d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:2c194f29-f1f6-30d0-b919-4b853d5fe97d
msgctxt "hc2ba6356gde34g40c1ga7a0g31fdba1a84b7"
msgid "But don't linger for long. The shadows are not known to take pity."
msgstr "그래도 너무 오래 끌진 마. 그림자가 봐주는 경우는 없다니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e11fb1c-76f4-319c-1298-6ed3230c7ecf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:2e11fb1c-76f4-319c-1298-6ed3230c7ecf
msgctxt "h3778cb4egddf5g4cdegaef7gfed84f0e8be6"
msgid "The cult took me prisoner. Thank the gods you came when you did."
msgstr "교단에 붙잡혀있었지. 때마침 네가 왔으니 신께 감사드려야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 2e58143f-9c97-bdbd-3a68-b1a52a412e49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:2e58143f-9c97-bdbd-3a68-b1a52a412e49
msgctxt "h84b357e4gc3d5g4ce0g94dega0306d0842a6"
msgid "Explain yourself."
msgstr "정체를 밝혀라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 2fee0574-ef0a-f993-0b67-8538711d6802
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:2fee0574-ef0a-f993-0b67-8538711d6802
msgctxt "h64494125g6ad0g4af6ga807g2afe8aa048f9"
msgid "Follow me. I know a refuge from the darkness. You can rest there."
msgstr "따라와. 어둠을 피할 안전한 장소를 알아. 거기서 쉴 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 300b210b-842f-bec4-4449-36bd39c04202
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_HarperPin_HistoryPassed(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Factions_Knows_Harpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:300b210b-842f-bec4-4449-36bd39c04202
msgctxt "h27224196g748fg4560gbb35ga8fd3df96559"
msgid ""
"*You notice a pin on the man's chest, identical to the one you found in "
"Grymforge. He is a Harper.*"
msgstr "*남자의 가슴에 꽂혀있는 핀을 발견합니다, 당신이 그림포지에서 발견한 것과 같은 것입니다. 그는 하퍼입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 369a105c-e4f5-c185-63cf-5bc0c7cee6d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:369a105c-e4f5-c185-63cf-5bc0c7cee6d5
msgctxt "hc6dacc3cg9df2g489cg9fd6g10874190aebd"
msgid ""
"The lantern is yours to keep - Jaheira's said as much. It will guide your "
"way to the Towers."
msgstr "등불은 네가 가져가, 자헤이라가 그러라고 말했어. 타워까지 가는 길을 알려줄거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 3cf05517-899f-20cf-c060-f4631a13d914
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_StartCaravanEscort = False
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:3cf05517-899f-20cf-c060-f4631a13d914
msgctxt "h1bce9993g3430g416dga310g7bf34ea6bb68"
msgid "Go on. Take the beast's lantern."
msgstr "계속해. 저 짐승의 등불을 챙겨."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 49e05457-4fea-6835-ffe6-f5358314b1cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Factions_Knows_Harpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:49e05457-4fea-6835-ffe6-f5358314b1cb
msgctxt "h6d67565cg4e6fg4b03gac48g8e3ccff3cd1e"
msgid ""
"*The pin the man wears is familiar to you. He belongs to the Harpers, a "
"covert organisation dedicated to freedom and balance.*"
msgstr "*남자가 착용한 핀이 무엇인지 압니다. 그는자유와 균형을 위해 헌신하는 비밀결사, 하퍼 소속입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4ad795ad-9a52-5abc-1bfc-03f630764758
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:4ad795ad-9a52-5abc-1bfc-03f630764758
msgctxt "h0287aee0g30f8g4feeg97ebg37fe4a7cdf1c"
msgid ""
"*The lantern flickers ever so briefly, and you hear a slight twitter - or "
"perhaps it's simply your imagination.*"
msgstr "*등불이 아주 짧게 깜빡입니다, 그리고 약하게 지저귀는 소리가 들립니다, 어쩌면 단순히 당신의 착각일지도 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 4d983942-19ab-bcc2-6591-bcc17241f223
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_GainedAccess = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:4d983942-19ab-bcc2-6591-bcc17241f223
msgctxt "h74d865bbga1a8g4190ga508gd9bd09b0368a"
msgid "You. Don't move a godsdamned muscle."
msgstr "너. 그 망할 근육 하나라도 움직이지 마라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 4df83a26-57ad-d48f-d044-46e8d1e0f6ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:4df83a26-57ad-d48f-d044-46e8d1e0f6ee
msgctxt "h41a50baag94fcg499bg831egbc4dbca73082"
msgid "We've done only as duty dictates."
msgstr "해야 할 일을 한 것뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d52cb6f-2665-8caf-982c-14b8306d3248
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:5d52cb6f-2665-8caf-982c-14b8306d3248
msgctxt "h02188dfagaeaeg4db3g978ega85e0f10e28c"
msgid "I meant to infiltrate the cult. You've ruined the mission."
msgstr "교단에 잠입하려 했는데. 네가 다 망쳤군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 6edc66f2-b518-4868-c0f1-a4047fcfb64b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:6edc66f2-b518-4868-c0f1-a4047fcfb64b
msgctxt "h0e44ec52g8e65g485cgb625gd866559a54e4"
msgid "You were no prisoner - and I am no fool. Your lies end here, rat."
msgstr "넌 붙잡혀 있던 게 아니잖아, 난 바보가 아니야. 거짓말은 여기서 끝이다, 쥐새끼야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 706adbfa-e712-353a-6e51-1da22b4f9048
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:706adbfa-e712-353a-6e51-1da22b4f9048
msgctxt "h95e4fb10g4ed5g46f9ga9f7g15e74a678cc7"
msgid "By the Nine Hells, is that right? Then you are quite the curiosity."
msgstr "아홉 지옥 맙소사, 그게 정말인가? 그렇다면 넌 좀 신기하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 81085c9f-2415-2a4b-82e9-5dccdc4b3ac1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_StartCaravanEscort = False
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:81085c9f-2415-2a4b-82e9-5dccdc4b3ac1
msgctxt "hb51c20a6g538dg4d88g9165gb3de515a87d7"
msgid ""
"A pleasure to keep my weapon stayed for once. Go on, the lantern's yours."
msgstr "무기를 꺼내지도 않고 해결하다니 좋군. 어서 갑시다. 등불부터 챙겨요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 817a2e0e-05dc-837e-0868-22425c9c5f95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:817a2e0e-05dc-837e-0868-22425c9c5f95
msgctxt "h44be9304g97bcg4dafga134gafcfa8961a30"
msgid "No lantern? Damnable cultist. Only a fool would play your bloody games."
msgstr "등불이 없어? 망할 광신도자식. 바보가 아니면 네 수작에 놀아날 사람은 없을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8399c266-b5ab-da04-de0a-b55c2645f735
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:8399c266-b5ab-da04-de0a-b55c2645f735
msgctxt "h66214eefgcfa4g41b2gab78gbddf65e91a66"
msgid "<i>Hand over the lantern.</i>"
msgstr "<i>등불을 넘겨준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 860881e7-9a17-d743-38f9-0151824520fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_GiveMoonlantern(0) = False
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:860881e7-9a17-d743-38f9-0151824520fa
msgctxt "ha211d36egab7dg4b89g9781g8b7bfdcb518e"
msgid "Sorry. I don't have it anymore."
msgstr "미안한데. 내가 안 갖고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f9bc739-6015-7775-4e86-f9fae439cbf7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:8f9bc739-6015-7775-4e86-f9fae439cbf7
msgctxt "hf35d4f56gab1bg4046g9af8g663cf567296b"
msgid "How about I just kill you and keep the lantern for myself?"
msgstr "그냥 널 죽이고 등불을 내가 갖는 게 나을 거 같은데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 90902458-4844-f703-35b3-3a92e6b59ff9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:90902458-4844-f703-35b3-3a92e6b59ff9
msgctxt "h7bf38ea6g90b6g47f6gabd2g0b8864ac388a"
msgid "Talk. Why in the hells would a cultist turn on his kind?"
msgstr "말해. 광신도가 왜 같은 편을 배신했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 90902458-4844-f703-35b3-3a92e6b59ff9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:90902458-4844-f703-35b3-3a92e6b59ff9
msgctxt "h9c30ed81gdb40g4af8ga1bcge99f15566e4b"
msgid "Talk. Why in the hells would a cultist turn on her kind?"
msgstr "말해. 광신도가 왜 같은 편을 배신했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 90902458-4844-f703-35b3-3a92e6b59ff9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:90902458-4844-f703-35b3-3a92e6b59ff9
msgctxt "h7b25f5b2g0967g4379gb941g8fc7b2306af1"
msgid "Talk. Why in the hells would a cultist turn on their kind?"
msgstr "말해. 광신도가 왜 같은 편을 배신했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 963f49fc-52f9-ed65-2e32-d4eb61856d8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:963f49fc-52f9-ed65-2e32-d4eb61856d8b
msgctxt "h6a4ec29cg8c94g40a7gb1c6g477b756b08c6"
msgid ""
"Your mission is fiction, snake - and Harpers do not ally with liars. We "
"silence them."
msgstr "꾸며낸 말이군, 뱀같은 자식, 하퍼는 거짓말쟁이와 협력하지 않아. 조용하게 만들지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = a46bc459-6d83-ea33-79c3-194e3d0da91d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:a46bc459-6d83-ea33-79c3-194e3d0da91d
msgctxt "h578b5359g99b1g4d73g8287g64f68bf3e5ca"
msgid "It's time you seize what's yours. Check the drider - take the lantern."
msgstr "네 몫을 챙길 시간이야. 드라이더의 등불을 챙겨."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = a80376db-fcc1-1481-c4b7-03e33b21d35f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:a80376db-fcc1-1481-c4b7-03e33b21d35f
msgctxt "h5a1bcf67g6243g4494g8af3gb38c789d125a"
msgid ""
"An inn - Last Light, it's called. A place you can sigh without the shadow-"
"beasts hearing."
msgstr "최후의 빛 여관이라고 부르는 곳. 거기선 한숨을 쉬어도 그림자 괴물이 못 듣지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac398900-f7a1-db5e-7ace-7bc005f8e6b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_GiveMoonlantern(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:ac398900-f7a1-db5e-7ace-7bc005f8e6b9
msgctxt "h56a33d76g74dfg4235gbb44g622899fcf1f8"
msgid ""
"I'm not here to explain myself - I just want the lantern. Hand it over, or "
"die."
msgstr "여기 자기소개나 하러 온게 아니야, 등불이 필요할 뿐이다. 이리 넘겨, 아니면 죽든가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = acb584e5-9184-9b54-b79d-0396f2c4f6b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Harpers_Event_ShowHavenLocation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:acb584e5-9184-9b54-b79d-0396f2c4f6b5
msgctxt "h5e4072f4g6206g463ag941cg128cd64e5680"
msgid "A dangerous choice - but yours to make. I will mark your map."
msgstr "위험한 선택이지만, 네가 결정한 거다. 지도에 표시해주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = b4cf990a-5c73-7008-ebf9-495306978a70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:b4cf990a-5c73-7008-ebf9-495306978a70
msgctxt "h3605d7eega539g4141g96e2ga96bbec0d02a"
msgid "And I am no fool."
msgstr "난 바보가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc19e1b6-09f1-14f6-dbfb-6af53988e590
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:bc19e1b6-09f1-14f6-dbfb-6af53988e590
msgctxt "h45dd5f11g6e72g4f5eg9cd0g7f4d0e9e7ee3"
msgid "I will make my way there in my own time."
msgstr "때가 되면 알아서 가도록 할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc565889-9861-dd1b-d4dc-2e2ebb88fc4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:bc565889-9861-dd1b-d4dc-2e2ebb88fc4a
msgctxt "hf8f55584g0d48g44abg8bd5g931455a669cc"
msgid "I'm infected with their parasite, but I'm seeking a cure."
msgstr "저 놈들의 기생충에 감염됐어, 해결할 방법을 찾는 중이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = c0f2bbf1-2794-e8df-8d76-63d9af3e28d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:c0f2bbf1-2794-e8df-8d76-63d9af3e28d0
msgctxt "h89482475ge92bg483cgae07g0820dbdb9964"
msgid ""
"But remember: you don't just fight shadows. You fight what hides inside."
msgstr "하지만 명심해, 넌 그림자와 싸우는 게 아니야. 그 안에 숨은 것과 싸우는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = c1254f57-03cc-9ca9-b5a5-be116fc4aefe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:c1254f57-03cc-9ca9-b5a5-be116fc4aefe
msgctxt "h5d109306g7e41g4ce7g8e47gd24e826a6127"
msgid "Then I can only apologise. I was not aware of this mission."
msgstr "그렇다면 사과하지. 그런줄은 몰랐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c17506de-d9ed-0a37-febd-c6adc838109f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#.      - SHADOWHEART_ENEMYOFSHARPATH(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:c17506de-d9ed-0a37-febd-c6adc838109f
msgctxt "h18931d9bg1bbfg4779g97cegc8eff108ef4f"
msgid "My goddess protects me. I'll make my own way there."
msgstr "나의 여신께서 날 보호하시니. 내가 알아서 가도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = c4f477cb-a63b-69da-d496-4cb3dad7b153
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_GiveMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:c4f477cb-a63b-69da-d496-4cb3dad7b153
msgctxt "h80813230g156eg47dfg93deg54c4992e781e"
msgid ""
"The lantern is yours - Jaheira's orders. Take it, and it will guide your way "
"to the Towers."
msgstr "등불은 네 거야, 자헤이라의 명령이다. 가져, 타워까지 가는 길을 알려줄테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = c698ada0-8cbd-a51a-222c-d47bd2204dfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:c698ada0-8cbd-a51a-222c-d47bd2204dfc
msgctxt "h701c0f4dg891bg47bagb84eg56002870496f"
msgid "Rotten swine!"
msgstr "빌어먹을 새끼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = c9a04622-38d1-0734-fa9b-83cef7210885
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:c9a04622-38d1-0734-fa9b-83cef7210885
msgctxt "ha70d3276gd5f5g4fdfga350g81c8294b22d0"
msgid "Jaheira's godsend. Such strange company you keep."
msgstr "자헤이라의 뜻밖의 선물이로군. 너 이상한 자들과 다니는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = d7855a93-d1c9-a18b-49c2-35257caffcdb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:d7855a93-d1c9-a18b-49c2-35257caffcdb
msgctxt "h1baec255gf730g43d3gadb4gec6b91465f81"
msgid "Incredible. A light so radiant, not even the curse can dim it."
msgstr "엄청나. 빛이 아주 환하군, 저주에도 흐려지지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = d802a32e-d69e-8756-839a-0f2e21a3c346
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_StartCaravanEscort = False
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:d802a32e-d69e-8756-839a-0f2e21a3c346
msgctxt "h5e94156bg34deg4460gb432ga4fd1f9f3c5c"
msgid "Extraordinary. You strike even truer than I'd expected."
msgstr "비범해. 내가 예상했던 것 보다 더 정확하게 공격하더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d9d77153-6abe-2428-83c5-b77b7f2d4a5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:d9d77153-6abe-2428-83c5-b77b7f2d4a5a
msgctxt "h4e769cbegf9d9g49a8g876dg93e09a6f1c24"
msgid "<i>Attack him.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그를 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = dba74c15-5bd7-8985-f8ee-6c6bd741b3e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Harpers_Event_ShowHavenLocation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:dba74c15-5bd7-8985-f8ee-6c6bd741b3e8
msgctxt "h2c8cf455g8c94g4a1dga900ga3e448c9055a"
msgid ""
"Let the lantern's light be your guide. I'll mark your map, should you lose "
"the way."
msgstr "등불의 빛이 인도가 될 거야. 길을 잃지 않게 지도에 표시 해주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = ddd8cc43-9fca-29e0-7266-4f486b4ade3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_StartCaravanEscort = False
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:ddd8cc43-9fca-29e0-7266-4f486b4ade3c
msgctxt "h2f67b874gb736g41c6gbf22g37b4db560a51"
msgid ""
"A tongue of pure silver. Take the lantern from the drider - you've earned it."
msgstr "은의 혀를 가진 자로군. 드라이더의 등불을 챙겨 가. 그럴 자격 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = e011e477-bc37-7414-0830-a5531d73fc50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_GiveMoonlantern(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:e011e477-bc37-7414-0830-a5531d73fc50
msgctxt "hb9ca2a23ge605g4462ga12cge87f1a9e4e0c"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "고마워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e1c22ba9-0cc9-f47a-3a9e-dbab7a2e74ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:e1c22ba9-0cc9-f47a-3a9e-dbab7a2e74ce
msgctxt "he8aa3ed4gc5efg4fc6gb01bg14a5b661cbd3"
msgid "I couldn't bear the atrocities committed in the Absolute's name."
msgstr "절대자의 이름으로 저질러진 잔학행위들을 견딜 수 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = e34c348c-6e9a-43c3-4a6a-c9e82ed12595
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:e34c348c-6e9a-43c3-4a6a-c9e82ed12595
msgctxt "h59a4784eg5d3dg4890gb887g98dcbedcf0d1"
msgid ""
"Give me the lantern, and follow. I know a refuge from the darkness. You can "
"rest there."
msgstr "등불을 나한테 주고 따라와. 어둠을 피할 안전한 장소를 알아. 거기서 쉴 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ec5125cc-a561-a541-ef4b-498df5fd4134
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:ec5125cc-a561-a541-ef4b-498df5fd4134
msgctxt "hd60f987agf3f0g40a4gb647g2908d7f3f5aa"
msgid "What sort of refuge do you mean?"
msgstr "안전한 장소라면 어떤 곳이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f1c78ce5-13e3-d4bc-711e-dd1c3a086128
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Harpers_Event_ShowHavenLocation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:f1c78ce5-13e3-d4bc-711e-dd1c3a086128
msgctxt "hbff31580gfbdcg4d6dg9ad3g63c4cc1875a1"
msgid "Lead on, then."
msgstr "앞장서, 그럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa9eff75-dc2d-8da2-0f78-e3392ed117e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:fa9eff75-dc2d-8da2-0f78-e3392ed117e1
msgctxt "hcd7c0c4bgc7bbg4694ga427gd89d5f3d6b1d"
msgid "I'm not one of them. They took me prisoner."
msgstr "난 광신도들 편이 아니야. 놈들이 날 포로로 잡았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ff90a1e0-f335-cfe5-69b6-a11134d38dfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperMelee_000_AfterAmbush:ff90a1e0-f335-cfe5-69b6-a11134d38dfc
msgctxt "hc8db2daagd8bcg45b3gb184g2eedba2e319a"
msgid "I succumbed to their temptations. You gave me an opportunity to escape."
msgstr "난 그들의 유혹에 굴복했었지. 네가 나에게 탈출할 기회를 줬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f8ca44e-31b9-f98f-2144-547179a4ddb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#.      - SHADOWHEART_ENEMYOFSHARPATH(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:0f8ca44e-31b9-f98f-2144-547179a4ddb7
msgctxt "h2b3f9673g5761g45a5g870dg816291d5a9fa"
msgid "My goddess protects me. I don't fear the dark."
msgstr "여신께서 날 지켜주시니. 어둠이 두렵지 않다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0fd960db-410f-70f1-3afd-2a7e60342772
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:0fd960db-410f-70f1-3afd-2a7e60342772
msgctxt "h498cff75g97a6g4683g894egc5c0071714de"
msgid "*They sigh and offer to guide you to a nearby refuge.*"
msgstr "*그들은 한숨을 쉬더니 당신을 피난처로 안내 하겠다고 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1450f5a8-660e-9a3a-f9cc-90fb76344f05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:1450f5a8-660e-9a3a-f9cc-90fb76344f05
msgctxt "h64ac01f1gb06eg48c4ga9acg29b89ff4da39"
msgid "Lead on, then."
msgstr "앞장서, 그럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 21e83289-0116-71c6-1f0a-095d301ef269
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:21e83289-0116-71c6-1f0a-095d301ef269
msgctxt "h43428e7bg5314g4ac9g887cgca7b82f8a52e"
msgid ""
"*Lastly, the Harper wishes you well. The path to Moonrise Towers is arduous -"
" but you will overcome.*"
msgstr "*마지막으로, 하퍼들이 당신의 안녕을 빕니다. 문라이즈 타워로 가는 길은 고되겠지만, 당신은 이겨낼 수 있을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 242f0b0c-8aa0-5b7b-a576-7ac726b312ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:242f0b0c-8aa0-5b7b-a576-7ac726b312ad
msgctxt "h0dc03a71g4ae9g4b05gaa3bg0ba0603386bf"
msgid "I meant to infiltrate the cult. You've ruined the mission."
msgstr "교단에 잠입하려 했는데. 네가 다 망쳤군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 33b978bb-07bf-308c-b866-f2cc3d40dda1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:33b978bb-07bf-308c-b866-f2cc3d40dda1
msgctxt "h4b23803dgd5d1g495ega42bg4a817c8e8bae"
msgid "*They ready for battle.*"
msgstr "*그들이 싸울 준비를 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a0fcfc2-da93-b70b-c57f-effff6ee1623
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:3a0fcfc2-da93-b70b-c57f-effff6ee1623
msgctxt "h69fd52a1ge214g413dg8002gee70a2cd9c28"
msgid "How about I just kill you and keep the lantern for myself?"
msgstr "그냥 널 죽이고 등불을 내가 갖는 게 나을 거 같은데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3e086e0e-557d-ff7a-f17b-ee18a3f1c998
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:3e086e0e-557d-ff7a-f17b-ee18a3f1c998
msgctxt "h4abe9a43g4f5fg4a20gb561gd7cdbea4bbf4"
msgid ""
"*The Harper acknowledges your explanation, grateful to see you in one piece.*"
msgstr "*하퍼 요원이 당신의 해명을 받아들입니다. 해를 입지 않아 다행이라는 눈치입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42de3a65-d5d5-56f8-20c9-2e22174c1204
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:42de3a65-d5d5-56f8-20c9-2e22174c1204
msgctxt "h71090cc6ga5fcg457egb2aeg2743a18134c8"
msgid ""
"I'm not here to explain myself - I just want the lantern. Hand it over, or "
"die."
msgstr "여기 자기소개나 하러 온게 아니야, 등불이 필요할 뿐이다. 이리 넘겨, 아니면 죽든가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4433f4ea-05fb-7724-5428-1b73bf274516
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:4433f4ea-05fb-7724-5428-1b73bf274516
msgctxt "hf2fd1b61g10deg42e1g8734gd487d0c35660"
msgid ""
"*You hold the lantern aloft. Its glow warms you through, chasing away the "
"shadows in and around you.*"
msgstr "*당신은 등불을 높이 치켜듭니다. 따뜻하게 빛나는 등불이 당신을 집어삼킬듯 둘러싼 그림자를 몰아냅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4cad6fb4-8c29-3da4-a9da-e7b3501217b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_GainedAccess = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:4cad6fb4-8c29-3da4-a9da-e7b3501217b3
msgctxt "haedaf753g6644g43b7gaf0bg8fd474fffc1e"
msgid ""
"*The hunter warns you to remain still, considering why a cultist would turn "
"on its kind.*"
msgstr "*사냥꾼이 당신에게 가만히 있으라고 경고합니다. 교단 추종자가 왜 같은 편을 배신하는지 모르겠다는 눈치입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4efe4dfa-9f59-3e38-bf62-896fe6b02cb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:4efe4dfa-9f59-3e38-bf62-896fe6b02cb7
msgctxt "h76c67fbdgf047g471cgafd0g0261f661a7cf"
msgid ""
"*They tell you of an inn called Last Light, and promises you will be safe "
"there.*"
msgstr "*그들은 최후의 빛 이라고 하는 여관을 말해줍니다, 그리고 그 곳에서는 안전할 거라는 약속을 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 585b836b-f1a0-3065-a2b4-e982252b1bec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:585b836b-f1a0-3065-a2b4-e982252b1bec
msgctxt "h09a69eb9g5a56g47b0g81e8g9624ba81748f"
msgid ""
"*The lantern flickers ever so briefly, and you hear a slight twitter - or "
"perhaps it's simply your imagination.*"
msgstr "*등불이 아주 짧게 깜빡입니다, 그리고 약하게 지저귀는 소리가 들립니다, 어쩌면 단순히 당신의 착각일지도 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 59e5ad6f-c3dd-a4c8-beaa-deac997efcbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:59e5ad6f-c3dd-a4c8-beaa-deac997efcbe
msgctxt "h167ba992gac82g46a3gbb22g56506917899f"
msgid "*The Harper demands an explanation. Why did you travel with cultists?*"
msgstr "*하퍼들이 설명을 요구합니다. 왜 광신도들과 함께 다니는지?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8ee5c61a-3843-429a-c611-013db704c805
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:8ee5c61a-3843-429a-c611-013db704c805
msgctxt "hc91d22d3g6411g47f3ga333gdc45751592b3"
msgid ""
"*They motion for you to hand over the lantern. They will take it and guide "
"you to safe refuge.*"
msgstr "*그들이 등불을 넘겨달라고 손짓합니다. 등불을 받고 당신을 피난처로 안내해 줄 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9155dda8-e111-9cb5-8a48-4d60956d5ff8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:9155dda8-e111-9cb5-8a48-4d60956d5ff8
msgctxt "h74826f79gf997g4187gaa2fgfafa9a2cd30e"
msgid "Sorry. I don't have it anymore."
msgstr "미안한데. 내가 안 갖고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9d7698b8-c5be-6bdf-b85b-a9d284a0ef20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:9d7698b8-c5be-6bdf-b85b-a9d284a0ef20
msgctxt "h156f21d7g5de1g4416g82ffg0b30efdd022f"
msgid "<i>Attack them.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이들을 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a9acf105-a946-3b61-a981-24e83a3d8602
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:a9acf105-a946-3b61-a981-24e83a3d8602
msgctxt "h8a42f130g2a35g4729g9151g099344e4856b"
msgid ""
"*The lantern flickers ever so briefly, and you hear a slight twitter - or "
"perhaps it's simply your imagination.*"
msgstr "*등불이 아주 짧게 깜빡입니다, 그리고 약하게 지저귀는 소리가 들립니다, 어쩌면 단순히 당신의 착각일지도 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1ef941b-ed01-abc1-8f29-8c10df4de659
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:b1ef941b-ed01-abc1-8f29-8c10df4de659
msgctxt "hc034e174g634cg436dga030g0e7dc5f71511"
msgid "The cult took me prisoner. Thank the gods you came when you did."
msgstr "교단에 붙잡혀있었지. 때마침 네가 왔으니 신께 감사드려야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b90e5d24-51bc-cb12-04da-4c1dfe9b3de5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:b90e5d24-51bc-cb12-04da-4c1dfe9b3de5
msgctxt "h909e0813gf27cg48eeg915cg1875f92d7f6d"
msgid "<i>Hand over the lantern.</i>"
msgstr "<i>등불을 넘겨준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ccdb2879-c203-3d72-b046-7b642925a969
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:ccdb2879-c203-3d72-b046-7b642925a969
msgctxt "he76a0c57g0696g4dfcgb271g92c80f05e1c9"
msgid ""
"*You no longer carry the lantern. The hunter frowns, and readies for battle.*"
msgstr "*당신은 더 이상 등불을 가지고 있지 않습니다. 사냥꾼들은 눈살을 찌푸리고는, 전투를 준비합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d49cc259-618c-a02e-d352-59bc7b1e109c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:d49cc259-618c-a02e-d352-59bc7b1e109c
msgctxt "hb3ff0fa8g146bg4f32gaf00g795f6cce5a7c"
msgid "*The Harper sees through your lies and readies for battle.*"
msgstr "*하퍼들이 당신의 거짓말을 꿰뚫어 보고는 전투를 준비합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d5853302-7b02-01b4-1d7a-2bd7573a36fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:d5853302-7b02-01b4-1d7a-2bd7573a36fd
msgctxt "h22793765gb2c1g4338gab8eg28cd0238a069"
msgid ""
"*The hunter holds the lantern aloft. Its glow warms you through, chasing "
"away the shadows in and around you.*"
msgstr "*사냥꾼이 등불을 높이 치켜듭니다. 따뜻하게 빛나는 등불이 당신을 집어삼킬듯 둘러싼 그림자를 몰아냅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d7098c41-30e4-f5f9-0768-3ebd8d121319
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:d7098c41-30e4-f5f9-0768-3ebd8d121319
msgctxt "h04e176e1g7258g46ebga69fgc412f6fb67b8"
msgid "What sort of refuge do you mean?"
msgstr "안전한 장소라면 어떤 곳이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e017d3ad-983b-98eb-fac7-388d76ecf547
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_GiveMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:e017d3ad-983b-98eb-fac7-388d76ecf547
msgctxt "h2744465dg6e3dg4084g9d8cgc4a6fb7fbb46"
msgid "*They hand you the Moonlantern. You bask in its glow.*"
msgstr "*그들이 달등불을 당신에게 건네줍니다. 당신은 그 빛을 쬡니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f756d6c5-db62-4c85-ef17-95c7277ce2b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Harpers_Event_ShowHavenLocation = True
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_GiveMoonlantern(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:f756d6c5-db62-4c85-ef17-95c7277ce2b5
msgctxt "hc0b5cc1bg6bd8g496bgbb7bgbe84cc5bc27e"
msgid ""
"*They thank you and mark the destination on your map, should you lose the "
"way.*"
msgstr "*그들은 감사를 표하고 당신이 길을 잃을까 지도에 목적지를 표시해줍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc65ab0e-d663-6297-8ce3-98188b425c2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperNarrator_AfterAmbush:fc65ab0e-d663-6297-8ce3-98188b425c2e
msgctxt "h56fb210dg00d9g4543gb38fgf60ed790f06d"
msgid "I will make my way there in my own time."
msgstr "때가 되면 알아서 갈거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 0d725220-1cb9-53fa-0db1-5e40bf7987de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersBackAtInn = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:0d725220-1cb9-53fa-0db1-5e40bf7987de
msgctxt "h04900b86g2d9bg454egb054ga6c9a6584059"
msgid "An honour to battle at your side. Jaheira is right to trust in you."
msgstr "당신 곁에서 싸울 수 있어 영광이야. 자헤이라가 당신을 믿었던 건 옳은 선택이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 0f2f4359-943d-5323-b53e-c15be2138212
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersWaitingAtBridge = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:0f2f4359-943d-5323-b53e-c15be2138212
msgctxt "hf9d67409g6bf6g4f95g9664g93c9a686d880"
msgid ""
"I must be brief: if you intend to reach Moonrise, no torch nor blessing will "
"fully guard you."
msgstr "간단히 말할게. 문라이즈에 도착하고 싶다면, 횃불이나 축복으로는 너를 완전히 지켜주지 못할거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 28574ed7-d7e5-be1c-89f8-1471498a4179
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:28574ed7-d7e5-be1c-89f8-1471498a4179
msgctxt "h402be59bg5dbeg4abbg8c88g61b27a8d75ab"
msgid "The next step is yours alone to take. Make it a careful one."
msgstr "너의 다음 행동은 혼자서 판단해야 해. 신중하게 결정하도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 29129f2e-4e1a-cfbf-2ca2-b9a305386133
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:29129f2e-4e1a-cfbf-2ca2-b9a305386133
msgctxt "h21508e40gceb8g480cg89dege46435f34695"
msgid ""
"Yet I know what can - a strange lantern, used by a cultist convoy that oft "
"passes."
msgstr "하지만 그걸 막을 수 있는 게 있어. 종종 지나다니는 광신도 호송대가 사용하는 이상한 등불이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 30184dd6-bf4f-c5ec-6eff-c31ef88c4896
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:30184dd6-bf4f-c5ec-6eff-c31ef88c4896
msgctxt "h59d827b4g7119g4b0dgbbe5gd4dfef192d03"
msgid "You have other matters to pursue, surely."
msgstr "당신은 풀어야 할 다른 문제들이 있어, 분명."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 34a3a5ca-e209-c994-464c-58cf7565e50b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:34a3a5ca-e209-c994-464c-58cf7565e50b
msgctxt "hdff07ee7ge286g44aeg9428g63a1da999464"
msgid ""
"But do not be long. Our chances grow thinner with each moment that passes."
msgstr "하지만 오래 걸리지는 마. 시간이 지날수록 우리의 기회는 점점 줄어들고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 49542fd1-71ee-56f4-b17f-9bc5d5b0a8a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:49542fd1-71ee-56f4-b17f-9bc5d5b0a8a3
msgctxt "h9aae204fg3f96g4d8fg98f0g8bf46c43460e"
msgid "Keep on your toes. Cultists are on the move."
msgstr "긴장 늦추지 마. 광신도들이 움직이고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 49777e10-6094-c490-ea22-9f63a8159939
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Unprotected = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:49777e10-6094-c490-ea22-9f63a8159939
msgctxt "h3ac5b524g2e52g4f55g9bffg570964cde0ad"
msgid "The barrier's dropped. Find the light, and stick to it."
msgstr "장벽이 무너졌어. 빛을 찾아, 그리고 따라가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 4e399e98-6056-cc29-64b3-3d0f3487a157
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:4e399e98-6056-cc29-64b3-3d0f3487a157
msgctxt "ha5eb16b5g6589g4eaegb587g7e91d7313c11"
msgid "Pardon, but I've no mind for small talk."
msgstr "미안한데, 난 잡담에는 관심이 없어서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 540490db-91d5-98dd-5a0d-3de42682392b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:540490db-91d5-98dd-5a0d-3de42682392b
msgctxt "h2df34a5agfe3eg4195gb7d5g4ae8c014561d"
msgid "Indeed? Then be grateful your head still sits atop your shoulders."
msgstr "그래? 그럼 머리가 아직 목에 붙어있다는 것에 감사해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 71fc6ec6-6755-0cd3-4d3a-e7a43c0b203e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:71fc6ec6-6755-0cd3-4d3a-e7a43c0b203e
msgctxt "hf8123c7cg6649g492bgb5baga714c3212db2"
msgid "Together, we will take it by force - you simply need speak the word."
msgstr "다 같이, 우리가 그걸 강탈하면 되는 거야. 넌 그냥 그러자라고 하면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 83e7ae59-f592-afe2-f601-8a606a036931
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersBackAtInn = True
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:83e7ae59-f592-afe2-f601-8a606a036931
msgctxt "hae989037ga602g46eega4aeg5e8718bbabcb"
msgid "Let the Moonlantern light your way, friend."
msgstr "달등불이 네 길을 비춰주길 바라네, 친구."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 8edaaf55-d88e-af0c-2a1c-ab4e5d31f254
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:8edaaf55-d88e-af0c-2a1c-ab4e5d31f254
msgctxt "h91d339c9g3cf4g460dg9db9gf9f27d167f9d"
msgid "Then prepare. I will stand wait."
msgstr "그럼 준비해. 기다릴게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 9d19b1ff-2fb1-b60d-fe81-8fe597031b9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersWaitingAtBridge = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:9d19b1ff-2fb1-b60d-fe81-8fe597031b9b
msgctxt "hadb45a8cga898g4dadg996dgc9d8a0023157"
msgid "Weapons at the ready."
msgstr "무기 준비해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad120895-9a9e-ffc7-dc0a-fe4b5ee71bac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:ad120895-9a9e-ffc7-dc0a-fe4b5ee71bac
msgctxt "he2012fbbgedcbg421cg8ee9ge4bd7c0e411f"
msgid "I need time to prepare."
msgstr "준비할 시간이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af33f012-798d-7366-101b-58f0ea9b6c8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_StartedAmbushQuestWithHarpers = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_StartHarpersAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:af33f012-798d-7366-101b-58f0ea9b6c8c
msgctxt "hbcc163f2g3067g4a15g83c2g320e523a6490"
msgid "Let's take on that convoy. You lead, I follow."
msgstr "호송대가 있는 곳으로 가자. 안내해, 따라갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = b0e586e8-bf0e-e834-3bca-00f55a7d7505
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:b0e586e8-bf0e-e834-3bca-00f55a7d7505
msgctxt "he0b9e0d8g5b36g487cg8219gbdd1e01b517c"
msgid "Time to show us your might."
msgstr "너의 힘을 보여줄 시간이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = cb945384-5a50-7b3a-5f8d-2ac2e891e2e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:cb945384-5a50-7b3a-5f8d-2ac2e891e2e8
msgctxt "hb0f4163bge478g4201g8b6ag002787eccd7a"
msgid "At the ready!"
msgstr "준비해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = d2000b58-0f34-d9eb-f4bc-26a7aada1fe3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersLearnMissedCaravan = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger000(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:d2000b58-0f34-d9eb-f4bc-26a7aada1fe3
msgctxt "h243fd0c0g77d6g4f9fga1f3g03797927232d"
msgid "Get to Moonrise, and get it done."
msgstr "문라이즈에 도착해서, 일을 끝내 버려."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = d6f8f29e-4ba0-734c-5abc-d3ca2d00c375
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:d6f8f29e-4ba0-734c-5abc-d3ca2d00c375
msgctxt "h6fc57466gb546g4ad2g9198g95dea60fa824"
msgid "Quickly, then. I will mark your map, should we be separated."
msgstr "그럼 서둘러. 우리가 떨어지게 될 것에 대비해 지도에 표시해 줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = e0a34c00-e4a2-e6fa-252d-30135bcf616a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:e0a34c00-e4a2-e6fa-252d-30135bcf616a
msgctxt "hb4e140c9gc700g4fbbg952cg39f82c53dabc"
msgid "Very well. I will mark your map."
msgstr "좋아. 지도에 표시해 줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e83243bb-eff2-f062-7402-9924691ad9d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersLearnMissedCaravan = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:e83243bb-eff2-f062-7402-9924691ad9d0
msgctxt "hdf9efc72ge42fg4151g8e18g1d05f4fab3a2"
msgid "You're too late - I've encountered the convoy, led by a drider."
msgstr "너무 늦게 왔군. 우린 이미 드라이더가 이끄는 호송대와 마주쳤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9120d66-608f-0930-1f37-15f16cdb8d65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_StartedAmbushQuestWithHarpers = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_StartHarpersAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000:e9120d66-608f-0930-1f37-15f16cdb8d65
msgctxt "h264c37bagec4cg4164gb0ffgec5064a0fc00"
msgid "Go on ahead. I'll catch up."
msgstr "먼저 가. 곧 따라갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 1b3211e8-081d-e31c-b959-abac120eab14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000_AfterAmbush:1b3211e8-081d-e31c-b959-abac120eab14
msgctxt "hb99ddf68gb3beg4bedgb268gd955e0621d6e"
msgid "Take the lantern. I doubt that corpse will be fighting back."
msgstr "등불을 가져가세요. 시체가 다시 일어날 것 같진 않군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 393d4535-d5e0-0683-1286-c064f7d9601d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000_AfterAmbush:393d4535-d5e0-0683-1286-c064f7d9601d
msgctxt "hb3e22d71g08e3g45d5ga2e1gd4ebf543cb1f"
msgid "Go on, check the drider. The lantern's yours for the taking."
msgstr "어서 가서 드라이더를 확인해 봐요. 등불을 챙겨야 할 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 3bcf4677-fd23-a882-e013-29cfd5beaa3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000_AfterAmbush:3bcf4677-fd23-a882-e013-29cfd5beaa3d
msgctxt "h8bde7794g17cdg417bg86ddg118db02bfb63"
msgid "Splendid - not one arrow fired."
msgstr "경이롭군요. 화살 한 발 안 쏘고 상황을 끝내다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = c7897e69-9643-c9e9-a054-2b1f08c50b78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_000_AfterAmbush:c7897e69-9643-c9e9-a054-2b1f08c50b78
msgctxt "h06f1b3cdgc58eg481cgadb9g714d0d71ad52"
msgid ""
"Splendid show - newsworthy, even! Where's Volo Geddarm when you need him?"
msgstr "훌륭하더군요. 서사시로도 손색이 없을 정도로! 정작 필요할 때 볼로 게담은 대체 어디로 간거람?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 07baa005-2346-3d6b-ab86-c65079824ce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersLearnMissedCaravan = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:07baa005-2346-3d6b-ab86-c65079824ce4
msgctxt "ha96aa25eg5c66g4140g95bcge5c58cc18f57"
msgid "You're too late - I've encountered the convoy, led by a drider."
msgstr "너무 늦게 왔군. 우린 이미 드라이더가 이끄는 호송대와 마주쳤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 08ec1fe9-1f3f-e422-5d31-a71545960654
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersWaitingAtBridge = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:08ec1fe9-1f3f-e422-5d31-a71545960654
msgctxt "he0444644g4fbeg4136g9bd0gf0b1cba797af"
msgid ""
"You're the one Jaheira entrusted to infiltrate Moonrise, aren't you? Gods be "
"with you."
msgstr "자헤이라님이 문라이즈에 잠입하는 임무를 맡겼다는 게 당신 맞죠? 신들께서 함께하시길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 0aa874e6-b0e3-c15d-8dbc-bd2d0b4b5d0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:0aa874e6-b0e3-c15d-8dbc-bd2d0b4b5d0b
msgctxt "h7736712cg4eafg4f8ag8a3dgbfa50bc9197f"
msgid ""
"If you insist. I'll mark your map - but waste no more time than is needed. "
"This chance is too precious to miss."
msgstr "정 그렇다면, 지도에 표시해 주겠소. 하지만 너무 지체해서는 안 됩니다. 놓치기에는 너무 아까운 절호의 기회니까요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 223b2ffd-8ac3-a6ea-90af-92179dbd1cf4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:223b2ffd-8ac3-a6ea-90af-92179dbd1cf4
msgctxt "h531e24ccgccaeg479bg94d4g4ca4fcc28c22"
msgid ""
"Quickly, then. I will mark the rendezvous point, should you lose your way."
msgstr "그럼 빨리 갑시다. 합류 지점을 지도에 표시해 주겠소. 길을 잃어서는 안 되니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 28f58f77-ae08-f881-aa39-77012e923ad9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersBackAtInn = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:28f58f77-ae08-f881-aa39-77012e923ad9
msgctxt "h4f43803cgad99g4a0fgbfa2g2416e3f91343"
msgid "May the road rise to meet you, and the shadows keep at bay."
msgstr "올바른 길로 들어서길, 또 그림자로부터 안전하길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 3120c6d7-a023-be17-2ae6-d1fe65752ddd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersBackAtInn = True
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:3120c6d7-a023-be17-2ae6-d1fe65752ddd
msgctxt "h8b8b129bg1291g4da5g81bbg7c56e2d73c67"
msgid "Walk tall, friend."
msgstr "당당하게 나아가시오, 친구여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 68fba7b1-868d-b113-9341-0aed96577697
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:68fba7b1-868d-b113-9341-0aed96577697
msgctxt "hca63e5a6gdbbfg4e55g8cc4gc4886dad069f"
msgid "We will survive. We <i>must </i>survive."
msgstr "우린 살아남을 거야. <i>반드시</i> 살아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 747ae8a6-5bec-d65a-2b1b-f1bfe14cb773
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:747ae8a6-5bec-d65a-2b1b-f1bfe14cb773
msgctxt "h346f5bf1g0131g4e65g8418g7d1002088158"
msgid ""
"For now, then, I can only wait. I eagerly await the next call to battle."
msgstr "그럼, 지금 당장은, 기다릴 수밖에 없겠군. 다음에 있을 전투를 기대하겠소."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 795d39fe-9b45-dee6-6403-16a5c69d9058
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_StartedAmbushQuestWithHarpers = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_StartHarpersAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:795d39fe-9b45-dee6-6403-16a5c69d9058
msgctxt "hab5c4cc3g4d60g426cg90c0gab63c5535f0e"
msgid "Let's take them down. You lead, I follow."
msgstr "놈들을 무찌릅시다. 앞장서시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 8a7964ca-7f0d-1a37-053b-2a40f7705c89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:8a7964ca-7f0d-1a37-053b-2a40f7705c89
msgctxt "ha2561194g3a86g43ddg92d8gb13f1749d1e7"
msgid ""
"The farther you stray from Last Light, the stronger the curse becomes - and "
"Moonrise is beyond where the shadows are darkest."
msgstr "최후의 빛에서 멀어질수록, 저주도 더욱 강력해집니다. 문라이즈는 그림자가 가장 어두운 곳 그 너머에 있죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 94cfe8f3-5045-453b-57ab-ca44e7aae527
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:94cfe8f3-5045-453b-57ab-ca44e7aae527
msgctxt "h83656d36g15aag467fg8c52gc90b7015d154"
msgid "A drider? Gods - yet still your heart beats. Most impressive."
msgstr "드라이더라고? 이런 세상에. 그런데도 아직 살아있다니, 정말 대단하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 95127cc7-835e-1b0e-875a-1f45b73b532a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:95127cc7-835e-1b0e-875a-1f45b73b532a
msgctxt "hc7d917fegd2f8g4512ga9afg671da4d1f876"
msgid "You brought hope, just as we'd lost it. But we're not out of this yet."
msgstr "우리가 희망을 잃었을 때, 네가 희망을 가져다 줬어. 하지만 아직 이 일이 끝난 건 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = ad94107a-2db4-1c8f-ce66-7e37e8eab8ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:ad94107a-2db4-1c8f-ce66-7e37e8eab8ac
msgctxt "h725908afg7c66g48a8gb52egc178bd3c71f4"
msgid ""
"You won't survive the journey without protection - and we know where you can "
"find it."
msgstr "특별한 보호 수단 없이는 여기서 살아남을 수 없소. 우린 그게 어딨는지 알고 있죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = b5603ba6-8f28-00ad-7bdf-f6befd69b36b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersBackAtInn = True
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithHarpers = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:b5603ba6-8f28-00ad-7bdf-f6befd69b36b
msgctxt "hbac4117dg7cdfg4a79g8964g67a8b0d0d01e"
msgid "We've shared but one victory, friend. But it will not be our last."
msgstr "함께 나눈 승리는 아직 한 번 뿐이지만, 앞으로 또 기회가 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = b80819c1-0e3d-8b6b-9ecf-267d2c9eb80b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:b80819c1-0e3d-8b6b-9ecf-267d2c9eb80b
msgctxt "hc2477299gde7bg4010g974cg593b8f036b3d"
msgid "At your side until we claim victory, my friend."
msgstr "우리가 승리할 때까진 네 곁에 있겠다, 친구여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = c3ec99f7-c68c-17e2-d01e-12315a2ed1e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:c3ec99f7-c68c-17e2-d01e-12315a2ed1e9
msgctxt "hac45516dg150cg4c3aga771g99aba68ef837"
msgid "Let no cultist remain standing."
msgstr "교단놈들 모두 쓸어버리자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = d02c2ebf-424c-5426-2c70-5e56839c1e44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:d02c2ebf-424c-5426-2c70-5e56839c1e44
msgctxt "h40081104gbb8ag4969g81a9g8dcd5065e664"
msgid "'True Soul', I believe? How fortunate we are, to have you among us."
msgstr "'참된 영혼', 맞지? 네가 우리와 함께 한다니 정말 행운이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = d65f00bf-e5ed-ee9a-9fb2-e6f85ae2caff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersWaitingAtBridge = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:d65f00bf-e5ed-ee9a-9fb2-e6f85ae2caff
msgctxt "h38ef1e85g9ebfg434dg881bge8c27f6552c4"
msgid "Let's move - we can't miss our chance to strike the convoy."
msgstr "가자, 호송대를 습격할 기회를 놓칠 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d9c66b27-0407-b814-d16c-b1df82953dd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_StartedAmbushQuestWithHarpers = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_StartHarpersAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:d9c66b27-0407-b814-d16c-b1df82953dd8
msgctxt "hf07edc40g7eb8g48ecg9467g083cee41018c"
msgid "Go on ahead. I'll catch up."
msgstr "먼저 가. 곧 따라갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e425bcc7-cca3-7f42-077e-4b684294fde5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:e425bcc7-cca3-7f42-077e-4b684294fde5
msgctxt "h36b6b406g57feg4adbga9d7g3e633906e790"
msgid "I need time to prepare."
msgstr "준비할 시간이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = e8fe3e8c-14ba-5728-e2ef-c148198c08dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:e8fe3e8c-14ba-5728-e2ef-c148198c08dc
msgctxt "hdb5aeb08g0decg46aeg8313g779183e764da"
msgid ""
"We've been tracking cultists who pass through the shadows unharmed, guided "
"by an uncanny light. We plan to steal it."
msgstr "아무런 해도 입지 않고 그림자 속을 지나다니는 교단 놈들을 추적했습니다. 기묘한 빛의 인도를 따르더군요. 그걸 뺏을 생각입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = ecc08ca6-b3d8-5fd9-02ed-69bfa9c28f4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Unprotected = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet_HarperRanger001(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:ecc08ca6-b3d8-5fd9-02ed-69bfa9c28f4b
msgctxt "h5516ba49g77bfg42dfg94cdgd1e0318f0174"
msgid "We are exposed. With Isobel gone, each of us must rely on the others."
msgstr "속수무책이로군. 이소벨이 없으니, 이제 서로에게 의지해야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = f2844872-6791-9055-62a6-a84d42248f2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001:f2844872-6791-9055-62a6-a84d42248f2e
msgctxt "h160d53d9gae11g4d9eg8e02gbc1302879b54"
msgid ""
"With your help, we'll destroy their convoy. Then you can forge a path to the "
"tower, with their light to guide you."
msgstr "당신만 도와준다면, 호송대를 격파할 수 있어요. 놈들이 갖고 있던 빛을 이용해 타워로 향하는 길을 여는 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 07ee8dab-31f5-b198-2db3-ededad6f2f13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_StartCaravanEscort = False
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:07ee8dab-31f5-b198-2db3-ededad6f2f13
msgctxt "h9d2154abgd8eag46cbga0feg712e1b9f8792"
msgid "Victory is ours - alas, not without consequence."
msgstr "승리는 우리 것이다. 물론 대가를 치르긴 했다만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 07fc083e-027b-1ecd-2e6f-52eba1b8f8f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:07fc083e-027b-1ecd-2e6f-52eba1b8f8f0
msgctxt "hb05a38bag53d7g4205g86c3g6f57b1f9173e"
msgid "A face I once trusted, now allied with the shadows' most favoured."
msgstr "한때 내가 신뢰했던 자가, 이제는 그림자의 총애를 받는 이와 결탁했구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 08b66eb1-d7c0-4977-6ef6-f86e20ab333e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:08b66eb1-d7c0-4977-6ef6-f86e20ab333e
msgctxt "h0a31cd0eg6079g43b4gbce2gbd3f1121a623"
msgid "Give me the lantern. You must come to Last Light."
msgstr "등불을 내게 주시오. 최후의 빛으로 가야만 하니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0cf63897-3801-10b0-e3fe-2d08e90c17fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:0cf63897-3801-10b0-e3fe-2d08e90c17fb
msgctxt "h1b627e9bg7975g4d02gbacagdd874d8fdf58"
msgid "I'm infected with their parasite, but I'm seeking a cure."
msgstr "저 놈들의 기생충에 감염됐어, 해결할 방법을 찾는 중이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 0d8a02cb-eda5-2ed1-0478-3638c077cb72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_StartCaravanEscort = False
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:0d8a02cb-eda5-2ed1-0478-3638c077cb72
msgctxt "h68967a21gf258g4c62g9604g629db16b7a3e"
msgid "Our objectives complete without drawing a weapon. Incredible work."
msgstr "무기도 꺼내지 않고 간단히 목표를 달성하다니, 대단해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 13c52120-f5d8-7864-d7fc-9fe9c63e79e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_GiveMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:13c52120-f5d8-7864-d7fc-9fe9c63e79e3
msgctxt "h4fc5beeegc670g4e92g99e8g1e806ed8afa1"
msgid ""
"Here - Jaheira insists you take the lantern. It will guide you safely to "
"Moonrise Towers."
msgstr "여기. 자헤이라 님이 등불은 당신한테 주랬어요. 등불이 안전하게 문라이즈 타워까지 인도할 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14acd477-4e2f-c179-13d0-5f029ab224a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:14acd477-4e2f-c179-13d0-5f029ab224a1
msgctxt "hd2454a77g80e0g4c1fgaa45g5e111066a3ad"
msgid "Last Light? Tell me more."
msgstr "최후의 빛? 자세히 말해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 2118ea39-d8f4-de20-0a10-0043773b691b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:2118ea39-d8f4-de20-0a10-0043773b691b
msgctxt "he786b77cg7aebg4626g941dg98e0dce3f3d1"
msgid "Incredible. A light that chases away even the deepest shadows."
msgstr "굉장하군. 가장 짙고 어두운 그림자마저도 몰아내는 빛이라니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 3507b8d7-b23a-c14a-73e2-f8cfd1deea66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:3507b8d7-b23a-c14a-73e2-f8cfd1deea66
msgctxt "h40c9f557g6312g4e33gb32ag6a355fc90087"
msgid "A cultist deserter? By the gods."
msgstr "교단 도망자인가? 이런 세상에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3dcea811-247b-a780-1693-be824a97a624
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:3dcea811-247b-a780-1693-be824a97a624
msgctxt "hf8b781e6g91efg47b6g83e5g79ea9ce6a219"
msgid "Lead on, then."
msgstr "앞장서, 그럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 462e209b-09a5-367b-85ba-80c18278cf39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:462e209b-09a5-367b-85ba-80c18278cf39
msgctxt "h70694013g7f01g4778g820bg50949b969b02"
msgid "Talk. Why in the hells would a cultist turn on his kind?"
msgstr "말해. 광신도가 왜 같은 편을 배신했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 462e209b-09a5-367b-85ba-80c18278cf39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:462e209b-09a5-367b-85ba-80c18278cf39
msgctxt "h8eb072d2g9072g4a07gb9b1g44f92ab83cef"
msgid "Talk. Why in the hells would a cultist turn on her kind?"
msgstr "말해. 광신도가 왜 같은 편을 배신했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 462e209b-09a5-367b-85ba-80c18278cf39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:462e209b-09a5-367b-85ba-80c18278cf39
msgctxt "ha51cc1afg9bb0g4470g806bgabee5b63de9a"
msgid "Talk. Why in the hells would a cultist turn on their kind?"
msgstr "말해. 광신도가 왜 같은 편을 배신했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4731d887-40f4-03b8-00fa-293af75f94ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:4731d887-40f4-03b8-00fa-293af75f94ff
msgctxt "hc8e2405eg4165g4f7bga812g9e5a1ad6e3f4"
msgid "The cult took me prisoner. Thank the gods you came when you did."
msgstr "교단에 붙잡혀있었지. 때마침 네가 왔으니 신께 감사드려야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4746eba7-3679-ae77-1196-fb2cce3e0d0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:4746eba7-3679-ae77-1196-fb2cce3e0d0b
msgctxt "h0996d01eg8ee2g4efdg9fc9gc5f817e860a3"
msgid "<i>Hand over the lantern.</i>"
msgstr "<i>등불을 넘겨준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4fbe62d0-2ddd-5d88-5570-a75944ed4e0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:4fbe62d0-2ddd-5d88-5570-a75944ed4e0b
msgctxt "h8ac2aacegc049g4b29g8297gb473f88ad1c5"
msgid ""
"*The lantern flickers ever so briefly, and you hear a slight twitter - or "
"perhaps it's simply your imagination.*"
msgstr "*등불이 아주 짧게 깜빡입니다, 그리고 약하게 지저귀는 소리가 들립니다, 어쩌면 단순히 당신의 착각일지도 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 590650fd-08d3-4c2a-af8b-50928671ab8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:590650fd-08d3-4c2a-af8b-50928671ab8b
msgctxt "h4a6fd05eg4c11g410fg9133g092cd9272b2e"
msgid ""
"Apologies - I had no word of this mission. Take comfort in knowing there "
"will many more yet."
msgstr "죄송합니다. 그 임무에 관해서는 들은 바가 없어서요. 광신도들이야 머잖아 또 올 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 5d7bef2f-71d4-9a0c-7157-431bdfea69c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_StartCaravanEscort = False
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:5d7bef2f-71d4-9a0c-7157-431bdfea69c3
msgctxt "haf230d02g7709g4d79g8afdg901f40ba7870"
msgid ""
"Well played, you have a gift for cunning. Take the lantern - you earned it."
msgstr "잘했소. 교활한 수에는 도가 튼 모양이군. 등불 가져가시오. 그럴 자격이 있으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 5e11ecee-bd08-41e0-bc23-78c8bd050c3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:5e11ecee-bd08-41e0-bc23-78c8bd050c3d
msgctxt "h3a832acdg8173g4a44ga65bg2c30dd38fd49"
msgid "What is this? A cultist after all, then - vermin for crushing."
msgstr "이게 뭐지? 이제보니 교단 광신도였군. 해충은 박멸한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5fb12fcc-b830-4444-cf89-58d9ca848781
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:5fb12fcc-b830-4444-cf89-58d9ca848781
msgctxt "hecffeebcgc775g4fd4ga414g7e0762b7f4a0"
msgid "I couldn't bear the atrocities committed in the Absolute's name."
msgstr "절대자의 이름으로 저질러진 잔학행위들을 견딜 수 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 68f4a491-0b76-430d-a624-584102c55e50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_StartCaravanEscort = False
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:68f4a491-0b76-430d-a624-584102c55e50
msgctxt "hdbfa1049gd986g49c2g8ce4g7c8c26f66dcd"
msgid "Go on - take the lantern from the corpse."
msgstr "어서. 시체에서 등불을 챙기도록 하시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b7193ff-0f46-e8aa-a38b-70654375ddbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:6b7193ff-0f46-e8aa-a38b-70654375ddbb
msgctxt "ha4a80e89g50c1g4b56gbec4g90d3e48c185e"
msgid ""
"I'm not here to explain myself - I just want the lantern. Hand it over, or "
"die."
msgstr "여기 자기소개나 하러 온게 아니야, 등불이 필요할 뿐이다. 이리 넘겨, 아니면 죽든가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 6e7855c7-6905-d105-92b3-d8ee38a0f99a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:6e7855c7-6905-d105-92b3-d8ee38a0f99a
msgctxt "h1cefb271gbb33g48f8g83edgd98f7a72143e"
msgid "<i>Explain.</i>"
msgstr "<i>해명을 들어볼까.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 7a62df9f-330b-9b32-b45b-e80c149d18f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:7a62df9f-330b-9b32-b45b-e80c149d18f5
msgctxt "h351a6230g51e1g4996gb4eag90d68242d235"
msgid ""
"Keep the lantern - Jaheira insisted. It will guide you safely to Moonrise "
"Towers."
msgstr "등불은 갖고 있어요. 자헤이라 님의 명입니다. 문라이즈 타워로 가는 길을 안전하게 밝혀줄 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 8165fc69-f9b4-3d32-e6cc-5ff29082cf68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Harpers_Event_ShowHavenLocation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:8165fc69-f9b4-3d32-e6cc-5ff29082cf68
msgctxt "h098c4c77g2b13g4863g8dd6g4db145d9df17"
msgid ""
"Stay close, and be wary of the shadows. I'll mark your map, should the way "
"be lost."
msgstr "바짝 붙어요. 그리고 그림자를 조심해요. 지도에 표시해 줄테니, 길을 잃지 마시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 8528bc4e-3d10-bdb2-060e-1b8f01408703
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:8528bc4e-3d10-bdb2-060e-1b8f01408703
msgctxt "h138b3273ga85cg463dgb810g0a06ebb4bfb6"
msgid "I've merely heeded my calling, friend."
msgstr "날 부르는 소리는 못들었는데 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85971a90-0c71-e9f6-9a23-dc652872a4d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_GiveMoonlantern(0) = False
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:85971a90-0c71-e9f6-9a23-dc652872a4d8
msgctxt "hd4069a2dgd2bdg4ed6gb4ccgdae94a2bf2f6"
msgid "Sorry. I don't have it anymore."
msgstr "미안한데. 내가 안 갖고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 921a6b4a-6d6b-05ed-8350-e6c9fcd81cb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:921a6b4a-6d6b-05ed-8350-e6c9fcd81cb1
msgctxt "hcd51daccg4d08g4d5eg8e89gaf9d52384087"
msgid ""
"Of which there have been many, I assure you. I am glad you've broken free."
msgstr "그런 일들이 수도 없이 벌어졌지. 내가 잘 알아. 세뇌에서 벗어났다니 다행이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 97b147e6-541b-7e01-c05f-e13ff0b7c397
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:97b147e6-541b-7e01-c05f-e13ff0b7c397
msgctxt "h8db8ad50g6258g4789gb5e0g81ef0e6f2abe"
msgid "Breathe easy, then - you are a captive no longer."
msgstr "긴장 푸시오. 더는 포로가 아니니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 9a7ea458-dc16-72df-8d47-98256de5eec7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:9a7ea458-dc16-72df-8d47-98256de5eec7
msgctxt "haff6a06dgc922g44d0g96f8gd0d21a03ef45"
msgid "Then it's time you shed your bonds and joined a righteous cause."
msgstr "그럼, 이제 그 속박에서 벗어나 정의의 편에 합류할 때가 된 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 9ad6fc8e-98c5-091b-64a9-e129a837ed42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:9ad6fc8e-98c5-091b-64a9-e129a837ed42
msgctxt "h3072fe51g5b49g4bd4g946bg267291cdf453"
msgid ""
"An inn, at first glance - but also a safe haven, free from the curse's "
"tendrils, or so it's been promised."
msgstr "겉보기엔 그저 여관이지만, 안식처이기도 해. 저주의 마수로부터 안전한 곳이지. 적어도 난 그렇게 들었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 9e366654-3ac7-ecfb-003a-9dc5eb6513c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:9e366654-3ac7-ecfb-003a-9dc5eb6513c2
msgctxt "h1d6a732bgc5a2g46c6g8c9cg4a1108a6c6e0"
msgid "Examine the corpse. The lantern is yours to take."
msgstr "시체를 뒤져보시오. 등불을 챙겨야 할 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e4efaf0-c4bc-3298-cc70-69cd0054523e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:9e4efaf0-c4bc-3298-cc70-69cd0054523e
msgctxt "h5cb258aeg995bg4ce7gb44agec75b0aadf3c"
msgid "I will make my way there in my own time."
msgstr "때가 되면 알아서 가도록 할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f9faf6e-3d4f-02de-1978-297ac0f5700f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:9f9faf6e-3d4f-02de-1978-297ac0f5700f
msgctxt "h0d952029gd1afg4af8gb4bdgcecbabf7af07"
msgid "I'm not one of them. They took me prisoner."
msgstr "난 광신도들 편이 아니야. 놈들이 날 포로로 잡았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2cd1e41-93ad-7c41-1e31-7c86c24a5c83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:a2cd1e41-93ad-7c41-1e31-7c86c24a5c83
msgctxt "h18ed1844gbce4g4a3cg9211gcfdf2ac46493"
msgid "<i>Attack the woman.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a4576932-3000-e29d-189b-451d7a32f120
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:a4576932-3000-e29d-189b-451d7a32f120
msgctxt "he2a43f7dgaebcg46dfg9001gbd9db11202e0"
msgid "I meant to infiltrate the cult. You've ruined the mission."
msgstr "교단에 잠입하려 했는데. 네가 다 망쳤군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = ad267943-a7fd-cc94-81d7-6f38476ab0bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:ad267943-a7fd-cc94-81d7-6f38476ab0bf
msgctxt "hf6fa01e1g9964g4f80ga6e9gc4baa3ff2630"
msgid "Another wretch among many. And another kill for my list."
msgstr "시덥잖은 잡놈들 중 하나였군. 또 한 명 죽어나가게 생겼네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = b517b98c-5e0d-0010-175a-7f67f35ac02d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:b517b98c-5e0d-0010-175a-7f67f35ac02d
msgctxt "hba038726g5a9cg433bga0b2g2e07769dc610"
msgid "Incredible. A light that chases away even the deepest shadows."
msgstr "굉장하군. 가장 짙고 어두운 그림자마저도 몰아내는 빛이라니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba6c5453-515f-543a-28af-ab0e3cf60032
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:ba6c5453-515f-543a-28af-ab0e3cf60032
msgctxt "h2e693521ga91eg4ea4gbac8gc85186fd9829"
msgid "How about I just kill you and keep the lantern for myself?"
msgstr "그냥 널 죽이고 등불을 내가 갖는 게 나을 거 같은데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = be7c0465-4bfe-ed0e-65f5-36377d89f951
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:be7c0465-4bfe-ed0e-65f5-36377d89f951
msgctxt "hdfcede61g573cg4037gaf8dg1815432a5f65"
msgid "A prisoner? Of course - and you would not be the first."
msgstr "포로라고? 그럼, 그렇지. 당신이 처음도 아니고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = c5665f75-fbf4-29bb-b740-fb3a498dbd35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_GiveMoonlantern(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:c5665f75-fbf4-29bb-b740-fb3a498dbd35
msgctxt "h8e508e48g82a3g4087gb7dbg0405654f631b"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "고마워요. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c620914e-caee-0ca6-04e0-1cafaac09e1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - UND_DuergarCamp_HarperPin_HistoryPassed(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Factions_Knows_Harpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:c620914e-caee-0ca6-04e0-1cafaac09e1e
msgctxt "h3dccb71dg4d14g43e9gb467gc63b8ec1fbdc"
msgid ""
"*You notice a pin on the woman's chest, identical to the one you found in "
"Grymforge. She is a Harper.*"
msgstr "*당신은 여자의 가슴팍에 있는 핀이 그림포지에서 찾은 것과 똑같다는 것을 알아차립니다. 그녀는 하퍼입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = cc057c66-ae8c-02a7-f64a-81727c786189
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:cc057c66-ae8c-02a7-f64a-81727c786189
msgctxt "hd5f62f2ag917eg4f07g8f6cge6971acadd6a"
msgid "You must rest. Come - I will take you to Last Light."
msgstr "휴식이 필요하겠군. 따라오시오. 최후의 빛으로 데려가 줄테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = d1fdd024-8847-9bd0-7b86-eacd4621181d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Harpers_Event_ShowHavenLocation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:d1fdd024-8847-9bd0-7b86-eacd4621181d
msgctxt "hb8204bbcg40f4g43d1g8a3dg186761ee19b1"
msgid ""
"Then permit me to mark your map. We will await, for when you are at your "
"most weary."
msgstr "그럼 당신 지도에 위치를 표시해 주겠소. 거기서 기다릴테니, 심신이 피로해지면 찾아와요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = d47e2bbe-b2f1-b64d-a819-e9b84c0f1a40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:d47e2bbe-b2f1-b64d-a819-e9b84c0f1a40
msgctxt "h8fdddbbdg1fe6g4f19gadf5g9f344acf8ae4"
msgid ""
"But it will not slay the creatures that emerge from the darkness. Be "
"vigilant 'til the last."
msgstr "하지만 그게 어둠 속에서 튀어나오는 괴물들까지 처리해주진 않을 테니, 끝까지 경계를 늦추지 마시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d510601f-1166-dd43-45c4-07adaef96c3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:d510601f-1166-dd43-45c4-07adaef96c3d
msgctxt "hd17d69e6g3ff9g41f3g9fa6ga0c877ef4c1d"
msgid "I succumbed to their temptations. You gave me an opportunity to escape."
msgstr "난 그들의 유혹에 굴복했었지. 네가 나에게 탈출할 기회를 줬어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = de64771c-de1a-faf8-d041-7297c3c56854
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Factions_Knows_Harpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:de64771c-de1a-faf8-d041-7297c3c56854
msgctxt "h8473dcd7g88c9g4f3cg8e5cg9fb15f78e8b9"
msgid ""
"*The pin the woman wears is familiar to you. She belongs to the Harpers, a "
"covert organisation dedicated to freedom and balance.*"
msgstr "*여자가 차고 있는 핀이 눈에 익습니다. 그녀는 자유와 균형에 헌신하는 비밀 조직, 하퍼의 일원입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e02e38cc-6c0b-6bb3-30b1-95736dc87462
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasDriderMoonlantern(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:e02e38cc-6c0b-6bb3-30b1-95736dc87462
msgctxt "h631a7e91g67d6g4e34g99cfge6b3e02d799c"
msgid "Lead on, then."
msgstr "앞장서, 그럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e3c14e06-7f39-fe7f-2765-5e61118b45eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:e3c14e06-7f39-fe7f-2765-5e61118b45eb
msgctxt "h2e555ac4g6dbag4941gaee8g697b1174b9d9"
msgid ""
"*The lantern flickers ever so briefly, and you hear a slight twitter - or "
"perhaps it's simply your imagination.*"
msgstr "*등불이 아주 짧게 깜빡입니다, 그리고 약하게 지저귀는 소리가 들립니다, 어쩌면 단순히 당신의 착각일지도 모릅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = ea0a7152-7b69-01a4-9ad2-2bc95102c03c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_GainedAccess = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:ea0a7152-7b69-01a4-9ad2-2bc95102c03c
msgctxt "h0398d368gbd53g4cbfgbd84gf6beeab768b3"
msgid "You. Don't move a godsdamned muscle."
msgstr "너. 그 망할 근육 하나라도 움직이지 마라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = f5aa7a81-1475-0c3d-680e-a6f7c149471c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAttackHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:f5aa7a81-1475-0c3d-680e-a6f7c149471c
msgctxt "ha9449ea6g9d15g4632g8af5ga72dd9c44ee8"
msgid "A lie, clear as the Chionthar's waters. And for that, you will bleed."
msgstr "거짓말, 치온타르 강물 속만큼이나 뻔하군. 피로써 대가를 치러라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f89c9d83-e77f-862a-909c-b2ca1791471b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#.      - SHADOWHEART_ENEMYOFSHARPATH(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperRanger_001_AfterAmbush:f89c9d83-e77f-862a-909c-b2ca1791471b
msgctxt "hdffae8acg4d6dg4764ga856ged445b589d3a"
msgid "My goddess protects me. I'll find my own way there."
msgstr "여신님께서 날 보호하신다. 알아서 찾아갈 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 0bcf8b61-d3e8-8ba9-7795-bb64a74be850
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AfterAmbush:0bcf8b61-d3e8-8ba9-7795-bb64a74be850
msgctxt "h851b5ce0ge331g4aedg8796gbefa1833496a"
msgid "Take the lantern off the corpse. I doubt it will mind."
msgstr "시체에서 랜턴을 가져가세요. 놈은 신경 쓰지 않을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 41f15183-fc06-f2a7-d95b-4976b0c696fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AfterAmbush:41f15183-fc06-f2a7-d95b-4976b0c696fe
msgctxt "hb3872500g8e47g495dgaf0dg8e448ddbf91e"
msgid "Impressive - you've a way with words."
msgstr "인상적이군요. 정말 대단한 말솜씨였어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 5e05077f-0d04-1fb0-e93c-b8c42bec869a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AfterAmbush:5e05077f-0d04-1fb0-e93c-b8c42bec869a
msgctxt "h662e35cfgc4d9g4f77gb492g41ce1482f17d"
msgid "A battle I won't soon forget. And in such favoured company, no less."
msgstr "결코 잊지 못할 전투였습니다. 게다가 이렇게 훌륭한 전우들까지, 맙소사."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 8fdea777-fb27-d64e-3319-9cbc0ea2ff1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AfterAmbush:8fdea777-fb27-d64e-3319-9cbc0ea2ff1e
msgctxt "h810cadc1g4377g41c6g8248g38c9781f807c"
msgid "Go ahead, examine the drider. The lantern's there for the taking."
msgstr "가서 드라이더를 살펴보세요. 놈에게서 등불을 찾으실 수 있을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = c4500a74-2134-95fb-8dc8-bf492157da6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AtAmbush_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_AfterAmbush:c4500a74-2134-95fb-8dc8-bf492157da6b
msgctxt "hc727c199gd4c1g4d10g8688ge0780eda6d4c"
msgid "Take the lantern off the corpse. I doubt it will mind."
msgstr "시체에서 랜턴을 가져가세요. 놈은 신경 쓰지 않을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 01d42d98-db80-4cd0-9104-323cf8a94018
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_General_HarperScout_000_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:01d42d98-db80-4cd0-9104-323cf8a94018
msgctxt "h26579146g5c58g462agba81gfc495e8d0e16"
msgid "'Last Light', indeed. Savour it while you can."
msgstr "과연 '최후의 빛'이야. 즐길 수 있을 때 즐기도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 17482b41-4856-6c7e-68f9-0b77514527db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_General_HarperScout_000_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersWaitingAtBridge = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_General_HarperScout_000_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:17482b41-4856-6c7e-68f9-0b77514527db
msgctxt "h4dd41f8bg06a7g4482g99e7gb3e273cc9948"
msgid ""
"Listen - if you want to reach Moonrise, you're going to need help. And I "
"know where you'll find it."
msgstr "잘 들어, 문라이즈에 가고 싶다면 넌 도움이 필요할거야. 그리고 그 도움을 찾을 수 있는 곳을 알고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 2334a306-ad58-4695-9e1c-66d2776d88a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Alert = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_General_HarperScout_000_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:2334a306-ad58-4695-9e1c-66d2776d88a7
msgctxt "hb4ca12e9g12a4g4110ga93fg6e785e89dcd5"
msgid ""
"The shadows are getting bolder. I don't know if we can repel another attack."
msgstr "그림자가 점점 더 진해지고 있어. 또 다른 공격을 막을 수 있을지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 31299956-7c48-80c4-5f88-5b269059fd12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:31299956-7c48-80c4-5f88-5b269059fd12
msgctxt "ha49ff862gc814g433cgabc9g2e56dac58a99"
msgid ""
"You're going to seize that lantern - and I'm going to help you. Just say the "
"word."
msgstr "네가 그 등불을 빼앗아야 해. 내가 도와줄게. 말만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 4a69f54e-6ea0-9eee-4405-be2dc1b3ff8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:4a69f54e-6ea0-9eee-4405-be2dc1b3ff8a
msgctxt "h9d033646gedc5g489eg95f0g1957fb800495"
msgid ""
"I guess you don't need my help after all. Though something tells me I'll be "
"needing yours."
msgstr "결국 내 도움은 필요 없겠네. 그래도 도움이 될만한 게 있다면 도와줄테니 말해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 59374740-be2d-9342-fbdf-b399c273d043
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersLearnMissedCaravan = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:59374740-be2d-9342-fbdf-b399c273d043
msgctxt "h3eb0a2ceg0233g4703g8ef3g0bbfd8ad9049"
msgid "You're too late - I've encountered the convoy, led by a drider."
msgstr "너무 늦게 왔군. 우린 이미 드라이더가 이끄는 호송대와 마주쳤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 72245374-3590-3d07-b5ba-98d50b3ab4bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_General_HarperScout_000_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_General_HarperScout_000_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:72245374-3590-3d07-b5ba-98d50b3ab4bd
msgctxt "h23682654g8e65g47dfga594gc199dc270d74"
msgid "Your time to shine, friend."
msgstr "빛날 시간이야, 친구."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 778a2266-a0eb-d355-c538-7132a3561a22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_StartedAmbushQuestWithHarpers = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_StartHarpersAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:778a2266-a0eb-d355-c538-7132a3561a22
msgctxt "hc513ba0bg7e7eg422cg9c1dga45c1cb3d68f"
msgid "Let's take on that convoy. You lead, I follow."
msgstr "호송대가 있는 곳으로 가자. 안내해, 따라갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 83192818-5f36-7cff-a1cd-13f8eba3e890
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:83192818-5f36-7cff-a1cd-13f8eba3e890
msgctxt "he44cb24bg7eabg497bga354gdee5b6515806"
msgid ""
"Hells - and you survived? A drider's no joke. Especially in these lands."
msgstr "세상에, 게다가 살아남았고? 드라이더는 장난 아니야. 특히 이런 땅에서는."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = ae4ac666-29e0-5cb6-f8e0-2b06145691c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:ae4ac666-29e0-5cb6-f8e0-2b06145691c8
msgctxt "h746677fbg1effg4ba3g9289g252853601ff4"
msgid "But don't take long. We must strike while the iron is hot."
msgstr "하지만 오래 지체하지는 마. 철은 뜨거울 때 때려야 하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = b9da712a-6fcd-c531-2799-b2866893ea81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:b9da712a-6fcd-c531-2799-b2866893ea81
msgctxt "h14f19354g9c83g4061gaf39gb0c85d860567"
msgid ""
"Wonderful. I will mark your map, so you can find us, should you lose the way."
msgstr "좋아. 길을 잃으면 우리를 찾을 수 있도록, 지도에 표시해 줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d8ee90fe-208a-eeb6-39c0-616bc17cd69d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:d8ee90fe-208a-eeb6-39c0-616bc17cd69d
msgctxt "hed6035f3g51b3g403bgab59gc1c2012db9bb"
msgid "I need time to prepare."
msgstr "준비할 시간이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = da37fa07-5642-4441-9c48-3e9f97c58b74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_General_HarperScout_000_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_General_HarperScout_000_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:da37fa07-5642-4441-9c48-3e9f97c58b74
msgctxt "h55871231gd6a7g4d4dg953cgd22b6726986c"
msgid "Good to see a friendly face."
msgstr "반가운 얼굴을 보니 좋군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = e1d1c180-1471-41a3-85dd-56450b0788ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Unprotected = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - HAV_General_HarperScout_000_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:e1d1c180-1471-41a3-85dd-56450b0788ba
msgctxt "hf4a9f937g4366g4b97gb9ecg245050ce7bfd"
msgid ""
"We're damn near helpless without Isobel. It's only a matter of time now."
msgstr "이소벨이 없으면 우린 빌어먹게도 거의 도움이 안돼. 이제는 그저 시간문제야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e23a92cd-bfd6-a3ac-77a8-d23ef9fce6ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_StartedAmbushQuestWithHarpers = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_StartHarpersAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:e23a92cd-bfd6-a3ac-77a8-d23ef9fce6ee
msgctxt "ha7395485gd642g453egacefg349bfff96c62"
msgid "Go on ahead. I'll catch up."
msgstr "먼저 가. 곧 따라갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = e5479f3a-b8d5-e658-3e14-08ea5bd8ee9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:e5479f3a-b8d5-e658-3e14-08ea5bd8ee9f
msgctxt "hedb257c9g240eg4d4aga5dfg3804e58dd647"
msgid "Sure, why not? I'll mark your map."
msgstr "물론이지, 왜 안 되겠어? 지도에 표시해줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = e78f74ca-47b6-f6a5-28aa-aa2dbc6f1d0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_General_HarperScout_000_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:e78f74ca-47b6-f6a5-28aa-aa2dbc6f1d0d
msgctxt "h24db2edfg87ceg4223gaafag6e67e3424650"
msgid "All or nothing. That's the bottom line."
msgstr "모 아니면 도. 이게 바로 결론이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = ec903b2c-03be-22e6-7c4f-79fa2223963e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:ec903b2c-03be-22e6-7c4f-79fa2223963e
msgctxt "hef4d7965g6dfdg45ebg985age6db92e6b7c8"
msgid ""
"Fair enough. But try not to dally - that lantern's your key to survival."
msgstr "알겠어. 하지만 너무 여유부리지는 마. 그 등불은 네 생존의 열쇠니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = f9425207-fc71-97e6-4ad8-790de5ba71af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:f9425207-fc71-97e6-4ad8-790de5ba71af
msgctxt "hd7621897g9039g4b63gbe50gdf3d23dcf1fc"
msgid ""
"There's a cultist convoy that passes each day. It carries a lantern that "
"burns the curse away."
msgstr "매일 지나가는 광신도 호송대가 있어. 그들이 갖고 다니는 등불은 저주를 태워서 쫓아버리지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = fc0a8d06-aee1-e6ea-572c-25252cc37ed7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_General_HarperScout_000_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersWaitingAtBridge = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:fc0a8d06-aee1-e6ea-572c-25252cc37ed7
msgctxt "h9aadb6cbg19a8g4d8cga60aga364467f00c9"
msgid ""
"If you're to make it to Moonrise, we need to ambush that convoy and take "
"their lantern."
msgstr "문라이즈에 도달하려면, 저 호송대에 매복해서 등불을 빼앗아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = fda82ef2-10f8-08e8-7a43-0a2bea451355
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarperScout_PreparingForAmbush:fda82ef2-10f8-08e8-7a43-0a2bea451355
msgctxt "ha196878agbab4g4805ga4edg8c7aae8a1c69"
msgid "Now let's move."
msgstr "이제 움직이자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Melee_000_AD_CombatStarts
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 34add1c4-425b-0d90-017e-ad2d3c3c1b59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Melee_000_AD_CombatStarts:34add1c4-425b-0d90-017e-ad2d3c3c1b59
msgctxt "h064afbb0g978dg4c86gafbagb81719f0cfe8"
msgid "Take out the drider - we need that lantern!"
msgstr "드라이더 놈을 처치해. 저 등불이 목표야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Melee_000_AD_DriderDies
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = d94116df-0f07-4ecc-bff3-26822831084e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Melee_000_AD_DriderDies:d94116df-0f07-4ecc-bff3-26822831084e
msgctxt "h4797f265geb43g4d62gb572gc25bf94b0544"
msgid "Big and ugly's down - grab the lantern!"
msgstr "추악한 괴물을 물리쳤다. 등불을 챙겨!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Melee_000_AD_DriderDropsLantern
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = adb13df8-fb96-40fb-9272-25a822a954b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Melee_000_AD_DriderDropsLantern:adb13df8-fb96-40fb-9272-25a822a954b8
msgctxt "h41bf5c82g9e3ag4305gb9bage8dc6551da46"
msgid "The lantern's free - grab it!"
msgstr "등불이다. 집어 들어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Melee_000_AD_LassandraDies
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = aceae4cd-3f19-4bdf-ba66-94468b0d1635
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Melee_000_AD_LassandraDies:aceae4cd-3f19-4bdf-ba66-94468b0d1635
msgctxt "hccb70165g31a5g4c20g91e9gcf6a27d1a600"
msgid "Lass! No!"
msgstr "라스! 안돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Melee_000_AD_PlayerTookLantern
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 9e59ab8f-2cfe-491f-80f2-b89811e19394
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Melee_000_AD_PlayerTookLantern:9e59ab8f-2cfe-491f-80f2-b89811e19394
msgctxt "hac89eb41g5cf8g453eg8586gee10821e45bd"
msgid "The cultist has the lantern - take them out!"
msgstr "광신도들이 등불을 갖고 있다. 놈들을 쓰러뜨려!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Melee_000_AD_TakesMoonlantern
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 6e3969b0-6eee-440f-a488-d85172fda7b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Melee_000_AD_TakesMoonlantern:6e3969b0-6eee-440f-a488-d85172fda7b1
msgctxt "h1b3452f6g766eg4a55ga546g0e67c9587b65"
msgid "I have the lantern! Let's finish this up and go home."
msgstr "등불을 손에 넣었다! 어서 마무리하고 돌아가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Ranger_000_AD_LassandraDies
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 74216240-5267-4371-bcff-2a9034121f7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_Harper_Ranger_000_AD_LassandraDies:74216240-5267-4371-bcff-2a9034121f7a
msgctxt "h714cb9e1gb891g4d08gbef3g7087b8fc842b"
msgid "No! Lassandra!"
msgstr "안돼! 라산드라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00621d65-47a8-4f67-9646-599b2d27e3c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. TagRule: SORCERER or WIZARD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:00621d65-47a8-4f67-9646-599b2d27e3c6
msgctxt "h2c7bfbcfg459dg4196gbc5bg2cf2939688a4"
msgid ""
"That lantern is mine - by order of the Absolute. Drop it, or I'll boil your "
"brain inside your skull."
msgstr "절대자의 명령에 따라 등불은 나의 것이다. 내놓아라, 안 그러면 네 그 뇌를 뇌수로 삶아 죽여주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03ef5221-8b82-f798-7cbc-ef5e8aed3e53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:03ef5221-8b82-f798-7cbc-ef5e8aed3e53
msgctxt "ha67bec7bg056ag4f88g9e18gb317325d11b0"
msgid ""
"<i>(Wave hands.)</i> There - you now carry the blessing of the Absolute. "
"You'll be safe."
msgstr "<i>(손을 휘젓는다.)</i> 자, 이제 네게 절대자의 축복이 함께함이니, 안전할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 04300055-14bb-32d1-7aaa-d02284f34b9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:04300055-14bb-32d1-7aaa-d02284f34b9e
msgctxt "h82494ec2g6583g4646g8937g501af3019d1f"
msgid "Now, let's see what we've got here..."
msgstr "자, 여기 우리가 얻어낸 걸 한번 볼까..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 05fd7f06-9257-0659-7170-1fa95134e339
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:05fd7f06-9257-0659-7170-1fa95134e339
msgctxt "h4474dc07g1c18g4590ga94bgd90e49d0f289"
msgid "<i>Attack!</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 07ece76d-3127-8b4b-5804-e12368d7dc42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:07ece76d-3127-8b4b-5804-e12368d7dc42
msgctxt "h2d27666egbcccg4ba9g9c54gcdafb0486e76"
msgid "You blessed them too, my Queen? Where is their lantern?"
msgstr "그들도 축복해주셨습니까, 여왕님? 그들의 등불은 어딨나이까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 0968340c-86a4-5da7-4e92-88d9240fa703
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_9 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:0968340c-86a4-5da7-4e92-88d9240fa703
msgctxt "hd75c6d7egac63g42d7g8d4bge39392d7d6a6"
msgid "You're not going anywhere. Attack!"
msgstr "네놈은 아무 데도 못 간다. 공격!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0e132e9e-952f-aabf-88bb-d4b226c82ebf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:0e132e9e-952f-aabf-88bb-d4b226c82ebf
msgctxt "h9445bd34gc669g408dga786geefe9b206d3b"
msgid ""
"I have tested my mind and body beyond to its absolute limits - I do not fear "
"the darkness."
msgstr "난 나의 정신과 몸을 극도의 한계까지 시험해봤다. 어둠은 두렵지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ed53263-9e08-761b-8f72-694887a34f8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:0ed53263-9e08-761b-8f72-694887a34f8a
msgctxt "h265ade03gc787g4ca6ga15fg63d665ac78e5"
msgid "No higher forces protect me - I survived by my own tenacity."
msgstr "날 수호하는 지고한 힘 따위는 존재하지 않는다. 내 스스로의 힘으로 견뎌냈지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 136ecd9a-370a-9ebc-7634-1fb6d73e8f92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:136ecd9a-370a-9ebc-7634-1fb6d73e8f92
msgctxt "h31c39bd0g6255g4ab2g9574gb61a94923cd8"
msgid "No, we will keep your gift and drive this false one back into the dark!"
msgstr "아니, 우리가 너의 선물을 갖고 이 가짜를 다시 어둠 속으로 몰아넣겠다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 194352bf-4cdd-7171-8063-12ff5c067dbf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:194352bf-4cdd-7171-8063-12ff5c067dbf
msgctxt "h994b8455g322dg47c9gb365gac3be2e0a0e5"
msgid "NO! THEY WILL NOT GO INTO THE DARK!"
msgstr "<b>어둠에! 들지 말라! 하시니!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 1e0cf3d6-268b-baec-57e2-7a56f677fc35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:1e0cf3d6-268b-baec-57e2-7a56f677fc35
msgctxt "ha905d91dge80cg4130ga9c9g08a563745792"
msgid ""
"She has blessed the lantern's light. It is the Absolute who protects us from "
"the shadows."
msgstr "그분께서 등불에 은총을 내리셨다. 절대자께서 우리를 그림자로부터 보호하신다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 200dfc0c-783b-f229-016c-ce83571a4406
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_6 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:200dfc0c-783b-f229-016c-ce83571a4406
msgctxt "he81c5bf4ge7bfg4e3fgba2fgb1eceabdce8e"
msgid "We'll wait for your signal. Go!"
msgstr "신호를 기다릴게. 가!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2013d178-ec35-e00c-7201-c42186e68b68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(3) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and !SHADOWHEART_ENEMYOFSHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:2013d178-ec35-e00c-7201-c42186e68b68
msgctxt "hee82b496gcbe8g41abgb33egad49d3c3bdbf"
msgid "Lady Shar protects me - I do not belong to your Queen."
msgstr "샤께서 날 지켜주시니, 나는 네 여왕의 종이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2013d178-ec35-e00c-7201-c42186e68b68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(3) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EVIL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:2013d178-ec35-e00c-7201-c42186e68b68
msgctxt "hd19bd316g6a37g47f3gac71g413d2ca37517"
msgid "My god does not fear the shadows - I  do not belong to your Queen."
msgstr "나의 신께서는 어둠을 두려워하지 않으시니, 난 네 여왕의 종이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2013d178-ec35-e00c-7201-c42186e68b68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(3) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_NEUTRAL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:2013d178-ec35-e00c-7201-c42186e68b68
msgctxt "h88f13975g2499g4b1dg8371g88bc1fd52558"
msgid "My god's favour protected me - I do not belong to your Queen."
msgstr "내 신의 은총이 날 보호했지. 난 네 여왕의 종이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2013d178-ec35-e00c-7201-c42186e68b68
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(3) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GOOD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:2013d178-ec35-e00c-7201-c42186e68b68
msgctxt "h38a84295g7f67g49a7gab0fg59dff01e02c7"
msgid "I am not one of <i>hers - </i>divine light guides my footfall."
msgstr "난 <i>그분</i>의 신도가 아니다. 성스러운 빛이 내 발 닿는 곳을 인도하시니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2bd307b3-2774-fc14-a471-af021e3010c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:2bd307b3-2774-fc14-a471-af021e3010c3
msgctxt "h491ce88ag1534g4452gbc4egf6cbebd02cdc"
msgid ""
"I am both a True Soul and a cleric. I've blessed you with the power of the "
"Absolute - you'll be safe."
msgstr "나는 참된 영혼이자 클레릭이니. 너를 절대자님의 이름으로 축복하겠다. 너는 안전할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 2be62ad4-3c35-ff89-b1c8-5142b640162d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:2be62ad4-3c35-ff89-b1c8-5142b640162d
msgctxt "h52c998f2gec07g4eb5g8129g4cfe544e524e"
msgid "Silence! The Absolute's favoured are speaking."
msgstr "침묵해라! 절대자의 은총을 받은 자가 말씀하고 계신다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2c64a1f9-6baf-e74a-4ce5-7a6b4ff3ca50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:2c64a1f9-6baf-e74a-4ce5-7a6b4ff3ca50
msgctxt "h3d6ee606g5ffeg45f6g8bf8gcf5a28a17941"
msgid ""
"<i>Vale, idiotae! </i>There - you now carry the blessing of the Absolute. "
"You'll be safe."
msgstr "<i>발레, 이디오타이! </i> 자 - 이제 네게 절대자의 축복이 함께함이니, 안전할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 2d81c0f8-93a4-9430-8613-52d6da350a4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_ToldHarpersAboutMoonlantern = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_8 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:2d81c0f8-93a4-9430-8613-52d6da350a4e
msgctxt "hc405b106gd115g4514g8f42g1c3f2d935262"
msgid ""
"The plan is simple - draw them close with your tadpole, we attack from "
"above, and you collect the lantern once they're dead."
msgstr "계획은 간단해. 네 올챙이로 가까이 유인해서, 우리는 위에서 공격한 후에, 그들이 죽으면 넌 등불을 챙겨."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e026f61-1233-23e3-47d7-f5cc00c86cd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:2e026f61-1233-23e3-47d7-f5cc00c86cd6
msgctxt "h10d55d2bg27b3g4373g9ad0ga2d2ccd0a07e"
msgid ""
"<i>Securus! </i>There - you now carry the blessing of the Absolute. You'll "
"be safe."
msgstr "<i>세쿠루스! </i> 자, 이제 너는 절대자의 축복과 함께하니, 너는 안전할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 2e70f194-bfcd-254c-0923-d2f54420fd5e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_5 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:2e70f194-bfcd-254c-0923-d2f54420fd5e
msgctxt "h062c4eb9g90d1g4175ga07fg539d57d50ea8"
msgid "You're not leaving with them."
msgstr "그냥 저렇게 보내면 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 2e752959-dcb7-69cf-121a-37b923281f12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:2e752959-dcb7-69cf-121a-37b923281f12
msgctxt "hee217d20g7a64g4df5g8925gfb3393127911"
msgid ""
"We bring more to your church every day, my Queen. Your followers are legion."
msgstr "교단에 더 많은 이들을 매일같이 데려갑니다. 여왕이시여. 그들은 군단과도 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 2f6dfbc3-38b7-88ac-d138-525a319e8946
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_5 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:2f6dfbc3-38b7-88ac-d138-525a319e8946
msgctxt "h455a2bc0ga2dag4baeg8f67g44f833a2ef56"
msgid "That was spectacular! I was sure you were dead."
msgstr "정말 훌륭했습니다! 분명 죽은 목숨일 거라 생각했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Brawler Vez
#. NodeID = 309e0973-eff7-ad21-5bd7-142baa182fa4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_DriderKillsGoblin = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:309e0973-eff7-ad21-5bd7-142baa182fa4
msgctxt "h0eac8c96g0916g4eefgb815ga92a89d6a6ef"
msgid "Huh? Argh!"
msgstr "허? 으아악!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32cdd503-e414-82c1-d151-30e9f025d75c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:32cdd503-e414-82c1-d151-30e9f025d75c
msgctxt "hc42f9abfg9f50g40dagad97g75ab7bce9cb3"
msgid "<i>Stay hidden, keep watching.</i>"
msgstr "<i>조용히 숨어서 더 지켜본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 3934584a-c33a-ec18-f33d-00ea7ec9655c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_8 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:3934584a-c33a-ec18-f33d-00ea7ec9655c
msgctxt "hd296bd38g9a8dg4ca3ga541g56f17251e060"
msgid "They're getting away - attack!"
msgstr "놈들이 떠나고 있다, 공격해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a24d1de-537c-ea1d-6b3a-008c171e929d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:3a24d1de-537c-ea1d-6b3a-008c171e929d
msgctxt "h80eee814gfb83g432ega7e6g1fb1424de4b4"
msgid "<b><i>ROAR.</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>크아아.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a24d1de-537c-ea1d-6b3a-008c171e929d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:3a24d1de-537c-ea1d-6b3a-008c171e929d
msgctxt "h14afd645g9110g4a0ega263g6a90912ef473"
msgid "<i>ROAR.</i>"
msgstr "<i>크아아.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c9cf8b1-a7f2-cd10-ef4d-7537c6156aac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Player_Knows_MoonlanternExists = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:3c9cf8b1-a7f2-cd10-ef4d-7537c6156aac
msgctxt "h504895aag6698g45cbgbbe9g63dbf628eb34"
msgid "Lantern? Is that what protects you out here?"
msgstr "등불? 그게 널 보호해주는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ff6978f-7d4c-4a16-95c7-14c14c679879
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:3ff6978f-7d4c-4a16-95c7-14c14c679879
msgctxt "h051c299agac08g4f67g961eg205188eda86e"
msgid ""
"I know dangerous terrains - you'll be fine if you stick to the path. Trust "
"me."
msgstr "난 위험한 지형에 대해 잘 알아. 길을 따라가면 안전할 거야. 나를 믿어. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 406cb7e3-3e97-ddb0-8eb7-0f183bfd96db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithCaravan = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithHarpers = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:406cb7e3-3e97-ddb0-8eb7-0f183bfd96db
msgctxt "hb487aeb9g8c71g4cfegb124g2ecc0716f3d3"
msgid "Never mind that, there's a gang of Harpers ready to ambush you."
msgstr "그건 신경 쓰지 마. 너희를 기습하려는 하퍼 무리가 숨어있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 40ac576c-1638-bf98-16e8-02f969b637f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_AvoidedCombat = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithCaravan = False
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithHarpers = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:40ac576c-1638-bf98-16e8-02f969b637f6
msgctxt "hae9e7e5dg1951g465eg9531g9691ea48e28b"
msgid "Follow close, little ones. Do not leave the light!"
msgstr "가까이 따라와라, 얘들아. 불빛을 떠나지 마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 4493e4e3-b015-7798-e5bc-1c3bd660b9e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_ToldHarpersAboutMoonlantern = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_9 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:4493e4e3-b015-7798-e5bc-1c3bd660b9e3
msgctxt "h789181f4g85fcg4e1eg870bg956f9fa93c0d"
msgid ""
"If you can distract them with that tadpole of yours, we can attack from up "
"here. It'll be over before they know it, and then you can collect the "
"lantern."
msgstr ""
"만약 당신이 그 올챙이로 주의를 끌어 준다면, 우린 여기 위에서 공격할 수 있을 거야. 놈들이 알아채기도 전에 끝날 거고, 당신은 등불을 "
"가져가면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 45179d2a-9d07-fabf-86ec-cce7557e53a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersStartFollowingDrider = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_AvoidedCombat = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:45179d2a-9d07-fabf-86ec-cce7557e53a8
msgctxt "hd79d9004g2d24g444cgbe25gd7413ad4c810"
msgid "They will follow close. Do not leave the light!"
msgstr "가까이 따라붙을 지어다. 빛에서 멀어지지 말도록!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 475b6ff6-8e0b-c076-9d5b-92b063e8d411
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:475b6ff6-8e0b-c076-9d5b-92b063e8d411
msgctxt "h0bf033b9g3398g456dga5fcg143e3e8988d4"
msgid "<i>Try to blend into the shadows, letting them pass you by.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그림자 속으로 섞여 들어가, 그들이 지나쳐 가게 한다</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b694cbe-0c43-57ad-633c-89089b434d12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(3) = False
#.      - SORCERER(3) = False
#.      - WIZARD(3) = False
#.      - BARD(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:4b694cbe-0c43-57ad-633c-89089b434d12
msgctxt "hf15ac46dgdc55g46f6ga3ecg6d42cb3bcb36"
msgid "The Absolute has blessed you. You will be safe."
msgstr "절대자께서 널 축복하셨다. 넌 안전할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 4bf927ac-de6a-7480-a32f-b251925f2a1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:4bf927ac-de6a-7480-a32f-b251925f2a1b
msgctxt "ha5ae56f0g4a9dg4daegb104gd0ffd14b3e0b"
msgid ""
"I almost pity them, walking into all that. But you did what you needed to."
msgstr "저 속으로 걸어 들어가다니 거의 불쌍할 지경이군. 하지만 필요한 일을 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 505d5737-9cf5-ad91-0b0e-9db0d4f0b63d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:505d5737-9cf5-ad91-0b0e-9db0d4f0b63d
msgctxt "h3fa9ddedg5176g4b06ga18bg724334cafccd"
msgid "They don't know? Our Queen told them nothing?"
msgstr "모른단 말입니까? 우리의 여왕께서 아무것도 알려주시지 않았나이까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 52c5e458-5923-e532-9a97-4358753d2404
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:52c5e458-5923-e532-9a97-4358753d2404
msgctxt "h5d4973b5gbc3eg4d41g8b06g6ab0230d2314"
msgid "<i>Attack the drider.</i>"
msgstr "<i>드라이더를 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5312f98e-5239-719e-7eb0-9e4b0c6c30e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:5312f98e-5239-719e-7eb0-9e4b0c6c30e1
msgctxt "h1cd70beeg50bdg48ccg99d1g72228ec47eb5"
msgid "Or I could kill you and take that light."
msgstr "아니면 그냥 널 죽이고 그 빛을 빼앗아갈 수도 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 541cbef0-52ed-b854-031c-49644bb56e0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = False
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(3) = False
#.      - DROWELF(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:541cbef0-52ed-b854-031c-49644bb56e0d
msgctxt "hd4849199ge005g4ee8g980ag16f71bd69f12"
msgid "The Absolute wants you to go. Now!"
msgstr "절대자께서 가라고 명하신다. 당장!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 544e8346-5ccc-a52b-98ad-008076239304
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:544e8346-5ccc-a52b-98ad-008076239304
msgctxt "h1c727badg2d73g411ag8818g6b3851491954"
msgid "<i>Signal the Harpers to attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>하퍼들에게 공격 신호를 보낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 54cfa8c4-9ae1-d0cc-75e7-605f2f20be71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:54cfa8c4-9ae1-d0cc-75e7-605f2f20be71
msgctxt "ha3992eb9gf3cag4b4eg95a6g5999d889edd2"
msgid ""
"*Your minds connect and you hear a voice whispering to you. The Absolute? Or "
"just the echoes of his fractured mind, reverberating in the darkness?*"
msgstr "*정신이 이어지고 속삭이는 목소리가 들립니다. 절대자? 아니면 단지 그의 분열된 정신의 메아리가 어둠 속에 울려퍼지는 걸까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 557ecb77-43f9-5ca5-9137-30b8cf284041
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:557ecb77-43f9-5ca5-9137-30b8cf284041
msgctxt "h5aa98a2ag46e5g4a8cg8232gf9bc8a0ea7da"
msgid ""
"Simply shadows. Cursed, hungry shadows, trying to grab the living. And they "
"are getting stronger."
msgstr "말 그대로 그림자다. 저주받고 굶주려서 산 것들을 잡아채려고 들지. 그리고 더욱 강해지고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56997a2d-0993-0b7e-f593-79cc0f7c80d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:56997a2d-0993-0b7e-f593-79cc0f7c80d4
msgctxt "h4f845562g88a5g4adbga1b7g1850e6e16a77"
msgid "<i>Try to fade into the background until they pass.</i>"
msgstr "<i>뒷쪽으로 숨어들어 지나갈 때까지 기다린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 56bf708d-b67c-4849-513a-7445f9cd41fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_5 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:56bf708d-b67c-4849-513a-7445f9cd41fc
msgctxt "he510327agada4g4a8fg87fdg13de1f7ddb66"
msgid "You're not leaving with them."
msgstr "그냥 저렇게 보내면 안 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 5733f331-86a4-651d-defb-8fa2cb6f79da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_6 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:5733f331-86a4-651d-defb-8fa2cb6f79da
msgctxt "h46413d4ag2be8g4fcbgbaadg3afd251a9300"
msgid "The hells are you waiting for? Attack!"
msgstr "대체 뭘 기다리고 있는 거야? 공격!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5bf50db9-3684-0949-7c2a-e7e36b1f2d31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = False
#.      - SORCERER(3) = False
#.      - WIZARD(3) = False
#.      - MONK(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:5bf50db9-3684-0949-7c2a-e7e36b1f2d31
msgctxt "h78e6f0e6gc743g4eb2gb1eag0de955023822"
msgid "The Absolute has asked me to carry the lantern. Hand it over."
msgstr "절대자께서 내가 등불을 가지라고 하셨다. 이리 넘겨."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 5ce87c4a-5b8f-fff6-a827-bb2da34d31ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:5ce87c4a-5b8f-fff6-a827-bb2da34d31ab
msgctxt "hc013ea52g1068g4c93g8ee1g6496a86aba60"
msgid "Heretics! Blasphemers in the dark!"
msgstr "이단자! 모독자 놈들이 숨어있다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 60e6e71b-2c42-b095-4f38-f8e747fe330d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_7 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:60e6e71b-2c42-b095-4f38-f8e747fe330d
msgctxt "hdd595b73g593bg4031g9a6cg9b30b6d2f007"
msgid "No - what are you doing?!"
msgstr "안돼, 뭐 하는 거야?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61831cd1-e16f-5734-be28-7ad5f7cf8f8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Player_Knows_NereToldAboutMoonlantern = True
#. TagRule: !(REALLY_DROWELF and REALLY_DROWHALFELF)
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:61831cd1-e16f-5734-be28-7ad5f7cf8f8d
msgctxt "hbe632db3g3eacg4b6eg97c5g5d392419780a"
msgid "I would use the drow Nere's lantern, but it broke."
msgstr "드로우 니어의 등불을 쓰려고 했는데, 망가졌다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61831cd1-e16f-5734-be28-7ad5f7cf8f8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Player_Knows_NereToldAboutMoonlantern = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:61831cd1-e16f-5734-be28-7ad5f7cf8f8d
msgctxt "h23560b42g85aeg4aa8g96b2g5f63e5a13ceb"
msgid "I would use True Soul Nere's lantern, but it broke."
msgstr "참된 영혼 니어의 등불을 쓰려고 했는데, 망가졌다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64db1015-cd96-c836-4d99-0000beef9de5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:64db1015-cd96-c836-4d99-0000beef9de5
msgctxt "he4bf6786g9048g43c0ga308g89eea2f2380a"
msgid "I am a guardian of nature - and in return nature protects me."
msgstr "난 자연의 수호자다. 그렇기에 자연 또한 나를 보호하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a74bdd6-7900-38e8-2ee3-555633485abf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:6a74bdd6-7900-38e8-2ee3-555633485abf
msgctxt "h439539fdg4c17g4d7fgb53eg2961125f6c72"
msgid "Protects us from what? What are the shadows, exactly?"
msgstr "무엇으로부터 보호한다고? 그림자는 정확히 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b323f29-e30b-c643-f173-ebed7e1893a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:6b323f29-e30b-c643-f173-ebed7e1893a5
msgctxt "h8ed17273gcd64g4e75g9d95gf885dc791c5e"
msgid "Navigating dangerous terrain is second nature to me."
msgstr "위험한 땅을 헤쳐나가는 건 내 천성이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6bcccd19-75f6-8ebf-6405-60f7a29bb015
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithCaravan = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithHarpers = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:6bcccd19-75f6-8ebf-6405-60f7a29bb015
msgctxt "hf7eb20d9g1445g4d71g9a56gbecd3edacb1b"
msgid "Thank you - let's go."
msgstr "고맙군, 가자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e9d6135-fe71-71a1-99ed-570aa5a5a910
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:6e9d6135-fe71-71a1-99ed-570aa5a5a910
msgctxt "h77aaee71gde1eg4863g92f6gb387001be850"
msgid "With the aid of my mind and my magic, for I am a master of both."
msgstr "나의 정신력과 마법의 도움으로 살아남았지, 난 그 두 가지의 대가거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 70fe9b68-31c4-e8c5-dfb0-0b3da3d6eb1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:70fe9b68-31c4-e8c5-dfb0-0b3da3d6eb1c
msgctxt "ha858e07fg6ecfg46f4g9f26g7f43cb2abd61"
msgid "We will punish them for this blasphemy. We will make them scream!"
msgstr "우린 저들의 모독을 벌하겠습니다. 비명을 지르게 하겠습니다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 71f4ef0f-022f-9b0d-a3eb-71b25e676eee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:71f4ef0f-022f-9b0d-a3eb-71b25e676eee
msgctxt "h6544052dgf0afg4072gb019g8362fbf3e7a5"
msgid "Heretics. Blasphemers! Kill them all!"
msgstr "이단자. 모독자놈들! 전부 죽여버려라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7507407b-48b0-f413-a8ef-7d38b68c0ea1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:7507407b-48b0-f413-a8ef-7d38b68c0ea1
msgctxt "h42c9c94egc9fbg4662gb8efg9247a7e424bc"
msgid "<i>Emerge from the shadows and attack!</i>"
msgstr "<i>그림자로부터 뛰쳐나와 공격한다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 753872fa-a070-f804-1f75-198e9f63a465
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_ApplySneakingStatus = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:753872fa-a070-f804-1f75-198e9f63a465
msgctxt "ha50d01bdg58d0g4b55g896dg7576450470ef"
msgid "We will carry your light, Majesty. We are happy to serve..."
msgstr "당신의 등불을 지니겠나이다, 신이시여. 섬길 수 있어 기쁩니다..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 78179ef6-b5a2-45fe-204d-6e5cfa13630f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:78179ef6-b5a2-45fe-204d-6e5cfa13630f
msgctxt "h8b2ce52ag1f5dg4212ga88bg84a69d2228c0"
msgid "<i>Signal the Harpers to attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>하퍼들에게 공격 신호를 보낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 78397fb6-31ce-2e18-02be-844cbb744567
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:78397fb6-31ce-2e18-02be-844cbb744567
msgctxt "h3341046fgeaf9g46adg99bcg19537432b868"
msgid ""
"If we in the Underdark, I would split you open, drider. Leave before I "
"change my mind."
msgstr "여기가 언더다크였으면 네놈을 쪼개버렸을 것이다, 드라이더. 내 마음에 바뀌기 전에 떠나라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 78c6c3a7-4036-ba11-a89f-ae074ac289dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:78c6c3a7-4036-ba11-a89f-ae074ac289dd
msgctxt "h0ac9dfc3g8aa3g4e93ga90agbf9b6c4bbb87"
msgid "Heretics. Blasphemers! Kill them all!"
msgstr "이단자. 모독자놈들! 전부 죽여버려라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 79c11c78-22e1-a1e6-7f1f-f7a0abd34022
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_7 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:79c11c78-22e1-a1e6-7f1f-f7a0abd34022
msgctxt "h24ac71c0ga442g4c14ga494gbdef755d927d"
msgid "Don't let them escape! Harpers!"
msgstr "놈들이 빠져나가게 두지 마라! 하퍼들이여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = 7b891d1b-bae9-ea2e-4f61-0a981941b9f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:7b891d1b-bae9-ea2e-4f61-0a981941b9f9
msgctxt "hf71c7728g5c1fg4cf7gaec7ge53965511381"
msgid "We can't go without you - the shadows would tear us to pieces."
msgstr "당신 없이는 못 갑니다. 그림자가 우릴 토막낼 거예요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c01dd25-dde0-7a56-0e99-111d1e39c316
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:7c01dd25-dde0-7a56-0e99-111d1e39c316
msgctxt "h18c99f87g5521g4e3dg8dbbg30cf5d5eb99b"
msgid "Question me again, and I will drag you into the darkness - screaming."
msgstr "한 번만 더 의문을 표한다면, 그림자 속으로 끌고 가서 비명을 지르게 해 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c4d8c5b-1346-0d56-cb3d-ac21df72754a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DROWELF(3) = False
#.      - BARD(3) = False
#.      - ROGUE(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:7c4d8c5b-1346-0d56-cb3d-ac21df72754a
msgctxt "hc6e500cbga788g4918ga880gc005d94bdc55"
msgid "The Absolute guided me to you. She said I was to take yours."
msgstr "절대자께서 나를 네게 인도하셨다. 그분께서 네 것을 취하라고 하셨다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 7fa7d0c4-bfd9-3a33-3cd1-aebb0b850ade
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_5 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:7fa7d0c4-bfd9-3a33-3cd1-aebb0b850ade
msgctxt "ha8e93bb2gc76dg4e7dg8fafgf6ae79671ec5"
msgid "Into position. We'll follow your lead."
msgstr "모두 위치로. 네 신호를 기다릴게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 801c2f6d-7474-1238-e2a3-b69f7210e6e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:801c2f6d-7474-1238-e2a3-b69f7210e6e4
msgctxt "h688876c9gc9dbg45a3g8f70g379914a79f0a"
msgid "<i>Attack the drider.</i>"
msgstr "<i>드라이더를 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 80abcd01-cec9-6c33-0ead-9b640f541f5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:80abcd01-cec9-6c33-0ead-9b640f541f5c
msgctxt "h8085b6a3g5b22g4815g9305g0ae1a9822ad1"
msgid "Treachery! Blasphemers in the dark!"
msgstr "배신이다! 모독자 놈들이 어둠 속에 숨어있다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = 82a68a4c-92e1-c4fd-9cbc-a593ddd0e75e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:82a68a4c-92e1-c4fd-9cbc-a593ddd0e75e
msgctxt "hc2d71ea1gfc6ag4dacga9b6g8fac615a175f"
msgid "Enough! Stop!"
msgstr "됐어! 이제 그만!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8329edc6-f83f-bf27-8c65-c1e33d338fc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:8329edc6-f83f-bf27-8c65-c1e33d338fc6
msgctxt "h0f230f0cgd80ag4b6dgb293g72b73605aa0f"
msgid "<i>Clear your throat to make yourself known.</i>"
msgstr "<i>목을 가다듬고 정체를 알린다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 83616ce5-5f85-26e4-215a-7a410e0fd84c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_9 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:83616ce5-5f85-26e4-215a-7a410e0fd84c
msgctxt "h2b7a574bg4070g4f74gaaa9g3b51bd7a1a60"
msgid "What are you waiting for? Attack!"
msgstr "뭘 기다리는 거야? 공격!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Brawler Vez
#. NodeID = 846f803b-e02c-8f98-7bf6-e44e70047fd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:846f803b-e02c-8f98-7bf6-e44e70047fd8
msgctxt "h248edee4g51b3g4fceg8f0dga722545b35ef"
msgid "'Ere, web arse - something moved up there. Want me to drag it out?"
msgstr "잠깐, 거미줄 싸개! 저 위에 뭔가 움직였어. 끌어내 볼까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = 868235d9-106f-4efe-fbf6-f59881f8870b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_ToldHarpersAboutMoonlantern = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_7 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:868235d9-106f-4efe-fbf6-f59881f8870b
msgctxt "h646da492g4050g4b00g8e3cg18dae69033a3"
msgid ""
"The plan's simple: you draw the cultists' attention with your brain-bug, we "
"hit them hard and fast. Once they're down, you grab the lantern."
msgstr ""
"간단한 계획이야. 네 머리 속의 벌레로 이교도들의 관심을 끌고, 우리는 빠르고 강하게 공격한다. 그들이 쓰러지면, 넌 등불을 가져간다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = 87f47a96-3029-be88-a8e9-f00361a22cdb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:87f47a96-3029-be88-a8e9-f00361a22cdb
msgctxt "h340a289bgc8ceg469dgadc2g6baf7e5133a7"
msgid ""
"It's time to go, lantern bearer. The sooner we clear the dark, the better."
msgstr "이제 갈 시간이다, 등불 운반자. 어둠을 빨리 걷어내면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = 886c093b-7749-6ec0-0c76-5c99c5b42911
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_8 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:886c093b-7749-6ec0-0c76-5c99c5b42911
msgctxt "h944e481bgf325g4bc1g9741gdfc62a62f42f"
msgid "Go. Signal us when you're ready."
msgstr "가. 준비되면 신호를 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 89d35af3-c22f-7420-1a5e-92f56c775de8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:89d35af3-c22f-7420-1a5e-92f56c775de8
msgctxt "h317e91f6g0908g4215g8e66gb8c91f13ccf7"
msgid "This is not her Majesty's will."
msgstr "이건 그분의 뜻이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8abce9f5-84b0-9dc1-98e3-2cdcb4ef2d1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:8abce9f5-84b0-9dc1-98e3-2cdcb4ef2d1c
msgctxt "h34725018g27e4g4df8gb9c8g656bbe784946"
msgid "*As the sounds fade, there is nothing left but cold, still silence.*"
msgstr "*소리가 사라지고, 그곳에는 차갑고 고요한 적막이 맴돕니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 8adc7938-23e1-3095-9698-9225ce0fa6d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:8adc7938-23e1-3095-9698-9225ce0fa6d1
msgctxt "h8c164842gd17eg4883ga398gecb494e2e1ce"
msgid "Now, let's find that lantern, huh?"
msgstr "이제, 등불을 한 번 찾아볼까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 8bbe8a06-3c1f-fd88-096b-b7c63066c90d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:8bbe8a06-3c1f-fd88-096b-b7c63066c90d
msgctxt "h8beee0feg6c7dg47aega999g5f956e7050f2"
msgid "But majesty, you gave this lantern to me. You said it was mine!"
msgstr "그런데 여왕님, 이 등불은 저에게 주셨습니다. 제 것이라고 하셨지 않습니까!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 8f6b1215-7fc7-ed91-6632-e097a123073b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:8f6b1215-7fc7-ed91-6632-e097a123073b
msgctxt "h67415fb6g6becg4505g82bcg2821c2f5200b"
msgid "Majesty? Is - is this true? Did I not serve you well?"
msgstr "여왕님? 이게, 이게 정말입니까? 제가 당신을 잘 섬기지 못한 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 94f266a3-9bc8-95f5-3e15-59b5a5b65f24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_ToldHarpersAboutMoonlantern = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_5 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:94f266a3-9bc8-95f5-3e15-59b5a5b65f24
msgctxt "hb948f3aag7c39g4aa7g8adfg9fa53fd2d3db"
msgid ""
"Your parasite gives us the element of surprise - let's use it. You lure them "
"in, we cut them down, then you grab the lantern."
msgstr ""
"네 기생충이 기습할 수 있는 상황을 만들어줄 거야 - 그걸 이용하자고. 저놈들을 유인해서, 도륙 낸 다음, 넌 등불을 가져가면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 96d495c9-01c7-3aba-e8d2-b8327df00b67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_9 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:96d495c9-01c7-3aba-e8d2-b8327df00b67
msgctxt "h27227359gb92eg46d3gae38g33457f6aa492"
msgid "Go! We'll wait for your signal."
msgstr "가! 신호를 기다릴게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 97f2b7f6-c9d3-8400-67dc-a5de1538e9bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:97f2b7f6-c9d3-8400-67dc-a5de1538e9bc
msgctxt "h6c552995g49a2g4db4gaa53gce013db1bb92"
msgid "I burn with pure arcana - how on earth do <i>you</i> survive?"
msgstr "난 순수한 마력이 타오르고 있거든. 근데 <i>너흰</i> 어떻게 살아남은 건데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 98cc9348-a29f-461e-cf2d-1a11fdc2a1e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:98cc9348-a29f-461e-cf2d-1a11fdc2a1e4
msgctxt "h5c96d7aegcb5bg4f7dg8170g664d7b5eb13f"
msgid "Traitors - heretics!"
msgstr "배신자들! 이단자들!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 995a0fe2-1f62-e1ff-cd4b-c130cd5d9866
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:995a0fe2-1f62-e1ff-cd4b-c130cd5d9866
msgctxt "h304d0af6ge52ag42d9g9a9fg7aa099438d1b"
msgid ""
"<i>Try to blend into the shadows, letting the caravan pass unchallenged. </i>"
msgstr "<i>그림자 속에 녹아들어, 호송대가 무사히 지나가게 해본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a78da37-5045-6196-1afd-7b80100fd7c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:9a78da37-5045-6196-1afd-7b80100fd7c7
msgctxt "h5a221353g0dc8g4e82gac3ag73f01c48e47a"
msgid "GO. NOW."
msgstr "<b>가. 당장.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ae6cfbe-da47-bd80-32fb-0bf7e60ccba2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:9ae6cfbe-da47-bd80-32fb-0bf7e60ccba2
msgctxt "h76bce3cagb9efg4727gbb90g7c76a22c3545"
msgid "<i>Signal the Harpers to Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>하퍼에게 공격 신호를 보낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 9c5116d9-88d8-22e3-0fc2-3df67421c4d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:9c5116d9-88d8-22e3-0fc2-3df67421c4d4
msgctxt "h6353c31fg530ag42b2g82aag106721e1ecc6"
msgid ""
"But do not worry, there is still power in the lantern. Our queen will "
"protect you, as she protected me."
msgstr "하지만 걱정하지 마라, 아직 등불에 힘이 있으니. 우리의 여왕께서 나한테 그러셨듯 너희를 보호하실 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ed5a6ed-438d-3c0f-fa22-874f16f3fe7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:9ed5a6ed-438d-3c0f-fa22-874f16f3fe7b
msgctxt "h187368f8g19efg429dg923eg6e292019e299"
msgid ""
"No - that lantern is mine, by order of the Absolute. Give it - <i>now.</i>"
msgstr "아니, 절대자님의 명령에 따라 그 등불은 내 것이다. 내게 넘겨. <i>당장.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 9f6b4597-d48f-d69e-3cf1-78fd80657cd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_5 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:9f6b4597-d48f-d69e-3cf1-78fd80657cd2
msgctxt "h63ce794eg2065g4583g8483g09be5edab26b"
msgid "What? Have you lost your mind?!"
msgstr "뭐? 너 정신 나갔어?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 9f7d9d76-2128-557d-c9dc-2fe34e8e740b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:9f7d9d76-2128-557d-c9dc-2fe34e8e740b
msgctxt "hac62c832g04dcg4d81ga020g4484f5087fd9"
msgid "Treachery! Blasphemers in the dark!"
msgstr "배신이다! 모독자들이 숨어있다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a19cfecb-e463-ea21-be95-6368a7983b3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DROWELF(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:a19cfecb-e463-ea21-be95-6368a7983b3f
msgctxt "h6bf2f242g2debg478cg8657g1727e0ea02f3"
msgid ""
"The Absolute guided me here. She said a mere drider was not worthy - that I "
"must take your lantern."
msgstr "절대자께서 나를 인도하셨다. 그분께서 하등한 드라이더는 가치가 없다고 하시더군. 그 등불은 내가 가져가겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2755701-3a6a-4426-d2d3-033cf01f5361
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:a2755701-3a6a-4426-d2d3-033cf01f5361
msgctxt "h49b7bf08g3fa2g4a0ag94f0ga84e1c1daa53"
msgid "You're holding my lantern. The Absolute said you had to give it to me."
msgstr "내 등불을 가지고 있잖아. 절대자께서 그 등불을 나한테 넘기라고 하셨어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = a2d8424b-ff83-6893-92cd-681a189cb2ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_DriderDropsLantern = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:a2d8424b-ff83-6893-92cd-681a189cb2ee
msgctxt "ha65df565g30e2g46e5gbbedg4887a1ff4f1b"
msgid "Very well. If it is your will, they can have it."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 이것이 당신께서 원하시는 바라면, 그들은 등불을 가질 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a45ed65a-6fe2-9651-5b7e-57557d380898
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:a45ed65a-6fe2-9651-5b7e-57557d380898
msgctxt "h5f72e369ge8c4g4553ga395g50b6e0cfca73"
msgid "The Absolute protected me."
msgstr "절대자께서 보호해 주셨다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = a6492b7c-535b-ccda-51e7-54a5c3bac8fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:a6492b7c-535b-ccda-51e7-54a5c3bac8fe
msgctxt "h7291683agc837g4198gbe89gf22a0f70a7b9"
msgid ""
"The lamp's light keeps the shadows at bay. Stops them from getting close "
"enough to grab us."
msgstr "등불의 빛이 그림자를 물리칩니다. 그림자가 우릴 잡을 수 없도록 가까이 오지 못하게 막아주죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Brawler Vez
#. NodeID = a70264c3-64f3-1005-e4fe-64eef996df39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_CheckpointGoblin_State_Defeated = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:a70264c3-64f3-1005-e4fe-64eef996df39
msgctxt "h3c67886ag40e3g4a3ega09cg615886f51f2b"
msgid "...Whatcha mean 'go'?"
msgstr "...'가보도록' 이라니 무슨 말이여?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = a7145e6a-26b4-aeef-584e-e27025b947e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:a7145e6a-26b4-aeef-584e-e27025b947e1
msgctxt "h9ff07acbg6223g4286g95f4g57f0291d989d"
msgid "To arms! Strike down the heretics!"
msgstr "무기를 들어라! 이교도 놈들을 쳐라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = a91de117-1f18-849d-2d8b-01d0af38eec3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_7 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:a91de117-1f18-849d-2d8b-01d0af38eec3
msgctxt "ha9830d8ag0dd5g4c7agb102g393ea5956f25"
msgid "Quickly - we'll wait for your signal."
msgstr "어서 - 신호를 기다릴게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = aa98bfcb-4a37-9450-7a14-50dcba8ed918
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_9 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:aa98bfcb-4a37-9450-7a14-50dcba8ed918
msgctxt "heb6c8e6bg8285g42ccga3c5g9dcebb779105"
msgid "No - what have you done?!"
msgstr "안돼. 무슨 짓이야?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = aa99c098-140c-7f9d-f7f3-ddda84300a75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:aa99c098-140c-7f9d-f7f3-ddda84300a75
msgctxt "h8515b522g26f3g415bgb12bg52b7540d8949"
msgid ""
"Yes, majesty, your light can shield another of your faithful. They will join "
"us on the road."
msgstr "그렇습니다, 여왕님. 당신의 빛은 다른 신도도 품을 만큼 밝게 빛납니다. 저들도 저희의 행군에 함께할 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = ae4f638b-b391-0b67-f600-e827f0f6a89a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:ae4f638b-b391-0b67-f600-e827f0f6a89a
msgctxt "h15695cd3g228dg420dg9ea8g0a96e88bf167"
msgid "You can't be serious. You know what's out there-"
msgstr "진심일 리가 없잖습니까. 등불이 없으면 어떻게 될지 아시면서..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = afea7765-957b-2228-c2d5-e2c544090321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_7 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:afea7765-957b-2228-c2d5-e2c544090321
msgctxt "hd4d5fe44g6225g406ag9ee5g3c921ab3ff03"
msgid "Now that was impressive."
msgstr "아주 인상적이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = b1f8895d-2ae2-7754-4960-98044307e1e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_6 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:b1f8895d-2ae2-7754-4960-98044307e1e6
msgctxt "hf161d4d4gc23cg4aefg911cg41f2e36d102d"
msgid "You treacherous dog!"
msgstr "이 배신자 자식!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = b3798d2b-f473-6f27-b98f-0171c0d770fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:b3798d2b-f473-6f27-b98f-0171c0d770fc
msgctxt "h446d2ff4gbe87g4e5eg962eg09382f94344b"
msgid "One of your True Souls, my Queen! How have they survived?"
msgstr "참된 영혼들이옵니다, 여왕님! 여기서 어떻게 살아남았지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = b4a0b29f-2f36-88e7-ea30-927ce951e895
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_6 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:b4a0b29f-2f36-88e7-ea30-927ce951e895
msgctxt "h173e7ac5gb762g4928gb360gf191286ef6dd"
msgid "I'd never believe it if I hadn't just seen it. Nicely done!"
msgstr "직접 본 게 아니었다면 믿지 못할 광경이었어. 잘했어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = b62d0e85-72ea-1db3-ba2f-ffd80361d36e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:b62d0e85-72ea-1db3-ba2f-ffd80361d36e
msgctxt "h7b84f932g9be1g4632g9c3bg3680ea11cf19"
msgid "She will protect us. She - she must."
msgstr "여왕님이 우릴 보호하실 거다. 그분께서... 분명히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = b6f3a5b9-761b-9702-7b8d-b442118d8695
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_8 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:b6f3a5b9-761b-9702-7b8d-b442118d8695
msgctxt "hbc4b0910g78bcg4cefg96a3g39c0d8dba013"
msgid "That was... terrifying. I'm impressed."
msgstr "방금 그건... 무서울 정도였어. 놀라운걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b784c59c-18f4-7213-e825-6b51a56eff9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:b784c59c-18f4-7213-e825-6b51a56eff9e
msgctxt "hfd1e8996g256fg4688gba82g61d9b71918d7"
msgid "Good. You may go now."
msgstr "좋아. 이만 가보도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ba96afef-aa90-1dd5-1a6d-4063249a45fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:ba96afef-aa90-1dd5-1a6d-4063249a45fe
msgctxt "h63c94ccfgf2afg40cbgb10agdb215fa9d1f3"
msgid ""
"Our wondrous Queen dropped me a message - she said you need to give me that "
"lantern. It's <i>very</i> important."
msgstr "우리의 경애하는 여왕께서 내게 전언을 남기셨다 - 네 그 등불을 내게 넘기라더군. <i>아주</i> 중요한 일이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bcdecfb8-5f39-9b70-49ba-4b5e7fd1ddce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:bcdecfb8-5f39-9b70-49ba-4b5e7fd1ddce
msgctxt "hcec7319dgdd4ag4241g925age1b04e9441e7"
msgid ""
"That lantern is mine - by order of the Absolute. Drop it, or I'll shatter "
"your spine as the wind breaks a twig."
msgstr "절대자의 명령에 따라 등불은 내 것이다. 내놓지 않으면, 마치 바람이 나뭇가지를 부러뜨리듯 네 척추를 부러뜨려 주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd1fba7f-0d54-4ec1-1f27-7b1bf3feb285
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:bd1fba7f-0d54-4ec1-1f27-7b1bf3feb285
msgctxt "h235ce798g031dg4c5dgb491g15440a34fdd4"
msgid "You know what they say - a ballad a day, keeps the darkness away!"
msgstr "누가 그랬지. 하루에 한 곡의 발라드면, 어둠을 몰아낼 수 있다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = c3f35e58-cede-f477-d016-46ac238ca416
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:c3f35e58-cede-f477-d016-46ac238ca416
msgctxt "h32d77a1fgcb5ag4f69g8959ge41759421e3f"
msgid ""
"Your faithful stand ready, Majesty. Soon we march. Soon the world will bow "
"to you."
msgstr "신하들은 준비됐습니다. 폐하, 곧 행군을 시작합니다. 곧 세상이 당신께 머리를 조아릴 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c6c61fba-030b-a921-528e-6201fa7b811b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:c6c61fba-030b-a921-528e-6201fa7b811b
msgctxt "h8c77bd4eg1cdbg4004g8da3g820c259c9423"
msgid "<i>Try to hide and let the caravan pass unchallenged. </i>"
msgstr "<i>숨어서 호송대가 무사히 지나가게 해본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c920fd8e-c39b-e3d2-8c89-92740209ca18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:c920fd8e-c39b-e3d2-8c89-92740209ca18
msgctxt "h327bcf88g7a05g4d22g945bgba223ec71d22"
msgid "Indeed, it's time for you to go."
msgstr "좋아, 이제 가보도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Manus
#. NodeID = c9a5f4c1-40be-695f-f061-e0cbcebe75be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_7 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:c9a5f4c1-40be-695f-f061-e0cbcebe75be
msgctxt "hae563c22gb265g4890g9f56g4ec8d6fd05af"
msgid "You're not going anywhere. Harpers!"
msgstr "네놈은 아무 데도 못 간다. 하퍼들이여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = cad8ea85-5d54-c478-a660-2670d6280f2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_8 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:cad8ea85-5d54-c478-a660-2670d6280f2c
msgctxt "hf2221de8gefd9g4b30g923fg2f99fc34402c"
msgid "No - what are you doing?!"
msgstr "안돼, 뭐 하는 거야?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = cb9f0930-e83b-d8d2-aa63-48a016284644
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:cb9f0930-e83b-d8d2-aa63-48a016284644
msgctxt "hf44c012eg7081g435egabebgc906e67bcfd0"
msgid "Nere? A fickle, unworthy servant to our Queen."
msgstr "니어라고? 우리 여왕님의 변덕스럽고, 자격 없는 종복 말이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Brawler Vez
#. NodeID = d08debd5-020f-6c4c-209c-5baafd238d12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:d08debd5-020f-6c4c-209c-5baafd238d12
msgctxt "h13e77310g2d3ag43cfg8a8dg8a54f29aea74"
msgid "Didn't figure something as big and ugly as you for a coward."
msgstr "너처럼 크고 못생긴 놈이 겁쟁이일 줄이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = d3d942c2-42b8-f119-17c1-d48c065becf1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:d3d942c2-42b8-f119-17c1-d48c065becf1
msgctxt "h5000a38fg73e4g4bc0ga0bbgac6f69c816bf"
msgid "Forgive me, my Queen, but I had to. Before the dark got any stronger."
msgstr "용서해주소서, 여왕이시여, 하지만 그럴 수 밖에 없었나이다. 어둠이 더 강해지지 않게..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = d4ccb949-28f3-ccb0-2670-01597b79747a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_8 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:d4ccb949-28f3-ccb0-2670-01597b79747a
msgctxt "h4af4f74cge727g4102g96cag7b72e4397e0b"
msgid "We can't let you leave. Harpers - now!"
msgstr "네놈을 가게 둘 순 없다. 하퍼들이여, 지금이다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = d5416f8b-f916-cdce-63be-e46c15a6645d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:d5416f8b-f916-cdce-63be-e46c15a6645d
msgctxt "h4fbc79aeg0dd7g424fgabc1ga8ac82273e58"
msgid "What's this?"
msgstr "뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = d57f7dde-69cb-380e-dc48-c2d0f297fc85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:d57f7dde-69cb-380e-dc48-c2d0f297fc85
msgctxt "h34f58fa3ge48eg4c26g9180g0aea15f3b05f"
msgid ""
"Our goddess protects us. We carry her sacred light to drive back the shadows."
msgstr "여신께서 우리를 보호하신다. 그분의 신성한 빛이 그림자를 몰아내신다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da3182d9-7f6e-d6e6-e0fc-25ffbe93d981
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:da3182d9-7f6e-d6e6-e0fc-25ffbe93d981
msgctxt "h3a5040d2g8380g4c3bg8edbg8de72f901ffb"
msgid "Never mind me, how have you survived the curse?"
msgstr "난 신경 쓰지 마. 너희야말로 저주를 어떻게 견뎠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = dbc05890-5892-a83a-b8ee-fd44e8dd8d3f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:dbc05890-5892-a83a-b8ee-fd44e8dd8d3f
msgctxt "h4ab7ba26g56f8g40cag801ag0b5aaed5413c"
msgid "Traitor - heretic!"
msgstr "배신자, 이교도놈!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = dc5e8be7-6319-b470-8cc7-6069b715a680
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_ToldHarpersAboutMoonlantern = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_6 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:dc5e8be7-6319-b470-8cc7-6069b715a680
msgctxt "h5a4f9856gddccg46b3g9f52ga461cca98e4f"
msgid ""
"Plan's simple: your brain-bug is the bait - they'll trust you. Lure them in, "
"then we hit 'em hard and fast. Once they're down, you grab the lantern."
msgstr ""
"계획은 간단해. 뇌 속의 벌레를 미끼로 삼는다. 그들은 널 신뢰하겠지. 유인한 다음, 강하고 빠르게 공격한다. 저것들이 쓰러지면, 넌 "
"등불을 가져간다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = dc8d3b28-43f7-1b6e-1a71-32fdbbbff207
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:dc8d3b28-43f7-1b6e-1a71-32fdbbbff207
msgctxt "ha3655284gef25g42b0g9b0bgebb72923250b"
msgid "Heretics in the dark! Kill them - destroy the blasphemers!"
msgstr "어둠속의 이단자들이다! 모두 죽여라! 신성모독자들을 말살해라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = dd980128-e1f6-4fe4-8d20-24cda346775e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:dd980128-e1f6-4fe4-8d20-24cda346775e
msgctxt "h58796386g819ag4ae2g98bbg83391e6c4698"
msgid "Majesty! Please..."
msgstr "여왕이시여! 자비를..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Skywin
#. NodeID = e0df902b-b3da-93fc-8f0b-d1020139f39a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:e0df902b-b3da-93fc-8f0b-d1020139f39a
msgctxt "h1efb95d8g22cfg4c31ga423g61eaf9e0591c"
msgid "And no one can argue with the results."
msgstr "게다가 누구도 결과에 이의를 제기할 수는 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e2ac335f-6e59-60d5-1989-d5cb64b6544b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:e2ac335f-6e59-60d5-1989-d5cb64b6544b
msgctxt "h9609ab41g8e91g436dgac85g3be4b02130af"
msgid ""
"*The drider's eyes cut through the darkness, locking on you as your parasite "
"squirms with excitement.*"
msgstr "*당신의 기생충이 흥분으로 꿈틀대자, 드라이더의 시선이 어둠을 뚫고 당신에게 고정됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = e38b5450-524d-7d6c-0551-2835f30613cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:e38b5450-524d-7d6c-0551-2835f30613cc
msgctxt "hcbca5c44g780eg44c5gb74dg66ae5ba44ab8"
msgid ""
"They think us fools, Majesty. They think we cannot see through their lies."
msgstr "신이시여, 저들은 우리가 멍청한 줄 압니다. 우리가 거짓말을 꿰뚫어 볼 줄 몰랐나 봅니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e39ceab0-e504-b7ca-795e-58e373be7866
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:e39ceab0-e504-b7ca-795e-58e373be7866
msgctxt "h8acacd6bga8c6g49f3gac27g04b66c98c2e5"
msgid ""
"I swore an oath - a powerful one. It will take more than darkness to end me."
msgstr "나에겐 아주 강력한 맹세의 힘이 있지. 어둠으론 내 목숨을 거둘 수 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = ea4715eb-1338-0d19-0a4b-c794de9b47ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:ea4715eb-1338-0d19-0a4b-c794de9b47ac
msgctxt "hca410e80gf0c9g4071g8df8g13654d9c84c6"
msgid "IF IT IS HER MAJESTY'S WILL, THEN WE SHALL WALK!"
msgstr "<b>그분의 뜻이라면, 우린 가야만 한다! </b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ebdeffbc-9c5c-798a-6c43-71deba337d0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:ebdeffbc-9c5c-798a-6c43-71deba337d0b
msgctxt "h4b7c0d66g9fedg432dg9023ga0883da39009"
msgid "So how does this work, exactly?"
msgstr "그래서 정확히 이게 어떻게 작동하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ef758712-f21f-b306-8881-13bbd2849dd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:ef758712-f21f-b306-8881-13bbd2849dd2
msgctxt "h3a43e86fgc599g4e06gab39gcc4c6b461fc9"
msgid ""
"*Your minds connect and before you can stop him, the drider is inside your "
"head - scrabbling through your secrets.*"
msgstr "*정신이 이어지자 드라이더는, 당신이 멈출 새도 없이 머릿속을 비집고 들어와 당신의 비밀을 뒤적입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = f12f15d7-fc31-b279-bb26-bce1cd18b67e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_6 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:f12f15d7-fc31-b279-bb26-bce1cd18b67e
msgctxt "h384cdb2fg34a9g4f6dga3c4gdddf694eb6c5"
msgid "The hells are you doing? Attack!"
msgstr "대체 뭐 하고 있는 거야? 공격!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2448a8f-7248-5c4e-9705-33c0242d445a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:f2448a8f-7248-5c4e-9705-33c0242d445a
msgctxt "h3fc923b9gb89cg4442g9913g1d966043e19c"
msgid "Takes more than shadows to put someone like me down."
msgstr "나 같은 자를 쓰러뜨리려면 그림자로는 안되지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = f71b8222-7285-72bf-eda6-28cd158f1a69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:f71b8222-7285-72bf-eda6-28cd158f1a69
msgctxt "ha982295ag1e80g46cbg9777g26a2d336bd2c"
msgid "THEY WILL NOT BECOME SHADOWS! THEY WILL NOT FEED THE CURSE!"
msgstr "그림자가 되지 말라! 저주를 배 불려 주지 말라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = f75f6ea5-9ea7-913d-fdda-535c52f42b10
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:f75f6ea5-9ea7-913d-fdda-535c52f42b10
msgctxt "h4c7d7ab8g6160g4b02ga7ecg76baa18b71fd"
msgid "Happy to be proven wrong, of course. Now, what's this lantern?"
msgstr "제 생각이 틀려서 정말 다행입니다. 이제, 저 등불이 뭔지 볼까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = fa479cdf-4136-7d77-2683-c5c15743cd12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:fa479cdf-4136-7d77-2683-c5c15743cd12
msgctxt "h03d74ea3gb4f5g4b28g95a6gc6f439bc8f5e"
msgid "They stay in the light! They do not go into the dark."
msgstr "빛에 머물러야 한다! 어둠에 가까이 가지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = fba8fa3b-748a-04c1-f755-3ec926a8a21d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_DriderLeavesTowardsTower = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_AvoidedCombat = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:fba8fa3b-748a-04c1-f755-3ec926a8a21d
msgctxt "hb0ec9009gd211g4799ga22eg690984838e37"
msgid "If - if it is her majesty's will..."
msgstr "그... 그분의 뜻이라면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fddf2e8d-e047-705a-d6b5-c1ddb5076e86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:fddf2e8d-e047-705a-d6b5-c1ddb5076e86
msgctxt "h84d04607g7943g4f41gb690g7a086f859605"
msgid "<i>Signal the Harpers to attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>하퍼들에게 공격 신호를 보낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = ffbcbab1-5385-7b66-af89-f8f84d80a6f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_9 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:ffbcbab1-5385-7b66-af89-f8f84d80a6f3
msgctxt "h42659879gdb7cg4b3bgb3cbga7473978f586"
msgid "You are full of surprises, aren't you? Incredible."
msgstr "네겐 놀랄 점 투성이야, 안 그래? 엄청나군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02c3aff3-c68b-82b9-a469-595daf32a23d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_Defeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:02c3aff3-c68b-82b9-a469-595daf32a23d
msgctxt "h557f3552g54dcg41b4g82fag8dd509c8c64d"
msgid "Not just alive - victorious. I killed it."
msgstr "그냥 살아만 있는 게 아니라, 이겼지. 그 짐승을 죽였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 054b5ed7-2bc7-43f1-a866-f4d4e3059261
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:054b5ed7-2bc7-43f1-a866-f4d4e3059261
msgctxt "hb65f1bedg4eaag4e5ega468gfa0a6090d6aa"
msgid "Fuck yes - let's do it! I want to crush something evil."
msgstr "좋아 씨발! 해보자고! 사악한 녀석들을 부숴버리고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 0e2a69eb-4be1-6c4a-9538-822a9b8dd08c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:0e2a69eb-4be1-6c4a-9538-822a9b8dd08c
msgctxt "h4c1ff923ge0afg4c69g92d0g35e5eaf520c7"
msgid "Holy hells. Incredible, that it didn't tear off your every limb."
msgstr "세상에나, 사지가 찢어지지 않은 게 놀랍네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 10fac7dc-1748-1acd-8331-943919323363
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:10fac7dc-1748-1acd-8331-943919323363
msgctxt "hce823092gc537g4324g8af5gd20aacef32db"
msgid "What? Hideous beast! It is a miracle you're alive."
msgstr "뭐라고 했나? 그 흉측한 짐승과 마주쳤다니! 자네가 살아있는 게 기적이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 134c42a7-6d4a-4d96-83df-f3ea23503852
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:134c42a7-6d4a-4d96-83df-f3ea23503852
msgctxt "h9045ec25gcbecg4e70g9a7bg870d388b1215"
msgid ""
"We must take this advantage. Githyanki perish in bloodbaths, not dreary "
"curses."
msgstr "반드시 이 기회를 잡아야 해. 기스양키는 음산한 저주가 아닌, 피바다 속에서 죽어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 1e136723-681f-4b16-b37e-21819f2ad144
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:1e136723-681f-4b16-b37e-21819f2ad144
msgctxt "h73adeb49g5e85g4862g81edg402d73591156"
msgid "I'm with the Harper. We should take every advantage in reach."
msgstr "난 이 하퍼 편이야. 얻을 기회가 있다면 모두 써야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 1f2c664c-4069-a677-7209-a2c6541999ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:1f2c664c-4069-a677-7209-a2c6541999ed
msgctxt "h25249023g40d9g4501g8b0bgdbcd7e220e17"
msgid "Just as I'm no stranger to the scars it leaves behind."
msgstr "무관심이 남긴 상처가 더 이상 낯설지 않듯이 말이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 30cab109-a9e4-f379-0ef6-f48ea58a4533
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:30cab109-a9e4-f379-0ef6-f48ea58a4533
msgctxt "h92b7dac0g7302g445aga1dfga2222056c23b"
msgid "But - there will be more chances. You'll make them. It's what you do."
msgstr "하지만. 더 많은 기회가 있을 것이네. 자네가 만들어 낼 것이야. 그리고 그것이 자네가 할 일이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 3462a173-39dd-c68f-e676-e7ad070ba89a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:3462a173-39dd-c68f-e676-e7ad070ba89a
msgctxt "hf47b6686g950ag4136gbacbg6c6a0d02198b"
msgid "Prudent words. As I expected."
msgstr "신중하군. 내가 예상했던 대로야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 3d98bbd2-4563-9981-c976-49f80116ba7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:3d98bbd2-4563-9981-c976-49f80116ba7e
msgctxt "h31578112g70fcg47c2g8309g5757c61ce57e"
msgid "Even in deepest darkness -"
msgstr "가장 깊은 어둠 속에서 조차도,"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3fa83b2e-7077-7577-142e-40fd68e90ee1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_ToldHarpersAboutMoonlantern = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:3fa83b2e-7077-7577-142e-40fd68e90ee1
msgctxt "h76b29997gaeb5g4684gb9b8g7681b88e0d75"
msgid "Gotta be a Moonlantern. Just what we need."
msgstr "우리에게 필요한 달등불이어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 42b0cd7e-1fb7-e6d5-17f0-b66edcbcc3aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarpersAtInn_State_WontDoAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:42b0cd7e-1fb7-e6d5-17f0-b66edcbcc3aa
msgctxt "h21ee1edege014g4069gabefgcd4ddd8a8f73"
msgid "You don't just fight shadows. You fight what hides inside."
msgstr "자네는 단순히 그림자와 싸우는 게 아니네. 그 안에 숨어있는 것과 싸워야 할걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 497f81a6-c62e-370d-c7c4-4c7bfc6fbdbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_ToldHarpersAboutMoonlantern = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:497f81a6-c62e-370d-c7c4-4c7bfc6fbdbb
msgctxt "hb110b5d6g1cfcg470agae7dg7ad85030c78e"
msgid ""
"If they move freely, they must have a Moonlantern. Let's have a little war "
"with that convoy and claim the spoils."
msgstr "그들이 자유롭게 이동할 수 있다면, 반드시 달등불을 가지고 있을 거야. 저 호송대랑 작은 전투를 벌여 전리품을 차지하자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 4bfb52a8-b131-7912-0e2c-f61962dfdcaf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:4bfb52a8-b131-7912-0e2c-f61962dfdcaf
msgctxt "hce6c1065g0b6cg496dgb3a9gfa70ace2932c"
msgid "Damn it all."
msgstr "젠장."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 5941fb9b-991e-f1ba-49de-ca4a71ba0966
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:5941fb9b-991e-f1ba-49de-ca4a71ba0966
msgctxt "hae1de146g05bdg41d3g845cgbce147d73595"
msgid ""
"Mind the gap between confidence and arrogance, True Soul. That's where true "
"danger lies."
msgstr "자신감과 오만함의 차이를 명심하길 바라네. 참된 영혼이여. 그 차이에 진정한 위험이 도사리고 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 5af159cf-3135-d1b3-3301-19bbdf3db9c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:5af159cf-3135-d1b3-3301-19bbdf3db9c0
msgctxt "hae00d0f0gccdag401cg9048g6f3f67d18c8c"
msgid "Go on, then - take your lantern, or not. Moonrise is waiting."
msgstr "그러면 출발하게. 등불을 챙기든 말든간에. 문라이즈가 기다리고 있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d7b83b9-c689-8053-7577-24989919b5d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_HarpersLearnMissedCaravan = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:5d7b83b9-c689-8053-7577-24989919b5d8
msgctxt "h27531d48g5adeg456ega00bgf261ab4b44d7"
msgid "You're too late - I've encountered the convoy, led by a drider."
msgstr "너무 늦게 왔군. 우린 이미 드라이더가 이끄는 호송대와 마주쳤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 636935b7-c80a-4093-b51c-ee88090038a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:636935b7-c80a-4093-b51c-ee88090038a8
msgctxt "hd752f6d1g9600g4229g9dfag0716b289a739"
msgid "Sounds like just what we need to get to Moonrise."
msgstr "문라이즈에 가려면 꼭 필요한 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 677b1857-3033-c105-1768-00fd11b1d96a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:677b1857-3033-c105-1768-00fd11b1d96a
msgctxt "h82221d21g2fb1g441ag8ebegb1b5433e5d9f"
msgid "I only saw its trail. It was fresh."
msgstr "지나간 흔적만 볼 수 있었지. 얼마 되지 않았던 거였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 6e0aba49-063e-c5c2-3138-dfc33b88d7b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:6e0aba49-063e-c5c2-3138-dfc33b88d7b3
msgctxt "h0cf2880fgcb9bg46d3ga459g2c92fdc31468"
msgid ""
"Isobel's blessing is a palliative, not a cure. Some shadows, even her magic "
"can't counter."
msgstr "이소벨의 축복은 임시방편일 뿐, 회복 마법이 아냐. 어떤 그림자는 그 마법으로도 막지 못하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 72b2d0e8-eaa1-0082-1a79-83993b7461fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(7) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_ToldHarpersAboutMoonlantern = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:72b2d0e8-eaa1-0082-1a79-83993b7461fd
msgctxt "h3ad8e8begac18g42degb234gc2f43855d4ec"
msgid ""
"A Moonlantern, I wager. There's no overstating the advantage we'll gain with "
"that light."
msgstr "내기 하나 하면, 달등불인 것에 걸지. 그 조명으로 얻을 수 있는 이득은 아무리 강조해도 지나치지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 82018a82-c922-1b35-a170-98bf320ae15a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarpersAtInn_State_WontDoAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:82018a82-c922-1b35-a170-98bf320ae15a
msgctxt "h3ac56974gec16g428egb334gda84c5870cc8"
msgid "- you will shine."
msgstr "자네는 빛날 것이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 823e9570-bf1d-463a-b0e6-c2dfa8fc5bd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:823e9570-bf1d-463a-b0e6-c2dfa8fc5bd6
msgctxt "h812b86bfgdd8ag4bd8ga5d5g22cfcd8ccb0f"
msgid ""
"If they move freely, they must have some kind of magic that protects them. "
"I'm not averse to claiming that magic indeed."
msgstr "그들이 자유롭게 이동한다면, 반드시 일종의 보호 마법이 걸려있을 거야. 그 마법이 정말로 있다는 주장에 어느정도 동의도 하고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 862349eb-59d9-fab8-fe23-63ac236b186c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#. TagRule: RANGER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:862349eb-59d9-fab8-fe23-63ac236b186c
msgctxt "hfa1b6846g9b03g43d7g86ceg4044b541d04e"
msgid ""
"It's refreshing not to have set the trap I'm springing - take me to the "
"convoy."
msgstr "저에게 함정을 미리 설치하지 않는 건 신선한 일입니다. 호송대가 있는 곳으로 데려다 주세요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 862349eb-59d9-fab8-fe23-63ac236b186c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:862349eb-59d9-fab8-fe23-63ac236b186c
msgctxt "h6285a5adge11bg407egb06egbf4ca2dab505"
msgid "Let's take on that convoy. You lead, I follow."
msgstr "호송대가 있는 곳으로 가자. 안내해, 따라갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b8e3557-66f7-4855-7e12-85b1dbe60dfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:8b8e3557-66f7-4855-7e12-85b1dbe60dfa
msgctxt "h5e3882a5gee3bg4484gb818g4386a9aa8245"
msgid "Yes, I've taken their light. I will be safe in its glow."
msgstr "그래, 그들의 등불을 챙겼어. 등불의 빛 속에선 안전할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 8d3cb3f9-804d-949c-6cb0-afc967dfac29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_StartedAmbushQuestWithHarpers = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_StartHarpersAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:8d3cb3f9-804d-949c-6cb0-afc967dfac29
msgctxt "h18164113gf1bcg43b6g9bd6ge19c3d9e5ea5"
msgid "Don't be long. Our window of chance will close all too quickly."
msgstr "오래 걸리지 말게. 기회의 창문은 금방 닫혀버린다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 93ae7221-3780-0d89-b6b3-14c60f237ae7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:93ae7221-3780-0d89-b6b3-14c60f237ae7
msgctxt "h6a1f2d03g1ebag4071gb8d1g544387f544ab"
msgid ""
"Yet the cultists have found a way to move freely. Whatever this method, you "
"must claim it."
msgstr "하지만 추종자들은 자유롭게 이동할 수 있는 방법을 찾아냈네. 이 방법이 무엇이든 간에, 반드시 알아내야 하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 93daa6c8-acd9-5651-c2b0-8e1027cdca3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:93daa6c8-acd9-5651-c2b0-8e1027cdca3d
msgctxt "h4aec0bbcg0ce9g471fga30fg4314a8f4c46e"
msgid "So glad to have you. Truly."
msgstr "진심으로, 함께해서 정말 기뻐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 968558c3-b3a1-0826-b598-de4021bfcd0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:968558c3-b3a1-0826-b598-de4021bfcd0d
msgctxt "h92d6a29eg977ag4cf1gb0a4g8531378dfdcf"
msgid ""
"The path to the Towers is drenched in blackness so deep, even a torch cannot "
"quell it."
msgstr "타워로 가는 길은 횃불로도 걷어낼 수 없을 만큼 어둠으로 깊게 잠겨있네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 997ca8ae-0e31-328e-df40-5dad271c4cb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:997ca8ae-0e31-328e-df40-5dad271c4cb7
msgctxt "h6f2284a7gf80fg490ega1a1g5b803770ae81"
msgid "Wait here. I need time to prepare."
msgstr "여기서 기다려주세요. 준비할 시간이 필요합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = 9edd3e39-4922-c44e-cae9-594bf88175a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarpersAtInn_State_WontDoAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:9edd3e39-4922-c44e-cae9-594bf88175a4
msgctxt "hb9fa7c94gf67cg41c4g884bg3763793a35c3"
msgid "And so are we."
msgstr "우리도 마찬가지네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f6393db-bcd9-8412-0337-7495aac68428
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasMoonlantern(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:9f6393db-bcd9-8412-0337-7495aac68428
msgctxt "h3592e441g042eg45a2gaf24g5c22cd6ce4d5"
msgid "Forget the convoy. I can handle myself out there."
msgstr "호송대는 잊어버려. 저 밖은 내가 알아서 하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9ff209c5-29fb-3a7d-073a-47be032636ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:9ff209c5-29fb-3a7d-073a-47be032636ff
msgctxt "h0c7bfac1gd936g4c13g92efgf90ee361f321"
msgid "A magic lantern. It'll help. But it's only a tool, not a solution."
msgstr "마법 등불이야. 이게 도움이 될 거야. 하지만 도구일 뿐, 해결 방법은 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = a0edc186-743b-ff90-eac3-9891bdf07572
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:a0edc186-743b-ff90-eac3-9891bdf07572
msgctxt "h1aac741eg3b70g46c7ga25eg743d10752943"
msgid "Splendid. I'll mark your map, should you lose the way."
msgstr "훌륭하군. 길을 잃을 것을 대비해, 지도해 표시해 두지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = a104d0a6-26c1-e9ef-c94a-df1e08f5d1f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_ToldHarpersAboutMoonlantern = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:a104d0a6-26c1-e9ef-c94a-df1e08f5d1f2
msgctxt "ha598a679g91d3g4fe5g87a5ge911542bdbd2"
msgid ""
"A Moonlantern - it must be. And we must take it. Githyanki perish in "
"bloodbaths, not dreary curses."
msgstr "달등불이 틀림 없어. 반드시 빼앗아야 해. 기스양키는 음산한 저주가 아니라, 피바다 속에서 죽어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a433ac5b-1344-fb15-78c4-c74913661434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasMoonlantern(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:a433ac5b-1344-fb15-78c4-c74913661434
msgctxt "h7e5579c4ga416g4af0ga5edg828a76cf0d05"
msgid "I wasn't able to retrieve it, I'm afraid. The way will be dark indeed."
msgstr "유감스럽게도 찾지 못했어. 가는 길은 정말로 어두울 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a68a901a-4dae-7a4a-585d-df81a434fc87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_Event_GiveOintment = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:a68a901a-4dae-7a4a-585d-df81a434fc87
msgctxt "h716232bdgdcd0g4244gb933gcf9bbbe33ec1"
msgid "Shouldn't Isobel's blessing keep me safe?"
msgstr "이소벨의 축복으로는 안전하게 지켜주지 못하는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ac696709-e461-05db-07df-fef536b2e415
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:ac696709-e461-05db-07df-fef536b2e415
msgctxt "hbccf4e2bg3dbag4c7bg957fgd3174db3388c"
msgid "Not a miracle - I was simply careful. I saw its light in the distance."
msgstr "단순한 기적이 아니라 그저 조심했을 뿐이야. 저 멀리서 불빛이 보였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b1e7be21-713c-cac0-ebad-99dc0b1fc7fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_Event_GiveOintment = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:b1e7be21-713c-cac0-ebad-99dc0b1fc7fb
msgctxt "h3004ce90g6f9ag4067g98dfg33e834b08653"
msgid "Jaheira said Isobel had a way to keep me safe."
msgstr "자헤이라와 이소벨이 나를 안전하게 지켜줄 방법이 있다고 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = b35c4b3c-202c-e926-07aa-8b666fe19a8f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:b35c4b3c-202c-e926-07aa-8b666fe19a8f
msgctxt "h9048f3b8g3890g40f5ga238g0791cba60470"
msgid "I'll be damned - you're something else."
msgstr "정말 놀랍군. 자네는 뭔가 다르네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b4f1c76e-0ca5-413e-b1a7-48bd6bbc1f6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(6) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:b4f1c76e-0ca5-413e-b1a7-48bd6bbc1f6f
msgctxt "hdce41fc5g01dbg432cg95aegfe538360435f"
msgid ""
"Sounds like an opportunity. And it would be nice to surprise the Absolute "
"for once."
msgstr "기회 같아. 그리고 한 번쯤은 절대자를 놀라게 하는 것도 좋아 보이고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = b66040dc-7a17-f400-9c88-0510dfb1be32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:b66040dc-7a17-f400-9c88-0510dfb1be32
msgctxt "h93aa272dgf829g42ccga7cdgc25dd515b273"
msgid "Hells. Then our chance has passed."
msgstr "젠장. 그러면 기회는 날아갔군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = b8c771cf-4415-b72c-bcb5-183f8f0b0877
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:b8c771cf-4415-b72c-bcb5-183f8f0b0877
msgctxt "hd89fdb27g5815g4ce6g976ag01eab6d56ab5"
msgid "Is that it, then? I'm no stranger to indifference, True Soul."
msgstr "그게 전부인가? 나는 무관심에 익숙하다네, 참된 영혼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = b98cd33f-bd97-0811-9641-09eb5baefcc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(6) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_ToldHarpersAboutMoonlantern = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:b98cd33f-bd97-0811-9641-09eb5baefcc6
msgctxt "hf5174e12gd6e0g4406g8edfgf63942724c38"
msgid "A Moonlantern, surely? I would love to have one of those."
msgstr "달등불이지? 하나 있었으면 좋겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = baeb388f-a69c-36c9-7c9e-d12b6635d05f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersAmbushDialogEnded = True
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersMetCaravanAlone = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:baeb388f-a69c-36c9-7c9e-d12b6635d05f
msgctxt "h77aaaeadg7cb7g439cga902g8f30ab213f77"
msgid "I stayed well out of its way. There was no chance of it spotting me."
msgstr "그 길에서 멀리 떨어져 있었어. 나를 발견할 가능성은 전혀 없었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = bf2501ba-4d3e-aabe-5799-4280f08c8c69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:bf2501ba-4d3e-aabe-5799-4280f08c8c69
msgctxt "h57454385gc6d2g4675ga676g1b0a94b4c46c"
msgid "My feet are planted deep 'til you return."
msgstr "돌아올 때까지 여기서 그대로 기다리고 있겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c3da86ad-77b8-d74c-784b-f000b8ea39a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasMoonlantern(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:c3da86ad-77b8-d74c-784b-f000b8ea39a4
msgctxt "hbdbcfea0g1e56g4a06gb2bdgb0eeacdf8cbf"
msgid "Forget the convoy. I am your saviour here, not some magic lamp."
msgstr "호송대는 잊어버려. 나는 마법의 등 같은 게 아니라, 너의 구원자로서 여기에 있는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = cb97dc27-faa6-6c20-0092-06735a86d55b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_StartedAmbushQuestWithHarpers = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_StartHarpersAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:cb97dc27-faa6-6c20-0092-06735a86d55b
msgctxt "heabbf2a1g7d27g442cg9da3ged7503dee18c"
msgid "Harpers - with me. Stray no more than an arm's length from your course."
msgstr "하퍼들이여, 나를 따르라. 그리고 가는 도중에 길에서 한 팔 이상 벗어나지 말게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc1c863f-3116-464d-2da1-287f3ba242a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_HasMoonlantern(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:cc1c863f-3116-464d-2da1-287f3ba242a7
msgctxt "h652ba41fg3f41g4616g99eega17f99d8c57c"
msgid "<i>Shrug.</i>"
msgstr "<i>으쓱.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = d1a9709c-8bd9-c3e0-a1c8-8e6ddbfb6174
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn_OneLinerHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:d1a9709c-8bd9-c3e0-a1c8-8e6ddbfb6174
msgctxt "h233d63bag85b1g4222gb2efgcef97bdfd6ec"
msgid "You mean to reach Moonrise. And I've orders to help you."
msgstr "문라이즈에 가겠다는 뜻이군. 당신을 도우라는 명령을 받았다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = d8f90a8a-6270-01e0-bd6d-a76d6ed5e87a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:d8f90a8a-6270-01e0-bd6d-a76d6ed5e87a
msgctxt "had79efe7gf0e9g4f29g8d48g078e20b71047"
msgid "Then it has already travelled to Moonrise."
msgstr "그러면 이미 문라이즈로 이동한 거네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d9864d6e-008b-2949-85fb-69bc14f75c47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_ToldHarpersAboutMoonlantern = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:d9864d6e-008b-2949-85fb-69bc14f75c47
msgctxt "h18e7260cge487g4f6cgba12gee67243e2416"
msgid "Sounds like a Moonlantern - that's just what we need."
msgstr "달등불처럼 들리는데. 우리에게 필요한 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = dc8c7f23-9106-5fed-916b-0d5eb30950b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:dc8c7f23-9106-5fed-916b-0d5eb30950b1
msgctxt "h6647fd94gc1fag43b3gb4f8g935da62d3823"
msgid "And their means of safe passage - do you have it?"
msgstr "그러면 그들이 가지고 있던 안전한 통행 수단을 찾아냈나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = dc8c9b98-09fe-eefa-c161-d88fdf0a4818
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn_OneLinerHasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:dc8c9b98-09fe-eefa-c161-d88fdf0a4818
msgctxt "hc0ccbb7bg05dag406cg8d3egff52cc6bb677"
msgid "Say the word, and we set the ambush in motion."
msgstr "말만 하면, 매복을 준비하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0576e58-536f-4a08-32e2-ee3f64138a8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersWillFindCaravanAtAmbush = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:e0576e58-536f-4a08-32e2-ee3f64138a8d
msgctxt "h20bca184g7f3bg4e94g9ea0g2d4a6f7f8e3f"
msgid "Go on ahead. I'll catch up."
msgstr "먼저 가. 곧 따라갈게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = e871cc83-b280-c30c-65e1-3fab419f7092
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:e871cc83-b280-c30c-65e1-3fab419f7092
msgctxt "h9b2cb67cga445g4ecag8f93gd12c781b379b"
msgid "Go, then - Moonrise Towers awaits. But know this:"
msgstr "떠나게, 문라이즈 타워가 기다리고 있네. 하지만 이것만큼은 알아두게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = eb55541f-6c20-4590-9a9a-8dae7a266f97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:eb55541f-6c20-4590-9a9a-8dae7a266f97
msgctxt "h60402534g39f4g4a0agb8b7g15264a7fbce0"
msgid ""
"A cultist convoy crosses the land as we speak. I've readied an ambush. Say "
"the word, and we fly."
msgstr "지금 이 순간에도 추종자 호송대가 이 땅을 지나다니고 있네. 매복을 준비했다. 말만 하면 바로 출발하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = f5252ca4-f4c5-59dd-cfd4-74751f88e0d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:f5252ca4-f4c5-59dd-cfd4-74751f88e0d2
msgctxt "h30128748g7cf3g4148ga67cg54aa341e5dca"
msgid "But don't tarry. The greater the opportunity, the shorter its visit."
msgstr "하지만 너무 오래 걸리지는 말게. 기회가 클수록, 그것이 우리에게 머무르는 시간은 길지 않으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn
#. Speaker = Harper Branthos
#. NodeID = f64473ab-a0ac-aee3-0d4e-d93fc12d96a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAtInn:f64473ab-a0ac-aee3-0d4e-d93fc12d96a4
msgctxt "he7df10b2gb454g47f9ga560gf72c51af41c5"
msgid "As you say. I'll mark your map with the rendezvous point."
msgstr "알았네. 접선 장소를 지도에 표시해 두도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
msgctxt "h8bef4dd6g1fdfg42d2gb473gbce41d08374c"
msgid "This must be where the drider collected his victims."
msgstr "드라이더가 그의 희생양을 모아둔 곳이 분명하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
msgctxt "h1004acc8g18e5g4c02g826dgbf37e1184320"
msgid "The origin point of the drider's caravan, it seems."
msgstr "드라이더의 호송대가 출발한 곳으로 보이는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
msgctxt "h7ef2c62egf1b6g4a25g966bge43cd1c2e975"
msgid "Must've been the caravan's home base."
msgstr "분명 여기가 호송대의 출발점이겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
msgctxt "h2d7fc0b8gbd87g4dfbg9e51g4e89f7b47207"
msgid "Look here - this is where the drider's caravan originated."
msgstr "여길 봐라. 이곳이 드라이더의 호송대가 출발한 곳이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
msgctxt "hbb11b828g0b1fg452dg8d07g28d5f00e3b3e"
msgid "The drider's caravan came from here, I'll wager."
msgstr "드라이더의 호송대가 이곳에서 왔다는 쪽에 걸겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
msgctxt "h574364eeg2f54g41c9ga9f1g4839c385ea50"
msgid "Reckon here's where that drider convoy came from."
msgstr "이곳이 드라이더 호송대가 온 장소인 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:11ed8ade-27e9-4227-b42c-ebf403d8a7bd
msgctxt "he7eb5357g4d1fg4221gbe55gbf57ca17023f"
msgid "Looks like the drider's caravan came from here."
msgstr "드라이더의 호송대는 여기서 온 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a891b9d-c74c-d24a-cb24-c99c4ff7dc5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_PlayersDefeatedCaravan = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:2a891b9d-c74c-d24a-cb24-c99c4ff7dc5d
msgctxt "hc892e3c0ge3ebg46d4g9b91gb531c0035844"
msgid ""
"It's a long walk through the dark. You'd almost pity the poor souls they "
"dragged along."
msgstr "어둠을 가로지르는 머나먼 길이로군. 놈들이 끌고 다닌 불쌍한 영혼들이 가엾게 느껴질 정도야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a891b9d-c74c-d24a-cb24-c99c4ff7dc5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_PlayersDefeatedCaravan = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:2a891b9d-c74c-d24a-cb24-c99c4ff7dc5d
msgctxt "h7a202cb4g21f1g4b57g97a4ge739fb7e53dd"
msgid "A long march through dark, unfriendly lands. I don't envy them."
msgstr "어둠이 깔린 낯선 땅을 가로지르는 기나긴 행군이라니. 전혀 부럽진 않군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a891b9d-c74c-d24a-cb24-c99c4ff7dc5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_PlayersDefeatedCaravan = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:2a891b9d-c74c-d24a-cb24-c99c4ff7dc5d
msgctxt "h1b6073c4g685bg47d8g99begf36a39c156b9"
msgid "Spidey and co. got pretty far from home base."
msgstr "거미랑 그 친구들이 집에서 꽤나 멀리도 나왔군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a891b9d-c74c-d24a-cb24-c99c4ff7dc5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_PlayersDefeatedCaravan = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:2a891b9d-c74c-d24a-cb24-c99c4ff7dc5d
msgctxt "h856fe359gb335g4d42gb7e8ga2254e2e14dc"
msgid "A veritable torture camp and prison unto itself."
msgstr "그 자체만으로도 고문실이자 수용소라 할만하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2a891b9d-c74c-d24a-cb24-c99c4ff7dc5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_PlayersDefeatedCaravan = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:2a891b9d-c74c-d24a-cb24-c99c4ff7dc5d
msgctxt "hc4114db9g430eg4a1agac7dg949bd45fe3b6"
msgid "Cages, chains - all awaiting prisoners of the Absolute."
