#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:f3f8795d-87ad-b66e-0b8f-c0a0c9eded13
msgctxt "hb3d3848egc9ccg41e0g8ddfgcff0b22c5930"
msgid "The drider's caravan came from here, I'll wager."
msgstr "드라이더의 호송대가 이곳에서 왔다는 쪽에 걸겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3f8795d-87ad-b66e-0b8f-c0a0c9eded13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:f3f8795d-87ad-b66e-0b8f-c0a0c9eded13
msgctxt "h9dbccb90gdc48g4596gbffag2d4c087b44d6"
msgid "Reckon here's where that drider convoy came from."
msgstr "이곳이 드라이더 호송대가 온 장소인 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3f8795d-87ad-b66e-0b8f-c0a0c9eded13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_BacktrackedToCaravanCheckpoint:f3f8795d-87ad-b66e-0b8f-c0a0c9eded13
msgctxt "h9dbd1867g9b64g4bbbg9869g4a8bdc4f5832"
msgid "Looks like the drider's caravan came from here."
msgstr "드라이더의 호송대는 여기서 온 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush:19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
msgctxt "h66718e56gf00cg4e41gab98g5f068bca260f"
msgid "Now we're done killing, that lantern's ours. Time to collect."
msgstr "볼 장 다 봤으니, 등불은 우리 몫이야. 수집할 시간이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush:19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
msgctxt "h90e381c1g0e51g463cg97a1g246c4e93940d"
msgid "Now to make use of that lantern."
msgstr "이제 저 등불을 사용해 보실까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush:19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
msgctxt "hed52bc33g9000g4c47gbc07ge5555395b43f"
msgid "Well done. Now I just need that lantern."
msgstr "좋았어. 이제 저 등불만 손에 넣으면 되겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush:19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
msgctxt "h07c7a17egc3f7g4650gbb46g309c0b8c43d6"
msgid "The drider is down. Now, to take its light."
msgstr "드라이더가 쓰러졌군. 이제 빛을 취하도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush:19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
msgctxt "h5c4978e7gc8e2g4bd3gbfceg3a4d7e1d0f04"
msgid "That's the last of them - better fetch that lantern."
msgstr "그놈이 마지막이었어. 등불을 챙겨야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush:19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
msgctxt "h5b138eeeg2282g488agab35g2bd4f458343e"
msgid "Victory - of course. Better grab the lantern from the corpse."
msgstr "승리라, 당연한 결과지. 시체에서 등불을 주워야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PAD_TakeLanternAfterAmbush:19bb1395-fa13-4b7c-9d41-027d399856a9
msgctxt "h2c65f352geae1g4a99g8e32g88f48b5e27e1"
msgid "Excellent - now all I need is that lantern."
msgstr "훌륭하군. 이제 등불만 있으면 되겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 01495783-adf7-4a9c-81a7-e11b5b6e8f27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:01495783-adf7-4a9c-81a7-e11b5b6e8f27
msgctxt "he6f02b27g1a7bg41e8g90b6gf097f8b7e93d"
msgid ""
"She has blessed the lantern's light. It is the Absolute who protects us from "
"the shadows."
msgstr "그분께서 등불에 은총을 내리셨다. 절대자께서 우리를 그림자로부터 보호하신다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 046cfb9c-8362-4846-aed4-9de59938ed42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_CaravanGoesHostile = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:046cfb9c-8362-4846-aed4-9de59938ed42
msgctxt "hcaa50c5fg1202g432ag8277ge9c9ee5b35c7"
msgid ""
"They think us fools, Majesty. They think we cannot see through their lies."
msgstr "신이시여, 저들은 우리가 멍청한 줄 압니다. 우리가 거짓말을 꿰뚫어 볼 줄 몰랐나 봅니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 055b5b8d-7ed4-42bb-a957-acb6e3da7e8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:055b5b8d-7ed4-42bb-a957-acb6e3da7e8c
msgctxt "hc27e0429ge1e8g4482ga95bg625bd6e90d27"
msgid "So how does this work, exactly?"
msgstr "그래서 정확히 이게 어떻게 작동하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0e9a65cb-35ef-44e0-a340-725e1a40f80c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:0e9a65cb-35ef-44e0-a340-725e1a40f80c
msgctxt "h6930a8acgcaeag49abg91f1gbb303367098b"
msgid "Good. You may go now."
msgstr "좋아. 이만 가보도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 142e6b92-d813-b168-50d0-7c97df20e2b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:142e6b92-d813-b168-50d0-7c97df20e2b8
msgctxt "hff300803g2e2fg47c0ga24bg3985b05341c7"
msgid ""
"A mere mortal warrior could have never persevered alone... Ah! Of course!"
msgstr "고작 필멸자 전사가 절대 버텨낼 수 없었을 텐데... 아! 그렇군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 101b8749-82e6-4e4e-8f76-8cdfb826182a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:101b8749-82e6-4e4e-8f76-8cdfb826182a
msgctxt "h51c17d24g2fb8g43ffga523g30951b48b029"
msgid ""
"A mere mortal warrior could have never persevered alone... Ah! Of course!"
msgstr "한낱 필멸자 전사가 홀로 살아남다니... 아! 그런 거군요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1437bcd8-ce66-472a-b3fe-219cd8e7a610
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:1437bcd8-ce66-472a-b3fe-219cd8e7a610
msgctxt "hf600e3b6gac6bg4bf1gbc1dgea01341b6f99"
msgid "I am a guardian of nature - and in return nature protects me."
msgstr "난 자연의 수호자다. 그렇기에 자연 또한 나를 보호하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 182b5c93-c42e-f0cf-c7c3-b81c73724f6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:182b5c93-c42e-f0cf-c7c3-b81c73724f6f
msgctxt "h09527a0cg4af1g4a71gaeeeg0236bc15c3e1"
msgid ""
"To make the darkness quiver with mere song - you must have blessed them, my "
"Queen. But if so... where is their lantern?"
msgstr "그저 노래로 어둠을 떨게 하다니, 여왕님께서 그들에게 축복을 내리신 게 틀림없다. 그렇다면... 그들의 등불은 어디 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 157685c4-e230-49b1-9046-ad713f1121ed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:157685c4-e230-49b1-9046-ad713f1121ed
msgctxt "h1718c346g32a5g4fdcgb190gb655523f658e"
msgid ""
"To make the darkness quiver with mere song - you must have blessed them, my "
"Queen. But if so... where is their lantern?"
msgstr "그저 노래로 어둠을 떨게 하다니, 여왕님께서 그들에게 축복을 내리신 게 틀림없다. 그렇다면... 그들의 등불은 어디 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 16756480-60e6-4e04-93f9-b2a6b683eed9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:16756480-60e6-4e04-93f9-b2a6b683eed9
msgctxt "h08843607ga6a1g4416gb5edg939c4f8bf7b9"
msgid ""
"I have tested my mind and body beyond to its absolute limits - I do not fear "
"the darkness."
msgstr "난 나의 정신과 몸을 극도의 한계까지 시험해봤다. 어둠은 두렵지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 1704f09c-b41a-4278-b9b6-38c64d25e367
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:1704f09c-b41a-4278-b9b6-38c64d25e367
msgctxt "h3bde3cf8gea90g49f5g9205gcb09740aeb12"
msgid "This is not her Majesty's will."
msgstr "이건 여왕님의 의지가 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 18972462-1e4a-4fea-91d1-2470913e3366
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:18972462-1e4a-4fea-91d1-2470913e3366
msgctxt "h7205241eg8f4ag4c45g99eeg62268b41bc94"
msgid "One of your True Souls, my Queen! How have they survived?"
msgstr "당신의 참된 영혼입니다. 여왕이시여! 그들이 어떻게 살아남았나이까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 1c18605c-2ec5-4ebc-aadb-503f135e4496
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:1c18605c-2ec5-4ebc-aadb-503f135e4496
msgctxt "hc6639cb7gaf82g40a8gb11fg11c864ebf73c"
msgid "They don't know? Our Queen told them nothing?"
msgstr "모른단 말입니까? 우리의 여왕께서 아무것도 알려주시지 않았나이까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fef724b-50b4-42b3-9fa2-152246153e94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:1fef724b-50b4-42b3-9fa2-152246153e94
msgctxt "h1c3d72feg07c2g43cbgabb3g796d454ede74"
msgid "Indeed, it's time for you to go."
msgstr "좋아, 이제 가보도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 21880ea0-2819-4761-9668-041f199e894b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:21880ea0-2819-4761-9668-041f199e894b
msgctxt "h6b26f18cg1aa6g4831g98faga568e66fe1e2"
msgid "No, we will keep your gift and drive this false one back into the dark!"
msgstr "아니, 우리가 너의 선물을 갖고 이 가짜를 다시 어둠 속으로 몰아넣겠다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 2865dbd2-f921-47f3-ad81-5a52eca0a88b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:2865dbd2-f921-47f3-ad81-5a52eca0a88b
msgctxt "h5af888b8g7d7cg4539ga342g809b625b9c48"
msgid "We will punish them for this blasphemy. We will make them scream!"
msgstr "우린 저들의 모독을 벌하겠습니다. 비명을 지르게 하겠습니다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ce124a9-a696-4065-8e1b-ec2014b6e34c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:2ce124a9-a696-4065-8e1b-ec2014b6e34c
msgctxt "hbcb6e5a5g3235g4372gb612gccb8e7d54bb1"
msgid "Navigating dangerous terrain is second nature to me."
msgstr "위험한 땅을 헤쳐나가는 건 내 천성이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3117d42d-cf55-4972-92ce-fcd66b618aad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = False
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(3) = False
#.      - DROWELF(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:3117d42d-cf55-4972-92ce-fcd66b618aad
msgctxt "hb6d413f1g9dffg417ega85eg5aa34f984ec6"
msgid "The Absolute wants you to go. Now!"
msgstr "절대자께서 가라고 명하신다. 당장!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 329ca5d9-5faf-41e4-adb3-16b0cdebca4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:329ca5d9-5faf-41e4-adb3-16b0cdebca4c
msgctxt "h2354c75ag09e4g49cbgb76ag6e7f2b1198e9"
msgid "Majesty? Is - is this true? Did I not serve you well?"
msgstr "여왕님? 이게, 이게 정말입니까? 제가 당신을 잘 섬기지 못한 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 33e0fbae-fbfd-4b32-90db-4de3ae640fe8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_DriderLeavesTowardsTower = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_AvoidedCombat = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_AcquiredMoonlanternWithoutFight = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:33e0fbae-fbfd-4b32-90db-4de3ae640fe8
msgctxt "h5c223782gdaddg4bf6g8681gf2bd963f49a3"
msgid "If - if it is her majesty's will..."
msgstr "그... 그분의 뜻이라면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 346acad9-76a4-40ed-aba8-93769ceb74c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:346acad9-76a4-40ed-aba8-93769ceb74c1
msgctxt "h06454bc3g47e1g45a8g96fbg07bf77935c63"
msgid "<i>Attack the drider.</i>"
msgstr "<i>드라이더를 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 34a317db-7480-41a1-8a47-d60552ed46f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_DriderDropsLantern = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:34a317db-7480-41a1-8a47-d60552ed46f0
msgctxt "h45a64e8cg23c5g486fg904eg439c1aa2d9de"
msgid "Very well. If it is your will, they can have it."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 이것이 당신께서 원하시는 바라면, 그들은 등불을 가질 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34ac84d4-4c19-44d1-85a5-e43b10f8826f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:34ac84d4-4c19-44d1-85a5-e43b10f8826f
msgctxt "h0c09a506gb2b0g44e9g8dfeg6d3539b7fffa"
msgid "With the aid of my mind and my magic, for I am a master of both."
msgstr "나의 정신력과 마법의 도움으로 살아남았지, 난 그 두 가지의 대가거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 398d8b5a-ad9d-4a18-9c4e-64e82e55dc1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:398d8b5a-ad9d-4a18-9c4e-64e82e55dc1f
msgctxt "h3bed52f9g0e53g4a6fgb4b0ge366b742b36a"
msgid ""
"I swore an oath - a powerful one. It will take more than darkness to end me."
msgstr "나에겐 아주 강력한 맹세의 힘이 있지. 어둠으론 내 목숨을 거둘 수 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 4a629eaa-9e5b-a761-7b85-5eb4227a4d94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:4a629eaa-9e5b-a761-7b85-5eb4227a4d94
msgctxt "h581e61c5g59e2g4deegb441g9ec031bb3cdb"
msgid "But the druids have no power here, not since... Ah, of course!"
msgstr "하지만 그 사건 이후로 드루이드는 더 이상 힘을 발휘할 수 없을 터인데... 아, 그렇군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 47c670c6-f931-4b24-881f-f9a72ae6c39b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:47c670c6-f931-4b24-881f-f9a72ae6c39b
msgctxt "h6963d39eg96b5g4b4dga79dgf5c27a3da432"
msgid "But the druids have no power here, not since... Ah, of course!"
msgstr "하지만 그 사건 이후로 드루이드는 더 이상 힘을 발휘할 수 없을 터인데... 아, 그렇군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a64384c-6a4b-446b-bfe7-e8168355ff13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:4a64384c-6a4b-446b-bfe7-e8168355ff13
msgctxt "had63ef6dg0188g4dc6gac23g61e1f6012f2f"
msgid ""
"No - that lantern is mine, by order of the Absolute. Give it - <i>now.</i>"
msgstr "아니, 절대자님의 명령에 따라 그 등불은 내 것이다. 내게 넘겨. <i>당장.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 5178ee5f-7ec6-4cbb-ad5a-57ac0571a895
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:5178ee5f-7ec6-4cbb-ad5a-57ac0571a895
msgctxt "hc08ed28dg7ce7g4dd8g9755g04d73d11c640"
msgid ""
"Simply shadows. Cursed, hungry shadows, trying to grab the living. And they "
"are getting stronger."
msgstr "말 그대로 그림자다. 저주받고 굶주려서 산 것들을 잡아채려고 들지. 그리고 더욱 강해지고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 554201c0-a9d2-4543-b03f-b5da2454f0c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:554201c0-a9d2-4543-b03f-b5da2454f0c2
msgctxt "h903c5000gaf5fg4748g8014gcaf70ce1e97e"
msgid ""
"I am both a True Soul and a cleric. I've blessed you with the power of the "
"Absolute - you'll be safe."
msgstr "나는 참된 영혼이자 클레릭이니. 너를 절대자님의 이름으로 축복하겠다. 너는 안전할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5a620947-6ecb-4bed-afba-22554f2d5b00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DROWELF(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:5a620947-6ecb-4bed-afba-22554f2d5b00
msgctxt "hf56231a4g6bf2g495ag864cg79c0bb978b1d"
msgid ""
"If we in the Underdark, I would split you open, drider. Leave before I "
"change my mind."
msgstr "여기가 언더다크였으면 네놈을 쪼개버렸을 것이다, 드라이더. 내 마음에 바뀌기 전에 떠나라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61db3ad1-4ae9-41c0-b4fe-a01f29706919
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:61db3ad1-4ae9-41c0-b4fe-a01f29706919
msgctxt "hcbcdedfdgb736g4757gb949g980b32409b7a"
msgid "Never mind me, how have you survived the curse?"
msgstr "난 신경 쓸 거 없다. 그보다 어떻게 저주를 견뎌낸 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63dee6c0-0bcc-478a-8a43-dfceaa766855
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Player_Knows_MoonlanternExists = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:63dee6c0-0bcc-478a-8a43-dfceaa766855
msgctxt "h5513c48bg996ag42fega302gccee4b2c672a"
msgid "Lantern? Is that what protects you out here?"
msgstr "등불? 그게 널 저주로부터 보호한다고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 660d40ed-b4ee-41ef-a622-b5ea99c15861
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:660d40ed-b4ee-41ef-a622-b5ea99c15861
msgctxt "hfe0e0f21g2f5cg4488g8dfagedfc93cec108"
msgid ""
"That lantern is mine - by order of the Absolute. Drop it, or I'll shatter "
"your spine as the wind breaks a twig."
msgstr "절대자의 명령에 따라 등불은 내 것이다. 내놓지 않으면, 마치 바람이 나뭇가지를 부러뜨리듯 네 척추를 부러뜨려 주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 662a8174-dee4-48fa-b70e-76e016fe7770
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_CaravanGoesHostile = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:662a8174-dee4-48fa-b70e-76e016fe7770
msgctxt "h245864aeg2d27g4563g8680gf6d154f21948"
msgid "Traitor - heretic!"
msgstr "배신자 - 이 이단 놈!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 71599562-6e2e-4749-9b0c-d966cd3cbe49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:71599562-6e2e-4749-9b0c-d966cd3cbe49
msgctxt "hbd4a0bc1gf2e9g4bd1gb5b6g3ed8b5dd44b8"
msgid "You blessed them too, my Queen? Where is their lantern?"
msgstr "여왕이시여, 당신께서 그들에게도 축복을 내리셨나이까? 그런데 그들의 등불은 어디 있는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7549bf7f-c040-4aa5-9d27-c04194aaa798
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = False
#.      - SORCERER(3) = False
#.      - WIZARD(3) = False
#.      - MONK(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:7549bf7f-c040-4aa5-9d27-c04194aaa798
msgctxt "h19ad83bfgb76ag45f0g9ec9g7cc92fffc14c"
msgid "The Absolute has asked me to carry the lantern. Hand it over."
msgstr "절대자께서 내게 등불을 옮기라고 명령하셨다. 이리 내놓아라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76ac2dfb-cbc2-433f-bddf-f648285738c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:76ac2dfb-cbc2-433f-bddf-f648285738c4
msgctxt "ha9888b67g4186g41d0gbcdcg2aca6367ab34"
msgid "I burn with pure arcana - how on earth do <i>you</i> survive?"
msgstr "난 순수한 마력이 타오르고 있거든. 근데 <i>너흰</i> 어떻게 살아남은 건데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 7767c5a8-61d3-4d42-9dc1-cb4f654b1052
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:7767c5a8-61d3-4d42-9dc1-cb4f654b1052
msgctxt "h27537cfdg25cbg43a6gad23g7588297c1e86"
msgid "No, we will keep your gift and drive this false one back into the dark!"
msgstr "아니, 우리가 너의 선물을 갖고 이 가짜를 다시 어둠 속으로 몰아넣겠다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7bc570de-ef28-4ea0-b4dd-6d6c72cedd32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DROWELF(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:7bc570de-ef28-4ea0-b4dd-6d6c72cedd32
msgctxt "hc56b2ccfgd60cg4727g88f0g271e1c6850f3"
msgid ""
"The Absolute guided me here. She said a mere drider was not worthy - that I "
"must take your lantern."
msgstr "절대자께서 나를 인도하셨다. 그분께서 하등한 드라이더는 가치가 없다고 하시더군. 그 등불은 내가 가져가겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 7d6654f7-68b2-448f-8a82-9b7845f919a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_CaravanGoesHostile = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:7d6654f7-68b2-448f-8a82-9b7845f919a1
msgctxt "h2a446978g32beg47abg81edgf566dd4dc3e5"
msgid "But majesty, you gave this lantern to me. You said it was mine!"
msgstr "그런데 여왕님, 이 등불은 저에게 주셨습니다. 제 것이라고 하셨지 않습니까!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 838eeeaa-9cf5-493c-81d0-59caa4a3a9b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:838eeeaa-9cf5-493c-81d0-59caa4a3a9b7
msgctxt "h7d402bb9g30cbg45c5gb38ag779d2407867a"
msgid "They will follow close. Do not leave the light!"
msgstr "가까이 따라붙을 지어다. 빛에서 멀어지지 말도록!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83b6149b-fb88-42af-9c6a-7244f9eb437a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:83b6149b-fb88-42af-9c6a-7244f9eb437a
msgctxt "he31211e0g5756g4f77gbacag87992800a3ee"
msgid ""
"Question me again, and I will make drag you into the darkness - screaming."
msgstr "한 번만 더 내 말에 의문을 제기하면, 그땐 내가 직접 널 어둠 속으로 끌고 가겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 85b5f0ef-66cd-4b6f-a65e-bcdd93e65a2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_CaravanGoesHostile = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:85b5f0ef-66cd-4b6f-a65e-bcdd93e65a2e
msgctxt "hce2466bagf7d2g4f77g9b00gb5f5b903f01d"
msgid "But majesty, you gave this lantern to me. You said it was mine!"
msgstr "그런데 여왕님, 이 등불은 저에게 주셨습니다. 제 것이라고 하셨지 않습니까!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8653043c-1883-4db6-9fe6-70c32ffc3599
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:8653043c-1883-4db6-9fe6-70c32ffc3599
msgctxt "h3691564egd95fg4226g8541g8803bcc87f04"
msgid "You know what they say - a ballad a day, keeps the darkness away!"
msgstr "누가 그랬지. 하루에 한 곡의 발라드면, 어둠을 몰아낼 수 있다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 7df9ba0e-cfa8-99d4-db95-3513353df8d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:7df9ba0e-cfa8-99d4-db95-3513353df8d9
msgctxt "hc725f32eg7f8eg439dg9983ga90cdac5b67a"
msgid "There is but one god - and she is <i>Absolute.</i>"
msgstr "세상엔 오직 한 분의 신이 계시다. 그리고 그분은 <i>절대자시다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 8753770d-8c2d-428d-9747-a072a66d774b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:8753770d-8c2d-428d-9747-a072a66d774b
msgctxt "h32cd664cg37b9g4c5dg99f1g4fbb2adc0a3a"
msgid "There is but one god - and she is <i>Absolute.</i>"
msgstr "세상엔 오직 한 분의 신이 계시다. 그리고 그분은 <i>절대자시다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8e7c76e3-daeb-4b95-85ae-64c4361f880f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: SHAR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:8e7c76e3-daeb-4b95-85ae-64c4361f880f
msgctxt "h34d7cbefg62d3g4582g8f5fg671396cdb271"
msgid "The shadows do not hunt me as they do others. What are they, exactly?"
msgstr "그림자가 남들한테 하는 것만큼 날 쫓진 않던데. 정확히 정체가 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8e7c76e3-daeb-4b95-85ae-64c4361f880f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:8e7c76e3-daeb-4b95-85ae-64c4361f880f
msgctxt "h5813fad3g14b1g4fe3g8627ge07b2a7ca656"
msgid "Protects us from what? What are the shadows, exactly?"
msgstr "우리를 보호한다고? 이 그림자란 게 정확히 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 93367af1-df16-4bc5-9625-6213908d03ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:93367af1-df16-4bc5-9625-6213908d03ee
msgctxt "h5953aee6gd32bg4565gaf4ag68b8950dac59"
msgid "Majesty! Please..."
msgstr "여왕이시여! 자비를..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 88f4d1c5-5a12-49ca-efe8-e39c34565e05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:88f4d1c5-5a12-49ca-efe8-e39c34565e05
msgctxt "hbaeaa4fbgc936g4751g82fdg0454401fec08"
msgid "Ah, you swore an oath to my Queen! But if so... where is their lantern?"
msgstr "아, 나의 여왕께 맹세를 했군! 하지만 그렇다면... 랜턴은 어디에 있나이까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 9500d5e5-8261-4f84-914e-4dcf86784aa3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:9500d5e5-8261-4f84-914e-4dcf86784aa3
msgctxt "he870be5bgf0a7g4520gad96gf256e3ad45c5"
msgid "Ah, you swore an oath to my Queen! But if so... where is their lantern?"
msgstr "아! 나의 여왕께 맹세를 하였구나! 그런데... 그럼 네 등불은 어디 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 9c3b6fdf-11de-424b-98b6-e43040fd4564
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:9c3b6fdf-11de-424b-98b6-e43040fd4564
msgctxt "h12f3f38ag55eeg42fbgaeb5gf99793df7f95"
msgid "IF IT IS HER MAJESTY'S WILL, THEN WE SHALL WALK!"
msgstr "<b>그분의 뜻이라면, 우린 가야만 한다! </b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e6f4be6-d0dd-4ae3-9bb6-e42f450cfd3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:9e6f4be6-d0dd-4ae3-9bb6-e42f450cfd3c
msgctxt "hc484c5f0ge728g481cg83fegf8d43c1349d5"
msgid "Or I could kill you and take that light."
msgstr "아니면 그냥 널 죽이고 그 빛을 빼앗아갈 수도 있겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a65452e4-1a09-4a24-bf5f-1ba2891c4a1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:a65452e4-1a09-4a24-bf5f-1ba2891c4a1c
msgctxt "h2becc8a6gf81cg49c2gbd35g083c48a5b31f"
msgid "*As the sounds fade, there is nothing left but cold, still silence.*"
msgstr "*소리가 잦아들며, 차갑고 고요한 정적만이 남는다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abfbad59-1b75-4f1d-bd64-34fcc32da916
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:abfbad59-1b75-4f1d-bd64-34fcc32da916
msgctxt "h4bcb5002gf9c7g4936g90fdgdc8cb338aeea"
msgid "No higher forces protect me - I survived by my own tenacity."
msgstr "날 수호하는 지고한 힘 따위는 존재하지 않는다. 내 스스로의 힘으로 견뎌냈지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = b0220e6a-aecc-43f3-802e-a2b69c77ddaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:b0220e6a-aecc-43f3-802e-a2b69c77ddaa
msgctxt "h43850372g1822g4edbgbe0egce3c35e97da0"
msgid "Step into the light! Let us see you."
msgstr "빛으로 들어와라! 너희들의 모습을 볼 수 있도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = b6c61099-6538-44ed-bd4d-f9d416e90270
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:b6c61099-6538-44ed-bd4d-f9d416e90270
msgctxt "h50245784gea69g476dg948ag5eefd49722f5"
msgid "Someone in the dark, mistress."
msgstr "어둠 속에 누군가가 있군요, 여주인이시여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bea5653c-ecb6-4f38-ad3f-464434fc4b55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersStartFollowingDrider = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_AvoidedCombat = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithCaravan = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_SidedWithHarpers = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:bea5653c-ecb6-4f38-ad3f-464434fc4b55
msgctxt "hc104066agbf59g45d9gabeeg37a2130cb7ec"
msgid "Thank you - let's go."
msgstr "고맙군 - 그럼 움직이도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1847823-b7d9-4c79-8717-9d0baa4b5b76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:c1847823-b7d9-4c79-8717-9d0baa4b5b76
msgctxt "hb7ccff7bg2216g4babg9ff5gf63eb6d81818"
msgid "You're holding my lantern. The Absolute said you had to give it to me."
msgstr "내 등불을 가지고 있구나. 절대자께서 그걸 내게 넘기라 명하셨다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4161cd6-2c09-43ce-9d68-10684561bbf9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:c4161cd6-2c09-43ce-9d68-10684561bbf9
msgctxt "ha5bfe005g2fedg4fa9g96bcg80fc3427cf5a"
msgid "GO. NOW."
msgstr "<b>가. 당장.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4202430-beb9-43b8-9f4a-5f190c3760bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:c4202430-beb9-43b8-9f4a-5f190c3760bd
msgctxt "hfc8ec1b2g9e32g4774gb649g893d61c70302"
msgid ""
"<i>(Wave hands.)</i> There - you now carry the blessing of the Absolute. "
"You'll be safe."
msgstr "<i>(손을 휘젓는다.)</i> 자, 이제 네게 절대자의 축복이 함께함이니, 안전할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce1f67b3-254e-49ba-b239-ec6ed93795c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:ce1f67b3-254e-49ba-b239-ec6ed93795c7
msgctxt "h3201d346g3534g4adcgb2d4g29bec2ea2861"
msgid "The Absolute protected me."
msgstr "절대자께서 나를 보호하셨다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cf24b3e3-e920-4ce5-b528-e24af6b23be1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:cf24b3e3-e920-4ce5-b528-e24af6b23be1
msgctxt "h3f264b31g342dg4334gaa38g5cffb9952a33"
msgid "<b><i>ROAR.</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>크아아.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cf24b3e3-e920-4ce5-b528-e24af6b23be1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:cf24b3e3-e920-4ce5-b528-e24af6b23be1
msgctxt "h9fbec86bg4757g4a5fg8e52g2e0a1d8d7171"
msgid "<i>ROAR.</i>"
msgstr "<i>크아아.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cfad911f-aec4-432c-9808-bc55caa3f4f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:cfad911f-aec4-432c-9808-bc55caa3f4f5
msgctxt "hf38db785g5a94g4c51g8b6bg334c490556ec"
msgid "Takes more than shadows to put someone like me down."
msgstr "나쯤 되는 자를 쓰러트리려면, 고작 그림자로는 부족하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = d11c48ca-6de8-42c3-8c4d-ba76e7eecae9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:d11c48ca-6de8-42c3-8c4d-ba76e7eecae9
msgctxt "h617d9471g5f15g4e6cg9525gea1a7b93cdbb"
msgid ""
"Our goddess protects us. We carry her sacred light to drive back the shadows."
msgstr "여신께서 우리를 보호하셨지. 어둠을 몰아내는 그분의 신성한 빛 덕분이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = c706c29c-6fbd-7bf5-d351-1a38c62d3435
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:c706c29c-6fbd-7bf5-d351-1a38c62d3435
msgctxt "hf6ba7402gab72g408bg9973gc6d1feec7c91"
msgid "Magic alone could never have persevered... Ah! Of course!"
msgstr "마법만으로는 절대 버틸 수 없었을 텐데... 아! 그렇군!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = d2aeedd1-fb87-4856-8408-2d60bc133e0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:d2aeedd1-fb87-4856-8408-2d60bc133e0b
msgctxt "h332708d7g2f2ag42f4g898eg08e4bbfe4805"
msgid "Magic alone could never have persevered... Ah! Of course!"
msgstr "고작 마법으로 견딜수가 없을 텐데... 아! 그런 거군요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kansif
#. NodeID = d6351959-c708-42ff-a273-eacde4172423
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:d6351959-c708-42ff-a273-eacde4172423
msgctxt "h417e2ef6g9f46g4e07g96fbgefd258097852"
msgid "You can't be serious. You know what's out there-"
msgstr "진심일 리가 없잖습니까. 등불이 없으면 어떻게 될지 아시면서..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da0e4363-9e30-4c10-9e93-a3ef5e02cd63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(3) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART and !SHADOWHEART_ENEMYOFSHARPATH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:da0e4363-9e30-4c10-9e93-a3ef5e02cd63
msgctxt "hd3646240g7882g4359g8b81g2620b167a43c"
msgid "Lady Shar protects me - I do not belong to your Queen."
msgstr "샤께서 날 지켜주시니, 나는 네 여왕의 종이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da0e4363-9e30-4c10-9e93-a3ef5e02cd63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(3) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EVIL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:da0e4363-9e30-4c10-9e93-a3ef5e02cd63
msgctxt "h703d30d5g2ea5g4138ga2beg0bcd08483cf3"
msgid "My god does not fear the shadows - I do not belong to your Queen."
msgstr "내 신께서는 고작 어둠 따위를 두려워하지 않으시니 - 나는 네 여왕의 종이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da0e4363-9e30-4c10-9e93-a3ef5e02cd63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(3) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_NEUTRAL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:da0e4363-9e30-4c10-9e93-a3ef5e02cd63
msgctxt "h34ac0eddg4ad7g47b3ga2b9g00103b481a18"
msgid "My god's favour protected me - I do not belong to your Queen."
msgstr "내 신의 은총이 날 보호했지. 난 네 여왕의 종이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = da0e4363-9e30-4c10-9e93-a3ef5e02cd63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(3) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GOOD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:da0e4363-9e30-4c10-9e93-a3ef5e02cd63
msgctxt "ha1b15772gf97bg4745ga41bg247da501d1ec"
msgid "I am not one of <i>hers - </i>divine light guides my footfall."
msgstr "난 <i>그녀의 </i> 종이 아니다. 신성한 빛이 내 발이 향하는 곳을 인도하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = db738f87-12a0-4bc5-aaaa-90bd2209cac5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:db738f87-12a0-4bc5-aaaa-90bd2209cac5
msgctxt "he58b2edag6b9bg417egb591gf0e5e73d6b59"
msgid ""
"Yes, majesty, your light can shield another of your faithful. They will join "
"us on the road."
msgstr "그렇습니다, 여왕님. 당신의 빛은 다른 신도도 품을 만큼 밝게 빛납니다. 저들도 저희의 행군에 함께할 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddb7290c-d6e8-4c01-9a28-0e5edb7905f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DROWELF(3) = False
#.      - BARD(3) = False
#.      - ROGUE(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:ddb7290c-d6e8-4c01-9a28-0e5edb7905f3
msgctxt "he58f2f66g8a1dg40cagb1ccg7ae93010d522"
msgid "The Absolute guided me to you. She said I was to take yours."
msgstr "절대자께서 나를 네게 인도하셨다. 그분께서 네 것을 취하라고 하셨다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e14f4606-da21-414e-a48b-f8754975c95b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:e14f4606-da21-414e-a48b-f8754975c95b
msgctxt "h20e822fdge1efg407egac86g9523f2617488"
msgid ""
"*Your minds connect and you hear a voice whispering to you. The Absolute? Or "
"just the echoes of his fractured mind, reverberating in the darkness?*"
msgstr "*정신이 이어지고 속삭이는 목소리가 들립니다. 절대자? 아니면 단지 그의 분열된 정신의 메아리가 어둠 속에 울려퍼지는 걸까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e40be1cc-a9c5-4e7c-ab95-27af3a5e00c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(3) = False
#.      - SORCERER(3) = False
#.      - WIZARD(3) = False
#.      - BARD(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:e40be1cc-a9c5-4e7c-ab95-27af3a5e00c5
msgctxt "h0117e8c3g0318g49c7g86c3gf1459216b215"
msgid "The Absolute has blessed you. You will be safe."
msgstr "절대자께서 너를 축복하셨으니, 안전할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8478376-9cfd-42ca-a918-bdcfd4149627
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:e8478376-9cfd-42ca-a918-bdcfd4149627
msgctxt "h6d048760g37acg4697g8ad6g15cf42d23572"
msgid ""
"<i>Securus! </i>There - you now carry the blessing of the Absolute. You'll "
"be safe."
msgstr "<i>세쿠루스! </i> 자 - 이제 절대자의 은총이 너와 함께하니, 안전할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eaec9b1b-0dab-4fb0-a2ab-9700e25e6734
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:eaec9b1b-0dab-4fb0-a2ab-9700e25e6734
msgctxt "h02e01bf5gb927g4515gbb03g984f6dd0d2b2"
msgid ""
"Our wondrous Queen dropped me a message - she said you need to give me that "
"lantern. It's <i>very</i> important."
msgstr "우리의 경애하는 여왕께서 내게 전언을 남기셨다 - 네 그 등불을 내게 넘기라더군. <i>아주</i> 중요한 일이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = ed55cd83-5ed0-4f52-8db5-d12d819e7837
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:ed55cd83-5ed0-4f52-8db5-d12d819e7837
msgctxt "he742ae1ag7a63g4cc2g8114gd0cbb526ad5f"
msgid ""
"But do not worry, there is still power in the lantern. Our queen will "
"protect you, as she protected me."
msgstr "하지만 두려워할 것 없습니다. 아직 그 등불에 힘이 남아있으니. 우리의 여왕께서 당신을 지켜주실 것입니다, 저를 지켜주셨듯이요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f00bd9e5-19b5-484d-861d-8b9ec12bcc1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. TagRule: SORCERER or WIZARD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:f00bd9e5-19b5-484d-861d-8b9ec12bcc1f
msgctxt "h1a2632e4gc103g4c02g98dfg0971456e5617"
msgid ""
"That lantern is mine - by order of the Absolute. Drop it, or I'll boil your "
"brain inside your skull."
msgstr "절대자의 명령에 따라 등불은 나의 것이다. 내놓아라, 안 그러면 네 그 뇌를 뇌수로 삶아 죽여주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = f2375890-6e83-c787-efba-848a3b9fa91a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_HarpersAndPlayersAmbush:f2375890-6e83-c787-efba-848a3b9fa91a
msgctxt "h0d4b7c1cge9dfg4733gbcaag18debb6dd26c"
msgid ""
"To have a rage so fierce the dark quivers - you must have blessed them, my "
"Queen! But if so... where is their lantern?"
msgstr "어둠마저 떨게 하는 분노라니. 그들에게 축복을 내리셨군요, 여왕이시여! 하지만 그렇다면... 랜턴은 어디에 있나이까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = f4768bee-d853-4acb-a320-1a2a41e51511
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:f4768bee-d853-4acb-a320-1a2a41e51511
msgctxt "h58466584ge0e4g4c5fgb09bg22cc9d49ddb9"
msgid ""
"To have a rage so fierce the dark quivers - you must have blessed them, my "
"Queen! But if so... where is their lantern?"
msgstr ""
"어둠마저 몸서리치게 만드는 흉포한 분노라니 - 여왕이시여, 당신께서 이 자들을 축복하셨군요! 하지만... 그렇다면 그들의 등불은 어디 "
"있습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f4eafcf0-94de-45c0-b665-59732b465cc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:f4eafcf0-94de-45c0-b665-59732b465cc7
msgctxt "h29c457c7gcf7dg46cag8e14g77b28ce2773e"
msgid ""
"<i>Vale, idiotae! </i>There - you now carry the blessing of the Absolute. "
"You'll be safe."
msgstr "<i>발레, 이디오타이! </i> 자 - 이제 네게 절대자의 축복이 함께함이니, 안전할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = f76417ce-6eb0-46db-8a72-24174af26431
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:f76417ce-6eb0-46db-8a72-24174af26431
msgctxt "h839c0e9ag18c2g457egbc30g898ef5f1eef2"
msgid "Nere? A fickle, unworthy servant to our Queen."
msgstr "니어라고? 우리 여왕님의 변덕스럽고, 자격 없는 종복 말이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = f93a4d43-6692-4d56-a10b-81b80406c2ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:f93a4d43-6692-4d56-a10b-81b80406c2ca
msgctxt "h17d56894g5fa2g4f18g916eg51509c05d724"
msgid "She will protect us. She - she must."
msgstr "그분께서 우릴 보호하실 거다. 그분께서 - 그분께서 분명히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9b81d8a-8ab7-46f8-ab71-c717d082f04b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:f9b81d8a-8ab7-46f8-ab71-c717d082f04b
msgctxt "h605906d7gdd9fg4525gba40g70e1b47bd1b8"
msgid "<i>Attack the drider.</i>"
msgstr "<i>드라이더를 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa6a3019-d0ed-4b6e-b6df-bec6499dd347
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Player_Knows_NereToldAboutMoonlantern = True
#. TagRule: !(REALLY_DROWELF and REALLY_DROWHALFELF)
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:fa6a3019-d0ed-4b6e-b6df-bec6499dd347
msgctxt "ha24f75a5gba9fg4b4bg84f8g2638cf3ba659"
msgid "I would use the drow Nere's lantern, but it broke."
msgstr "그 드로우 니어의 등불을 사용하려 했는데, 망가졌더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fa6a3019-d0ed-4b6e-b6df-bec6499dd347
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Player_Knows_NereToldAboutMoonlantern = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_PlayersAmbush:fa6a3019-d0ed-4b6e-b6df-bec6499dd347
msgctxt "h765c1f73gc1efg450dg868cg2954c09610fc"
msgid "I would use True Soul Nere's lantern, but it broke."
msgstr "참된 영혼 니어의 등불을 사용하려 했는데, 부서졌더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 042922c4-dd98-b7c0-e0ed-afc03d5b895c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:042922c4-dd98-b7c0-e0ed-afc03d5b895c
msgctxt "h71bbde53g36a8g4573g9addg64b4b6fddcbc"
msgid ""
"They're protected from the curse by a power like your lantern - but weaker."
msgstr "이들도 네 등불과 비슷하지만 - 더 나약한 힘에 의해 보호받고 있었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0919946f-14c2-47ec-9905-19763f8d6c86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5f9a395c-f766-5a61-f122-bbcd094c95a0_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:0919946f-14c2-47ec-9905-19763f8d6c86
msgctxt "he85d9597ga1ecg4a58gba43gfb0366c55716"
msgid ""
"Do not question your superiors, creature. My orders come directly from the "
"Absolute."
msgstr "감히 네 상관에게 의심을 품지 말아라, 짐승아. 내가 받은 명령은 절대자께서 직접 내리신 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09eb9b0d-b703-abe0-1b38-2d3a11cc548f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Factions_Knows_Harpers = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:09eb9b0d-b703-abe0-1b38-2d3a11cc548f
msgctxt "h847f7077g6a2bg456cg9d1ag1d09a5c5d081"
msgid "You never said there were others out here. Who are they?"
msgstr "다른 이들에 대해서 말한 적은 없었지 않나. 저들은 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 15c1bf93-87a2-da10-73dc-0878d98f0f21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:15c1bf93-87a2-da10-73dc-0878d98f0f21
msgctxt "hb7c5159cge504g46fag881fg871c10186f04"
msgid "Because their gods are weaker. None compare to the Absolute."
msgstr "놈들의 신이 더 나약하기 때문이지. 절대자께는 비교조차 되지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 2dc5d500-da51-d4eb-a515-981c9336fd91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersStartFollowingDrider = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_WaitingAtAmbushAfterCombat = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:2dc5d500-da51-d4eb-a515-981c9336fd91
msgctxt "hd63a4d30ge0e1g41e5gb5fdg5e72bf605e0f"
msgid "Yes, we have our duty. We shall lead them home, Majesty."
msgstr "물론입니다. 우리에겐 의무가 있지요. 이들을 집으로 인도하겠습니다, 폐하."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 31a92c5b-d3f5-112a-485b-69a8bc4581f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:31a92c5b-d3f5-112a-485b-69a8bc4581f3
msgctxt "h33dc3887g1275g4b95gba7bg20fcca10d9f6"
msgid "A True Soul. Why would one of our queen's blessed walk with Harpers?"
msgstr "참된 영혼이라니. 어째서 우리 여왕의 축복을 받은 이가 하퍼들과 함께하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 32252909-4913-f8c2-2112-ebe32b972d44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:32252909-4913-f8c2-2112-ebe32b972d44
msgctxt "h63586dc4gb3e2g4859gacaeg83994fd78881"
msgid ""
"*Your minds connect and you hear a whispered voice. The Absolute? Or just "
"the echoes of his fractured mind, reverberating in the dark?*"
msgstr ""
"*여러분의 정신이 연결되고 속삭이는 소리가 들립니다. 절대자일까요? 아니면 그의 조각난 정신의 메아리가 어둠속에서 울리는 것 일까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 32836451-a2f1-4e14-b4ea-f561400661ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5f9a395c-f766-5a61-f122-bbcd094c95a0_MindHasBeenRead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:32836451-a2f1-4e14-b4ea-f561400661ef
msgctxt "h64255061g6904g4b7aga25dgf42c7e9f2d96"
msgid ""
"<i>They are holier than me - a greater part of Her design! I was wrong to "
"question them!</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>나보다 더 고결한 자들 - 그분의 설계의 더 중요한 역할을 맡은 자들이라니! 감히 그들에게 의문을 품어서는 안 되는데!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 35307512-af1b-4c97-80d0-b786a4ded166
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5f9a395c-f766-5a61-f122-bbcd094c95a0_MindHasBeenRead = False
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CanDetectThoughts_2 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:35307512-af1b-4c97-80d0-b786a4ded166
msgctxt "ha3e4b40ag8986g43f8gbfbfg18d53105edcf"
msgid "<i>Search his mind.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그의 정신을 뒤져본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 38552cd4-bf83-022c-d925-c06f772e94cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:38552cd4-bf83-022c-d925-c06f772e94cf
msgctxt "h7f2560a0g4031g4e56g940bg269744dd1a5e"
msgid "They will hurry, Majesty. They must not keep you <i>waiting.</i>"
msgstr "다를 서두를 겁니다, 폐하. 당신을 <i>기다리게</i> 해서는 안 되죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 387c88f6-2117-a998-b5eb-0feadb014e94
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_AfterAmbushSituationDefused = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:387c88f6-2117-a998-b5eb-0feadb014e94
msgctxt "h5685bb16g0be4g4f7bg9a50gedb4e5420886"
msgid "Very well. We welcome all who follow our holy queen."
msgstr "그렇군. 우리의 신성한 여왕을 따르는 자들이라면 누구나 환영이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 407466bb-4358-9e3a-7139-fd68dbad95e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:407466bb-4358-9e3a-7139-fd68dbad95e4
msgctxt "h8b8e3affg477fg4354gaf02g01714e9f75bc"
msgid "It was a pleasure to kill by your side. Onwards, in death!"
msgstr "함께 놈들을 죽일 수 있어서 즐거웠다. 그럼 계속 나아가도록 하지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 409ea6de-af55-3283-b3f0-2517b0ed7c85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 6
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_ExaminedBody(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SELUNE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_ExaminedBody(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:409ea6de-af55-3283-b3f0-2517b0ed7c85
msgctxt "he362badcgc512g4fc8gb68bg4924efef314a"
msgid ""
"<i>You feel a familiar power from the bodies. Try to find its source.</i>"
msgstr "<i>시체에서 익숙한 힘이 느껴진다. 그 근원을 조사해본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4181d954-3437-ddd9-3647-bbfae28be344
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:4181d954-3437-ddd9-3647-bbfae28be344
msgctxt "h83112941g9051g42dbgb448g71ea935f2afc"
msgid "Give me a moment, I'm not ready to go yet."
msgstr "잠깐만, 아직 떠날 준비가 안 됐다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45a3ec5c-0f88-3dbb-3a82-59e70dc34681
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:45a3ec5c-0f88-3dbb-3a82-59e70dc34681
msgctxt "ha8d27997g19b2g4473ga9c0gd811ba5bcdd7"
msgid "To Moonrise, then - lead the way."
msgstr "문라이즈로 가자. 앞장서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 47954043-06e6-411b-279b-ed1918e2060f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:47954043-06e6-411b-279b-ed1918e2060f
msgctxt "hfb7904eagf8e1g4bd1gbdc9g29fcf14a0e58"
msgid ""
"You will wipe away all opposition, Majesty. Nothing can stand in the way of "
"Your glory."
msgstr "당신의 적들은 모두 쓸려나가게 될 겁니다, 폐하. 당신이 걸어갈 영광의 길은 그 무엇도 막을 수 없습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 4aa6e1d2-6329-6041-163f-02a335f7e9d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:4aa6e1d2-6329-6041-163f-02a335f7e9d3
msgctxt "hcbf9d821gf927g4847g950dg45401a3c312c"
msgid "And heretics must be destroyed."
msgstr "이단자들은 모두 말살해야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4dd04a44-a65c-ada0-0819-3d181feb3c7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DROWELF(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:4dd04a44-a65c-ada0-0819-3d181feb3c7e
msgctxt "h3f7f1fa6ga11fg46cbg8ab5gbb8af83f8dbc"
msgid "Don't you <i>dare </i>speak to me, you abomination!"
msgstr "<i>감히</i> 나한테 말을 걸다니, 이 혐오스러운 것!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 4e27d377-1dff-0303-e3e1-3ed06059059b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:4e27d377-1dff-0303-e3e1-3ed06059059b
msgctxt "h03ff9732g1678g4db0gafc7g804792b9ff2f"
msgid "But they will fail. They cannot hope to stand in our way, Majesty."
msgstr "허나 저들은 실패하리라. 우리 앞을 막아설 생각조차 못하게 될 겁니다, 폐하."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 55d2ad4e-9ec5-a294-17fd-8f5a738d9067
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:55d2ad4e-9ec5-a294-17fd-8f5a738d9067
msgctxt "h758d57c0ge758g47b9gacecg06fdd6272cc9"
msgid ""
"Perhaps they wish to stop our Queen's great mission. But we are not "
"concerned."
msgstr "우리 여왕님의 사명을 막고자 하는 것 같군. 그러나 우려할 바는 못된다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 575f2b43-aaec-e066-6362-4670e646e0dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_FailedConvincingAfterAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:575f2b43-aaec-e066-6362-4670e646e0dd
msgctxt "hfcdcaf96g9782g4f2fgaa21g04003a2495e6"
msgid "<i>Attack the creature.</i>"
msgstr "<i>괴물을 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 578349bc-c3a0-b918-05e5-a057182834af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:578349bc-c3a0-b918-05e5-a057182834af
msgctxt "h765890ebg5afag46eeg8ca3gebc71cf1093b"
msgid "I need a moment to look around."
msgstr "잠시 주변을 둘러보겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5b43c25f-cbeb-ad8c-3dd9-3b49ed4f892c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:5b43c25f-cbeb-ad8c-3dd9-3b49ed4f892c
msgctxt "h80d15cfcgd735g4b54g820dg9928a6f4a1d6"
msgid "*Aside from the wounds of battle, you can't see anything unusual.*"
msgstr "*전투로 인한 상처 외에는 특이한 점을 찾아볼 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 62778f10-c478-9f9a-fc7a-3c04fdd11f83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_FailedConvincingAfterAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:62778f10-c478-9f9a-fc7a-3c04fdd11f83
msgctxt "h6e97f0aeg173cg4088g9ff0g146a91dcf17e"
msgid ""
"They think us fools, Majesty. They think we don't see through their lies!"
msgstr "우리를 바보로 아나 봅니다, 폐하. 저들의 거짓말을 꿰뚫어 보지 못하리라 생각하다니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 634b43cb-1223-4028-346a-b0fc78942a26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_ExaminedBody(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SELUNE(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN_SELUNE(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_ExaminedBody(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:634b43cb-1223-4028-346a-b0fc78942a26
msgctxt "h2c953916gd290g488ega5fbg3b494e371080"
msgid ""
"<i>These corpses have a strange power about them. Drink it in. Swim in "
"it.</i>"
msgstr "<i>이 시체에는 이상한 힘이 있다. 그것을 들이킨다. 그 안에서 헤엄친다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 634b43cb-1223-4028-346a-b0fc78942a26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_ExaminedBody(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SELUNE(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN_SELUNE(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_ExaminedBody(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:634b43cb-1223-4028-346a-b0fc78942a26
msgctxt "h544c1754gce1eg4806g8cdcg5c91bf5cb1c3"
msgid ""
"<i>Examine one of the bodies, looking for the magic protecting them out "
"here.</i>"
msgstr "<i>시신들 중 하나를 면밀히 조사해, 이들을 보호하는 마법이 뭔지 찾아본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 67a4d0dd-a720-c6a1-5655-24b8c481ec6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:67a4d0dd-a720-c6a1-5655-24b8c481ec6d
msgctxt "h02ed23f0g0511g4c02g988bg1a8861222dba"
msgid "But no matter, Majesty. They are already dead, and soon forgotten."
msgstr "하지만 상관 없습니다, 폐하. 놈들은 이미 죽었고, 곧 잊힐 것입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6967a2d2-ada3-d855-44ed-d8b7d32a1d59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:6967a2d2-ada3-d855-44ed-d8b7d32a1d59
msgctxt "h4a9853c6g851dg4803g918agc9e7d4e57a10"
msgid "I infiltrated their ranks - gathering information for our cause."
msgstr "위장중이다 - 우리 대의를 위한 정보를 수집하던 중이었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ff2d8d2-a193-d4de-ade9-b975e76b0526
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 6
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Drider_Event_ExaminedBody(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_SELUNE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_ExaminedBody(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:6ff2d8d2-a193-d4de-ade9-b975e76b0526
msgctxt "h0db4b2cbg2d60g4e12g938ag06ee6b76638c"
msgid ""
"<i>You feel a familiar power from the bodies. Try to find its source.</i>"
msgstr "<i>시체에서 익숙한 힘이 느껴진다. 그 근원을 조사해본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 7a1154f8-8e1d-1375-5714-c54b2f01eef8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_AfterAmbushSituationDefused = False
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_StartedAmbushQuestWithHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:7a1154f8-8e1d-1375-5714-c54b2f01eef8
msgctxt "he7a82db6gc3a6g4919gaac7g0c9a9605f0af"
msgid "And what of the strange little turncoat, Majesty? Should we spare them?"
msgstr "이 괴상한 변절자들은 어떻게 할까요, 폐하? 놈들에게 자비를 베푸시렵니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7aa382e8-6b21-cecd-9f4d-18fa78bc4278
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Factions_Knows_Harpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:7aa382e8-6b21-cecd-9f4d-18fa78bc4278
msgctxt "h44f588ebg5a4dg4855g99aega2219ddda854"
msgid "What are Harpers doing here?"
msgstr "하퍼가 여기서 뭐 하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ebeb180-7cf3-50b5-433e-e4581fe6ee8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersStartFollowingDrider = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_WaitingAtAmbushAfterCombat = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:7ebeb180-7cf3-50b5-433e-e4581fe6ee8c
msgctxt "h4455b9a8g764bg4811ga82ag54977d1b5a55"
msgid "Good. Take me to Moonrise."
msgstr "좋아. 문라이즈로 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 8e2511be-d71e-96bb-a3ce-c75832a92e9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:8e2511be-d71e-96bb-a3ce-c75832a92e9b
msgctxt "h6e776990gcf65g4b3cgb261g0cd84e873e37"
msgid "The sooner we reach Moonrise, the sooner you will see Her power."
msgstr "우리가 더 빨리 문라이즈에 도착할수록, 당신께서도 더 빨리 그분의 힘을 목격할 수 있을겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94f861ab-5376-b358-178e-b77c45282755
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:94f861ab-5376-b358-178e-b77c45282755
msgctxt "he90a5130g0ce3g4e1bg8b2ega9dfe40a05b8"
msgid "'They' just need another moment. I won't be long."
msgstr "'다들' 잠시만 더 기다려줘. 오래 걸리지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 96b6ab43-93f2-a4c4-fee8-a1ab7db5e5e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersStartFollowingDrider = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_WaitingAtAmbushAfterCombat = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:96b6ab43-93f2-a4c4-fee8-a1ab7db5e5e8
msgctxt "h2700c87ag7371g40fegbc08ge24674b2baf3"
msgid "Follow close. We shall lead them home, Majesty."
msgstr "가까이 붙도록. 우리가 그들을 집으로 안내하겠나이다, 폐하."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 993d973b-9ff8-1987-5807-80eafe0c5321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:993d973b-9ff8-1987-5807-80eafe0c5321
msgctxt "h58bbfd8fg02f0g4bd5gb524g81e902f98d41"
msgid ""
"Are they ready to depart? We do not want to linger in the shadows, Majesty."
msgstr "저들 모두 떠날 준비가 된 겁니까? 그림자 속에 오래 머물러서는 안됩니다, 폐하."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 9bd03f9d-b0b0-fb3f-bd45-8ab271a396d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_SpokeToAfterAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:9bd03f9d-b0b0-fb3f-bd45-8ab271a396d9
msgctxt "h19bab0cag7ec0g4d19g9bbegca0883bcae5f"
msgid "Wretched little things. No better than the shadows."
msgstr "빌어먹을 잡것들, 그림자랑 다를 게 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 9bdede7b-b073-44bc-9523-90bbfb915e17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:9bdede7b-b073-44bc-9523-90bbfb915e17
msgctxt "hb99c747dg1260g45f1gb71egc1fe32c7010a"
msgid "Yes, yes, of course. Her grace burns bright in them - I see it!"
msgstr "물론, 물론입니다. 그분의 은총이 밝게 타오르고 있군요. 잘 보입니다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = a1ce1739-4abe-4b87-8365-e491e77f9762
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_FailedConvincingAfterAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:a1ce1739-4abe-4b87-8365-e491e77f9762
msgctxt "h2511e427gaaa0g482bg84b6g80da79ab3af3"
msgid ""
"So many voices inside my mind, so many - but these ones are tricksters and "
"thieves!"
msgstr "수많은 목소리가 내 머릿속에서 재잘거린다. 하지만 이건 사기꾼과 도둑놈의 목소리야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = a434292c-0633-c6f3-b52d-15b943231414
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:a434292c-0633-c6f3-b52d-15b943231414
msgctxt "h4449a84bg2e7dg48d3gbcf0gaa77a2735275"
msgid "Very well. We depart when you are ready."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 준비되시면 출발하겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = aa6e932f-0f01-5193-b077-43788f44db24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:aa6e932f-0f01-5193-b077-43788f44db24
msgctxt "h5cabed64gf55eg4edcg8298gdf784eaebc38"
msgid "Follow close - the shadows are hungry. Do not stray from the light."
msgstr "가까이 붙으시오. 그림자가 굶주렸으니. 빛에서 멀어지지 마십시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b3142e5a-5eb5-34f4-c906-5c0443c34fcc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN_SHAR(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:b3142e5a-5eb5-34f4-c906-5c0443c34fcc
msgctxt "h1043a5d9g0e45g4650g9192g4fe81c2397c3"
msgid ""
"*You can feel the power it held - weak, but still divine. These soldiers "
"were protected from the shadows by your own lady Selûne.*"
msgstr "*그 힘은 약하지만, 그래도 여전히 신성함이 느껴집니다. 이 병사들을 그림자로부터 보호한 건, 당신의 여신 셀루네입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = bf4c48c9-069d-50df-61e8-4a39d628f0e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:bf4c48c9-069d-50df-61e8-4a39d628f0e5
msgctxt "hd12d572eg5aa4g42a7g8701geea4a877f893"
msgid "Do not linger<i>. Must </i>not linger."
msgstr "머뭇거리지 마<i>. 절대</i> 머뭇거리지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c450f020-2896-fd35-738c-00e976f6c512
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:c450f020-2896-fd35-738c-00e976f6c512
msgctxt "h9bf27e12g1920g4a1fg9712g7e4b18d17689"
msgid "I answer to the Absolute, not to you."
msgstr "설명은 절대자께 하겠다. 네가 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = c6e8a072-a113-920e-c9f5-5612f8e3f0c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersStartFollowingDrider = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_WaitingAtAmbushAfterCombat = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:c6e8a072-a113-920e-c9f5-5612f8e3f0c9
msgctxt "hd56925eeg9683g4ef9ga117gce93c10cac14"
msgid "Yes. We lead the way."
msgstr "물론, 앞장서겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = ca87655b-3d50-c124-0bfc-dfb0eb83e036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:ca87655b-3d50-c124-0bfc-dfb0eb83e036
msgctxt "h14137c9dg35c2g42e7gb1d7gbc4ea2858edd"
msgid "We will wait, but not for long."
msgstr "기다리겠지만, 오래 기다리지는 않을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d01a7f7b-4587-50b1-b45a-70cd657d689a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:d01a7f7b-4587-50b1-b45a-70cd657d689a
msgctxt "h633d6006g5e16g4c91ga527g0d802a606624"
msgid "All right, let's go."
msgstr "좋아, 가도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0f89948-7313-e09a-1eae-2387ee2280ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:d0f89948-7313-e09a-1eae-2387ee2280ea
msgctxt "h6128f582g5c3fg4b51g970ag276aed0eebf0"
msgid "It's over now. Let's go."
msgstr "다 끝났군. 이제 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d1422d0b-a194-0686-2abb-1160621c8824
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_PlayersStartFollowingDrider = True
#.     - SCL_Drider_State_WaitingAtAmbushAfterCombat = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:d1422d0b-a194-0686-2abb-1160621c8824
msgctxt "h706a49ecg4bb6g4b4cg8cf8g3c2e6ee2e9cf"
msgid "I'm ready. Let's go."
msgstr "준비됐어. 가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = d202d084-75b0-4d88-0430-c0b139cb016a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:d202d084-75b0-4d88-0430-c0b139cb016a
msgctxt "h8842a055gf2d0g4aa7gba82gc66e2193da50"
msgid ""
"Come, follow us to Moonrise Towers. Then you will see Her power in all its "
"glory."
msgstr "어서, 우리를 따라 문라이즈 타워로 갑시다. 그분의 힘과 은총을 두 눈으로 직접 보게 될테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = daccea48-9496-3330-bc15-0e1224d8f680
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:daccea48-9496-3330-bc15-0e1224d8f680
msgctxt "h886617c8g81fdg49c2ga3aaga44f0cf898b6"
msgid ""
"Harpers. Spies. Little scurrying rats, trying to stop our queen's great "
"mission."
msgstr "하퍼다. 염탐꾼이지. 쥐새끼같은 놈들. 우리 여왕님의 위대한 사명을 막으려 들다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dad9a0d3-36e7-f9cf-d014-9b21f201a86a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:dad9a0d3-36e7-f9cf-d014-9b21f201a86a
msgctxt "h67c22874g3becg4aaaga931g68d26dba95c9"
msgid "You'll wait here. I'll tell you when I'm ready."
msgstr "여기서 기다려. 준비되면 그때 알려줄 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ddc9443b-1a2d-aa2e-373b-5b6d596091f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:ddc9443b-1a2d-aa2e-373b-5b6d596091f2
msgctxt "h2cc8c8ecg8235g4f97ga125g882e668cf727"
msgid ""
"*You can feel the power it held - weak, but still divine. These soldiers "
"were protected from Your Lady's shadows by her wretched sister Selûne.*"
msgstr ""
"*그 힘은 약하지만, 그래도 여전히 신성함이 느껴집니다. 이 병사들을 당신 여신의 그림자로부터 보호한 건, 그녀의 형편없는 자매인 "
"셀루네입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = dedafdc1-3503-2ca2-dae4-7b7c17be0f66
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_SpokeToAfterAmbush = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:dedafdc1-3503-2ca2-dae4-7b7c17be0f66
msgctxt "h616b6a07g70f6g403cgbedcgf5ad393ace9d"
msgid "They must get on. They must <i>hurry.</i>"
msgstr "다들 빨리 가야 해. 다들 <i>서둘러야 해.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e0e786af-5398-8f16-5e02-3a8045137ff4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:e0e786af-5398-8f16-5e02-3a8045137ff4
msgctxt "he75e37aegb3d4g4859g8b2agf11b6468ab82"
msgid "Let's go. We need to reach Moonrise."
msgstr "출발하자. 문라이즈에 가야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = e8d693d4-f447-d668-bea3-7a25d93d0819
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:e8d693d4-f447-d668-bea3-7a25d93d0819
msgctxt "h10f6685fg4d3eg4322gb22bg0ab550ab10b7"
msgid "All dead, majesty. It is time for us to move on."
msgstr "모두 죽었습니다, 폐하. 이제 저희는 움직이겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f1e5c648-9992-dfc6-0a48-66235125a25e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC_SELUNE(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN_SHAR(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN_SELUNE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:f1e5c648-9992-dfc6-0a48-66235125a25e
msgctxt "h0e73fd13gf108g49cfg9c70g01965deae13e"
msgid ""
"*You can feel the power it held - weak, but still divine. These soldiers "
"were protected from the shadows by a blessing of Selûne.*"
msgstr "*그 힘은 약하지만, 그래도 여전히 신성함이 느껴집니다. 셀루네의 축복이 이 병사들을 그림자로부터 보호하고 있었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = f3d66483-6740-5009-ed54-df861904cfc2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_FailedConvincingAfterAmbush = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:f3d66483-6740-5009-ed54-df861904cfc2
msgctxt "h4a8e9494g9222g45b2g95c5gdc15b0b97caa"
msgid ""
"How dare they - we are all equal in our queen's crusade. To say otherwise is "
"heresy!"
msgstr "감히라니, 여왕님의 성전이라는 사명 아래에선 우리 모두 평등하다. 이를 거스른다면 그건 이단일 뿐!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = f46e5db3-bf50-00df-fd69-cc42b3ff6a7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_AfterAmbushSituationDefused = True
#.      - SCL_Drider_State_StartedAmbushQuestWithHarpers = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:f46e5db3-bf50-00df-fd69-cc42b3ff6a7b
msgctxt "h86c43536g6d10g41a2gaba7ge42d7425e310"
msgid "Are they ready, Majesty? Can we leave?"
msgstr "저들 모두 준비 됐습니까, 폐하? 떠나도 되겠습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = faaf4e83-3130-28ad-67bc-22bf17eb6998
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:faaf4e83-3130-28ad-67bc-22bf17eb6998
msgctxt "h282389cagdd37g4a95g825agf1132bf9f5c2"
msgid "Give me a moment. I want to look around."
msgstr "잠시 시간을 줘. 둘러보고 싶군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fcaf2498-19f3-5fa1-40ea-0d76d53077a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_ThanksAfterAmbush:fcaf2498-19f3-5fa1-40ea-0d76d53077a2
msgctxt "h5c414202g7db9g466aga504gbe868fe1a210"
msgid ""
"*You notice something odd on the fallen soldier - a faint glow about the "
"face, like an aura fast-fading.*"
msgstr "*당신은 죽은 병사에게서 이상한 점을 발견합니다. 얼굴에 오라같은 희미한 빛이 반짝이다가 빠르게 사라집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_WaitingDuringEscort
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0de7fab1-c87d-37f4-85d3-10f49ab1363f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_WaitingDuringEscort:0de7fab1-c87d-37f4-85d3-10f49ab1363f
msgctxt "h6052128bg6a0eg49d3g8766g4c8d8a023493"
msgid "Wait here."
msgstr "여기서 기다려."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_WaitingDuringEscort
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5bc9ccff-f25c-e05d-ccb8-68ea07c35258
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_WaitingDuringEscort:5bc9ccff-f25c-e05d-ccb8-68ea07c35258
msgctxt "he71d603agf67fg4c9ag9edagb8867109c1ef"
msgid "Lead the way."
msgstr "앞장서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_WaitingDuringEscort
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = 62eb06e4-ff13-4c31-386f-6c8dae166261
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_Drider_Event_ResumeEscort = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_WaitingDuringEscort:62eb06e4-ff13-4c31-386f-6c8dae166261
msgctxt "h06144a95g505dg47cagba7ag0d911ebe487f"
msgid "I do not lead. I follow Her voice - it calls us to Moonrise. Come!"
msgstr "앞장서는 게 아니다. 그분의 목소리를 따르는 것 뿐이지. 우리를 문라이즈로 부르신다. 어서!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_WaitingDuringEscort
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = ce082e87-9821-2490-74b9-340ade23596a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_WaitingDuringEscort:ce082e87-9821-2490-74b9-340ade23596a
msgctxt "heeb79e9bg9da9g4ba4g812ege73c9387284f"
msgid ""
"We must reach Moonrise - She waits there for us. Hurry, hurry, and be done "
"with the darkness."
msgstr "우리는 문라이즈로 가야만 한다. 그분께서 우릴 기다리신다. 얼른 어둠에서 벗어나야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_WaitingDuringEscort
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = e89ae37f-8b48-7982-0195-b251c42c8fdb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Drider_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_WaitingDuringEscort:e89ae37f-8b48-7982-0195-b251c42c8fdb
msgctxt "hc0336c23g40b1g4228g8361g81ff03dbf3bc"
msgid "Do not stray from the light, little one. The shadows are hungry."
msgstr "빛에서 멀어지지 말거라. 그림자가 굶주렸으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_WaitingDuringEscort
#. Speaker = Kar'niss
#. NodeID = f14023da-0399-241e-0f8c-d36b787400cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Drider_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Drider_WaitingDuringEscort:f14023da-0399-241e-0f8c-d36b787400cb
msgctxt "h6e59c62eg2d44g42ebga1cagc566c0cb61ac"
msgid "We thought you were lost. Such a shame it would be. Stay close!"
msgstr "아예 길을 잃어버린 줄 알았다. 실로 안타까운 일 아니겠느냐. 바짝 붙어라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0318d106-f4d7-4d05-83a6-ed0e4eecf4cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:0318d106-f4d7-4d05-83a6-ed0e4eecf4cc
msgctxt "h153ffdd5gc286g4e55g92dag13c6e431510c"
msgid "Where are you from?"
msgstr "어디서 왔지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09a5943d-b274-4703-a528-1dd993ac28e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:09a5943d-b274-4703-a528-1dd993ac28e5
msgctxt "h84801d20g51b6g4c70g9e8eg5765a5fd1233"
msgid "I need to find Moonrise Towers. How do I get there?"
msgstr "문라이즈 타워를 찾고 있다. 어떻게 해야 갈 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0af4fd4a-4f24-47dc-b2c6-abcdfc8ba2cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:0af4fd4a-4f24-47dc-b2c6-abcdfc8ba2cb
msgctxt "h9e84ec28gcb97g4a1dg81f6g02ee8dcc6991"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = 12b7be04-ca78-44b1-a75b-290d93fb9121
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:12b7be04-ca78-44b1-a75b-290d93fb9121
msgctxt "h79e62b5bg03e1g4fbag9e99g962beccd9e1d"
msgid "Work and die... In her name... <i>Absolute...</i>"
msgstr "봉사하다 죽는다... 그 분을 위해... <i>절대자...</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2edc1bde-0527-4d35-93fd-8d0991b35913
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:2edc1bde-0527-4d35-93fd-8d0991b35913
msgctxt "h88475f86g40c8g4bb8g9936g56693aa98c36"
msgid "What was your job?"
msgstr "무슨 일을 했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = 63be5732-6049-49c9-8e03-550d72f1e69f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:63be5732-6049-49c9-8e03-550d72f1e69f
msgctxt "h1238be86g41ecg47cbga62bge80b318c6f38"
msgid "To the... east... Need a... torch..."
msgstr "동쪽으로... 가라... 횃불이... 필요해..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d2913b8-0042-4d44-b663-2708737a8107
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:6d2913b8-0042-4d44-b663-2708737a8107
msgctxt "h720a03f8g6d1bg4a19ga89cg59367bb41dbc"
msgid "Who killed you?"
msgstr "누가 너를 죽였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b1b5af6-a3e4-4580-83b8-6695bf3353ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:9b1b5af6-a3e4-4580-83b8-6695bf3353ea
msgctxt "h658e1553g0256g4346ga0ccgef35090f6e3f"
msgid "What happened to you?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 있었지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9e315a9c-eaea-aff5-35ef-9e3626e1c6b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:9e315a9c-eaea-aff5-35ef-9e3626e1c6b2
msgctxt "ha50408ecg3de5g4546g827ag34d5a1f78474"
msgid "*The corpse says nothing. Perhaps if she knew, she wouldn't be dead.*"
msgstr "*시체는 아무 말이 없습니다. 진작 방법을 알았다면, 죽지 않았을 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = b08edbf3-37cb-4c66-874e-0da2aff3ced4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:b08edbf3-37cb-4c66-874e-0da2aff3ced4
msgctxt "hba781dc8ga67eg4905ga6afg7306ba8cd30c"
msgid "Moonrise... Towers..."
msgstr "문라이즈... 타워..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = c9bd5164-b915-469e-b389-65f356ffb15d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:c9bd5164-b915-469e-b389-65f356ffb15d
msgctxt "h134c4f40g22cag4cd1ga07agb37291e18998"
msgid "Ri... Rizzle..."
msgstr "리... 리즐..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cc1dba07-6b90-43d6-a15e-fe2a9aa67fa3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:cc1dba07-6b90-43d6-a15e-fe2a9aa67fa3
msgctxt "hf34640a0gd937g41a3ga3f6g4e10923f0e09"
msgid "*The corpse does not stir. It will answer no more questions.*"
msgstr "*시체는 움직이지 않습니다. 더 이상 질문을 받지 않을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d473c018-754c-50fe-7b52-9c593a87b182
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:d473c018-754c-50fe-7b52-9c593a87b182
msgctxt "hb60ace34g46a4g4bfegb849gccd9387a0ea5"
msgid "How do I survive the curse?"
msgstr "이곳의 저주에서 어떻게 살아남을 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e20f6f3d-c429-4cdb-97fc-250753873c2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:e20f6f3d-c429-4cdb-97fc-250753873c2b
msgctxt "h0d44a8b9g6d95g4942g8aaeg0d5cf8c9145d"
msgid "*The corpse regards you lifelessly.*"
msgstr "*시체가 생기 없는 모습으로 당신을 맞이합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e54fbc46-5edf-411d-b8fc-620877dc8ba0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_SpeakWithDead_Event_QuestionAsked(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:e54fbc46-5edf-411d-b8fc-620877dc8ba0
msgctxt "h94b5dfb5g55bdg410fgb109gb4fbd2c6e61d"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "당신은 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = e6ea2e97-980a-4a99-8dad-e1fc1e3c7403
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:e6ea2e97-980a-4a99-8dad-e1fc1e3c7403
msgctxt "h404f7cd5g5682g4710gbc7dgc1b2b9b3ad10"
msgid "<i>Curse</i>... Them shadows... Got teeth too..."
msgstr "<i>저주</i>... 그림자들이... 이빨을 드러냈어..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e913db0c-0455-49c2-851f-a1361479d183
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:e913db0c-0455-49c2-851f-a1361479d183
msgctxt "h00c0026bg215eg4ed6g865bg4ccd85e5c917"
msgid "*The spell's power wanes. You can ask no more questions.*"
msgstr "*주문의 힘이 약해집니다. 더 이상 질문을 할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = eb899124-b1e1-41b4-832d-4224abb86772
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:eb899124-b1e1-41b4-832d-4224abb86772
msgctxt "hb51f463ag4228g4e70g9644gc3bff40dfa30"
msgid "Not... Who... <i>What...</i>"
msgstr "'누구'가... 아니야... <i>뭔가가...</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f54a2b7f-216a-4051-81d9-9206898a10f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_Killer(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPointGoblin_Dead:f54a2b7f-216a-4051-81d9-9206898a10f0
msgctxt "h28fd5f71g642eg4dbeg95f3g5c89c3052bf7"
msgid "*The corpse seems willing to speak - but not to its killer.*"
msgstr "*시체는 말할 의지가 있지만, 자신을 죽인 자와 대화하고 싶지는 않은 듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_AD_Sign
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bfc75a17-7a7e-d46e-48f1-91e68d6e6bcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_AD_Sign:bfc75a17-7a7e-d46e-48f1-91e68d6e6bcb
msgctxt "h1ea3d26fg35d4g409bgab4dg4d45e8850a93"
msgid "*Night and shadow have claimed this place. Turn back.*"
msgstr "*어둠과 그림자가 이 땅을 장악했습니다. 당장 돌아가십시오.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_DaisyAD_ReachTowers
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = b380ee7f-06ea-4850-a16b-c02ef06b063a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_DaisyAD_ReachTowers:b380ee7f-06ea-4850-a16b-c02ef06b063a
msgctxt "h684f2031g71c6g4235gb963ga6d4c79046d4"
msgid ""
"We are approaching the Absolute. A telepathic storm is surging all around us."
msgstr "절대자에 가까워지고 있어요. 텔레파시의 소용돌이가 우리를 둘러싸고 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_DaisyAD_ReachTowers
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = b380ee7f-06ea-4850-a16b-c02ef06b063a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_DaisyAD_ReachTowers:b380ee7f-06ea-4850-a16b-c02ef06b063a
msgctxt "h695c378bgc315g429dg9ae7g3fa9a1bf24ae"
msgid ""
"We are approaching the Absolute. A telepathic storm is surging all around us."
msgstr "절대자에 가까워지고 있어요. 텔레파시의 소용돌이가 우리를 둘러싸고 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_DaisyAD_ReachTowers
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = c6e3e6c8-169e-4133-a4f7-07a28163723e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_MALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_DaisyAD_ReachTowers:c6e3e6c8-169e-4133-a4f7-07a28163723e
msgctxt "h0d89e79cg9f88g4ce6g8ad8g6ca39ae2dbe4"
msgid "And the eye of the storm lies above that tower."
msgstr "그리고 그 소용돌이의 눈은 그 탑 위에 있어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_DaisyAD_ReachTowers
#. Speaker = GROUP_Daisy
#. NodeID = c6e3e6c8-169e-4133-a4f7-07a28163723e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DAISY_FEMALE_VOICE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_DaisyAD_ReachTowers:c6e3e6c8-169e-4133-a4f7-07a28163723e
msgctxt "h8f757e46g9dd9g4258ga56ag706503237a6e"
msgid "And the eye of the storm lies above that tower."
msgstr "그리고 그 소용돌이의 눈은 그 탑 위에 있어요.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 0e63066b-6d67-5504-8cd7-dedae739fa23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:0e63066b-6d67-5504-8cd7-dedae739fa23
msgctxt "hae2cc889g8113g41a8ga6edg31777982d62a"
msgid "Can you feel it? The shadows gnaw at us. Do not take them for granted."
msgstr "느껴지나? 그림자가 우릴 갉아 먹는다. 대수롭지 않게 여기지 마라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ef42520-d38f-6981-e6c4-0544950dfba9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:0ef42520-d38f-6981-e6c4-0544950dfba9
msgctxt "hdb78202bg2d00g4952ga0a1g2078f52efbc1"
msgid ""
"I may or may not be the single greatest True Soul you may or may not have "
"met in your life."
msgstr "난 네가 만났을지도 만나지 않았을지도 모르는 단 하나의 위대할지도 위대하지 않을지도 모르는 참된 영혼이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = 0fdf1678-e4b2-4e12-f721-01c4fcf31db3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:0fdf1678-e4b2-4e12-f721-01c4fcf31db3
msgctxt "h19dea961g2f1bg4a27g8477g6a3ed1db30d6"
msgid "A - a thousand sorrys, True Soul, but I've gotta warn you."
msgstr "저, 정말 죄송합니다, 참된 영혼이시여, 당신께 경고드려야 해서요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 2883d042-e49a-ddcc-d576-9c25d550735f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:2883d042-e49a-ddcc-d576-9c25d550735f
msgctxt "hb2cad33ega803g475fga397gcafc6df506c3"
msgid ""
"Can you feel that? The dark, it's... <i>hungry</i>. Best watch the shadows."
msgstr "느껴져? 어둠이... <i>배고파</i>하는군. 그림자를 잘 살펴."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2c47515e-89be-f8d8-cb3c-859219c6b1f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:2c47515e-89be-f8d8-cb3c-859219c6b1f6
msgctxt "h4f4dd6c0geb60g4210ga86fg526a19421132"
msgid "What about you?"
msgstr "그럼 넌?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ff601e5-63e8-b751-61dd-55ef589c8619
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:2ff601e5-63e8-b751-61dd-55ef589c8619
msgctxt "h6b653442g506cg433fgb1b5ga6d907bd1996"
msgid "What do you mean 'more or less'?"
msgstr "'거의'라니 무슨 뜻이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 32adf860-2c7d-d0e7-3f18-bfdc1cba5709
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:32adf860-2c7d-d0e7-3f18-bfdc1cba5709
msgctxt "h9745a585gfddfg48c6g925cg7a44ad9d74aa"
msgid ""
"Phew. This place is dark beyond dark. You feel it too, right? I'm sticking "
"to light wherever I can find it."
msgstr "휴. 여긴 어둠 속의 어둠같아. 너도 느끼지? 빛을 찾으면 거기 꼭 붙어 있어야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 35dc71da-7da4-1dec-cecf-4812f7159e11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:35dc71da-7da4-1dec-cecf-4812f7159e11
msgctxt "h6c0da1f6g698fg4e9bgb79eg939a28c344a4"
msgid "We are all everything, and yet nothing, at the same time."
msgstr "우린 모든 것이면서 동시에 아무것도 아닌 존재다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = 39086a1f-fbe2-a875-cae9-64531e906f76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:39086a1f-fbe2-a875-cae9-64531e906f76
msgctxt "hdb05b76eg958cg41c0ga702ga351070c3fb8"
msgid "I'll take that as a yes. Listen up."
msgstr "긍정의 의미로 받아들이겠습니다. 들어보십시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = 43890c6a-1e72-b96e-5a2b-5351c02486ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:43890c6a-1e72-b96e-5a2b-5351c02486ad
msgctxt "h26f7737cg80f8g415fgbb72g1605506d60b8"
msgid "Uh."
msgstr "아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58a753fa-7edc-ec11-fd09-2241fa5607ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:58a753fa-7edc-ec11-fd09-2241fa5607ce
msgctxt "h66200f63g0eb7g47edg923cg53963d81a836"
msgid "I don't have time for this - begone."
msgstr "이럴 시간 없어, 비켜."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = 5b20e24a-d046-bc42-8170-e778b1018494
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:5b20e24a-d046-bc42-8170-e778b1018494
msgctxt "h9925ee08g5d4cg41e4g8128g0fabd0004748"
msgid ""
"I'll keep an eye for other True Souls and then head to camp. Can't get out "
"of here fast enough."
msgstr "다른 참된 영혼께서 오시는지 지켜보고 야영지로 안내할 겁니다. 아직은 여길 벗어날 수 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c5b2cfc-16b8-7f38-3a7f-cfd769d12582
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:5c5b2cfc-16b8-7f38-3a7f-cfd769d12582
msgctxt "hada4f334g4da3g4b43ga269gbcd36fdb7808"
msgid "No, I kill them. And you're next."
msgstr "아니, 내가 다 죽였다. 그리고 네가 그 다음이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 5cd84630-ffbf-2c5f-7677-d28815318c51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:5cd84630-ffbf-2c5f-7677-d28815318c51
msgctxt "h6f811016g5e04g440agaa80gfb141ad13633"
msgid "This is no typical gloom. Need to stay alert."
msgstr "일반적인 어둠이 아니군. 긴장해야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5f05395d-e140-92e0-20d7-1ab760e3f6d1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:5f05395d-e140-92e0-20d7-1ab760e3f6d1
msgctxt "h02db0348gfe04g4f9bg9e37g6cae84aa2fdf"
msgid ""
"That's no ordinary darkness. It feels powerful... and <i>familiar</i>. Stay "
"on your guard."
msgstr "평범한 어둠이 아니야. 강하고... <i>친숙해</i>. 대비하고 있어야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69425d6f-16b0-358a-703f-be293616d44c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:69425d6f-16b0-358a-703f-be293616d44c
msgctxt "hf972c470ge1cfg421fg9234gaea3f962e5d9"
msgid "I am death itself, with a tadpole in my skull and sin in my heart."
msgstr "나는 죽음 그 자체이며, 두개골 안에는 올챙이, 심장엔 죄를 품고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8cee4125-aefb-e1cd-fa2e-6fd93c0c2174
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_Knows_CreaturePath = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:8cee4125-aefb-e1cd-fa2e-6fd93c0c2174
msgctxt "ha44a620dg0040g4185ga19dg474dd2dc3ea2"
msgid "I am. Minthara sent me."
msgstr "그렇다. 민타라가 날 보냈지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = 90ba9539-135a-60c4-0d5e-b4524f377927
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:90ba9539-135a-60c4-0d5e-b4524f377927
msgctxt "h3bc4ace1gdbe4g479dga138g1337400aff16"
msgid ""
"There's things in the dark, True Soul. Things that... been touched by the "
"curse. Run and run fast."
msgstr "어둠속에 뭔가 있습니다, 참된 영혼이시여. 그건... 저주받은 거구요. 재빨리 움직이셔야 합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9326e93-31fe-e7d0-3d3d-559c23eb37b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:a9326e93-31fe-e7d0-3d3d-559c23eb37b9
msgctxt "h1d39bf1fg7127g462egaac5gd987d1c76f66"
msgid "Probably. I'm still trying to figure out who I am."
msgstr "아마 그럴지도. 여전히 내가 누군지 알아보는 중이거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = afb9ef8d-701b-85d6-4016-76616352c793
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:afb9ef8d-701b-85d6-4016-76616352c793
msgctxt "h66ac7851g4badg4089g85aagaf9ee4886333"
msgid "Who wants to know?"
msgstr "알아서 뭐하게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = b1abca1a-4c92-c001-2dd0-0551d21ccf7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:b1abca1a-4c92-c001-2dd0-0551d21ccf7e
msgctxt "h4cacdb11g7e75g44bfg9583g23b36d707c5d"
msgid "This darkness. It <i>hurts</i>. You must feel it too."
msgstr "이 어둠. <i>아픈데</i>. 너도 느껴질껄."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c16f5400-baaa-64a7-0c1e-30fd8450bc2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:c16f5400-baaa-64a7-0c1e-30fd8450bc2f
msgctxt "hc5f2b0e4g3580g489ega2bbg4952736fdffe"
msgid "Faith keeps my soul true, yes. What of it?"
msgstr "신앙심이 나의 영혼을 참되게 하지. 맞아. 그래서?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = c3cc5a18-9896-dd64-041b-cd648c740260
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:c3cc5a18-9896-dd64-041b-cd648c740260
msgctxt "hdd0ca0e7g773fg4603g9eb6g56a88840ad6d"
msgid "Bless the Absolute. I couldn't take standin' out here much longer."
msgstr "절대자께 축복을. 더는 여기 있기가 힘듭니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cac53b77-7cdc-f096-25d9-34bef44033e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:cac53b77-7cdc-f096-25d9-34bef44033e7
msgctxt "h0e3cbb94gc359g4d41g9780g33ed6a9cacd5"
msgid ""
"*This is no ordinary darkness. It feels powerful... and familiar. These "
"lands have been blessed by Lady Shar. You must learn more about her presence "
"here.*"
msgstr ""
"*일반적인 어둠이 아닙니다. 강하며... 친숙합니다. 샤 여신의 축복을 받은 땅입니다. 여신의 존재에 대해 더 알아봐야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cb743196-e35a-084f-3acf-b575c247414b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:cb743196-e35a-084f-3acf-b575c247414b
msgctxt "hd925450bg90b2g4c7cgbed7gec638b628e3d"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = dc67b58c-46e9-4f5d-72c4-573d583eb935
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_EntryPointGoblin_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:dc67b58c-46e9-4f5d-72c4-573d583eb935
msgctxt "h410c5420ga079g42e3g8f86gf6af2d726025"
msgid "Are... are you... the True Soul?"
msgstr "다... 당신은... 참된 영혼이십니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = dfc371e5-e2a3-52ac-4f00-6414b7eceb54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_EntryPointGoblin_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_EntryPoint_State_IntroPlayed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:dfc371e5-e2a3-52ac-4f00-6414b7eceb54
msgctxt "hf27a3478gb419g49ceg9a58ge0acaec09281"
msgid "Don't stick about. A torch will keep you safe - more or less."
msgstr "여기 머무르지 마십시오. 횃불이 안전하게 지켜줄 겁니다, 어느 정도는요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain
#. Speaker = Goblin Brawler
#. NodeID = f745e9c8-dfee-9353-7bf1-589e4776ecc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ShadowCurse_Knows_Curse = True
#.     - SCL_EntryPoint_State_GoblinInvited = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_Mountain:f745e9c8-dfee-9353-7bf1-589e4776ecc6
msgctxt "h1a2c0a7cge850g4bf5ga82dg2a918e1c517b"
msgid ""
"Grab a torch, stay outta the dark, and move <i>fast</i>. The shadows have "
"eyes. Go on."
msgstr "횃불을 드시고, 어둠을 피하십시오, <i>빠르게</i> 움직이시고요. 그림자에 눈이 있습니다. 가시죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
msgctxt "h1121ab54g0cd7g405cg8436gde31e9d36c22"
msgid ""
"I lived in the shadows for centuries, but never found darkness <i>this</i> "
"unsettling."
msgstr "수 세기 동안 그림자 속에서 살아왔는데, 어둠이 <i>이렇게</i> 불안하게 느껴진 건 처음이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
msgctxt "hbe2409a3g0c9ag4c86gba12gb60bac69a75d"
msgid "I know the dark of wildspace. But I've never known a dark like this."
msgstr "우주의 어둠도 겪어보았지만, 이런 어둠은 처음이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
msgctxt "hc1ed72ecgfa86g4b05gbd08g6ec647e01930"
msgid "Shrouded in no ordinary shadows. What evil lurks within such darkness?"
msgstr "이건 정상적인 그림자들이 아니로군. 도대체 어떤 악이 도사리고 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
msgctxt "hbea0e7b9gd6d3g4c42ga41fg18cfd7ac80c8"
msgid ""
"There's a familiar power to these shadows... neither fully comforting or "
"threatening."
msgstr "이 그림자들은 편안하면서도, 위협적으로 느껴지네... 어째선지 익숙한 힘인걸..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
msgctxt "h8d8e9c66gaa03g45adg91bfge1394ef19e83"
msgid "This place is darker than dark, as if the shadows could cast shadows."
msgstr "이곳은 어둠 그 자체보다도 어둡군, 마치 그림자 위에 씌워진 그림자처럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
msgctxt "h7b78cdcdg310bg4104g8969gcd2382028332"
msgid ""
"Kind of beautiful - but also feels like you could choke on your own breath "
"here."
msgstr "이쁘긴 한데, 동시에 목 졸려 죽을 것 같은 느낌이 드는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
msgctxt "h614d0905ga47bg43a2gb104gd7fe6899ea27"
msgid "Even in the Underdark, I never saw gloom like this. It's unsettling."
msgstr "언더다크에서조차 이런 어둠은 겪어본 적이 없어. 불안하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:330caae4-88dc-485d-ad59-d0c876b7e0f7
msgctxt "h34b84e64g95a7g4bedga985gea1ae4130bb8"
msgid "I've never seen darkness like this before. It's unsettling."
msgstr "이런 어둠은 처음이야. 답답하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
msgctxt "h5923491eg90beg4a75g8093gd1ad64c83107"
msgid "Alas, this is the only path to Moonrise Towers. So into the dark I go."
msgstr "하아, 이게 문라이즈 타워로 향하는 유일한 길이로군. 그럼 어둠 속으로 발을 내디뎌 봐야겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
msgctxt "haca29473g3ea8g4fa6g9c3eg1748d44a72a1"
msgid "But it's the only path to Moonrise Towers. I have to push forward."
msgstr "하지만 문라이즈 타워로 향하는 길은 이것뿐이야. 전진해야겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
msgctxt "h79c4c7d4ge19fg4b4bga085gde0c8d402fe3"
msgid "Moonrise Towers lies ahead. I must keep going, however bleak the path."
msgstr "문라이즈 타워가 앞에서 기다리고 있으니, 그 길이 아무리 어둡더라도 나아가는 수 밖에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
msgctxt "h4253e7b8g7d19g4f50gaccbg363bbcd2996c"
msgid "No matter. Moonrise Towers has to remain the focus."
msgstr "됐어. 그보다 문라이즈 타워에 집중해야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
msgctxt "h208205adg5595g4598ga326g653b15168c79"
msgid ""
"Well - I've got to push through. Unless a passing griffon offers a ride, "
"it's the only way to Moonrise Towers."
msgstr ""
"뭐 - 그럼 가보는 수밖에. 지나가던 그리폰이 등을 내주지라도 않는 이상, 이게 문라이즈 타워로 갈 수 있는 유일한 방법이니 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
msgctxt "h20054b0cg4172g4c4dgad12g0a457139b969"
msgid "Only way to Moonrise, unfortunately."
msgstr "유감이지만 이게 문라이즈로 가는 유일한 길 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene:e8d1423e-7c36-4a2f-a87f-3127121fe00f
msgctxt "h6e1d4d61gb1b5g4223g9985g485ebf60926e"
msgid ""
"But if this is the way to Moonrise Towers, then this is the only path I've "
"got."
msgstr "이게 문라이즈 타워로 가는 길이라면, 나로써는 다른 방도가 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
msgctxt "h678fd4adgcb0cg4829ga209gcc5ca269dd02"
msgid ""
"I've lived in darkness for centuries, but never found any like this... "
"unsettling."
msgstr "어둠 속에서 수 세기를 살아왔는데, 어둠이 이렇게... 섬뜩하게 느껴지긴 처음이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
msgctxt "hc04bb322g80acg45e7g87dcg6935b83906b3"
msgid "Shrouded in no ordinary shadows. What evil lurks within such darkness?"
msgstr "평범한 그림자가 아니로군. 도대체 무슨 악이 이 어둠 속에 도사리고 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
msgctxt "h19532f09g20c3g4300g9d60g310ed3f178f1"
msgid "I know the dark of wildspace. But I've never known a dark like this."
msgstr "우주의 어둠조차 익숙하지만, 이런 어둠은 처음이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
msgctxt "hd6a31373g1d34g452fg813eg3b7fdf86dc92"
msgid ""
"There's a power to these shadows - a familiar one. I swear I can feel it..."
msgstr "이 그림자에는 어떤 힘이 숨겨져 있어 - 어째서인지, 익숙하게만 느껴지는걸..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
msgctxt "h1e72a080g3c68g4c23gb5d9ga4b1b5598de9"
msgid "This place is darker than dark, as if the shadows could cast shadows."
msgstr "이곳은 어둠 그 자체보다 어둡군, 마치 그림자 위에 그림자가 덧씌워진 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
msgctxt "hb3549d8ag074bg44bcga087g67eb611b8af7"
msgid ""
"Kind of beautiful - but also feels like you could choke on your own breath "
"here."
msgstr "좀 예쁘기도 하네 - 근데 또 숨 막혀서 죽을 것 같은 기분이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_UNDERDARK
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
msgctxt "h3a29d525g463cg4310ga4bbgf140b58cc1f0"
msgid "Even in the Underdark, I never saw gloom like this. It's unsettling."
msgstr "언더다크에서조차 이런 어둠은 본 적이 없는데. 불안한걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:a125bb60-a0f8-4eb5-a1db-d52ceb8ea204
msgctxt "h1167ccb0g6c5bg4befga93egd99119f8fb27"
msgid "I've never seen darkness like this before. It's unsettling."
msgstr "이런 어둠은 처음이야. 답답하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
msgctxt "hf531ed8bg46b0g4e9cgb9a8ge6ddabf1a94c"
msgid ""
"Alas, it's the only path to Moonrise Towers. We have to push into the dark."
msgstr "하아, 이게 문라이즈 타워로 가는 유일한 길이라니. 그럼 어둠 속으로 나아가는 수 밖에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
msgctxt "h8b943df2g835bg49c6ga58bg7ebe42c82089"
msgid "Moonrise Towers lies ahead. We must venture on, however bleak the path."
msgstr "문라이즈 타워는 저 아래야. 암울한 길이지만, 가야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
msgctxt "hd34335b6g80e5g48c1ga7c9g9069effee785"
msgid ""
"This is the way to Moonrise Towers. We've no choice but to push forward."
msgstr "이게 문라이즈 타워로 가는 유일한 길이니, 우리도 앞으로 나아가는 수 밖에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
msgctxt "hd76d6253gaa20g432fgb3cfg642a139dbb1a"
msgid ""
"We've got to push through. Unless a passing griffon offers a ride, it's the "
"only way to Moonrise Towers."
msgstr "움직여야겠군. 지나가던 그리폰이 등이라도 내주지 않는 이상, 이게 문라이즈 타워로 갈 유일한 방도이니 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
msgctxt "h121c0f9cg0134g48a1ga8e1gf82d6a543089"
msgid "Darkness or not, we need to reach Moonrise Towers."
msgstr "어둠 따위는 중요치 않아, 중요한 건 우리가 문라이즈 타워로 가야 한다는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
msgctxt "hd6a61c3bgf5adg47cegbfc1g969087edbebb"
msgid "Only way to Moonrise, unfortunately."
msgstr "유감스럽게도, 이게 문라이즈로 가는 유일한 길 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_AfterCutscene_2Characters:d870dad0-ea82-4c18-8085-9047f90eb123
msgctxt "h2b0c164fgbe91g4741g96ffg49750ce1ea38"
msgid "It's the only way to Moonrise Towers. We have to push through."
msgstr "문라이즈로 가는 유일한 길이 이것뿐이니, 우리도 나아가는 수 밖에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 00a125b2-3afc-4700-809c-d0ef2d383b3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5b1ec9d1-cec5-2107-d929-f1af9c05d5d9_A = True
