msgctxt "hfc79566egf428g4f5egbd6cge1ba0bd2e374"
msgid "The shadows - I can feel them draining the life from me."
msgstr "이 그림자가... 나에게서 생명을 앗아가려는 것이 느껴지는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse
