msgctxt "h86826eadga943g4650g8cdag477c661758a8"
msgid "Most would feel their strength wilting in these shadows. Not me."
msgstr "이 그림자 속이라면 대다수는 쇠약해지는 느낌을 받겠지만, 난 아냐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60a97c95-9f01-4aea-b7c1-2fbca8b731b7
