msgctxt "haafb64e7g4b46g456agac7cgae98aff7bd1f"
msgid "I'm fading. Bloody curse - I won't let it take me."
msgstr "힘이 빠진다. 빌어먹을 저주 같으니. 날 데려가게 두지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse
