msgctxt "hfb05c7e4g7c5cg4d3cg9f02g529a44c1aa26"
msgid "The curse will consume me entirely if I linger much longer."
msgstr "오래 머뭇거리면 저주가 날 완전히 집어삼킬 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60a97c95-9f01-4aea-b7c1-2fbca8b731b7
