msgctxt "hef6300f6g7a78g49d4gae22g5a55a06abd2d"
msgid "My life's bleeding away. This curse, it's - it's too much."
msgstr "내 생명력이 빠져나가고 있어. 이 저주는, 이건.. 좀 심한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e41199be-000a-4870-8f72-f9fa34042a33
