msgctxt "h6f44e326gd680g492dg8605g9feeabaa4705"
msgid "I can't - I can't take this darkness. I need some light."
msgstr "이... 이 어둠, 더는 버틸 수 없어. 빛이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse
