msgctxt "h80a3329bg40b9g4fe5g826bg1c2942fee968"
msgid "The darkness is <i>in</i> me. Clotting my blood, dissolving my bones."
msgstr "어둠이 내 <i>안으로</i> 들어왔다. 피는 엉겨 붙고 뼈는 녹아내리고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e41199be-000a-4870-8f72-f9fa34042a33
