msgctxt "h40960c99g7444g4b64g9ff3g7433f1a3f06b"
msgid "The shadows are hungry - and Shar won't help me now."
msgstr "그림자가 굶주렸어. 그리고 이제 샤님은 날 돕지 않으실 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a7f22b6-f402-a00e-9b9f-66b5a7d39a09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_A = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#.      - SHADOWHEART_ENEMYOFSHARPATH(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters:3a7f22b6-f402-a00e-9b9f-66b5a7d39a09
msgctxt "h53b39fc6g4922g40d9g8706g155042fda325"
msgid ""
"The shadows are draining me - I can't just walk through them like before."
msgstr "그림자가 날 집어삼키고 있어. 전처럼 그저 걸어서 지나갈 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 407d5643-e473-5006-c3b7-ca0f858eda8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Shadowheart_Knows_CurseResistant = True
#.   Local:
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters:407d5643-e473-5006-c3b7-ca0f858eda8e
msgctxt "h87e390efg8819g408bgb73eg53e5908b3b39"
msgid "These shadows can pull the life from someone - but not me."
msgstr "이 그림자들은 생명을 앗아갈 수 있어. 하지만 나한테선 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41bc1f28-9c8d-5993-535c-53f875c369f3
