msgctxt "hde586231gfb86g49f9g8cb8gfc76597b5afd"
msgid "I feel... cold. Miserable. What kind of dark is this?"
msgstr "느낌이... 추워. 비참하고. 무슨 어둠이 이렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 531682ca-cc74-d4b2-0507-d7a6a828e455
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_A = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters:531682ca-cc74-d4b2-0507-d7a6a828e455
msgctxt "h5c60260eg5f80g427ag809egc3e765ae9179"
msgid ""
"This darkness - it's <i>cursed. </i>I can feel it leeching the life from me."
msgstr "이 어둠은... <i>저주받았군.</i> 내 안의 생명이 빨려 나가는 걸 느낄 수 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 531682ca-cc74-d4b2-0507-d7a6a828e455
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_A = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters:531682ca-cc74-d4b2-0507-d7a6a828e455
msgctxt "h075bfd93gd9e1g447eg94f8g2ea910c28f3e"
msgid "Dark. Cold. As if all the life is being sucked out of me."
msgstr "어둡고, 추워. 마치 내 모든 생명이 빨려나가는 거 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 531682ca-cc74-d4b2-0507-d7a6a828e455
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_A = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters:531682ca-cc74-d4b2-0507-d7a6a828e455
msgctxt "ha344813bg7f6cg4facgb5c5g2dbfcf878cc0"
msgid "The shadows - I can feel them draining the life from me."
msgstr "이 그림자가... 나에게서 생명을 앗아가려는 것이 느껴지는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 531682ca-cc74-d4b2-0507-d7a6a828e455
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters:531682ca-cc74-d4b2-0507-d7a6a828e455
msgctxt "hd85bb176g0ca0g48d6g95c3g8932f2aea270"
msgid "Something's wrong. I feel weak. <i>Drained</i>."
msgstr "이상해. 기운이 <i>빠져나가는</i> 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 559a6457-b8c6-c6c6-6b6a-e4e2a8cd9181
