msgctxt "hcbc6ca7cg0d7cg4ff7g9c7cgef1817638c7a"
msgid "This curse... I need some light..."
msgstr "이 저주... 빛이 필요해..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 559a6457-b8c6-c6c6-6b6a-e4e2a8cd9181
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_A = False
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_C = False
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_B = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters:559a6457-b8c6-c6c6-6b6a-e4e2a8cd9181
msgctxt "h1a30012ag33b6g404ag883fg047fa9b56701"
msgid "<i>Tsk'va</i> - I barely have the strength to move forward."
msgstr "<i>츠크바</i>... 앞으로 나아갈 힘도 거의 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 559a6457-b8c6-c6c6-6b6a-e4e2a8cd9181
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_A = False
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_C = False
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_B = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters:559a6457-b8c6-c6c6-6b6a-e4e2a8cd9181
msgctxt "h95b0cadcg09c9g4a6fgaa5ag9798eb13aa33"
msgid "I can't linger in this darkness - I'm weakening by the moment."
msgstr "이 어둠 속에서 머뭇거릴 수 없어. 매 순간 약해지고 있다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 559a6457-b8c6-c6c6-6b6a-e4e2a8cd9181
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_A = False
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_C = False
#.     - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_B = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters:559a6457-b8c6-c6c6-6b6a-e4e2a8cd9181
msgctxt "h383321b9gd58cg40b8g9327gaab01b9b400a"
msgid "I'm fading. Bloody curse - I won't let it take me."
msgstr "난 죽어가고 있어. 젠장 할 저주 같으니, 날 데려가게 두지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_EntryPoint_PAD_Curse_2Characters
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 559a6457-b8c6-c6c6-6b6a-e4e2a8cd9181
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4ca7d7ab-9b51-31d8-22be-0e26b2a7f3ed_C = True
#. SetFlags:
