#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_Dead_HarperScout_000:f3349593-a614-4ae1-bfa7-66c56498397e
msgctxt "h1a36e739g7e17g4cc9g805eg7400e04f3419"
msgid "*The spell's power wanes. You can ask no more questions.*"
msgstr "*주문의 힘이 약해집니다. 더 이상 질문을 할 수 없습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_Dead_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f9e1df15-03f1-4a40-bf16-c534ba2cee07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_Killer(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_Dead_HarperScout_000:f9e1df15-03f1-4a40-bf16-c534ba2cee07
msgctxt "h6257b5a6gf4d8g4e8ag81a7g477cbd98b45e"
msgid "*The corpse seems willing to speak - but not to its killer.*"
msgstr "*시체는 말할 의지가 있지만, 자신을 죽인 자와 대화하고 싶지는 않은 듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 0b99e4d9-15e5-5155-30fe-a28ca4ba075b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:0b99e4d9-15e5-5155-30fe-a28ca4ba075b
msgctxt "h7ee2a20ega845g441ag8e3eg42a59ff0b2ba"
msgid ""
"If you want to catch your breath, the inn's the only place to do it. Hope to "
"see you there."
msgstr "숨을 돌리고 싶으시다면, 여관을 찾으십시오. 거기서 뵙겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 0e460efe-75f2-689d-ed84-a036fdd99784
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:0e460efe-75f2-689d-ed84-a036fdd99784
msgctxt "h2f55713dge8b4g48faga189g007a20a2eb82"
msgid ""
"Keep your torch high - if you step into the shadows, you'll be felled in a "
"heartbeat."
msgstr "횃불을 높이 드십시오 - 그림자 속으로 발을 들이면, 심장 한 번 뛰기도 전에 쓰러지고 말 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 114a228c-4894-9bd7-5bf5-cacffc7d33be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_State_ReadyToDepart = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:114a228c-4894-9bd7-5bf5-cacffc7d33be
msgctxt "hf2cb744agf1b4g4dc5ga3e7g83c9a1d6d9cd"
msgid ""
"That's right - protected by magic. Only spot in the region that's not been "
"swallowed up by this damn curse. Light'll save you here on the outskirts, "
"but a few paces deeper and you're screwed."
msgstr ""
"그렇습니다 - 마법에 의해 보호받고 있죠. 이 지역 전체에서 저주에 삼켜지지 않은 유일한 거점입니다. 이곳 외곽에서는 빛이 당신을 "
"구해주겠지만, 몇 발자국만 더 들어가면 끝장입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 3fe64e61-53be-2652-b935-b601c45d8dfd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_PlayerWasEvil(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_Event_InvitedToHaven = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:3fe64e61-53be-2652-b935-b601c45d8dfd
msgctxt "h924ca444gd1ecg4579gb6fagd17179535066"
msgid ""
"Not such a freak after all. I know a safe place - let me mark it on your map."
msgstr "괴물 같은 겉모습과는 영 딴판이시군요. 안전한 장소를 압니다 - 지도에 표시해 드리죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 7a90bfc2-9b9e-d943-cf1f-92f8a8c135e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_State_HarpersButLassandraDefeated = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_Event_InvitedToHaven = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:7a90bfc2-9b9e-d943-cf1f-92f8a8c135e6
msgctxt "hded21ff3g21bdg4820g85bbg2ce6f324bc41"
msgid ""
"There's no time to mourn the others - we have to move. I know a safe space. "
"Let me mark it on your map."
msgstr "다른 이들을 위해 애도할 시간은 없습니다 - 곧바로 움직여야 해요. 안전한 장소를 압니다. 지도에 표시해 드리죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b89c14a1-c224-25ca-0214-c06d4832a3bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: SHAR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:b89c14a1-c224-25ca-0214-c06d4832a3bc
msgctxt "h2ec7bf20geb37g4d12ga24cg305b977cef61"
msgid ""
"<i>You </i>may be as vulnerable as a lost lamb in the place, but Lady Shar "
"protects me."
msgstr "<i>너희는</i> 길 잃은 양과 같이 연약하겠으나, 샤 여신께서는 나를 보호하신다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b89c14a1-c224-25ca-0214-c06d4832a3bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:b89c14a1-c224-25ca-0214-c06d4832a3bc
msgctxt "hc91f57adgac34g4321ga956g3628112ac997"
msgid "Thanks, but I'm heading to Moonrise Towers."
msgstr "고맙지만, 나는 문라이즈 타워로 가고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = c976612f-c58a-46ff-d60b-29d35a9c096c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_State_HarpersButLassandraDefeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:c976612f-c58a-46ff-d60b-29d35a9c096c
msgctxt "hcee0e065gb482g48b2g8d24ge1065c28ffea"
msgid "Harpers - move out!"
msgstr "하퍼들 - 움직인다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = d4dbe86f-e295-be4d-3be4-99c13034516a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_State_ReadyToDepart = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:d4dbe86f-e295-be4d-3be4-99c13034516a
msgctxt "h666713f6g052cg429fg939dg536b267e02bf"
msgid "Remember: stay in the light or you're done for."
msgstr "기억하십시오: 빛 속에 머무르지 않으면 끝장입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e01386cd-6588-e707-d3e6-0f38cae2f5b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:e01386cd-6588-e707-d3e6-0f38cae2f5b1
msgctxt "h66683975ge706g44e3ga630g94273637f136"
msgid "'Safe place'? You mean somewhere the shadows can't penetrate?"
msgstr "'안전한 곳'? 그림자가 뚫고 들어올 수 없는 곳을 말하는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = e877acf1-4c4f-678d-5261-0b51ecdd2fab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:e877acf1-4c4f-678d-5261-0b51ecdd2fab
msgctxt "h83b19f6agf2b4g4b4dgb1d8g359e442b6e03"
msgid ""
"The shadows'll get you eventually, the deeper in you go. Keep to the light "
"to buy yourself some time."
msgstr "더 깊숙이 들어갈수록 그림자는 결국 당신을 붙잡고 말 겁니다. 빛 속에 머무르며 어떻게든 시간을 버십시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = f75bd2ca-1746-d0d7-c9ba-e04fc5f4a96d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_State_ReadyToDepart = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:f75bd2ca-1746-d0d7-c9ba-e04fc5f4a96d
msgctxt "h2e424363g521ag462bg92e3g0718d3af88c4"
msgid "Your funeral. Far as we can tell, there's no way through."
msgstr "당신 손해죠. 우리가 아는 한, 저주를 통과할 수 있는 방법은 없습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9101177-f3bf-6370-ce03-68120354abd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:f9101177-f3bf-6370-ce03-68120354abd1
msgctxt "h70dd2859g6f8fg4758gbb05gf1486429c95e"
msgid "I'll follow in a moment."
msgstr "곧바로 따라가겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = fee62559-1293-f052-78d2-6ffa5e9e10cf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_Event_InvitedToHaven = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_000:fee62559-1293-f052-78d2-6ffa5e9e10cf
msgctxt "h02fa868fg64b8g45a1g90a9g72ceb89562d5"
msgid ""
"Well done - now we've got to move. I know a safe place - give me your map."
msgstr "잘하셨습니다 - 이제 움직여야만 합니다. 안전한 장소를 압니다 - 지도에 표시해 드리죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 2da8d574-7b44-4e0f-9a7f-cd538d402588
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001:2da8d574-7b44-4e0f-9a7f-cd538d402588
msgctxt "ha3fc979cgf1a5g436cgb87ag5d94c47653b5"
msgid "We need to hurry, <i>please</i>."
msgstr "서둘러야 합니다, <i>어서요</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 4edf4f8d-5eab-0ef4-0fcb-4f60b699fa3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_State_ReadyToDepart = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001:4edf4f8d-5eab-0ef4-0fcb-4f60b699fa3b
msgctxt "h2555098fg0082g4e38g97f6ga9f43652d369"
msgid "I'm sorry, Yonas..."
msgstr "미안하다, 요나스..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 65751d90-e99d-4747-bd23-60306c6da810
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_State_ReadyToDepart = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001:65751d90-e99d-4747-bd23-60306c6da810
msgctxt "h43aafdb2g9aafg4378g8cefgc1e579f6fb28"
msgid "Be quick. You don't want to linger here, trust me."
msgstr "서두르십시오. 여기서 미적대봐야 좋은 꼴은 못 보실 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 9f21769f-46ca-467f-9b34-a555eefd6304
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001:9f21769f-46ca-467f-9b34-a555eefd6304
msgctxt "h8c6597feg6d41g4457gb71agedd585222e66"
msgid "We need to get out of here. There's a safe place - follow me."
msgstr "여기서 벗어나도록 하죠. 안전한 곳으로 갈 겁니다, 따라오십시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = a28d59b1-afc9-4061-8dd3-1860e63162cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001:a28d59b1-afc9-4061-8dd3-1860e63162cd
msgctxt "h46f67cb4gc5f1g4df8g9b58g6393f78b55f4"
msgid "Stay close, and try avoid the shadows."
msgstr "딱 붙으십시오, 그림자를 최대한 피하셔야 합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = a38ade53-f6bd-24b6-79ab-c97e78a86fa0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_State_PlayerTriedToLeave = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_State_PlayerTriedToLeave = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001:a38ade53-f6bd-24b6-79ab-c97e78a86fa0
msgctxt "h6a411a6ag5410g46e6g93afge2377a4db439"
msgid "You can't just wander off! Stick with me, I'll show you the way."
msgstr "함부로 돌아다니시면 곤란합니다! 같이 가시지요, 제가 안내하겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c1da37a1-f83f-4daf-9c8a-65699fc5102c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001:c1da37a1-f83f-4daf-9c8a-65699fc5102c
msgctxt "h984d4268gf89eg4d0eg8e65ge4d6d5ba5c52"
msgid "Lead on."
msgstr "앞장서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3bc51ee-17cf-48b8-8039-69ec7f4db9d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001:d3bc51ee-17cf-48b8-8039-69ec7f4db9d4
msgctxt "h85f05cb9g7af3g4b74ga000g30082f88de89"
msgid "Give me a moment."
msgstr "잠시만 기다려."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = d8196783-5cce-438f-9c2a-048296c78de3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_State_WaitingForPlayer = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_001:d8196783-5cce-438f-9c2a-048296c78de3
msgctxt "h83224b85gc65cg488bg9a26g0852349ff26a"
msgid "Thank you... wouldn't have made it without your help."
msgstr "감사합니다... 도와주시지 않았다면 전멸했을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003
#. Speaker = Harper Karrow
#. NodeID = 2cd99a69-28c4-4b66-b5d8-06f50964f1f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003:2cd99a69-28c4-4b66-b5d8-06f50964f1f2
msgctxt "h62612f28g8eb2g4fc0gb447g60444c7ac200"
msgid "Hurry up - more of them will be on us any moment."
msgstr "서둘러. 곧 녀석들이 더 많이 공격해 올 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003
#. Speaker = Harper Karrow
#. NodeID = 4721ac2e-1d34-4c35-a9bf-7ed47377c845
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_State_ReadyToDepart = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003:4721ac2e-1d34-4c35-a9bf-7ed47377c845
msgctxt "h82313d34ge303g4b09g9af9gd7a687e57a33"
msgid "Make it quick. Waiting'll get us killed."
msgstr "서둘러. 너무 오래 끌면 우린 다 죽어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003
#. Speaker = Harper Karrow
#. NodeID = 604404f5-0bfe-4900-b474-1ffc821145f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_State_ReadyToDepart = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003:604404f5-0bfe-4900-b474-1ffc821145f4
msgctxt "h3986ef9fg5db5g4262gbee5gb2551133c316"
msgid "Keep close. Avoid the shadows."
msgstr "가까이 붙어. 그림자를 피해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003
#. Speaker = Harper Karrow
#. NodeID = 9fc723f5-44f4-7e9f-ae44-dc1e49510240
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003:9fc723f5-44f4-7e9f-ae44-dc1e49510240
msgctxt "hb261f61cg4b67g4fadg9e30g3c574a0652f4"
msgid "More will be here soon. We need to go - there's a place nearby."
msgstr "그놈들이 더 많이 몰려올 거야. 근처에 안전한 곳이 있으니 빨리 가자고. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003
#. Speaker = Harper Karrow
#. NodeID = ac60b384-e7b6-942e-81f6-6137384d5194
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_State_PlayerTriedToLeave = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_State_PlayerTriedToLeave = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003:ac60b384-e7b6-942e-81f6-6137384d5194
msgctxt "hc71e5c6dg31f0g4d2cga7e4g099e739a6649"
msgid "This is no place for a wander. Stay by me, I know the path."
msgstr "이리저리 방황하면 안 돼. 내가 길을 아니까 가까이 붙어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bc78b16f-fc80-49b2-8ad7-cb88e33b41c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003:bc78b16f-fc80-49b2-8ad7-cb88e33b41c5
msgctxt "hb3ddfe38g026bg4cf8gac57g83dc97d877d0"
msgid "All right, lead the way."
msgstr "좋아, 앞장서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e7c84e5d-7ffb-4060-a3ff-ec9bea1b1f1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003:e7c84e5d-7ffb-4060-a3ff-ec9bea1b1f1f
msgctxt "he5e93e33g17a9g4eeag851dg44def9e81289"
msgid "Wait - I need a moment."
msgstr "잠시만, 시간이 좀 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003
#. Speaker = Harper Karrow
#. NodeID = f6bf96e7-28b8-4902-94a1-72205dd5b314
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_State_WaitingForPlayer = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_PostCombat_HarperScout_003:f6bf96e7-28b8-4902-94a1-72205dd5b314
msgctxt "h6d1cdcfcg663dg4bbcg8fa2gdd6303540d95"
msgid "Nicely fought. You've got some chops."
msgstr "잘 싸웠어. 실력이 좋은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 054f88db-d98b-9fdf-15a2-a773fbd78211
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:054f88db-d98b-9fdf-15a2-a773fbd78211
msgctxt "hcd8d7dafg8ce8g4821g80e3gffe47b3adda3"
msgid ""
"I'll be the judge of that. Stow your weapons, put your hands up, and walk "
"into the light - slowly."
msgstr "그건 내가 판단하겠다. 무기 집어넣고, 손은 높이 든 채로 빛 안으로 걸어와. 천천히 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 085e9bed-410f-fce1-14b4-86cd2986dc13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(4) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:085e9bed-410f-fce1-14b4-86cd2986dc13
msgctxt "h642713e3g22e8g492fgb942gd87c95645eaf"
msgid ""
"My name is [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. Who are "
"<i>you</i>?"
msgstr ""
"나는 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]라고 한다. <i>당신</i>은 "
"누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0889ab5a-236d-7969-b5cf-3519fb819213
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:0889ab5a-236d-7969-b5cf-3519fb819213
msgctxt "h4d8066c3g7959g472bg904eg7ca844b31fba"
msgid ""
"Someone who will snap both you and your weapons in two unless you lower them."
msgstr "무기를 내리지 않으면 너와 너의 무기 모두 두 동강 낼 사람."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 0d7c47fb-735c-adcb-6769-6280320ad609
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_State_EnteredAbove = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_HasMet(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:0d7c47fb-735c-adcb-6769-6280320ad609
msgctxt "he0d9925fg7f21g4716ga2cbg54a271f40566"
msgid "Keep in the light! You - who the hells are you?!"
msgstr "빛 안에 머물러! 너희들, 대체 뭐야?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 145712f4-e94e-263c-b529-00b7c8943268
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(4) = False
#.      - FIGHTER(4) = False
#.      - PALADIN_DEVOTION(4) = False
#.      - DRUID(4) = False
#.      - PALADIN_ANCIENTS(4) = False
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(4) = False
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(4) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:145712f4-e94e-263c-b529-00b7c8943268
msgctxt "ha2d34470g25c8g491bg8ce3gb8981506162e"
msgid "<i>Get ready to fight.</i>"
msgstr "<i>싸울 준비를 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1757f8e2-8182-4d86-7624-ff2186428608
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:1757f8e2-8182-4d86-7624-ff2186428608
msgctxt "h7295c802g0f4eg495dgbd09g96ddd9e4616e"
msgid "His soul... consumed by the darkness. Not a good sign."
msgstr "그의 영혼이... 어둠에 잠식됐어. 좋은 징조는 아니군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 1cbe185b-1571-d254-6855-ac7564c57291
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:1cbe185b-1571-d254-6855-ac7564c57291
msgctxt "h5974b44dg5d02g44a5g9b16g7ef887c00f04"
msgid ""
"Not taking requests, love. Now put your hands up and walk over here - slowly."
msgstr "요구는 받지 않는다. 이제 두 손을 들고 이쪽으로 걸어와, 천천히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 22a13417-616a-1de8-c8a9-5bfbe1507233
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_Event_ShadowCreaturesAppear = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:22a13417-616a-1de8-c8a9-5bfbe1507233
msgctxt "h5f6b2a3fgc2d1g4a78g9bcfgfc8924c6eb07"
msgid "Harpers - you heard the man. TO ARMS!"
msgstr "하퍼들이여, 이 자의 말을 들었겠지. <b>무기를 들어라!</b> "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 22a13417-616a-1de8-c8a9-5bfbe1507233
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_Event_ShadowCreaturesAppear = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:22a13417-616a-1de8-c8a9-5bfbe1507233
msgctxt "he02041cegc94eg4a65g9043gf362e7be6279"
msgid "Harpers - you heard the woman. TO ARMS!"
msgstr "하퍼들이여, 이 자의 말을 들었겠지. <b>무기를 들어라!</b> "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 22a13417-616a-1de8-c8a9-5bfbe1507233
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_Event_ShadowCreaturesAppear = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:22a13417-616a-1de8-c8a9-5bfbe1507233
msgctxt "habeba4e5g2379g43f8gab9cg8d862cf96703"
msgid "Harpers - you heard them. TO ARMS!"
msgstr "하퍼들이여, 이 자의 말을 들었겠지. <b>무기를 들어라!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 230caeba-e327-524f-2bfc-42dcb629bea6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:230caeba-e327-524f-2bfc-42dcb629bea6
msgctxt "h9df61852gf43cg4b4cg9bb0g0ec1b38a1d65"
msgid "Answer me!"
msgstr "대답해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 25158e85-2d4e-9c6d-5172-23267b227a4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(4) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:25158e85-2d4e-9c6d-5172-23267b227a4f
msgctxt "hcd7d6f53gb989g4d32g899ag6e7c67dff9c5"
msgid "<i>Run.</i>"
msgstr "<i>도망친다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 2557a285-5589-5dd5-4980-06ab35da8403
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:2557a285-5589-5dd5-4980-06ab35da8403
msgctxt "hb6259391gbb85g4c30gb41egb19f78676da3"
msgid "It'll be you unless you show yourself. Come out - slowly."
msgstr "모습을 드러내지 않으면 네가 되겠지. 이리 나와, 천천히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 2bbf108d-fbff-90e0-8234-becba909aa2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:2bbf108d-fbff-90e0-8234-becba909aa2c
msgctxt "h15e3ed76gc855g47acgaf8cgcf54308bdf13"
msgid "...Yonas?"
msgstr "...요나스?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2db08a66-6071-15f7-6017-e0033ff95919
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:2db08a66-6071-15f7-6017-e0033ff95919
msgctxt "h2c07946egbf05g414ag977ag630d0c2d08e0"
msgid "I am but a simple monk - I am no threat."
msgstr "하지만 난 그냥 몽크일 뿐이야. 위협이 안 된다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 31888c6a-2938-d561-1553-1045a1d7ddc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:31888c6a-2938-d561-1553-1045a1d7ddc6
msgctxt "hbb445799g5bc4g4f8ag8475g623451f9db3b"
msgid "Yonas - look out!"
msgstr "요나스, 조심해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 342c8b12-4035-887a-a412-03f4115324d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:342c8b12-4035-887a-a412-03f4115324d9
msgctxt "hffd4a5feg122fg4981g8594gaafea991a56b"
msgid "Wrong direction. Come into the light, hands high."
msgstr "방향이 틀렸잖아. 빛 드는 곳으로 와, 손들고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 38c1abc9-d930-2aa3-f207-21e062a68c47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:38c1abc9-d930-2aa3-f207-21e062a68c47
msgctxt "h02d929a0g9951g42cegb65dgb5e206327cfe"
msgid ""
"The darkness can <i>force </i>rapid transfiguration? What magic is this?"
msgstr "어둠이 이렇게 급격한 변이를 <i>강제로</i> 일으킨다고? 이건 대체 무슨 마법이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 41b38621-b1cd-b0bc-9d70-bd26004baec4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_Event_ShadowCreaturesAppear = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:41b38621-b1cd-b0bc-9d70-bd26004baec4
msgctxt "h4521fca0gfcc8g4db4ga33fgee98a5169bbf"
msgid "Don't let it get hold of you. Harpers - now!"
msgstr "저것들에게 붙잡히지 마. 하퍼들이여, 지금이야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 44b63bd7-ab62-cd5b-c15d-6cd1fbd04eb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_State_EnteredAbove = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_HasMet(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:44b63bd7-ab62-cd5b-c15d-6cd1fbd04eb3
msgctxt "h4bf97eefgca94g4087gaee6gb76c4dddb54b"
msgid "Stay together! Keep to the light!"
msgstr "떨어지지 마! 빛 안에 머물러!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4570394b-3acb-1115-20d6-b353e9c3a205
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:4570394b-3acb-1115-20d6-b353e9c3a205
msgctxt "hd7e83703g6e00g4deag964dg4b1bd3afb7c1"
msgid "<i>Abandon them. Hope they die.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그들을 두고 떠난다. 다 죽어버리면 좋겠다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 49fc161b-a6bb-cdb7-416d-daa14800926a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:49fc161b-a6bb-cdb7-416d-daa14800926a
msgctxt "hb2e64b3dg6547g48dcg87b7g5387e8914b85"
msgid ""
"You're a chatty shadow, I'll give you that. Come out into the light - hands "
"high."
msgstr "말 많은 그림자 씨로구먼, 그건 인정하지. 빛 드는 곳으로 와, 손들고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4a182857-6b69-3290-6038-4a2bbfe3397c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:4a182857-6b69-3290-6038-4a2bbfe3397c
msgctxt "h032c15fcgdd26g4e4dga823g79d970c1799c"
msgid ""
"An expert in magic. Perhaps I can aid you in traversing this darkness. What "
"do you know of it?"
msgstr "마법의 전문가지. 당신들이 이 어둠을 가로지르는데 도움을 줄 수도 있어. 이것에 대해 뭘 알고 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 4c062be4-6460-6053-8a2b-74293c7364b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_PlayerWasEvil(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_Event_ShadowCreaturesAppear = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:4c062be4-6460-6053-8a2b-74293c7364b8
msgctxt "h6c734cc5g0633g467dgab74g40a39e179b73"
msgid ""
"Step out of the light and you're done for, freak. Fight with us or die in "
"the dark. To arms! Now!"
msgstr "빛 밖으로 나오면 넌 끝장이야, 멍청아. 우리와 함께 싸우거나 어둠 속에서 죽어라. 무기를 들어라! 당장!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 519ff99e-d8c2-b1c1-d271-731fe05ce0e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:519ff99e-d8c2-b1c1-d271-731fe05ce0e1
msgctxt "h5d29604eg0954g47begb7b7gd1d505807ec6"
msgid ""
"Whether we attack or not depends entirely on you, love. Come into the light -"
" hands high."
msgstr "우리가 공격하고 말고는 오롯이 너에게 달려있어, 예쁜이. 빛 드는 곳으로 와, 손들고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 570f46f4-2b73-320b-5766-0f691d2ec1d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:570f46f4-2b73-320b-5766-0f691d2ec1d6
msgctxt "hc4fefe99g7cc1g4271gb8d4gc4388d715476"
msgid "First, come closer. Hands up."
msgstr "일단, 가까이 와라. 손든 채로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5801d2d8-4dc3-1938-74b7-4b3ed21f6370
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(4) = True
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(4) = False
#.      - OATHBREAKER(4) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:5801d2d8-4dc3-1938-74b7-4b3ed21f6370
msgctxt "h047d4f36g2831g4f50g87f9g91d3192ae83c"
msgid "One who has sworn an oath to do no harm. Lower your weapons, please."
msgstr "해를 끼치지 않겠다고 맹세한 자. 무기를 내려줘, 부탁컨대."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 58347b5e-5a56-7007-0972-1f995d39cc86
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:58347b5e-5a56-7007-0972-1f995d39cc86
msgctxt "hf5dea9a8g5be6g421dga83cgcf9d5fb399ae"
msgid ""
"So you can fry us alive? I don't think so. Come into the light - hands high."
msgstr "우리를 산 채로 튀겨버리려고? 안 될 말이지. 빛 드는 곳으로 와, 손들고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Yonas
#. NodeID = 665436d8-93e3-e0ee-1367-4e952c2e0efd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ShadowCurse_Knows_Curse = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:665436d8-93e3-e0ee-1367-4e952c2e0efd
msgctxt "hc3951d3bg153eg43d1g8484g0e43cf5ee2fa"
msgid "There you are... Come... Join me..."
msgstr "거기 있구나... 이리 와... 함께 하자..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 673da333-9d53-2a20-c006-001175b04bb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:673da333-9d53-2a20-c006-001175b04bb8
msgctxt "ha119b74dgbb43g47d0g9f8ag479c0b391f48"
msgid "Yonas is gone. All that remains is a monster - one I intend to kill."
msgstr "요나스는 죽었어. 남은 건 괴물 하나군. 내가 죽여야 할."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 6e1dbdb9-d7c7-604b-f4b1-c6e0a3c81537
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:6e1dbdb9-d7c7-604b-f4b1-c6e0a3c81537
msgctxt "h2bee85c5g08e2g4741gb833g43c5ad77001e"
msgid "All right, freak. Don't move."
msgstr "좋아, 또라이 녀석아. 움직이지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6fa1f7f8-3578-7541-95e8-0222f04f82c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:6fa1f7f8-3578-7541-95e8-0222f04f82c7
msgctxt "h2045d123gfb76g4c95ga233g9babfcd93ecf"
msgid ""
"Peace - I am a druid. This land and its festering shadows - what do you know "
"of it?"
msgstr "진정해. 나는 드루이드야. 이 땅과 이곳을 좀먹는 그림자 말인데, 아는 게 좀 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73f08b94-a163-fae5-5ab5-104d431be065
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:73f08b94-a163-fae5-5ab5-104d431be065
msgctxt "h05aab913gf063g4dfcg87b9g03c3344bc034"
msgid ""
"A ranger who knows the marks of a hunting party - what are you tracking?"
msgstr "사냥감의 흔적을 쫓을 줄 아는 레인저지. 뭘 추적하고 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 765b9431-03b3-4fd2-36d0-6299f8b5d6f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: RANGER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:765b9431-03b3-4fd2-36d0-6299f8b5d6f9
msgctxt "h56cf9beag283cg4a74ga254gf47b57350e8e"
msgid ""
"I think we've just become prey. Stick together, stay in the light. No "
"heroics."
msgstr "이제 막 우리가 먹잇감이 된 것 같군. 같이 붙어 있고, 빛 속에 머물러. 무모한 행동은 하지 마. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 765b9431-03b3-4fd2-36d0-6299f8b5d6f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: ROGUE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:765b9431-03b3-4fd2-36d0-6299f8b5d6f9
msgctxt "h441c2166g5cd1g4d3bg979bgc32faca708ac"
msgid "I'm afraid poor Yonas is bait - and this is a trap."
msgstr "미안하지만 불쌍한 요나스는 미끼에 불과했고, 이건 함정이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Yonas
#. NodeID = 797b6ea4-0596-e5f8-506f-6f139ce33543
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:797b6ea4-0596-e5f8-506f-6f139ce33543
msgctxt "h9016d78fg6a89g4e7cg97e7ged51b689dc8a"
msgid "I can't see anything. Something's wrong."
msgstr "아무것도 안 보여. 뭔가 잘못됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Yonas
#. NodeID = 7cf86836-68f6-37fa-f26b-ac8be85fddee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:7cf86836-68f6-37fa-f26b-ac8be85fddee
msgctxt "he7ef1086g815ag4be3ga5c4g05a0528c511f"
msgid "Who's there? Meg? Is that - argh!"
msgstr "거기 누구야? 메그? 거기- 아악!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80f32263-b091-c8ff-ef32-2d3bc11fad0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:80f32263-b091-c8ff-ef32-2d3bc11fad0f
msgctxt "h5752ea88g9bd9g46f0gb019gcc06d7019915"
msgid ""
"Guards up, everyone. I'm not letting the shadows take anyone else today."
msgstr "모두 방어 태세를 취해. 오늘은 그림자가 아무도 데려가지 못하게 할 거야. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 84ad8edb-2d48-c7c9-b59e-e886645dc5a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:84ad8edb-2d48-c7c9-b59e-e886645dc5a7
msgctxt "h7446abbaga977g41f5g987eg0ed72d289556"
msgid "Follow my voice. Come back to the light."
msgstr "내 목소리 들리는 곳으로 따라와. 빛으로 돌아와."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Meygan
#. NodeID = 89a8a58b-ca4c-fc71-7e27-9dc4e306d9f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:89a8a58b-ca4c-fc71-7e27-9dc4e306d9f9
msgctxt "h09cf1d59g9023g437dg81a7g1e717f9c46d3"
msgid "Yonas...?"
msgstr "요나스...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d59de32-5424-3898-0b50-95ba0f0ed415
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:8d59de32-5424-3898-0b50-95ba0f0ed415
msgctxt "hcfb33688g234dg4d5dg9bf6g9504556cc1e1"
msgid "An escaped lunatic. Be careful, or the madman will take over..."
msgstr "탈출한 미치광이지. 조심해, 내 광기가 날뛸지도 모르니깐..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = 8da9ebb6-a55b-f2db-5cbb-3b8a7d21d4ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_State_PlayerBeingSeen(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_HasMet(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:8da9ebb6-a55b-f2db-5cbb-3b8a7d21d4ae
msgctxt "h81d44fe0gc3cdg41cbg9a4dg063e35678298"
msgid "Stop - who's there?!"
msgstr "정지! 거기 누구냐?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9013f477-0fab-5d23-2b40-47f25f5b7640
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_PlayerWasEvil(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:9013f477-0fab-5d23-2b40-47f25f5b7640
msgctxt "h17cc919cg4bfdg4cadg8acfg7d627ba431d3"
msgid "A nightmare in the dark."
msgstr "어둠 속 악몽."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9333c400-f088-b8ce-3876-30d4fad595d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:9333c400-f088-b8ce-3876-30d4fad595d7
msgctxt "h969942a8g6d51g4d62g9de5g02ad36b51d0f"
msgid ""
"A paladin - one who will only take you down if you're foolish enough to "
"strike first."
msgstr "팔라딘이다. 먼저 네가 공격하는 멍청한 짓을 하면 쓰러트릴 뿐이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Yonas
#. NodeID = 9876ca2d-813d-ec66-095b-4f6f9eb86764
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:9876ca2d-813d-ec66-095b-4f6f9eb86764
msgctxt "hb3b008c3g6d1fg48a6g83e7g9d0453b00634"
msgid "I'm here! Where are you?"
msgstr "나는 여기 있어! 다들 어디 간 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a287bef9-f0c3-7488-ef2f-393a65d1a6be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:a287bef9-f0c3-7488-ef2f-393a65d1a6be
msgctxt "h30e3b869ga8a5g435fgb0d9gbcccb55d9d85"
msgid "<i>Try to save them, get ready to fight.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그들을 구하려 시도하고, 싸울 준비를 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = a46252ed-eda2-95b3-8b92-dcb5fcb380f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:a46252ed-eda2-95b3-8b92-dcb5fcb380f2
msgctxt "h311daf5fgac1cg49d8g9c7fgab3d8b486b27"
msgid "Yonas? Can you see our torches?"
msgstr "요나스? 횃불이 보이나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a6a3d6af-c8e5-b93b-cde3-99c52c133254
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:a6a3d6af-c8e5-b93b-cde3-99c52c133254
msgctxt "h2c98362egb727g462fgb6edg0825d61f340f"
msgid "Move. I'll take care of this."
msgstr "나와. 내가 처리하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = ab4c6206-3148-f4b9-ef41-7992f80a6818
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_Event_ShadowCreaturesAppear = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:ab4c6206-3148-f4b9-ef41-7992f80a6818
msgctxt "h292cb7b4g1773g47e2g9ce3g39d70b3391a2"
msgid "Harpers - to arms!"
msgstr "하퍼들이여! 무기를 들어라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = af18d177-37e0-c389-698d-f8e479d7a321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:af18d177-37e0-c389-698d-f8e479d7a321
msgctxt "h1742caa2g69e9g4c44g9246ge916b9b5fcf2"
msgid "Yonas! Move in!"
msgstr "요나스! 안으로 들어와!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_BAHAMUT
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h62bc4627gefdeg4052ga82cg6a83e3483342"
msgid ""
"I serve the Platinum Dragon - I mean you no harm. Please, lower your weapons."
msgstr "난 플래티넘 드래곤을 섬기는 사람이야. 그러니까 해칠 생각은 없어. 제발, 무기를 내려. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_CORELLONLARETHIAN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h5c132d8eg0facg4330gad7fgc68a24bc1099"
msgid "I'm but a lost Corellite - not an enemy. I beg of you, do not strike."
msgstr "나는 그저 길 잃은 코렐론 신자일 뿐이다. 적이 아니라고. 부탁이니, 공격하지 마라. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EILISTRAEE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h9cd9dac8gdc3fg4552g87d0gcae72ae086cb"
msgid "I'm a worshipper of Lady Silverhair - please, spare me your wrath."
msgstr "나는 은발의 여신을 숭배하는 사람이야. 제발, 분노를 거둬."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GARLGLITTERGOLD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h41e154deg7c9cg4bd6g9ce3gdabc87e78fff"
msgid "Naught but one of the Priceless Gem's faithful - lower your weapons."
msgstr "귀중한 보석단의 독실한 신자일뿐, 무기를 내려."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GRUUMSH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "hf3346ed2g564eg45a8gba92gddc980cd64b2"
msgid "I walk in blood with Gruumsh. To attack me would be foolish."
msgstr "난 그룸쉬와 함께 피를 밟고 다닌다. 나를 공격하는 건 어리석은 짓이다. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_HELM
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h0b2bbaafg5d79g40b8g8055g4e35c57d50e4"
msgid "I keep vigil for Helm - attacking me would be unwise."
msgstr "나는 헬름을 위해 경계를 서는 사람이다. 나를 공격하는 건 현명하지 못한 일이야. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_ILMATER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h8e64e0aag6357g48b8g9eb7g2604a0abff07"
msgid ""
"I serve the Lord on the Rack - do not shoot. There is no need for wanton "
"suffering."
msgstr "난 고통의 신을 섬긴다. 쏘지 마라. 예정에 없는 고통은 필요 없어. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_KELEMVOR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h57b1e321gfef1g4056gb00egba700b87683f"
msgid "I am a warden of Death - but I seek none here. Lower your weapons."
msgstr "난 죽음의 감시자다. 하지만 여기선 아무 죽음도 찾지 않는다. 무기를 내려라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_LADUGUER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h525934bcg41fdg43b3gb053g7fd0d02c913a"
msgid ""
"One of the Harsh's faithful, and I do not care to fight you. Stand down."
msgstr "나는 하쉬의 신도 중 한 명이다. 그리고 너와 싸우고 싶지는 않아. 물러서라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[9].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_LATHANDER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h99e84f50gedd9g4e9fgb51ege9d771472706"
msgid "A servant of the Morninglord stands before you. I do not wish to fight."
msgstr "아침의 군주의 종복이 네 앞에 서 있다. 싸우고 싶지는 않다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[10].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_LOLTH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h7e840b33g0590g4e21ga05cg6bf603e2d915"
msgid "Lower your weapons or feel the Mother of Spiders' prickly wrath."
msgstr "무기를 내려놔. 아니면 거미들의 어머니의 날카로운 분노를 느끼든가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[11].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_MIELIKKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h999987e2g3ef2g4632gbeeega79d148b8fac"
msgid ""
"One of Mielikki's faithful - I wish for allies in this warped place, not "
"enemies."
msgstr "미엘리키의 신도 중 하나다. 이런 뒤틀린 곳에서는 아군을 원한다. 적이 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[12].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_MORADIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h06183c0ag1bfag4d72g8c29g8c49e7c6d1d8"
msgid "I serve the Dwarffather - there is no need for violence."
msgstr "난 드워프 아버지를 섬긴다. 폭력은 필요 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[13].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_MYSTRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h3168a92dgd759g4c05g9befg10d703865f76"
msgid "I'm but a scion of the Weavemistress. I do not wish to fight."
msgstr "나는 위브의 여신님의 후손일 뿐이다. 싸우고 싶지 않다. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[14].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_OGHMA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "hf7baf997g30d9g4914g83cfg6b9fdada7447"
msgid ""
"I am a servant of Oghma - and us fighting would be unwise. Lower your "
"weapons."
msgstr "나는 오그마의 종복이다. 우리가 싸우는 건 현명하지 못한 일이지. 무기를 내려라. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[15].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SELUNE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h603a2f03g9550g4506gbcfcgebb55ef9d277"
msgid "I walk in Selûne's moonlight. I don't want any trouble."
msgstr "나는 셀루네의 달빛을 걷는 사람이다. 문제를 일으키고 싶지는 않아. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[16].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_TALOS
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h3a188f39g4116g4c6dga8a9g456738785877"
msgid ""
"I am one of the Storm Lord's adherents. Lower your weapons if you wish to "
"live."
msgstr "나는 폭풍 군주의 추종자 중 하나다. 살고 싶다면 무기를 내려라. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[17].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_TEMPUS
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "hb062b7e5g9a5dg44e7gb7a6g62d2a564032c"
msgid "I serve the Lord of Battle. Raising arms against me would be foolish."
msgstr "난 전쟁의 신을 섬긴다. 나를 상대로 무기를 드는 것은 어리석은 짓이 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[18].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_TIAMAT
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h5d016edfgf8dfg4a66gb34egfb0cd6a8cdd0"
msgid "Lower your puny weapons before me. I serve the Dragon Queen herself."
msgstr "내 앞의 네 하잖은 무기를 내려라. 난 드래곤 여왕님을 섬기는 자다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[19].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_TYMORA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h2bd63507g0ff8g4790g97f9g608289d74c36"
msgid ""
"For us to battle would be terrible luck. By Tymora's grace - stand down."
msgstr "우리가 싸운다면 악운이 될거야. 티모라의 은총으로, 물러서라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[20].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_TYR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h1acb156bg496bg4f93g8a59g672350d7feeb"
msgid "I am simply one of Justice's disciples. You can stand down."
msgstr "난 그저 정의의 신의 신봉자 중 하나일 뿐이야. 물러서도록 해. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[21].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_VLAAKITH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "hd58c6a24g0954g43a8g9e1dgc60e479b3e84"
msgid ""
"One of the Undying Queen's faithful. Lower those weapons - for your own "
"sakes."
msgstr "불멸의 여왕의 신도들 중 하나다. 무기를 내려놔. 너희들을 위해서라도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[22].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_YONDALLA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h6705e4fag5b70g4609g9a49g8b4ba08ea4f1"
msgid "I am a cleric of Yondalla - I mean you no harm. Let's talk, not fight."
msgstr "나는 욘달라의 클레릭이다. 해칠 생각 없다. 말로 해, 싸우지 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[23].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(4) = False
#.      - CLERIC(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b24a1752-5670-8e3e-99a1-436e9d2fae63
msgctxt "h7fc3cebfg775ag4023g8657ga52a783d52dd"
msgid "I am but a faithful adherent - I do not wish to fight you."
msgstr "나는 충실한 신도일 뿐이다. 너와 싸우고 싶지는 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = b8cf689d-6272-2205-3f84-9d135824b84b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:b8cf689d-6272-2205-3f84-9d135824b84b
msgctxt "h5fa0eb0bg0e88g451fga55cg938b49525547"
msgid ""
"I saw a 'simple monk' break a fella's spine once - hands where I can see "
"them."
msgstr "'그냥 몽크' 가 친구의 척추를 박살 내는 걸 본 적 있어 - 손을 눈에 띄는 곳에 두라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf7747be-2e79-1897-20f9-8ecb31cf4ad9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(4) = True
#. TagRule: SORCERER_WILDMAGIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:bf7747be-2e79-1897-20f9-8ecb31cf4ad9
msgctxt "hf58ee5edgd733g4a57gb3c5gda9e2b81f6e5"
msgid ""
"I'm a sorcerer, so kindly lower your weapons - or who knows what my magic "
"might do."
msgstr "난 소서러다, 그러니 무기를 내려주시지 - 아니면 내 마법이 뭘 할 수 있는지 알게 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf7747be-2e79-1897-20f9-8ecb31cf4ad9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:bf7747be-2e79-1897-20f9-8ecb31cf4ad9
msgctxt "hc0b3f341g5406g41c7ga4dfg25ed61e5b8eb"
msgid ""
"I'm a sorcerer, so kindly lower your weapons or things might get ugly. Very "
"ugly."
msgstr "난 소서러다. 그러니 무기를 내리지 않으면 상황이 아주 안 좋게 흘러갈 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf9c3a0b-0c3e-9a3b-b4f0-55047dee5191
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: PALADIN_ANCIENTS or PALADIN_DEVOTION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:bf9c3a0b-0c3e-9a3b-b4f0-55047dee5191
msgctxt "h30cead31g5b47g4f4eg8a92g65491f81223f"
msgid "Get behind me - I'll protect you."
msgstr "뒤로 물러서 - 내가 지켜주겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = c6349291-dc67-4f12-a65a-58d1ee4cbe9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_Event_ShadowCreaturesAppear = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:c6349291-dc67-4f12-a65a-58d1ee4cbe9c
msgctxt "h49445924g1066g4c6dg9f17gddb14d4ad2eb"
msgid "Now is <i>not</i> the time. Harpers, to arms!"
msgstr "지금은 <i>그럴 때</i>가 아니야. 하퍼들이여, 전투 준비!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = cc481aaf-d307-7c3e-1833-d5e416182a3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:cc481aaf-d307-7c3e-1833-d5e416182a3e
msgctxt "h04e72bf3g3b31g41bdga34ag6f9ec8dc36e8"
msgid "Answer me!"
msgstr "대답해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Harper Lassandra
#. NodeID = d0e8a3d7-17f4-0857-14a8-0b8b6a99fc80
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_State_EnteredAbove = True
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_HarperScouts_State_PlayerBeingSeen(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures_HasMet(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:d0e8a3d7-17f4-0857-14a8-0b8b6a99fc80
msgctxt "ha90283adg5cf0g4f88g9e5fg15e017959152"
msgid "Keep in the light! You - who the hells are you?!"
msgstr "빛 안에 머물러! 너희들, 대체 뭐야?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d13d73e6-5ad5-61ba-80bb-de04d4b54a87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_HarperScouts_ShadowCreatures:d13d73e6-5ad5-61ba-80bb-de04d4b54a87
msgctxt "hd64d76c0g0b6ag450bg88e3g86a1363cf22f"
msgid ""
"This darkness is no natural plight - we must fight, or succumb to it too."
msgstr "이 어둠은 자연스러운 상황은 아니군. 우리는 싸워야 한다. 아니면 똑같이 먹힐 뿐."

