msgid "Hmm - it won't go out. Must be some trick to it."
msgstr "흠, 꺼지지 않네. 뭔가 다른 요령이 필요한 걸지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_MastiffPoachers_PAD_TouchedTorches_WithGale
