msgid "RING RING, UNTER-SCUNTER."
msgstr "<b>땡 땡, 운터-스쿤터</b>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 4a2a276a-1120-4ef6-344e-4d5b18c6b689
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Pixie_State_CharacterHasShieldActive(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:4a2a276a-1120-4ef6-344e-4d5b18c6b689
msgctxt "ha32febd8ge50dg4803g858cg66456c40cbab"
msgid "Been blessed already, haven't you? Move on with your life!"
msgstr "아까 축복 받았잖아? 이제 네 인생이나 살러 가!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 4a90ef67-28ec-dfbf-e261-b1b239bdaff0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:4a90ef67-28ec-dfbf-e261-b1b239bdaff0
msgctxt "hd82c3135gdd35g4a7fg8a8eg53dc1810396d"
msgid ""
"You look like you want to say the magic words. Like they're right on the tip "
"of your lips..."
msgstr "마법의 주문을 말하고 싶은 모양인데. 입 밖으로 나오기 바로 직전인 것 같기도 하고..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 659ab637-0d4f-652a-6174-dd7de3f65e42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Pixie_State_SaidCorrectAnswer(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:659ab637-0d4f-652a-6174-dd7de3f65e42
msgctxt "hdfbc2d1fg7f01g4f7bg8408g0f0802e34da1"
msgid "Dolly Dolly Dolly, Dolly; won't you save me from my folly?"
msgstr "돌리 돌리 돌리, 돌리. 날 좀 도와주면 안 되겠니, 부디?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 766fec1c-ba90-934b-eca7-2fe25667b6c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_PixieBell_HasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:766fec1c-ba90-934b-eca7-2fe25667b6c2
msgctxt "hbcc31aefg5ec3g464cgbddegef36f6b9e9d4"
msgid "Ding-dang-dong, your stench is strong."
msgstr "딩-댕-동. 네 몸에서 악취가 진동하지롱."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 766fec1c-ba90-934b-eca7-2fe25667b6c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_PixieBell_HasMet(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:766fec1c-ba90-934b-eca7-2fe25667b6c2
msgctxt "h4c07f5cbga83fg490bgb478g273380a08086"
msgid "Dongity ding, you ruin everything."
msgstr "동기티 딩. 넌 다 망치는구나, 뭐든지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 7f3ca6f9-9534-9256-010c-9a3f7ba9b9fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:7f3ca6f9-9534-9256-010c-9a3f7ba9b9fc
msgctxt "h250cff4cgc9c5g4760g95d5gea43c9a13752"
msgid ""
"Sorry, baby, you gotta use your brain to get this boon. Even if it's the "
"size of a pea."
msgstr "미안, 자기. 이 은혜를 받으려면 머리를 써야 해. 뇌가 콩만한 크기라도 예외는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 825b8b04-e5d7-743b-5a87-5937bb41c7f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:825b8b04-e5d7-743b-5a87-5937bb41c7f5
msgctxt "h1022dbecg4148g4b10gb232gca1e1913135e"
msgid "I'm afraid I don't know the magic words. Mind sharing them?"
msgstr "마법의 주문에 대해선 아는 바가 없는데. 좀 알려줄 순 없을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 8f99538d-5fec-c76b-a4eb-dc60b9aae9be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_PixieBell_Event_TransformsIntoBoar(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:8f99538d-5fec-c76b-a4eb-dc60b9aae9be
msgctxt "hc0188fc5ga5b3g449dgad6dg3011871703c2"
msgid "HEY! You're not supposed to know that! Eat dirt."
msgstr "<b>야</b>! 그걸 네가 어떻게 아는 거야! 흙이나 먹어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 91d77ab5-ff05-e0b7-83bb-ace2ea4b346a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:91d77ab5-ff05-e0b7-83bb-ace2ea4b346a
msgctxt "hc7000dd9gfac0g4c68g97beg3bb53007ceb0"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b12d50b-588a-33fc-8fe8-9617fac2ecb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_Pixie_State_SaidCorrectAnswer(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:9b12d50b-588a-33fc-8fe8-9617fac2ecb3
msgctxt "h9852d2c3g7e7eg4974g8332g8dfe36da917d"
msgid "Dolly, aren't we friends? I helped you out of the lantern, didn't I?"
msgstr "돌리, 우리 친구 아니었어? 내가 널 등불에서 꺼내줬잖아, 기억해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 9b9c0d45-8f5c-488e-3cd9-682960b438c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Pixie_Event_GivesImmunity = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:9b9c0d45-8f5c-488e-3cd9-682960b438c4
msgctxt "h8a651438g0ff4g4ca6g9106gf3b79500bd28"
msgid "HEH! I sure love it when they beg."
msgstr "<b>헤헷</b>! 애걸하는 꼴은 언제봐도 좋다니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 9c9ebf68-1ada-22e2-8993-e8c97ac60079
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_PixieBell_Event_TransformsIntoFrog(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:9c9ebf68-1ada-22e2-8993-e8c97ac60079
msgctxt "h2bdc9928ga4f2g49a0ga18bga8f6fb8c7b37"
msgid "Ribbit, ribbit, Rigoberto!"
msgstr "개굴, 개굴, 개구락지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 9cbcf53f-9d98-63a4-27e1-be558488c48e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:9cbcf53f-9d98-63a4-27e1-be558488c48e
msgctxt "hc5edbac6gbae2g4847g84dbg98861243211c"
msgid "Come on, you can do it, Billy. Once you guess, you'll feel so silly."
msgstr "제발 좀, 너도 할 수 있어. 일단 맞히라고, 암만 바보라도, 별거 아니라고. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b402ae13-e8de-8767-1bd8-649a6de7b2b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PixieBell:b402ae13-e8de-8767-1bd8-649a6de7b2b5
msgctxt "h6cee4f73g44c6g4ffbga8fdg104f0b85735f"
msgid "We're living in a magical theatre show puppeteered by a madman."
msgstr "우리의 삶은 한 미치광이가 조종하는 마법 극장 속 인형극이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_AD_AsksForHelp
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 56b6422d-40bb-adb8-0c2c-606b35188282
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_AD_AsksForHelp:56b6422d-40bb-adb8-0c2c-606b35188282
msgctxt "hd390dcb6g52f2g4d0dg8220g71216be9b24c"
msgid "Oh help! Help!"
msgstr "오, 여기! 여기!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_AD_AsksForHelp
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 56b6422d-40bb-adb8-0c2c-606b35188282
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_AD_AsksForHelp:56b6422d-40bb-adb8-0c2c-606b35188282
msgctxt "h6497bcabg0382g4c29g8b17g5fd57bddc38a"
msgid "Me oh my, oh my oh me!"
msgstr "어쩜 좋아, 오, 내 신세야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_AD_AsksForHelp
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 56b6422d-40bb-adb8-0c2c-606b35188282
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[2]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_AD_AsksForHelp:56b6422d-40bb-adb8-0c2c-606b35188282
msgctxt "hdf03b7d7gd5d4g4425ga2ddg85732afbc1b0"
msgid "Won't you help me? Set me free?"
msgstr "나 좀 도와주지 않을래? 빠져나갈 수 있게?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_AD_ScreamingInsideLantern
