msgctxt "h436811b3g911bg4c09gbb75g5069916ce4fa"
msgid "I'll kill you so badly!"
msgstr "끔찍하게 죽여 주마!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_InsideLantern
#. Speaker = Harper Elindale
#. NodeID = 01df404b-012c-3d16-e28c-52ea59c032fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_4 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_InsideLantern:01df404b-012c-3d16-e28c-52ea59c032fd
msgctxt "h64a022c4gdab1g436agb1bcg97986858b0b3"
msgid ""
"Can - can you feel it? Light. <i>Hope. </i>I'd near forgotten how it felt."
msgstr "느... 느껴지십니까? 이 빛. <i>희망</i>을요. 이 느낌을 거의 잊을 뻔 했습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_InsideLantern
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 02bcb917-b00c-946e-1b17-88f119f50534
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_InsideLantern:02bcb917-b00c-946e-1b17-88f119f50534
msgctxt "hf40a07b1gf9dbg4366g8724gad044c77a63e"
msgid "Let me out and we can start the party."
msgstr "어서 날 꺼내주고 파티라도 시작하자고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_InsideLantern
#. Speaker = Dolly Dolly Dolly
#. NodeID = 07aba3ed-c99d-4d00-e51f-1b0c9772f43e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_InsideLantern:07aba3ed-c99d-4d00-e51f-1b0c9772f43e
msgctxt "hc8aa0b59ge61cg494bg96f8g6c00f98ed490"
msgid "Takes my light... to protect from... the curse..."
msgstr "내 빛으로... 저주로부터... 보호..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_InsideLantern
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 08f0b46c-d477-4d4a-afe7-3c23714ab975
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(9) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(9) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_InsideLantern:08f0b46c-d477-4d4a-afe7-3c23714ab975
msgctxt "h799cbad7g1371g45dfg8a2bg504c7fb3dd1a"
msgid "I know the feeling. We've got to set her free."
msgstr "나도 저 기분을 알아. 저 녀석을 풀어줘야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_InsideLantern
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 099955d2-3754-ccfd-33ca-192fb094339d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_GOOD(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(1) = False
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_InsideLantern:099955d2-3754-ccfd-33ca-192fb094339d
msgctxt "hda0b02cfgd459g4cb8gbf36g7d6a7afa1626"
msgid "You're fuel for the lantern? How does that work?"
msgstr "네가 등불을 작동시키는 동력이라고? 어떻게 작동하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Pixie_InsideLantern
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0af0af9c-e870-3bdb-ffff-c6a5a60e6d0b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
