msgctxt "hbec36b35g2531g46d8g9441g923594db8979"
msgid "Stupid beast was probably out of its mind with fear."
msgstr "이 멍청한 짐승은 공포 때문에 정신이 나갔던 모양이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
msgctxt "hcd02a415g3629g4863ga1a0g8775e1df6601"
msgid "The beast was consumed by shadows. A fate to be avoided."
msgstr "이 짐승은 그림자에 먹혀버렸군. 이렇게 되어서는 안돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
msgctxt "h7d3e6933g4566g4903ga378g586d6a94dba5"
msgid "Poor beast. It didn't deserve to die in fear."
msgstr "불쌍한 짐승. 이렇게 겁에 질린 채 죽어선 안 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
msgctxt "h2f60b7b9g47efg40a4g9af9gb3bdc27e0b56"
msgid "Poor creature. It must have been terrified."
msgstr "불쌍한 생물이야. 겁에 질렸을 테지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
msgctxt "h00f701f3gbaf3g4f96g99a1g0dab4fefe1f8"
msgid "Choked to death by cursed shadows. A terrible fate."
msgstr "저주받은 그림자에 목 졸려 죽었어. 끔찍한 운명이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
msgctxt "h27ae46b6g79f7g4355g873dg975929ec3efe"
msgid "What happened to this poor beast?"
msgstr "이 불쌍한 짐승에게 무슨 일이 일어난 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
msgctxt "h0252336eg34a4g4754ga69dgf1e4bc1ac9d5"
msgid "The beast did not die a gentle death. It must have been terrified."
msgstr "부드러운 죽음을 맞이하진 않았군. 공포에 질렸던 게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
msgctxt "h8a95fb23g7b48g42eaga961g2c891a9eb635"
msgid "Poor creature. Yoked into servitude, only to die like this."
msgstr "불쌍한 생물이야. 멍에 씌워진 채로 부려 먹히다 이렇게 죽어 버리다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:8c6b213c-f3a7-4e02-8026-ed2aa14276d5
msgctxt "hc789fb2agcbebg4925gba4dg0665ea7634f9"
msgid "Hells. Poor thing didn't deserve to die like this."
msgstr "제길. 이 가엾은 것은 이렇게 죽어선 안 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_PlunderedCaravan_State_PassedOxInvestigation = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
msgctxt "ha2b63863g2741g4cd2g8c44g1ef72686749d"
msgid ""
"Looks like it succumbed to the curse before it died. I bet it was hell to "
"kill."
msgstr "죽기 전에 저주에 굴복한 모양이군. 죽이려면 지옥 같았겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_PlunderedCaravan_State_PassedOxInvestigation = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
msgctxt "h96cbc9f1g1d26g4df0g8ceag65103cec9450"
msgid "A shadow-cursed beast. It wouldn't have gone down without a fight."
msgstr "그림자 저주에 걸린 짐승이라. 만만치않은 상대였겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_PlunderedCaravan_State_PassedOxInvestigation = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
msgctxt "h49edbe61gcce2g47a3gbd90g83fbf172ab29"
msgid "Its horns bear someone else's blood. It must have put up a fight."
msgstr "뿔에 피가 묻어있군. 한바탕 싸웠던 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_PlunderedCaravan_State_PassedOxInvestigation = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
msgctxt "hc70466e5gcc2bg4e2agbdbagdc753bbdcdbd"
msgid "Looks like it gored one of its attackers, before it died."
msgstr "죽기 전에 상대방을 뿔로 찔렀던 모양인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
