msgctxt "h3ba46786g0194g4857ga9a0gc594af1bebc0"
msgid "An ox this big wouldn't go down without a fight."
msgstr "이만한 덩치의 황소가 순순히 죽어줬을 리가 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_PlunderedCaravan_State_PassedOxInvestigation = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
msgctxt "h7fef18dag842ag4755g810eg735c68159129"
msgid "This thing put up a fight. But who'd kill an ox out here unless..."
msgstr "한바탕 싸웠던 모양인데. 그런데 누가 여기서 황소를 죽인걸까..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_PlunderedCaravan_State_PassedOxInvestigation = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
msgctxt "h81503240g818bg4731g80deg2c4def51c3ce"
msgid ""
"Little matter if you walk on four legs or two - the shadows will not spare "
"you."
msgstr "다리가 네 개인지 두 개인지는 중요치 않지 - 그림자는 봐주는 법이 없으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_PlunderedCaravan_State_PassedOxInvestigation = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
msgctxt "ha824d474g0a65g45fdg9305gbcb7acef71bd"
msgid "This ox died fighting - it looks like it put its horns to good use."
msgstr "이 황소는 싸우다 죽은 듯하군 - 뿔을 아주 잘 써먹은 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_PlunderedCaravan_State_PassedOxInvestigation = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedOx:f829fff8-8350-cd2e-9420-e8da73a34d0e
msgctxt "h361fe38cgfa6fg48d2gafa3gf3a324ee192d"
msgid "This beast didn't go down without a fight."
msgstr "이런 짐승이 순순히 죽어 줬을 리 없지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling
