msgctxt "he95c2e2bga3c5g40b2g92c4g5118e4ffc5a0"
msgid "Looks like he was gored by the ox. It must have been chaos here."
msgstr "황소한테 당했던 모양이야. 아주 난장판이었겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling
