#, fuzzy
msgctxt "he352cd6ege987g430egb88age70a374ee1c7"
msgid "The ox rampaged - and the tiefling got the business end of it."
msgstr "황소가 날뛰었고 - 티플링이 마무리를 지었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling
