#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hd4924598g358fg4442g9a51gaf0a151ad03b"
msgid ""
"Gored by an ox, I think. Tsk, was this one of the refugees from the druid's "
"grove?"
msgstr "황소한테 찔린 모양인데. 쯧, 이 녀석 숲에서 온 난민들인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling
