msgctxt "hd863f6eag5bc0g4b6bga1e3g565baa25644e"
msgid ""
"Run through by an ox's horn. A beast of burden is a beast just the same."
msgstr "황소의 뿔에 찔렸군. 짐을 나르는 짐승이라 해도 결국 짐승이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling
