msgid "Whatever killed him, it was messy."
msgstr "누가 죽였는지는 몰라도, 아주 난장판이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling:fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
msgctxt "h34d3eef4g382eg4570g92c3gc561629d1272"
msgid "Not a clean death. And probably not a quick one."
msgstr "깔끔한 죽음이 아니었어. 숨이 빠르게 끊어지지도 않았겠군.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling:fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
msgctxt "h2a919f4dg9a96g4f5egb9bage512c153a889"
msgid "All the hallmarks of a miserable death."
msgstr "비참하게 죽은 게 아주 확실하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling:fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
msgctxt "h5d72d212g06f9g4815ga54cg9c945168d391"
msgid "Not what you'd call a clean death."
msgstr "별로 깔끔하게 죽지는 못 한 모양이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling:fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
msgctxt "h71a8609dge4ccg4007gabf4ge528359f7d8d"
msgid "Gore everywhere. This tiefling met a vicious end."
msgstr "피가 난자하는군. 이 티플링은 끔찍하게 죽었던 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling:fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
msgctxt "h3cc313d4g6255g4745ga4cdg2503a2b27ed0"
msgid "Oh no. Was this one of the refugees from the druid's grove?"
msgstr "맙소사. 이거 설마 숲에서 온 피난민인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling:fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
msgctxt "ha7ead1a8g7173g44d3g8b0eg4b3e19243656"
msgid "A slow end - and a painful one, I think."
msgstr "천천히 - 그리고 고통스럽게 죽은 듯 하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling:fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
msgctxt "h51b1fabcgedd4g4132ga721gcc5f4531a372"
msgid "An unenviable fate."
msgstr "전혀 부럽지않은 운명이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_PlunderedCaravan_PAD_InvestigatedTiefling:fccde01b-730e-4d5d-8af8-faff2638ecc8
msgctxt "h98b0d65bg6ca2g4ffbg975dg270127aca11b"
msgid "This one died badly."
msgstr "끔찍하게도 죽었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = 1b2a4d16-b929-14d8-2881-96339aab1e8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:1b2a4d16-b929-14d8-2881-96339aab1e8c
msgctxt "h8f4e3eebgdb1fg497dgac40gf713c82bf2b1"
msgid "Or not hard enough."
msgstr "이 정돈 고생도 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1c43607f-4f3e-ec2e-855a-a8fef1339e3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:1c43607f-4f3e-ec2e-855a-a8fef1339e3b
msgctxt "h7c1e947bg5af2g4218g93e6g357f04aad4a6"
msgid "You're supposed to be at Last Light."
msgstr "넌 최후의 빛에 있어야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = 1f6c0ac9-6b6f-a079-cf30-ba5d3ab05f2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:1f6c0ac9-6b6f-a079-cf30-ba5d3ab05f2b
msgctxt "h4c6fd5b8g64ebg483fga440g5e8a6937a168"
msgid ""
"Instead, I found myself cornered by shadow-fiends and in need of rescue. "
"From you, of all bloody people."
msgstr "그렇지만, 그림자 마족들한테 둘러싸여 구출만 바라는 신세가 되었지. 다름 아닌 당신에게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d5c2076-9632-5551-f47b-b64240b0c0d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:2d5c2076-9632-5551-f47b-b64240b0c0d8
msgctxt "h0832aa3dg96ecg4e53g8511g508b3533a317"
msgid "Should I have left you to die?"
msgstr "죽게 내버려 뒀어야 했나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = 31f765e4-2d82-9bc8-8b03-deb9ec31e7b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:31f765e4-2d82-9bc8-8b03-deb9ec31e7b7
msgctxt "h205f87fcg9950g477bga803g5007f1657eab"
msgid ""
"I've failed Cal and Lia, <i>again</i>. Be on your way - I'll return to Last "
"Light... I know when I'm outmatched."
msgstr "칼과 리아를 실망시켰어. <i>또다시</i>. 갈 길 가. 최후의 빛으로 돌아갈 테니... 부족한 건 나도 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 536e25cc-87fd-a9df-3c1f-764585004e19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:536e25cc-87fd-a9df-3c1f-764585004e19
msgctxt "hd618cc50g0c44g426fg8034ga0b0b32c5fae"
msgid "What are you even doing here?"
msgstr "도대체 여기서 뭐 하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = 5677b080-c759-86ad-752d-5697dac3de9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:5677b080-c759-86ad-752d-5697dac3de9f
msgctxt "h8a97d86agffedg4d20g8b2dgc46f1dd8d781"
msgid "So what if I was? Cal and Lia could be there!"
msgstr "맞으면 어쩔건데? 칼과 리아가 거기 있을 수도 있다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = 58b681ee-bcc3-ed66-4fd4-3952c51e3154
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:58b681ee-bcc3-ed66-4fd4-3952c51e3154
msgctxt "h61059f29gdf55g4a0fg856dg421c5075c263"
msgid ""
"At least dead I'd have a purpose - perhaps as an appetiser for some cursed "
"monster."
msgstr "그럼 최소한 목적을 갖고 죽었겠지. 저주받은 괴물의 간식거리라도 됐을 거란 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 664e8dd3-92ad-fedd-8a82-c504428257f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:664e8dd3-92ad-fedd-8a82-c504428257f3
msgctxt "h28ca202fg9caeg435egbd73g2c1f34151ae9"
msgid "Please tell me you weren't looking for Moonrise."
msgstr "문라이즈 찾으러 왔다는 헛소리는 제발 하지 말아줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = 6c130fea-e133-34bb-e8c5-6acc0fced460
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:6c130fea-e133-34bb-e8c5-6acc0fced460
msgctxt "hb7b53cd1gee88g447dg9c9dgc69de1479467"
msgid ""
"I don't care about me, you empty-headed luddite. I came here to save Cal and "
"Lia!"
msgstr "내 안위 따위는 신경 안 써, 이 대가리 빈 야만인 자식아. 난 여기 칼과 리아를 구하러 왔다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71da51cb-774a-61c4-0797-6f77d664dbcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:71da51cb-774a-61c4-0797-6f77d664dbcd
msgctxt "h11b14390g512ag4163g8f43g9d63e470f5dd"
msgid ""
"Look, your magic wasn't up to scratch and you needed saving. It happens."
msgstr "이거 봐, 네 마법은 수준 미달이라 손이 많이 가겠던데. 결국 이렇게 됐네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = 75f8b5d3-269b-3322-276e-cc7414fa98b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:75f8b5d3-269b-3322-276e-cc7414fa98b5
msgctxt "h9b820fabgedffg45a7g88a3g113a5fb08b81"
msgid ""
"I don't care about me, you jumped-up apprentice! I came here to save Cal and "
"Lia!"
msgstr "내 안위 따위는 신경 안 써, 혈통빨 수련생 나리! 난 여기 칼과 리아를 구하러 왔다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = 7c42a876-75dd-e611-3491-149140766555
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:7c42a876-75dd-e611-3491-149140766555
msgctxt "hdfc1cc69g83c3g4cc7g8dbcgf37dec8753ed"
msgid "Nobody asked you to!"
msgstr "누가 구해달라고 했나!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 84dea556-4de9-8c06-4223-5425440d8214
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_GeneralHaven_State_HavenDestroyed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:84dea556-4de9-8c06-4223-5425440d8214
msgctxt "h23f9af75g237bg4305ga6efgcb5fc12ee144"
msgid ""
"You can't return - it's been destroyed. I'll help you find somewhere else."
msgstr "거긴 더 이상 돌아갈 수 없어. 파괴됐거든. 다른 곳을 알아봐 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 884c5f64-a1ff-a3e7-15ca-d5b7e28cf15e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:884c5f64-a1ff-a3e7-15ca-d5b7e28cf15e
msgctxt "hdd48948eg6eb0g4edbg8434gdd42c1725b6c"
msgid "You were trying to help your family - you're too hard on yourself."
msgstr "네 가족을 구하려고 한 거잖아. 너무 스스로를 고생시키지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = 93e03a73-035b-813c-9132-c085093075e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_Prodigy_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:93e03a73-035b-813c-9132-c085093075e9
msgctxt "h9fc6ca8dg3704g40b4g8c56g8baa1276c63c"
msgid "Don't bother - I'm leaving."
msgstr "신경 쓰지 마, 난 갈 거니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = 9de89074-fce8-38b7-c0e3-c8411f7628d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:9de89074-fce8-38b7-c0e3-c8411f7628d8
msgctxt "h39955928g487ag4c2dgb836ge46ad0392783"
msgid "But what good am I if I can't do this... this one thing?"
msgstr "하지만 이 작은 것 하나 해내지 못한다면... 나한테 무슨 쓸모가 있겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a541c1b5-f095-ab91-3d5f-16aeb85ac466
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:a541c1b5-f095-ab91-3d5f-16aeb85ac466
msgctxt "h7e28ccfbgd395g4768gb8b6g24b7f275d23f"
msgid "Pathetic wizard - of course you needed saving."
msgstr "한심한 위저드 자식, 이럴 줄 알았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = a66bff70-06cd-988b-a41f-c20eca26c743
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:a66bff70-06cd-988b-a41f-c20eca26c743
msgctxt "ha8a1d0b2gb370g419dg83e0g1d1f6c443907"
msgid "I'm supposed to be saving Cal and Lia!"
msgstr "난 칼과 리아를 구했어야 한다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8845bd9-f6b7-3e3b-8ef8-e3f24bfe090d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:a8845bd9-f6b7-3e3b-8ef8-e3f24bfe090d
msgctxt "hf322a235gb557g455dga645gc2b9cf383d1c"
msgid "A good wizard knows when to ask for guidance - for help."
msgstr "훌륭한 위저드라면 가르침을 구하고 도움을 요청할 줄도 알아야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2cdae41-76b9-dec3-55cb-a958dc436543
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:b2cdae41-76b9-dec3-55cb-a958dc436543
msgctxt "ha4713d93g80c4g4ac9gb357g56e062e0fdd5"
msgid "Shut up, and be grateful I saved your sorry tail."
msgstr "아가리 닥치고, 네 꼬랑지 구해준 거 고마운 줄 알아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = b613e8ea-d2d2-8b20-2fb8-9713de8742a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_Prodigy_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:b613e8ea-d2d2-8b20-2fb8-9713de8742a8
msgctxt "h50ae3217g8533g4735gb865g381067d3cc16"
msgid "Gods <i>damn</i> it all. I can do nothing right - not a damn thing."
msgstr "이런 <i>빌어처먹을</i>. 내 뜻대로 되는 게 없어. 단 하나도!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b9f4253a-4635-01e8-52a0-d724054d230e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:b9f4253a-4635-01e8-52a0-d724054d230e
msgctxt "h316366acg215fg4f06gb107g79acf2d78b98"
msgid ""
"If it helps, when I re-tell this story, I could say you killed all the "
"monsters?"
msgstr "혹시, 네가 괴물을 다 죽인 걸로 이야기를 다시 쓰면 위로가 되겠니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = c2bcc8f7-141b-6d91-1af5-ad348088646b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:c2bcc8f7-141b-6d91-1af5-ad348088646b
msgctxt "h045601acgedfag48f5gbfe8g658738af9368"
msgid ""
"Who gives a damn about your stories? All I care about is getting my brother "
"and sister back."
msgstr "네 이야기 따위 누가 신경이나 써? 난 그저 내 형제 자매를 되찾고 싶을 뿐이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = ce65847f-250c-9052-35f6-55551bfc7db1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:ce65847f-250c-9052-35f6-55551bfc7db1
msgctxt "h2a48c6f9geaf3g434dg9f53g1d30af7515a6"
msgid "Yes, there is! I came here to save Cal and Lia!"
msgstr "아니, 수치심 느껴야지! 난 여기 칼과 리아를 구하러 왔다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = d06fd125-0ed8-8ed4-7af9-5b2539810068
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:d06fd125-0ed8-8ed4-7af9-5b2539810068
msgctxt "h71a0139bgabc3g48fcgafbcg6c768e1e7cb6"
msgid "I was looking for Cal and Lia, what else?"
msgstr "당연히 칼과 리아를 찾고 있었지, 아님 왜 왔겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ddce3b6a-92dc-e63e-51b9-cc714d583ea7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:ddce3b6a-92dc-e63e-51b9-cc714d583ea7
msgctxt "hb9e53a5bg31ebg4818gab30g26ea573a1d64"
msgid "You were outmatched in that fight - there is no shame in that."
msgstr "방금 전투에서 넌 열세였다. 수치심 느낄 필요 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e436a809-ba08-f1f8-133a-e0fb38166527
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:e436a809-ba08-f1f8-133a-e0fb38166527
msgctxt "hfab6f846ge3cfg48d9gbecdg113267d8611d"
msgid "Why don't I go with you?"
msgstr "나랑 같이 가지 않겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e7c58144-0b8a-00af-3acd-99c59b7df6be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ProdigyLament_Event_LeavingSCL = True
#.     - SCL_ProdigyLament_Event_BackToHaven = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:e7c58144-0b8a-00af-3acd-99c59b7df6be
msgctxt "h9ed951f6gb4d9g41b0ga0bcg87999375b2b1"
msgid "Good luck."
msgstr "행운을 빌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ef37bebc-bc75-75af-2504-7019fc13a2ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy:ef37bebc-bc75-75af-2504-7019fc13a2ea
msgctxt "h1be877cfg07d5g4a72g8890g2ae500638199"
msgid "If you ask me really, really nicely I might escort you back."
msgstr "정말, 정말 정중하게 부탁한다면 널 호위해 줄 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_AD_AgainstShadows
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = 0d9b9d48-9f39-4c9b-9bb0-fde476410d7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4ca79daf-c389-2693-bd63-4e758972e2da_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4ca79daf-c389-2693-bd63-4e758972e2da_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_AD_AgainstShadows:0d9b9d48-9f39-4c9b-9bb0-fde476410d7d
msgctxt "h4f84a1c4gca41g433fgad47g2c5b451367cc"
msgid "I am Rolan, apprentice to Lorroakan himself - do not try me!"
msgstr "나는 그 유명한 로로아칸의 제자 롤란이다. 내게 감히 도전하지 마라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_AD_AgainstShadows
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = cb9ebe64-78c9-4781-90a9-afbd4b736d69
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4ca79daf-c389-2693-bd63-4e758972e2da_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4ca79daf-c389-2693-bd63-4e758972e2da_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_AD_AgainstShadows:cb9ebe64-78c9-4781-90a9-afbd4b736d69
msgctxt "h97ae7ca7gae73g40b5ga1d1gac82e17fb770"
msgid "Back, get back!"
msgstr "저리 가, 저리 물러나라고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_AD_AgainstShadows
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = d126db1e-f057-4e68-b671-19b532d255e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4ca79daf-c389-2693-bd63-4e758972e2da_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_AD_AgainstShadows:d126db1e-f057-4e68-b671-19b532d255e9
msgctxt "hf6cced41g2ce2g4913gb58fge1adc7caee1d"
msgid "Away, away from me!"
msgstr "꺼져, 저리 가란 말이다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_AD_AgainstShadows
#. Speaker = Rolan
#. NodeID = f52a4c77-57ad-473b-9d3e-3b44e393d298
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4ca79daf-c389-2693-bd63-4e758972e2da_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4ca79daf-c389-2693-bd63-4e758972e2da_B = False
#.     - 4ca79daf-c389-2693-bd63-4e758972e2da_A = False
#.     - 4ca79daf-c389-2693-bd63-4e758972e2da_C = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_AD_AgainstShadows:f52a4c77-57ad-473b-9d3e-3b44e393d298
msgctxt "h6029490dg2b80g4f3aga0f7g565d23e68661"
msgid "My magic is not to be trifled with - leave or die!"
msgstr "내 마법은 장난이 아니라고. 비키지 않으면 죽음뿐이다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan:c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
msgctxt "h475e0351g8c99g4b13g8ddcgbf03256ade17"
msgid "Rolan? I knew the tiefling was a fool, but this?"
msgstr "롤란? 이 티플링 녀석 멍청한 건 알았지만, 여기까지 오다니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan:c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
msgctxt "hffe2927egcfffg480egbe76g3323d91ba745"
msgid "Is that Rolan? What's that foolish wizard doing out here?"
msgstr "저기 롤란인가? 이 멍청한 위저드는 여기 왜 온 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan:c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
msgctxt "h3b9cbb82gec7dg4ce9g853fg303c07421128"
msgid ""
"Is that Rolan? Gods, his foolishness is enough to give wizards a bad name.."
msgstr "저거 롤란인가? 세상에, 저 어리석은 짓거리가 위자드의 명성을 먹칠하는군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan:c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
msgctxt "h69152fdbgf242g49a1gabe5g5cfa10879eed"
msgid "Rolan? He isn't going to last very long out here like this..."
msgstr "롤란? 여기 있으면 오래 버티지 못할 거야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan:c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
msgctxt "h6c555551g3effg467ag869fg72a6592b30a8"
msgid "Rolan? What's he up to out here?"
msgstr "롤란? 여기서 뭘 하고 있는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan:c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
msgctxt "h77b81854gb053g476aga3f1g505620c0dfd8"
msgid "That can't be Rolan, can it? He wouldn't be so foolish."
msgstr "저게 롤란일 리가 없어, 그치? 이렇게까지 멍청한 녀석은 아닌데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan:c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
msgctxt "h8cf26000g0612g48e2ga03fg9c38a85b7341"
msgid "Watching gods, what is the boy-wizard doing out here."
msgstr "신들이여 맙소사, 어린 위저드 녀석이 여기서 뭐하고 있는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan:c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
msgctxt "h485df1bbg3c3ag407cg9550g4d31b5f64dcc"
msgid "Rolan...? Is he looking to get himself killed?"
msgstr "롤란...? 왜 목숨을 스스로 내다 버리려는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Prodigy_PAD_FoundRolan:c307c96d-076c-499d-87a4-928a3e4719e4
msgctxt "ha72055dagb9e1g4339ga4e7g6f19b8a51223"
msgid "Is that Rolan? I thought he had better sense than this."
msgstr "저건 롤란인가? 이렇게 생각이 없을 줄은 몰랐는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_RuinedBattlefield_AD_EmeraldEnclaveFallen
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 197676c2-34d3-4323-ae30-02db9ca340aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_SCL_Ketheric_State_PlayerKnowsKethericHistory = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_RuinedBattlefield_AD_EmeraldEnclaveFallen:197676c2-34d3-4323-ae30-02db9ca340aa
msgctxt "hc75ae7deg9e56g459aga786gf290e0b62472"
msgid ""
"*The dead of the Emerald Enclave. They lay here ever since their war against "
"Ketheric Thorm.*"
msgstr "*에메랄드 엔클레이브 소속의 시체입니다. 케서릭 쏨과의 전투에서 패하여 이곳에 쓰러져 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_RuinedBattlefield_AD_EmeraldEnclaveFallen
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 197676c2-34d3-4323-ae30-02db9ca340aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_SCL_Ketheric_State_PlayerKnowsKethericHistory = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_RuinedBattlefield_AD_EmeraldEnclaveFallen:197676c2-34d3-4323-ae30-02db9ca340aa
msgctxt "h3d61252eg2c0cg40eeg9f2ag8678af0981df"
msgid ""
"*Fallen druids of the Emerald Enclave. They died trying to stop Ketheric "
"Thorm, long ago.*"
msgstr "*에메랄드 엔클레이브 소속 드루이드들입니다. 오래 전 케서릭 쏨을 막으려다 목숨을 잃었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_RuinedBattlefield_AD_EmeraldEnclaveFallen
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 197676c2-34d3-4323-ae30-02db9ca340aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[2]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_SCL_Ketheric_State_PlayerKnowsKethericHistory = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_RuinedBattlefield_AD_EmeraldEnclaveFallen:197676c2-34d3-4323-ae30-02db9ca340aa
msgctxt "h3bc99221geeaeg4aabg8f58g1ba659547254"
msgid ""
"*Fallen members of the Emerald Enclave. Casualties in the war against "
"Ketheric Thorm, years past.*"
msgstr "*에메랄드 엔클레이브 소속 드루이드들입니다. 오래 전, 케서릭 쏨과 맞서 싸우다 목숨을 잃었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_RuinedBattlefield_AD_EmeraldEnclaveFallen
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4d0a9db5-d407-472c-9b02-6ccfd58d207a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_RuinedBattlefield_AD_EmeraldEnclaveFallen:4d0a9db5-d407-472c-9b02-6ccfd58d207a
msgctxt "hbaa51111g0bc8g44e7g9de8gc5fd82b00617"
msgid ""
"*The old remains sport green armour and garb. What banner did they march "
"under?*"
msgstr "*오래된 잔해 속에서 녹색 갑옷과 의복이 보입니다. 이들이 치켜든 깃발은 무엇이었을까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_RuinedBattlefield_AD_LostGoods
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4ce35b1b-0d90-4442-82fc-d396d8a4afad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_RuinedBattlefield_AD_LostGoods:4ce35b1b-0d90-4442-82fc-d396d8a4afad
msgctxt "ha1e84290g2243g4aedgbd68g065c19bc23df"
msgid ""
"*A pile of belongings, forsaken to the curse so that their owners could "
"escape with their lives.*"
msgstr "*한 무더기의 짐들, 짐의 주인들이 목숨을 지키기 위해 도망치느라 저주 받은 곳에 버려진 것 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 089956a8-2155-5407-1a03-cec51f055743
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_BodyGone = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:089956a8-2155-5407-1a03-cec51f055743
msgctxt "hb2408e40g9aa7g4017g9b74g2af5a4125268"
msgid "The murderer's body is gone - and with it, any change of justice."
msgstr "살인자의 시체가 사라졌다. 정의의 심판을 내릴 기회도 사라졌군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = 1ed03201-e31f-b982-755f-6e2f6b2413d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:1ed03201-e31f-b982-755f-6e2f6b2413d9
msgctxt "h3be10be7gbc2bg48d1gbb0egc92aca91e846"
msgid "Companion. COMPANION."
msgstr "동료. <b>동료</b>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 235e3d98-949b-783f-456b-115f6f254044
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:235e3d98-949b-783f-456b-115f6f254044
msgctxt "hff9b2e7fg9244g435fga551gcd2ea538e483"
msgid "Be at ease. None could ever replace you."
msgstr "진정하거라. 너를 대신할 자는 아무도 없으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 47d525bb-adc7-ec88-f0f4-bc0a913386d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:47d525bb-adc7-ec88-f0f4-bc0a913386d0
msgctxt "h5a99c055gcfbdg47e7ga042g5bf45136cb15"
msgid ""
"You are right. There are others in need of judgement - let us find them."
msgstr "네 말이 맞다. 심판이 필요한 다른 자들이 있으니, 그들을 찾도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 5324d320-6e20-1e70-e53d-21e04f9f3a7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3a47baed-8459-4629-40aa-893d83a8d0b2_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:5324d320-6e20-1e70-e53d-21e04f9f3a7f
msgctxt "h74380549g4c94g47a9g8675g15a82bccfcf0"
msgid "If you do not approve, you can leave."
msgstr "동의하지 않는다면, 떠나라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = 7422b6f8-97c5-1a9d-a976-d3964d72d2c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:7422b6f8-97c5-1a9d-a976-d3964d72d2c2
msgctxt "h6914f777gf605g45a3g8de2g404e41fe91d4"
msgid "*Caw.*"
msgstr "*까악.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 89986fce-a416-a470-de29-6f50f3b3cb9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:89986fce-a416-a470-de29-6f50f3b3cb9f
msgctxt "he4fc2137gebf2g452cg8d49g7785c5bfa103"
msgid "I thought so."
msgstr "그럴 줄 알았다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 8d85f8f4-b47b-6235-c3df-365ad36e5ee3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 3a47baed-8459-4629-40aa-893d83a8d0b2_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3a47baed-8459-4629-40aa-893d83a8d0b2_B = False
#.     - 3a47baed-8459-4629-40aa-893d83a8d0b2_C = False
#.     - 3a47baed-8459-4629-40aa-893d83a8d0b2_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:8d85f8f4-b47b-6235-c3df-365ad36e5ee3
msgctxt "hd748fad6g09dbg43bdg97e5g1e9eb36192dc"
msgid "We are fortunate to have found a companion."
msgstr "운 좋게도 우리가 동료를 찾은 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = a911815e-1104-d4eb-d992-e962af946f32
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:a911815e-1104-d4eb-d992-e962af946f32
msgctxt "h5ca30f7ag5deeg41cbgad0eg605c80b25a1f"
msgid "Not. NOT."
msgstr "아니. <b>아니.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = a9c2f7b3-3e0c-2159-57c7-dcbc60d654cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:a9c2f7b3-3e0c-2159-57c7-dcbc60d654cc
msgctxt "hfc943a93g008ag4e44gbe78gc9476020b646"
msgid "No. Not until we've dealt with Madeline."
msgstr "아니, 매들린의 일을 처리하기 전까지는 안 된다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = aaca9a62-998f-b74f-9384-dcb67ee8bf5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 3a47baed-8459-4629-40aa-893d83a8d0b2_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3a47baed-8459-4629-40aa-893d83a8d0b2_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:aaca9a62-998f-b74f-9384-dcb67ee8bf5c
msgctxt "h1881888fg3dfag4b02ga376g5f71e09e44a8"
msgid "*Caw.*"
msgstr "*까악.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = abc817e3-1f0c-56c7-3e03-3ae380f3de1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:abc817e3-1f0c-56c7-3e03-3ae380f3de1d
msgctxt "h7616b696ge95fg4c63g84deg5e629136bcb1"
msgid "LEAVE."
msgstr "<b>떠난다.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = c19a90eb-ea59-90bd-ed9a-116ec9dd4a2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:c19a90eb-ea59-90bd-ed9a-116ec9dd4a2b
msgctxt "h09bbdc52g0983g4fefg899eg178d7ea594a3"
msgid "Our orders do not matter. We make our own destiny now."
msgstr "명령은 중요하지 않아. 우리의 운명은 이제 우리가 결정한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = d57dbf1b-2c6d-de68-b71d-e57c4da49db7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:d57dbf1b-2c6d-de68-b71d-e57c4da49db7
msgctxt "h50f95e31g3adag4504gb1f3g151ab8bd2174"
msgid "We will leave soon enough."
msgstr "곧 떠나도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = f491356d-6df2-1f33-7e8b-6a74e8674502
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 3a47baed-8459-4629-40aa-893d83a8d0b2_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 3a47baed-8459-4629-40aa-893d83a8d0b2_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_Idle:f491356d-6df2-1f33-7e8b-6a74e8674502
msgctxt "hcfc81a12g5242g4081g90dfgf781b45d1df1"
msgid "Do not look at me like that."
msgstr "날 그렇게 쳐다보지 마라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_TakingTurn_001_Combat
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = b044028c-2811-498e-9fa5-7457c450d10b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_TakingTurn_001_Combat:b044028c-2811-498e-9fa5-7457c450d10b
msgctxt "h4806e066g5451g4403g819age2001f47a961"
msgid "Death is inevitable."
msgstr "죽음을 피할 순 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_TakingTurn_002_Combat
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 2c813c27-d66e-4374-8279-ff5057bee6e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_TakingTurn_002_Combat:2c813c27-d66e-4374-8279-ff5057bee6e0
msgctxt "h9d8ddbafg525eg417eg9c1eg8a4f46aaedf3"
msgid "Embrace the darkness."
msgstr "어둠을 받아들여라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_TakingTurn_003_Combat
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 63b66079-7f67-48b1-ae3e-ffec3637e89c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_AD_TakingTurn_003_Combat:63b66079-7f67-48b1-ae3e-ffec3637e89c
msgctxt "h78129c28g68d3g40f1gb740g33ad6ecdf390"
msgid "You have been judged - and found wanting."
msgstr "너는 심판받았다. 그리고 네 부족함이 증명되었구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Madeline_SwD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a7784815-003f-4632-ab3a-88ceb7efc537
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_QuestionsLimitReached(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Madeline_SwD:a7784815-003f-4632-ab3a-88ceb7efc537
msgctxt "h401ad264g5f46g4c16g8931g8e2bebf6a538"
msgid "*The corpse does not stir. It will answer no more questions.*"
msgstr "*시체는 움직이지 않습니다. 더 이상 질문을 받지 않을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 02acd57e-49df-4594-27fc-7561ffd583c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_TaskCompleted = True
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Event_PlayerCompletedTask(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:02acd57e-49df-4594-27fc-7561ffd583c6
msgctxt "ha954425egeb31g4082gb132g9117056ef175"
msgid ""
"Here - for your services. Should I find another murderer in need of torment, "
"I shall call upon you. Farewell."
msgstr "자 - 수고에 대한 대가다. 고통을 안겨줘야 할 또 다른 살인자를 찾게 되면 너를 부르도록 하지. 그럼 이만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 038b3c46-13ca-339f-a910-fef5bdbf6efb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:038b3c46-13ca-339f-a910-fef5bdbf6efb
msgctxt "h8d59c5e9ge402g47a6g8e96g1333f887485c"
msgid "ARGH! You vile sadist, what have you done to me?"
msgstr "아아악! 이 사악한 사디스트 자식이, 내게 무슨 짓을 한 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 042ab953-1120-3693-222f-e0a1e677b9dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:042ab953-1120-3693-222f-e0a1e677b9dd
msgctxt "h810babcbgd28eg4400g9da0g96020837968e"
msgid "Fine - where is this ledger?"
msgstr "좋아 - 그 일지는 어디에 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04e59226-a3aa-ed2c-22e8-ae0a8f46d351
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:04e59226-a3aa-ed2c-22e8-ae0a8f46d351
msgctxt "haf315e32gcfefg4a41g8823g9408c3097fae"
msgid "Tell me why you want it first."
msgstr "우선 당신이 왜 그걸 원하는지를 알고 싶군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 05a3d442-6fdb-29ab-7fce-7290b081b068
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:05a3d442-6fdb-29ab-7fce-7290b081b068
msgctxt "h3cdec8f7g80d0g4827ga4e2gc6d9286f9bc9"
msgid "There's nothing you need do. This wasn't your fault - I promise."
msgstr "아무것도 할 필요 없어. 이건 당신 잘못이 아냐. 약속하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 05a8ebe1-53d6-4d8d-5947-7470f1779734
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:05a8ebe1-53d6-4d8d-5947-7470f1779734
msgctxt "hcb3a9af9g5c43g422aga49bgb1e7b43cb9a7"
msgid "She was punished - that's all that matters."
msgstr "그녀는 벌을 받았어. 중요한 건 그것뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 08006610-53d7-14fa-6521-d18d36e57a50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:08006610-53d7-14fa-6521-d18d36e57a50
msgctxt "hc454a6ecg4d15g49aaga1a5g0147114d20cb"
msgid "The raven always knows."
msgstr "까마귀가 모르는 것은 없나니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 083902c1-aa72-e276-9d9e-8829a7ce20f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: OATHBREAKER_VENGEANCE or PALADIN_VENGEANCE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:083902c1-aa72-e276-9d9e-8829a7ce20f2
msgctxt "h5a348a2fge60fg472fg97f6g1dd901b0bf11"
msgid "When punishment is needed, my hand will not shy from the blade."
msgstr "단죄가 필요할 때, 내 손은 검 앞에 주저함 없을지니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 09b41ec1-018d-3e5f-3398-3c9883df989a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:09b41ec1-018d-3e5f-3398-3c9883df989a
msgctxt "hce6ca011g51ccg471eg9780gefdb884f056b"
msgid ""
"The raven was right, we were fated to meet. Break her, my friend - most "
"thoroughly."
msgstr "까마귀가 옳았다. 우리의 만남의 운명적이었구나. 그녀를 무너뜨려라, 나의 친우여 - 아주 철저히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 0dd0d760-254b-4f48-00bd-d9a6c3a4d996
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4a608e34-aaa3-a6b8-0f43-214d81cc8d82_DUadmittedguilt = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_TaskCompleted = True
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Event_PlayerCompletedTask(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:0dd0d760-254b-4f48-00bd-d9a6c3a4d996
msgctxt "h83da0ce9gb04eg4178g90b4g8bb81935bfdc"
msgid ""
"Here - for your services. However, a friendly warning - be careful, or you "
"may be the next murderer I bring to justice."
msgstr "자 - 수고에 대한 대가다. 하지만 조심하도록. 내가 다음으로 심판할 살인자가 바로 네가 될지도 모르니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 0e4a9cf2-fc68-b203-a660-7c8135bb614f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:0e4a9cf2-fc68-b203-a660-7c8135bb614f
msgctxt "hb55f7caagd422g4c59g88afg283855054007"
msgid "But - but this wasn't supposed to happen - I swear!"
msgstr "하지만, 하지만 그건 일어나서는 안 되는 일어었어요. 맹세해요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 0f80b325-f844-5f5b-2c16-32dd5b0d243b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Event_KnifeStab = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:0f80b325-f844-5f5b-2c16-32dd5b0d243b
msgctxt "h3692f5d7ge385g4c80gbff0ga6f57ee878a7"
msgid "<i>Ah! </i>I'm sorry."
msgstr "<i>아아!</i> 내가 잘못했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 1220a578-2ddf-f477-4450-2683a326f3d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_MissionAbandoned = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:1220a578-2ddf-f477-4450-2683a326f3d3
msgctxt "hc2f9d7f8g41dbg4a1agb97bg821fc4ea3052"
msgid ""
"A pity. Should I find another murderer in need of torment, I will find you. "
"Until then, farewell."
msgstr "안타깝군. 고통이 필요한 또 다른 살인자를 찾게 되면, 그대를 찾겠다. 그때까지, 작별이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 13bd48b9-9486-1096-72fa-6b89f59e4907
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:13bd48b9-9486-1096-72fa-6b89f59e4907
msgctxt "hbb20c7f8g5359g4866gb9a5g204dcc5ddbda"
msgid "Stop. You've done enough."
msgstr "그만. 그걸로 충분해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 143fc3ec-29ca-feb9-53bf-317ffc961a26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_RitualMidpoint = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:143fc3ec-29ca-feb9-53bf-317ffc961a26
msgctxt "h3ee96192gb116g440cgb238g24464db86f2b"
msgid ""
"You! He said I was gonna be punished, that you'd be the judge. But I didn't "
"mean to hurt anyone!"
msgstr "당신! 그가 저보고 벌을 받아야 한다고 했어요. 당신이 심판관이 될 거라면서요. 하지만 전 누구도 해칠 생각이 없었어요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 14d44bd8-b37b-c3a5-52bb-7ff4edcca6c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:14d44bd8-b37b-c3a5-52bb-7ff4edcca6c2
msgctxt "h53d491c1ga6d0g44c8gb2c4g975486824d62"
msgid "Ah! <i>Glorious. </i>Look - my hand still shakes."
msgstr "아! <i>훌륭하군.</i> 이것 봐, 내 손이 아직도 떨리고 있다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 15f93b17-793f-085e-41f2-b7096c41939c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4a608e34-aaa3-a6b8-0f43-214d81cc8d82_murderhobosuccess = True
#. TagRule: !(CLERIC_EVIL and PALADIN_EVIL)
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:15f93b17-793f-085e-41f2-b7096c41939c
msgctxt "h819f047dg09ccg45e3g89b7g08f9255bb916"
msgid "Keep going."
msgstr "계속 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ca7ac0f-99a0-7b49-1fb0-6b7aa567d3ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:1ca7ac0f-99a0-7b49-1fb0-6b7aa567d3ef
msgctxt "h5f45ce9cg65b7g4975gbf48g245c7bc5f920"
msgid "What happened wasn't her fault - she deserved forgiveness."
msgstr "일어났던 사건은 그녀의 잘못이 아니야. 그녀는 용서받아 마땅해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 1cef7c03-8c13-72d8-4135-81e58b3684bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4a608e34-aaa3-a6b8-0f43-214d81cc8d82_PersuasionSuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:1cef7c03-8c13-72d8-4135-81e58b3684bc
msgctxt "h6ef571d6g1b36g4591gae1age82cd36ec640"
msgid "You're right. I'm a killer. A <i>monster.</i>"
msgstr "당신 말대로에요. 난 살인자에요. <i>괴물이라고요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 21ba9554-42df-16d9-ea51-0eb5a90d2b0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_RitualMidpoint = False
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_LedgerReceived = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:21ba9554-42df-16d9-ea51-0eb5a90d2b0e
msgctxt "h2b55ab15gf4aag4e29ga9e1g88f8e77a7a48"
msgid ""
"Madeline's spirit is within reach. It is time to make her face trial, to "
"make her <i>suffer.</i>"
msgstr "매들린의 영혼이 가까이에 있도다. 그녀를 재판에 세우고 <i>고통을</i> 안겨 줄 시간이니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 220be319-75e0-01cc-9e50-0c4588c813fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:220be319-75e0-01cc-9e50-0c4588c813fb
msgctxt "haac82be5g81b5g4606g8900gcc1f291cdd8c"
msgid ""
"To punish a murderer. If that is not enough, leave. I have no time for those "
"lacking commitment."
msgstr "살인자를 벌하기 위해서지. 이걸로 납득되지 않다면, 떠나라. 헌신이 부족한 이에게 낭비할 시간은 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 221efc6f-604b-5cd6-a882-0b1bdc734ec2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_MissionAbandoned = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:221efc6f-604b-5cd6-a882-0b1bdc734ec2
msgctxt "ha66c4935g26abg40dcga0ccg79f6c9f9823c"
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr "작별이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 247431ec-2924-eceb-9fc5-3e71a6e60deb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:247431ec-2924-eceb-9fc5-3e71a6e60deb
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h0e5c9832g886dg4dcagaaacg991ab3732072"
msgid "What did the Dark Justiciar actually do to your friends?"
msgstr "다크 저스티시어가 네 친구들에게 실제로는 무슨 짓을 했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 26da817f-5cf2-fe64-63f0-75620e83cce7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:26da817f-5cf2-fe64-63f0-75620e83cce7
msgctxt "h2677b2bbgaa29g4d90g8133g1d144c291641"
msgid ""
"You were the one who forced her to relive the death of her friends - nicely "
"done."
msgstr "그녀에게 친구들의 죽음을 되새기게 한 건 바로 너다. 훌륭하게 해냈지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2898a492-3fda-dfa2-a814-e137e9ebf72b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:2898a492-3fda-dfa2-a814-e137e9ebf72b
msgctxt "h13057345gfa2cg40ccgb1f2ga9e79e498ef3"
msgid "Life runs through our fingers like falling rain, nothing we can do."
msgstr "삶은 쏟아지는 빗물처럼 우리의 손가락 사이로 흘러나가지만, 우리가 할 수 있는 거라곤 아무것도 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 2ca6056b-2f4c-01d7-4a65-00b2e024d4c2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:2ca6056b-2f4c-01d7-4a65-00b2e024d4c2
msgctxt "h658fbc05g5d28g43f6gb6d0g0b7a7af4d8b3"
msgid ""
"Then steel your heart - for this woman is a serpent who wears many faces. Do "
"not be fooled."
msgstr "그렇다면 마음을 단단히 먹어라. 이 여자는 여러 얼굴을 가진 뱀이니, 속아나지 말도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 2e433bcb-755b-62ba-4149-aeb4e2363770
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:2e433bcb-755b-62ba-4149-aeb4e2363770
msgctxt "h92e4bcb7gf3e8g4dbcg9d77gcd7d76446a25"
msgid "And you will be the judge. Make her beg, make her <i>suffer.</i>"
msgstr "그리고 네가 그 심판관이 될 것이다. 그녀가 애원하게 만들고, <i>고통받게</i> 하여라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ec6a9d1-69cf-0633-af83-24bf557f4fc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:2ec6a9d1-69cf-0633-af83-24bf557f4fc7
msgctxt "ha199c01fgf62dg4ef0g89f1g46f205307145"
msgid "I know how to break people - don't you worry."
msgstr "난 사람을 부수는 법을 잘 알고 있어. 걱정 말라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 300ffd69-11e5-7245-d440-75cdd485da09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:300ffd69-11e5-7245-d440-75cdd485da09
msgctxt "hd9330a0egd00fg4b37gbf80g2068cc67acd0"
msgid "Careful - for a serpent in life is a serpent in death."
msgstr "주의하도록. 살아서의 뱀은 죽어서도 뱀이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 3027ca14-5ea5-88bc-b7b8-d010d86e66c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:3027ca14-5ea5-88bc-b7b8-d010d86e66c6
msgctxt "h90c6704egd342g452bgaf76ga2d4d712227a"
msgid "I might be a monster, but at least I <i>regret </i>it."
msgstr "비록 괴물일지라도, 전 적어도 <i>후회는</i> 해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 329da24c-9583-e564-1c36-c5825522c978
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:329da24c-9583-e564-1c36-c5825522c978
msgctxt "h1f690551g2150g4f65g8c3cg18e49b869cd1"
msgid "ENOUGH!"
msgstr "<b>그만!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3409d66f-602c-e5da-aa2f-89c5ba127ef1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:3409d66f-602c-e5da-aa2f-89c5ba127ef1
msgctxt "h59a7f971g699eg477fg9d71g43cff8d62db6"
msgid ""
"You had the means to stop it - you <i>chose</i> not to. You let fear and "
"cowardice rule you."
msgstr "네겐 이를 막을 수단이 있었다. 하지만 그러지 않기로 <i>선택했지</i>. 넌 공포와 비겁함에 굴복한 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 37a38932-9721-bec5-9085-701045ae0ed9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:37a38932-9721-bec5-9085-701045ae0ed9
msgctxt "hcd62db0bg2caeg4c6cg9901g57e8d0ec8cb2"
msgid "I should have known - there's no hope for me."
msgstr "진작에 알았어야 했는데. 제게는 가망이 없어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 391dbb9f-a0d7-87fb-57b2-f39a64df6844
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:391dbb9f-a0d7-87fb-57b2-f39a64df6844
msgctxt "hcc68a02cg623cg4f04g8b6eg6b4bc7246d00"
msgid ""
"Forgiveness comes from within - I cannot gift it to you. But know that I "
"would, if I could."
msgstr ""
"용서는 마음속에서 우러나오는 것이기에 내가 이를 줄 수는 없어. 하지만 내가 용서할 수만 있는 것이었다면, 난 그리 하였을 것이라고만 "
"알아 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b478604-54dd-3352-700e-2a5c9b901b2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:3b478604-54dd-3352-700e-2a5c9b901b2d
msgctxt "h78eeb926gc8a7g4879gb1c7g7a872890fa4a"
msgid "Start stabbing, and don't stop until I say so."
msgstr "어서 찌르라고. 내가 멈추라고 하기 전까지 계속."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3cccac24-fb51-10ce-36e0-ab32ebfa9cd9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:3cccac24-fb51-10ce-36e0-ab32ebfa9cd9
msgctxt "h95b94b0eg8414g4407gb657g55db0cc6c5f2"
msgid "Stop. You were willing to hurt yourself - that is enough for me."
msgstr "그만. 넌 스스로를 해칠 의향까지도 있었지. 내게는 그걸로 충분해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 3f30799f-67fa-1a6b-c60a-eff94001c63e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:3f30799f-67fa-1a6b-c60a-eff94001c63e
msgctxt "h25f8d11eg3495g4e8bg9efdga22b5f0d6ec6"
msgid "Still, her grief was most potent. It will satiate me for a time."
msgstr "그래도 그녀의 슬픔은 정말 강력했지. 한동안은 만족스러울 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 3f977836-3e20-be1b-0a21-be2fc074f889
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_RitualMidpoint = True
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_LedgerReceived = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:3f977836-3e20-be1b-0a21-be2fc074f889
msgctxt "h166923d9gfe74g4673g9de4gedc95c8643c5"
msgid ""
"Alas, Madeline has fled, and not even my powers can force her to return. I "
"no longer require you."
msgstr ""
"아아, 매들린은 달아나버렸고, 이 몸의 힘마저도 그녀를 귀환시키는 것은 역부족이구나. 이 몸은 더 이상 그대를 필요로 하지 않노라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 409da511-2070-3ea7-8ffd-a7a844db4726
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4a608e34-aaa3-a6b8-0f43-214d81cc8d82_murderhobosuccess = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EVIL or PALADIN_EVIL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:409da511-2070-3ea7-8ffd-a7a844db4726
msgctxt "h51cdc32egd341g4c7cg8e39gc9439ca59699"
msgid "Did I say stop? Drive the knife in deeper."
msgstr "내가 언제 멈추라고 했지? 칼을 더 깊숙이 찔러넣도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42108f4c-6810-4503-8e6f-c96469d2491e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:42108f4c-6810-4503-8e6f-c96469d2491e
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "When I tell this tale, you won't be the villan - I promise. The Dark "
#| "Justiciar is to blame."
msgctxt "hae734e1ege708g416cg9828g4f6f21efb84e"
msgid ""
"When I tell this tale, you won't be the villain - I promise. The Dark "
"Justiciar is to blame."
msgstr "내가 네 이야기를 전할게. 넌 악당이 될 일 없을 거야 - 약속할게. 죗값은 다크 저스티시어에게 물어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 43a1a4bb-eba7-066e-bbc5-9f5d77a5f21b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:43a1a4bb-eba7-066e-bbc5-9f5d77a5f21b
msgctxt "hee930385g61adg4b2eg96f5g9914bb213920"
msgid "Like... this?"
msgstr "이...이렇게요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44a0ff72-a0f0-9b52-642f-596b41bf1bf8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:44a0ff72-a0f0-9b52-642f-596b41bf1bf8
msgctxt "h13401ac7gaf19g4a41g8677g2e99a61f2fb5"
msgid "Let's see what she has to say first."
msgstr "우선 그녀의 말부터 들어보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 4506fabd-b41a-642c-083d-27a893f70aa7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:4506fabd-b41a-642c-083d-27a893f70aa7
msgctxt "hcc5046e2g690ag4a01g91afg9bf78f179b05"
msgid "No - no that wasn't the worst of it."
msgstr "아뇨, 아뇨 그건 시작에 불과했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 470198cc-941e-ef0d-1730-60f389a9878f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4a608e34-aaa3-a6b8-0f43-214d81cc8d82_murderhobosuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:470198cc-941e-ef0d-1730-60f389a9878f
msgctxt "hee1b2038g9e21g41a1gacb6gb4c46edb5eb9"
msgid "I am the one bleeding out and near <i>death.</i>"
msgstr "피 흘리며 <i>죽어 가는</i> 쪽은 이 몸이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 479dd69e-2a0b-8a5c-6d5c-8a325ccb6d4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:479dd69e-2a0b-8a5c-6d5c-8a325ccb6d4c
msgctxt "h2145648fgad02g4976g9a77gdc5acf284061"
msgid "I did it? I'm forgiven?"
msgstr "된건가요? 전 용서받은 건가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 47cfae6b-db85-817a-9928-5420b65c1bc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:47cfae6b-db85-817a-9928-5420b65c1bc3
msgctxt "he6cd8a5cgda8eg4f5fgaf0dgb4269824bbf0"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 47d01f76-0743-41ee-61e0-606f230038a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:47d01f76-0743-41ee-61e0-606f230038a3
msgctxt "hcf971af1ga90cg485cg852fgab8858d03d11"
msgid "It's all right, I'm not here to judge you."
msgstr "괜찮아, 난 당신을 심판하러 온 게 아니니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 48b98ee9-b47e-2005-5fad-c8903a0c1925
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4a608e34-aaa3-a6b8-0f43-214d81cc8d82_murderhobosuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:48b98ee9-b47e-2005-5fad-c8903a0c1925
msgctxt "h70e22868g66b8g4e22g8116g5449e2e74457"
msgid "You dare mock me as I near bleed to death?"
msgstr "난 지금 출혈로 죽을 뻔했는데, 감히 날 조롱해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 49355db8-e08b-9c43-2dcf-96886ba1b5c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRAven_Servant_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:49355db8-e08b-9c43-2dcf-96886ba1b5c0
msgctxt "h3a27acd9gcb32g482aga703g777e5a1469a7"
msgid "The raven's-favoured returns. What have you brought?"
msgstr "까마귀가 반기는 손님이 돌아왔구나. 무엇을 가져왔는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 496a93d3-ba22-804f-18dc-a290ccbf7bed
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4a608e34-aaa3-a6b8-0f43-214d81cc8d82_PersuasionSuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:496a93d3-ba22-804f-18dc-a290ccbf7bed
msgctxt "h9332e4a9g40bbg401dg8a0bgad61b13ee7b0"
msgid "Though I'd have preferred not bleeding <i>quite </i>so profusely."
msgstr "<i>이렇게나</i> 피를 많이 흘릴 필요가 없었다면 더 좋았겠지만 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 49bf18cb-ac52-875c-f55b-c5d8a3759fa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:49bf18cb-ac52-875c-f55b-c5d8a3759fa1
msgctxt "h26d04b06g8b74g4940g9b59g974c9adb626d"
msgid "You could have fought back. You deserve no forgiveness, COWARD!"
msgstr "넌 맞서 싸울 수 있었잖아. 네게 용서받을 자격 따윈 없다, 비겁한 자식!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 50d3d105-9af9-44a1-9028-8d6a49722bf8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:50d3d105-9af9-44a1-9028-8d6a49722bf8
msgctxt "hedd2aae1g9a95g4701gb4f9g119a8f444050"
msgid "Well now, let's not throwing stones. Glass houses and all that."
msgstr "자 자. 겨 묻은 개 너무 나무라지는 말자고. 이것저것 만만찮게 묻은 입장에서 말야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 52e66e93-09f0-0b48-96a7-66e5ba6f1978
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:52e66e93-09f0-0b48-96a7-66e5ba6f1978
msgctxt "he5bc972dgf002g4e2dga46bgd3605257e62f"
msgid "Don't blame others for what you did."
msgstr "네가 저지른 일을 남의 탓으로 돌리지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 5417f404-8b5f-f251-5158-332070151f2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:5417f404-8b5f-f251-5158-332070151f2a
msgctxt "h9ed32243g104ag4016gad66ge254a9979d9f"
msgid "You have crossed me, and for that, I end your pathetic life."
msgstr "넌 나를 거슬렀으니, 네 비참한 삶을 끝내주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 54657223-ba88-2d5a-ff2e-04a55fc96ac4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:54657223-ba88-2d5a-ff2e-04a55fc96ac4
msgctxt "hdedd6011g735fg4512gae0dg64d0425d568d"
msgid "Fine. What do I have to do?"
msgstr "좋아. 뭘 하면 되는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 557d7998-bba0-5b13-db4c-6817c6c5cb1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:557d7998-bba0-5b13-db4c-6817c6c5cb1d
msgctxt "h0af4da6bg6974g4802g9d41gc9fb129b3973"
msgid "Peace - speak your truth. We will go from there."
msgstr "진정하고 진실을 말해 봐. 일단 거기서부터 시작하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 5798572e-3a05-dbf3-66ef-d9acc8a00678
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:5798572e-3a05-dbf3-66ef-d9acc8a00678
msgctxt "hfb164681g4944g48ebga516g3387bd46f3bd"
msgid ""
"She gave 'em a dagger each, and told 'em to press it against their stomachs."
msgstr "그녀는 단검을 하나씩 나눠주더니, 그걸 각자 배에다 가져다 대게 했어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 57ddb879-bd23-74b0-4f2e-fe01d6bf9400
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:57ddb879-bd23-74b0-4f2e-fe01d6bf9400
msgctxt "h242e1ce4g7ba2g426bg9c4fg2df712f33bd8"
msgid "You broke her - most thoroughly. Well done."
msgstr "그녀를 무너뜨렸구나 - 아주 철저하게. 잘해주었다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 596097d3-cb21-0d6a-206e-9f676d30c7db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:596097d3-cb21-0d6a-206e-9f676d30c7db
msgctxt "h7f7792a4g78dbg4bb2g8307gcd20893a9008"
msgid ""
"You did not harm her as much as I had hoped, but your work was adequate, as "
"will be your reward."
msgstr "내가 기대했던 것만큼 고통을 주지는 않았지만 그만하면 충분했고, 네 보상도 그리할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 596918f3-adc1-4b61-ba77-67ceb6e3ddc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:596918f3-adc1-4b61-ba77-67ceb6e3ddc9
msgctxt "h9353c722g8aeeg4ce0g8534g3bb0eadfdd2d"
msgid "No. I don't have time for this."
msgstr "아니. 난 그럴 시간 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 5ac7ee4b-2333-01c9-b459-ae8c35c9a239
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:5ac7ee4b-2333-01c9-b459-ae8c35c9a239
msgctxt "h207cfec2gdde2g4f6ega941g438d313cb788"
msgid "I should have known - there's no forgiveness for people like us."
msgstr "그럴 줄 알았어야 했어요. 우리 같은 사람들에게 용서 따윈 없다는 것을."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 5d9fbc6d-b947-13ce-c003-31886e74739e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:5d9fbc6d-b947-13ce-c003-31886e74739e
msgctxt "h46dd9da2g9bb2g45daga533g901ab83bb8ac"
msgid ""
"I seek a record of this one's crimes - a ledger written in her own hand. "
"With it, I can summon her spirit - and force her to face trial."
msgstr ""
"이 몸은 살인자의 범죄를 입증할 기록 - 죄인이 직접 작성한 장부를 찾고 있다. 그것으로 이 몸은 살인자의 영혼을 불러내어 심판 받게 할 "
"수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5fa530d2-7a11-1d7f-ce49-9cab4c2a5947
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:5fa530d2-7a11-1d7f-ce49-9cab4c2a5947
msgctxt "h602e64e7gc8e2g4777g8bbfg62cc795ee26f"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6383c474-007d-857d-51fb-4c5f6e7a9fc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4a608e34-aaa3-a6b8-0f43-214d81cc8d82_DUadmittedguilt = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:6383c474-007d-857d-51fb-4c5f6e7a9fc9
msgctxt "h3503de72g8bd7g44bcg8292g4535b66a5556"
msgid "Blood taints all our hands in ways we never predict."
msgstr "피는 예측하지 못한 방식으로 우리 모두의 손을 더럽히지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 64b7e8ad-3efd-6613-8f6c-e4c17567a03f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Event_StabbedShadarKai = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:64b7e8ad-3efd-6613-8f6c-e4c17567a03f
msgctxt "h7304990dg885eg45bbga79cg28182eb792c1"
msgid "You will join me in the darkness of oblivion, you treacherous insect!"
msgstr "넌 나와 함께 망각의 어둠 속으로 사라질 것이다, 이 벌레같은 배신자 놈!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 68b3bb6f-eab0-59d1-2fbf-1cea94c90176
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:68b3bb6f-eab0-59d1-2fbf-1cea94c90176
msgctxt "h34fdf760g22c5g45dcg9cc6g5c00da128751"
msgid "I should have... died instead..."
msgstr "차라리 내가... 대신 죽었어야 했는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 6a2415ff-4ef3-bda2-3a01-90cfe12fc0b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4a608e34-aaa3-a6b8-0f43-214d81cc8d82_PersuasionSuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:6a2415ff-4ef3-bda2-3a01-90cfe12fc0b9
msgctxt "h644d21e5g6051g4a06ga3e4g1a7224c07f42"
msgid ""
"You have done well. Her pain and anguish were sublime - I will treasure it."
msgstr "아주 잘해주었다. 그녀의 고통과 괴로움은 실로 지고했나니 - 이 몸이 소중히 간직하겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b96326b-16cb-2d82-ff4d-0ce59293c5ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:6b96326b-16cb-2d82-ff4d-0ce59293c5ba
msgctxt "h6e23fcd1g92c7g44aagadc8g2ccc848c06ae"
msgid ""
"I don't - not really. The image haunts me, leaving me more dead than alive."
msgstr "감내하고 있지 않아. 그 장면이 시시때때로 눈앞에 나타나서, 차라리 죽는 게 낫겠다는 생각이 들지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 6c9a0301-0022-8498-edf6-67bddf6a6775
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:6c9a0301-0022-8498-edf6-67bddf6a6775
msgctxt "h601aa239g8517g4903g894fgd7e22d81cb7a"
msgid ""
"The joy of bringing suffering to the unpunished. Her victims deserve "
"closure, and the ledger is key."
msgstr "단죄받지 않은 자에게 고통을 안기는 기쁨이지. 살해당한 영혼들은 안식을 찾아야만 하며, 그러자면 장부가 필요하도다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 6d973a8a-0440-c161-905f-9204efbf9d51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:6d973a8a-0440-c161-905f-9204efbf9d51
msgctxt "hafed5f70g33ecg4fe9g8484g4c71935c82c3"
msgid ""
"I said it didn't mean nothin', that Ben n' Marc were just drunk n' whining."
msgstr "그냥 별 뜻 없는 헛소리라고 했어요. 벤이랑 마크가 그냥 취해서 투덜대는 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73cd8de2-c4f7-f1a8-ca8b-df3bc7919ed0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:73cd8de2-c4f7-f1a8-ca8b-df3bc7919ed0
msgctxt "hf821e2d4gcd44g45a9gbee7gb5e9192132b4"
msgid "No - I don't have time for this."
msgstr "아니, 난 그럴 시간 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 73de0bfe-2ee7-f2c5-91d0-2a8e470bf8ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:73de0bfe-2ee7-f2c5-91d0-2a8e470bf8ef
msgctxt "hf833231ega990g48c6g843bgd2ec1872684c"
msgid ""
"<i>Argh.</i> You were supposed to make her suffer! Not <i>forgive </i>her."
msgstr "<i>아윽.</i>고통받게 하라고 했거늘! <i>용서하는 게</i> 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 7513f08e-b1fe-02bc-804e-3fa1a532f191
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:7513f08e-b1fe-02bc-804e-3fa1a532f191
msgctxt "h9b20caffg026ag4a9ag97c0g13caa6d343d7"
msgid ""
"I suppose it is on me for not being more specific. But Madeline suffered, "
"that is all that matters."
msgstr "좀 더 구체적으로 말하지 않은 내 책임이긴 하군. 하지만 매들린이 고통받았다는 게 중요한 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 775369cc-f6a6-8642-f276-63598fdeffc5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:775369cc-f6a6-8642-f276-63598fdeffc5
msgctxt "h7e73bf06g694bg4f3egab2ag5129671a47ce"
msgid "There is no justice for traitors - only pain."
msgstr "배신자에게는 정의는 없다. 오직 고통만 있을 뿐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 77756b32-9f80-4eef-a10c-c833e31408ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:77756b32-9f80-4eef-a10c-c833e31408ba
msgctxt "hf6743f23g80e7g4781g8511g22cf2338354f"
msgid ""
"Come now - you're hardly in position to cast judgement on <i>that </i>score, "
"are you?"
msgstr "이봐, 네게 <i>그런</i> 문제에 대해 뭐라할 자격은 없다고 생각하는데, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 77de14d4-c710-ec14-c7a0-31f7d2d68b55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_HasLedger(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:77de14d4-c710-ec14-c7a0-31f7d2d68b55
msgctxt "h40c5149bgdcd6g4c0bg86dcg79b0bfb43be3"
msgid "<i>Witness her.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀를 목도하게나.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 782a0a5d-2802-4c4f-0909-97bc0a2695dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:782a0a5d-2802-4c4f-0909-97bc0a2695dd
msgctxt "hed0590eag4b69g4952g9505gcfedfa3658bb"
msgid ""
"You have denied her victims any chance of rest. I pray you sleep easy at "
"night."
msgstr "그대는 살해당한 영혼들이 고이 잠들 기회를 영영 박탈해버렸다. 밤잠 설칠 일 없기를 바라노라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79e765c8-67dd-085f-55f5-1893b1d2f5e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_Event_KillFavouriteCharacter = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4a608e34-aaa3-a6b8-0f43-214d81cc8d82_DUadmittedguilt = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:79e765c8-67dd-085f-55f5-1893b1d2f5e3
msgctxt "h55e4ccf9g9104g4f82gbd57g7ba7feb523b5"
msgid ""
"I once ended one dear to me. There is no punishment which could atone for it."
msgstr "나도 소중한 사람을 죽였던 적이 있었지. 그 어떤 벌로도 이를 속죄할 수는 없을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a778e0e-961d-fecc-cb54-ea647488bc54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:7a778e0e-961d-fecc-cb54-ea647488bc54
msgctxt "hb53fb921g112ag47a0g81b1ge293b87979ce"
msgid "Find it yourself."
msgstr "직접 찾아보지 그래."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7a994b87-a5c7-37d8-c8fb-e916ef8697db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:7a994b87-a5c7-37d8-c8fb-e916ef8697db
msgctxt "h8281f5cag0405g4574gb115g3e4961c23813"
msgid "Do not speak to me like that."
msgstr "내게 그런 식으로 말하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ab31099-91cc-9540-2c96-7cb3eed8bbe6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:7ab31099-91cc-9540-2c96-7cb3eed8bbe6
msgctxt "hffc48753ga7cbg4358gaa53geefe98d683a0"
msgid "How do you know I have the ledger?"
msgstr "어떻게 내게 일지가 있다는 걸 알았지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7cdfaf59-fa5c-3b6c-1b0c-317a647bfeea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:7cdfaf59-fa5c-3b6c-1b0c-317a647bfeea
msgctxt "h789432cag4f29g45e2g9e03g01844bbec2a4"
msgid "I try to do better by the living."
msgstr "선한 일을 실천하며 살기 위해 애쓰고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 7dc7438e-a919-2a03-fd84-fd8def45b876
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:7dc7438e-a919-2a03-fd84-fd8def45b876
msgctxt "h38108a86gabd4g48e5ga10dg91f947ca8f4c"
msgid "Perhaps, but we both got what we wanted, didn't we?"
msgstr "어쩌면, 하지만 우리 모두 원하는 것을 갖지 않았나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 81a7ab35-ac4c-c85e-ec94-41e0c575e314
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:81a7ab35-ac4c-c85e-ec94-41e0c575e314
msgctxt "hb67945d6g3895g401fg81b5g2fa4b611b0df"
msgid ""
"We have it - her lies, her <i>guilt. </i>Madeline reported her friends to a "
"Dark Justiciar and fled when they were butchered."
msgstr ""
"드디어 손에 넣었군. 그녀의 거짓말, 그녀의 <i>죄책감을.</i> 매들린은 자신의 친구들을 다크 저스티시어에게 고발하곤, 그들이 "
"도살당하자 도망쳤다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 81bbf7bb-4186-4e07-823e-8fe18cdd3bbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:81bbf7bb-4186-4e07-823e-8fe18cdd3bbd
msgctxt "hb6c7a75cgaf94g4f6eg8e96ge616f95bcbf5"
msgid ""
"Yes - how laughable. You're <i>above</i> such things as the killing urge."
msgstr "그래, 정말 우습군. 너야 살인 충동 같은 건 이미 <i>초월했을 테니</i> 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 82d6684b-5edf-b90b-3810-cc1da2a90bef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:82d6684b-5edf-b90b-3810-cc1da2a90bef
msgctxt "hd9773959g15bcg4523g9983g302b2be6b2d6"
msgid ""
"That doesn't matter! I seek the guilty. The tormented. The <i>anguished.</i>"
msgstr "그런건 중요하지 않아! 난 죄있는 자들을 찾는다. 고통받는 자. <i>고뇌에 찬 자들을.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 83104bfb-ffd4-a19f-963a-e72897041565
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:83104bfb-ffd4-a19f-963a-e72897041565
msgctxt "h4bcf9882gd3aag4150g8ffbg0fe1b0469aed"
msgid "She never said stop. I'd do anything to take it back. <i>Anything.</i>"
msgstr ""
"하지만 그만하라는 말은 끝까지 나오지 않았죠. 제가 저지른 일을 되돌릴 수만 있다면 뭐든지 할 텐데. <i>무슨 일이라도요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 8a8b9d02-4433-6675-bfe7-cd47b340b4e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:8a8b9d02-4433-6675-bfe7-cd47b340b4e0
msgctxt "h9f1b6ed0g5025g42e1g8101ga4ae966f6928"
msgid ""
"Ah! A pity - she fades. Her pain was such that even I could not tether her "
"for long."
msgstr "아! 안타깝게도 사라지고 말았군. 그녀의 고통은 나조차도 오래 묶어둘 수 없을 정도였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = 8c88d3c3-7202-daa6-a8a8-00c5076d6bb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:8c88d3c3-7202-daa6-a8a8-00c5076d6bb0
msgctxt "hfc956dafg1d7fg42efgb136g028a2ebb699c"
msgid ""
"On the count of three, to 'start stabbin', and not to stop 'til she said so."
msgstr "셋을 셀 테니, 그때부터 서로 '찌르기 시작하도록' 명령했어요. 자기가 그만하라고 할 때까지 멈추지 말라면서요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 90bf88d8-c736-2df2-62b1-bf7dd1a6451a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRAven_Servant_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_DialogUnlocked = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:90bf88d8-c736-2df2-62b1-bf7dd1a6451a
msgctxt "hb2d3661agb585g4fb7g836eg43377d9a62b8"
msgid ""
"This one is a murderer who walks free. She deserves to be punished. Or will "
"you deny her victims peace?"
msgstr ""
"이 여자는 살인을 저지르고도 자유롭게 풀려나 있으니. 죄에 마땅한 처벌이 있을지어다. 아니면 그대는 살해당한 영혼들의 안식을 외면하겠는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 92dee124-38a0-9177-ec5a-34a61912acae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_HasLedger(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:92dee124-38a0-9177-ec5a-34a61912acae
msgctxt "h3e4c0e64ge0a0g43feg9e0aga2d6e7d45e52"
msgid "The air stirs in trepidation - you have the ledger."
msgstr "공기가 두려움으로 전율하는구나 - 장부를 손에 넣었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9451c17b-9df1-ff85-69d6-1ef88eb051c0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:9451c17b-9df1-ff85-69d6-1ef88eb051c0
msgctxt "h0fbcaf88ge00fg456ag8da6g16c9b6077814"
msgid "Pathetic - you murdered your friends. You're a <i>coward.</i>"
msgstr "한심하군. 넌 친구들을 죽인 거야. 이 <i>겁쟁이</i> 같으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9482456a-563c-c2ad-3d53-64231521adb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:9482456a-563c-c2ad-3d53-64231521adb3
msgctxt "h10f00132g6243g44a4g9df3ga92797ebc6e7"
msgid "I think I'll just kill you instead."
msgstr "차라리 널 죽이는 건 어떨까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94b04b17-b5e7-7ae6-f104-dc17087476b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:94b04b17-b5e7-7ae6-f104-dc17087476b7
msgctxt "h43f99ab5gecadg4d0agad6fg52dfacc95c0b"
msgid "What do you get out of it?"
msgstr "이걸로 당신이 얻는 건 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 95e6b2db-b28d-2207-c5f1-735ce8ec1289
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:95e6b2db-b28d-2207-c5f1-735ce8ec1289
msgctxt "h35856c6ega64dg49e6ga718g306faff662e0"
msgid "It is pleasing to see we are of one mind."
msgstr "우리가 한 마음이라는 것을 알게 되어 기쁘군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a46112a-4457-98e6-28cd-14b7389a97f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:9a46112a-4457-98e6-28cd-14b7389a97f1
msgctxt "h50ef4f13g6b54g4b49g98bagfa8e9105113b"
msgid "What do I need to do?"
msgstr "내가 뭘 하면 되는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9af083df-f028-cc51-e09d-41281241126c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_GOOD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:9af083df-f028-cc51-e09d-41281241126c
msgctxt "h0e668c79ge3ebg4929gaafag703001e50646"
msgid "By the light of the one I serve, I forgive you. This wasn't your doing."
msgstr "내가 섬기는 빛의 이름으로, 너를 용서하노라. 이 죄는 네가 짊어질 짐이 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 9b148f07-c684-96e9-f320-8de2d0194017
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:9b148f07-c684-96e9-f320-8de2d0194017
msgctxt "h372c4c99g0fddg448dg805cgabacd3f832dd"
msgid "A pity, I thought you smarter than this. <i>Come.</i>"
msgstr "안타깝군, 네가 이것보다는 현명할 줄 알았건만. <i>와라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9df91e00-8086-726a-07fa-34442ee1aa8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:9df91e00-8086-726a-07fa-34442ee1aa8e
msgctxt "h56d9dfa9gd115g4ea2g9be1g1e983be0fc84"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 9ef0056f-adc4-98da-f1cc-8f132e623b53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:9ef0056f-adc4-98da-f1cc-8f132e623b53
msgctxt "hfd1d765cg1d24g44c6ga4f9gc7cd3f45dad3"
msgid "If you are satisfied, than so am I."
msgstr "네가 만족했다면, 나 또한 만족한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2fdb37d-a2dd-89ad-af5e-d8166baa2d72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:a2fdb37d-a2dd-89ad-af5e-d8166baa2d72
msgctxt "h53df4f09gd8d0g4405g8fd7gf9583b5da6ae"
msgid "Perhaps I will finish what the Dark Justiciars started."
msgstr "어쩌면 다크 저스티시어들이 시작한 일을 내가 마무리지을 수도 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a3ace2ab-6526-4863-b948-8ade1dee3471
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:a3ace2ab-6526-4863-b948-8ade1dee3471
msgctxt "h79deabe8g01b6g4a90g8438ge227b6c4ebf9"
msgid "Oh, come on now - it happens to the best of us, from time to time."
msgstr "이런, 너무하네. 누구나 간간이 저지르는 일인줄 알았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = a3e74cc6-5d0c-a0ea-6fe3-7e347073aec7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:a3e74cc6-5d0c-a0ea-6fe3-7e347073aec7
msgctxt "h842f55b3gb02dg4e59g8858g7d47e6e10ce3"
msgid ""
"But hearin' that just one person doesn't hate me. That one person forgives "
"me, makes the load so much lighter."
msgstr ""
"그럼에도 단 한 사람만은 저를 원망하지 않는다니. 그리고 나를 용서해주겠다니. 내 영혼을 짓누르던 짐이 훨씬 가벼워지는 것 같아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = a4a2cdb8-90b5-5e96-26cc-2096ac4bdae5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:a4a2cdb8-90b5-5e96-26cc-2096ac4bdae5
msgctxt "he1d9af18g6509g4ca1g8853gd46040bc0313"
msgid "Not until I have recovered, if you wouldn't mind."
msgstr "이 몸이 회복할 때까지는 안 되겠네. 양해를 구하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = a4f91359-d6d7-136e-516b-b5f4a8821cca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:a4f91359-d6d7-136e-516b-b5f4a8821cca
msgctxt "h0d05e59dgcb5bg471aga1a2g8d0181696d74"
msgid "You didn't see it. Didn't see what the Dark Justiciar did."
msgstr "당신은 아직 몰라요. 다크 저스티시어가 무슨 일을 했는지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a807e632-b44b-c660-ca05-6daedf6a0f51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:a807e632-b44b-c660-ca05-6daedf6a0f51
msgctxt "h232070e5g5107g49bagb056g5775e549e299"
msgid "That was fun."
msgstr "꽤 즐거운걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = a81259b5-0925-6be2-0786-9a71157887e5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:a81259b5-0925-6be2-0786-9a71157887e5
msgctxt "h116585f4g7618g4c7cg944egb3353dd6f567"
msgid "You're right, now is not the time for talk."
msgstr "그 말대로다. 지금은 대화나 할 때가 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a862f722-812d-9def-ae0a-cf82fc70ae31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:a862f722-812d-9def-ae0a-cf82fc70ae31
msgctxt "h07150bd8gc7ddg4fb0g8b73ga9fcdd12e0e2"
msgid "What? You said to punish her!"
msgstr "뭐? 아깐 나더러 벌주라고 하더니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa35aefb-207d-2666-a154-17e2612739e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:aa35aefb-207d-2666-a154-17e2612739e2
msgctxt "h15253162g58b8g4642gb05eg9272326f63bb"
msgid "You 'didn't mean' to kill your friends? How laughable."
msgstr "친구들을 죽이려고 '의도'한 적은 없다고? 웃기시네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = abfee45a-7415-ebe4-68c2-5cb92ba1fe83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Event_ForgaveMadeline = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:abfee45a-7415-ebe4-68c2-5cb92ba1fe83
msgctxt "h4cfc49f3g8f10g4104g8d3cgd872099344d3"
msgid "Thank... you."
msgstr "고마...워요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = b2141695-629a-49a4-b595-e3e0db1443e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:b2141695-629a-49a4-b595-e3e0db1443e6
msgctxt "hbe3b9274gdf05g409bg9455g20ff50c65eb1"
msgid ""
"Not as if you can relate to the killing urge, can you? Hmph - I can taste "
"the hypocrisy from here."
msgstr "네 살인충동과는 달리 공감해주기 어렵나? 흥, 벌써부터 위선이 느껴지는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b429561e-c349-ad6d-10a9-688cb12c5ae8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:b429561e-c349-ad6d-10a9-688cb12c5ae8
msgctxt "hac392510g1befg4240g9b67gb17339e638c5"
msgid "Why don't you tell me what happened?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 일어났는지부터 말해주지 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = b46a7b2a-fd2b-d191-5fa5-68f63db7f140
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 4a608e34-aaa3-a6b8-0f43-214d81cc8d82_PersuasionSuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:b46a7b2a-fd2b-d191-5fa5-68f63db7f140
msgctxt "hcf27cf27g9282g4c95g80c6g5a2f385e16c0"
msgid "What I did was wrong - and I won't ever forgive myself."
msgstr "전 분명 잘못을 했어요. 그리고 앞으로도 스스로를 용서할 수 없겠죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = b6d8fc22-7124-47c0-19bf-e8e846fa894a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_DialogUnlocked = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:b6d8fc22-7124-47c0-19bf-e8e846fa894a
msgctxt "h6885092eg2ae4g479egb0bfgcba24f137c0c"
msgid "And together, we shall mete out justice long overdue."
msgstr "그런 다음, 우리는 함께 유예된 정의를 마침내 실현하리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b74c2d45-2595-a907-0233-860d787065e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:b74c2d45-2595-a907-0233-860d787065e4
msgctxt "h7205785bgb37eg4e21g9eb1g5e78be714951"
msgid "I'm here to make sure she sees justice."
msgstr "그녀가 정당한 심판을 받도록 왔을 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = ba0f56c1-89dc-690e-d6b6-7a922b448532
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:ba0f56c1-89dc-690e-d6b6-7a922b448532
msgctxt "h0a138421gfa20g40a9g9bd8gd05ce86d83e1"
msgid ""
"Well, she flees no more. I will be the conduit for Madeline's spirit. I will "
"force her to face trial."
msgstr "글쎄, 이 여자도 더는 도망치지 못하겠군. 내가 매들린의 영매가 되겠노라. 이로써 그녀를 심판대 앞에 세우겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd392f3f-2db8-9bc0-d21c-49b64c67afcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_LedgerReceived = True
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Event_HandOverLedger(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:bd392f3f-2db8-9bc0-d21c-49b64c67afcd
msgctxt "hc33bf887g7889g4e7cg9e3dgfe74a1d50986"
msgid "Here - take it."
msgstr "자, 받아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd411d7e-a0dc-45d3-63dc-4a6f86bebc1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:bd411d7e-a0dc-45d3-63dc-4a6f86bebc1f
msgctxt "h31f5327fg0b53g498aga73egdfac04b4ca61"
msgid "Anything? Then hurt yourself as Ben and Marc did - stab yourself."
msgstr "뭐든지? 그럼 벤과 마크가 했던 것처럼, 스스로 칼로 찔러 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bdc08480-dd13-c3a6-9cbe-ba82777b4ca9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:bdc08480-dd13-c3a6-9cbe-ba82777b4ca9
msgctxt "h27f86444g8ee7g42ebg949fg517c02dfa5d3"
msgid "Prove you're sorry. Do it for Ben and Marc."
msgstr "스스로 미안하다는 것을 증명해 보라고. 벤과 마크를 생각하며 찔러."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4fd9800-377b-7557-4450-dfb8342234f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:c4fd9800-377b-7557-4450-dfb8342234f9
msgctxt "h0c0857bdg6d82g46b0g89d4gc9b3f27aee93"
msgid "If it was drunk complaining, why did you report them?"
msgstr "주정뱅이의 불평일 뿐이었다면 왜 굳이 친구들을 신고했지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c6b07c1f-ef95-48bf-1500-e51cd5104fba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:c6b07c1f-ef95-48bf-1500-e51cd5104fba
msgctxt "hb5247f4fged18g41a9g8d57g8e31d29ff4d6"
msgid "Nothing yet."
msgstr "아직은 아무것도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7321e8b-2f17-f1b2-1386-eaf875022837
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:c7321e8b-2f17-f1b2-1386-eaf875022837
msgctxt "heb1776c4ged2cg4ea0g9381ga4475d3f8b64"
msgid "My gorge rises at your sickening naivety."
msgstr "역겨울 정도의 순진함에 속이 뒤집히는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = c73bc9e6-6f82-50be-6aab-54f98eb8cf55
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:c73bc9e6-6f82-50be-6aab-54f98eb8cf55
msgctxt "h5e2b0560g2cf5g411egb56bg84e6fff4ce4d"
msgid ""
"The Dark Justiciar said to report everythin', big or small. She ain't the "
"type you say no to."
msgstr ""
"다크 저스티시어가 제게 전부 보고하라고 명령해서였어요. 크든 작든 간에 전부요. 그녀는 제가 감히 거스를 수 있는 사람이 아니었어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = c99a3d9b-6499-fbbe-a12b-beb2e36f233e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:c99a3d9b-6499-fbbe-a12b-beb2e36f233e
msgctxt "h112b0587g50bdg413cgb803gc8dcbdf566b2"
msgid "You did? But how - how do you live with yourself?"
msgstr "그랬나요? 하지만 어떻게 - 당신은 어떻게 그 죄를 감내하고 있는 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = cdbb34ee-8a58-0f1a-45e0-62d03c33d4d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:cdbb34ee-8a58-0f1a-45e0-62d03c33d4d5
msgctxt "h5125504dgac59g4556gaec8g4e44978a98d4"
msgid "Argh. I'm so sorry."
msgstr "아악. 정말 미안해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d1492541-d191-4dfe-f630-2488c2b398f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - OATHBREAKER_VENGEANCE(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:d1492541-d191-4dfe-f630-2488c2b398f5
msgctxt "hd0744234ga7d1g41f4ga0f3ge8409c61e2e7"
msgid "I'm going to punish her - throughly."
msgstr "그녀를 벌하도록 하지. 아주 철저하게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d163862d-9d48-4fef-e3d2-7c14188d6298
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:d163862d-9d48-4fef-e3d2-7c14188d6298
msgctxt "h1fe3fb77gd9ffg4833ga9fag6aa843d499a4"
msgid "This was just some perverted fantasy of yours, wasn't it?"
msgstr "이건 그냥 네 변태적인 취향일 뿐이잖아, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d271bf33-4f96-7187-59f5-89a54dd2fdf4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:d271bf33-4f96-7187-59f5-89a54dd2fdf4
msgctxt "h91d4871cgc89eg4b75gbedeg64583ec11a17"
msgid "*Overwrought with grief, the connection begins to fade.*"
msgstr "*비탄에 지나치게 몰두한 나머지, 연결이 희미해지기 시작합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = d588aa9d-128a-a9b5-2a40-b5a0b2feb6ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:d588aa9d-128a-a9b5-2a40-b5a0b2feb6ab
msgctxt "hc2587d15g5643g4603gbd15g3b7b990b5f0c"
msgid "But I'm <i>dead. </i>I can't do better. Not any more."
msgstr "그치만 난 <i>죽었어요. </i> 더 나은 삶을 살 수 없다고요. 더는 말이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd57b2af-8914-f4c7-e13a-96a38236bad5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:dd57b2af-8914-f4c7-e13a-96a38236bad5
msgctxt "hf7e75fd7g824dg4ac4g8f1fgfb4a5edb36d9"
msgid "I'd like to hear her story first - I imagine it's quite the tale."
msgstr "매들린의 이야기를 먼저 들어보고 싶군 - 사연 없는 사람은 없는 법이니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = ddbc10ab-27f2-0669-98ba-05aef9f24d40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:ddbc10ab-27f2-0669-98ba-05aef9f24d40
msgctxt "hde8ed68cgbcc5g4b9ega003g52e3726c3ce1"
msgid ""
"That was <i>genius</i>, my friend. You have broken her in ways I could not "
"have imagined."
msgstr "정말 <i>천재적이었다</i>, 내 친구여. 내가 상상조차 못한 방법으로 그녀를 망가뜨렸군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = df0a9acf-4820-c1c9-7dbf-dbd66859d5a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:df0a9acf-4820-c1c9-7dbf-dbd66859d5a9
msgctxt "hceec029dg6357g4692g80dfge32c2b2a8583"
msgid "Your soul is lit with a grace few possess. It is... blinding."
msgstr "그대의 영혼은 보기 드문 미덕으로 빛나는구나. 참으로... 영롱하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = dfaa77fe-5aab-3e15-a6fd-56802cbd187a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:dfaa77fe-5aab-3e15-a6fd-56802cbd187a
msgctxt "hd4811e25ga770g4b2cga745g6e639b6a5dd1"
msgid ""
"Go to the distillery, the one she calls The Waning Moon. Find it - and bring "
"it to <i>me</i>."
msgstr "증류소로 가라. 기우는 달이라고 불리는 곳이다. 장부를 찾아라 - 그리고 가져와라 <i>내게</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = e25e872a-34b9-5d29-4ec0-49e049a802de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Event_KnifeStab = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:e25e872a-34b9-5d29-4ec0-49e049a802de
msgctxt "hcd3a8fc3g562cg4703ga16eg3d75f8357eed"
msgid "I'm... sorry..."
msgstr "미... 안해..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e430cf80-3da6-a285-0872-2b2128a05202
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:e430cf80-3da6-a285-0872-2b2128a05202
msgctxt "hd3c9e3b9gce9bg48f2gabe7gc65bef2002e5"
msgid "I killed my darling for sport, and I enjoyed it."
msgstr "그냥 재미로 사랑하는 사람을 죽였지. 즐거운 경험이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = e7a8c0a0-6db1-9222-60f7-24a85b181220
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 4a608e34-aaa3-a6b8-0f43-214d81cc8d82_murderhobosuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:e7a8c0a0-6db1-9222-60f7-24a85b181220
msgctxt "hdd95a2d0g4c5dg4a3bgab0cg18b83a5493b5"
msgid "Not to the point of killing this body!"
msgstr "내 몸을 죽여버릴 정도로 하면 어쩌자는 거냐!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e7ecd63f-57c0-3066-2a01-147f6376c971
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#. TagRule: (CLERIC_EVIL or PALADIN_EVIL) and !(CLERIC_SHAR and PALADIN_SHAR)
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:e7ecd63f-57c0-3066-2a01-147f6376c971
msgctxt "h9c0d9076gdd65g41cbgb103g3e8b1208a439"
msgid "She won't know her own name by the time I'm done with her."
msgstr "내가 일을 다 볼 때까지 이 여자는 자기 이름조차 떠올리지 못할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e85d09ec-5421-e0a0-2d15-517337155aa5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:e85d09ec-5421-e0a0-2d15-517337155aa5
msgctxt "hbc307cefg74bfg45aeg8ffdg7de1480b891c"
msgid "That was fun - can I do it again?"
msgstr "꽤 재밌는데, 또 해 볼 수 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = e8fa8311-8394-7b69-faba-23e3967dbb31
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:e8fa8311-8394-7b69-faba-23e3967dbb31
msgctxt "hf3cda2d8gbbc0g4d2dgacbeg1aec291891d5"
msgid "I'm sorry, Ben... I'm sorry, Marc... I'm so..."
msgstr "미안해, 벤... 미안해, 마크... 난 정말..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = ea7f6416-de92-49f7-97c5-272481d4953b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:ea7f6416-de92-49f7-97c5-272481d4953b
msgctxt "h4b0eb586gd7efg4b28g9c7bge051ed611dfd"
msgid "Pot, meet kettle."
msgstr "사돈 남 말 하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = eaa8966f-7469-b72a-d0a6-f3c16edc27b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:eaa8966f-7469-b72a-d0a6-f3c16edc27b2
msgctxt "hf49fc412ge8f4g4aabga437g046dbfc42928"
msgid ""
"The ledger lies in The Waning Moon. Retrieve it, or this murderer will go "
"unpunished."
msgstr "장부는 기우는 달에 있다. 장부를 가져와라, 아니면 이 살인자가 처벌 피할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = ebeb4cf7-b1f7-6c4e-4017-0282832b6f6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:ebeb4cf7-b1f7-6c4e-4017-0282832b6f6f
msgctxt "h43a8ce9fg35d5g4c0cg99d1g32f4f6a336d2"
msgid "You're - you're not? But he said I deserved it. That I'm... evil."
msgstr "아니라고요? 하지만 그 사람은 제가 심판받아 마땅하다 했어요. 제가... 악하다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ecedba35-52da-cc30-050d-d6e51f5f215e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:ecedba35-52da-cc30-050d-d6e51f5f215e
msgctxt "h61449484g41c9g41c9ga781g2ff73f7c76a8"
msgid "You whine more than she did."
msgstr "매들린보다 네가 더 칭얼대는것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = eec38e93-2223-8673-bf29-47cdb0ab2f51
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:eec38e93-2223-8673-bf29-47cdb0ab2f51
msgctxt "h8ba86439gc549g4ecfg8a07g19defbf4d6d4"
msgid ""
"The Dark Justiciar promised she was gonna chat with 'em. She <i>promised.</i>"
msgstr "다크 저스티시어는 제게 그냥 대화만 좀 할 거라고 약속했어요. 분명 그렇게 <i>약속했다고요.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f0301857-330e-8f70-f090-71f32319cac2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:f0301857-330e-8f70-f090-71f32319cac2
msgctxt "h671d2e73g899cg4d32g93a5g29adf333f45a"
msgid "That was awful."
msgstr "끔찍했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = f030329d-d713-a061-ea87-228a78c88fb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:f030329d-d713-a061-ea87-228a78c88fb9
msgctxt "h98b0b684g263cg4333ga3fdg908dc1531d7d"
msgid ""
"You break their bones, my friend - a curable malady. I need you to leave her "
"very soul broken and <i>useless.</i>"
msgstr ""
"너는 뼈를 부러뜨리지만 이는 치료될 수 있는 고통이다, 친구여. 나는 네가 그녀의 영혼 자체를 부수어 <i>망가뜨리기를</i> 바란다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = f6dd8c53-385e-4fbe-febe-77ca34ae939e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:f6dd8c53-385e-4fbe-febe-77ca34ae939e
msgctxt "hdc2d4451ga97dg44cdgba10g46c7f0e4a26a"
msgid "It hurts... gods... I'm..."
msgstr "고통스러워... 신들이시여... 난..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f86ab129-da7b-26dc-c6b3-0a585fda30b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 6
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(1) = True
#. TagRule:
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:f86ab129-da7b-26dc-c6b3-0a585fda30b2
msgctxt "hd2201c07g3322g4f62gbe91g61d7adf54155"
msgid ""
"Stab yourself. Rip your stomach open. Feel the pain of your friends - only "
"then will you be free."
msgstr "너도 스스로를 칼로 찔러. 네 배를 갈라 찢으라고. 친구들의 고통을 느껴봐. 그러고서야 자유로워질 수 있을 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8ef46b8-922c-4849-0c6a-06f1dc682718
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:f8ef46b8-922c-4849-0c6a-06f1dc682718
msgctxt "h2bcf76d9gc31dg4bd1g9a01gbed969d09319"
msgid ""
"Yours is a classic tale of cowardice. Were you a character in a tale of "
"mine, I would kill you off - immediately."
msgstr "네 사연은 겁쟁이들의 뻔한 설정에 지나지 않아. 난 각본을 짤 때 너 같은 인물을 가장 먼저 죽여버리지 - 고민 없이."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = f9ced527-3876-0c4b-011b-bcaa304fa766
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_HasLedger(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:f9ced527-3876-0c4b-011b-bcaa304fa766
msgctxt "ha07ad43ag4c0fg4c9bg8d64g103f1316c389"
msgid ""
"What's this? The ledger is gone - how curious. Without it, the ceremony is "
"an impossibility."
msgstr "이게 뭐지? 장부가 사라지다니 - 이 얼마나 기이한 일인가. 장부가 없으면, 의식은 불가능하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fba3601f-1896-49a9-9704-ca764ab601e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_DEVOTION(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:fba3601f-1896-49a9-9704-ca764ab601e9
msgctxt "h8059d4b2g1765g49a6g82e8gcc88c60a162b"
msgid "I am here in the honour of justice and order - that is all."
msgstr "나는 정의와 질서를 수호하기 위해 이 자리에 있을 뿐이다. 그게 전부다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc2e5a27-dfd0-9a7b-c0f2-f4fdd61b21ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:fc2e5a27-dfd0-9a7b-c0f2-f4fdd61b21ca
msgctxt "hf89097c9g04bcg4197gb5a5g6fe1e18fc319"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = fcf0d7d0-9b1a-b19a-af40-827d642267c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_TaskCompleted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:fcf0d7d0-9b1a-b19a-af40-827d642267c1
msgctxt "he68deabcgf7dfg4947gba0cg0cc776e07daf"
msgid "The raven was right about you. Your name will be remembered."
msgstr "그대에 대한 까마귀의 식견이 옳았구나. 그대의 이름은 기억되리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = ff341140-8420-6baa-a214-e0a2609c1aa9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:ff341140-8420-6baa-a214-e0a2609c1aa9
msgctxt "h8ff5da8dg4ff1g42bcgaa08g9ac7793a71d6"
msgid "I thought us of one mind, I see now I was wrong."
msgstr "우리의 생각이 일치하는 줄 알았는데, 나의 착각이었나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = ffa82ef5-6376-1c1a-5379-6419f27a7e26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Memories:ffa82ef5-6376-1c1a-5379-6419f27a7e26
msgctxt "hb7ad2db3g2cf9g40a2g875egd956a35efa73"
msgid ""
"I thought I the teacher. But I have a feeling I will learn much from you."
msgstr "난 내 쪽이 스승인 줄 알았건만, 나도 너에게서 많은 걸 배울 것 같다는 느낌이 드는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = 0fcffe08-674f-4b54-62b3-cdf05d1a32c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:0fcffe08-674f-4b54-62b3-cdf05d1a32c4
msgctxt "h07c27605g9cadg457bg8005g1ef1319ad406"
msgid ""
"They whisper about you, you know. Call you stupid and ignorant. They wish "
"you were dead! Hah!"
msgstr "온통 수군대는 말들 뿐이야. 멍청하고 오만한 놈이라고 하더군. 걔들은 네가 죽기를 바란다고! 하!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1323d72f-d5d3-4e70-1d22-3e6a7c7f89ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:1323d72f-d5d3-4e70-1d22-3e6a7c7f89ac
msgctxt "h59ce284cg976eg4f3dg878dg3b707656a916"
msgid ""
"*There is a malevolence in this bird - rooted deep. It would not be wise to "
"touch it.*"
msgstr "*이 새에게서 뿌리 깊고도 순수한 악의가 느껴집니다. 만지지 않는 것이 좋겠습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2d369e1e-feb1-8487-3fc5-bdb6f9339bf6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:2d369e1e-feb1-8487-3fc5-bdb6f9339bf6
msgctxt "h1d6d297fgfa89g47efgbfdbg52a1e9b44470"
msgid "*You notice nothing out of the ordinary.*"
msgstr "*눈에 띄는 특이한 점은 없는 것으로 보입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = 31b91a3e-be89-9319-d542-8d683fba81f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:31b91a3e-be89-9319-d542-8d683fba81f7
msgctxt "h045b8a3dge6d4g499cg8249g27c3ea9f27c7"
msgid "True. But people will miss me when I'm gone."
msgstr "그건 맞지. 하지만 사람들은 내가 죽으면 날 그리워할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41fda785-6728-9407-f9dd-458088dcf9bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: DRUID or RANGER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:41fda785-6728-9407-f9dd-458088dcf9bc
msgctxt "h99cbf6aeged4bg4879g9862g2dd3cfd62e26"
msgid "I am friend to all, little raven. There is no need to be cruel."
msgstr "작은 까마귀야, 난 모두의 친구야. 못되게 굴 필요 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = 439f738f-b2bd-716f-23d7-e59e91091e67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:439f738f-b2bd-716f-23d7-e59e91091e67
msgctxt "he365802ag32a8g4c27g8bc1g1423c086b34b"
msgid ""
"You think the creatures of the realm owe you something just because you "
"never shut up."
msgstr "네가 쉴 새 없이 떠들어댄다고 해서 온 세상 생물들이 네게 빚이라도 졌다고 생각하나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = 4bbbfdca-7df6-e389-24d6-d255e974e10f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:4bbbfdca-7df6-e389-24d6-d255e974e10f
msgctxt "h91045a5bg345eg4175ga666g5a247070d582"
msgid "No one will miss you when you die. They'll piss on your grave. Hah!"
msgstr "네가 죽으면 추모할 사람은 아무도 없어. 대신 네 무덤에 오줌을 갈겨댈걸. 하!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5a3aad34-5da1-4230-ae74-33eab048e433
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_HasMet(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:5a3aad34-5da1-4230-ae74-33eab048e433
msgctxt "hc8ad98c7ga07cg431bgbc47g06a1e71bb986"
msgid "*The raven looks at you with cold, dead eyes.*"
msgstr "*까마귀가 당신을 차갑고, 생기 없는 눈으로 바라봅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = 6d61bf2f-46ba-3cf7-631c-bc630a271760
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:6d61bf2f-46ba-3cf7-631c-bc630a271760
msgctxt "h70fe7c36g4f20g4f86g817fg9bdc337fcc4b"
msgid "<i>Pathetic.</i>"
msgstr "<i>한심한 자식.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 70c92099-f38c-f09d-bc10-ac078755fb01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:70c92099-f38c-f09d-bc10-ac078755fb01
msgctxt "h7613b64ag4f42g40f8ga246gb9d8aaab059a"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = 802af53c-be7c-4a10-89cc-fa7ddb7bb643
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:802af53c-be7c-4a10-89cc-fa7ddb7bb643
msgctxt "h49720788g12d3g4983gab56g0275ebe19475"
msgid "You're disgusting. Ugly. Loathsome. You should just shut up and die."
msgstr "넌 역겹고. 못생기고. 혐오스러운 놈이야. 입 닥치고 죽어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8efdb3f3-677c-463c-a69a-092cb1eaab23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:8efdb3f3-677c-463c-a69a-092cb1eaab23
msgctxt "ha81ac368g0d6ag4fc7g94e7gf2bd773f6aaa"
msgid "<i>Pet the raven.</i>"
msgstr "<i>까마귀를 쓰다듬는다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8fc21c4c-c09e-4c70-9d47-44458cff4fd5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:8fc21c4c-c09e-4c70-9d47-44458cff4fd5
msgctxt "hd2170fdcgf77fg46b8g8366ga99346f7ff1b"
msgid "The feeling is mutual."
msgstr "그건 너도 마찬가지야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a152c16-796f-2f09-e940-835c3c1dda8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:9a152c16-796f-2f09-e940-835c3c1dda8e
msgctxt "h151a14eeg1124g4a6eg9fa2g94a91f32f1e5"
msgid "<i>Examine the raven.</i>"
msgstr "<i>까마귀를 살펴본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a31e512e-5506-8b99-db6a-43d4ba5d3c25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:a31e512e-5506-8b99-db6a-43d4ba5d3c25
msgctxt "h3efd9168g600cg4f2bg8f0aga11b7c37ca6c"
msgid "You're a loathsome little bird, aren't you?"
msgstr "참 성깔 더러운 새 납셨구만, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = b0659b4c-395e-dec8-354a-33c3138a1933
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:b0659b4c-395e-dec8-354a-33c3138a1933
msgctxt "hf7e5ab6bg8d4cg4278g9206gcf8c21170d99"
msgid ""
"Good. You should hate yourself - you're vicious and evil and cruel. Everyone "
"who loves you will suffer and die!"
msgstr "좋아. 스스로를 좀 증오해봐. 사악하고 악랄하고 잔인한 녀석아. 널 사랑하는 모두가 고통에 몸부림치다 죽게 될 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = b7c6c3fa-663e-4d59-a3c2-86a81cc81543
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:b7c6c3fa-663e-4d59-a3c2-86a81cc81543
msgctxt "h666123e7g1e92g431cga737gc8bcccf858c9"
msgid "Lies. You'll die alone, you know."
msgstr "구라 치네. 넌 혼자 죽게 될 거야, 너도 알잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = d51b86b0-088d-d01e-4ce7-4964ab4c29c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:d51b86b0-088d-d01e-4ce7-4964ab4c29c8
msgctxt "h56c9f0ccg8ba8g45a5g8c95ge385fd8c03a1"
msgid "Slitting your own throat would be a kindness. HAH!"
msgstr "차라리 네가 직접 목 긋고 뒤지는 게 자비롭겠지. 하!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = d6817ca4-00be-417f-bda4-4e743bbcae4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_HasMet_SWA(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_HasMet_SWA(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:d6817ca4-00be-417f-bda4-4e743bbcae4c
msgctxt "h722129a2g9423g4f47g8b74ge3c08894ec68"
msgid "Everyone hates you."
msgstr "모두가 널 증오해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = deedeb03-b15c-47e2-83f6-7b776d299356
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:deedeb03-b15c-47e2-83f6-7b776d299356
msgctxt "h7ced6b2bg14c0g405fga2dbg317ff1de3af8"
msgid "Excuse me?"
msgstr "뭐라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e51018c3-ca93-174d-3e0d-8e4cc61700ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:e51018c3-ca93-174d-3e0d-8e4cc61700ac
msgctxt "h59752bcbg7c67g4e3dgbf0fgc073482c86e4"
msgid "Not as much as I hate myself."
msgstr "내가 날 증오하는 만큼은 아닐걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = e60a6565-a47a-4ca9-985a-2e3026e6f4fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_HasMet_SWA(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:e60a6565-a47a-4ca9-985a-2e3026e6f4fa
msgctxt "hda15cbf5gacb6g4f5bgb346g144c1d2c27f6"
msgid "Still alive? How disappointing."
msgstr "아직도 안 죽었어? 정말 실망스럽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f2db9f76-4229-4447-9c0a-048371e0ef75
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:f2db9f76-4229-4447-9c0a-048371e0ef75
msgctxt "hccf86931g616dg4a5fgbd21g9a61cccaa0ae"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = f507b57d-8cfd-f6f2-896c-eec20d2ecbf5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Event_KnifeStab = True
#.   Object:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Event_RavenPeck(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:f507b57d-8cfd-f6f2-896c-eec20d2ecbf5
msgctxt "h0c26fb40g304bg47ecg9271gb4d836897044"
msgid "*Caw.*"
msgstr "*까악.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f5847323-f910-4c71-b6ea-dba21345b790
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven:f5847323-f910-4c71-b6ea-dba21345b790
msgctxt "h72d67780g2a99g476dg91c4ge580e86c6c66"
msgid "*The raven stares at you.*"
msgstr "*까마귀가 당신을 응시합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_AD_Bye
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = 776bc0bb-600c-4c89-ddc9-17da65cfb4fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_AD_Bye:776bc0bb-600c-4c89-ddc9-17da65cfb4fe
msgctxt "h8fa45be7gb238g40edg9ad7g46e24e1e826e"
msgid "I'd say bye, but you'll be dead soon! Hah!"
msgstr "잘 가라고 하고 싶지만, 곱게 죽진 못할 거 같네! 하!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_AD_Bye
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = e6538a71-eed0-56e9-039e-6648ac3bba14
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_AD_Bye:e6538a71-eed0-56e9-039e-6648ac3bba14
msgctxt "h0086e2c0g9287g46bcgbceag7b13930d5e6b"
msgid "Die. Die. DIE."
msgstr "죽어. 죽어. <b>죽 어</b>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_AD_GoBack
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = 8caafb65-219e-4350-da0a-e39a1890eaa2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_AD_GoBack:8caafb65-219e-4350-da0a-e39a1890eaa2
msgctxt "hb8b577a1g0266g41c5g8dfbg22f01a62f9e2"
msgid ""
"You found the ledger? Guess you're not so useless. Get back to master, on "
"the double!"
msgstr "장부를 찾았나? 아주 쓸모가 없지는 않은 모양이네. 주인님께 돌아가, 서둘러!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_AD_GoBack
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = d16ac950-29b5-8d0a-eff9-b01dc5459eb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_Raven_AD_GoBack:d16ac950-29b5-8d0a-eff9-b01dc5459eb2
msgctxt "h9816f53ag1f2cg4dcbgaa10gaa3395afe747"
msgid "Ledger. RETURN. Caw!"
msgstr "장부. <b>돌아가.</b> 까악!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0223d861-a63d-fcdb-2fcc-c96dd0198c3e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:0223d861-a63d-fcdb-2fcc-c96dd0198c3e
msgctxt "h4c22048eg12c8g41f8gb6d8gb7d046bedeea"
msgid "Not many people out here in the darkness."
msgstr "이런 어둠 속을 쏘다니는 사람은 잘 없을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 036f89a8-62af-5d1e-09ac-048e36e559a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:036f89a8-62af-5d1e-09ac-048e36e559a8
msgctxt "hd50f5865gf319g4794g8fa7gb7693eab1cc0"
msgid "They died because of her - and to this day her victims lie unavenged."
msgstr "그들이 이 여자로 인해 살해당했으니 - 희생자들은 오늘날까지 복수를 이루지 못한 채 잠들어 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 05d0da1e-2d21-dd76-e740-9de306b50686
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:05d0da1e-2d21-dd76-e740-9de306b50686
msgctxt "h10a4fa05gf7e3g4f48g929dg59f682c5b8b1"
msgid ""
"*Your mind swoons with possibilities, this blessed loon may murder the same "
"soul as many times as he wishes.*"
msgstr "*당신의 마음이 가능성으로 들뜹니다. 이 축복받은 미치광이만 원한다면 같은 영혼을 얼마든지 다시 죽일 수 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 0c40c444-400c-b05d-71c3-0cec615c9b11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:0c40c444-400c-b05d-71c3-0cec615c9b11
msgctxt "he7bd36fbg6d6cg40ccg8a87g0dd01fc68316"
msgid "The murdered lie silent. The raven asks - will you be their voice?"
msgstr "살해당한 영혼들이 침묵 속에 잠들어 있다. 까마귀가 묻기를 - 그들의 목소리가 되어 주겠는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 0e0ee946-81a7-5f8f-77bc-cb99dd57312b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:0e0ee946-81a7-5f8f-77bc-cb99dd57312b
msgctxt "h10e71927g3d54g4203gb9e5g721edf9085e3"
msgid ""
"Such spells are ancient secrets, and closely guarded - but I could be "
"convinced to share them with an <i>ally.</i>"
msgstr "이러한 주문은 고대의 비밀로서 철저히 보호되고 있지만 - 어쩌면 <i>같은 편</i>과는 공유할 수 있을지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0eb2b32e-ace8-0932-0090-54816015da1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:0eb2b32e-ace8-0932-0090-54816015da1b
msgctxt "h781100f4g24a6g440eg91c7g97dcc1608c9f"
msgid "I will - what must I do?"
msgstr "할게. 어디서 시작해야 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0f6a0094-22ba-b21d-b917-52e7128b4c09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:0f6a0094-22ba-b21d-b917-52e7128b4c09
msgctxt "h62dc023egff33g4260g8f31g077e504c72ad"
msgid "Why does the raven want to know?"
msgstr "까마귀가 왜 그걸 알고 싶어 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1519fb9e-b732-460e-1737-b2f17e19a4bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:1519fb9e-b732-460e-1737-b2f17e19a4bc
msgctxt "h2fb4f9ccg2b43g4d89gb542g4292619551ea"
msgid "No. You're on your own."
msgstr "아니. 네가 알아서 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 171e59e0-f50e-cb7d-5d48-cceaa3328f52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:171e59e0-f50e-cb7d-5d48-cceaa3328f52
msgctxt "h2ee39ebfg5ee1g45f6ga1degf7ffbff350ce"
msgid ""
"Kill the dead. Kill the killed dead. Kill the killed dead again and again."
msgstr "죽은 자를 죽여라. 죽임당한 죽은 자를 죽여라. 죽임당한 죽은 자를 다시 죽이고 죽여라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 1d4f296b-6ae1-b00b-169a-a3203c66a6c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:1d4f296b-6ae1-b00b-169a-a3203c66a6c4
msgctxt "h9fef4377g4433g4c04g9ebbgb17aabeb0aba"
msgid "You see it as I do."
msgstr "그대의 견지가 나와 같도다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 1fe9eda6-5607-0359-931d-4e92f61a9b8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:1fe9eda6-5607-0359-931d-4e92f61a9b8a
msgctxt "h83a487ffg44a4g41d7gb4f9gb5a6cd260896"
msgid "I thank you - as do those who died by her words."
msgstr "감사를 전하마. 이 여자의 감언이설에 속아 살해당한 영혼들을 대신해서 말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 2155d949-8a0c-2de8-c879-b25d5212113f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:2155d949-8a0c-2de8-c879-b25d5212113f
msgctxt "h771001acg16a1g4a37g80f7g707576e2c51e"
msgid ""
"And I have met few who stand so tall and fearless in the face of the "
"unknown. Be on your way, brave soul."
msgstr "그리고 나 역시 미지의 존재에 맞서 두려움 없이 지껄이는 사람은 거의 만나 보지 못했지. 갈 길 가거라, 용감한 영혼이여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 23905984-65e1-a384-9d89-0205216addd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:23905984-65e1-a384-9d89-0205216addd6
msgctxt "hf59484cag343eg4fc1g9bcbg939a899408d6"
msgid "My reasons are of no consequence."
msgstr "이유 따위는 중요하지 않나니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 24d82c3b-75fa-95d7-6cf8-1922223cfe04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:24d82c3b-75fa-95d7-6cf8-1922223cfe04
msgctxt "h4c6c60d4g72cfg40f3g8804g3b4a21dfb57f"
msgid "I seek a record of this one's crimes - written in her own hand."
msgstr "범죄를 입증할 사물을 찾고 있나니 - 이 자가 손수 작성한 증거물이 있을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 257a0a9f-9edb-b912-a144-fcde0620e80c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !(CLERIC_GOOD and CLERIC_NEUTRAL)
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:257a0a9f-9edb-b912-a144-fcde0620e80c
msgctxt "h290377edgc048g4322g8ac2gd2f595139da8"
msgid "She's dead - how much more can she pay?"
msgstr "이 여자는 죽었다 - 얼마나 더 대가를 치러야 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27267b24-d28e-9f89-8f5d-9d9ee3e5eedb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:27267b24-d28e-9f89-8f5d-9d9ee3e5eedb
msgctxt "h10efa39dg0755g425cg85dcge8d9d9b7491f"
msgid "You look tough - good. It's more fun that way."
msgstr "넌 강해 보인다 - 좋아. 그 덕에 재미 좀 보겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 2aa140e7-d5e0-9fd0-2c69-fce321f3e750
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:2aa140e7-d5e0-9fd0-2c69-fce321f3e750
msgctxt "h50c04838gc7f6g4a60g8179g047da7ada18e"
msgid "Not for one such as I."
msgstr "이 몸에겐 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b67ba1b-5347-9440-8f13-50848cfbf83f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:2b67ba1b-5347-9440-8f13-50848cfbf83f
msgctxt "h4239ac29g0a45g43a8gaf50g15df20324364"
msgid ""
"What good is murder if it isn't done in the name of the divine? It would be "
"an honour to punish her."
msgstr "신의 이름으로 행하는 게 아닌 이상, 살인이 무슨 소용이 있겠어? 그녀를 처벌하는 건 영광스런 일이 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 2c2579da-1e02-466b-52c3-647dcf2e6c2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:2c2579da-1e02-466b-52c3-647dcf2e6c2c
msgctxt "hfd307f12g4589g428fg859ag333400b154b9"
msgid "Depends. Did those you kill trust you? Care for you?"
msgstr "상황에 달려 있나니. 그대가 죽인 자들이 그대를 신뢰했던가? 돌보았던가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 32856495-69d8-6c8e-3323-51af7deb3226
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:32856495-69d8-6c8e-3323-51af7deb3226
msgctxt "hfaf0d93dg85a8g408fg9355g63764e84903c"
msgid "The death of heroism is close, I see."
msgstr "이 땅의 영웅심도 씨가 말라가는구나, 좋다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3531b3e2-4b55-7b6a-9e1c-246b207a01f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN_VENGEANCE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:3531b3e2-4b55-7b6a-9e1c-246b207a01f1
msgctxt "h5e33d20dg0da3g438ega013gc035428d8982"
msgid "Then we should seek revenge on her behalf."
msgstr "그렇다면 이 여자가 거둔 부당한 이득에 복수를 내려야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 36b5d0d5-56f9-fad8-8a2e-7f1dfd698308
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:36b5d0d5-56f9-fad8-8a2e-7f1dfd698308
msgctxt "haaea58fagb1fbg4175gac6dg1bba016572ed"
msgid ""
"I am not 'people'. Though many would question how wise it is to approach a "
"stranger in the dark. Be on your way."
msgstr ""
"이 몸은 '평범한' 자가 아니니라. 그들 대부분은 어둠 속에서 낯선 이에게 접근하는 것이 얼마나 현명한 일인지 의문을 갖겠지만 말이다. "
"갈 길 가거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 39e7fc75-1318-567a-f7e9-eb2811a55079
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GOOD or CLERIC_NEUTRAL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:39e7fc75-1318-567a-f7e9-eb2811a55079
msgctxt "heea46883ge6c5g4ebbgaa93g24dc878fc921"
msgid ""
"Her soul has departed for the Fugue Plane, to be judged or lost forever. "
"What more could she pay?"
msgstr "이 여자의 영혼은 심판을 받기 위해 배회 차원계로 떠났거나, 이미 영영 사라져버렸다. 어떤 대가를 더 치러야 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 3cff53fe-1b5b-e9e9-85b7-de46fd0fb336
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:3cff53fe-1b5b-e9e9-85b7-de46fd0fb336
msgctxt "h35b83f41g2222g43abg9f50g046997855ae7"
msgid ""
"I offer you a chance to avenge this murderer's victims. Will you take it?"
msgstr "이 살인자에게 희생당한 영혼들을 대신해 복수할 기회를 주겠노라. 수락하겠는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4293dd17-cc36-d013-3ac1-9f4561cab8eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:4293dd17-cc36-d013-3ac1-9f4561cab8eb
msgctxt "ha76b3f62g5d8eg4039gaec2g0c04412323e0"
msgid "<i>Ready yourself for a fight.</i>"
msgstr "<i>전투를 준비한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 44d4b7c7-b7e4-8ab0-0770-7205419a5040
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:44d4b7c7-b7e4-8ab0-0770-7205419a5040
msgctxt "h0c0168c4gc188g4c5cg91ccg4e0ac1397530"
msgid "You walk in the darkness, unafraid? How curious."
msgstr "두려움 없이 어둠 속을 걷다니? 이 얼마나 흥미로운가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 481a5cd7-e927-0f74-31ae-36ca7ac33a7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:481a5cd7-e927-0f74-31ae-36ca7ac33a7f
msgctxt "h299891a1g0c0ag46cbg93ebg02e9016bf479"
msgid "Yet she turned their words into knives - and stabbed them in the back."
msgstr "허나 그녀는 약속을 칼과 맞바꾸었고 - 그자들의 등을 찔렀다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 49b20002-b167-21e4-b699-781596d57c49
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:49b20002-b167-21e4-b699-781596d57c49
msgctxt "h7d98eca8g9a90g4ea4gb5b7g5deb0f874ac1"
msgid "Forgive me - it has been some time since I spoke to another."
msgstr "용서해 다오 - 마지막으로 다른 이와 대화를 나눈 지가 꽤 되었구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 4a537c7d-af46-1570-d17b-3d709be9cf92
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:4a537c7d-af46-1570-d17b-3d709be9cf92
msgctxt "he9150513gbf53g49a8g9193ga729c4698b8e"
msgid ""
"For your kind to know Her ways is rare. You will suit the task at hand well."
msgstr "그대 종족이 우리 여왕의 존재를 아는 건 드문 일이다. 네게 맡길 임무에 적격이로구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 4f299c0a-fb4d-c0aa-5fe1-b6f61d43dbcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:4f299c0a-fb4d-c0aa-5fe1-b6f61d43dbcb
msgctxt "h29f13445g5232g4037gb2b9g603bc838c75f"
msgid ""
"Your soul sparks with justice. With fortitude. This is your chance to bring "
"a murderer to justice. To avenge her victims."
msgstr "그대의 영혼이 정의감으로 불타오르는구나. 굳세도다. 살인자에게 정의를 안겨 줄 기회다. 희생자들을 위해 복수해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 50a154b4-4519-a912-81fc-5b9f9bfc5d58
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e7083a50-b95e-0d18-df87-c1c021e34f9c_bardhistorysuccess = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:50a154b4-4519-a912-81fc-5b9f9bfc5d58
msgctxt "h56566cafg5480g431cgb992gf6a377c2aa0a"
msgid ""
"It is an honour to meet one of the Raven Queen's scions. What brings you "
"here?"
msgstr "까마귀 여왕의 자손을 만나 뵈어 영광입니다. 무슨 용무로 이곳까지 오셨습니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 62d20181-4042-0b61-fc04-852670fbd9ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:62d20181-4042-0b61-fc04-852670fbd9ca
msgctxt "h6d118f9cg0bd7g4cacg9844gaf63638efaa8"
msgid "Will you take it?"
msgstr "수락하겠는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 662cef16-2973-b689-6ad4-64401534a903
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:662cef16-2973-b689-6ad4-64401534a903
msgctxt "hd26cd5fbg6ee5g4863gbf99g03cccb53a92a"
msgid "You are not an impartial judge. Why have you decided her guilt already?"
msgstr "당신은 공정한 심판자가 아니오. 어째서 이미 그녀에게 유죄를 선고했소?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Raven
#. NodeID = 6d4e1252-4f73-68a4-5c50-e216f0d1bcf1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:6d4e1252-4f73-68a4-5c50-e216f0d1bcf1
msgctxt "h0093048ag6f64g4414gbd02gf233fee73935"
msgid "*CAW.*"
msgstr "*까악.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7557be7e-d2fa-8f99-e13d-108d38cc277d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:7557be7e-d2fa-8f99-e13d-108d38cc277d
msgctxt "hdf601d03gff61g4e48g9b72gdcf080e627eb"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr "무슨 일이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 78e01fa5-9438-c254-2bf4-d99344944bcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:78e01fa5-9438-c254-2bf4-d99344944bcb
msgctxt "h382ae641g6f52g495cgb024g176d9c60e950"
msgid "<i>No.</i> I seek only justice - not murderous deviancy."
msgstr "<i>안 된다.</i> 이 몸은 오직 정의만을 추구한다 - 살인 욕구에 매몰된 일탈 행위가 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 7e9d1fc3-62e6-56f1-c53e-4a9ba2709dc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:7e9d1fc3-62e6-56f1-c53e-4a9ba2709dc1
msgctxt "h26ebf61bg5ebfg4a6eg949cg6ddb3fe117c2"
msgid "Then you and I were fated to meet."
msgstr "그렇다면 그대와 나는 틀림없이 조우할 운명이었구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 7f6506c6-96d4-8b3a-84c8-c3e20b5ae6f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:7f6506c6-96d4-8b3a-84c8-c3e20b5ae6f5
msgctxt "hd2103cfcg4ba8g4ab3ga1b3gf8decc1f547e"
msgid "A fair point - perhaps this one could assist us."
msgstr "맞는 말이다 - 어쩌면 이 자가 우리 일을 도울 수도 있을지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 81458c9d-d122-7964-6914-6229de41196b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:81458c9d-d122-7964-6914-6229de41196b
msgctxt "ha2b1c504g57cag40c6gaca2g36e3cd986894"
msgid "Indeed. One whose secrets are not for your ears. Be on your way."
msgstr "물론. 네 귀에는 들리지 않을 비밀을 품은 자와 이야기 중이니라. 갈 길 가도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 82ba5913-6efb-48e5-382a-3a8281e4bb77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:82ba5913-6efb-48e5-382a-3a8281e4bb77
msgctxt "h4238085bg7474g4b8bgac4ag4b16b0556197"
msgid "She is not the victim. Nay, she is the perpetrator."
msgstr "이 자는 희생자가 아니다. 반대지. 그녀가 바로 가해자이니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 84def103-b96f-a302-8212-d685f2d30e16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:84def103-b96f-a302-8212-d685f2d30e16
msgctxt "h88e71331ga445g4c67ga6f9g6180dc13522f"
msgid ""
"When you have lived as long as I, such simple magic becomes second nature."
msgstr "그대가 이 몸만큼 오래 산다면, 이런 단순한 마법 따위는 저절로 다루게 되리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 880841ff-7188-9a01-eb6b-01f9649839cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:880841ff-7188-9a01-eb6b-01f9649839cd
msgctxt "hf9cb9623g7ef6g4e56gbbedg469a68309a74"
msgid "I have no heart."
msgstr "이 몸에 마음 같은 건 없나니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 907fc859-7e42-cac0-4a4c-463776481a52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:907fc859-7e42-cac0-4a4c-463776481a52
msgctxt "h1eafb4fege4bag4af9g9313gb2449a086756"
msgid "Playing with the dead, are we? How charming."
msgstr "죽은 자를 가지고 놀고 있는 것 같은데, 맞나? 대단하신 양반이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = 910ffad4-a8f4-8638-61e5-ea485137de74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:910ffad4-a8f4-8638-61e5-ea485137de74
msgctxt "h2c2db126g2e4eg41abg931dgc491ffa9e54a"
msgid ""
"Your soul sparks with vengeance. With fury. This is your chance to torment a "
"murderer. To make her suffer."
msgstr "그대의 영혼이 복수심으로 불타오르는구나. 분노로다. 살인자를 고문할 수 있는 기회다. 그녀에게 고통을 안겨라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95ee24f4-3246-fe32-fcd6-7a868073ef05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:95ee24f4-3246-fe32-fcd6-7a868073ef05
msgctxt "h997e4046g07f9g426dgb1f5g8a1ec85ba3f8"
msgid ""
"Death often comes for a reason. I've killed before, does that make me a "
"murderer?"
msgstr "죽음에는 모름지기 이유가 따르는 법. 나 역시 사람을 죽인 적 있소만, 그렇다면 나도 살인자가 되는 것이오?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9bc42aff-3ed9-8520-424a-8d7bf60fc9fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:9bc42aff-3ed9-8520-424a-8d7bf60fc9fe
msgctxt "he2b0c78cga2d6g407fga0e3g29149543683b"
msgid "What do you need me to do?"
msgstr "어떻게 도와주면 될까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = a1892c5a-7796-1c33-6c12-78ab5aa850f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:a1892c5a-7796-1c33-6c12-78ab5aa850f7
msgctxt "h237d43e9g0207g4be3g8e66g4aa7363165c6"
msgid ""
"Through it, I can summon her spirit - and force her to face trial for her "
"crimes."
msgstr "그것으로 이 여자를 불러내어 - 그녀가 저지른 범죄에 대한 재판을 받게 하리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a237a4a5-9201-e93f-dcaf-8d9517ef6966
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:a237a4a5-9201-e93f-dcaf-8d9517ef6966
msgctxt "h96403a82gc6c7g45a1ga33egac2dc938138e"
msgid "Depends. Who murdered this woman?"
msgstr "경우에 따라서. 누가 이 여자를 죽였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a97f44b2-b059-7d9f-019a-8ae206d13541
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:a97f44b2-b059-7d9f-019a-8ae206d13541
msgctxt "h6a48de1aga8f9g4208ga2dbg9213b0994360"
msgid "I doubt you're here out of the goodness of your heart."
msgstr "당신이 선한 마음으로 찾아온 게 맞는지 의심스럽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aad55887-e06a-2c6c-f2e6-ce7c120dcdaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: SORCERER or WARLOCK or WIZARD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:aad55887-e06a-2c6c-f2e6-ce7c120dcdaa
msgctxt "h2d3b7afeg90d4g4730gbec8ga6a5fb30eb6a"
msgid "That's some powerful magic - how do you do it? Can you show me?"
msgstr "아주 강력한 마법인데 - 어떻게 한 거지? 내게 보여줄 수 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = b1e0fa13-b674-d512-3600-51a92e4d872b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:b1e0fa13-b674-d512-3600-51a92e4d872b
msgctxt "hd77d0c27gc286g46c5g873agd11cebc3525c"
msgid "He thinks you strong enough for the task at hand."
msgstr "그는 네가 임무를 맡아도 좋을 만큼 충분히 강하다고 생각하느니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = b51e4ee6-5c45-1858-1b8e-d2060f5a227f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:b51e4ee6-5c45-1858-1b8e-d2060f5a227f
msgctxt "h2e9539c4g3b64g4da5g8d57g7cd6365b095d"
msgid "Death is not the end - merely another beginning."
msgstr "죽음은 최후가 아니다 - 차라리 또 다른 시작에 가깝노라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b68d028a-7ed6-7369-a718-ed419ee13611
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:b68d028a-7ed6-7369-a718-ed419ee13611
msgctxt "hb37ad6fag113ag47fegb578g099954f984fd"
msgid ""
"That spell - Speak With Dead, correct? Your technique is <i>impeccable.</i>"
msgstr "그 주문, 죽은 자와 대화, 맞지? 기술이 정말 <i>흠잡을 데 없는걸.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Madeline
#. NodeID = bafd3db3-8658-ab69-5218-2de4894cad9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:bafd3db3-8658-ab69-5218-2de4894cad9d
msgctxt "h41154984gf6e2g4468g9f84gf75c2a079f16"
msgid "The... Waning Moon..."
msgstr "기우는 달..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf175aab-a31a-1b60-a6cd-e50de3b85d6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_PartySpokeWithDead = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:bf175aab-a31a-1b60-a6cd-e50de3b85d6d
msgctxt "h1160c375g8981g44d0g8493gd8b7cad97581"
msgid "I've met few who can also commune with the dead."
msgstr "이미 죽은 자와도 말을 나눌 수 있는 사람은 거의 만나 보지 못했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = bf4f0756-8905-944b-b83a-3c0a9a9fe364
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:bf4f0756-8905-944b-b83a-3c0a9a9fe364
msgctxt "hac3f5b60g05deg4528gbf5ag22afa3325f9e"
msgid "A pity - I thought I sensed the spark of heroes in you."
msgstr "안타깝구나 - 그대의 영혼에서 영웅심의 불씨를 느꼈거늘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c6c2820c-7011-1c64-d9c7-ae3a34d743a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:c6c2820c-7011-1c64-d9c7-ae3a34d743a4
msgctxt "hd4b60417g0564g4673gbe0eg74216b956310"
msgid "Speak plainly - what are you talking about?"
msgstr "제대로 설명해 봐 - 뭘 말하고 싶은 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = da743080-95c9-48ff-171e-43fa0ec4953c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_State_DialogUnlocked = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:da743080-95c9-48ff-171e-43fa0ec4953c
msgctxt "he7bfb265gc70fg4af3g9534g2243c27d4fe0"
msgid ""
"Go to the distillery, the one she calls The Waning Moon. Find the ledger - "
"and bring it to <i>me</i>."
msgstr "증류소로 가거라. 기우는 달이라고 불리는 곳이니라. 장부를 찾아 - <i>내게</i> 가져오너라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db648a61-6503-8e1c-4f8a-ad3e3889c71e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_SpeakWithDead_State_PartySpokeWithDead = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:db648a61-6503-8e1c-4f8a-ad3e3889c71e
msgctxt "ha94a393cg7c80g42f1g8aa8gc4a611aec7e7"
msgid "Were you just talking to a <i>corpse?</i>"
msgstr "지금 <i>시체</i>와 이야기하고 있는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = dbc00a76-d24e-1f6e-9852-0dc297b49e8c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:dbc00a76-d24e-1f6e-9852-0dc297b49e8c
msgctxt "h133cd1d2gd317g4731ga5c5g5bdd44ca41e8"
msgid "Stay your hand, and be on your way. I'll not raise mine against you."
msgstr "손을 거두고 갈 길 가거라. 이 몸은 그대와 맞서지 않겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dfb45791-2d81-704f-a53b-8c3435f35dc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: (CLERIC_GOOD or PALADIN) and !OATHBREAKER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:dfb45791-2d81-704f-a53b-8c3435f35dc7
msgctxt "h72ab2abfg0a23g4051g8b55g86e781415c44"
msgid "I will always seek justice for the wronged."
msgstr "나는 언제나 부당한 이들에게 정의를 안겨 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e810cca4-4718-5ae5-1137-2b09d1f6ee47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e7083a50-b95e-0d18-df87-c1c021e34f9c_bardhistorysuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:e810cca4-4718-5ae5-1137-2b09d1f6ee47
msgctxt "hf1d59c6fg3e5cg4170g8276gbc6bae54d75f"
msgid ""
"*The raven, the piercings, the general malaise: this is a shadar-kai. Tales "
"and songs featuring servants of the Raven Queen tend to be tragedies.*"
msgstr ""
"*까마귀, 피어싱, 전반적으로 풍기는 불쾌감: 이 자는 샤다르카이입니다. 까마귀 여왕의 종복이 등장하는 이야기와 노래는 대체로 비극적인 "
"경향이 짙습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ec8027a8-620e-b723-0ccb-0a97d24bdf07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:ec8027a8-620e-b723-0ccb-0a97d24bdf07
msgctxt "h39b9cbb1g1994g4bbdgb2f6g6bfae06bb4fb"
msgid "It sounds like she must be punished - thoroughly."
msgstr "이 여자는 처벌받아야만 한다. 철저히 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = edaa137e-20ac-cef1-a9b9-917346fe967c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:edaa137e-20ac-cef1-a9b9-917346fe967c
msgctxt "h36bafdacge4edg42f0g9bc0g275b70db0ee2"
msgid "Hardly a fair trial - you've already decided her guilt. Why?"
msgstr "그리 공정한 재판은 아니군 - 당신은 이미 여자에게 유죄를 선고했다. 어째서지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = f77b5257-eebc-697a-827b-0b020ac8887f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:f77b5257-eebc-697a-827b-0b020ac8887f
msgctxt "h35fc42c6g5cfcg49d9g8500g347fcb616cc8"
msgid "The Fugue Plane is no obstacle to one such as I."
msgstr "배회 차원계는 이 몸의 임무를 방해하지 못하노라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f9543512-e5fb-de3f-5ac3-f3aab3a84a44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:f9543512-e5fb-de3f-5ac3-f3aab3a84a44
msgctxt "h841c6097gcdabg4145g9c82gf1107804dea7"
msgid "Why would you do that?"
msgstr "무슨 이유로 그렇게 하는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = fd34779d-469b-38b9-1893-9b92569a4ce0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SCL_ServantOfTheRAven_Servant_HasMet(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:fd34779d-469b-38b9-1893-9b92569a4ce0
msgctxt "had2d35bdg8f18g491ag8319g31a9636b16e5"
msgid "Where lies your guilt?"
msgstr "네 죄는 어디에 묻혀 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fe495953-f2c4-7e4a-f1f9-925022dfce8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:fe495953-f2c4-7e4a-f1f9-925022dfce8e
msgctxt "hf5bf27cag68f6g4e9fgb5a0g108b21771e6a"
msgid "So long as I get paid."
msgstr "보상만 두둑하다면."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ffa7f3a4-8e1f-ee6d-df7c-393fbe318d12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !(SORCERER and WARLOCK and WIZARD)
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:ffa7f3a4-8e1f-ee6d-df7c-393fbe318d12
msgctxt "hfa118babgaa58g4bccg81a4gffd86af553ce"
msgid "That's some powerful magic."
msgstr "정말 강력한 주문인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai
#. Speaker = He Who Was
#. NodeID = ffe54153-1f6a-1ee1-2998-3ef05e77aa2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_ShadarKai:ffe54153-1f6a-1ee1-2998-3ef05e77aa2c
msgctxt "ha998e6a4g0262g4108ga7aag226ba0c074b8"
msgid ""
"This woman tended a bar where she took her patrons, her <i>friends, </i>into "
"her confidence - promised their secrets were safe with her."
msgstr ""
"이 여자는 술집을 운영했었다. 단골 고객이자 <i>친구</i>였던 이들의 비밀을 지켜 주겠노라 약속하며 그들에게 신뢰를 심어 주었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ShadowBirds_PAD_Approach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04669eba-1e82-4d1b-9779-2a7de2b443be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_ShadowBird_State_Identified = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ShadowBirds_PAD_Approach:04669eba-1e82-4d1b-9779-2a7de2b443be
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h7cf87e81gd47cg496cg9657g1c062983d494"
msgid "Let's hope a dead bird is the creepiest thing around here."
msgstr "저 죽은 새가 이곳의 마지막 소름끼치는 광경이길 바라자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ShadowBirds_PAD_Approach
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 04669eba-1e82-4d1b-9779-2a7de2b443be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SCL_ShadowBird_State_Identified = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ShadowBirds_PAD_Approach:04669eba-1e82-4d1b-9779-2a7de2b443be
msgctxt "hbeccdcd1ga742g4f1ag85d4g1a3a72e3bc71"
msgid "A dead bird. Even wings can't lift you out of these damned shadows."
msgstr "죽은 새로군. 날개가 있어도 이 망할 그림자 저주에서 벗어나질 못하다니."

