msgid "Poor creature. This was no place for it to die."
msgstr "불쌍한 것. 이곳에서 죽어선 안 되는 거였건만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ShadowBirds_PAD_Approach
