msgctxt "h2a4bb246g6834g4779gac8eg47241aaef7dc"
msgid "It belongs to the shadows now. Better if it's just left alone."
msgstr "저건 그림자에 잠식당했군. 그냥 내버려 두는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ShadowBirds_PAD_Approach
