msgctxt "h1c6a3c2fg4075g4a09g96ddg8eedfb9bc7fe"
msgid "The darkness has consumed it. Better leave it be."
msgstr "어둠이 집어삼켜 버렸군. 건들지 않는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ShadowBirds_PAD_Approach
