#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h9236f101g639fg4b64g8721g5c12afdf8b86"
msgid "The shadows claimed that bird. Not for me to interfere..."
msgstr "그림자가 새를 가져갔군. 내가 개입할 영역이 아니야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ShadowBirds_PAD_Approach
