msgctxt "h4a110ccdga35cg4582g8f9dgefcdb4592e03"
msgid "That dead bird must be laden with cursed shadow. I wouldn't touch it."
msgstr "죽은 새에 저주받은 그림자가 잔뜩 깃들어 있군. 건들지 않는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ShadowBirds_PAD_Approach
