msgctxt "h18fd4457g1317g4865ga749gad5239a669b7"
msgid "The shadows claimed that poor creature. Its remains are tainted."
msgstr "그림자가 저 불쌍한 아이의 생명을 앗아가 버렸군. 남은 건 오염된 흔적뿐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ShadowBirds_PAD_Approach
