msgctxt "h9d18716fg67dcg42c7gb0e0gf62eddb617d4"
msgid ""
"That dead bird's been corrupted by the shadows. Would be wise to leave it "
"alone..."
msgstr "저기 죽은 새가 그림자에 잔뜩 오염됐어. 그냥 내버려 두는 게 현명하겠지..."

