#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hddcda8b7g565ag414cgac00g49f81af5c335"
msgid ""
"I'd gladly carry a pair of rancid britches on a stick right now, if they "
"kept aflame."
msgstr "지금이라면 냄새나는 속옷 한 쌍이라도 막대에 걸어두겠어, 불만 붙어준다면."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ShadowCurse_PAD_LightsSnuffedOut
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ef4b11f-4366-4107-9062-539d468fc2b6
