msgctxt "ha01ff35bg59f9g4f90g86e0g18862e4fdd8e"
msgid "The torch is no help, damn it - the shadows here are too strong."
msgstr "횃불이 쓸모가 없어, 젠장. 여기 그림자는 너무 강력해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ShadowCurse_PAD_LightsSnuffedOut
