msgctxt "hbc7f5bdbg6a7dg4b3dgb376g4e4dd5ea9a98"
msgid "The curse is strong here - torches won't even stay lit."
msgstr "저주가 강력해. 횃불이 타오르지도 못할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_ShadowCurse_PAD_LightsSnuffedOut
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c465f50-30df-4c18-97fa-e9b3e43962a3
