msgid ""
"There has to be more to this place. There has to be a reason I came to be "
"here."
msgstr "이 장소엔 뭔가 더 있어야 해. 내가 여기 온 이유가 있어야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shadowland/SCL_Shadowheart_PAD_DarkJusticiarRemains
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 10e01b83-0b68-40fc-ab87-cd116c3f492c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
