msgid ""
"The disc is moving. The Gauntlet of Shar must continue wherever it leads."
msgstr "원반이 움직이는군. 어디로 데려가든 샤의 건틀릿이 이어지겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked
