msgctxt "h691f279fg8e7dg41f2gb407g2d2b73cec3e8"
msgid "The disc is moving. Maybe it'll lead to the next step - or the end."
msgstr "원반이 움직이네. 다음 단계로 이끌어 주겠지. 아님 끝으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked
