msgctxt "h92fb36c2gaf05g4565g8763g91cffb8fdbd9"
msgid "The disc is moving. It must lead to the next step of Shar's Gauntlet."
msgstr "원반이 움직인다. 샤의 건틀렛의 다음 단계로 이끌겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked
