msgctxt "hdd1fd41bgab48g4abbgb844g9670251a9621"
msgid ""
"The disc's on the move. Looks like I'm catching a ride to the next part of "
"the Gauntlet."
msgstr "원반이 움직여. 건틀릿의 다음 부분으로 가는 탈것을 잡아탄 모양인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked
