msgctxt "ha312f2a5g9ca3g4726gac2agcc810319d683"
msgid ""
"The disc is moving. Lady Shar has granted passage to the next step of her "
"Gauntlet."
msgstr "원반이 움직여. 샤 여신께서 건틀릿 다음 단계로 가는 길을 허락해 주셨어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ccc82a0-d6f5-f958-a901-875658950554
