msgctxt "hc10d14b4g08ceg40a5gb99cgf6abe6e64faf"
msgid "At last, we can travel in style!"
msgstr "마침내, 멋지게 여행할 수 있겠네!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked:9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
msgctxt "h51f34406g4124g48f8gb57cg39e7e977f03c"
msgid "The disc is moving. Better see where it leads."
msgstr "원반이 움직여. 어디로 가는지 봐 둬야겠네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked:9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
msgctxt "hcd9884dbg3cb1g4adfg957dge6e4a9a05545"
msgid ""
"The disc is moving. There must be even greaters depths to explore in this "
"place."
msgstr "원반이 움직이네. 여기엔 분명 훨씬 더 깊은 곳이 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked:9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
msgctxt "h66b08cbfgb363g4c37gac53g643cfed368ba"
msgid "Disc is moving! That's good, right?"
msgstr "원반이 움직여! 좋은 거지, 그치?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked:9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
msgctxt "h16b6b1f7g037fg404ega0dag2c021043608e"
msgid "The disc is in motion. A welcome boon for an arduous journey."
msgstr "원반이 움직이고 있다. 힘든 여정을 위한 환영 선물 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked:9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
msgctxt "hc115cee2g1bcag4dd4gaf76g3a7f167de014"
msgid ""
"That disc has started moving. Might be a quicker way to get around than the "
"stairs."
msgstr "저 원반이 움직이기 시작했어. 계단보다 더 빠르게 갈 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked:9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
msgctxt "hcf6ecd9agdd62g431egbc5dg823b5e80b00f"
msgid "The disc's on the move. Why walk, when you can ride?"
msgstr "원반이 움직인다. 탈 수 있는데, 왜 걸어가겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Disc_PAD_Unlocked:9aaa1b75-d9c8-49a3-b237-85ebfe06fb4a
msgctxt "h472ef59eg1fe4g45b3g9d01gf8c86d335325"
msgid "That disc is moving - might be useful to navigate this place."
msgstr "저 원판이 움직이네. 여길 탐색하는 데 유용할지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Displacer
