msgctxt "haaf35eaag4576g4e9dg8d53g9a679e99bece"
msgid "Master? Didn't think of your kind as <i>slaves</i>."
msgstr "주인님? 너희 종족을 <i>노예</i>라 생각하진 않았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Displacer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c768163d-1cec-43f3-bbb0-0cb0b8d4e58f
