msgctxt "hee3c8f14g2657g43f4g9b37gd086646f7aef"
msgid "Dedicated to the goddess Shar. Which probably isn't good news."
msgstr "샤 여신에게 봉헌한 곳이군, 뭐 좋은 정보는 아닌걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Entrance_State_ReligionSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple:8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
msgctxt "he0319a14g2d87g4419ga2ffgd5405e43626c"
msgid "This architecture - this can only be the work of Shar worshippers."
msgstr "이 건축물은 - 이건 샤 숭배자들의 작품임에 틀림없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Entrance_State_ReligionSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple:8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
msgctxt "habfcf5f9g0a76g4503g8fc9gd7b3a2e31d27"
msgid "Looks Sharran. Beautiful but terrifying."
msgstr "샤 여신과 관련이 있군. 아름답지만 한편으론 무서워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Entrance_State_ReligionSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple:8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
msgctxt "h4b69cd62g5651g444cg97e5gb131e2313262"
msgid ""
"A temple of Shar - hidden deep enough to escape the effects of her shadow "
"curse."
msgstr "샤의 신전이라.. 그림자 저주의 영향에서 벗어날 수 있을 만큼 깊숙이 자리 잡고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Entrance_State_ReligionSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple:8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
msgctxt "hd6a58670gea5eg4280ga924gb52271c28cce"
msgid ""
"Dark. Pretentious. Shar's temples leave <i>nothing</i> to the imagination."
msgstr "어둡고. 잔뜩 잘난척해놓은 것이, 샤의 신전인 게 틀림없네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Entrance_State_ReligionSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple:8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
msgctxt "h3e18987fg3344g4751g9ac1g6169714545e2"
msgid ""
"I've explored Shar's temples before - but never one quite so... funereal."
msgstr "이전에 샤의 신전을 탐험해 본 적이 있습니다. 하지만 이렇게.. 조용한.. 장례식장 같은 곳은 처음이네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Entrance_State_ReligionSuccess = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SHAR or PALADIN_SHAR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple:8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
msgctxt "h8a7913e1gdd0ag490bga7a1gffd4287f6112"
msgid "A stronghold built in Lady Shar's honour. Quite a sight."
msgstr "샤 여신을 기리기 위한 요새 군. 장관이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Entrance_State_ReligionSuccess = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple:8558931f-dd2a-4685-9aa6-777d3cd7cfc8
msgctxt "hfdf29135gb665g49cegb4d0ge2d073edac70"
msgid "A Sharran structure, going by the design."
msgstr "디자인을 보아하니, 샤 종교의 건축양식이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3559c2c-e2e5-85a2-d9e0-4f4e2273ebb6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple:f3559c2c-e2e5-85a2-d9e0-4f4e2273ebb6
msgctxt "h8f7f89f8g7169g4546ga6ffg73ad45152c77"
msgid "A temple to Lady Shar. It almost seems like... no, surely it can't be."
msgstr "샤 여신의 사원이야. 여기 보이기엔.. 아냐, 절대 그럴 리 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f70d9b22-bb6f-81c8-6795-cb2afb2c1c0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#.      - ORI_Shadowheart_Knows_JusticiarDream = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple:f70d9b22-bb6f-81c8-6795-cb2afb2c1c0e
msgctxt "h5aef1469gcb72g4ec5ga28dg0de6019ec1d4"
msgid ""
"The Gauntlet of Shar, before my very eyes... the Dark Lady guided me here. "
"She wanted me to find this place."
msgstr "내 눈앞에 샤의 건틀릿이... 어둠의 여신이 여기로 인도했어. 내가 이곳을 찾길 바라신 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc04cad6-3a6f-4949-fda0-7eb8bca9f363
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#.      - ORI_Shadowheart_State_DarkJusticiarSuspicion = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Entrance_PAD_RecognisedSharTemple:fc04cad6-3a6f-4949-fda0-7eb8bca9f363
msgctxt "h0a32ef27gff3cg4ee9g8c68g8af306094468"
msgid ""
"I suspected there was something to be found, but this... <i>the Gauntlet of "
"Shar</i>. I can scarcely believe my own eyes..."
msgstr "뭔가 발견할 것 같긴 했는데, 이.. 이건.. <i>샤의 건틀릿</i>이잖아. 보고도 믿질 못하겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FamiliarFace_AD_MonitorLeaves
#. Speaker = Raphael
#. NodeID = d87c123d-93b2-4d49-8102-8b2c3b10dd12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FamiliarFace_AD_MonitorLeaves:d87c123d-93b2-4d49-8102-8b2c3b10dd12
msgctxt "h3445bb20g900ag4d45g9922g75b45f4c4da6"
msgid "You cannot harm me, but you can irritate me. Goodbye."
msgstr "넌 날 해칠 수 없어. 그래도 날 짜증 나게는 하는군. 그럼 이만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayer
#. Speaker = Flesh
#. NodeID = 18075419-bb34-e732-fec7-8529c3d67f90
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayer:18075419-bb34-e732-fec7-8529c3d67f90
msgctxt "hdf2d6133ge60eg4243g9d4cg085b6e92ea6c"
msgid "*Roar.*"
msgstr "*크어엉.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse:fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
msgctxt "hd2c1914bg2f31g471ega712g636000da1b9b"
msgid "Oh what - it won't fight its friends? Coward."
msgstr "오 뭔데 - 친구들은 공격하지 않겠다는 거야? 겁쟁이 자식."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse:fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
msgctxt "hd679ca5agce13g4137g9d88gfc21da5e1b7c"
msgid "It won't fight its allies? Just what I needed, a golem with principles."
msgstr "자기 편은 공격하지 않는 건가? 원칙이 있는 골렘이라니 참 다행이구만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse:fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
msgctxt "hc6bb191cgee17g47fagb993gcc054348f89f"
msgid "It won't fight its... friends. Siblings?"
msgstr "그... 친구들과는 싸우지 않네. 형제라고 봐야하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse:fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
msgctxt "h9ea394c3g96a5g4c24gbbf6gb36db3a75ade"
msgid "It won't turn against the others. Vexing."
msgstr "서로 공격하지는 않는군. 짜증나게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse:fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
msgctxt "h9166b26bg8eefg4f71g8d1eg34cf92971072"
msgid ""
"I suppose it was wishful thinking to hope that thing'd attack its own..."
msgstr "자기들끼리 싸워 주지 않을까 했던 건 너무 큰 소망이었나보네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse:fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
msgctxt "hc856a865ge24cg44acg9159ga34508fc8b3f"
msgid "It won't turn on its own kind. Of <i>course.</i>"
msgstr "자기들끼리는 싸우지 않는 모양인데. <i>그럼 그렇지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_FleshGolem_AD_TurnsAgainstPlayerResponse:fc6c115f-8e18-4e2f-8d89-f5752be18d88
msgctxt "h257b662dg5e6ag4491g9c2bg85bae9db394e"
msgid "Not keen on fighting its allies. Should've figured."
msgstr "같은 편이랑은 싸우려 들지 않는군. 알아차렸어야 했는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Gauntlet_PAD_Shadowheart
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 1fd6020b-1cc5-9bb2-8ff3-d23ebab65110
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Gauntlet_PAD_Shadowheart:1fd6020b-1cc5-9bb2-8ff3-d23ebab65110
msgctxt "h7186f42dg59dfg406cg99a9g081fa53d9021"
msgid "Through there... there's something about it. Need to look."
msgstr "저기 너머 좀 봐... 저기 뭔가 있어. 확인해 봐야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_AD_ShutteredMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 39ccbf63-042f-4bd5-afbc-c2d51031194c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_UsedShatteredMirrorOfLoss = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_AD_ShutteredMirrorOfLoss:39ccbf63-042f-4bd5-afbc-c2d51031194c
msgctxt "h47e876dag9f3dg4dfbg88f5g8694bec25216"
msgid ""
"*Gazing into the broken mirror serves no purpose. The reflection it offers "
"is like a dizzying kaleidoscope.*"
msgstr "*깨진 거울을 쳐다보아도 소용이 없습니다. 거울이 비추는 형상은 어지러운 만화경 같습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
msgctxt "h38899066g3f8ag4b75ga892g816b4f4e6f82"
msgid "Blood's still warm. Whatever happened to his head happened recently."
msgstr "핏자국에 아직 온기가 남아있어. 이 머리에 뭔 일이 일어났든 최근임이 틀림없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
msgctxt "h4cbb9d91gc2a5g4280gb2cdg268c91d226c0"
msgid "Warm body, head smashed. A recent kill."
msgstr "몸은 따뜻한데, 머리가 뭉개졌군. 죽은 지 얼마 안 됐어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
msgctxt "h49644804g2e81g4efeg8be1g6dccfd5287c3"
msgid "Freshly-spilled blood. A recent decapitation if I ever saw one."
msgstr "피를 흘린 지 얼마 안 됐군. 아무래도 목이 잘린 건 최근인 것 같아. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
msgctxt "hec9f155bg4328g4f8eg804cgf5fc874981d5"
msgid ""
"A recent kill - I can still see blood pulsing out of that headless stump."
msgstr "죽은 지 얼마 안 됐군. 목 없는 몸통에서 아직도 피가 뿜어져 나오고 있어.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
msgctxt "h904c31e4g4240g4cb4gac33g5ecb36caee70"
msgid "Skull, smashed- but the corpse is warm. A terrible fate."
msgstr "머리는 박살 났지만 시체에는 온기가 남아있어. 끔찍한 최후로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
msgctxt "h56c49b70g2242g4edegbb3bgeabd7970437d"
msgid "Still warm."
msgstr "아직 따뜻해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
msgctxt "ha9147affg391bg40dagb978gfbf50372a6c4"
msgid "That blood smells fresh. Whoever took his head did so recently."
msgstr "갓 흘린 피냄새로군. 이 자의 머리가 이렇게 된 건 방금 전 일이네.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 743a2007-30eb-4157-9315-eb8058c16178
