msgctxt "h0e88a000gef7eg495eg96d8g0c59ad21be6f"
msgid "Something obliterated his skull. What a mess."
msgstr "뭔가가 이 자의 머리를 박살 냈군. 아주 엉망이 됐잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
msgctxt "h26d31e30gc184g489egb9b4g88a9f3cb195a"
msgid "Head, smashed. A crude kill, but a potent one."
msgstr "머리가 뭉개졌다. 투박한 방식이지만, 확실하긴 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
msgctxt "hf048fd8bgab81g4fdbgbf78gdc204b08b97c"
msgid "Head's missing. Safe to assume foul play?"
msgstr "머리가 사라졌군. 살인이 일어난 거라고 봐야겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
msgctxt "hec30c693g451cg49e4ga23fgc14097e8a561"
msgid "No head. A closed coffin at the funeral, then."
msgstr "머리가 없어. 장례를 한다면 관뚜껑을 닫은 채로 해야겠네.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
msgctxt "he44c9327gfa6dg4ceeg9952g24bcfe4e0e47"
msgid "The skull's been smashed. A brutal death by any account."
msgstr "머리가 박살이 났군. 어떻게 봐도 잔혹한 죽음이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
msgctxt "h6ee1b4deg0016g4847g939fgc6ee229bb19e"
msgid "No head. Brutal."
msgstr "머리가 없다니. 잔인해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
msgctxt "h51f4d827g8585g47d5g9861g2625ace6b92f"
msgid "Head's gone, with the rest left for the crows."
msgstr "머리가 사라졌군. 나머지는 까마귀밥이 될 테고.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[9].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
msgctxt "h515924e8g52b3g4748gafafg8af4e1da6292"
msgid "Gods, what happened to his head?"
msgstr "세상에, 대체 머리에 무슨 일이 있었던 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[10].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - WYR_SmugglersCave_Event_DeadBodyCheckSuccess = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act3/Wyrm/WYR_SmugglersCave_PAD_FoundDeadBody:d4ff4f7b-6fb2-d712-d841-140587106d35
msgctxt "hf7adedaeg4650g4efaga2d1g7e52926eab5d"
msgid "Gods, what happened to his head?"
msgstr "세상에, 대체 머리에 무슨 일이 있었던 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
msgctxt "h0bab49eeg3d62g4bfbgadffg8c07f9324717"
msgid "There was magic in this glass, once. Dark, hungry magic..."
msgstr "이 거울에도 한때는 마법이 깃들어 있었어. 어둡고, 굶주린 마법이..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
msgctxt "hc1040c18g197eg4364gb2cbgb3e4e8f4ee31"
msgid ""
"This mirror was an instrument of Shar's faithful. Dark magic still flows "
"from the shards."
msgstr "이 거울은 샤 신도들을 위한 도구였다. 그 파편에서 아직도 어둠의 마법이 느껴지는군. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
msgctxt "hb9a0cf71g2b36g44ffga60bga10a17ed6f07"
msgid ""
"This mirror once drew its power from the Shadow Weave. Even shattered, its "
"dark power lingers."
msgstr "이 거울은 그림자 위브로부터 힘을 끌어다 썼어. 산산이 부서진 지금도, 그 어두운 힘은 남아있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
msgctxt "h4b7a90efga877g442egb291g7a1b4421b8dd"
msgid ""
"This mirror... it's so familiar. I've stood before one like it before. Felt "
"its magic. What did it do...?"
msgstr "이 거울... 너무나 익숙해. 이것과 비슷한 거울 앞에 선 적이 있어. 마법이 느껴졌지. 이게 나한테 뭘 한 걸까...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
msgctxt "h485d41b6gce50g42d8gb94cgdc1052845cd4"
msgid ""
"Dark magic - I can feel it. It wasn't used just for reflection, but for "
"<i>collection.</i>"
msgstr "어둠의 마법이군. 느껴져. 단순히 거울로써 쓰인 게 아니야. 뭔가를 <i>수집했어.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
msgctxt "he96e6454g919ag4d75gb70dg138f8bd6598a"
msgid "Used to be magic in this mirror. Something... dark. Shattered, now."
msgstr "이 거울에는 마법이 깃들어 있었어. 뭔가... 어두운. 지금은 부서졌지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
msgctxt "hc5775488g0313g403dg8089geb5c6b9687d6"
msgid ""
"Sharran magic once imbued this mirror - I can feel it. But it works no more."
msgstr "샤의 마법이 이 거울에 깃들어 있었군. 느껴진다. 하지만 더는 작동하지 않아.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
msgctxt "hbcc9ed96gbb8ag405dg893dg725c75e2e821"
msgid ""
"Traces of malevolent magic linger here, but their power was shattered along "
"with the mirror."
msgstr "악한 마법의 흔적이 느껴지는 물건이다. 하지만 그 힘은 거울이 깨지면서 함께 사라져 버렸군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:bad6ea94-452d-4b05-9768-21672f70567a
msgctxt "h22ddefbbg371fg4802gb3dcg54996a1cbf3a"
msgid ""
"There was magic within this mirror once... <i>consuming </i>magic. But it's "
"shattered, now."
msgstr "이 거울에는 마법이 깃들어 있었어...<i>흡수하는</i> 마법이. 하지만 지금은 부서졌군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2f8f675-3309-44c7-921f-0d705bc23549
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:c2f8f675-3309-44c7-921f-0d705bc23549
msgctxt "h68ff3ecbgcddcg4568gadd8gb56ab0d1c946"
msgid "A fine looking glass, once. Not that I'd have had much use for it."
msgstr "멋지게 생긴 거울이었겠네. 물론 나한테는 쓸모가 없겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2f8f675-3309-44c7-921f-0d705bc23549
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:c2f8f675-3309-44c7-921f-0d705bc23549
msgctxt "h3d4a8f25gd20cg471eg9c41g16a412853bce"
msgid ""
"A mirror this large, and in this place, must have more than just a simple "
"looking glass."
msgstr "이렇게나 큰 거울이라니. 게다가 이 공간을 생각하면, 분명 단순한 거울 이상의 물건이었겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2f8f675-3309-44c7-921f-0d705bc23549
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:c2f8f675-3309-44c7-921f-0d705bc23549
msgctxt "h4d35628egd741g42d2ga82eg410c35fa92bf"
msgid ""
"Someone took offence at what that mirror showed them. Or what it didn't."
msgstr "누군가 거울이 보여주는 광경에 화가 났었나 본데. 아님 뭘 보여주지 않았다거나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2f8f675-3309-44c7-921f-0d705bc23549
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:c2f8f675-3309-44c7-921f-0d705bc23549
msgctxt "h68442c6agbb36g450cgbf5dgcdf64a27a21f"
msgid ""
"This mirror... it must have been for more than just reflecting, once. A "
"shame it's broken."
msgstr "이 거울... 분명 단순히 빛을 반사하는 물건은 아니었을 거야. 부서졌다니 아쉽네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2f8f675-3309-44c7-921f-0d705bc23549
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:c2f8f675-3309-44c7-921f-0d705bc23549
msgctxt "hff38ccccg9285g4be6ga3d3gebcfdba1f176"
msgid ""
"A broken mirror? A sign of bad luck, they say. Just who 'they' are, I've "
"never figured out."
msgstr "부서진 거울이라? 불운의 징조라고 흔히들 말하던데. 대체 그 '흔히들'이 누군지는 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2f8f675-3309-44c7-921f-0d705bc23549
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss:c2f8f675-3309-44c7-921f-0d705bc23549
msgctxt "h40d92cb5g57fcg4442g889fg0a77107f4621"
msgid "Pity. Wanted to check my hair."
msgstr "아쉬워라. 머리카락 정리 좀 하고 싶었는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2f8f675-3309-44c7-921f-0d705bc23549
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_HQ_MirrorOfLoss_Success = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
