msgctxt "h10d1e013g59e9g48bdgbb4fgf6e1f1c116cf"
msgid "Breaking a mirror of this size must lead to quite a lot of bad luck..."
msgstr "이만한 크기의 거울을 부순다면, 그에 따른 불운도 그만큼이나 대단하겠지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
