msgctxt "h5add19c9g32bfg4ed9g9a28gbe8e65b1fc49"
msgid ""
"Would have been a handsome mirror once, and I would have given it a handsome "
"reflection."
msgstr "한때는 꽤 멋지게 생긴 거울이었겠군. 멀쩡했다면 내 멋진 모습을 거울에 비치게 해 줬을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_HQ_PAD_BrokenMirrorOfLoss
