#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0942b01f-da69-2b2a-cae2-366c9dd9a52d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SHAR(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:0942b01f-da69-2b2a-cae2-366c9dd9a52d
msgctxt "h499e07abgcc25g4175ga2f6g61f6548bf339"
msgid "I'd never have struck at a fellow servant of Lady Shar, had I realised."
msgstr "전말을 알았다면, 샤 여신을 섬기는 같은 종복을 공격할 일도 없었을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Lyrthindor
#. NodeID = 0c031be2-a0a7-662b-5a63-514eddb04a4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:0c031be2-a0a7-662b-5a63-514eddb04a4f
msgctxt "h3bdd403bg5c00g4016gaf91gbfc32396da8a"
msgid ""
"You - why did you have to keep prying? <i>Why couldn't you just leave?!</i>"
msgstr "너, 어째서 꼬치꼬치 캐물었던 거냐? <i>어째서 그냥 떠나버리지 않은 거냐고!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Lyrthindor
#. NodeID = 1ac10ba3-3305-e937-fb08-dc74fe5650a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:1ac10ba3-3305-e937-fb08-dc74fe5650a9
msgctxt "h3b4bc5d0gea07g405agbaf2g8b83f3e07bca"
msgid ""
"But you ruined it. Trespassed. Spoiled our - <i>my</i> - secret. Now you'll "
"rot in the dark."
msgstr ""
"헌데 네놈이 헛수고로 만들었다, 무단 침입자. 우리의, <i>나의</i> 비밀을 망쳐 놓다니. 이제 어둠 속에서 썩게 될 줄 알아라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Lyrthindor
#. NodeID = 201e8e99-e275-106d-e6c7-cb606ad37f05
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:201e8e99-e275-106d-e6c7-cb606ad37f05
msgctxt "h2ddf5ef6g1252g4a6fgb36ag62fe374be723"
msgid ""
"No, there's no others. We - <i>I </i>- kept the faith, alone. You will not "
"steal the Dark Lady's favour from me!"
msgstr ""
"아니, 다른 이들은 없다. 우리는, - <i>나는</i>- 홀로 믿음을 지켜 왔다. 내게서 어둠의 여인의 총애를 훔쳐 가게 두지 않겠다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Lyrthindor
#. NodeID = 2385169e-326d-3e11-f228-f4641d959b2e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:2385169e-326d-3e11-f228-f4641d959b2e
msgctxt "h8eb0735cgf082g4675g8c69gffd1f5157f9b"
msgid "You should have just ran from him. Now you'll die before me instead."
msgstr "놈을 발견하자마자 도망쳤어야지. 대신 내 손에 먼저 죽게 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
