msgctxt "h41c8328bgbc5dg4c51gb746gaddd1b1c41b1"
msgid ""
"I'm glad I did it. The world's better off without Shar worshippers skulking "
"about."
msgstr "내가 옳았다니 기쁘군. 쥐새끼 같은 샤 숭배자들이 사라지면 세상이 한결 살 만해질 것 같거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Lyrthindor
#. NodeID = 2f652919-c7d8-9510-be07-96ffdbe9e4f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:2f652919-c7d8-9510-be07-96ffdbe9e4f7
msgctxt "h5f6a744dg5fb2g4647gb235gaff312a21e1d"
msgid ""
"Lyrthindor - last Dark Justiciar. I kept watch over Lady Shar's temple. Kept "
"the faith alive, after all the others were killed."
msgstr ""
"리씬도르. 마지막 남은 다크 저스티시어다. 샤 여신의 신전을 줄곧 감시해 왔지. 다른 이들이 모두 죽임당한 이후에도 신앙심을 지켜 왔다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Lyrthindor
#. NodeID = 3cd18002-0fb6-a1f6-afa2-30e151fb1ff6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:3cd18002-0fb6-a1f6-afa2-30e151fb1ff6
msgctxt "h5a47c403g3d64g44b5ga98fg51ff00c4c90e"
msgid ""
"My side is <i>dead </i>- just piles of old bones lying in the dark. You're "
"nothing to me!"
msgstr "내 편은 죄다 <i>죽었다</i>. 오래된 뼈 더미로 어둠 속에 누워 있지. 넌 아무것도 아니야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44f1e30f-b7dc-2b03-c6a6-6bfa550e08e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SHAR(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:44f1e30f-b7dc-2b03-c6a6-6bfa550e08e4
msgctxt "h18553b8egcf0cg4df6gbb89gec6c46dbc807"
msgid "Wait - I'm a child of Lady Shar, just like you. We're on the same side."
msgstr "잠깐. 나 또한 샤 여신을 섬기는 아이다. 우린 같은 편이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Lyrthindor
#. NodeID = 48b7d86b-dbb7-33d7-d0eb-66b3d6ba5ca5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:48b7d86b-dbb7-33d7-d0eb-66b3d6ba5ca5
msgctxt "h4f8a1865gf1efg4c2agb611gf6ba5af376de"
msgid ""
"Oh yes there is<i>. </i>All these years, I kept the Dark Lady's faith alive, "
"against the odds, against the <i>devil.</i>"
msgstr ""
"동의하기 힘들군. 오랜 세월, 난 어둠의 여신께 봉헌된 이 신전을 지켜 왔다. 그 모든 역경, 그 모든 <i>데빌</i> 놈들에 맞서!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Lyrthindor
#. NodeID = 4b52f5e6-133e-2930-0647-65959a54aab8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:4b52f5e6-133e-2930-0647-65959a54aab8
msgctxt "h03f95379g4640g4462g8fd8gaaa96ee45a58"
msgid ""
"These hands... too big. Where are the others? <i>Where's the rest of me?!</i>"
msgstr "이 손... 너무 커. 모두 어디 갔어? <i>내 나머지는?!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Lyrthindor
#. NodeID = 6583367c-166e-0ebf-0b28-8a51cd504e0d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:6583367c-166e-0ebf-0b28-8a51cd504e0d
msgctxt "h5f13d6fbgb8fag4389ga3e2gba0287c54107"
msgid ""
"The world will never be rid of us - we are <i>everywhere</i>. But you...? "
"Your miserable tale ends right now."
msgstr ""
"세상은 결코 우릴 없애지 못한다. 우린 <i>어디에나</i> 있으니까 말이지. 하지만 네놈은...? 네 비참한 이야기도 여기서 끝이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66f9f5aa-5129-6c37-b74e-b61bc5c49609
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears_Event_PlayerClaimedIgnorance(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Orthon_Event_SearchPersuasionSuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:66f9f5aa-5129-6c37-b74e-b61bc5c49609
msgctxt "hf1670c9eg50a3g4f6dg9e2dg2f26a7912202"
msgid ""
"You mean Yurgir? I'm telling you, I didn't know. I was just trying to humour "
"him so he'd let me go."
msgstr "그거 유르기르 얘기야? 말해 두는데, 난 몰랐어. 그냥 놈에게서 벗어나려고 비위 좀 맞춰준 게 다야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b82fe80-a8dc-292b-2c88-3eaadce9ddbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears_Event_PlayerClaimedIgnorance(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Orthon_Event_SearchPersuasionSuccess = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:6b82fe80-a8dc-292b-2c88-3eaadce9ddbd
msgctxt "habd69803g750cg45begaf38g4f21331e19fe"
msgid ""
"I'm telling you, I didn't know. There's no need for violence - <i>more "
"</i>violence."
msgstr "말해 두는데, 난 정말 몰랐어. 서로 폭력 행위는 삼가자. <i>더</i> 심각해지기 전에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7af5fdf4-3eb5-97d4-e231-64dbe240b650
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:7af5fdf4-3eb5-97d4-e231-64dbe240b650
msgctxt "h4c09df42g3c80g4eb7g83b4gd1e41e86b5c1"
msgid "Hold on - who are you?"
msgstr "잠깐, 넌 누구야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Lyrthindor
#. NodeID = 85a0af33-7c0c-68f8-b139-4892aed39da2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:85a0af33-7c0c-68f8-b139-4892aed39da2
msgctxt "hf3917cb2gf460g404dgb9d9g06fca28bc746"
msgid ""
"That <i>devil</i>. You should have just ran from him. Now you'll die before "
"me instead."
msgstr "그 <i>데빌</i> 말이군. 놈의 눈에 띄자마자 도망쳤어야지. 대신 내 손에 먼저 죽게 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9738ffb5-4e43-bb99-19a6-eb1c89e8255f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears_Event_PlayerClaimedIgnorance(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Orthon_Event_SearchPersuasionSuccess = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:9738ffb5-4e43-bb99-19a6-eb1c89e8255f
msgctxt "h1ed6ce30gde94g4d35gaa9eg1a7c5c78e0d8"
msgid "I didn't know. There's no need for violence - <i>more </i>violence."
msgstr "난 정말 몰랐어. 서로 폭력 행위는 삼가자. <i>더</i> 심각해지기 전에 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Lyrthindor
#. NodeID = a1207cfe-48e8-95b3-ee65-bb8ca7ff4e59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:a1207cfe-48e8-95b3-ee65-bb8ca7ff4e59
msgctxt "hba7d011agb428g42e1ga32cg1c15606e6daa"
msgid ""
"Such ignorance is unworthy of the Nightsinger's followers. Her church will "
"be stronger once you are dead."
msgstr "나이트싱어의 숭배자들에게 그와 같은 무지가 용납될 거라 생각 마라. 네 죽음으로 그분의 교회는 더 강해질 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b248677f-b9a3-9fd5-52a8-225652798028
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SHAR(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears_Event_PlayerClaimedIgnorance(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:b248677f-b9a3-9fd5-52a8-225652798028
msgctxt "he6d29a21ge459g4d2cg90cdgb2aec5b33b6d"
msgid "Wait - I didn't realise. There's no quarrel between us."
msgstr "잠깐, 정말 몰랐어. 우리끼리 다툴 필요 없다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Lyrthindor
#. NodeID = ba36021f-a5a2-5e88-8ebd-b209ebe02507
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:ba36021f-a5a2-5e88-8ebd-b209ebe02507
msgctxt "ha31b6729g3a49g4d18g827fg60d361acbfec"
msgid ""
"Wrong - you forced my hand. Now I'll make you into an offering for Lady Shar."
msgstr "틀렸다. 모두 네 책임이야. 이제 널 샤 여신께 제물로 바치겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd060808-e3fd-b627-9542-39f66c25c958
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:dd060808-e3fd-b627-9542-39f66c25c958
msgctxt "h684eea02g83e7g4ee1gbd45g5554e089da3e"
msgid "I'm sorry. What more can be said?"
msgstr "미안하군. 무슨 할 말이 더 있겠어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9b57f81-b27c-b90f-904e-755d409c567c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears_Event_PlayerClaimedIgnorance(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Orthon_Event_SearchPersuasionSuccess = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:e9b57f81-b27c-b90f-904e-755d409c567c
msgctxt "h4082361bg043bg461bgbdffg01f2011e16fb"
msgid "I didn't know. I was just trying to humour Yurgir so he'd let me go."
msgstr "정말 몰랐어. 유르기르에게서 벗어나려고 비위 좀 맞춰 줬을 뿐이라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Lyrthindor
#. NodeID = eb5ed4fb-7b98-de59-28be-ab1ef5f5172e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:eb5ed4fb-7b98-de59-28be-ab1ef5f5172e
msgctxt "hd6aa3882gf7ddg4493g8b31g67671f84c6f2"
msgid "Nothing. You had your chance to talk - now you die."
msgstr "없겠지. 대화는 이미 물 건너갔어. 이제 죽어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f7e3dc00-e6f6-0cde-db31-533232dcfa5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:f7e3dc00-e6f6-0cde-db31-533232dcfa5c
msgctxt "heb43f511g1a80g432fg8a0dgae91a9ff33d7"
msgid ""
"Stand down. I completed the rites of this place. I am a Dark Justiciar, same "
"as you."
msgstr "물러서. 난 이 신성한 장소에서 의식을 마쳤다. 너와 마찬가지로 다크 저스티시어가 되었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fed3e581-2f8e-a16f-5e96-60a71970404f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_JusticiarAppears:fed3e581-2f8e-a16f-5e96-60a71970404f
msgctxt "hd297a25fg6ce9g4d4dg99ebg0b9950c5e976"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats:f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
msgctxt "he0d78776gfb92g4f0aga210gc14eafdb3b85"
msgid ""
"Tenacious little runts. They can't keep throwing themselves at me forever... "
"I hope."
msgstr "끈질긴 놈들이군. 언제까지고 이렇게 달려들 순 없겠지... 바라건대."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats:f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
msgctxt "h799d8a45gd655g402cga37dg0fa368004ccf"
msgid "These creatures think numbers alone can daunt me? Never."
msgstr "이놈들은 머릿수가 많다고 내가 겁이라도 먹을 줄 아는 건가? 천만에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats:f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
msgctxt "h2045482bg84f3g470fgb0f8g9ec60502cb2f"
msgid ""
"Quite a host of furry foes. There <i>must</i> be an end to them - have to "
"keep fighting."
msgstr "털복숭이 친구들이 많기도 하군. 언젠가는 <i>분명</i> 끝이 날거야. 계속 싸워야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats:f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
msgctxt "h6072977cgffa9g43ffg8c50gbe401c2cfe27"
msgid ""
"More vermin. Fine - they can keep coming, and I'll just keep on killing."
msgstr "더 많은 쥐라. 뭐, 좋아. 계속 오라고 해. 계속 죽여버리면 되니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats:f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
msgctxt "hf10bef55g8c1fg4569gb061gc7310a0fcc04"
msgid ""
"These rats just keep coming... I can't give up. Overwhelming odds are my "
"bread and butter."
msgstr "쥐들이 끝도 없이 오는군... 물러설 수는 없어. 불리한 싸움이야 내가 밥 먹듯 해 온 일이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats:f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
msgctxt "hc35f829fg954ag46eeg8bd3g2a90cf725335"
msgid "These hairy little shits don't give up easily - but neither do I."
msgstr "털날리는 쥐새끼들 주제에 쉽게 포기를 않네. 나도 만만치 않지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats:f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
msgctxt "h6ab4c5eag51b4g40d7gb4b1gfd212e3988f9"
msgid "The rats' numbers will surely dwindle, so long as I do not give up."
msgstr "쥐들의 수는 곧 줄어들 것이다. 내가 포기하지만 않는다면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats:f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
msgctxt "h9de4fe1cg1ec0g4bf2ga052g69957023cbc1"
msgid ""
"A great horde of rats, but not an endless one, surely. I must keep fighting."
msgstr "대단한 수의 쥐 떼로군. 하지만 분명 한계가 있을 거야. 계속 싸워야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats:f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
msgctxt "h9dd85a74g8ae6g44e8ga363gf158b352c90a"
msgid ""
"I'd prefer larger prey, but I'll slaughter this rat-swarm until we're knee-"
"deep in their blood if I must."
msgstr "좀 더 큰 사냥감이 내 취향이긴 하지만, 필요하다면야 피로 발목이 잠길 때까지 이 쥐 떼를 도륙하겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[9].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_KillRats:f8721202-e4d7-4c33-8096-c31ce1b6fbb2
msgctxt "hdce714a0g79c1g4bfcga415g2d23e02524ac"
msgid "These rats can't keep it up forever - just have to outlast them."
msgstr "이 쥐들도 계속 이럴 수는 없겠지. 어떻게든 버텨내야만 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook:4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
msgctxt "he8af7d00g1093g40d1gbc08g557e6b6f11ed"
msgid "With this spell, one can become legion. So the book claims, at least."
msgstr "이 주문이면, 한 명으로도 군단을 만들 수 있겠군. 적혀 있는 그대로라면 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook:4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
msgctxt "hdc828735gcd11g4b4bgacabg589210e27772"
msgid "So one person could use this spell to become many. Pretty powerful."
msgstr "그러니까 한 사람이 이 주문을 이용해서 여럿이 될 수 있다는 거로군. 아주 강력한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook:4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
msgctxt "hb013e43bg0638g44faga85fgcc66c1537e05"
msgid ""
"A spell to divide one into many... Gosh, I wouldn't know what to do with "
"myself."
msgstr "하나를 여럿으로 나누는 주문이라... 세상에, 날 여럿으로 만든다면 뭐부터 해야 할지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01408d53-95f4-4b9e-b4ec-df55d52fa3b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_Knows_InfernalRitual = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:01408d53-95f4-4b9e-b4ec-df55d52fa3b2
msgctxt "hdd14d1a1gbf9eg4f15gb585gd42eb0136e06"
msgid "An infernal ritual circle... Someone's been very naughty."
msgstr "지옥의 의식 마법진이라... 누군가 아주 못되게 굴었는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook:4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
msgctxt "hd0c565ecg66b9g4fc6gb23dg2e1d339d18ab"
msgid "The spell claims to make many of one. Powerful magic."
msgstr "하나를 여럿으로 만드는 주문이라는데. 강력한 마법이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01408d53-95f4-4b9e-b4ec-df55d52fa3b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_Knows_InfernalRitual = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:01408d53-95f4-4b9e-b4ec-df55d52fa3b2
msgctxt "hb2bc0eecg560cg4a53ga1a2gd485a8ba1428"
msgid "An infernal ritual circle, I think."
msgstr "내 생각에는, 지옥의 의식 마법진 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook:4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
msgctxt "h8ed566begc32cg4cb4g9f8fgbb19f6ea3afb"
msgid ""
"A spell to turn one into many. Could come in handy, especially when I get "
"back to my reading list..."
msgstr "하나를 여럿으로 만드는 주문이라니. 유용할지도 모르겠군. 읽어야 할 책들이 워낙 많다 보니..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01408d53-95f4-4b9e-b4ec-df55d52fa3b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_Knows_InfernalRitual = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:01408d53-95f4-4b9e-b4ec-df55d52fa3b2
msgctxt "h8bc379e3g5738g4a8dg9f1bgf22822611d9c"
msgid ""
"A ritual circle, chalked in the manner of the hells. What infernal purpose "
"did it serve?"
msgstr "지옥 방식으로 그린 의식 마법진이야. 어떤 지옥같은 목적이었을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook:4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
msgctxt "hfc36253fg8510g4860g9f9aga661f268f1ad"
msgid "This spell... it claims to divide an individual into a whole crowd."
msgstr "이 주문... 한 명을 여럿으로 나눌 수 있다는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01408d53-95f4-4b9e-b4ec-df55d52fa3b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_Knows_InfernalRitual = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:01408d53-95f4-4b9e-b4ec-df55d52fa3b2
msgctxt "h193c69f5gc038g4ddfga2bag819fa39c89ad"
msgid "A ritual circle - and an infernal one at that. What's it doing here...?"
msgstr "의식 마법진이네. 게다가 지옥 것이고. 여기서 뭘 하고 있지...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook:4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
msgctxt "h767beddcg9fc8g4db1gaceeg30ec436d9801"
msgid "A magic incantation. One that can turn an individual into a horde..."
msgstr "마법적인 환생이야. 한 개인을 한 무리로 만드는..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01408d53-95f4-4b9e-b4ec-df55d52fa3b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_Knows_InfernalRitual = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:01408d53-95f4-4b9e-b4ec-df55d52fa3b2
msgctxt "h904b32a9g26aag4336ga0c7ge17c1aa2f94c"
msgid ""
"A ritual circle - and not of this plane, either. Infernal, I would guess."
msgstr "의식 마법진이고, 이 차원에 속한 물건도 아니야. 추측하건대, 지옥이겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualBook:4168e79e-6f12-457c-ab80-8aba6dd8f647
msgctxt "hb944107agb655g4feega9b4g0647d6c2eb60"
msgid ""
"This speaks of magic that can divide someone into many... but many "
"<i>what?</i>"
msgstr "누군가를 복수로 만드는 마법이라고 적혀 있어... 하지만 복수의 <i>무엇</i>으로 만든다는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 01408d53-95f4-4b9e-b4ec-df55d52fa3b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_Knows_InfernalRitual = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:01408d53-95f4-4b9e-b4ec-df55d52fa3b2
msgctxt "h768c3a76g689bg4ffcg9d8fg4754fa417f06"
msgid "A ritual circle. Seems to be infernal in nature."
msgstr "의식 마법진이군. 지옥 것 같아 보여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6100d53d-9ea7-aafc-f88b-458bf08403de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:6100d53d-9ea7-aafc-f88b-458bf08403de
msgctxt "hf45637b0g97bag40bfgbe9fg1ba63f7348e6"
msgid "Infernal ritual markings. Ugh, what's waiting for us?"
msgstr "지옥의 의식을 위한 표식이잖아. 윽, 도대체 우릴 기다리는 게 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83894a60-8ef1-395d-2de1-d58268d643c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:83894a60-8ef1-395d-2de1-d58268d643c3
msgctxt "he97fe77agc297g4461g99bcgca86313cbd7a"
msgid ""
"An infernal circle, used for the casting of the Hells' most diabolical magic."
msgstr "지옥의 원형진이로군, 지옥의 가장 사악한 마법을 시전하기 위해 쓰이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af915679-af03-48c6-ad06-f4a087265341
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:af915679-af03-48c6-ad06-f4a087265341
msgctxt "hc60018d2gb530g4121g8e0dg019d79dc7f59"
msgid "What odd markings. Ritualistic, perhaps."
msgstr "이상한 표식이네. 아마 의식 같은 거에 쓰이는 거 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af915679-af03-48c6-ad06-f4a087265341
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:af915679-af03-48c6-ad06-f4a087265341
msgctxt "hd1291205gb593g4948gb19dg9a93c9084d99"
msgid "Hm. Markings for some manner of ritual."
msgstr "흠. 어떤 의식을 위해 그린 표식이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af915679-af03-48c6-ad06-f4a087265341
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:af915679-af03-48c6-ad06-f4a087265341
msgctxt "hdd30b761g1affg42efgb6d7g57b618fc6a20"
msgid "A ritual circle, though for what purpose I haven't the foggiest."
msgstr "의식 마법진이군, 그 목적은 잘 모르겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af915679-af03-48c6-ad06-f4a087265341
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:af915679-af03-48c6-ad06-f4a087265341
msgctxt "hba2ad6c0g4832g4e93gb52ag562cb1220894"
msgid "Some sort of ritual circle... but not one that belongs here."
msgstr "일종의 의식 마법진이야... 하지만 이곳에 어울리진 않는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af915679-af03-48c6-ad06-f4a087265341
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:af915679-af03-48c6-ad06-f4a087265341
msgctxt "h2ba2a963gdd10g4087gb344g6e9171f13071"
msgid "The hallmarks of a ritual... but not one I am familiar with."
msgstr "의식을 위한 각인이군... 내가 아는 종류는 아닐세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = af915679-af03-48c6-ad06-f4a087265341
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_PAD_RitualCircle:af915679-af03-48c6-ad06-f4a087265341
msgctxt "hdcc090beg1563g4e1egaa20g48dc8023a5b4"
msgid "What's this? For a ritual of some sort?"
msgstr "이게 뭐지? 뭔가 의식을 위한 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Rat
#. NodeID = 070c03f4-337e-9b10-7c62-03e9c9d434b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:070c03f4-337e-9b10-7c62-03e9c9d434b6
msgctxt "h87bb15d2gadbdg45b1g8932g87fc389c9a24"
msgid ""
"Talking of you - intruder, invader, unworthy one! These halls are not for "
"<i>you!</i>"
msgstr "네놈을 말하는 거다, 침입자, 침략자, 자격 없는 놈! 이 전당은 <i>네놈</i>을 위한 곳이 아니야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0fccb56d-a2d7-2c75-07a7-2ab0b744b87b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:0fccb56d-a2d7-2c75-07a7-2ab0b744b87b
msgctxt "hc06a1608g9251g4333gbbecg8dd8ce2d8348"
msgid "<i>Study the rat's ki to see the source of its aggression. </i>"
msgstr "<i>쥐의 기에서 공격성의 원인을 찾아본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Rat
#. NodeID = 1abc027a-062a-1724-fe3f-4e1f9e78bb1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - df19817d-fc15-a495-a022-40aadef838cc_B = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - df19817d-fc15-a495-a022-40aadef838cc_C = True
#.     - df19817d-fc15-a495-a022-40aadef838cc_B = False
#.   Object:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_State_Knows_WeirdRatBehaviour(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:1abc027a-062a-1724-fe3f-4e1f9e78bb1b
msgctxt "h02774430ge1e2g4396gbccdg24a498f5b8bb"
msgid "Unworthy of dark cloak! Unworthy of dark fur! <i>Unworthy!</i>"
msgstr "어둠의 장막을 쓸 자격이 없다! 어둠의 모피를 쓸 자격이 없다! <i>자격이 없다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1ebafba9-335c-3d88-3f4c-18d5bcfcb9d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_InsightSuccess(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:1ebafba9-335c-3d88-3f4c-18d5bcfcb9d9
msgctxt "hd3f23b43g0533g4ba4g93cag94f3c46d5de3"
msgid ""
"*The rat isn't merely territorial - it's proud. This place means a great "
"deal to it.*"
msgstr "*쥐는 그저 영역을 지키는 게 아니라, 자랑스러워 하고 있습니다. 이 곳은 쥐에게 매우 중요한 장소입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 20b5c908-547d-4a2f-bae6-6b489e504bae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_CompanionSuggestsLeave(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:20b5c908-547d-4a2f-bae6-6b489e504bae
msgctxt "h65777fc5g0281g4220gab89g8f4b382e0d51"
msgid "That sounded like a threat. I like threats."
msgstr "위협하는 것 처럼 들리는데. 난 오히려 좋아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Rat
#. NodeID = 21c280bf-43fd-2701-eec1-0e99d95a8a22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - df19817d-fc15-a495-a022-40aadef838cc_C = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - df19817d-fc15-a495-a022-40aadef838cc_C = False
#.     - df19817d-fc15-a495-a022-40aadef838cc_D = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:21c280bf-43fd-2701-eec1-0e99d95a8a22
msgctxt "h812f3fc1g017eg40dbgae73g88aee4dcd34b"
msgid "This is the path of heroes! Your feet sully it."
msgstr "여기는 영웅의 길이다! 네 발이 길을 더럽히고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 23986d30-8d19-413b-a30a-c0d85a74bb6d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:23986d30-8d19-413b-a30a-c0d85a74bb6d
msgctxt "he7dc5fabg41e1g4b8fga3aag98b5b624ec3e"
msgid "That's a mean ol' rat. Wonder what's bothering it."
msgstr "아주 못된 쥐잖아. 대체 왜 저러는 건지 궁금하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2a8f8522-46d5-5929-b9b6-8a8207f27a8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:2a8f8522-46d5-5929-b9b6-8a8207f27a8b
msgctxt "h70bdd8fcg5f6ag4a41g98c3g87716567dd03"
msgid ""
"*Rats have ki, like all living things. But it is not usually this frenetic. "
"Or powerful.*"
msgstr "*쥐에게서 기가 느껴집니다. 생명체라면 다 있지만, 보통은 이처럼 요동치지도, 강하지도 않습니다.* "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2c63af55-d171-2335-07f3-067e961b51c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_AttemptedInsightCheck(1) = False
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_State_Knows_WeirdRatBehaviour(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_AttemptedInsightCheck(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:2c63af55-d171-2335-07f3-067e961b51c8
msgctxt "h17dba371g313ag44acgbc53g3430562862c1"
msgid "<i>Consider the rat's tone, and choice of words.</i>"
msgstr "<i>쥐의 말투와 어휘에 대해 생각해 봅니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e1fcb38-579f-09e4-d5c4-60d85a568135
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_AskedWhatItMeans(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_AskedWhatItMeans(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:2e1fcb38-579f-09e4-d5c4-60d85a568135
msgctxt "h22fed154g0ca4g4decg8798g50eff6d30c1a"
msgid "Calm down. What are you talking about?"
msgstr "진정해. 무슨 얘길 하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ae2b08a-f3e0-efe7-cba0-3a9223be57fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_ToldBackOff(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_ToldBackOff(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:3ae2b08a-f3e0-efe7-cba0-3a9223be57fa
msgctxt "ha97bed60g62d5g4b31g9ba1gdc756ab2dc16"
msgid "Back off, or I'll be scraping your guts off my heel in a moment."
msgstr "물러서지 않으면 곧 신발에 묻은 네 내장을 털어낼 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 3d2f91e6-d923-4e2b-842c-12ed58cade81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_CompanionSuggestsLeave(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:3d2f91e6-d923-4e2b-842c-12ed58cade81
msgctxt "h269a7152ga135g444dgb0e2gb5b9ee224b49"
msgid "A rat with delusions of grandeur. A bit like the gods themselves."
msgstr "위엄을 뽐내려고 애쓰는 쥐라니. 마치 신들을 보는 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 3e1d10cb-7728-47a4-be3d-add257e294a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:3e1d10cb-7728-47a4-be3d-add257e294a3
msgctxt "h961f1d33g3ff2g4325ga16bg1c52fed33897"
msgid ""
"Spiteful little lad. Hint of malice in its eyes, too. That's not normal, is "
"it?"
msgstr "쬐끄만게 앙칼지네. 눈에서 적의가 느껴져. 이거 정상 아니지, 그치?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3f84c9e9-a016-1ea5-4d4b-731bd33013c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_AnimalHandlingSuccees(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:3f84c9e9-a016-1ea5-4d4b-731bd33013c8
msgctxt "h5958463cg7ca9g4b2egb586g607e457759b2"
msgid "*The rat holds its ground. It almost seems <i>defiant</i>.*"
msgstr "*쥐는 버티고 있습니다. <i>도전적으로</i> 보이기까지 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 43366012-a414-4c6e-a74e-90bf7339c103
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:43366012-a414-4c6e-a74e-90bf7339c103
msgctxt "hc1425900g7467g47ecg923dg3d701dec8887"
msgid "<i>Chk. </i>That rat's about to bite off more than it can chew."
msgstr "<i>츠크. </i>쥐 주제에 앞뒤 안 가리고 물어뜯을 기세로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43696281-786f-6c9f-d922-fb898d4e8ae3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_AttemptedAnimalHandling(1) = False
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_State_Knows_WeirdRatBehaviour(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_AttemptedAnimalHandling(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:43696281-786f-6c9f-d922-fb898d4e8ae3
msgctxt "h371e1507gd818g492agb65ag1585db208a54"
msgid "<i>Study the rat's behaviour.</i>"
msgstr "<i>쥐의 행동을 연구한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 4515e005-c68b-4fe4-9dcf-08251df3d47c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_CompanionSuggestsLeave(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:4515e005-c68b-4fe4-9dcf-08251df3d47c
msgctxt "h48a16a35g62d1g43e7gbea8g25f2e872fc62"
msgid "That rodent's got the spirit of a centaur. I've got to respect it."
msgstr "설치류의 몸에 켄타우로스의 혼이라도 깃든 모양이군. 기개는 대단하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 557823ae-ad21-d8d2-f8ec-dbdf0f2b4a2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_AnimalHandlingSuccees(1) = True
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Knows_RatsUncooperative(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Knows_RatsUncooperative(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:557823ae-ad21-d8d2-f8ec-dbdf0f2b4a2b
msgctxt "h30ae7e06g5d90g4ee7g9a7eg8f8ff2276fe7"
msgid "<i>Extend a hand to the rat. Show you mean no harm.</i>"
msgstr "<i>쥐에게 손을 내민다. 해를 끼칠 의도가 없음을 보여준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5cf492e2-d99f-1d75-d3bb-2681fa9ee541
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:5cf492e2-d99f-1d75-d3bb-2681fa9ee541
msgctxt "h270fe77ega90eg44aeg98d5gf2a538a83cf4"
msgid ""
"*The rat has a thick coat and dark, staring eyes. Old, but in good health.*"
msgstr "*쥐의 털은 두껍고, 어두운 두 눈은 흔들림이 없습니다. 쥐는 늙었으나, 건강합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Rat
#. NodeID = 5ee61a5e-d67f-64f0-308e-fe2d2b18f236
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - df19817d-fc15-a495-a022-40aadef838cc_A = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - df19817d-fc15-a495-a022-40aadef838cc_A = False
#.     - df19817d-fc15-a495-a022-40aadef838cc_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:5ee61a5e-d67f-64f0-308e-fe2d2b18f236
msgctxt "h80149906g0ef0g4debgb8b0g3441d20eb3a8"
msgid "We outnumber you, leave me be!"
msgstr "우리가 수적으로 우세하다, 날 내버려 둬!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Rat
#. NodeID = 5fd39b1e-77cc-c9e6-adc3-e9f41d47ec34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - df19817d-fc15-a495-a022-40aadef838cc_D = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - df19817d-fc15-a495-a022-40aadef838cc_E = True
#.     - df19817d-fc15-a495-a022-40aadef838cc_D = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:5fd39b1e-77cc-c9e6-adc3-e9f41d47ec34
msgctxt "h02e73928g86a8g44d3gbb43g3de6612330fe"
msgid "Two legs. Too familiar."
msgstr "두 다리. 아주 익숙해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 6902a8e0-6ec2-4fca-adcc-f726acf832af
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:6902a8e0-6ec2-4fca-adcc-f726acf832af
msgctxt "h4a7848ddg707cg4c4fg9afagd0aa4fb00a4f"
msgid "The blighter's worked up. Wonder what's got under its skin?"
msgstr "저 녀석 흥분한 것 같은데. 대체 뭐 때문에 저러는 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 6e9fef03-e1ac-4d3c-b6f6-28b66ba3ce24
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm:6e9fef03-e1ac-4d3c-b6f6-28b66ba3ce24
msgctxt "hf8adf082g4ce0g4e2cgb824g60ced6355269"
msgid "A rodent with an attitude. Not unlike a few githyanki I've known."
msgstr "반항심 넘치는 설치류라. 내가 알던 몇 안 되는 기스양키도 저랬지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 70663da4-0ab2-894c-859c-edd5cbdc519b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsCalm_Event_AttemptedNatureCheck(1) = False
