#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:80956d14-cf98-b912-474b-3cbe56915a69
msgctxt "h11013571g1c5eg4486gaaa3gb360d0ca9542"
msgid "These rats paint a vivid picture, do they not?"
msgstr "이 쥐들은 꽤 생생한 그림을 그려주는군, 안 그런가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Rat
#. NodeID = 8763bbb4-cbf1-cd3d-449e-c7e35b1e140d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - a7515c86-de40-c19f-34fb-2dd693bbb8b2_B = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a7515c86-de40-c19f-34fb-2dd693bbb8b2_C = True
#.     - a7515c86-de40-c19f-34fb-2dd693bbb8b2_B = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:8763bbb4-cbf1-cd3d-449e-c7e35b1e140d
msgctxt "h606b9838g7ee0g4638g8db1g250cd9330134"
msgid "Another hunter, taking pieces of me. Hide. HIDE!"
msgstr "또 다른 사냥꾼이야, 나랑 싸우려고 해. 숨어. <b>숨어!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 88e47aef-c784-1bb0-2701-44e82a029f36
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:88e47aef-c784-1bb0-2701-44e82a029f36
msgctxt "h157b51aegdd16g44fcg871fgbae4021c5141"
msgid "And it is the rats, to be clear. The rats sound smarter."
msgstr "바뀐 건 쥐들 쪽이야, 확실히 해두자고. 쥐들이 똑똑해진 거라고. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 8f2425a9-c15e-6f34-ceae-62c29a3377cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:8f2425a9-c15e-6f34-ceae-62c29a3377cc
msgctxt "h2fc0109cgaf9eg4c72gb1cfg09155b094106"
msgid "*The rat issues a defensive, high-pitch squeak.*"
msgstr "*쥐는 방어적이고 높은 찍 소리를 냅니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9f9c4dca-da68-152b-f5ad-a0c54437ec1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:9f9c4dca-da68-152b-f5ad-a0c54437ec1c
msgctxt "h255a1c29g4db1g45afg93feg94ed53fc2e0f"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Rat
#. NodeID = 9fbcfef2-a497-6127-f3c5-1df854001e56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a7515c86-de40-c19f-34fb-2dd693bbb8b2_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:9fbcfef2-a497-6127-f3c5-1df854001e56
msgctxt "h781eeb90g5077g4830g8c4eg93d0f55eec1e"
msgid ""
"My head's too full. It wants to burst - this is <i>your </i>fault. You slew "
"my kin!"
msgstr "머리가 가득 찼어. 터져버릴 것 같아, 이건 <i>네</i> 탓이야. 우리 동족을 죽였어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Rat
#. NodeID = a108b98e-31ac-edd7-9dce-cf2df2359f4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:a108b98e-31ac-edd7-9dce-cf2df2359f4b
msgctxt "hb9e94847g4fb2g4176gab42g560732c86ad3"
msgid ""
"Very ordinary. But one of many - leave us be or we'll gnaw your rotten bones "
"in the dark!"
msgstr "아주 평범하지. 하지만 나는 일부일 뿐, 우릴 내버려 두지 않으면 어둠 속에서 네 썩은 뼈를 갉아주겠어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = ad76a69a-f099-4f82-a73a-46f4d6b0b9d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked_Event_CompanionInclusionTriggered(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:ad76a69a-f099-4f82-a73a-46f4d6b0b9d9
msgctxt "h184eef5cg36e4g45f7gbd41gc00624f89186"
msgid ""
"I'm not imagining it, am I? These rats seem to be getting more articulate."
msgstr "내가 망상을 하는 건 아니겠지? 이 쥐들은 갈수록 더 말을 잘하는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Rat
#. NodeID = c4378005-ed76-ee0e-2114-fd6e7640ee84
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - a7515c86-de40-c19f-34fb-2dd693bbb8b2_A = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - a7515c86-de40-c19f-34fb-2dd693bbb8b2_B = True
#.     - a7515c86-de40-c19f-34fb-2dd693bbb8b2_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:c4378005-ed76-ee0e-2114-fd6e7640ee84
msgctxt "h37437cd7gef2bg4110gb21eg9a6aad913ef0"
msgid "Save yourselves! Sacrifice yourselves! Run! Fight! Hide! Bite!"
msgstr "네 목숨을 챙겨! 네 목숨을 바쳐! 도망쳐! 싸워! 숨어! 물어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = c49badce-a389-46ad-89fb-176a6a08174f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked_Event_CompanionInclusionTriggered(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:c49badce-a389-46ad-89fb-176a6a08174f
msgctxt "h8c5963cegfe27g4f89g8ea8g623862f66ae5"
msgid ""
"I'm not imagining it, am I? These rats' grasp of language seems to be "
"improving."
msgstr "내가 지금 망상을 하는 건 아니겠지? 이 쥐들의 언어 능력이 향상되고 있는 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ca1c32c8-a6b9-a5c4-8283-074b2efc727c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:ca1c32c8-a6b9-a5c4-8283-074b2efc727c
msgctxt "h316d99abga25eg44f5g907eg4e2088c0ebb6"
msgid "*The rat stares, ever so slightly calmed.*"
msgstr "*쥐가 쳐다봅니다, 아주 조금 진정한 듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Rat
#. NodeID = d1a2e238-9ffb-f6d2-a846-99b4943fa9cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:d1a2e238-9ffb-f6d2-a846-99b4943fa9cb
msgctxt "ha52fd454g0961g4552g8c86gce5f778c52e2"
msgid "I remember hands. Why do I remember <i>having hands?</i>"
msgstr "손을 기억해. 왜 <i>손을 가졌던 걸</i> 기억하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d9977550-1c10-34ce-61b0-f3761039a593
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked_State_AskedRatsUpset(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked_State_AskedRatsUpset(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:d9977550-1c10-34ce-61b0-f3761039a593
msgctxt "h1dbdde1cge6e2g429fg957dg35ab69d1c157"
msgid ""
"You're upset about your fellow rats' deaths? I didn't expect such compassion "
"from vermin."
msgstr "다른 쥐들의 죽음에 기분이 상한 거야? 쥐가 이런 연민을 느낄 줄이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e6126a23-2a00-cd06-2edc-76bdf4c39adf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TemporaryHostilityAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:e6126a23-2a00-cd06-2edc-76bdf4c39adf
msgctxt "h41f675d9gec5fg453dg8cecg5e9552737eb8"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = e9a5c7d1-c158-4b13-80fb-d6a15c2e2eb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
