msgctxt "h0ecd002dgefd3g4cbag8879ga51daeb817c8"
msgid ""
"*The rat seems agitated, afraid. It must know that you killed some of its "
"peers.*"
msgstr "*쥐는 겁에 질려 동요하고 있는 것 같습니다. 당신이 동료 쥐들을 죽였다는 사실을 알고 있는 게 분명합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fbb1be44-3a53-886b-98c0-033c4259ae50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsPanicked:fbb1be44-3a53-886b-98c0-033c4259ae50
msgctxt "h0f36c4b8gd609g43fag83bfgcf9583cd30fe"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsUltimatum
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2486284e-770a-e01d-d5b5-d1b3658a1c25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsUltimatum:2486284e-770a-e01d-d5b5-d1b3658a1c25
msgctxt "h2373ab2fg0da0g43baga1f4g0677845b10c0"
msgid "*The rat utters a defiant hiss. Bloodlust fills its little black eyes.*"
msgstr "*쥐가 반항적인 울음소리를 냅니다. 작고 검은 두 눈이 피의 욕망으로 물듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsUltimatum
#. Speaker = Rat
#. NodeID = 774700ea-422c-047e-d35a-40dab1c2fe4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PETPAL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_LastJusticiar_RatsUltimatum:774700ea-422c-047e-d35a-40dab1c2fe4a
msgctxt "h7b08e31dg8c44g4adeg810bgc7bc5bca9efe"
msgid ""
"I pleaded, I bargained, I warned. You didn't listen - you made me remember "
"again, hurt again. I am coming for you - <i>all of me</i>."
msgstr ""
"빌어도 봤고, 제안도 해봤고, 경고도 했다. 근데 넌 듣지 않았지. 또다시 기억하게 했어. 날 아프게 했어. 이젠 내가 상대해 주겠다. "
"<i>내 전부가</i>."

