msgctxt "hda52fc82g94d7g4982gbabag32b93d2914c9"
msgid "That disc looks like it can move - but where does it lead?"
msgstr "저 원판 움직일 것처럼 생겼네. 하지만 어디로 이어질까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundDisc
