msgctxt "h71096450g8b11g47dega04cg38277da54b1f"
msgid "We should see where it brings us."
msgstr "보면 알겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundDisc_2Players
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90bc4890-500a-4084-8994-ebbf5f78dea4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundDisc_2Players:90bc4890-500a-4084-8994-ebbf5f78dea4
msgctxt "he11b9ee5gaf06g430aga76cgd11959064206"
msgid "Yeah, but where's it lead?"
msgstr "그래, 근데 어디로 가지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundDisc_2Players
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90bc4890-500a-4084-8994-ebbf5f78dea4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundDisc_2Players:90bc4890-500a-4084-8994-ebbf5f78dea4
msgctxt "h98bed780g7e35g46degbb42ga662fe8ef250"
msgid "Only one way to find out where it leads to..."
msgstr "어디로 가는지 알 유일한 방법은..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundDisc_2Players
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90bc4890-500a-4084-8994-ebbf5f78dea4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundDisc_2Players:90bc4890-500a-4084-8994-ebbf5f78dea4
msgctxt "h88cedf95g2213g4d29gb536g5eed07ba6ded"
msgid "Where will it bring us, though?"
msgstr "근데 어디로 가는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
msgctxt "h62e15eedg2144g4749ga2e0gd559a1f14683"
msgid ""
"Isobel? Ketheric's daughter, no doubt. Let's hope the apple fell far from "
"the twisted, cursed tree."
msgstr "이소벨? 케서릭의 딸이 맞는 것 같다. 뒤틀리고 저주내린 나무에서 멀리 떨어진 사과이길 바라야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
msgctxt "h52bbfb1cgd05ag4817gb953g2d5a103a9362"
msgid "Ketheric has a daughter - Isobel. What's become of her?"
msgstr "케서릭에게 이소벨이라는 딸이 있어. 어떻게 되었을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
msgctxt "h33acd340gf20dg4532ga753g41df5f35950a"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm had a daughter? I hope she didn't follow in daddy's "
"footsteps..."
msgstr "케서릭에게 딸이 있었네? 아버지처럼 되지 않았기를...."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
msgctxt "h1b054676g0a17g406bg9fc9g2981b2596752"
msgid "Ketheric Thorm had a daughter? I wonder what happened."
msgstr "케서릭이 딸이 있었어? 어떻게 되었나 궁금하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
msgctxt "hd03d3a42g9372g4a67g8240gabe04b4d1fa0"
msgid "Isobel? So Ketheric has a daughter. Is she still alive, I wonder?"
msgstr "이소벨? 케서릭한테 딸이 있었네. 아직 살아있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
msgctxt "h94fb33c7gae48g46e9ga84agd12d0f1d0e84"
msgid "Ketheric had a daughter. Wonder if she was lost to the shadows."
msgstr "케서릭에겐 딸이 있었어. 그림자에 먹혀버린 건 아닌지 궁금하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
msgctxt "hac48bd67g820eg47cegad84g0893c46763bd"
msgid "Ketheric Thorm's daughter. Her death compelled his descent into evil."
msgstr "케서릭의 딸. 그녀의 죽음이 그를 악으로 가라앉게 만들었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
msgctxt "h3cc5147fg8268g4613gbe01ga12927b1dafa"
msgid ""
"Ketheric had a daughter? I wonder if she is a creature of dust and bone as "
"well."
msgstr "케서릭에게 딸이 있었어? 그녀도 아버지처럼 먼지와 뼈로 된 피조물일까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = False
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:3ce6dba2-aaf3-4471-9fd3-4be638c69fb7
msgctxt "hba91e3e2g6b40g47d1g8871g3aaaa316d23a"
msgid "So Ketheric had a daughter. Wonder what became of her?"
msgstr "Ketheric에게 딸이 있었나 보네. 딸은 어떻게 됐을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
msgctxt "h271b9e62gbc99g49eegb5dfg858802ce83d3"
msgid "If she's Isobel Thorm - Ketheric is her father? Is that even possible?"
msgstr "이소벨 쏨이라면, 케서릭이 아버지야? 말이 돼?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
msgctxt "ha0b86f79g7700g432cg8055g2758a96812aa"
msgid "So Isobel is Isobel Thorm? Such a thing should not be possible..."
msgstr "그러니까 이소벨은 이소벨 쏨이다? 말이 안 되는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
msgctxt "h658e934fg8929g4ad7g8db3g82001e524445"
msgid ""
"So she is the blood of Ketheric Thorm. Even Selûne's faithful have their "
"secrets, it seems."
msgstr "그러니까 케서릭 쏨의 혈육이라는 거네. 셀루네의 종에게도 비밀은 있나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
msgctxt "hb4167111gc626g40dega3d6g391bf28695e5"
msgid "So she is a Thorm - as in, <i>Ketheric</i> Thorm."
msgstr "즉, 이소벨은 <i>케서릭</i>의 가족이란 말이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
msgctxt "hb3399541gaecbg4ea9g9bd8gf5f0021d45af"
msgid "Does this mean she is Ketheric Thorm's daughter? But she's alive..."
msgstr "케서릭의 딸이란 소리야? 하지만 그녀는 살아있잖아..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
msgctxt "he9326b6bgc02cg4b24gb0b7g1d578f139fb0"
msgid "She can't be Isobel Thorm - can she? Ketheric's daughter?"
msgstr "이소벨 쏨일 리 없어, 아닌가? 케서릭의 딸일까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
msgctxt "h16b21db4g47cdg4ec6ga0adgd5fd726b5133"
msgid "A coincidence surely... or perhaps not."
msgstr "우연이겠지... 정말일 수도 있고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
msgctxt "hb6fd37ccg1118g4b9fg8ff1gce068bc0a98d"
msgid ""
"How deliciously strange it would be for a daughter of Ketheric to be a "
"virtuous servant of light."
msgstr "케서릭의 딸이 고결한 빛의 사제라면 그것참 묘한 일이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:8d65f827-bd88-4a17-9c89-096ca09e0035
msgctxt "h4ddc551bg4f6dg4c58g95a0gbb4d68940b9c"
msgid "Can she possibly be Ketheric's daughter?"
msgstr "그 여자가 케서릭의 딸일 수가 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
msgctxt "he10d7dc8g1dedg473bg8bfdg4676603d40ec"
msgid "Isobel? As in 'the cleric from Last Light' Isobel?"
msgstr "이소벨이라고? '최후의 빛의 그 클레릭' 이소벨?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
msgctxt "he20e25a3ge5f3g4a1fg810cg52356565646a"
msgid "Isobel - the cleric at Last Light?"
msgstr "이소벨이라니, 우리가 만난 그 클레릭?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
msgctxt "h6f27b53fg8af8g4e7bg81acg55f5f3594bd6"
msgid "Isobel... isn't that the name of the Last Light's cleric protector?"
msgstr "이소벨이면... 최후의 빛을 지키는 그 클레릭 이름 아냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
msgctxt "h71abd550gd873g4ed2gbe1dg73604e3fcfdc"
msgid "Isobel... the Selûnite cleric from Last Light?"
msgstr "이소벨... 최후에 빛에 있던 그 셀루네의 클레릭?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
msgctxt "hf908b91fg4229g4240g8e27gec829371f559"
msgid "Isobel? Isn't that the cleric of Selûne at Last Light?"
msgstr "이소벨? 최후의 빛에 있는 셀루네의 클레릭 아냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
msgctxt "h69997c07g011cg4e08g9924gb1594a9f8f19"
msgid "Isobel. Isn't that the name of the cleric at Last Light?"
msgstr "이소벨. 최후의 빛에 있던 그 클레릭 이름 아냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
msgctxt "h0930b36bg068bg4834g9b5fg13330faf3442"
msgid ""
"Ketheric's late daughter. <i>Isobel</i>... the name of the cleric at Last "
"Light?"
msgstr "케서릭의 죽은 딸. <i>이소벨</i>... 최후의 빛에 있던 클레릭 이름이잖아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_TakingIsobel_HasMet_Isobel = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
msgctxt "h3fb40f2dg1f5ag414cg9427g3d4b33f53d49"
msgid "Isobel. That is the name of the Selunite cleric at Last Light Inn."
msgstr "이소벨. 최후의 빛 여관에 있던 셀루네의 클레릭 이름이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
