#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:bf330170-0051-4ea9-b16c-5ae277653ec6
msgctxt "h395e0a7fg1db3g4c2agb104g0fc33a2b80e4"
msgid "Isobel. That's the name of the cleric at Last Light Inn, right?"
msgstr "이소벨? 최후의 빛 여관에서 만난 그 클레릭 이름이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Isobel_KnowsKethericFather = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
msgctxt "h5d119a8cge9c6g4982gbeb4g770fd95c7b8b"
msgid ""
"So this is where Isobel was resting before Daddy Ketheric brought her back."
msgstr "그럼 여긴 이소벨이 잠들어 있던 곳이구나. 케서릭이 되살려내기 전까지 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Isobel_KnowsKethericFather = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
msgctxt "hc8f7f611g528cg48c1g81fag2e7ea1914bfe"
msgid ""
"Isobel's final resting place. Well, not <i>that</i> final, once Ketheric "
"came back for her..."
msgstr "이소벨의 마지막 안식처로군. 글쎄, <i>진짜</i> 마지막은 아니었지. 케서릭이 그녀를 위해 돌아왔으니..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Isobel_KnowsKethericFather = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
msgctxt "ha4daacabg550ag4d3cg9e63ga51abb9d1456"
msgid "Ah - this Isobel's resting place before Ketheric resurrected her."
msgstr "이소벨이 안식을 취하던 곳이로군. 케서릭이 부활시키기 전까지 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Isobel_KnowsKethericFather = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
msgctxt "h8f7677a6g04d9g400cgb7aag6c142091d77b"
msgid ""
"This must be where Isobel was interred before... before Ketheric brought her "
"back."
msgstr "여기가 이소벨이 매장된 곳이었겠군... 케서릭이 되살려내기 전까진 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Isobel_KnowsKethericFather = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
msgctxt "h741a49a2gcbc1g44a9g840bgf1f82515dee4"
msgid ""
"Isobel's not-so-final resting place. Ketheric Thorm has a problem with "
"letting things die."
msgstr "이소벨의 마지막 안식처라고 여겨졌던 곳이군. 케서릭 쏨은 뭔가가 죽는 걸 못 견뎌 하는 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Isobel_KnowsKethericFather = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
msgctxt "h5b8cafcag1826g4b10gadb4g8d01adba60c4"
msgid ""
"Isobel's grave. Before Ketheric wrenched her back into the land of the "
"living."
msgstr "이소벨의 무덤이군. 케서릭이 산 자들의 땅으로 끄집어내 버렸지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Isobel_KnowsKethericFather = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
msgctxt "h7bc094bdg4bfeg4a4fg859fg4c9ea7c72685"
msgid "Isobel's tomb. But her father would not let her rest."
msgstr "이소벨의 무덤이군. 비록 아버지 때문에 안식은 없었지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Isobel_KnowsKethericFather = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
msgctxt "h86f48d29g6220g4cbag82fcg7d7f551a63db"
msgid "Isobel's tomb. The very one that Ketheric raised her from."
msgstr "이소벨의 무덤이군. 케서릭이 바로 여기서 그녀를 일으켰지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Isobel_KnowsKethericFather = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_FoundIsobelsPlaque:cc687a6c-6fa9-49a3-9197-3cf819d660a5
msgctxt "h54ff2941g7c98g4c97g94fbg8386f87ab07b"
msgid "Isobel's sarcophagus. Before Ketheric brought her back."
msgstr "이소벨의 석관이군. 케서릭이 되살려낸 덕에 그 주인을 잃었지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap:95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
msgctxt "hc3541865gb1bfg4cecga7c1g33b9d7b2f446"
msgid "So, there's a whole temple down there. With something lurking inside."
msgstr "아래 신전이 통째로 있다는 말이군. 숨어있는 무언가도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap:95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
msgctxt "h926e3c89g1600g4f8cg8358g19850235d0dc"
msgid ""
"This map shows a temple of Shar. Seems to highlight some great danger within."
msgstr "지도는 샤 신전을 나타내는군. 내부에 커다란 위험 요소가 있는 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap:95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
msgctxt "h7f4e49f4g3beag4eb8g999dg3a8528870170"
msgid ""
"There's a temple down there?! And something lurking in there, too. "
"Fascinating."
msgstr "저기 아래 신전이 있다고?! 뭔가 숨어있기도 하고. 흥미가 당기는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap:95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
msgctxt "h30bf5bb2g9e7bg4403ga34bgcf46d097fced"
msgid ""
"Judging by this map, there's a temple below - and something deadly waiting "
"there."
msgstr "이 지도에 따르면, 아래 신전이 있군. 그리고 치명적인 무언가도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap:95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
msgctxt "h29f039e9g354cg46bdg9f5fgbdfb26a17081"
msgid ""
"This map shows a temple of Shar... and something dangerous lurking within."
msgstr "이 지도는 샤의 신전을 나타내고 있어...그리고 안에 도사린 위험한 무언가도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap:95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
msgctxt "h36453350g23e2g4a10gabbeg66ff4459d891"
msgid ""
"I'll be. There's a temple under here - and something monstrous hiding inside "
"it."
msgstr "세상에. 이 아래에 신전이 있어. 그 안에는 뭔가 무시무시한 것이 숨어있고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsMap:95a123f6-dc78-4205-b24d-75ea974e6036
msgctxt "hb76362f5g49d9g43b9gb92bg9707d4f2b31b"
msgid ""
"Looks like there's a temple under this place - and something deadly sealed "
"inside it."
msgstr "이 곳 아래 신전이 있는 모양이야. 봉인된 치명적인 무언가도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsWifePlaque
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fd5500fd-ed35-0e17-6aba-bc514fc56d25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_KethericsWifePlaque:fd5500fd-ed35-0e17-6aba-bc514fc56d25
msgctxt "h887f0788gfc44g483bga2acg4679ae89038c"
msgid ""
"*Here lies Melodia Thorm, beloved wife and mother. <i>Ai armiel telere "
"maenen hir.</i>*"
msgstr "*사랑스러운 아내이자 엄마였던 멜로디아 쏨, 여기 잠들다. <i>에이 아미엘 텔러레이 마넨 히어</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel:e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
msgctxt "h03ee11b9g5299g4efag9a5dg4c6b66404c2f"
msgid "Growing people in vats just takes all the sport out of dinner."
msgstr "통 안에서 사람을 기르다니, 식사 시간이 따분해지겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel:e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
msgctxt "hff2e6b6cg431ag446bg810dg14920ee0d0ae"
msgid "Looks like some sort of... jar-grown lifeform?"
msgstr "보아하니 일종의... 병에 넣어 키운 생명체인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel:e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
msgctxt "hb229a76dg56a8g402fg893cgc688ec4d1109"
msgid "But where's it lead?"
msgstr "그래서 어디로 이어지는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel:e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
msgctxt "hbebf4c1egcf84g40b5gbfb5g469136dec643"
msgid "A gestating human - neither born not hatched, but <i>made</i>."
msgstr "인간이 들어있군. 태생도, 난생도 아니야. <i>만들어졌어</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel:e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
msgctxt "h69e38fa7g365eg4c34g9c26gaeee3ff23b05"
msgid ""
"Ugh, what is that? Looks like someone tried to grow their own friend but "
"lost the instructions."
msgstr "윽, 저게 대체 뭐지? 자기 친구를 직접 만들려고 한 것 같은데, 중간에 설명서를 잃어버렸나 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel:e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
msgctxt "h0940d242g2250g46f1g9c5bg9bd9deb3ac88"
msgid "Is that - a <i>person</i> being grown in there? Gods, that's ghastly."
msgstr "저기 저 안에 든 거, <i>사람</i>인가? 세상에, 정말 끔찍하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MakeshiftVessel:e73a4118-4f3a-4d8a-ba89-2fe287829bb3
msgctxt "h392ccef1g87e4g4460gaa6bg134b0dd282d5"
msgid "What is that? Almost looks like someone was trying to grow a person."
msgstr "저게 뭐지? 사람을 만들려고 했던 것 처럼 보이는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 11613dcd-0598-b372-1bfc-932a537d8e6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:11613dcd-0598-b372-1bfc-932a537d8e6f
msgctxt "h0450d433g169dg4d99gb250g03f3f626880d"
msgid ""
"*Moonrise Towers. It makes the Urge hiss within. It was part of your "
"disgrace, but <i>how</i>?*"
msgstr "*문라이즈 타워입니다. 충동이 쉬익거리게 하는군요. 당신의 굴욕의 일부였습니다, 하지만 <i>어떻게요</i>?*\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3b3359a1-04e3-e7b9-9bb8-63aa88d480c3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:3b3359a1-04e3-e7b9-9bb8-63aa88d480c3
msgctxt "h92ccd442g739cg48bfg8b17gb0c5aee3ae4c"
msgid "*This tower - a part of you knows it. A part of you <i>hates </i>it.*"
msgstr "*이 탑은, 당신의 일부가 알고 있습니다. 당신의 일부가 <i>싫어합니다</i>.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f4ef8fc-35f6-405b-9cc5-802bc0cbcc7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
