msgctxt "h592df102gc785g4864gacb0g571fd8847b44"
msgid "Moonrise Towers, back before all... that."
msgstr "문라이즈 타워라, 옛날...그 일 전 모습이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f4ef8fc-35f6-405b-9cc5-802bc0cbcc7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:5f4ef8fc-35f6-405b-9cc5-802bc0cbcc7d
msgctxt "h7fffe068gaef8g4ceegbd5bg5dfd591fb749"
msgid "Moonrise Towers - under its original stewardship."
msgstr "문라이즈 타워로군, 원래 관리자 하에 있을 때 모습이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f4ef8fc-35f6-405b-9cc5-802bc0cbcc7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:5f4ef8fc-35f6-405b-9cc5-802bc0cbcc7d
msgctxt "h4b8675b9g7cc6g4b65g8e50gb8d26270215d"
msgid "Moonrise Towers, once upon a time."
msgstr "문라이즈 타워, 옛날 옛적에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f4ef8fc-35f6-405b-9cc5-802bc0cbcc7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:5f4ef8fc-35f6-405b-9cc5-802bc0cbcc7d
msgctxt "hff90f47bg6726g4c61ga7bfg8c90a6b92c9f"
msgid "Moonrise Towers in its prime. Hardly the monstrosity it is now."
msgstr "문라이즈 타워의 전성기 때로군. 지금 같은 기괴함은 없다시피 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f4ef8fc-35f6-405b-9cc5-802bc0cbcc7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:5f4ef8fc-35f6-405b-9cc5-802bc0cbcc7d
msgctxt "h0407def4g8e54g402dga1b9g30c2a83fefca"
msgid "Moonrise Towers. It must have been quite a sight in its heyday."
msgstr "문라이즈 타워야. 전성기에는 꽤나 볼만한 광경이었겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f4ef8fc-35f6-405b-9cc5-802bc0cbcc7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:5f4ef8fc-35f6-405b-9cc5-802bc0cbcc7d
msgctxt "h04ca7734g93cbg4988g9afeg503e2f848d24"
msgid "Moonrise Towers, looks like. Quite a beauty back in the day."
msgstr "문라이즈 타워 같군. 예전에는 꽤 아름다웠겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5f4ef8fc-35f6-405b-9cc5-802bc0cbcc7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:5f4ef8fc-35f6-405b-9cc5-802bc0cbcc7d
msgctxt "h86d0d2a1ged0fg43b0g94ccgab77d161e6e1"
msgid "That bright tower... it's Moonrise. Or it used to be."
msgstr "저 밝은 탑은... 문라이즈로군. 옛 문라이즈거나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7b83f4a2-4443-68c1-cac7-6ea475e425ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALSIN(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:7b83f4a2-4443-68c1-cac7-6ea475e425ef
msgctxt "h4c366b1cgdf79g4795g94f0g6496058c6e53"
msgid ""
"Moonrise Towers... before Ketheric Thorm offered it over to the shadows."
msgstr "문라이즈 타워야... 케서릭 쏨이 그림자에게 탑을 바치기 전 모습이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
msgctxt "h0c66069bga1bbg4f7bga293g276571d9288d"
msgid "Not bad. A little gaudy for my taste, but not bad."
msgstr "나쁘지 않아. 내 취향엔 좀 과하지만, 나쁘지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
msgctxt "hfc4d476egee0ag452dga5e5gde1bc7ac9330"
msgid "Looks like quite a place."
msgstr "꽤 멋진 곳인걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
msgctxt "hbe917f1dg2b8cg41b3ga12agede04a3bbe0e"
msgid "Bright tower. Pretty."
msgstr "밝은 탑이야. 꽤."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
msgctxt "h07d00a95g59b4g4775gb59fgfccdd9a99a44"
msgid "A shining tower. A primitive depiction, but not unpleasant."
msgstr "빛나는 탑이로군. 원시적인 그림이지만, 불쾌하지는 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
msgctxt "he887403fg7ea5g43a4g8e00g936886c89325"
msgid "Impressive. What is that place?"
msgstr "대단한걸. 저 장소는 어디지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
msgctxt "h04e76ca8g1900g4b6egaaadgfd866332b6c3"
msgid "Beautiful depiction of a tower - never seen the likes of it."
msgstr "탑을 그린 아름다운 그림이야. 이런 건 처음 봤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_MoonriseTower_EverEnteredBefore = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_000:feea6c1c-0847-4943-9af5-171a39be481a
msgctxt "h1141a15eg83fcg48c9g8066g8fb2635e9b97"
msgid "What is this bright tower? Strange."
msgstr "이 밝은 탑은 뭐지. 이상한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2ff2e7fa-8c71-73c5-ea8c-e4feb157b184
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:2ff2e7fa-8c71-73c5-ea8c-e4feb157b184
msgctxt "hb3feb45cgb762g4802gb9b4g28aab86bfc94"
msgid ""
"*Ketheric lost his daughter, but the bastard knows why you <i>lost "
"everything</i>.*"
msgstr "*케서릭은 딸을 잃었지만, 그 개자식은 당신이 왜 <i>모든 것을 잃었는지</i> 알고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
msgctxt "h9e77b3fbgcbdcg4af2g873bg96147a3e097c"
msgid "A big painting of a sad elf. Heart-breaking, truly."
msgstr "슬퍼하는 엘프를 그린 벽화네. 마음 아프군. 진짜야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
msgctxt "he5d28da1g0c9dg4817ga26fgd361ee27f534"
msgid ""
"This depicts a man grieving over a lost one, his wife or daughter most "
"likely. I don't want to imagine such pain."
msgstr "잃어버린, 딸이거나 아내 같은 사람을 위해 슬퍼하는 남자를 그렸어. 그런 고통은 상상하고 싶지 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
msgctxt "hfde82e80gf3ccg458eg82cfg1db7c0d00a39"
msgid "Oh, that's sad. Wonder who it's of."
msgstr "오, 슬퍼라. 누군지 궁금한걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
msgctxt "h5d47647fg5561g46aeg9784gec58c885bcc3"
msgid "An elf in mourning? <i>Chk</i> - a fruitless tradition."
msgstr "애도하는 엘프라? <i>츠크</i>, 부질 없는 관습이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
msgctxt "hc7b32955g4466g465ag9cf0g527c69a711cb"
msgid "An elven warrior, mourning. But who is he?"
msgstr "엘프 전사가 상심한 모습이야. 대체 누굴까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
msgctxt "hc2057779ga48ag452agb079g1845b68a8205"
msgid "An elf, deep in mourning. He must have lost someone dear."
msgstr "엘프가 깊은 슬픔에 빠져있군. 사랑하던 누군가를 잃은 게 분명해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:6d5a307c-5c8f-443a-93e9-1375a18f3af9
msgctxt "h9db8ab6bg6571g4c54g88d9gccf1e376fa48"
msgid "Looks like that elf lost someone dear to him."
msgstr "엘프가 소중한 사람을 잃은 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d2f1bd0d-8e25-419c-a0b6-1f34cfaa7f00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:d2f1bd0d-8e25-419c-a0b6-1f34cfaa7f00
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h7d126fe7g13e6g4a37g8216g02d12bf9e89c"
msgid ""
"*The elf from this painting... He knows you. He was a trifling stain in your "
"bloody past. But who is he mourning?*"
msgstr ""
"*이 그림 속 엘프는... 당신을 압니다. 당신의 피투성이 과거에 남겨진 사소한 오점입니다. 하지만 누구를 애도하고 있는 걸까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e14a8c9c-4874-4248-9875-4179224d9134
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:e14a8c9c-4874-4248-9875-4179224d9134
msgctxt "h549ffcd5gdb88g4338g8be7ged9da8caac79"
msgid "Ketheric Thorm, mourning his daughter. Who knew he had it in him?"
msgstr "케서릭 쏨이, 딸을 애도하고 있군. 그런 마음을 갖고 있는 줄 누가 알았을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e14a8c9c-4874-4248-9875-4179224d9134
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:e14a8c9c-4874-4248-9875-4179224d9134
msgctxt "hcafea34agbfc4g4cf9gb4abg498697b80da1"
msgid ""
"This depicts Ketheric Thorm grieving over his daughter. But did he shed "
"tears too for all who fell beneath his sword?"
msgstr "케서릭 쏨이 딸을 잃고 애도하는 모습을 그리고 있군. 하지만 그의 검 아래 쓰러진 모든 이를 위해서도 눈물을 흘렸을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e14a8c9c-4874-4248-9875-4179224d9134
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:e14a8c9c-4874-4248-9875-4179224d9134
msgctxt "hb3b28740g34e9g4f27ga64fgc727f70648db"
msgid "Ketheric Thorm in mourning for his daughter. Tsk, that's very sad."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨이 딸을 애도하고 있다. 쯧, 퍽이나 슬프군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e14a8c9c-4874-4248-9875-4179224d9134
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:e14a8c9c-4874-4248-9875-4179224d9134
msgctxt "heeaf787ege1afg483bgbae1g12b0f751ab8a"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm, deep in mourning for his daughter - such a fruitless "
"endeavor."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨이, 딸을 잃고 깊은 슬픔에 잠겨 있군. 불필요한 노력이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e14a8c9c-4874-4248-9875-4179224d9134
