#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:e14a8c9c-4874-4248-9875-4179224d9134
msgctxt "h5a38e646g4bb2g4e8eg831eg20a9b5de705b"
msgid "Ketheric Thorm, grieving his daughter. He'd have been devastated..."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨이, 딸을 잃고 슬퍼하고 있어. 크게 낙심했겠지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e14a8c9c-4874-4248-9875-4179224d9134
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_001:e14a8c9c-4874-4248-9875-4179224d9134
msgctxt "h5214c41cg569eg4067g9c51g197a8274f224"
msgid "Ketheric Thorm, bowed by grief for his daughter."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨이, 딸을 잃은 슬픔에 고개숙이고 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
msgctxt "h6ea0a771gc52eg4e86ga213gc8c6e8d4160a"
msgid ""
"The mighty general - Ketheric at the head of an army of Shar worshippers."
msgstr "위대한 장군, 케서릭이 샤 숭배자 군대의 선봉에 있구나. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
msgctxt "hf7e410c8g3fb5g4060gb4d9g74c1964543d8"
msgid ""
"There he is, General Ketheric Thorm leading an army of Sharran warriors. A "
"Fallen Paladin if ever there was one."
msgstr "여기 있군, 케서릭 쏨 장군이 샤 신도 전사들의 군대를 이끌고 있어. 하나 나올까말까한 타락한 팔라딘이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
msgctxt "h4a7b0b99g6d08g4f0fg873fgd0e36ac27eb1"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm and his Dark Justiciars. Now there's a fall from grace for "
"the history books."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨과 휘하 다크 저스티시어들이야. 역사책에 남을 몰락이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
msgctxt "h1c8eb106g1f7dg4fd0ga912g0eba38ef526a"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm, commanding a Sharran army. He'd turned his eyes from Selûne "
"to her sister."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨, 샤의 신도 군대를 지휘하는군. 셀루네에게서 그 자매로 눈을 돌렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
msgctxt "h6d6c089bg7107g44bfgb62fg5c929a8ebdeb"
msgid "Ketheric Thorm leading a Dark Justiciar army. He fully embraced Shar."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨이 다크 저스티시어 군대를 이끌고 있어. 샤를 완전히 받아들였구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
msgctxt "hcf1bc8f0g0bb1g417cga125g6d071bf1bfe9"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm at the helm of a Sharran army. Volo himself couldn't have "
"written a better twist."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨이 샤 신도의 군대 선봉에 섰군. 볼로라도 더한 반전을 쓰진 못했을걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:34dd824f-d897-401f-9feb-c8656aa5153e
msgctxt "h85de6e02g2375g48d2ga739g607754f492c9"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm, leading Shar's forces. Quite the about-face for a warrior of "
"Selûne."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨, 샤의 군세를 이끌고 있군. 셀루네의 전사에겐 꽤나 큰 반전인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3a075c67-8cb1-fb79-5f78-dff849173a5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:3a075c67-8cb1-fb79-5f78-dff849173a5a
msgctxt "he840b20bg474fg48afga96bg828a0a67aac3"
msgid ""
"*Ketheric? Helming a Sharran army? He's hiding his own past, just as he's "
"keeping pieces of yours.*"
msgstr "*케서릭? 샤의 신도 군대를 이끄는? 당신의 과거 일부를 감추고 있듯, 그는 자신의 과거도 숨기고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6bda2852-2ddf-f6c1-f337-95184e547072
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:6bda2852-2ddf-f6c1-f337-95184e547072
msgctxt "h6920d6a2g3c5ag4100g9703gdc5fd380e568"
msgid ""
"*An army of Sharrans. You've led grander hoards of truer butchers. This is "
"nothing.*"
msgstr "*샤 신도의 군대입니다. 당신은 예전에 훨씬 더 큰 도살자 무리를 이끌었습니다. 이건 아무것도 아닙니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
msgctxt "hdb143862g81d2g4dd9g8d56ga9e8c1bf4bd2"
msgid ""
"Now that's what I like to see - an elf at the head of an army. Even a "
"Sharran one."
msgstr "이거 좋은걸, 엘프가 군대의 선봉에 섰어. 샤의 신도라 해도 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h8bc7e6fcg9ca7g4b92g8794ga62a4e167c03"
msgid ""
"A venerated leader stands out among the Sharran warriors. Must have been a "
"champion of Shar, perhaps a Chosen even."
msgstr "샤 신도 전사 중에 존경받는 지도자가 서 있군. 샤의 챔피언이었겠지, 어쩌면 선택받은 자일지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
msgctxt "h2625d3fegbb9cg4920g8712g7ce312b76e3d"
msgid ""
"Fierce-looking elf with an army of Sharrans. Wouldn't like to get caught in "
"the middle."
msgstr "샤 신도의 군대와 함께 있는 사나워 보이는 엘프야. 한가운데 끼고 싶지는 않네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
msgctxt "h7ff082bcg0f8ag43ebgbdcegfcbb01dd4b32"
msgid "An elf leading an army of Shar disciples - an unmistakable depiction."
msgstr "샤의 신봉자 군대를 이끄는 엘프라, 착각할 수 없는 묘사로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
msgctxt "ha10d94cegb460g4788g8c03g66925d393877"
msgid "That elf is leading an army of Dark Justiciars. Who is he?"
msgstr "엘프가 다크 저스티시어 군대를 거느리고 있어. 이 자는 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
msgctxt "h753245fdg6cedg4cbfgb81cgea137a815c02"
msgid "An army of Sharrans with an elf at the helm. But who?"
msgstr "샤 신도의 군대와 선봉에 선 엘프라. 그런데 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Ketheric_Knows_HasSeen = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_Mural_002:d73e4d3f-f52f-bb1c-f246-5e8efa782f45
msgctxt "hf0c76882g2fe6g4a09ga13cg5a4d526c807b"
msgid ""
"Whoever that elf is, he's got an army of Shar worshippers at his command."
msgstr "이 엘프가 누군지는 몰라도, 샤 신도들로 구성된 대군을 거느렸군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol:2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
msgctxt "h7bb4cb62g1883g4d19g95e4gf8bc48da8d15"
msgid "Interesting sigil. Not that I know or care who it belongs to."
msgstr "흥미로운 인장이군. 뭘 의미하는 지도 모르고, 관심도 없지만. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol:2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
msgctxt "hd3caf4degfe7dg4eb8gaf20g5c60ad26e312"
msgid "What's that symbol I spy?"
msgstr "저 기호는 뭘까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol:2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
msgctxt "h2fbcdbd3gf2b4g43e3g967fgf6e30c65e3e4"
msgid "Don't like the look of that. Don't know why."
msgstr "저거 이유는 몰라도, 맘에 안 들어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol:2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
msgctxt "h47c690aag9c9eg499cg8ec5g44374a51b086"
msgid "I should know this symbol - but the meaning evades me."
msgstr "이 상징 분명 본 적이 있는데, 그 의미는 기억이 안 나는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol:2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
msgctxt "hcfaa8c8dg7413g442egb061gee8a63389b65"
msgid "Eye-catching insignia. Not sure what it means though."
msgstr "시선을 사로잡는 휘장이네. 뭘 뜻하는지는 잘 모르겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol:2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
msgctxt "h1fbef458gcdccg49cegb0a4g69fd0134b88e"
msgid "Nice symbol. What's it mean, I wonder..."
msgstr "멋진 상징이군. 뭘 의미하는 걸까..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol:2e818e28-8232-4f11-bb3e-0f86ff7df04c
msgctxt "h2c045acfgd2fbg4623g8a21g4e84f93154ab"
msgid "What is that symbol supposed to mean?"
msgstr "저 상징은 뭘 뜻하는 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Mausoleum_PAD_MyrkulSymbol
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64f5eb25-9631-a3ab-2f07-2304ffbfaf0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Mausoleum_State_PassedMyrkulReligionCheck = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
