msgctxt "hfc039c4fgf271g42cdg96f4ga6022104933e"
msgid ""
"*The merregon's mind is sealed. It doesn't even react to your attempted "
"intrusion.*"
msgstr "*메레곤의 정신이 굳게 닫혀있습니다. 당신의 침투 시도에 반응조차 하지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Merregon_002
#. Speaker = Player
