msgctxt "h7dbcc5a8g3f15g48c9gbae4g6854decf0878"
msgid ""
"Well if it isn't our Mistress of Pain. HahaHAHA, what anguish she has "
"visited upon me!"
msgstr "이게 누구야, 고통의 여제 아니신가. 하하<b>하하</b>, 나를 찾아오다니 이렇게 괴로울 데가!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NGB_NightsongPrison_PlayerAttackedNecro
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 25963b60-2a98-5a20-2d59-05db304d8a79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_PlayerBetrayedNecro = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NGB_NightsongPrison_PlayerAttackedNecro:25963b60-2a98-5a20-2d59-05db304d8a79
msgctxt "he7b78274gdf34g47d0ga5a4gda26460afe2d"
msgid ""
"A cheap attack, just as I'm finally reunited with my masterwork? This will "
"not stand."
msgstr "이제서야 내 걸작과 겨우 재회했는데, 이런 옹졸한 공격이라니? 좌시하지 않겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_BarricadeLeader
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = 6522d40f-ac11-ab4d-679d-a9b35db35dda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_BarricadeLeader:6522d40f-ac11-ab4d-679d-a9b35db35dda
msgctxt "hab2afbeeg6e4fg4f36gb47bg25e2296f73d3"
msgid "You dawdle. Come closer - <i>now.</i>"
msgstr "굼벵이 놈. 가까이 와라. <i>당장.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_Death
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 26d45e25-c84d-1c88-19d3-aa2888c2108b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_Death:26d45e25-c84d-1c88-19d3-aa2888c2108b
msgctxt "ha1a175fdgb3c2g4105gb143gd5324cf14ae9"
msgid "Death... But a fleeting inconvenience."
msgstr "죽음은... 찰나의 불편함일 뿐이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_DominateGolem
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 9db3b5a3-560e-af0f-0ada-be5c1abfe6be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_DominateGolem:9db3b5a3-560e-af0f-0ada-be5c1abfe6be
msgctxt "h29903e2eg8a29g4c6ag8063gf79d831f6dc8"
msgid "Flesh! Enough of this foolishness!"
msgstr "살덩이! 바보짓은 그 쯤 해둬!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_EnemyVulnerable
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 6f0aaf0c-5d88-d4a9-547a-467ec66f8b2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_EnemyVulnerable:6f0aaf0c-5d88-d4a9-547a-467ec66f8b2c
msgctxt "h5d20e1e6gcc6dg4879g974agbb2c67b4c631"
msgid "We have the upper hand - do your work, Flesh!"
msgstr "우리가 우위에 있다. 네 할 일을 해, 살덩이!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_GhoulSnarl
#. Speaker = GROUP_SHA_Necromancer_Ghouls
#. NodeID = a21951d6-8725-5c0a-447a-f73f4a9d6eca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_GhoulSnarl:a21951d6-8725-5c0a-447a-f73f4a9d6eca
msgctxt "he91cdd96g567dg4d53g9eb8g70d6303adb2f"
msgid "<i>Aaaway!</i>"
msgstr "<i>저리 꺼져!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_GhoulSnarl
#. Speaker = GROUP_SHA_Necromancer_Ghouls
#. NodeID = a21951d6-8725-5c0a-447a-f73f4a9d6eca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_GhoulSnarl:a21951d6-8725-5c0a-447a-f73f4a9d6eca
msgctxt "hfffc434ag9c7fg49cdga47eg69fb1d1327f0"
msgid "<i>No clossser!</i>"
msgstr "<i>가까이 오지 마라!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_GhoulSnarl
#. Speaker = GROUP_SHA_Necromancer_Ghouls
#. NodeID = a21951d6-8725-5c0a-447a-f73f4a9d6eca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[2]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_GhoulSnarl:a21951d6-8725-5c0a-447a-f73f4a9d6eca
msgctxt "hf3d6700dg300fg4fe5g8cf3g770d76d2ad63"
msgid "<i>Back, or I feassst!</i>"
msgstr "<i>물러서, 물어뜯기기 싫으면!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_GolemDead
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = c432ae13-20c8-69e9-bbac-ecce660b3b5c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_GolemDead:c432ae13-20c8-69e9-bbac-ecce660b3b5c
msgctxt "h63ad1f5bg2069g4279g87acg398f1ca4a233"
msgid "Wretch. You broke my brother!"
msgstr "네 이놈. 네가 내 동생을 망가뜨렸어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_GolemGoesBerserk
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 66093378-f766-271f-ceea-64e8720a5c72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_GolemGoesBerserk:66093378-f766-271f-ceea-64e8720a5c72
msgctxt "h547645edg128ag4813g9e39g2f385f6ee21b"
msgid "Imbecile! You've knocked the wits out of him!"
msgstr "이 멍청아! 너 때문에 넋이 나가버렸잖아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_Justiciar_CombatStarts
#. Speaker = Justiciar Avenger
#. NodeID = 39097d1d-4fc7-4f43-916f-abe999ea8fa0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_Justiciar_CombatStarts:39097d1d-4fc7-4f43-916f-abe999ea8fa0
msgctxt "h08867fd0g39eag4ba9g9b45ged9f3cfec524"
msgid "Trespasser. Myrkul's fat lapdog!"
msgstr "침입자. 머큘의 개들!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_Justiciar_TakingTurn_1
#. Speaker = Justiciar Avenger
#. NodeID = 9ce1f04c-4687-47f1-bde1-c6f765493dac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_Justiciar_TakingTurn_1:9ce1f04c-4687-47f1-bde1-c6f765493dac
msgctxt "h5cc41501gfab7g4d76gbc67gd74b7a8b73f0"
msgid "Foul assemblage! You should never have come here!"
msgstr "불경스런 집단이여! 너희는 여기 오지 말았어야 했다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_Justiciar_TakingTurn_2
#. Speaker = Justiciar Avenger
#. NodeID = 1a10746e-7038-46aa-a622-1e1ec6c7ffc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_Justiciar_TakingTurn_2:1a10746e-7038-46aa-a622-1e1ec6c7ffc9
msgctxt "hcfdbc556g1cefg409cg938eg8405034591fa"
msgid "Darkness shall consume you, corpse-thief!"
msgstr "어둠이 너를 삼키리라, 도굴꾼이여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_LowHP
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 56e69bb8-d351-684c-8f96-046aec339cbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_LowHP:56e69bb8-d351-684c-8f96-046aec339cbb
msgctxt "hae04a754gb227g4104gbf5dgd3cfd858e4dd"
msgid "Fool. You think striking down my body will be the end of me?"
msgstr "멍청하긴. 내 육체를 때려눕힌다고 날 물리칠 수 있을 것 같으냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 23aa350b-53bf-45e7-bcee-967bd295f892
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 003e1f20-0cac-171b-aa7c-df901e42aa6c_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 003e1f20-0cac-171b-aa7c-df901e42aa6c_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls:23aa350b-53bf-45e7-bcee-967bd295f892
msgctxt "hdb649aa7g7f63g43b8g9bd9g66f6db65538c"
msgid "Embalming fluid, and a pipette. Now."
msgstr "방부 용액이랑, 피펫 가져와. 당장."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls
#. Speaker = GROUP_SHA_Necromancer_Ghouls
#. NodeID = 41b9c467-cac5-bad1-1728-95cc6b7079ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls:41b9c467-cac5-bad1-1728-95cc6b7079ce
msgctxt "h5fe9f334g69afg4098g8c72ge2c3695557d4"
msgid "<i>At ooonce.</i>"
msgstr "<i>즉시 따르겠습니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls
#. Speaker = GROUP_SHA_Necromancer_Ghouls
#. NodeID = 44dfdca3-5aa3-f085-b940-f2711f410694
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls:44dfdca3-5aa3-f085-b940-f2711f410694
msgctxt "h40ed7552g3cb3g42ccga8c5g05d2c7e16afb"
msgid "<i>Never, maaaster.</i>"
msgstr "<i>물론입니다, 주인님.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 79799083-6ebc-46e0-8ce7-703279355752
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 003e1f20-0cac-171b-aa7c-df901e42aa6c_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 003e1f20-0cac-171b-aa7c-df901e42aa6c_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls:79799083-6ebc-46e0-8ce7-703279355752
msgctxt "h57ee95ebged6cg4f0egb089gd770c83a6ed3"
msgid "Bring me a liver - and I don't want to see any bite marks on it!"
msgstr "간을 가져와라. 그리고 물린 자국이 있으면 안 된다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 8a3c2ae8-c87b-438c-843b-500063964cda
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 003e1f20-0cac-171b-aa7c-df901e42aa6c_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls:8a3c2ae8-c87b-438c-843b-500063964cda
msgctxt "hb862935eg8a4cg4cc6ga356gc3319cb4bae1"
msgid "Bring me a femur bone - a good one, not the one with the marrow pox."
msgstr "대퇴골을 하나 가져와라. 멀쩡한 걸로. 골수에 염증난 거 말고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = c06795de-9a71-4ab1-ad64-4728d37373a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 003e1f20-0cac-171b-aa7c-df901e42aa6c_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 003e1f20-0cac-171b-aa7c-df901e42aa6c_C = False
#.     - 003e1f20-0cac-171b-aa7c-df901e42aa6c_B = False
#.     - 003e1f20-0cac-171b-aa7c-df901e42aa6c_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls:c06795de-9a71-4ab1-ad64-4728d37373a2
msgctxt "hbbb49d71gbf30g4ddfgaf1fg6169911115f8"
msgid "Where's that bloody embalming fluid?"
msgstr "대체 빌어먹을 방부 용액은 어딨는 거냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls
#. Speaker = GROUP_SHA_Necromancer_Ghouls
#. NodeID = cb529979-811e-9e60-64a5-e25398cf4c1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls:cb529979-811e-9e60-64a5-e25398cf4c1b
msgctxt "h752f398bgb8e4g4df7gb827ge76e6ba263a2"
msgid "<i>Thirrrsty.</i>"
msgstr "<i>목이 마릅니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls
#. Speaker = GROUP_SHA_Necromancer_Ghouls
#. NodeID = d9816e31-1949-51e0-efb9-ba017e9484df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OrderingGhouls:d9816e31-1949-51e0-efb9-ba017e9484df
msgctxt "h7b7db2abg714cg48f2g8c87g3c92b87f2e6f"
msgid "<i>Yesss.</i>"
msgstr "<i>네에.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OutsideRoom
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 31fab4ed-ae28-a538-3422-016922c4f776
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_OutsideRoom:31fab4ed-ae28-a538-3422-016922c4f776
msgctxt "h97fb2497g672cg468egab09g5798e0ef6b4a"
msgid "Come inside. Then we can talk."
msgstr "안으로 들어와라. 얘기를 해 보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_StartTurn
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 67c51da0-8c2d-4f51-9da9-8be28fd068d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6bc7114f-5279-4374-385e-b396157d5189_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6bc7114f-5279-4374-385e-b396157d5189_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_StartTurn:67c51da0-8c2d-4f51-9da9-8be28fd068d9
msgctxt "hefdca950g289ag4a16g9d72g4fd2e9d29e46"
msgid "It will be a kindness to put an end to your follies."
msgstr "네 어리석은 짓을 멈추는 것이 친절한 일이겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_StartTurn
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 70866327-a058-4dd8-940b-872243d9ae70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6bc7114f-5279-4374-385e-b396157d5189_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6bc7114f-5279-4374-385e-b396157d5189_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_StartTurn:70866327-a058-4dd8-940b-872243d9ae70
msgctxt "hbc89124bgb411g462dg9748gf9585e66c5dd"
msgid "You shall live to regret this. Perhaps not for long."
msgstr "평생 후회하게 될 거다. 평생이래 봐야 그리 길지는 않겠지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_StartTurn
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 96637e07-10b0-4120-ac2f-0f35b1b4e035
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6bc7114f-5279-4374-385e-b396157d5189_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_StartTurn:96637e07-10b0-4120-ac2f-0f35b1b4e035
msgctxt "h4c798ab6g38ddg45dbg9ee1g7d1ce607b1c8"
msgid "Let us make short work of this."
msgstr "빨리 끝내자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_StartTurn
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = b5914b96-87a8-4184-b579-530950146450
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 6bc7114f-5279-4374-385e-b396157d5189_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 6bc7114f-5279-4374-385e-b396157d5189_B = False
#.     - 6bc7114f-5279-4374-385e-b396157d5189_C = False
#.     - 6bc7114f-5279-4374-385e-b396157d5189_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_AD_StartTurn:b5914b96-87a8-4184-b579-530950146450
msgctxt "hc6ab2b17g3c0cg4dedg8d59g5b98573cb39a"
msgid "Your time runs short, womb-born..."
msgstr "네놈에겐 시간이 없다, 자궁에서 태어난 자여..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = 03afe7c0-09d0-f950-46fb-84468f34cac5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:03afe7c0-09d0-f950-46fb-84468f34cac5
msgctxt "h4977f024g2c1eg4395gb27cgaad6921cf480"
msgid ""
"These are masterworks. Perhaps you'll join their ranks, once I repurpose "
"your corpse."
msgstr "이것들은 명작이다. 네 시체를 개조하면 그 반열에 들 수 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = 0cb51b3f-11f2-dbb4-7df6-1052ad3ffb4d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:0cb51b3f-11f2-dbb4-7df6-1052ad3ffb4d
msgctxt "h6a97f53eg1619g47a6gbf6dg199d2a201724"
msgid ""
"<i>Rancid donkey scrotum! </i>The quakes herald the shadows - it's already "
"too late!"
msgstr "<i>썩은 내 나는 당나귀 불알 주머니</i> 같으니! 그림자들이 땅을 울리고 있다. 이미 늦었어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = 0e36d207-5fa2-0f22-0e6f-d99c1a15b855
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:0e36d207-5fa2-0f22-0e6f-d99c1a15b855
msgctxt "hd5b5f58eg149cg4968g9339g984221511f86"
msgid "Come join me and find out. I want to look at you with my own eyes."
msgstr "이리로 와서 날 만나라. 너를 내 눈으로 직접 보고 싶군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = 124afa8b-894d-8203-60e6-e8419b51077d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:124afa8b-894d-8203-60e6-e8419b51077d
msgctxt "hba413e45g692dg466bg836eg43ed473a7618"
msgid ""
"<i>Stinking pile of ogre afterbirth! </i>The quakes herald the shadows - "
"they've found me!"
msgstr "<i>오우거 뱃속에서 난 냄새 나는 부산물 같으니! </i>그림자들이 땅을 울리고 있다. 날 찾아낸 거야!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = 1604df9a-8fde-b4d3-84ea-7465aee28c79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:1604df9a-8fde-b4d3-84ea-7465aee28c79
msgctxt "h2780d3d1g0636g4a29ga587g1c64cb1cef93"
msgid ""
"You prowl <i>my </i>battleground - why? Are you friend? Foe? Thieving "
"scavenger?"
msgstr "<i>내</i> 전장을 살금살금 돌아다니는군. 왜지? 너는 친구인가? 적인가? 아니면 도굴꾼인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 35368ac6-c0ef-4527-b3f2-c9f9169a89d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:35368ac6-c0ef-4527-b3f2-c9f9169a89d8
msgctxt "h9118e61fg7e46g4ae5gb35bga3d9792f6444"
msgid "Who am I really speaking to?"
msgstr "내가 정확히 누구한테 말하고 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = 3a0f2489-762f-dbb2-caa9-f7214e3b27bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:3a0f2489-762f-dbb2-caa9-f7214e3b27bf
msgctxt "h59a81f51ge0a7g45adg8904g5a109136c11c"
msgid "No. I will accept a gift from you instead. <i>Raw materials.</i>"
msgstr "아니. 대신 너에게 선물을 받아가마. <i>신선한 재료를.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 438befd4-8c4c-439f-f41f-61615c2849c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:438befd4-8c4c-439f-f41f-61615c2849c6
msgctxt "h199ab795g49a1g4b08ga57cg336ab534c4ba"
msgid "Z'rell sent me, looking for someone called Balthazar."
msgstr "즈렐이 발타자르라는 자를 찾아보라고 보냈다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 448cb43d-755d-47d5-b416-ca519da09c4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:448cb43d-755d-47d5-b416-ca519da09c4f
msgctxt "ha75658e3ge582g466ag98e9gd3b20dfe59fe"
msgid "I'm no friend of yours - whatever you are."
msgstr "네가 뭐든 간에, 난 친구가 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b309eac-8547-674e-65ff-c4dc0701256a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:4b309eac-8547-674e-65ff-c4dc0701256a
msgctxt "h3c96518dg4f22g4016gb258g00702c1e5588"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = 4c4ae5d8-cd40-8b28-b2a2-43a101d47962
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:4c4ae5d8-cd40-8b28-b2a2-43a101d47962
msgctxt "h8f19aa36g56bag4e0dg88c8g0bc66ac0b149"
msgid "Did she now? Enter - I will see if I have any use for you."
msgstr "그렇단 말이지? 들어와라, 네가 쓸모가 있는지 봐야겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = GROUP_PartyMembers
#. NodeID = 643f8db2-4de7-5136-0754-b0b041445b63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:643f8db2-4de7-5136-0754-b0b041445b63
msgctxt "hed801555gf0b7g42e1ga7a6g5c63919f8e76"
msgid ""
"Afraid I'd ruin these things' looks? Make good on your threat, or else stand "
"aside."
msgstr "내가 이것들 외관을 망칠까 두려운가 보군? 협박을 더 잘해보던가, 아니면 물러나시지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = 723e3322-d5c1-0200-eeb9-6a0db7f70bce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:723e3322-d5c1-0200-eeb9-6a0db7f70bce
msgctxt "hc370a6c0gbe13g46b6g835agccbc20fcbaa4"
msgid "Hurry inside, or your racket is liable to -"
msgstr "서둘러 들어와라, 아니면 네가 피운 소란이..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b2b4a688-8e48-37d5-a8cf-cec7a8bc6a2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:b2b4a688-8e48-37d5-a8cf-cec7a8bc6a2d
msgctxt "h960717c7geb66g4f98gba8bg1eac69d5b13d"
msgid "*You feel a tremble rising from the floor, growing stronger...*"
msgstr "*당신은 바닥으로부터 올라오는 떨림을 느낍니다. 점점 강해지고 있습니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = b7024761-6f47-4751-272a-c9cfc388cd57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:b7024761-6f47-4751-272a-c9cfc388cd57
msgctxt "h7fdd96cbge277g488dg8e49g204ec87ae80c"
msgid "Ah. A friend - an uninvited friend. I did not request help."
msgstr "아. 친구로군. 초대하지 않은 친구. 도움을 요청한 적은 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d1357a61-5b64-b3f8-fa5b-778e09c00487
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_StartShadowquake = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:d1357a61-5b64-b3f8-fa5b-778e09c00487
msgctxt "h47da28c2g626eg4cfbg9132gbddfaec55b6d"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = da3beedf-1235-678a-c230-34a6a0532daf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:da3beedf-1235-678a-c230-34a6a0532daf
msgctxt "he0ab33d0g9c4eg408agba63g90d0ab395aed"
msgid ""
"*You find yourself in a dead, putrid skull - somehow hosting a tadpole "
"amongst a squirm of maggots. Another presence lurks within, manipulating the "
"corpse like a puppet.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 죽은, 부패한 두개골 안에 있습니다. 그 안에 있는 구더기 떼 사이에 올챙이가 들어 있습니다. 또 다른 존재가, 시체를 "
"꼭두각시처럼 조종하며 그 안에 숨어 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = ddd4b792-c70b-6a40-4530-2fc3732cdcd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:ddd4b792-c70b-6a40-4530-2fc3732cdcd8
msgctxt "h8261d4b5g1301g4562ga800g837a6315bac6"
msgid "Hot blood and bluster. But perhaps I can use you."
msgstr "혈기왕성하고 기세등등하군. 쓸모가 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = GROUP_PartyMembers
#. NodeID = df4f9efd-5a94-5bd1-63a1-30b5e9e29dc1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:df4f9efd-5a94-5bd1-63a1-30b5e9e29dc1
msgctxt "h4edf9a2bgb449g47e8gaa9dgf474da420986"
msgid "A misunderstanding. Please, accept my apologies."
msgstr "오해다. 부디 내 사과를 받아줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = e2df13cc-2016-11d0-c562-73fc30d2a897
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:e2df13cc-2016-11d0-c562-73fc30d2a897
msgctxt "h94d71a1eg4d73g4322g97ecgf4467b4552bd"
msgid ""
"Not a friend, perhaps, but an ally. Or a servant. I saw within you - we "
"share common purpose."
msgstr "친구는 아니더라도 동맹은 될 수 있겠지. 아니면 종복이라던가. 널 들여다봤다. 우리는 같은 목적을 가졌어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = e3e24b89-ec67-ee48-5c06-859fa699cd91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:e3e24b89-ec67-ee48-5c06-859fa699cd91
msgctxt "h2eec3d09gc060g4e21gbb2bg698a1d144dab"
msgid "I can do little with an apology. But you... I may have a use for you."
msgstr "사과는 별 도움이 안 돼. 하지만 넌...쓸모가 있겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = fd2c9923-a6fa-f06d-7dca-abbb7b62d297
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_PlayerAttacked = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Barricade:fd2c9923-a6fa-f06d-7dca-abbb7b62d297
msgctxt "hbb93a0c7gf6d3g4cc6ga458g0e509e6c23cc"
msgid "My creations are my pride and joy. I shall kill you for attacking them."
msgstr "내 피조물은 나의 자랑이자 기쁨이다. 그들을 공격하다니 널 죽여주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 000a0468-ffff-4695-91b1-d695b770641f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(1) = False
#.      - WIZARD(1) = False
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:000a0468-ffff-4695-91b1-d695b770641f
msgctxt "h406bac83g8a4fg4affg8500gb119be4bcc39"
msgid "It's simple - you need me. Don't pretend otherwise."
msgstr "간단하지, 넌 내가 필요해. 아닌 척하지 마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 00c3e2f5-697f-4e4b-84ba-1cc2951bfaac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_HasGolemBell(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:00c3e2f5-697f-4e4b-84ba-1cc2951bfaac
msgctxt "h3e491a27ge242g4153g8b93geaa47b0638a0"
msgid "Fine. I will assign Flesh to aid you on your way. Ring this bell..."
msgstr "좋다. 가는 길에 널 도와 줄 살덩이를 할당해 주마. 이 종을 울리면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 010925fd-1564-4159-8898-67dd4907339c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Knows_InvulnerabilitySource = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:010925fd-1564-4159-8898-67dd4907339c
msgctxt "ha919f1a4g2ae7g47b5g8d73g6da7f689989f"
msgid ""
"Fine, if it'll spare me your bleating. The relic lends the General his "
"strength, his invulnerability. It must be recovered, before his enemies "
"attempt to exploit it."
msgstr ""
"좋다, 네 투덜거림을 멈출 수 있다면야. 그 유물은 장군님께 힘과 무적을 제공하지. 그분의 적들이 이용하려고 시도하기 전에 반드시 "
"되찾아야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0227ef5f-032d-4a95-89bb-8cb6dfaeb63c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:0227ef5f-032d-4a95-89bb-8cb6dfaeb63c
msgctxt "h03a90d8cg7245g4c99ga770ga9fd8388b637"
msgid "Interesting - let's test that theory. Time to die, monster."
msgstr "흥미롭군, 그 이론을 시험해 보자고. 죽을 시간이다, 괴물아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 02c63300-7f34-4a64-bc36-9242f6849f8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:02c63300-7f34-4a64-bc36-9242f6849f8a
msgctxt "hfd607177g1464g43b9g9e9agfddd3785fb26"
msgid ""
"Words - even my words - are woefully insufficient. When you see for "
"yourself, you will understand."
msgstr "말로는... 심지어 내 말로도... 표현하기엔 애처로울 정도로 부족하지. 직접 보면 이해할 수 있을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 0327d1cc-033d-4c5f-bb19-c9681e8bc795
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:0327d1cc-033d-4c5f-bb19-c9681e8bc795
msgctxt "hf14a7b74g21f7g49a4g9537g49700921c199"
msgid "Now, given your prying nature, I have work for you, as a scout."
msgstr "자, 너의 호기심 많은 성격을 감안할 때, 정찰병으로서 해야 할 일을 주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03e670e3-a1e4-4039-8ac6-9cf01633425c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_SaidNoToHelpWithNightsong(1) = True
#. TagRule: SHAR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:03e670e3-a1e4-4039-8ac6-9cf01633425c
msgctxt "hd55d325dgb1bdg4589g9feeg0f4cb9bc1073"
msgid ""
"I'm not helping. You trespassed in Lady Shar's temple - this is a problem of "
"your own making."
msgstr "난 돕지 않겠다. 너는 샤 여신의 신전을 무단 침입했다. 이건 너 스스로가 만든 문제야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 03e670e3-a1e4-4039-8ac6-9cf01633425c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_SaidNoToHelpWithNightsong(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:03e670e3-a1e4-4039-8ac6-9cf01633425c
msgctxt "hf5c9c609g2a43g41f5g979ag8aeed9fd625c"
msgid "This sounds like your problem, not mine."
msgstr "이건 나완 상관없는 네 문제인 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 03f05e20-54e2-4c1e-9133-323ad47169c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_State_AskedHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:03f05e20-54e2-4c1e-9133-323ad47169c9
msgctxt "heb4b4832g0d1ag465cg8bacg585fcf36fb33"
msgid ""
"While you, an <i>infinitely </i>more humble servant, fulfil my command. I "
"will put you to work - as a scout."
msgstr "그러면 너는, <i>한없이 더</i> 겸허한 종으로서, 내 명령을 따르는 거다. 내가 일을 하나 주지. 정찰 임무다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 05d5622a-6332-4066-b911-5134ccb47e27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Even_NightsongBriefing(1) = True
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_SaidNoToHelpWithNightsong(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:05d5622a-6332-4066-b911-5134ccb47e27
msgctxt "h65b076c0gbb67g4671gbb9bgdec8b59b0a91"
msgid ""
"All right, I'll help you find the Nightsong - and yes, I know more about "
"this 'relic' than you realise."
msgstr "그래, 밤의 노래를 찾는 걸 도와주지... 그리고 맞아, 이 '유물'에 대해선 너보다 더 많이 알고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0a942ada-2caa-4497-afb3-029c8b4d2c78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:0a942ada-2caa-4497-afb3-029c8b4d2c78
msgctxt "h940770cag31e5g4dfdgb8cagbd6921cc2593"
msgid ""
"Because I'll rip your tongue out, shove it down your throat, then stomp on "
"your 'creations' until they are dirt beneath my feet."
msgstr ""
"왜냐하면, 내가 네 혀를 뜯어내고, 목구멍에 쑤셔 박은 다음, 네 '피조물'들이 내 발밑의 흙으로 돌아갈 때까지 짓밟을 것이기 때문이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 0c50d285-36f1-44b1-b2a6-1cb681180ee2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:0c50d285-36f1-44b1-b2a6-1cb681180ee2
msgctxt "h25d90833g33a7g486fg9895g9aacb512d015"
msgid ""
"Ah, it was you who pulled his sorry carcass from the rubble. You should have "
"left him there."
msgstr "아, 네가 놈의 가엾은 몸뚱아리를 돌무더기에서 꺼내줬나 보군. 그냥 내버려뒀어야 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0ec5a4ea-f36c-4457-b652-de4d81e64581
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:0ec5a4ea-f36c-4457-b652-de4d81e64581
msgctxt "hb0e6b5d2ga636g4f37g9566g66eda9ca4310"
msgid ""
"*The thought eludes you. Perhaps you saw a passing reference in some old "
"tome.*"
msgstr "*생각이 나지 않습니다. 아마 어떤 오래된 학술서에서 대충 언급하고 지나간 걸 보았을 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 126128fb-208a-4e4b-94f3-a133c2a61218
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:126128fb-208a-4e4b-94f3-a133c2a61218
msgctxt "h09582122g104cg44c6gae2eg4c6b6638b876"
msgid ""
"...Fine. I'll forgive your transgressions this time - there are much grander "
"things at stake."
msgstr "...좋다. 이번만 너의 죄를 눈감아 주지. 훨씬 더 큰 문제들이 걸려있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 1592bf3c-9ec5-4568-b585-f2cdea4e7a15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Even_NightsongBriefing(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:1592bf3c-9ec5-4568-b585-f2cdea4e7a15
msgctxt "hdf1fb0f6g9176g4559g8f8cg882e84dead88"
msgid ""
"The relic is close, but the way is barred and Shar's dead are... "
"uncooperative. Clear the path for me - by blade, cunning, or whatever it "
"takes."
msgstr ""
"유물은 가까이에 있지만, 길은 막혀 있으며 샤의 시체들은... 비협조적이지. 나를 위해 길을 비우도록. 칼이나, 교활함이나, 뭐든 "
"활용해서."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1616d42e-96db-4444-8a88-b44699809163
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:1616d42e-96db-4444-8a88-b44699809163
msgctxt "h24e2e3d7g6796g412eg9c11g2b0828ff9918"
msgid ""
"Do it - unleash your creations. But they will not protect you from me - or "
"my righteous fury."
msgstr "해 봐라, 네 피조물을 풀어라. 그것들은 나, 혹은 나의 정의로운 분노로부터 널 지킬 수 없을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 16629ca4-c1a6-4f1f-a3a6-1dc8db9d83c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_MentionedZrell(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:16629ca4-c1a6-4f1f-a3a6-1dc8db9d83c8
msgctxt "haad62930g3d83g460cg85eege6a1f27ad7f4"
msgid ""
"Enough unpleasantries. You're Balthazar, yes? Z'rell sent me, to ensure you "
"didn't fail your master."
msgstr "불쾌한 얘기는 그만해. 네가 발타자르군, 맞지? 즈렐이 날 보냈다, 네 주인님의 일을 실패한 건지 확인하라고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 1699cfd9-fcfa-4d90-971f-0b35c50e4180
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_InvitedToRoom(1) = False
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_State_Naturalborn(1) = True
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet(1) = True
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:1699cfd9-fcfa-4d90-971f-0b35c50e4180
msgctxt "hd12ae2b1gd9fag4348g9071g4f283627d12d"
msgid ""
"Ah, the interloper - and in one piece as well. Not an entirely unpromising "
"specimen, for one <i>naturally-born</i>."
msgstr "아, 그 침입자로군. 게다가 사지가 멀쩡하다니. 그저 <i>평범하게 태어난 것</i>치고는 전혀 가능성 없는 표본은 아니군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1731b074-a054-44e8-aab3-c22c55d6fcdb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:1731b074-a054-44e8-aab3-c22c55d6fcdb
msgctxt "h0dfa1505g6e33g45b0ga839gf43489b9f279"
msgid "What do you need me to do?"
msgstr "내가 무엇을 돕길 바라는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ade2e8c-b2bd-4690-8364-06c9660b3158
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_SaidNoToHelpWithNightsong(1) = True
#. TagRule: SHAR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:1ade2e8c-b2bd-4690-8364-06c9660b3158
msgctxt "h8c6c45e2gdbb3g414bgb752g8e00d557f5b8"
msgid "Keep it - this is your problem, for trespassing in Lady Shar's temple."
msgstr "됐어, 이건 샤 여신의 신전을 무단 침입한 네 문제다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ade2e8c-b2bd-4690-8364-06c9660b3158
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_SaidNoToHelpWithNightsong(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:1ade2e8c-b2bd-4690-8364-06c9660b3158
msgctxt "h2ae70991gf83cg481dgaea4g20680b101a1f"
msgid "Keep it - this is your problem, not mine."
msgstr "됐어, 이건 네 문제지 내 문제가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1bff8db8-260f-4f8a-b286-f25fad06f38f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:1bff8db8-260f-4f8a-b286-f25fad06f38f
msgctxt "h00536730g317dg4724g8418g00e80c744771"
msgid ""
"Yet you seem no closer to retrieving the Nightsong? I read your notes - very "
"interesting."
msgstr "그럼에도 불구하고 밤의 노래를 회수하는 데 진전은 없단 말인가? 네 메모를 읽었지. 아주 흥미롭더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 1fa3ec22-c04c-4b6d-a0b4-d80fbe4876a8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_HasGolemBell(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:1fa3ec22-c04c-4b6d-a0b4-d80fbe4876a8
msgctxt "h3a66c292g4d06g4763gb215gd1e6e808aaf1"
msgid "...Hmm. Misplaced, it seems. You will be capable enough without it."
msgstr "...흠. 잃어버린 모양이군. 종 없이도 잘 헤쳐나갈 수 있을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 200fffd7-e3cc-41da-9f82-0b08c56ef078
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION or WARLOCK
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:200fffd7-e3cc-41da-9f82-0b08c56ef078
msgctxt "ha7555b33g38b4g4d0cg89ccge9065122a56c"
msgid ""
"Ah... you're a <i>leech</i>. Interesting... but there's always room for "
"improvement when it comes to the flesh."
msgstr "아... 너는 <i>흡혈귀</i>로구나. 흥미롭군... 하지만 육체적인 부분에 있어서는 항상 개선의 여지가 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 200fffd7-e3cc-41da-9f82-0b08c56ef078
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:200fffd7-e3cc-41da-9f82-0b08c56ef078
msgctxt "h0e622502g9ddcg4bafg9c41gbdf5e50a4637"
msgid ""
"Hatched, you say? That's novel, I'll admit, but still limiting. There's "
"always room for improvement when it comes to the flesh."
msgstr "부화했다고 말했나? 참신하군, 인정하마, 하지만 여전히 한계가 있어. 육체적인 부분에 있어서는 항상 개선의 여지가 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 200fffd7-e3cc-41da-9f82-0b08c56ef078
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:200fffd7-e3cc-41da-9f82-0b08c56ef078
msgctxt "hbdeb8587g168ag43b2gb8c4g1e9b4cd6a5a1"
msgid ""
"Not so. Womb births are such <i>imprecise</i> things... There's always room "
"for improvement when it comes to the flesh."
msgstr "그렇지 않다. 자궁 출산은 매우 <i>애매한</i> 것이지... 육체적인 부분에 있어서는 항상 개선의 여지가 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 206f31ed-c5bb-40d5-9f24-555a62867805
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:206f31ed-c5bb-40d5-9f24-555a62867805
msgctxt "h07929085gdbc8g473eg8488ga7e139b6936c"
msgid ""
"I could have, but decided not to - all the better for judging your mettle."
msgstr "그럴 수도 있었지만, 그러지 않았다. 네 기개를 알아보기엔 그 편이 더 낫더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 222af5ec-96d7-4c61-a9c1-93d397eff946
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_MentionedZrell(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:222af5ec-96d7-4c61-a9c1-93d397eff946
msgctxt "he8e3c3b6gc474g4e31g933dgf4e879908b33"
msgid ""
"You, Z'rell, all the rest... you have only one body with which to serve. I "
"have as many as I care to make."
msgstr "너, 즈렐, 나머지 모두... 섬길 수 있는 몸은 오직 하나뿐이지. 나는 내가 만들고 싶은 만큼 많이 가지고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 23676bf1-43d8-4b43-a39e-97d8e3ce39b6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:23676bf1-43d8-4b43-a39e-97d8e3ce39b6
msgctxt "h91eda790g687dg49b5g852cg656c0ea00bc5"
msgid ""
"You are a True Soul - there is no excuse for you to not recognise your "
"betters."
msgstr "넌 참된 영혼이다. 네 상사를 알아보지 못한다는 변명은 통하지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26aea6ce-e84e-4b14-a35a-615a768c8e25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_DidHistoryCheck(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_DidHistoryCheck(1) = True
#. TagRule: BARD or MONK
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:26aea6ce-e84e-4b14-a35a-615a768c8e25
msgctxt "h4989d483g529cg4074gb236g1c2ae5f88df6"
msgid ""
"<i>You're sure you've read of a notable Balthazar before... But where?</i>"
msgstr "<i>분명 예전에 유명한 발타자르라는 사람에 대해 읽어본 적이 있었는데... 어디서 읽어봤던 걸까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 28d1d5bd-899a-46e6-8527-e8c9fcfe3720
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_SaidNoToHelpWithNightsong(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:28d1d5bd-899a-46e6-8527-e8c9fcfe3720
msgctxt "hc6eb3deagae04g4a1fg87c9g1fc948548f9f"
msgid "As much as I enjoy you flattering me, this isn't my problem."
msgstr "네 알랑거림을 듣는 건 즐겁지만, 이건 내 문제가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 28df08d5-bc4f-47ee-bae5-05e04c724305
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:28df08d5-bc4f-47ee-bae5-05e04c724305
msgctxt "hdc82a19bga30ag4b74gbfb9gdd15ecd2f21d"
msgid ""
"Though it's not all natural, is it? A touch of the divine... Most curious, "
"for a True Soul."
msgstr "그리고 이건 또 흥미롭군. 신성한 존재의 손길이 닿았다니... 참된 영혼치고는 흔치 않은 일인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 297129ea-06a1-43cb-b693-9e59d1f65696
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:297129ea-06a1-43cb-b693-9e59d1f65696
msgctxt "h73b4a84fgb571g4e78ga9d7g4543e76a9a13"
msgid ""
"This one's broken. He once tormented me as a youth, lifetimes ago. Now he "
"serves me, forever."
msgstr "이 녀석은 고장났어. 오래 전 젊은 시절에 나를 괴롭혔던 녀석이야. 지금은 나에게 복종하지, 영원히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 2abf8c05-f6fa-4dd0-92f8-13cf1d12ef06
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:2abf8c05-f6fa-4dd0-92f8-13cf1d12ef06
msgctxt "h54af0717gf8cdg4952ga7ceg589501e7da86"
msgid ""
"There is a relic here. One which General Thorm desires. No - <i>needs</i>. I "
"will retrieve it for him..."
msgstr "이곳에 유물이 하나 있다. 쏨 장군님께서 원하시는 것이지. <i>필요</i>한 게 아니라. 그분을 위해 회수할 것이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
