msgctxt "hdebc755dgfe66g4fd3gaa58g9198a8489674"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2f066b61-80d4-497f-afc0-09b49d92f949
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_ToldAboutNere(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_State_MentionedBalthazar = True
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_ToldGeneral = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_ToldAboutNere(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:2f066b61-80d4-497f-afc0-09b49d92f949
msgctxt "hf832353agf672g4743ga46dg7a2fcf88221b"
msgid ""
"Nere mentioned that you were seeking access to the Temple. Looks like you "
"found it."
msgstr "네가 신전으로 들어갈 길을 찾고 있다고 니어가 말해줬다. 보아하니 찾은 거 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 31b08f48-753e-4b05-a259-c626ca1ac0a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_PlayerAttacked = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:31b08f48-753e-4b05-a259-c626ca1ac0a2
msgctxt "h68918719ge8d6g47afgab2bge2685918df43"
msgid ""
"I take it the breaking of my skeletons was an accident - the living are so "
"clumsy, after all."
msgstr "내 해골들을 박살낸 건 그냥 넘어가 주마. 살아있는 것들이란 원래 다 어리석으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3273b05b-aace-432b-a5e0-548b68826530
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_AskedAboutGolem(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_AskedAboutMother(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:3273b05b-aace-432b-a5e0-548b68826530
msgctxt "hebb6bac6gf4c6g4840gba72g275241d0ce15"
msgid "What happened to your mother?"
msgstr "네 어머니는 어떻게 됐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 32e654eb-82b8-44b9-b891-e7777fb894fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Even_NightsongBriefing(1) = True
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_SaidNoToHelpWithNightsong(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:32e654eb-82b8-44b9-b891-e7777fb894fb
msgctxt "h9c9fd306g831ag4ac5gb897g37f9a0098fd9"
msgid "All right, I'll help you find the Nightsong."
msgstr "좋아, 밤의 노래를 찾는 것을 돕겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 360036f6-772c-49e4-9d93-1700eb11c823
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:360036f6-772c-49e4-9d93-1700eb11c823
msgctxt "h68bb0ad1g419ag4eaega50dg8f04476337ff"
msgid "No, I think I'll keep her."
msgstr "싫다, 그녀는 내가 가져야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 361c0bf1-9c05-43e3-8a9a-230c23cbc9d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:361c0bf1-9c05-43e3-8a9a-230c23cbc9d0
msgctxt "h8a2939b2gce7ag4b0fg97b6gf13650f3e61f"
msgid "No, I just decided to kill you instead."
msgstr "아니, 그냥 널 죽이기로 결심했을 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 37ff4da7-e1e8-4a69-9893-cd9f7e4105cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:37ff4da7-e1e8-4a69-9893-cd9f7e4105cc
msgctxt "h764ba181g8eedg4974gb7f2g8bd1cb2d86a3"
msgid ""
"Doesn't matter - I've already mapped out five escape routes. But I'll bite - "
"who are you?"
msgstr "문제없다. 난 이미 5개의 탈출로를 설정해 놨거든. 근데 좀 묻자, 넌 누구냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 394c0222-14d4-4efb-b850-3d7971e44593
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_MentionedMikan(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:394c0222-14d4-4efb-b850-3d7971e44593
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h870f6718gb5bag4af6ga642gc1605124507e"
msgid "What exactly will you be doing while I'm out risking myself?"
msgstr "내가 목숨을 걸고 돌아다닐 동안 넌 뭘 하게 되는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 39df6a88-c36a-4c80-b549-67caf2ed96e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:39df6a88-c36a-4c80-b549-67caf2ed96e0
msgctxt "hd32d69adgb6d0g4e64ga050ga1a26452e7e9"
msgid ""
"He didn't seem very legendary when I took his name - naught but a pile of "
"bones. Impressive tomb, though."
msgstr "내가 그의 이름을 가져갔을 땐 그다지 전설적으로 보이지 않았다. 그저 뼈 무더기였지. 묘비만큼은 인상적이더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 3b976130-9481-41cf-8ac4-2d7e8ae0da6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:3b976130-9481-41cf-8ac4-2d7e8ae0da6f
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h167910f4gab6bg4910gb6e5g335e14303d66"
msgid "No rest for you yet, Mikan. You will serve me until I am satisfied."
msgstr "아직 쉴 때가 아니다, 미칸. 넌 날 섬겨야 한다. 내가 만족할 때까지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 3bb3d3f3-d140-4c80-b7b0-eef24dba3f34
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:3bb3d3f3-d140-4c80-b7b0-eef24dba3f34
msgctxt "hee896948g5a9dg4487g98bag352c20beb718"
msgid ""
"Do you truly expect your <i>betters </i>to sully their hands to aid you at "
"every turn, True Soul? Such a poor grasp of hierarchy..."
msgstr ""
"너보다 더 <i>뛰어난 </i>이들이, 매번 널 위해 손을 더럽히며 도와줄 거라고 진정 기대하는 건가, 참된 영혼? 네 위치를 너무나도 "
"망각하고 있군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c22f27f-c4f9-42dd-90ca-26f82e4ca614
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:3c22f27f-c4f9-42dd-90ca-26f82e4ca614
msgctxt "he56d30f1g9e5ag464fg99dbg50ee8ecfc09c"
msgid "I had Z'rell's permission - that good enough for you?"
msgstr "즈렐의 허가를 받았다. 그 정도면 충분하겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c767bff-2016-4747-b231-8d9d12186b27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:3c767bff-2016-4747-b231-8d9d12186b27
msgctxt "h412b49e0g340fg4a91gb26bg75dcc7dd1653"
msgid ""
"I think I'd rather exploit the Nightsong for myself - after I've gotten rid "
"of you."
msgstr "차라리 널 제거하고 난 후, 나 자신을 위해 밤의 노래를 이용하는 것이 더 낫겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d222833-6462-48f8-854f-acedd108de2d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:3d222833-6462-48f8-854f-acedd108de2d
msgctxt "hb244f29dg15c1g4a80g8f2bgbe8aa9791345"
msgid "Judging by how you're cowering in here, your survival?"
msgstr "네가 여기 웅크려 있는 걸 보아하니, 네 목숨이려나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3f611d17-b8be-425e-8896-0743876b3df7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:3f611d17-b8be-425e-8896-0743876b3df7
msgctxt "h5f2654a3g5410g40b6g9f1bg3d42ade16173"
msgid ""
"I received permission. Take it up with your peers at Moonrise, if you have "
"an issue."
msgstr "난 허가를 받았다. 만약 문제 삼고 싶다면, 문라이즈에서 너의 동료들과 얘기해 보도록 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 3f639581-c2dc-413a-acb0-84e6da46954a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_InvitedToRoom(1) = True
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet(1) = True
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:3f639581-c2dc-413a-acb0-84e6da46954a
msgctxt "h2741766dg5ed6g4915g9168g66be45529805"
msgid "Finally, we can talk face-to-face."
msgstr "마침내, 마주보고 이야기를 하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 3f6dfa79-560e-41f1-bd7c-6a0778b887cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:3f6dfa79-560e-41f1-bd7c-6a0778b887cd
msgctxt "h10adf38ag263dg47eag923bg53c19433be9f"
msgid "Do you know what is at stake here?"
msgstr "이곳에 어떤 게 걸려있는지 아나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42da964a-ac91-4b0e-92b0-1834ccbb044e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_Naturalborn(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_PlayerAttacked = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:42da964a-ac91-4b0e-92b0-1834ccbb044e
msgctxt "he1388b49g80fbg4a46ga1fag3fecf6d95159"
msgid "It's been some time since anyone considered me a natural anything."
msgstr "누군가가 나를 평범한 사람이라고 여기는 건 정말 오랜만인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42da964a-ac91-4b0e-92b0-1834ccbb044e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_Naturalborn(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_PlayerAttacked = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:42da964a-ac91-4b0e-92b0-1834ccbb044e
msgctxt "hd0376368gaa2eg4e25g9654g4a1fd56cb2fc"
msgid ""
"I was hatched in a crèche and have fought ever since. What do you care of my "
"gestation?"
msgstr "나는 양성소에서 부화한 이후로 전투의 삶을 살아왔다. 내 잉태 과정은 어떻게 생각하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 42da964a-ac91-4b0e-92b0-1834ccbb044e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_Naturalborn(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_PlayerAttacked = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:42da964a-ac91-4b0e-92b0-1834ccbb044e
msgctxt "h1c368afag159bg4a93gab64g71a4cd4d1009"
msgid "Naturally-born? That's a strange thing to hold against someone."
msgstr "<i>평범하게 태어난 것</i>이라고? 그것 가지고 뭐라고 하는 건 좀 이상한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 431482a7-07e2-4967-85dd-1c9fd6e39a53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 10
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_FailedBellPersuasion(1) = False
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_BellOffered(1) = False
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_HasGolemBell(0) = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:431482a7-07e2-4967-85dd-1c9fd6e39a53
msgctxt "h4ef4fbc6gda36g4e10ga273g62a066fd643f"
msgid ""
"For jobs like this it's good form to provide your operatives some extra "
"resources."
msgstr "이런 작업의 경우에는 요원에게 추가 자원을 제공하는 것이 효과적이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4378ea09-c91a-41c3-89e6-cbd46b73b19b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:4378ea09-c91a-41c3-89e6-cbd46b73b19b
msgctxt "h0be6c259g3ea5g4d11ga34bg0fe128cd1b6b"
msgid ""
"Sounds like you've good reason to be proud of the Nightsong - tell me more."
msgstr "밤의 노래를 자랑스러워할 만한 충분한 이유가 있는 거 같군, 더 말해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 449b360c-1fdc-4051-a6f6-f509fbda5949
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = True
#.   Object:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_GiveGolemBell(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:449b360c-1fdc-4051-a6f6-f509fbda5949
msgctxt "h188d5f53g91a2g4989g856fg0e94d001fdb4"
msgid "<i>Take the bell.</i>"
msgstr "<i>종을 가져간다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 451e8e6c-fe87-45a1-a64c-8da740b2f701
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_OrthonAcknowledged(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_OrthonLair_Knows_Orthon = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_OrthonAcknowledged(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:451e8e6c-fe87-45a1-a64c-8da740b2f701
msgctxt "h1167effegcd45g4967gad82g40dcd7afefe0"
msgid "About the orthon in these ruins - friend or foe to you?"
msgstr "이 폐허에 있는 오르쏜은... 너에게 있어서 친구인가? 아님 적인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 455aa875-a267-4a0e-917c-4d02cf50a059
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:455aa875-a267-4a0e-917c-4d02cf50a059
msgctxt "h46046f29g1830g453ag95cbg8b52a9a5269c"
msgid ""
"Not just any True Soul would have succeeded in following my path through "
"this place. You should be pleased."
msgstr "그저 평범한 참된 영혼이라면 내 길을 따라 이 곳에 올 수 없었을 텐데. 기뻐해도 좋다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 472a1d67-636f-45eb-96c1-1754b5b727fe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_HasGolemBell(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_BellOffered(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:472a1d67-636f-45eb-96c1-1754b5b727fe
msgctxt "hd8d083c2gcd26g42e7ga5f1g96d8aa21d3cc"
msgid "...and he will come."
msgstr "...그가 올 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 4742a3de-f1c9-40cb-966b-11c5a4c8e5fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:4742a3de-f1c9-40cb-966b-11c5a4c8e5fc
msgctxt "hf7477a58gcdcdg4bb1g8c05gd8a12bf307db"
msgid ""
"...Fine. Your usefulness may outweigh your insolence - for now. There are "
"much grander things at stake."
msgstr "...좋다. 지금은, 너의 유용성이 무례함을 능가할 수도 있지. 훨씬 더 큰 문제들이 걸려있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4b3d6567-738b-4ac9-addf-427ecab261f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_MentionedZrell(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:4b3d6567-738b-4ac9-addf-427ecab261f2
msgctxt "h4d66a1dbgef00g44e5g90cfg53ec1337f6bb"
msgid ""
"I'm friendly. Z'rell sent me to make sure you weren't failing your master."
msgstr "난 아군이다. 즈렐이 날 보냈지, 네 주인님의 일을 실패한 건지 확인하라고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 4ca5c323-d79a-422d-a47a-99e89493dfd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:4ca5c323-d79a-422d-a47a-99e89493dfd1
msgctxt "h0e2de6bbg1931g492aga962gb3b6a0a96859"
msgid "What the...? Give me back my mother, this instant!"
msgstr "뭐라...? 내 어머니를 내놔, 지금 당장!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cde1325-8c48-4801-b14e-298bb4629f97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Even_NightsongBriefing(1) = True
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_SaidNoToHelpWithNightsong(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:4cde1325-8c48-4801-b14e-298bb4629f97
msgctxt "h3dde4f82ga2bbg4b84g9d20gafc3ababf856"
msgid "All right, I'll help you find this relic."
msgstr "좋아, 유물을 찾는 것을 돕지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 4f4dbe55-2fac-489f-ba1f-a8ab0fad2b2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:4f4dbe55-2fac-489f-ba1f-a8ab0fad2b2a
msgctxt "hf466a22ag1d67g4424g964bg8e0fef545f91"
msgid "<i>General Thorm...?</i>"
msgstr "<i>쏨 장군님께서...?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4f8d9efe-9b33-467e-b813-b5c3c935e036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:4f8d9efe-9b33-467e-b813-b5c3c935e036
msgctxt "hf2b70d0dg9887g45cdg90d8geb8c8abd81c7"
msgid ""
"Touch me, and I'll strike you down with all of nature's fang and fury. Go "
"ahead - try me."
msgstr "나를 건드린다면, 자연의 모든 송곳니와 분노로 널 때려눕혀 주마. 어서 해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 4fb594e0-cd00-42bb-99cb-2cd5e04efd13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:4fb594e0-cd00-42bb-99cb-2cd5e04efd13
msgctxt "h792e62bcga009g4718g8503g5356080d0c0d"
msgid ""
"Interesting, and <i>private</i>. Give me one reason why I shouldn't have my "
"creations kill you right now, thief."
msgstr "흥미롭고, <i>사적이지</i>. 내 피조물들을 시켜 널 죽이지 않을 이유를 한 가지 대 봐라, 도둑놈."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 4fe0f208-2132-4dfd-8c65-e97f41d73d64
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:4fe0f208-2132-4dfd-8c65-e97f41d73d64
msgctxt "h02ecc4e2g54dag4c94gab14g4c7fc97c0c06"
msgid "We're still close. She's in a jar on the shelf over there."
msgstr "우린 여전히 가까운 사이지. 저기 선반에 있는 병 안에 계신다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 521b9752-1aff-420f-9ba7-26eb69dd56eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Knows_InvulnerabilitySource = True
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_State_AskedHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:521b9752-1aff-420f-9ba7-26eb69dd56eb
msgctxt "h782990b9g7fbbg4428g9667g516896744e92"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong lends the General his strength, his invulnerability. It must "
"be recovered, before his enemies attempt to exploit it."
msgstr "밤의 노래는 장군님께 힘과 무적을 제공하지. 그분의 적들이 이용하려고 시도하기 전에 반드시 되찾아야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 527ca591-1aa8-47a0-a6cd-4302d7d1fe0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_RefusedOnce(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:527ca591-1aa8-47a0-a6cd-4302d7d1fe0a
msgctxt "hfe2fa60bg0c3ag4904gbc89g8c6a25481c7b"
msgid ""
"Go, then - you'll either come to your senses, or die in this place without "
"me."
msgstr "가라, 그럼... 정신을 차리든지, 아니면 나 없이 이곳에서 죽든지 해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 53589488-7462-4d3e-ba82-61b427bf29b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:53589488-7462-4d3e-ba82-61b427bf29b4
msgctxt "h3fcbf4b2gf443g4a23g8e82g4c83cd1096a6"
msgid ""
"Flesh will remain here until called. Don't fear, he has very sharp hearing - "
"I chose his ears myself. Now, get to work."
msgstr ""
"육체는 부름을 받기 전까지 여기 있을 것이다. 걱정하지 마라, 그의 청력은 매우 예민하니까. 내가 직접 고른 귀거든. 자, 일을 시작해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5430d358-f4a1-403e-af87-bdc5cdab8e13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = False
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_DidHistoryCheck(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_DidHistoryCheck(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:5430d358-f4a1-403e-af87-bdc5cdab8e13
msgctxt "hb0131fe4gb0a8g4f33g817aga97b1ad77696"
msgid "<i>The name Balthazar seems vaguely familar, but from where?</i>"
msgstr "<i>발타자르라는 이름이 어렴풋이 익숙합니다, 하지만 어디서?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 54fcd82d-1073-47df-98d2-6fd678283617
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_SaidNoToHelpWithNightsong(1) = True
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:54fcd82d-1073-47df-98d2-6fd678283617
msgctxt "heb51aae9ga156g43e6gadcfg2832e49fd628"
msgid "I said you'd be back. Reconsidered my proposition?"
msgstr "네가 돌아올 거라고 했지. 제안은 생각해봤나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56e3aea2-5d13-4e32-9f88-f467967863e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = True
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_DidHistoryCheck(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_DidHistoryCheck(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:56e3aea2-5d13-4e32-9f88-f467967863e4
msgctxt "h2a452a71gd9a2g4384gb912g527823055d88"
msgid ""
"<i>The name Balthazar seems familar, but not as a servant of Ketheric Thorm. "
"Where have you heard it before?</i>"
msgstr "<i>발타자르라는 이름은 익숙한 듯 한데, 케서릭 쏨 수하에 있는 인물은 아니었다. 어디서 들어봤던 걸까?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 580ba872-6793-44c3-99c4-bca35a2a5c70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:580ba872-6793-44c3-99c4-bca35a2a5c70
msgctxt "hc222d730g0a0ag4442gb14dg2dd81284d9ea"
msgid "Enlighten me."
msgstr "가르쳐 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5c8b9fc7-f867-4815-9921-6adeaf194a22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:5c8b9fc7-f867-4815-9921-6adeaf194a22
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "*This necromancer has Ketheric's trust. Helping him could be just what you "
#| "need to gain acccess to the man himself.*"
msgctxt "h199f7bb1g30f1g4e7ag8316g8324d6c8952b"
msgid ""
"*This necromancer has Ketheric's trust. Helping him could be just what you "
"need to gain access to the man himself.*"
msgstr "*이 사령술사는 케서릭의 신임을 받고 있습니다. 그를 돕는 것이 케서릭에게 접근하기 위해 필요한 것일 수도 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 6026ea08-2199-47bc-a0e3-78b99771f5fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:6026ea08-2199-47bc-a0e3-78b99771f5fd
msgctxt "h6b3b05c8gd0e1g4e3bg920dg9a8a94e4278b"
msgid ""
"But enough idle chatter - keep to the matter at hand. You <i>do </i>know "
"what's at stake here, yes?"
msgstr "한가한 잡담은 이제 그만, 당면한 문제에 집중해야지. 너는 여기서 중요한 게 뭔지 알고 <i>있을 거야</i>, 그렇지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60922b8e-dac1-498b-ab53-0430e2f72d07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Knows_BalthazarHistorySuccess(1) = True
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_AskedAboutBalthazar(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_AskedAboutBalthazar(1) = True
#. TagRule: BARD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:60922b8e-dac1-498b-ab53-0430e2f72d07
msgctxt "ha1afa446g31c4g456bg9f12gf6943cf7b74e"
msgid ""
"I recall tales of Balthazar the Monk - I must say, the legends don't do you "
"justice."
msgstr "발타자르라는 몽크의 이야기가 기억나는군. 이 말은 해야겠어, 전설은 당신을 정의롭게 하지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60922b8e-dac1-498b-ab53-0430e2f72d07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Knows_BalthazarHistorySuccess(1) = True
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_AskedAboutBalthazar(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_AskedAboutBalthazar(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:60922b8e-dac1-498b-ab53-0430e2f72d07
msgctxt "hda32e6e9gfc4bg40e8gb156g8c55d53d96f0"
msgid ""
"Balthazar - I heard of a monk by that name once. He died a long time ago."
msgstr "발타자르, 그 이름을 가진 몽크에 대해 들어본 적이 있다. 그는 오래 전에 죽었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 610463e8-c598-4eb7-80d5-78489fbfdb26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:610463e8-c598-4eb7-80d5-78489fbfdb26
msgctxt "ha465cb80g8dd1g44cbga463g8d41684cf15a"
msgid "As you mention serving Ketheric, he sent you to find a relic, no?"
msgstr "케서릭을 섬긴다고 했었지, 유물을 찾으라고 보낸 거 맞나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6341a25b-27c5-42c1-b946-ecf8deaa7b53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:6341a25b-27c5-42c1-b946-ecf8deaa7b53
msgctxt "ha7fe7c9eg9bd4g4ea2gb312g5fbe1f85bece"
msgid "Your creations? Mindless undead minions, from what I've seen."
msgstr "네 피조물들? 내가 본 건 생각 없는 언데드 추종자들뿐이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 661c8bb9-5af0-4575-94f7-500a35999f7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:661c8bb9-5af0-4575-94f7-500a35999f7c
msgctxt "hf73d8611g839dg4f19g8d30gc12867e5c464"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "넌 누구냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6841ed89-a17a-4f51-bce4-ecfc99c16195
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Knows_BalthazarHistorySuccess(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:6841ed89-a17a-4f51-bce4-ecfc99c16195
msgctxt "h1c7fce2egbca6g41f7g88a4g0f7961b59f15"
msgid ""
"*You remember an ancient scroll rescued from an Amkethran monastery. It "
"spoke of Balthazar, the monastic order's leader. Specifically, it recorded "
"his death.*"
msgstr ""
"*앰케스란의 수도원에서 건져낸 오래된 두루마리가 기억납니다. 수도원의 지도자 발타자르의 이야기가 적혀 있었고, 구체적으로는 그의 죽음에 "
"대해 기록되어 있었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b713279-8f4e-4833-bd94-669d913b85f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_AskedAboutMother(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_HasMother(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:6b713279-8f4e-4833-bd94-669d913b85f8
msgctxt "h227662d6g2f0bg473agaf28g4629706b9338"
msgid "Actually, I have your mother."
msgstr "사실, 네 어머니 내가 가지고 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 6b7f6818-06b8-49a0-ad24-53cf984fd136
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_MentionedMikan(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:6b7f6818-06b8-49a0-ad24-53cf984fd136
msgctxt "h357eb6beg4042g4274ga0acg13069f8dc281"
msgid "Do not fail me, or you can share in Mikan's fate."
msgstr "실패하지 마라, 아니면 미칸과 운명을 함께 하게 될 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b801e12-b7f0-4857-9992-3379b872263c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:6b801e12-b7f0-4857-9992-3379b872263c
msgctxt "h23fecfbcgca6cg4ee2gbe81gbf4fe5dc8cb0"
msgid "Something called the Nightsong. Your notes were very interesting."
msgstr "밤의 노래라 불리는 것이지. 네 노트는 무척 흥미롭더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 6ea3ac44-9fbd-4a01-b085-ec0de9cac09a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:6ea3ac44-9fbd-4a01-b085-ec0de9cac09a
msgctxt "hdd6a4d46g529dg499egafebg72b4d7893e58"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you'd be more useful dead than alive if you don't even know what I'm "
"seeking here."
msgstr "내가 이곳에서 뭘 찾는지도 모른다면 너는 죽은 상태에서 더 쓸모가 있을 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6f225a31-b6c9-4c41-a53c-20cbeddde84e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:6f225a31-b6c9-4c41-a53c-20cbeddde84e
msgctxt "hb4966236g3340g4ae0g8b59g807828df73ca"
msgid "You didn't look deep enough. This will be your end, monster."
msgstr "아주 깊게 보진 못했나 보군. 네놈은 끝장이다, 괴물아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 717777b5-1fcc-46df-950a-f94a10ed4060
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:717777b5-1fcc-46df-950a-f94a10ed4060
msgctxt "h631a2fa4g602ag49bfgb874g2507dd114852"
msgid ""
"In part, yes - my poor unborn twin. Mother always resented me for it - said "
"<i>I </i>strangled him in the womb, if you can believe such tripe."
msgstr ""
"부분적으로는 그렇다. 태어나지 못한 내 가엾은 쌍둥이지. 그 때문에 어머니는 항상 나를 원망하더군. <i>내가</i> 자궁에서 그를 목 "
"졸랐다고 말이야. 네가 그런 헛소리를 믿는다면야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71ff2a1c-ac2d-438b-bed1-24007580fbf8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:71ff2a1c-ac2d-438b-bed1-24007580fbf8
msgctxt "h3e3b154fgc0d4g4840g8718gbd81bfd17b3b"
msgid ""
"Well, I'm not <i>just</i> a True Soul. I have some extraplanar help, so to "
"speak."
msgstr "글쎄, 난 <i>단순한</i> 참된 영혼이 아니야. 말하자면, 다른 차원의 도움을 받고 있다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 75a00b23-1296-4b42-be24-df3119f760dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:75a00b23-1296-4b42-be24-df3119f760dd
msgctxt "h76d94cb7gae08g48cegaf63g7df78df019fc"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong is my finest creation - if I never exceed myself, I will still "
"die happy. Not that I ever intend to do something as gauche as truly dying, "
"of course."
msgstr ""
"밤의 노래는 내가 만든 최고의 작품이다. 그걸 넘어서는 것을 다신 만들지 못하더라도, 여전히 행복하게 죽을 수 있을 정도지. 물론 진짜로 "
"죽는 것 같은 천박한 짓을 할 생각은 전혀 없지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 76232b9b-534b-4b60-ae6b-62e1f28c7882
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:76232b9b-534b-4b60-ae6b-62e1f28c7882
msgctxt "h39d64936g7c35g48fcgbacagf10609615a31"
msgid ""
"Rubbish. Everything is at hand here - Z'rell merely envies the General's "
"faith in me. I am in the midst of a grand strategy."
msgstr ""
"허튼소리. 모든 것 내 통제 하에 있다. 즈렐은 단지 나에 대한 장군의 신뢰를 질투할 뿐이지. 나는 이 위대한 계획의 중심에 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 78854b71-47a6-41c8-adf0-16ccc4c91333
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:78854b71-47a6-41c8-adf0-16ccc4c91333
msgctxt "h8a1f4e5dgb051g4a0dg9d5eg4bf4f7003820"
msgid "Wrong - no part of you will remain here when I'm finished with you."
msgstr "틀렸어. 내가 너를 끝장내면 너의 어떤 부분도 이곳에 남지 않을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 794ab54c-3399-4866-8a44-af6a9eede58a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:794ab54c-3399-4866-8a44-af6a9eede58a
msgctxt "h25f57f96g625cg4edfg9d2bg340b4b85d1dd"
msgid ""
"Besides, once I developed my powers, I fetched him from the graveyard and "
"brought him back - gave him a new, <i>better</i> body. Alas, mother was... "
"not pleased."
msgstr ""
"내 능력을 개발한 후, 묘지에서 그를 꺼낸 다음 다시 살려냈지. 새롭고 <i>더 좋은</i> 신체를 주었는데도, 아아, 어머니는... "
"기뻐하지 않으셨어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 7cd4de8e-e5ec-4a1e-8224-3fa4ebb709a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Orthon_State_Defeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:7cd4de8e-e5ec-4a1e-8224-3fa4ebb709a1
msgctxt "hac58597dg5bccg4a1bg827fg79ea3c1d506a"
msgid ""
"That caterwauling beast is irrelevant as far as I'm concerned - unless he "
"hampers my goals. In that case, consider him a foe, and act accordingly."
msgstr ""
"발정 난 고양이처럼 울어대는 그 짐승은 내 목표를 방해하지 않는 한 나와 무관하다. 반대의 경우에는, 적으로 간주하고 적절한 행동을 "
"취하도록 해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 7d3709eb-443e-4a83-a63d-425b78638e9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:7d3709eb-443e-4a83-a63d-425b78638e9c
msgctxt "h52e8ee4bg5feag458cg8689gb365eebe0f6f"
msgid ""
"I'd trust this gasbag about as far as I can throw him - which isn't far. But "
"perhaps better to play along, for now."
msgstr ""
"난 이 허풍선이를 내가 던질 수 있을 거리만큼만 믿겠어. 멀리 가진 않겠지만. 하지만 지금은 같이 어울리는 게 더 나을 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 7d3ac892-c6d5-445a-9550-a400b5c6902a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:7d3ac892-c6d5-445a-9550-a400b5c6902a
msgctxt "ha4e4fb64g1e0cg43aeg9a8bg9fb5322d5645"
msgid ""
"You and all the rest have only one body with which to serve. I have as many "
"as I care to make."
msgstr "너 그리고 나머지 모두... 섬길 수 있는 몸은 오직 하나뿐이지. 나는 내가 만들고 싶은 만큼 많이 가지고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7e1cf249-947e-4997-8dd8-aa9227bf7b54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = False
#.      - WARLOCK(1) = False
#.      - WIZARD(1) = False
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#.      - ROGUE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:7e1cf249-947e-4997-8dd8-aa9227bf7b54
msgctxt "h8865341egb445g4c11g8b1cgb4b2f771db53"
msgid "I need more to go on. Why is this relic so important? What does it do?"
msgstr "진행하려면 더 많은 정보가 필요해. 왜 이 유물이 그렇게 중요한 거지? 그것이 어떤 기능을 하는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7fc21066-9e09-4abc-b426-fee269ef8d1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = True
#. TagRule: SHAR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:7fc21066-9e09-4abc-b426-fee269ef8d1e
msgctxt "hda04c53agcb3ag411cgbd74gccc5e131c466"
msgid "Lady Shar forgive me... but I'll see what I can do to help."
msgstr "샤 여신이시여 용서하소서... 도울 수 있는 방법을 찾아보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7fc21066-9e09-4abc-b426-fee269ef8d1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:7fc21066-9e09-4abc-b426-fee269ef8d1e
msgctxt "h781f0de0g6ca6g4b15gafd0g8326e7c2cfa6"
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "내가 할 수 있는 방법을 찾아 보지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 804bb66c-a9a1-4480-9555-28348bb6e387
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:804bb66c-a9a1-4480-9555-28348bb6e387
msgctxt "hebad55edg8371g4d98g899eg2694cd3eabfd"
msgid ""
"Dull, dull, dull. Nere was never cut out to be a True Soul - he's a very "
"obedient corpse, though."
msgstr "멍청하고, 멍청하고, 멍청해. 니어는 참된 영혼으로서는 영 자질이 없었다. 하지만 굉장히 순종적인 시체지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 80725973-22f8-42ea-b20a-5d7322cf367b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:80725973-22f8-42ea-b20a-5d7322cf367b
msgctxt "h05b706cegd79eg44f0g85fdg7930f83d7c6e"
msgid "Such a... <i>limited</i> grasp of mortality. Idiot."
msgstr "그것 참... 죽음에 대한 <i>부족한</i> 이해력이로군. 멍청한 자식."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80a1fadf-4ef9-41cc-ac52-3e820738fbd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:80a1fadf-4ef9-41cc-ac52-3e820738fbd4
msgctxt "h39052d47g853eg47cdg94fbg3b594b019d7f"
msgid "I think I'd rather exploit this relic - after I've gotten rid of you."
msgstr "차라리 널 제거하고 난 후, 그 유물을 이용하는 것이 더 낫겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80e1d2a2-27ec-471d-8f01-c97f2b1e9710
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_OrthonAcknowledged(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_OrthonLair_Knows_Orthon = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_OrthonAcknowledged(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:80e1d2a2-27ec-471d-8f01-c97f2b1e9710
msgctxt "hc09443efg948ag4a74gb4f4g9483f9b1d7d1"
msgid ""
"You could have warned me about the orthon that was lurking in this place."
msgstr "이곳에 매복해있던 오르쏜에 대해 경고해 줄 수도 있었을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 81060dc4-8994-4bfe-aec2-2e1204c1c038
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Knows_BalthazarHistorySuccess(1) = True
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_AskedAboutBalthazar(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_AskedAboutBalthazar(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:81060dc4-8994-4bfe-aec2-2e1204c1c038
msgctxt "ha6353020g6b1dg48beg95bagcdc7ed85be17"
msgid ""
"Balthazar - I heard of a monk by that name once. He died a long time ago."
msgstr "발타자르, 그 이름을 가진 몽크에 대해 들어본 적이 있다. 그는 오래 전에 죽었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 816c1839-6498-497a-b839-4f6995c9eebf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_MINTHARA(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:816c1839-6498-497a-b839-4f6995c9eebf
msgctxt "h88b86656gdae7g4aa7ga9a0ge90a74911fff"
msgid "I'm pleased to be of service, Balthazar."
msgstr "섬길 수 있게 되어 기쁩니다, 발타자르 님."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 81a83b46-b286-454f-8c4e-4356837972a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:81a83b46-b286-454f-8c4e-4356837972a0
msgctxt "ha6de3b15g2926g4487g865age1a29f8d380e"
msgid ""
"...and you will help me. Ignorant you may be, you've shown some prowess in "
"scouting and combat by making it this far."
msgstr "...그리고 너는 날 도와야 한다. 무지하긴 해도, 여기까지 도달함으로써 정찰과 전투에서 어느 정도의 실력을 보여줬거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 84725d4c-473b-4075-8d38-83887f9e32ea
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:84725d4c-473b-4075-8d38-83887f9e32ea
msgctxt "hb412899ag1df2g4c96ga8a5gfbf414fd28c2"
msgid "My creations need tending to - not that it's any of your concern."
msgstr "내 창조물들을 돌봐야 해. 그건 네가 상관할 바가 아니지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 8611563a-b92e-4049-825f-2d4bf47c56a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:8611563a-b92e-4049-825f-2d4bf47c56a4
msgctxt "hcac0deabga44dg4499ga4f8g4a7debc24227"
msgid "You will obey - once you are reborn as one of my creations."
msgstr "너는 복종할 것이다... 내 창조물 중 하나로 다시 태어나면 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 87d96156-53cf-4cdc-9555-9fd3dbfd9630
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_PlayerAttacked = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:87d96156-53cf-4cdc-9555-9fd3dbfd9630
msgctxt "hd5fd4b22ga64bg490ega124g51bb0bf162ae"
msgid "Bold of you to assume I didn't destroy your skeletons deliberately."
msgstr "내가 일부러 네 해골들을 박살 낸 게 아니라고 생각한다니, 참 대담한 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88c24460-3a7c-4ee3-abd3-d60c74db52aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:88c24460-3a7c-4ee3-abd3-d60c74db52aa
msgctxt "h7cb5a493g65d1g4671g9fe1g623c9d60e033"
msgid ""
"I could break you quicker than you could squeak an order. Talk - who are you?"
msgstr "네가 명령을 찍찍대기도 전에 으스러뜨릴 수 있다. 말해라, 넌 누구냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b801a4a-1e76-4bb4-97c4-c125d77dcd8b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:8b801a4a-1e76-4bb4-97c4-c125d77dcd8b
msgctxt "h1ecea551gd6cag4207gaf27g803a5e5bfc99"
msgid ""
"Fine, consider your merits acknowledged. Care to enlighten me as to what's "
"going on?"
msgstr "좋아, 네 장점을 인정한다고 생각해라. 이제 무슨 일인지 설명해 주겠나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 927a27e0-b039-431c-9ba8-2c2a398627e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:927a27e0-b039-431c-9ba8-2c2a398627e2
msgctxt "h85034fadg29f1g4993gbc5bg3572ec6807bb"
msgid ""
"Telling you will not make the task any less perilous. Just obey, and use "
"your ignorance as a shield. You should be adept at that already."
msgstr "너에게 말해준다고 일이 덜 위험해지지는 않는다. 그냥 복종해라, 그리고 너의 무지를 방패로 삼아라. 이미 그 정도는 능숙해야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 92eb8cc8-11bf-4482-b359-d54df4990497
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:92eb8cc8-11bf-4482-b359-d54df4990497
msgctxt "h65f9037cgae9ag461cg885aga168eda3300c"
msgid ""
"Z'rell exceeds her authority. But fine, I'll overlook your transgressions "
"this time - there are much grander things at stake."
msgstr "즈렐 본인의 권한을 넘은 거다. 하지만 좋다, 이번만 너의 죄를 눈감아 주지. 훨씬 더 큰 문제들이 걸려있거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 936e0d70-380f-4ad5-8b58-7c3ed021cf16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:936e0d70-380f-4ad5-8b58-7c3ed021cf16
msgctxt "hebfd0d23g2352g4d87g8559g77d5cbc1b275"
msgid ""
"Been prying into my research, then? What a devious piece of flesh you are. "
"Consider yourself lucky that I have use for you."
msgstr "그럼, 내 연구를 캐고 있었다는 건가? 정말 교활한 살점 덩어리구나. 너를 이용하는 것을 다행으로 생각해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93f2f561-61f5-4bed-a31a-22418fc9f1dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:93f2f561-61f5-4bed-a31a-22418fc9f1dc
msgctxt "ha7c1d568gc9d6g4309ga838gc304df64721e"
msgid ""
"I hunt and kill monsters - such threats mean nothing to me. Talk - who are "
"you?"
msgstr "난 괴물을 사냥하고 죽이지. 그런 협박은 나에게 아무런 의미가 없어. 말해라. 넌 누구냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 946cd623-a497-4005-a589-84bcf5bd0b25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:946cd623-a497-4005-a589-84bcf5bd0b25
msgctxt "hfd4f9236g0eaeg4180gbd55g32ae2d1d3c1b"
msgid ""
"Oh, him? Yes, I decided to take his name for myself after taking his rib "
"bones. Suits me better, I think."
msgstr "오, 그 자 말인가? 그래, 그의 갈비뼈를 취한 후에 내 이름으로 삼기로 결정했지. 내게 더 잘 어울린다고 생각하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 96eb05b2-9ef4-413c-9f14-0c3219fefb8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Even_NightsongBriefing(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:96eb05b2-9ef4-413c-9f14-0c3219fefb8e
msgctxt "h54eca30bg12f5g4c4cgb509gcc3ee35d0e4a"
msgid "What do you need of me?"
msgstr "내게서 뭘 필요로 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 99072cae-b2e5-474d-8df8-bb96f400e251
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:99072cae-b2e5-474d-8df8-bb96f400e251
msgctxt "hc4f3fa12g59fcg4c0dgaf1fg16e91d797d0b"
msgid ""
"<i>General Thorm </i>to you. But yes, recovering the relic is the crux of "
"it. He commands, and I, his humble servant, fulfil that command."
msgstr ""
"<i>쏨 장군님</i>이라고 불러라. 어쨌든, 그렇다. 유물을 되찾는 것이 핵심이지. 그분께서 명령을 내리시면, 나는 그분의 겸허한 "
"종으로서, 그 명령을 따르는 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 9b21c8b6-6127-4d9f-8933-e7deb5fd1845
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:9b21c8b6-6127-4d9f-8933-e7deb5fd1845
msgctxt "hb792c610gdc0dg4d8bg97c3gf657b93f5424"
msgid "My creations are more than a sum of their parts."
msgstr "나의 피조물들은 단순한 부분의 합 그 이상이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9bb10df9-f0c6-4968-b2ac-b2ab77fa4046
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:9bb10df9-f0c6-4968-b2ac-b2ab77fa4046
msgctxt "ha07bac97gc58dg4d6eg8ad6g870d49b883d4"
msgid ""
"Sir, I am a jack-of-all-trades and a master of many. Our meeting was not by "
"chance - you <i>need</i> me."
msgstr "나으리, 전 해결사이자 수많은 분야의 대가입니다. 저희의 만남은 우연이 아닐지니, 당신은 제가 <i>필요</i>합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 9e0bb06b-470b-4542-acd8-bdd99e9d3c67
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_FailedBellPersuasion(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:9e0bb06b-470b-4542-acd8-bdd99e9d3c67
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h5b64ed18g70bbg4e5bga76ag49b0b6931dfa"
msgid ""
"I think not. You seem a capable type, and I'll need to keep myself well-"
"protected in this place."
msgstr "아니, 그렇게 하지 않겠네. 넌 충분히 유능한 녀석으로 보이고, 난 이곳에서 내 자신을 보호하고 있어야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 9e4a205e-c5d8-4666-b703-6c0d8529d042
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:9e4a205e-c5d8-4666-b703-6c0d8529d042
msgctxt "h732f3677g0b48g466aga4c1gbc8c39c86f40"
msgid ""
"My brother is no intellectual powerhouse, but he is strong, loyal and "
"punctual. Should a fight turn against you, remember the bell."
msgstr "내 동생은 지적인 부분은 떨어지지만, 강한 데다가 충성스럽고 시간을 잘 지키지. 싸움이 불리하게 돌아간다면, 종을 기억하거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = a00e3e21-2d77-4851-bf62-8b9589a3d78b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a00e3e21-2d77-4851-bf62-8b9589a3d78b
msgctxt "hdccb5e37gd042g4da1gb980gc8bcdb15006f"
msgid ""
"Is it? I've seen inside your head, thanks to my troops. Besides, if you were "
"an enemy, you'd be completely surrounded."
msgstr "그러한가? 나의 병사들을 이용해 네 머릿속을 들여다봤다. 게다가, 네가 진정 적이었다면 완전히 포위됐을 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = a025cecb-7c78-498e-bc69-5e7b5921cf7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a025cecb-7c78-498e-bc69-5e7b5921cf7d
msgctxt "he47ebc27g7308g4bf5gaa9fg04dd320cc0d5"
msgid ""
"Promising flesh wasted on an idiot mind, I see. I'll salvage what parts I "
"can from you."
msgstr "전도유망한 육체가 멍청한 정신에 낭비됐구나. 너에게서 쓸 수 있는 부분은 회수해 주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0f06828-a0d8-4199-8aff-0777ed665b2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_PlayerAttacked = False
#. TagRule: CLERIC
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a0f06828-a0d8-4199-8aff-0777ed665b2b
msgctxt "h8e838bbdg766fg4e9agbd94gf99115f52c6b"
msgid "Bold of you to assume I'm a comrade - considering you know of my god."
msgstr "내 신이 누구인지 알고 있으면서 같은 편이라 생각하다니 대담하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0f06828-a0d8-4199-8aff-0777ed665b2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_PlayerAttacked = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a0f06828-a0d8-4199-8aff-0777ed665b2b
msgctxt "h8a192e1fgcb61g40e3ga2eeg273052640ef8"
msgid "True Soul? Bold of you, to assume I'm a comrade."
msgstr "참된 영혼? 나를 같은 편으로 여기다니, 대담하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a217897a-9721-4806-a058-443449dd0d1c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_GiveMother(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a217897a-9721-4806-a058-443449dd0d1c
msgctxt "h62066e20g7b4dg4f5dga836g9e8b5b161d2c"
msgid "<i>Return Balthazar's mother.</i>"
msgstr "<i>발타자르의 어머니를 돌려준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a30dd2e5-7c23-47a3-a7dd-561e11f4938e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a30dd2e5-7c23-47a3-a7dd-561e11f4938e
msgctxt "h4348a7c6g151ag439bg9b0cg00106a20cf8a"
msgid "Obey? No - I will smite you where you stand, necromancer."
msgstr "복종? 아니... 네가 서 있는 그 자리에서 박살 내주마, 사령술사."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = a38a109c-45fb-402e-bd55-2a9f39e1973f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a38a109c-45fb-402e-bd55-2a9f39e1973f
msgctxt "h9cd2d276g0becg42f1gbcd5g73a8753593eb"
msgid ""
"I do not <i>need </i>you, or your help. But you are here in spite of that, "
"so I may as well make use of you."
msgstr "난 너와 너의 도움 따윈 <i>필요</i>없다. 하지만 네가 여기 있으니, 이용하도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a74fef68-2b4d-4603-9c80-0150f64aed89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: WIZARD_NECROMANCY
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a74fef68-2b4d-4603-9c80-0150f64aed89
msgctxt "hb9dda1bdg8f45g43ecgb25bged2079cc3c9d"
msgid ""
"Enough prattling. I'll show you what it is to <i>truly</i> command the dead. "
"Then I'm sending you to join them."
msgstr "그만 나불대라. 죽은 자를 <i>진정으로</i> 지휘하는 게 뭔지 보여주마. 그다음 너도 지휘해 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a74fef68-2b4d-4603-9c80-0150f64aed89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: WIZARD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a74fef68-2b4d-4603-9c80-0150f64aed89
msgctxt "h77435f9cg1deeg4634ga6d0g2ec4e99eb038"
msgid ""
"You've fouled the name of mages long enough. I'll never let you leave this "
"place alive, necromancer."
msgstr "넌 이미 마법사의 이름을 더럽힐 대로 더럽혔다. 이곳에서 절대 살려 보내진 않겠다, 사령술사."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a76f95fc-7e61-4deb-a02d-ed91d1cbf882
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_Naturalborn(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_PlayerAttacked = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a76f95fc-7e61-4deb-a02d-ed91d1cbf882
msgctxt "h5f6a13f4gfdd7g4e8bgb70eg4b402bfadf33"
msgid "I'm not exactly 'living', technically speaking."
msgstr "엄밀히 말해서, 난 '살아' 있지는 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a76f95fc-7e61-4deb-a02d-ed91d1cbf882
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_Naturalborn(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_PlayerAttacked = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a76f95fc-7e61-4deb-a02d-ed91d1cbf882
msgctxt "h668425b0gf167g42ecg91feg77f468d9986a"
msgid ""
"I was hatched in a crèche and have fought ever since. What do you care of my "
"gestation?"
msgstr "나는 양성소에서 부화한 이후로 전투의 삶을 살아왔다. 내 잉태 과정은 어떻게 생각하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a76f95fc-7e61-4deb-a02d-ed91d1cbf882
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_Naturalborn(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_PlayerAttacked = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a76f95fc-7e61-4deb-a02d-ed91d1cbf882
msgctxt "h098dcd7eg410bg4690g8611gf934df54a0ba"
msgid "Naturally-born? That's a strange thing to hold against someone."
msgstr "<i>평범하게 태어난 것</i>이라고? 그것 가지고 뭐라고 하는 건 좀 이상한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = a7c34e78-e5b8-46ad-9fb8-7681bf4c499d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a7c34e78-e5b8-46ad-9fb8-7681bf4c499d
msgctxt "hb82cf3e6g7f6ag4f01g9e70g2ec1d0751edf"
msgid "Good. And keep your hands to yourself in future."
msgstr "좋아. 다시는 남의 것에 손대지 마라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a880d43d-c2c1-44d9-a9cd-63065800460a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a880d43d-c2c1-44d9-a9cd-63065800460a
msgctxt "h0a68fb0dgd91dg4120g9b62g88cfc961be18"
msgid ""
"You expect your words to spark fear - but I am past such things. Who are you?"
msgstr "네 말이 공포의 불씨를 피우길 바라는구나, 허나 난 그런 것들을 뛰어넘었다. 넌 누구냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8e87a3d-eaf1-45a9-a8bf-bacc2fd2614f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_AskedAboutGolem(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_AskedAboutGolem(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:a8e87a3d-eaf1-45a9-a8bf-bacc2fd2614f
msgctxt "h367c0a5agbbfcg42eagba9cgddcffd290f4b"
msgid "Wait. It - <i>he</i> - is your brother?"
msgstr "잠깐. 이게, 아니 <i>이 자가</i> 네 동생이라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = abf6c158-767b-4d7c-9cf3-d6dea2dd6f4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_SaidNoToHelpWithNightsong(1) = False
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:abf6c158-767b-4d7c-9cf3-d6dea2dd6f4e
msgctxt "h560d97beg4abeg4685g9263g7a942daf2635"
msgid ""
"Not lost your nerve, I hope? I tend to remove those from my creations - too "
"much fuss."
msgstr "용기를 잃은 건 아니겠지? 내 창조물들은 그것을 제거하는 편이지... 너무 흥분해 대거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae5e1e3c-76ae-4bc2-9af3-6340985c0cdc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_ToldAboutNere(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_State_MentionedBalthazar = True
#.      - UND_TheDrowNere_Event_ToldGeneral = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_ToldAboutNere(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:ae5e1e3c-76ae-4bc2-9af3-6340985c0cdc
msgctxt "h980f623ag6575g44c0gab05gc317da431a08"
msgid ""
"Another True Soul was looking for you. Nere - I aided him in the Underdark."
msgstr "내가 언더다크에서 구해줬던 니어라는 참된 영혼도 널 찾더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = b167e31b-4e63-40f4-85f3-32a2bf4e0e50
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:b167e31b-4e63-40f4-85f3-32a2bf4e0e50
msgctxt "hf00ba8beg14aag4067gb01dga5d23772408a"
msgid "I gave you a chance, mother-thief!"
msgstr "난 기회를 준 거였다, 이 어머니 도둑놈아!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2352ebb-7ed5-47a3-938f-357f7e8064c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_MentionedZrell(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:b2352ebb-7ed5-47a3-938f-357f7e8064c5
msgctxt "hd616fbcagf374g4fd4g9a08ga877f7dbd443"
msgid ""
"Balthazar, I presume? Z'rell sent me. She thinks you're in danger of failing "
"your master."
msgstr "발타자르인가? 즈렐이 보내서 왔다. 네 주인을 실망시킬까 봐 걱정하더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b23e6a21-eab3-41aa-9980-aab6c57dcea8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - FIGHTER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:b23e6a21-eab3-41aa-9980-aab6c57dcea8
msgctxt "h071dd707gac81g45a7gbf35ga64ae11383c6"
msgid ""
"A scout is little good if they don't know what to look for. What does this "
"relic do?"
msgstr "정찰병이 무엇을 찾는지 모른다면 별로 쓸모가 없지. 그 유물의 기능이 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = b6805953-20da-4332-9451-a0b63cb87ab8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_MentionedMikan(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:b6805953-20da-4332-9451-a0b63cb87ab8
msgctxt "h8a716906g3488g43f6gbe35g0033297567d4"
msgid ""
"Do not fail me. If you do, you'll join the ranks of my creations, and be "
"forced to try again."
msgstr "실패하지 마라. 만약 그렇게 된다면, 내 창조물들의 대열에 널 합류 시키고, 다시 시도하게 할 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = b6f6fe7b-c3cd-45a5-951f-ed9294b494d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:b6f6fe7b-c3cd-45a5-951f-ed9294b494d5
msgctxt "h5ba846f7g1491g45afga1bdg34818fce37b5"
msgid ""
"But you're here now, and I may be able to put those limbs to work. You know "
"what's at stake here, I take it?"
msgstr "그러나 넌 이곳에 있지. 아마 네 팔다리를 바쁘게 만들어 줄 수 있겠어. 지금 뭐가 제일 중요한지 알고 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b78f64e8-c52b-4ba8-bf7b-c5a1d3f7d7a1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_SaidNoToHelpWithNightsong(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:b78f64e8-c52b-4ba8-bf7b-c5a1d3f7d7a1
msgctxt "h7104d625g7ba1g4117gb399g47a6b5612208"
msgid "I never said I was going to help. This is your problem."
msgstr "난 돕겠다고 말한 적 없다. 이건 너의 문제다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b87af0fb-8f61-42a7-9226-7de59d705daf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:b87af0fb-8f61-42a7-9226-7de59d705daf
msgctxt "h6adff1d0g826dg4ef0g9cdegddc73284bed1"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "넌 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd151b0f-8ca5-45f7-bc39-4b00734d5eb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:bd151b0f-8ca5-45f7-bc39-4b00734d5eb1
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h53e55c20gbf4dg4cd3g9cb6g8783130c685b"
msgid ""
"I wield the divine. I can use it to assist you, or send you screaming to the "
"Fugue Plane. Your choice."
msgstr "난 신성력을 다룬다. 이걸로 널 도울 수도, 절규하며 배회 차원으로 떨어지게 할 수도 있지. 네가 선택해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bd91c740-0bfb-4670-8fb2-e3613dcf722e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_FailedBellPersuasion(1) = False
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_BellOffered(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_HasGolemBell(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:bd91c740-0bfb-4670-8fb2-e3613dcf722e
msgctxt "h2a33ce15g0756g4ac1g91f5g89a18c454c1f"
msgid "Give me the bell. I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "종을 줘. 내가 뭘 할 수 있나 보겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be852695-0d8d-44cc-ba01-025c5f20d595
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:be852695-0d8d-44cc-ba01-025c5f20d595
msgctxt "h697bc851g8e93g4980g91ddg36dcde90a3ca"
msgid "So you need my help - what would I have to do?"
msgstr "내 도움이 필요한 거군, 뭐 어떻게 하면 되는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = be87538c-845a-4749-b6f2-d6b86674705e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Even_NightsongBriefing(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:be87538c-845a-4749-b6f2-d6b86674705e
msgctxt "h76b7a240gf801g4079g9663g9168ebbdc90b"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong is close, but the way is barred and Shar's dead are... "
"uncooperative. Clear the path for me - by blade, cunning, or whatever it "
"takes."
msgstr ""
"밤의 노래는 가까이 있다. 하지만 길은 막혀 있고 샤의 망자들은... 비협조적이지. 날 위해 길을 치워라. 칼을 쓰든, 잔꾀를 부리든, "
"뭐든 사용해서 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bec56110-b040-4c6d-afd6-d8727503b7f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:bec56110-b040-4c6d-afd6-d8727503b7f0
msgctxt "h0ca15009g2191g46d0g87a2geb9b132f00c6"
msgid ""
"I'm not the type to make a deal without the details. What exactly am I "
"looking for?"
msgstr "나는 세부 사항 없이 거래하는 타입은 아니라고. 내가 찾아야 하는 게 정확히 뭐야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c009ed8d-fa44-4ca3-85f5-8af691e3f2a2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC(1) = False
#.      - DRUID(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:c009ed8d-fa44-4ca3-85f5-8af691e3f2a2
msgctxt "h2cdf6065ga455g4cafg89ddge298919b43ba"
msgid ""
"You're hiding from shadows - literally. Don't make threats you can't back up."
msgstr "넌 말 그대로 그림자로부터 숨어 있다. 장담할 수도 없는 위협은 그만둬라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c2567a9d-bc33-4d12-85bf-b040b9ef720b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:c2567a9d-bc33-4d12-85bf-b040b9ef720b
msgctxt "h8f17792bg6c36g4868ga4bbg98b53da079fa"
msgid ""
"Z'rell spoke of a relic - something called the Nightsong in your notes. They "
"were very interesting."
msgstr "즈렐은 유물에 대해서 말했다. 네 메모에선 밤의 노래라고 부르던 물건이지. 아주 흥미로웠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c45d9768-a12e-4f63-a385-f1a194e453b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:c45d9768-a12e-4f63-a385-f1a194e453b0
msgctxt "h163ab0cdg13eeg403egbddcgd06775c66919"
msgid "You're assuming I'm an ally. Unwise, perhaps."
msgstr "내가 아군이라고 넘겨짚는군. 현명치 못해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c45dae36-20eb-4174-90dd-7c326a3c4019
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#.      - OATHBREAKER(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:c45dae36-20eb-4174-90dd-7c326a3c4019
msgctxt "hb1d9219eg420fg4086g8036gf3f79a1737bb"
msgid ""
"I'll be pleased when I separate your head from your shoulders, necromancer."
msgstr "네 머리통을 몸통에서 분리해버리면 기쁠 것 같은데. 사령술사."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4866271-d54f-4f31-99f7-98e946c8a6f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = True
#. TagRule: SHAR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:c4866271-d54f-4f31-99f7-98e946c8a6f2
msgctxt "h3d0559d3g5a65g4e2cgbea4g51bf0cf58b26"
msgid "Fine. I'll see what I can do. May Lady Shar forgive me for aiding you."
msgstr "알겠다. 방법을 찾아보도록 하지. 널 도와준 것을 샤 여신께서 용서해 주시길."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4866271-d54f-4f31-99f7-98e946c8a6f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:c4866271-d54f-4f31-99f7-98e946c8a6f2
msgctxt "h932a8801g09ccg40c9gb810geda457366956"
msgid "Fine. I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "알겠다. 방법을 찾아보도록 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c51b24aa-73a6-4411-888a-910fd61684d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:c51b24aa-73a6-4411-888a-910fd61684d6
msgctxt "h70b5db3eg7818g48f1gbdc1gff1539056d88"
msgid ""
"Jobs like this always go smoother when I know <i>exactly</i> what I'm "
"looking for."
msgstr "이런 일들은 내가 <i>정확히</i> 무엇을 찾는지 알아야 항상 더 순조로워지지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c5d99338-0d94-4a9f-85e5-6c50b6f13627
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_NecroFoughtJusticiars = False
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:c5d99338-0d94-4a9f-85e5-6c50b6f13627
msgctxt "h434a649bg3af5g4423ga3a6g4a0f707c2f06"
msgid ""
"I fought a battle right under your nose - whoever you are, some help would "
"have been useful."
msgstr "난 네 코 앞에서 싸우고 있었다. 네가 누군진 몰라도, 도와줬다면 좋았을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c65abd9c-bc29-4365-b6cd-dc9e7454182b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_FailedBellPersuasion(1) = False
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_BellOffered(1) = True
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_HasGolemBell(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:c65abd9c-bc29-4365-b6cd-dc9e7454182b
msgctxt "hc0b0e803g5008g4f25g8f4egd3cfdc6b6966"
msgid "I'll take that bell. It may prove useful."
msgstr "종을 가져가지. 유용해 보이는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7ee5113-5511-40e5-b193-27c42d6b082c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = False
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:c7ee5113-5511-40e5-b193-27c42d6b082c
msgctxt "heae89404g6abcg43b9g887ag8364a2bd7407"
msgid "Z'rell said Ketheric wants you to find a relic. That's all I know."
msgstr "즈렐이 말하길 케서릭 님이 네게 유물을 찾으라 했다더군. 그게 내가 아는 전부다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c8e4512e-c4b5-491d-b1f3-e47b02080e5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:c8e4512e-c4b5-491d-b1f3-e47b02080e5d
msgctxt "ha3b13ae3g54d5g4596g9ed6g6a99cb583eed"
msgid "There's always a choice. Like I can let you live, or not."
msgstr "선택의 여지는 항상 존재하지. 널 죽일지 살릴지처럼 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cafbc7c8-9cdf-40db-87e9-6a8e3b2225b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:cafbc7c8-9cdf-40db-87e9-6a8e3b2225b1
msgctxt "hda17c1bdg8facg482dgb838g1e558fc666a2"
msgid "You need my help?"
msgstr "내 도움이 필요한가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cbfcc772-5d78-4375-a90e-d31973b423dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_PartyProgress_EnteredMoonrise = False
#.      - GLO_Jaheira_State_SentToMoonrise = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:cbfcc772-5d78-4375-a90e-d31973b423dc
msgctxt "h3c6ec6f5gefa9g430dgb30agb17c75cfc3d2"
msgid ""
"*This necromancer has Ketheric's trust. Helping him might just be the best "
"way to gain access to Moonrise Towers.*"
msgstr "*이 사령술사는 케서릭의 신임을 받고 있습니다. 그를 돕는 것이 문라이즈 타워에 접근하는 가장 좋은 방법일 수도 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = cd8cf38d-763a-4d8b-b807-15843b5ddac9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_RefusedOnce(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_RefusedOnce(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:cd8cf38d-763a-4d8b-b807-15843b5ddac9
msgctxt "hf202de3fge937g46d5g840cg5d0bb100c308"
msgid ""
"This is not a problem - it is an opportunity. And it is not a choice either -"
" you will <i>obey</i>."
msgstr "이건 문제가 아니라... 기회다. 그리고 이건 선택의 여지도 없다... 너는 <i>복종</i>할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cf595726-9356-4ca8-b677-404897d3e979
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Knows_BalthazarHistorySuccess(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:cf595726-9356-4ca8-b677-404897d3e979
msgctxt "h6bc0223cg9f6cg4588ga1bagc5f9bf1034b6"
msgid ""
"*It comes back to you - Balthazar headed a monastic order that controlled a "
"place called Amkethran, in the deserts of Calimshan... but he is long dead, "
"from what you recall.*"
msgstr ""
"*이제 기억이 납니다. 발타자르는 칼림샨 사막의 앰케스란이라는 지역을 지배하는 수도원의 수장이었습니다... 하지만 당신이 기억하기로는, "
"오래 전에 죽은 사람입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = d0cc5d53-eef8-4676-9239-49c22d572de4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:d0cc5d53-eef8-4676-9239-49c22d572de4
msgctxt "h323c635ag96b2g44b4gbbd4g4e0611ce39a9"
msgid ""
"You are a waste of flesh. I'll see what I can salvage, after my creations "
"are through with you."
msgstr "넌 육체의 낭비다. 내 창조물들이 널 다룬 후에, 무엇을 회수할 수 있는지 살펴보겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = d0f24994-a3f7-4813-a58a-8bf621759d8e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:d0f24994-a3f7-4813-a58a-8bf621759d8e
msgctxt "he3dbb6f4g2063g4389g939dgcd4bd5a16d37"
msgid ""
"But never mind, your potential may outweigh your ignorance. I am Balthazar - "
"Chief Advisor to General Thorm, and entrusted with a mission of utmost "
"importance."
msgstr ""
"하지만 신경 쓰지 마라, 너의 가치는 무지함을 넘어설지도 모르니. 나는 발타자르다. 쏨 장군님의 수석 고문이며, 가장 중요한 임무를 "
"부여받았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d3634ac8-8c5e-4d4d-861b-403c9af00798
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:d3634ac8-8c5e-4d4d-861b-403c9af00798
msgctxt "hb5395467g1695g4067g9124g0ec163b885c7"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4674ade-66c1-4a1e-a8f4-5b9ceb70c5e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - SORCERER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:d4674ade-66c1-4a1e-a8f4-5b9ceb70c5e9
msgctxt "hf2a705c3g6c6dg44faga8f1g39935cbd8f52"
msgid "Because I am magical <i>powerhouse.</i> You need me, and you know it."
msgstr "왜냐하면, 내가 마법의 <i>동력소</i>이기 때문이지. 넌 내가 필요하고, 이미 이를 알고 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = d4c474cf-df88-4c6e-864b-7981abe3f30a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:d4c474cf-df88-4c6e-864b-7981abe3f30a
msgctxt "h0c42d259g6432g4100ga367gba1be3ab83eb"
msgid ""
"And spoil the surprise? I think not. But let's just say that the Nightsong "
"was a unique specimen even before I began my work..."
msgstr "놀라움을 망치란 말인가? 그건 아니지. 하지만 내가 작업을 시작하기 전부터 밤의 노래는 특별한 표본이었다고만 말해 주마..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = d598c103-165d-4342-8a46-3ca714cc8b71
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:d598c103-165d-4342-8a46-3ca714cc8b71
msgctxt "hb89c2bb9gd6a4g406dgb26dg565b285ea8e5"
msgid ""
"Perhaps I will seek out his carcass, should I be afforded the opportunity. "
"Surely there are some parts I could put to use..."
msgstr "기회가 주어진다면, 그의 시체를 찾아볼지도 모르겠어. 분명 내가 사용할 수 있는 부분들이 있을 거야..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d6341c17-fcce-4d3c-9c2f-270944814f81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_Naturalborn(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:d6341c17-fcce-4d3c-9c2f-270944814f81
msgctxt "h9ebf5615gb96fg4841g8d93gff580168cf9c"
msgid "Naturally-born? I don't know if it's true, but that's a novel insult."
msgstr "평범하게 태어난 것? 그런지는 모르겠는데, 참신한 모욕이네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d8e8bfdd-c984-4485-8b2e-7e25d7f1114a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:d8e8bfdd-c984-4485-8b2e-7e25d7f1114a
msgctxt "hfab4a443g3757g4441g919bgb39ce96f4f44"
msgid "I outmatch you in both brains and magic - you <i>need</i> me."
msgstr "지력도 마법도 내가 너보다 한 수 위야. 넌 <i>내</i>가 필요할 걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = dad57a6b-dcd3-4744-8af2-175376f73aa7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Orthon_State_Defeated = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:dad57a6b-dcd3-4744-8af2-175376f73aa7
msgctxt "he4d81e24g41a2g4cd2gac02g47a9b68f9cc8"
msgid ""
"Neither. That caterwauling beast is irrelevant as far as I'm concerned - "
"unless he hampers my goals. In that case, consider him a foe, and act "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"둘 다 아니다. 발정 난 고양이처럼 울어대는 그 짐승은 내 목표를 방해하지 않는 한 나와 무관하다. 반대의 경우에는, 적으로 간주하고 "
"적절한 행동을 취하도록 해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = db258233-46d6-4402-a05e-81b06cad3f4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Orthon_State_Defeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:db258233-46d6-4402-a05e-81b06cad3f4a
msgctxt "h6f91c402g99dag4eebg93dbgc36f8e99580a"
msgid ""
"The devil is of no relevance to my goal. Besides, it seems you handled him "
"well enough - I no longer hear that blasted singing of his."
msgstr ""
"그 데빌은 내 목표와는 관계가 없다. 게다가, 보아하니 네가 잘 손 봐준 거 같구나. 더 이상 그놈의 망할 노랫소리가 들리질 않는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = db47e853-518e-4564-b350-b208fdd575b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:db47e853-518e-4564-b350-b208fdd575b1
msgctxt "hc3595734gcbf1g4a5fg8988g2fd1e4704d88"
msgid ""
"What are the properties of this relic, magical or otherwise? So I can be of "
"better assistance, of course."
msgstr "그 유물의 특성이 마법인가? 아니면 다른 것인가? 알려 줘야 내가 더 도움이 될 수 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dc0de2c7-2216-4414-a728-5a3d9ff4ce9e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#.      - RANGER(1) = False
#.      - MONK(1) = False
#.      - ROGUE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:dc0de2c7-2216-4414-a728-5a3d9ff4ce9e
msgctxt "h40fafda8g0a1fg4659g990bg38d9cc4127df"
msgid "Let's assume I'm friendly. Who are you?"
msgstr "내가 같은 편이라고 치자고. 넌 누구냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = dcbc239d-8e05-47ab-83a7-d4b86991799d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:dcbc239d-8e05-47ab-83a7-d4b86991799d
msgctxt "h01ca6a20gaa99g40c2g8cebg83a90fb6cb2a"
msgid ""
"General Thorm trusts me. He knows I will deliver. He knows I will stand by "
"him long after all others wilt and fall."
msgstr ""
"쏨 장군님은 날 신뢰하신다. 내가 전달해 줄 수 있다는 것을 그분은 알고 계신다. 다른 모든 이들이 시들고 쓰러진 후에도 나는 오래도록 "
"곁에 있을 것을 그분은 알고 계신다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = de537552-9d51-4ddf-a53f-6b864d05bfe0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_NecroFoughtJusticiars = False
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:de537552-9d51-4ddf-a53f-6b864d05bfe0
msgctxt "h602392deg08b4g4d76g8a07g34e726fd76a1"
msgid "I fought a battle right under your nose - help would have been useful."
msgstr "난 네 코 앞에서 싸우고 있었다. 도와줬다면 좋았을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = e100083a-2e1f-4eb7-945d-5b297af25ea6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:e100083a-2e1f-4eb7-945d-5b297af25ea6
msgctxt "h1cdd4064gbdbdg4ba4ga1ccg3d12b1be1aea"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you can prove to me that you're more useful alive than dead. You "
"know what's at stake here, I take it?"
msgstr "네가 살아있는 상태에서 더 쓸모 있다는 걸 보여 봐라. 가장 중요한 사안이 뭔지 알고 있겠지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = e5915aa7-7db0-470f-9c9b-58ae6e4cbe5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:e5915aa7-7db0-470f-9c9b-58ae6e4cbe5b
msgctxt "h350f401fga362g4e15g9eecg3c3b855d02b5"
msgid "Kill me? Death is my <i>ally</i>, fool."
msgstr "날 죽인다고? 죽음은 나의 <i>동맹</i>이다, 어리석은 놈."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eeb7576a-a56c-4bb3-964f-b3a9a220c9f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_FailedBellPersuasion(1) = False
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_BellOffered(1) = False
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_HasGolemBell(0) = True
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:eeb7576a-a56c-4bb3-964f-b3a9a220c9f2
msgctxt "hc3a40c8fgcaeeg4578g820fg911f27ee8a68"
msgid "You have resources to spare - give me something to aid my search."
msgstr "충분한 자원이 있잖아. 수색을 돕기 위해 무언가를 줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = ef10069f-af24-430a-a7c2-87037864d531
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:ef10069f-af24-430a-a7c2-87037864d531
msgctxt "h9da6caadgfaaeg460egbdc5g7e8f05148c7b"
msgid "I do not cower - I plan. I command. <i>I create.</i>"
msgstr "난 웅크리지 않는다. 난 계획한다. 난 지휘한다 <i>난 창조한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = f2e8ae78-7c5e-4ab3-ad20-551e0902a83f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:f2e8ae78-7c5e-4ab3-ad20-551e0902a83f
msgctxt "h281259a7g72f1g42afgae40gfbbc62a656ac"
msgid ""
"<i>Liar. </i>Liar and a waste of flesh. I'll see what I can salvage from "
"you, after my creations are through with you."
msgstr "<i>거짓말쟁이.</i>거짓말쟁이에다가 육체의 낭비다. 내 창조물들이 널 끝장낸 후, 무엇을 회수할 수 있는지 살펴봐 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = f407be4e-205a-4ec2-8e82-300368e53df2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_State_HasGolemBell(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:f407be4e-205a-4ec2-8e82-300368e53df2
msgctxt "he925fe4dgaa6eg4474ga19ag8415fbb20ae4"
msgid "Fine. I will assign Flesh to aid you on your way. Ring this bell..."
msgstr "좋다. 가는 길에 널 도와 줄 살덩이를 할당해 주마. 이 종을 울리면..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f54947be-b4c8-463f-befd-42f3d166e4d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:f54947be-b4c8-463f-befd-42f3d166e4d7
msgctxt "h6715ef11g4468g49dbg8c74gb4841f8f5f93"
msgid ""
"You are a ship without a sail, necromancer. You need allies - you need "
"<i>me.</i>"
msgstr "너는 돛 없는 배와 같다, 사령술사. 너는 아군이, <i>내가</i> 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = f8cc6144-a50b-42fc-9c95-df1740ae6534
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_State_AskedHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:f8cc6144-a50b-42fc-9c95-df1740ae6534
msgctxt "h57df04b7gf3a7g49cdgbb2fg12f2d0e21a97"
msgid "I will remain here until you have succeeded, or fallen."
msgstr "네가 성공하거나 쓰러질 때까지 여기 있겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = fbbdddbb-9453-403a-84c8-bc7b2b5e1c99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:fbbdddbb-9453-403a-84c8-bc7b2b5e1c99
msgctxt "hf9f17257g0abeg4474g9ba2g9f4db404a12b"
msgid ""
"They are mere sketches compared to my masterwork - that would leave you in "
"awe, should you be fortunate enough to bear witness."
msgstr "그것들은 내 걸작에 비하면 단순 밑그림일 뿐이다. 보고 나면 느껴질 경외감을 증언하려면 운이 좋아야 할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = fdaecaa1-ce7f-4516-9bfa-7230d94fc1d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:fdaecaa1-ce7f-4516-9bfa-7230d94fc1d7
msgctxt "h7220924cg6c91g4b55g9cb1g1c88995aa244"
msgid ""
"The miserable worm tried to kill me, hoping to take all the glory of this "
"mission for himself."
msgstr "그 불쌍한 벌레 놈은 날 죽이려 했다. 임무의 영광을 독차지하려고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = fe68e7ea-3cb8-4bc8-9d06-0e7bc579853c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Chosen:fe68e7ea-3cb8-4bc8-9d06-0e7bc579853c
msgctxt "h89bc8d5fg8035g4f23g8319geff01f684a30"
msgid ""
"Go, then. You'll be back, once you've had another taste of Shar's "
"hospitality."
msgstr "가라, 그럼. 샤의 환대를 다시 한번 맛보고 나면, 넌 다시 돌아올 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_FleshGolem
#. Speaker = Flesh
#. NodeID = 7c5aeb6f-519a-53fa-d27e-1031620ed711
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_FleshGolem:7c5aeb6f-519a-53fa-d27e-1031620ed711
msgctxt "h62f503b2gb3bdg4a22g901eg521619fd40a1"
msgid "*Moan.*"
msgstr "*으르렁.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_GolemInvitation
#. Speaker = Flesh
#. NodeID = c7b94939-87f2-9c3a-80b0-ef998ae7c25b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_GolemInvitation:c7b94939-87f2-9c3a-80b0-ef998ae7c25b
msgctxt "hda89df7dg9ce9g422bg9526gdad83e98b282"
msgid "*Gurgle.*"
msgstr "*꼬르륵.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_NecroInvitation
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = dcc28b72-cca7-5751-279b-06320f66bf9f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_State_InvitedToRoom(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_NecroInvitation:dcc28b72-cca7-5751-279b-06320f66bf9f
msgctxt "ha242ccadgcd67g4a35g87ddgb7f686003af7"
msgid ""
"Join me in my chambers. I would speak to you, before your blundering causes "
"any more calamities."
msgstr "내가 있는 곳으로 와라. 너와 대화를 하고 싶다. 네가 이것저것 건드리며 난장판을 만드는 꼴을 더는 못 보겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_NecroInvitation
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = fe80eb82-f578-a33b-9f96-80c1497cf058
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_NecroInvitation:fe80eb82-f578-a33b-9f96-80c1497cf058
msgctxt "hab581415g8912g42b4g9104ga16da98b711c"
msgid "Forced to fight using my own flesh? How... unbecoming."
msgstr "내가 직접 전투에 나서게 되다니? 이리도... 꼴사나울 수가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro:0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
msgctxt "h1e5b95dagdbd7g4af3g86e1gf13aa71ab343"
msgid "Well, he's dead. Let's hope he stays that way."
msgstr "뭐, 놈은 죽었군. 계속 그 상태이길 빌자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro:0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
msgctxt "h14cabee2g90d2g4942gb306gc5da2c4c6518"
msgid "Dead. A pity I can't toy with him a bit longer."
msgstr "죽었군. 좀 더 놈과 놀아주지 못해 아쉬울 따름이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro:0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
msgctxt "h89c83361g021bg4edegaf6ag07533572ce02"
msgid "Balthazar's dead. Luckily he can't use his necromancy on himself."
msgstr "발타자르가 죽었군. 다행인 점은, 사령술을 스스로한테 쓸 수는 없다는 거지.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro:0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
msgctxt "hae40fc1dg1decg404ag992egce241e6a41c3"
msgid "Farewell, Balthazar. You won't be missed."
msgstr "잘가라, 발타자르. 네가 그립진 않을 거야.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro:0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
msgctxt "hfea7fd2ag1c77g4138gbaa0gfe882de31f44"
msgid "The necromancer's dead. I pray he stays that way."
msgstr "사령술사가 죽었군. 계속 죽은 채로 남아 있기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro:0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
msgctxt "hdc943736g90deg4634gb1f9geaffa24100cd"
msgid "Goodnight forever, stink-breath."
msgstr "영원히 잠들어라, 입 냄새 고약한 놈아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro:0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
msgctxt "he6107fffg22dfg4775ga728gbe3a9f02b7dd"
msgid "The corpse-botherer has fallen. No loss."
msgstr "시체 애호가가 쓰러졌군. 잘 된 일이야.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_DefeatedNecro:0c635682-7ab1-4909-9164-8d88a58c1ce4
msgctxt "h977a7a21g2805g444egac34g29ca6e9d5e96"
msgid "He's dead. Good riddance."
msgstr "놈이 죽었군. 속이 다 시원하네.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_MintharaReaction
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 267c7662-1eff-4eb4-9949-2561d60dcdd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_PAD_MintharaReaction:267c7662-1eff-4eb4-9949-2561d60dcdd1
msgctxt "hc4dc0e4cge974g4571gb8cfgb459eed6961f"
msgid ""
"I wish I could kill that bloated sack of offal, but he may yet help us reach "
"Ketheric."
msgstr "저 불어 터진 쓰레기 같은 놈을 당장이라도 죽여버리고 싶지만, 그가 우릴 케서릭에게 데려다줄지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons
#. Speaker = GROUP_SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons
#. NodeID = 159ccf5b-d4a2-a54e-481f-4511cd29f503
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons_State_PostFight_Met(1) = True
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons:159ccf5b-d4a2-a54e-481f-4511cd29f503
msgctxt "h8606d383g32fag4aadgaffcg10a7147e2c39"
msgid "Enough - my creations have nothing to say to you."
msgstr "그만. 내 피조물들이 네게 할 말은 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons
#. Speaker = GROUP_SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons
#. NodeID = a99884a3-54ab-9e52-e18d-303ccc141b91
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons_State_PostFight_Met(1) = False
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons_State_PostFight_Met(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons:a99884a3-54ab-9e52-e18d-303ccc141b91
msgctxt "h742fadf7g0764g4c79g9147gae06ff380cfc"
msgid "Head inside, now."
msgstr "안으로 들어가라, 당장."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons
#. Speaker = GROUP_SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons
#. NodeID = c5ecff7f-c266-ba4f-e6ba-5a307fd70c33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons_State_PostFight_Met(1) = True
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons:c5ecff7f-c266-ba4f-e6ba-5a307fd70c33
msgctxt "hc6a8097dg908dg4056g9719g049c464dcb9e"
msgid "Enough dawdling - come to my inner chambers."
msgstr "꾸물거리는 건 그쯤하고, 안으로 들어와라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons
#. Speaker = GROUP_SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons
#. NodeID = f7176ea4-4f1d-1650-4d1f-734ad247001d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons_State_PostFight_Met(1) = False
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons_State_PostFight_Met(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Necromancer_Skeletons:f7176ea4-4f1d-1650-4d1f-734ad247001d
msgctxt "h933dc6f0ge1d5g4c78g9072g421adc7ad125"
msgid "Leave my creations be - they must focus on their duties."
msgstr "내 피조물들은 내버려 둬라. 각자 맡은 바에 집중해야 하니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_EntrancePlaque
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0447a26c-46ba-72e3-e107-828b6c3d44fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Knows_NightsongIsPerson = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_EntrancePlaque:0447a26c-46ba-72e3-e107-828b6c3d44fc
msgctxt "hb0887a50gb21dg43dega402gf631fb87724f"
msgid "*Spill the blood of Selûne and rise a warrior of Shar.*"
msgstr "*셀루네의 피를 흘려 샤의 전사로 거듭날지어다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_DarknessPlaque
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6b444663-8d1d-4467-beb2-b21fcc1960eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_DarknessPlaque:6b444663-8d1d-4467-beb2-b21fcc1960eb
msgctxt "hf1ccbb17g534dg475ag9fd4g7e8191ed2a45"
msgid "*Shroud yourself in blackest night.*"
msgstr "*밤의 칠흑같은 어둠에 몸을 감출지어다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 358872fd-877f-468e-9a60-62530099abba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7cd27f5f-4eee-558e-eee6-ee37600f04ef_A = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7cd27f5f-4eee-558e-eee6-ee37600f04ef_B = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:358872fd-877f-468e-9a60-62530099abba
msgctxt "h8434fc13gad2cg46f9g8c26g29fe3b7ed6b6"
msgid "As much as I savour our conversations, it's high time we got started."
msgstr "나로서도 즐거운 대화였네만, 슬슬 시작해 보도록 할까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 4a8b314c-f76f-926a-027f-a606c3430213
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:4a8b314c-f76f-926a-027f-a606c3430213
msgctxt "headff3c8g504fg41e2gb27egf3b8e531a7ab"
msgid ""
"Please, Aylin - spare me. Your insults grew tired and shopworn years ago."
msgstr "제발, 에일린, 그만해 다오. 네가 모욕이랍시고 하는 진부한 말들도 이제 질리는구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 67249477-fd3f-4a31-9d37-28f4872d2a5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7cd27f5f-4eee-558e-eee6-ee37600f04ef_B = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7cd27f5f-4eee-558e-eee6-ee37600f04ef_C = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:67249477-fd3f-4a31-9d37-28f4872d2a5a
msgctxt "hd0ffe192g86adg4be1ga29cgadb554906c03"
msgid "Someone's coming. Another Justiciar, I presume."
msgstr "누가 오고 있군. 다른 저스티시어인가 보지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 6927e346-9b0f-979d-51cf-8db864bec08f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:6927e346-9b0f-979d-51cf-8db864bec08f
msgctxt "h2945099eg3b58g4003gaa9fga08d3510d73f"
msgid "Do you hunger for more company? Am I not enough to keep you sated?"
msgstr "더 많은 친구가 그리운가? 나만으로는 만족하지 못하는 모양이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 7766a471-6252-b455-91a6-47fc2d2d6c1d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:7766a471-6252-b455-91a6-47fc2d2d6c1d
msgctxt "hdce89216g7844g4d22ga6e4gb394a7250921"
msgid ""
"Poor child, so enthralled by gory revenge fantasies. You may find yourself "
"disappointed by reality."
msgstr "불쌍한 아이로구나, 잔혹하게 복수할 거라는 망상에나 빠져 있다니. 현실에 부딪혀 절망할지도 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 7c52595a-9b22-441c-8344-fa25e181fd61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7cd27f5f-4eee-558e-eee6-ee37600f04ef_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:7c52595a-9b22-441c-8344-fa25e181fd61
msgctxt "h07379773g0e03g45b6g8724g78bb5100036f"
msgid "Hatred makes you so hideous, Balthazar."
msgstr "증오가 너를 상당히 흉물스럽게 바꿔놨구나, 발타자르."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 875e22c4-a821-b965-e5cf-e25b8f766f5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:875e22c4-a821-b965-e5cf-e25b8f766f5a
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h22f22112g430bg483agbc19ga466385fdfa8"
msgid ""
"A mere interlude for the likes of you and I. But nevertheless, perhaps it is "
"time for a new chapter."
msgstr "우리 같은 이들에겐 한낱 막간일 뿐이지. 하지만 이제는 다음 장으로 넘어갈 때가 된 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 8b8644d9-1d1c-b5ee-51c7-1a93a7eda2de
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:8b8644d9-1d1c-b5ee-51c7-1a93a7eda2de
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h488c8731g04a1g4bc2gb253gb00d2fa5027b"
msgid "Perhaps you're right - perhaps you're incapable of feeling at all."
msgstr "그럴 수도 있겠네, 아무런 감정도 느끼지 못하는 모양이니 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 8f889574-4de1-bbda-1049-b069a2b9d952
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:8f889574-4de1-bbda-1049-b069a2b9d952
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h6409d9fagf1b9g4332g9961g4bbc281669de"
msgid ""
"Do as you will. You can pierce my flesh, but my heart beats on, forever."
msgstr "좋을 대로 해봐라. 내 육신을 찢어낼 수는 있어도 심장은 계속해서 뛸 것이다. 영원히."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 93e34dd7-17ad-492b-af01-284760230652
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 7cd27f5f-4eee-558e-eee6-ee37600f04ef_C = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 7cd27f5f-4eee-558e-eee6-ee37600f04ef_C = False
#.     - 7cd27f5f-4eee-558e-eee6-ee37600f04ef_B = False
#.     - 7cd27f5f-4eee-558e-eee6-ee37600f04ef_A = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:93e34dd7-17ad-492b-af01-284760230652
msgctxt "h379a4e08g7563g4460gb0cdgc70ed602e5f3"
msgid ""
"How long has it been so far? With my work, time just slips away from me."
msgstr "얼마나 지난 건가? 일에 몰두하다 보면 시간 가는 줄 모르겠단 말이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 97abe9d2-bd3b-58b4-953c-30d7a8c21549
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:97abe9d2-bd3b-58b4-953c-30d7a8c21549
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h56755363gb938g4000g8e27g336618091d6e"
msgid ""
"I'd live a thousand years in solitude than lay my eyes open thy putrid "
"visage again."
msgstr "구역질 나는 네놈 면상을 다시 보느니 천 년 동안 고독하게 사는 게 낫겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 9ac303da-4533-c332-a758-89e7eab79ea1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:9ac303da-4533-c332-a758-89e7eab79ea1
msgctxt "h648218f3geab2g4339g866cg5606e2f1de18"
msgid "Let us find out."
msgstr "어디 지켜보자고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = ae187d1b-d5a4-cfe8-e479-4a99af207719
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:ae187d1b-d5a4-cfe8-e479-4a99af207719
msgctxt "he18dffc8g141bg40c5g82d4gc4824ec44eab"
msgid ""
"Do what you will. I cannot prevent you. But you know as well as I, I will "
"come for you. One day."
msgstr "마음대로 해봐라. 너를 막을 방법은 없으니. 하지만 언젠가, 내 너를 찾아가고 말 것이다. 반드시."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = c019348f-17ef-4539-80cc-c6085bb4d17d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:c019348f-17ef-4539-80cc-c6085bb4d17d
msgctxt "ha378b7d0g87e4g40a9gbc0fga85742d3635c"
msgid "Only a thousand?"
msgstr "고작 천 년?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = c4edf229-2832-582c-6322-30929a946165
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:c4edf229-2832-582c-6322-30929a946165
msgctxt "h0611ac11g7c10g42bdg9146g8252baca6e47"
msgid "Unkind, Aylin. Unkind and incorrect - I could never hate my masterwork."
msgstr "불쾌하구나, 에일린. 불쾌한 데다 틀리기까지 했어. 내 걸작을 싫어할 리가 없잖은가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = db58e9ae-27c4-9fa8-3fc1-e004f08e1ba0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAndNightsong:db58e9ae-27c4-9fa8-3fc1-e004f08e1ba0
msgctxt "h8f2f1381g95e4g4876g8b25gce345a625f29"
msgid "A hundred years."
msgstr "백 년."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAtPrisonEntrance
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 627edf9d-f6a6-eef8-c382-cb908c4dc996
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAtPrisonEntrance:627edf9d-f6a6-eef8-c382-cb908c4dc996
msgctxt "hbf99e5d0g0253g42ffgb841gf157aa845b99"
msgid ""
"Beyond lies Nightsong's sanctum. Soon, you will be privileged to see a true "
"masterwork."
msgstr "이 너머에 밤의 노래의 성소가 있다. 곧 진정한 걸작을 직접 보는 영광을 누리게 될 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAtPrisonEntrance
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 969edc0b-7c8f-099f-5c65-740158300b6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroAtPrisonEntrance:969edc0b-7c8f-099f-5c65-740158300b6c
msgctxt "h427454d4gdb8dg4c2aga960g03313429fda6"
msgid "Come now, do not tarry. Enter the waters."
msgstr "따라와라. 지체하지 말고. 물 속으로 들어가라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroUnavailable
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = b60f2e62-d5ce-eb1d-4040-28ffaf94cb89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NecroUnavailable:b60f2e62-d5ce-eb1d-4040-28ffaf94cb89
msgctxt "hd9d4397ega336g4d6bg9b0aga12f2752ab5a"
msgid "I smell the stink of Balthazar. Bring him to me."
msgstr "발타자르의 악취가 느껴지는군. 놈을 내게 데려와라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NightsongUnavailable
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = ab728f1a-41e8-eafe-e6f5-9d6207bfa1ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_NightsongUnavailable:ab728f1a-41e8-eafe-e6f5-9d6207bfa1ef
msgctxt "hf8f8917eg142dg4605g984ag57b74fb30306"
msgid ""
"Hold your tongue for now. It is the Nightsong I need to speak with, not you."
msgstr "당분간은 입을 다물어 주게. 내가 대화해야하는 상대는 네가 아니라 밤의 노래가니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_Plaque2
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 14f5eae8-4c54-40bb-87eb-a77bd8115b0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_Plaque2:14f5eae8-4c54-40bb-87eb-a77bd8115b0e
msgctxt "h2992652cg88cbg4c8dg8a74gdb592335f33d"
msgid "*'Ascend in her silver blood.'*"
msgstr "*'은빛 피가 흐를 제 하늘로 오르라.'*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_Plaque3
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 352bbf85-0458-410d-8264-922bfd5efc27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_Plaque3:352bbf85-0458-410d-8264-922bfd5efc27
msgctxt "h1a645ceag49d9g4353gaf4dgb4dc9a27ac21"
msgid "'In her blood be anointed: Dark Justiciar.'"
msgstr "'그 피로써 축성을 받으라. 다크 저스티시어로 거듭나라.'"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_MartialPlaque
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 95fe550b-bf7f-4ddd-9225-460bc08b3007
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_MartialPlaque:95fe550b-bf7f-4ddd-9225-460bc08b3007
msgctxt "h95ba3353g58b7g4036g9800ga319eb195537"
msgid "*Deliver the Night Mother's mercy upon her enemies.*"
msgstr "*밤의 어머니의 적들에게 그분의 자비를 내려주어라.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_StealthPlaque
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b651ad91-a3d8-4542-9a74-bf236fc452e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_StealthPlaque:b651ad91-a3d8-4542-9a74-bf236fc452e3
msgctxt "h5cf7a2a3g640ag4e1dg8707gbc107040da77"
msgid "*Trust your secrets to the night.*"
msgstr "*네 비밀을 밤에 맡길지니.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_AD_VanishingJusticiarChanting
