msgctxt "hb3ee8062g67eeg4d67gbcf8gc4534506918e"
msgid "Kill her."
msgstr "그녀를 죽여라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 040447c7-8036-90ec-9ad3-79f6822e4958
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:040447c7-8036-90ec-9ad3-79f6822e4958
msgctxt "h441af766g76cdg483dga839g7423ced0255f"
msgid ""
"My name is Balthazar, trusted advisor of General Ketheric Thorm. Surely he "
"spoke of me if he sent you to my aid."
msgstr ""
"내 이름은 발타자르, 케서릭 쏨 장군께 신뢰받는 조언자이지. 그분께서 날 돕기 위해서 네 녀석을 보내셨다면 분명히 내 이름을 말씀하셨을 "
"텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 0d6afb2e-707e-dfda-f288-c3e5026cff85
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MUTED(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:0d6afb2e-707e-dfda-f288-c3e5026cff85
msgctxt "h07ae7188g0d41g41edg8597g6394591aad33"
msgid ""
"What, lost for words? I've been known to have that effect on underlings. "
"Come and join me if you survive the descent - but do not interfere."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 할 말을 잃었나? 내가 아랫것들을 놀래키는 걸로 유명하긴 하지. 날 따라와라. 이 곳을 살아서 내려갈 수 있다면 말이야. "
"걸리적거리진 마라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 11d222c2-0c69-2bdd-6dc7-ca0b72a8be23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:11d222c2-0c69-2bdd-6dc7-ca0b72a8be23
msgctxt "hbad170cdg1a6bg41cdg979fg3508bc1e165e"
msgid ""
"Your lack of ability, perhaps? You made for an adequate errand-boy thus far, "
"but let's not overstate your virtues."
msgstr "아마, 네놈이 나약하다는 거? 지금까지는 꽤 훌륭한 심부름꾼이었다고 인정해 주겠지만, 네 녀석의 공을 과대평가하진 말도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 11d222c2-0c69-2bdd-6dc7-ca0b72a8be23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:11d222c2-0c69-2bdd-6dc7-ca0b72a8be23
msgctxt "h859fcfeag008bg4258gb935g57c5c3571c41"
msgid ""
"Your lack of ability, perhaps? You made for an adequate errand-girl thus "
"far, but let's not overstate your virtues."
msgstr "아마, 네놈이 나약하다는 거? 지금까지는 꽤 훌륭한 심부름꾼이었다고 인정해 주겠지만, 네 녀석의 공을 과대평가하진 말도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 11d222c2-0c69-2bdd-6dc7-ca0b72a8be23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:11d222c2-0c69-2bdd-6dc7-ca0b72a8be23
msgctxt "h789e621cg0959g4a73g895fg5f67b0cf8dff"
msgid ""
"Your lack of ability, perhaps? You made for an adequate errand-runner thus "
"far, but let's not overstate your virtues."
msgstr "아마, 네 놈이 나약하다는 거? 지금까지는 꽤 훌륭한 심부름꾼이었다고 인정해 주겠지만, 네 녀석의 공을 과대평가하진 말도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 14b6c34d-5638-5bba-615b-542f1f76fa93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:14b6c34d-5638-5bba-615b-542f1f76fa93
msgctxt "h4dc529ecg6e44g4887g85e3g480ee7ac7b04"
msgid "Oh, look, he thinks he has free will. How darling."
msgstr "이것 봐라, 이 녀석 자기가 자유의지가 있다고 생각하잖아. 사랑스럽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 14b6c34d-5638-5bba-615b-542f1f76fa93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:14b6c34d-5638-5bba-615b-542f1f76fa93
msgctxt "hefe6d8f7g2d83g49c7g8e9ag76109616477d"
msgid "Oh, look, she thinks she has free will. How darling."
msgstr "이것 봐라, 이 녀석 자기가 자유의지가 있다고 생각하잖아. 사랑스럽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 14b6c34d-5638-5bba-615b-542f1f76fa93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:14b6c34d-5638-5bba-615b-542f1f76fa93
msgctxt "h9e58734cgebbeg4ec1g8e29gb47e6eeff1b0"
msgid "Oh, look, they think they have free will. How darling."
msgstr "이것 봐라, 이 녀석 자기가 자유의지가 있다고 생각하잖아. 사랑스럽군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 193fd52d-191e-a3b5-a904-ed91ff4e271f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = False
#. TagRule: SHAR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:193fd52d-191e-a3b5-a904-ed91ff4e271f
msgctxt "hc45fa6a3ga452g4836g99bdg59d6eeece1b2"
msgid ""
"I have my own reasons for seeking out the Dark Lady's domain. You play no "
"part in them."
msgstr "내가 어둠의 여신의 권역을 찾아낸 건 다른 이유 때문이야. 여기에 너가 끼어들 부분은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 193fd52d-191e-a3b5-a904-ed91ff4e271f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:193fd52d-191e-a3b5-a904-ed91ff4e271f
msgctxt "haddb2170g0fc9g44d5gabc0gae0b5014adee"
msgid "I'm here for my own reasons - not because of you."
msgstr "난 내 할 일이 있어서 여기에 온 거야. 네놈 때문이 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 20460079-0400-cedb-22e4-b2aa67ea63bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet(1) = False
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:20460079-0400-cedb-22e4-b2aa67ea63bb
msgctxt "h30a521d4g4a4bg4d1fga49bgb4db50246e55"
msgid "You still haven't explained just who the hells you are."
msgstr "아직도 네가 빌어먹을 누구인지 얘기하지 않았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 2e67d773-fb28-3232-3afe-4e05997c7ca8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:2e67d773-fb28-3232-3afe-4e05997c7ca8
msgctxt "hd7e4a164gc110g4421g931fg49ad4b646b30"
msgid ""
"Now get on with it. Try not to lose your footing. I'd hate to see good flesh "
"wasted on a long fall into oblivion."
msgstr "이제 따라와라. 발 헛디디지 않도록 하고. 신선한 육체를 망각 속으로 떨어뜨려 잃어버리고 싶진 않거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3312abad-7ef1-0e37-decf-c9fede6564ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:3312abad-7ef1-0e37-decf-c9fede6564ac
msgctxt "h37e03d09gc4e9g43cbgb748g430e4c5f3558"
msgid "Your thanks buy very little - I prefer to be paid in coin. Lots of it."
msgstr "네 감사 같은 건 쓸데없어. 돈으로 받으면 좋겠는데. 아주 많이 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c7889dc-0870-f71f-4e82-66a68f120272
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:3c7889dc-0870-f71f-4e82-66a68f120272
msgctxt "hdcb2237egc8ccg4b5cg910ag3c3a787aaef7"
msgid "Lead on, then."
msgstr "그럼 앞장서라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44166503-216e-6ef3-d662-ee3b87161b54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: SHAR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:44166503-216e-6ef3-d662-ee3b87161b54
msgctxt "h8b59d826g804ag4c04gb8a0gce7cf602e12f"
msgid "Is this place what I think it is...?"
msgstr "여기는 내가 생각한 그 곳인가...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44166503-216e-6ef3-d662-ee3b87161b54
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:44166503-216e-6ef3-d662-ee3b87161b54
msgctxt "hdbf345dag318bg413eg8d64g546fa168cfc6"
msgid "What is this place?"
msgstr "이 장소는 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5147624a-d13f-9f36-adf5-1c38309f3409
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = False
#. TagRule: SHAR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:5147624a-d13f-9f36-adf5-1c38309f3409
msgctxt "h3ecda766g1e78g4786ga01eg936f0d05bb72"
msgid ""
"I risked the ire of my goddess in helping you. I deserve more than your "
"flaccid thanks."
msgstr "난 내 여신의 분노를 감수하고 너를 도왔어. 네 흐느적거리는 감사보단 더 나은 걸 받을 자격이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5147624a-d13f-9f36-adf5-1c38309f3409
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:5147624a-d13f-9f36-adf5-1c38309f3409
msgctxt "h985824dbg29a7g446egae75g347df66e87f7"
msgid "I was hoping for something more substantial than 'thanks'."
msgstr "'감사합니다' 보단 뭔가 좀 더 있으면 좋겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 580520fa-26ef-5559-fa0e-0de2b576fcf1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:580520fa-26ef-5559-fa0e-0de2b576fcf1
msgctxt "hab683d90g2ac7g4337gb9b1g220fdde4c709"
msgid ""
"How kind of you to do so exactly as I ordered you to, even after you "
"refused. You're a better pawn than you claim to be."
msgstr ""
"내가 시킨 일을 이렇게 잘 해냈으니 얼마나 기특한지. 말로는 안 하겠다고 했으면서도 말이다. 네 녀석은 스스로 생각하는 것보단 좋은 "
"졸개다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 61133f87-4828-53c6-4374-1ebfbc2a77ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:61133f87-4828-53c6-4374-1ebfbc2a77ac
msgctxt "h5b776014g9130g442ag8733gdbce2742ebf3"
msgid ""
"Don't be so mercenary - General Thorm's approval is worth more than any mere "
"bauble."
msgstr "그렇게 계산적으로 굴지 마라. 쏨 장군께 인정받는다는 건 한낱 금붙이 따위보다 값진 것이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 656aad57-c7eb-65e5-c4dc-6e13da1fb48e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:656aad57-c7eb-65e5-c4dc-6e13da1fb48e
msgctxt "h78316087g89edg4a3ag8592g65f3cf2cd250"
msgid "Quite an elaborate set-up. Is the relic truly worth it?"
msgstr "상당히 정교하게 만들어진 곳이군. 그 유물이 정말 그렇게 귀중한 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ee1c129-b908-55fc-20db-4b596473bfba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Necromancer_Event_AskHowHeGotThere(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Necromancer_Event_AskHowHeGotThere(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:6ee1c129-b908-55fc-20db-4b596473bfba
msgctxt "h1e072791ge602g4f7dg8d5cga3a4e26c6aa1"
msgid "How did you even get here?"
msgstr "여긴 어떻게 왔지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 6ee256cf-039f-a525-8a2a-4402e63a9195
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:6ee256cf-039f-a525-8a2a-4402e63a9195
msgctxt "hced300d8gd4bbg4577gb15cgf5a2b9a5a3af"
msgid ""
"Simple - I followed you. It seems Shar still holds a grudge against General "
"Thorm, and so sought to prevent me from entering in his name."
msgstr ""
"간단하다. 널 따라왔지. 아직도 샤는 쏨 장군께 원한이 있는 거 같군. 기를 쓰고 내가 그분의 이름으로 이곳에 오는 걸 막고 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 73c1b6e7-39ef-acb9-f2e0-da1f89819b7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:73c1b6e7-39ef-acb9-f2e0-da1f89819b7b
msgctxt "h8cc1af55g6fd0g4cf6g9576g19496cc6f3a9"
msgid ""
"You did well - better than I would have credited you with. Now hurry along "
"and bear witness to my masterpiece."
msgstr "잘했다. 내 예상보다 일을 더 잘 처리했군. 이제 어서 가서 나의 걸작을 목도하도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 752bb5b5-d3e1-30d4-2821-caa049093ac7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:752bb5b5-d3e1-30d4-2821-caa049093ac7
msgctxt "h115e3326g1256g4872ga567g7cd97a5be677"
msgid ""
"Luckily, you were the perfect agent in helping me slip past her defences. "
"Now the Nightsong is within reach."
msgstr "운 좋게도, 샤의 방어를 피해 이곳으로 들어오는 데에 네가 훌륭한 역할을 해줬다. 이제 밤의 노래가 손 닿을 거리에 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 8485451e-75e7-d6bb-af54-0b742cb6a40e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:8485451e-75e7-d6bb-af54-0b742cb6a40e
msgctxt "h56df921cgbf00g4f7agbbbfg1db1df2909cb"
msgid ""
"The Shadowfell - or at least a little pocket of it, repurposed to house the "
"Nightsong."
msgstr "섀도펠, 아니면 최소한 그곳의 일부분이지. 밤의 노래를 보관하기 위해 개조한 곳이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 9a647894-c861-bfea-83b6-9da183e28e5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:9a647894-c861-bfea-83b6-9da183e28e5f
msgctxt "hc17e1e18gbd3dg4926g81d3gc57916b976b3"
msgid ""
"You think any coin or bauble can be more valuable than General Thorm's "
"favour? Temper your greed."
msgstr "네 녀석은 쏨 장군께 인정을 받는 것보다 돈이나 금붙이가 더 값질 수 있다고 생각하는 거냐? 탐욕을 가라앉혀라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 9e535f91-d7f2-1263-4a41-6ea18304f5dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:9e535f91-d7f2-1263-4a41-6ea18304f5dd
msgctxt "hcf699fb8gf471g4e87ga9b4g1fd5ba1e0778"
msgid ""
"Raise one finger to me and I'd sunder you like lightning would a rotten oak. "
"Now enough dullard questions - follow me."
msgstr "손가락 하나라도 더 까딱하면 벼락 맞은 썩은 오크나무처럼 네 녀석을 찢어버리겠다. 이제 멍청한 질문은 충분하다. 따라오도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = a181042b-ff75-aa07-b482-eea5ab9d439a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:a181042b-ff75-aa07-b482-eea5ab9d439a
msgctxt "h0f154c3cg1ca6g40eegbb72g63e98c2ed073"
msgid ""
"The Shadowfell - or at least a little pocket of it, repurposed to house the "
"relic."
msgstr "섀도펠, 아니면 최소한 그곳의 일부분이지. 유물을 보관하기 위해 개조한 곳이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab000212-7390-c46f-2ab2-ad45607a582e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:ab000212-7390-c46f-2ab2-ad45607a582e
msgctxt "heaf8f722gd4d7g4203gb900g9933859c56ab"
msgid ""
"This is Lady Shar's domain. I have purpose here - you do not. Why shouldn't "
"I just kill you?"
msgstr "여기는 샤 여신의 권역이야. 난 여기에 볼일이 있어. 너는 아니지. 내가 너를 죽이지 않을 이유라도 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ab000212-7390-c46f-2ab2-ad45607a582e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:ab000212-7390-c46f-2ab2-ad45607a582e
msgctxt "hb7f4c129g3384g4d47g8069gb8f60d18c34b"
msgid ""
"I cleared the way to this place, not you. Why shouldn't I just kill you "
"instead of letting you interfere?"
msgstr "내가 이곳으로 오는 길을 열었지. 네가 아니라. 네놈이 방해되지 않도록 죽이지 않아야 할 이유가 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b63697ba-c13e-e63a-e61b-d118377d511e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:b63697ba-c13e-e63a-e61b-d118377d511e
msgctxt "h13f588d8g5566g4518ga588g4daee7569467"
msgid ""
"*This creature does not belong here in the Dark Lady's sacred realm. He "
"could ruin your chance to prove yourself to her.*"
msgstr "*이 괴물은 어둠의 여신의 신성한 영역에 속하는 존재가 아닙니다. 이 자는 당신을 그분께 증명할 기회를 망칠 수도 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b89f5260-400c-3235-0d8c-a425f0943023
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:b89f5260-400c-3235-0d8c-a425f0943023
msgctxt "hc43a548cg51f9g4f30g99edg80dfb190edd1"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c450ab82-6656-bb36-572d-587276f8ae9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:c450ab82-6656-bb36-572d-587276f8ae9a
msgctxt "h9c96c7a6g91e7g4840g83c0gd4ba207f9db4"
msgid ""
"What's stopping me from just killing you and taking this relic for myself?"
msgstr "내가 그냥 네놈을 죽이고 그 유물을 가져가면 안 될 이유가 뭘까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = c749578d-e142-920b-70a4-6685a24919a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:c749578d-e142-920b-70a4-6685a24919a9
msgctxt "h8f05fab0g7211g4625g9960gb889ad31d28a"
msgid "I knew you would do my bidding - even though you pretended otherwise."
msgstr "네가 내 제안을 이행할 걸 알고 있었지. 물론 네 녀석이 아닌 척을 했지만 말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = c99fdfe1-3ca0-8fa4-1c7c-b425a05990d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:c99fdfe1-3ca0-8fa4-1c7c-b425a05990d6
msgctxt "ha5547de4g8a5eg4ff1g96feg5b62d566430d"
msgid ""
"Simple - I followed you. It seems Shar bears a grudge against my master, "
"General Thorm, and so sought to prevent me from entering in his name."
msgstr ""
"간단하다. 널 따라왔지. 아직도 샤는 쏨 장군께 감정이 있는 거 같군. 기를 쓰고 내가 그분의 이름으로 이곳에 오는 걸 막고 있었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = cb7b5ab5-f6f0-fe74-a892-a1eff65f7c81
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:cb7b5ab5-f6f0-fe74-a892-a1eff65f7c81
msgctxt "hf3f58c0cgf04fg4aaagb701g3e7db1197f27"
msgid ""
"*The Shadowfell. Never before have you found yourself so close to Lady "
"Shar's embrace. The fulfilment of her command is so close now. You must "
"allow nothing to stop you.*"
msgstr ""
"*섀도펠. 당신은 여태까지 이렇게 샤 여신의 품에 가까이 다가간 적이 없습니다. 그분의 뜻을 이행하는 데에 거의 다 왔습니다. 어떤 것도 "
"당신을 방해하는 것을 허용해선 안 됩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = d0f48eb2-2e0d-f2b0-9dce-2ace6ed8edcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:d0f48eb2-2e0d-f2b0-9dce-2ace6ed8edcb
msgctxt "h8039c74bg52ccg498bg93d8ge78d24659809"
msgid "Very well, then. My <i>sincere</i> thanks."
msgstr "잘 알겠다, 그럼. <i>진심으로</i> 감사하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = d35134fe-10ef-c77f-3c52-b19ced697a3d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:d35134fe-10ef-c77f-3c52-b19ced697a3d
msgctxt "habc0328egcaf0g4989gbdb3g0f2132a7b8c6"
msgid ""
"Balthazar. Trusted advisor to General Thorm, and your better in every "
"measure. Now enough questions - follow me."
msgstr ""
"발타자르다. 케서릭 쏨 장군께 신뢰받는 조언자이지. 그리고 모든 부분에서 네 녀석보다 우월한 존재이다. 이제 질문은 충분하다. 따라오도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d654ceb3-9fac-816b-fef0-620f2f398661
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet_AtTemple(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_AgreedToHelp = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:d654ceb3-9fac-816b-fef0-620f2f398661
msgctxt "he8e7666egd169g4db3g85f9g01d002688c98"
msgid "Who the hells are you?"
msgstr "넌 뭐하는 녀석이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = dcfb8c1c-4636-f46c-722b-43048ec74c04
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:dcfb8c1c-4636-f46c-722b-43048ec74c04
msgctxt "hb25977f3g7f21g4a32g877cg5cc1a9e86400"
msgid ""
"I had been trying to reach this place, to retrieve something of great value. "
"And thanks to you, the path is unblocked. <i>Bravo.</i>"
msgstr "그동안 이곳에 오려고 애를 썼지. 아주 귀중한 것을 회수해야 해서 말이야. 그런데 네 덕분에 길이 열렸군. <i>브라보.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = e16a961c-491a-4e6a-9ba0-0b048bcfbf1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:e16a961c-491a-4e6a-9ba0-0b048bcfbf1a
msgctxt "h17fa946bgd5cbg4e9cg8fbdg6d8b4d8f8d02"
msgid ""
"Lady Shar... I can feel her all around. This is her domain. This is the "
"Shadowfell."
msgstr "샤 여신께서... 이곳 전체에서 그분이 느껴져. 이곳은 그분의 권역이야. 여기가 바로 섀도펠이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = e3fb5913-1c58-4830-a651-7fa93b0f5b13
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:e3fb5913-1c58-4830-a651-7fa93b0f5b13
msgctxt "hbffe3e76g8d9ag4935ga401g470f839c14d0"
msgid "This is the Dark Lady's domain - <i>he </i>does not belong here."
msgstr "이곳은 어둠의 여신의 권역이야. <i>저 자는</i> 여기에 있을 자격이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = f19a1c6b-c7e5-7d5b-daec-c46abbfcba79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:f19a1c6b-c7e5-7d5b-daec-c46abbfcba79
msgctxt "h48cf31e4gabd4g458dgb3c4g0af940d29552"
msgid ""
"Gladly. And once proceedings begin, please show some wits and <i>do not "
"</i>interfere."
msgstr "기꺼이. 그리고 이제부터는 부디 멍청하게 굴지 말고 <i>걸리적거리지</i> 않았으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f5fa1e18-5098-07bd-5a8c-7e48743fa2ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Necromancer_Event_AskHowHeGotThere(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Necromancer_Event_AskHowHeGotThere(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:f5fa1e18-5098-07bd-5a8c-7e48743fa2ff
msgctxt "h6c12cb1eg40f9g46aag8d5dgd16beffd9677"
msgid "How did you get here?"
msgstr "이곳에 어떻게 왔지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = f6e611da-4bd3-4b56-7d64-038f50324977
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:f6e611da-4bd3-4b56-7d64-038f50324977
msgctxt "hb1bb8d55g5873g4813ga42bgcfad20bfc28a"
msgid ""
"You cleared the way for me, True Soul. What promising flesh you are. As a "
"reward, I shall let you bear witness to my masterpiece."
msgstr "날 위해 길을 열어줬군, 참된 영혼. 이 얼마나 훌륭한 육체인가. 상으로 나의 걸작을 볼 수 있도록 허락하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb2a9820-48f3-bec8-4a18-9e8fa6f492d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:fb2a9820-48f3-bec8-4a18-9e8fa6f492d9
msgctxt "ha465460fg5eb5g4e26gaeddg49be30d463a7"
msgid "Quite an elaborate set-up. Is the Nightsong truly worth it?"
msgstr "상당히 정교하게 만들어진 곳이군. 밤의 노래가 정말 그렇게 귀중한 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = fbd8168a-4b6b-b288-c5aa-f1cad31b40e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:fbd8168a-4b6b-b288-c5aa-f1cad31b40e8
msgctxt "h7c8cb68agfd29g4ce9ga74ag757772ce7f94"
msgid ""
"There is not a shadow of a doubt. But don't take my word for it. Come. See "
"for yourself."
msgstr "그것 만큼은 그림자 한 점 없이 명확하지. 그렇지만 내 말을 믿지 말고, 따라와서 직접 봐라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fda162a9-3cea-f7d1-4599-927627afbfce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Chosen_Event_NightsongInfoRevealed(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_ArriveAtShadowfell:fda162a9-3cea-f7d1-4599-927627afbfce
msgctxt "h21525490g3196g4843g8fc1g16c327bb0b6f"
msgid ""
"What's stopping me from just killing you and taking the Nightsong for myself?"
msgstr "내가 그냥 네놈을 죽이고 밤의 노래를 가져가면 안 될 이유가 뭘까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_CINE_EnterWater
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 12c093fa-dc9d-0336-9912-f1cfaf1f3deb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SHAR or PALADIN_SHAR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_CINE_EnterWater:12c093fa-dc9d-0336-9912-f1cfaf1f3deb
msgctxt "h28162a50gb6dcg415eg898fg09e820f30090"
msgid ""
"*As you step into the silent water, you sense Shar's presence. A comforting "
"emptiness carves into you.*"
msgstr "*고요한 물 속으로 걸음을 내딛자, 샤의 존재가 느껴집니다. 편안한 공허함이 당신 안에 자리잡습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_CINE_EnterWater
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ba5e4a4b-1b2f-cd57-1fba-92497d337c9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_CINE_EnterWater:ba5e4a4b-1b2f-cd57-1fba-92497d337c9a
msgctxt "h55aeba88gd0eag4cdagb325ge50a4bf49c5c"
msgid ""
"*Trepidation and awe ripple through you as you enter the water. Beyond lies "
"Shar's domain - the Shadowfell.*"
msgstr "*물에 들어가자 전율과 경외의 파도가 당신을 휘젓습니다. 너머에는 샤의 권역, 섀도펠이 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_CINE_EnterWater
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c3737a5b-9ce9-4032-af55-1e0daf4ee0d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_CINE_EnterWater:c3737a5b-9ce9-4032-af55-1e0daf4ee0d5
msgctxt "h33cf2a98g552fg4c07g837bgd169629195f0"
msgid "*It curls its way up your leg, squeezing <i>tight</i>.*"
msgstr "*그 두려움이 당신의 다리를 타고 올라와 <i>단단히</i> 휘감습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_CINE_EnterWater
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = dc63f20e-5353-cb6d-7951-6a507b3b52f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Shadowheart_Knows_HasSeenWolfDream = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(0) = True
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Shadowheart_State_QueueWolfDream = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_CINE_EnterWater:dc63f20e-5353-cb6d-7951-6a507b3b52f2
msgctxt "h63143a69g2b54g43cbga8cfgc03f830d6567"
msgid ""
"*You surrender yourself to Lady Shar, completely. You feel her embrace, just "
"like the very first time, long ago...*"
msgstr "*당신은 샤 여신에게 스스로를 완전히 바칩니다. 아주 오래전 처음 그 때 처럼, 그녀의 품이 느껴집니다...*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_CINE_EnterWater
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = de0c608e-c0b4-8ac7-7c63-28b2c9503a22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_CINE_EnterWater:de0c608e-c0b4-8ac7-7c63-28b2c9503a22
msgctxt "h25866621g3789g4043gad03gbbc4bc80689a"
msgid "*It beckons you in, welcoming you home.*"
msgstr "*귀환을 환영한다는 듯, 당신을 유혹합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_CINE_EnterWater
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e4227e96-0e36-4eae-eb88-10c75e325ec0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !(CLERIC_SHAR and PALADIN_SHAR)
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_CINE_EnterWater:e4227e96-0e36-4eae-eb88-10c75e325ec0
msgctxt "h674e798ag3544g415fg9ae5gd62b1d0c64ce"
msgid ""
"*As you step into the silent water, a foreign dread travels through you.*"
msgstr "*고요한 물 속으로 발을 내딛자, 낯선 두려움이 당신에게로 찾아옵니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_GatherYourParty
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 52e21e30-6846-40ff-bca5-b9ffc24e1175
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_GatherYourParty:52e21e30-6846-40ff-bca5-b9ffc24e1175
msgctxt "h6cfbf808g3512g4b6fgb99ag1e898478135c"
msgid "*You must gather your party before venturing forth.*"
msgstr "*앞으로 나아가기 위해선 일행을 모아야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_GatherYourParty
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 971fc1b9-3950-7e9c-9b2e-458ae22633b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_AllPlayersAtEntrance = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_StartReadyCheck(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_GatherYourParty:971fc1b9-3950-7e9c-9b2e-458ae22633b5
msgctxt "h42e33be1gfc95g4ad6ga920g5ed485024080"
msgid "*Your party is gathered. You are ready - or so you hope.*"
msgstr "*당신의 일행이 모였습니다. 당신은 준비가 됐습니다. 혹은 그러길 바랍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 015f4e2d-a33d-3399-997b-f3e893fad722
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:015f4e2d-a33d-3399-997b-f3e893fad722
msgctxt "h83878712g8c83g4b6ag9950g106a6db97eb1"
msgid ""
"If I'd known you were hunting a person, I'd have charged for my services."
msgstr "사람 잡아오는 일인줄 알았으면 비용을 더 불렀을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 01872e2b-8974-cbe6-b7ae-d7124ae36c74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:01872e2b-8974-cbe6-b7ae-d7124ae36c74
msgctxt "h9005ec03g086eg4a57gb378g8dbdfcf9a9f3"
msgid ""
"What you thought was best...? This was important to me - this was everything "
"to me."
msgstr "최선...? 나한테 이게 얼마나 중요한 일인데. 이게 내 전부였다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02ef5cc7-5004-a882-93f4-fe860c1e2b98
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_MINTHARA(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:02ef5cc7-5004-a882-93f4-fe860c1e2b98
msgctxt "h6dd0735ag7767g460fg9485g92f0399ca2f3"
msgid ""
"Impressive work, Balthazar, but you are not needed anymore. The Nightsong is "
"our sacrifice."
msgstr "수고했다, 발타자르. 하지만 넌 이제 쓸모가 없어. 밤의 노래는 우리가 데려간다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 0b0c490b-07c9-6af0-44a8-62b56dd22fbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NecroSummonsSkellies = True
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_PlayerBetrayedNecro = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:0b0c490b-07c9-6af0-44a8-62b56dd22fbe
msgctxt "h67be1e4dg2d75g40a6gaa7egb017dbbbde7f"
msgid ""
"Dead man? You haven't been paying attention, have you? Perhaps I'll revive "
"your carcass, and add you to my retinue. Then you'll have all the time in "
"the world to think on your mistakes."
msgstr ""
"죽은 목숨? 아직 분위기 파악이 안 되는 모양이군, 그래? 네 시체를 되살려서 내 부하로 삼아야 할지도 모르겠어. 그러면 네놈의 실수에 "
"대해서 생각해볼 시간이 많이 생기겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 10b0c454-62d9-4120-a0c7-3f7cd341b0b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:10b0c454-62d9-4120-a0c7-3f7cd341b0b3
msgctxt "hfc317de3g166ag440dg9913gdc6dbf4accd0"
msgid ""
"Perhaps it wouldn't have come to that. But we'll never know now - you took "
"the decision away from me."
msgstr "그럴 수도 있지. 근데 이젠 알 도리가 없네. 네가 그 기회를 날려버렸으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 13158983-478d-cc36-9654-200f7a247b0e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NecroSummonsSkellies = True
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_PlayerBetrayedNecro = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:13158983-478d-cc36-9654-200f7a247b0e
msgctxt "h9528f3b9g66d2g4dd4ga1a9g2c199faa8d3c"
msgid ""
"So eager to die. Very well, brute - you will make a welcome addition to my "
"undying retinue."
msgstr "스스로 명을 재촉하는군. 좋다, 짐승아. 널 내 수집품에 추가해 주마."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 185b3a1b-044a-930d-c7d0-b5f82e2364e6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NecroSummonsSkellies = True
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_PlayerBetrayedNecro = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:185b3a1b-044a-930d-c7d0-b5f82e2364e6
msgctxt "h95b25725g4ef3g46e2gbe17gffbea92e3fce"
msgid ""
"The arrogance of divinity. Your patron will not hear your prayers when I add "
"you to my undying retinue, godling."
msgstr ""
"너희 족속은 오만하기 짝이 없군. 신의 졸개여, 네가 내 수집품에 추가되려고 할 때 열심히 기도해 봤자 네 신은 듣지 못할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a508e68-1c0a-b299-e54f-b9ab447620d8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_NEUTRAL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:1a508e68-1c0a-b299-e54f-b9ab447620d8
msgctxt "h833a6667g0a97g454bg8872gabf15db23799"
msgid "The Nightsong is angel-born. It deserves freedom<i>. </i>"
msgstr "밤의 노래는 천사로 태어났다. <i>자유</i>로워져야 마땅해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 1b00c9d0-a679-2738-f438-e08a279f74e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NecroSummonsSkellies = True
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_PlayerBetrayedNecro = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:1b00c9d0-a679-2738-f438-e08a279f74e7
msgctxt "h2a41f3bdg50e0g402fg8e64g96c0413ab203"
msgid ""
"What would a godling know of freedom? Come - I will show you freedom. From "
"want. From need. From <i>everything</i>."
msgstr "신의 졸개가 자유에 대해 뭘 안다는 거냐? 와라, 내가 자유롭게 해 주지. 소망과, 욕구와, <i>이 모든 것</i>으로부터."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 206c2f6f-7f46-597a-f552-931e76807552
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Leave(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:206c2f6f-7f46-597a-f552-931e76807552
msgctxt "h37c8d4fag72c7g4268g9c11ge692150350bb"
msgid "You may have his trust, but you've lost mine. Farewell."
msgstr "넌 그의 신뢰를 얻을지는 몰라도 내 신뢰는 잃었어. 잘 가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Shar
#. NodeID = 2104e0ac-8d44-6ace-4efe-a19ce28e58d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartGaveOpinion = False
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_HasSpear(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:2104e0ac-8d44-6ace-4efe-a19ce28e58d3
msgctxt "h5fe44026gff44g48e1g9ee4g704020bc3e2f"
msgid ""
"Stop him. Nightsong must not leave. She must die by my spear, or you will "
"have failed me."
msgstr "놈을 막아라. 밤의 노래가 이 곳을 떠나서는 안 된다. 내 창으로 밤의 노래를 죽이지 못한다면 넌 실패한 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 222aee18-3ac9-3796-a06a-b4d40f8dc7d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:222aee18-3ac9-3796-a06a-b4d40f8dc7d0
msgctxt "hc18f8ecfga9fbg42ccg9b8bg6c4bc24fa50f"
msgid ""
"Aylin is so much more than that. She is an aasimar, bound to a soulcage of "
"my creation, and lending her immortal strength to General Thorm."
msgstr ""
"에일린은 그보다 더 위대한 존재다. 에일린은 아시마르고, 내가 손수 제작한 영혼 감옥에 갇혀, 그 불멸의 힘을 쏨 장군님께 드리고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 2277d7a4-1cad-92be-197c-395ba107b6b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NecroSummonsSkellies = True
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_PlayerBetrayedNecro = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:2277d7a4-1cad-92be-197c-395ba107b6b0
msgctxt "hcbadf2b1gf9c2g451egbbafg1041ec442cb2"
msgid ""
"Death only frightens those of limited vision. You should be <i>terrified</"
"i>, godling."
msgstr "깨달음이 부족한 것들이나 죽음을 무서워 하지. 그러니 <i>두려워 벌벌 떨어라</i>, 신의 졸개야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 279eb70f-e27f-023b-d1c7-847d0f01cdd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongsFate_State_ShadowheartFailedShar = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:279eb70f-e27f-023b-d1c7-847d0f01cdd1
msgctxt "hbb0c375eg8ff1g4df3gaa4fg1c1380887615"
msgid ""
"*Your blood chills as you await Lady Shar's wrath for your failure... but "
"there is nothing. The silence is terrifying.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 피가 차갑게 식으며 실패한 대가로 샤의 분노가 내리는 것을 기다리지만... 아무 일도 없습니다. 너무 고요해서 소름이 끼칩니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 2c6a0729-185d-75a9-66bf-4b5bcb4f0cb8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:2c6a0729-185d-75a9-66bf-4b5bcb4f0cb8
msgctxt "haec2a03eg5b90g4401gad4ag32239c04113b"
msgid "Now don't struggle, Aylin. Well... maybe struggle a little."
msgstr "이제 저항하지 마라, 에일린. 아니... 약간은 저항해 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c6af98e-d533-2204-f5ce-6ce3df32ffdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#. TagRule: BERSERKER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:3c6af98e-d533-2204-f5ce-6ce3df32ffdf
msgctxt "h5c273a62gec55g4770gbf0fgb53e33cda46a"
msgid "<b><i>ROAR AT THE NECROMANCER.</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>사령술사에게 고함을 지른다.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3c6af98e-d533-2204-f5ce-6ce3df32ffdf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:3c6af98e-d533-2204-f5ce-6ce3df32ffdf
msgctxt "hcdcc8379g7bafg450cg9105g8449e23b7029"
msgid "I agree - no more questions. More <b>blood.<i> YOURS</i>. </b>"
msgstr "그래, 질문 따위는 필요 없어. 진짜 필요한 건 <b>피야. <i>네 피.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 42f8504d-e068-9e0f-2183-05ebbc7088a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:42f8504d-e068-9e0f-2183-05ebbc7088a0
msgctxt "hb66e4b9bg56ddg412fg831fg31375df167a8"
msgid "Person? Please, you insult her - you insult <i>me</i>."
msgstr "사람? 에일린한테 그런 표현은 실례지. <i>내</i>게도 실례고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4395f026-1c07-c481-f8e6-6a7cdc2c46ce
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartGaveOpinion = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:4395f026-1c07-c481-f8e6-6a7cdc2c46ce
msgctxt "ha62338cfg3cecg4b5cg900egd8194a7d2bd8"
msgid "My companion has her own plans for this one. Stand down."
msgstr "물러서. 내 동료가 밤의 노래를 데리고 할 계획이 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 499bf8f1-15c2-d1c2-8e15-ae21151953dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = False
#.      - ROGUE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:499bf8f1-15c2-d1c2-8e15-ae21151953dd
msgctxt "h0ba7b282g25a8g4227ga8e4g7924d6ed0999"
msgid "Wait - the Nightsong is a <i>person</i>?"
msgstr "잠깐... 밤의 노래가 <i>사람</i>이라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4feca7d7-5b9c-4937-f4eb-c09818eb062e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:4feca7d7-5b9c-4937-f4eb-c09818eb062e
msgctxt "h82e0fbcfga411g4808g9ecbg3df16c8c59ef"
msgid ""
"<i>You </i>are the one who interferes - in Lady Shar's bidding. For that, "
"you must die."
msgstr "<i>방해</i>하는 건 너다. 이건 여신님의 명에 반하는 일이야. 그 대가로, 넌 죽어줘야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4feca7d7-5b9c-4937-f4eb-c09818eb062e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:4feca7d7-5b9c-4937-f4eb-c09818eb062e
msgctxt "ha3a2405ag8b6fg4c02gac4fg57754fe65ea1"
msgid ""
"I care not for the holy creature - but you tricked me, necromancer. For that:"
" you die."
msgstr "신성한 존재들에게는 관심 없지만, 넌 날 속였다, 사령술사. 그 대가로 넌 죽어줘야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 52328941-2d1e-c37e-2ccd-40febdd01c27
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_LeaveBlocked(4) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:52328941-2d1e-c37e-2ccd-40febdd01c27
msgctxt "h9c283cd4gf6fdg4348gb908g2d1f1d10ad2d"
msgid "Finding a cure is what matters - now we have Ketheric Thorm's trust."
msgstr "치료법을 찾는 게 급선무야. 이걸로 케서릭은 우릴 믿게 되겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 5302c938-b035-e685-8dce-e23ae92a5b70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_MoonriseTower_State_Outcast = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:5302c938-b035-e685-8dce-e23ae92a5b70
msgctxt "hfe254228g4adfg42f2gbb3ag8f3337f2ff33"
msgid ""
"General. <i>Thorm.</i> You will show respect, Aylin. Watch, and see what "
"happens if you do not. See what I do to our acquaintance here."
msgstr ""
"<i>쏨</i> 장군님이시다. 제대로 예의를 갖춰라, 에일린. 아니면 어떻게 되는지 보여주지. 이 녀석이 어떻게 되는지 잘 봐라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 53cf14a7-6a9f-1996-af3a-d87c48193d2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_GOOD(1) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SELUNE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:53cf14a7-6a9f-1996-af3a-d87c48193d2c
msgctxt "hfd5add44g2f41g400cg8f66g17a7502d8e07"
msgid ""
"The Moonmaiden's light dances around this one... You will harm her no more, "
"necromancer."
msgstr "달처녀의 빛이 이 분 곁에서 춤을 추는군... 더는 이 분을 해치지 못할 것이다, 사령술사여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 53cf14a7-6a9f-1996-af3a-d87c48193d2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_GOOD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:53cf14a7-6a9f-1996-af3a-d87c48193d2c
msgctxt "hd673c439gfac4g4f06gb116g4f963abeca7e"
msgid "You will torture this angel-born no longer, necromancer."
msgstr "더는 천사님을 고문하지 못할 것이다, 사령술사여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = 55bbb4f1-244e-b35e-ca39-125e4f6fddbf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_ShadowHeart_State_IsInParty = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:55bbb4f1-244e-b35e-ca39-125e4f6fddbf
msgctxt "h625acb9eg1c7dg4c37g9a2cg5ec39320339e"
msgid ""
"I stand with you, Shadowheart. Slay the Nightsong, and take your place as a "
"Dark Justiciar."
msgstr "네 편에 서지, 섀도하트. 밤의 노래를 죽이고 다크 저스티시어로 거듭나라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 5cbbd2bf-cecd-70a4-5449-80692e0ce153
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:5cbbd2bf-cecd-70a4-5449-80692e0ce153
msgctxt "h3c4f0e4ag28d3g49c0gbb3bga38494141ca7"
msgid ""
"You. Your usefulness does not forgive your <i>treachery</i>. I felt it the "
"very first moment I entered your mind. You are an enemy of the Absolute, "
"banished from Moonrise."
msgstr ""
"너. 활약 한 번 했다고 네 배신이 용서될 거라고 생각하지 마라. 네 정신과 처음 맞닿은 순간부터 눈치채고 있었지. 절대자님의 적, "
"문라이즈의 추방자 자식."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 5d3a6421-4a50-78a1-4114-690a857d40f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:5d3a6421-4a50-78a1-4114-690a857d40f7
msgctxt "h0ca12e48ga039g4decga7bfge23c89b8c72f"
msgid "Until then."
msgstr "그럼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 5dc2f770-6aab-44eb-ea3f-4b5735568acd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:5dc2f770-6aab-44eb-ea3f-4b5735568acd
msgctxt "h17bbf156g9b8eg44c1g8a11g181d337bdefd"
msgid ""
"I invite you: heap more sins upon your head. My retribution will be all the "
"sweeter for them."
msgstr "부디 업보를 더 쌓아라. 그럴수록 언젠가 이뤄질 내 복수가 더욱 달콤해질 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 602ab562-8534-0c06-2340-5b551ec78206
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_LeaveBlocked(4) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:602ab562-8534-0c06-2340-5b551ec78206
msgctxt "hc1694637ga8efg4dddg98e0g4c6044fcfb05"
msgid "I make the decisions - not you."
msgstr "결정은 내가 내려. 네가 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 6303346a-2295-6f34-14eb-308b82332b26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(1) = True
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:6303346a-2295-6f34-14eb-308b82332b26
msgctxt "h4f2f7517g6d01g4645gb840g53cf1b95e43a"
msgid ""
"*Do as Shar wishes, and you will become Her chosen, but the Absolute cult "
"will know you are its enemy.*"
msgstr "*샤의 말을 듣는다면 그녀의 선택받은 자로 거듭나겠지만, 절대자 교단을 적으로 돌리게 될 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 680d2045-0acc-f911-6356-bf4033d88839
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:680d2045-0acc-f911-6356-bf4033d88839
msgctxt "h242dc0f0g1d2cg4ef2g8d1bgdd4dfdbcd23f"
msgid "Go on, then. Take the Nightsong to Ketheric. Get it over with."
msgstr "그럼 계속해. 케서릭에게 밤의 노래를 데려가고 끝내라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 696d7ae0-0ae0-0390-2815-88df81fb4db6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:696d7ae0-0ae0-0390-2815-88df81fb4db6
msgctxt "h64f7da13g7a3dg47efga355g2c4571fd8b74"
msgid ""
"<i>Plans.</i> The drone plans to court the queen bee - yet it dies all the "
"same. Aylin is mine - an aasimar bound to a soulcage of my creation. Lending "
"her immortal strength to General Thorm."
msgstr ""
"<i>계획</i>이라. 일벌도 여왕벌을 지키려 계획을 짜지. 어차피 죄다 죽지만. 에일린은 내 것이다. 내가 손수 만든 영혼 감옥에 갇힌 "
"아시마르고, 그 불멸의 힘을 쏨 장군님께 드리고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 6a572a85-fe63-7933-29e7-b01a6922a001
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:6a572a85-fe63-7933-29e7-b01a6922a001
msgctxt "hac11c42dgfa29g4ce9gaf93g4313768f4316"
msgid ""
"Or perhaps to lead this would-be Justiciar's blade directly to my heart?"
msgstr "아니면 내 심장에 저스티시어 놈들의 칼을 꽂으러 왔느냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 6b11b7ec-8a14-356c-af06-f597cbb388f3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Leave(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:6b11b7ec-8a14-356c-af06-f597cbb388f3
msgctxt "h62e18943g1f53g4b2dg9216g060e04684d2a"
msgid ""
"Then this is where we part ways. Shar forgive me, I was so close... Farewell."
msgstr "그럼 우린 이쯤에서 헤어져야겠네. 샤께서 용서하시길, 거의 다 왔는데... 잘 가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 6d171b00-32ac-eb1a-28fb-61074d825565
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:6d171b00-32ac-eb1a-28fb-61074d825565
msgctxt "h16d7c73dg4e98g4b07gaf60gda0ae17acf42"
msgid "Her power, his will, and my genius. An unsurpassable feat."
msgstr "저 여자의 힘, 그분의 의지, 그리고 내 천재성이 합쳐진 거다. 완벽한 삼위일체지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ecf1f4d-83f3-5e3f-74bb-c78558578c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_MINTHARA(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#.      - PALADIN_EVIL(1) = False
#. TagRule: OATHBREAKER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:6ecf1f4d-83f3-5e3f-74bb-c78558578c15
msgctxt "h57e8bf64g6b19g4629g8486gb1380fa59a3a"
msgid ""
"You cannot bind a <i>person</i> to the needs of another. Free her. "
"<i>Now.</i>"
msgstr "그 어떤 이유로도 <i>사람</i>을 잡아 가두는 걸 정당화할 순 없다. 이 여자를 풀어줘라, <i>당장</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ecf1f4d-83f3-5e3f-74bb-c78558578c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_MINTHARA(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN(1) = True
#.      - PALADIN_EVIL(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:6ecf1f4d-83f3-5e3f-74bb-c78558578c15
msgctxt "h6eb91865g0558g41e7g9fbfga3a25de1f594"
msgid ""
"She is a person - not a <i>thing</i> to be used. On my oath, she will be "
"freed."
msgstr "사람을 <i>물건</i> 취급해서는 안 되지. 내 맹세에 따라, 그녀를 해방하리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 750a67cf-a657-d968-72e2-65817aff2166
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_LeaveBlocked(4) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:750a67cf-a657-d968-72e2-65817aff2166
msgctxt "h2dad6658g1883g466ega7b1g4a6f1d3c94d6"
msgid "I'm sorry. But I have my reasons. I did what I thought was best."
msgstr "미안해. 하지만 나도 이게 최선이라고 생각해서 그랬던 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 7522990a-339b-fff5-1c66-dda0079161e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:7522990a-339b-fff5-1c66-dda0079161e4
msgctxt "h9b047796g77e9g4620g9291g804c72e71e53"
msgid ""
"Hold your tongue, Aylin. Or I'll take it away from you again. And you - no "
"more questions. No more interference."
msgstr "함부로 혀 놀리지 말아라, 에일린. 저번처럼 빼앗기기 싫다면. 그리고 너. 더 이상 질문하거나 간섭하지 마라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 75c85c96-7466-bc12-2be3-87a5892fd986
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:75c85c96-7466-bc12-2be3-87a5892fd986
msgctxt "h13361d0cg15dbg436cgb7b6ga16e1b087693"
msgid ""
"Bring her home - what else? Aylin is so much more than you comprehend. She "
"is an aasimar, bound to a soulcage of my creation, and lending her immortal "
"strength to General Thorm."
msgstr ""
"집으로 데려가는 것이지, 또 뭐가 있겠나? 에일린은 네 녀석의 이해를 훨씬 넘어서는 존재다. 에일린은 아시마르고, 내가 손수 제작한 영혼 "
"감옥에 갇혀, 그 불멸의 힘을 쏨 장군님께 드리고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 812940c6-f22d-24c0-6722-210369bb9ab2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_Leave(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:812940c6-f22d-24c0-6722-210369bb9ab2
msgctxt "hb4a3c78cgb72ag46ddg8db4g90a18eed44fe"
msgid "There's nothing more to be said. Farewell."
msgstr "이제 더 할 말 없어. 잘 가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 86024de7-7f9e-fd2b-1501-c7af93ab3100
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NecroSummonsSkellies = True
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_PlayerBetrayedNecro = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:86024de7-7f9e-fd2b-1501-c7af93ab3100
msgctxt "h9d0f24ffgc260g44ecg9f99g79d712138328"
msgid "Fly at me, you fool. You cannot stop what is to come."
msgstr "와 봐라, 얼간아. 넌 내게 닥칠 일을 막지 못하리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90485211-e25d-ad82-7ee5-e3c968941bba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:90485211-e25d-ad82-7ee5-e3c968941bba
msgctxt "h726799ffgf19dg4dd6g8093gaa3444bbef23"
msgid "I can't let you take her, Balthazar."
msgstr "네 맘대로 하게 두진 않겠다, 발타자르."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 924323ed-c757-5dec-f4fe-e1645b71da12
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_Knows_ImmortalitySource = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:924323ed-c757-5dec-f4fe-e1645b71da12
msgctxt "h68e0bda3g1c67g4477gb5eeg7e6b82d3d038"
msgid ""
"<i>Ketheric. </i>I welcome the sight of him, after these hundred years. He "
"whose immortality I supply with my very soul."
msgstr "<i>케서릭.</i> 나도 놈을 보고 싶군. 한 세기 동안 내 영혼 속에서 불멸의 힘을 뜯어내고 있는 놈이니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 93a1858a-e3dc-45bc-81b0-f493938ffecf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:93a1858a-e3dc-45bc-81b0-f493938ffecf
msgctxt "h4c8d5b20g667eg4bbeg9b32g804be8afc0ce"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong's a <i>person</i>? Balthazar, this is an affront to the Weave "
"itself."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 <i>사람</i>이었다고? 발타자르, 이건 위브 자체에 대한 모욕이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 97834964-e733-e907-48ee-071f06df3fa9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:97834964-e733-e907-48ee-071f06df3fa9
msgctxt "he2590172g7dbag40f4g8b9eg5ac2dca87ae7"
msgid ""
"Keep back. It will take quite some concentration to secure Aylin for her "
"little journey."
msgstr "물러서라. 에일린이 이 작은 여행을 무사히 보내게 하려면 잠깐 집중해야 하거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 996d8bf4-8a71-1981-aa28-5df76098f2d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:996d8bf4-8a71-1981-aa28-5df76098f2d2
msgctxt "he26a369eg0a5bg402cga535gf969cdb4ae8a"
msgid ""
"All this time, and you still fail to appreciate the gifts I bestowed on you, "
"Aylin. Sad, to see a thing of beauty not recognise its own worth."
msgstr "그토록 오랜 세월 네게 선물을 줬건만 아직도 감사할 줄을 모르는구나, 에일린. 아름다운 것을 봐도 그 가치를 모르다니 슬프군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = 9a5ef446-1c2a-fb6c-339c-c9c2fbecd1cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NecroSummonsSkellies = True
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_PlayerBetrayedNecro = True
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:9a5ef446-1c2a-fb6c-339c-c9c2fbecd1cb
msgctxt "hc17e0329g7157g430dg988dg86987fb0f10d"
msgid ""
"Perhaps there will be something I can salvage from your carcass once I'm "
"finished; I hate to see flesh squandered - even a traitor's flesh."
msgstr "넌 죽어서 시체가 되는 게 더 쓸모가 있겠군. 난 무엇도 낭비하는 법이 없지. 배신자의 살점조차도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a31bc411-58b8-a1b4-d972-6809e3f8122e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:a31bc411-58b8-a1b4-d972-6809e3f8122e
msgctxt "hc8539038g84a5g4a71gabf0g73749e9e33a9"
msgid "What are you going to do to her?"
msgstr "이 여자에게 뭘 할 생각이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = a445b1fe-0293-c4df-0b72-2c77d2cac805
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(4) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:a445b1fe-0293-c4df-0b72-2c77d2cac805
msgctxt "hce1baca0gc35cg4953g93d3g22c319b68692"
msgid "What have you done?! Her fate was mine to decide!"
msgstr "무슨 짓이야?! 이건 내가 결정할 일이었어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = b67b3003-5d56-e28c-58d8-3ee34adac4d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:b67b3003-5d56-e28c-58d8-3ee34adac4d3
msgctxt "h8d199ceagd6a9g428fg9a72gcf8c89073214"
msgid ""
"I can do whatever I want! She is mine. An aasimar bound to a soulcage of my "
"creation. Lending her immortal strength to General Thorm."
msgstr ""
"난 뭐든지 내 맘대로 할 수 있어! 에일린은 내 것이다. 내가 손수 만든 영혼 감옥에 갇힌 아시마르고, 그 불멸의 힘을 쏨 장군님께 "
"드리고 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = c06f70d4-9dd4-caaa-c2be-89ce04ebe6f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:c06f70d4-9dd4-caaa-c2be-89ce04ebe6f5
msgctxt "h5cb7812fg5659g4ff8gaf06gbb7708516407"
msgid ""
"But General Thorm - <i>he </i>appreciates you. And he wants you close at "
"hand, so I am here to whisk you back to him."
msgstr "하지만 쏨 장군께선... <i>그분</i>은 너를 높이 평가하고, 가까이 두고 싶어 하신다. 그래서 내가 널 데리러 왔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = d02088db-06ce-caab-3a11-a97dd4657bec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:d02088db-06ce-caab-3a11-a97dd4657bec
msgctxt "h5905204ag89f4g4da5ga6dfg54699220ce1a"
msgid ""
"Get it over with? No, this is to be <i>savoured</i>. Return to Moonrise "
"Towers - I'm sure we'll find further use for you there."
msgstr ""
"끝내라고? 그럴 순 없지, 이런 건 천천히 <i>음미</i>해야 해. 문라이즈 타워로 돌아가라. 네 녀석은 거기서나 더 쓸모 있을 것 "
"같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e4003e0e-7a0a-8337-9900-79616a8496e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Companion_LeaveBlocked(4) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:e4003e0e-7a0a-8337-9900-79616a8496e3
msgctxt "hfe265bb3g3057g401fgb581g3d3f9db7629a"
msgid "I couldn't let you kill her."
msgstr "네가 저 여자를 죽이도록 놔둘 수 없었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e7a99ae4-7a35-6529-c3ff-13ca6d98862e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:e7a99ae4-7a35-6529-c3ff-13ca6d98862e
msgctxt "h47bc3b4bgc146g4f65g99cegf101441f80b5"
msgid "<i>Attack him.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Balthazar
#. NodeID = e8b2d3ca-b776-a94f-d8df-285e4546d6e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_MoonriseTower_State_Outcast = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:e8b2d3ca-b776-a94f-d8df-285e4546d6e1
msgctxt "ha27345adgb10eg4610gbc9bg71059fb7da81"
msgid ""
"General. <i>Thorm.</i> I'm sure you'll be on your best behaviour for him. "
"But just in case, I've taken some precautions."
msgstr "<i>쏨</i> 장군님이시다. 그 분 앞에서는 예의 있게 행동하리라 믿으마. 그래도 만약을 대비해서 손을 좀 써야겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = e8b3feef-8604-4ef6-8813-9d3cfe01beb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(4) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartGaveOpinion = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:e8b3feef-8604-4ef6-8813-9d3cfe01beb4
msgctxt "ha140d722gea02g4b0bgbe9cgce815dcdf7dc"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong is Shar's sacrifice - she's <i>my destiny</i>. He cannot have "
"her!"
msgstr "여신님께 밤의 노래를 바치는 게 내 <i>운명</i>이야. 이대로 둘 순 없어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ecad4a14-03d9-c98b-d9cb-479885c8942d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:ecad4a14-03d9-c98b-d9cb-479885c8942d
msgctxt "h03b6f7d3gd851g40adg8fbfge8957f2d3918"
msgid ""
"If she's the reason Ketheric Thorm is invulnerable, you're not taking her. "
"Leave, or you're a dead man."
msgstr "저 여자가 케서릭 쏨이 무적인 이유라면, 넌 데려갈 수 없다. 떠나라, 아니면 넌 죽은 목숨이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = eeaa985c-60a7-09bb-47c9-c706a8edee44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:eeaa985c-60a7-09bb-47c9-c706a8edee44
msgctxt "hc61c7caegc4b0g4b18g87bcg927c9527abc2"
msgid ""
"A pleasure to have made your acquaintance, little warrior. We will meet "
"again. I am eternal; I will be free, one day; and I never forget a face."
msgstr ""
"알게 되어 기뻤다, 작은 전사여. 우린 다시 만날 것이다. 불멸자인 나는 언젠가 이곳을 벗어날 테니. 그리고 난 한 번 본 얼굴을 잊지 "
"않지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = f141917f-d333-fbbe-5612-5d44db19bd97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_Knows_ImmortalitySource = True
#.     - SHA_Nightsong_HasMet = True
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_Knows_AboutImmortality = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:f141917f-d333-fbbe-5612-5d44db19bd97
msgctxt "h1c512e9cgbc2cg4b83g9476g0bc95eb42613"
msgid "Balthazar. Come to add more bars to my cage."
msgstr "발타자르. 감옥에 창살이라도 더 달으러 온 건가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = f52ff76a-7ab3-c6b0-2bd8-f40c41f1b45d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:f52ff76a-7ab3-c6b0-2bd8-f40c41f1b45d
msgctxt "hf6464ee2gb520g47e0g86bbg53f75632905d"
msgid ""
"Ramblings most unsane. Poor Balthazar, for maggots ate his brain long ago."
msgstr "정신 나간 소리. 불쌍한 발타자르, 이미 오래전에 구더기가 뇌를 파먹어 버렸구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = faa3f3c0-4066-ee1a-eda5-7c157aba04a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NecroAndNightsong:faa3f3c0-4066-ee1a-eda5-7c157aba04a5
msgctxt "hff19b58ag936ag44e2g8086g898141e0d705"
msgid ""
"If this Nightsong is the source of Ketheric's power, we cannot let Balthazar "
"take her. We should unleash her wrath."
msgstr "이 밤의 노래가 케서릭이 가진 힘의 근원이라면, 발타자르가 그녀를 데려가게 놔둘 수는 없다. 그녀의 분노를 해방하는것이 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 069ce33c-c2e2-5fd7-fded-20c695aac514
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:069ce33c-c2e2-5fd7-fded-20c695aac514
msgctxt "h918e8246g92eeg447agb714gd9b60f361cd1"
msgid ""
"You have done what we feared was impossible. You have released me from a "
"century of sorrow."
msgstr "그대는 우리가 불가능하다며 두려워했던 일을 해냈다. 그대는 나를 백 년의 슬픔으로부터 해방시켰다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 0eb69a7c-b54f-b3f7-d4a3-bde93f74d172
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:0eb69a7c-b54f-b3f7-d4a3-bde93f74d172
msgctxt "h40d3157dg93cbg40c2g8238gc38b7d5bbd33"
msgid ""
"We need to leave. Lady Shar won't stand for us to be here - not after what "
"we did."
msgstr "지금 바로 떠나야 해. 그런 짓을 저질렀으니 - 샤 여신은 우리가 여기 있는 걸 좋아하지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 14757c97-411c-4e2f-775a-50a1acc3648f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:14757c97-411c-4e2f-775a-50a1acc3648f
msgctxt "hbee62922g5bdeg4d44g891ege62a4bf635fd"
msgid ""
"You have done what we feared was impossible. You have released me from a "
"century of sorrow."
msgstr "그대는 우리가 불가능하다며 두려워했던 일을 해냈다. 그대는 나를 백 년의 슬픔으로부터 해방시켰다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 19b2c44f-8385-f498-817b-9928d9e568c7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:19b2c44f-8385-f498-817b-9928d9e568c7
msgctxt "ha5c7b834ga2feg448dgb76cge9487454bf85"
msgid "To kill Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨의 죽음."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1a7a4af7-f9b6-df64-5ea0-5306dddec0ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:1a7a4af7-f9b6-df64-5ea0-5306dddec0ab
msgctxt "h69f50926g4829g4847g9590g7fa854202846"
msgid ""
"*It is time to leave this place, and see what chaos you have unleashed upon "
"Moonrise Towers.*"
msgstr "*이제 이곳을 떠나, 문라이즈 타워에 당신이 어떤 혼란을 초래했는지 확인하러 갈 시간입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 21f075e6-a3c2-8903-4976-fc4719ccf9d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_GiveWeapon = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:21f075e6-a3c2-8903-4976-fc4719ccf9d0
msgctxt "hb3d0b1eeg3e9ag4cdbgbdeaga23298237373"
msgid ""
"Your power is great. So too must be your weapon. You must choose what you "
"will wield. And the Moonmaiden will provide. Thus I have said; thus will it "
"be so."
msgstr ""
"그대는 위대한 힘을 지녔다. 그에 걸맞는 무기 또한 지녀야겠지. 어떤 무기를 휘두를지 택하거라. 그리하면 달처녀께서 내려 주시리라. 내가 "
"말하노니, 이루어질지어다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 2aadb8b4-93ea-fc5b-1978-ef6b92f938ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:2aadb8b4-93ea-fc5b-1978-ef6b92f938ad
msgctxt "hf4dc060cg0d1fg409fgb347ga00969fcfb66"
msgid "We're going to kill Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr "우린 케서릭 쏨을 죽이리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 2f5e496a-a895-5b5c-aec7-036f2a2e9fb0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:2f5e496a-a895-5b5c-aec7-036f2a2e9fb0
msgctxt "he7a334afg8373g4a0fg98e1ga75004946021"
msgid ""
"Let's get out of here, please. Whatever's coming, I don't want to be in the "
"heart of the Shadowfell when it finds me."
msgstr "여기서 나가자, 얼른. 어떤 결과가 뒤따르든, 섀도펠 한복판에서 맞닥뜨리고 싶진 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3058585c-7511-801c-3c41-bcd4ff2df59c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:3058585c-7511-801c-3c41-bcd4ff2df59c
msgctxt "ha68d722agb51eg4206g9a93g3dac322689de"
msgid "For my weapon? Naturally."
msgstr "무기를 위해서 말입니까? 물론이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 307be674-d862-c426-01f5-62c860facea3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:307be674-d862-c426-01f5-62c860facea3
msgctxt "heaff6f48g8f15g4117gb332g4087180e7196"
msgid "If Shar is angry, she's being remarkably quiet about it."
msgstr "샤가 실제로 분노했다면, 지나치게 조용한 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 31a022f4-c967-9a17-d4a3-1a1574bcb9c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:31a022f4-c967-9a17-d4a3-1a1574bcb9c4
msgctxt "h050c7c4bgfa85g4440g92c7g00b6cb95950a"
msgid "Ho! And it shall be yours. And then?"
msgstr "호! 물론 그대에게 주어질 것이다. 그런 다음에는?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b81db26-8159-81b6-d458-0c73f619eaee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:3b81db26-8159-81b6-d458-0c73f619eaee
msgctxt "h63ae75c7g87b2g40d7gade3g223b40623bb2"
msgid "Dark Lady be merciful... What have I done?"
msgstr "어둠의 여신이시여 자비를... 내가 대체 무슨 짓을 한 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 432996bf-bfc7-e23b-551b-c92877cd153e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:432996bf-bfc7-e23b-551b-c92877cd153e
msgctxt "h1cf75336gbc07g42a7gbd13g399d9bc0d2ea"
msgid ""
"You have done me an incredible service. The Moonmaiden has blessed you in "
"kind."
msgstr "그대는 내게 믿기지 않는 공헌을 베풀었다. 그 대가로 달처녀께서 그대에게 축복을 내리시리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 556d473a-ad8f-652a-5e0a-19002056783b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_GiveWeapon = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:556d473a-ad8f-652a-5e0a-19002056783b
msgctxt "h305e5158g7222g407fg897ag17b4b8ccea6c"
msgid ""
"Your power is great. So too must be your weapon. You must choose what you "
"will wield. And the Moonmaiden will provide. Thus I have said; thus will it "
"be so."
msgstr ""
"그대는 위대한 힘을 지녔다. 그에 걸맞는 무기 또한 지녀야겠지. 어떤 무기를 휘두를지 택하거라. 그리하면 달처녀께서 내려 주시리라. 내가 "
"말하노니, 이루어질지어다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 57fb3ab3-83ca-10d3-d09e-ea1c24953a70
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:57fb3ab3-83ca-10d3-d09e-ea1c24953a70
msgctxt "h92412d87ge686g43a5g97bdg9bf44fefee21"
msgid "To get out of this place? Absolutely."
msgstr "이곳을 빠져나가기 위한 준비 말입니까? 물론이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 667c1426-f43a-6657-9120-5827d62658c1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:667c1426-f43a-6657-9120-5827d62658c1
msgctxt "ha1c56b1dg6d78g4c66gbf05gcb3d7307a4b2"
msgid "For my weapon? Naturally."
msgstr "무기를 위해서 말입니까? 물론이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a3eb6fc-921b-9d1e-3879-99fc4651f60e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:6a3eb6fc-921b-9d1e-3879-99fc4651f60e
msgctxt "hd88545bbg4edeg4937g9ca1gf2ee114c84fa"
msgid "To get out of this place? Absolutely."
msgstr "이곳을 빠져나가기 위한 준비 말입니까? 물론이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 6ecbff21-d0bf-0124-3e4c-414c5803aad0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:6ecbff21-d0bf-0124-3e4c-414c5803aad0
msgctxt "h1bb1de70gcb7ag49d9g89e8g850437ecc49b"
msgid "Ho! We'll do more than that, my friend."
msgstr "호! 우린 그 이상을 이루리라, 나의 벗이여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6fe3e533-cb6b-b75d-fad8-6076c89b363e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:6fe3e533-cb6b-b75d-fad8-6076c89b363e
msgctxt "h3508ad87g7477g4627g8fdfg9914fcc068f5"
msgid "All right, let's get out of here."
msgstr "좋아, 여기서 나가자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7033c36d-4f61-e152-12cd-e2d97ad7e626
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:7033c36d-4f61-e152-12cd-e2d97ad7e626
msgctxt "hee767e52g05c3g424fg8ae7gdb8198adbfb5"
msgid "What just happened?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 일어난 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 73813a6e-8afe-2301-d14b-1a6dbfc09ef5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:73813a6e-8afe-2301-d14b-1a6dbfc09ef5
msgctxt "hc70a68e2g9e3ag451bg9e25g2311c8b7c3ba"
msgid ""
"*Yet no pain, no recrimination. Only silence. And somehow, this strikes you "
"as worse.*"
msgstr "*그러나 고통도, 비난도 느껴지지 않습니다. 침묵뿐입니다. 이 같은 상황이 도리어 당신을 더 불안하게 만듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 75beff20-cce6-7343-13e0-8ea3cdeaad63
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:75beff20-cce6-7343-13e0-8ea3cdeaad63
msgctxt "hacd1328bgca8eg4bd3ga319g435814d24b1c"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong will be headed for Moonrise Towers. We'd better get there, and "
"see what she's unleashed against Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr ""
"밤의 노래는 문라이즈 타워로 향할 거야. 우리도 얼른 뒤쫓아 가서, 케서릭 쏨을 상대로 그녀가 어떤 활약을 펼치는지 확인하는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 77e01bfc-9495-1964-239a-502dc609bee4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:77e01bfc-9495-1964-239a-502dc609bee4
msgctxt "hcf2ac193g75a7g4c29g96c6g26d2e23b3613"
msgid "For my weapon? Absolutely."
msgstr "무기를 위해서 말입니까? 물론이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 791a2733-d269-e905-7e03-138d0bfeabec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:791a2733-d269-e905-7e03-138d0bfeabec
msgctxt "h56a0d98bgf9eeg4bfeg8ac8gdfa961e350c1"
msgid "Ready for what?"
msgstr "무엇을 위한 준비 말인가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 7a321100-e5da-a131-5e05-66ad81d85948
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:7a321100-e5da-a131-5e05-66ad81d85948
msgctxt "hd414a94dg2421g4d46g8160g4e98ffa90b7e"
msgid "It is your turn, my friend."
msgstr "네 차례다, 친구여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 7b66452d-c276-a383-b27b-245f9c9e94a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:7b66452d-c276-a383-b27b-245f9c9e94a3
msgctxt "hea1ecd64g358eg4e39ga4acg993dc984d38d"
msgid "It is your turn."
msgstr "네 차례다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 7f767f5d-4ee5-241e-975d-a31d1fe39428
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:7f767f5d-4ee5-241e-975d-a31d1fe39428
msgctxt "hcd161e17gcb59g480ag972dg4fc4e3e6d588"
msgid "Are you ready?"
msgstr "준비되었는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 831e97b4-3104-f45e-00a3-1474dad5e3fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:831e97b4-3104-f45e-00a3-1474dad5e3fa
msgctxt "h345c3a88g6b77g441cg8d6bg24d0b848fb5e"
msgid "Are you ready?"
msgstr "준비되었는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 8d577dee-888c-7728-fc95-f7219eda8d6f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:8d577dee-888c-7728-fc95-f7219eda8d6f
msgctxt "hb993f666gf4d6g4cabg9acbgbaef12d6a93c"
msgid ""
"That's what frightens me. She must be angry, yet I don't feel it, or hear "
"it... There's only silence."
msgstr "그래서 더 무서워. 그분은 틀림없이 분노에 사로잡혀 있을 텐데, 내겐 조금도 느껴지거나 들리지 않아... 사방이 침묵뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 903a473c-b49c-65cd-6464-965b203c095b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:903a473c-b49c-65cd-6464-965b203c095b
msgctxt "h6eb5e6e2gca78g482bg9adbg05bff2670754"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure there's a place that's far enough away for me to go. Lady Shar "
"must be angry... but there's only silence."
msgstr ""
"여기서 벗어날 수 있을 만큼 멀리 떨어진 곳이 있을지 모르겠어. 샤 여신은 틀림없이 분노에 사로잡혀 있을 텐데... 온통 침묵뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 981e4b1c-aeee-cadb-2e80-034c166d4f1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:981e4b1c-aeee-cadb-2e80-034c166d4f1e
msgctxt "hfd4b4e16g4aa2g4d0cgaad4g6fb74290da24"
msgid "We're going to kill Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr "우린 케서릭 쏨을 죽이리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 9a8c8542-c7e1-53d5-b807-bdba3b6ccb46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:9a8c8542-c7e1-53d5-b807-bdba3b6ccb46
msgctxt "h14b383a1g7419g4bfagadf2gf37fd2980af2"
msgid "You have injured me, soldier. But you have given me a great gift, too."
msgstr "병사여, 그대는 나를 상처 입혔지만, 커다란 선물 또한 주었구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9b8e90d2-1e72-af1a-a7b0-7644ed4d437a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:9b8e90d2-1e72-af1a-a7b0-7644ed4d437a
msgctxt "h7c82e4c3gf8ccg43f5gbbf8g8c6bda53aea3"
msgid ""
"*A shudder of fear runs through you. Lady Shar asked you to prove yourself - "
"and you failed.*"
msgstr "*공포의 전율이 온몸을 휘감습니다. 샤 여신은 능력을 입증해 보일 것을 명했지만, 당신은 실패했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 9bc5653c-867d-5758-b46b-987b4b53342e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:9bc5653c-867d-5758-b46b-987b4b53342e
msgctxt "h60ac1e6eg5bd9g49abg804cg3c641984abb1"
msgid "Ho! And it shall be yours. And then?"
msgstr "호! 물론 그대에게 주어질 것이다. 그런 다음에는?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9e2228c5-71f5-7aa6-883a-d0b7dd34d493
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:9e2228c5-71f5-7aa6-883a-d0b7dd34d493
msgctxt "h18349269g3b46g447ag9c64g29a0c77612d1"
msgid "Ready for what?"
msgstr "무엇을 위한 준비 말인가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = a9e0db7e-c43f-2962-0aee-d61fcb3785f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:a9e0db7e-c43f-2962-0aee-d61fcb3785f7
msgctxt "h7723b55bgc48eg4f8cgae86g2710236151a3"
msgid "And now? Now, Ketheric Thorm must die."
msgstr "그다음에는? 바야흐로 케서릭 쏨은 죽어야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abfb17a6-3cb5-355d-be31-9bf75e241d60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - AVATAR(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:abfb17a6-3cb5-355d-be31-9bf75e241d60
msgctxt "hda55cca5g743fg4045g80afg365e59e2bd12"
msgid "To get out of this place? Absolutely."
msgstr "이곳을 빠져나가기 위한 준비 말입니까? 물론이죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = b2b436ee-2b4d-0e7b-2cfe-b8e6d5a7f3d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:b2b436ee-2b4d-0e7b-2cfe-b8e6d5a7f3d7
msgctxt "h3fb5ee77g942bg44e1g913dge4f7782d78cb"
msgid "Ho! We'll do more than that, my friend."
msgstr "호! 우린 그 이상을 이루리라, 나의 벗이여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = c97c5c5c-0ce1-3beb-4140-2185abadae62
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:c97c5c5c-0ce1-3beb-4140-2185abadae62
msgctxt "hc8358656g86ebg4f07g8d6bgd9026fdb0790"
msgid ""
"Our Lady of Silver. Hear me!\n"
"She Who Guides, the Moonmaiden Selûne -\n"
"MOTHER OF THE SO-CALLED NIGHTSONG.\n"
"THE NIGHTSONG IS NO MORE!"
msgstr ""
"은의 여인이시여. 들어 주소서!\n"
"달처녀 셀루네, 길을 밝히시는 분이시여.\n"
"이름하여 밤의 노래의 어머니 되시는 분이시여.\n"
"바야흐로 밤의 노래의 끝이 도래했나니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = cd019a65-4511-f38a-973a-d97a9d3c6ecf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:cd019a65-4511-f38a-973a-d97a9d3c6ecf
msgctxt "h1b734fd7g7112g4d4ag8cacgeefdabc35f35"
msgid "I am resplendent."
msgstr "나는 눈부신 존재이니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = cf2190d9-1a8e-7694-5c38-9aa404d2d204
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:cf2190d9-1a8e-7694-5c38-9aa404d2d204
msgctxt "h14d42f81gef6bg4d34gbc1cg81cbe286c25d"
msgid "I am resplendent."
msgstr "나는 눈부신 존재이니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = d036840c-02b7-9113-86e9-42b11e3864e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:d036840c-02b7-9113-86e9-42b11e3864e2
msgctxt "h2ea2747bg23eag48d1g986fg032e2ce31cd7"
msgid "But that will come later. There is a battle yet to be fought."
msgstr "하지만 그 문제는 나중에 처리하도록 하지. 치러야 할 전투가 남았으니 말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = d11380d0-ab8b-4fdc-9ccd-17cac71f37d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:d11380d0-ab8b-4fdc-9ccd-17cac71f37d5
msgctxt "hfc908518g36b9g4f51g9c9eg95394f84622c"
msgid ""
"What have you done? She was to be Shar's sacrifice - her death was to be my "
"destiny!"
msgstr "무슨 짓이야? 그녀는 샤를 위한 희생양이었어 - 그녀의 죽음이 바로 내 운명이었다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = db74873f-575b-d690-6d4d-949cfc1fcccf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:db74873f-575b-d690-6d4d-949cfc1fcccf
msgctxt "h52ce2262g5fe4g4c0ag9e43g2e65ec52ee93"
msgid ""
"Our Lady of Silver. Hear me!\n"
"She Who Guides, the Moonmaiden Selûne -\n"
"MOTHER OF THE SO-CALLED NIGHTSONG.\n"
"THE NIGHTSONG IS NO MORE!"
msgstr ""
"은의 여인이시여. 들어 주소서!\n"
"달처녀 셀루네, 길을 밝히시는 분이시여.\n"
"이름하여 밤의 노래의 어머니 되시는 분이시여.\n"
"바야흐로 밤의 노래의 끝이 도래했나니!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = e12e90cb-3c25-0ebd-ff35-585b17756bd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongsFate_OM_Shadowheart_State_NightsongAsksForFreedom = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:e12e90cb-3c25-0ebd-ff35-585b17756bd0
msgctxt "h5a72d5a6g65b1g4ea1g87aag75ed996e261d"
msgid ""
"You have given me a great gift, little warrior. Don't you find it oh-so-"
"curious that you would spurn your Dark Lady? Perhaps you feel a stirring of "
"the truth already."
msgstr ""
"내게 크나큰 선물을 주었구나, 어린 전사여. 어둠의 여인을 내쳤다는 사실에 의아함이라도 품고 있는 것이냐? 아마도 그대는 이미 진실의 "
"파동을 느끼고 있었으리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = e4bf050c-5ee9-4507-3a81-69264ef015d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:e4bf050c-5ee9-4507-3a81-69264ef015d0
msgctxt "hb097dd83g9ca2g4aa0g80f7g6f43bb7ff45b"
msgid ""
"You have done me an incredible service. The Moonmaiden has blessed you in "
"kind."
msgstr "그대는 내게 믿기지 않는 공헌을 베풀었다. 그 대가로 달처녀께서 그대에게 축복을 내리시리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ec63206e-c621-61e0-4c6d-15540106a2c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:ec63206e-c621-61e0-4c6d-15540106a2c8
msgctxt "h34170ab2g955fg40aeg8188g5bc0942467b6"
msgid "Ready for what?"
msgstr "무엇을 위한 준비 말인가요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = f100beff-f3f9-7abd-f92f-ae893bb38556
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:f100beff-f3f9-7abd-f92f-ae893bb38556
msgctxt "h4e627608g0f77g457agbc0ag74725ba324a3"
msgid "To kill Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨의 죽음."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = fe565f5d-7763-84ef-c6f1-9a53f866235f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFreed:fe565f5d-7763-84ef-c6f1-9a53f866235f
msgctxt "h7fe8e28ag9944g45e8gb78fgf1eacbd50f29"
msgid "And now? Now, Ketheric Thorm must die."
msgstr "그다음에는? 바야흐로 케서릭 쏨은 죽어야 한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 009504fe-7c8c-c1a5-3b3f-e4a4fad7aa4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:009504fe-7c8c-c1a5-3b3f-e4a4fad7aa4f
msgctxt "h74cd82b4gca6fg4700g8140gee67f6feaded"
msgid "<i>Wait.</i>"
msgstr "<i>잠깐.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 03a5cdc2-219c-535c-219b-2d90478189d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:03a5cdc2-219c-535c-219b-2d90478189d7
msgctxt "h61a98258g27a2g418dgb75fg72240e316782"
msgid ""
"Come - now is not the time for a crisis of faith. Go on. Kill me. You won't "
"be the first."
msgstr "오너라... 지금은 믿음의 위기를 겪을 때가 아니지. 어서. 날 죽여라. 네가 처음도 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 0461c3c5-3b27-9f83-a0cd-0274eef847f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:0461c3c5-3b27-9f83-a0cd-0274eef847f2
msgctxt "hf7c9644dg6637g4d28gb782g44c811ee9bed"
msgid "Release me. I beg you."
msgstr "날 풀어다오. 부탁한다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 0975d391-f730-37ca-6fb7-b0464e08a9db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:0975d391-f730-37ca-6fb7-b0464e08a9db
msgctxt "h25907bb2gf852g4aafg962eg4116188366b4"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you've met my mother. You've seen her pale face in the night sky - "
"Selûne, the Moonmaiden."
msgstr "나의 어머니를 만나봤겠지. 밤하늘에 뜬 그녀의 창백한 얼굴을 봤을 것이야. 달처녀 셀루네님."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d38b45e-fa13-b860-664e-912088447e6a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:0d38b45e-fa13-b860-664e-912088447e6a
msgctxt "h268eb8bdgcc07g47dbga424g068a2b312521"
msgid "No - you'll stay where you are."
msgstr "아니, 당신은 그대로 있을 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 0e2c2538-2130-9adf-5c09-d4e21c3af8e1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - FactionHostileToPlayerGroupAfterDialog(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:0e2c2538-2130-9adf-5c09-d4e21c3af8e1
msgctxt "hfe0ee9ccgadf1g4be2ga2cag8de355567aef"
msgid ""
"Know I will feel every wound, and still I will hurt less than you, who so "
"utterly yourself defile."
msgstr "나는 무수한 고통을 느낄 테지만, 네가 더 고통받으리라는 것을 알라. 자신을 무참히 더럽힌 자여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 10f6baab-262e-19c5-9db7-95415574843f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:10f6baab-262e-19c5-9db7-95415574843f
msgctxt "h7601dde8geb62g4f51g9075g81d7e8866b51"
msgid ""
"How many of your Dark Justiciar brethren have run my heart through? How many "
"times have I, immortal, risen again, to await the next?"
msgstr "너희 다크 저스티시어들이 얼마나 내 심장을 꿰뚫었느냐고? 이 몸, 불멸자가 얼마나 부활해 다음 차례를 기다렸느냐고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 11d034fd-6a83-094e-a9dd-a73f15549695
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:11d034fd-6a83-094e-a9dd-a73f15549695
msgctxt "hbb30e7fdg3fffg4c1egaa98g525e426ad132"
msgid "I never forget a face."
msgstr "난 절대 네 얼굴을 잊지 않겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 16f96c0a-e8ac-11d3-3d0f-7ad8e2a855d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:16f96c0a-e8ac-11d3-3d0f-7ad8e2a855d3
msgctxt "hf6a46bb9g306eg4397gbea7gd2a9d51af725"
msgid "I'm here to help you - not harm you."
msgstr "난 당신을 해치는 게 아니라 도우러 왔습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 18ffe0d4-ad4e-dd60-80c6-b6e16836f5fb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:18ffe0d4-ad4e-dd60-80c6-b6e16836f5fb
msgctxt "h9b95895dg5b71g4a96ga979g5e54e4854f2b"
msgid ""
"That and nothing more. So certain was Balthazar that I had no friends in "
"this place. Oh, how he taunted and cajoled."
msgstr "그것뿐이다. 발타자르는 이곳에 내 편이 없을 거라 무척이나 확신했지. 오, 어찌나 조롱하고 속이려 들던지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 202c496d-907b-4c8c-5d29-ed23746f0c4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:202c496d-907b-4c8c-5d29-ed23746f0c4c
msgctxt "h2e967bb1g5ae4g44a6ga493g1fd691ff00ac"
msgid "Your eyes are keen. Free me. You will enjoy what comes next."
msgstr "눈썰미가 좋구나. 날 풀어주어라. 결과가 마음에 들 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 2162dfed-b649-551d-36c7-044997c9962b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:2162dfed-b649-551d-36c7-044997c9962b
msgctxt "h7e32f7b3gda8dg4539g8406gdde7ebd6af81"
msgid "A Sharran with a heart? No... perhaps you are no Sharran at all."
msgstr "마음이 있는 샤 신도라? 아니... 어쩌면 넌 샤 신도가 아닐 수도 있겠구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21956c52-3101-8608-2ba2-acf03ba5c425
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:21956c52-3101-8608-2ba2-acf03ba5c425
msgctxt "hbae81147g5fa3g465eg8abbg3f2e3fcaa43c"
msgid ""
"Some would call his experiments heretical - I simply thought them cruel. "
"Unnecessary."
msgstr "어떤 사람들은 그의 실험을 이단적이라고 하겠지만, 난 그저 잔인하다 생각했지. 너무 과해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 21ab295d-9bd2-2cbd-bbef-751f7db741e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFate_LeftNS(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_HasMet = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_PlayerBetrayedNecro = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_Knows_ImmortalitySource = True
#.     - SHA_Nightsong_HasMet = True
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_Knows_AboutImmortality = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:21ab295d-9bd2-2cbd-bbef-751f7db741e8
msgctxt "h2cf9ea73gbccbg42dfg998cg571f1dd7f8f1"
msgid ""
"A valiant performance. I admit, my heart lit like a full moon when you "
"struck down that cadaver."
msgstr "용감무쌍한 행동이군, 인정하마. 저 송장을 때려눕혔을 때 내 심장은 보름달처럼 빛났도다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 25de8c17-8e6b-8be3-8c9d-1988e3b9302b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 1b089469-44dc-7de7-52d2-0ca7dba60a86_NSOptimism = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:25de8c17-8e6b-8be3-8c9d-1988e3b9302b
msgctxt "hb8eb98b7gb669g44f6g8d77g1d3d02337560"
msgid ""
"To think I nearly thought my anguish done. To think I nigh believed you "
"weren't one of Shar's footmen."
msgstr "내 고통이 끝나리라 믿을 뻔했다니. 네가 샤의 부하가 아니라고 믿을 뻔했다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26d14e91-be35-0b9c-ab54-6e6a029cde08
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:26d14e91-be35-0b9c-ab54-6e6a029cde08
msgctxt "h5986bc62gcff8g4cc0gb19fg052c8d074a02"
msgid "How are you the source of Ketheric's invulnerability?"
msgstr "케서릭이 가진 불멸의 근원은 어떻게 되는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2a7d75cd-7219-7a79-b6bc-a1403b18e3ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_Event_SpearAcknowledged(1) = False
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_HasSpear(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:2a7d75cd-7219-7a79-b6bc-a1403b18e3ef
msgctxt "hbd3049dagb16ag4243gbcc2gc1a18495c39b"
msgid ""
"*The Spear of Night could be meant to sacrifice the Nightsong - but are you "
"the one supposed to wield it?*"
msgstr "*밤의 창은 밤의 노래를 희생시키기 위한 무기일 순 있지만... 그걸 휘두르는 게 당신이 맞을까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 2c53d8db-9432-0db4-b07e-8363bd446e0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:2c53d8db-9432-0db4-b07e-8363bd446e0a
msgctxt "h3f5456cag17fag4bf0g959cgb6f5638589d6"
msgid ""
"That is when this immortal will visit you, Sharran. That is when I will show "
"you what it is to be afraid."
msgstr "그때 이 불멸자가 널 방문할 것이다. 샤 신도여. 그때 네가 두려워해야 할 것이 무엇인지 보여주겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2db8a06c-274d-4959-83de-5a912c1f68f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 1b089469-44dc-7de7-52d2-0ca7dba60a86_NSOptimism = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:2db8a06c-274d-4959-83de-5a912c1f68f2
msgctxt "h039f4d10gca77g448fg865fg8ff6b7800f1d"
msgid ""
"I thought the 'Nightsong' was some relic. When I realised you were a person, "
"I couldn't justify helping Balthazar."
msgstr "여태 '밤의 노래'라는 게 유물의 일종이라고만 생각했는데, 그것이 사람이었다는 걸 깨닫고 나니 발타자르를 도울 수가 없더군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 2dc2af96-1304-acf6-c013-991c09b9fd52
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:2dc2af96-1304-acf6-c013-991c09b9fd52
msgctxt "hdf57b32bgd5d4g4334ga270g87a3dfb4088d"
msgid ""
"I showed you my heart; now use your head, young warrior. How will you fly "
"this place without my helping hand?"
msgstr "난 네게 진심을 보여줬다. 이제 생각해봐라, 어린 전사여. 내 도움 없이 어떻게 이곳을 빠져나갈 테냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 31834680-068c-6a84-8b99-bc844a1f1628
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:31834680-068c-6a84-8b99-bc844a1f1628
msgctxt "h073c4b99gd052g4ecbg80beg465dd753a05f"
msgid "<i>Do as she says: kill her.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀의 말대로 한다: 죽인다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 32cb7e5a-139c-ce79-6648-bd11c0ee092d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:32cb7e5a-139c-ce79-6648-bd11c0ee092d
msgctxt "hcccc6546gc761g4c61gac8cgf26e02fcd95d"
msgid ""
"I cannot prevent you. But I can advise you. Be careful to whom you yoke your "
"fate."
msgstr "난 너를 막을 순 없다. 하지만 충고는 해줄 수 있지. 누구에게 너의 운명을 얽어맨 것인지 주의하거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 35f87772-34a7-6a20-6f9e-84d2981907ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:35f87772-34a7-6a20-6f9e-84d2981907ac
msgctxt "h20066fc5g090dg4b16gb927g66c262faf81e"
msgid "To eat his sins. Shall I take yours too?"
msgstr "그의 죄를 먹기 위해서지. 네 죄도 먹어야 하나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 36c22878-6896-703d-6878-4d393de70ade
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:36c22878-6896-703d-6878-4d393de70ade
msgctxt "had80443ag8715g4a62gac9bg63b8d6d44b17"
msgid "What will happen when I do?"
msgstr "그러면 어떤 일이 일어나는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 3cfac56e-1756-c22f-9d32-f2d2e58f805b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:3cfac56e-1756-c22f-9d32-f2d2e58f805b
msgctxt "h00ce7350g4ac5g4da8gb5f9g4b541ec138d3"
msgid ""
"A century have I been subject to endless death - at hands so like your own."
msgstr "한 세기 동안 나는 끝없는 죽음의 대상이 됐다... 네 손으로 한 것처럼 말이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d1768d9-009b-3c65-c201-8a97bf6bd51f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:3d1768d9-009b-3c65-c201-8a97bf6bd51f
msgctxt "h0489a798gdbd6g46d9g8418g39a99f4e5a60"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3e284ef8-ce0e-7192-5523-ad7189c7e160
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_Necromancer_Event_SaidNoToHelpWithNightsong(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:3e284ef8-ce0e-7192-5523-ad7189c7e160
msgctxt "ha60e9c39gd922g44e5g85d5g93aec0dfb329"
msgid "Balthazar didn't send me here - I came of my own accord."
msgstr "발타자르가 날 보낸 게 아니라 내가 알아서 이곳으로 온 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 3fdde59b-4b28-c3e5-47e0-9cb46b29b195
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:3fdde59b-4b28-c3e5-47e0-9cb46b29b195
msgctxt "h9406e7dfgec85g44d3g95begd73291903918"
msgid "And I have naught but time."
msgstr "좋다. 내게 남는 거라곤 시간밖에 없으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 4094ac6e-01d5-11f4-439a-42c5701464a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:4094ac6e-01d5-11f4-439a-42c5701464a9
msgctxt "hbc714190g96e3g48cfg98d1gfe2e52284e89"
msgid "You, who seek to claim the ultimate prize."
msgstr "궁극의 보상을 취하려고 온 자여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 40b56999-caad-421a-4e42-c4bd72cc8290
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:40b56999-caad-421a-4e42-c4bd72cc8290
msgctxt "h6901f106gea1fg4cb0g9f27g2839dd601746"
msgid "You say you're immortal - how is that so?"
msgstr "본인이 불멸자라고 말했는데... 어떻게 그럴 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 423a161b-be1c-cba2-ec12-5cf10969920e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:423a161b-be1c-cba2-ec12-5cf10969920e
msgctxt "h0de3ba70g51bbg4b80gad20g3d7a4901ee64"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 42e587df-d9b3-e044-5999-e501656b246d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:42e587df-d9b3-e044-5999-e501656b246d
msgctxt "he1e4e98ag5d90g4b37g9e27g63f85c98f549"
msgid ""
"I accept my fate - for now. But the life of a divine is longer than you can "
"fathom, Sharran. And this cold chapter will close, one day."
msgstr ""
"지금은... 내 운명을 받아들인다. 하지만 신성의 삶은 네가 상상할 수 없을 만큼 길다, 샤 신도여. 그리고 언젠가는, 이 냉혹한 시기도 "
"끝날 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 449b7db6-4573-6e85-59fc-de8fa3a050a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:449b7db6-4573-6e85-59fc-de8fa3a050a7
msgctxt "h336eb8e9g320ag48f3ga9f9g64b92503d354"
msgid ""
"Then your task is done. Lay a hand upon me in camaraderie, and I will be "
"free."
msgstr "그렇다면 네 과업은 끝났다. 우정의 표시로 내게 손을 얹어라, 그러면 나는 해방될 테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 45d40cba-7409-cb2e-94f7-5792f9f8f732
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(1) = False
#. TagRule: !(CLERIC_SHAR and PALADIN_SHAR)
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:45d40cba-7409-cb2e-94f7-5792f9f8f732
msgctxt "h3e5fe2c1gb86cg4585ga766g82d4f41a6889"
msgid "I am no Sharran. I've come to free you."
msgstr "저는 샤를 섬기지 않습니다. 당신을 해방하러 온 겁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4614a22f-6355-12ce-bdec-7bf1ecc0a429
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !(CLERIC_SHAR and PALADIN_SHAR)
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:4614a22f-6355-12ce-bdec-7bf1ecc0a429
msgctxt "h8df23961gdf38g4486g9a19g4b51cc6c25ab"
msgid "I am no Sharran."
msgstr "저는 샤를 섬기지 않습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 46246662-d22a-9e51-b175-661cae629192
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:46246662-d22a-9e51-b175-661cae629192
msgctxt "h617ba77fg9b81g416ega8a7gce622b3471e6"
msgid ""
"A maxim simple and noble - too noble for a Sharran. Perhaps I named you "
"false."
msgstr "간결하고 숭고한 격언이지만... 샤 신도에게는 어울리지 않는 격언이지. 어쩌면 내가 널 잘못 부른 거 같구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 478efb8a-c992-6f5e-c46a-b0b074489adb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:478efb8a-c992-6f5e-c46a-b0b074489adb
msgctxt "heb409c73g97d6g466eg9d55g5eeb68a9d041"
msgid ""
"Even one who had crossed a terrible threshold just prior; even one who had "
"driven me to death."
msgstr "방금 끔찍한 선을 넘었던 자라도 말이다. 날 죽였던 자일 지라도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 4cff58bc-fe32-dc8f-e590-27db62a1e6f4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:4cff58bc-fe32-dc8f-e590-27db62a1e6f4
msgctxt "hc3008343gc149g4031gbe9cg3ac657a234a7"
msgid "Shar herself could not dim her face. And you will never dim mine."
msgstr "샤 본인도 셀루네님의 얼굴을 흐리게 할 수 없다. 너도 나를 절대 흐리게 할 수 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 4fb6fd33-a6e0-e515-9511-c53864e404b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:4fb6fd33-a6e0-e515-9511-c53864e404b1
msgctxt "h274da593gb463g488ag8d02gb3bc3936375f"
msgid ""
"Shar kept you ignorant, did she? Or was it Ketheric? Perhaps they forgot to "
"tell you they'd make a murderer of you yet."
msgstr "샤가 네게 알려주지 않았나 보군? 아니면 케서릭인가? 그들이 너를 살인자로 만들 거라고 말해주는 걸 깜빡했나 보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 51f63312-381f-30e6-a730-f024e50d5221
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:51f63312-381f-30e6-a730-f024e50d5221
msgctxt "ha84b6ca8g0959g47cbga242gad6530fe424b"
msgid ""
"I am Dame Aylin. Out of this hellish realm I carry my sword by the blessing "
"of my mother, Selûne."
msgstr "나는 여기사 에일린이다. 나의 어머니, 셀루네의 축복을 받고 검을 들어 이 지옥 같은 차원계로 왔지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 527ea4fb-25e2-dd3d-2fda-d1f1f758447a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:527ea4fb-25e2-dd3d-2fda-d1f1f758447a
msgctxt "hcf7416e0g598cg4e76g8893g9f11e17aa552"
msgid "Why do you call me Sharran?"
msgstr "왜 저를 샤 신도라고 하는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 550ca1e1-0e4f-fbd0-7e08-eddca718206b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:550ca1e1-0e4f-fbd0-7e08-eddca718206b
msgctxt "h7c1dca43ged17g499agb15bg394a2d856965"
msgid "And your purpose?"
msgstr "그렇다면 네 목적은?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 561db6f6-bb85-d2e9-5ee8-5581b7ff4fd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:561db6f6-bb85-d2e9-5ee8-5581b7ff4fd4
msgctxt "he6e37bdbg9670g444dg936bg45fa36b209fb"
msgid ""
"Keep it, if you wish. It is nothing but a bauble now. Just <i>free me</i>."
msgstr "원한다면 가져라. 이젠 잡동사니와 다를 바 없으니. 날 <i>풀어주기나 해라</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5776ebe8-f58f-3779-71f8-bf13f63b147f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFate_LeftNS(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:5776ebe8-f58f-3779-71f8-bf13f63b147f
msgctxt "h4b048f39g318bg43bbg9bb3ge2831eabdfc1"
msgid "<i>Leave her.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 5ae7c20c-1e4c-db69-8741-5a91a2d27723
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:5ae7c20c-1e4c-db69-8741-5a91a2d27723
msgctxt "h83381ae0g5cf2g4eb5gbb11g623d25326ce9"
msgid ""
"But perhaps... an inoculation, to make the sickness less catching. If you "
"seek to harm Ketheric, our aims are aligned. If you seek to make him "
"vulnerable, your task is done."
msgstr ""
"하지만 어쩌면... 예방 접종으로, 역겨움을 좀 줄일 수도 있겠지. 케서릭을 물리치고자 한다면, 우리의 목표는 일치한다. 그를 취약하게 "
"만들려고 하는 거라면, 네 임무는 끝났다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c18ba6a-042a-99db-f99b-012907a09d4f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:5c18ba6a-042a-99db-f99b-012907a09d4f
msgctxt "hb47d29a0g19f6g4857gbb9cg7a4cd5c63462"
msgid ""
"I'm [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53]. I need to kill "
"Ketheric Thorm."
msgstr ""
"저는 [GEN_PlayerName_c11eee1e-7815-6143-7233-f2427799fa53] 입니다. 케서릭 쏨을 죽여야 합니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5db9f447-61b5-bfa3-8e1d-0af6ba8ff7bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongFate_LeftNS(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:5db9f447-61b5-bfa3-8e1d-0af6ba8ff7bc
msgctxt "h820fdff0g0629g44c7g8bc4gaf4acb961989"
msgid "<i>Leave her.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 5ed82d78-8473-a7c4-c270-df00ad191466
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Shadowheart_State_PlayerDeniedNightsongKill = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_Knows_ImmortalitySource = True
#.     - SHA_Nightsong_HasMet = True
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_Knows_AboutImmortality = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:5ed82d78-8473-a7c4-c270-df00ad191466
msgctxt "h9c7fe3cagd971g450fgaffcgf07ca46bf1b9"
msgid ""
"An intriguing fray. You lay low the Dark Lady's messenger - your ally, your "
"friend. Perhaps you wish to slay the 'Nightsong' yourself, Sharran."
msgstr ""
"흥미로운 싸움이로다. 어둠의 여신의 전령을 낮게 깔아뭉갰구나. 네 동맹이자 친구를 말이다. 아마도 네가 직접 '밤의 노래'를 죽이고 "
"싶은가 보구나, 샤 신도여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 617649c6-e5c5-59fa-55b3-2a7b83bc4aec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:617649c6-e5c5-59fa-55b3-2a7b83bc4aec
msgctxt "h694fd53fgcd13g4330g8b13g93e110ea6b2f"
msgid "How much is your freedom worth to you?"
msgstr "네 자유의 가치는 얼마나 되지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6352e751-9eb1-2506-81c5-a75ef4359b20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:6352e751-9eb1-2506-81c5-a75ef4359b20
msgctxt "hc180c6a1gdaedg45adg950dg753313c49a35"
msgid "I'm someone who can recognise a good opportunity."
msgstr "저는 좋은 기회를 알아보는 자입니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6884f520-1370-8521-5275-ea1d1c782d7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:6884f520-1370-8521-5275-ea1d1c782d7e
msgctxt "hd321a2c1g76f0g48adg8d93g7cb5554b6782"
msgid "I have questions for you, first."
msgstr "먼저 당신에게 질문하고 싶습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 689b67e4-aa1c-aef6-6a13-285a5f0ea00f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:689b67e4-aa1c-aef6-6a13-285a5f0ea00f
msgctxt "hb5b5ee73g57b9g4531g8a3agd20afd9b2d00"
msgid "Good. Foolish prey makes for easy finding."
msgstr "좋아. 바보 같은 먹잇감은 찾기 쉽지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 6aa9c7ba-fd73-c797-762c-750bd337487b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SELUNE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:6aa9c7ba-fd73-c797-762c-750bd337487b
msgctxt "h2eb5c2eag9516g449dg9323g7944c144a2b7"
msgid ""
"This cursed place is far from our Lady's favour - why would you walk here?"
msgstr "이 저주받은 장소는 우리 여신님의 호의와 동떨어져 있군. 왜 이곳까지 오게 된 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 6fa15f36-eacf-2323-c650-a6e7a2620cb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:6fa15f36-eacf-2323-c650-a6e7a2620cb1
msgctxt "h0b8140e8g1443g49bcgb798g8f591892e1b3"
msgid "No. Please."
msgstr "안 돼. 부탁이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 732d9adc-3494-7004-b61a-e9f641a5b975
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:732d9adc-3494-7004-b61a-e9f641a5b975
msgctxt "h608ad9c9gec88g49aega126g7323623aa7e2"
msgid ""
"And I? I will come for you. When the time is right. When your sons are grown "
"and your beard is long and wiry; when you cannot hold your nightly water and "
"your nose grows as long as your weary, weary days..."
msgstr ""
"그리고 난? 때가 되면, 널 찾아갈 것이다. 네 아들들이 다 자라고 네 수염이 길고 꼬부라질 때, 밤마다 목마름을 참지 못하고, 네 코가 "
"피곤하고 지친 날들만큼 길어질 때..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 732d9adc-3494-7004-b61a-e9f641a5b975
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:732d9adc-3494-7004-b61a-e9f641a5b975
msgctxt "hb8a846e5g5e67g4cb5g9fa9g8cf5ff78a45a"
msgid ""
"And I? I will come for you. When the time is right. When your daughters are "
"grown and your chin sprouts whiskers dark - when your teeth are yellow as "
"corn and your sleep grows short and your days are long and weary, so weary..."
msgstr ""
"그리고 난? 때가 되면, 널 찾아갈 것이다. 네 딸들이 다 자라고 네 턱에서 털이 짙게 돋아날 때, 네 이빨이 옥수수처럼 누레지고 점점 "
"잠이 짧아질 때, 하루가 점점 길고 피곤하고 지쳐갈 때..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 732d9adc-3494-7004-b61a-e9f641a5b975
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:732d9adc-3494-7004-b61a-e9f641a5b975
msgctxt "h71763134gfd08g4447ga776g1091506089fa"
msgid ""
"And I? I will come for you. When the time is right. When your children are "
"grown and your eyes are weak; when your nose grows as long as your weary, "
"weary days..."
msgstr ""
"그리고 난? 때가 되면, 널 찾아갈 것이다. 네 아이들이 다 자라고 네 눈이 침침할 때, 네 코가 피곤하고 지친 날들만큼 길어질 때..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 753ba124-0bf9-8f4f-1b84-aef68ec1d945
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:753ba124-0bf9-8f4f-1b84-aef68ec1d945
msgctxt "h291616a7g8e9dg4498ga859gffa70c074327"
msgid "It would be a delight to grant your desired death, my lady."
msgstr "네가 원하는 죽음을 허락하게 되어 기쁘구나, 여인."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 78968020-9966-2f63-31be-b10748f5f79e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:78968020-9966-2f63-31be-b10748f5f79e
msgctxt "h714655aag2f2eg4d53gb58bg3ab266e0c1fa"
msgid "Say more. Please."
msgstr "자세히 말해다오. 부탁이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 7a9ffab8-50e1-2632-0ab0-c99e60c71d77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_HasMetKilledNightsong(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_HasMet = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:7a9ffab8-50e1-2632-0ab0-c99e60c71d77
msgctxt "hcb66d05age36eg4f2dga254gc4f8be027f3f"
msgid ""
"Free me, and I will forgive your transgressions - generous, don't you think?"
msgstr "날 풀어주어라, 그러면 네 죄를 용서하마. 관대하다고 생각하지 않나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 7a9ffab8-50e1-2632-0ab0-c99e60c71d77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_HasMetKilledNightsong(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_HasMet = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:7a9ffab8-50e1-2632-0ab0-c99e60c71d77
msgctxt "hdbcf2d2egb7bcg4944gb630g627f9ed56de8"
msgid "I'm ready to fly this place. Are you?"
msgstr "난 이곳을 빠져나갈 준비가 됐다. 너는 어떻지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 7a9ffab8-50e1-2632-0ab0-c99e60c71d77
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[2]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_HasMetKilledNightsong(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_HasMet = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:7a9ffab8-50e1-2632-0ab0-c99e60c71d77
msgctxt "h9b41190eg4e2fg47dbg9b05g5cb71b99f3e2"
msgid "I have all the time in the world. How about you?"
msgstr "나에겐 무궁한 시간이 있다. 너는 어떻지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 7ba26ece-9e40-45c6-7500-ad1335ff8ee1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:7ba26ece-9e40-45c6-7500-ad1335ff8ee1
msgctxt "h94706218g37fdg4822gbaeeg45d5dee72c84"
msgid ""
"But why betray your kinsman? Why turn your ire on he who sent you here? Go "
"on, Sharran - speak."
msgstr "하지만 왜 너의 동족을 배신한 거지? 왜 너를 보낸 자에게 분노를 돌린 것이냐? 어서, 말해보거라, 샤 신도여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7d4eee03-2f65-b58d-f2bc-e82e912b2f83
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_Event_SpearAcknowledged(1) = False
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_HasSpear(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_Event_SpearAcknowledged(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:7d4eee03-2f65-b58d-f2bc-e82e912b2f83
msgctxt "h27423215ge921g48dfgb8bcg6641d39f516e"
msgid ""
"Perhaps I can still kill you - I found a spear that seems intended for that "
"very purpose."
msgstr "아직 널 죽일 수 있을지도. 바로 그 목적을 위한 창을 찾은 것 같거든."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 7e47e514-0c60-ed93-a97b-4daf5709df46
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:7e47e514-0c60-ed93-a97b-4daf5709df46
msgctxt "h78691c8eg2616g49f2g8e7fg7582854187b9"
msgid ""
"You will have done what your Dark Lady requires - you will have slain a "
"child of Selûne. You will be a Dark Justiciar. Isn't it so?"
msgstr "네 어둠의 여신이 요구한 일을 이루게 되겠지, 셀루네님의 자식을 죽이는 것. 넌 다크 저스티시어가 될 것이다. 그렇지 않은가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 7f3d2213-0542-bf0a-b2ba-e8d371b22756
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:7f3d2213-0542-bf0a-b2ba-e8d371b22756
msgctxt "h6a67b184g44feg463eg81fegf289911df30a"
msgid ""
"Ha! A century have I been confined here - and I would spend a century more "
"in devoted gratitude to they who set me free."
msgstr ""
"하! 한 세기 동안 이곳에 갇혀 있었다... 그리고 나를 자유롭게 해준 이를 위해 한 세기 더 헌신적으로 감사하는 시간을 보낼 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 7f459415-6565-fe8c-7e99-a82e5557f4d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:7f459415-6565-fe8c-7e99-a82e5557f4d5
msgctxt "h1539f2cegc5a3g4ff6g9d5dg791b5f6aae5a"
msgid ""
"Present your weapon, soldier. Plunge it into the Nightsong. I cannot stop "
"you. But know this:"
msgstr "네 무기를 꺼내라, 병사여. 밤의 노래를 깊숙이 찌르도록 하여라. 난 너를 막을 수 없지만, 이것만은 기억해 두도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 815c2ad5-f4db-5a4d-18b7-01755c145cd6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:815c2ad5-f4db-5a4d-18b7-01755c145cd6
msgctxt "h0fe1fa2ega27fg497bgaa95g13f112ce727d"
msgid "Is that all it takes?"
msgstr "그게 전부입니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 88937a4a-b8c9-e57d-9e42-f6f99c40d1ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:88937a4a-b8c9-e57d-9e42-f6f99c40d1ef
msgctxt "hf9123462g64acg45aega416g5d385461af31"
msgid ""
"A century I have known naught but sorrow; rage. A century have I been "
"Ketheric's captive."
msgstr "한 세기 동안 나에게는 슬픔과 분노뿐이었다. 한 세기 동안 케서릭의 포로가 되어 살았다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 889969d8-2223-7cec-0700-1dcb79b641b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:889969d8-2223-7cec-0700-1dcb79b641b0
msgctxt "hc7001ec8g40d7g4da2gb1bbgda75fb2a03bd"
msgid "Congratulations - your mistress Shar will write your name on her hand."
msgstr "축하해주마... 네 놈의 여주인 샤가 너의 이름을 본인 손에 써 주겠구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 892ceb9a-fcc2-176d-837c-0cdcb8a80866
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_Event_SpearAcknowledged(1) = False
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_HasSpear(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_Event_SpearAcknowledged(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:892ceb9a-fcc2-176d-837c-0cdcb8a80866
msgctxt "hf590349aga2f1g4ec4ga610g79b4f0fc5799"
msgid "Kill you? I found a spear that seems intended for that very purpose."
msgstr "널 죽인다고? 바로 그런 목적에 맞는 창을 발견하긴 했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b28271b-5bad-f67c-b8a6-79499acd5384
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:8b28271b-5bad-f67c-b8a6-79499acd5384
msgctxt "h7a26877dg8ab0g4781gb3c6g0a785365f9d1"
msgid "I'm no Sharran. I'm something far worse."
msgstr "난 샤 신도가 아니다. 훨씬 좋지 않은 무언가지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8be53799-ceb6-13b7-86ac-499d12858efe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:8be53799-ceb6-13b7-86ac-499d12858efe
msgctxt "h3a60521fg8946g4644gbc8dg36ba72b28ba9"
msgid "I must decide what to do with you."
msgstr "당신을 어떻게 해야 할지 결정해야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 8e5bb4b2-a1db-e89b-699d-272610420374
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:8e5bb4b2-a1db-e89b-699d-272610420374
msgctxt "h89ccf25ag4e29g4655g82efge3c47ccd7b34"
msgid ""
"This cage links us, like a parasite's fangs to its host. I am immortal; "
"while I am trapped here, so is he."
msgstr "이 감옥은 마치 기생충의 송곳니처럼 숙주와 연결하고 있다. 나는 불멸이니, 내가 이곳에 갇혀있는 동안, 그 또한 불멸이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 8eee4de5-f7a7-3bf6-40a6-e0a0ea913f4a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:8eee4de5-f7a7-3bf6-40a6-e0a0ea913f4a
msgctxt "hdb75d8e0g77dag456bg87a2g6e3d63b05034"
msgid ""
"And I - hah - I will die. Then live. And when the next of your ilk comes "
"with sword aloft or arrow nocked, I'll die again."
msgstr "그리고 나는...하. 죽겠지. 다시 살아나고. 그리고 너와 같은 자가 검이나 활을 든 채 찾아오면, 또 죽게 되겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 8fef7f0a-a246-be2e-a11e-029856656bd0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:8fef7f0a-a246-be2e-a11e-029856656bd0
msgctxt "h4b18606fgd7beg41a8g806cgfbe4f7ea472a"
msgid "Go on. Lay a hand upon my shoulder, and I shall be free."
msgstr "계속해라. 내 어깨에 손을 얹으면 난 자유가 될 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 91e6acbf-bf27-35db-5c10-1f691c583470
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:91e6acbf-bf27-35db-5c10-1f691c583470
msgctxt "h0ac782c1gd7b8g4b06g890cg474d5126ff53"
msgid "HAH! By all means, Sharran. Decide."
msgstr "하하! 마음껏 해봐라, 샤 신도여. 결정하거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 930491c7-76e9-9f1c-2e5b-78103a266fbd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:930491c7-76e9-9f1c-2e5b-78103a266fbd
msgctxt "hd3f0f68eg1732g4a4egae76gc4a3a79dac59"
msgid ""
"A hundred years. More, perhaps. Concocted by Ketheric, enacted by Balthazar, "
"my misery has been my centuries' long companion."
msgstr "백년. 그 이상일지도 모르지. 케서릭이 만들어 발타자르가 제정한 이 고통은 지난 한 세기 동안 나의 동반자였다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a134b3d-67f6-eee0-f2c0-f822a3678c65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:9a134b3d-67f6-eee0-f2c0-f822a3678c65
msgctxt "he74601cbg08e6g48ddgae6dge41b2ea1371b"
msgid "What happens if I do as you say - plunge my weapon into your heart?"
msgstr "제가 당신 말대로 심장을 찌르면 어떻게 되지요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9b221abd-ef24-33e0-2acf-2512c4ec2fb9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:9b221abd-ef24-33e0-2acf-2512c4ec2fb9
msgctxt "h1924b6b5g24b9g48a2g84bdg31df48309901"
msgid "<i>You're </i>the Nightsong. A person. Not a relic."
msgstr "<i>당신이</i> '밤의 노래' 였군요. 사람이었어. 유물이 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = 9f4b5e4a-11fc-56e5-a4a2-f60c037da349
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:9f4b5e4a-11fc-56e5-a4a2-f60c037da349
msgctxt "h06d8246fgdad6g4941g9400g20400cfcbd4d"
msgid "Open this cage."
msgstr "이 감옥을 열어라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a08b7cd6-e28a-563b-ddd7-75b33c70b1bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:a08b7cd6-e28a-563b-ddd7-75b33c70b1bb
msgctxt "h12f5f8d3g115bg42c5ga4b5gbc1a30a676db"
msgid "<i>Free her from her bonds.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀를 구속에서 풀어준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = a13c8a29-3865-e4d5-2118-ee157fc79247
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:a13c8a29-3865-e4d5-2118-ee157fc79247
msgctxt "hbf767e8fg6271g445eg8e8ag5670c6d12ab5"
msgid "Run your coop all you like, chicken. You cannot fly without my wings."
msgstr "마음껏 이 감옥에서 도망쳐 봐라, 겁쟁이 녀석. 내 날개 없이는 넌 날 수 없다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = a3c60709-3b31-2ba6-b788-a29a8726142e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:a3c60709-3b31-2ba6-b788-a29a8726142e
msgctxt "hc6ac86abg94beg4a81g8019g244f2d858289"
msgid "Do I name you false?"
msgstr "내가 잘못 부른 것이냐?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a8190db8-8746-00e1-8a5b-5072bbce11eb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:a8190db8-8746-00e1-8a5b-5072bbce11eb
msgctxt "h457dad97g0b72g4061ga4fag0e42fb40546f"
msgid "Perhaps I shouldn't..."
msgstr "어쩌면 안 하는 게 좋을지도..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a89dfec8-1417-4a9d-70a6-d1de6aca4ac0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:a89dfec8-1417-4a9d-70a6-d1de6aca4ac0
msgctxt "h61b06ce4gdaefg4abega321g07d25465f3ef"
msgid "I will kill you for pleasure, not <i>Lady Shar</i>."
msgstr "<i>샤 여신</i> 같은 게 아니라 나의 즐거움을 위해 죽여드리죠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad4a1a5d-ecf7-6e67-23c0-b3250f259e76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_Event_SpearAcknowledged(1) = False
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_HasSpear(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_Event_SpearAcknowledged(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:ad4a1a5d-ecf7-6e67-23c0-b3250f259e76
msgctxt "h46a52949gb71dg4fb6gb852g4005f9eb635a"
msgid "I was really looking forward to using this spear, though."
msgstr "하지만 이 창을 정말 써보고 싶었습니다만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ad4a1a5d-ecf7-6e67-23c0-b3250f259e76
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_Event_SpearAcknowledged(1) = False
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_HasSpear(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_Event_SpearAcknowledged(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:ad4a1a5d-ecf7-6e67-23c0-b3250f259e76
msgctxt "h4821bc31g8c14g493eg990fgf6ab4494ea0c"
msgid ""
"Maybe it would be safer to just kill you. I found a spear in this place that "
"seems perfect for the task."
msgstr "당신을 죽이는 게 더 안전할지도. 이곳에서 딱 알맞은 창을 찾았거든요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = adc01f99-8b11-990d-444c-7e6cf693a4cd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:adc01f99-8b11-990d-444c-7e6cf693a4cd
msgctxt "h3d7181d6g012cg4048g8f13g8c6bdbbb2665"
msgid "Then lay a hand upon my shoulder, and I shall be free."
msgstr "그렇다면 내 어깨에 손을 얹거라. 그리하면 내가 자유를 찾으리니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = afa9f4fd-2d36-2932-b536-c4e251fe9eec
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:afa9f4fd-2d36-2932-b536-c4e251fe9eec
msgctxt "h9fe939c6gb8b0g43dcg96acge68c79cd6136"
msgid ""
"I get a bit obsessive about murder at times, but I'm no<i> cultist</i>! "
"That's just rude."
msgstr "가끔 살인에 대한 강박관념이 들기도 하지만, <i>광신도</i>는 아니야! 무례하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = b1fba3ba-461c-b318-c698-2ec32dc4d777
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:b1fba3ba-461c-b318-c698-2ec32dc4d777
msgctxt "h558b12eegbe41g44c6gb2bagb73e0416aa68"
msgid ""
"Run along now. Go tell your darling master Ketheric what a good girl you've "
"been."
msgstr "당장 달려가거라. 사랑하는 주인 케서릭에게 가서 네가 얼마나 착한 소녀인지 말해주거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = b1fba3ba-461c-b318-c698-2ec32dc4d777
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:b1fba3ba-461c-b318-c698-2ec32dc4d777
msgctxt "h797f3eccg2170g4ddbga6b0g05cd88e0a40b"
msgid ""
"Run along now. Go tell your darling master Ketheric what a good boy you've "
"been."
msgstr "당장 달려가거라. 사랑하는 주인 케서릭에게 가서 네가 얼마나 착한 소년인지 말해주거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = b1fba3ba-461c-b318-c698-2ec32dc4d777
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:b1fba3ba-461c-b318-c698-2ec32dc4d777
msgctxt "h006296cdgd66cg477dgb827ge123d7b7164e"
msgid ""
"Run along now. Go tell your darling master Ketheric what a good child you've "
"been."
msgstr "당장 달려가거라. 사랑하는 주인 케서릭에게 가서 네가 얼마나 착한 아이인지 말해주거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b2c9e18f-cc40-6ea7-69ac-5eb0c50fcdcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:b2c9e18f-cc40-6ea7-69ac-5eb0c50fcdcb
msgctxt "hf6353e52g3cd8g40b9gbea4g61edb5bf3d7d"
msgid "I am not one of Shar's servants."
msgstr "저는 샤의 종복이 아닙니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = b348f576-065a-16f8-ea74-ccfb3067df7a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_HasMetKilledNightsong(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_HasMet = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:b348f576-065a-16f8-ea74-ccfb3067df7a
msgctxt "h057bbf0dg2b59g4e44g97f9g77da5259ea2c"
msgid "Come for more blood, you dog?"
msgstr "개자식, 더 피를 봐야 하는가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b3d0db85-d6bd-7064-1cf7-80ef05d0f189
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_DARK_URGE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:b3d0db85-d6bd-7064-1cf7-80ef05d0f189
msgctxt "h78ba0ec9gcbefg408bg9556g550752fe43d4"
msgid ""
"Usually there is a lot more struggling and screaming when I'm about to kill "
"someone."
msgstr "보통 내가 누굴 죽일 땐 훨씬 더 많은 몸부림과 비명이 있던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b3d0db85-d6bd-7064-1cf7-80ef05d0f189
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:b3d0db85-d6bd-7064-1cf7-80ef05d0f189
msgctxt "he9b00952g6c8eg45a7g82bcgd0fa3029bf7b"
msgid "It almost seems like you want me to attack you."
msgstr "마치 당신을 죽이길 바라는 것 같군요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b44c20d7-d025-5527-9645-988f43c8491a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:b44c20d7-d025-5527-9645-988f43c8491a
msgctxt "h935095f7gacc5g4625gba6bgd703b4487929"
msgid "How many times have you given that speech?"
msgstr "그 말을 몇 번이나 해왔던 거죠?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = b7c5af09-10b3-a4f0-1f68-22ae042b125d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:b7c5af09-10b3-a4f0-1f68-22ae042b125d
msgctxt "h4acc4336g6a4fg4ebdgab12g096951d4afd7"
msgid ""
"A promise - the most sacred I can give. Release me and I will kill Ketheric "
"Thorm."
msgstr "약속을... 내가 할 수 있는 가장 신성한 약속을 하마. 날 풀어주면 케서릭 쏨을 죽이겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = b8d0f5c4-55c9-38bf-97ee-70e484531eab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:b8d0f5c4-55c9-38bf-97ee-70e484531eab
msgctxt "h62bbce8cg5d2ag42f8g89bcg3c383d486fae"
msgid "Free me, and Ketheric will bleed."
msgstr "날 풀어주면, 케서릭은 피를 흘릴 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b9a6758a-cbc9-67b2-e200-4f04cfef4c7f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_Event_ImmortalityRemoved = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:b9a6758a-cbc9-67b2-e200-4f04cfef4c7f
msgctxt "hab137a8dgec9cg439fg885ege79de1ca4dad"
msgid "<i>Do as she asks.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그녀의 부탁을 들어준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = bafeb9be-8bea-4e02-fdd3-9c05b394efad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:bafeb9be-8bea-4e02-fdd3-9c05b394efad
msgctxt "h65689eb7g0a3cg4881gb97cg49390bab5413"
msgid ""
"Do what you came to do, Sharran. Then run to your darling master Ketheric "
"and tell him what a good girl you've been."
msgstr "네 일을 마쳐라, 샤 신도여. 그리고 네 사랑스러운 주인 케서릭에게 달려가 네가 말 잘 듣는 여자애였다고 말해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = bafeb9be-8bea-4e02-fdd3-9c05b394efad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:bafeb9be-8bea-4e02-fdd3-9c05b394efad
msgctxt "h905dbf89g18f7g45afgab02gba9d47b56c32"
msgid ""
"Do what you came to do, Sharran. Then run to your darling master Ketheric "
"and tell him what a good boy you've been."
msgstr "네 일을 마쳐라, 샤 신도여. 그리고 네 사랑스러운 주인 케서릭에게 달려가 네가 말 잘 듣는 남자애였다고 말해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = bafeb9be-8bea-4e02-fdd3-9c05b394efad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:bafeb9be-8bea-4e02-fdd3-9c05b394efad
msgctxt "he9f2de09g9ebag426dg800ag45f11dea480d"
msgid ""
"Do what you came to do, Sharran. Then run to your darling master Ketheric "
"and tell him what a good child you've been."
msgstr "네 일을 마쳐라, 샤 신도여. 그리고 네 사랑스러운 주인 케서릭에게 달려가 네가 말 잘 듣는 아이였다고 말해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c0e81e1b-060c-5dad-7b22-3ee91a2b2778
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:c0e81e1b-060c-5dad-7b22-3ee91a2b2778
msgctxt "h2e2df507g70fdg4abcga34fg286d10bdd2a5"
msgid "I'm a friend. Let me free you."
msgstr "저는 당신의 편입니다. 당신을 풀어 드리겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c10bd047-ff6b-a8ad-d16a-2b79ea662733
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:c10bd047-ff6b-a8ad-d16a-2b79ea662733
msgctxt "h106ba129g5ca0g44f9g9e60g7396927b3772"
msgid ""
"I didn't realise you were a person - not a relic. Let's get you out of here."
msgstr "당신이 유물이 아니라 사람인 줄은 몰랐습니다. 여기서 빼내 드리겠습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = c1fbf52a-9ec2-84ea-3ad5-f0586a347950
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:c1fbf52a-9ec2-84ea-3ad5-f0586a347950
msgctxt "he8eaff71g4418g431bg8f9fg980affc40afe"
msgid "No? Then correct me. By all means, little warrior, explain yourself."
msgstr "아니라고? 그렇다면 나의 말을 정정하도록 해라. 작은 전사여, 어디 설명해 보거라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = c63086b8-3fe2-6cfd-323d-ef3c8f5fcbd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:c63086b8-3fe2-6cfd-323d-ef3c8f5fcbd8
msgctxt "hb9768b54g0fdcg441dg9590gbf87afe829bb"
msgid "Did you expect me to beg? To cry? To plead? For what."
msgstr "내가 애원이라도 할 줄 알았나? 울며 매달릴 거라고? 무엇 때문에?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = c6c84f02-5282-5c12-1a44-fb94462e13d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:c6c84f02-5282-5c12-1a44-fb94462e13d9
msgctxt "h984a3223ga5a3g4236g809cg17b241db63e8"
msgid ""
"A servant of the Dark Lady would never disavow her. Perhaps I named you "
"false."
msgstr "어둠의 여신의 종이라면, 절대 그녀를 부인하지 않겠지. 어쩌면 너를 잘못 칭하였을지도 모르겠구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7895551-1a6a-3b53-4dc3-b3796855ad42
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:c7895551-1a6a-3b53-4dc3-b3796855ad42
msgctxt "h4bc88776g7556g4c31gbb87gb42a257a5479"
msgid ""
"I've come to find the source of Ketheric's invulnerability - and end it."
msgstr "케서릭의 무적의 원천을 찾아 끝장내러 왔습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = c7ecf2bb-b8af-a12b-e9a3-66d4d769f4bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:c7ecf2bb-b8af-a12b-e9a3-66d4d769f4bd
msgctxt "hb9cdeb23gc7fdg482bgabfbg3b1347529b17"
msgid "Go on, then. Lay a hand upon my shoulder, and I shall be free."
msgstr "그럼, 계속하라. 내 어깨에 손을 얹으라, 그럼 난 해방될 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = c840a9bb-11e9-a648-7b07-48af970ca3e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_HasMetKilledNightsong(1) = False
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_HasMet = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate_HasMetKilledNightsong(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:c840a9bb-11e9-a648-7b07-48af970ca3e0
msgctxt "hfb541917g8265g4b90gae4cg62f00bb82f53"
msgid ""
"Was it everything you hoped for? Was it sweet, Sharran, to murder a paladin "
"of Selûne - her daughter - her sword?"
msgstr "바라던 대로 됐나? 셀루네의 팔라딘, 그녀의 딸, 그녀의 검을 죽인 게 달콤했나, 샤 신도여?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c867a20c-0ea4-48c7-7f5b-8326d054fd9c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:c867a20c-0ea4-48c7-7f5b-8326d054fd9c
msgctxt "h033f9abfg3450g4400g8030g1b67a6ce62ee"
msgid ""
"That's all? No abjurations or charms to unweave? All you need is a "
"<i>hand</i>?"
msgstr "그게 전부라고? 폐기한다는 선언도 없고 해방하는 주문도 없다고? 필요한 게 그냥 <i>손</i>이 전부인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c945ed87-f8be-fcc6-67ca-3ee8a6f685ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:c945ed87-f8be-fcc6-67ca-3ee8a6f685ef
msgctxt "h5dd2c2a0g6fe2g4742g8da6g0c075e409981"
msgid "Why do you call me Sharran?"
msgstr "왜 날 샤 신도라고 부르는 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = c959c05b-cecd-9fc5-b646-15b69e308dd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:c959c05b-cecd-9fc5-b646-15b69e308dd4
msgctxt "h545e19ccg2221g4dbfg8eaag94beae14dffe"
msgid ""
"There is no moon in this black sky, Sharran - no. There is only your "
"mistress - the void of her. The shadow."
msgstr "이 검은 하늘에 달은 없다, 샤 신도여. 네 여주인만이 있을 뿐이지. 그녀의 공허. 그림자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d2db0ec9-5a3c-614c-04d5-e6fe01bb6240
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:d2db0ec9-5a3c-614c-04d5-e6fe01bb6240
msgctxt "h988f8216g490ag4ec3g95aeg6ef870fdd1fd"
msgid "My kin are strong of arm and heart. The necromancer was neither."
msgstr "내 동족은 강인한 팔과 심장이 있지. 저 사령술사는 둘 다 없더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d37449d2-2b95-b18a-1aea-c7ac7789c5d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:d37449d2-2b95-b18a-1aea-c7ac7789c5d2
msgctxt "h365ee6e8g60e1g4ae9g8a95gfeb0c43dc71d"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "당신은 누구입니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = d48d7aa4-b7dd-204c-b9d7-51671b5ebcb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:d48d7aa4-b7dd-204c-b9d7-51671b5ebcb1
msgctxt "h5546e6cdgb3e5g464cg8be9g4e13e7da8e95"
msgid ""
"HAH! Are you afraid, Sharran? Do you rattle and jump at the realisation that "
"an immortal has your face emblazoned in her mind forevermore?"
msgstr "하! 두려운가, 샤 신도여? 불멸자가 네 얼굴을 영원히 마음속에 새길 거란 사실에 덜컥 겁이라도 나는 건가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = d4a43b21-ddc2-97cd-7ed8-d140c9908c61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:d4a43b21-ddc2-97cd-7ed8-d140c9908c61
msgctxt "hb348e94eg97e8g49a7gb563g9122c5930520"
msgid ""
"When you have exhausted yourself with foolishness, you will release me. Go "
"on: see."
msgstr "네 어리석음에 지치고 나면, 날 풀어주게 될 것이다. 어디 한번 해 봐라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = d508563b-a237-368b-229b-336c7faa605f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_HasMet = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_Knows_ImmortalitySource = True
#.     - SHA_Nightsong_HasMet = True
#.     - GLO_Ketheric_Knows_AboutImmortality = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:d508563b-a237-368b-229b-336c7faa605f
msgctxt "h0867fcd4g3a8bg4e1ag89dbgb72012610fb7"
msgid "I have felt you coming. The first in a century."
msgstr "네가 오는 걸 느꼈다. 백 년 만에 처음으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d8009c0c-4a66-1ff6-53f9-25a650b20a95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:d8009c0c-4a66-1ff6-53f9-25a650b20a95
msgctxt "h03e964c7g8b98g4cbfgbcfdg06e9a249182c"
msgid "I'm not afraid of you - now or ever."
msgstr "난 지금도, 앞으로도 네가 두렵지 않다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = d97a0726-1613-44ac-5a9c-96d62136683c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:d97a0726-1613-44ac-5a9c-96d62136683c
msgctxt "hcb0e3a44g3f42g4502ga1abg72f160151241"
msgid ""
"Didn't you, when you murdered me? Perhaps you were stricken blind by foolish "
"devotion."
msgstr "날 죽여놓고도 몰랐다고? 어리석은 헌신에 눈이 멀었던 모양이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d9c5133b-05d4-3342-9375-8bfb7f141290
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:d9c5133b-05d4-3342-9375-8bfb7f141290
msgctxt "h2aaea591ge805g4934g915cg99f15a0064c7"
msgid "Forgive me. I should not have harmed you."
msgstr "용서하십시오. 당신을 해쳐선 안 됐습니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd6f353b-4ef3-b61f-c1b6-52ae866f7434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:dd6f353b-4ef3-b61f-c1b6-52ae866f7434
msgctxt "ha8492347g6045g47d2g9b20g53b56c3fd686"
msgid "You say you're immortal. How is that so?"
msgstr "본인이 불멸자라고 말했는데, 어떻게 그럴 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = e27e922e-010e-da4a-3fb9-772d24b20e8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:e27e922e-010e-da4a-3fb9-772d24b20e8d
msgctxt "hd3069f15g74c8g4059ga904g97cb7e251a48"
msgid ""
"Those are words I've never heard - not since I've been in this dark dungeon."
msgstr "이 어두운 감옥에 갇힌 이후로 한번도 들어본 적 없는 말이구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = e75ed58c-731c-2ec8-3505-8f6f57d64f53
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:e75ed58c-731c-2ec8-3505-8f6f57d64f53
msgctxt "h43ca418cg15a3g44bdg8452g479082805f6a"
msgid ""
"I will be freed from these shackles. Ketheric will be made mortal. And then? "
"Lo! Then, I will run him through until he's dead."
msgstr "난 이 족쇄로부터 해방되겠지. 케서릭은 필멸자가 되고. 그리고 나서는? 보라! 놈이 죽을 때까지 난도질하리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e9967dd8-dec5-2eba-7093-a225f37aeb15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:e9967dd8-dec5-2eba-7093-a225f37aeb15
msgctxt "hcd13bbe2gcb87g43b6gb875g837ec1847c71"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = ea5ab25d-3981-7f0a-c4cf-8f651e590321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:ea5ab25d-3981-7f0a-c4cf-8f651e590321
msgctxt "hed1b1e26g1dbeg45a2gb9f5gce794ba6bdc3"
msgid "But if you are a friend - you can be my salvation."
msgstr "그러나 네가 나의 편이라면, 날 구원할 수 있다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = eaf9f307-806f-0b54-401e-04f03d2993e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFateDecided = True
#.   Object:
#.     - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_StartNightsongFreedDialog(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:eaf9f307-806f-0b54-401e-04f03d2993e0
msgctxt "h5961a243g68dag4e1cg867cg60a9816499c7"
msgid "<i>Yes...</i>"
msgstr "<i>좋아...</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ec183b11-c5f0-7426-23f0-8151ec3ad553
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:ec183b11-c5f0-7426-23f0-8151ec3ad553
msgctxt "h8a53ebffg8475g41cfg8928g368cd4af1ae3"
msgid "Ketheric trapped you here. Why?"
msgstr "케서릭이 당신을 이곳에 가뒀군. 왜지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = ee979da7-91b1-2d82-87e4-4a426b4509c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:ee979da7-91b1-2d82-87e4-4a426b4509c8
msgctxt "he3950d29gfb94g4eb4ga622g5a61fd2de2aa"
msgid "You, who have come to drive a dagger through my heart."
msgstr "나의 심장에 칼을 꽂으러 온 자여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eece1ee5-9b44-82dd-47d6-e613e3ca68d9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:eece1ee5-9b44-82dd-47d6-e613e3ca68d9
msgctxt "h6194e798gb058g4322gb91fgaf8fcd1416d2"
msgid "How long have you been trapped here?"
msgstr "얼마나 오래 이곳에 붙잡혀 있던 겁니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = f0f36c8c-c13c-d3c6-3331-13f692bce0e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:f0f36c8c-c13c-d3c6-3331-13f692bce0e4
msgctxt "had4baa8cg6d6fg4ef0g8e6age9bdb20f0b6a"
msgid ""
"Do not play games with <i>me</i>, Sharran. You have come to earn your title; "
"to become what your queen has promised. One of her chosen murderers."
msgstr ""
"<i>나</i>와 장난질하지 마라, 샤 신도. 네 여왕이 약속한 것이 되기 위한 명분을 취하러 왔겠지. 그녀의 선택받은 살인자 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f16b8594-827e-a020-c2d6-5f1b1fcff429
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:f16b8594-827e-a020-c2d6-5f1b1fcff429
msgctxt "hf5a6d3ccg8786g4f88gba9eg5ae434a8af3c"
msgid "Not so fast. What's to stop you from turning on me once you're free?"
msgstr "서두르지 마시죠. 당신이 풀려난 뒤 저에게 등을 돌리면 어떡합니까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3163132-0da9-ac20-eba7-809dcb9db795
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_EVIL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:f3163132-0da9-ac20-eba7-809dcb9db795
msgctxt "h0c68fceag43cbg4df6g8a30g14f1440c5d3d"
msgid ""
"I am familiar with the Lady of Loss - but I serve a more competent deity. "
"I'm no Sharran."
msgstr "상실의 여인은 잘 알고 있지만, 나는 더 자격 있는 분을 섬긴다. 난 샤 신도가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3163132-0da9-ac20-eba7-809dcb9db795
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_NEUTRAL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:f3163132-0da9-ac20-eba7-809dcb9db795
msgctxt "h667f409fg3fc7g41dcgb154g7f92a0097439"
msgid "I serve a more... partisan god than the Dark Lady. I am no Sharran."
msgstr "나는 어둠의 여신보다 더욱... 열렬한 신을 섬긴다. 난 샤 신도가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3163132-0da9-ac20-eba7-809dcb9db795
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_SELUNE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:f3163132-0da9-ac20-eba7-809dcb9db795
msgctxt "h27d5f93age965g45ddg905ag5d7215d0bf31"
msgid "I spit on the Dark Lady's name. I serve the Moonmaiden."
msgstr "어둠의 여신에게 침 뱉을지니. 저는 달처녀를 섬깁니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f3163132-0da9-ac20-eba7-809dcb9db795
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_SHAR(1) = False
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#. TagRule: CLERIC_GOOD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:f3163132-0da9-ac20-eba7-809dcb9db795
msgctxt "hc1775427g0d5eg4c01g894fge294a5cdde84"
msgid "I serve a god who walks the light. I am no Sharran."
msgstr "나는 빛의 길을 걷는 신을 섬긴다. 난 샤 신도가 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = f3af4cfe-a356-c771-119c-9e7497666a8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:f3af4cfe-a356-c771-119c-9e7497666a8a
msgctxt "hfd7ee040g76f5g473egad44g64c30815f0c5"
msgid ""
"The Spear of Night. You are not the Nightsinger's chosen champion - her "
"weapon is useless in your hands."
msgstr "밤의 창. 넌 나이트싱어의 선택을 받은 대리인이 아니군. 네 손에선 그녀의 무기는 힘이 없을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = f5d7aae0-c0da-32ce-12ce-fa9714a8d71c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:f5d7aae0-c0da-32ce-12ce-fa9714a8d71c
msgctxt "hdc0e4287gfd13g4582gafc9gd893f0a1d6a8"
msgid ""
"One day, when he is severed from me, Ketheric will die. I will not. And when "
"I am freed, I will remember whose recompense to claim."
msgstr ""
"언젠가, 케서릭이 나와 단절된다면, 그는 죽을 것이다. 난 아니지만. 그리고 내가 풀려나면, 누구에게 보상을 요구해야 할지 기억할 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f63562bb-fe76-7741-0660-a0a060f09dfa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:f63562bb-fe76-7741-0660-a0a060f09dfa
msgctxt "h9f995c1egd414g447cga2a3ga1f9fa17c682"
msgid "Ketheric has sent me to retrieve you."
msgstr "케서릭이 당신을 되찾아 오라고 보냈다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fb9d4aaa-ff23-0e45-2221-01a8e5eddb74
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:fb9d4aaa-ff23-0e45-2221-01a8e5eddb74
msgctxt "h0031f62bg94fbg4aaegaf8bg5ae47eead2d5"
msgid "To kill an immortal: what perfect irony. I think I will."
msgstr "불멸자 죽이기라... 완벽한 아이러니군. 난 할 수 있을 거 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Nightsong
#. NodeID = fce6d3f4-1ea6-f6fc-35d7-fd7f4cf3c9b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:fce6d3f4-1ea6-f6fc-35d7-fd7f4cf3c9b2
msgctxt "hf8fdd8acge29fg4603g967fg333b8a0ab88b"
msgid ""
"A bloodsporter, then. No Sharran, but a killer without cause. Fie! What "
"sickness plagues Faerûn."
msgstr "그럼, 샤 신도가 아니라 유혈주의자로구나. 명분 없는 살인자야. 쳇! 페이룬의 역겨운 질병이로다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd434813-d95d-0826-b5a2-09f2f0945b93
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_NightsongsFate:fd434813-d95d-0826-b5a2-09f2f0945b93
msgctxt "h8687aeeeg6fd3g4c73ga30dgecec2dc60c4b"
msgid "I do not serve Ketheric. I've come to make him vulnerable."
msgstr "나는 케서릭을 섬기지 않는다. 그를 취약하게 하려고 온 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell:27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
msgctxt "h80dce656g0cefg4206gaae6g69be4013b01f"
msgid "I feel as though a light breeze would float me away - how quaint."
msgstr "가벼운 바람에 실려 떠내려갈 것만 같아 - 기묘해라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell:27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
msgctxt "hdc3867bdge765g48e5ga4bag273e77019bcc"
msgid ""
"A touch of the shadowfell. I feel so light - any leap should be a safe one."
msgstr "섀도펠의 손길인가. 몸이 가벼워진 것 같아 - 안전하게 도약할 수 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell:27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
msgctxt "hd5be7df1ge7eeg467fga259g5af75659ee9b"
msgid "I feel lighter than a tressym's feather. Like I could fly away..."
msgstr "트레심의 깃털만큼 가벼워진 느낌이 들어. 날아갈 수 있을 것처럼..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell:27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
msgctxt "h71cc45dege3ccg497bg8acegb1346a88ef82"
msgid "I feel... light? Almost like I could float away, if I cared to."
msgstr "몸이... 가벼워? 맘만 먹으면 떠다닐 수도 있겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell:27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
msgctxt "h048fd4d3g97bag4c21ga04eg728a3602786c"
msgid "Incredible. I feel so light, I swear I might fly."
msgstr "대단해. 너무 가벼워서 날 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell:27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
msgctxt "he399339dg59e2g45e2gbebeg3bb7012a9746"
msgid "Feels like a dream - like I could fly."
msgstr "꿈만 같은 기분인걸 - 날 수 있을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell:27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
msgctxt "h6c11640bgdc9cg4a79gb5ffg93c1900b45ca"
msgid ""
"I feel strange... lighter, untethered to the ground. Almost like I could "
"float away."
msgstr "기이하군... 가볍고, 땅에 얽매이지 않고 있어. 거의 떠다닐 수 있을 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EnteredShadowfell:27896035-e050-446d-bcf0-56d003c9a7e2
msgctxt "hc6bd80c1g423ag4509g89bfg661d283813b5"
msgid ""
"I feel lighter, unburdened, as if the softest push could send me drifting "
"away."
msgstr "몸이 짐을 던 것처럼 가벼워, 힘을 조금만 받아도 둥둥 떠내려가겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
msgctxt "hcea9512dgddeag4530gafd6gd160a07299a2"
msgid "The blood of Selûne? What about this 'Nightsong' person?"
msgstr "셀루네의 피? 그럼 이 '밤의 노래'라는 사람은 어쩌려고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
msgctxt "hbfc34d17gd3f3g47e0g9ecag8316ebe48d8d"
msgid "The blood of Selûne? But what about the Nightsong?"
msgstr "셀루네의 피? 밤의 노래는 어쩌고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
msgctxt "hed0b664bg1b28g495bg94d3g476e60f698cb"
msgid ""
"The blood of Selûne? I thought we neared Aradin's precious Nightsong, not a "
"sacrifice."
msgstr "셀루네의 피? 제물이 아니라 아라딘의 소중한 밤의 노래에 가까워졌다고 생각했는데, 아니었나보군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
msgctxt "h53221f62g5d91g48b9g913cg7ac300083123"
msgid ""
"Don't like the sound of that. I thought we were finding the Nightsong, not "
"something bloody."
msgstr "맘에 안 드는데. 난 우리가 밤의 노래를 찾는 줄 알았어, 피투성이 뭐시기가 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
msgctxt "hdfc04200gfdaag444dg9a7cga2fc83396478"
msgid "The blood of Selûne? Then what of this 'Nightsong'?"
msgstr "셀루네의 피? 그러면 '밤의 노래'는 무엇이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
msgctxt "h1f934355gefa8g40deg842agb8f229de7a61"
msgid ""
"Blasted temple. I was expecting the Nightsong, not some blood sacrifice."
msgstr "빌어먹을 신전. 난 피의 제물 같은 게 아니라 밤의 노래를 기대했다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
msgctxt "h12f51df4gea45g4f06g9209g4033b9062a51"
msgid ""
"Perhaps the Nightsong is the sacred artefact used to spill the blood of "
"Selûnites. I hope so."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 셀루네 신도들을 죽일 때 사용한 신성한 유물일지도 모르지. 그랬으면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:1cc9c812-fc4b-6ff8-a886-3437d595517e
msgctxt "he1573753gda63g499ag9f55g91c36eef2cd4"
msgid ""
"The blood of Selûne? I was expecting we'd find this Nightsong relic, not "
"some sacrifice."
msgstr "셀루네의 피? 제물이 아니라 밤의 노래 유물을 찾을 줄 알았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3faafb42-4f42-05c4-a47f-f4df3a0bc3ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_HasSpear(0) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:3faafb42-4f42-05c4-a47f-f4df3a0bc3ab
msgctxt "hfce3b045g252eg4956gadcfg38ac3cc3f821"
msgid ""
"The sacrifice lies ahead. I must find the spear before going any farther."
msgstr "제물이 앞에 있어. 나아가기 전에 반드시 창을 찾아야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
msgctxt "hddeec130gaacbg467ag92e8g1f862d6a68c2"
msgid ""
"The blood of Selûne? I'd rather sample it than spill it, but needs must."
msgstr "셀루네의 피? 난 흘리기보단 맛보고 싶은데, 해야 한다면야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
msgctxt "h672eecc9gfc04g4955ga8ccg52e6bf5274ec"
msgid "The blood of Selûne? Sounds like a sacrifice..."
msgstr "셀루네의 피? 제물처럼 들리는데..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
msgctxt "h8ed3129fg0303g4ef2g87fbg67cb312e85f0"
msgid "Sounds like sacrifices were carried out beyond here."
msgstr "제물 의식이 이 너머에서 진행되었던 것 같군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
msgctxt "h4cf0727bg048eg48e1g8591g12023f555191"
msgid ""
"The <i>blood</i> of Selûne? I really don't want to sacrifice anything, for "
"the love of all."
msgstr "셀루네의 <i>피</i>? 난 정말 아무것도 희생하기 싫은데, 모두를 위해서라도 말야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
msgctxt "h51f47f6dgce86g4b9dgba6dg52bc03301b0d"
msgid "Sacrificial blood. Of course - Shar would demand no less."
msgstr "제물의 피. 역시 - 샤는 그런 걸 요구하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
msgctxt "h1533f05ag5c07g41a6ga5c4gc7408787759d"
msgid ""
"It's always a blood sacrifice, isn't it? Why not a bit of spittle, or a nose "
"hair?"
msgstr "언제나 피의 제물이지, 안 그래? 침이나 코털로는 안 되는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
msgctxt "h510d5709g1a4cg4be6gbca5gb0df3108154e"
msgid ""
"Blood sacrifices to Shar were made here in the darkness. I wonder how many "
"have died here?"
msgstr "샤에게 바치는 피의 제물들은 이 어둠 속에서 행해졌군. 얼마나 죽었는지 궁금한걸?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:429c6c7a-dfb6-427a-a8c0-a4434043e2ba
msgctxt "h0943afc6gc108g41e6g99a0g8e63d17a6a51"
msgid "The blood of Selûne? Sounds like a sacrifice."
msgstr "셀루네의 피? 제물처럼 들리는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b8493c74-8fea-5887-b71e-d8eacc371cd4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_HasSpear(0) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_1:b8493c74-8fea-5887-b71e-d8eacc371cd4
msgctxt "h5c4ac51eg40ebg42a7g9890g6bce83736a35"
msgid "The sacrifice lies ahead. I will not fail you, Lady Shar."
msgstr "제물이 앞에 있어. 당신을 실망하게 하지 않겠습니다, 샤 여신이시여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02430e70-e71e-aab1-1653-edf02d017635
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:02430e70-e71e-aab1-1653-edf02d017635
msgctxt "h88a4edb7g2eb0g4cbfgbb0bg15d5de084dad"
msgid "So NIghtsong is not only a person - she's a living sacrifice."
msgstr "그러니까 밤의 노래는 단순히 사람이 아니군. 그녀는 산제물이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02430e70-e71e-aab1-1653-edf02d017635
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:02430e70-e71e-aab1-1653-edf02d017635
msgctxt "haab8ed94g5fd2g4b86g94c9g95a948b1798d"
msgid "The Nightsong awaits. A living sacrifice to the Mistress of the Night."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 기다린다. 밤의 여주인에게 바쳐지는 산제물."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02430e70-e71e-aab1-1653-edf02d017635
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:02430e70-e71e-aab1-1653-edf02d017635
msgctxt "h879eb550g6165g4b5egba77g23b38bb15012"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong's a person indeed - and a sacrifice to the Dark Goddess, at "
"that."
msgstr "밤의 노래는 사람이었군. 게다가 어둠의 여신에게 바쳐질 제물이고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 02430e70-e71e-aab1-1653-edf02d017635
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:02430e70-e71e-aab1-1653-edf02d017635
msgctxt "h6cff56d2g3c39g4370g8cbeg2462d381c2a2"
msgid "So the Nightsong is indeed a person, and a sacrifice at that."
msgstr "밤의 노래는 사람이로군. 게다가 제물이고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22e2d9f2-a9d8-6d8a-8f94-912ce32ea826
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:22e2d9f2-a9d8-6d8a-8f94-912ce32ea826
msgctxt "h1db50022g4fcbg4437gafc5ga5f14c2fc2a2"
msgid ""
"So this Nightsong is a person? A blood sacrifice? She's a cruel one, your "
"lady."
msgstr "그러니까 밤의 노래는 사람이란 건가? 산제물로 바쳐질? 잔인하군, 네 여신은."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22e2d9f2-a9d8-6d8a-8f94-912ce32ea826
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:22e2d9f2-a9d8-6d8a-8f94-912ce32ea826
msgctxt "h7b06f9d7g8cdag4a05gb705g889ddd2565e3"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong is no ordinary offering. If the Nightsong is a person, then "
"it's blood Shar demands..."
msgstr "밤의 노래는 평범한 제물이 아니야. 만약 그게 사람이라면, 샤는 피를 보길 원하는 거로군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22e2d9f2-a9d8-6d8a-8f94-912ce32ea826
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:22e2d9f2-a9d8-6d8a-8f94-912ce32ea826
msgctxt "hec777ef5g275cg43f5ga031g24e78ade7994"
msgid ""
"So the Nightsong is no relic, but a living sacrifice - a blood offering to "
"your vain goddess."
msgstr "그러니까 밤의 노래란 유물이 아니라 산제물 이었군. 네 허영 가득한 여신에게 바치는 목숨 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22e2d9f2-a9d8-6d8a-8f94-912ce32ea826
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:22e2d9f2-a9d8-6d8a-8f94-912ce32ea826
msgctxt "h8cf34fafg3186g4420gbad8g8d05c0aaa0ac"
msgid ""
"Then the Nightsong is no relic - but a person. A living sacrifice to the "
"Dark Goddess."
msgstr "그럼 밤의 노래는 유물이 아니라 사람이었군. 어둠의 여신에게 바치는 산제물."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 22e2d9f2-a9d8-6d8a-8f94-912ce32ea826
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:22e2d9f2-a9d8-6d8a-8f94-912ce32ea826
msgctxt "h1cc46a4dg7da2g4ab8gab68ge0b25a6723bc"
msgid ""
"So the Nightsong is a real, living being. Not an effigy, or a relic. A blood "
"sacrifice."
msgstr "그러니까 밤의 노래는 실제 살아있는 존재로군. 우상이나 유물이 아니라, 산제물."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43fbde66-8d75-dfc0-9d2e-6e30d0082cb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:43fbde66-8d75-dfc0-9d2e-6e30d0082cb1
msgctxt "h00ff4ff1geff2g42e4g8548g995d2d89aee6"
msgid "Trapped down here for centuries. A living hell, no doubt."
msgstr "수 세기 동안 여기 갇혀 있었다니. 생지옥이 따로 없었겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43fbde66-8d75-dfc0-9d2e-6e30d0082cb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:43fbde66-8d75-dfc0-9d2e-6e30d0082cb1
msgctxt "hb9d85e3dg01d2g4370g85b8ge417c95c6adf"
msgid ""
"This is Shar's way. So vain is the goddess that she requires a blood "
"offering to appease her."
msgstr "이게 샤의 방식이로군. 피를 제물로 바쳐야만 만족하는 허영심에 찬 여신이라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43fbde66-8d75-dfc0-9d2e-6e30d0082cb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:43fbde66-8d75-dfc0-9d2e-6e30d0082cb1
msgctxt "h2bc403dcg345dg45b9g82c3g9279602f1c36"
msgid ""
"Alive and abandoned for what - years? Centuries? I can barely fathom it."
msgstr "산 채로 그 오랜 세월을 갇혀 지내다니 - 도대체 얼마나 오랜 시간이 지난거지? 감히 상상조차 하기 어렵군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43fbde66-8d75-dfc0-9d2e-6e30d0082cb1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:43fbde66-8d75-dfc0-9d2e-6e30d0082cb1
msgctxt "hb61a94cdg8d6fg42aagad9bg79e437ce996c"
msgid "Alive - and abandoned in this place for a very long time."
msgstr "산 채로... 이곳에 엄청나게 오래 갇혀 있었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e8edfc7-e011-470b-9d1a-8cf6f8d8f611
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:6e8edfc7-e011-470b-9d1a-8cf6f8d8f611
msgctxt "ha66c5c42g03c6g41cfg874dg31d812700ce6"
msgid "Alive, but trapped down here for years - centuries. Pitiable creature."
msgstr "산 채로 이곳에 몇년, 몇백년이고 갇혀있다니. 불쌍하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e8edfc7-e011-470b-9d1a-8cf6f8d8f611
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:6e8edfc7-e011-470b-9d1a-8cf6f8d8f611
msgctxt "hd4cbf28ag4cabg4883ga66egd6a87a09a3ab"
msgid ""
"This is Shar's way. So vain is the goddess that she requires a blood "
"offering to appease her."
msgstr "이게 샤의 방식이군. 자신이 만족하기 위해 산제물을 요구하다니 허영스럽기 짝이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e8edfc7-e011-470b-9d1a-8cf6f8d8f611
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:6e8edfc7-e011-470b-9d1a-8cf6f8d8f611
msgctxt "h27f706b1gcc16g488bg8728gec2e777f0036"
msgid ""
"A sacrifice, abandoned for what - years? Centuries? I can barely fathom it."
msgstr "얼마 동안 버려졌다고? 수십 년? 수백 년? 상상도 할 수 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6e8edfc7-e011-470b-9d1a-8cf6f8d8f611
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:6e8edfc7-e011-470b-9d1a-8cf6f8d8f611
msgctxt "h450f6abcg0091g4cb4g8c7bge7eed2e18fda"
msgid ""
"Alive, but abandoned in this place for years? Hells, just what are we going "
"to find down here?"
msgstr "산 채로 이곳에 그 오랜 세월 버려졌다고? 젠장, 뭘 보게 될지도 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f0069cb-8d10-f0b4-3206-5ac841199310
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:7f0069cb-8d10-f0b4-3206-5ac841199310
msgctxt "h5d276f56g9323g4cb7g9136g495af09220c1"
msgid "A blood sacrifice no less? Your Lady is crueller than I thought."
msgstr "말 그대로 산제물 이라고? 네 여신은 생각보다 잔인하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f0069cb-8d10-f0b4-3206-5ac841199310
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:7f0069cb-8d10-f0b4-3206-5ac841199310
msgctxt "h36cce7fcgc33eg4c9fga3ccge139e2ee4442"
msgid ""
"Shar isn't known for her mercy. Though I thought a more merciful heart lay "
"within you..."
msgstr "샤는 무자비한 것으로 알려졌지. 너는 좀 더 자비로울 것으로 생각했지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f0069cb-8d10-f0b4-3206-5ac841199310
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:7f0069cb-8d10-f0b4-3206-5ac841199310
msgctxt "h9e566e9cg23a1g4071gb4d9g7de540a66c7f"
msgid ""
"Such is Shar's way. So vain is the goddess that she requires a blood "
"offering to appease her."
msgstr "이게 샤의 방식이군. 자신이 만족하기 위해 산제물을 요구하다니 허영스럽기 짝이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f0069cb-8d10-f0b4-3206-5ac841199310
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:7f0069cb-8d10-f0b4-3206-5ac841199310
msgctxt "hbdfd094bg11b9g4c34g8171g1ab45b111ec3"
msgid ""
"This is Shar's will - to spill the Nightsong's blood with no compunction?"
msgstr "이게 샤의 뜻인가, 죄책감 없이 밤의 노래의 피를 흘리라는 것이?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7f0069cb-8d10-f0b4-3206-5ac841199310
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_BalthazarsSecrets_Knows_NightsongSecret = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:7f0069cb-8d10-f0b4-3206-5ac841199310
msgctxt "h0d58bd69gce8ag4b76g9a20g4dbdcdfb2baf"
msgid ""
"But this confirms what we knew already - the Nightsong is a living being, "
"not some symbolic sacrifice."
msgstr "이로써 확신할 수 있겠군. 밤의 노래는 살아있는 존재야, 어떤 상징적인 제물이 아니라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8eff34e7-6bab-a2f9-e549-409b9543af9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_HasSpear(0) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:8eff34e7-6bab-a2f9-e549-409b9543af9a
msgctxt "h082dc81cg5dd4g45cagad85gd3b398d40644"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong lies ahead. I need that spear, or I won't be able to make a "
"sacrifice to Lady Shar."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 앞에 있어. 난 그 창이 필요해. 그게 없다면 샤 여신님께 제물을 바칠 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 91d9d146-af0f-8ab7-8552-1e7c90ef53c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:91d9d146-af0f-8ab7-8552-1e7c90ef53c8
msgctxt "h62003820g03f4g4e07gb5e5g09523b02293f"
msgid "I was hoping for a valuable relic. But no, Nightsong's a living person."
msgstr "진기한 유물을 기대했건만. 그게 아니라 밤의 노래가 사람이었다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 91d9d146-af0f-8ab7-8552-1e7c90ef53c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:91d9d146-af0f-8ab7-8552-1e7c90ef53c8
msgctxt "h8b22612ag3a00g4f8ega78bg5ea1a351235c"
msgid "Then the Nightsong is a person. A blood sacrifice, more precisely."
msgstr "그렇다면 밤의 노래는 사람이로군. 산제물이지, 정확히는."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 91d9d146-af0f-8ab7-8552-1e7c90ef53c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:91d9d146-af0f-8ab7-8552-1e7c90ef53c8
msgctxt "hd86080b5gd44fg49cag8372g903c94109bdb"
msgid "The Nightsong is no relic. It's a person - and a sacrifice."
msgstr "밤의 노래는 유물이 아니야. 사람이자... 제물이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 91d9d146-af0f-8ab7-8552-1e7c90ef53c8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:91d9d146-af0f-8ab7-8552-1e7c90ef53c8
msgctxt "h00598208g3cdcg4336g8ae6g67f12ae6f035"
msgid ""
"So the Nightsong's no relic, but a living being? And a sacrifice at that?"
msgstr "그러니까 밤의 노래는 유물이 아니라 살아있는 존재라고? 게다가 제물이고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 99d81228-c632-6d11-25f8-b3ef4416ff48
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_HasSpear(0) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:99d81228-c632-6d11-25f8-b3ef4416ff48
msgctxt "h3428d98fgb292g4401ga5d5gb0864d2326aa"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong lies ahead. Lady Shar will soon have her sacrifice, by my hand."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 앞에 있어. 샤 여신님은 곧 내가 바친 제물을 받으실 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e76a411a-4d1c-24c4-6c95-96284f4c61c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_HasSpear(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:e76a411a-4d1c-24c4-6c95-96284f4c61c4
msgctxt "h4ce4e175g2a9dg437egada8gbe7cc8fc312f"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong is an offering to Lady Shar - nothing more. But first, I need "
"that spear."
msgstr "밤의 노래는 샤 여신님께 바치는 제물이야. 그뿐이지. 하지만 먼저 그 창이 필요해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fbbf4d4f-97f5-3acd-4dac-f89d07359ffe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_HasSpear(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_EntrancePlaqueReaction_2:fbbf4d4f-97f5-3acd-4dac-f89d07359ffe
msgctxt "hc80d7145g53deg4516g855dg84defaf20271"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong is an offering to Lady Shar - nothing more. The spear will at "
"least make it quick."
msgstr "밤의 노래는 샤 여신님께 바치는 제물이야. 그뿐이지. 그 창은 적어도 일을 빨리해치울 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_FalseNightSpear
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 734a5783-0c04-4265-9054-3927cb860724
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Shadowheart_Knows_NeedSpear = True
#.   Object:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_HasSpear(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_FalseNightSpear:734a5783-0c04-4265-9054-3927cb860724
msgctxt "h607e636fg5846g4d76ga529gb2410989e444"
msgid ""
"A ceremonial spear... but not the true Spear of Night. Lady Shar's hand "
"never held this."
msgstr "의식용 창... 하지만 진짜 밤의 창이 아니야. 샤 여신께서는 이걸 사용하신 적이 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
msgctxt "h3b9baca9gfb0ag4311g8533g1726c01128d2"
msgid ""
"At least you've made Shar happy. Or whatever passes for 'happy' with her."
msgstr "적어도 샤를 만족스럽게 하긴 했네. 샤를 '만족'시킨다는 게 가능한지는 차치하고서라도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
msgctxt "h45c61f27gcf01g4424gb2d9ga91c7f7d0ccb"
msgid ""
"Shar is no doubt pleased. Though I'm not sure I care for the pleasures of "
"such a goddess."
msgstr "분명 샤는 흡족해하겠군. 그런 신의 즐거움 따위 내가 신경을 써야 하는지는 잘 모르겠지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
msgctxt "h671f17a4g4dbfg4e19gb89ag16eca5e449d2"
msgid "Your goddess is appeased, then. How grand for you."
msgstr "네가 섬기는 신이 만족했겠군. 참 대단하기도 하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
msgctxt "h784ece54g0ffbg4248g806bg25adc01cd16c"
msgid "Shar must be thrilled. Congratulations."
msgstr "샤는 엄청나게 기분 좋아 하겠네. 축하해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
msgctxt "h80b78116ge1e4g472fgaeb2gb57e823429a0"
msgid "Hope your miserable god is delighted with herself."
msgstr "네가 섬기는 그 비참한 신이 기쁨에 겨워 날뛰고 있기를 바랄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
msgctxt "ha44dd5ddg0848g4ca6gbad6g9e5c776c348b"
msgid ""
"You have shed the rarest of blood for your goddess, Shadowheart. I hope it "
"was worth it to you."
msgstr "그대는 자신의 신을 위해서 가장 진기한 존재의 피를 흘렸네, 섀도하트. 이 행동이 그대에게 그만한 가치가 있었기를 바라지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
msgctxt "hbd3cbedbg4ba8g4718g9bb4gb5deefe43ebe"
msgid "You have earned your place as a Dark Justiciar of Shar."
msgstr "이제 너는 샤의 다크 저스티시어로 우뚝 서게 된 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:14e00318-d9fd-4166-a172-bcb338892434
msgctxt "h31ed5403g28d6g4798g9948g5ca3a12f979d"
msgid "Let's hope the Lady of Loss is pleased."
msgstr "상실의 여인께서 만족하셨기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
msgctxt "he48cb2c9g07d0g41d2g9e73gef45657b2398"
msgid "Do you feel better now, Shadowheart? A little less tense?"
msgstr "이제 직성이 풀렸나, 섀도하트? 긴장이 덜어졌어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
msgctxt "h8ada6c4bg994ag482fg87c5g37d0e52bfa3b"
msgid ""
"A cruel fate for such a wondrous being. Is there so little room for light in "
"you, Shadowheart?"
msgstr "그토록 환상적인 존재가 맞기에는 너무 잔혹한 운명이었어. 네 안에는 정녕 빛을 받아들일 자리가 없는 거야, 섀도하트?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
msgctxt "h27a03449g8934g410fg9f71g6264465f7ae5"
msgid "It is done. The Nightsong is no more."
msgstr "이제 끝났다. 밤의 노래는 최후를 맞았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
msgctxt "hee9b01ecg426eg4b29ga6f0g5811f91c4927"
msgid "By the gone gods, what great light have you gone and quenched?"
msgstr "세상에, 방금 얼마나 위대한 불꽃을 꺼뜨려 버린 건지 알기나 해?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
msgctxt "h2a01e7f1g624cg4278g8be3g9f2f387913f7"
msgid "That was hard to watch. Hope it was worth it, Shadowheart."
msgstr "정말이지 차마 보기가 힘들었어. 이런 짓까지 한 가치가 있길 바라자고, 섀도하트."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
msgctxt "hda3e8d77g3322g4c20ga590g4a0cb7d16acb"
msgid "A sorry outcome."
msgstr "참으로 유감스러운 결과로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
msgctxt "hab3766a2g8b3dg4731gbba3gc7234e3c947c"
msgid "The Nightsong is silenced. You have done well, Shadowheart."
msgstr "밤노래가 잦아들었구나. 잘 했다, 섀도하트."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1958dcc8-957d-4b02-996b-9750d3aa39bb
msgctxt "h0c51b4d4g32c4g4586g921dg28890a9ee05d"
msgid "It's done, Shadowheart."
msgstr "이제는 끝났어, 섀도하트."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
msgctxt "h9c7aaff7g6007g4289g9614g4a79e99f70f4"
msgid "With her free, Ketheric is exposed. We only have to strike."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 풀려났으니 케서릭의 약점도 노출됐어. 공격하기만 하면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
msgctxt "h96940dd7g2436g417agbd1cg8606f127a8f8"
msgid ""
"Ketheric has the wrath of the heavens upon him now. And no hope of "
"resurrection."
msgstr "케서릭도 이제는 천상의 진노를 맞닥뜨리게 됐군. 더군다나 더는 부활할 가망도 없게 됐고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
msgctxt "h602b5d47gb7b0g4efagba52g21adc69b4141"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm's immortal no longer. He will know true death at our hands."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨도 더는 불멸의 존재가 아니게 됐다. 놈은 우리 손에 진정한 죽음이 어떤 것인지를 깨닫게 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
msgctxt "h8f1f3974gcf07g4ec6g9f5dge0d047f19629"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong will tear Ketheric to shreds. I wouldn't miss it for the world."
msgstr "밤의 노래는 케서릭을 갈기갈기 찢어 버릴 거야. 그런 광경이라면 반드시 봐야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
msgctxt "ha8c8fe39gf336g4ed8g8211gb0a8b0fbe7da"
msgid "Can't wait to see her cleave Ketheric's head in two."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 케서릭의 대가리를 둘로 쪼개는 광경을 얼른 보고 싶네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
msgctxt "h404aa1e5gca2cg4501g9f36gc511f5aeb8ee"
msgid "And with her free, Thorm is vulnerable. The time to strike is upon us."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 풀려났으니 쏨도 취약해졌네. 이제는 공세에 나설 때야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
msgctxt "hb73c0514g6246g4d70ga791gddf0dc84b2db"
msgid ""
"Ketheric is vulnerable now. We should hasten to Moonrise, lest our angelic "
"friend kills him before we have a chance to."
msgstr "케서릭도 이제는 취약해졌다. 서둘러 문라이즈 타워로 가야 해. 천사 친구가 우리보다 먼저 케서릭 놈을 죽여 버리기 전에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:1fb42446-4fed-41f0-9ed7-5c4e58223b87
msgctxt "h8b549811g77a4g45b8gbbd1g309229c4936f"
msgid "Ketheric's vulnerable now. All we have to do is strike."
msgstr "케서릭도 이제는 취약해졌어. 놈을 공격하기만 하면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
msgctxt "hab4d2fccg5eddg4d8bg9da4g53ed27fa6938"
msgid "Should... should we kill her again?"
msgstr "혹시... 다시 한 번 더 죽여야 하려나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
msgctxt "h36361528gf7bdg4b0bg8983g91f3e0425569"
msgid "When she resurrects, she'll have no interest in helping us."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 부활하면, 그때는 우릴 도우려고 하지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
msgctxt "he243565cg96cdg47ffgb733g2e5c9c826664"
msgid ""
"Going forward, stay your hand. In her death, we'll find neither purpose nor "
"pleasure."
msgstr "계속 앞으로 나아가는 수밖에. 밤의 노래를 계속 죽여 봐야 즐거움도 쓸모도 찾지 못할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
msgctxt "hf31da4f3gd2f5g41c1g9b65gb55e41997f72"
msgid "Not her first death, or her last. Is there no end to her suffering?"
msgstr "이게 밤의 노래에게는 첫 번째 죽음도, 마지막 죽음도 아닐 거야. 이자의 고통에는 끝이 없는 걸까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
msgctxt "h7f6ebd62g018fg46c1g9ed3g60a89fccdef5"
msgid "No sense in making her suffer more. Not after what she's been through."
msgstr "이 이상으로 밤의 노래에게 고통을 줘 봤자 의미없는 짓이잖아. 그간 겪은 게 있는 마당인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
msgctxt "h7fb42dd7gc3cdg4d5dg82b3g4197bd4586e4"
msgid ""
"How many times has she died and returned? How much agony has she endured...?"
msgstr "밤의 노래는 얼마나 숱하게 죽고 또 다시 돌아왔을까? 대체 얼마나 지독한 고통을 견뎌야 했던 것인가...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
msgctxt "h7fbc32a7gc100g4634g8d7egf1e3e422b286"
msgid "It would be a waste of effort to strike her again."
msgstr "밤의 노래의 숨통을 다시 끊으려 해 봐야 헛된 일일 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:2d464755-d296-4e3b-8253-6458b2c51272
msgctxt "h17911b9cg45b8g409agac84g61e7cf6a0b14"
msgid "Wonder how many times she's been killed down here."
msgstr "여기서 밤의 노래가 얼마나 무수히 많은 죽음을 겪었을지 궁금하군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
msgctxt "h222002dbgee90g43e8ga9abg4256c3a9c8b0"
msgid "She does seem like a powerful ally. I just hope she's powerful enough."
msgstr "강력한 우군을 얻은 것 같네. 밤의 노래의 힘만으로 판을 뒤집을 수 있다면 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
msgctxt "h366a478cg1500g48b4g9f91g4a2c1baf35a2"
msgid "An aasimar for an ally. I feel the odds shifting in our favour already."
msgstr "아시마르를 우군으로 얻다니. 벌써부터 판도가 우리 쪽에 이롭게 풀려나가는 게 느껴져."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
msgctxt "h77d8953dga0ddg42d9gab4fgf75a1fe6a91b"
msgid ""
"By all the planes - she is a mighty force, one I'm glad to call an ally."
msgstr "가히 모든 차원을 통틀어도 저만한 막강한 힘은 찾기 어려울 거다. 밤의 노래를 우군으로 얻어 기쁘군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
msgctxt "h0a882cb2gf0b1g4549g974bg9df029602780"
msgid "Incredible. She'll make a powerful ally, all fury and light."
msgstr "엄청나. 밤의 노래는 강력한 우군이 될 거야. 진노와 빛으로 이글거리는."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
msgctxt "h7e6e6332g5bcbg4b61gb25dgd7c473000270"
msgid "Fuck yes. She's <i>incredible</i>. Well-chosen, Shadowheart."
msgstr "씨발, 이거지. 밤의 노래 끝내 준다. 잘 선택했어, 섀도하트."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
msgctxt "h5ecba0deg7f74g4eb1g89dbgc24270163560"
msgid ""
"You chose well, Shadowheart. You may have angered your goddess, but now we "
"have an aasimar as an ally."
msgstr "잘 선택했네, 섀도하트. 그대가 섬기는 신의 화를 돋우었을지는 모르나, 이제 우리는 아시마르를 우군으로 얻었네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
msgctxt "h8cb914a4g8fd1g4fcdgb769g646ba8e1416e"
msgid "I hope her bite is equal to her bark."
msgstr "밤의 노래에게 자기가 떠들어댄 만큼의 힘이 있다면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:41ce0311-ee77-484d-ac66-85a706bdb2d5
msgctxt "h64c0f53fg10c8g4516g98cegd8681ada7ca0"
msgid "What a sight. We chose a powerful ally."
msgstr "대단한 광경이로군. 우린 막강한 우군의 편을 든 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
msgctxt "h16dfbd6cgd8eeg4725g9ad7g97cbb9370b0b"
msgid "At least Shar will be happy. Or whatever passes for 'happy' with her."
msgstr "적어도 샤는 만족스러워 하겠네. 샤를 '만족'시킨다는 게 가능한지는 차치하고서라도 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
msgctxt "hd469bbafg2808g489bg90a4g171e7248769c"
msgid ""
"Shar is no doubt pleased. Though I'm not sure I care for the pleasures of "
"such a goddess."
msgstr "분명 샤는 흡족해하겠군. 그런 신의 즐거움 따위 내가 신경을 써야 하는지는 잘 모르겠지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
msgctxt "hdc976385gbaf5g4de1g8e87g9c7ee96ba742"
msgid "Your goddess is satisfied. Or so I hope, for your sake."
msgstr "네가 섬기는 신은 만족스러워 하겠군. 네 안위를 위해서라도 그게 사실이기를 바라지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
msgctxt "hce57312fg1bb8g4375gadacg795c5497c956"
msgid "I'm sure your dark goddess is proud..."
msgstr "네가 섬기는 그 어둠의 신이 정말이지 자랑스러워 하겠네..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
msgctxt "h2e673b18gcd69g40acgb7b8g5755228c3bbe"
msgid "Hope you made She of the Absolute Misery feel better."
msgstr "네가 섬기는 그 지독하게 비참한 신의 기분이나마 좋아졌길 바라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
msgctxt "hfeaff5d9g9582g49efgbf7ag9e3763b277c0"
msgid ""
"You have shed the rarest of blood for your goddess, Shadowheart. I hope it "
"was worth it to you."
msgstr "그대는 자신의 신을 위해서 가장 진기한 존재의 피를 흘렸네, 섀도하트. 이 행동이 그대에게 그만한 가치가 있었기를 바라지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
msgctxt "h01999ef1g82fcg40a7gb868g54aca1047717"
msgid ""
"I hope your goddess appreciates the blood you have shed for her, Shadowheart."
msgstr "너의 신이 네가 바친 피의 공물에 만족했기를 바라겠다, 섀도하트."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:44f8a8ab-e96a-4867-b575-2b3009ab0654
msgctxt "hc0065bc9gb6c2g419agab93g675c3111318c"
msgid "I hope your goddess is pleased."
msgstr "네가 섬기는 신이나마 만족했기를 바라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
msgctxt "h6ed80c0bgbee0g4b3fg99efg1147f89b6030"
msgid "Let's hope we backed the right horse. Or the right nightmare."
msgstr "올바른 편에 선 것이기를 바라자고. 악몽이 될지도 모르지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
msgctxt "h58667c7eg2a19g4664g9b42g4e81b26b58b4"
msgid ""
"Let's hope she doesn't seek revenge. I don't fancy facing an aasimar's wrath."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 복수를 꾀하지 않기를 바라자고. 아시마르의 진노에 맞서는 건 피하고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
msgctxt "hdd7f9b9eg0c28g4092gaafdge2b6cfaf9d7a"
msgid ""
"With every choice, a consequence. We haven't seen the last of the Nightsong."
msgstr "모든 선택에는 결과가 따른다. 아직 밤의 노래는 끝장난 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
msgctxt "hc2c1e72ag469fg4f0cgaaf2gc4ad2c5e3b68"
msgid "This doesn't sit right with me. We've travelled a dark path."
msgstr "마음이 착잡해. 우린 암흑의 길을 걸어왔구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
msgctxt "hc085785ag6b14g4882g93bfg130122502b17"
msgid "I didn't sign up for this."
msgstr "난 이러려고 여기 온 게 아닌데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
msgctxt "hd0916959gd0e1g455bga825g82b476fc57d7"
msgid "That was not just foolish. It was immoral."
msgstr "그건 단순히 어리석기만 한 일이 아니었네. 부도덕하기까지 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
msgctxt "h583b6418gc7e8g4b82g9f07g3d223f86087d"
msgid "I question the wisdom of that decision."
msgstr "방금 그 결정이 과연 현명했는지 의문이 든다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:56185e30-2652-4e34-8bb1-49cec6af1a0a
msgctxt "h6ba57d55g4643g4827g9d50g1097507c0cf0"
msgid "Hopefully this will all be over soon."
msgstr "바라건대 이 사태도 곧 있으면 끝나겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
msgctxt "h12ee0c73g2dddg4d4ag8725g58bcaf7b73f8"
msgid "Let's hope we backed the right horse. Or the right nightmare."
msgstr "올바른 편에 선 것이기를 바라자고. 악몽이 될지도 모르지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
msgctxt "hbc526c9agd732g4accg94aeg49d2ad9bea8e"
msgid ""
"Let's hope she doesn't seek revenge. I don't fancy facing an aasimar's wrath."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 복수를 꾀하지 않기를 바라자고. 아시마르의 진노에 맞서는 건 피하고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
msgctxt "h0f49211ag1b1cg4622g95cbg3807304b58cc"
msgid ""
"With every choice, a consequence. We haven't seen the last of the Nightsong."
msgstr "모든 선택에는 결과가 따른다. 아직 밤의 노래는 끝장난 게 아니야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
msgctxt "hfd277607g512cg471egb3c2g591dcce1976e"
msgid "This doesn't sit right with me. We've travelled a dark path."
msgstr "마음이 착잡해. 우린 암흑의 길을 걸어왔구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
msgctxt "hff53dd0dg99ebg435ag9cc8gedf9fb879d80"
msgid "What goes around comes around. We're going to pay for this."
msgstr "뭐든 끝에 가서는 돌려받기 마련이야. 우리도 이번 일의 대가를 치르게 될 거라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
msgctxt "h68232a43g325fg45d4g8394ga30a0271ce3a"
msgid "That was not just foolish. It was immoral."
msgstr "그건 단순히 어리석기만 한 일이 아니었네. 부도덕하기까지 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
msgctxt "h9bb7b112g0532g4869gbcffg3c915e1861dc"
msgid ""
"Doing Balthazar's bidding sickens me, but if it gets us closer to Ketheric, "
"so be it."
msgstr "발타자르가 시키는 대로 고분고분히 따랐다는 데 욕지기가 나지만, 그렇게 해서 케서릭에게 가까워질 수 있다면야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:5c99f77e-f15c-4a48-ae42-f1001aba16b7
msgctxt "hb1fc2172g0a2ag4559ga065g6ec3a464a68f"
msgid "Let's hope we chose the right ally."
msgstr "올바른 우군을 택한 것이기를 바라자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
msgctxt "hc0a151edg2e02g4aa3gb5eeg976f8e9e9f79"
msgid "She does seem like a powerful ally. I just hope she's powerful enough."
msgstr "강력한 우군을 얻은 것 같네. 밤의 노래의 힘만으로 판을 뒤집을 수 있다면 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
msgctxt "h21a93665g8384g4d46g8c9fg891b6bc70111"
msgid "An aasimar for an ally. I feel the odds shifting in our favour already."
msgstr "아시마르를 우군으로 얻다니. 벌써부터 판도가 우리 쪽에 이롭게 풀려나가는 게 느껴져."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
msgctxt "h542c3950g3a90g4f55g9830gb98d5a1bf9e0"
msgid "A well-chosen ally. In her suffering, she's found strength."
msgstr "우군을 잘 선택했다. 밤의 노래는 고통 속에서도 힘을 찾았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
msgctxt "hd001c229gac10g4c3eg8ff8g3492767316ea"
msgid "The right choice - she's quite something, isn't she?"
msgstr "올바른 선택을 한 거야. 밤의 노래 굉장하지, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
msgctxt "haedac2f4g68c5g47c3ga343g57fbe6d59fe2"
msgid "She's incredible."
msgstr "진짜 끝내준다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
msgctxt "h7ed44bd7gaffcg4719ga52eg2dbf3488888f"
msgid ""
"She shall be a powerful ally against Ketheric Thorm. I look forward to "
"witnessing her power unleashed against him."
msgstr ""
"밤의 노래는 케서릭 솜에게 맞서는 데 큰 힘이 될 걸세. 밤의 노래가 케서릭 놈에게 자신의 힘을 퍼붓는 광경을 직접 보는 게 기대되는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
msgctxt "hb09ff45bg72a7g49a3g9892ga63f9ed915bd"
msgid "A righteous and furious ally. Impressive."
msgstr "의로운 한편으로 진노에 이글거리는 아군이라니. 인상적이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6a30e45a-8613-4b3f-90ed-2bf10e51addf
msgctxt "hbb87387cgba7dg458cg9999gb216f67318da"
msgid "We've made a powerful ally today."
msgstr "우린 오늘 강력한 우군을 만든 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NightsongSentToMoonrise = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
msgctxt "h01388744g0491g453egb740g0a04de8f99d4"
msgid "Well, she's Ketheric's now. Her fate's in his hands."
msgstr "뭐, 이제는 케서릭의 것이 되었네. 밤의 노래의 운명은 그자 손에 달렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NightsongSentToMoonrise = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
msgctxt "h4f0e8a53g2f33g49bfgac67gb5eaf25eb45d"
msgid "Rather ruthless of you to just hand her over like that."
msgstr "그냥 그런 식으로 밤의 노래를 줘 버리다니 잔혹해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NightsongSentToMoonrise = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
msgctxt "h44d70c3dga009g4b45ga240g3c887acb3169"
msgid "The choice is made, and fate is written."
msgstr "결정은 내려졌고, 운명은 매듭지어졌다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NightsongSentToMoonrise = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
msgctxt "he902cf3bgd547g4832g95f6g88743c6a0586"
msgid "Doomed to suffer. A tragedy many times over."
msgstr "끝까지 고통받는 파멸의 운명을 타고나다니. 그야말로 비극적이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NightsongSentToMoonrise = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
msgctxt "h2aed30d5gebf1g4400g8795g7ac2044cb3d9"
msgid "How could you let that corpse take her?!"
msgstr "어떻게 그 시체 새끼가 밤의 노래를 데려가게 둘 수가 있어?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NightsongSentToMoonrise = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
msgctxt "h50023ccdg342eg4f85g9c0ag8e15c10de885"
msgid ""
"We just surrendered her...? She could have helped us put a stop to Ketheric "
"Thorm!"
msgstr "이런 식으로 밤의 노래를 줘 버리다니...? 그자가 케서릭 쏨에게 맞서는 데 도움을 줄 수도 있었을 텐데!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NightsongSentToMoonrise = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
msgctxt "h96c00007g52bcg4aa3gb2e3gb1e44cd8428e"
msgid "She was defiant for a caged beast. Moonrise will break her."
msgstr "우리에 갇힌 짐승치고는 반항적이었군. 문라이즈 타워에 가면 부서질 터."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_NightsongSentToMoonrise = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:6d8f6fd4-db41-49b0-ab1b-e4b5a56a78a6
msgctxt "h020dea1fg56f3g457bg81c3g9e6ecc451a9e"
msgid "We did what we had to do."
msgstr "우리는 해야만 하는 일을 한 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(0) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
msgctxt "h3d17fa07g4d93g4047g9877gd58fef954bb5"
msgid "She's definitely immortal - no question about that."
msgstr "확실히 불멸자이기는 하네. 그건 의문의 여지가 없겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(0) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
msgctxt "h02936e24g8340g457bg889eg4bbd7885341a"
msgid "Her death will be temporary, but her anger... that will be permanent."
msgstr "밤의 노래의 죽음은 일시적인 것에 불과할 거야. 그렇지만 그 분노는... 그건 영원할 테지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(0) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
msgctxt "hc813d153g67c9g4fa2gb019ga444ecbe4b2c"
msgid "Immortal, indeed. And angry for certain."
msgstr "과연 불멸자로군. 그리고 확실히 화가 난 것 같다만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(0) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
msgctxt "h9edf0d7fg4c6eg47c7gb4d0gfaa7bfc2f441"
msgid "By the gone gods, what have we done?"
msgstr "맙소사, 우리가 무슨 짓을 한 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(0) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
msgctxt "h9f05dd52gf7f2g4f22gb7f2g19f9a59ed3bb"
msgid "Oh goody. We've pissed off the immortal."
msgstr "참 잘 됐네. 불멸자의 심기를 거스르고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(0) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
msgctxt "h96d274adg387bg4bddg99a7g8b75f531a92c"
msgid "She is immortal - and enraged. What have we done...?"
msgstr "밤의 노래는 불멸자이고, 이제는 격분하기까지 했네. 우리가 무슨 짓을...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(0) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
msgctxt "h1b20db09gc6e0g4e9cgb0afga44579b4ce28"
msgid "My family have a saying: 'Do not provoke what you cannot kill'."
msgstr "우리 가문에 전해지는 격언이 있지. '죽일 수 없는 존재의 심기를 거스르지 말라'는."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - GLO_NightsongPrison_State_KilledNightsong(0) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = False
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:75701ca3-5db0-4641-b395-ffb1a8677dcd
msgctxt "h89a4d677gbce5g4d75g93eeg87290a48d702"
msgid "Well, she wasn't lying - she's immortal."
msgstr "이것 참, 거짓말이 아니었네. 진짜 불멸자잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
msgctxt "hdd89d23dg9f21g465bg9ed4g256d14279d03"
msgid "Do you feel better now, Shadowheart? A little less tense?"
msgstr "이제 직성이 풀렸나, 섀도하트? 긴장이 덜어졌어?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
msgctxt "h4bc4484fgbc73g431bgbcb8g64ff1a57a25a"
msgid ""
"A cruel fate for such a wondrous being. Is there so little room for light in "
"you, Shadowheart?"
msgstr "그토록 환상적인 존재가 맞기에는 너무 잔혹한 운명이었어. 네 안에는 정녕 빛을 받아들일 자리가 없는 거야, 섀도하트?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
msgctxt "h0d5a4d6bgdb98g4d8eg9026g054dcc29c5ab"
msgid "Vicious. Only a coward refuses her challenger the chance to fight back."
msgstr "악독하군. 적수에게서 맞서싸울 기회를 박탈하는 건 겁쟁이나 하는 짓이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
msgctxt "hf34292c5g9a24g4e2dga64ega079bdbcee25"
msgid "Gods - she was an absolute wonder, and you destroyed her."
msgstr "맙소사. 밤의 노래는 정말로 경이로운 존재였는데, 네가 죽여 버리고 말았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
msgctxt "h6fb0cbe4g45e6g46a8ga4a6g7703b5b27821"
msgid "You killed her. After all she'd been through."
msgstr "밤의 노래를 죽이다니. 그토록 오래 고통받았는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
msgctxt "h53981651g3458g44bag907dg3876c330a294"
msgid "A sorry outcome."
msgstr "참으로 유감스러운 결과로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
msgctxt "h8e94c6bag13c3g4773g83ebg7f47c2c5d4bd"
msgid "The Nightsong is silenced. You have done well, Shadowheart."
msgstr "밤노래가 잦아들었구나. 잘 했다, 섀도하트."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_ShadowheartKilledNightsong = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:766f2873-9295-4443-8018-c027648cd140
msgctxt "he2e82b7bgefa0g44f6ga616g91d0e6a52e27"
msgid "The Nightsong is dead. Permanently."
msgstr "밤의 노래는 죽었어. 확실하게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
msgctxt "h0704aa48gf9beg4468gb574g95b25788eeba"
msgid "Let's hope we backed the right horse. Or the right nightmare."
msgstr "올바른 편에 선 것이기를 바라자고. 악몽이 될지도 모르지만 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
msgctxt "h43c103cegba44g47eegb4faga33279c2a174"
msgid ""
"Let's hope she doesn't seek revenge. I don't fancy facing an aasimar's wrath."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 복수를 꾀하지 않기를 바라자고. 아시마르의 진노에 맞서는 건 피하고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
msgctxt "h5d0cb0abgfd38g4ddcg9bb6g05598f7d15a2"
msgid "Our ally is chosen. There is no going back."
msgstr "우리는 어느 쪽과 손잡을지를 선택했다. 이제는 돌이킬 수 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
msgctxt "h13655e7eg3cd7g4f98g8173gee412c57fda6"
msgid "A terrible choice for which we'll all pay a price."
msgstr "잘못된 선택을 했어. 우리 모두가 대가를 치를 거고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
msgctxt "h6f4c6202ge3f2g41a2gb0b7g49013fc077f5"
msgid "That was wrong. And we're going to pay for it."
msgstr "이건 잘못됐어. 그 책임은 우리가 져야 할 테고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
msgctxt "h262161dcgac50g43b0g9f44gb01d729c8867"
msgid "That was not just foolish. It was immoral."
msgstr "그건 단순히 어리석기만 한 일이 아니었네. 부도덕하기까지 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
msgctxt "h2f7d8409g7fefg42f6g8098gf26308e0fbe4"
msgid ""
"Doing Balthazar's bidding sickens me, but if it gets us closer to Ketheric, "
"so be it."
msgstr "발타자르가 시키는 대로 고분고분히 따랐다는 데 욕지기가 나지만, 그렇게 해서 케서릭에게 가까워질 수 있다면야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:85173e10-d5e3-4967-9ffb-60718872ecc7
msgctxt "h975442aega981g459aga009ged2704171b14"
msgid "I hope we chose the right ally."
msgstr "올바른 우군을 택한 것이기를."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
msgctxt "h85d696aag9f00g45eag84dbgbfe3d1229954"
msgid "I'm glad you let her go - she seems like a powerful ally."
msgstr "밤의 노래를 풀어 주다니 다행이야. 아주 강력한 우군 같던걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
msgctxt "h22a6023bgafe0g4956g80c8g7b885edc8b20"
msgid "An aasimar for an ally. I feel the odds shifting in our favour already."
msgstr "아시마르를 우군으로 얻다니. 벌써부터 판도가 우리 쪽에 이롭게 풀려나가는 게 느껴져."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
msgctxt "ha06ffc9cg530fg48b8gbb41g6f9cd4f1ecbc"
msgid "A well-chosen ally. In her suffering, she's found strength."
msgstr "우군을 잘 선택했다. 밤의 노래는 고통 속에서도 힘을 찾았어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
msgctxt "hc9caa790g8cb3g43eeg8eb0g6dbf0fa0c3dd"
msgid "Well chosen - she's quite something, isn't she?"
msgstr "잘 선택했어. 밤의 노래는 대단히 인상적이야, 안 그래?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
msgctxt "h055f6275g5b75g482fga828gb4a2a72e85fe"
msgid "She's incredible. You did the right thing."
msgstr "밤의 노래는 대단해. 옳은 일을 한 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
msgctxt "h9eceff29g242bg4544ga163ge0f0ec545018"
msgid "An aasimar at our side. I can think of few allies that could match her."
msgstr "아시마르가 우리 편에 서다니. 밤의 노래에 견줄 만한 우군은 또 없을 걸세."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
msgctxt "hb7ab05a3g34d7g4b7bg83b4g30a214343f17"
msgid "I hope her bite is equal to her bark."
msgstr "밤의 노래에게 자기가 떠들어댄 만큼의 힘이 있다면 좋겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_Event_ShadowheartThereForFate = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:88c15d70-37ba-43b6-9d75-58afad67e36e
msgctxt "hc6aefc93ga257g4856gbd0egaa661350844e"
msgid "A powerful ally. Well-chosen, Shadowheart."
msgstr "강력한 우군이야. 잘 선택했어, 섀도하트."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
msgctxt "hdb9e2b50gc31cg4d80gaea9ge908ae1d3183"
msgid "Gods, what a hellish thing to be trapped in."
msgstr "맙소사, 정말이지 지독한 신세로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
msgctxt "h906375bcg8d39g405fga004gdc63daccdadd"
msgid ""
"Imagine being trapped here, faced with eternal torment. I think I'd rather "
"just die."
msgstr "여기 갇힌 채로 영원한 고통을 마주해야 한다니 상상이나 해 봐. 난 차라리 죽고 말겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
msgctxt "hf755bfbfgc8dbg494bgab91g6bd7f5a6e9d9"
msgid ""
"I don't fear the grave. But an eternal cycle of death and rebirth? I can't "
"bear to think of it."
msgstr "나는 죽음이 두렵지 않지만, 죽음을 맞고 또 다시 재탄생하는 영원한 굴레에 갇히는 건? 생각조차 하고 싶지 않다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
msgctxt "h364d82dcg94c1g4487g8ef4g231942bdbf82"
msgid "A terrible contraption by all estimations."
msgstr "모로 봐도 끔찍하기가 짝이 없는 처지네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
msgctxt "hfdc1737dge682g468dg92cdge99638ea56bd"
msgid "An awful fate, to be trapped here so long."
msgstr "이곳에 그토록 오래 갇혀 있어야 했다니 정말 지독해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
msgctxt "he93999d7gaeccg477cga4degc3f2cb82abfb"
msgid ""
"Imagine being tormented  in this place for so long. It makes me shudder."
msgstr "이런 곳에서 그토록 오랫동안 고통받는다는 생각을 하면 몸서리가 쳐지네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:a0cc5b78-71f7-4140-8519-4b0dec02cb21
msgctxt "h98d56c99ga45bg4e9agae54gf390596063bc"
msgid "A terrible fate, to be trapped here so long."
msgstr "이곳에 그토록 오랫동안 갇혀 있어야 한다니 끔찍한 운명이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
msgctxt "h065adcd7g7d57g4889ga89bg2c0ef3fa2c5a"
msgid "With her free, Ketheric is exposed. We only have to strike."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 풀려났으니 케서릭의 약점도 노출됐어. 공격하기만 하면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
