msgctxt "h40fbae2bg638bg4433g802ag8a98a037f71e"
msgid ""
"Ketheric has the wrath of the heavens upon him now. And no hope of "
"resurrection."
msgstr "케서릭도 이제는 천상의 진노를 맞닥뜨리게 됐군. 더군다나 더는 부활할 가망도 없게 됐고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
msgctxt "h9b7bb9c2g5bb5g4875ga94agba68fbaf5d39"
msgid ""
"Ketheric Thorm's immortal no longer. He will know true death at our hands."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨도 더는 불멸의 존재가 아니게 됐다. 놈은 우리 손에 진정한 죽음이 어떤 것인지를 깨닫게 될 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
msgctxt "hecf393c4g0fd9g4c46ga417gf3f55274a11a"
msgid ""
"The Nightsong will tear Ketheric to shreds. I wouldn't miss it for the world."
msgstr "밤의 노래는 케서릭을 갈기갈기 찢어 버릴 거야. 그런 광경이라면 반드시 봐야지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
msgctxt "hdf6d55f5g97bfg4069g9e7ega3155858caf4"
msgid "Can't wait to watch her cleave Ketheric's head in two."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 케서릭의 대가리를 둘로 쪼개 버리는 광경을 얼른 보고 싶네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
msgctxt "h97aef255g52b6g4012ga381g8aec0c8987cd"
msgid "Ketheric Thorm shall be vulnerable now. The time to strike is upon us."
msgstr "케서릭 쏨도 이제는 취약해졌을 것이네. 지금이야말로 놈을 칠 때야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
msgctxt "h9c19c002gb1e8g48f0g8fdcg2f902fe7284d"
msgid ""
"Ketheric is vulnerable now. We should hasten to Moonrise, lest our angelic "
"friend kills him before we have a chance to."
msgstr "케서릭도 이제는 취약해졌다. 서둘러 문라이즈 타워로 가야 해. 천사 친구가 우리보다 먼저 케서릭 놈을 죽여 버리기 전에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:ae43e054-8ad2-4b5a-890b-e7dd642ca321
msgctxt "hc0a79eb6g7d6cg481bga30bgef9c8df09d0c"
msgid "Ketheric will be vulnerable, now. All we need to do is strike."
msgstr "이제 케서릭도 취약해졌을 거야. 우리는 공격하기만 하면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
