msgctxt "h9836268bg0bd9g4af9gb0f6g50bbddeab656"
msgid ""
"Ketheric has the wrath of the heavens upon him now. And no hope of "
"resurrection."
msgstr "케서릭도 이제는 천상의 진노를 맞닥뜨리게 됐군. 더군다나 더는 부활할 가망도 없게 됐고 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b208ec3a-eec3-48af-9c37-b707a3b7d4b8
