msgctxt "hd1a4594dg3294g4a37ga3degcc50d09f81d8"
msgid ""
"Ketheric is eternal no longer. We should strike now, while he's at his most "
"fragile."
msgstr "케서릭은 더는 불멸의 존재가 아니게 됐다. 놈이 가장 취약해진 지금 바로 공격해야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b208ec3a-eec3-48af-9c37-b707a3b7d4b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:b208ec3a-eec3-48af-9c37-b707a3b7d4b8
msgctxt "h35e3ac70g6b78g4454g851dga7ac24cb50f3"
msgid ""
"So much for Ketheric's immortality. Let's move - I want to see this angel of "
"doom in action."
msgstr "케서릭의 불멸성도 이제는 동이 났군. 이제 그만 이동하자. 이 파멸의 천사가 활약하는 걸 보고 싶어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b208ec3a-eec3-48af-9c37-b707a3b7d4b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction:b208ec3a-eec3-48af-9c37-b707a3b7d4b8
msgctxt "h923e8144g4c24g4301ga380g77d7ccd822b2"
msgid "Can't wait to watch her break Ketheric's face."
msgstr "밤의 노래가 케서릭의 상판을 박살내는 걸 얼른 보고 싶은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b208ec3a-eec3-48af-9c37-b707a3b7d4b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
