msgctxt "h43069452g85afg4c07gab58gabf7dba833a3"
msgid "Hope I haven't hitched my wagon to the wrong fuckin' horse."
msgstr "우리가 잡은 줄이 썩은 동아줄이 아니길 바라야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction_Solo
