msgctxt "h54fab1d2ge431g496bgadabg77d601955bd3"
msgid "Her death will be temporary, but her anger... that will be permanent."
msgstr "그녀의 죽음은 일시적일지 모르나, 그 분노는... 영원하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_NightsongsFateReaction_Solo
