msgctxt "h0edcab18gbda8g49f5gb40eg5402aab6c74a"
msgid "Blessed Nightsinger, witness my adoration..."
msgstr "축복받은 나이트싱어시여, 당신을 향한 나의 숭배를 지켜보소서..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_NightsongPrison_PAD_Prayer
