"<i>Inspect the bite marks more closely to see if you can identify what made "
"them.</i>"
msgstr "<i>무엇이 씹은 자국인지 알아내기 위해 흔적을 자세히 살펴본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_AD_ScoutsRetreat
