msgid "You tread where you are not wanted - <i>leave</i>."
msgstr "여긴 네가 드나들어선 안 되는 곳이다. <i>떠나라</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_AD_ScoutsRetreat
