msgid ""
"Rally on me - a wall of bone and blade against the darkness. <i>Now!</i>"
msgstr "내게 집결하라, 뼈의 벽과 어둠에 맞서는 칼날이여. <i>당장!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
