msgstr "죽음에서도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Marksman
#. NodeID = 768141c0-348d-a4a8-b050-e198e80e3bde
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WILDSHAPE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:768141c0-348d-a4a8-b050-e198e80e3bde
msgctxt "hc1a2494eg898ag4532gb10fg49ae6d0e3069"
msgid "Your animal flesh does not fool me. You do not belong here."
msgstr "네 동물 육신은 날 속이지 못해. 넌 이곳에 속하지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7b31a8ea-fbbd-89b9-9cc6-a75b49f0d5a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Necromancer_HasMet(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:7b31a8ea-fbbd-89b9-9cc6-a75b49f0d5a5
msgctxt "h22b26449g510dg48c6g931dg4e9315347d65"
msgid ""
"*Your mind upends. Somehow, in the decayed soup of this creature's brain, a "
"tadpole lives. Another presence nurtures it, manipulates it like a puppet.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신의 정신이 뒤집힙니다. 어째서인지, 이 생명체의 썩어가는 뇌수 속에 올챙이가 있습니다. 다른 존재가 이를 키우고, 꼭두각시처럼 "
"조종하고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = 923acb5d-a3eb-e9a4-51ae-762ab3084cdd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:923acb5d-a3eb-e9a4-51ae-762ab3084cdd
msgctxt "h826e0022g1756g41c7g9b69gdb99fec4bb04"
msgid "You upset <i>my </i>plans. Leave."
msgstr "<i>나의</i> 계획을 망치고 있다. 떠나라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Marksman
#. NodeID = 97096cdc-772a-fd52-9944-80f64b77113c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:97096cdc-772a-fd52-9944-80f64b77113c
msgctxt "h0707b74fga3a0g44c4gac2bg23010e138136"
msgid "Bones? They are more than bones."
msgstr "뼈? 단순한 뼈가 아니다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = 9ab213c0-7945-90d6-8024-ce15959a0bd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:9ab213c0-7945-90d6-8024-ce15959a0bd7
msgctxt "hd6bdcec3gbe21g44f1gadc5gb8f8b8fb5b3a"
msgid "You blunder."
msgstr "넌 싸돌아다니고,"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = a2557e2f-9882-1594-aa8f-11597c56ea89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:a2557e2f-9882-1594-aa8f-11597c56ea89
msgctxt "haee5246ag6703g4412g968agfe1e5c6278e6"
msgid "Z'rell lacks faith."
msgstr "믿음도 부족하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3b58d42-27fa-93e7-5dbe-b9653788acfc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - MOO_Executioner_Knows_BalthazarIsMissing = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:a3b58d42-27fa-93e7-5dbe-b9653788acfc
msgctxt "h0e638f59gb420g488bga847gef9b13efff13"
msgid "Z'rell sent me. I'm here to help a certain Balthazar."
msgstr "즈렐이 날 보냈다. 발타자르라는 자를 도우러 왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Marksman
#. NodeID = a7e3f8b1-8ee5-9ac1-dee0-713c4ee815f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:a7e3f8b1-8ee5-9ac1-dee0-713c4ee815f0
msgctxt "h3a91b434gc6bdg4e40gba4eg52ee1e621917"
msgid "You meddle."
msgstr "참견하고,"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = afd5b7c9-8c13-80dd-4717-523aa5575c47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WILDSHAPE(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:afd5b7c9-8c13-80dd-4717-523aa5575c47
msgctxt "h9a46c8d0g286fg4c01gaf28g5c6be216e5ab"
msgid "Your animal flesh does not fool me. You do not belong here."
msgstr "네 동물 육신은 날 속이지 못해. 넌 이곳에 속하지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = c9a3de84-a9c2-15af-9201-271f2a683ff2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:c9a3de84-a9c2-15af-9201-271f2a683ff2
msgctxt "h7eaeee86gf2a6g43a6ga0d6g24117de45e1b"
msgid "From their skin and their flesh. Now they serve me. Leave, before -"
msgstr "그들의 피부와 살점에서도. 이제 모두 나를 섬기지. 떠나라, 아니면... "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = cba8d9ce-58e2-e987-e503-18019d876ab1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:cba8d9ce-58e2-e987-e503-18019d876ab1
msgctxt "h3935e751g063dg4283g8d68gd96ceded0a4d"
msgid ""
"And <i>you </i>do? I won't allow some walking, talking feast for stray dogs "
"where I belong or not."
msgstr ""
"그러는 <i>너</i>는 여기 속하나? 내가 여기 속하든 아니든, 들개들이 말하고 걸으며 축제를 벌이는 장면을 내버려둘 생각은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Marksman
#. NodeID = d34a22fc-f0df-ba3d-088d-40842aab9802
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_Minthara_State_IsInParty = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - MINTHARA(3) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:d34a22fc-f0df-ba3d-088d-40842aab9802
msgctxt "h45f1c8dbg0e37g4a38g8840g705643f4bfc3"
msgid ""
"Your pet drow, Minthara, should recognise me. I'm her superior after all. As "
"for these creatures."
msgstr "네 애완 드로우 민타라는 날 알아볼 테지. 난 그녀보다 윗사람이니까. 이 크리쳐들도 마찬가지고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Marksman
#. NodeID = dc00e421-15e1-59b3-088b-a607a5b9cad8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:dc00e421-15e1-59b3-088b-a607a5b9cad8
msgctxt "hd8fd1203gb47dg473dgab12g18f7fca6e76c"
msgid "I am their creator. I saved them from life."
msgstr "나는 그들의 창조주이다. 내가 그들을 삶에서 구했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd0fbe86-8aa1-585c-b497-c415b8c1c5a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: SHAR
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:dd0fbe86-8aa1-585c-b497-c415b8c1c5a7
msgctxt "hb0a450d7ga0c7g4721g8ee8gd1d969993326"
msgid ""
"<i>You</i> leave. I belong in this place far more than some irate bone pile."
msgstr "<i>네가</i> 떠나라. 웬 열받은 뼈다귀 더미보다는 내가 이 장소에 더 속하니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd0fbe86-8aa1-585c-b497-c415b8c1c5a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: ROGUE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:dd0fbe86-8aa1-585c-b497-c415b8c1c5a7
msgctxt "h0f5ea76fg5ec6g4d62gaaadg2cdbf243f717"
msgid ""
"Meddling or trespassing I'd accept - but blundering? Spare me your insults, "
"bone pile."
msgstr "참견 질이나 무단침입은 그렇다 쳐도, 싸돌아다닌다고? 모욕은 이만 하시지, 뼈 무더기."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dd0fbe86-8aa1-585c-b497-c415b8c1c5a7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:dd0fbe86-8aa1-585c-b497-c415b8c1c5a7
msgctxt "h6d9a280cge59dg4a3bgaed4g9d5e8596f2f7"
msgid "<i>You</i> leave. I don't answer to bone piles."
msgstr "<i>네가</i> 떠나라. 뼈다귀 더미와는 할 이야기 없으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = e0399bd4-1661-90ee-113d-16c1bd95b278
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:e0399bd4-1661-90ee-113d-16c1bd95b278
msgctxt "hc2f0f048gdffdg4460gb959gf2606bf1ab66"
msgid ""
"More than skin, blood, hair and piss. They are <i>more</i>. They are "
"<i>mine. </i>Now leave, before -"
msgstr "살갗, 피, 털, 오줌 그 <i>이상</i>이다. 그들은 <i>내 것</i>이다. 이제 떠나라, 그림자..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = e3af6c31-a8e2-4de2-92ff-7de9473e9b45
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:e3af6c31-a8e2-4de2-92ff-7de9473e9b45
msgctxt "h7cf7e792gfcaeg45c1g8d19g7988ca0aa3ae"
msgid ""
"No - <i>you </i>do not belong. This is the Dark Lady's house. She has no use "
"for old, faithless bones."
msgstr "아니, 너야말로 여기 속하지 않는다. 이곳은 어둠의 여신의 집이다. 그분께 낡아빠진 불신자 뼈다귀는 필요하지 않다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = e44479c7-051b-10e3-adcd-a96b2404749f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Event_ShadowsAttack = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:e44479c7-051b-10e3-adcd-a96b2404749f
msgctxt "hd0ac9c9eg686dg4c21g9330g411594a45ad7"
msgid "<i>- stupid, worm-infested cockhead! </i>You have awoken the shadows!"
msgstr "<i>멍청한, 벌레 끓는 좆대가리 같으니!</i> 네가 그림자를 깨웠다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = e6092c09-20af-5d8c-010c-8963f788b672
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_3 = True
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_1 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:e6092c09-20af-5d8c-010c-8963f788b672
msgctxt "h1125ab9cg6940g4ec5g9d8ag78429dbe3761"
msgid "You do not belong here."
msgstr "넌 이곳에 속하지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ec2186e7-eee3-1b19-ea52-0f0bddd32e38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:ec2186e7-eee3-1b19-ea52-0f0bddd32e38
msgctxt "hdcde667fg0233g4440gb981g408c3fd70477"
msgid "<i>Turn to leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>돌아서서 떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Marksman
#. NodeID = efd1fcf8-b9f5-f6c5-cb14-3b757b897b8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:efd1fcf8-b9f5-f6c5-cb14-3b757b897b8a
msgctxt "hc5047958ga123g4153g8274g757c1227905f"
msgid "Z'rell lacks imagination."
msgstr "즈렐은 상상력이 부족하다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Reconstituted Duellist
#. NodeID = f809b52d-9ef6-3fe0-4f54-5c0de41341b9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:f809b52d-9ef6-3fe0-4f54-5c0de41341b9
msgctxt "hb41f4001gb69dg4b0agbb2eg445bfc785dd1"
msgid "You do not belong here."
msgstr "넌 이곳에 속하지 않는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = fd79797b-e9a3-db8b-fd43-06f55c49c856
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TadpoledSkeletons_Scouts:fd79797b-e9a3-db8b-fd43-06f55c49c856
msgctxt "h65da064eg3d7bg417ag8d28g4ce5fe8863d1"
msgid ""
"I've heard of making instruments out of bones but this is just ridiculous."
msgstr "뼈로 악기를 만드는 건 들어봤다지만 이런 건 정말 터무니없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TrapJunction_AD_AlarmStatues
#. Speaker = Shar
#. NodeID = d2d87190-b156-d919-62f9-332c61424dcd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 85c99cdc-a2b2-a0c3-4ca3-6ec206fb4766_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TrapJunction_AD_AlarmStatues:d2d87190-b156-d919-62f9-332c61424dcd
msgctxt "h15c98d5agc425g41ceg9ba2gf02ef4e9fd42"
msgid ""
"Shar's warriors must not be caught, must not be tricked. Only loss awaits "
"the unworthy."
msgstr "샤의 전사는 붙잡혀서도, 속아서도 안 된다. 무가치한 자에게는 상실만이 있으니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TrapJunction_AD_AlarmStatues
#. Speaker = Shar
#. NodeID = eff3ba75-b498-876a-7c32-1960d41ab6ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 85c99cdc-a2b2-a0c3-4ca3-6ec206fb4766_A = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_TrapJunction_AD_AlarmStatues:eff3ba75-b498-876a-7c32-1960d41ab6ff
msgctxt "h5a36bb87g0e8eg4e9fg8342gae3ae18ffae2"
msgid ""
"Shar will not embrace those who blunder. The darkness will feed on the weak, "
"taking what they hold dear."
msgstr "샤는 부주의한 자들을 포용하지 않는다. 어둠은 약한 이들을 먹어치울 것이며 그들이 소중히 여기는 것을 앗아갈 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_AD_LightTrialShadow
#. Speaker = Shadow
#. NodeID = 3084bfe1-3ae0-d5c9-7aaa-aa5a4492455e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_AD_LightTrialShadow:3084bfe1-3ae0-d5c9-7aaa-aa5a4492455e
msgctxt "h9d2c0e19gfab1g4d95ga0d6g030a421d6ef9"
msgid "A true child of the Nightsinger embraces the shadows and passes unseen."
msgstr "나이트싱어의 참된 자손은 그림자를 품고 눈에 띄지 않게 움직일지니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_DarkJusticiar
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 45282fff-6327-4915-9f86-47a1d7090d47
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_DarkJusticiar:45282fff-6327-4915-9f86-47a1d7090d47
msgctxt "h60af8a52g9369g42ebgad5dg33b1971978c6"
msgid ""
"Countless initiates walked these halls once, seeking to become Dark "
"Justiciars."
msgstr "다크 저스티시어가 되려고 수많은 수련생이 이 복도를 걸었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_DarkJusticiar
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = daf14de6-bf86-4a4c-a367-9199b85c01ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_DarkJusticiar:daf14de6-bf86-4a4c-a367-9199b85c01ff
msgctxt "he56fe9a2g184eg4576g9a0cg3f484ee0ddac"
msgid "I will follow in their path. I will succeed."
msgstr "그들의 전철을 밟겠어. 반드시 해내고 말 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_DontHaveGem
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5860a4b6-0604-4d82-adb3-40dd298a3e61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_DontHaveGem:5860a4b6-0604-4d82-adb3-40dd298a3e61
msgctxt "h7818225ag92e2g4123g8830ga8f93dd08f17"
msgid "Alas, I've nothing to fill it with."
msgstr "이런, 알맞는 부품이 없잖아."

