msgid "An empty notch. Time to find what fits it."
msgstr "비어 있는 홈이라. 알맞은 부품을 찾아야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_DontHaveGem
