msgid ""
"I need to reach the room behind the locked door without getting blown to "
"bits or spotted or... whatever else this place has in store."
msgstr "폭발하거나 발견되거나... 이 방에 있는 뭐던간에 피해서 잠긴 문 뒤에 있는 방에 도착해야해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_ObjectOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f984325c-68d5-4252-9c26-9854b5471b5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_SneakTrialHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_ObjectOfDarknessHint:f984325c-68d5-4252-9c26-9854b5471b5a
msgctxt "h3b11c955g7431g4280g8696g930c5caf7b8c"
msgid ""
"The book was quite clear. Navigate the maze, avoid traps, avoid detection. "
"Elementary, really."
msgstr "책의 지시는 명확하다. 미궁을 돌파하고 함정을 피하고 발견되지 말아라. 아주 기초적이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_ObjectOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f984325c-68d5-4252-9c26-9854b5471b5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_SneakTrialHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_ObjectOfDarknessHint:f984325c-68d5-4252-9c26-9854b5471b5a
msgctxt "h5f70b716g761bg479dg8346g4c0ce5fcf60b"
msgid ""
"It's like the book mentioned - get through the maze without being caught or "
"setting off a trap... easier said than done."
msgstr "책에 쓰여있는 대로야 - 들키거나 함정을 건드리지 말고 돌파해라... 말은 쉽지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_ObjectOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f984325c-68d5-4252-9c26-9854b5471b5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_SneakTrialHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_ObjectOfDarknessHint:f984325c-68d5-4252-9c26-9854b5471b5a
msgctxt "hfa2e4936g4a68g4fd4ga2d0g130e3c83549f"
msgid ""
"The book said to pass the maze without triggering a trap or getting caught. "
"Sounds easy enough."
msgstr "책에 따르면, 함정을 밟거나 들키지 않고 미로를 통과하라고 적혀 있어. 해 볼 만하겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_ObjectOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f984325c-68d5-4252-9c26-9854b5471b5a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_SneakTrialHint = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_ObjectOfDarknessHint:f984325c-68d5-4252-9c26-9854b5471b5a
msgctxt "ha870f0b0g623dg43f0gb08cgd16da53937eb"
msgid ""
"Like the book said - I've to get through this maze without getting caught or "
"triggering a trap. Simple... I hope."
msgstr "책에 나와 있듯, 함정을 밟거나 들키지 않고 미로를 통과해야 해. 별 것 아냐... 아마도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_ObjectOfDarknessPlaque
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 77bd3371-af8e-55e1-8504-2574e84f7b9b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_ObjectOfDarknessPlaque:77bd3371-af8e-55e1-8504-2574e84f7b9b
msgctxt "hc38b03a0gb420g4ec7gb7a1g4f48a6b2205b"
msgid "*Her Most Vaunted Treasure*"
msgstr "*그분의 가장 긍지 높은 보물*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessFirstWarning
#. Speaker = Shar
#. NodeID = 3bdf6e6d-afc2-4fee-bfc5-fa441f094a18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessFirstWarning:3bdf6e6d-afc2-4fee-bfc5-fa441f094a18
msgctxt "h9342f9ecg9a59g4005ga3cdg58a03347d05e"
msgid "Unfortunate. Fail twice more, and my embrace may elude you."
msgstr "안타깝구나. 두 번 더 실패하면, 내 포옹이 그대를 외면하리니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
msgctxt "h6408af35g47c5g4727g89a6g6a5004633bda"
msgid ""
"Ah, just like the book. I simply have to get across, remembering where the "
"platforms are."
msgstr "아, 책이랑 똑같네. 그냥 플랫폼이 어디 있는지 잘 기억하고 건너가기만 하면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
msgctxt "h3a858e5eg4a2ag41d8g8074gacb15c991c78"
msgid ""
"Seems I need to find the platforms by memory alone if I'm to cross unscathed."
msgstr "목적지까지 도달하려면 순전히 암기력에 의지해 발판을 찾아야겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
msgctxt "h0e1792f6gb54ag4b9cga967g241e8d4f9737"
msgid ""
"That book had it right. I just need to remember where the platforms are and "
"get across."
msgstr "책에 적혀 있던 대로야. 발판이 어디에 놓여 있는지 기억하고 건너가기만 하면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
msgctxt "hfdf391b0ga935g4a1ag8c5fg72c9a48a1d16"
msgid ""
"Step one: remember the platform locations. Step two: jump, just as the book "
"explained."
msgstr "첫째 : 발판의 장소를 기억하기. 둘째 : 책에 적혀있던 대로 점프하기."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
msgctxt "h4380b0b1ge8bbg4e92ga1degf76667de3764"
msgid ""
"I'll need to remember where each platform is if I'm to get across - like the "
"book described."
msgstr "발판이 어느 곳에 놓여 있는지 기억해야만 건너갈 수 있어. 책에 적혀 있던 대로야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
msgctxt "hdaddfd61g30fag4b42g9ce3g4d88cc64dd1e"
msgid ""
"So - memorise the platform locations and bound across. It was in a book, so "
"it <i>must</i> be true."
msgstr "그러니까, 플랫폼 위치를 잘 기억하고 건너 뛰어. 책에 적혀 있었으니까 <i>반드시</i>맞을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:14d01592-b300-48ea-b0e5-2f3bbe4a2ae6
msgctxt "h3c748fccge5d0g4b1cgb734gcc84a0ca5155"
msgid ""
"This must be what that book meant. I need to get across - and that means "
"remembering where these platforms are."
msgstr "책에 적혀 있던 내용이 맞았군. 무사히 건너가려면 발판이 어디쯤에 놓여 있는지 기억해 둘 필요가 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c6251ff-5dda-b7b5-113f-67137abb3544
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:6c6251ff-5dda-b7b5-113f-67137abb3544
msgctxt "he8c2f3e5gf6bcg4029g986cg23a5c55f1917"
msgid "I must remember where to step, and have faith that she will guide me."
msgstr "발 디딜 곳을 기억하고, 그분께서 이끌어 주시리라 믿어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90eb9e4e-068a-839b-e1fa-d6fe74c70440
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:90eb9e4e-068a-839b-e1fa-d6fe74c70440
msgctxt "h11c71bfegb3e1g4507g89c0gbf07675caade"
msgid "Ah, a puzzle. If only I knew the solution."
msgstr "아, 퍼즐이네. 해법을 알았으면 좋으련만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90eb9e4e-068a-839b-e1fa-d6fe74c70440
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:90eb9e4e-068a-839b-e1fa-d6fe74c70440
msgctxt "h8599617dge0fdg430eg86dcg12ebcdf9b765"
msgid "I'll admit it - I'm at a loss."
msgstr "인정할게. 나도 어떻게 할 지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90eb9e4e-068a-839b-e1fa-d6fe74c70440
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:90eb9e4e-068a-839b-e1fa-d6fe74c70440
msgctxt "h71d44a43g971eg4267g8fafg93151c9df08d"
msgid "This is breaking my brain. I need a hint."
msgstr "머리 깨지겠네. 어디 도움말 좀 없나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90eb9e4e-068a-839b-e1fa-d6fe74c70440
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:90eb9e4e-068a-839b-e1fa-d6fe74c70440
msgctxt "h165d2772gd4efg49c8g9835g9e06260f1a5e"
msgid "A puzzle of sorts. No match for superior wits, naturally."
msgstr "일종의 퍼즐이로군. 물론 우월한 지혜 앞에선 무용지물이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90eb9e4e-068a-839b-e1fa-d6fe74c70440
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:90eb9e4e-068a-839b-e1fa-d6fe74c70440
msgctxt "h9ad20d8age163g4007ga5dbg8ad7f9d71d4c"
msgid "Hm. I could really use an instruction book."
msgstr "흠. 사용 설명서가 간절히 필요한 듯한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 90eb9e4e-068a-839b-e1fa-d6fe74c70440
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Trials_Knows_PathOfDarknessHint = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:90eb9e4e-068a-839b-e1fa-d6fe74c70440
msgctxt "h410d09a2gfbe0g43ccg885dgc871e0b09d79"
msgid "I don't understand - what am I supposed to do?"
msgstr "이해하기 힘들군. 어떻게 풀어 가야 하지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c37000d5-6116-4e48-a955-14cfbb1f2483
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessHint:c37000d5-6116-4e48-a955-14cfbb1f2483
msgctxt "hf3b9b54ag2cf3g4f3fga96agc994885dc724"
msgid ""
"The Dark Justiciars were said to be sure of foot in even the darkest "
"recesses of Lady Shar's embrace. I must remember where to step, and have "
"faith that she will guide me."
msgstr ""
"다크 저스티시어는 샤 여신의 품 속만큼이나 어두운 곳에서도 길을 잃는 법이 없다고들 하지. 발 디딜 곳을 기억하고, 그분께서 이끌어 "
"주시리라 믿어야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessPlaque
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a59a699c-c263-29a6-f190-637806186796
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessPlaque:a59a699c-c263-29a6-f190-637806186796
msgctxt "h33255601g5e73g403dg8c82g2a0e5b457ab4"
msgid "*Her Most Sacred Path*"
msgstr "*그분의 가장 신성한 길*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessSecondWarning
#. Speaker = Shar
#. NodeID = 8cfda665-33eb-4a61-8bc4-a65821aded89
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_PathOfDarknessSecondWarning:8cfda665-33eb-4a61-8bc4-a65821aded89
msgctxt "h0ad84267ge50dg48ddgaca6gc68acc17dfbb"
msgid "Disappointing. Succeed or fail, the next attempt shall be the last."
msgstr "실망스럽구나. 성공하던 실패하던, 다음 기회가 마지막이 될 것이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_SpotGem
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e8c2e32-cef7-4ccc-b7ba-dcbeb1cc9fb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Disc_Altar_Knows_GemsRequired = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Trials_PAD_SpotGem_Event_FirstGemSeen(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_SpotGem:2e8c2e32-cef7-4ccc-b7ba-dcbeb1cc9fb5
msgctxt "ha5a01b5dgd199g4338gba7fge89806b2046a"
msgid "Is that a gem for the altar? Or just a pretty rock?"
msgstr "저게 제단에 놓을 보석인가? 아니면 그냥 예쁜 돌인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_SpotGem
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e8c2e32-cef7-4ccc-b7ba-dcbeb1cc9fb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Disc_Altar_Knows_GemsRequired = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Trials_PAD_SpotGem_Event_FirstGemSeen(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_SpotGem:2e8c2e32-cef7-4ccc-b7ba-dcbeb1cc9fb5
msgctxt "h8ddcc205g1fbeg4869ga66dgf321da5c1fff"
msgid "A fine gem. And a fine fit for the altar."
msgstr "훌륭한 보석이군. 그리고 제단에도 잘 맞겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_SpotGem
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2e8c2e32-cef7-4ccc-b7ba-dcbeb1cc9fb5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Disc_Altar_Knows_GemsRequired = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - SHA_Trials_PAD_SpotGem_Event_FirstGemSeen(0) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_SpotGem:2e8c2e32-cef7-4ccc-b7ba-dcbeb1cc9fb5
msgctxt "h318a1f05g6e15g4a12gb60dg5be3e7d4722a"
msgid "Better get my hands on that gem."
msgstr "그 보석을 손에 넣는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Shar/SHA_Trials_PAD_SpotGem
