msgctxt "hbcfdd39cg3485g480dg90b7g13e72fb6ef8c"
msgid "Well hello - the dust's disturbed here. Someone's been using this door."
msgstr "이것 좀 보게. 여기 먼지가 덜 얹혀있군. 누군가 이 문을 사용하는 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_AasimarSurvivor_PAD_DoorSpotted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ecdbd9ae-24af-4731-a691-0285a252144a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_AasimarSurvivor_PAD_DoorSpotted:ecdbd9ae-24af-4731-a691-0285a252144a
msgctxt "h03863b96g8be4g453dg85d9g290b9cee8a2d"
msgid ""
"There's significantly less dust on the leftmost door. Recently opened and "
"closed, I think."
msgstr "가장 왼쪽 문에 확연히 먼지가 적어. 최근에 사용된 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_AasimarSurvivor_PAD_DoorSpotted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ecdbd9ae-24af-4731-a691-0285a252144a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_AasimarSurvivor_PAD_DoorSpotted:ecdbd9ae-24af-4731-a691-0285a252144a
msgctxt "h20fe2958gb53ag4f78gba94g09dbe3febe9a"
msgid "Less dust on the left there. Someone's been through here."
msgstr "저기 왼쪽에 먼지가 덜 앉았군. 누군가 저기로 통과했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_AasimarSurvivor_PAD_DoorSpotted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ecdbd9ae-24af-4731-a691-0285a252144a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_AasimarSurvivor_PAD_DoorSpotted:ecdbd9ae-24af-4731-a691-0285a252144a
msgctxt "h739c8941gd921g4a12g824cga295893e5a3e"
msgid ""
"Handprints on the door there. Someone's been 'poking about', as these "
"Faerûnians say."
msgstr "문에 손자국이 남아있어. 누군가 ＇들쑤시고＇ 다녔군, 페이룬인 처럼 말하자면."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_AasimarSurvivor_PAD_DoorSpotted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ecdbd9ae-24af-4731-a691-0285a252144a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_AasimarSurvivor_PAD_DoorSpotted:ecdbd9ae-24af-4731-a691-0285a252144a
msgctxt "h9a05f03aga737g4a61g897cgb219d9e0f4b4"
msgid ""
"Dust is sparse on that door - looks like it's been in use more recently."
msgstr "저 문에 먼지가 옅군. 최근까지 사용된 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_AasimarSurvivor_PAD_DoorSpotted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ecdbd9ae-24af-4731-a691-0285a252144a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_AasimarSurvivor_PAD_DoorSpotted:ecdbd9ae-24af-4731-a691-0285a252144a
msgctxt "he70cb28cg4931g4e6ag88c8g7ec6f1aa844b"
