msgctxt "h27fb9586g12beg4de1gb85cg4ae2e5a3ae00"
msgid "That corpse there - Arabella's mother. At least, what remains of her."
msgstr "저 시체는, 아라벨라의 엄마야. 최소한 그녀의 일부야."

