msgid "Arabella's mother. I remember her, from the grove."
msgstr "아라벨라의 어머니야. 기억나, 숲에서 봤었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_PAD_FoundParents
