msgctxt "h6d4f456agc985g4f6dg9f5bg2428572d7c3f"
msgid "Wait - isn't he from the grove? He had the idol-stealing daughter..."
msgstr "잠깐, 숲에서 본 남자 아닌가? 우상 훔치려 했던 딸이 있는..."

