#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h3c2df68ag6c93g45edgb459gbac954a57af9"
msgid "So you send mum and pops <i>there</i>. I'll be waiting, hero-person!"
msgstr "엄마와 아빠를 <i>거기로</i> 보내주세요. 기다리고 있을께요, 나의 영웅!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 78bff99a-4a8a-f2f4-f9be-f743e6ca42f0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_10 = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellaPowers_Event_ShadowsAppear = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:78bff99a-4a8a-f2f4-f9be-f743e6ca42f0
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h0bacd187g7badg43b9g94efg2bf9db311594"
msgid "Hey - I know you! You're -"
msgstr "저기요! 그 쪽이 누군지 알아요! 이름이..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7c05ae25-1675-0405-bac6-8e84b6658dd7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedAboutPowers(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedToLearn(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:7c05ae25-1675-0405-bac6-8e84b6658dd7
msgctxt "h17e3e1ebg9384g41ffgba69g46548d6e564c"
msgid "How about you teach me those powers of yours?"
msgstr "네 그 힘 말이야, 나한테 가르쳐 주는 건 어때?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 7f684a7e-ea03-a7f5-2292-15f861965f22
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellaPowers_State_StayedAtTown = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:7f684a7e-ea03-a7f5-2292-15f861965f22
msgctxt "ha2b99428g8865g4b8ag9f1fg6df40f4fe184"
msgid "I <i>have</i> a family. And if you won't find them, I will!"
msgstr "나한텐 가족이 <i>있어요</i> . 당신이 찾아주지 않겠다면 내가 하겠어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7fe351d4-0e94-9f45-270c-ebb6e2df6796
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedAboutPowers(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - WIZARD(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedAboutPowers(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:7fe351d4-0e94-9f45-270c-ebb6e2df6796
msgctxt "hfb8f95c2g81cdg4800g812ag4fa8c9051ef5"
msgid ""
"You need to take care with wild magic. You could end up hurting yourself."
msgstr "야생 마법을 사용할 때는 조심해야 한다. 스스로를 다치게 할 수도 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 80414d10-126b-4aab-fb2f-6ef97d104eab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_State_BothParentsDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:80414d10-126b-4aab-fb2f-6ef97d104eab
msgctxt "ha8513f36g4c74g462dg8935gf3bfe053aaee"
msgid "Forget the search. Your parents are dead."
msgstr "찾는 건 이제 포기하렴. 네 부모님들은 돌아가셨어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 806e7fa9-fedb-fdc8-5fb8-3dd2067ca77a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellaPowers_State_MovedToCamp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:806e7fa9-fedb-fdc8-5fb8-3dd2067ca77a
msgctxt "he826d2e1g9bbeg4a57gb029ge681d2f7b73d"
msgid "Camp, huh? Guess I'll see you when I see you."
msgstr "야영지랬죠? 거기서 보겠네요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 85abd7b8-8f6d-07da-ae59-d0f44ee7b73a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:85abd7b8-8f6d-07da-ae59-d0f44ee7b73a
msgctxt "ha6181c0cga774g44e8g87a2gdd88cc5609f7"
msgid "She's going to get herself killed out here, powers or not."
msgstr "저 애는 여기서 죽게 될 거야. 힘이 있든지 없든지 간에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 86a101bc-dbcd-6c99-0579-3df578849d5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellaPowers_State_StayedAtTown = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:86a101bc-dbcd-6c99-0579-3df578849d5f
msgctxt "h4063bf01g121cg49b4g8cecgfd4d5b9444cc"
msgid "To the hells with your camp, and to the hells with you."
msgstr "당신 야영지는 지옥에나 떨어지라 그래. 당신도 지옥에나 떨어져."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 87ef6fdc-b5e3-5e11-5a60-131d9135b070
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_State_ParentsFoundDead = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:87ef6fdc-b5e3-5e11-5a60-131d9135b070
msgctxt "h651d55a6g3847g4eb7gbe66g91887fcb2a22"
msgid "Your parents are test-fodder stuffed full of needles, little orphan."
msgstr "네 부모는 이제 속이 바늘로 가득 찬 실험체일 뿐이다, 고아 꼬맹아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 88821e06-2bce-bf3d-38e4-5f0c06570066
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:88821e06-2bce-bf3d-38e4-5f0c06570066
msgctxt "hf841ab3fge452g4698gb366gf017ec819b91"
msgid ""
"That was rather inhospitable. She could well die out there, we should go "
"after her."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8b5b4c0a-1d80-6414-5e38-9925d8c059a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:8b5b4c0a-1d80-6414-5e38-9925d8c059a4
msgctxt "h3d12e0b0g34b2g4a8egb4e0g3638a614c22a"
msgid "It doesn't matter what you do - you'll end up dead like them, out here."
msgstr "그런 건 하나도 중요하지 않아. 너도 네 부모처럼 여기서 죽게 될 테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 8f248cab-e5f9-0713-f6ae-e0a8af414b72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_10 = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:8f248cab-e5f9-0713-f6ae-e0a8af414b72
msgctxt "h8bb1bedcg8fcag4b60ga1b5g52f77d62d39b"
msgid "I don't see any - wait. Here they come!"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 91982479-60b9-e0c3-4c18-6d9a35b41d00
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:91982479-60b9-e0c3-4c18-6d9a35b41d00
msgctxt "h7dc52b3fgaeedg48a7gb0cegbbf698d8c218"
msgid "New... family? But I don't want..."
msgstr "새... 가족이요? 하지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 926fb4bd-89c6-ffb1-1669-d16e3110303d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:926fb4bd-89c6-ffb1-1669-d16e3110303d
msgctxt "ha411b48dgb329g4212g83f8g3d292f5bc028"
msgid "I got powers. But pulling coins from the sky ain't one."
msgstr "나한텐 힘이 있어요. 하지만 하늘에서 동전을 끌어내는 힘은 아니에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 98403cb0-9b41-284a-9c5c-9b877d156b2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingLeader_State_PermaDefeated = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_FindZevlor_Knows_MissingArabella = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:98403cb0-9b41-284a-9c5c-9b877d156b2a
msgctxt "he79dab64gc18ag4192g97dfgcd8739401894"
msgid "I was looking. For mum and pops. When Zevlor - when he -"
msgstr "엄마랑 아빠를 찾고 있어요. 제블로어가... 그때..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 9a1ba630-9dcc-0feb-3624-33d4368e453d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellaPowers_State_StayedAtTown = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:9a1ba630-9dcc-0feb-3624-33d4368e453d
msgctxt "he85bbfd7g2422g480aga6f0ga7d2546109e9"
msgid "You're worse than all the nasties in this blighted place."
msgstr "당신은 이 폐허의 모든 괴물보다도 끔찍해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9a6719b9-073e-1112-243c-06570c6f1738
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:9a6719b9-073e-1112-243c-06570c6f1738
msgctxt "h62bd0472g6eddg4d51g815bg602adbc994d5"
msgid "Forget it. No kids in my camp."
msgstr "관둬. 내 야영지에 어린애는 못 들어와."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9ae6c593-4563-48f7-9217-801b4c2d7ef9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:9ae6c593-4563-48f7-9217-801b4c2d7ef9
msgctxt "h9ca3d9dcg5044g4132gb7cdgcdbceb55f220"
msgid "*The girl's mind is closed to you.*"
msgstr "*아이의 마음은 당신에게 닫혀있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 9c4ad89b-93b6-4cec-d912-f4526649e1ca
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:9c4ad89b-93b6-4cec-d912-f4526649e1ca
msgctxt "had2a1664gca71g4d67ga521g3f2be6c164de"
msgid "I'm not sure I like her chances out here, even if she does have powers."
msgstr "저 애가 힘을 갖고 있다고는 하지만, 여기서 살아남을 수 있을지 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = 9ee72841-7872-a882-3256-a6e772bd5e59
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:9ee72841-7872-a882-3256-a6e772bd5e59
msgctxt "h461a8db7gcc15g487ag84e1g34483cbdc49f"
msgid "I mean, I'm sure you think that. But you ain't seen what I seen."
msgstr "제 말은, 물론 절 그들에게 맡기고 싶으시겠죠. 하지만 제가 본 걸 못 보셨잖아요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a3d83ea6-2a1e-de99-58e9-4d56d94876fc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:a3d83ea6-2a1e-de99-58e9-4d56d94876fc
msgctxt "h20ee0726gbd64g4725g8dd8g06043962fce7"
msgid "Do what you want. I'm not stopping you."
msgstr "원하는 대로 해. 난 안 막는다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = a87cba2d-9d01-7351-4369-36e4b6123c73
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:a87cba2d-9d01-7351-4369-36e4b6123c73
msgctxt "h024fa8aag9885g4d31gb292g07d73490b000"
msgid "Take me in. I won't make a peep - cross my heart, hope to die."
msgstr "저 좀 껴줘요. 찍소리도 내지 않을게요. 목숨을 걸고 맹세해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = ab56a49e-9235-c890-a49f-22fa42b5747d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:ab56a49e-9235-c890-a49f-22fa42b5747d
msgctxt "h6a72aba7ga2f8g4a2eg9838g84e957f7c914"
msgid "I don't want to forget about them... I can't."
msgstr "엄마 아빠를 잊어버리고 싶지 않아요... 못해요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = ae9cfc14-9c68-ad14-2f88-6902800003b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:ae9cfc14-9c68-ad14-2f88-6902800003b8
msgctxt "h0d996f79gb47fg4fc0gbac4ga9c1c0e93709"
msgid "Is that... the kid Kagha went after? Seems she's learned a new trick."
msgstr "저건... 카그하가 벌주려 했던 아이인가? 새로운 재주를 익힌 모양인데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = aef04508-76c4-ff01-9d63-7e0fbbbacc0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:aef04508-76c4-ff01-9d63-7e0fbbbacc0f
msgctxt "h3a07e89eg4990g4692g943dg96705e712d30"
msgid ""
"I'll prove it. Let me help in the camp, til you bring mom and pops back to "
"me."
msgstr "증명해 보일게요. 야영지에서 잡일을 돕게 해 줘요. 엄마랑 아빠를 찾아주기 전까지만요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = b0bbf92f-fde6-cf52-bdd4-0cb602ebf6b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_TieflingLeader_State_PermaDefeated = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - COL_FindZevlor_Knows_MissingArabella = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:b0bbf92f-fde6-cf52-bdd4-0cb602ebf6b1
msgctxt "h3824c18cgd0a5g4512gbc02g321a81226e88"
msgid "We followed Zevlor out here. Then he - he -"
msgstr "우린 제블로어를 따라왔어요. 그랬는데... 제블로어가..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = b14d2a4e-f344-1757-0036-a149a307b8fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:b14d2a4e-f344-1757-0036-a149a307b8fa
msgctxt "hc610ef7dgb923g45aag9881g58974eb3c62e"
msgid ""
"Fierce kid. Doubt she'll survive the shadows, but I hope she'll surprise us."
msgstr "맹렬한 꼬마야. 그림자 속에서 살아남을 것 같진 않지만, 우릴 놀래 줬으면 좋겠는걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = b2dbc4f8-1400-6bf9-2c7c-ed8bd9473e0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:b2dbc4f8-1400-6bf9-2c7c-ed8bd9473e0f
msgctxt "he176aefdgf071g4daegac99gf542ff0a0144"
msgid "P-pops... I -"
msgstr "아, 아빠... 나..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = b32ecf03-3b56-34dc-32a9-52ac59c27825
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellaPowers_State_MovedToCamp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:b32ecf03-3b56-34dc-32a9-52ac59c27825
msgctxt "h9d3dce3dg82efg4e45gba75gd52fe817902b"
msgid "...just don't leave me."
msgstr "...그냥 떠나지 말아줘요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = b68bb372-a618-109d-8e2d-e505d1a5e269
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:b68bb372-a618-109d-8e2d-e505d1a5e269
msgctxt "hc2232171g0026g4deeg92d9g94d6efb42d0a"
msgid "No way."
msgstr "절대 안 돼요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b8187f01-ba88-51b5-9493-86df45fd7227
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedAboutPowers(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:b8187f01-ba88-51b5-9493-86df45fd7227
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h9b3bf803g3dddg4793g982ag6a4e54afb9c6"
msgid ""
"Normally tales of stolen artefacts are tragedies - I'm glad you've bucked "
"that trend."
msgstr "대부분 도둑맞은 유물에 관한 노래는 비극으로 끝나는데, 넌 아닌 것 같아서 다행이구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = bb2438b9-ef8b-05d5-b8c9-3aa111753adb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:bb2438b9-ef8b-05d5-b8c9-3aa111753adb
msgctxt "hfc991141gabfeg4a85gb71fg59332bdd31a3"
msgid "No one - I learnt it all on my own! Well... I had a <i>little</i> help."
msgstr "누구한테 배운 건 아니에요, 저 혼자 익혔어요! 뭐... <i>작은</i> 도움을 받긴 했지만요. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = bd458ac1-c441-88b2-3fb5-4ad4e7bdd29e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellaPowers_Event_ShadowsTwisted = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:bd458ac1-c441-88b2-3fb5-4ad4e7bdd29e
msgctxt "hd94c7744g2904g4ec3g860dgf498b7c3bd34"
msgid "<i>Twist'em up!</i>"
msgstr "<i>휘감아버려라!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = bde2352a-0ce5-f75f-d9bb-da50358f2348
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:bde2352a-0ce5-f75f-d9bb-da50358f2348
msgctxt "hfd9a1930g5212g475dgbb3bgdd525b1380e1"
msgid "Damn it - new powers or not, the kid's going to get herself killed."
msgstr "젠장, 새로운 힘이 있건 없건 저 아이는 죽고 말 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be1938ce-6611-26f4-bd3e-f47bc0bf4e1a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:be1938ce-6611-26f4-bd3e-f47bc0bf4e1a
msgctxt "h411dbca0g5850g4a56gba4eg53af7078ead8"
msgid "I'll find your parents - you can count on me."
msgstr "내가 부모님을 찾아올게. 믿어도 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = be4e82b6-22d9-6966-1866-e165d4f3c3b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - HAV_AlfiraTale_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - HAV_EnteringHaven_State_GainedAccess = True
#.      - HAV_Area_State_BarrierIsOff = False
#.      - HAV_Mood_State_Siege = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:be4e82b6-22d9-6966-1866-e165d4f3c3b8
msgctxt "hffdd4259ga28fg42e0gb158gee398015f512"
msgid "There's an inn called Last Light. You'll be safe there."
msgstr "최후의 빛이라는 여관이 있어. 거기로 가면 안전할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c3570414-0138-810a-423e-682135803407
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:c3570414-0138-810a-423e-682135803407
msgctxt "h6a195ae9gf630g47d8gb23bg2b2768d2b03b"
msgid ""
"They're gone, Arabella - but you have a new family now. Come to my camp."
msgstr "그분들은 돌아가셨어, 아라벨라. 하지만 너에겐 이제 새로운 가족이 있단다. 내 야영지에 오렴."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c4453310-bcf4-6b72-1ac6-665f2e26cebe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:c4453310-bcf4-6b72-1ac6-665f2e26cebe
msgctxt "h55997071g8f54g4434g9682g8e21834da6b7"
msgid ""
"Their bodies <i>fester</i>, pumped full enough of quack serums, swelling "
"organs ready to burst."
msgstr "시체가 <i>곪아 터졌더라.</i> 돌팔이 놈 혈청으로 가득 채워진 내장이 부풀어서 폭발 직전이던데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = c4a86463-bea7-baf6-dc40-64750d02294a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:c4a86463-bea7-baf6-dc40-64750d02294a
msgctxt "hcd4f464cg4c46g4680g894cgba7bf507076c"
msgid "Sorry. Knocks the wind right out of me."
msgstr "미안해요. 깜짝 놀라는 바람에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = c540cdfe-2127-7230-f4f1-c2e17a35c1ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:c540cdfe-2127-7230-f4f1-c2e17a35c1ba
msgctxt "hdc952fa3g655bg432dg85e2g2ed4c3999cea"
msgid "Tragedies? Them's the sad ones, right? I hope not."
msgstr "비극이요? 슬픈 이야기 맞죠? 아니길 바라요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = c9d9dc86-3b56-6900-f209-0d9ccc544fc6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:c9d9dc86-3b56-6900-f209-0d9ccc544fc6
msgctxt "h41167a80ge646g4f5ag92fag1fc8fc5e7777"
msgid "Aw, thanks - you're the best."
msgstr "휴, 고마워요. 당신이 최고에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d2a25a23-990e-f8d7-85ee-abe532edcc9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedAboutPowers(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedAboutPowers(1) = True
#. TagRule: BARD
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:d2a25a23-990e-f8d7-85ee-abe532edcc9a
msgctxt "hc521313eg93b6g49abg9efcg042f71076967"
msgid ""
"Quite the powerful spell - bet there's a great story behind you learning it."
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d2a25a23-990e-f8d7-85ee-abe532edcc9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedAboutPowers(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedAboutPowers(1) = True
#. TagRule: WARLOCK
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:d2a25a23-990e-f8d7-85ee-abe532edcc9a
msgctxt "hd4820542g9500g4851ga924gc1cc077f88de"
msgid "Magic that strong usually isn't free, child. Where did you acquire it?"
msgstr "그렇게 강력한 마법은 보통 거저 주어지는 게 아니란다, 얘야. 어디서 얻었니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d2a25a23-990e-f8d7-85ee-abe532edcc9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedAboutPowers(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedAboutPowers(1) = True
#. TagRule: SORCERER
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:d2a25a23-990e-f8d7-85ee-abe532edcc9a
msgctxt "h2e0d0b21gb283g4bddg81a8g5f9a824e9daf"
msgid "Powerful sorcery for a child. How did you come by it?"
msgstr "어린아이치곤 강력한 주문인데. 어떻게 배우게 된 거니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d2a25a23-990e-f8d7-85ee-abe532edcc9a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedAboutPowers(1) = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedAboutPowers(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:d2a25a23-990e-f8d7-85ee-abe532edcc9a
msgctxt "h3ca667c3gb6dcg4654g8090g0cb0fb04f482"
msgid "That's a powerful spell. Where did you learn to do that?"
msgstr "강력한 주문인걸. 어디서 배운 거니?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = d70bfeac-448b-1a26-b764-c2cd94cc4455
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellasPowers_State_AgreedToHelp = True
#. TagRule: MALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:d70bfeac-448b-1a26-b764-c2cd94cc4455
msgctxt "hfb514551gb127g4484g88a7gf14a46567f55"
msgid "Thanks, mister. I <i>knew</i> you'd help me again!"
msgstr "고마워요, 아저씨. 다시 한 번 도와주실 줄 <i>알았어요</i>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = d70bfeac-448b-1a26-b764-c2cd94cc4455
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellasPowers_State_AgreedToHelp = True
#. TagRule: FEMALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:d70bfeac-448b-1a26-b764-c2cd94cc4455
msgctxt "h6d1bc0b7g2130g41b2gaef5g4a73ee71f2c2"
msgid "Thanks, miss. I <i>knew</i> you'd help me again!"
msgstr "고마워요, 언니. 다시 한 번 도와주실 줄 <i>알았어요</i>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = d70bfeac-448b-1a26-b764-c2cd94cc4455
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellasPowers_State_AgreedToHelp = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:d70bfeac-448b-1a26-b764-c2cd94cc4455
msgctxt "h5403ce7eged40g4d1bg8423g6b087767ffa2"
msgid "Thanks so much. I <i>knew</i> you'd help me again!"
msgstr "진짜 고마워요. 다시 한 번 도와주실 줄 <i>알았어요</i>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = d8dc75dd-8665-233d-2913-f425cc6fa997
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:d8dc75dd-8665-233d-2913-f425cc6fa997
msgctxt "h3e6d56c0gf505g4701gb812g95c53493aa22"
msgid ""
"Okay. I promise to be <i>really</i> good with practising - but only if you "
"look for my mum and pops. Deal?"
msgstr "좋아요. <i>진짜로</i> 연습 열심히 한다고 약속할게요. 우리 엄마랑 아빠를 찾아준다면요. 어때요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = d9778f78-7515-aee5-2971-e8744b14679b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:d9778f78-7515-aee5-2971-e8744b14679b
msgctxt "hd1cd018aga4abg4b0bgbcb6gf159a3425fba"
msgid "Fine. Whatever. I don't need you - I'll find them myself!"
msgstr "좋아요. 뭐 어때요. 당신 도움은 필요 없어요, 내가 찾을 거니까!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = db1a808d-e224-d53d-be89-b3e97fdca551
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:db1a808d-e224-d53d-be89-b3e97fdca551
msgctxt "h80f5ad4cg802ag457aga6a7ge7467af302f6"
msgid "But -"
msgstr "하지만..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dbdd957a-58e0-df2e-61f7-9870b7068969
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_Event_AskedAboutPowers(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:dbdd957a-58e0-df2e-61f7-9870b7068969
msgctxt "h87b79231gff7bg4e39g8386g5b0b9c41f7bf"
msgid ""
"Nature's magic only grows stronger with age, little one. Learn to control it "
"now, while you still can."
msgstr "자연의 마법은 시간이 갈수록 강력해질 거란다, 꼬마야. 아직 가능할 때 그 마법을 통제하는 법을 배워 놔야 해. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = ddb383c9-406a-cb71-5a54-20987f3622d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:ddb383c9-406a-cb71-5a54-20987f3622d0
msgctxt "h8aa65586ga933g40degba65g9734adc21d6a"
msgid ""
"I don't know how. I'd kill 'em all if I could. I - I just want my mum and "
"pops."
msgstr "어떻게 하는지 몰라요. 할 수 있었다면 죽였을 거예요. 나... 난 그냥 엄마랑 아빠를 찾고 싶어요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = e8d00929-d9f7-bc5d-271e-af3de08dbbe5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:e8d00929-d9f7-bc5d-271e-af3de08dbbe5
msgctxt "hc1902b0ag8c0fg42cbgad08g67ac975023ee"
msgid "W-w-waah..."
msgstr "으아앙..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = e8d398fe-b198-3fc3-f55b-a8052517acb7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:e8d398fe-b198-3fc3-f55b-a8052517acb7
msgctxt "hd11d66c1ge7ceg4776gab96g5b787ac0998f"
msgid ""
"That druid idol I took? It changed me. I can do all sorts of stuff now, not "
"just the vines."
msgstr "제가 훔쳤던 드루이드 우상 기억해요? 그게 저를 바꿔놓았어요. 저는 덩굴 말고도 온갖 것들을 할 수 있다고요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = e9c36d32-e0a4-331d-62e0-1bff21984ec5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:e9c36d32-e0a4-331d-62e0-1bff21984ec5
msgctxt "h04c6e78eg4d0dg488cg9768g6c0a7f26b7d6"
msgid "Just 'til you find mum and pops. I won't be any trouble, I swear it!"
msgstr "엄마랑 아빠를 찾아주기 전까지만요. 절대 말썽 안 피울게요, 맹세해요!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = ea58a46a-59d9-969c-9449-dd065fb5f5fa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellaPowers_State_StayedAtTown = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:ea58a46a-59d9-969c-9449-dd065fb5f5fa
msgctxt "h25bd3882g78a9g4c35g8b70gcc8a0a3a85cd"
msgid ""
"I mean, damn right I can! I don't need you. I'll do it myself. <i>Hmph!</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = ea9ac89b-7637-0889-0e61-696300f99b2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:ea9ac89b-7637-0889-0e61-696300f99b2b
msgctxt "hbfad470ag489eg4684g9f2fg29ad4fb54f8d"
msgid "If I get strong enough, I won't have to run next time... Hmm."
msgstr "제가 충분히 강해지면, 다음에는 도망칠 필요가 없겠네요... 흠."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = eadfdcb4-b629-ee04-2a6a-9eacbadf5936
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:eadfdcb4-b629-ee04-2a6a-9eacbadf5936
msgctxt "h1cc02797gae9cg4348g84b3ga654ff78c561"
msgid "But not 'til you get my mum and pops back."
msgstr "하지만 엄마랑 아빠를 찾아오기 전까진 안 돼요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = eb58de77-d729-753d-a325-e366ce031c5d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:eb58de77-d729-753d-a325-e366ce031c5d
msgctxt "h1fd511f7gd78dg4918g8957gc67afb030439"
msgid ""
"*You remember this girl - Arabella, from the druids' grove, the thief Kagha "
"tried to punish.*"
msgstr "*당신은 이 여자아이를 기억합니다. 드루이드 숲에서 만났던 아라벨라, 카그하가 처벌하려 했던 도둑이었죠.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ebd32ab9-095b-512f-e4b7-8fd536a197dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(8) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(8) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:ebd32ab9-095b-512f-e4b7-8fd536a197dd
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "hfb1abe59g2720g40d4ga42cgdd70dde6a672"
msgid ""
"Wait, that's Arabella, is it not? Looks like she's got some new Weave up her "
"sleeve."
msgstr "잠깐. 아라벨라, 맞지? 못 본 사이에 위브로 소매 걷는 법 좀 배웠나 본데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = ecb2b0f9-2022-fae2-d6af-72dec77a9803
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:ecb2b0f9-2022-fae2-d6af-72dec77a9803
msgctxt "h267a710bg52cbg4b1agb001g4019f5499c83"
msgid "Then what... what is even left for me to do?"
msgstr "그럼... 그럼 난 이제 뭘 해야 하는데요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ed9424e4-35ea-b957-2c1a-fba2a7edf42f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:ed9424e4-35ea-b957-2c1a-fba2a7edf42f
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h7158e004g31cag49f9ga15cg0b95a994f1c1"
msgid "Live, grow up, and make your path anew by my side."
msgstr "살아남아서, 어른이 되는 거야. 그리고 내 곁에서 새로운 길을 걷는 거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = ef94c47e-bab5-2c4e-62af-f53e6b74d960
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_ArabellaPowers_State_StayedAtTown = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:ef94c47e-bab5-2c4e-62af-f53e6b74d960
msgctxt "h31497390gb3fcg4adega86cgd609b1102a81"
msgid ""
"Whatever - who needs your lousy camp? I got powers. All I need is <i>me.</i>"
msgstr "됐어요. 누가 당신의 거지 같은 야영지가 필요하댔어요? 난 힘이 있다고요. 내가 필요한 건 <i>나 자신</i>뿐이에요."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = efb98aa8-a7ae-4046-7582-5dab28b8fe3b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_ArabellasPowers_State_ParentsFoundDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:efb98aa8-a7ae-4046-7582-5dab28b8fe3b
msgctxt "h3ace6a79gf28eg4ca5g9bc1gdddb1c065e00"
msgid "Your parents are dead, sorry to say."
msgstr "네 부모님은 돌아가셨어. 미안하구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = f08bc0d9-ad44-6f28-eef6-c0b92950d7e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
