#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h0807ada2gab4dg4879g85a0gdd946f7a35ae"
msgid ""
"Stubborn little tyke! Even if she can swing a spell or two, she's going to "
"get herself killed out here."
msgstr "고집 센 말썽꾸러기 같으니! 저 애가 한두 가지 주문을 쓸 수 있다고 하더라도, 곧 죽게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Arabella
#. NodeID = fcb84237-e4d2-43d0-23f9-d299dae6043f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:fcb84237-e4d2-43d0-23f9-d299dae6043f
msgctxt "ha85e20b7g747cg44c4g8551g2592dc78fc7a"
msgid "Please, I'm not -"
msgstr "제발요, 난..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = fd1806cb-960d-275b-6f65-5131a67c93a3
