#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_TownIntroduction:fe1dde83-b3ad-bbdc-5309-4b7f7be617c9
msgctxt "hb5d65a72g2ab8g4701g9c55g4a8e208a6d43"
msgid "There's an inn called Last Light. Alfira's there - you'll be safe."
msgstr "최후의 빛이라는 여관이 있어. 알피라도 거기에 있지. 너도 거기서 안전할 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_ZombieArabella_Dead
