msgctxt "h07cab919g7781g45f7g97f2gdd1791c3096c"
msgid "Tsk. I really hoped it wouldn't come to this. Poor thing."
msgstr "쯧... 정말 이렇게 되지 않기를 바랐는데. 불쌍한 것."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ArabellasPowers_ZombieArabella_Dead
