msgctxt "h608f5e71gfe5ag413bga467g93c9f03f67f8"
msgid ""
"*Long-dead warriors, clad in dark cloaks and fearsome armour. For what cause "
"did they perish?*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_AD_Justiciar
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 09b03682-ec9e-4029-9373-399f1e430e3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[1]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_AD_Justiciar:09b03682-ec9e-4029-9373-399f1e430e3a
msgctxt "h007bfb38g6f46g4d7cg884ege5ddfb126a18"
msgid ""
"*Hard to believe that such formidable warriors could have fallen - and to "
"whom?*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_AD_Justiciar
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 09b03682-ec9e-4029-9373-399f1e430e3a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[2]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_AD_Justiciar:09b03682-ec9e-4029-9373-399f1e430e3a
msgctxt "h334b8490g6969g40adgbad8g36516f44fe8e"
msgid ""
"*There is a darkness to these warriors that endures even now, long after "
"their lives were spent. But who did they serve?*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_AD_Justiciar
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 266bfe46-9ed3-4eb7-9f3a-810ac6cbf7ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_SCL_Ketheric_State_PlayerKnowsKethericHistory = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_AD_Justiciar:266bfe46-9ed3-4eb7-9f3a-810ac6cbf7ee
msgctxt "h21982d8bg2bfbg4610g9f33g620e214f2616"
msgid ""
"*Dark Justiciars, who fell long ago in service of Shar, and Ketheric Thorm.*"
msgstr "*다크 저스티시어, 샤와 케서릭 쏨을 섬기며 싸웠던 이들의 시체입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_PAD_EnteredSanctuary
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ad4b496-33c7-4ee7-8493-36533fa9fe16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_PAD_EnteredSanctuary:2ad4b496-33c7-4ee7-8493-36533fa9fe16
msgctxt "hdd057095g7ce5g4f10g85b7ga462d88d5b5a"
msgid "I feel lighter - like the curse just evaporated. What is this place?"
msgstr "몸이 한결 가볍군. 저주가 말끔히 사라진 느낌이야. 여긴 뭐하는 곳이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_PAD_EnteredSanctuary
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ad4b496-33c7-4ee7-8493-36533fa9fe16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
