msgctxt "h08952358gcd23g4421g9557g50e419f80d6a"
msgid "Strange - I can't feel the shadow curse down here. What is this place?"
msgstr "이상하네, 이 아래에선 그림자 저주가 느껴지지 않아. 여긴 대체 어디지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_PAD_EnteredSanctuary
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ad4b496-33c7-4ee7-8493-36533fa9fe16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_PAD_EnteredSanctuary:2ad4b496-33c7-4ee7-8493-36533fa9fe16
msgctxt "h2993a4f9g944bg473cgaf20gc0dd00487af9"
msgid "Not even a whiff of curse in here. It's nice to breathe easy."
msgstr "저주의 기운이 전혀 안 느껴져. 편히 숨 쉴 수 있어서 좋네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_PAD_EnteredSanctuary
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2ad4b496-33c7-4ee7-8493-36533fa9fe16
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_PAD_EnteredSanctuary:2ad4b496-33c7-4ee7-8493-36533fa9fe16
msgctxt "h9aeec250gad5dg4a68g8b84g3d63eea360e3"
msgid "The curse has no effect here - what is this place?"
msgstr "저주의 영향이 전혀 없어. 여긴 대체 뭐하는 곳이지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_CentralSquare_PAD_ExitLocked
