msgid "How do the Thorms sustain the shadows?"
msgstr "케서릭이 어떻게 그림자를 유지할 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 070a94dc-4198-46b8-b359-52b11fc7130e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:070a94dc-4198-46b8-b359-52b11fc7130e
msgctxt "h2c6b2758g0bbeg4db9gb03fg4181139617db"
msgid ""
"This guy looks like he had a long, long, <i>long </i>night. Might be best to "
"keep him happy for now."
msgstr "이 남자 아주 길고 긴, <i>기나긴</i> 밤을 보내고 있는 거 같네. 지금은 즐겁게 해주는 게 최선일지도 모르겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 072c7336-165c-c6a2-a15f-c01de8805a2c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_Bottomless_SpiderQueen_State_PermaDefeated = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:072c7336-165c-c6a2-a15f-c01de8805a2c
msgctxt "h25a9d5d2g34f6g438bga47ag3f4e1affb6e9"
msgid "I challenged a daunting phase spider. Its corpse is all that remains."
msgstr "무시무시한 위상 거미와 맞서 싸웠지. 이젠 시체밖에 안 남았지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 07a1acc6-6b76-8096-a8a3-9a3f8da1d4c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:07a1acc6-6b76-8096-a8a3-9a3f8da1d4c4
msgctxt "hfe541747ge639g4760gb6e6gbcd5f56ba478"
msgid ""
"No, must <b>not</b>, can <b>not</b>, will <b>not</b> mention <b>her</b>."
msgstr ""
"싫어, 그래선 <b>안 돼</b>. 해서는 <b>안 돼</b>. 앞으로도 <b>안 돼</b>. <b>그녀</b>에 대해 말하는 거."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 081cfbf7-8ae3-e14b-abcd-bc1ca7acab19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_Brewer_Event_MentionedKetheric(1) = True
#.      - TWN_Brewer_Event_AskedCurse(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:081cfbf7-8ae3-e14b-abcd-bc1ca7acab19
msgctxt "h818d417bg22e5g4b9dg9292gf066d72bb775"
msgid "Silence, quiet, <b>hushhhh</b>. Just drink."
msgstr "침묵, 조용, <b>쉬이이잇</b>. 그냥 마셔라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 09f1dcba-b386-c140-4d1f-626f3fe08b79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_Owlbear_State_PermaDefeated = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:09f1dcba-b386-c140-4d1f-626f3fe08b79
msgctxt "h7855fde0g127dg44e5g9544g560971132c85"
msgid "An owlbear mother lunged at me. I slaughtered it in reply."
msgstr "한번은 내게 아울베어 어미가 달려들었지. 나는 그 대답으로 도륙내줬다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b38c14e-477b-6c0d-fc8f-00ba92d7e30c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Templar_State_Defeated = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:0b38c14e-477b-6c0d-fc8f-00ba92d7e30c
msgctxt "hea42a2cdgdef7g4012gb46egce6deea6072b"
msgid ""
"I bested an inquisitor - the vaunted champion of my own Queen, Vlaakith."
msgstr "블라키스 여왕님의 자랑스러운 챔피언인 심문관을 무찔렀었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0b38c14e-477b-6c0d-fc8f-00ba92d7e30c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Templar_State_Defeated = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:0b38c14e-477b-6c0d-fc8f-00ba92d7e30c
msgctxt "he4e7ac9eg7233g4607gb6f6g687ea7b494fe"
msgid ""
"I bested an inquisitor - a dreaded champion of the Lich Queen, Vlaakith."
msgstr "리치 여왕 블라키스의 두려운 챔피언인 심문관을 무찔렀었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0ba8ca10-9d74-5d0b-b11b-22c9e48e39cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:0ba8ca10-9d74-5d0b-b11b-22c9e48e39cb
msgctxt "h4812eda3g58afg4aaagb383gca8187a41523"
msgid "I gazed upon all Faerûn from the four peaks of the Spine of the World."
msgstr "세상의 등뼈의 네 꼭대기에 올라 페이룬 전역을 내려다 봤었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0cf78dae-738e-cd70-0e01-2e8ad8933198
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:0cf78dae-738e-cd70-0e01-2e8ad8933198
msgctxt "h9c5bd0b2g5f38g4252g8213geaf489a91c67"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 0d1a8500-d420-3749-1610-22e870e6e357
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:0d1a8500-d420-3749-1610-22e870e6e357
msgctxt "h2e7aadd7g6887g4855gbc7bge382bc75e872"
msgid "I walked the corpse of a dead god in the timeless Astral Plane."
msgstr "시간이 흐르지 않는 아스트랄 차원에서 죽은 신의 시체 위를 걸었었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 0d2ed7b0-8524-e21d-d423-452184222638
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:0d2ed7b0-8524-e21d-d423-452184222638
msgctxt "h6e2bb5aag746ag4f62gb536g42ef0d542455"
msgid ""
"Heh. Did you open her up and find the <b>inner beauty</b>? A wonderful tale. "
"Fit for children."
msgstr "하. 해그를 열어서 <b>내면의 아름다움</b>은 봤나? 멋진 이야기군. 어린애들에게 딱이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 0da5e97c-e47b-091a-d094-48458f91beb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:0da5e97c-e47b-091a-d094-48458f91beb4
msgctxt "hbf7ed6b7g5af3g409dga126g1340a0c89ef4"
msgid ""
"I'll drink to that. I drink to everything, but especially to that. "
"<b>Bravo.</b>"
msgstr "그 일에 건배하지. 난 모든 것에 건배 하지만, 특별히 그 일을 위해 건배 하겠어. <b>브라보.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1330470d-11ee-5d90-d462-1a8668ca3a7d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:1330470d-11ee-5d90-d462-1a8668ca3a7d
msgctxt "hbbf04067g8759g4e97g82d8gc8cc30bf90c7"
msgid "<i>Pick up the tankard.</i>"
msgstr "<i>맥주잔을 든다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 14a2d612-a079-4818-d8b3-bc977d0a3a61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:14a2d612-a079-4818-d8b3-bc977d0a3a61
msgctxt "h0628b017g9c54g4e28g8cccg335f06deec1c"
msgid "Drink it in, toss it down, lap it up."
msgstr "마시고, 내려놓고, 즐겨라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 1797cdc9-f18e-8a7f-846b-86925f261ed7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:1797cdc9-f18e-8a7f-846b-86925f261ed7
msgctxt "h232536d8g129bg4a3dg920fg3ddb9e0d6bfb"
msgid ""
"Huh. Molten. Hot. Heavy. I saw such a beast in my latrine. A <b>fierce "
"foe</b>."
msgstr "허. 녹고. 뜨겁고. 무거운 놈이라. 나도 그런 놈을 내 뒷간에서 본 적 있지. 아주 <b>사나운 놈</b>이었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 17bcacdb-6341-e326-1312-265c0ebe5adf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:17bcacdb-6341-e326-1312-265c0ebe5adf
msgctxt "h1d9f1d6fg05fbg4141gb19fga655f8224313"
msgid "Horns - not just for supping from. What noises he must have made."
msgstr "뿔이라, 그냥 홀짝 마시는 용도가 아니라니. 그놈 엄청 소리를 질러댔겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1d1a78ce-793a-fbee-8249-e9ae8fbcdac2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:1d1a78ce-793a-fbee-8249-e9ae8fbcdac2
msgctxt "he52abe06g615bg4b7aga65cg0f0e2f127445"
msgid ""
"*Leaning in, you can see how the creature's skin barely holds it together. "
"The bulge of its belly is on the cusp of bursting wide open.*"
msgstr "*몸을 기울이자, 당신은 이 괴물의 피부가 간신히 붙어 있는 것을 봅니다. 배의 불룩한 부분이 활짝 열려 터지기 직전입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 224895aa-d758-8c77-0e43-17e92df60a7c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_Owlbear_State_PermaDefeated = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:224895aa-d758-8c77-0e43-17e92df60a7c
msgctxt "h13aeff84ge48cg4c9fga2f9gd73fa6b4b560"
msgid "An owlbear mother lunged at me. I slaughtered it in reply."
msgstr "한번은 내게 아울베어 어미가 달려들었지. 나는 그 대답으로 도륙내줬다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 23539f7b-60c0-40ca-a561-5f27f6ad305b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:23539f7b-60c0-40ca-a561-5f27f6ad305b
msgctxt "hf75b0205g21b6g49f7gafbfgb04a44f2a804"
msgid "I've seen some grotesques in my time, but this is something else."
msgstr "살면서 기괴한 걸 몇 개 봤지만, 이건 전혀 다른 느낌이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26069cb5-96ad-b1c0-8a34-e3bc49c1b983
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:26069cb5-96ad-b1c0-8a34-e3bc49c1b983
msgctxt "h8f145c61g48acg4b8dg8401g4445b850c97a"
msgid "No. I will not share any stories."
msgstr "아니. 어떤 얘기도 들려주지 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 26d146ed-0fc9-282f-9f21-ddedf60d01d0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:26d146ed-0fc9-282f-9f21-ddedf60d01d0
msgctxt "ha86453a7g2e1ag494dgab1bg6c5ca7ee8b30"
msgid "Beauty is boring, nature a nuisance. I am dulled, you are dullard."
msgstr "아름다움은 지루하고, 자연은 골칫거리야. 따분해지는군, 넌 멍청이고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 2abb297d-b1cd-1098-00bf-c54fadd94afd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:2abb297d-b1cd-1098-00bf-c54fadd94afd
msgctxt "h76b53b95gfe5eg448fg80e9gcecf34ae5031"
msgid "Talk and... perish, die, buried. Buried in Thorm tomb. Father told me."
msgstr "말하면... 망가지고, 죽고, 묻힌다. 쏨 무덤에 쏙 들어간다. 아버지 말했다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 2b7e5e9b-110b-698e-2c8f-a928c5cc1642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_PassedDrinkingCheck(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:2b7e5e9b-110b-698e-2c8f-a928c5cc1642
msgctxt "h595bd5a3g2b4cg4eaeg9461ge5532ca0568c"
msgid "More stories."
msgstr "더 많은 이야기."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2ba4d57b-7720-8b04-763d-73859a69e920
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_DrankBrewersPoisonAndSucceededOnSave(1) = True
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_DrankBrewersPoison(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:2ba4d57b-7720-8b04-763d-73859a69e920
msgctxt "h29ad56cdgf547g4c8ag8774g3e1ef989104a"
msgid ""
"*Your belly rumbles as the vile brew fills it, yet your mind remains "
"miraculously steady.*"
msgstr "*끔찍한 술이 당신의 배를 가득 채우면서 울렁거리지만, 정신은 기적처럼 평온함을 유지합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 2e8567a1-82d4-a92f-aa54-3c1548443819
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_Brewer_Event_MentionedKetheric(1) = True
#.      - TWN_Brewer_Event_AskedCurse(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:2e8567a1-82d4-a92f-aa54-3c1548443819
msgctxt "hd727fb3bgbe56g4c1fga137g4b55f42f26b0"
msgid "Questions done, finished, over. Only drink."
msgstr "질문 완료, 끝났음, 물건너감. 마실 시간이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 2f8ec8ab-64ec-bf1a-1b2c-361fc25d045c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:2f8ec8ab-64ec-bf1a-1b2c-361fc25d045c
msgctxt "hb4993ef0g7c30g413dgbbd8g08e45268927f"
msgid "Insects, <b>roach</b>es, vermin all. I bore of their petty customs."
msgstr "전부 다 벌레들, <b>바퀴벌레</b>들, 해충들이야. 그 놈들의 사소한 전통은 지루해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2f9b938c-328d-7400-b374-3a147e050c17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_GivenSlayerForm = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:2f9b938c-328d-7400-b374-3a147e050c17
msgctxt "hd089c265gb79eg4c85ga965gf56b397509a0"
msgid "I have transformed into an ancient beast. One of pure hate."
msgstr "나는 고대의 괴물로 변신한 적이 있다. 순수한 증오의 존재 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 2f9f3a20-e867-bd37-2f3d-b00e8d6518c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:2f9f3a20-e867-bd37-2f3d-b00e8d6518c9
msgctxt "h20503e66g099bg4672gb905g7dad3e0bdd50"
msgid "Feel unfeeling, <b>know</b> un<b>know</b>ing. Be devoured!"
msgstr "무정함을 마주해라. <b>무지</b>를 <b>무진장</b> 깨달아라. 집어삼켜져라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 2fd743d1-6240-62b1-f96b-afbfecc22b72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:2fd743d1-6240-62b1-f96b-afbfecc22b72
msgctxt "hb65c4c3dgb1fbg48dfgab52g2b388352c812"
msgid "Son of Thorm. <b>Sot</b> of Sword Coast."
msgstr "쏨의 자식이지. 소드 코스트의 <b>주정뱅이</b> 자식이고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 300abdea-d58c-21b5-1bd9-802f80c6fce2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:300abdea-d58c-21b5-1bd9-802f80c6fce2
msgctxt "h7554fef5ga669g414fga9e4g65e4ec764887"
msgid ""
"<b>Mothers.</b> Commiserations. This place is my mother. Its teats are "
"copper. Its milk is barrel-aged."
msgstr "<b>어미들.</b> 조의를 표한다. 이곳이 내 어미지. 젖꼭지는 구리로 되어있다. 모유는 숙성된 술통이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 344baaeb-8842-ea66-e3e8-e287f87773ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_SawForge = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:344baaeb-8842-ea66-e3e8-e287f87773ba
msgctxt "ha168b0dcgfd42g442ag970bge0d6ea8c9fe4"
msgid "I explored a lost fortress buried deep in the Underdark's bowels."
msgstr "언더다크 내부에 깊숙이 파묻혀 있던 잊힌 요새를 탐험했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 38c49cd0-27fc-12c4-1aa4-0dbaff48e259
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:38c49cd0-27fc-12c4-1aa4-0dbaff48e259
msgctxt "h37b72735g3df2g4209gb5e9g4205231fc027"
msgid "<i>Refuse to tell more stories.</i>"
msgstr "<i>더 많은 이야기 들려주기를 거부한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3a317ca5-a0e0-e3fa-a813-2e6b0283bae0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_Monitor_HasMet_Dinner = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:3a317ca5-a0e0-e3fa-a813-2e6b0283bae0
msgctxt "h73188bcbg9cacg4309g89efg4975f0611f8f"
msgid ""
"A silver-tongued devil bade me feast in his lavishly appointed banquet hall."
msgstr "말솜씨 좋은 데빌이, 날 호화롭게 꾸며진 연회장으로 초대해 만찬을 베풀어 준 적이 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 3b4ac269-ce5b-2e36-4cca-5ec50c11e8ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:3b4ac269-ce5b-2e36-4cca-5ec50c11e8ac
msgctxt "hd2e6cb5fg9056g4600g8949g9e9257c0ef01"
msgid ""
"Bowels? Speak not of <b>bowels</b>. My guts are a firestorm - but I have the "
"means to douse it."
msgstr "내부? <b>내부</b>에 대해 말하다니. 내 내장은 불 폭풍이나 다름 없어. 하지만 나한텐 그 불을 끌 수단이 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3b6b8cf7-7b7a-5d0e-0cbe-bc562c2287f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:3b6b8cf7-7b7a-5d0e-0cbe-bc562c2287f8
msgctxt "h3bf87842g2153g4678g8471g10e60b6f8557"
msgid "I disembowelled a balor with its own pointed horn."
msgstr "발러의 머리에서 그 뾰족한 뿔을 도려낸 적이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 3d6eb240-8fac-9556-4ec6-208e8e83db99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:3d6eb240-8fac-9556-4ec6-208e8e83db99
msgctxt "h4728880ag08f2g49fdg8563g01046f2cb521"
msgid ""
"A horror I can hardly bear, tolerate, <b>endure</b>, if only in my mind. "
"Such daring!"
msgstr "내 정신으로는 감히 참지도, 인내하지도, <b>견디지도</b> 못할 공포로구먼. 정말 무모해!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3d845cbc-2f6c-88f7-80e3-5f369a0b93bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_State_GolemPermaDefeated = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:3d845cbc-2f6c-88f7-80e3-5f369a0b93bb
msgctxt "hdad935d7ga293g43c3ga395gcca8e6df9c0b"
msgid ""
"A towering creature rose from molten lava. I felled it with great wit and "
"might."
msgstr "우뚝 솟은 괴물이 들끓는 용암에서 솟구쳐 올랐지. 놈을 무시무시한 재치와 힘으로 쓰러뜨렸어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 3d9bd64b-80ca-a087-40e1-a930c8953f44
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_FailedPerformanceCheck(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:3d9bd64b-80ca-a087-40e1-a930c8953f44
msgctxt "h66886c62gf3afg4216gbd95gee6da1cf7ec5"
msgid "No more blah, bland, banal. Give me <b>blood</b>. Or I take it."
msgstr "더는 허풍같은, 싱겁고, 하찮은 소린 그만. <b>피</b>를 내놔라. 아니면 내가 가져가지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 3e5f8f6f-be52-2ce9-6d5e-e8fecfdc1d8d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:3e5f8f6f-be52-2ce9-6d5e-e8fecfdc1d8d
msgctxt "h3516d3efg8d21g4ca0gb435g716a3513cbd7"
msgid ""
"<b>Hoard</b>, you say? Sounds like you can stand me a round or seven. But "
"later..."
msgstr "<b>보물</b>...이라고? 그럼 내게 한 일곱 잔은 더 사줄 수 있겠군. 하지만 그건 나중에..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 4346c887-e590-4b44-96e5-f7528c5f9441
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:4346c887-e590-4b44-96e5-f7528c5f9441
msgctxt "hf7c1df4fg10a9g4a7fgb9adgfb06a2612034"
msgid ""
"Was this once a man? The shadows have corrupted him beyond comprehension."
msgstr "이게 인간이었다고? 그림자가 이 사람을 무참하게 타락 시켜버렸군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43ac9727-861e-4c94-f71c-2fdc4f90ec72
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:43ac9727-861e-4c94-f71c-2fdc4f90ec72
msgctxt "hb01628f3g0331g48e7gbd98g9c3d8a0a7f45"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 43ca2726-6489-2a40-9804-85e0d0b644ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_OneDrinkServed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:43ca2726-6489-2a40-9804-85e0d0b644ff
msgctxt "h7d91d95dg38b7g45bcg81f8gf0fed89a0b4c"
msgid "<i>Drink with the Brewer.</i>"
msgstr "<i>양조자와 함께 마신다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 447ab570-9387-893e-c63a-efbf04b852d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:447ab570-9387-893e-c63a-efbf04b852d7
msgctxt "ha74df14fgd9b7g459dg8c42g50ff90273fb4"
msgid "Father Ketheric created. Father Ketheric sustains."
msgstr "아버지 케서릭이 창조했다. 아버지 케서릭이 지속시킨다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 48234621-4e6c-2a86-9405-c1b28f6edea1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:48234621-4e6c-2a86-9405-c1b28f6edea1
msgctxt "h2c0509d5g41ffg46f1g806dgdfb0671c5a57"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 49cca74f-0183-c6b3-670b-fbb13ae17dd1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:49cca74f-0183-c6b3-670b-fbb13ae17dd1
msgctxt "h42faa782gcb93g44c7g95edg6c2a590437b0"
msgid "I am transported. I see the grove, the green, the grace before me!"
msgstr "나도 거기에 있는 거 같군. 눈 앞에 숲이, 신록이, 그 아름다움이 보여!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4aa31622-4d14-e51e-8906-3c58fa0d1fb4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_TwoDrinksServed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:4aa31622-4d14-e51e-8906-3c58fa0d1fb4
msgctxt "h878ca85fg530fg4775ga04fga52e52688f6b"
msgid "<i>Do as he says. Drink.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그가 말한 대로 한다. 건배.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 4edfbe3b-c911-0a3d-2149-0c68061b097c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:4edfbe3b-c911-0a3d-2149-0c68061b097c
msgctxt "h4ebb2dedgbb27g4994ga9b6gfc0e7eded326"
msgid "You ask. You drink. Then you <b>amaze</b>, enthuse, astound me. Again."
msgstr "넌 질문한다. 넌 마신다. 그리고 날 <b>즐겁게</b>, 열광하게, 놀라게 만들어줘. 다시."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 4f8958f4-a5ca-73ff-c4ca-46d6c873c9bb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:4f8958f4-a5ca-73ff-c4ca-46d6c873c9bb
msgctxt "h26e374ccgdd68g41b1g9413g7863b729b2b3"
msgid "A devil is as he does. Promises, poetry, a story musty as must."
msgstr "전형적인 데빌이 하는 짓거리잖아. 새 포도주처럼 퀴퀴한 냄새가 나는 암시, 시, 이야기야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4ff14094-0e2e-fe8a-551b-5d458ac8f7e0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_OneDrinkServed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:4ff14094-0e2e-fe8a-551b-5d458ac8f7e0
msgctxt "h505be865g4c8cg4671g9a3dge0dd51da142c"
msgid "<i>Pretend to swig deeply, avoiding the liquid at the last moment. </i>"
msgstr "<i>아주 크게 벌컥벌컥 마시는 척 하며, 끝까지 음료를 피한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 51b32a19-e309-20b7-2235-c2071c2ab515
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_TriedFakingDrinking(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:51b32a19-e309-20b7-2235-c2071c2ab515
msgctxt "h7747ed52g00ebg44a7g83c1g2ca658525490"
msgid "Impostor."
msgstr "사기꾼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 51cd4ccb-083b-2b58-88fb-a2e1da6226ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_FailedPerformanceCheck(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:51cd4ccb-083b-2b58-88fb-a2e1da6226ad
msgctxt "h89569dd5g5511g4450g9599g25ade7030d08"
msgid ""
"Spin a more fantastic fable. Entertain, engross, <b>amuse</b> me - or be "
"<b>amuse</b>ment."
msgstr ""
"좀 더 환상적인 이야기를 자아내봐. 날 즐겁게, 몰두하게, <b>웃음</b> 짓게 해달라고. 아니면 내 <b>웃음</b> 거리가 될 "
"테니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 544275b1-e8fd-23e9-d21d-d2811a4bd4e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_Bulette_State_HasBeenPermaDefeated = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:544275b1-e8fd-23e9-d21d-d2811a4bd4e9
msgctxt "h6b7e4857g38eeg44d8ga350gf456f47e5955"
msgid "A bulette made me its prey, but proved no match for me."
msgstr "불레트 한 마리가 날 먹이로 삼으려 했지만, 내 상대가 안 되더군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 548d2db2-0cf9-d129-06bc-6ef5dbe88b57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_GoblinKing_State_PermaDefeated = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:548d2db2-0cf9-d129-06bc-6ef5dbe88b57
msgctxt "h19f16acfg2d56g4ac9ga100g65b68852b6e3"
msgid "I conquered infamous hobgoblin Dror Ragzlin and his minions."
msgstr "난 악명 높은 홉고블린 드롤 라그즐린과 그의 하수인들을 무찔렀다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5688c544-32c9-91d8-320e-8b9fcef3b5e3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:5688c544-32c9-91d8-320e-8b9fcef3b5e3
msgctxt "h0847dc98g7119g48d6g8e17gf4d05d61ddeb"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 58fde35b-b989-5f22-4c0f-7277730214dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_TwoDrinksServed = True
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_TriedFakingDrinking(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:58fde35b-b989-5f22-4c0f-7277730214dc
msgctxt "hd621c3acg7b33g4395gb3c7g599fd23e06c6"
msgid "<i>Mime a sip of your drink.</i>"
msgstr "<i>한 모금 마시는 척 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 595a9275-43c5-e2b4-d4a6-533e7d051716
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:595a9275-43c5-e2b4-d4a6-533e7d051716
msgctxt "h155547bagdd6bg457bgbc93gaa275644d531"
msgid "Go on. Cheers, bottoms up, down the <b>hatch</b>."
msgstr "자. 건배, 바닥 보일 때까지, <b>목구멍</b> 아래로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 5a57bd32-c5d9-4bfe-adb9-86297c023373
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:5a57bd32-c5d9-4bfe-adb9-86297c023373
msgctxt "h715aa2e6g59c1g4b8ag82d0g8766342d2dbf"
msgid "The curse has wrecked this man. This is no life - this is torture."
msgstr "저주가 이 남자를 망가뜨렸어. 이건 삶이 아니라, 고문이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 5af8c584-8125-1cdb-cd58-9ae2d46fb5aa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_Brewer_Event_AskedKetheric(1) = True
#.      - TWN_Brewer_Event_AskedWhatSustains(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:5af8c584-8125-1cdb-cd58-9ae2d46fb5aa
msgctxt "he4b19294g5d92g45d6gaa02gb7a316991a38"
msgid "No... talk. Drink."
msgstr "말... 그만. 마셔라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = 5d067d58-06f8-bda4-6f5a-49b2ebc565ef
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(7) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:5d067d58-06f8-bda4-6f5a-49b2ebc565ef
msgctxt "h3080782eg019bg4dc6ga093g82d8d0167731"
msgid ""
"Look at the thing... A few more tastes of its own medicine and it'll burst."
msgstr "저것 좀 봐... 저 놈의 약을 몇 번만 더 맛보면 터져버릴 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 5d0731c1-c039-368d-ba91-30df819b19dc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:5d0731c1-c039-368d-ba91-30df819b19dc
msgctxt "h2cdef6e4gf3d5g4877g98b5g2bbf305d5c7c"
msgid ""
"Tell me of <b>foes</b> felled, <b>villains</b> vanquished, <b>beasts</b> "
"bested."
msgstr "쓰러진 <b>적</b>들, 짓밟힌 <b>악당들</b>, 두들겨 맞은 <b>짐승</b>들 얘기를 들려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 5dcb88a3-8ed3-26b3-1bb7-3775be34395f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:5dcb88a3-8ed3-26b3-1bb7-3775be34395f
msgctxt "h6bd364c0g4d3ag4c9cga780g07ec5c846837"
msgid "A wasted journey. The Hells can be seen <b>right here</b>."
msgstr "쓸모 없는 여행이었군. 지옥은 <b>바로 여기</b>서도 볼 수 있는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 5e0cedd3-7079-d835-cd1e-16692496aa0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:5e0cedd3-7079-d835-cd1e-16692496aa0f
msgctxt "h34de9f07g42dcg4782g8c15gc8d746f9fea0"
msgid ""
"Treasures in the dark, like the dusty anniversary bottle forgotten in the "
"widow's cellar. Delightful. <b>Delicious.</b>"
msgstr "어둠 속의 보물이라, 과부의 저장실에 잊혀 있던 먼지 낀 기념주 같구만. 즐거워. <b>맛있어.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 5f558a2d-09ae-fc4a-a1f2-04c2a335fac0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:5f558a2d-09ae-fc4a-a1f2-04c2a335fac0
msgctxt "hf700ec1eg7b29g43feg98d8gedc97414137a"
msgid ""
"A deal most <b>sordid</b> for powers profane. To sign away your very "
"<b>self</b>... <b>Compelling.</b>"
msgstr ""
"부정한 힘을 위해 치른 아주 <b>불결한</b> 거래로다. 계약으로 네 <b>스스로</b>를 넘기다니... <b>강렬하군.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 5f5c769e-afaa-6eb8-c99c-0352bc1cfd7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:5f5c769e-afaa-6eb8-c99c-0352bc1cfd7b
msgctxt "h437876eag559fg485cgbebdg8dc46704eef6"
msgid ""
"<b>Hob</b>-gob? <b>Min</b>-ion? Small beer. Small and <b>sour</b>. That tale "
"does not wag."
msgstr ""
"<b>홉</b> 고블린? <b>아랫</b>것들? 맹맹한 맥주. 보잘것없이 맹맹한데 <b>시큼</b>하기까지. 설득력이 하나도 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 5fedf47d-7036-4889-90f4-721c5a641937
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(3) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:5fedf47d-7036-4889-90f4-721c5a641937
msgctxt "hbf624895g93b2g4efagb1f2g2e2206a4c8b7"
msgid ""
"He's bloated like a corpse, and smells worse. Did the curse do "
"<i>this</i>...?"
msgstr "시체처럼 부풀었는데, 냄새는 더 심하네. 저주가 <i>이렇게</i> 바꾼 건가...?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 632d7f66-82ba-496a-8045-8969ed350c15
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:632d7f66-82ba-496a-8045-8969ed350c15
msgctxt "hfedb6d30g1b44g4b6dgae8ag00940e5c2238"
msgid "Any fool can grapple with <b>hot rocks</b>. Just poke a fireplace."
msgstr "<b>뜨거운 바위</b>를 붙잡고 싸우는 건 어떤 멍청이라도 할 수 있어. 그냥 벽난로를 찌르면 돼."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 66fb405d-cc9b-3544-4d48-f91637ac9df9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_AdamantineForge_Knows_SawForge = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:66fb405d-cc9b-3544-4d48-f91637ac9df9
msgctxt "h7f9c755eg5851g4bcfgbf6cgcaf74fb7c94c"
msgid "I explored a lost fortress buried deep in the Underdark's bowels."
msgstr "언더다크 내부에 깊숙이 파묻혀 있던 잊힌 요새를 탐험했지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 6753d1f1-cb4d-9492-0f29-27d9dfe08cbb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_OneDrinkServed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:6753d1f1-cb4d-9492-0f29-27d9dfe08cbb
msgctxt "he617ebb7g939fg47cbga0d6g97899e532d1c"
msgid ""
"<i>Ah.</i> Elixir. But such a small sip you take... Fear not. You will soon "
"quaff as I do."
msgstr "<i>아</i>. 보약이구먼. 그런데 넌 고작 한 모금밖에 안 마셨군... 걱정 마. 너도 곧 나처럼 단숨에 마시게 될 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69992d1f-85a6-e7e9-faa8-29af8d137c25
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:69992d1f-85a6-e7e9-faa8-29af8d137c25
msgctxt "hbbacebf8g0a90g4ac4gab01g370e33cbb4fc"
msgid "What is it that you're serving?"
msgstr "나한테 준 게 뭐지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69a87c39-a484-6c12-dffc-1d60ca3311b0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_GoblinHunt_RaiderCelebration = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:69a87c39-a484-6c12-dffc-1d60ca3311b0
msgctxt "h7d12f7abgbab6g476fga199g21653eb7e81f"
msgid ""
"I massacred an entire Grove of Tieflings who thought me their protector."
msgstr "날 수호자라 생각하던 숲의 모든 티플링들을 학살했었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 6b1980ad-a392-6f5d-5b35-453b7db8c176
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_Brewer_Event_AskedKetheric(1) = True
#.      - TWN_Brewer_Event_AskedWhatSustains(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:6b1980ad-a392-6f5d-5b35-453b7db8c176
msgctxt "h922007dagefb4g4b8ag8407g666a0ee3d3c4"
msgid "No more. Questions. Drink."
msgstr "질문. 그만. 마셔."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6c3da73d-0e35-9b5a-78a3-57e9f625688a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_Bottomless_SpiderQueen_State_PermaDefeated = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:6c3da73d-0e35-9b5a-78a3-57e9f625688a
msgctxt "h50e6ae32g0d5fg44cbg8428ge9ea325dad67"
msgid "I challenged a daunting phase spider. Its corpse is all that remains."
msgstr "무시무시한 위상 거미와 맞서 싸웠지. 이젠 시체밖에 안 남았지만."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 709deb3a-a547-34d5-282a-d546a69e6c8a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_OneDrinkServed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:709deb3a-a547-34d5-282a-d546a69e6c8a
msgctxt "h683219dcg1547g408eg9582gb46d1b6bec4d"
msgid "<i>Whisper a prayer to your god, then drink.</i>"
msgstr "<i>신께 기도를 속삭인 뒤 마신다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 7202e021-21d3-1400-1f06-fa59f30b0a79
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:7202e021-21d3-1400-1f06-fa59f30b0a79
msgctxt "h9e89ebe8g9d1dg4d39gb6e5ge2cea683eac2"
msgid ""
"Pah! <b>Hate </b>is not special. It takes no beast to <b>hate</b>. It is the "
"raw state of every man."
msgstr ""
"파하! <b>증오</b>는 특별한 게 아니야. 괴물만 <b>증오</b>를 가지고 있는 게 아니라고. 그건 모든 이들의 원초적인 상태지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 7209ae60-4f4b-c639-b336-f429a896ef56
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:7209ae60-4f4b-c639-b336-f429a896ef56
msgctxt "h44f9a929gf69cg4f01gb8d1g89bb878823fc"
msgid ""
"Did they bleed flame? Did their screams rend the sky? No - don't tell me. "
"Let me <b>dream</b>."
msgstr "그것들은 피 대신 화염이 흐르나? 비명이 하늘을 갈랐나? 아니, 말하지 마. 내가 <b>꿈꾸게</b> 해줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72d0a58c-0667-4f88-d139-a250e8afc28f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Templar_State_Defeated = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:72d0a58c-0667-4f88-d139-a250e8afc28f
msgctxt "h00d16d84g272cg4633g9ab5g32f7f7ae1f9b"
msgid ""
"I bested an inquisitor - the vaunted champion of my own Queen, Vlaakith."
msgstr "블라키스 여왕님의 자랑스러운 챔피언인 심문관을 무찔렀었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72d0a58c-0667-4f88-d139-a250e8afc28f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_Templar_State_Defeated = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:72d0a58c-0667-4f88-d139-a250e8afc28f
msgctxt "hbb7bb07fgf1a4g49b2g868dgf6053e6db7d8"
msgid ""
"I bested an inquisitor - a dreaded champion of the Lich Queen, Vlaakith."
msgstr "리치 여왕 블라키스의 두려운 챔피언인 심문관을 무찔렀었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 760db3c2-fcf4-0814-74aa-68718a1ce3ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_GotToThirdDrink(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:760db3c2-fcf4-0814-74aa-68718a1ce3ac
msgctxt "hb2c466fbg4343g4d68g9ac2g59d6444a966f"
msgid "Ask, question, make your query. And drink <b>once</b> more."
msgstr "물어봐라, 질문을, 질문할 것을 정해라. 그리고 <b>한 잔</b> 더 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 761a1e1e-820a-4eed-7fc0-e55520b2510c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_GoblinKing_State_PermaDefeated = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:761a1e1e-820a-4eed-7fc0-e55520b2510c
msgctxt "hf752dc99g2a7eg4025g9e48g5cc763e6e443"
msgid "I conquered infamous hobgoblin Dror Ragzlin and his minions."
msgstr "난 악명 높은 홉고블린 드롤 라그즐린과 그의 아랫것들을 무찔렀다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 767c12a2-a56b-9d93-db4a-7332c850b38a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_TwoDrinksServed = True
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_TriedFakingDrinking(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:767c12a2-a56b-9d93-db4a-7332c850b38a
msgctxt "hb2a1e315g627dg46e4g8413g539acc23a4bc"
msgid ""
"<i>Take a sip, but spit out the liquour before the creature notices. </i>"
msgstr "<i>한 모금 마시되, 괴물이 눈치 채기 전에 술을 뱉어낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 76d900f1-89a9-ce9c-ff91-6a1f4fbbbddf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:76d900f1-89a9-ce9c-ff91-6a1f4fbbbddf
msgctxt "h0e43555age331g41cegb761g6bea7860a15a"
msgid "...Not a single drop swallowed. You must think me a ripe fool."
msgstr "...한 방울도 안 마시다니. 날 술 취한 멍청이로 보는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 77a9d93d-f45b-214d-3484-3e207a57fcbf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_PeacefulResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:77a9d93d-f45b-214d-3484-3e207a57fcbf
msgctxt "h0598e71bg5dd7g4435gb039gdfaf70cd80e5"
msgid "I can't perish - no, nay, neither. Too strong, too..."
msgstr "나 망가지기 싫다. 아냐, 싫어, 다 틀렸어. 너무 강해, 너무..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 781aa931-c52b-592c-4990-684b3a3e7438
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_TriedFakingDrinking(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:781aa931-c52b-592c-4990-684b3a3e7438
msgctxt "h9e906e7cg126cg41dfgb607gb6d8d57c610e"
msgid "<i>Take a drink, but hold it in your mouth instead of swallowing. </i>"
msgstr "<i>음료는 마시되, 입에 머금고 삼키지 않는다. </i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 794d792c-47e1-4a7e-9cdc-5fa3e527501a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:794d792c-47e1-4a7e-9cdc-5fa3e527501a
msgctxt "h05438307g4161g47f6g89c8gffd0b769070e"
msgid "<i>CHUG! CHUG! CHUG!</i>"
msgstr "<i>칙칙폭폭! 칙칙폭폭! 칙칙폭폭!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 7dca67b8-5d16-ab13-7912-7e590f1ee78e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:7dca67b8-5d16-ab13-7912-7e590f1ee78e
msgctxt "he8d92679g477fg44ccg8d8egb3ad68544b5a"
msgid ""
"So have <b>I</b>, when my cup runs <b>dry</b>. Let me pour you some sympathy."
msgstr "<b>나</b>도 내 컵이 <b>말랐을</b> 때 그런 적이 있어. 공감을 좀 더 부어주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 8067d0a3-39a0-6018-881f-d1bd4738cd7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:8067d0a3-39a0-6018-881f-d1bd4738cd7b
msgctxt "h912c1b40g7945g4050gbe3cg941cd6435fd4"
msgid ""
"I am Thorm. My father's tower grazed the <b>new moon</b>. Yours means zero, "
"<b>nothing</b>, naught."
msgstr ""
"나는 쏨이다. 내 아버지의 탑은 <b>초승달</b>을 스쳐 지나갔지. 네 이야기는 아무 의미도 없고, <b>아무것도 아니고</b>, "
"무가치하다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 808c33b7-9395-89e6-f90a-fbb18d4836da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:808c33b7-9395-89e6-f90a-fbb18d4836da
msgctxt "hb62c1b30g5aadg426fg8dccg54a1e4c1c983"
msgid "A pixie's piss. I give you <b>Blackfire</b>."
msgstr "픽시의 오줌 같으니. <b>블랙파이어</b>를 주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 83f9dc8f-8e93-e1a2-1b8d-ad292e0cf046
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_Brewer_Event_AskedKetheric(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:83f9dc8f-8e93-e1a2-1b8d-ad292e0cf046
msgctxt "ha9003c5dg01cdg4076ga367g49bff7d7c1c0"
msgid "What do you mean? How can I defeat Ketheric?"
msgstr "그게 무슨 뜻이지? 케서릭을 어떻게 쓰러뜨릴 수 있는데?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 86745a34-ea86-645c-9c37-df48651e231b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:86745a34-ea86-645c-9c37-df48651e231b
msgctxt "h86f0f65fg3b72g4c2egab64g00f6362f5e84"
msgid ""
"I stomp on the detritus of a <b>dead town </b>every day. Tell me of another "
"life."
msgstr "난 매일 <b>죽은 마을</b>의 잔해를 쿵쿵 밟고 다녀. 다른 삶을 말해달라고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 86accfaa-eef3-3fc2-017b-42f199117482
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_KilledIsobel_Requirement = False
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:86accfaa-eef3-3fc2-017b-42f199117482
msgctxt "h6a1c1ff5g6854g4286gaf0bgc6476d950f4f"
msgid ""
"I massacred an entire village of innocents who thought me their protector."
msgstr "날 수호자라 생각하던 마을의 모든 무고한 자들을 학살했었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 873ac838-b449-ea10-4a93-bfc591209384
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:873ac838-b449-ea10-4a93-bfc591209384
msgctxt "hc3f9298bg41eag4870g804bg36a5131ded9c"
msgid "A waste of tongue flaps. I wanted <b>glory</b>, not pus!"
msgstr "쓸 데 없는 혀놀림이군. 난 고름 얘기가 아니라 <b>영광</b>얘기를 듣고 싶었다고!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 87f52f4b-a5f2-393e-40c5-a5f170e386ab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:87f52f4b-a5f2-393e-40c5-a5f170e386ab
msgctxt "hce600d5age8d5g47efg876cga5bdcb76ad2b"
msgid "I ripped apart winged imps spawned from the fires of Avernus."
msgstr "난 아베르누스의 불길에서 태어난 날개 달린 임프들을 찢어발겼지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 883c4517-e009-84cb-364b-b31ff49ca151
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:883c4517-e009-84cb-364b-b31ff49ca151
msgctxt "hfbd02096gb053g4858g9b3ag35d8e5a4011e"
msgid ""
"We <b>all</b> have owlbear mothers. Mine was a lush. <b>Unimpressive.</b>"
msgstr "우리 <b>모두</b>에겐 그런 아울베어 어미가 있지. 내 어미는 술 주정뱅이였지. 전혀 <b>인상적이지 않아.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 886609e0-635a-7db7-607a-e37cce341848
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:886609e0-635a-7db7-607a-e37cce341848
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h875badd4gdd81g4e8fg80dag8aedf196decf"
msgid ""
"That's all? A single fight? Against a lone knight? Sounds like a stinking "
"pile of..."
msgstr "그게 다야? 그냥 싸움? 기사 한 명을 상대로? 악취가 진동하는 한 무더기 같군..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 8911a43c-0d84-fb46-8b3a-c57ddc31961a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:8911a43c-0d84-fb46-8b3a-c57ddc31961a
msgctxt "h1ea8baf9g109cg4475gbd3eg193e7f009360"
msgid ""
"Pathetic! Paultry! Poxy puddle of <b>piddle</b>! Why not boast of snots dug "
"from your nostril?"
msgstr "한심하다! 하찮은 것! 더러운 <b>오줌</b> 구덩이 같은! 차라리 콧구멍에서 파낸 콧물을 자랑하지 그래!?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 8d7d6a07-2615-6966-cdee-2f0a74a12726
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:8d7d6a07-2615-6966-cdee-2f0a74a12726
msgctxt "h6b67f26agd45ag499fg9822gdbf11aa1a971"
msgid "Now tell me a story, a fable, a saga. <b>Delight</b> me."
msgstr "이제 이야기, 설화, 모험담을 들려줘. 날 <b>즐겁게 해줘</b>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 8fab6d1a-a2ea-60bb-9775-37854c2ae7cc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:8fab6d1a-a2ea-60bb-9775-37854c2ae7cc
msgctxt "h9ee981c5g7c60g47bbgaafdg736034955226"
msgid ""
"The only one left alive to tell your wicked tale. <b>Kill</b> another drink "
"with me."
msgstr "네 사악한 이야기를 들려줄 유일한 생존자로군. 나와 함께 한 잔 더 <b>죽여보자고</b>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9007ba86-78a9-bc51-5179-c244f9aca4e8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - HAV_Jaheira_State_DrankWine(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:9007ba86-78a9-bc51-5179-c244f9aca4e8
msgctxt "h505e301cg84e5g42bagb587g937521ebdfab"
msgid "I already drank some wine earlier, thank you."
msgstr "좀 전에 와인을 마셔서, 사양할게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 90946200-b61f-286b-1442-ca7bd7960ed5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:90946200-b61f-286b-1442-ca7bd7960ed5
msgctxt "he26b35a4g326cg47afga2c9gb7d8684fcdbb"
msgid "Keep your distance. He looks like he could burst any second."
msgstr "거리를 유지하라고. 금방이라도 터질 것 같으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 92f68094-bce0-3c0a-6978-daf85bec5121
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_OneDrinkServed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - TWN_Brewer_Event_MentionedKetheric(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:92f68094-bce0-3c0a-6978-daf85bec5121
msgctxt "h6fc10d67g2925g4b64ga876g3862cd939823"
msgid "How did you become... what you are now?"
msgstr "이건 대체 어떻게 돼먹은... 어쩌다 이런 꼴이 되어버린 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 935876a6-95ac-117f-0e3f-d2b0e30246a9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:935876a6-95ac-117f-0e3f-d2b0e30246a9
msgctxt "h61cb7a5fg700eg40b0g98a4g83ac6ec54e75"
msgid "Eternal, invincible, forever, except <b>not</b>."
msgstr "불멸, 무적, 영원. 사실 <b>아니지만</b>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 94dc6253-4ecf-aeba-475f-78d7f0f203ee
