#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:94dc6253-4ecf-aeba-475f-78d7f0f203ee
msgctxt "h9527da2ag6a07g4a5eg9163g22feb1626715"
msgid "I ripped apart winged imps spawned from the fires of Avernus."
msgstr "난 아베르누스의 불길에서 태어난 날개 달린 임프들을 찢어발겼지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 96362595-c8c7-7da5-6498-00d33bc7a09e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinThrone_Event_Entered = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:96362595-c8c7-7da5-6498-00d33bc7a09e
msgctxt "h2d784baegc1b2g44feg9e60g358ece4e28de"
msgid "I've seen the goblins' vile rituals with my own eyes."
msgstr "내 두 눈으로 직접 고블린들의 고약한 의식을 봤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 965170b9-f3fb-457f-b319-d9a9a0e01642
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GOB_GoblinThrone_Event_Entered = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:965170b9-f3fb-457f-b319-d9a9a0e01642
msgctxt "h8f1ddb8age2c5g4709gb0d3g9752431fe5f6"
msgid "I've seen the goblins' vile rituals with my own eyes."
msgstr "내 두 눈으로 직접 고블린들의 고약한 의식을 봤어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 96782580-911c-2b78-412b-e20f1dc4c4f2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:96782580-911c-2b78-412b-e20f1dc4c4f2
msgctxt "h490755ffgb3bcg4ee8gad82g505ecfd0249f"
msgid ""
"Boo-<b>what</b>? I do not know what that is. But let us imagine it "
"impressive."
msgstr "부, <b>뭐라고</b>? 난 그게 뭔지 몰라. 하지만 대단하다고 생각하지 뭐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 99c8b008-5eab-218e-3e0f-413385e07e21
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:99c8b008-5eab-218e-3e0f-413385e07e21
msgctxt "ha50da341g2279g4a31gb8ebgd1df3bcdb562"
msgid ""
"You want father's personal mysterious - <i>(secret)</i> - <b>secret</b>. No, "
"not, never!"
msgstr "넌 아버지의 개인적인 비밀을 원하는군. <i>(비밀)</i>, <b>비밀</b>. 싫어, 안돼, 어림없어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = 99cb550e-30c6-4216-544a-fa376dbae79c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:99cb550e-30c6-4216-544a-fa376dbae79c
msgctxt "h299582e7gaaefg4332gb096ge9d7d2ea5c74"
msgid "Another. Drink."
msgstr "한 잔 더. 마셔."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a209c074-edd5-f710-e8e8-a496251636d6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - NIGHT_GoblinHunt_RaiderCelebration = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:a209c074-edd5-f710-e8e8-a496251636d6
msgctxt "h2eb5f1d0g0fbag426dgb510g72356698f7df"
msgid ""
"I massacred an entire Grove of Tieflings who thought me their protector."
msgstr "날 수호자라 생각하던 숲의 모든 티플링들을 학살했었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a5472d6a-75d2-a87e-1238-526efa0286be
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:a5472d6a-75d2-a87e-1238-526efa0286be
msgctxt "hb6052134g1047g4de7gbd4egb00b38cf63f5"
msgid "No. I will not drink."
msgstr "아니. 마시지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = a751f7ee-7945-0d14-cb6c-ccf1e0779d1e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:a751f7ee-7945-0d14-cb6c-ccf1e0779d1e
msgctxt "he7332900g1864g4e75gbb53gf46dbbc5db0f"
msgid ""
"Such a trek, for the sake of a <b>view</b>? I will drink to your iron knees."
msgstr "고작 <b>경치</b>를 보려고, 그런 여행을 해? 너의 무쇠 무릎에 건배하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a893e568-9506-90a0-c358-6f0145f2510f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_OneDrinkServed = True
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_DrankBrewersPoisonAndSucceededOnSave(1) = True
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_DrankBrewersPoison(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:a893e568-9506-90a0-c358-6f0145f2510f
msgctxt "hcca56010gf344g4985g829agaf420b8a24ba"
msgid ""
"*The liquid burns your throat as you swallow, but otherwise, you feel no ill "
"effects.*"
msgstr "*음료를 삼키자 당신의 목이 화끈거리지만, 그것 말고 별다른 나쁜 영향은 느껴지지 않습니다. *"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = a976e4ad-f147-e321-b751-d1df410b74c5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:a976e4ad-f147-e321-b751-d1df410b74c5
msgctxt "heca84767g069ag4d66gbbd1g17c52a9ecaa1"
msgid "Adrift and unmourned, like a fly in red wine. <b>Poetic.</b>"
msgstr "애도하는 이 없이 표류하다니. 적포도주 속 파리 같아. <b>시적이군.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a9e8af8b-a559-a90a-179f-c056b7360fbe
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_State_GivenSlayerForm = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:a9e8af8b-a559-a90a-179f-c056b7360fbe
msgctxt "h4cf74d12g3b98g4111g9e6fg884b7101ef60"
msgid "I have transformed into an ancient beast. One of pure hate."
msgstr "나는 고대의 괴물로 변신한 적이 있다. 순수한 증오의 존재 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = aa649a1d-64d1-a97f-b172-d03eca7aae01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - FOR_Monitor_HasMet_Dinner = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:aa649a1d-64d1-a97f-b172-d03eca7aae01
msgctxt "h2f37d635g7d45g4ab3g8651g6c893d7c7741"
msgid ""
"A silver-tongued devil bade me feast in his lavishly appointed banquet hall."
msgstr "말솜씨 좋은 데빌이, 날 호화롭게 꾸며진 연회장으로 초대해 만찬을 베풀어 준 적이 있지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = ae5309a3-4351-b84a-3f15-11400a5f594e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:ae5309a3-4351-b84a-3f15-11400a5f594e
msgctxt "h0a368ac1g7f9eg405ag9917g3b863a20dacf"
msgid "What is that? A dessert wine? <b>Unimpressive.</b>"
msgstr "그게 뭔데? 디저트 포도주? <b>별거 아니잖아.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = af2afcb5-de88-e842-8098-d2902030cecb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:af2afcb5-de88-e842-8098-d2902030cecb
msgctxt "hc39c516egd6d7g4424g84d2gb5c2bfd2014e"
msgid "The spirit of the land."
msgstr "대지의 정령으로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = afc66e3f-4b3c-ce21-c642-f48ea60c9a07
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:afc66e3f-4b3c-ce21-c642-f48ea60c9a07
msgctxt "h97aa1669g9cacg48bfg9df1gccbcdb1f45e7"
msgid "Lies of a lying liar. <b>Let void take you.</b>"
msgstr "거짓말하는 거짓말쟁이의 거짓말이군. <b>공허가 널 데려가게 해주마.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b18aad6c-5eb7-8ac9-f2dd-5488c5915bc0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_Brewer_Event_MentionedKetheric(1) = True
#.   Local:
#.      - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_TwoDrinksServed = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - TWN_Brewer_Event_AskedKetheric(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:b18aad6c-5eb7-8ac9-f2dd-5488c5915bc0
msgctxt "h8d0370f7g0e89g487dg8f9ag3ba3f39eb3d2"
msgid "What can you tell me about Ketheric?"
msgstr "케서릭에 대해 뭘 말해줄 수 있지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = b35d7e81-78f0-0e3c-a344-8fc8e02ce728
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:b35d7e81-78f0-0e3c-a344-8fc8e02ce728
msgctxt "h4074e282g21b7g47adga194gf970d7834ce1"
msgid "Father. Father is father."
msgstr "아버지. 아버지는 아버지다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b361032c-c300-c1cf-c8b7-f9ce74a560a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_General_State_EnteredCave = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:b361032c-c300-c1cf-c8b7-f9ce74a560a5
msgctxt "hc27034deg6378g4a71g8654ge9f996aa7fa4"
msgid "I gazed on nature's bounties in a verdant grove of druids."
msgstr "드루이드들의 푸르른 숲에서 자연의 관대함을 가만히 바라보았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b46bd4ad-a6c0-e033-f489-db92eb343e1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - HAG_Hag_State_IsDead = True
#.      - GLO_Hag_Knows_HagIsHag = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:b46bd4ad-a6c0-e033-f489-db92eb343e1b
msgctxt "hf12c2b6bg8a37g47e3gbfc3gdc12a2d5ea0f"
msgid "I slayed a hideous, pustule-ridden hag. She died a gruesome death."
msgstr "고름이 들끓는 흉측한 해그를 죽였던 적이 있어. 아주 고통스럽게 죽었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = b7788239-3b1d-6acb-eddd-2799de5263d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(2) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:b7788239-3b1d-6acb-eddd-2799de5263d7
msgctxt "hb6551d68gda1eg4a01gb028gb9c2f94bad15"
msgid "Near to bursting. The next few sips could be his last."
msgstr "터지기 직전이야. 몇 모금 더 마시면 터져버리겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = b7910f4e-ccce-50cc-29db-691d4f7b3a3c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:b7910f4e-ccce-50cc-29db-691d4f7b3a3c
msgctxt "h6b43d600gb934g4644g8b24g2c2578659c2e"
msgid "No. I will not drink."
msgstr "아니. 마시지 않겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = b8e6b97f-ac94-65a5-3a83-4432bbcf9e2a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:b8e6b97f-ac94-65a5-3a83-4432bbcf9e2a
msgctxt "hc398d9f0gaddag4d27gb679gf75c2f4ac78f"
msgid ""
"You have it within you still, I can tell from the <b>crack</b> in your smile "
"and the <b>gleam</b> in your foul eye."
msgstr "넌 아직도 그 모습을 갖고 있군. 네 미소의 <b>틈새</b>와 더러운 눈동자의 <b>광채</b>로부터 알 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = ba6a5eaa-d535-4ae2-deae-42f59c4b2c60
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:ba6a5eaa-d535-4ae2-deae-42f59c4b2c60
msgctxt "hc010489bg4c14g44dcg9bb7gcf93c13359bd"
msgid "More. Drink."
msgstr "더. 마셔라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = bdaa5d77-8bab-d1ff-c507-ce0c8cc6e76c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:bdaa5d77-8bab-d1ff-c507-ce0c8cc6e76c
msgctxt "h41f72f9eg5badg4e3dg94a7ga60fb73ae36e"
msgid "Only the best. Oblivion. And beyond."
msgstr "최고로 좋은 술이지. 망각. 그리고 그 이상."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = be438c5e-a44b-c033-f4fb-568e3f506315
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:be438c5e-a44b-c033-f4fb-568e3f506315
msgctxt "haa637c6fg7488g465fg92e6g497cf0daf315"
msgid ""
"Father said, ordered, commanded. Don't say it, don't say it! The cage. "
"<b>Her cage.</b>"
msgstr "아버지 말했다, 명령했다, 지시했다. 말하지 말라고, 말하지 말라고! 감옥. <b>그녀의 감옥.</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = beee9c70-02b4-c907-050e-80e172b3127c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:beee9c70-02b4-c907-050e-80e172b3127c
msgctxt "hc7f2daafg3e8bg426cgb55ege77b0eae8bc2"
msgid ""
"You want father's personal mysterious - <i>(secret)</i> - <b>secret</b>. No, "
"not, never!"
msgstr "너 아버지의 사적인 비밀 원한다 - <i>(비밀)</i> - <i>(비밀)</i>. 싫어, 안 돼, 어림없어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bfb06d36-f9aa-e96e-4dae-38fdcf16943f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:bfb06d36-f9aa-e96e-4dae-38fdcf16943f
msgctxt "h15579c57gca06g49f2g91a2ge1fbad28cbc5"
msgid ""
"<i>Swear eternal devotion to your divine as you knock back the drink.</i>"
msgstr "<i>술을 들이키며 신에 대한 영원한 헌신을 맹세한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c3be93cc-0990-ec67-70d6-4e49a3fa5fc9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - UND_ArcaneTower_MainPowerOn = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:c3be93cc-0990-ec67-70d6-4e49a3fa5fc9
msgctxt "h3e008c36g5e26g43a4g81b9gb98d4a83c096"
msgid "I ascended a great tower infused with the most powerful of magic."
msgstr "가장 강력한 마법이 주입된 거대한 탑을 올랐지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = c503e88f-4e70-5eb8-b7fe-5e620d810460
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:c503e88f-4e70-5eb8-b7fe-5e620d810460
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h36d5fd20gf63ag4dcegaa43g518030ffbe1e"
msgid ""
"Foul creatures. Too many limbs - like seeing double, triple, <b>quadruple</"
"b>. Better as husks."
msgstr "부정한 괴물. 다리가 너무 많아, 더블, 트리플, <b>쿼드러플</b>을 보는 거 같아. 겨 만큼 많은 거 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c91b4b3f-9eda-5a4d-2d86-025c01ca0fbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_TwoDrinksServed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:c91b4b3f-9eda-5a4d-2d86-025c01ca0fbc
msgctxt "h86e37953gc614g4131gb801g1d2120e1233d"
msgid "<i>As your drink, call upon your god to steady you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>당신이 믿는 신에게 독주를 인내할 체력을 요청한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = cb435bb5-53a3-8183-8d03-e62d72ec7c97
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:cb435bb5-53a3-8183-8d03-e62d72ec7c97
msgctxt "h093ed1afg1a75g477agae8cgaa23d0eda68a"
msgid ""
"Minions? Many - <b>good</b>. More blood to slurp and marrow to suck out."
msgstr "하수인들? 많을수록 <b>좋지</b>. 더 많은 피와 골수를 빨아들일 수 있으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = cca218b8-1f7e-33c5-ef96-f5c5fc0794c6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:cca218b8-1f7e-33c5-ef96-f5c5fc0794c6
msgctxt "h402f17d3g23a5g4a73g9ebfg7e24b2838d50"
msgid "<i>Channel your focus to a sharpened point as you drink.</i>"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = cdc45df3-be8a-4ceb-c481-936290f06527
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:cdc45df3-be8a-4ceb-c481-936290f06527
msgctxt "h0a2ee4a7g37a5g4b81gbf45g526333340305"
msgid "Do you adventure in <b>broom closets</b>? I want a <b>saga</b>."
msgstr "<b>청소도구함</b>에서 모험을 하는 거야? 난 <b>무용담</b>을 원한다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = cde5eeec-089e-dab1-45bd-cb2b812b0de9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:cde5eeec-089e-dab1-45bd-cb2b812b0de9
msgctxt "h026eda79gafc5g4283gb73eg742d1e90b3fc"
msgid ""
"The work of wizards. That crackle, that spark, how I wish it still stirred "
"within me!"
msgstr "위저드의 작품이라. 그 따닥거리는 소리, 그 불꽃이 내 안에서 계속 휘저어지길 얼마나 바랐었는지!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = ce374299-1dce-f62c-d5f0-7c374071a671
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:ce374299-1dce-f62c-d5f0-7c374071a671
msgctxt "he4db32a4g20d6g4c97ga731g2184e9f09549"
msgid ""
"Its eyes were not bigger than its belly, then? <b>Hah!</b> Delightful. A "
"grisly tale with a frothing ale."
msgstr "그놈 눈이 배보다 크진 않았던 거네, 그렇지? <b>하!</b> 재밌군. 거품 이는 맥주 한 잔에 소름 끼치는 이야기라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d0354362-e1cb-eebf-94a7-fb6ebfe2d017
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
