msgctxt "h2be347begbbc3g4178g9e21gbed929e07b5e"
msgid "Who placed the curse on this land?"
msgstr "이 땅에 저주를 풀어놓은 자가 누구지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d44737b5-2c8a-e0e7-4d1a-be649c0f6984
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_Drinkonce = True
#.     - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_OneDrinkServed = True
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_Event_DrankOnce(1) = True
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_DrankBrewersPoison(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:d44737b5-2c8a-e0e7-4d1a-be649c0f6984
msgctxt "h809aa1f9geeacg4b05g9f53gfcced0d23149"
msgid ""
"*The creature's brew is more potent than anything you ever drank before. You "
"feel instantly drunk and unsteady on your feet.*"
msgstr "*이 괴물의 맥주는 당신이 이제껏 마셔본 어떤 술보다 더 셉니다. 당신은 즉시 숙취로 발이 불안정해짐을 느낍니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d4af9adc-5e2d-a94a-63af-8b8b97d05966
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:d4af9adc-5e2d-a94a-63af-8b8b97d05966
msgctxt "h55b1ca9cgbcf8g4cf3ga375g82cd4552c071"
msgid "<i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr "<i>공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d68892f1-48bf-85f8-1a2d-154b4b9a70c4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_Drinkonce = True
#.      - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_Drinktwice = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_Event_DrankThrice(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:d68892f1-48bf-85f8-1a2d-154b4b9a70c4
msgctxt "h7d90cdd6gbd04g4aceg9da2g4e6679537167"
msgid ""
"*The third drink is too much. You're spinning down a black maelstrom toward "
"the heart of oblivion. All goes dark.*"
msgstr "*세 번째 잔은 과음이었습니다. 당신은 망각의 중심부를 향해 검은 소용돌이를 일으키고 있습니다. 사방이 어두워집니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d9157ff5-4230-fb28-92d1-b3eb05de94b1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ORI_DarkUrge_KilledIsobel_Requirement = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_DARK_URGE(1) = True
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:d9157ff5-4230-fb28-92d1-b3eb05de94b1
msgctxt "h5d5a916bg4d07g4a1dg9a6eg2a47b112280b"
msgid ""
"I massacred an entire village of innocents who thought me their protector."
msgstr "날 수호자라 생각하던 마을의 모든 무고한 자들을 학살했었지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = da3ab1e7-21f8-9ea0-6303-9a89e61470b2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:da3ab1e7-21f8-9ea0-6303-9a89e61470b2
msgctxt "h4f02aeaeg9ca8g435cg84e0gaffa63c5b57f"
msgid "Drink, gulp it down, wet your whistle. Tell your <b>story</b>."
msgstr "마시자, 꿀꺽꿀꺽 넘기고, 목을 축여. 네 <b>이야기</b>를 들려줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dcfd1e6e-027a-eb40-d5d6-acbf247b2e17
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 16
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_TwoDrinksServed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:dcfd1e6e-027a-eb40-d5d6-acbf247b2e17
msgctxt "h0ba0156dgca42g4d36g8bf3gb19486c6401d"
msgid "<i>Fortify your spirit with a silent mantra as you drink.</i>"
msgstr "<i>술을 마시면서, 조용하게 만트라로 정신을 강화한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dfb29fbe-06e5-4946-aa7d-0408cae8cf26
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:dfb29fbe-06e5-4946-aa7d-0408cae8cf26
msgctxt "hee5755a1g647dg4612gabd3g517dc1f78bdb"
msgid "<i>Steel yourself and drink.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마음을 단단히 먹고 마신다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e2871e76-6f53-02e6-4641-8f7bb09c13f7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:e2871e76-6f53-02e6-4641-8f7bb09c13f7
msgctxt "h8dfa31d7gddb8g4909ga990g321afde77539"
msgid "I slaughtered a gold dragon and collected its vast hoard."
msgstr "골드 드래곤을 죽이고 그 방대한 보물을 쓸어 담기도 했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = e29f92ff-a9a4-0a75-e7c8-768eff8af95d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:e29f92ff-a9a4-0a75-e7c8-768eff8af95d
msgctxt "h7c3d044cgeac8g4500gaac4g2ceef14edc0c"
msgid "Bloated as a pufferfish. He takes a few drinks, and I bet he'll pop."
msgstr "복어처럼 부풀어 올랐군. 몇 모금 더 마시면, 분명히 터질 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e456f1ca-09c6-d0d0-d1f3-a463e1b4f30e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:e456f1ca-09c6-d0d0-d1f3-a463e1b4f30e
msgctxt "ha600c3d6gfc2fg446fgaa33g3e4bd1301aeb"
msgid "I ripped one head from an ettin and force-fed it to the other."
msgstr "에틴의 머리 하나를 잘라서 다른 머리가 강제로 먹게 한 적이 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e63f4619-ee20-6e26-aa2a-9fff9b8c82ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SavingThrow
#. RollAbility: Constitution
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - e96d7fc6-1b8c-da21-4777-4f1471441ed3_OneDrinkServed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:e63f4619-ee20-6e26-aa2a-9fff9b8c82ac
msgctxt "h9bdba3bcg8479g4a49g8eb7g809d0517fb33"
msgid "<i>Steady your body and mind, then drink.</i>"
msgstr "<i>몸과 마음을 안정 시킨 뒤 마신다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e653f10f-8d95-5c5b-7194-f542836e4845
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_General_State_EnteredCave = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:e653f10f-8d95-5c5b-7194-f542836e4845
msgctxt "h8ec5ad57g837ag4a35g871ag3afaeee9ae54"
msgid "I gazed on nature's bounties in a verdant grove of druids."
msgstr "드루이드들의 푸르른 숲에서 자연의 관대함을 가만히 바라보았지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = e781230b-bac0-5c8a-2f22-5ef056695b30
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:e781230b-bac0-5c8a-2f22-5ef056695b30
msgctxt "h88382a9eg33cfg456ag86a5gb9a6ac17ae42"
msgid "You. Will. Regret."
msgstr "너. 후회. 할 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Thisobald Thorm
#. NodeID = e7a20169-54a7-1c11-9830-93f5944c9a40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer:e7a20169-54a7-1c11-9830-93f5944c9a40
msgctxt "hb518d12cgf703g44b2gb797g9aa39524778e"
msgid ""
"Of pacts and deals and dotted lines - this <b>bores </b>me. <b>You </b>bore "
"me."
msgstr "서약과 거래와 점으로 뒤덮인 줄들, 이런 건 <b>지루해</b>. <b>넌</b> 날 지루하게 하는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e87c776c-4afe-fafe-ab3f-1b8d8140b510
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Dexterity
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
