msgid "You mean you're an actor? How did you end up here?"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_Brewer_Zombie_04
#. Speaker = Blighted Actor
#. NodeID = ed63fee5-c078-2b5c-87f1-d64e75fdf712
