msgid "Oh dear - she's well-pickled, whoever she was."
msgstr "오 이런, 아주 푹 절여졌네, 누구였든 간에."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel
