#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel:44a5de86-5ff9-8252-5c0a-8c9243e0d00e
msgctxt "he9cd88d7gb457g452ag8750gf787777046a3"
msgid ""
"If you don't find solace at the bottom of a bottle, try a barrel, I suppose."
msgstr "술병을 다 비우고도 위안을 찾지 못했다면, 술통을 한 번 비워 봐야겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44a5de86-5ff9-8252-5c0a-8c9243e0d00e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel:44a5de86-5ff9-8252-5c0a-8c9243e0d00e
msgctxt "h09d94b7fg2fecg4f7cgb35ag99dd26746dd7"
msgid "Someone drowned in alcohol. Yeesh."
msgstr "누가 알코올에 익사했어. 으으."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44a5de86-5ff9-8252-5c0a-8c9243e0d00e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel:44a5de86-5ff9-8252-5c0a-8c9243e0d00e
msgctxt "h0de94a58g4738g40ccg95a1gaa82c90738c6"
msgid "A body in a barrel. Quite the unique flavouring technique."
msgstr "통 속의 시체라. 꽤 독특하게 풍미를 내는 기술이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44a5de86-5ff9-8252-5c0a-8c9243e0d00e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel:44a5de86-5ff9-8252-5c0a-8c9243e0d00e
msgctxt "ha9dc6e56g7476g4fd8g9d3cg914d82756b72"
msgid "I suppose there's worse things to drown in."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44a5de86-5ff9-8252-5c0a-8c9243e0d00e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel:44a5de86-5ff9-8252-5c0a-8c9243e0d00e
msgctxt "he73cdf05ge393g4408gb842g8f557bdd61de"
msgid "Oh my. Someone went drowning their troubles - quite literally."
msgstr "오 이런. 누가 곤경에 빠졌군. 말 그대로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 44a5de86-5ff9-8252-5c0a-8c9243e0d00e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel:44a5de86-5ff9-8252-5c0a-8c9243e0d00e
msgctxt "h0c1b4584g96ccg4274ga861g2f26c9289d35"
msgid "Is that... a human arm? Do I even want to know?"
msgstr "저건... 사람 팔인가? 굳이 확인해볼 필요는 없겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_State_ReadBrewersDiary = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel:a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
msgctxt "hf57243d9g1ff7g4ad0g8340gf3208c3b9ead"
msgid "The Brewer's blackmailer. Quite the pickle she got herself into."
msgstr "양조업자 협박범이라. 절여지게 힘든 상황이었겠는데 ."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_State_ReadBrewersDiary = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel:a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
msgctxt "h451e817bg1dd1g4afcgb0d8gc7b3fd695223"
msgid ""
"This must be what remains of the lady who tried to blackmail the brewer. Put "
"her into a barrel rather than over one, it seems."
msgstr "분명 양조업자를 협박하려던 여성의 시체겠지. 궁지에 몰아넣으려다 술통으로 몰아넣은 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_State_ReadBrewersDiary = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel:a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
msgctxt "h39183983g360fg416dga364ge0ac114ee8b1"
msgid "Looks like this is the woman who tried to blackmail the brewer."
msgstr "이 사람이 양조업자를 협박하려던 여성인가본데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_State_ReadBrewersDiary = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel:a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
msgctxt "h57d3e2fag453ag47f8gad02gd0643bd44e0a"
msgid ""
"The brewer's blackmailer. I might find it funny, were I capable of it.\n"
"\n"
"Heh."
msgstr "양조업자 협박범이라. 내가 협박했더라면 재미있었겠어. 하하. 하."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_State_ReadBrewersDiary = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel:a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
msgctxt "heb1305dbg46ebg4ae5g873agdf7ecbf2f4d7"
msgid "The reward for attempted blackmail, I think."
msgstr "협박 미수에 대한 보상인가 봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_State_ReadBrewersDiary = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel:a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
msgctxt "hf8015e0eg48feg460fga8d0g1f115ee62845"
msgid "The blackmailer's remains. Must've made for a... flavourful toast."
msgstr "협박범의 시체로군. 아주... 풍미 가득한 건배사를 했겠는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_State_ReadBrewersDiary = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_ArmInBarrel:a2859617-741b-4aa9-aee7-faaaa1ba35a4
msgctxt "hf835a056g04ddg468agace3g940dd79d88b3"
msgid "Oh - oh my. Must be what's left of that would-be extortionist."
msgstr "오, 오 이런. 과하게 청구하려던 사람의 최후인가 보군.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead:1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
msgctxt "h84d01b70g72bcg43bega66fg1e6220bb3406"
msgid "Thank gods it's over. That creature was <i>disgusting</i>."
msgstr "다 끝나서 다행이야. 저 괴물은 <i>역겨웠어</i>."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead:1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
msgctxt "h5657fd86g17acg4d94gb50dg2c759af57ca5"
msgid "It's done. Let the shadows torment him no longer."
msgstr "끝났군. 그림자가 이 자를 더 이상 괴롭히지 않길 바라지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead:1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
msgctxt "h3fc86316gebf6g4dc9gbf33gd2436de094c4"
msgid ""
"A man to be pitied, for all the bile he had in life. His was a lonely end, "
"made a monster by these shadows."
msgstr "연민 받아 마땅해, 사는 동안 모든 증오를 받았잖아. 거기에 그림자에 잡아먹혀 괴물이 된 데다, 외롭게 혼자 죽었고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead:1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
msgctxt "hcac2c3b7gb87cg448agac12g245daa84ebea"
msgid "He's done for. I'll drink to that."
msgstr "놈이 죽었어. 이걸로 건배하지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead:1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
msgctxt "hd25becceg6c9dg4851g87a1g008d030a0a89"
msgid "A shame, what the shadows did to him. His death gives me no pleasure."
msgstr "안타까워, 그림자들이 그에게 한 짓을 보면. 그의 죽음은 어떤 만족감도 주지 않는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead:1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
msgctxt "h8f7f8eb5g376cg4e1bgbc06ga5b1b10fd24f"
msgid "Poor bloke. Wouldn't have minded drinking with him in another life."
msgstr "불쌍한 친구. 다른 생에서라면 그와 한잔하는 것도 나쁘지 않았을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_MINTHARA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead:1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
msgctxt "hdfedffdfgcf11g4008g87dbg1a120dbb9682"
msgid "Disgusting creature. I'm not sure I'll ever be rid of his bile-stench."
msgstr "역겨운 괴물 같으니. 이놈의 악취를 없앨 수 있을지 모르겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead:1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
msgctxt "hb87a399egb6ecg4245gb6c4gb0ecedbb7a40"
msgid ""
"Dead at last - but it will be some time before his foul vapours fade from my "
"nostrils."
msgstr "드디어 죽었군. 하지만 그 썩은 연기가 내 코에서 사라지기까지는 시간이 꽤 걸릴 것 같네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[8].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_BrewerDead:1627db2e-855d-4117-ab85-f197d1901e20
msgctxt "h3370ea75gdb6bg44bfg9041ga253f3fbac8f"
msgid "Pity we had to kill him. He seemed more lonely than cruel."
msgstr "죽여야 해서 불쌍하군. 잔혹하기보단 외로워 보였는데 말이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_Acid
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 8f17d52e-f529-4278-a653-d8b12fb1c761
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_Acid:8f17d52e-f529-4278-a653-d8b12fb1c761
msgctxt "h4eb73134g65f0g4214gab74gecc656bcc0de"
msgid "Watch it - the acid's altered his brew."
msgstr "조심해, 산이 놈의 술을 변화시켰어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_Cold
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75971e36-cba9-419f-8608-4322da3f6600
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_Cold:75971e36-cba9-419f-8608-4322da3f6600
msgctxt "h70c314f1g684eg47c7g88beg87f19708bd2d"
msgid "The brew's been chilled!"
msgstr "맥주가 차가워졌어!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted:7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
msgctxt "h746369efgc54ag4629gb03cg28bd7cbc2b81"
msgid "The damn thing's pickled himself with booze - will he even feel pain?"
msgstr "저 망할 것이 술에 절어버렸잖아, 고통을 느낄 수 있을까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted:7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
msgctxt "h595fa5ccgb764g4a9cg9357g3e4d8e87276d"
msgid "That gasbag is three sheets to the wind - can it even feel pain?"
msgstr "저 가스통이 취해버렸군, 고통을 느낄 순 있나?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted:7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
msgctxt "hc5162d08gabddg4d9dg9a78g975e13132929"
msgid "Guy is cursed and totally soused. Those types don't go down easy."
msgstr "녀석은 저주받은데다 술에 완전히 절었어. 저런 부류는 잘 안 쓰러지는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted:7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
msgctxt "h7f26160ag153eg4e5ag9e79g74b91716c40f"
msgid "This deviant's been rotted by drink. I shall enjoy sobering him up."
msgstr "이 변태는 술에 절었군. 내 기꺼이 깨워주지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted:7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
msgctxt "hc5e907a4g59d7g47a5gaf12g7a6082276a5c"
msgid "Damn thing's sozzled - might make for an unpredictable fight."
msgstr "저 젠장할 것이 취했어 - 예측하기 힘든 싸움이 될 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted:7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
msgctxt "h5c2a2f7fgbcafg4698gb8a1g9e8bc761c7fc"
msgid "Ugh - no telling what this bloated bastard's capable of."
msgstr "으윽, 저 부풀어 오른 개자식이 뭘 할지 감도 안 오는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_PAD_Brewer_CombatStarted:7ac45124-3119-44d2-85b2-066b199d1827
msgctxt "h7db5eca0gc03ag4c1agb1a5gf0b36ed36767"
