"destination hard to make out.*"
msgstr ""
"*시체 장미 꽃잎을 사용한 독에 대해 적혀있습니다. 양조업자가 한 상자 주문한 것으로 보이지만 짙은 보랏빛 얼룩 때문에 배송지를 알아보기 "
"어렵습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3e2d7fdd-fcc3-3ccb-0edc-73ba454c2658
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:3e2d7fdd-fcc3-3ccb-0edc-73ba454c2658
msgctxt "h691b2dbdgb504g4037ga583gd82ed0812cce"
msgid ""
"*After exhaustive experimentation, he was able to make a near-deadly extract "
"from the glands. But to complete his poison, Thisobald required one last "
"ingredient:*"
msgstr ""
"*고루한 반복 실험 끝에, 분비샘에서 치명적인 추출물을 만들어냈습니다. 하지만 티소발드의 독을 완성하기 위해서는 마지막 한 재료가 "
"필요했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 42e0215d-9988-ae7f-d555-e08ca4d425d2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:42e0215d-9988-ae7f-d555-e08ca4d425d2
msgctxt "h5e1898e6gb8b7g4ca8g85e9g145fe192b7fb"
msgid ""
"*With the corpse rose petals the package contains, you might create "
"Thisobald's purple worm poison.*"
msgstr "*꾸러미 안에 든 시체 장미 꽃잎이 있다면, 티소발드의 퍼플 웜 독을 만들 수 있겠지요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 50422d2e-afde-69cb-d864-6f447a41176a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_State_InLabCinematicTrigger(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:50422d2e-afde-69cb-d864-6f447a41176a
msgctxt "h7d3895bag930eg46dega51cg8404df945706"
msgid "*You set your eyes on the various formulas and copious notes.*"
msgstr "*당신은 다양한 화학식과 방대한 양의 주석을 읽어 내려갑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7763e7ab-98fb-7ef3-a680-c5b2026ae636
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:7763e7ab-98fb-7ef3-a680-c5b2026ae636
msgctxt "hbdc9cc85g1d2ag4939ga4a0gb0f3ad51792b"
msgid ""
"*He procured several parts of a gullet, but rinsed one in error. The poison "
"he brewed was noxious - but not fatal.*"
msgstr "*벌레 식도 몇 부분을 구했지만, 실수로 하나를 헹구고 말았습니다. 그가 제조한 독은 강했지만, 치명적이지는 않았습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 7ca3bf68-76f1-5d8c-9086-9cf59da0daae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Intelligence
#. DifficultyClass: 14
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_Knows_AlchemyStashLocation = False
#.   Object:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_State_CheckedResearchNotes(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_State_CheckedResearchNotes(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:7ca3bf68-76f1-5d8c-9086-9cf59da0daae
msgctxt "h2775ea5eg354ag4f03ga9c5g3873cd67144b"
msgid ""
"<i>Focus your eyes on the page. Mentally separate the blank ink from the "
"purple stain.</i>"
msgstr "<i>집중해서 마지막 장을 본다. 마음 속에서 검은 잉크와 보라색 얼룩을 분리해낸다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7d3f5db2-4f05-5aa1-f74c-042945eedc6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:7d3f5db2-4f05-5aa1-f74c-042945eedc6c
msgctxt "h0bbea685g245eg4336gaee6gd19d8d386edd"
msgid ""
"*The book's index reveals corpse roses may grow near tombs, mausoleums, and "
"particularly redolent cadavers.*"
msgstr "*책의 색인에서 시체 장미는 무덤이나 영묘, 특히 악취나는 시체 근처에서 자랄 것이라는 내용을 찾았습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 97a8364c-ace4-db9d-a9eb-732b1393447f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_Knows_AlchemyStashLocation = False
#.   Object:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_State_InLabCinematicTrigger(1) = True
#.      - TWN_Distillery_HasMet_ResearchNotes(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_HasMet_ResearchNotes(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:97a8364c-ace4-db9d-a9eb-732b1393447f
msgctxt "h252a17b4g7281g4bcfg893bgb10d9850ec93"
msgid ""
"*Research notes. They describe a powerful venom extracted from a rare purple "
"worm. Distiller Thisobald Thorm sought to create a fatal poison using the "
"worm's gullet.*"
msgstr ""
"*연구 노트. 희귀한 퍼플 웜에서 추출한 강력한 독에 대한 설명입니다. 양조자 티소발드 쏨은 벌레의 식도를 이용해 치명적인 독을 만들려고 "
"했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 98f188a3-9c48-f9db-d6f9-544cdef69481
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:98f188a3-9c48-f9db-d6f9-544cdef69481
msgctxt "h60fc2892g36dcg42efga322ga48b5ef1e6bb"
msgid ""
"*He procured several parts of a worm gullet, but rinsed one in error. The "
"poison he brewed was noxious - but not fatal.*"
msgstr "*벌레 식도 몇 부분을 구했지만, 실수로 하나를 헹구고 말았습니다. 그가 제조한 독은 강했지만, 치명적이지는 않았습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 9bd422a3-2b8c-b2d9-4d7d-dbbf153fbe5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:9bd422a3-2b8c-b2d9-4d7d-dbbf153fbe5b
msgctxt "he562854egc773g4c7ega58agc538a45fcccb"
msgid ""
"*Thisobald enlisted a courier from Baldur's Gate to obtain corpse rose "
"petals and other ingredients and deliver them to a covert location.*"
msgstr "*티소발드는 시체 장미 꽃잎과 다른 재료를 얻기 위해 택배원을 고용해 은밀한 장소에 배달하도록 했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = be7c9ef0-adde-3465-1c48-405f55d8a46c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:be7c9ef0-adde-3465-1c48-405f55d8a46c
msgctxt "hd4ac0676ge5ebg4962g9793gaa642b7ce90b"
msgid ""
"*He devoted months to formulating a deadly poison with the remaining "
"ingredients, without success.*"
msgstr "*티소발드는 남은 재료로 치명적인 독을 만드는 데 몇 달을 투자했지만, 성공하지 못했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c3de448a-8d0b-4533-4340-617355174618
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:c3de448a-8d0b-4533-4340-617355174618
msgctxt "haf6a1d06gb66bg4d2cgad19g9285d04753d7"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = c55c42fa-8116-0df9-11fa-d02c5eb7d425
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:c55c42fa-8116-0df9-11fa-d02c5eb7d425
msgctxt "hf5f18667g5d4ag4115g9db7gfe68aabb96df"
msgid ""
"*Unfortunately, a deep purple stain darkens the final page, obscuring the "
"parcel's destination.*"
msgstr "*아쉽게도, 짙은 보라색 얼룩이 마지막 장을 물들여 택배 목적지를 가렸습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d808fe84-34ca-82b3-cd11-c94c02e5e495
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:d808fe84-34ca-82b3-cd11-c94c02e5e495
msgctxt "hbb92eae7gb8d3g4c44gb083g3c3f3d6fde20"
msgid ""
"*Thisobald devoted months to formulating a deadly poison with the remaining "
"ingredients, without success.*"
msgstr "*티소발드는 남은 재료로 치명적인 독을 만드는 데 몇 달을 투자했지만, 성공하지 못했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e0820b70-845b-363f-e424-724c7b331f20
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_State_FoundAlchemyStash = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_Event_LearnedAlchemyStashLocation(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:e0820b70-845b-363f-e424-724c7b331f20
msgctxt "ha22a563cg2f93g4343gae69g1906988415a7"
msgid ""
"*Your mind separates the black from the blue, revealing the stash's "
"location. You mark your map as a reminder.*"
msgstr ""
"*당신은 마음 속에서 검은색과 푸른 색을 분리해내고, 보관함의 위치를 밝혀냅니다. 나중에 확인할 수 있도록 당신의 지도에 표시합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e0faedca-9be9-7c89-3e63-af513c25317b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_State_FoundAlchemyStash = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:e0faedca-9be9-7c89-3e63-af513c25317b
msgctxt "h3b04e806gb030g4c4ag9769g052f28b0cfd7"
msgid ""
"*The location is revealed. And it seems you have already discovered the "
"package.*"
msgstr "*위치를 알아냈습니다. 그리고 이미 당신은 꾸러미를 찾은듯합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e7ae1705-cba1-34f8-e6c6-71a03e0b9b01
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_Knows_AlchemyStashLocation = False
#.   Object:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_HasMet_ResearchNotes(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_Distillery_HasMet_ResearchNotes(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:e7ae1705-cba1-34f8-e6c6-71a03e0b9b01
msgctxt "h549e7500gc9c1g461bgb3a9gc1007e81c9a2"
msgid ""
"*Research notes. They describe a powerful venom extracted from a rare purple "
"worm. Distiller Thisobald Thorm sought to create a fatal poison using the "
"worm's gullet.*"
msgstr ""
"*연구 노트. 희귀한 퍼플 웜에서 추출한 강력한 독에 대한 설명입니다. 양조자 티소발드 쏨은 벌레의 식도를 이용해 치명적인 독을 만들려고 "
"했습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = ef46f85a-f86d-86c1-0c8a-94a156edde19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Distillery_State_FoundAlchemyStash = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:ef46f85a-f86d-86c1-0c8a-94a156edde19
msgctxt "hfdec47bfg4bfbg4d65gb497g85a05dc3e3b7"
msgid ""
"*The poison described within requires corpse rose petals. The distiller "
"ordered a packet of them, but a dark purple stain makes the delivery "
"destination hard to make out.*"
msgstr ""
"*시체 장미 꽃잎을 사용한 독에 대해 적혀있습니다. 양조업자가 한 상자 주문한 것으로 보이지만 짙은 보랏빛 얼룩 때문에 배송지를 알아보기 "
"어렵습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fe236491-2bd4-6a71-128b-17459b507bbc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Distillery_ResearchNotes:fe236491-2bd4-6a71-128b-17459b507bbc
msgctxt "h66eed9cbg5838g4278gbe95ga88a0031577f"
msgid ""
"*The page is a mess of dark colour. The delivery's location remains a "
"mystery.*"
msgstr "*마지막 장은 어두운 색으로 엉망입니다. 배송 위치는 수수께끼로 남아 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_LeavingAct
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 002fc1cf-af32-f8dd-7515-e9da2fa8684a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_LeavingAct:002fc1cf-af32-f8dd-7515-e9da2fa8684a
msgctxt "hd53dff96g1079g4f6dg8c20g6f7e576597db"
msgid ""
"*Ketheric is defeated, the path ahead clear. You should be elated, but the "
"sight of the land you leave behind does nothing to alleviate your sorrow.*"
msgstr "*케서릭이 패배하며, 앞길이 뚜렷해졌습니다. 기뻐할 일이지만, 당신의 뒤에 남겨진 땅의 광경은 슬픔을 달래기 어렵게 만듭니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_LeavingAct
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 00adef0c-2e8c-9136-f262-79c41da793ba
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_LeavingAct:00adef0c-2e8c-9136-f262-79c41da793ba
msgctxt "hf94725e6g9cdag492dg9532g6a7281569db1"
msgid "*Though however deep your pain, it cannot compare to Halsin's.*"
msgstr "*당신이 심적으로 얼마나 괴롭든, 할신의 고통과는 견줄 수 없을 겁니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_LeavingAct
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = d4085dba-4fc9-42b2-a710-360a3fb78aaa
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_LeavingAct:d4085dba-4fc9-42b2-a710-360a3fb78aaa
msgctxt "h2a265f7bg4781g4821gb1e8g1d61dc9ca996"
msgid ""
"*Your courage has been tested, and in this, at least, you have triumphed.*"
msgstr "*당신의 용기가 시험대에 올랐으나, 적어도 이번만큼은 승리를 거두었습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_LeavingAct
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e810a241-1d67-4f17-e9b5-297bc6588477
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_LiftingTheCurse_State_BreathHasBeenRestored = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_LeavingAct:e810a241-1d67-4f17-e9b5-297bc6588477
msgctxt "h23da93d4gd07dg404agb9b4g5da581868abc"
msgid ""
"*The curse has been lifted, the lands cleansed of the shadows. Ketheric's "
"reign of living death is over.*"
msgstr "*저주가 걷히며, 섀도펠의 그림자 또한 이 땅에서 물러납니다. 죽음 그 자체였던 케서릭의 통치가 마침내 막을 내렸습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
msgctxt "hd5f3f9d4g39c0g44bdgaa66g32bb806f347d"
msgid "So, the army's gone. Next stop: Baldur's Gate."
msgstr "그래서, 군대는 떠났군. 다음 정류장은 발더스 게이트."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
msgctxt "h15b5b661g3df4g439ag9e07g34a1139fff31"
msgid ""
"The army of the Absolute is gone, marching west. Sooner or later the very "
"walls of Baldur's Gate will tremble."
msgstr "절대자의 군대가 서쪽으로 행군하고 있어. 이르든 늦든 발더스 게이트의 성벽이 흔들리겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
msgctxt "h0a11d59dgb29bg4a89gb342g04852c1593cd"
msgid ""
"The Absolute's army trampled through here. We can't let them get to Baldur's "
"Gate."
msgstr "절대자의 군대가 이곳을 짓밟고 지나갔군. 발더스 게이트에 도달하게 둘 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
msgctxt "hbbb7b66cg2788g472ag9ea0gd109a63e8f29"
msgid "The Absolute's forces have marched forth. Baldur's Gate is in danger."
msgstr "절대자의 병력이 진격했군. 발더스 게이트가 위험해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
msgctxt "h217a7b3agcfa7g4bd2g8195g37be01d5b53a"
msgid ""
"The Absolute's legions - they're gone. And I doubt they've disbanded "
"peacefully..."
msgstr "절대자의 군단이 떠났어. 평화롭게 해산했을 리는 없지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
msgctxt "ha2efe2c8g4f1ag4f12g87c0gb2629b55e4e7"
msgid ""
"The army of the Absolute marches west to the Gate. The city is strong - but "
"it will not hold forever."
msgstr "절대자의 군대가 서쪽에 있는 발더스 게이트로 행군하는군. 그 도시는 강하지만, 영원히 버틸 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:08a96937-dd2b-4766-bdba-d81b11be2343
msgctxt "he09516d6g541fg4d29g9a6ag7e2baf66acb9"
msgid ""
"The Absolute's armies are on the march - and Baldur's Gate is their target."
msgstr "절대자의 군대가 행군하고 있어. 발더스 게이트가 목표로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
msgctxt "hd86c74c6g5845g4b20ga5e4g14b292a80d2b"
msgid "It looks like a horde stomped past here."
msgstr "수많은 무리가 이곳을 짓밟고 지나간 모양이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
msgctxt "he3d02c85g2d1ag4aa7g9de1gf316d160d13b"
msgid ""
"These grounds look like they've been trampled by an entire horde of beasts. "
"An army passed through here."
msgstr "이 땅은 마치 수많은 짐승 무리에게 짓밟힌 것 같군. 군대가 이곳을 통과했어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
msgctxt "h0f7560c2gbe77g4f86gbe2cgd749763ab43b"
msgid "An army's stampeded through here. A <i>big </i>army."
msgstr "군대가 이곳을 쇄도해 지나갔어. 그것도 <i>큰</i> 군대가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
msgctxt "hf5612eebg5c8eg420dga006g4bbc81270c37"
msgid ""
"An army's trampled these grounds. The Absolute's forces are on the move."
msgstr "군대가 이 땅을 깔아뭉갰군. 절대자의 병력이 이동 중이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
msgctxt "h390b471cgea8eg4f0cgb913g7b3051bf9daf"
msgid "All these tracks - enough for an army. They must be on the march."
msgstr "이 많은 흔적들…. 군대가 분명해. 행군 중인 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = False
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
msgctxt "h548f6502g89ffg467ag9e93g27965d16732e"
msgid ""
"An army has marched through here, travelling west to... to Baldur's Gate!"
msgstr "군대가 이곳을 지나갔어, 서쪽으로... 발더스 게이트로!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Finale_PAD_ArmyLeft:351732d7-24da-258a-95ab-3e7673179036
msgctxt "h44ccebb9gf1cfg4abbgb927g4aec7b3ab2d7"
msgid "Looks like an army marched through here."
msgstr "군대가 이곳을 지나간 모양이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_FishermanNote_AD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3ccd3d8c-d3b1-3871-810c-75a5c1b4c21c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_FishermanNote_AD:3ccd3d8c-d3b1-3871-810c-75a5c1b4c21c
msgctxt "h714f9b89ga72eg4edfg9ba6gf174e9546e3d"
msgid "*Gone fishing. CATCH you later! - Ellis*"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1ce53d46-c29b-be23-1025-a794d8d644db
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss:1ce53d46-c29b-be23-1025-a794d8d644db
msgctxt "ha605f175g1d68g484dgb71ag0dd9a929645c"
msgid "<i>Leave it be.</i>"
msgstr "<i>내버려 둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 32cdd5e3-c92e-3b14-e6cf-c30683e0ed11
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss:32cdd5e3-c92e-3b14-e6cf-c30683e0ed11
msgctxt "h218f6bbeg0956g4331g9b29gbb6424236fc3"
msgid ""
"*Is this the Shadow Weave's presence, or a darkness within you from the "
"beginning, waiting to be called?*"
msgstr "*이것이 그림자 위브의 존재일까요, 아니면 애초에 당신 안에 있던 어둠이, 불려나오길 기다리고 있었을까요?*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 3c475054-6239-6f5b-32b5-6b137d284e61
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss:3c475054-6239-6f5b-32b5-6b137d284e61
msgctxt "hadf1d9d2ge42cg48a2gaa4egb6429b12a116"
msgid ""
"*Left alone, its corruption will leak and spread. You could nullify it, "
"preventing such harm as Mystra would want. Or you could absorb it, tasting "
"Shar's forbidden magic for yourself.*"
msgstr ""
"*홀로 남겨두면, 오염은 새어나와 퍼질 것입니다. 당신은 미스트라가 원하듯, 이를 중화하여 피해를 막을 수 있겠지요. 혹은 이를 "
"흡수하여, 샤의 금지된 마법을 맛볼 수 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4691cf19-f0f4-87c1-1be9-ae5e98e59ac7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BREWER_CREATURE(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss:4691cf19-f0f4-87c1-1be9-ae5e98e59ac7
msgctxt "h98e27125gc7cag445eg8ae7gcc18a796445d"
msgid ""
"*The corpse is saturated with darkness, flesh and bone corrupted by a dense "
"concentration of Shadow Weave. Sharran magic, summoned from beyond the "
"Weave's boundaries. Beyond Mystra's control.*"
msgstr ""
"*시체는 어둠으로 가득 찼으며, 살점과 뼈는 진한 그림자 위브에 오염되었습니다. 샤의 마법입니다. 위브의 가장자리 너머에서 불려 왔죠. "
"미스트라의 통제 너머에서요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 5fac9503-e863-c7b8-d19b-f9427465fb23
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss:5fac9503-e863-c7b8-d19b-f9427465fb23
msgctxt "ha7bb7d9bg64f1g490dg9f73g1835fcf856a8"
msgid ""
"*A blast of purest Weave is enough to banish the shadow magic trapped "
"beneath the corpse's skin.*"
msgstr "*순수한 위브의 폭발은 시체의 피부 아래 붙잡혀 있는 그림자 마법을 없애 버리기에 충분합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6bbeeccd-ae03-7dbe-fee1-c032609c3ffd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Gale_State_RefusedTWNBossPower = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss:6bbeeccd-ae03-7dbe-fee1-c032609c3ffd
msgctxt "h4f3bf89cg2bb8g4911ga690g150763c37d3e"
msgid "<i>Cleanse the corpse. Destroy this tainted power.</i>"
msgstr "<i>시체를 정화한다. 이 오염된 힘을 파괴한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = a3555063-1f3a-c67c-0536-3f2b7279bed5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BREWER_CREATURE(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss:a3555063-1f3a-c67c-0536-3f2b7279bed5
msgctxt "hba62bc2fgee58g4be9ga41fg1df3c919dcdd"
msgid ""
"*The corpse is saturated with darkness, flesh and bone corrupted by a dense "
"concentration of Shadow Weave. Sharran magic, summoned from beyond the "
"Weave's boundaries. Beyond Mystra's control.*"
msgstr ""
"*시체는 어둠으로 가득 찼으며, 살점과 뼈는 진한 그림자 위브에 오염되었습니다. 샤의 마법입니다. 위브의 가장자리 너머에서 불려 왔죠. "
"미스트라의 통제 너머에서요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = b31879eb-21f8-e90e-c4e2-74a54405d91b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss:b31879eb-21f8-e90e-c4e2-74a54405d91b
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "haeda5dcegb109g4c83g8c0dg84962dede20e"
msgid ""
"*In its stead, a new power answers your call. One beyond the bounds of "
"Mystra's authority. And beyond her approval.*"
msgstr "*그 대신, 새로운 힘이 당신의 부름에 응합니다. 미스트라의 권위 너머에 있는 힘. 그리고 미스트라의 승인 너머에 있는 힘.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = bd387fba-ee6d-4c46-0f4b-94db942f3b29
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ORI_GALE_MYSTRABLESSED(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Gale_State_AbsorbedTWNBossPower = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss:bd387fba-ee6d-4c46-0f4b-94db942f3b29
msgctxt "hdc533483gf843g4616ga5c1gf7977c386b89"
msgid ""
"*Shadow magic floods your body. Where you once felt Mystra's light, there is "
"now only darkness.*"
msgstr "*그림자 마법이 몸에 흘러넘칩니다. 당신이 한때 미스트라의 빛을 느꼈던 곳엔, 이제 어둠만이 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c9f050b3-c036-b5bd-72ab-541850737cab
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss:c9f050b3-c036-b5bd-72ab-541850737cab
msgctxt "he8441dc2gafb0g490fg86f5g9941bb48ccb0"
msgid "<i>Consume the Shadow Weave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그림자 위브를 흡수한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = f34ea68a-8afb-7591-b759-5fed27bdb8b5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ORI_GALE_MYSTRABLESSED(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - ORI_Gale_State_AbsorbedTWNBossPower = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss:f34ea68a-8afb-7591-b759-5fed27bdb8b5
msgctxt "hdd3a145eg6eb7g4a9cg8a1agac64247ffc1f"
msgid ""
"*Its shadows spread through your veins, purging all traces of Mystra's "
"blessing. It cannot tolerate such light.*"
msgstr "*그림자가 당신의 혈관을 통해 퍼져나가, 미스트라가 내린 축복의 흔적을 지워냅니다. 그런 빛을 용납하지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = feafbf8d-ee12-a927-7b31-cb27bfb0894a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Gale_LootBoss:feafbf8d-ee12-a927-7b31-cb27bfb0894a
msgctxt "h10e50e05gb79ag434cgbb65gd6473b6edbfa"
msgid ""
"*As its blight fades, you feel a lightness rush in to take its place - "
"<i>Mystra</i>. A taste of what you lost and of what awaits you for "
"fulfilling her purpose.*"
msgstr ""
"*질병이 사라지고, 빛의 충만함이 그 자리를 채워나갑니다. <i>미스트라</i>입니다. 당신이 잃어버린 것, 그리고 미스트라의 목적을 "
"달성하였을 때 기다리는 것의 맛입니다.* "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_HelpWantedPoster_AD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = fd6f2141-0c05-43dd-9ce7-a9ec6d6fdb65
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_HelpWantedPoster_AD:fd6f2141-0c05-43dd-9ce7-a9ec6d6fdb65
msgctxt "h7fad0decg3832g436cg951cg015184291241"
msgid ""
"*Hauliers and merchants wanted. Sail the silvery seas! Gaze upon the Gate! "
"No experience required.*"
msgstr "*운송업자들과 상인들을 모집합니다. 은빛 바다를 항해하세요! 발더스 게이트를 바라보세요! 경험이 필요하지 않습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_HospitalPlaque_AD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 1b717844-4d79-44b3-1213-b022f5088526
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_HospitalPlaque_AD:1b717844-4d79-44b3-1213-b022f5088526
msgctxt "ha54983a0g1515g418dgb3f0gbda888241d2c"
msgid "*Reithwin House of Healing. Presiding Surgeon: Malus Thorm.*"
msgstr "*라이스윈, 치유의 집. 집도 중인 외과의: 메일러스 쏨.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_HospitalSignpost_AD
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 4a5598c7-f983-4b7e-bc2b-affb53ae7843
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_HospitalSignpost_AD:4a5598c7-f983-4b7e-bc2b-affb53ae7843
