#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_AD_Surgeon:1b01a23d-7859-4c94-9cf1-c8f4cfc82de5
msgctxt "he76c2418gebdfg4325gaf69g331f4f59b696"
msgid "See here, how I soothe each vein with the tenderest touch."
msgstr "여기 와서, 내가 어떻게 부드러운 손길로 하나하나 정맥을 진정시키는지 보게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_AD_Surgeon
#. Speaker = Malus Thorm
#. NodeID = 22e751ea-8dd6-1ffe-daca-c905174210a4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
