msgctxt "hf9b90b90g5048g4336ga731g1e50ad2e1305"
msgid "Woe, that every subject cannot know the peace of absence."
msgstr "슬프군. 부재의 평화를 모르는 신도가 있다니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_AD_Surgeon
#. Speaker = Malus Thorm
#. NodeID = 8ff3ae91-74cb-cda0-0dd7-a286fe2bc931
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
