#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P:63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
msgctxt "h3176b6a2g746bg4f8fg8372g81cb25ec9105"
msgid "Is that a hospital? Not that anyone's being healed around here."
msgstr "병원이 맞아? 회복하고 있는 환자들은 안 보이는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P:63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
msgctxt "hd43b225dgabdfg47f1gb1b3gc2c6a9244905"
msgid "A hospital. Doubt anyone's been healed around here in a long time..."
msgstr "병원이군. 오랜 기간 방치된 것 같아 보여."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P:63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
msgctxt "h4bcaba07g827fg4d80gaf0cgef10661e5f83"
msgid "Looks like a hospital - or a healer's house, anyway."
msgstr "병원... 아니, 치유의 집 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P:63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
msgctxt "h2e54fa70g5bd5g4560g9618g1fb9e821e15d"
msgid ""
"A place of healing. We might stand to plunder a few tonics, at the very "
"least."
msgstr "치유의 집이군. 아마 굴러다니는 물약 몇 개는 찾을 수 있겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P:63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
msgctxt "hb87eb92cgaba9g492eg8c0dg8c9436275e87"
msgid "A hospital. Might be able to scrounge a few supplies."
msgstr "병원이야. 필요한 물자를 구할 수 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P:63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
msgctxt "h91fba77bg2c27g4e26ga9f5ga0b5deeb8646"
msgid "An infirmary. Too bad the current locals are beyond saving."
msgstr "보건실이라. 현지인들이 이미 구할 수 없는 상태라는 게 안타까울 뿐이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_1P:63dc5fb5-6e9f-4a39-a2a9-e69a86e955f1
msgctxt "h65b322c9gf8f2g4ceag908cg9998d8c32801"
msgid "A house of healing, for all the good it does anyone now."
msgstr "치유의 집이라. 이제는 쓸모 없어진 장소에 와 있군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71df27e4-ec23-433f-ab3f-591403f70ff7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P:71df27e4-ec23-433f-ab3f-591403f70ff7
msgctxt "h702b2e6bg8580g4c05gb068gfeac820314f6"
msgid "Is that a hospital? <i>Here?</i>"
msgstr "병원인가?<i>이런 곳에?</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71df27e4-ec23-433f-ab3f-591403f70ff7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P:71df27e4-ec23-433f-ab3f-591403f70ff7
msgctxt "h24e692e0g66c9g4d13gb80dgdf3e1bf6702b"
msgid "Looks like a hospital. Or the remains of one."
msgstr "병원같은데. 병원의 잔재라고 해야 할지도."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71df27e4-ec23-433f-ab3f-591403f70ff7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
