msgctxt "ha094887eg075fg4a06ga106g50ee0fdc03bd"
msgid "Looks like a hospital - or a healer's house, anyway."
msgstr "병원... 아니, 치유의 집 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71df27e4-ec23-433f-ab3f-591403f70ff7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P:71df27e4-ec23-433f-ab3f-591403f70ff7
msgctxt "hd58d7316g16f0g47ccg8ba2gfeb1f860e0d2"
msgid "Ah - a house of healing."
msgstr "아, 치유의 집이군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71df27e4-ec23-433f-ab3f-591403f70ff7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P:71df27e4-ec23-433f-ab3f-591403f70ff7
msgctxt "ha61e4d41gf408g4841g9ca7g3f9cf70feabc"
msgid "Looks like a hospital."
msgstr "병원같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71df27e4-ec23-433f-ab3f-591403f70ff7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P:71df27e4-ec23-433f-ab3f-591403f70ff7
msgctxt "h2f27d782g67f9g4958g992fg51de25106fd4"
msgid "An infirmary, no doubt about it."
msgstr "틀림없이 의무실이로군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 71df27e4-ec23-433f-ab3f-591403f70ff7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P:71df27e4-ec23-433f-ab3f-591403f70ff7
msgctxt "ha212e185g4c74g4251ga1c1gebb35da829f5"
msgid "A house of healing, from the looks of it."
msgstr "치유의 집 같아 보이는데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P:ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
msgctxt "h42a4da52g2dd2g4248gad06g88edcdbccc2c"
msgid "For all the good it's doing in a place like this."
msgstr "이런 마을에 치유의 집 따위가 무슨 소용이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P:ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
msgctxt "hbee3c170g6fc0g498bga9c4g9386b9c2bab8"
msgid "Should I be in need of medical treatment, please don't bring me here."
msgstr "내가 다치더라도 이곳에 데리고 오진 말아줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P:ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
msgctxt "heb870038g5f64g4160gb24bg0d40dc008f33"
msgid ""
"Might be some potions inside. Or a load of cursed scalpels flying at our "
"faces."
msgstr "어딘가 물약이 있을지 몰라. 혹시 저주 받은 메스 한 뭉치가 날아올지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P:ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
msgctxt "h0a340ee1gc061g4246g82abgdc4faca86df9"
msgid "A fortunate find. We could do with some potions for the journey ahead."
msgstr "운이 좋군. 이곳에서 물약을 좀 찾을 수 있을 것 같아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P:ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
msgctxt "h8597f9cag9262g41c8gaa0dgdfe338218a49"
msgid ""
"We could check for supplies - not like the remaining locals have use for "
"them."
msgstr "물자라도 찾아보는 게 어때, 여기 사람들이 더 필요할 것 같진 않으니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P:ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
msgctxt "hdf013bebg1d93g4993g8121g1661a4cee25a"
msgid "Too bad the cursed locals are well beyond saving."
msgstr "이곳 사람들의 저주를 치료 하기에는 이미 너무 늦었어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_Entrance_2P:ce13f0c9-9a88-43f9-9b43-eaefa65c05b7
msgctxt "h7b86956bge1eeg4edbga410g2bad4e6fd3dc"
msgid "Good news for us. There could be some useful potions inside."
msgstr "잘 됐네. 아직 쓸만한 물약이 남아있을지도 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
msgctxt "h88c9b2a4g24ceg4727gb63fgb712420b3140"
msgid "Gods, that was horrific. Even by this place's standards."
msgstr "세상에나, 갈수록 끔찍해지는데. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
msgctxt "h5c6c9979g507dg4f40gb8eag2d64a72e12a4"
msgid ""
"What a thrill. The more abhorrent the creature, the more satisfying the kill."
msgstr "짜릿하군. 사냥감이 끔찍할수록 사냥이 만족스럽기 마련이지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
msgctxt "h3306d226g95abg48a4ga366gd33459d92d2d"
msgid "I'm not doctor, but I'd say that's terminal."
msgstr "내가 의사는 아니지만, 이미 가망이 없다는 건 알겠군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
msgctxt "h276ff2e2gdca3g415fg89cege48f908720a4"
msgid "I'm glad that's over. No wonder some people are afraid of doctors..."
msgstr "끝나서 다행이네. 이래서 사람들이 의사를 무서워하는 것도 무리는 아니지..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
msgctxt "h96ac2138g3069g4732g9cb0g29317a75ffb3"
msgid "It's over. He will perform no more surgeries, inflict no more pain."
msgstr "끝났어. 이제 더는 누구를 수술하는 것도 고통주는 것도 못하겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
msgctxt "h8430ec0bg6c73g4cdfgbe18gd16434116034"
msgid "Scalpels down, thank the gods."
msgstr "드디어 끝났군. 정말 다행이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
msgctxt "h18f30a0eg35b0g4dd0g8311g59abc7a3dfa4"
msgid "A rotten heart beats no more. Good riddance."
msgstr "이걸로 저 썩은 심장이 더는 뛰지 못하겠지. 이런이런."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:4cd37dbd-e38f-7062-0f44-860fcf3f5f02
msgctxt "h76c94778gf775g41dbgb4faga344d5b10186"
msgid "That's one shadow monster dead."
msgstr "그림자 괴물이 또 하나 죽었군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_NursesKilledSurgeon = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
msgctxt "h1b339c9bgc8adg4613g8399ge1c76d0efc55"
msgid ""
"Horrific as this place is, seeing someone cut down by their own minions is "
"always funny."
msgstr "이 장소는 끔찍하지만 자기 부하들에게 썰리는 괴물을 보는 건 좀 유쾌하네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_NursesKilledSurgeon = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
msgctxt "hfa580e30g50bdg463bga3bdgb0f3347ef2ab"
msgid ""
"An appropriate end, given the torture he's inflicted. A shame I didn't get "
"to take part."
msgstr "저 괴물이 행한 고문들을 생각하면 걸맞은 결말이지. 내가 직접 끝내지 못한 건 아까워."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_NursesKilledSurgeon = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
msgctxt "h34c06c0eg0dbdg4a99g860ag8d5a67affc8d"
msgid "Killed by his own nurses. Not a treatment I'd be eager to sign up for."
msgstr "자기 간호사들 손에 죽다니, 저런 방식의 치료법은 전혀 받고 싶지 않은걸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_NursesKilledSurgeon = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
msgctxt "hb4e2a001gec25g4ce8g853cgf9a135bd5f6b"
msgid "Always a pleasure, watching your foes turn on themselves."
msgstr "자기들끼리 죽고 죽여준다면 언제나 환영이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_NursesKilledSurgeon = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
msgctxt "h48fe5175gc799g4ee1ga4c4g96aafff4e2ab"
msgid "Delivered to the jaws of oblivion by the sisters who revered him."
msgstr "따르던 자매들의 손에 영영 떠나버렸군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_NursesKilledSurgeon = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
msgctxt "h6bca1691g6db7g4067gb5bag4d9e1c0c9c46"
msgid "What kind of hell did I just watch."
msgstr "대체 내가 방금 무슨 지옥을 본거지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_NursesKilledSurgeon = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
msgctxt "h2c6a84fcga5d7g431fg8af8g6c201db7b073"
msgid "Slaughtered by his own minions. A deservedly-ignominious end."
msgstr "자기 부하들에게 학살당하다니, 이 자에게 걸맞은 수치스러운 최후야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_NursesKilledSurgeon = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:64692f60-2f65-4b03-a1f1-7ee79c1102d7
msgctxt "h15c80591g4a0eg4972gb75eg21c8117955c5"
msgid "I can't believe that worked. These shadows really do twist people."
msgstr "이게 되다니 믿을 수 없네. 그림자가 정말 사람을 뒤틀어놓는 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_SurgeonKilledHimself = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
msgctxt "h372f78ddge843g439dgaf55g3d0d801e7de9"
msgid ""
"That was... easy? I wish more of our enemies were that happy to destroy "
"themselves."
msgstr "생각보다... 쉬웠네? 우리 적들이 좀 더 자주 서로 죽여주면 좋을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_SurgeonKilledHimself = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
msgctxt "he86cdfafgdbbbg4209gbbf7gb1a0a95074c3"
msgid ""
"His own final victim. A bloody sort of poetry - beautiful in its own way."
msgstr "자신이 대망의 마지막 희생자가 되다니, 잔혹하고 아름답군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_SurgeonKilledHimself = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
msgctxt "h2f3ace97g8ef5g4910ga912ge78ae7057e68"
msgid "Nothing like giving someone a taste of their own medicine."
msgstr "준 만큼 똑같이 돌려받는군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
