msgctxt "hbfdef5fbg12f0g4a5bg9803gac8723d303ea"
msgid "Fool. Someone so gullible has no business being near a scalpel."
msgstr "멍청한 놈. 저렇게 속기 쉬운 사람은 메스 근처에 있어서는 안 되지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_SurgeonKilledHimself = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
msgctxt "he5dfff7bg0981g48d4g8146g7a1824562dc5"
msgid "He delivered himself to the jaws of oblivion - a fitting end."
msgstr "스스로 자신의 끝을 맞이하는군, 적절한 최후야. "

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
