#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
msgctxt "ha0588990g2a7cg44efgbe60g6cde93d2e2c0"
msgid "If only all our enemies could be convinced to take themselves out."
msgstr "적들 모두 이렇게 스스로 처리해주면 참 좋을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_SurgeonKilledHimself = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_HALSIN
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
msgctxt "h7b45ce27g4c78g4697g9a9dg23588814d47e"
msgid ""
"If only that foul creature had been compelled to perform surgery on himself "
"years before."
msgstr "좀 더 일찍 저 괴물이 스스로 수술대에 오르도록 했더라면 좋았을 텐데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[7].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Hospital_State_SurgeonKilledHimself = True
#. TagRule: !REALLY_JAHEIRA
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_PAD_SurgeonDead:9838d2d6-25a9-6368-bd94-672497d594f6
msgctxt "heb47d1b4geffeg47c7gb24fgd0639f913ca6"
msgid "I didn't think that would work. This shadow curse is something else."
msgstr "이게 통할 줄은 몰랐어. 이 그림자 저주는 뭔가 다르군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_Patient
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1a43d1f4-03c3-df88-772a-7b27312126df
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_Patient:1a43d1f4-03c3-df88-772a-7b27312126df
msgctxt "hfe38b56ag8735g4956gade1g9686f8a01915"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr "<i>떠난다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_Patient
#. Speaker = Distressed Patient
#. NodeID = 240086cc-8521-9cbc-5f50-2ed3b55db7e2
