msgctxt "h266fcff8ge8d0g407cg9eecg5d2ca3cc0f85"
msgid "<i>Give the corpse a subtle poke.</i>"
msgstr "<i>시체를 가볍게 찔러본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_Reception_CorpseTender
#. Speaker = Sister Lidwin
#. NodeID = 0be53aed-ddee-5f89-bc63-d2122755fe39
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - TWN_Hospital_Reception_CorpseTender_PassedDruidCheck(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_Reception_CorpseTender:0be53aed-ddee-5f89-bc63-d2122755fe39
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "h43ba5a84gd380g4dd1g8f7dgf1b3bc7b7537"
msgid ""
"Most unorthodox. But I am not one to question the doctor's methods... Do you "
"need something of me?"
msgstr "사이비 유사의학이라니. 하지만 선생님의 방식에 제가 참견할 위치는 아니니... 제가 도울 일이 있을까요?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_Reception_CorpseTender
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 195614ae-d896-f7a3-757a-a42031ed65da
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_Reception_CorpseTender:195614ae-d896-f7a3-757a-a42031ed65da
msgctxt "h22dd198cg5160g4cb6gb436ge6704321d3bb"
msgid ""
"The patient's definitely dead. Been dead for a while, judging by the smell."
msgstr "진짜로 죽은 거 맞아. 것도 좀 된거 같은데, 냄새 맡아보면 알 수 있어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_Reception_CorpseTender
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = 19762847-81a4-9461-cef5-0c3c3a8c5daa
