msgctxt "hc6fbc430g037cg4633gba17g12aa1e12f08e"
msgid ""
"A tiefling. That's Arabella's mother, I wager - or <i>was </i>Arabella's "
"mother."
msgstr "티플링. 아라벨라의 어머니야, 확실해, 어머니 <i>였던 것</i>이든지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_Reception_CorpseTender
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 29a0282d-1f01-5ed5-6f52-eaeb6ae1db6c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
