msgid "*The nurse has nothing to say - or, perhaps, can say nothing at all.*"
msgstr "*간호사는 말이 없습니다 - 어쩌면, 아무 말도 할 수 없는 걸지도요.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Hospital_ZealousAssistant_002
