msgctxt "h1425ef19g5f53g406ag8c98ga797f890ab42"
msgid "A dead githyanki. The corpse may hold something useful."
msgstr "죽은 기스양키로군. 시체에 뭔가 쓸만할 게 있을지 몰라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest
