#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest_HasMet(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest:753d5b86-8673-16cc-4790-d854a45d4546
msgctxt "h06678d1egb5feg41afga5e1gef3d3ba1ac4c"
msgid "*A monstrous army looms ahead.*"
msgstr "*괴물의 군대가 이 앞에 도사리고 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 804db2f0-a7b7-687d-f81f-c527142b34e7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_Event_AnotherCharacterJoined(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_MarchingArmy_Event_BackedOff(0) = True
#.     - TWN_MarchingArmy_Event_AnotherCharacterJoined(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest:804db2f0-a7b7-687d-f81f-c527142b34e7
msgctxt "hf6a13043gcad0g46d0g8321g75e8596e6d39"
msgid "Let's head back. We're no match for an army."
msgstr "돌아가자. 군대를 상대할 수는 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 82188e2c-d0fb-976d-6632-dbbf679b13ff
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_Event_AnotherCharacterJoined(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest:82188e2c-d0fb-976d-6632-dbbf679b13ff
msgctxt "hdbf92d7dg455cg44f3g87ccg6dc733ae77a6"
msgid "<i>Continue forward.</i>"
msgstr "<i>앞으로 나아간다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 97ab697d-c12a-476b-b3c4-2b4a73f9a37a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(1) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(1) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_MarchingArmy_Event_AnotherCharacterJoined(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest:97ab697d-c12a-476b-b3c4-2b4a73f9a37a
msgctxt "hc9283019g0505g4ebbgb180g72a36f6be16a"
msgid ""
"We are mighty - but we've no chance to fell such a legion. We must turn back."
msgstr "우리는 강하지만 저런 군단을 물리치는 건 불가능하다. 돌아가야해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = a4f7ac87-df15-472f-b567-ab35d877b803
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(5) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(5) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_MarchingArmy_Event_AnotherCharacterJoined(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest:a4f7ac87-df15-472f-b567-ab35d877b803
msgctxt "h05ca5714gf3abg41caga5cbg9de4eef676d0"
msgid "That's a whole lot of soldiers - a dead end in every sense of the term."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = aa8bfb05-8c87-4b30-8931-16ce7a1543d4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(2) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(2) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_MarchingArmy_Event_AnotherCharacterJoined(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest:aa8bfb05-8c87-4b30-8931-16ce7a1543d4
msgctxt "hc562c6e7g64e1g469ega2acg4495932ee076"
msgid ""
"We're hardly pushovers, but let's not pretend we can take on an entire army."
msgstr "우리가 겁쟁이는 아니지만 그래도 군대를 상대할 정도라고는 하지 말아줘."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = ac6cee2e-72cb-4c71-9bc9-03a8794db527
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(6) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(6) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_MarchingArmy_Event_AnotherCharacterJoined(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest:ac6cee2e-72cb-4c71-9bc9-03a8794db527
msgctxt "h59cbfe70gfe67g4b81g8ffbg3a57c70a0053"
msgid ""
"Ketheric's army. I suppose I could end them all with a bang, but my target "
"is the Absolute itself."
msgstr "케서릭의 군대군. 내가 펑하고 끝내버릴 수야 있겠지만 내 목표는 절대자 그 자체야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c7d02620-4765-8bf1-91e0-bb9bde9dd050
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - TWN_MarchingArmy_Event_AnotherCharacterJoined(0) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_MarchingArmy_Event_AnotherCharacterJoined(0) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest:c7d02620-4765-8bf1-91e0-bb9bde9dd050
msgctxt "hdd257ca9g82c2g4353gb632g2c8c6c777155"
msgid "I'm not afraid. We need to press on."
msgstr "난 두렵지 않아. 우린 앞으로 나아가야 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = d21530e4-8b2e-4a05-b250-3434284ff389
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(4) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(4) = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - TWN_MarchingArmy_Event_AnotherCharacterJoined(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_Arrest:d21530e4-8b2e-4a05-b250-3434284ff389
msgctxt "ha1752f36g4463g4012g8e96g80fdf7c70fc9"
msgid ""
"There's a point where bravery becomes stupidity. And walking into that would "
"be very, very stupid."
msgstr "용기가 만용이 되는 순간이 있지. 저기 들어간다는 게 바로 그런 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
msgctxt "h54dd666eg47d5g43c8ga2d4g8e78007677fb"
msgid ""
"Just when I think the worst is behind us, you manage to drop us in some new "
"turd."
msgstr "이제 최악의 상황은 면했다고 생각했더니 네가 우리를 다시 사지로 밀어넣는구나."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
msgctxt "hd49c33f9ge692g4234g80fbga0ac7dedd051"
msgid "Not your wisest move, was it?"
msgstr "별로 현명한 판단은 아니였지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
msgctxt "h33bcf999gbf57g4659g8b19g9593ae7870ed"
msgid "I knew we should've been a little more... I don't know, demure."
msgstr "좀더 그... 보수적이여야 할 필요가 있지 않았을까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
msgctxt "h6b2c1969g0e89g4850g91bbg74eac1d56cd6"
msgid ""
"Into the dragon's maw and straight to its belly. I trust you've learned your "
"lesson."
msgstr "용의 주둥이에서 위장까지 일직선으로 들이닥친 셈이지. 뭔가 교훈을 배웠길 바란다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
msgctxt "h323e297eg77a3g4d49g8de6g5f44c07aa3d1"
msgid ""
"As a general rule, I try to avoid confrontations where my opponents number "
"in the thousands."
msgstr "보편적으로 난 상대가 몇천이 되면 싸움을 피하는 편이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
msgctxt "h6f5b782egb262g4d7bg9ea4gd90f0baa1967"
msgid "Maybe next time let's not wander into a mass of armed soldiers, yeah?"
msgstr "다음번엔 이렇게 무장한 무리에는 함부로 뛰어들지 말자고 응?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_IsSpeakerPresent_2 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:72e19908-9edf-4d19-b291-599d64df1365
msgctxt "h547f31dagc106g4941gb9f0g7690ef16b171"
msgid "Well. This is quite the mess you've gotten us into."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
msgctxt "h91d1038bg1eeag4924g87e9g4e0dde807df1"
msgid "Another fun, dingy hole I've been thrown into."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
msgctxt "haabd224cgd49ag4693ga0dcg5d2c302698d2"
msgid "Hmm. Perhaps facing down an army wasn't my wisest choice..."
msgstr "흠. 어쩌면 군대를 상대한다는 건 제일 현명한 선택은 아니였을지도..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
msgctxt "hf4d86744g4463g434fgaefdg4bd2f254e0a1"
msgid "I guess trying to sneak pack the Absolute's army wasn't my best idea."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
msgctxt "he731de06g6e8cg471ag8817gd63e1a655d20"
msgid "I was careless. Now to clean the mess my own hands wrought."
msgstr "방심했다. 내가 저지른 혼란은 내 손으로 정리해야겠지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
msgctxt "h8216f050ga7e2g4002g81efgdc1a9c71c5a3"
msgid "I suppose standing up to an entire army wasn't my most cunning move."
msgstr "군대에 맞서는 건 좋은 선택은 아니였던 모양이야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
msgctxt "hc3f50afbg61d2g4a3agaa16g8afb4569fd55"
msgid "Well well, if it isn't the consequences of my own actions."
msgstr "이런이런, 내 행동에 따른 결과일 뿐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Arrested:abccac23-6817-628a-947c-c41ac68ae27d
msgctxt "h4741c6cag8231g46d2g8d5dg4012b080690e"
msgid "Damn it all. I should've known better than to stray so close."
msgstr "젠장. 그렇게 가까이서 어슬렁거리는 게 아니였어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Warning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 018ec6a4-d91c-4ea5-bc48-3c8dd98fc1d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Warning:018ec6a4-d91c-4ea5-bc48-3c8dd98fc1d7
msgctxt "h8948cb0eg9a12g400agb1f8gd8c31f8c6322"
msgid ""
"Demon's teeth, look at those fires. The Absolute's own personal horde - best "
"steer clear."
msgstr "데몬의 이빨같으니, 저 불빛을 봐. 절대자의 군단이네 - 떨어져있는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Warning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 018ec6a4-d91c-4ea5-bc48-3c8dd98fc1d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Warning:018ec6a4-d91c-4ea5-bc48-3c8dd98fc1d7
msgctxt "h52dff343gaec9g44ceg8788g7bc2e9001cd8"
msgid ""
"Enough campfires for an army - the Absolute's army. That's close enough, I "
"think."
msgstr "군대에, 절대자의 군대에 충분할 정도로 많은 모닥불이군. 이미 충분히 가까이 왔어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Warning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 018ec6a4-d91c-4ea5-bc48-3c8dd98fc1d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Warning:018ec6a4-d91c-4ea5-bc48-3c8dd98fc1d7
msgctxt "h738cc3d4g37f8g485cgbcc5gecd30fd7f52d"
msgid "Look at all those campfires. The Absolute's army? Better steer clear."
msgstr "저 모닥불들을 봐. 절대자의 군대인가? 피해가는 게 좋겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Warning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 018ec6a4-d91c-4ea5-bc48-3c8dd98fc1d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Warning:018ec6a4-d91c-4ea5-bc48-3c8dd98fc1d7
msgctxt "h357058beg8c7cg422eg989fgacf97f97e2f5"
msgid ""
"Fires as far as my eyes can reach. The Absolute's army is camped here - I "
"should turn heel."
msgstr "보이는 곳이 다 불빛이군. 절대자의 군대가 야영중이야 - 돌아가야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Warning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 018ec6a4-d91c-4ea5-bc48-3c8dd98fc1d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - GLO_Absolute_Knows_Name = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_MarchingArmy_State_SawAbsoluteArmy = True
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Warning:018ec6a4-d91c-4ea5-bc48-3c8dd98fc1d7
msgctxt "hde0ef1cag2812g4645ga27cg180df32e1537"
msgid "All those campfires - enough for an army. The Absolute's army."
msgstr "이 모닥불들이 전부 저 군대의 것이야. 절대자의 군대."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Warning
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 018ec6a4-d91c-4ea5-bc48-3c8dd98fc1d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
