"An army camp, I reckon - the <i>Absolute's</i> army. I better keep clear."
msgstr "저 군대의 야영지로군 - 절대자의 군대. 피해가야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Warning
