msgid "Look at all those campfires. Practically an army. Better steer clear."
msgstr "이 모닥불들을 봐. 이건 거의 군대로군. 피해가야겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_MarchingArmy_PAD_Warning
