msgctxt "hb023f536gbdfbg46cagb296gaad8ea3ab4e7"
msgid ""
"Protective charms, offerings, prayers... all left by Harpers, before they "
"charged into battle.\n"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21e080cf-bf78-407c-9af1-ca9d9134be5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P:21e080cf-bf78-407c-9af1-ca9d9134be5f
msgctxt "hde25e008gd8d3g418bgbdeag7ba0dea74f94"
msgid "Prayers, war cries, and... the Harpers' symbol. They came to fight."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 21e080cf-bf78-407c-9af1-ca9d9134be5f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P:21e080cf-bf78-407c-9af1-ca9d9134be5f
msgctxt "hba08d5b5g9513g403fgb0e1g6b84b560d84f"
msgid ""
"Prayers, charms, battle cries - the Harpers' work. They were primed for "
"combat."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P:c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
msgctxt "hce794c2eg15b5g467fg8316g0fbc0780b07f"
msgid ""
"Ah yes, the gods - famously compassionate and concerned with mortal lives."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P:c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
msgctxt "h8bc9f8abg1643g4b4egabe5g51542fecac65"
msgid ""
"Worthless. You'd find more value in an adolescent boy's spent handkerchief."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P:c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
msgctxt "h2addf255g38ceg47e6gb176g7cf95d1e2be9"
msgid "Didn't do much good. Pity."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P:c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
msgctxt "h6bb65c89gd3dfg4492g970cgc84b2db38bef"
msgid "Simple words and marks. Yet for a keen warrior, a rousing call to arms."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P:c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
msgctxt "h103ee80bg47b7g4c4agba2dg2a3c821da43a"
msgid ""
"Their offerings didn't bring them victory - that's plain to see wherever you "
"look."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P:c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
msgctxt "h9b026a32g7aeeg4578g874eg7f81df8a3b87"
msgid "The marks will fade soon enough - if not the memories they contain."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[6].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_PrayersAndCharms_PAD_2P:c60dbe80-e793-4fce-b724-38fd4d87dcf2
msgctxt "hb416e667ge2ecg445eg841bg74abbfcae14a"
msgid "A commemoration of battles long past. Like the town itself."
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ReadSelunePrayerBook_PAD
