#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ReadSelunePrayerBook_PAD:217b7783-d8e0-4a0e-90b5-cf766c457e94
msgctxt "he244e22fg22e8g4981g8faeg23cf7f014a27"
msgid "Rambling nonsense. Why someone would be drawn to this is beyond me."
msgstr "헛소리뿐이네. 왜 이딴 걸 믿는지 이해가 안 가."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ReadSelunePrayerBook_PAD
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 59ef81ef-3dd0-9a0f-e1f6-964c16927f7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ReadSelunePrayerBook_PAD:59ef81ef-3dd0-9a0f-e1f6-964c16927f7e
msgctxt "h350c90e7g9aaag4375g826eg995579c81de8"
msgid "I'm sure there's better things you could find to read."
msgstr "찾아보면 읽기 더 좋은 책들이 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ReadSelunePrayerBook_PAD
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = 713e07c8-b0cf-1884-289b-d890096416fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#.   Object:
#.      - TWN_State_ReadSelunePrayerBook(0) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ReadSelunePrayerBook_PAD:713e07c8-b0cf-1884-289b-d890096416fd
msgctxt "he6ac5d15gc43cg4704ga710g707cc068a90a"
msgid ""
"Moonlight, guidance, <i>tides</i>... how fascinating. Consider me converted, "
"Selûne."
msgstr "달빛, 안내, <i>조수</i>... 정말 환상적이네. 나 개종한 걸로 쳐줘, 셀루네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ReadSelunePrayerBook_PAD
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = f21e222d-7a07-4a7b-aaf2-417d2e13da6b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - ShadowHeart_InParty_Knows_SharWorshipper = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_ReadSelunePrayerBook_PAD:f21e222d-7a07-4a7b-aaf2-417d2e13da6b
msgctxt "h153da47bgbc8eg4e52g8dd4gdb14f5144b91"
msgid "I didn't realise we had time to read childrens' stories."
msgstr "어린애 동화나 읽고 있을 시간이 있을 줄 몰랐네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_SeluneGrave_PAD_IdentifiedGrave
