msgid "Forget it - it's blocked from behind.\n"
msgstr ""

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_PAD_ConfiscatedItemPlaqueUsed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eded1016-f0e6-4d23-a9cc-f87a82fd5f19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_ASTARION
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_PAD_ConfiscatedItemPlaqueUsed:eded1016-f0e6-4d23-a9cc-f87a82fd5f19
msgctxt "h41f1a536g3511g4c90gb5b5gde45fe4a5a8b"
msgid "Looks like fun, but we're not getting in this way."
msgstr "재미있어 보이지만, 이런 식으로는 못 들어갈 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_PAD_ConfiscatedItemPlaqueUsed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eded1016-f0e6-4d23-a9cc-f87a82fd5f19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GALE
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_PAD_ConfiscatedItemPlaqueUsed:eded1016-f0e6-4d23-a9cc-f87a82fd5f19
msgctxt "hc000a694g50fag41bag9a53g543b1703b931"
msgid "There's got to be another way in."
msgstr "다른 입구가 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_PAD_ConfiscatedItemPlaqueUsed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eded1016-f0e6-4d23-a9cc-f87a82fd5f19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[2].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_KARLACH
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_PAD_ConfiscatedItemPlaqueUsed:eded1016-f0e6-4d23-a9cc-f87a82fd5f19
msgctxt "h4242f451g0c7eg4e34ga5edg78885d0835c3"
msgid "Gotta be another way in."
msgstr "분명 다른 입구가 있을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_PAD_ConfiscatedItemPlaqueUsed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eded1016-f0e6-4d23-a9cc-f87a82fd5f19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[3].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_LAEZEL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_PAD_ConfiscatedItemPlaqueUsed:eded1016-f0e6-4d23-a9cc-f87a82fd5f19
msgctxt "hf52216eegb095g4307gb4a8ge4fd34c85a3e"
msgid ""
"Confiscated items? I should find a way in - I might find something useful."
msgstr "압수한 물건들이라고? 들어갈 방법을 찾아야겠어. 유용한 물건이 있을지도 모르니까."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_PAD_ConfiscatedItemPlaqueUsed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eded1016-f0e6-4d23-a9cc-f87a82fd5f19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[4].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_SHADOWHEART
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_PAD_ConfiscatedItemPlaqueUsed:eded1016-f0e6-4d23-a9cc-f87a82fd5f19
msgctxt "h607f9bfbg7123g459bgb63bg4ac04f5903b3"
msgid "Confiscated goods? Sounds promising... if there's a way to get inside."
msgstr "압수한 물건들? 기대가 되는데... 안으로 들어갈 방법이 있다면 말이지.\n"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_PAD_ConfiscatedItemPlaqueUsed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eded1016-f0e6-4d23-a9cc-f87a82fd5f19
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[5].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_WYLL
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_PAD_ConfiscatedItemPlaqueUsed:eded1016-f0e6-4d23-a9cc-f87a82fd5f19
msgctxt "h0d362da4g9339g46f1g9bcbg69a7c4847b8c"
msgid ""
"Confiscated items? I should find a way in - could find something useful."
msgstr "압수한 물건들이라고? 들어갈 방법을 찾아야겠군. 유용한 게 있을지도 모르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_PAD_ConfiscatedItemPlaqueUsed
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eded1016-f0e6-4d23-a9cc-f87a82fd5f19
