msgctxt "h6e1272c9g9cf2g41a9gbc05gfdabdbce5695"
msgid "You've been promoted! You'll collect gold from a much better tollhouse."
msgstr "너 승진했대! 더 준수한 징수 시설에서 통행료를 걷게 될 거야."

