msgctxt "h7eec0ff7g1250g47c6g8b61gff848fec30ea"
msgid ""
"Gold, indeed - not for the toll, but for <i>yourself</i>. Isn't that right?"
msgstr "금이라, 그렇고 말고 - 통행료는 핑계고 실은 <i>너 자신</i>을 위해 모으려는 거잖아?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 26f769b6-7e1b-64cd-8c01-2d4d0d20090d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
