msgctxt "h9766e655gf08dg499fgb4e8gb7007f1f6aa0"
msgid ""
"Everything from mephits to burning infernos - it depends on the day, really."
msgstr "메피트부터 불타는 지옥까지 뭐든지 - 그날그날 달라, 진짜로."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
