msgid "Harmony and a greater understanding of this plane."
msgstr "이 차원에 대한 탁월한 식견과 조화."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 49153ff6-ffbc-05ee-b437-3d43ac8f7dd2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:49153ff6-ffbc-05ee-b437-3d43ac8f7dd2
msgctxt "h509374ccg637dg4551gae1fg94807911fbb7"
msgid "I'm here to replace you as toll collector."
msgstr "내가 바로 새로 부임한 통행료 징수원이라네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Gerringothe Thorm
#. NodeID = 4ce5e57b-1faf-6f00-b279-853c65dfcb78
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Tollhouse_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:4ce5e57b-1faf-6f00-b279-853c65dfcb78
msgctxt "h3ca33d98gfbceg4406gb012g321e7f916690"
msgid "I WILL NOT LEAVE. I CANNOT LEAVE. I REQUIRE GOLD!"
msgstr "떠나지 않는다. 떠날 수 없다. 금이 필요하다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Gerringothe Thorm
#. NodeID = 4dd76935-4cf5-20b6-5c34-136ca77a38c9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Tollhouse_State_PeacefulResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:4dd76935-4cf5-20b6-5c34-136ca77a38c9
msgctxt "ha2f61afagf38eg4c5dg9630g571ebf1838a1"
msgid "I... I... GOLD?"
msgstr "내... 내가... 금화를?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Gerringothe Thorm
#. NodeID = 4f9ea187-e492-4af8-b777-d2f64967ded7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster_HasMet(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:4f9ea187-e492-4af8-b777-d2f64967ded7
msgctxt "h2714ea6egb55cg4809g862cga3a67b1bdaa7"
msgid "WHAT DO YOU BRING?"
msgstr "뭘 가져왔지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 56c52e97-994a-43f4-8073-d7679f40a959
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:56c52e97-994a-43f4-8073-d7679f40a959
msgctxt "h2711dbfcg5250g4eeegae9cg06bf0b072a96"
msgid "I have no more money to give."
msgstr "더는 남은 돈이 없군."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5aaa55b1-36b6-3d62-503d-b575ec0d5dcb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 21
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:5aaa55b1-36b6-3d62-503d-b575ec0d5dcb
msgctxt "haa6c93adg91bbg4a2ega953gbdf3250472f0"
msgid ""
"You've done a great job here. Really set the standard. But I'll take it from "
"here."
msgstr "지금까지 정말 잘해 줬어. 정석 그 자체였지. 하지만 지금부터는 내게 맡기도록."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5cac99d3-3764-0673-95dc-5cf60aa488d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - WARLOCK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:5cac99d3-3764-0673-95dc-5cf60aa488d7
msgctxt "h2c08f818g1885g4e2fg83bcg46cd8c3fd6f8"
msgid ""
"Gold is such a limited desire. With the right help, you could become <i>so</"
"i> much more."
msgstr "금은 제한된 욕망에 불과하다. 작은 도움만 빌리면, <i>훨씬</i> 더 위대한 존재가 되리니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5d000c64-f3a9-aed2-a5be-71bcad4e6ba3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:5d000c64-f3a9-aed2-a5be-71bcad4e6ba3
msgctxt "h850dc6b7g10a2g4aecg97efgc56d999fa273"
msgid "I require passage - or your throat will be cut."
msgstr "길을 비킬 것을 요구한다 - 아니면 네 목을 그어버리겠다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Gerringothe Thorm
#. NodeID = 5e25a259-7052-1d43-ff60-e41b4c218d09
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Tollhouse_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:5e25a259-7052-1d43-ff60-e41b4c218d09
msgctxt "h71c9b21dg9d23g49cbga56cg4d18d9da5215"
msgid "NO! YOU MUST PAY. YOU MUST PAY THE GOLD!"
msgstr "아니! 넌 반드시 내야 한다. 금을 내놓아야 한다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5e6919e2-75ba-4fc0-89fd-15ab227fae88
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CheckPocketGold = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GEN_TransferNPCPayment(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:5e6919e2-75ba-4fc0-89fd-15ab227fae88
msgctxt "h48ba59fcg2063g43c4gaa08ge409de304778"
msgid "<i>Toss the creature a gold piece.</i>"
msgstr "<i>금화 한 닢을 던져준다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 5fb207e8-c3d7-a811-edbc-f9e9505c0364
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:5fb207e8-c3d7-a811-edbc-f9e9505c0364
msgctxt "h1581afd4g12edg4179ga42ag01e0ee5dec30"
msgid ""
"Enough! You're an embodiment of the curse and its corruption. You get "
"nothing from me."
msgstr "그만! 그대는 저주와 타락의 화신일지니. 내게서 아무것도 얻지 못하리라."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 60d53988-c85c-453a-0ea2-692d520da3a3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARD(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:60d53988-c85c-453a-0ea2-692d520da3a3
msgctxt "hf4431123g9a03g4f51ga909gda365922322b"
msgid "Ballads, sonnets, jigs - the list is endless, really."
msgstr "노래와 시, 춤 - 참으로 끝도 없다네."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 61ac6760-01ad-a9b3-3458-b21f57c5aaa1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - CLERIC_EVIL(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:61ac6760-01ad-a9b3-3458-b21f57c5aaa1
msgctxt "hfdf2deafg48f1g44degb3e6g57982244e86d"
msgid ""
"I know lust and avarice when I see it. You'll never be happy, no matter how "
"much gold I give you."
msgstr "나는 색욕이든 탐욕이든 한눈에 알아보지. 내가 얼마를 내놓든, 너는 절대 행복해질 수 없을 거다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 62563350-2690-4c23-b570-bc902456ef4e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:62563350-2690-4c23-b570-bc902456ef4e
msgctxt "hc9a33169g86e8g4be1g8af3g50d9d3df1066"
msgid "It seems to me you have enough."
msgstr "이미 충분히 가지고 있는 것 같은데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Gerringothe Thorm
#. NodeID = 636a533b-6179-2c2d-87bf-a664ef082d2f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Tollhouse_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:636a533b-6179-2c2d-87bf-a664ef082d2f
msgctxt "h2a19919bg0c1ag4247g8c02g75c7f83c54bb"
msgid "STAND DOWN? NO! <i>YOU </i>MUST PAY! YOU MUST PAY GOLD!"
msgstr "물러서? 아니! <i>넌</i> 반드시 지불한다! 금화를 내놓아라!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 64c12e7a-ade3-6b01-90b0-5cebf76441b3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:64c12e7a-ade3-6b01-90b0-5cebf76441b3
msgctxt "hcc3c3428g031cg4a45gbe7dg6270109bf6df"
msgid "I'm afraid I'm more of a taker than a bringer, if you catch my meaning."
msgstr "알아들을지 모르겠지만, 나는 가져오는 쪽이 아니라 털어먹는 쪽이 익숙한데."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Gerringothe Thorm
#. NodeID = 6580d8dc-9adc-e80b-377a-adcbe637604a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Tollhouse_State_PeacefulResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:6580d8dc-9adc-e80b-377a-adcbe637604a
msgctxt "haf6d040dgdcfag4f21gabc5g26ab4cb21a2d"
msgid "GOLD... GOLD! GOLD..."
msgstr "금... 금! 금..."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6688aff4-1beb-a89c-9095-62187dff70b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - ROGUE(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:6688aff4-1beb-a89c-9095-62187dff70b8
msgctxt "h7119e596gb0dfg40f1g99cegfba4dbd3caa7"
msgid ""
"The 'toll collector' scam is old and uninspired. Give it a rest - figure out "
"a new trick."
msgstr "'요금 징수원' 사기 수법은 좀 오래되고 진부하다고. 좀 쉬다 오지 그래 - 새로운 기술도 익힐 겸."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 69cc45ff-7692-d732-63ea-8d06d6239d0f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - BARBARIAN(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:69cc45ff-7692-d732-63ea-8d06d6239d0f
msgctxt "hd1259035g7de3g455dgb8d4gd5b413c90359"
msgid "Pain and death, usually."
msgstr "보통은 고통과 죽음이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6a4431bc-7ffd-45ba-919f-0571799261bc
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:6a4431bc-7ffd-45ba-919f-0571799261bc
msgctxt "h8e31b1e3g0cceg4ef2g9bddg6c20553cb8fe"
msgid "I don't hand out so much gold for so little in return."
msgstr "난 밑지는 장사는 안 해."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6b096bf2-72ef-2cee-e3b1-40a2666ea689
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Tollhouse_Knows_CollectorWasStealing = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - DRUID(1) = False
#.      - PALADIN(1) = False
#.      - ROGUE(1) = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:6b096bf2-72ef-2cee-e3b1-40a2666ea689
msgctxt "h2a8fc255gc39ag45d5gbae0g47f271d269de"
msgid "You're corrupt. I don't take kindly to such tactics."
msgstr "넌 부패했어. 그런 제안에 상냥하게 응할 생각은 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Gerringothe Thorm
#. NodeID = 70d6b8bb-edf9-1ef3-b224-76574da4fc0c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:70d6b8bb-edf9-1ef3-b224-76574da4fc0c
msgctxt "h39c4402fgdc63g4804g9102g6bcb5dc74ee5"
msgid "YOU <i>NEVER</i> TAKE. ONLY BRING."
msgstr "너는 절대 빼앗지 못한다. 가져올 뿐이다."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 73848345-040a-8771-07ac-914fcf38e9dd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - RANGER(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:73848345-040a-8771-07ac-914fcf38e9dd
msgctxt "h648cbe3ag08f3g4a5dg94ffg6dd5b5f29853"
msgid "Depends on the beast I'm hunting."
msgstr "사냥하는 동물에 따라 다르지."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 75d71b24-8ee5-48e9-962d-c134729870e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:75d71b24-8ee5-48e9-962d-c134729870e2
msgctxt "h2a08cdc8ga4bag4491g9b54ge911ce70c426"
msgid "This ends now."
msgstr "이제 끝내자."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Gerringothe Thorm
#. NodeID = 77029645-8fed-7704-2576-caf6459de5ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Tollhouse_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:77029645-8fed-7704-2576-caf6459de5ac
msgctxt "h6780a338g6095g4c91g8cd8g4b52afb1340c"
msgid "MEAGRE. LACKING. INSUFFICIENT!"
msgstr "빈약하다. 부족하다. 충분하지 않다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Gerringothe Thorm
#. NodeID = 7713384a-058c-c427-7d5b-a3233ab3816c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster_HasMet(1) = False
#.   Global:
#.      - TWN_Tollhouse_State_FaceWasAttacked = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.     - TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster_HasMet(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:7713384a-058c-c427-7d5b-a3233ab3816c
msgctxt "h364fa816g024bg4ba2g9988ga55456d49101"
msgid ""
"YOU BROUGHT VIOLENCE. UNACCEPTABLE. BUT ALL CAN BE FORGIVEN. FOR THE RIGHT "
"PRICE."
msgstr "이 땅에 폭력을 불러왔구나. 용납할 수 없다. 그러나 용서받을 수 있다. 적절한 대가만 지불한다면."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Gerringothe Thorm
#. NodeID = 77237f4a-dd8b-4e11-b1c3-107af714448b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - TWN_Tollhouse_State_HostileResolution = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:77237f4a-dd8b-4e11-b1c3-107af714448b
msgctxt "hd51263eeg86b3g4142g8eebgb24baf27ec23"
msgid "IF YOU CANNOT PAY, YOU CANNOT PASS. GOLD. GOLD. GOLD!"
msgstr "금을 낼 수 없다면, 지나갈 수 없다. 금. 금. 금!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 78256de8-3feb-451a-13ac-d804942f29f9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: SkillCheck
#. RollAbility: Charisma
#. DifficultyClass: 18
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - MONK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:78256de8-3feb-451a-13ac-d804942f29f9
msgctxt "hef4a5653g9f21g4931g9f7cgae9b455f3902"
msgid ""
"The happiness gold grants is temporary at best. Do not let your need for "
"gold trap you here."
msgstr "금이 주는 행복은 고작해야 일시적일 뿐이오. 금에 대한 집착 때문에 당신 스스로를 이곳에 가둬 두지 마시오."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Gerringothe Thorm
#. NodeID = 79ca4dd6-9d03-0fe8-b133-da7a0a5c3f4b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster:79ca4dd6-9d03-0fe8-b133-da7a0a5c3f4b
msgctxt "h16aa0242g28ddg4f83g82ddgda8206a6b2bf"
msgid "TRICK? NO... GOLD! I REQUIRE GOLD!"
msgstr "<b>기술? 아니... 금! 금을 요구한다!</b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2/Town/TWN_Tollhouse_TollhouseMaster
#. Speaker = Gerringothe Thorm
