msgctxt "hd1d78c28g33e0g4447ga1acg1997559af6ba"
msgid "<i>Stop it! I am not your enemy! </i>"
msgstr "<i>그만! 난 적이 아니다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 0b9bc036-07d8-4c18-234b-3f388fcfac1b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - INT_EmperorRevealed_Event_PlayerWarned = True
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - INT_EmperorRevealed_Event_EmperorIsDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies:0b9bc036-07d8-4c18-234b-3f388fcfac1b
msgctxt "h882b94b2g2cceg4555gac2fgdc0628f41104"
msgid ""
"*Somewhere between pity and disappointment, the Emperor's final gaze cuts "
"through you, signalling your joint downfall.*"
msgstr ""
"*동정심과 실망 사이의 어떤 감정을 내비치며, 황제의 마지막 시선이 당신을 꿰뚫습니다. 여러분 모두의 몰락을 의미하는 듯합니다. *"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 0bd1d713-1a63-04a6-dd88-ff3d89043b5b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies:0bd1d713-1a63-04a6-dd88-ff3d89043b5b
msgctxt "hb7299cbagfcfeg4ce9gb2a2g0e9fee5dc4ce"
msgid "<i>Thank you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>고맙다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 3098ef3d-0f07-91b0-f0a2-1ed62cb3e7b8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - INT_EmperorRevealed_State_PlayerAgreedToHelpEmperor = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies:3098ef3d-0f07-91b0-f0a2-1ed62cb3e7b8
msgctxt "h27c3592dge262g401eg9354gd2c0b2d9632b"
msgid "<i>With your help, we will both survive.</i>"
msgstr "<i>덕분에 우리 모두 살아남을 수 있을 거다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 6ca23a52-73c3-ff12-0628-c729667a23cb
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - INT_EmperorRevealed_Event_EmperorRezzed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies:6ca23a52-73c3-ff12-0628-c729667a23cb
msgctxt "h996ca84bgcfecg4a97gb066g0024fc24a846"
msgid "Get up. I'll fight with you."
msgstr "일어나. 함께 싸워줄게."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 6f25886c-0c5c-b7a8-2119-8810d5fa3816
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies:6f25886c-0c5c-b7a8-2119-8810d5fa3816
msgctxt "h66bbc5acga15dg4932g9453g4b74e71d58fb"
msgid "<i>You... have... failed us. All. </i>"
msgstr "<i>네가... 우리 모두를... 패망시켰다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 76d6b3e5-52c9-04c9-1056-32dcf8840f43
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - INT_EmperorRevealed_Event_EmperorIsDead = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies:76d6b3e5-52c9-04c9-1056-32dcf8840f43
msgctxt "he3a31ad0g4ad2g4c38gaa05g5fbdeca11ee7"
msgid "<i>Let the mind flayer die. </i>"
msgstr "<i>마인드 플레이어가 죽게 내버려둔다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 822c9e76-d88c-a8de-c610-9dd7ec7d2560
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies:822c9e76-d88c-a8de-c610-9dd7ec7d2560
msgctxt "h6f44ad6eg4140g47c0g9498ga9169ba4e989"
msgid ""
"*With startling clarity, you realise the mind flayer was telling the truth - "
"if it dies, so do you.*"
msgstr "*불현듯 마인드 플레이어의 말이 사실이었음을 깨닫습니다. 마인드 플레이어가 죽으면 당신도 죽습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = e0eb8501-2376-2950-a20e-d5a786d54f2b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - INT_EmperorRevealed_Event_PlayerWarned = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorDies:e0eb8501-2376-2950-a20e-d5a786d54f2b
msgctxt "hd0c579d8g30a1g420bga63bgf05ee5c73c39"
msgid ""
"*Its laboured breaths resound like a death knell in your mind, tolling for "
"the end of all hopes of survival, and freedom.*"
msgstr ""
"*생존, 그리고 자유를 향한 한 가닥 희망에마저 끝을 고하는 종말의 서막처럼, 마인드 플레이어의 헐떡이는 숨소리가 마음속에 울려 "
"퍼집니다. *"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 017a41d2-017d-ade6-1274-189bf8ac5ae9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:017a41d2-017d-ade6-1274-189bf8ac5ae9
msgctxt "h8a17f44cg70cdg4e82gacc1gb1b439b58cbc"
msgid ""
"<i>And you will not even be able to defend yourself. If you kill him, the "
"Absolute will enthral you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그러면 스스로를 방어할 수도 없게 되겠지. 그를 죽이면 절대자가 너를 노예로 만들어 버릴 테니.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 073e0520-785f-30f8-1632-fbd7589aae9d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:073e0520-785f-30f8-1632-fbd7589aae9d
msgctxt "h0ea91cafg6ce0g4080g9c91gf38948b88468"
msgid ""
"*Despite your best attempts to be subtle, the mind flayer's awareness is "
"everywhere. You blunder in its presence like a worg pup learning to walk.*"
msgstr ""
"*은밀히 접근하려 했지만, 마인드 플레이어의 정신이 닿지 않는 곳이 없습니다. 당신은 그 정신 속에서 걸음마를 막 뗀 새끼 워그처럼 "
"미숙하게 허둥댑니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 0fd8ce7e-bfca-0771-03a3-c99e87b78364
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:0fd8ce7e-bfca-0771-03a3-c99e87b78364
msgctxt "h617773e9g86c1g4c81g93ebg433079f9c176"
msgid "<i>HAPPY? Now. Join me. <b>FIGHT.</b></i>"
msgstr "<i>만족했나? 이제 날 도와 <b>싸워라.</b></i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1e874cd0-6571-91dc-1c16-90e0bf608241
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:1e874cd0-6571-91dc-1c16-90e0bf608241
msgctxt "h9b6843bbgb968g4078g9f6ag1f8e28fc35db"
msgid "Leave the githyanki alone!"
msgstr "저 기스양키를 내버려 둬!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 1e88815b-71c9-41bd-b1ed-22900a33f492
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_JAHEIRA(10) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:1e88815b-71c9-41bd-b1ed-22900a33f492
msgctxt "h217d414bg53dag4764g924dg5e5609df59a4"
msgid ""
"<i>You</i> are in danger indeed, mind flayer. What the hells is happening?"
msgstr "지금 위험에 처한 건 <i>네 목숨</i>이야, 마인드 플레이어. 대체 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 1eafdd0e-b4df-c9c3-3290-54a69a6d9fa8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:1eafdd0e-b4df-c9c3-3290-54a69a6d9fa8
msgctxt "h2405f1c6g5e0cg41f5g85cdg4a83e0a94c6b"
msgid "<i>Join the mind flayer's fight.</i>"
msgstr "<i>마인드 플레이어와 함께 싸운다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 20057835-f7e1-c4bd-1e7b-c0a381a2db7b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Daisy_State_TriedToReadMind(1) = False
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Daisy_State_TriedToReadMind(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:20057835-f7e1-c4bd-1e7b-c0a381a2db7b
msgctxt "h4d107a6eg046eg4f36ga213g2742ed145fed"
msgid ""
"<i>You must be joking. I am <b>TELLING</b> you my thoughts. Directly. Into. "
"Your. Head.</i>"
msgstr "<i>장난하자는 건가. 지금. 머리 속에. 직접. 생각을. <b>말해주고</b> 있잖아.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 2773642a-1954-2e66-ad17-7f4feb33eba6
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - INT_EmperorRevealed_State_PlayerAgreedToHelpEmperor = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:2773642a-1954-2e66-ad17-7f4feb33eba6
msgctxt "h787069acgfc6ag4928gafe3g0ac0dc60e745"
msgid "<i>Together we can turn the tide.</i>"
msgstr "<i>힘을 합치면 전세를 역전할 수 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 2b3209ea-9481-6dd3-51e0-8876fe38f10c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:2b3209ea-9481-6dd3-51e0-8876fe38f10c
msgctxt "hd38f2658g8cc0g4e73g9d6fg38694900d4e4"
msgid "Prove to me that you are who you say."
msgstr "네가 한 말을 증명해봐."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 30e68b15-8328-02c5-dfa8-025b4bedc300
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:30e68b15-8328-02c5-dfa8-025b4bedc300
msgctxt "h13ca1934g8f72g4a87gb0d9g61012bd82e65"
msgid ""
"<i>We are more alike than you want to admit. Look past it. I know you don't "
"want to, but you must. </i>"
msgstr "<i>너는 인정하기 싫겠지만 우린 닮아있다. 그 너머를 봐라. 보기 싫어도 봐야만 한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 321f606f-fe4e-0063-23ae-3ae8b799a3f5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:321f606f-fe4e-0063-23ae-3ae8b799a3f5
msgctxt "ha2f062ccg71f5g4caaga25dg536cc4dc75f2"
msgid "<i>This </i>is the battle you were fighting?"
msgstr "<i>이게</i> 네가 그동안 해온 싸움인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 32cb9d71-5cd7-9582-f1ad-a0ebb5bed431
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   User:
#.      - CAMP_DaisyCourseCorrection_State_ComfortedDaisy(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:32cb9d71-5cd7-9582-f1ad-a0ebb5bed431
msgctxt "hbdf1a5adgc4adg4a7fgab52g4eb5d9fc6852"
msgid ""
"<i>I told you about my room in the Elfsong Tavern, that night when you held "
"me. I was vulnerable - you comforted me. </i>"
msgstr "<i>엘프송 주점의 내 방에 대해 얘기해 준 그날 밤에, 날 안아줬지. 내가 연약할 때에 네가 위로해 줬다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 3af6cbca-f3e2-3cc7-9547-748d54deb074
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:3af6cbca-f3e2-3cc7-9547-748d54deb074
msgctxt "hf21c88b5ge46bg4875g8e37gbb1f05f67ad7"
msgid ""
"<i>The githyanki is the source of our protection against the Absolute. I "
"MUST subdue him or everything we've worked towards is lost. </i>"
msgstr ""
"<i>저 기스양키가 절대자를 막아주는 보호 수단의 원동력이다. 내가 그를 제압하지 못하면 우리가 해온 모든 일들이 물거품이 될 "
"거다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 3f8f8c8c-16aa-03b5-a45e-7acc58aefea8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:3f8f8c8c-16aa-03b5-a45e-7acc58aefea8
msgctxt "ha7be3b31gc2d0g4f98gb0d5g7e014cbf1c37"
msgid "No."
msgstr "싫어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 461f4f25-a193-95b8-0891-c0fa85d93d0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:461f4f25-a193-95b8-0891-c0fa85d93d0a
msgctxt "hff2a98dfg11efg4dd5gb02fg6c32a33b1b68"
msgid "Die, monster!"
msgstr "죽어라, 괴물!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 493e546d-748b-f3c1-3830-941bc982a2ae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:493e546d-748b-f3c1-3830-941bc982a2ae
msgctxt "hc574b88eg5107g4408ga691g078e830a7a05"
msgid "<i>Before you do anything - I am your <b>ally</b>.</i>"
msgstr "<i>기다려. 난 너의 <b>동맹</b>이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 49636ab8-590e-0702-100d-44b3323a10fd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:49636ab8-590e-0702-100d-44b3323a10fd
msgctxt "h8fb618ddg0c65g4100ga0dcg1b571765bbca"
msgid ""
"<i>Don't let my form deceive you. I am the one that's been protecting you. I "
"am the one that came to you in your dreams.</i>"
msgstr "<i>내 겉모습에 속단하지 마라. 그동안 너를 지켜온 건 바로 나다. 네 꿈에서 만난 자가 나였다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 4a3a7f5d-103d-aec4-0c01-c3df597dcdfd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:4a3a7f5d-103d-aec4-0c01-c3df597dcdfd
msgctxt "h939b44f2gb161g48dega33ag29293760c98c"
msgid ""
"<i>The honour guard - eliminate them. My forces are weakened by their "
"assault. But with your help, we can turn this around. </i>"
msgstr "<i>친위대를 제거해라. 내 세력은 저들의 공격으로 약해졌다. 네가 도와준다면 전세를 역전할 수 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 4e08dc80-df5a-f8ea-897a-86c98c5ed31f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:4e08dc80-df5a-f8ea-897a-86c98c5ed31f
msgctxt "h195dc72ag6c9ag4792ga59dg592e88528df4"
msgid "<i>We are in DANGER. </i>"
msgstr "<i>우리는 지금 <b>위험에</b> 처해 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 4fbaa2a1-8a78-6563-e0ad-02466d469908
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:4fbaa2a1-8a78-6563-e0ad-02466d469908
msgctxt "h67221cf4gb632g439cgac6fg214f84c833e0"
msgid "You're a <i>mind flayer</i>."
msgstr "넌 <i>마인드 플레이어</i>잖아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 57c4e40b-2af7-9a00-492c-f98303fdf6e4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - GLO_Daisy_State_TriedToReadMind(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:57c4e40b-2af7-9a00-492c-f98303fdf6e4
msgctxt "h4fccd985g47f6g4e6cgb0cbgb8e10f876af9"
msgid ""
"<i>That was awful. Just awful. You haven't even IMPROVED since your last "
"attempt! </i>"
msgstr "<i>끔찍하군. 그냥 형편없어. 지난번에 시도한 후로 <b>하나도</b> 발전한 것도 없지 않나!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 5da0e756-b205-bad0-33da-1006ddf66a18
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Dialog:
#.      - CRE_AstralPrison_HasMet_Daisy(1) = True
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_AstralPrison_State_KilledDaisyDuringDialog = False
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:5da0e756-b205-bad0-33da-1006ddf66a18
msgctxt "h970237cbg7fa9g48a5ga8c2g758c2f96cd74"
msgid ""
"<i>You let me live, last time you were here. Though it brought Vlaakith's "
"wrath upon you.</i>"
msgstr "<i>지난번 이곳에 찾아왔을 때 날 죽이지 않았고, 그걸로 블라키스의 분노를 샀다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 63661684-802f-7e04-d70a-1f5fbdde9c38
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CAMP_GoblinHuntCelebration_NightWithDrow_Satisfied = True
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_HadSexWithMinthara(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:63661684-802f-7e04-d70a-1f5fbdde9c38
msgctxt "h1118fe27gf8f6g4fe3g9e85g90d36f37b3fe"
msgid "<i>You slept with the drow Minthara. You <b>pleased</b> her.</i>"
msgstr "<i>드로우 민타라와 잤다. 꽤 <b>만족</b>시켰더군.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Karlach
#. NodeID = 64c2d9d4-b2c9-47cd-8e50-ebd6e9a52eac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_KARLACH(8) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:64c2d9d4-b2c9-47cd-8e50-ebd6e9a52eac
msgctxt "hcd402617g386eg4e5agb05cg4f342d830b70"
msgid "Oh, shit. A <i>mind flayer</i>?"
msgstr "이런 미친, <i>마인드 플레이어</i>라고?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 68138b5e-e58d-a205-1402-5486eef3d4ee
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:68138b5e-e58d-a205-1402-5486eef3d4ee
msgctxt "ha3f01666g1432g4c6fga5f3g0e1a3d19f1ae"
msgid "<i>Destroy the guard. I will subdue their master. </i>"
msgstr "<i>친위대를 없애면 내가 주인을 제압하겠다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 6cd7440d-9028-67e7-94a1-55ff0ee458bf
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_HadSexWithMinthara(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:6cd7440d-9028-67e7-94a1-55ff0ee458bf
msgctxt "h7bcae21fgb72ag4df5gb504g76ad12d84755"
msgid "<i>You shared an intimate night with the drow, Minthara.</i>"
msgstr "<i>드로우 민타라랑 꽤 친밀한 밤을 보냈다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 7023dec9-0c4f-5a97-c20a-ee0838ed442e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:7023dec9-0c4f-5a97-c20a-ee0838ed442e
msgctxt "h4feac724g42d7g455fg96e8g374b47f8e3e0"
msgid ""
"*As the horror subsides, you are left with only one coherent thought - you "
"must do whatever you can to subdue the githyanki.*"
msgstr "*공포가 진정되자 한 가지 분명한 생각만이 남았습니다. 무슨 수를 써서라도 저 기스양키를 제압해야 합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 770bcb04-9dd6-01ec-3280-94c04724f581
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. RollType: RawAbility
#. RollAbility: Wisdom
#. DifficultyClass: 0
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Script:
#.      - GEN_CanDetectThoughts_2 = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:770bcb04-9dd6-01ec-3280-94c04724f581
msgctxt "h7c7ebdbagb025g4f61gb879g19b2e75b81d6"
msgid "<i>Try to read the mind flayer's thoughts. </i>"
msgstr "<i>마인드 플레이어의 생각을 읽으려 해본다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = 79168820-12cf-59c3-e331-562b16444cd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:79168820-12cf-59c3-e331-562b16444cd8
msgctxt "h6d40b765g8ef3g4268gb372g506c1675150a"
msgid "I don't believe you. You're a <i>mind flayer</i>."
msgstr "넌 <i>마인드 플레이어</i>잖아. 믿기 힘들다고."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 80f3e5ed-4c54-3e57-1e61-036ddee2d678
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - INT_EmperorRevealed_Event_PlayerRefusedToHelpEmperor = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:80f3e5ed-4c54-3e57-1e61-036ddee2d678
msgctxt "h97cde79age7cbg4c65ga259g2fc970d313d3"
msgid "<i>FOOL. Without me you will perish!</i>"
msgstr "<i><b>멍청한 놈.</b> 내가 없으면 넌 소멸할 것이다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 82e0458e-67e7-c474-bc61-e85f649ec872
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:82e0458e-67e7-c474-bc61-e85f649ec872
msgctxt "h7718d74bgcdc6g4be5g9153g7f0f0390e42f"
msgid ""
"*Nothing in your colourful existence to date could have prepared you for "
"this.*"
msgstr "*지금까지 살아온 다채로운 경험 중 아무것도 이것에 대한 대비는 되지 못합니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = 8345dba5-4413-4694-b6b6-3fe640a1dcae
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_LAEZEL(3) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:8345dba5-4413-4694-b6b6-3fe640a1dcae
msgctxt "h3be5d69dg0703g4905g955fg770f742c831d"
msgid "<i>Ghaik</i> abomination! By the One True Sky, what is this madness?"
msgstr "<i>게이크</i> 괴물이잖아! 창공이시여, 대체 이게 무슨 광기란 말인가?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 89ba786b-2ce3-f535-f15e-6e872c3ba267
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:89ba786b-2ce3-f535-f15e-6e872c3ba267
msgctxt "h64c96646g8ec5g4bbcgb7deg9b4a057ce9a1"
msgid "<i>I am not your enemy. </i>"
msgstr "<i>나는 너의 적이 아니다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 90685c49-fdf0-fde8-2f51-84590fe3d98b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:90685c49-fdf0-fde8-2f51-84590fe3d98b
msgctxt "had1f1f78g16f1g4513ga1d7gfa2adac56871"
msgid "<b><i>Help me. </i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>나를 도와라.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 910ffc7e-a1c4-9c89-4bde-8b133ff15f1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:910ffc7e-a1c4-9c89-4bde-8b133ff15f1f
msgctxt "h72f2792bg0989g4b8fga64agb6ae12cdafff"
msgid "<i>I AM THE REASON YOU ARE FREE.</i>"
msgstr "<i><b>내가 네 자유의 원인이다.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 9245474e-9b44-038a-51a9-145956de20bd
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Global:
#.     - INT_EmperorRevealed_Event_PlayerRefusedToHelpEmperor = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:9245474e-9b44-038a-51a9-145956de20bd
msgctxt "h472be965ga009g4719gadc3gfd0cd5793ed9"
msgid ""
"<i>Then you would betray yourself and all your allies? Without me you will "
"perish!</i>"
msgstr "<i>그러면 네 자신과 모든 동맹을 배반할 테냐? 내가 없으면 넌 소멸할 것이다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 9397d49b-a20f-9b6b-a0ed-6ba57a298e7e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_AstralPrison_State_KilledDaisyDuringDialog = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:9397d49b-a20f-9b6b-a0ed-6ba57a298e7e
msgctxt "h050b5b95gdeadg4f71g8426g6e942aa0f25a"
msgid ""
"<i>The last time you were here, you tried to kill me. Not far from this very "
"spot. </i>"
msgstr "<i>지난번 여기에 왔을 때는 날 죽이려고 했다. 이 자리에서 멀지 않은 곳에서.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = 97f205cb-9e14-b4c5-00a7-fb222837127a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:97f205cb-9e14-b4c5-00a7-fb222837127a
msgctxt "h152f26b2gfab6g4104g860dg5940ce3ea311"
msgid "<i>Now HELP ME!</i>"
msgstr "<i>이제 <b>도와라!</b></i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Wyll
#. NodeID = 9fe0dad9-6ca8-48d7-8066-fa6d523d4039
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_WYLL(6) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:9fe0dad9-6ca8-48d7-8066-fa6d523d4039
msgctxt "h0a469421g528fg4e71ga545g8f1733fb9a63"
msgid "A mind flayer. Godsdamned <i>abomination</i>!"
msgstr "마인드 플레이어잖아. 저주 받을 <i>괴물이라고</i>!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = a973c704-f305-13f1-b856-a6211241bf4c
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:a973c704-f305-13f1-b856-a6211241bf4c
msgctxt "h1968f2f3ga780g403bga23fg0f3d2f876f4c"
msgid "<i>Fight with me. Your future depends on it!</i>"
msgstr "<i>나와 함께 싸워라. 네 미래가 여기에 달렸다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Nightwarden Minthara
#. NodeID = b5845f3e-34f2-e31a-70b3-37c8e9c223f8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_MINTHARA(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:b5845f3e-34f2-e31a-70b3-37c8e9c223f8
msgctxt "h62ac55d4g0e9ag4073g8462gaea57159e3df"
msgid "Explain yourself, illithid, or we will end you."
msgstr "어디 해명 해보시지 일리시드, 아니면 끝장내줄테니."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = b89f783a-6765-9d9e-7821-a91728790b57
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:b89f783a-6765-9d9e-7821-a91728790b57
msgctxt "h11785078gb388g4f94gbb9dgde4b7ac2ada3"
msgid ""
"<i>The guard. Destroy the guard. They prevent me from subduing their "
"master.</i>"
msgstr "<i>친위대를 없애라. 내가 저들의 주인을 제압하는 걸 방해하고 있다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bad09f84-85aa-4782-441b-104744e359a5
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:bad09f84-85aa-4782-441b-104744e359a5
msgctxt "h56420cd9g2357g463dgbe0ag8e5788560b69"
msgid "How do I help?"
msgstr "뭘 하면 돼?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bcba32f8-4890-83f3-385b-9916afdc5393
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:bcba32f8-4890-83f3-385b-9916afdc5393
msgctxt "h89be4251gdc0bg41eegbf14gcbd99e28245b"
msgid "What do you need me to do?"
msgstr "어떻게 도와주면 될까?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = bd66002c-5c70-3c23-0150-c5bb297c1794
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - CRE_AstralPrison_State_KilledDaisyDuringDialog = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:bd66002c-5c70-3c23-0150-c5bb297c1794
msgctxt "h83cc0704g3c52g4eb9gbd55g06fc38f8828a"
msgid ""
"<i>I should have known. This wasn't the first time you tried to kill me. </i>"
msgstr "<i>미리 알았어야 했는데. 날 죽이려 한 게 이번이 처음이 아니지.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = bf45bf8c-6ae5-3b43-af27-d79825308711
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GITHYANKI(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:bf45bf8c-6ae5-3b43-af27-d79825308711
msgctxt "hb88e3d64gc71bg4024gbf70gd907728336c8"
msgid "I will not betray my people!"
msgstr "동족을 배반하진 않을 거다!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Shadowheart
#. NodeID = ca7869c1-d59b-477b-a6bd-4b58fef71950
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_SHADOWHEART(4) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:ca7869c1-d59b-477b-a6bd-4b58fef71950
msgctxt "ha41443fegd01bg40b6ga97eg475b96e5ab4f"
msgid "A mind flayer? What's going on here?!"
msgstr "마인드 플레이어? 뭐가 어떻게 돌아가는 거야?!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = cb371279-3097-a8a2-2f28-beec07cbd4e9
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Object:
#.     - GLO_Daisy_State_TriedToReadMind(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:cb371279-3097-a8a2-2f28-beec07cbd4e9
msgctxt "h0e264d83g56bag46b3gb79eg5b5231030b0f"
msgid "<i>You must be joking. Look around you - we are at <b>WAR. </b></i>"
msgstr "<i>장난하는 건가. 주위를 둘러봐라. 우리는 <b>전쟁</b> 중이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = d1b72042-2f81-4702-c04d-8ff7e7ea86ad
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:d1b72042-2f81-4702-c04d-8ff7e7ea86ad
msgctxt "h87529cc2g2424g4e39gb874ga2bf978b53e2"
msgid "<i>But without me, you will perish!</i>"
msgstr "<i>내가 없으면, 넌 소멸할 것이다!</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = d51ca4e5-cb1a-064c-0758-9d2bde2eaa95
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - DEN_ShadowDruid_State_KidFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:d51ca4e5-cb1a-064c-0758-9d2bde2eaa95
msgctxt "h95eba1f5g67c8g43b0gb481g05071fda4994"
msgid "<i>You saved a child from a viper, back in the druids' grove. </i>"
msgstr "<i>넌 독사로부터 어린아이를 구했지. 드루이드의 숲에서.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = d578adf4-8504-36e0-5257-203462090f1f
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:d578adf4-8504-36e0-5257-203462090f1f
msgctxt "hcf2f843agd6d5g45bbgabd6gf0a62c5be875"
msgid ""
"<i>Do NOT be driven by fear! Trust me now and I promise you will have all "
"the answers you seek. </i>"
msgstr "<i>감정에 이끌리지 말아라! 지금 나를 믿으면 나중에 원하는 모든 답을 해주겠다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d70a9552-3a5e-af17-95ff-29cfb158130b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:d70a9552-3a5e-af17-95ff-29cfb158130b
msgctxt "h3a72ce94g1b8cg4a2cga27dg4dd5a6ea55f4"
msgid "I want no part in the slaughter of innocents."
msgstr "무고한 사람들을 학살하고 싶지 않아."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d70a9552-3a5e-af17-95ff-29cfb158130b
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[1].TagText[0]
#. TagRule: REALLY_GITHYANKI
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:d70a9552-3a5e-af17-95ff-29cfb158130b
msgctxt "h37660b4bge05dg40d5g8332g5c6e0e5dd678"
msgid "I want no part in the slaughter of my kin."
msgstr "동족을 학살하는 걸 도울 순 없어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = d730916b-3875-c6f6-8d65-02f14bdf722a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:d730916b-3875-c6f6-8d65-02f14bdf722a
msgctxt "h6ab2ec7fg043dg4d39gb2a2g7232240e4c68"
msgid "<i>Attack the mind flayer. </i>"
msgstr "<i>마인드 플레이어를 공격한다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = da3a6565-d7ef-a8e6-b111-4a7a2f1e86d3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:da3a6565-d7ef-a8e6-b111-4a7a2f1e86d3
msgctxt "h22a95187g9ec3g42f8g8e75gd39dbd89471f"
msgid ""
"<i>Your continued existence as yourself and not a mind flayer should be all "
"the proof you need.</i>"
msgstr "<i>네가 여전히 너로 존재하고 마인드 플레이어가 아니라는 사실만으로도 충분한 증거가 될 것이다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = dbd10684-6ff6-7b13-e376-320530927b99
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:dbd10684-6ff6-7b13-e376-320530927b99
msgctxt "h5449c90cg303ag497bgafa6gfa1eb98fba7b"
msgid "I will do it."
msgstr "알겠어."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Gale
#. NodeID = de2a55f5-2752-47db-a031-3054bdc6f45e
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_GALE(7) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:de2a55f5-2752-47db-a031-3054bdc6f45e
msgctxt "hb0657c1cg020dg425fg9ee9g827e2c57c4cd"
msgid "A mind flayer? What the blazes is going on here?"
msgstr "마인드 플레이어라고? 대체 뭔 일이 일어나고 있는 거야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = de3cfeec-d4ec-d411-0989-5ac6cc465d40
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Local:
#.      - 5ba77ab9-a425-4662-fb59-2e52b757551a_LaezelInclusion = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:de3cfeec-d4ec-d411-0989-5ac6cc465d40
msgctxt "h382226bfg4aeeg42c7g9c28g73ef71873130"
msgid ""
"<i>Your blind loyalty will be your undoing, Lae'zel. Fight with me. <b>For "
"your own survival.</b></i>"
msgstr "<i>네 눈먼 충성심이 널 죽음으로 이끌 것이다. 레이젤. 나와 함께 싸워라. <b>네 생존을 위해.</b></i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = e06e2ad8-ec97-4256-5ebe-5268d0519b0a
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - DAISY_FEARTRACK(1) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:e06e2ad8-ec97-4256-5ebe-5268d0519b0a
msgctxt "h0aa7f080gbc50g468cg97b8gddb222dcf0d2"
msgid "<b><i>Finally.</i></b>"
msgstr "<b><i>마침내.</i></b>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = e0e2bc80-48ad-66ed-582d-fa80815afdd8
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_NightsongPrison_State_NightsongFreed = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:e0e2bc80-48ad-66ed-582d-fa80815afdd8
msgctxt "hac966439g757eg4bd4ga18fg7a9792898951"
msgid "<i>You saved the aasimar Nightsong from her soul cage.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아시마르 밤의 노래를 영혼 감옥에서 구출했다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = e268ac5c-8cfb-02f3-db4d-2effd0cbee82
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:e268ac5c-8cfb-02f3-db4d-2effd0cbee82
msgctxt "h511809ecg70a8g4c3fg8d2eg78fac4787e8d"
msgid "Enough. <i>Die.</i>"
msgstr "그만. <i>뒤져라.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = e84c4dd9-806d-1e8f-b3ec-9d4b1ff9a101
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:e84c4dd9-806d-1e8f-b3ec-9d4b1ff9a101
msgctxt "he562ef6eg2ae1g4f7fgb67dg3e28dccfa92d"
msgid ""
"<i>You do not understand. He will attack anyone that reeks of illithid - "
"that includes YOU. </i>"
msgstr "<i>네가 모르는 게 있다. 저 자는 일리시드 냄새가 나는 모두를 공격할 거다. <b>너</b>도 포함해서.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = e8aac988-9ff2-2b65-12a9-10556bd987f1
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:e8aac988-9ff2-2b65-12a9-10556bd987f1
msgctxt "he6ce2c38gdae7g4ac3g859cg72924ae3de62"
msgid "<i>But if you insist on taking a look for yourself, BE MY GUEST.</i>"
msgstr "<i>그렇게 직접 보고 싶다면, <b>어서 와라.</b></i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Player
#. NodeID = eab1add1-f682-257a-7a77-4dc506475f33
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:eab1add1-f682-257a-7a77-4dc506475f33
msgctxt "hed5755fbg3311g47b9gafe0gd333159cd5d5"
msgid "I'm not helping a mind flayer."
msgstr "마인드 플레이어를 돕진 않을 거야."

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = f07ecd5f-0b9a-33e2-56e3-fb59043890a0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - SHA_Nightsong_State_PermaDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:f07ecd5f-0b9a-33e2-56e3-fb59043890a0
msgctxt "h4ef0e40dg47f2g481ag8810g21917a1edf97"
msgid "<i>You killed the aasimar Nightsong. You didn't have to.</i>"
msgstr "<i>아시마르 밤의 노래를 죽였다. 그럴 필요는 없었음에도.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = f131764f-6aa2-7d89-fa96-efa59c2a8292
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Global:
#.      - INT_EmperorRevealed_Event_EmperorNearlyDefeated = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:f131764f-6aa2-7d89-fa96-efa59c2a8292
msgctxt "he3f9219cg26f0g4eb1gb3efg9ec639ff89ea"
msgid "<i>You BETRAYED me. </i>"
msgstr "<i>넌 나를 <b>배신</b>했다.</i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Astarion
#. NodeID = f2cea151-7de5-48ac-8234-20f5781611b4
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_ASTARION(5) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:f2cea151-7de5-48ac-8234-20f5781611b4
msgctxt "h1ad6e4b0gba1dg4587g861cg0ddc20bd5b7c"
msgid "Another tentacled freak? What in the hells is this?"
msgstr "또 촉수 괴물이라고? 대체 어떻게 되먹은 일이야?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Lae'zel
#. NodeID = f5b2fa9a-3e83-4b95-a2c1-180d3094dcc3
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. SetFlags:
#.   Local:
#.     - 5ba77ab9-a425-4662-fb59-2e52b757551a_LaezelInclusion = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:f5b2fa9a-3e83-4b95-a2c1-180d3094dcc3
msgctxt "h73b0fcc3g4949g41d9g8452g3dc8fc78e919"
msgid "Aid an illithid against githyanki? We cannot, we <i>must</i> not!"
msgstr "기스양키를 상대로 일리시드를 도우라고? 그럴 수 없어, <i>그래선</i> 안돼!"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = Halsin
#. NodeID = f725cfb1-15a7-4416-9797-4d9c1143a0e2
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_HALSIN(9) = True
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:f725cfb1-15a7-4416-9797-4d9c1143a0e2
msgctxt "h5df49cb0gcdffg4b95g8c2bgf7937a8eb859"
msgid "A mind flayer? What foul trickery is this?"
msgstr "마인드 플레이어라고? 이건 무슨 더러운 협잡질인 거지?"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea
#. Speaker = The Emperor
#. NodeID = fe5a4a23-0d32-03b2-4718-bb4e9c75a2d7
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_EmperorPlea:fe5a4a23-0d32-03b2-4718-bb4e9c75a2d7
msgctxt "h17a0306cg3b4dg4243gadfag9c64937093a7"
msgid "<i>Do it. NOW.</i>"
msgstr "<i>지금. <b>당장.</b></i>"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_NarratorAD_CrystalsImmuneToAttacks
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 2645a0e5-8334-483b-916f-297d15bbeab0
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_NarratorAD_CrystalsImmuneToAttacks:2645a0e5-8334-483b-916f-297d15bbeab0
msgctxt "h78be2853ge0edg40efg87ccgb11d660c8b49"
msgid "*The rock resists all attempts to shatter it.*"
msgstr "*이 바위는 무슨 짓을 해봐도 부숴지 않을 것입니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_NarratorAD_DescribeOrb
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 51ad9c3a-6b89-46cd-af2e-aecf5684e85d
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_NarratorAD_DescribeOrb:51ad9c3a-6b89-46cd-af2e-aecf5684e85d
msgctxt "h2e740ba8gf9b5g4c8ag9639g2556181dadbc"
msgid "*The orb hums with cerebral magic, permeable, but impenetrable.*"
msgstr "*구체가 투명하지만 침투할 순 없는 정신 마법으로 요동칩니다. *"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_NarratorAD_DescribeOrb
#. Speaker = Narrator
#. NodeID = 64f09be1-0808-207c-faf5-20dfd86b8227
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#: Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_NarratorAD_DescribeOrb:64f09be1-0808-207c-faf5-20dfd86b8227
msgctxt "he115b235g72f4g4d84ga8b3g139475e9ad05"
msgid ""
"*Within it, the githyanki Prince is as silent as a corpse, but for the "
"murmur of his powers being siphoned away.*"
msgstr "*이 안에서 기스양키 왕자는 힘이 빨아들여 지는 소리 외에는 죽은 듯이 조용하게 있습니다.*"

#. Dialog = Mods/GustavDev/Story/Dialogs/Act2b/Intermezzo/INT_EmperorRevealed_OrbExplodes
#. Speaker = Jaheira
#. NodeID = 40afe098-67d3-4214-9f57-409d099c23ac
#. HandlePath = TaggedText[0].TagText[0]
#. CheckFlags:
#.   Object:
#.      - ORI_Inclusion_PickedAtRandom(9) = True
#.   Tag:
#.      - REALLY_JAHEIRA(9) = True
